ko":"TanStack Start D3 ","es":"TanStack Start + D3 Charting es una combinación para crear gráficos con Selective SSR y temas personalizables.","fr":"TanStack Start + D3 Charting est une combinaison pour créer des graphiques avec Selective SSR et des thèmes personnalisables.","de":"TanStack Start + D3 Charting ist eine Kombination zur Erstellung von Charts mit Selective SSR und anpassbaren Themes.","pt":"TanStack Start + D3 Charting é uma combinação poderosa para criar gráficos personalizados. Aprenda a usar regras de SSR e temas com Tailwind CSS","ru":"TanStack Start + D3 Charting - это мощная комбинация для создания пользовательских графиков. Узнайте, как использовать правила SSR и темы с Tailwind CSS","ar":"تانستاك استارت + دى 3 تشارتينج هو مزيج قوي لإنشاء الرسومات البيانية المخصصة. تعلم كيفية استخدام قواعد SSR والسمات مع Tailwind CSS","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["TanStack ","D3 ","SSR","Tailwind CSS","UTC"],"ja":["TanStack ","D3 ","SSR","Tailwind CSS","UTC"],"ko":["TanStack ","D3 ","SSR","Tailwind CSS","UTC"],"es":["Selective SSR por ruta","Uso de D3 para cálculos y diseño","Gráficos de tiempo en UTC por defecto","Temas personalizables con Tailwind","Compatibilidad con Server-Side Rendering (SSR)"],"fr":["Selective SSR par route","Utilisation de D3 pour les calculs et la conception","Graphiques de temps en UTC par défaut","Thèmes personnalisables avec Tailwind","Compatibilité avec le rendu du serveur (SSR)"],"de":["Selective SSR pro Route","Verwendung von D3 für Berechnungen und Layout","Zeitcharts in UTC standardmäßig","Anpassbare Themes mit Tailwind","Kompatibilität mit Server-Side Rendering (SSR)"],"pt":["Suporte a SSR seletivo","Uso de D3 para cálculos e layout","Padrão de gráficos de tempo em UTC","Temas personalizados com Tailwind CSS","Compatibilidade com diferentes navegadores"],"ru":["Поддержка выбора SSR","Использование D3 для расчетов и компоновки","Стандартное время графиков в UTC","Настройка тем с помощью Tailwind CSS","Совместимость с разными браузерами"],"ar":["دعم SSR الانتقائي","استخدام D3 للحسابات والتخطيط","معيار الرسومات البيانية الزمنية في التوقيت العالمي المنسق","السمات القابلة للتخصيص مع Tailwind CSS","التوافق مع متصفحات الإنترنت المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TanStack Start","D3 ","SSR","React","Tailwind CSS","UTC","D3"],"ja":["TanStack Start","D3 ","SSR","React","Tailwind CSS","UTC","D3"],"ko":["TanStack Start","D3 ","SSR","React","Tailwind CSS","UTC","D3"],"es":["TanStack Start","D3 Charting","Server-Side Rendering","SSR","Gráficos con SSR","Tailwind","Visualización de datos"],"fr":["TanStack Start","D3 Charting","Rendu du serveur","SSR","Graphiques avec SSR","Tailwind","Visualisation de données"],"de":["TanStack Start","D3 Charting","Server-Side Rendering","SSR","Charts mit SSR","Tailwind","Datenvisualisierung"],"pt":["TanStack Start","D3 Charting","SSR","Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento de gráficos","Raspagem de dados","Visualização de dados"],"ru":["TanStack Start","D3 Charting","SSR","Tailwind CSS","Разработка графиков","Парсинг данных","Визуализация данных"],"ar":["تانستاك استارت","دى 3 تشارتينج","SSR","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الرسومات البيانية","تحليل البيانات","تمثيل البيانات"]}},"owner":"AndyMarigoldLabs","repo":"continuous-funding","repoPath":"AndyMarigoldLabs/continuous-funding","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tanstack-start-d3-charting","description":"SSR-safe, designer-approved D3 charting for TanStack Start (React). D3 for math, React for rendering, Tailwind v4 tokens, Biome linting.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["viz","d3","tanstack-start","ssr","tailwind-v4","biome"],"bodyPreview":"# TanStack Start + D3 Charting (SSR-safe)\n\n## Core rules\n- TanStack Start supports Selective SSR per route (`ssr: true | \"data-only\" | false`).  [oai_citation:0‡TanStack](https://tanstack.com/start/latest/docs/framework/react/guide/selective-ssr?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- Use D3 for **math/layout** (scales/shapes/format), not DOM mutation.\n- Default time charts to **UTC** (`scaleUtc` + `utcFormat`) to reduce SSR/client mismatches.\n- Theme via Tailwind v4 CSS-first tokens (`@theme`), and consume v","body":"# TanStack Start + D3 Charting (SSR-safe)\n\n## Core rules\n- TanStack Start supports Selective SSR per route (`ssr: true | \"data-only\" | false`).  [oai_citation:0‡TanStack](https://tanstack.com/start/latest/docs/framework/react/guide/selective-ssr?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- Use D3 for **math/layout** (scales/shapes/format), not DOM mutation.\n- Default time charts to **UTC** (`scaleUtc` + `utcFormat`) to reduce SSR/client mismatches.\n- Theme via Tailwind v4 CSS-first tokens (`@theme`), and consume via CSS variables.\n\n## Forbidden imports\nEnforced via Biome `noRestrictedImports`:\n- d3-selection\n- d3-axis\n- d3-transition\n- d3-brush\n- d3-zoom\n\n(See `biome.json` snippet in this skill.)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:17:21.023Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Visualization Agents needing SSR-safe D3 chart generation with TanStack Start compatibility.","zh":"非常适合需要SSR安全的D3图表生成和TanStack Start兼容性的前端可视化代理。","ja":"SSR安全なD3チャート生成とTanStack Startの互換性が必要なフロントエンドの可視化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"SSR 안전한 D3 차트 생성 및 TanStack Start와의 호환성이 필요한 프론트엔드 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Frontend Visualization Agents needing SSR-safe D3 chart generation with TanStack Start compatibility.","fr":"Perfect for Frontend Visualization Agents needing SSR-safe D3 chart generation with TanStack Start compatibility.","de":"Perfect for Frontend Visualization Agents needing SSR-safe D3 chart generation with TanStack Start compatibility.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização Frontend que necessitam de geração de gráficos D3 seguros para SSR com compatibilidade com o TanStack Start.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуализации Frontend, которым нужна генерация графиков D3, безопасная для SSR, с совместимостью с TanStack Start.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوكيل الأمامي التي تحتاج إلى توليد مخططات D3 آمنة لتحليل الخادم مع توافق مع TanStack Start."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate server-side rendered D3 charts using TanStack Start''s selective SSR capabilities (true/data-only/false) while leveraging D3 for mathematical layouts and UTC time scaling with scaleUtc and utcFormat to prevent hydration mismatches.","zh":"使代理能够使用TanStack Start的选择性SSR功能（true/data-only/false）生成服务器端渲染的D3图表，同时利用D3进行数学布局和UTC时间缩放，使用scaleUtc和utcFormat防止水合不匹配。","ja":"エージェントがTanStack Startの選択的なSSR機能（true/data-only/false）を使用してサーバー側でレンダリングされたD3チャートを生成できるようにし、D3を使用して数学的なレイアウトとUTC時間のスケーリングを行い、scaleUtcとutcFormatを使用して水化の不一致を防ぐ。","ko":"에이전트가 TanStack Start의 선택적 SSR 기능(true/data-only/false)을 사용하여 서버 측에서 렌더링된 D3 차트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, D3를 사용하여 수학적 레이아웃과 UTC 시간 스케일링을 수행하고, scaleUtc 및 utcFormat를 사용하여 수화 불일치를 방지합니다.","es":"Enables agents to generate server-side rendered D3 charts using TanStack Start''s selective SSR capabilities (true/data-only/false) while leveraging D3 for mathematical layouts and UTC time scaling with scaleUtc and utcFormat to prevent hydration mismatches.","fr":"Enables agents to generate server-side rendered D3 charts using TanStack Start''s selective SSR capabilities (true/data-only/false) while leveraging D3 for mathematical layouts and UTC time scaling with scaleUtc and utcFormat to prevent hydration mismatches.","de":"Enables agents to generate server-side rendered D3 charts using TanStack Start''s selective SSR capabilities (true/data-only/false) while leveraging D3 for mathematical layouts and UTC time scaling with scaleUtc and utcFormat to prevent hydration mismatches.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar gráficos D3 renderizados no servidor usando as capacidades de SSR seletivas do TanStack Start (true/data-only/false), aproveitando o D3 para layouts matemáticos e dimensionamento de tempo UTC com scaleUtc e utcFormat para prevenir problemas de hidratação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать графики D3, отображаемые на стороне сервера, используя возможности выбора SSR TanStack Start (true/data-only/false), используя D3 для математических макетов и масштабирования времени UTC с помощью scaleUtc и utcFormat, чтобы предотвратить несоответствия при гидратации.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توليد مخططات D3 المُحسّنة على الخادم باستخدام إمكانيات SSR الانتقائية من TanStack Start (true/data-only/false)، مع استخدام D3 للتنسيقات الرياضية وتحجيم الوقت بالتوقيت العالمي باستخدام scaleUtc وutcFormat لمنع مشاكل التهيئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating SSR-safe time series charts with UTC formatting","Creating data visualization components with selective SSR per route","Building theme-aware charts using Tailwind v4 CSS-first tokens"],"zh":["生成带有UTC格式的SSR安全时间序列图表","使用每个路由的选择性SSR创建数据可视化组件","使用Tailwind v4 CSS-first令牌构建主题感知图表"],"ja":["UTC形式のSSR安全な時間シリーズチャートを生成する","各ルートごとの選択的なSSRを使用してデータ可視化コンポーネントを作成する","Tailwind v4 CSS-firstトークンを使用してテーマ認識チャートを構築する"],"ko":["UTC 형식의 SSR 안전한 시간 시리즈 차트 생성","각 루트별 선택적 SSR을 사용하여 데이터 시각화 컴포넌트 생성","Tailwind v4 CSS-first 토큰을 사용하여 테마 인식 차트 구축"],"es":["Generating SSR-safe time series charts with UTC formatting","Creating data visualization components with selective SSR per route","Building theme-aware charts using Tailwind v4 CSS-first tokens"],"fr":["Generating SSR-safe time series charts with UTC formatting","Creating data visualization components with selective SSR per route","Building theme-aware charts using Tailwind v4 CSS-first tokens"],"de":["Generating SSR-safe time series charts with UTC formatting","Creating data visualization components with selective SSR per route","Building theme-aware charts using Tailwind v4 CSS-first tokens"],"pt":["Gerar gráficos de séries temporais seguros para SSR com formatação UTC","Criar componentes de visualização de dados com SSR seletiva por rota","Construir gráficos conscientes de temas usando tokens CSS-first do Tailwind v4"],"ru":["Генерировать графики временных рядов, безопасные для SSR, с форматированием UTC","Создавать компоненты визуализации данных с избирательной SSR для каждого маршрута","Построение графиков, осведомленных о темах, с помощью токенов CSS-first Tailwind v4"],"ar":["توليد مخططات السلاسل الزمنية آمنة لتحليل الخادم مع تنسيق التوقيت العالمي","إنشاء مكونات للرؤية البيانية للبيانات مع SSR انتقائية لكل مسار","بناء مخططات متوافقة مع السمات باستخدام رموز Tailwind v4 الأولية للتصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TanStack Start framework integration","Limited to D3 for math/layout (no DOM mutation)","UTC timezone formatting mandatory for time charts"],"zh":["需要TanStack Start框架集成","仅限于D3用于数学/布局（不允许DOM变异）","时间图表需要强制使用UTC时区格式"],"ja":["TanStack Startフレームワークの統合が必要","数学/レイアウトにはD3のみ（DOMミューテーションは不可）","時間チャートではUTC時区形式の使用が必須"],"ko":["TanStack Start 프레임워크 통합 필요","수학/레이아웃에는 D3만 사용 가능(DOM 변이 불가)","시간 차트에서는 UTC 시간대 형식 사용 필수"],"es":["Requires TanStack Start framework integration","Limited to D3 for math/layout (no DOM mutation)","UTC timezone formatting mandatory for time charts"],"fr":["Requires TanStack Start framework integration","Limited to D3 for math/layout (no DOM mutation)","UTC timezone formatting mandatory for time charts"],"de":["Requires TanStack Start framework integration","Limited to D3 for math/layout (no DOM mutation)","UTC timezone formatting mandatory for time charts"],"pt":["Exige integração com o framework TanStack Start","Limitado ao D3 para matemática/layout (sem mutação de DOM)","Formatação de fuso horário UTC obrigatória para gráficos de tempo"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с фреймворком TanStack Start","Ограничен до D3 для математики/макета (без мутации DOM)","Обязательное форматирование часового пояса UTC для графиков времени"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع إطار TanStack Start","محدود بالد3 للرياضيات/التنسيق (دون تغيير DOM)","تنسيق التوقيت العالمي مطلوب لرسوميات الوقت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
