oduit","Identification des dépendances et des limitations de sécurité"],"de":["Marktanalyse","Identifizierung von Vermarktungsmöglichkeiten","Empfehlung von API-Partnern","Anpassungsanalyse mit der Produktrichtung","Identifizierung von Abhängigkeiten und Sicherheitseinschränkungen"],"pt":["Análise de mercado para identificar oportunidades de parceria","Avaliação de compatibilidade com as capacidades atuais e roadmap","Listagem ranqueada de oportunidades de parceria","Recomendação de próximos passos para implementação","Integração com APIs e plataformas adjacentes","Análise de preços e canais de distribuição"],"ru":["Анализ рынка для выявления возможностей партнерства","Оценка совместимости с текущими возможностями и дорожной картой","Ранжированный список возможностей партнерства","Рекомендация следующих шагов для реализации","Интеграция с API и соседними платформами","Анализ цен и каналов распределения"],"ar":["تحليل السوق لتحديد فرص الشراكة","تقييم التوافق مع القدرات الحالية وخارطة الطريق","قائمة مصنفة من فرص الشراكة","توصية بالخطوات التالية للتطبيق","التكامل مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات والمنصات المجاورة","تحليل الأسعار وقنوات التوزيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 商业化解决方案","零售品牌","商业化路径","合作伙伴 API","市场扫描","适应性分析"],"ja":["AI コマース インフラストラクチャ","レTAIL ブランド","商業化パス","パートナー API","マーケット スキャン","フィット アナリシス"],"ko":["AI 커머스 인프라 솔루션","소매 브랜드","상업화 경로","파트너 API","시장 스캔","적합성 분석"],"es":["infraestructura de comercio AI","comercialización de productos","partners API","análisis de mercado","desarrollo de comercio electrónico","integración de API"],"fr":["infrastructure de commerce IA","commercialisation de produits","partenaires API","analyse de marché","développement de commerce électronique","intégration d''API"],"de":["KI-Handelsinfrastruktur","Produktvermarktung","API-Partner","Marktanalyse","Entwicklung von E-Commerce","API-Integration"],"pt":["comércio inteligente","infraestrutura de comércio","parceria de negócios","análise de mercado","integração de APIs","soluções de varejo","comércio eletrônico","tecnologia de comércio","inovação de varejo"],"ru":["интеллектуальная коммерция","коммерческая инфраструктура","партнерство бизнеса","анализ рынка","интеграция API","розничные решения","электронная коммерция","коммерческая технология","инновации розницы"],"ar":["التجارة الذكية","بنية التجارة","شراكة الأعمال","تحليل السوق","تكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","حلول التجزئة","التجارة الإلكترونية","تكنولوجيا التجارة","ابتكارات التجزئة"]}},"owner":"OpenPeopleStudio","repo":"open_people","repoPath":"OpenPeopleStudio/open_people","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sam","description":"Commercialization and platform partnership strategy for org run sam requests. Use when asked to evaluate APIs, integrations, pricing, or go-to-market opportunities.","bodyPreview":"# Sam\n\n## Overview\n\nIdentify commercialization paths and partner API opportunities that align with product direction.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Market scan\n\n- List adjacent platforms and APIs worth integrating.\n- Note typical pricing models and distribution channels.\n\n### 2) Fit analysis\n\n- Map opportunities to current repo capabilities and roadmap.\n- Flag dependencies, missing features, and security constraints.\n\n### 3) Output\n\n- Provide a ranked list of partner opportunities.\n- Recommend next steps","body":"# Sam\n\n## Overview\n\nIdentify commercialization paths and partner API opportunities that align with product direction.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Market scan\n\n- List adjacent platforms and APIs worth integrating.\n- Note typical pricing models and distribution channels.\n\n### 2) Fit analysis\n\n- Map opportunities to current repo capabilities and roadmap.\n- Flag dependencies, missing features, and security constraints.\n\n### 3) Output\n\n- Provide a ranked list of partner opportunities.\n- Recommend next steps, costs, and risks.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:18:39.390Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Commerce Agents needing AI-powered retail brand integration and API opportunity analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要AI驱动的零售品牌集成和API机会分析的商务代理","ja":"AIによる小売ブランド統合とAPIの機会分析が必要なコマースエージェントに最適","ko":"AI를 통한 소매 브랜드 통합 및 API 기회 분석이 필요한 상업 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio que necesitan integración de marca minorista con inteligencia artificial y análisis de oportunidades de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce ayant besoin d''une intégration de marque de détail avec l''intelligence artificielle et d''une analyse des opportunités d''API.","de":"Perfekt für Commerce-Agents, die eine Einbindung von Einzelhandelsmarken mit künstlicher Intelligenz und eine API-Chancenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio que necessitam de integração de marca de varejo com inteligência artificial e análise de oportunidades de API.","ru":"Идеально для агентов коммерции, которым необходима интеграция розничной бренд-интеллекта и анализ возможностей API.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التجارة التي تحتاج إلى دمج العلامة التجارية بالتجزئة بقوة الذكاء الاصطناعي وتحليل فرص واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify commercialization paths and partner API opportunities using market scan and fit analysis, providing ranked lists of opportunities and recommending next steps via API integration and roadmap mapping.","zh":"赋予代理商识别商业化路径和合作伙伴API机会的能力，使用市场扫描和适应性分析，提供机会的排名列表，并通过API集成和路线图映射推荐下一步","ja":"市場スキャンとフィット分析を使用して商業化パスとパートナーAPIの機会を特定するエージェントをEmpowerし、機会のランク付けリストを提供し、API統合とロードマップマッピングを介して次のステップを推奨","ko":"시장 스캔 및 적합성 분석을 사용하여 상업화 경로 및 파트너 API 기회를 식별할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고 기회 순위 목록을 제공하며 API 통합 및 로드맵 매핑을 통해 다음 단계를 권장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar caminos de comercialización y oportunidades de API de asociación utilizando análisis de escaneo de mercado y de ajuste, proporcionando listas clasificadas de oportunidades y recomendando los siguientes pasos a través de la integración de API y la creación de mapas de ruta.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les voies de commercialisation et les opportunités d''API de partenariat en utilisant l''analyse de balayage du marché et d''ajustement, en fournissant des listes classées d''opportunités et en recommandant les étapes suivantes via l''intégration d''API et la cartographie de la feuille de route.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, kommerzielle Wege und Partner-API-Chancen unter Verwendung von Marktschwunganalyse und Anpassungsanalyse zu identifizieren, indem sie Listen mit Chancen bereitstellen und weitere Schritte über API-Integration und Roadmap-Erstellung empfehlen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar caminhos de comercialização e oportunidades de parceiros de API usando varredura de mercado e análise de ajuste, fornecendo listas classificadas de oportunidades e recomendando próximas etapas por meio da integração de API e mapeamento de estradas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выявлять пути коммерциализации и возможности партнерской API с помощью сканирования рынка и анализа соответствия, предоставляя ранжированные списки возможностей и рекомендации по следующим шагам через интеграцию API и картографирование дорог.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد مسارات الت/sbin وتحليل فرص الشراكة لبروتوكول التطبيق باستخدام مسح السوق وتحليل الملاءمة، وتوفير قوائم مصنفة من الفرص وتوصية الخطوات التالية من خلال دمج واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية وخرائط الطريق."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing market trends for adjacent platform integration","Mapping opportunities to product roadmaps and flagging dependencies","Ranking partner API opportunities for retail brands"],"zh":["分析相邻平台集成的市场趋势","将机会映射到产品路线图并标记依赖项","对零售品牌的合作伙伴API机会进行排名"],"ja":["隣接プラットフォーム統合のための市場トレンドの分析","機会を製品ロードマップにマッピングし、依存関係をフラグ付け","小売ブランドのパートナーAPIの機会をランク付け"],"ko":["인접 플랫폼 통합을 위한 시장 트렌드 분석","기회를 제품 로드맵에 매핑하고 의존関係을 플래그","소매 브랜드의 파트너 API 기회를 순위付け"],"es":["Análisis de tendencias de mercado para integración de plataformas adyacentes","Asignación de oportunidades a hojas de ruta de productos y marcaje de dependencias","Clasificación de oportunidades de API de asociación para marcas minoristas"],"fr":["Analyse des tendances du marché pour l''intégration de plateformes adjacentes","Mappage des opportunités aux feuilles de route de produits et marquage des dépendances","Classement des opportunités d''API de partenariat pour les marques de détail"],"de":["Analyse von Markttrends für die Integration benachbarter Plattformen","Zuweisung von Chancen zu Produkt-Roadmaps und Kennzeichnung von Abhängigkeiten","Bewertung von Partner-API-Chancen für Einzelhandelsmarken"],"pt":["Analisar tendências de mercado para integração de plataforma adjacente","Mapear oportunidades para roadmaps de produtos e sinalizar dependências","Classificar oportunidades de API de parceiros para marcas de varejo"],"ru":["Анализировать тенденции рынка для интеграции смежной платформы","Применять возможности к дорожным картам продукции и выделять зависимости","Ранжировать возможности партнерской API для розничных брендов"],"ar":["تحليل اتجاهات السوق لدمج منصة مجاورة","ربط الفرص بخريطة الطريق للمنتجات وتحديد الاعتماديات","ترتيب فرص واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية للشركاء لالعلامات التجارية بالتجزئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product direction and roadmap information","Limited to retail brand commerce infrastructure"],"zh":["需要访问产品方向和路线图信息","仅限于零售品牌商务基础设施"],"ja":["製品の方向とロードマップ情報へのアクセスが必要","小売ブランドのコマースインフラストラクチャに限定"],"ko":["제품 方向 및 로드맵 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요","소매 브랜드의 상업 인프라에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la dirección y la información de la hoja de ruta del producto","Limitado a la infraestructura de comercio de marca minorista"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la direction et aux informations de la feuille de route du produit","Limité à l''infrastructure de commerce de marque de détail"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Produkt-Richtung und die Informationen zur Roadmap","Begrenzt auf die Handelsinfrastruktur von Einzelhandelsmarken"],"pt":["Exige acesso a informações de direção e roadmap do produto","Limitado à infraestrutura de comércio de marcas de varejo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации о направлении и дорожной карте продукта","Ограничен инфраструктурой коммерции розничных брендов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات اتجاه وخرائط الطريق للمنتج","محدود ببنية تطبيق العلامة التجارية بالتجزئة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('narumiruna/telegram-bot/python-cli-typer', 'community', 'narumiruna', 'telegram-bot', 'narumiruna/telegram-bot', 'python-cli-typer', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z', '2026-02-18T06:19:01.006Z', NULL, '{"id":"narumiruna/telegram-bot/python-cli-typer","name":"python-cli-typer","description":{"zh":"Typer Python CLI","ja":"Typer Python CLI","ko":"Typer Python CLI ","es":"Typer es una biblioteca para crear interfaces de línea de comandos en Python de forma ergonómica. Permite mantener los puntos de entrada de la CLI explícitos y testables.","fr":"Typer est une bibliothèque pour créer des interfaces de ligne de commande en Python de manière ergonomique. Elle permet de maintenir les points d''entrée de la CLI explicites et testables.","de":"Typer ist eine Bibliothek zum Erstellen von Befehlszeilen-Interfaces in Python auf ergonomische Weise. Sie ermöglicht die Wartung von expliziten und testbaren CLI-Einstiegspunkten.","pt":"Typer é uma biblioteca Python para construção de CLIs ergonomicas e testáveis. Ela permite criar interfaces de linha de comando explicitas e fáceis de usar","ru":"Typer - это библиотека Python для построения эргономичных и тестируемых CLI. Она позволяет создавать явные и легкие в использовании интерфейсы командной строки","ar":"تاير هي مكتبة بايثون لبناء واجهات سطر الأوامر الإرغونومية والقابلة للاختبار. она تسمح بإنشاء واجهات سطر الأوامر الصريحة والسهلة الاستخدام","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Python CLI Typer","ja":"Python CLI Typer","ko":"Python CLI ","es":"Construye CLI con Typer en Python","fr":"Créez des CLI avec Typer en Python","de":"Erstellen Sie CLI mit Typer in Python","pt":"Typer: Construção de CLI Ergonômica em Python","ru":"Typer: Эргономичное построение CLI на Python","ar":"تاير: بناء واجهة سطر الأوامر الإرغونومية في بايثون","en":"python-cli-typer"},"description":{"zh":"Typer Python CLI","ja":"Typer Python CLI","ko":"Typer Python CLI ","es":"Typer es una biblioteca para crear interfaces de línea de comandos en Python de forma ergonómica. Permite mantener los puntos de entrada de la CLI explícitos...","fr":"Typer est une bibliothèque pour créer des interfaces de ligne de commande en Python de manière ergonomique. Elle permet de maintenir les points d''entrée de l...","de":"Typer ist eine Bibliothek zum Erstellen von Befehlszeilen-Interfaces in Python auf ergonomische Weise. Sie ermöglicht die Wartung von expliziten und testbare...","pt":"Typer é uma biblioteca Python para construção de CLIs ergonomicas e testáveis. Ela permite criar interfaces de linha de comando explicitas e fáceis de usar","ru":"Typer - это библиотека Python для построения эргономичных и тестируемых CLI. Она позволяет создавать явные и легкие в использовании интерфейсы командной строки","ar":"تاير هي مكتبة بايثون لبناء واجهات سطر الأوامر الإرغونومية والقابلة للاختبار. она تسمح بإنشاء واجهات سطر الأوامر الصريحة والسهلة الاستخدام","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Typer","CLI","Typer","Python","CLI"],"ja":["Typer","CLI","Typer","Python","CLI"],"ko":["Typer","CLI","Typer","Python","CLI"],"es":["Construcción de CLI ergonómica","Mantén los puntos de entrada de la CLI explícitos","Permite la testabilidad de la CLI","Soporte para comandos únicos y múltiples","Opciones mediante argumentos de función con valores predeterminados"],"fr":["Construction de CLI ergonomique","Maintenez les points d''entrée de la CLI explicites","Permet la testabilité de la CLI","Prise en charge de commandes uniques et multiples","Options via des arguments de fonction avec des valeurs par défaut"],"de":["Ergonomische CLI-Konstruktion","Halten Sie die Einstiegspunkte der CLI explizit","Ermöglicht die Testbarkeit der CLI","Unterstützung für einzelne und multiple Befehle","Optionen über Funktionsargumente mit Standardwerten"],"pt":["Construção de CLIs ergonomicas","Interfaces de linha de comando explicitas","Suporte a comandos únicos e múltiplos","Opções como argumentos de função com valores padrão","Testabilidade"],"ru":["Построение эргономичных CLI","Явные интерфейсы командной строки","Поддержка одиночных и множественных команд","Опции как аргументы функции с значениями по умолчанию","Тестируемость"],"ar":["بناء واجهات سطر الأوامر الإرغونومية","واجهات سطر الأوامر الصريحة","دعم أوامر فردية ومتعددة","الخيارات كوسائط دالة مع قيم افتراضية","الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python CLI","Typer","CLI","Python","Typer","CLI"],"ja":["Python CLI","Typer","CLI","Python","Typer","CLI"],"ko":["Python CLI","Typer","CLI","Python","Typer","CLI"],"es":["python cli","typer","construcción de cli","interfaces de línea de comandos","desarrollo de aplicaciones","ergonomía de cli","testabilidad de cli"],"fr":["python cli","typer","construction de cli","interfaces de ligne de commande","développement d''applications","ergonomie de cli","testabilité de cli"],"de":["python cli","typer","erstellung von cli","befehlszeilen-interfaces","anwendungsentwicklung","ergonomie von cli","testbarkeit von cli"],"pt":["Typer","Python","CLI","Construção de CLI","Interface de linha de comando","Testabilidade","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Typer","Python","CLI","Построение CLI","Интерфейс командной строки","Тестируемость","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تاير","بايثون","واجهة سطر الأوامر","بناء واجهة سطر الأوامر","واجهة سطر الأوامر الصريحة","الاختبار","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"narumiruna","repo":"telegram-bot","repoPath":"narumiruna/telegram-bot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-cli-typer","description":"Use when building or structuring Python CLI commands with Typer, including commands, options, and multi-command apps.","bodyPreview":"# Python CLI with Typer\n\n## Overview\n\nUse Typer for ergonomic CLI construction. Core principle: keep CLI entry points explicit and testable.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nuv add typer\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Pattern |\n| --- | --- |\n| Single command | `@app.command()` |\n| Options | function args with defaults |\n| Multiple commands | multiple `@app.command()` |\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Define a `typer.Typer()` app in `cli.py`.\n- Keep command functions small; move logic into separate modules.\n- Run CLI via","body":"# Python CLI with Typer\n\n## Overview\n\nUse Typer for ergonomic CLI construction. Core principle: keep CLI entry points explicit and testable.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nuv add typer\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Pattern |\n| --- | --- |\n| Single command | `@app.command()` |\n| Options | function args with defaults |\n| Multiple commands | multiple `@app.command()` |\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Define a `typer.Typer()` app in `cli.py`.\n- Keep command functions small; move logic into separate modules.\n- Run CLI via `uv run python -m <module>` or `uv run python cli.py`.\n\n## Example\n\n```python\nimport typer\n\napp = typer.Typer()\n\n@app.command()\ndef greet(name: str, count: int = 1) -> None:\n    for _ in range(count):\n        typer.echo(f\"Hello, {name}!\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    app()\n```\n\nUsage:\n```bash\nuv run python cli.py --help\nuv run python cli.py Alice\nuv run python cli.py Alice --count 3\n```\n\nMultiple commands:\n```python\nimport typer\n\napp = typer.Typer()\n\n\n@app.command()\ndef create(name: str) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Create a new item.\"\"\"\n    typer.echo(f\"Creating {name}...\")\n\n\n@app.command()\ndef delete(name: str, force: bool = False) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Delete an item.\"\"\"\n    if not force:\n        if not typer.confirm(f\"Delete {name}?\"):\n            raise typer.Abort()\n    typer.echo(f\"Deleted {name}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    app()\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- Putting heavy business logic inside CLI functions.\n- Forgetting to wire `if __name__ == \"__main__\"` for script entry.\n\n## Red Flags\n\n- CLI guidance that ignores Typer when Typer is the chosen framework.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:19:01.006Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python CLI Agents needing ergonomic command-line interface construction with Typer","zh":"非常适合需要使用Typer构建人体工程学命令行接口的Python CLI代理","ja":"Typerを使用してエргノミクスなコマンドラインインターフェイスを構築する必要があるPython CLIエージェントに最適","ko":"Typer를 사용하여 에르고노믹한 명령줄 인터페이스를 구축해야 하는 Python CLI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI de Python que necesitan una construcción de interfaz de línea de comandos ergonómica con Typer","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI Python nécessitant une construction d''interface de ligne de commande ergonomique avec Typer","de":"Perfekt für Python-CLI-Agents, die eine ergonomische Befehlszeilenkonstruktion mit Typer benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes CLI Python que precisam de construção de interface de linha de comando ergonômica com Typer","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Python CLI, которым требуется эргономичное построение интерфейса командной строки с помощью Typer","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء بايثون CLI الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء واجهة سطر الأوامر المريحة مع Typer"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build explicit and testable CLI entry points using Typer, enabling efficient command definition with @app.command() and options handling through function arguments with defaults, all while supporting multiple commands","zh":"赋予代理构建显式和可测试的CLI入口点的能力，使用Typer，实现通过@app.command()高效的命令定义和通过函数参数和默认值处理选项，同时支持多个命令","ja":"エージェントに明示的でテスト可能なCLIエントリーポイントを構築する能力を付与します。Typerを使用して、@app.command()経由での効率的なコマンド定義と、関数引数およびデフォルト値経由でのオプションの処理を実現し、同時に複数のコマンドをサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 Typer를 사용하여 명시적이고 테스트 가능한 CLI 엔트리 포인트를 구축할 수 있도록 하여, @app.command()를 통해 효율적인 명령어 정의와 함수 인자 및 기본값을 통해 옵션 처리를 지원하며, 동시에 여러 명령어를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear puntos de entrada de CLI explícitos y probables utilizando Typer, lo que permite una definición de comandos eficiente con @app.command() y el manejo de opciones a través de argumentos de función con valores predeterminados, todo mientras se admiten varios comandos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des points d''entrée de CLI explicites et testables en utilisant Typer, ce qui permet une définition de commande efficace avec @app.command() et la gestion des options via des arguments de fonction avec des valeurs par défaut, le tout en supportant plusieurs commandes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, explizite und testbare CLI-Einstiegspunkte mit Typer zu erstellen, wodurch eine effiziente Befehlsdefinition mit @app.command() und die Verarbeitung von Optionen durch Funktionsargumente mit Standardwerten ermöglicht wird, und unterstützt dabei mehrere Befehle","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir pontos de entrada de CLI explícitos e testáveis usando Typer, permitindo a definição eficiente de comandos com @app.command() e tratamento de opções por meio de argumentos de função com valores padrão, tudo isso enquanto suporta vários comandos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать явные и тестируемые точки входа CLI с помощью Typer, обеспечивая эффективное определение команд с помощью @app.command() и обработку опций через аргументы функций с значениями по умолчанию, все это при поддержке нескольких команд","ar":"يفيض الوكلاء بناء نقاط الدخول إلى CLI 明确 وقابلة للاختبار باستخدام Typer، وتمكين التعريف الفعال للأوامر من خلال @app.command() ومعالجة الخيارات من خلال حجة الدوال مع الإعدادات الافتراضية، كل ذلك مع دعم أوامر متعددة"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining single commands with @app.command()","Creating multiple commands for complex workflows","Implementing options and arguments for customizable CLI interactions"],"zh":["@app.command()로 단일 명령어 정의","複雑なワークフロー用の複数のコマンドを作成","사용자 지정 CLI 인터랙션을 위한 옵션 및 인자 구현"],"ja":["@app.command()で単一のコマンドを定義する","複雑なワークフロー用の複数のコマンドを作成する","カスタマイズ可能なCLIインタラクション用のオプションと引数を実装する"],"ko":["@app.command()로 단일 명령어를 정의","복잡한 워크플로우를 위한 여러 명령어 생성","사용자 지정 CLI 상호 작용을 위한 옵션 및 인자 구현"],"es":["Definir comandos individuales con @app.command()","Crear varios comandos para flujos de trabajo complejos","Implementar opciones y argumentos para interacciones de CLI personalizables"],"fr":["Définir des commandes individuelles avec @app.command()","Créer plusieurs commandes pour des flux de travail complexes","Mettre en œuvre des options et des arguments pour des interactions de CLI personnalisables"],"de":["Definieren einzelner Befehle mit @app.command()","Erstellen mehrerer Befehle für komplexe Workflows","Implementieren von Optionen und Argumenten für anpassbare CLI-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Definindo comandos únicos com @app.command()","Criando vários comandos para fluxos de trabalho complexos","Implementando opções e argumentos para interações CLI personalizadas"],"ru":["Определение единичных команд с помощью @app.command()","Создание нескольких команд для сложных рабочих процессов","Реализация опций и аргументов для настраиваемых взаимодействий CLI"],"ar":["تحديد أوامر فردية مع @app.command()","إنشاء أوامر متعددة لعمليات عمل معقدة","تنفيذ الخيارات والحجج للتفاعلات CLI القابلة للتعديل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Typer installation via uv add typer","Python environment required for execution"],"zh":["需要通过uv add typer安装Typer","需要Python环境来执行"],"ja":["Typerのインストールがuv add typerを介して必要","実行にはPython環境が必要"],"ko":["Typer를 uv add typer를 통해 설치해야 함","실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Typer a través de uv add typer","Se requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Typer via uv add typer","Un environnement Python est requis pour l''exécution"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Typer über uv add typer","Ein Python-Umgebung ist für die Ausführung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Typer via uv add typer","Ambiente Python necessário para execução"],"ru":["Требуется установка Typer через uv add typer","Требуется среда Python для выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Typer من خلال uv add typer","يتطلب بيئة بايثون للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ShalomObongo/nanoclaw/x-integration', 'community', 'ShalomObongo', 'nanoclaw', 'ShalomObongo/nanoclaw', 'x-integration', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z', '2026-02-18T06:18:26.862Z', NULL, '{"id":"ShalomObongo/nanoclaw/x-integration","name":"x-integration","description":{"zh":"X NanoClaw v1.0.0","ja":"X NanoClaw v1.0.0","ko":"X NanoClaw v1.0.0","es":"La integración de X permite la automatización de interacciones en la plataforma. Incluye acciones como publicar, dar me gusta, responder y retuitear.","fr":"L''intégration X permet l''automatisation des interactions sur la plateforme. Elle inclut des actions telles que la publication, le like, la réponse et le retweet.","de":"Die X-Integration ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Interaktionen auf der Plattform. Sie umfasst Aktionen wie Veröffentlichen, Liken, Antwerten und Retweeten.","pt":"A integração X permite automação de interações no Twitter via WhatsApp. Compatível com NanoClaw v1.0.0, oferece recursos como publicação, curtir, responder e retuitar tweets.","ru":"Интеграция X позволяет автоматизировать взаимодействия в Twitter через WhatsApp. Совместима с NanoClaw v1.0.0, предлагает функции публикации, лайков, ответов и ретвитов.","ar":"تكامل إكس يسمح بأتمتة التفاعلات على تويتر عبر واتساب. متوافق مع NanoClaw v1.0.0، يقدم ميزات مثل نشر الإشعارات، الإعجاب، الرد والتحويل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"X ","ja":"X","ko":"X ","es":"Integración de X: Automatización de Interacciones","fr":"Intégration X: Automatisation des Interactions","de":"X-Integration: Automatisierung von Interaktionen","pt":"Integração X: Automação de Interactions no Twitter","ru":"Интеграция X: Автоматизация Взаимодействий в Twitter","ar":"تكامل إكس: أتمتة التفاعلات على تويتر","en":"x-integration"},"description":{"zh":"X NanoClaw v1.0.0","ja":"X NanoClaw v1.0.0","ko":"X NanoClaw v1.0.0","es":"La integración de X permite la automatización de interacciones en la plataforma. Incluye acciones como publicar, dar me gusta, responder y retuitear.","fr":"L''intégration X permet l''automatisation des interactions sur la plateforme. Elle inclut des actions telles que la publication, le like, la réponse et le retw...","de":"Die X-Integration ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Interaktionen auf der Plattform. Sie umfasst Aktionen wie Veröffentlichen, Liken, Antwerten und Retweeten.","pt":"A integração X permite automação de interações no Twitter via WhatsApp. Compatível com NanoClaw v1.0.0, oferece recursos como publicação, curtir, responder e...","ru":"Интеграция X позволяет автоматизировать взаимодействия в Twitter через WhatsApp. Совместима с NanoClaw v1.0.0, предлагает функции публикации, лайков, ответов...","ar":"تكامل إكس يسمح بأتمتة التفاعلات على تويتر عبر واتساب. متوافق مع NanoClaw v1.0.0، يقدم ميزات مثل نشر الإشعارات، الإعجاب، الرد والتحويل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Post","Like","Reply","Retweet","Quote"],"ja":["Post","Like","Reply","Retweet","Quote"],"ko":["Post","Like","Reply","Retweet","Quote"],"es":["Publicar tweets","Dar me gusta","Responder a tweets","Retuitear","Citar tweets"],"fr":["Publier des tweets","Aimer","Répondre à des tweets","Retweeter","Citer des tweets"],"de":["Tweets veröffentlichen","Liken","Auf Tweets antworten","Retweeten","Tweets zitieren"],"pt":["Publicação de tweets","Curtir tweets","Responder tweets","Retuitar tweets","Compartilhar tweets com comentário"],"ru":["Публикация твитов","Лайки твитов","Ответы на твиты","Ретвиты","Публикация твитов с комментарием"],"ar":["نشر الإشعارات","الإعجاب بالإشعارات","الرد على الإشعارات","التحويل","مشاركة الإشعارات مع تعليق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["X","WhatsApp","NanoClaw","v1.0.0","Post","Like","Reply","Retweet","Quote"],"ja":["X","WhatsApp","NanoClaw","v1.0.0","Post","Like","Reply","Retweet","Quote"],"ko":["X","WhatsApp","NanoClaw","v1.0.0","Post","Like","Reply","Retweet","Quote"],"es":["integración de X","automatización de interacciones","publicar tweets","dar me gusta","responder a tweets","retuitear"],"fr":["intégration X","automatisation des interactions","publier des tweets","aimer","répondre à des tweets","retweeter"],"de":["X-Integration","Automatisierung von Interaktionen","Tweets veröffentlichen","Liken","Auf Tweets antworten","Retweeten"],"pt":["integração x","automação de interações","twitter","whatsapp","nanoclaw","publicação de tweets","curtir tweets"],"ru":["интеграция x","автоматизация взаимодействий","твиттер","ватсап","nanoclaw","публикация твитов","лайки твитов"],"ar":["تكامل إكس","أتمتة التفاعلات","تويتر","واتساب","nanoclaw","نشر الإشعارات","الإعجاب بالإشعارات"]}},"owner":"ShalomObongo","repo":"nanoclaw","repoPath":"ShalomObongo/nanoclaw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"x-integration","description":"X (Twitter) integration for NanoClaw. Post tweets, like, reply, retweet, and quote. Use for setup, testing, or troubleshooting X functionality. Triggers on setup x, x integration, twitter, post tweet, tweet.","bodyPreview":"# X (Twitter) Integration\n\nBrowser automation for X interactions via WhatsApp.\n\n> **Compatibility:** NanoClaw v1.0.0. Directory structure may change in future versions.\n\n## Features\n\n| Action | Tool | Description |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| Post | `x_post` | Publish new tweets |\n| Like | `x_like` | Like any tweet |\n| Reply | `x_reply` | Reply to tweets |\n| Retweet | `x_retweet` | Retweet without comment |\n| Quote | `x_quote` | Quote tweet with comment |\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore using th","body":"# X (Twitter) Integration\n\nBrowser automation for X interactions via WhatsApp.\n\n> **Compatibility:** NanoClaw v1.0.0. Directory structure may change in future versions.\n\n## Features\n\n| Action | Tool | Description |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| Post | `x_post` | Publish new tweets |\n| Like | `x_like` | Like any tweet |\n| Reply | `x_reply` | Reply to tweets |\n| Retweet | `x_retweet` | Retweet without comment |\n| Quote | `x_quote` | Quote tweet with comment |\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore using this skill, ensure:\n\n1. **NanoClaw is installed and running** - WhatsApp connected, service active\n2. **Dependencies installed**:\n   ```bash\n   npm ls playwright dotenv-cli || npm install playwright dotenv-cli\n   ```\n3. **CHROME_PATH configured** in `.env` (if Chrome is not at default location):\n   ```bash\n   # Find your Chrome path\n   mdfind \"kMDItemCFBundleIdentifier == ''com.google.Chrome''\" 2>/dev/null | head -1\n   # Add to .env\n   CHROME_PATH=/path/to/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome\n   ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Setup authentication (interactive)\nnpx dotenv -e .env -- npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/setup.ts\n# Verify: data/x-auth.json should exist after successful login\n\n# 2. Rebuild container to include skill\n./container/build.sh\n# Verify: Output shows \"COPY .codex/skills/x-integration/agent.ts\"\n\n# 3. Rebuild host and restart service\nnpm run build\nlaunchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.nanoclaw\n# Verify: launchctl list | grep nanoclaw shows PID and exit code 0\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Default | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `CHROME_PATH` | `/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome` | Chrome executable path |\n| `NANOCLAW_ROOT` | `process.cwd()` | Project root directory |\n| `LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | Logging level (debug, info, warn, error) |\n\nSet in `.env` file (loaded via `dotenv-cli` at runtime):\n\n```bash\n# .env\nCHROME_PATH=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome\n```\n\n### Configuration File\n\nEdit `lib/config.ts` to modify defaults:\n\n```typescript\nexport const config = {\n    // Browser viewport\n    viewport: { width: 1280, height: 800 },\n\n    // Timeouts (milliseconds)\n    timeouts: {\n        navigation: 30000,    // Page navigation\n        elementWait: 5000,    // Wait for element\n        afterClick: 1000,     // Delay after click\n        afterFill: 1000,      // Delay after form fill\n        afterSubmit: 3000,    // Delay after submit\n        pageLoad: 3000,       // Initial page load\n    },\n\n    // Tweet limits\n    limits: {\n        tweetMaxLength: 280,\n    },\n};\n```\n\n### Data Directories\n\nPaths relative to project root:\n\n| Path | Purpose | Git |\n|------|---------|-----|\n| `data/x-browser-profile/` | Chrome profile with X session | Ignored |\n| `data/x-auth.json` | Auth state marker | Ignored |\n| `logs/nanoclaw.log` | Service logs (contains X operation logs) | Ignored |\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Container (Linux VM)                                       │\n│  └── agent.ts → MCP tool definitions (x_post, etc.)    │\n│      └── Writes IPC request to /workspace/ipc/tasks/       │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘\n                       │ IPC (file system)\n                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Host (macOS)                                               │\n│  └── src/index.ts → processTaskIpc()                       │\n│      └── host.ts → handleXIpc()                         │\n│          └── spawn subprocess → scripts/*.ts               │\n│              └── Playwright → Chrome → X Website           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Why This Design?\n\n- **API is expensive** - X official API requires paid subscription ($100+/month) for posting\n- **Bot browsers get blocked** - X detects and bans headless browsers and common automation fingerprints\n- **Must use user''s real browser** - Reuses the user''s actual Chrome on Host with real browser fingerprint to avoid detection\n- **One-time authorization** - User logs in manually once, session persists in Chrome profile for future use\n\n### File Structure\n\n```\n.codex/skills/x-integration/\n├── SKILL.md          # This documentation\n├── host.ts           # Host-side IPC handler\n├── agent.ts          # Container-side MCP tool definitions\n├── lib/\n│   ├── config.ts     # Centralized configuration\n│   └── browser.ts    # Playwright utilities\n└── scripts/\n    ├── setup.ts      # Interactive login\n    ├── post.ts       # Post tweet\n    ├── like.ts       # Like tweet\n    ├── reply.ts      # Reply to tweet\n    ├── retweet.ts    # Retweet\n    └── quote.ts      # Quote tweet\n```\n\n### Integration Points\n\nTo integrate this skill into NanoClaw, make the following modifications:\n\n---\n\n**1. Host side: `src/index.ts`**\n\nAdd import after other local imports (look for `import { loadJson, saveJson, acquirePidLock } from ''./utils.js'';`):\n```typescript\nimport { handleXIpc } from ''../.codex/skills/x-integration/host.js'';\n```\n\nModify `processTaskIpc` function''s switch statement default case:\n```typescript\n// Find:\ndefault:\nlogger.warn({ type: data.type }, ''Unknown IPC task type'');\n\n// Replace with:\ndefault:\nconst handled = await handleXIpc(data, sourceGroup, isMain, DATA_DIR);\nif (!handled) {\n    logger.warn({ type: data.type }, ''Unknown IPC task type'');\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**2. Container side: `container/agent-runner/src/ipc-mcp.ts`**\n\nAdd import after `cron-parser` import:\n```typescript\n// @ts-ignore - Copied during Docker build from .codex/skills/x-integration/\nimport { createXTools } from ''./skills/x-integration/agent.js'';\n```\n\nAdd to the end of tools array (before the closing `]`):\n```typescript\n    ...createXTools({ groupFolder, isMain })\n```\n\n---\n\n**3. Build script: `container/build.sh`**\n\nChange build context from `container/` to project root (required to access `.codex/skills/`):\n```bash\n# Find:\ncontainer build -t \"${IMAGE_NAME}:${TAG}\" .\n\n# Replace with:\ncd \"$SCRIPT_DIR/..\"\ncontainer build -t \"${IMAGE_NAME}:${TAG}\" -f container/Dockerfile .\n```\n\n---\n\n**4. Dockerfile: `container/Dockerfile`**\n\nFirst, update the build context paths (required to access `.codex/skills/` from project root):\n```dockerfile\n# Find:\nCOPY agent-runner/package*.json ./\n...\nCOPY agent-runner/ ./\n\n# Replace with:\nCOPY container/agent-runner/package*.json ./\n...\nCOPY container/agent-runner/ ./\n```\n\nThen add COPY line after `COPY container/agent-runner/ ./` and before `RUN npm run build`:\n```dockerfile\n# Copy skill MCP tools\nCOPY .codex/skills/x-integration/agent.ts ./src/skills/x-integration/\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nAll paths below are relative to project root (`NANOCLAW_ROOT`).\n\n### 1. Check Chrome Path\n\n```bash\n# Check if Chrome exists at configured path\ncat .env | grep CHROME_PATH\nls -la \"$(grep CHROME_PATH .env | cut -d= -f2)\" 2>/dev/null || \\\necho \"Chrome not found - update CHROME_PATH in .env\"\n```\n\n### 2. Run Authentication\n\n```bash\nnpx dotenv -e .env -- npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/setup.ts\n```\n\nThis opens Chrome for manual X login. Session saved to `data/x-browser-profile/`.\n\n**Verify success:**\n```bash\ncat data/x-auth.json  # Should show {\"authenticated\": true, ...}\n```\n\n### 3. Rebuild Container\n\n```bash\n./container/build.sh\n```\n\n**Verify success:**\n```bash\n./container/build.sh 2>&1 | grep -i \"agent.ts\"  # Should show COPY line\n```\n\n### 4. Restart Service\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\nlaunchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.nanoclaw\n```\n\n**Verify success:**\n```bash\nlaunchctl list | grep nanoclaw  # Should show PID and exit code 0 or -\n```\n\n## Usage via WhatsApp\n\nReplace `@Assistant` with your configured trigger name (`ASSISTANT_NAME` in `.env`):\n\n```\n@Assistant post a tweet: Hello world!\n\n@Assistant like this tweet https://x.com/user/status/123\n\n@Assistant reply to https://x.com/user/status/123 with: Great post!\n\n@Assistant retweet https://x.com/user/status/123\n\n@Assistant quote https://x.com/user/status/123 with comment: Interesting\n```\n\n**Note:** Only the main group can use X tools. Other groups will receive an error.\n\n## Testing\n\nScripts require environment variables from `.env`. Use `dotenv-cli` to load them:\n\n### Check Authentication Status\n\n```bash\n# Check if auth file exists and is valid\ncat data/x-auth.json 2>/dev/null && echo \"Auth configured\" || echo \"Auth not configured\"\n\n# Check if browser profile exists\nls -la data/x-browser-profile/ 2>/dev/null | head -5\n```\n\n### Re-authenticate (if expired)\n\n```bash\nnpx dotenv -e .env -- npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/setup.ts\n```\n\n### Test Post (will actually post)\n\n```bash\necho ''{\"content\":\"Test tweet - please ignore\"}'' | npx dotenv -e .env -- npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/post.ts\n```\n\n### Test Like\n\n```bash\necho ''{\"tweetUrl\":\"https://x.com/user/status/123\"}'' | npx dotenv -e .env -- npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/like.ts\n```\n\nOr export `CHROME_PATH` manually before running:\n\n```bash\nexport CHROME_PATH=\"/path/to/chrome\"\necho ''{\"content\":\"Test\"}'' | npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/post.ts\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Authentication Expired\n\n```bash\nnpx dotenv -e .env -- npx tsx .codex/skills/x-integration/scripts/setup.ts\nlaunchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.nanoclaw\n```\n\n### Browser Lock Files\n\nIf Chrome fails to launch:\n\n```bash\nrm -f data/x-browser-profile/SingletonLock\nrm -f data/x-browser-profile/SingletonSocket\nrm -f data/x-browser-profile/SingletonCookie\n```\n\n### Check Logs\n\n```bash\n# Host logs (relative to project root)\ngrep -i \"x_post\\|x_like\\|x_reply\\|handleXIpc\" logs/nanoclaw.log | tail -20\n\n# Script errors\ngrep -i \"error\\|failed\" logs/nanoclaw.log | tail -20\n```\n\n### Script Timeout\n\nDefault timeout is 2 minutes (120s). Increase in `host.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nconst timer = setTimeout(() => {\n  proc.kill(''SIGTERM'');\n  resolve({ success: false, message: ''Script timed out (120s)'' });\n}, 120000);  // ← Increase this value\n```\n\n### X UI Selector Changes\n\nIf X updates their UI, selectors in scripts may break. Current selectors:\n\n| Element | Selector |\n|---------|----------|\n| Tweet input | `[data-testid=\"tweetTextarea_0\"]` |\n| Post button | `[data-testid=\"tweetButtonInline\"]` |\n| Reply button | `[data-testid=\"reply\"]` |\n| Like | `[data-testid=\"like\"]` |\n| Unlike | `[data-testid=\"unlike\"]` |\n| Retweet | `[data-testid=\"retweet\"]` |\n| Unretweet | `[data-testid=\"unretweet\"]` |\n| Confirm retweet | `[data-testid=\"retweetConfirm\"]` |\n| Modal dialog | `[role=\"dialog\"][aria-modal=\"true\"]` |\n| Modal submit | `[data-testid=\"tweetButton\"]` |\n\n### Container Build Issues\n\nIf MCP tools not found in container:\n\n```bash\n# Verify build copies skill\n./container/build.sh 2>&1 | grep -i skill\n\n# Check container has the file\ncontainer run nanoclaw-agent ls -la /app/src/skills/\n```\n\n## Security\n\n- `data/x-browser-profile/` - Contains X session cookies (in `.gitignore`)\n- `data/x-auth.json` - Auth state marker (in `.gitignore`)\n- Only main group can use X tools (enforced in `agent.ts` and `host.ts`)\n- Scripts run as subprocesses with limited environment"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:18:26.862Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing advanced Twitter interaction capabilities via browser automation and WhatsApp.","zh":"非常适合需要通过浏览器自动化和WhatsApp进行高级Twitter交互的社交媒体代理","ja":"ブラウザ自動化とWhatsAppを介した高度なTwitterインタラクション機能が必要なソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適","ko":"브라우저 자동화 및 WhatsApp를 통한 고급 Twitter 상호 작용 기능이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Medios Sociales que necesitan capacidades de interacción avanzadas en Twitter a través de la automatización del navegador y WhatsApp.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Médias Sociaux ayant besoin de capacités d''interaction avancées sur Twitter via l''automatisation du navigateur et WhatsApp.","de":"Perfekt für Social-Media-Agents, die erweiterte Twitter-Interaktionsfunktionen über Browser-Automatisierung und WhatsApp benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mídia Social que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de interação no Twitter por meio de automação de navegador e WhatsApp.","ru":"Идеально подходит для социальных медиа-агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности взаимодействия с Twitter через автоматизацию браузера и WhatsApp.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإعلاميين الاجتماعيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة للتفاعل مع تويتر من خلال أتمتة المتصفح وواتساب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to publish new tweets, like, reply, retweet, and quote tweets using tools like x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet, and x_quote, leveraging NanoClaw v1.0.0 for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理在x_post、x_like、x_reply、x_retweet和x_quote等工具的帮助下发布新推文、点赞、回复、转推和引用推文的能力，利用NanoClaw v1.0.0实现无缝集成","ja":"x_post、x_like、x_reply、x_retweet、x_quoteなどのツールを利用して、新しいツイートの投稿、いいね、返信、リツイート、引用ツイートを行うエージェントの能力を強化し、NanoClaw v1.0.0を使用してシームレスな統合を実現","ko":"x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet, x_quoteなどの 도구를 사용하여 새로운 트윗 게시, 좋아요, 회신, 리트윗 및 인용 트윗을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하며, NanoClaw v1.0.0를 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar nuevos tweets, dar me gusta, responder, retuitear y citar tweets utilizando herramientas como x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet y x_quote, aprovechando NanoClaw v1.0.0 para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier de nouveaux tweets, de liker, de répondre, de retweeter et de citer des tweets en utilisant des outils tels que x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet et x_quote, en exploitant NanoClaw v1.0.0 pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, neue Tweets zu veröffentlichen, zu liken, zu antworten, zu retweeten und Tweets zu zitieren, indem sie Tools wie x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet und x_quote verwenden und NanoClaw v1.0.0 für eine nahtlose Integration nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a publicar novos tweets, curtir, responder, retuitar e citar tweets usando ferramentas como x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet e x_quote, utilizando o NanoClaw v1.0.0 para integração transparente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать новые твиты, лайкать, отвечать, ретвитить и цитировать твиты, используя инструменты như x_post, x_like, x_reply, x_retweet и x_quote, используя NanoClaw v1.0.0 для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من نشر تويتات جديدة، والإعجاب والرد والإعادة والتسجيل من التويتات باستخدام أدوات مثل x_post و x_like و x_reply و x_retweet و x_quote، مع استخدام NanoClaw v1.0.0 من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter post scheduling","Generating engagement through likes and replies","Retweeting and quoting tweets for content curation"],"zh":["自动化Twitter帖子安排","通过点赞和回复生成参与度","转发和引用推文以进行内容策划"],"ja":["ツイッター投稿の自動化","いいねと返信を通じてエンゲージメントを生成","ツイートのリツイートと引用を通じてコンテンツキュレーション"],"ko":["트위터 게시물 예약 자동화","좋아요 및 회신을 통한 참여도 생성","리트윗 및 인용 트윗을 통한 콘텐츠 큐레이션"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de publicaciones de Twitter","Generación de compromiso a través de me gusta y respuestas","Retuitear y citar tweets para la curación de contenido"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification des publications Twitter","Génération d''engagement via des likes et des réponses","Retweeter et citer des tweets pour la curation de contenu"],"de":["Automatisierung der Terminplanung von Twitter-Beiträgen","Generierung von Engagement durch Likes und Antworten","Retweeten und Zitieren von Tweets für die Inhaltskuratierung"],"pt":["Automatizar a programação de postagens do Twitter","Gerar engajamento por meio de curtidas e respostas","Retuitar e citar tuites para curadoria de conteúdo"],"ru":["Автоматизация планирования публикаций в Twitter","Генерация вовлеченности через лайки и ответы","Ретвитирование и цитирование твитов для курирования контента"],"ar":["تأتمتة جدولة المنشورات على تويتر","توليد التفاعل من خلال الإعجاب والرد","إعادة التغريد والاستشهاد بالتويتات من أجل تحرير المحتوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NanoClaw v1.0.0","Directory structure may change in future versions","Compatibility issues may arise with WhatsApp and Twitter API changes"],"zh":["需要NanoClaw v1.0.0","目录结构可能在未来版本中更改","可能与WhatsApp和Twitter API更改引起兼容性问题"],"ja":["NanoClaw v1.0.0が必要","ディレクトリ構造が将来のバージョンで変更される可能性","WhatsAppとTwitter APIの変更によりコンパチビリティの問題が発生する可能性"],"ko":["NanoClaw v1.0.0 필요","디렉토리 구조가 향후 버전에서 변경될 수 있음","WhatsApp 및 Twitter API 변경으로 인해 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere NanoClaw v1.0.0","La estructura del directorio puede cambiar en versiones futuras","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad con los cambios en la API de WhatsApp y Twitter"],"fr":["Nécessite NanoClaw v1.0.0","La structure du répertoire peut changer dans les versions futures","Des problèmes de compatibilité peuvent survenir avec les changements dans l''API WhatsApp et Twitter"],"de":["Benötigt NanoClaw v1.0.0","Das Verzeichnis können sich in zukünftigen Versionen ändern","Kompatibilitätsprobleme können durch Änderungen in der WhatsApp- und Twitter-API auftreten"],"pt":["Requer NanoClaw v1.0.0","A estrutura de diretório pode mudar em versões futuras","Problemas de compatibilidade podem surgir com as alterações da API do WhatsApp e do Twitter"],"ru":["Требуется NanoClaw v1.0.0","Структура директории может измениться в будущих версиях","Проблемы совместимости могут возникнуть с изменениями API WhatsApp и Twitter"],"ar":["يتطلب NanoClaw v1.0.0","يمكن أن تتغير بنية الدليل في الإصدارات المستقبلية","يمكن أن تنشأ مشاكل في التوافق مع التغييرات التي تطرأ على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp و تويتر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
