 es una herramienta para generar un resumen conciso y listo para PR","fr":"Le résumé de brouillon de PR est un outil pour générer un résumé concis et prêt pour PR","de":"Die PR-Entwurfszusammenfassung ist ein Tool zur Erstellung einer knappen und PR-fertigen Zusammenfassung","pt":"O pr-draft-summary é uma habilidade que ajuda a criar um resumo conciso e pronto para PR após trabalho de código substancial no repositório openai-agents-python","ru":"Сводка черновика PR - это навык, который помогает создать краткое и готовое к PR описание после значительной кодировки в репозитории openai-agents-python","ar":"ملخص مسودة طلب السحب هو مهارة تساعد على إنشاء ملخص مختصر وجاهز للطلب السحب بعد العمل على تعديلات كبيرة على الكود في مستودع openai-agents-python","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["生成PR待审代码后的简洁摘要","创建PR标题和描述","支持代码运行时、测试、示例和文档的行为影响","支持构建和测试配置"],"ja":["コードレビューの準備が整ったPRの簡潔なサマリーを生成","PRタイトルと説明を作成","コードの実行時、テスト、例と文書の動作への影響をサポート","ビルドとテストの構成をサポート"],"ko":["코드 리뷰가 준비된 PR의 요약을 생성","PR 제목과 설명을 생성","코드 실행 시, 테스트, 예제 및 문서의 동작에 대한 영향을 지원","빌드 및 테스트 구성 지원"],"es":["Genera un resumen conciso","Crea un título listo para PR","Describe el propósito del cambio de código","Se puede pegar directamente en una solicitud de extracción","Se utiliza después de trabajar en código sustantivo","Es compatible con openai-agents-python"],"fr":["Génère un résumé concis","Crée un titre prêt pour PR","Décrire l''objectif du changement de code","Peut être collé directement dans une demande d''extraction","Est utilisé après avoir travaillé sur du code substantiel","Est compatible avec openai-agents-python"],"de":["Erstellt eine knappe Zusammenfassung","Erstellt einen PR-fertigen Titel","Beschreibt den Zweck der Codeänderung","Kann direkt in eine Pull-Anfrage eingefügt werden","Wird nach der Fertigstellung von Substanzcode verwendet","Ist kompatibel mit openai-agents-python"],"pt":["Gera resumo conciso e pronto para PR","Cria título e descrição para PR","Pronto para ser colado no repositório openai-agents-python","Ajuda a manter a consistência nos PRs","Reduz o tempo de criação de resumos de PR"],"ru":["Генерирует краткое и готовое к PR описание","Создает название и описание для PR","Готов к вставке в репозиторий openai-agents-python","Помогает поддерживать последовательность в PR","Уменьшает время создания описаний PR"],"ar":["ينشئ ملخص مختصر وجاهز للطلب السحب","يخلق عنوان ووصف للطلب السحب","جاهز للصق في مستودع openai-agents-python","يساعد على الحفاظ على الاتساق في الطلبات السحب","يقلل من وقت إنشاء ملخصات الطلبات السحب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PR草稿摘要","代码审查","代码运行时","测试","示例","文档","构建配置"],"ja":["PR下書きサマリー","コードレビュー","コード実行時","テスト","例","文書","ビルド構成"],"ko":["PR 초안 요약","코드 리뷰","코드 실행 시","테스트","예제","문서","빌드 구성"],"es":["resumen de borrador de PR","generador de resumen","herramienta de desarrollo","openai-agents-python","desarrollo de software","código sustantivo","solicitud de extracción","PR listo"],"fr":["résumé de brouillon de PR","générateur de résumé","outils de développement","openai-agents-python","développement de logiciels","code substantiel","demande d''extraction","PR prêt"],"de":["PR-Entwurfszusammenfassung","Zusammenfassungsgenerator","Entwicklungstool","openai-agents-python","Softwareentwicklung","Substanzcode","Pull-Anfrage","PR-fertig"],"pt":["pr-draft-summary","resumo de rascunho de PR","openai-agents-python","desenvolvimento de software","geração de resumos","otimização de PR"],"ru":["сводка черновика PR","генерация описаний PR","openai-agents-python","разработка программного обеспечения","создание описаний PR","оптимизация PR"],"ar":["ملخص مسودة طلب السحب","إنشاء ملخصات الطلبات السحب","openai-agents-python","تطوير البرمجيات","توليد ملخصات الطلبات السحب","تحسين الطلبات السحب"]}},"owner":"zaziedlm","repo":"openai-agents-python","repoPath":"zaziedlm/openai-agents-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-draft-summary","description":"Create a PR title and draft description after substantive code changes are finished. Trigger when wrapping up a moderate-or-larger change (runtime code, tests, build config, docs with behavior impact) and you need the PR-ready summary block with change summary plus PR draft text.","bodyPreview":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You ar","body":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You are about to send the \"work complete\" response and need the PR block included.\n- Skip only for trivial or conversation-only tasks where no PR-style summary is expected.\n\n## Inputs to Collect Automatically (do not ask the user)\n- Current branch: `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`.\n- Working tree: `git status -sb`.\n- Untracked files: `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` (use with `git status -sb` to ensure they are surfaced; `--stat` does not include them).\n- Changed files: `git diff --name-only` (unstaged) and `git diff --name-only --cached` (staged); sizes via `git diff --stat` and `git diff --stat --cached`.\n- Base reference (use the branch''s upstream, fallback to `origin/main`):\n  - `BASE_REF=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref --symbolic-full-name @{upstream} 2>/dev/null || echo origin/main)`.\n  - `BASE_COMMIT=$(git merge-base --fork-point \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || git merge-base \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || echo \"$BASE_REF\")`.\n- Commits ahead of the base fork point: `git log --oneline --no-merges ${BASE_COMMIT}..HEAD`.\n- Category signals for this repo: runtime (`src/agents/`), tests (`tests/`), examples (`examples/`), docs (`docs/`, `mkdocs.yml`), build/test config (`pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `Makefile`, `.github/`).\n\n## Workflow\n1) Run the commands above without asking the user; compute `BASE_REF`/`BASE_COMMIT` first so later commands reuse them.\n2) If there are no staged/unstaged/untracked changes and no commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, reply briefly that no code changes were detected and skip emitting the PR block.\n3) Infer change type from the touched paths listed under \"Category signals\"; classify as feature, fix, refactor, or docs-with-impact, and flag backward-compatibility risk when runtime code changed.\n4) Summarize changes in 1–3 short sentences using the key paths (top 5) and `git diff --stat` output; explicitly call out untracked files from `git status -sb`/`git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` because `--stat` does not include them. If the working tree is clean but there are commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, summarize using those commit messages.\n5) Choose the lead verb for the description: feature → `adds`, bug fix → `fixes`, refactor/perf → `improves` or `updates`, docs-only → `updates`.\n6) Suggest a branch name. If already off main, keep it; otherwise propose `feat/<slug>`, `fix/<slug>`, or `docs/<slug>` based on the primary area (e.g., `docs/pr-draft-summary-guidance`).\n7) If the current branch matches `issue-<number>` (digits only), keep that branch suggestion. Optionally pull light issue context (for example via the GitHub API) when available, but do not block or retry if it is not. When an issue number is present, reference `https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/issues/<number>` and include an auto-closing line such as `This pull request resolves #<number>.`.\n8) Draft the PR title and description using the template below.\n9) Output only the block in \"Output Format\". Keep any surrounding status note minimal and in English.\n\n## Output Format\nWhen closing out a task and the summary block is desired, add this concise Markdown block (English only) after any brief status note. If the user says they do not want it, skip this section.\n\n```\n# Pull Request Draft\n\n## Branch name suggestion\n\ngit checkout -b <kebab-case suggestion, e.g., feat/pr-draft-summary-skill>\n\n## Title\n\n<single-line imperative title, which can be a commit message; if a common prefix like chore: and feat: etc., having them is preferred>\n\n## Description\n\n<include what you changed plus a draft pull request title and description for your local changes; start the description with prose such as \"This pull request resolves/updates/adds ...\" using a verb that matches the change (you can use bullets later), explain the change background (for bugs, clearly describe the bug, symptoms, or repro; for features, what is needed and why), any behavior changes or considerations to be aware of, and you do not need to mention tests you ran.>\n```\n\nKeep it tight—no redundant prose around the block, and avoid repeating details between `Changes` and the description. Tests do not need to be listed unless specifically requested.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:19:05.599Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated PR summary generation for openai-agents-python repository","zh":"非常适合需要自动化PR摘要生成的代码审查代理，特别是针对openai-agents-python仓库","ja":"コードレビューエージェントがopenai-agents-pythonリポジトリの自動PRサマリ生成を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 openai-agents-python 리포지토리에서 자동화된 PR 요약 생성을 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una generación automática de resúmenes de PR para el repositorio openai-agents-python","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de résumés de PR pour le référentiel openai-agents-python","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine automatisierte PR-Zusammenfassungsgenerierung für das openai-agents-python-Repository benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de geração automática de resumo de PR para o repositório openai-agents-python","ru":"Идеально для агентов код-ревью, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация сводки PR для репозитория openai-agents-python","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى توليد تلقائي لملخص.PR ل仓庫 openai-agents-python"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce PR-ready summaries with concise titles and descriptions, streamlining the code review process for runtime code, tests, examples, docs, and build/test configurations using protocols like GitHub PRs","zh":"赋予代理生成带有简洁标题和描述的PR就绪摘要的能力，简化运行时代码、测试、示例、文档和构建/测试配置的代码审查过程，使用GitHub PR等协议","ja":"エージェントがコンサイスなタイトルと説明を備えたPR_readyサマリを生成する能力を付与し、GitHub PRなどのプロトコルを使用してランタイムコード、テスト、例、ドキュメント、ビルド/テスト構成のコードレビュー処理を簡素化する","ko":"에이전트가 PR 준비 요약을 생성하는 능력을 부여하여 런타임 코드, 테스트, 예제, 문서 및 빌드/테스트 구성의 코드 리뷰 프로세스를 간소화하고 GitHub PRなどの 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir resúmenes listos para PR con títulos y descripciones concisos, simplificando el proceso de revisión de código para el código de tiempo de ejecución, pruebas, ejemplos, documentación y configuraciones de compilación y prueba utilizando protocolos como GitHub PR","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des résumés prêts pour PR avec des titres et des descriptions concis, simplifiant le processus de revue de code pour le code d''exécution, les tests, les exemples, la documentation et les configurations de build et de test en utilisant des protocoles comme GitHub PR","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, PR-bereite Zusammenfassungen mit knappen Titeln und Beschreibungen zu erstellen, wodurch der Code-Review-Prozess für Laufzeitcode, Tests, Beispiele, Dokumentation und Build-/Testkonfigurationen mithilfe von Protokollen wie GitHub PR gestrafft wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir resumos prontos para PR com títulos e descrições concisos, simplificando o processo de revisão de código para código de tempo de execução, testes, exemplos, docs e configurações de build/teste usando protocolos como GitHub PRs","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить сводки PR с краткими названиями и описаниями, оптимизируя процесс код-ревью для runtime-кода, тестов, примеров, документации и конфигураций сборки/тестирования с использованием протоколов như GitHub PRs","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنتاج ملخصات جاهزة لل(PR) مع عناوين ووصف موجز ، مما يبسط عملية مراجعة الكود لمدى تشغيل الكود والاختبارات والأمثلة والوثائق وتكوين البناء / الاختبار باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل طلبات GitHub PRs"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR summary generation after substantive code changes","Generating draft descriptions for openai-agents-python pull requests","Streamlining code review workflows with pre-formatted PR summaries"],"zh":["在大量代码更改后自动化PR摘要生成","为openai-agents-python拉取请求生成草稿描述","使用预格式化PR摘要简化代码审查工作流"],"ja":["大量のコード変更後自動的にPRサマリを生成する","openai-agents-pythonプルリクエストの下書き説明を生成する","事前フォーマットされたPRサマリを使用してコードレビューのワークフローを簡素化する"],"ko":["대규모 코드 변경 후 자동화된 PR 요약 생성","openai-agents-python 풀 리퀘스트에 대한 초안 설명 생성","사전 형식화된 PR 요약을 사용하여 코드 리뷰 워크플ロー 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de resúmenes de PR después de cambios de código sustanciales","Generación de descripciones de borrador para solicitudes de extracción de openai-agents-python","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de revisión de código con resúmenes de PR preformateados"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de résumés de PR après des changements de code substantiels","Génération de descriptions de brouillon pour les demandes d''extraction de openai-agents-python","Optimisation des flux de travail de revue de code avec des résumés de PR préformatés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von PR-Zusammenfassungen nach wesentlichen Codeänderungen","Erstellung von Entwurfsbeschreibungen für openai-agents-python-Pull-Requests","Optimierung von Code-Review-Arbeitsabläufen mit vorformatierten PR-Zusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de resumo de PR após alterações de código substantivas","Gerar descrições de rascunho para solicitações de pull do openai-agents-python","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de revisão de código com resumos de PR pré-formatados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию сводки PR после существенных изменений кода","Генерировать черновые описания для запросов на вытягивание openai-agents-python","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы код-ревью с предварительно отформатированными сводками PR"],"ar":["توفير آلي لتوليد ملخص PR بعد تغييرات جوهرية في الكود","توليد وصف تفصيلي لمسودات طلبات السحب openai-agents-python","تبسيط تدفقات العمل لمراجعة الكود مع ملخصات PR معدة مسبقًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository code changes","Specific to openai-agents-python repository","Limited to generating summaries for PRs with behavior impact"],"zh":["需要访问仓库代码更改","特定于openai-agents-python仓库","仅限于生成对行为有影响的PR的摘要"],"ja":["リポジトリのコード変更へのアクセスが必要","openai-agents-pythonリポジトリに特有","動作に影響を与えるPRのサマリの生成のみ"],"ko":["리포지토리 코드 변경에 대한 액세스가 필요","openai-agents-python 리포지토리에 특정","동작에 영향을 미치는 PR의 요약 생성만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los cambios de código del repositorio","Específico del repositorio openai-agents-python","Limitado a la generación de resúmenes para PR con impacto en el comportamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux modifications de code du référentiel","Spécifique au référentiel openai-agents-python","Limité à la génération de résumés pour les PR ayant un impact sur le comportement"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Code-Änderungen des Repositorys","Spezifisch für das openai-agents-python-Repository","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Zusammenfassungen für PR mit Auswirkungen auf das Verhalten"],"pt":["Requer acesso às alterações de código do repositório","Específico para o repositório openai-agents-python","Limitado a gerar resumos para PRs com impacto comportamental"],"ru":["Требует доступа к изменениям кода репозитория","Специфичен для репозитория openai-agents-python","Ограничен генерацией сводок для PR с поведенческим воздействием"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تغييرات الكود في المستودع","محدد لمستودع openai-agents-python","محدود بتوليد ملخصات لطلبات PR ذات تأثير سلوكي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
