ocker para soporte en macOS y Linux","fr":"Cette compétence migre NanoClaw d''Apple Container à Docker pour prendre en charge macOS et Linux","de":"Diese Fähigkeit wandelt NanoClaw von Apple Container in Docker um, um Unterstützung für macOS und Linux zu erhalten","pt":"Essa habilidade migra NanoClaw do Apple Container para Docker, permitindo suporte cross-plataforma","ru":"Этот навык мигрирует NanoClaw из Apple Container в Docker, обеспечивая кроссплатформенную поддержку","ar":"هذه القدرة تنقل NanoClaw من Apple Container إلى Docker لتمكين الدعم المتقاطع للأنظمة الأساسية","en":"codex it"},"definition":{"en":"codex it"},"features":{"zh":["容器运行时从 Apple Container 到 Docker","挂载语法从 --mount 到 -v","启动检查从 container system status 到 docker info","构建命令从 container build/run 到 docker build/run"],"ja":["コンテナ 런타임を Apple Container から Docker に変更","マウント構文を --mount から -v に変更","起動チェックを container system status から docker info に変更","ビルド コマンドを container build/run から docker build/run に変更"],"ko":["컨테이너 런타임을 Apple Container에서 Docker로 변경","마운트 구문을 --mount에서 -v로 변경","시작 확인을 container system status에서 docker info로 변경","빌드 명령을 container build/run에서 docker build/run으로 변경"],"es":["Migra el entorno de ejecución del contenedor","Cambia la sintaxis de montaje","Actualiza los comandos de inicio y construcción","Mantiene el Dockerfile y el código del agente ejecutor sin cambios"],"fr":["Migre l''environnement d''exécution du conteneur","Change la syntaxe de montage","Met à jour les commandes de démarrage et de construction","Conserve le Dockerfile et le code de l''exécuteur d''agent sans modification"],"de":["Wandelt die Container-Laufzeitumgebung um","Ändert die Mount-Syntax","Aktualisiert die Start- und Build-Befehle","Behält die Dockerfile und den Agent-Runner-Code unverändert"],"pt":["Suporte cross-plataforma para macOS e Linux","Substituição do runtime de contêiner do Apple Container por Docker","Alteração da sintaxe de montagem para `-v path:path:ro`","Substituição do comando de inicialização por `docker info`","Manutenção do arquivo Dockerfile e do código do agente runner"],"ru":["Кроссплатформенная поддержка для macOS и Linux","Замена контейнерного runtime Apple Container на Docker","Изменение синтаксиса монтирования на `-v path:path:ro`","Замена команды запуска на `docker info`","Сохранение файла Dockerfile и кода агента runner"],"ar":["دعم متقاطع للأنظمة الأساسية لماك او اس و لينكس","استبدال وقت تشغيل الحاوية من Apple Container إلى دッカー","تغيير بناء الجملة لتثبيت المسار إلى `-v path:path:ro`","استبدال أمر التشغيل ب `docker info`","الحفاظ على ملف Dockerfile و kodu جهاز التشغيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["convert-to-docker","NanoClaw","Apple Container","Docker","跨平台支持","容器化"],"ja":["convert-to-docker","NanoClaw","Apple Container","Docker","クロスプラットフォーム サポート","コンテナ化"],"ko":["convert-to-docker","NanoClaw","Apple Container","Docker","크로스 플랫폼 지원","컨테이너화"],"es":["migrar a docker","conversión de nanoClaw","soporte multiplataforma"," apple container","docker para desarrolladores","migración de contenedores"],"fr":["convertir en docker","migration de nanoClaw","support multiplateforme","apple container","docker pour développeurs","migration de conteneurs"],"de":["in docker umwandeln","nanoClaw-Migration","Multi-Plattform-Unterstützung","apple container","docker für entwickler","container-migration"],"pt":["Migração para Docker","Suporte cross-plataforma","Contêineres","Apple Container","Docker","NanoClaw","Desenvolvimento de software","Engenharia de software"],"ru":["Миграция в Docker","Кроссплатформенная поддержка","Контейнеры","Apple Container","Docker","NanoClaw","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["نقل إلى دッカー","دعم متقاطع للأنظمة الأساسية","الحاويات","Apple Container","دッカー","NanoClaw","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"chrisfrantz","repo":"nanoclaw","repoPath":"chrisfrantz/nanoclaw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convert-to-docker","description":"Convert NanoClaw from Apple Container to Docker for cross-platform support. Use when user wants to run on Linux, switch to Docker, enable cross-platform deployment, or migrate away from Apple Container. Triggers on docker, linux support, convert to docker, cross-platform, or replace apple container.","bodyPreview":"# Convert to Docker\n\nThis skill migrates NanoClaw from Apple Container (macOS-only) to Docker for cross-platform support (macOS and Linux).\n\n**What this changes:**\n- Container runtime: Apple Container → Docker\n- Mount syntax: `--mount type=bind,...,readonly` → `-v path:path:ro`\n- Startup check: `container system status` → `docker info`\n- Build commands: `container build/run` → `docker build/run`\n\n**What stays the same:**\n- Dockerfile (already Docker-compatible)\n- Agent runner code\n- Mount securi","body":"# Convert to Docker\n\nThis skill migrates NanoClaw from Apple Container (macOS-only) to Docker for cross-platform support (macOS and Linux).\n\n**What this changes:**\n- Container runtime: Apple Container → Docker\n- Mount syntax: `--mount type=bind,...,readonly` → `-v path:path:ro`\n- Startup check: `container system status` → `docker info`\n- Build commands: `container build/run` → `docker build/run`\n\n**What stays the same:**\n- Dockerfile (already Docker-compatible)\n- Agent runner code\n- Mount security/allowlist validation\n- All other functionality\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVerify Docker is installed before starting:\n\n```bash\ndocker --version && docker info >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"Docker ready\" || echo \"Install Docker first\"\n```\n\nIf Docker is not installed:\n- **macOS**: Download from https://docker.com/products/docker-desktop\n- **Linux**: `curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh && sudo systemctl start docker`\n\n## 1. Update Container Runner\n\nEdit `src/container-runner.ts`:\n\n### 1a. Update module comment (around line 3)\n\n```typescript\n// Before:\n * Spawns agent execution in Apple Container and handles IPC\n\n// After:\n * Spawns agent execution in Docker container and handles IPC\n```\n\n### 1b. Update directory mount comment (around line 88)\n\n```typescript\n// Before:\n    // Apple Container only supports directory mounts, not file mounts\n\n// After:\n    // Docker bind mounts work with both files and directories\n```\n\n### 1c. Update env workaround comment (around line 120)\n\n```typescript\n// Before:\n  // Environment file directory (workaround for Apple Container -i env var bug)\n\n// After:\n  // Environment file directory (keeps credentials out of process listings)\n```\n\n### 1d. Update buildContainerArgs function\n\nReplace the entire function with Docker mount syntax:\n\n```typescript\nfunction buildContainerArgs(mounts: VolumeMount[]): string[] {\n  const args: string[] = [''run'', ''-i'', ''--rm''];\n\n  // Docker: -v with :ro suffix for readonly\n  for (const mount of mounts) {\n    if (mount.readonly) {\n      args.push(''-v'', `${mount.hostPath}:${mount.containerPath}:ro`);\n    } else {\n      args.push(''-v'', `${mount.hostPath}:${mount.containerPath}`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  args.push(CONTAINER_IMAGE);\n\n  return args;\n}\n```\n\n### 1e. Update spawn command (around line 204)\n\n```typescript\n// Before:\n    const container = spawn(''container'', containerArgs, {\n\n// After:\n    const container = spawn(''docker'', containerArgs, {\n```\n\n## 2. Update Startup Check\n\nEdit `src/index.ts`:\n\n### 2a. Replace the container system check function\n\nFind `ensureContainerSystemRunning()` and replace entirely with:\n\n```typescript\nfunction ensureDockerRunning(): void {\n  try {\n    execSync(''docker info'', { stdio: ''pipe'', timeout: 10000 });\n    logger.debug(''Docker daemon is running'');\n  } catch {\n    logger.error(''Docker daemon is not running'');\n    console.error(''\\n╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗'');\n    console.error(''║  FATAL: Docker is not running                                  ║'');\n    console.error(''║                                                                ║'');\n    console.error(''║  Agents cannot run without Docker. To fix:                     ║'');\n    console.error(''║  macOS: Start Docker Desktop                                   ║'');\n    console.error(''║  Linux: sudo systemctl start docker                            ║'');\n    console.error(''║                                                                ║'');\n    console.error(''║  Install from: https://docker.com/products/docker-desktop      ║'');\n    console.error(''╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\\n'');\n    throw new Error(''Docker is required but not running'');\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2b. Update the function call in main()\n\n```typescript\n// Before:\n  ensureContainerSystemRunning();\n\n// After:\n  ensureDockerRunning();\n```\n\n## 3. Update Build Script\n\nEdit `container/build.sh`:\n\n### 3a. Update build command (around line 15-16)\n\n```bash\n# Before:\n# Build with Apple Container\ncontainer build -t \"${IMAGE_NAME}:${TAG}\" .\n\n# After:\n# Build with Docker\ndocker build -t \"${IMAGE_NAME}:${TAG}\" .\n```\n\n### 3b. Update test command (around line 23)\n\n```bash\n# Before:\necho \"  echo ''{...}'' | container run -i ${IMAGE_NAME}:${TAG}\"\n\n# After:\necho \"  echo ''{...}'' | docker run -i ${IMAGE_NAME}:${TAG}\"\n```\n\n## 4. Update Documentation\n\nUpdate references in documentation files:\n\n| File | Find | Replace |\n|------|------|---------|\n| `AGENTS.md` | \"Apple Container (Linux VMs)\" | \"Docker containers\" |\n| `README.md` | \"Apple containers\" | \"Docker containers\" |\n| `README.md` | \"Apple Container\" | \"Docker\" |\n| `README.md` | Requirements section | Update to show Docker instead |\n| `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md` | \"Apple Container\" | \"Docker\" |\n| `docs/SPEC.md` | \"APPLE CONTAINER\" | \"DOCKER CONTAINER\" |\n| `docs/SPEC.md` | All Apple Container references | Docker equivalents |\n\n### Key README.md updates:\n\n**Requirements section:**\n```markdown\n## Requirements\n\n- macOS or Linux\n- Node.js 20+\n- [Codex CLI](https://openai.com/codex/cli)\n- [Docker](https://docker.com/products/docker-desktop)\n```\n\n**FAQ - \"Why Docker?\":**\n```markdown\n**Why Docker?**\n\nDocker provides cross-platform support (macOS and Linux), a large ecosystem, and mature tooling. Docker Desktop on macOS uses a lightweight Linux VM similar to other container solutions.\n```\n\n**FAQ - \"Can I run this on Linux?\":**\n```markdown\n**Can I run this on Linux?**\n\nYes. NanoClaw uses Docker, which works on both macOS and Linux. Just install Docker and run `/setup`.\n```\n\n## 5. Update Skills\n\n### 5a. Update `.codex/skills/setup/SKILL.md`\n\nReplace Section 2 \"Install Apple Container\" with Docker installation:\n\n```markdown\n## 2. Install Docker\n\nCheck if Docker is installed and running:\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\ndocker --version && docker info >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"Docker is running\" || echo \"Docker not running or not installed\"\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nIf not installed or not running, tell the user:\n> Docker is required for running agents in isolated environments.\n>\n> **macOS:**\n> 1. Download Docker Desktop from https://docker.com/products/docker-desktop\n> 2. Install and start Docker Desktop\n> 3. Wait for the whale icon in the menu bar to stop animating\n>\n> **Linux:**\n> \\`\\`\\`bash\n> curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh\n> sudo systemctl start docker\n> sudo usermod -aG docker $USER  # Then log out and back in\n> \\`\\`\\`\n>\n> Let me know when you''ve completed these steps.\n\nWait for user confirmation, then verify:\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\ndocker run --rm hello-world\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\nUpdate build verification:\n```markdown\nVerify the build succeeded:\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\ndocker images | grep nanoclaw-agent\necho ''{}'' | docker run -i --entrypoint /bin/echo nanoclaw-agent:latest \"Container OK\" || echo \"Container build failed\"\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\nUpdate troubleshooting section to reference Docker commands.\n\n### 5b. Update `.codex/skills/debug/SKILL.md`\n\nReplace all `container` commands with `docker` equivalents:\n\n| Before | After |\n|--------|-------|\n| `container run` | `docker run` |\n| `container system status` | `docker info` |\n| `container builder prune` | `docker builder prune` |\n| `container images` | `docker images` |\n| `--mount type=bind,source=...,readonly` | `-v ...:ro` |\n\nUpdate the architecture diagram header:\n```\nHost (macOS/Linux)                    Container (Docker)\n```\n\n## 6. Build and Verify\n\nAfter making all changes:\n\n```bash\n# Compile TypeScript\nnpm run build\n\n# Build Docker image\n./container/build.sh\n\n# Verify image exists\ndocker images | grep nanoclaw-agent\n```\n\n## 7. Test the Migration\n\n### 7a. Test basic container execution\n\n```bash\necho ''{}'' | docker run -i --entrypoint /bin/echo nanoclaw-agent:latest \"Container OK\"\n```\n\n### 7b. Test readonly mounts\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /tmp/test-ro && echo \"test\" > /tmp/test-ro/file.txt\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash -v /tmp/test-ro:/test:ro nanoclaw-agent:latest \\\n  -c \"cat /test/file.txt && touch /test/new.txt 2>&1 || echo ''Write blocked (expected)''\"\nrm -rf /tmp/test-ro\n```\n\nExpected: Read succeeds, write fails with \"Read-only file system\".\n\n### 7c. Test read-write mounts\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /tmp/test-rw\ndocker run --rm --entrypoint /bin/bash -v /tmp/test-rw:/test nanoclaw-agent:latest \\\n  -c \"echo ''test write'' > /test/new.txt && cat /test/new.txt\"\ncat /tmp/test-rw/new.txt && rm -rf /tmp/test-rw\n```\n\nExpected: Both operations succeed.\n\n### 7d. Full integration test\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n# Send @AssistantName hello via WhatsApp\n# Verify response received\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Docker not running:**\n- macOS: Start Docker Desktop from Applications\n- Linux: `sudo systemctl start docker`\n- Verify: `docker info`\n\n**Permission denied on Docker socket (Linux):**\n```bash\nsudo usermod -aG docker $USER\n# Log out and back in\n```\n\n**Image build fails:**\n```bash\n# Clean rebuild\ndocker builder prune -af\n./container/build.sh\n```\n\n**Container can''t write to mounted directories:**\nCheck directory permissions on the host. The container runs as uid 1000.\n\n## Summary of Changed Files\n\n| File | Type of Change |\n|------|----------------|\n| `src/container-runner.ts` | Mount syntax, spawn command, comments |\n| `src/index.ts` | Startup check function |\n| `container/build.sh` | Build and run commands |\n| `AGENTS.md` | Quick context |\n| `README.md` | Requirements, FAQ |\n| `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md` | Architecture references |\n| `docs/SPEC.md` | Architecture diagram, tech stack |\n| `.codex/skills/setup/SKILL.md` | Installation instructions |\n| `.codex/skills/debug/SKILL.md` | Debug commands |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:19:11.195Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents requiring seamless migration from Apple Container to Docker for enhanced compatibility across macOS and Linux environments.","zh":"适用于需要从Apple Container无缝迁移到Docker以增强macOS和Linux环境兼容性的跨平台代理。","ja":"Apple ContainerからDockerへの無縫な移行を必要とするクロスプラットフォームエージェントに適しています。これにより、macOSとLinux環境での互換性が向上します。","ko":"Apple Container에서 Docker로 무중단으로 마이그레이션하여 macOS와 Linux 환경에서 호환성을 향상시키는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de plataforma cruzada que requieren una migración sin problemas desde el contenedor de Apple a Docker para una mayor compatibilidad en entornos macOS y Linux.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de plateforme croisée nécessitant une migration transparente du conteneur Apple à Docker pour une compatibilité améliorée dans les environnements macOS et Linux.","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agents, die eine nahtlose Migration vom Apple-Container zu Docker für eine verbesserte Kompatibilität in macOS- und Linux-Umgebungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes Cross-Platform que requerem migração sem problemas do Apple Container para o Docker para uma compatibilidade melhorada em ambientes macOS e Linux.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cross-Platform, требующих бесшовной миграции из Apple Container в Docker для повышения совместимости в средах macOS и Linux.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المتوافقين عبر منصات تتطلب هجرة بدون مشاكل من حاوية Apple إلى Docker لتحسين التوافق عبر بيئات macOS و Linux."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Docker''s cross-platform support, utilizing mount syntax like `-v path:path:ro` and startup checks via `docker info`, while maintaining compatibility with existing Dockerfiles and agent runner code, thus ensuring a unified container runtime experience.","zh":"赋予代理利用Docker的跨平台支持，使用诸如 `-v path:path:ro` 的挂载语法和通过 `docker info` 进行的启动检查，同时保持与现有Dockerfile和代理运行器代码的兼容性，从而确保统一的容器运行时体验。","ja":"エージェントがDockerのクロスプラットフォームサポートを利用できるようにし、`-v path:path:ro` のようなマウントの構文や `docker info` を介した起動時のチェックを使用しながら、既存のDockerfileおよびエージェントランナーコードと互換性を維持し、統一されたコンテナランタイム体験を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 Docker의 크로스 플랫폼 지원을 활용할 수 있도록 하여 `-v path:path:ro`와 같은 마운트 구문 및 `docker info`를 통해 시작 시 체크를 수행하며, 기존 Dockerfile 및 에이전트 런너 코드와의 호환성을 유지하여 통일된 컨테이너 런타임 환경을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar el soporte de plataforma cruzada de Docker, utilizando la sintaxis de montaje como `-v path:path:ro` y comprobaciones de inicio a través de `docker info`, manteniendo la compatibilidad con los Dockerfiles y el código del ejecutor de agentes existentes, lo que garantiza una experiencia de tiempo de ejecución de contenedor unificada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser le support de plateforme croisée de Docker, en utilisant une syntaxe de montage telle que `-v path:path:ro` et des vérifications de démarrage via `docker info`, tout en maintenant la compatibilité avec les Dockerfiles et le code de l''exécuteur d''agents existants, ce qui garantit une expérience de runtime de conteneur unifiée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dokers Unterstützung für Cross-Platform zu nutzen, indem es die Mount-Syntax wie `-v path:path:ro` und Startprüfungen über `docker info` verwendet, während es die Kompatibilität mit bestehenden Dockerfiles und Agent-Runner-Code beibehält, was eine einheitliche Container-Laufzeitumgebung gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem o suporte cross-platform do Docker, utilizando a sintaxe de montagem como `-v path:path:ro` e verificações de inicialização via `docker info`, mantendo a compatibilidade com os Dockerfiles e o código do executor de agentes existentes, garantindo assim uma experiência de tempo de execução de contêiner unificada.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать поддержку Docker на нескольких платформах, используя синтаксис монтирования, такой как `-v path:path:ro`, и проверки запуска через `docker info`, сохраняя при этом совместимость с существующими Dockerfiles и кодом запуска агентов, обеспечивая тем самым унифицированный опыт запуска контейнеров.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استغلال الدعم المتوافق عبر المنصات من Docker، باستخدام بناء الجملة مثل `-v path:path:ro` وعمليات التحقق عند التشغيل عبر `docker info`، مع الحفاظ على التوافق مع Dockerfiles وق��드 تشغيل الوكيل الحالي، وبالتالي ضمان تجربة وقت تشغيل حاوية موحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating NanoClaw applications from Apple Container to Docker for broader platform support","Updating container build and run commands to utilize Docker''s `docker build` and `docker run` syntax","Ensuring consistent mount security and syntax across different operating systems"],"zh":["将NanoClaw应用程序从Apple Container迁移到Docker以获得更广泛的平台支持","更新容器构建和运行命令以使用Docker的 `docker build` 和 `docker run` 语法","确保不同操作系统之间的一致的挂载安全性和语法"],"ja":["Apple ContainerからDockerへのNanoClawアプリケーションの移行を通じて、より広範なプラットフォームサポートを実現する","コンテナのビルドおよび実行コマンドを更新して、Dockerの `docker build` および `docker run` 構文を利用する","さまざまなオペレーティングシステム間で一貫したマウントのセキュリティと構文を確保する"],"ko":["NanoClaw 애플리케이션을 Apple Container에서 Docker로 마이그레이션하여 더 넓은 플랫폼 지원을 제공함","컨테이너 빌드 및 실행 명령어를 Docker의 `docker build` 및 `docker run` 구문을 사용하도록 업데이트함","다양한 운영 체제 간에 일관된 마운트 보안 및 구문을 보장함"],"es":["Migrar aplicaciones NanoClaw desde el contenedor de Apple a Docker para una mayor compatibilidad de plataforma","Actualizar los comandos de compilación y ejecución de contenedores para utilizar la sintaxis `docker build` y `docker run` de Docker","Garantizar la seguridad y la sintaxis de montaje coherentes en diferentes sistemas operativos"],"fr":["Migrer des applications NanoClaw du conteneur Apple à Docker pour un support de plateforme plus large","Mettre à jour les commandes de construction et d''exécution de conteneurs pour utiliser la syntaxe `docker build` et `docker run` de Docker","Assurer une sécurité et une syntaxe de montage cohérentes sur différents systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["Migration von NanoClaw-Anwendungen vom Apple-Container zu Docker für eine breitere Plattformunterstützung","Aktualisieren von Container-Build- und Run-Befehlen, um Dokers `docker build`- und `docker run`-Syntax zu nutzen","Sicherstellung konsistenter Mount-Sicherheit und -Syntax auf verschiedenen Betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Migrar aplicações NanoClaw do Apple Container para o Docker para um suporte de plataforma mais amplo","Atualizar comandos de compilação e execução de contêiner para utilizar a sintaxe `docker build` e `docker run` do Docker","Garantir a segurança e a sintaxe de montagem consistentes em diferentes sistemas operacionais"],"ru":["Мигрировать приложения NanoClaw из Apple Container в Docker для более широкой поддержки платформ","Обновлять команды сборки и запуска контейнеров для использования синтаксиса `docker build` и `docker run` Docker","Обеспечить согласованность безопасности и синтаксиса монтирования на разных операционных системах"],"ar":["هجرة تطبيقات NanoClaw من حاوية Apple إلى Docker لدعم أوسع للمنصات","تحديث أوامر بناء وتشغيل الحاويات لاستخدام بناء الجملة `docker build` و `docker run` من Docker","ضمان συνέافة أمان وتركيب عبر أنظمة تشغيل مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Docker-compatible Dockerfile","Limited to migration from Apple Container to Docker","Compatibility with macOS and Linux environments only"],"zh":["需要现有的Docker兼容Dockerfile","仅限从Apple Container迁移到Docker","仅与macOS和Linux环境兼容"],"ja":["既存のDockerと互換性のあるDockerfileが必要","Apple ContainerからDockerへの移行のみ","macOSとLinuxの環境でのみ互換性がある"],"ko":["기존의 Docker와 호환되는 Dockerfile이 필요함","Apple Container에서 Docker로의 마이그레이션만 지원함","macOS 및 Linux 환경에서만 호환됨"],"es":["Requiere un Dockerfile compatible con Docker existente","Limitado a la migración desde el contenedor de Apple a Docker","Compatibilidad solo con entornos macOS y Linux"],"fr":["Nécessite un Dockerfile compatible avec Docker existant","Limité à la migration du conteneur Apple à Docker","Compatibilité uniquement avec les environnements macOS et Linux"],"de":["Erfordert ein vorhandenes Docker-kompatibles Dockerfile","Begrenzt auf die Migration vom Apple-Container zu Docker","Kompatibilität nur mit macOS- und Linux-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer um Dockerfile compatível com o Docker existente","Limitado à migração do Apple Container para o Docker","Compatibilidade apenas com ambientes macOS e Linux"],"ru":["Требуется существующий Dockerfile, совместимый с Docker","Ограничен миграцией из Apple Container в Docker","Совместимость только с средами macOS и Linux"],"ar":["يتطلب Dockerfile متوافقًا مع Docker الحالي","محدود بهجرة حاوية Apple إلى Docker","التوافق فقط مع بيئات macOS و Linux"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cjprybol/Mycelia/hpc-context', 'community', 'cjprybol', 'Mycelia', 'cjprybol/Mycelia', 'hpc-context', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.445Z', '2026-02-18T06:19:08.278Z', NULL, '{"id":"cjprybol/Mycelia/hpc-context","name":"hpc-context","description":{"zh":"HPC Context 是一个用于生物特征、预测和设计的多组学分析和数据集成工具，设计用于Linux高性能计算和云系统","ja":"HPC Contextは、生物学的特性、予測、設計のためのマルチオミクス分析およびデータ統合ツールです","ko":"HPC Context는 생물학적 특성, 예측 및 설계를 위한 멀티오믹스 분석 및 데이터 통합 도구입니다","es":"El contexto HPC es una herramienta para el análisis multiómico y la integración de datos para la caracterización biológica, la predicción y el diseño en sistemas HPC y cloud","fr":"Le contexte HPC est un outil pour l''analyse multiomique et l''intégration de données pour la caractérisation biologique, la prédiction et la conception sur des systèmes HPC et cloud","de":"Der HPC-Kontext ist ein Werkzeug für die multiomische Analyse und die Datenintegration für die biologische Charakterisierung, Vorhersage und Gestaltung auf HPC- und Cloud-Systemen","pt":"O Mycelia HPC Context é uma ferramenta de análise multiômica para sistemas HPC e nuvem, projetada para caracterização biológica, previsão e design","ru":"Контекст HPC Mycelia - это инструмент для мультомного анализа для систем HPC и облака, предназначенный для биологической характеристики, прогнозирования и проектирования","ar":"سياق HPC Mycelia هو أداة لتحليل متعدد الأوجه لأنظمة HPC والسحابة، مصممة للاهتمامات البيولوجية والتنبؤ والتصميم","en":"In Development: Multiomic analysis and data integration for biological characterization, prediction, and  design. Designed for linux-based HPC and cloud systems."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"HPC Context - 高性能计算多组学分析","ja":"HPC Context - 高性能コンピューティングのマルチオミクス分析","ko":"HPC Context - 고성능 컴퓨팅 멀티오믹스 분석","es":"Contexto HPC: Análisis multiómico y diseño","fr":"Contexte HPC : Analyse multiomique 