n des compétences avec Electron ...","de":"Skill Evolve: Fähigkeitsverbesserung mit Electron und Svelte","pt":"Skill Evolve: Otimização de Habilidades com Dados","ru":"Skill Evolve: Улучшение Навыков с Помощью Данных","ar":"Skill Evolve: تحسين المهارات باستخدام البيانات","en":"skill-evolve"},"description":{"zh":"技能进化是一款 Electron+Svelte+Cagent品牌资产管理应用，帮助开发者跟踪技能使用情况并提高性能","ja":"スキルエボルブはElectron+Svelte+Cagentブランドアセット管理アプリで、開発者がスキル使用状況を追跡し、パフォーマンスを向上させることを支援します","ko":"스킬 에볼브는 Electron+Svelte+Cagent 브랜드 자산 관리 애플리케이션으로 개발자가 스킬 사용 현황을 추적하고 성능을 향상하는 것을 지원합니다","es":"Skill Evolve es una aplicación de gestión de activos de marca que ayuda a mejorar las habilidades a través del uso repetido y la retroalimentación del usuario","fr":"Skill Evolve est une application de gestion d''actifs de marque qui aide à améliorer les compétences grâce à l''utilisation répétée et à la rétroaction de l''ut...","de":"Skill Evolve ist eine Markenasset-Verwaltungsanwendung, die dabei hilft, Fähigkeiten durch wiederholte Nutzung und Benutzerfeedback zu verbessern","pt":"O Skill Evolve é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de ativos de marca que ajuda a converter o uso repetido de habilidades em melhoria mensurável.","ru":"Skill Evolve - это инструмент управления брендовыми активами, который помогает преобразовать повторное использование навыков в измеримое улучшение.","ar":"Skill Evolve هي أداة إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية التي تساعد على تحويل الاستخدام المتكرر للمهارات إلى تحسين قابل للقياس.","en":"Electron+Svelte+Cagent brand asset management app"},"definition":{"en":"Electron+Svelte+Cagent brand asset management app"},"features":{"zh":["跟踪技能使用情况","找出改进方向","提高20%的性能","Electron+Svelte+Cagent构建","品牌资产管理"],"ja":["スキル使用状況の追跡","改善点の特定","20%のパフォーマンス向上","Electron+Svelte+Cagent構築","ブランドアセット管理"],"ko":["스킬 사용 현황 추적","개선 방향 찾기","20%의 성능 향상","Electron+Svelte+Cagent 구축","브랜드 자산 관리"],"es":["Análisis de uso repetido de habilidades","Identificación de patrones de fallo","Mejora de la consistencia en un 20%","Retroalimentación del usuario","Integración con Electron y Svelte"],"fr":["Analyse de l''utilisation répétée des compétences","Identification de modèles de défaillance","Amélioration de la cohérence de 20%","Rétroaction de l''utilisateur","Intégration avec Electron et Svelte"],"de":["Analyse der wiederholten Fähigkeitsnutzung","Identifizierung von Fehlernmustern","Verbesserung der Konsistenz um 20%","Benutzerfeedback","Integration mit Electron und Svelte"],"pt":["Otimização de habilidades com base em dados reais","Gerenciamento de ativos de marca","Análise de padrões de falha","Melhoria da consistência em 20%","Integração com Electron, Svelte e Cagent","Acompanhamento do progresso ao longo do tempo"],"ru":["Улучшение навыков на основе реальных данных","Управление брендовыми активами","Анализ моделей неудач","Улучшение последовательности на 20%","Интеграция с Electron, Svelte и Cagent","Отслеживание прогресса во времени"],"ar":["تحسين المهارات باستخدام بيانات حقيقية","إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية","تحليل أنماط الفشل","تحسين الاتساق بنسبة 20%","التكامل مع Electron و Svelte و Cagent","متابعة التقدم مع مرور الوقت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能进化","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","品牌资产管理","性能优化","开发者工具"],"ja":["スキルエボルブ","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","ブランドアセット管理","パフォーマンス最適化","開発者ツール"],"ko":["스킬 에볼브","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","브랜드 자산 관리","성능 최적화","개발자 도구"],"es":["desarrollo de habilidades","análisis de uso","identificación de patrones de fallo","mejora de la consistencia","Electron","Svelte","gestión de activos de marca"],"fr":["développement de compétences","analyse de l''utilisation","identification de modèles de défaillance","amélioration de la cohérence","Electron","Svelte","gestion d''actifs de marque"],"de":["Fähigkeitsentwicklung","Nutzungsanalyse","Identifizierung von Fehlernmustern","Konsistenzverbesserung","Electron","Svelte","Markenasset-Verwaltung"],"pt":["otimização de habilidades","gerenciamento de ativos de marca","análise de padrões de falha","melhoria da consistência","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","desenvolvimento de habilidades","treinamento de habilidades"],"ru":["улучшение навыков","управление брендовыми активами","анализ моделей неудач","улучшение последовательности","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","развитие навыков","обучение навыкам"],"ar":["تحسين المهارات","إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية","تحليل أنماط الفشل","تحسين الاتساق","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","تطوير المهارات","تدريب المهارات"]}},"owner":"alchimie-di-circe","repo":"Extractor-desktop-app","repoPath":"alchimie-di-circe/Extractor-desktop-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-evolve","description":"Evolve skills iteratively based on usage tracking and feedback. Use for skills used repeatedly, when failure rate exceeds 10 percent, when user feedback indicates confusion, or when building team expertise over time. Achieves 20 percent consistency improvement through iterative refinement. Triggers on evolve skill, improve skill iteratively, skill evolution, track skill performance, refine skill.","bodyPreview":"# Skill Evolve\n\n## Purpose\n\nConvert repeated skill usage into measurable improvement. Track performance, identify failure patterns, and polish iteratively to achieve 20% consistency gain.\n\n**Specialization:** Long-term skill evolution based on real usage data.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Skill is used repeatedly (3+ times)\n- Failure rate exceeds 10%\n- User feedback indicates confusion\n- New edge cases discovered\n- Building team-specific expertise\n- Tracking skill evolution over time\n\n**When NOT to use:**","body":"# Skill Evolve\n\n## Purpose\n\nConvert repeated skill usage into measurable improvement. Track performance, identify failure patterns, and polish iteratively to achieve 20% consistency gain.\n\n**Specialization:** Long-term skill evolution based on real usage data.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Skill is used repeatedly (3+ times)\n- Failure rate exceeds 10%\n- User feedback indicates confusion\n- New edge cases discovered\n- Building team-specific expertise\n- Tracking skill evolution over time\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- One-off skill usage\n- Initial skill creation (use skill-bootstrap)\n- Session-based improvements (use skill-extract-pattern)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\n# Track usage\ntracker = SkillTracker(\"my-skill\")\ntracker.log_usage(task, result)\n\n# Analyze failures\nissues = tracker.analyze_failures()\n\n# Polish and measure\nimprovement = measure_evolution(before_version, after_version)\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```\nCREATE (v1.0.0) → USE (track) → ANALYZE (failures) → \nPOLISH (v1.1.0) → MEASURE (impact) → REPEAT\n```\n\n## Step 1: Create Initial Skill\n\nUse skill-bootstrap to create v1.0.0:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p .claude/skills/my-skill\n\n# Generate SKILL.md with skill-bootstrap\ncat > .claude/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md << ''EOF''\n---\nname: my-skill\ndescription: ...\n---\n# My Skill\n[Initial implementation]\nEOF\n\ngit add .claude/skills/my-skill\ngit commit -m \"feat: add my-skill capability (v1.0.0)\"\n```\n\n## Step 2: Track Usage\n\n### Simple Tracking (JSON file)\n\n```python\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nclass SkillTracker:\n    def __init__(self, skill_name):\n        self.skill_name = skill_name\n        self.log_file = f\".claude/skills/{skill_name}/usage.json\"\n    \n    def log_usage(self, task, success, issues=None, feedback=None):\n        entry = {\n            ''timestamp'': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n            ''task'': task,\n            ''success'': success,\n            ''issues'': issues or [],\n            ''feedback'': feedback\n        }\n        \n        try:\n            with open(self.log_file, ''r'') as f:\n                logs = json.load(f)\n        except FileNotFoundError:\n            logs = []\n        \n        logs.append(entry)\n        \n        with open(self.log_file, ''w'') as f:\n            json.dump(logs, f, indent=2)\n    \n    def get_consistency(self):\n        try:\n            with open(self.log_file, ''r'') as f:\n                logs = json.load(f)\n            if not logs:\n                return 0.0\n            successes = sum(1 for log in logs if log[''success''])\n            return successes / len(logs)\n        except FileNotFoundError:\n            return 0.0\n```\n\n### Usage Example\n\n```python\ntracker = SkillTracker(\"csv-to-json\")\n\n# After each usage\ntracker.log_usage(\n    task=\"Transform users.csv to JSON\",\n    success=True,\n    feedback=\"Worked perfectly\"\n)\n\n# Or on failure\ntracker.log_usage(\n    task=\"Transform products.csv to JSON\",\n    success=False,\n    issues=[\"encoding_error\", \"missing_fields\"],\n    feedback=\"Failed on UTF-16 encoding\"\n)\n```\n\n## Step 3: Analyze Failures\n\n```python\ndef analyze_failures(skill_name):\n    tracker = SkillTracker(skill_name)\n    \n    with open(tracker.log_file, ''r'') as f:\n        logs = json.load(f)\n    \n    failures = [log for log in logs if not log[''success'']]\n    \n    # Group by issue type\n    issues_by_type = {}\n    for failure in failures:\n        for issue in failure[''issues'']:\n            if issue not in issues_by_type:\n                issues_by_type[issue] = []\n            issues_by_type[issue].append(failure)\n    \n    return issues_by_type\n```\n\n**Example output:**\n```\nencoding_errors: 3 occurrences\nmissing_fields: 5 occurrences\nmalformed_csv: 2 occurrences\n```\n\n## Step 4: Polish Based on Data\n\nAddress highest-frequency issues first:\n\n```bash\n# Analyze\npython analyze_skill.py csv-to-json\n# → missing_fields: 5 occurrences (highest priority)\n```\n\nUpdate skill:\n\n```markdown\n## Error Handling\n\n### Missing Fields\nValidate against schema and provide defaults:\n\n```python\nrequired_fields = [''id'', ''name'', ''email'']\nfor field in required_fields:\n    if field not in df.columns:\n        df[field] = None\n```\n```\n\nCommit as part of regular work:\n\n```bash\ngit add .claude/skills/csv-to-json/SKILL.md\ngit commit -m \"feat: add product import endpoint\n- Implement import logic\n- Update csv-to-json skill with missing field handling\"\n```\n\n## Step 5: Measure Improvement\n\n```python\ndef measure_evolution(skill_name, before_ref, after_ref):\n    \"\"\"\n    Compare skill performance before and after polishing\n    \"\"\"\n    # Load logs from git history or separate tracking\n    before_logs = load_logs(skill_name, before_ref)\n    after_logs = load_logs(skill_name, after_ref)\n    \n    before_consistency = calculate_consistency(before_logs)\n    after_consistency = calculate_consistency(after_logs)\n    \n    improvement = ((after_consistency - before_consistency) / \n                   before_consistency * 100)\n    \n    return {\n        ''before'': before_consistency,\n        ''after'': after_consistency,\n        ''improvement_percent'': improvement\n    }\n```\n\n**Target:** 20% consistency improvement per iteration cycle.\n\n## Versioning Strategy\n\nSemantic versioning for skills:\n\n```bash\n# MAJOR: Breaking changes\ngit commit -m \"feat!: change required fields (BREAKING)\"\n# Tag: my-skill-v2.0.0\n\n# MINOR: New features, backwards compatible\ngit commit -m \"feat: add Excel support\"\n# Tag: my-skill-v1.2.0\n\n# PATCH: Bug fixes, polishing\ngit commit -m \"fix: handle empty CSV files\"\n# Tag: my-skill-v1.1.1\n```\n\n## Example: Skill Evolution\n\n### v1.0.0 - Initial\n```yaml\nname: csv-to-json\ndescription: Transform CSV to JSON\n```\n**Consistency: 75%**\n\n### v1.1.0 - Error Handling\nAdded encoding detection and missing field handling.\n**Consistency: 85%** (+10%)\n\n### v1.2.0 - Feature Addition\nAdded Excel support and data cleaning.\n**Consistency: 90%** (+5%)\n\n**Total: 75% → 90% = 20% improvement**\n\n## Polishing Priorities\n\n1. **Fix high-frequency failures first**\n2. **Improve unclear instructions**\n3. **Add missing error handling**\n4. **Provide better examples**\n5. **Optimize performance**\n\n## When to Polish\n\n| Condition | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Failure rate > 10% | Analyze and fix |\n| User feedback confusion | Clarify instructions |\n| New edge cases | Add handling |\n| Better approaches emerge | Evaluate adoption |\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n| Phase | Skill | Output |\n|-------|-------|--------|\n| Bootstrap | skill-bootstrap | v1.0.0 |\n| Harden | skill-hardening | Bulletproof skill |\n| Extract | skill-extract-pattern | Session-based improvements |\n| **Evolve** | **skill-evolve** | **Long-term iteration** |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Keep Tracking Lightweight\n- JSON file is sufficient for most cases\n- Don''t over-engineer tracking\n- Focus on actionable data\n\n### Polish Incrementally\n- Small improvements add up\n- Measure each iteration\n- Revert if consistency drops\n\n### Document Evolution\n- Keep simple changelog\n- Tag stable versions\n- Note breaking changes\n\n## Version\n\nv1.0.0 (2025-01-28) - Evolution-focused refactor of skill-continuous-polishing"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:19:47.239Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing data-driven skill improvement and performance tracking.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要数据驱动的技能改进和性能跟踪。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。これらはデータ駆動のスキル改善とパフォーマンス追跡を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 데이터 驱动의 기술 개선과 성능 추적이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una mejora de habilidades basada en datos y un seguimiento del rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui ont besoin d''une amélioration des compétences basée sur les données et d''un suivi des performances.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine datengetriebene Fertigkeitsverbesserung und Leistungsverfolgung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de melhoria de habilidades baseada em dados e acompanhamento de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходима улучшение навыков на основе данных и отслеживание производительности.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين المهارات القائمة على البيانات وتتبع الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track skill usage, identify failure patterns, and iteratively polish skills using Electron, Svelte, and Cagent brand asset management, resulting in a 20% consistency gain through measurable improvement and real usage data analysis.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪技能使用、识别失败模式并使用Electron、Svelte和Cagent品牌资产管理迭代地改进技能的能力，从而通过可衡量的改进和实际使用数据分析实现20%的一致性提升。","ja":"Electron、Svelte、Cagentブランドのアセット管理を使用して、スキルの使用状況を追跡し、失敗パターンを特定し、スキルを繰り返し改良することで、20%の一貫性の向上を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 기술 사용을 추적하고 실패 패턴을 식별하고 Electron, Svelte 및 Cagent 브랜드 자산 관리를 사용하여 기술을 반복적으로 다듬을 수 있도록 하여 20%의 일관성을 얻을 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un seguimiento del uso de habilidades, identificar patrones de fallo y pulir habilidades de forma iterativa utilizando la gestión de activos de marca Electron, Svelte y Cagent, lo que resulta en una mejora de la coherencia del 20% a través de una mejora medible y análisis de datos de uso real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre l''utilisation des compétences, d''identifier les modèles de défaillance et d''affiner les compétences de manière itérative en utilisant la gestion des actifs de marque Electron, Svelte et Cagent, ce qui aboutit à un gain de cohérence de 20 % grâce à une amélioration mesurable et à l''analyse de données d''utilisation réelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Nutzung von Fertigkeiten zu verfolgen, Fehlermuster zu identifizieren und Fertigkeiten iterativ zu verfeinern, indem sie die Markenverwaltung von Electron, Svelte und Cagent nutzen, was zu einer Konsistenzsteigerung von 20% durch messbare Verbesserung und Analyse von Echtdaten führt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear o uso de habilidades, identificar padrões de falha e aprimorar iterativamente as habilidades usando o gerenciamento de ativos de marca Electron, Svelte e Cagent, resultando em um ganho de consistência de 20% por meio de melhoria mensurável e análise de dados de uso real.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность отслеживать использование навыков, выявлять закономерности неудач и итеративно совершенствовать навыки с помощью управления брендовыми активами Electron, Svelte и Cagent, что приводит к 20% приросту согласованности за счет измеримого улучшения и анализа реальных данных об использовании.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تتبع استخدام المهارات وتحديد أنماط الفشل وتجديدها بشكل متكرر باستخدام إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية لشركة Electron و Svelte و Cagent، مما يؤدي إلى زيادة في الاتساق بنسبة 20٪ من خلال التحسين القابل للقياس وتحليل بيانات الاستخدام الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating skill performance tracking","Identifying and addressing failure patterns","Polishing skills for team-specific expertise","Analyzing skill evolution over time"],"zh":["自动化技能性能跟踪","识别和解决失败模式","为团队特定专业知识而改进技能","随时间分析技能演化"],"ja":["スキルパフォーマンスの追跡の自動化","失敗パターンの特定と解決","チーム固有の専門知識のためのスキルの改良","時間の経過とともにスキルの進化の分析"],"ko":["기술 성능 추적 자동화","실패 패턴 식별 및 해결","팀 특정 전문 지식에 대한 기술 다듬기","시간이 지남에 따라 기술 진화 분석"],"es":["Automatizar el seguimiento del rendimiento de las habilidades","Identificar y abordar patrones de fallo","Pulir habilidades para la especialización del equipo","Analizar la evolución de las habilidades con el tiempo"],"fr":["Automatiser le suivi des performances des compétences","Identifier et traiter les modèles de défaillance","Affiner les compétences pour l''expertise spécifique de l''équipe","Analyser l''évolution des compétences au fil du temps"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsverfolgung von Fertigkeiten","Identifizieren und Ansprechen von Fehlermustern","Verfeinern von Fertigkeiten für teamspezifische E