tions à risque","Compatibilité avec plusieurs environnements de développement"],"de":["Integration von ChatGPT in Open-Source-Projekte","Erzeugung von JSON-Ausgaben für eine bessere automatische Lesbarkeit","Einhaltung von Regeln zur Minimierung von Änderungen und Vermeidung von Netzwerkzugriffen","Anfragen für Genehmigung bei riskanten Aktionen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Integração de inteligência artificial em projetos de desenvolvimento","Solucões inovadoras para melhorar a eficiência e a produtividade","Ferramenta de codificação para desenvolvedores","Compatibilidade com múltiplas linguagens de programação","Suporte a desenvolvimento de chatbots e assistentes virtuais","Integração com plataformas de desenvolvimento existentes"],"ru":["Интеграция искусственного интеллекта в проекты разработки","Инновационные решения для повышения эффективности и производительности","Инструмент кодирования для разработчиков","Совместимость с несколькими языками программирования","Поддержка разработки чат-ботов и виртуальных помощников","Интеграция с существующими платформами разработки"],"ar":["دمج الذكاء الاصطناعي في مشاريع التطوير","حلول مبتكرة لتحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية","أداة الترميز للمطورين","التوافق مع لغات برمجة متعددة","دعم تطوير البوتات المحادثة والمساعدين الافتراضيين","التكامل مع منصات التطوير الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ChatGPT","桥接技术","对话式 AI","开发解决方案","机器学习","自然语言处理"],"ja":["ChatGPT","ブリッジ","会話式 AI","開発ソリューション","マシンラーニング","自然言語処理"],"ko":["ChatGPT","브릿지","대화형 AI","개발 솔루션","기계 학습","자연어 처리"],"es":["chatgpt-bridge","integración de ChatGPT","desarrollo de software","proyectos de código abierto","herramientas de desarrollo","JSON","automatización"],"fr":["chatgpt-bridge","intégration de ChatGPT","développement de logiciels","projets open source","outils de développement","JSON","automatisation"],"de":["chatgpt-bridge","Integration von ChatGPT","Softwareentwicklung","Open-Source-Projekte","Entwicklungstools","JSON","Automatisierung"],"pt":["ChatGPT Bridge","Inteligência artificial","Desenvolvimento de software","Chatbots","Assistentes virtuais","Integração de IA","Ferramentas de codificação","Linguagens de programação","Plataformas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Мост ChatGPT","Искусственный интеллект","Разработка программного обеспечения","Чат-боты","Виртуальные помощники","Интеграция ИИ","Инструменты кодирования","Языки программирования","Платформы разработки"],"ar":["جسر ChatGPT","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","البوتات المحادثة","المساعدين الافتراضيين","دمج الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الترميز","لغات البرمجة","منصات التطوير"]}},"owner":"yusuke124358","repo":"keiba","repoPath":"yusuke124358/keiba","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"chatgpt-bridge","description":"ChatGPT bridge workflow skill","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# chatgpt-bridge\n\n## Role\nYou are Codex working on a repo for a ChatGPT bridge. Always produce machine-readable JSON as final output, strictly matching the provided output schema.\n\n## Rules\n- Read the task and verify completion criteria. If unclear, ask in `needs_user_input` and set `status` to `needs_approval`.\n- Prefer minimal changes.\n- Avoid network access unless explicitly allowed.\n- If any action seems risky or requires confirmation, set `status` to `needs_approval` and explain in `summary","body":"# chatgpt-bridge\n\n## Role\nYou are Codex working on a repo for a ChatGPT bridge. Always produce machine-readable JSON as final output, strictly matching the provided output schema.\n\n## Rules\n- Read the task and verify completion criteria. If unclear, ask in `needs_user_input` and set `status` to `needs_approval`.\n- Prefer minimal changes.\n- Avoid network access unless explicitly allowed.\n- If any action seems risky or requires confirmation, set `status` to `needs_approval` and explain in `summary` and `needs_user_input`.\n\n## Output\nReturn ONLY a JSON object that matches the given schema. No extra text.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:20:08.803Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing seamless integration with ChatGPT services via JSON output.","zh":"非常适合需要与ChatGPT服务通过JSON输出实现无缝集成的AI代理。","ja":"ChatGPTサービスとのシームレスな統合を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。JSON出力による。","ko":"ChatGPT 서비스와 JSON 출력을 통해無縫な統合을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una integración sin problemas con los servicios de ChatGPT a través de la salida JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente avec les services ChatGPT via la sortie JSON.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit ChatGPT-Diensten über JSON-Ausgabe benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de integração sem interrupções com os serviços do ChatGPT via saída JSON.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с сервисами ChatGPT через выходные данные JSON.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد集امع دون انقطاع مع خدمات ChatGPT من خلال مخرجات JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bridge interactions with ChatGPT, facilitating tasks through machine-readable JSON output, strictly adhering to predefined schemas, and leveraging Codex for efficient processing, all while minimizing network access and preferring minimal changes.","zh":"赋予代理人通过机器可读的JSON输出与ChatGPT进行交互的能力，通过严格遵循预定义的模式并利用Codex进行高效处理，同时尽量减少网络访问并更倾向于最小化更改。","ja":"ChatGPTとのやり取りを可能にし、機械可読のJSON出力を通じてタスクを円滑に進め、事前定義されたスキーマに厳格に従い、Codexを 利用して効率的な処理を行い、ネットワークアクセスを最小限に抑え、可能な限り最小の変更を好む。","ko":"에이전트가 ChatGPT와 상호 작용을 가능하게 하며, máy기기 가독성 JSON 출력을 통해 태스크를 원활하게 진행하고,事前 정의된 스키마를 엄격히 준수하며, Codex를 활용하여 효율적인 처리를 수행하며, 네트워크 접근을 최소화하고, 가능한 한 최소한의 변경 사항을 선호합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a conectar interacciones con ChatGPT, facilitando tareas a través de una salida JSON legible por máquina, que se adhiere estrictamente a esquemas predefinidos, y aprovecha Codex para un procesamiento eficiente, todo esto mientras se minimiza el acceso a la red y se prefieren cambios mínimos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de relier les interactions avec ChatGPT, facilitant les tâches via une sortie JSON lisible par machine, en respectant strictement les schémas prédéfinis, et en exploitant Codex pour un traitement efficace, le tout en minimisant l''accès au réseau et en préférant des modifications minimales.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Interaktionen mit ChatGPT zu verbinden, Aufgaben durch maschinenlesbare JSON-Ausgaben zu erleichtern, die sich streng an vorgegebene Schemata halten, und Codex für effizientes Verarbeiten zu nutzen, all dies unter Minimierung des Netzwerkzugriffs und bevorzugter minimaler Änderungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar pontes entre interações com o ChatGPT, facilitando tarefas por meio de saídas JSON legíveis por máquina, aderindo estritamente a esquemas pré-definidos e utilizando o Codex para processamento eficiente, minimizando ao mesmo tempo o acesso à rede e preferindo alterações mínimas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью соединять взаимодействия с ChatGPT, облегчая задачи посредством машинно-читаемых выходных данных JSON, строго придерживаясь предопределенных схем и используя Codex для эффективной обработки, минимизируя при этом доступ к сети и отдавая предпочтение минимальным изменениям.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ربط التفاعلات مع ChatGPT، وتسهيل المهام من خلال مخرجات JSON يمكن قراءتها آليًا، والالتزام стрicktًا بالمواصفات المحددة مسبقًا، واستخدام Codex للمعالجة الفعالة، مع تحقيق الحد الأدنى من الوصول إلى الشبكة و تفضيل التغييرات الطفيفة في نفس الوقت."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying completion criteria for ChatGPT tasks","Generating machine-readable JSON outputs for ChatGPT interactions","Managing task status through needs_approval and needs_user_input protocols"],"zh":["验证ChatGPT任务的完成标准","生成用于ChatGPT交互的机器可读JSON输出","通过needs_approval和needs_user_input协议管理任务状态"],"ja":["ChatGPTタスクの完了基準を検証する","ChatGPTとのやり取りに使用される機械可読のJSON出力を生成する","needs_approvalおよびneeds_user_inputプロトコルを通じてタスクの状態を管理する"],"ko":["ChatGPT 태스크의 완료 기준을 검증하기","ChatGPT 상호 작용을 위한 기계 가독성 JSON 출력을 생성하기","needs_approval 및 needs_user_input 프로토콜을 통해 태스크 상태를 관리하기"],"es":["Verificar los criterios de finalización para las tareas de ChatGPT","Generar salidas JSON legibles por máquina para interacciones de ChatGPT","Administrar el estado de la tarea a través de los protocolos needs_approval y needs_user_input"],"fr":["Vérifier les critères d''achèvement pour les tâches de ChatGPT","Générer des sorties JSON lisibles par machine pour les interactions de ChatGPT","Gérer l''état de la tâche via les protocoles needs_approval et needs_user_input"],"de":["Überprüfen der Abschlusskriterien für ChatGPT-Aufgaben","Generieren maschinenlesbarer JSON-Ausgaben für ChatGPT-Interaktionen","Verwalten des Aufgabenstatus über die Protokolle needs_approval und needs_user_input"],"pt":["Verificar critérios de conclusão para tarefas do ChatGPT","Gerar saídas JSON legíveis por máquina para interações com o ChatGPT","Gerenciar status de tarefas por meio dos protocolos needs_approval e needs_user_input"],"ru":["Проверка критериев завершения задач ChatGPT","Генерация машинно-читаемых выходных данных JSON для взаимодействий с ChatGPT","Управление статусом задач посредством протоколов needs_approval и needs_user_input"],"ar":["التحقق من معايير الانتهاء من مهام ChatGPT","генерация مخرجات JSON يمكن قراءتها آليًا للتفاعلات مع ChatGPT","إدارة حالة المهام من خلال بروتوكولات needs_approval و needs_user_input"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to provided output schema","Preferably minimizes network access unless explicitly allowed","May require user approval for risky actions"],"zh":["需要严格遵循提供的输出模式","除非明确允许，否则最小化网络访问","可能需要用户批准进行风险操作"],"ja":["提供された出力スキーマに厳格に従う必要がある","明示的に許可されない限り、ネットワークアクセスを最小限に抑える","リスク操作の場合、ユーザーの承認が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["제공된 출력 스키마를 엄격히 준수해야 함","명시적으로 허용되지 않는 한 네트워크 접근을 최소화함","리스크 작업의 경우 사용자 승인이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adherencia al esquema de salida proporcionado","Preferiblemente minimiza el acceso a la red a menos que se permita explícitamente","Puede requerir aprobación del usuario para acciones de riesgo"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte au schéma de sortie fourni","Préfère minimiser l''accès au réseau à moins qu''il ne soit explicitement autorisé","Peut nécessiter l''approbation de l''utilisateur pour des actions à risque"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung des bereitgestellten Ausgabeschemas","Minimiert vorzugsweise den Netzwerkzugriff, es sei denn, er ist ausdrücklich erlaubt","Kann die Zustimmung des Benutzers für riskante Aktionen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita ao esquema de saída fornecido","Preferencialmente minimiza o acesso à rede a menos que explicitamente permitido","Pode exigir aprovação do usuário para ações de risco"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения предоставленной схемы выходных данных","Предпочтительно минимизирует доступ к сети, если не разрешено явно","Может требовать одобрения пользователя для рискованных действий"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بالمواصفات المحددة مسبقًا","يفضل تحقيق الحد الأدنى من الوصول إلى الشبكة ما لم يكن مسموحًا به صراحة","يمكن أن يتطلب موافقة المستخدم على الإجراءات الخطرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown/conversion-mapping-rules', 'community', 'kreuzberg-dev', 'html-to-markdown', 'kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown', 'conversion-mapping-rules', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z', '2026-02-18T06:20:02.373Z', NULL, '{"id":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown/conversion-mapping-rules","name":"conversion-mapping-rules","description":{"zh":"本文介绍了HTML到Markdown的转换映射规则，涵盖60+个HTML元素类型的转换逻辑","ja":"この文章では、HTMLからMarkdownへの変換マッピングルールについて説明します。60以上のHTML要素タイプの変換ロジックをカバーしています","ko":"이 문서는 HTML을 Markdown으로 변환하는 매핑 규칙을 설명하며 60개 이상의 HTML 요소 유형을 변환하는 논리를 다룹니다","es":"Este skill describe cómo se mapean los elementos HTML a sus equivalentes en Markdown, manteniendo la precisión semántica y respetando las variaciones de sintaxis de Markdown.","fr":"Ce skill décrit comment les éléments HTML sont mappés à leurs équivalents en Markdown, en maintenant la précision sémantique et en respectant les variations de syntaxe de Markdown.","de":"Dieses Skill beschreibt, wie HTML-Elemente auf ihre Markdown-Äquivalente abgebildet werden, wobei die semantische Genauigkeit beibehalten und die Syntax-Variationen von Markdown respektiert werden.","pt":"O mapeamento de conversão de HTML para Markdown é uma habilidade que permite converter elementos HTML em seus equivalentes Markdown, respeitando a sintaxe e a semântica.","ru":"Преобразование HTML в Markdown - это навык, который позволяет преобразовывать элементы HTML в их эквивалент Markdown, соблюдая синтаксис и семантику.","ar":"تحويل الخريطة من HTML إلى Markdown هو مهارة تسمح بتحويل عناصر HTML إلى ما يعادلها من Markdown ، مع احترام البناء وال-semântica.","en":"High performance and CommonMark compliant HTML to Markdown converter. Maintained by the Kreuzberg team. Kreuzberg is a fast, polyglot document intelligence engine with a Rust core. It extracts structured data from 56+ document formats using streaming parsers and built-in OCR."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"HTML转Markdown转换映射规则","ja":"HTMLからMarkdownへの変換マッピングルール","ko":"HTML을 Markdown으로 변환 매핑 규칙","es":"Reglas de mapeo de conversión: HTML a Markdown","fr":"Règles de mappage de conversion : HTML en Markdown","de":"Konvertierungs-Mapping-Regeln: HTML zu Markdown","pt":"Regras de Mapeamento de Conversão: HTML para Markdown","ru":"Правила преобразования: HTML в Markdown","ar":"قواعد تحويل الخريطة: HTML إلى Markdown","en":"conversion-mapping-rules"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍了HTML到Markdown的转换映射规则，涵盖60+个HTML元素类型的转换逻辑","ja":"この文章では、HTMLからMarkdownへの変換マッピングルールについて説明します。60以上のHTML要素タイプの変換ロジックをカバーしています","ko":"이 문서는 HTML을 Markdown으로 변환하는 매핑 규칙을 설명하며 60개 이상의 HTML 요소 유형을 변환하는 논리를 다룹니다","es":"Este skill describe cómo se mapean los elementos HTML a sus equivalentes en Markdown, manteniendo la precisión semántica y respetando las variaciones de sint...","fr":"Ce skill décrit comment les éléments HTML sont mappés à leurs équivalents en Markdown, en maintenant la précision sémantique et en respectant les variations ...","de":"Dieses Skill beschreibt, wie HTML-Elemente auf ihre Markdown-Äquivalente abgebildet werden, wobei die semantische Genauigkeit beibehalten und die Syntax-Vari...","pt":"O mapeamento de conversão de HTML para Markdown é uma habilidade que permite converter elementos HTML em seus equivalentes Markdown, respeitando a sintaxe e ...","ru":"Преобразование HTML в Markdown - это навык, который позволяет преобразовывать элементы HTML в их эквивалент Markdown, соблюдая синтаксис и семантику.","ar":"تحويل الخريطة من HTML إلى Markdown هو مهارة تسمح بتحويل عناصر HTML إلى ما يعادلها من Markdown ، مع احترام البناء وال-semântica.","en":"High performance and CommonMark compliant HTML to Markdown converter. Maintained by the Kreuzberg team. Kreuzberg is a fast, polyglot document intelligence e..."},"definition":{"en":"High performance and CommonMark compliant HTML to Markdown converter. Maintained by the Kreuzberg team. Kreuzberg is a fast, polyglot document intelligence engine with a Rust core. It extracts structured data from 56+ document formats using streaming parsers and built-in OCR."},"features":{"zh":["支持60+个HTML元素类型","保持语义准确性","尊重Markdown语法变体","高性能转换","CommonMark兼容"],"ja":["60以上のHTML要素タイプをサポート","意味的精度を維持","Markdownの文法変種を尊重","高性能変換","CommonMarkに互換性あり"],"ko":["60개 이상의 HTML 요소 유형 지원","의미적 정확성을 유지","Markdown 문법 변형을尊重","고성능 변환","CommonMark와 호환"],"es":["Mantiene la precisión semántica","Respeto de las variaciones de sintaxis de Markdown","Soporte para 60+ elementos HTML","Compatibilidad con CommonMark","Mapeo de elementos de encabezado (h1-h6)","Soporte para estilos de código (fenced vs indented)"],"fr":["Maintient la précision sémantique","Respect des variations de syntaxe de Markdown","Prise en charge de 60+ éléments HTML","Compatibilité avec CommonMark","Mappage des éléments de titre (h1-h6)","Prise en charge des styles de code (fenced vs indented)"],"de":["Beibehaltung der semantischen Genauigkeit","Respektierung der Syntax-Variationen von Markdown","Unterstützung für 60+ HTML-Elemente","Kompatibilität mit CommonMark","Abbildung von Überschriften-Elementen (h1-h6)","Unterstützung für Code-Stile (fenced vs indented)"],"pt":["Conversão de 60+ elementos HTML em Markdown","Respeito às variações de sintaxe Markdown","Manutenção da semântica e da estrutura dos documentos","Suporte a streaming parsers e OCR","Desenvolvido em Rust para alta performance"],"ru":["Преобразование 60+ элементов HTML в Markdown","Соблюдение вариаций синтаксиса Markdown","Сохранение семантики и структуры документов","Поддержка потоковых парсеров и OCR","Разработано на Rust для высокой производительности"],"ar":["تحويل 60+ عنصر HTML إلى Markdown","احترام تنوعات بناء الجملة Markdown","الحفاظ على Семантика و هيكل المستندات","دعم المُحللين المتدفقين و OCR","تم تطويره بلغة Rust للحصول على أداء عالٍ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HTML转Markdown","转换映射规则","Kreuzberg","高性能转换","CommonMark兼容","语义准确性"],"ja":["HTMLからMarkdownへの変換","変換マッピングルール","Kreuzberg","高性能変換","CommonMarkに互換性あり","意味的精度"],"ko":["HTML을 Markdown으로 변환","변환 매핑 규칙","Kreuzberg","고성능 변환","CommonMark와 호환","의미적 정확성"],"es":["conversión HTML a Markdown","reglas de mapeo de conversión","precisión semántica","CommonMark","elementos HTML","estilos de código","desarrollo web","ingeniería de documentación"],"fr":["conversion HTML en Markdown","règles de mappage de conversion","précision sémantique","CommonMark","éléments HTML","styles de code","développement web","ingénierie de documentation"],"de":["Konvertierung von HTML in Markdown","Konvertierungs-Mapping-Regeln","semantische Genauigkeit","CommonMark","HTML-Elemente","Code-Stile","Webentwicklung","Dokumenten-Engineering"],"pt":["conversão html para markdown","mapeamento de conversão","regras de conversão","markdown syntax","html to markdown","desenvolvimento web","rust","streaming parsers","ocr"],"ru":["преобразование html в markdown","правила преобразования","синтаксис markdown","html в markdown","веб-разработка","rust","потоковые парсеры","ocr"],"ar":["تحويل html إلى markdown","قواعد تحويل الخريطة","بناء الجملة markdown","html إلى markdown","تطوير الويب","rust","مُحللين متدفقين","ocr"]}},"owner":"kreuzberg-dev","repo":"html-to-markdown","repoPath":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"conversion-mapping-rules","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Conversion Mapping Rules: HTML Elements to Markdown\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill documents how html-to-markdown maps 60+ HTML element types to their Markdown equivalents. The conversion logic respects Markdown syntax variations (ATX vs Setext headings, fenced vs indented code, etc.) and maintains semantic accuracy.\n\n## Heading Elements (h1-h6)\n\n### ATX Style (Default)\n\n```markdown\n# Heading 1\n## Heading 2\n### Heading 3\n#### Heading 4\n##### Heading 5\n###### Heading 6\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Opti","body":"# Conversion Mapping Rules: HTML Elements to Markdown\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill documents how html-to-markdown maps 60+ HTML element types to their Markdown equivalents. The conversion logic respects Markdown syntax variations (ATX vs Setext headings, fenced vs indented code, etc.) and maintains semantic accuracy.\n\n## Heading Elements (h1-h6)\n\n### ATX Style (Default)\n\n```markdown\n# Heading 1\n## Heading 2\n### Heading 3\n#### Heading 4\n##### Heading 5\n###### Heading 6\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Option: `HeadingStyle::Atx` (default)\n- Each heading level uses n hashes\n- Single space after hashes required\n- Trailing hashes optional (ATX closed style adds them)\n\n**HTML Example:**\n```html\n<h1>Title</h1>          → # Title\n<h2 id=\"intro\">Intro</h2> → ## Intro\n<h3>Detail</h3>         → ### Detail\n```\n\n### Setext/Underlined Style\n\n```markdown\nHeading 1\n=========\n\nHeading 2\n---------\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Option: `HeadingStyle::Underlined`\n- H1: `=` characters for full line width\n- H2: `-` characters for full line width\n- H3+ not supported in Setext (fallback to ATX)\n\n**HTML Example:**\n```html\n<h1>Main Title</h1>  → Main Title\\n===========\n<h2>Subtitle</h2>    → Subtitle\\n---------\n<h3>Detail</h3>      → ### Detail (fallback to ATX)\n```\n\n### ATX Closed Style\n\n```markdown\n# Heading 1 #\n## Heading 2 ##\n### Heading 3 ###\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Option: `HeadingStyle::AtxClosed`\n- Closing hashes must match opening count\n- Single space before closing hashes\n- Less common, but valid Markdown\n\n## Block-Level Elements\n\n### Paragraph (`<p>`)\n\n**Mapping:**\n- Text content extracted and escaped\n- Trailing/leading whitespace trimmed\n- Single newline after paragraph\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<p>This is a paragraph with <strong>bold</strong> text.</p>\n→ This is a paragraph with **bold** text.\\n\n```\n\n### Division (`<div>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Transparent wrapper for Markdown\n- Content treated as block-level\n- No wrapping markers in output\n- Preserves child semantics\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<div>\n  <p>Paragraph inside div</p>\n</div>\n→ Paragraph inside div\\n\n```\n\n### Blockquote (`<blockquote>`)\n\n**Mapping:**\n- Each line prefixed with `> `\n- Nested blockquotes: `> > `\n- Handles multiple paragraphs\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Quote line 1</p>\n  <p>Quote line 2</p>\n</blockquote>\n→ > Quote line 1\\n>\\n> Quote line 2\\n\n```\n\n### Preformatted Text (`<pre>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Whitespace preserved exactly\n- Treated as code block (see Code Blocks below)\n- No entity decoding in content\n- Trimmed and indented\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<pre>    code with spaces</pre>\n→ (indented code or fenced, depends on CodeBlockStyle)\n```\n\n### Code Blocks\n\n**Indented Style (Default):**\n```markdown\n    line 1\n    line 2\n    line 3\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Option: `CodeBlockStyle::Indented`\n- Each line prefixed with 4 spaces\n- Requires blank line before/after\n- CommonMark default\n\n**Fenced Backtick Style:**\n```markdown\n```language\ncode here\n```\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Option: `CodeBlockStyle::Backticks`\n- Triple backticks with optional language specifier\n- Language from HTML class (e.g., `language-rust` → `rust`)\n- Can contain blank lines\n\n**Fenced Tilde Style:**\n```markdown\n~~~rust\ncode here\n~~~\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Option: `CodeBlockStyle::Tildes`\n- Triple tildes with optional language specifier\n- Less common variant of fenced style\n\n**HTML Mapping:**\n```html\n<pre><code>simple code</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">def foo(): pass</code></pre>\n<pre>indented code</pre>\n```\n\n### Horizontal Rule (`<hr>`)\n\n**Output:** `---\\n` (three dashes)\n\n**Alternatives:** `***`, `___` all valid but standardized to `---`\n\n### List Elements\n\n#### Unordered Lists (`<ul>`)\n\n**Default Syntax (dashes):**\n```markdown\n- Item 1\n- Item 2\n  - Nested item\n    - Deeply nested\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- `-` marker (could be `*` or `+`, but `-` is default)\n- Indentation for nesting: spaces or tabs\n- Option: `ListIndentType::Spaces` (default) or `ListIndentType::Tabs`\n\n#### Ordered Lists (`<ol>`)\n\n```markdown\n1. First item\n2. Second item\n3. Third item\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- `1.` through `9.` for first 9 items (reset per list)\n- Number must be followed by `. ` (dot space)\n- Indentation matches unordered for nesting\n\n#### List Items (`<li>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Content can include block elements (paragraphs, code blocks)\n- Continuation lines indented to match marker\n- Multi-line items:\n\n```markdown\n- First paragraph\n\n  Second paragraph (indented)\n```\n\n**HTML Example:**\n```html\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Item with paragraph</p>\n    <p>Second paragraph</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n#### Definition Lists (`<dl>`, `<dt>`, `<dd>`)\n\n```markdown\nTerm\n:   Definition\n\nAnother Term\n:   Definition 1\n:   Definition 2\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- `<dt>`: Term on its own line\n- `<dd>`: Definition with `:` prefix and indentation\n- Multiple definitions per term supported\n\n### Tables (`<table>`, `<tr>`, `<td>`, `<th>`)\n\n**Mapping:**\n```markdown\n| Header 1 | Header 2 |\n|----------|----------|\n| Cell 1   | Cell 2   |\n| Cell 3   | Cell 4   |\n```\n\n**Implementation:**\n- `<table>` → GFM (GitHub Flavored Markdown) table\n- `<thead>` content becomes header row\n- `<tbody>` rows become data rows\n- Cells separated by `|` pipes\n- Separator row: `|---|---|` (minimum 3 dashes)\n- Right-alignment: `:---|` Left: `|:--` Center: `:--:`\n\n**Cell Content:**\n- Escaped for pipe characters (`|` → `\\|`)\n- Nested elements converted (e.g., `<strong>` → `**`)\n- Newlines converted to `<br>` representation\n\n### Semantic HTML5 Elements\n\n#### Article (`<article>`)\n- Treated as transparent block wrapper\n- No semantic markers in Markdown\n- Content flows as-is\n\n#### Section (`<section>`)\n- Transparent block wrapper\n- Could insert heading separator in future\n\n#### Nav (`<nav>`)\n- List-like wrapper\n- Children converted normally\n- Could insert navigation markers\n\n#### Aside (`<aside>`)\n- Optional blockquote prefix (configurable)\n- Or treated as transparent block\n\n#### Header (`<header>`)\n- Transparent wrapper\n- Content converted normally\n\n#### Footer (`<footer>`)\n- Transparent wrapper\n- Could insert footer marker (e.g., `---\\n`)\n\n#### Main (`<main>`)\n- Transparent wrapper\n- Content flows normally\n\n## Inline Elements\n\n### Emphasis (`<em>`, `<i>`)\n\n**Mapping:** `*text*` or `_text_`\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Default: `*` (asterisk italic)\n- No underscore escaping needed in this context\n- Trimmed of excess whitespace\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<em>emphasized</em>  → *emphasized*\n<i>italic</i>        → *italic*\n```\n\n### Strong (`<strong>`, `<b>`)\n\n**Mapping:** `**text**`\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Double asterisks (bold)\n- Trimmed of excess whitespace\n- Can be nested with emphasis\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<strong>bold</strong>           → **bold**\n<b>bold</b>                     → **bold**\n<strong><em>bold italic</em></strong> → ***bold italic***\n```\n\n### Code (`<code>`)\n\n**Mapping:** `` `text` `` (backtick inline code)\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Single backticks for inline\n- Escaped if backticks present in content\n- No entity decoding within code\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<code>variable_name</code>        → `variable_name`\n<code>don''t</code>                → `don''t`\n<code>`already_quoted`</code>     → `` `already_quoted` ``\n```\n\n### Link (`<a href>`)\n\n**Mapping:** `[link text](url \"title\")`\n\n**Implementation:**\n- `href` attribute becomes URL\n- Text content becomes link text\n- `title` attribute becomes optional title (in quotes)\n- URL preserved as-is (no extra encoding)\n- Special link types:\n  - `href=\"#section\"` → Anchor link\n  - `href=\"/page\"` → Internal link (relative)\n  - `href=\"https://external.com\"` → External link\n  - `href=\"mailto:user@example.com\"` → Email link\n  - `href=\"tel:+1234567890\"` → Phone link\n\n**Examples:**\n```html\n<a href=\"https://example.com\">Link</a>\n→ [Link](https://example.com)\n\n<a href=\"/page\" title=\"My Page\">Internal</a>\n→ [Internal](/page \"My Page\")\n\n<a href=\"#section\">Anchor</a>\n→ [Anchor](#section)\n\n<a href=\"mailto:test@example.com\">Email</a>\n→ [Email](mailto:test@example.com)\n```\n\n### Image (`<img>`)\n\n**Mapping:** `![alt text](url \"title\")`\n\n**Implementation:**\n- `src` attribute becomes URL\n- `alt` attribute becomes alt text\n- `title` attribute becomes optional title\n- Dimensions (`width`, `height`) captured in metadata\n- Data URIs: `![alt](data:image/png;base64,...)`\n- Relative paths preserved\n\n**Examples:**\n```html\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"A photo\">\n→ ![A photo](photo.jpg)\n\n<img src=\"image.png\" alt=\"Image\" title=\"My Image\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\">\n→ ![Image](image.png \"My Image\")\n\n<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,...\" alt=\"Embedded\">\n→ ![Embedded](data:image/png;base64,...)\n```\n\n### Line Break (`<br>`)\n\n**Mapping:**\n- Two spaces + newline: `  \\n`\n- Or backslash + newline: `\\\\\\n`\n\n**Option:** `NewlineStyle::Spaces` (default) or `NewlineStyle::Backslash`\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<p>Line 1<br>Line 2</p>\n→ Line 1  \\nLine 2\\n\n```\n\n### Strikethrough (`<s>`, `<del>`, `<strike>`)\n\n**Mapping:** `~~strikethrough~~`\n\n**Implementation:**\n- GFM strikethrough syntax (double tilde)\n- Not standard Markdown, but widely supported\n- Trimmed of excess whitespace\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<del>removed text</del>  → ~~removed text~~\n<s>strikethrough</s>     → ~~strikethrough~~\n```\n\n### Subscript/Superscript (`<sub>`, `<sup>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- No native Markdown support\n- Typically converted to plain text or HTML passthrough\n- Implementation: Extract text content, no markup\n\n**Example:**\n```html\nH<sub>2</sub>O          → H2O (plain text)\nE=mc<sup>2</sup>        → E=mc2 (plain text)\n```\n\n### Mark/Highlight (`<mark>`)\n\n**Options:**\n1. `HighlightStyle::DoubleEqual`: `==text==`\n2. `HighlightStyle::Html`: `<mark>text</mark>`\n3. `HighlightStyle::Bold`: `**text**`\n4. `HighlightStyle::None`: plain text\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<mark>highlighted</mark>\n→ ==highlighted==  (DoubleEqual mode)\n→ <mark>highlighted</mark>  (Html mode)\n→ **highlighted**  (Bold mode)\n```\n\n### Ruby Annotations (`<ruby>`, `<rt>`, `<rp>`)\n\n**Mapping:**\n- Japanese ruby text support\n- Format: `text {rt_text}` or similar\n- Implementation: Extract base text with rt annotation\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<ruby>漢字<rt>かんじ</rt></ruby>\n→ 漢字 (かんじ)\n```\n\n## Media Elements\n\n### Audio (`<audio>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- No direct Markdown equivalent\n- Typically extracted as metadata or skipped\n- Could insert link to source if `src` attribute\n\n**Handling:**\n```html\n<audio src=\"sound.mp3\">Audio</audio>\n→ (Skipped or converted to link in metadata)\n```\n\n### Video (`<video>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Similar to audio\n- Could extract `poster` image\n- Typically skipped in markdown output\n\n### Picture/Source (`<picture>`, `<source>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Responsive image container\n- Extract from child `<img>` inside\n- Or use first source `src`\n\n## Form Elements\n\n### Input (`<input>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Generally skipped or marked as form element\n- Could convert to metadata about form structure\n- Types: text, checkbox, radio, button, hidden\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Placeholder preserved in metadata\n- Value not typically included in markdown\n\n### Select/Option (`<select>`, `<option>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Converted to list or metadata\n- Option text extracted\n- Selected state noted\n\n### Button (`<button>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Text content extracted (ignores `<button>` wrapper)\n- Click handlers ignored\n- Treated as inline text\n\n### Textarea (`<textarea>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Content treated as code block or preformatted\n- Whitespace preserved\n\n## Special Elements\n\n### SVG (`<svg>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Can be preserved as inline image or skipped\n- Feature: `inline-images` can extract inline SVG\n- Typically rendered as-is in compatible markdown renderers\n\n### MathML (`<math>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Skipped in standard markdown\n- Could be preserved with feature gate\n- Converted to LaTeX or plain text fallback\n\n### iframe (`<iframe>`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Generally skipped\n- Could extract as metadata (video embeds, etc.)\n- URL captured if needed\n\n## Whitespace and Formatting Context\n\n### Whitespace Mode\n\n**Normalized (default):**\n- Multiple spaces collapsed to single space\n- Multiple newlines → single newline\n- Leading/trailing whitespace trimmed per element\n\n**Strict:**\n- All whitespace preserved exactly\n- Multiple spaces and newlines intact\n- Useful for poetry, ASCII art, etc.\n\n### Text Escaping\n\n**Options:**\n- `escape_asterisks`: `*` → `\\*`\n- `escape_underscores`: `_` → `\\_`\n- `escape_misc`: Special chars `\\ & < ` [ > ~ # = + | -`\n- `escape_ascii`: All ASCII punctuation (CommonMark spec)\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<p>Price: $10 & free shipping *limited time*</p>\n\nescape_misc=true:\n→ Price: $10 \\& free shipping *limited time*\n\nescape_asterisks=true:\n→ Price: $10 & free shipping \\*limited time\\*\n\nescape_ascii=true:\n→ Price: \\$10 \\& free shipping \\*limited time\\*\n```\n\n## Implementation Details Location\n\n**Key Files:**\n- `/crates/html-to-markdown/src/converter.rs` - Element dispatch and conversion\n- `/crates/html-to-markdown/src/options.rs` - Style configuration enums\n- `/crates/html-to-markdown/src/text.rs` - Text escaping and normalization\n\n## Element Dispatch Example\n\n```rust\n// From converter.rs pattern\nmatch element.tag_name() {\n    \"h1\" | \"h2\" | \"h3\" | \"h4\" | \"h5\" | \"h6\" => convert_heading(...),\n    \"p\" => convert_paragraph(...),\n    \"a\" => convert_link(...),\n    \"img\" => convert_image(...),\n    \"strong\" | \"b\" => convert_strong(...),\n    \"em\" | \"i\" => convert_em(...),\n    \"code\" => convert_code(...),\n    \"pre\" => convert_pre(...),\n    \"blockquote\" => convert_blockquote(...),\n    \"ul\" | \"ol\" => convert_list(...),\n    \"li\" => convert_list_item(...),\n    \"table\" => convert_table(...),\n    \"br\" => convert_br(...),\n    \"hr\" => convert_hr(...),\n    // ... 40+ more elements\n    _ => convert_generic_element(...)\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Element Reference\n\nSee `/crates/html-to-markdown/src/visitor.rs` for exhaustive `NodeType` enum covering all 60+ supported elements.\n\n## Quick Reference Table\n\n| HTML Element | Markdown Output | Notes |\n|--------------|-----------------|-------|\n| `<h1>` | `# text` | ATX style default |\n| `<p>` | `text\\n` | Paragraph |\n| `<strong>` | `**text**` | Bold |\n| `<em>` | `*text*` | Italic |\n| `<a href>` | `[text](url)` | Link |\n| `<img>` | `![alt](src)` | Image |\n| `<ul>` | `- item` | Unordered list |\n| `<ol>` | `1. item` | Ordered list |\n| `<code>` | `` `text` `` | Inline code |\n| `<pre>` | Indented or fenced | Code block |\n| `<blockquote>` | `> text` | Quote |\n| `<table>` | GFM table | Pipe-delimited |\n| `<br>` | `  \\n` | Line break |\n| `<hr>` | `---` | Horizontal rule |\n| `<del>` | `~~text~~` | Strikethrough |\n| `<mark>` | `==text==` | Highlight (configurable) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:20:02.373Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Text Processing Agents requiring high-performance HTML to Markdown conversion with CommonMark compliance.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能HTML到Markdown转换的文本处理代理，且符合CommonMark标准。","ja":"テキスト処理エージェントが高性能のHTMLからMarkdownへの変換を必要とする場合に適しています。CommonMark準拠です。","ko":"고성능 HTML에서 Markdown로의 변환을 필요로 하는 텍스트 처리 에이전트에게 적합합니다. CommonMark 규격을 준수합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de procesamiento de texto que requieren una conversión de HTML a Markdown de alto rendimiento con cumplimiento de CommonMark.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de traitement de texte nécessitant une conversion HTML vers Markdown à haute performance avec une conformité CommonMark.","de":"Perfekt für Textverarbeitungsagenten, die eine Hochleistungs-HTML-zu-Markdown-Konvertierung mit CommonMark-Konformität erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Texto que exigem conversão de HTML para Markdown de alto desempenho com conformidade com o CommonMark.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки текста, требующих высокопроизводительного преобразования HTML в Markdown с соблюдением спецификации CommonMark.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معالجة النص الذين يتطلبون تحويل HTML إلى Markdown بأداء عالٍ مع امتثال لمواصفات CommonMark."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to accurately convert 60+ HTML element types to Markdown equivalents, respecting syntax variations like ATX vs Setext headings and maintaining semantic accuracy using Rust core and streaming parsers.","zh":"使代理能够准确地将60多种HTML元素类型转换为Markdown等价类型，尊重语法变体，如ATX和Setext标题，并使用Rust核心和流解析器维护语义准确性。","ja":"エージェントが60以上のHTML要素タイプをMarkdownの同等のタイプに正確に変換できるようにします。ATXとSetext見出しなどの構文のバリエーションを尊重し、Rustコアとストリーミングパーサーを使用して意味的正確性を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 60가지 이상의 HTML 요소 유형을 Markdown의 동일한 유형으로 정확하게 변환할 수 있도록 합니다. ATX 및 Setext 제목 등과 같은 구문 변형을尊重하며, Rust 핵심 및 스트리밍 파서를 사용하여 의미적 정확성을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir con precisión más de 60 tipos de elementos HTML a equivalentes de Markdown, respetando variaciones de sintaxis como encabezados ATX versus Setext y manteniendo la precisión semántica utilizando el núcleo de Rust y analizador de flujo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir avec précision plus de 60 types d''éléments HTML en équivalents Markdown, en respectant les variations de syntaxe comme les en-têtes ATX par rapport à Setext et en maintenant la précision sémantique en utilisant le noyau Rust et les analyseurs de flux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehr als 60 HTML-Elementtypen genau in Markdown-Äquivalente umzuwandeln, wobei Syntaxvarianten wie ATX- versus Setext-Überschriften respektiert und die semantische Genauigkeit unter Verwendung von Rust-Kern und Streaming-Parsern aufrechterhalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter com precisão 60+ tipos de elementos HTML para equivalentes Markdown, respeitando variações de sintaxe como títulos ATX versus Setext e mantendo a precisão semântica usando núcleo Rust e analisadores de transmissão.","ru":"Позволяет агентам точно преобразовывать более 60 типов элементов HTML в эквивалентный Markdown, соблюдая вариации синтаксиса, такие как заголовки ATX и Setext, и сохраняя семантическую точность с помощью ядра Rust и потоковых парсеров.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل أكثر من 60 نوعًا من عناصر HTML بدقة إلى معادلات Markdown ، مع احترام تنوعات البناء النحوي مثل العناوين ATX مقابل Setext والحفاظ على الدقة الدلالية باستخدام نواة Rust ومتحليلات التدفق."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting HTML documents to Markdown for seamless integration","Mapping HTML elements to Markdown for data extraction and analysis","Generating Markdown content from HTML sources while preserving formatting"],"zh":["将HTML文档转换为Markdown以实现无缝集成","将HTML元素映射到Markdown以进行数据提取和分析","从HTML源生成Markdown内容同时保留格式"],"ja":["シームレスな統合のためにHTMLドキュメントをMarkdownに変換する","データ抽出と分析のためにHTML要素をMarkdownにマッピングする","HTMLソースからMarkdownコンテンツを生成しながらフォーマットを保持する"],"ko":["무결점 통합을 위해 HTML 문서를 Markdown로 변환한다","데이터 추출 및 분석을 위해 HTML 요소를 Markdown에 매핑한다","HTML 소스에서 Markdown 콘텐츠를 생성하면서 형식을 유지한다"],"es":["Conversión de documentos HTML a Markdown para una integración sin problemas","Asignación de elementos HTML a Markdown para la extracción y el análisis de datos","Generación de contenido Markdown a partir de fuentes HTML mientras se mantiene el formato"],"fr":["Conversion de documents HTML en Markdown pour une intégration sans problème","Mappage d''éléments HTML à Markdown pour l''extraction et l''analyse de données","Génération de contenu Markdown à partir de sources HTML tout en préservant le format"],"de":["Konvertierung von HTML-Dokumenten in Markdown für eine nahtlose Integration","Zuordnung von HTML-Elementen zu Markdown für Datenextraktion und -analyse","Erzeugung von Markdown-Inhalten aus HTML-Quellen unter Beibehaltung des Formats"],"pt":["Conversão de documentos HTML para Markdown para integração perfeita","Mapeamento de elementos HTML para Markdown para extração e análise de dados","Geração de conteúdo Markdown a partir de fontes HTML enquanto preserva a formatação"],"ru":["Преобразование документов HTML в Markdown для бесшовной интеграции","Сопоставление элементов HTML с Markdown для извлечения и анализа данных","Генерация содержимого Markdown из источников HTML, сохраняя при этом форматирование"],"ar":["تحويل مستندات HTML إلى Markdown من أجل التكامل السلس","تعيين عناصر HTML إلى Markdown من أجل استخراج البيانات وتحليلها","توليد محتوى Markdown من مصادر HTML مع الحفاظ على تنسيق المحتوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to HTML and Markdown formats","Requires understanding of Markdown syntax variations"],"zh":["仅限HTML和Markdown格式","需要了解Markdown语法变体"],"ja":["HTMLとMarkdown形式のみに限定されている","Markdownの構文のバリエーションを理解する必要がある"],"ko":["HTML 및 Markdown 형식만으로 제한된다","Markdown 구문 변형을 이해해야 한다"],"es":["Limitado a los formatos HTML y Markdown","Requiere comprensión de las variaciones de la sintaxis de Markdown"],"fr":["Limité aux formats HTML et Markdown","Nécessite une compréhension des variations de syntaxe de Markdown"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Formate HTML und Markdown","Erfordert Verständnis für die Syntaxvarianten von Markdown"],"pt":["Limitado aos formatos HTML e Markdown","Exige compreensão das variações de sintaxe Markdown"],"ru":["Ограничен форматами HTML и Markdown","Требует понимания вариаций синтаксиса Markdown"],"ar":["محدود بتنسيقات HTML و Markdown","يتطلب فهمًا لتنوعات بناء جملة Markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
