** Use the `Skill` tool. When you invoke a skill, its content is loaded and presented to you—follow it directly. Never use","body":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n**In Claude Code:** Use the `Skill` tool. When you invoke a skill, its content is loaded and presented to you—follow it directly. Never use the Read tool on skill files.\n\n**In other environments:** Check your platform''s documentation for how skills are loaded.\n\n# Using Skills\n\n## The Rule\n\n**Invoke relevant or requested skills BEFORE any response or action.** Even a 1% chance a skill might apply means that you should invoke the skill to check. If an invoked skill turns out to be wrong for the situation, you don''t need to use it.\n\n```dot\ndigraph skill_flow {\n    \"User message received\" [shape=doublecircle];\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Invoke Skill tool\" [shape=box];\n    \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\" [shape=box];\n    \"Has checklist?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" [shape=box];\n    \"Follow skill exactly\" [shape=box];\n    \"Respond (including clarifications)\" [shape=doublecircle];\n\n    \"User message received\" -> \"Might any skill apply?\";\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" -> \"Invoke Skill tool\" [label=\"yes, even 1%\"];\n    \"Might any skill apply?\" -> \"Respond (including clarifications)\" [label=\"definitely not\"];\n    \"Invoke Skill tool\" -> \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\";\n    \"Announce: ''Using [skill] to [purpose]''\" -> \"Has checklist?\";\n    \"Has checklist?\" -> \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Has checklist?\" -> \"Follow skill exactly\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Create TodoWrite todo per item\" -> \"Follow skill exactly\";\n}\n```\n\n## Red Flags\n\nThese thoughts mean STOP—you''re rationalizing:\n\n| Thought | Reality |\n|---------|---------|\n| \"This is just a simple question\" | Questions are tasks. Check for skills. |\n| \"I need more context first\" | Skill check comes BEFORE clarifying questions. |\n| \"Let me explore the codebase first\" | Skills tell you HOW to explore. Check first. |\n| \"I can check git/files quickly\" | Files lack conversation context. Check for skills. |\n| \"Let me gather information first\" | Skills tell you HOW to gather information. |\n| \"This doesn''t need a formal skill\" | If a skill exists, use it. |\n| \"I remember this skill\" | Skills evolve. Read current version. |\n| \"This doesn''t count as a task\" | Action = task. Check for skills. |\n| \"The skill is overkill\" | Simple things become complex. Use it. |\n| \"I''ll just do this one thing first\" | Check BEFORE doing anything. |\n| \"This feels productive\" | Undisciplined action wastes time. Skills prevent this. |\n| \"I know what that means\" | Knowing the concept ≠ using the skill. Invoke it. |\n\n## Skill Priority\n\nWhen multiple skills could apply, use this order:\n\n1. **Process skills first** (brainstorming, debugging) - these determine HOW to approach the task\n2. **Implementation skills second** (frontend-design, mcp-builder) - these guide execution\n\n\"Let''s build X\" → brainstorming first, then implementation skills.\n\"Fix this bug\" → debugging first, then domain-specific skills.\n\n## Skill Types\n\n**Rigid** (TDD, debugging): Follow exactly. Don''t adapt away discipline.\n\n**Flexible** (patterns): Adapt principles to context.\n\nThe skill itself tells you which.\n\n## User Instructions\n\nInstructions say WHAT, not HOW. \"Add X\" or \"Fix Y\" doesn''t mean skip workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:21:36.660Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for strict protocol adherence agents requiring unconditional invocation of applicable skills.","zh":"适用于需要无条件调用相关技能的严格协议遵守代理。","ja":"厳格なプロトコル遵守が必要なエージェントに適しています。","ko":"엄격한 프로토콜 준수를 요구하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de adherencia estricta al protocolo que requieren invocación incondicional de habilidades aplicables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''adhésion au protocole strict nécessitant l''invocation inconditionnelle des compétences applicables.","de":"Ideal für Agenten mit strikter Einhaltung von Protokollen, die eine bedingungslose Aufrufung der anwendbaren Fähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de adesão a protocolos estritos que exigem invocação incondicional de habilidades aplicáveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, требующих строгого соблюдения протокола и неограниченного вызова применимых навыков.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الامتثال لبروتوكول صارم يتطلب استدعاء غير مشروط لمهارات قابلة للتطبيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to invoke skills unconditionally, ensuring adherence to critical protocols using the `Skill` tool in Claude Code, and presenting content directly for immediate execution, leveraging keywords like ''invocation'' and ''protocol'' for enhanced decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理调用技能的无条件能力，确保使用 Claude Code 中的 `Skill` 工具来遵守关键协议，并直接呈现内容以便立即执行，利用诸如 ''调用'' 和 ''协议'' 的关键词来增强决策。","ja":"エージェントにスキルを無条件に呼び出す能力を与え、Claude Code の `Skill` ツールを使用して重要なプロトコルに従ったり、コンテンツを直接提示して即時実行したりし、''呼び出し'' や ''プロトコル'' などのキーワードを使用して意思決定を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 무조건적으로 스킬을 호출할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Claude Code의 `Skill` 툴을 사용하여 중요한 프로토콜을 준수하고 콘텐츠를 직접 표시하여 즉시 실행하도록 하며, ''호출'' 및 ''프로토콜''과 같은 키워드를 사용하여 의사결정을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a invocar habilidades de forma incondicional, garantizando el cumplimiento de protocolos críticos mediante la herramienta `Skill` en Claude Code, y presentando contenido directamente para su ejecución inmediata, aprovechando palabras clave como ''invocación'' y ''protocolo'' para una toma de decisiones mejorada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''invoker des compétences de manière inconditionnelle, garantissant l''adhésion aux protocoles critiques en utilisant l''outil `Skill` dans Claude Code, et présentant le contenu directement pour une exécution immédiate, en exploitant des mots-clés comme ''invocation'' et ''protocole'' pour une prise de décision améliorée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Fähigkeiten bedingungslos aufzurufen, um die Einhaltung kritischer Protokolle unter Verwendung des `Skill`-Tools in Claude Code sicherzustellen und Inhalte direkt für die sofortige Ausführung bereitzustellen, indem Schlüsselwörter wie ''Aufruf'' und ''Protokoll'' für eine verbesserte Entscheidungsfindung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a invocar habilidades incondicionalmente, garantindo o cumprimento de protocolos críticos usando a ferramenta `Skill` no Claude Code, e apresentando o conteúdo diretamente para execução imediata, aproveitando palavras-chave como ''invocação'' e ''protocolo'' para uma tomada de decisão aprimorada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью неограниченного вызова навыков, обеспечивая соблюдение критических протоколов с помощью инструмента `Skill` в Claude Code, и представляя содержимое напрямую для немедленного выполнения, используя ключевые слова, такие как ''вызов'' и ''протокол'', для улучшения процесса принятия решений.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استدعاء المهارات دون قيد أو شرط، ضمان الامتثال لبروتوكولات حرجة باستخدام أداة `Skill` في Claude Code، وعرض المحتوى مباشرة للتنفيذ الفوري، واستخدام كلمات مفتاحية مثل ''الدعوة'' و ''البروتوكول'' لتحسين اتخاذ القرارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Invoking critical skills without exception","Ensuring protocol adherence in high-stakes tasks","Automating decision-making processes based on skill applicability"],"zh":["无例外地调用关键技能","在高风险任务中确保协议遵守","基于技能适用性的自动化决策过程"],"ja":["例外なく重要なスキルを呼び出す","ハイリスクタスクでのプロトコル遵守の確保","スキルの適用性に基づく自動化された意思決定プロセス"],"ko":["예외 없이 중요한 스킬 호출","고위험 작업에서의 프로토콜 준수 보장","스킬 적용성에 기반한 자동화된 의사 결정 프로세스"],"es":["Invocar habilidades críticas sin excepción","Garantizar la adherencia al protocolo en tareas de alto riesgo","Automatizar procesos de toma de decisiones basados en la aplicabilidad de habilidades"],"fr":["Invquer des compétences critiques sans exception","Assurer l''adhésion au protocole dans des tâches à haut enjeu","Automatiser les processus de prise de décision basés sur l''applicabilité des compétences"],"de":["Kritische Fähigkeiten ohne Ausnahme aufrufen","Die Einhaltung von Protokollen in hochriskanten Aufgaben sicherstellen","Automatisieren von Entscheidungsprozessen basierend auf der Anwendbarkeit von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Invocar habilidades críticas sem exceção","Garantir a adesão ao protocolo em tarefas de alto risco","Automatizar processos de tomada de decisão com base na aplicabilidade das habilidades"],"ru":["Вызов критических навыков без исключения","Обеспечение соблюдения протокола в задачах высокого риска","Автоматизация процессов принятия решений на основе применимости навыков"],"ar":["استدعاء مهارات حرجة بدون استثناء","ضمان الامتثال للبروتوكول في مهام الخطر العالي","توفير عمليات اتخاذ القرارات التلقائية بناءً على قابليته المهارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `Skill` tool in compatible AI platforms like Claude Code","Mandatory invocation may limit agent autonomy in certain scenarios"],"zh":["需要访问兼容的 AI 平台（如 Claude Code）中的 `Skill` 工具","强制调用可能会限制代理在某些场景中的自主性"],"ja":["Claude Code などの互換性のある AI プラットフォームの `Skill` ツールへのアクセスが必要","強制呼び出しによってエージェントの自律性が特定のシナリオで制限される可能性がある"],"ko":["Claude Code와 같은 호환 가능한 AI 플랫폼의 `Skill` 툴에 대한 액세스가 필요함","강제 호출에 의해 특정 시나리오에서 에이전트의 자율성이 제한될 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la herramienta `Skill` en plataformas de IA compatibles como Claude Code","La invocación obligatoria puede limitar la autonomía del agente en determinados escenarios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''outil `Skill` sur des plateformes d''IA compatibles comme Claude Code","L''invocation obligatoire peut limiter l''autonomie de l''agent dans certains scénarios"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf das `Skill`-Tool in kompatiblen KI-Plattformen wie Claude Code","Die obligatorische Aufrufung kann die Autonomie des Agenten in bestimmten Szenarien einschränken"],"pt":["Exige acesso à ferramenta `Skill` em plataformas de IA compatíveis como o Claude Code","A invocação obrigatória pode limitar a autonomia do agente em certos cenários"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструменту `Skill` в совместимых платформах ИИ, таких как Claude Code","Обязательный вызов может ограничить автономию агента в определенных сценариях"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة `Skill` في منصات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتوافقة مثل Claude Code","يمكن أن تقيد الاستدعاء الإجباري استقلالية الوكيل في بعض السيناريوهات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
