writer erstellen","pt":"Snapshot Writer: Ferramenta de Sumarização de Conteúdo","ru":"Снимок-писатель: Инструмент для создания кратких изложений","ar":"كتاب الصورة: أداة لتحضير ملخصات موجزة","en":"snapshot-writer"},"description":{"zh":"Snapshot Writer 技术是一种高效的文档编写方法，通过结构化的中间文档，实现紧凑的阅读体验","ja":"スナップショットライターの技術は、構造化された中間文書を通じて、コンパクトな読みやすさを実現する文書作成方法","ko":"스냅샷 작성기 기술은 구조화된 중간 문서를 통해緊凑한 읽기 경험을 제공하는 문서 작성 방법","es":"Snapshot-writer es una habilidad que permite a los desarrolladores crear resúmenes compactos y precisos de temas complejos","fr":"Snapshot-writer est une compétence qui permet aux développeurs de créer des résumés compacts et précis de sujets complexes","de":"Snapshot-writer ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, präzise und kompakte Zusammenfassungen komplexer Themen zu erstellen","pt":"O Snapshot Writer é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar resumos concisos e informativos para desenvolvedores, destacando os principais temas e tópicos","ru":"Снимок-писатель - это инструмент, помогающий создавать краткие и информативные резюме для разработчиков, подчеркивающий основные темы и вопросы","ar":"أداة كتاب الصورة هي أداة تساعد في تحضير ملخصات موجزة وغنية بالمعلومات للمطورين، وتبرز الموضوعات الرئيسية والقضايا","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents ..."},"definition":{"en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"features":{"zh":["紧凑的阅读体验","结构化的中间文档","高效的文档编写","基于证据的方法","提高读者参与度"],"ja":["コンパクトな読みやすさ","構造化された中間文書","効率的な文書作成","証拠に基づいた方法","読者参加度の向上"],"ko":["紧凑한 읽기 경험","구조화된 중간 문서","효율적인 문서 작성","증거 기반의 방법","읽기 참여도 향상"],"es":["Crea resúmenes compactos y precisos","Identifica los temas y subtemas clave","Proporciona punteros concretos para más información","Permite la creación de tarjetas de rol para editores","Utiliza una metodología de evidencia para evitar escritura hueca"],"fr":["Crée des résumés compacts et précis","Identifie les sujets et sous-sujets clés","Fournit des pointeurs concrets pour plus d''informations","Permet la création de cartes de rôle pour les éditeurs","Utilise une méthodologie d''évidence pour éviter l''écriture creuse"],"de":["Erstellt präzise und kompakte Zusammenfassungen","Identifiziert die Schlüsselthemen und -unterthemen","Bietet konkrete Zeiger für weitere Informationen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Rollenkarten für Redakteure","Verwendet eine Evidenzmethodik, um hohle Schreibweise zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Criação de resumos concisos e informativos","Destaque dos principais temas e tópicos","Uso de bullets e ponteiros concretos","Evita a escrita oca através de artefatos intermediários estruturados"],"ru":["Создание кратких и информативных резюме","Подчеркивание основных тем и вопросов","Использование точечных списков и конкретных ссылок","Предотвращение пустой écriture через структурированные промежуточные артефакты"],"ar":["تحضير ملخصات موجزة وغنية بالمعلومات","تأكييد الموضوعات الرئيسية والقضايا","استخدام النقاط والمراجع المحددة","منع الكتابة الفارغة من خلال إنتاج أشياء وسيطة منظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Snapshot Writer","文档编写","结构化中间文档","高效阅读","基于证据的方法","读者参与度","文档写作技术"],"ja":["スナップショットライター","文書作成","構造化中間文書","効率的な読み","証拠に基づいた方法","読者参加度","文書作成技術"],"ko":["스냅샷 작성기","문서 작성","구조화된 중간 문서","효율적인 읽기","증거 기반의 방법","읽기 참여도","문서 작성 기술"],"es":["snapshot-writer","resúmenes compactos","desarrollo de software","metodología de evidencia","tarjetas de rol","editores de instantáneas"],"fr":["snapshot-writer","résumés compacts","développement de logiciels","méthodologie d''évidence","cartes de rôle","éditeurs d''instantanés"],"de":["snapshot-writer","kompakte Zusammenfassungen","Softwareentwicklung","Evidenzmethodik","Rollenkarten","Momentaufnahmeditor"],"pt":["snapshot writer","sumarização de conteúdo","resumos concisos","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de produtividade","gestão de conteúdo"],"ru":["снимок-писатель","создание кратких изложений","резюме для разработчиков","инструменты для разработчиков","управление контентом","продуктивность разработчиков"],"ar":["كتاب الصورة","تحضير ملخصات","ملخصات موجزة للمطورين","أدوات المطورين","إدارة المحتوى","إنتاجية المطورين"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"snapshot-writer","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Snapshot Writer (1-page, bullet-first)\n\nGoal: produce a compact, reader-facing snapshot that answers:\n- what is the topic boundary?\n- what are the key themes?\n- what should a reader read first?\n\nThis is intentionally **not** a full survey: prefer tight bullets + concrete pointers over narrative.\n\n## Role cards (use explicitly)\n\n### Snapshot Editor (scout)\n\nMission: deliver a one-page, high-signal snapshot that a reader can act on immediately.\n\nDo:\n- Keep every bullet content-bearing: claim ->","body":"# Snapshot Writer (1-page, bullet-first)\n\nGoal: produce a compact, reader-facing snapshot that answers:\n- what is the topic boundary?\n- what are the key themes?\n- what should a reader read first?\n\nThis is intentionally **not** a full survey: prefer tight bullets + concrete pointers over narrative.\n\n## Role cards (use explicitly)\n\n### Snapshot Editor (scout)\n\nMission: deliver a one-page, high-signal snapshot that a reader can act on immediately.\n\nDo:\n- Keep every bullet content-bearing: claim -> why it matters -> pointer(s).\n- Prefer contrasts and evaluation anchors over topic lists.\n- Treat paper pointers as the product (auditable, minimal).\n\nAvoid:\n- Outline narration (\"This snapshot/section...\") and slide navigation (\"Next, we...\").\n- Generic survey boilerplate and disclaimer spam.\n- Turning the snapshot into a mini-survey with long paragraphs.\n\n### Pointer Curator (bibliography hygiene)\n\nMission: ensure every pointer is concrete and traceable to `papers/core_set.csv`.\n\nDo:\n- Use a stable pointer format: `P#### - Title (arXiv:... / doi:... / url:...)`.\n- Mix canonical anchors + recent strong baselines + benchmark/protocol papers.\n\nAvoid:\n- Dumping every paper; the snapshot is a reading path, not a catalog.\n\n## Role prompt: Snapshot Author (bullet-first; paper-like)\n\n```text\nYou are writing a one-page literature snapshot.\n\nYour job is to be useful fast:\n- define the topic boundary\n- surface the key themes as claims (not headings)\n- give an actionable reading path (paper pointers)\n\nStyle:\n- bullets-first, compact, calm\n- no narration (\"In this snapshot...\") and no slide navigation (\"Next, we...\")\n\nConstraints:\n- do not invent papers\n- pointers must come from papers/core_set.csv (or the same workspace candidate pool)\n- if evidence is abstract-only, state it once as a single bullet, then move on\n```\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `outline/outline.yml`\n- `papers/core_set.csv`\n\nOptional (if available):\n- `queries.md` (time window / exclusions context)\n- `papers/papers_dedup.jsonl` (if core_set is very small)\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `output/SNAPSHOT.md`\n\n## Writing contract (paper-like, not generator-like)\n\n- Keep it to about 1 page (roughly <= 700-900 words).\n- Bullets-first: use short paragraphs only when unavoidable (<= 3 lines each).\n- No outline narration: avoid `This section/subsection ...`, `In this snapshot ...`, `Next, we ...`.\n- Don’t spam disclaimers: if evidence is abstract-only, say it once in a short “Evidence policy” line.\n- Every claim bullet should attach at least 1 concrete pointer (paper_id + title; include `arxiv_id/doi/url` when present).\n\n## Recommended structure (stable, minimal headings)\n\n1. Title + scope (2-3 bullets)\n2. Evidence policy (1 bullet)\n3. Taxonomy (4-6 bullets; groupings only)\n4. Key themes (6-10 bullets; each bullet = 1 claim + 1-2 pointers)\n5. What to read first (6-12 bullets; canonical + recent; each bullet has pointers)\n6. Open problems / risks (4-8 bullets)\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read `outline/outline.yml` and extract:\n   - the intended chapter structure (H2)\n   - the 6-10 most “write-worthy” bullets per chapter\n\n2. Read `papers/core_set.csv` and build a small “pointer palette”\n   - Prefer: canonical anchors + recent strong baselines + evaluation/benchmark papers.\n   - Avoid: dumping every paper; pick “must-read” sets.\n   - If `papers/core_set.csv` is very small, also scan `papers/papers_dedup.jsonl` and cherry-pick a few missing anchors (keep pointers auditable).\n\n3. Write `output/SNAPSHOT.md`\n   - Start each section with a content claim (why it matters), not a navigation sentence.\n   - Make at least 2 cross-paper contrasts (A vs B) to avoid a flat list.\n   - Use consistent pointer formatting, e.g.:\n     - `P0012 - <Title> (arXiv:xxxx.xxxxx)` or `P0012 - <Title> (doi:...)`\n\n## Definition of Done\n\n- [ ] `output/SNAPSHOT.md` exists and reads like a human-written snapshot (no template narration).\n- [ ] Includes >= 15 distinct paper pointers (or all papers if core_set < 15).\n- [ ] Includes >= 2 explicit contrasts and >= 1 evaluation/benchmark bullet (if present in core set).\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: snapshot feels empty / generic\n\nFix:\n- Increase `papers/core_set.csv` size (rerun retrieval/dedupe with broader `queries.md`).\n- Tighten the outline: fewer headings, stronger H2 names, and bullets that encode “what to compare”.\n\n### Issue: snapshot reads like an outline narrator\n\nFix:\n- Delete all “This section ...” openers and replace with: `Claim -> why it matters -> pointers`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:22:00.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing structured snapshot generation for semantic execution units.","zh":"非常适合需要为语义执行单元生成结构化快照的研究型智能体。","ja":"意味的な実行単位のための構造化されたスナップショット生成を必要とするリサーチエージェントに最適です。","ko":"의미론적 실행 단위를 위한 구조화된 스냅샷 생성이 필요한 연구 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan generar instantáneas estructuradas para unidades de ejecución semántica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de générer des instantanés structurés pour les unités d''exécution sémantique.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die strukturierte Momentaufnahmen für semantische Ausführungseinheiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de geração de imagens estruturadas para unidades de execução semântica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Исследовательских Агентов, которым необходима структурированная генерация снимков для семантических единиц выполнения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى генера généراء مخططات متسلسلة لوحدات التنفيذ الدلالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce compact, reader-facing snapshots using evidence-first methodology, incorporating role cards and tight bullets for high-signal content, while leveraging acceptance criteria and guardrails for validation.","zh":"赋能智能体使用证据优先方法，结合角色卡和精炼的要点来生成面向读者的紧凑型高价值信息快照，同时利用验收标准和防护栏进行验证。","ja":"エビデンスファーストの方法論を活用し、ロールカードと高シグナルコンテンツのための簡潔な箇条書きを組み合わせて、読者向けのコンパクトなスナップショットを作成することをエージェントに可能にします。また、検証のために受け入れ基準とガードレールを活用します。","ko":"증거 중심 방법론을 활용하여 역할 카드와 높은 신호 콘텐츠를 위한 간결한 글머리 기호를 포함한 독자 친화적인 컴팩트 스냅샷을 생성하도록 에이전트를 강화합니다. 동시에 검증을 위해 수용 기준과 가드레일을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir instantáneas compactas y orientadas al lector utilizando la metodología de evidencia primera, incorporando tarjetas de roles y balas ajustadas para contenido de alta señal, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha los criterios de aceptación y barandillas para la validación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des instantanés compacts et orientés lecteur en utilisant la méthodologie de preuve première, en incorporant des cartes de rôle et des balles serrées pour un contenu à signal élevé, tout en exploitant les critères d''acceptation et les barrières de sécurité pour la validation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kompaktes, leserorientiertes Snapshot mithilfe der evidenzbasierten Methodik zu erstellen, indem Rollenkarten und enge Bullet-Points für High-Signal-Inhalte verwendet werden, während Akzeptanzkriterien und Schutzbarrieren für die Validierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir imagens compactas, orientadas ao leitor, usando metodologia baseada em evidências, incorporando cartões de papel e balas apertadas para conteúdo de alta densidade de sinais, aproveitando critérios de aceitação e guardrails para validação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить компактные, ориентированные на читателя снимки, используя методологию, основанную на доказательствах, включающую карты ролей и плотные пункты для контента с высокой плотностью сигналов, используя критерии приемки и поручни для проверки.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنتاج صور مدمجة، موجهة إلى القارئ، باستخدام منهجية قائمة على الأدلة، وتضمّن بطاقات الأدوار والرصاصات المضغوطة للمحتوى عالي الكثافة الإشارة، مع الاستفادة من معايير القبول والحدود الدفاعية للتأكيد."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating one-page snapshots for topic boundary definition","Creating structured intermediate artifacts for research pipelines","Delivering high-signal snapshots with concrete pointers for immediate reader action"],"zh":["为主题边界定义生成单页快照","为研究流水线创建结构化的中间产物","提供包含具体行动指南的高价值信息快照，供读者立即采取行动"],"ja":["トピックの境界定義のための1ページのスナップショット生成","研究パイプラインのための構造化された中間成果物の作成","読者が即座に行動を起こせる具体的な指針を含む高シグナルスナップショットの提供"],"ko":["주제 경계 정의를 위한 한 페이지 스냅샷 생성","연구 파이프라인을 위한 구조화된 중간 산출물 생성","즉각적인 독자 행동을 위한 구체적인 포인터가 포함된 높은 신호 스냅샷 제공"],"es":["Generar instantáneas de una página para la definición de límites de tema","Crear artefactos intermedios estructurados para tuberías de investigación","Entregar instantáneas de alta señal con punteros concretos para la acción inmediata del lector"],"fr":["Générer des instantanés d''une page pour la définition des limites de sujet","Créer des artefacts intermédiaires structurés pour les pipelines de recherche","Fournir des instantanés à signal élevé avec des pointeurs concrets pour l''action immédiate du lecteur"],"de":["Erzeugen von einseitigen Snapshots für die Themenbegrenzungsdefinition","Erstellen von strukturierten Zwischenartefakten für Forschungspipelines","Liefern von High-Signal-Snapshots mit konkreten Zeigern für die unmittelbare Leseraktion"],"pt":["Gerar imagens de uma página para definição de limite de tópico","Criar artefatos intermediários estruturados para pipelines de pesquisa","Entregar imagens de alta densidade de sinais com ponteiros concretos para ação imediata do leitor"],"ru":["Генерировать одностраничные снимки для определения границы темы","Создавать структурированные промежуточные артефакты для исследовательских конвейеров","Доставлять снимки с высокой плотностью сигналов и конкретными указателями для немедленного действия читателя"],"ar":["توليد صور من صفحة واحدة لتعريف حدود الموضوع","إنشاء مشغولات متوسطة منظمّة لخطوط أنابيب البحث","توصيل صور عالية الكثافة الإشارة مع مؤشرات ملموسة للعمل الفوري للقارئ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Intentionally limited to non-narrative, bullet-first content","Requires explicit use of role cards, such as the Snapshot Editor (scout) mission"],"zh":["有意局限于非叙述性、要点优先的内容","需要明确使用角色卡，例如快照编辑（侦察员）使命"],"ja":["意図的に非物語的で箇条書きファーストのコンテンツに限定","スナップショットエディター（スカウト）ミッションなどのロールカードの明示的な使用が必要"],"ko":["의도적으로 비내러티브, 글머리 기호 우선 콘텐츠로 제한됨","스냅샷 편집자(정찰병) 미션과 같은 역할 카드의 명시적 사용 필요"],"es":["Limitado intencionalmente a contenido no narrativo, con énfasis en viñetas","Requiere el uso explícito de tarjetas de roles, como la misión del Editor de instantáneas (scout)"],"fr":["Limité intentionnellement à un contenu non narratif, en premier lieu sous forme de balles","Nécessite l''utilisation explicite de cartes de rôle, telles que la mission de l''Éditeur d''instantanés (scout)"],"de":["Bewusst auf nicht-narrativen, bullet-basierten Inhalt beschränkt","Erfordert den expliziten Einsatz von Rollenkarten, wie z.B. der Mission des Snapshot-Editors (scout)"],"pt":["Intencionalmente limitado a conteúdo não narrativo, em primeiro lugar balas","Exige uso explícito de cartões de papel, como a missão do Editor de Imagem (scout)"],"ru":["Намеренно ограничен до ненарративного контента, сначала пункты","Требует явного использования карт ролей, таких как миссия Редактора Снимка (с카ут)"],"ar":["محدود عمداً إلى محتوى غير سرد، في المقام الأول الرصاصات","يتطلب استخدام صريح لبطاقات الأدوار، مثل مهمة محرر الصورة (كشاف)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
