ación de citas","Flujo de trabajo personalizable"],"fr":["Génération de citations","Vérification de l''authenticité des sources","Compatibilité avec les formats de citations","Enregistrement de la vérification des citations","Flux de travail personnalisable"],"de":["Erzeugung von Zitaten","Überprüfung der Echtheit der Quellen","Kompatibilität mit Zitatformaten","Aufzeichnung der Zitierüberprüfung","Anpassbarer Arbeitsablauf"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos de citação","Verificação da autenticidade das referências","Compatibilidade com fluxo de trabalho restrito","Registro de verificações para revisão posterior"],"ru":["Генерация файлов цитат","Проверка подлинности ссылок","Возможность работы в ограниченном рабочем процессе","Запись проверок для последующего рассмотрения"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات المراجع","التحقق من صحة المصادر","التوافق مع سير العمل المقيد","تسجيل التحقق للمراجعة اللاحقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Citation Verifier","引文生成","验证记录","自动化工具","离线工作模式","可追踪的验证记录"],"ja":["Citation Verifier","引用生成","検証レコード","自動化ツール","オフライン作業モード","追跡可能な検証レコード"],"ko":["Citation Verifier","인용문 생성","검증 기록","자동화 도구","오프라인 작업 모드","추적 가능한 검증 기록"],"es":["verificador de citas","generación de citas","verificación de fuentes","citas académicas","herramientas de investigación","bibliografía","gestión de referencias"],"fr":["vérificateur de citations","génération de citations","vérification de sources","citations académiques","outils de recherche","bibliographie","gestion de références"],"de":["Zitierverifier","Erzeugung von Zitaten","Überprüfung von Quellen","wissenschaftliche Zitierweise","Forschungstools","Bibliografie","Quellenverwaltung"],"pt":["verificador de citações","ferramenta de pesquisa","verificação de referências","geração de arquivos de citação","fluxo de trabalho de pesquisa","autenticidade de referências"],"ru":["проверка цитат","исследовательский инструмент","проверка ссылок","генерация файлов цитат","исследовательский рабочий процесс","подлинность ссылок"],"ar":["مُصادق المصادر","أداة البحث","التحقق من المراجع","إنشاء ملفات المراجع","سير عمل البحث","صحة المصادر"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"citation-verifier","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Citation Verifier\n\nGenerate `citations/ref.bib` and ensure every entry has a traceable verification record in `citations/verified.jsonl`.\n\nWhen network access is restricted, prefer a “record now, verify later” workflow: keep URLs/titles consistent and leave a clear verification note.\n\n## Input\n\n- `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `citations/ref.bib`\n- `citations/verified.jsonl`\n\n## Workflow (heuristic)\n\n1. Collect `bibkey`, `title`, `url`, `year`, `authors` from `papers/paper_notes.jso","body":"# Citation Verifier\n\nGenerate `citations/ref.bib` and ensure every entry has a traceable verification record in `citations/verified.jsonl`.\n\nWhen network access is restricted, prefer a “record now, verify later” workflow: keep URLs/titles consistent and leave a clear verification note.\n\n## Input\n\n- `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `citations/ref.bib`\n- `citations/verified.jsonl`\n\n## Workflow (heuristic)\n\n1. Collect `bibkey`, `title`, `url`, `year`, `authors` from `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`.\n2. Write/refresh `citations/ref.bib`:\n   - Prefer arXiv-style fields when `arxiv_id` / `primary_category` exist (`eprint`, `archivePrefix`, `primaryClass`).\n3. Write one verification record per BibTeX entry to `citations/verified.jsonl` with at least:\n   - `bibkey`, `title`, `url`, `date`\n4. If you cannot verify via network, record a clear `notes` field (e.g., “auto-generated; needs manual verification”) and/or request human confirmation depending on your policy.\n\n## Quality checklist\n\n- [ ] Every BibTeX entry has a corresponding `verified.jsonl` record.\n- [ ] No missing `url`/`date`/`title` in verification records.\n\n## Offline Mode\n\nWhen network access is restricted, run in offline mode to produce auditable records now, then verify later.\n\n- Generate offline records: `verification_status: offline_generated`\n- Verify later (when network is available): `--verify-only`\n\n### `verification_status`\n\n- `offline_generated`: record was generated without network verification (needs later verification)\n- `verified_online`: URL/title verified successfully by the script\n- `verify_failed`: verification was attempted but failed (network error or title mismatch)\n- `needs_manual_verification`: missing/ambiguous fields (e.g., empty `url`/`title`)\n\n## Script\n\n### Quick Start\n\n- `python .codex/skills/citation-verifier/scripts/run.py --help`\n- Offline (record now, verify later): `python .codex/skills/citation-verifier/scripts/run.py --workspace <workspace_dir> --offline`\n\n### All Options\n\n- `--offline`: do not attempt network verification; write `verification_status=offline_generated`\n- `--verify-only`: verify existing `citations/verified.jsonl` records (does not rewrite BibTeX)\n- `--verification-note <text>`: stored in `citations/verified.jsonl` `notes`\n\n### Examples\n\n- Generate BibTeX + offline verification records:\n  - `python .codex/skills/citation-verifier/scripts/run.py --workspace <ws> --offline --verification-note \"auto-generated; needs manual verification\"`\n- Later, verify-only (when network is available):\n  - `python .codex/skills/citation-verifier/scripts/run.py --workspace <ws> --verify-only`\n\n### Notes\n\n- Minimal requirement for every verification record: `url`, `date`, `title`.\n- The script sanitizes stray/unbalanced `{}` in titles to keep `bibtex` parsing robust.\n- The script escapes LaTeX special chars in text fields (`& % $ # _`) and rewrites superscript patterns like `X^N` or `X$^N$` as `X\\textsuperscript{N}` to keep LaTeX builds stable.\n- URLs are kept raw in BibTeX `url` fields (BibTeX styles wrap them with `\\url{...}`); `@misc` uses `howpublished=\\url{...}`.\n- In offline mode, records are *not* truly verified; treat `offline_generated` as a to-do for human/network verification.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### Issue: Missing `bibkey` / missing `url` in notes\n\n**Symptom**:\n- `citations/ref.bib` is missing entries, or `verified.jsonl` has empty `url/title`.\n\n**Causes**:\n- `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` lacks `bibkey`/`url` fields.\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Ensure each core paper note has a stable `bibkey` and a canonical `url`.\n- Rerun citation generation after fixing notes.\n\n#### Issue: `verification_status=offline_generated`\n\n**Symptom**:\n- Records exist but are not truly verified.\n\n**Causes**:\n- `--offline` was used, or network verification was unavailable.\n\n**Solutions**:\n- When network is available, run `--verify-only` to upgrade records.\n- Or manually verify and update `citations/verified.jsonl` with notes.\n\n### Recovery Checklist\n\n- [ ] Every BibTeX entry has a matching `citations/verified.jsonl` record.\n- [ ] Verification records include `url`, `date`, `title`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:22:50.731Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Research Agents requiring precise citation management and verification capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要精确引用管理和验证能力的研究代理。","ja":"精密な引用管理および検証機能を必要とする研究エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 인용 관리 및 확인 기능이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de investigación que requieren una gestión y verificación de citas precisas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche nécessitant une gestion et une vérification de citations précises.","de":"Ideal für Forschungsagenten, die eine präzise Quellenverwaltung und -verifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa que exigem gerenciamento de citação preciso e capacidades de verificação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-исследователей, требующих точного управления цитатами и возможностей верификации.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يتطلبون إدارة اقتباس دقيقة وقدرات التحقق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and verify citations in BibTeX format, leveraging JSONL files for efficient data exchange and utilizing a ''record now, verify later'' workflow to handle restricted network access, ensuring data consistency through URLs and titles.","zh":"使代理能够生成和验证BibTeX格式的引用，利用JSONL文件进行高效的数据交换，并使用''立即记录，稍后验证''的工作流来处理受限网络访问，通过URL和标题确保数据的一致性。","ja":"エージェントがBibTeX形式の引用を生成して検証できるようにし、JSONLファイルを使用した効率的なデータ交換を可能にし、制限されたネットワークアクセスに対処するために''記録する、今後検証''ワークフローを使用し、URLとタイトルを通じてデータの一貫性を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 BibTeX 형식의 인용을 생성하고 확인할 수 있도록 하며, JSONL 파일을 사용한 효율적인 데이터 교환을 가능하게 하며, 제한된 네트워크 액세스를 처리하기 위해 ''지금 기록, 나중에 확인'' 워크플로를 사용하여 URL 및 제목을 통해 데이터 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y verificar citas en formato BibTeX, utilizando archivos JSONL para un intercambio de datos eficiente y utilizando un flujo de trabajo ''grabar ahora, verificar más tarde'' para manejar el acceso a redes restringidas, garantizando la consistencia de los datos a través de URLs y títulos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de vérifier des citations au format BibTeX, en utilisant des fichiers JSONL pour un échange de données efficace et en utilisant un flux de travail ''enregistrer maintenant, vérifier plus tard'' pour gérer l''accès à des réseaux restreints, garantissant la cohérence des données via des URL et des titres.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Zitate im BibTeX-Format zu generieren und zu verifizieren, indem JSONL-Dateien für einen effizienten Datenaustausch verwendet werden und ein ''jetzt aufzeichnen, später verifizieren''-Workflow zur Handhabung des eingeschränkten Netzwerkzugriffs eingesetzt wird, um die Datenkonsistenz durch URLs und Titel sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e verificar citações no formato BibTeX, utilizando arquivos JSONL para uma troca de dados eficiente e utilizando um fluxo de trabalho ''gravar agora, verificar mais tarde'' para lidar com o acesso restrito à rede, garantindo a consistência dos dados por meio de URLs e títulos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и проверять цитаты в формате BibTeX, используя файлы JSONL для эффективного обмена данными и используя рабочий процесс ''записать сейчас, проверить позже'' для обработки ограниченного доступа к сети, обеспечивая согласованность данных через URL и названия.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد التحقق من الاقتباسات في تنسيق BibTeX، مع استخدام ملفات JSONL لنقل البيانات بشكل فعال والاعتماد على تدفق عمل ''سجل الآن، التحقق لاحقًا'' للتعامل مع الوصول المقيد إلى الشبكة، مما يضمن συνέافة البيانات من خلال عناوين URL والألقاب."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying citations against online sources","Generating BibTeX files with traceable verification records","Maintaining consistent citation data across research papers"],"zh":["验证引用与在线来源的一致性","生成具有可追溯的验证记录的BibTeX文件","维护研究论文中的一致的引用数据"],"ja":["オンラインソースとの照合による引用の検証","可追跡な検証レコードを含むBibTeXファイルの生成","研究論文全体での一貫性のある引用データの維持"],"ko":["온라인 소스와의 일치性에 대한 인용 확인","추적 가능한 확인 기록을 포함하는 BibTeX 파일 생성","연구 논문 전체에서 일관된 인용 데이터 유지"],"es":["Verificar citas contra fuentes en línea","Generar archivos BibTeX con registros de verificación rastreables","Mantener datos de citación consistentes en todo el artículo de investigación"],"fr":["Vérifier les citations contre des sources en ligne","Générer des fichiers BibTeX avec des enregistrements de vérification traçables","Maintenir des données de citation cohérentes à travers les articles de recherche"],"de":["Zitate gegen Onlinequellen überprüfen","BibTeX-Dateien mit nachverfolgbaren Verifizierungsprotokollen generieren","Konsistente Zitierdaten in allen Forschungsartikeln beibehalten"],"pt":["Verificar citações contra fontes online","Gerar arquivos BibTeX com registros de verificação rastreáveis","Manter dados de citação consistentes em todo o artigo de pesquisa"],"ru":["Проверка цитат против онлайн-источников","Генерация файлов BibTeX с отслеживаемыми записями верификации","Поддержание согласованных данных цитат во всех исследовательских работах"],"ar":["التحقق من الاقتباسات مقابل المصادر المتاحة عبر الإنترنت","توليد ملفات BibTeX مع سجلات التحقق القابلة للتتبع","الحفاظ على بيانات الاقتباس المتسقة عبر كل الأوراق البحثية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to citation data in JSONL format","Restricted network access may limit immediate verification"],"zh":["需要JSONL格式的引用数据","受限网络访问可能会限制立即验证"],"ja":["JSONL形式の引用データの必要性","制限されたネットワークアクセスによる即時検証の制限"],"ko":["JSONL 형식의 인용 데이터 필요","제한된 네트워크 액세스에 의한 즉시 확인 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de citación en formato JSONL","El acceso a la red restringida puede limitar la verificación inmediata"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de citation au format JSONL","L''accès à des réseaux restreints peut limiter la vérification immédiate"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Zitierdaten im JSONL-Format","Eingeschränkter Netzwerkzugriff kann die sofortige Verifizierung einschränken"],"pt":["Exige acesso a dados de citação no formato JSONL","O acesso restrito à rede pode limitar a verificação imediata"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным цитат в формате JSONL","Ограниченный доступ к сети может ограничить немедленную верификацию"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات الاقتباس بتنسيق JSONL","يمكن أن يحد الوصول المقيد إلى الشبكة من التحقق الفوري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills/paragraph-curator', 'community', 'WILLOSCAR', 'research-units-pipeline-skills', 'WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills', 'paragraph-curator', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z', '2026-02-18T06:23:11.817Z', NULL, '{"id":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills/paragraph-curator","name":"paragraph-curator","description":{"es":"El curador de párrafos es una habilidad que agrega una capa de decisión entre el borrador y la voz pulida, mejorando la estructura del contenido","fr":"Le curateur de paragraphes est une compétence qui ajoute une couche de décision entre le brouillon et la voix polie, améliorant la structure du contenu","de":"Der Absatzkurator ist eine Fähigkeit, die eine Entscheidungsebene zwischen dem Entwurf und der polierten Stimme hinzufügt, die Inhaltsstruktur verbessert","pt":"O Curador de Parágrafos é uma ferramenta que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do conteúdo, tornando-o mais conciso e atraente","ru":"Куратор абзацев - это инструмент, который помогает улучшить качество контента, делая его более кратким и привлекательным","ar":"محرر الفقرات هو أداة تساعد على تحسين جودة المحتوى وجعله أكثر إقناعا","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Curador de Párrafos: Optimiza tu Contenido","fr":"Curateur de Paragraphes: Améliorez votre Contenu","de":"Absatzkurator: Optimieren Sie Ihren Inhalt","pt":"Curador de Parágrafos: Ferramenta de Edição de Conteúdo","ru":"Куратор абзацев: инструмент для редактирования контента","ar":"محرر الفقرات: أداة تحرير المحتوى","en":"paragraph-curator"},"description":{"es":"El curador de párrafos es una habilidad que agrega una capa de decisión entre el borrador y la voz pulida, mejorando la estructura del contenido","fr":"Le curateur de paragraphes est une compétence qui ajoute une couche de décision entre le brouillon et la voix polie, améliorant la structure du contenu","de":"Der Absatzkurator ist eine Fähigkeit, die eine Entscheidungsebene zwischen dem Entwurf und der polierten Stimme hinzufügt, die Inhaltsstruktur verbessert","pt":"O Curador de Parágrafos é uma ferramenta que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do conteúdo, tornando-o mais conciso e atraente","ru":"Куратор абзацев - это инструмент, который помогает улучшить качество контента, делая его более кратким и привлекательным","ar":"محرر الفقرات هو أداة تساعد على تحسين جودة المحتوى وجعله أكثر إقناعا","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents ..."},"definition":{"en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"features":{"es":["Selección de los mejores párrafos","Fusión de párrafos redundantes","Reescritura para una argumentación más clara","Expansión solo cuando la cobertura es insuficiente"],"fr":["Sélection des meilleurs paragraphes","Fusion des paragraphes redondants","Réécriture pour une argumentation plus claire","Expansion uniquement lorsque la couverture est insuffisante"],"de":["Auswahl der besten Absätze","Fusion redundanter Absätze","Neuschreibung für eine klarere Argumentation","Erweiterung nur wenn die Abdeckung unzureichend ist"],"pt":["Seleção de parágrafos relevantes","Avaliação e reescrita de parágrafos","Subconjunto de parágrafos redundantes","Fusão de parágrafos para melhorar a clareza"],"ru":["Выбор релевантных абзацев","Оценка и переписывание абзацев","Подразделение избыточных абзацев","Объединение абзацев для улучшения ясности"],"ar":["اختيار الفقرات المعنية","تقييم وإعادة كتابة الفقرات","تصنيف الفقرات المكررة","دمج الفقرات لتحسين الوضوح"]},"keywords":{"es":["curador de párrafos","optimización de contenido","mejora de la calidad del contenido","estructura de contenido","desarrollo de contenido","herramientas de escritura"],"fr":["curateur de paragraphes","optimisation de contenu","amélioration de la qualité du contenu","structure de contenu","développement de contenu","outils d''écriture"],"de":["Absatzkurator","Inhaltsoptimierung","Qualitätsverbesserung von Inhalten","Inhaltsstruktur","Inhaltsentwicklung","Schreibwerkzeuge"],"pt":["curador de parágrafos","edição de conteúdo","ferramenta de escrita","melhoria da qualidade do conteúdo","conteúdo mais atraente","otimização de texto"],"ru":["куратор абзацев","редактирование контента","инструмент для написания","улучшение качества контента","более привлекательный контент","оптимизация текста"],"ar":["محرر الفقرات","تحرير المحتوى","أداة الكتابة","تحسين جودة المحتوى","محتوى أكثر إقناعا","تحسين النص"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paragraph-curator","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Paragraph Curator (select -> evaluate -> subset -> fuse)\n\nPurpose: turn “keep rewriting and getting longer” into a controlled convergence step.\n\nThis skill adds a decision layer between “draft paragraphs” and “polish voice”:\n- keep the best paragraphs\n- merge redundant ones\n- rewrite for clearer argument moves\n- expand only when coverage is missing (using existing evidence cards)\n\nThis is a content-structure pass (not a style pass). Run `style-harmonizer` and `opener-variator` after curation.","body":"# Paragraph Curator (select -> evaluate -> subset -> fuse)\n\nPurpose: turn “keep rewriting and getting longer” into a controlled convergence step.\n\nThis skill adds a decision layer between “draft paragraphs” and “polish voice”:\n- keep the best paragraphs\n- merge redundant ones\n- rewrite for clearer argument moves\n- expand only when coverage is missing (using existing evidence cards)\n\nThis is a content-structure pass (not a style pass). Run `style-harmonizer` and `opener-variator` after curation.\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `sections/` (especially H3 bodies: `sections/S<sub_id>.md`)\n- `outline/writer_context_packs.jsonl` (what each H3 must cover + allowed citations)\n- `output/ARGUMENT_SKELETON.md` (single source of truth for terminology + premises)\n\nRecommended:\n- `output/SECTION_ARGUMENT_SUMMARIES.jsonl` (paragraph moves + outputs)\n- `output/SECTION_LOGIC_REPORT.md` (paragraph linkage risks)\n- `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` (style smells / scope/citation warnings)\n\n## Outputs\n\n- Updated `sections/*.md` (same filenames; body-only; no headings)\n- `output/PARAGRAPH_CURATION_REPORT.md` (short; PASS/FAIL + what changed)\n- Create `sections/paragraphs_curated.refined.ok` when done (empty file; pipeline contract signal)\n\n## What this skill optimizes (rubric)\n\nYou are not trying to “shorten”. You are trying to increase information density while keeping the section verifiable.\n\nScore each paragraph on a simple 0-2 rubric:\n\n| Criterion | 0 (bad) | 1 (ok) | 2 (good) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Coverage | does not match any required axis/card | matches one axis, thin | directly executes a must-use card/comparison |\n| Novelty | repeats nearby content | partially redundant | adds a distinct comparison/insight |\n| Move clarity | unclear what it does | move exists, weak output | clear move + reusable output |\n| Consistency | premise/term drift vs skeleton | minor mismatch | fully aligned with Consistency Contract |\n| Citation hygiene | uncited when it should be; cite-dump vibe | acceptable | citations are local and anchored (not just tail) |\n| Fusion readiness | cannot merge; tangled | mergeable with edits | clean unit that can be fused or kept |\n\nDecision labels:\n- `KEEP`: keep mostly as-is\n- `REWRITE`: keep content, rewrite for clearer move/output\n- `FUSE`: merge with neighbor(s) and rewrite into one stronger paragraph\n- `REPLACE`: keep the slot, but rewrite using existing evidence cards (when coverage is missing)\n\n## Paragraph budget (profile-aware)\n\nDefault per-H3 target:\n- `draft_profile=survey`: 10-12 paragraphs\n- `draft_profile=deep`: 11-13 paragraphs\n\nIf you exceed the budget, do not delete content blindly. Prefer `FUSE` (merge redundancy) and make the fused paragraph denser.\n\n## Must-have coverage checklist (per H3)\n\nEach H3 must contain at least:\n- 1x `Definition/Setup` (only if this H3 introduces a new term/protocol field)\n- 2x concrete `Contrast` paragraphs (A-vs-B comparisons; not just “many papers do...”)\n- 1x `Evaluation anchor` paragraph (task + metric + constraint/budget/tool access; cite-backed)\n- 1x cross-paper `Synthesis` paragraph (what generalizes, what does not; cite-backed)\n- 1x `Boundary/Failure` paragraph (limitations; threats to validity; cite-backed when possible)\n- 1x `Local conclusion` (a reusable takeaway used downstream)\n\nIf any item is missing, use `REPLACE` to write that paragraph from the writer context pack (do not invent new facts).\n\n## Workflow (minimal)\n\n1) Pick the target set\n- Start with the H3 bodies listed in `output/SECTION_LOGIC_REPORT.md`, plus any H3 flagged in `output/WRITER_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` as repetitive/template-y, plus any H3 that keeps growing across edits.\n- Work file-by-file: each target is a concrete `sections/S<sub_id>.md`.\n\n2) Build a paragraph inventory (scratch only; do not paste into the paper)\n- If `output/SECTION_ARGUMENT_SUMMARIES.jsonl` exists, use its per-paragraph `moves`/`output` as the first draft of your inventory, then reconcile with the actual text.\nFor each paragraph, write one line:\n- `P<i> :: move(s) -> output (1 sentence) :: citations (keys)`\n\n3) Apply the rubric and label each paragraph\n- Mark `KEEP/REWRITE/FUSE/REPLACE`.\n- If two adjacent paragraphs repeat the same axis, `FUSE`.\n- For any paragraph you plan to change (`REWRITE`/`REPLACE`/`FUSE`), draft 2-3 candidate rewrites in parallel (different angles: contrast-first / protocol-first / synthesis-first).\n  - Score candidates quickly with the rubric; keep one winner (or fuse two if they cover complementary axes).\n  - Keep citation keys unchanged while sampling; you are choosing surface form + structure, not changing the evidence set.\n\n4) Construct the curated set\n- Use `outline/writer_context_packs.jsonl` to enforce must-have coverage (paragraph_plan/must_use/comparison_cards/limitation_hooks) without inventing new content.\n- Enforce the must-have coverage checklist.\n- Enforce the paragraph budget by fusing redundancy rather than deleting substance.\n\n5) Fuse + rewrite (keep citation keys fixed)\nRules that keep the pipeline stable:\n- Do not add/remove citation keys; when fusing, carry citations forward and re-anchor them to the right sentence.\n- Do not move citations across subsections.\n- Avoid adjacent citation blocks (e.g., `[@a] [@b]`) and duplicate keys in one block (e.g., `[@a; @a]`).\n- When fusing, it is often faster to write two fused candidates (one contrast-heavy, one synthesis-heavy) and pick the better one.\n\n6) Write the report + marker\n- `output/PARAGRAPH_CURATION_REPORT.md` should be short and actionable:\n  - `- Status: PASS|FAIL`\n  - per H3: paragraph count before/after; what was fused; any remaining gaps\n  - (minimal) how many candidates you tried for the main rewrites (e.g., 2-3), so future passes can see whether this was a real selection step\n- Create `sections/paragraphs_curated.refined.ok`.\n\n## Routing rules\n\n- If you cannot fill a missing must-have paragraph without new evidence: stop and route upstream (`evidence-selfloop` / C3-C4). Do not pad.\n- If you feel forced to change a definition or evaluation premise: update `output/ARGUMENT_SKELETON.md# Consistency Contract` first, then rerun `argument-selfloop`.\n- If the only issue is surface cadence/openers: do not overwork curation; run `style-harmonizer` / `opener-variator`.\n\n## Done checklist\n\n- [ ] Each targeted H3 stays within its paragraph budget (survey 10-12; deep 11-13) without losing required moves.\n- [ ] Redundant paragraphs are fused into denser, clearer ones (not just deleted).\n- [ ] No citation keys were added/removed; citation shape is reader-facing (no adjacent blocks, no dup keys).\n- [ ] `output/PARAGRAPH_CURATION_REPORT.md` exists and is understandable.\n- [ ] `sections/paragraphs_curated.refined.ok` exists.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:23:11.817Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Content Generation Agents requiring structured content refinement and evidence-based writing methodologies.","zh":"适用于需要结构化内容精炼和基于证据的写作方法的内容生成代理。","ja":"構造化されたコンテンツの洗練とエビデンスベースのライティング手法を必要とするコンテンツ生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"구조화된 콘텐츠 정련과 증거 기반 글쓰기 방법론을 필요로 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de contenido que requieren refinamiento de contenido estructurado y metodologías de escritura basadas en evidencias.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de contenu nécessitant un affinement de contenu structuré et des méthodologies d''écriture fondées sur des preuves.","de":"Ideal für Content-Generierungs-Agents, die strukturierte Inhaltsverfeinerung und evidenzbasierte Schreibmethodiken erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que requerem refinamento de conteúdo estruturado e metodologias de escrita baseadas em evidências.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по генерации контента, требующих структурированного контента и методов написания, основанных на доказательствах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد المحتوى الذي يتطلب تنمية المحتوى المنظم وأساليب الكتابة القائمة على الأدلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to curate paragraphs through selective evaluation, subset selection, and fusion, utilizing evidence cards to ensure clear argument moves and prevent hollow writing, all while maintaining a content-structure pass.","zh":"赋予代理人通过选择性评估、子集选择和融合来策划段落的能力，利用证据卡来确保清晰的论证步骤，并防止空泛的写作，同时保持内容结构的通过。","ja":"エージェントに選択的な評価、サブセットの選択、融合を通じて段落を策劃する能力を付与し、エビデンスカードを利用して明確な論証の動きを確保し、空洞な文章を防ぎ、コンテンツ構造のパスを維持します。","ko":"에이전트에게 선택적 평가, 부분 집합 선택 및 융합을 통해 段落를 기획할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 증거 카드를 활용하여 명확한 논증 단계를 보장하고 공허한 글쓰기를 방지하면서 콘텐츠 구조의 패스를 유지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes curar párrafos mediante evaluación selectiva, selección de subconjuntos y fusión, utilizando fichas de evidencia para garantizar movimientos argumentales claros y evitar escritura vacía, todo ello manteniendo un pase de estructura de contenido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de curator des paragraphes par évaluation sélective, sélection de sous-ensembles et fusion, en utilisant des fiches de preuve pour assurer des mouvements argumentaires clairs et éviter l''écriture creuse, le tout en maintenant une passe de structure de contenu.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Absätze durch selektive Bewertung, Teilauswahl und Fusion zu kuratieren, unter Verwendung von Evidenzkarten, um klare Argumentationsschritte zu gewährleisten und hohles Schreiben zu verhindern, alles bei Beibehaltung eines Inhaltsstruktur-Durchgangs.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a curar parágrafos por meio de avaliação seletiva, seleção de subconjuntos e fusão, utilizando cartões de evidências para garantir movimentos de argumentação claros e prevenir escrita oca, mantendo uma passagem de estrutura de conteúdo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью курировать абзацы посредством выборочной оценки, выбора подмножеств и слияния, используя карты доказательств для обеспечения четких аргументов и предотвращения пустого письма, сохраняя при этом проход структуры контента.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية حماية الفقرات من خلال التقييم الانتقائي واختيار المجموعات الفرعية والاندماج، باستخدام بطاقات الأدلة لضمان حركات الحجة الواضحة ومنع الكتابة الفارغة، مع الحفاظ على ممر هيكل المحتوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining draft paragraphs for clarity and concision","Merging redundant paragraphs for improved content flow","Expanding content coverage using existing evidence cards"],"zh":["为清晰和简洁而完善草稿段落","合并冗余段落以改善内容流程","使用现有的证据卡来扩展内容覆盖范围"],"ja":["明確性と簡潔性のためにドラフト段落を洗練する","冗長な段落を統合してコンテンツの流れを改善する","既存のエビデンスカードを使用してコンテンツのカバー範囲を拡大する"],"ko":["명확성과 간결성을 위해 초안 段落를 정련하는 것","중복된 段落를 합쳐 콘텐츠의 흐름을 개선하는 것","既存의 증거 카드를 사용하여 콘텐츠의 범위를 확장하는 것"],"es":["Refinar párrafos de borrador para claridad y concisión","Fusionar párrafos redundantes para mejorar el flujo del contenido","Ampliar la cobertura de contenido utilizando fichas de evidencia existentes"],"fr":["Affiner les paragraphes de brouillon pour la clarté et la concision","Fusionner les paragraphes redondants pour améliorer le flux de contenu","Étendre la couverture du contenu en utilisant des fiches de preuve existantes"],"de":["Verfeinern von Entwurfsabsätzen für Klarheit und Prägnanz","Zusammenführen redundanter Absätze für einen verbesserten Inhaltsfluss","Erweitern der Inhaltsabdeckung mithilfe vorhandener Evidenzkarten"],"pt":["Refinamento de parágrafos de rascunho para clareza e concisão","Mesclagem de parágrafos redundantes para melhor fluxo de conteúdo","Expansão da cobertura de conteúdo usando cartões de evidências existentes"],"ru":["Уточнение черновых абзацев для ясности и краткости","Объединение избыточных абзацев для улучшения потока контента","Расширение охвата контента с помощью существующих карт доказательств"],"ar":["تنمية الفقرات الأولية للوضوح والاجمال","دمج الفقرات الزائدة لتحسين تدفق المحتوى","توسيع تغطية المحتوى باستخدام بطاقات الأدلة الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing evidence cards for expansion","Not a style pass, requires subsequent style harmonization"],"zh":["需要现有的证据卡来扩展","不是风格的通过，需要随后的风格协调"],"ja":["拡張するために既存のエビデンスカードが必要","スタイルのパスではないため、後のスタイルの調整が必要"],"ko":["확장을 위해 기존의 증거 카드가 필요","스타일 패스가 아니므로 이후 스타일 조정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere fichas de evidencia existentes para la expansión","No es un pase de estilo, requiere una posterior armonización de estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite des fiches de preuve existantes pour l''expansion","N''est pas une passe de style, nécessite une harmonisation de style ultérieure"],"de":["Erfordert vorhandene Evidenzkarten für die Erweiterung","Ist kein Stil-Durchgang, erfordert eine nachfolgende Stilharmonisierung"],"pt":["Requer cartões de evidências existentes para expansão","Não é uma passagem de estilo, requer harmonização de estilo subsequente"],"ru":["Требует существующих карт доказательств для расширения","Не является проходом стиля, требует последующей гармонизации стиля"],"ar":["يتطلب بطاقات أدلة موجودة للتوسعة","ليست ممر أسلوب، تتطلب توحيد الأسلوب اللاحق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
