zh":"微信自动化技能提供了WeChat监控和自动化的解决方案，使用wxauto和Accessibility API实现自动回复","ja":"WeChat自動化スキルは、WeChatの監視と自動化のソリューションを提供し、wxautoとAccessibility APIを使用して自動応答を実現する","ko":"위챗 자동화 스킬은 위챗 모니터링과 자동화의 솔루션을 제공하며 wxauto와 Accessibility API를 사용하여 자동 응답을 구현한다","es":"La automatización de WeChat utiliza agentes específicos de plataforma para monitorear conversaciones y controlar la caja de entrada","fr":"L''automatisation de WeChat utilise des agents spécifiques à la plate-forme pour surveiller les conversations et contrôler la boîte de saisie","de":"Die WeChat-Automatisierung verwendet plattformspezifische Agenten, um Konversationen zu überwachen und die Eingabeschachtelung zu steuern","pt":"O WeChat Automation é uma ferramenta para monitorar e automatizar conversas no WeChat. Utiliza wxauto e Accessibility API para controlar a caixa de entrada.","ru":"WeChat Automation — это инструмент для мониторинга и автоматизации разговоров в WeChat. Использует wxauto и Accessibility API для контроля ввода.","ar":"WeChat Automation هو أداة لمراقبة وأتمتة المحادثات على وي تشات. يستخدم wxauto و Accessibility API للسيطرة على مربع الإدخال.","en":"微信聊天自动回复助手"},"definition":{"en":"微信聊天自动回复助手"},"features":{"zh":["使用wxauto实现Windows上的WeChat自动化","使用Accessibility API实现macOS上的WeChat自动化","支持JSON协议的通信","使用Rust Orchestrator进行通信","实现WeChat对话的监控和自动回复"],"ja":["wxautoを使用してWindows上的WeChat自動化を実現","Accessibility APIを使用してmacOS上的WeChat自動化を実現","JSONプロトコルの通信をサポート","Rust Orchestratorを使用して通信","WeChat対話の監視と自動応答を実現"],"ko":["wxauto를 사용하여 윈도우즈上的위챗 자동화를 구현","Accessibility API를 사용하여 맥오에스上的위챗 자동화를 구현","JSON 프로토콜의 통신을 지원","Rust Orchestrator를 사용하여 통신","위챗 대화의 모니터링과 자동 응답을 구현"],"es":["Monitoreo de conversaciones de WeChat","Automatización de la caja de entrada","Soporte para wxauto en Windows","Soporte para Accessibility API en macOS","Comunicación a través de protocolo JSON","Orquestador de Rust para la coordinación"],"fr":["Surveillance des conversations WeChat","Automatisation de la boîte de saisie","Prise en charge de wxauto sous Windows","Prise en charge de l''API d''accessibilité sous macOS","Communication via le protocole JSON","Orchestrateur Rust pour la coordination"],"de":["Überwachung von WeChat-Konversationen","Automatisierung der Eingabeschachtelung","Unterstützung für wxauto unter Windows","Unterstützung für die Accessibility-API unter macOS","Kommunikation über das JSON-Protokoll","Rust-Orchestrierer für die Koordination"],"pt":["Monitoramento de conversas no WeChat","Controle da caixa de entrada com wxauto","Integração com Accessibility API","Comunicação via protocolo JSON","Suporte a plataformas Windows e macOS"],"ru":["Мониторинг разговоров в WeChat","Контроль ввода с помощью wxauto","Интеграция с Accessibility API","Общение через протокол JSON","Поддержка платформ Windows и macOS"],"ar":["مراقبة المحادثات على وي تشات","السيطرة على مربع الإدخال مع wxauto","التكامل مع Accessibility API","التواصل عبر بروتوكول JSON","دعم منصات Windows و macOS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["微信自动化","WeChat自动化","wxauto","Accessibility API","Rust Orchestrator","JSON协议","自动回复","监控"],"ja":["WeChat自動化","wxauto","Accessibility API","Rust Orchestrator","JSONプロトコル","自動応答","監視"],"ko":["위챗 자동화","wxauto","Accessibility API","Rust Orchestrator","JSON 프로토콜","자동 응답","모니터링"],"es":["automatización de WeChat","monitoreo de WeChat","wxauto","Accessibility API","desarrollo de WeChat","automatización de conversaciones","integración de WeChat","soluciones de automatización"],"fr":["automatisation de WeChat","surveillance de WeChat","wxauto","API d''accessibilité","développement de WeChat","automatisation de conversations","intégration de WeChat","solutions d''automatisation"],"de":["WeChat-Automatisierung","WeChat-Überwachung","wxauto","Accessibility-API","WeChat-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Konversationen","WeChat-Integration","Automatisierungslösungen"],"pt":["WeChat Automation","automatizar WeChat","wxauto","Accessibility API","monitorar conversas","controle da caixa de entrada","desenvolvedores WeChat"],"ru":["WeChat Automation","автоматизировать WeChat","wxauto","Accessibility API","мониторинг разговоров","контроль ввода","разработчики WeChat"],"ar":["WeChat Automation","أتمتة وي تشات","wxauto","Accessibility API","مراقبة المحادثات","السيطرة على مربع الإدخال","مطورو وي تشات"]}},"owner":"cacr92","repo":"WeReply","repoPath":"cacr92/WeReply","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wechat-automation","description":"当用户要求微信监听、消息提取、Agent 开发、wxauto、Accessibility API、UI 自动化、输入框控制、Platform Agent，或者提到微信自动化、消息监控、WeChat monitoring时使用此技能。用于开发 WeReply 的 Platform Agent（Windows wxauto 或 macOS Accessibility API）、实现微信消息监听、消息提取、输入框控制和 Agent 错误处理。","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WeChat Automation Skill\n\nExpert guidance for WeChat monitoring and automation using wxauto (Windows) and Accessibility API (macOS).\n\n## Overview\n\nWeReply uses Platform-specific Agents to monitor WeChat conversations and control the input box:\n- **Windows Agent**: Python 3.12 + wxauto v4\n- **macOS Agent**: Swift + Accessibility API\n- **Communication**: JSON protocol via stdin/stdout with Rust Orchestrator\n\n## Architecture Pattern\n\n```\n微信窗口\n   ↓ (UI Automation)\nPlatform Agent\n   ├→ 监听消息（定时轮询）","body":"# WeChat Automation Skill\n\nExpert guidance for WeChat monitoring and automation using wxauto (Windows) and Accessibility API (macOS).\n\n## Overview\n\nWeReply uses Platform-specific Agents to monitor WeChat conversations and control the input box:\n- **Windows Agent**: Python 3.12 + wxauto v4\n- **macOS Agent**: Swift + Accessibility API\n- **Communication**: JSON protocol via stdin/stdout with Rust Orchestrator\n\n## Architecture Pattern\n\n```\n微信窗口\n   ↓ (UI Automation)\nPlatform Agent\n   ├→ 监听消息（定时轮询）\n   ├→ 提取消息内容\n   ├→ 发送到 Orchestrator (JSON via stdout)\n   └→ 接收命令 (JSON via stdin)\n       ↓\n   控制输入框（写入建议）\n```\n\n## Windows Agent - wxauto v4\n\n### Installation and Setup\n\n```bash\n# 安装依赖\npip install wxauto==4.0.0\n\n# 确保微信已登录且窗口可见\n```\n\n### Message Monitoring Pattern\n\n```python\nimport json\nimport time\nimport sys\nfrom wxauto import WeChat\n\nclass WeChatMonitor:\n    def __init__(self, interval_ms: int = 500):\n        \"\"\"\n        初始化微信监听器\n\n        Args:\n            interval_ms: 监听间隔（毫秒），默认 500ms\n        \"\"\"\n        self.wechat = WeChat()\n        self.interval_ms = interval_ms\n        self.last_message_id = None\n\n    def start_monitoring(self):\n        \"\"\"开始监听微信消息\"\"\"\n        try:\n            while True:\n                # 获取当前聊天窗口的最新消息\n                messages = self.wechat.GetAllMessage()\n\n                if messages and len(messages) > 0:\n                    latest_message = messages[-1]\n\n                    # 检查是否是新消息（避免重复处理）\n                    message_id = self._generate_message_id(latest_message)\n                    if message_id != self.last_message_id:\n                        self.last_message_id = message_id\n                        self._send_message_to_orchestrator(latest_message)\n\n                # 间隔等待\n                time.sleep(self.interval_ms / 1000.0)\n\n        except KeyboardInterrupt:\n            self._send_error(\"监听被用户中断\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            self._send_error(f\"监听错误: {str(e)}\")\n\n    def _generate_message_id(self, message) -> str:\n        \"\"\"生成消息唯一ID（用于去重）\"\"\"\n        # 结合时间戳、发送者、内容生成ID\n        content = message.get(''content'', '''')\n        sender = message.get(''sender'', '''')\n        timestamp = message.get(''time'', '''')\n        return f\"{sender}:{timestamp}:{hash(content)}\"\n\n    def _send_message_to_orchestrator(self, message):\n        \"\"\"\n        发送消息到 Rust Orchestrator\n\n        格式：\n        {\n            \"type\": \"MessageNew\",\n            \"content\": \"消息内容\",\n            \"sender\": \"发送者\",\n            \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-23T10:30:00\"\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"MessageNew\",\n            \"content\": message.get(''content'', ''''),\n            \"sender\": message.get(''sender'', ''''),\n            \"timestamp\": message.get(''time'', '''')\n        }\n\n        # 输出到 stdout（Rust 会读取）\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n\n    def _send_error(self, error_message: str):\n        \"\"\"发送错误信息到 Orchestrator\"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"Error\",\n            \"message\": error_message\n        }\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n\n# 使用示例\nif __name__ == ''__main__'':\n    monitor = WeChatMonitor(interval_ms=500)\n    monitor.start_monitoring()\n```\n\n### Input Box Control Pattern\n\n```python\nclass WeChatInputWriter:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.wechat = WeChat()\n\n    def write_to_input(self, content: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"\n        写入内容到微信输入框\n\n        Args:\n            content: 要写入的文本\n\n        Returns:\n            bool: 写入是否成功\n        \"\"\"\n        try:\n            # 使用 wxauto 写入输入框\n            self.wechat.SendMsg(content)\n            return True\n        except Exception as e:\n            self._send_error(f\"写入失败: {str(e)}\")\n            return False\n\n    def clear_input(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"清空输入框\"\"\"\n        try:\n            # wxauto v4 提供的清空方法\n            self.wechat.ClearMsg()\n            return True\n        except Exception as e:\n            self._send_error(f\"清空失败: {str(e)}\")\n            return False\n\n    def _send_error(self, error_message: str):\n        \"\"\"发送错误到 Orchestrator\"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"Error\",\n            \"message\": error_message\n        }\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n```\n\n### Command Handling Pattern\n\n```python\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport threading\n\nclass AgentCommandHandler:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.input_writer = WeChatInputWriter()\n        self.running = True\n\n    def start_command_listener(self):\n        \"\"\"监听来自 Orchestrator 的命令（stdin）\"\"\"\n        thread = threading.Thread(target=self._listen_commands, daemon=True)\n        thread.start()\n\n    def _listen_commands(self):\n        \"\"\"从 stdin 读取命令\"\"\"\n        try:\n            for line in sys.stdin:\n                if not self.running:\n                    break\n\n                try:\n                    command = json.loads(line.strip())\n                    self._handle_command(command)\n                except json.JSONDecodeError:\n                    self._send_error(f\"无效的 JSON 命令: {line}\")\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            self._send_error(f\"命令监听错误: {str(e)}\")\n\n    def _handle_command(self, command: dict):\n        \"\"\"处理命令\"\"\"\n        cmd_type = command.get(''type'')\n\n        if cmd_type == ''WriteInput'':\n            content = command.get(''content'', '''')\n            success = self.input_writer.write_to_input(content)\n            self._send_response(success)\n\n        elif cmd_type == ''ClearInput'':\n            success = self.input_writer.clear_input()\n            self._send_response(success)\n\n        elif cmd_type == ''HealthCheck'':\n            self._send_health_status()\n\n        else:\n            self._send_error(f\"未知命令类型: {cmd_type}\")\n\n    def _send_response(self, success: bool):\n        \"\"\"发送命令执行结果\"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"CommandResponse\",\n            \"success\": success\n        }\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n\n    def _send_health_status(self):\n        \"\"\"发送健康状态\"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"HealthStatus\",\n            \"status\": \"ok\",\n            \"agent_type\": \"windows_wxauto\"\n        }\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n\n    def _send_error(self, error_message: str):\n        \"\"\"发送错误\"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"Error\",\n            \"message\": error_message\n        }\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n```\n\n## macOS Agent - Accessibility API\n\n### Swift Implementation Pattern\n\n```swift\nimport Cocoa\nimport ApplicationServices\n\nclass WeChatMonitor {\n    private var monitoringTimer: Timer?\n    private var lastMessageId: String?\n    private let intervalMs: Int\n\n    init(intervalMs: Int = 500) {\n        self.intervalMs = intervalMs\n    }\n\n    func startMonitoring() {\n        // 请求 Accessibility 权限\n        if !AXIsProcessTrusted() {\n            let options = [kAXTrustedCheckOptionPrompt.takeUnretainedValue() as String: true]\n            AXIsProcessTrustedWithOptions(options as CFDictionary)\n            return\n        }\n\n        // 启动定时器\n        monitoringTimer = Timer.scheduledTimer(\n            withTimeInterval: TimeInterval(intervalMs) / 1000.0,\n            repeats: true\n        ) { [weak self] _ in\n            self?.checkForNewMessages()\n        }\n\n        RunLoop.main.run()\n    }\n\n    private func checkForNewMessages() {\n        guard let wechatApp = getWeChatApplication() else {\n            return\n        }\n\n        // 使用 Accessibility API 获取消息\n        if let messages = extractMessages(from: wechatApp) {\n            if let latestMessage = messages.last {\n                let messageId = generateMessageId(message: latestMessage)\n\n                if messageId != lastMessageId {\n                    lastMessageId = messageId\n                    sendMessageToOrchestrator(message: latestMessage)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private func getWeChatApplication() -> AXUIElement? {\n        let runningApps = NSWorkspace.shared.runningApplications\n        guard let wechatApp = runningApps.first(where: { $0.bundleIdentifier == \"com.tencent.xinWeChat\" }) else {\n            return nil\n        }\n\n        return AXUIElementCreateApplication(wechatApp.processIdentifier)\n    }\n\n    private func extractMessages(from app: AXUIElement) -> [[String: String]]? {\n        // 使用 Accessibility API 提取消息列表\n        // 这需要深入分析微信的 UI 层次结构\n\n        var messagesValue: AnyObject?\n        let result = AXUIElementCopyAttributeValue(app, kAXChildrenAttribute as CFString, &messagesValue)\n\n        guard result == .success, let windows = messagesValue as? [AXUIElement] else {\n            return nil\n        }\n\n        // 遍历窗口，找到聊天窗口，提取消息\n        // 具体实现需要根据微信的 UI 结构调整\n\n        return nil // Placeholder\n    }\n\n    private func generateMessageId(message: [String: String]) -> String {\n        let content = message[\"content\"] ?? \"\"\n        let sender = message[\"sender\"] ?? \"\"\n        let timestamp = message[\"timestamp\"] ?? \"\"\n        return \"\\(sender):\\(timestamp):\\(content.hashValue)\"\n    }\n\n    private func sendMessageToOrchestrator(message: [String: String]) {\n        let payload: [String: Any] = [\n            \"type\": \"MessageNew\",\n            \"content\": message[\"content\"] ?? \"\",\n            \"sender\": message[\"sender\"] ?? \"\",\n            \"timestamp\": message[\"timestamp\"] ?? \"\"\n        ]\n\n        if let jsonData = try? JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: payload),\n           let jsonString = String(data: jsonData, encoding: .utf8) {\n            print(jsonString, terminator: \"\\n\")\n            fflush(stdout)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Input Writer (Swift)\n\n```swift\nclass WeChatInputWriter {\n    func writeToInput(content: String) -> Bool {\n        guard let wechatApp = getWeChatApplication() else {\n            sendError(message: \"未找到微信应用\")\n            return false\n        }\n\n        // 查找输入框\n        guard let inputField = findInputField(in: wechatApp) else {\n            sendError(message: \"未找到输入框\")\n            return false\n        }\n\n        // 写入内容\n        var value = content as CFTypeRef\n        let result = AXUIElementSetAttributeValue(inputField, kAXValueAttribute as CFString, value)\n\n        if result == .success {\n            return true\n        } else {\n            sendError(message: \"写入失败: \\(result.rawValue)\")\n            return false\n        }\n    }\n\n    private func findInputField(in app: AXUIElement) -> AXUIElement? {\n        // 使用 Accessibility API 查找输入框\n        // 需要遍历 UI 层次结构找到输入框元素\n        return nil // Placeholder\n    }\n\n    private func getWeChatApplication() -> AXUIElement? {\n        // 同上\n        return nil\n    }\n\n    private func sendError(message: String) {\n        let payload: [String: Any] = [\n            \"type\": \"Error\",\n            \"message\": message\n        ]\n\n        if let jsonData = try? JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: payload),\n           let jsonString = String(data: jsonData, encoding: .utf8) {\n            print(jsonString, terminator: \"\\n\")\n            fflush(stdout)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Message Deduplication Strategy\n\n### Time-based Deduplication\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\n\nclass MessageDeduplicator:\n    def __init__(self, window_seconds: int = 5):\n        \"\"\"\n        消息去重器\n\n        Args:\n            window_seconds: 去重时间窗口（秒）\n        \"\"\"\n        self.seen_messages = {}  # {message_id: timestamp}\n        self.window_seconds = window_seconds\n\n    def is_duplicate(self, message_id: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"检查消息是否重复\"\"\"\n        now = datetime.now()\n\n        # 清理过期的消息记录\n        self._clean_old_messages(now)\n\n        # 检查是否已见过\n        if message_id in self.seen_messages:\n            return True\n\n        # 记录新消息\n        self.seen_messages[message_id] = now\n        return False\n\n    def _clean_old_messages(self, now: datetime):\n        \"\"\"清理过期的消息记录\"\"\"\n        cutoff = now - timedelta(seconds=self.window_seconds)\n        self.seen_messages = {\n            msg_id: timestamp\n            for msg_id, timestamp in self.seen_messages.items()\n            if timestamp > cutoff\n        }\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Polling Interval Tuning\n\n```python\nclass AdaptiveMonitor:\n    def __init__(self, min_interval_ms: int = 200, max_interval_ms: int = 1000):\n        \"\"\"\n        自适应监听间隔\n\n        当有活跃消息时，使用较短间隔（200ms）\n        当长时间无消息时，逐渐增加到最大间隔（1000ms）\n        \"\"\"\n        self.min_interval = min_interval_ms / 1000.0\n        self.max_interval = max_interval_ms / 1000.0\n        self.current_interval = self.min_interval\n        self.idle_count = 0\n\n    def get_next_interval(self, has_new_message: bool) -> float:\n        \"\"\"获取下次轮询间隔\"\"\"\n        if has_new_message:\n            # 有新消息，使用最短间隔\n            self.current_interval = self.min_interval\n            self.idle_count = 0\n        else:\n            # 无新消息，逐渐增加间隔\n            self.idle_count += 1\n            if self.idle_count > 5:  # 5次无消息后开始增加间隔\n                self.current_interval = min(\n                    self.current_interval * 1.2,\n                    self.max_interval\n                )\n\n        return self.current_interval\n```\n\n### Memory Optimization\n\n```python\nimport gc\n\nclass MemoryEfficientMonitor:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.message_buffer_size = 100  # 只保留最近100条消息\n        self.message_buffer = []\n\n    def add_message(self, message):\n        \"\"\"添加消息到缓冲区\"\"\"\n        self.message_buffer.append(message)\n\n        # 超过缓冲区大小，清理旧消息\n        if len(self.message_buffer) > self.message_buffer_size:\n            self.message_buffer = self.message_buffer[-self.message_buffer_size:]\n            gc.collect()  # 触发垃圾回收\n```\n\n## Error Handling and Recovery\n\n### Graceful Degradation\n\n```python\nclass RobustAgent:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.max_retries = 3\n        self.retry_delay_seconds = 2\n\n    def monitor_with_retry(self):\n        \"\"\"带重试的监听\"\"\"\n        retry_count = 0\n\n        while retry_count < self.max_retries:\n            try:\n                self.start_monitoring()\n                break  # 成功，跳出循环\n            except Exception as e:\n                retry_count += 1\n                self._send_error(f\"监听失败 (尝试 {retry_count}/{self.max_retries}): {str(e)}\")\n\n                if retry_count < self.max_retries:\n                    time.sleep(self.retry_delay_seconds)\n                else:\n                    self._send_error(\"监听失败次数过多，Agent 退出\")\n                    sys.exit(1)\n```\n\n### Health Check\n\n```python\nclass HealthMonitor:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.last_heartbeat = time.time()\n        self.heartbeat_interval = 10  # 每10秒发送一次心跳\n\n    def send_heartbeat(self):\n        \"\"\"发送心跳到 Orchestrator\"\"\"\n        payload = {\n            \"type\": \"Heartbeat\",\n            \"timestamp\": time.time(),\n            \"status\": \"ok\"\n        }\n        print(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False), flush=True)\n        self.last_heartbeat = time.time()\n```\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n### Input Validation\n\n```python\ndef validate_command(command: dict) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"验证来自 Orchestrator 的命令\"\"\"\n    # 检查命令类型\n    if ''type'' not in command:\n        return False\n\n    cmd_type = command[''type'']\n\n    # 只接受预定义的命令类型\n    valid_types = [''WriteInput'', ''ClearInput'', ''HealthCheck'', ''Stop'']\n    if cmd_type not in valid_types:\n        return False\n\n    # 验证内容长度（防止恶意超长内容）\n    if cmd_type == ''WriteInput'':\n        content = command.get(''content'', '''')\n        if len(content) > 10000:  # 最大10KB\n            return False\n\n    return True\n```\n\n### Privacy Protection\n\n```python\ndef sanitize_message_for_logging(message: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"清理消息中的敏感信息（用于日志）\"\"\"\n    sanitized = message.copy()\n\n    # 不记录完整的消息内容\n    if ''content'' in sanitized:\n        content = sanitized[''content'']\n        if len(content) > 50:\n            sanitized[''content''] = content[:50] + ''...''\n\n    return sanitized\n```\n\n## Testing Guidelines\n\n### Unit Testing\n\n```python\nimport unittest\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock, patch\n\nclass TestWeChatMonitor(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_message_deduplication(self):\n        \"\"\"测试消息去重\"\"\"\n        deduplicator = MessageDeduplicator(window_seconds=5)\n\n        message_id = \"test_message_1\"\n\n        # 第一次应该不是重复\n        self.assertFalse(deduplicator.is_duplicate(message_id))\n\n        # 第二次应该是重复\n        self.assertTrue(deduplicator.is_duplicate(message_id))\n\n    @patch(''wxauto.WeChat'')\n    def test_monitor_initialization(self, mock_wechat):\n        \"\"\"测试监听器初始化\"\"\"\n        monitor = WeChatMonitor(interval_ms=500)\n        self.assertEqual(monitor.interval_ms, 500)\n        self.assertIsNone(monitor.last_message_id)\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Implementing WeChat message monitoring\n- Developing Platform Agents (Windows/macOS)\n- Working with wxauto or Accessibility API\n- Handling message extraction and deduplication\n- Implementing input box control\n- Optimizing Agent performance\n- Handling Agent errors and recovery\n- Setting up IPC communication with Orchestrator\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:23:11.722Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing WeChat conversation automation and monitoring capabilities using wxauto and Accessibility API.","zh":"非常适合需要使用wxauto和无障碍API进行微信对话自动化和监控的AI代理。","ja":"wxautoとアクセシビリティAPIを使用したWeChat会話の自動化と監視機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"wxauto와 접근성 API를 사용한 웨이신(WeChat) 대화 자동화 및 모니터링 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan automatización y capacidades de monitoreo de conversaciones de WeChat utilizando wxauto y API de Accesibilidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''automatisation et de capacités de surveillance des conversations WeChat utilisant wxauto et API d''Accessibilité.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine Automatisierung und Überwachungsfunktionen für WeChat-Konversationen mit wxauto und Accessibility-API benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam de automação e monitoramento de conversas do WeChat usando wxauto e Accessibility API.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходима автоматизация и мониторинг разговоров WeChat с использованием wxauto и Accessibility API.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكياء الذين يحتاجون إلى تطبيق تلقائي وتحكم في محادثات WeChat باستخدام wxauto و Accessibility API."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WeChat conversations using Python 3.12 and wxauto v4 on Windows, and Swift with Accessibility API on macOS, enabling seamless communication via JSON protocol with a Rust Orchestrator.","zh":"通过使用Python 3.12和wxauto v4在Windows上以及Swift和无障碍API在macOS上，赋予代理自动化WeChat会话的能力，并通过JSON协议与Rust编排器进行无缝通信。","ja":"Python 3.12とwxauto v4を使用したWindows、SwiftとアクセシビリティAPIを使用したmacOSで、WeChat会話の自動化を可能にし、JSONプロトコルを使用してRustオーケストレーターとシームレスに通信します。","ko":"Windows에서 Python 3.12와 wxauto v4를 사용하고, macOS에서 Swift와 접근성 API를 사용하여 웨이신(WeChat) 대화를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, JSON 프로토콜을 통해 러스트 오케스트레이터와 무縫 통신을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar conversaciones de WeChat utilizando Python 3.12 y wxauto v4 en Windows, y Swift con API de Accesibilidad en macOS, lo que permite una comunicación fluida a través del protocolo JSON con un Orquestador de Rust.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les conversations WeChat en utilisant Python 3.12 et wxauto v4 sous Windows, et Swift avec API d''Accessibilité sous macOS, permettant une communication fluide via le protocole JSON avec un Orchestrateur Rust.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, WeChat-Konversationen mit Python 3.12 und wxauto v4 unter Windows sowie Swift und Accessibility-API unter macOS zu automatisieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Kommunikation über das JSON-Protokoll mit einem Rust-Orchester ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar conversas do WeChat usando Python 3.12 e wxauto v4 no Windows, e Swift com Accessibility API no macOS, permitindo uma comunicação sem interrupções via protocolo JSON com um Orquestrador Rust.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать разговоры WeChat с использованием Python 3.12 и wxauto v4 в Windows, и Swift с Accessibility API в macOS, обеспечивая бесперебойную связь через протокол JSON с Оркестратором Rust.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تطبيق تلقائي لمحادثات WeChat باستخدام Python 3.12 و wxauto v4 على نظام Windows، و Swift مع Accessibility API على نظام macOS، وتمكين التواصل السلس через بروتوكول JSON مع معزز Rust."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating WeChat message responses using Platform-specific Agents","Monitoring WeChat conversations for keyword triggers","Controlling WeChat input boxes programmatically via UI Automation"],"zh":["使用特定平台的代理自动化微信消息响应","监控微信会话以触发特定关键词","通过UI自动化以编程方式控制微信输入框"],"ja":["プラットフォーム固有のエージェントを使用してWeChatメッセージの応答を自動化する","WeChat会話を監視してキーワードトリガーを検知する","UI自動化を使用してWeChatの入力ボックスをプログラム的に制御する"],"ko":["특정 플랫폼의 에이전트를 사용하여 웨이신(WeChat) 메시지 응답을 자동화하는 것","웨이신(WeChat) 대화를 모니터링하여 키워드 트리거를 감지하는 것","UI 자동화를 사용하여 웨이신(WeChat) 입력 상자를 프로그래밍 방식으로 제어하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de respuestas de mensajes de WeChat mediante Agentes específicos de la plataforma","Monitoreo de conversaciones de WeChat para activadores de palabras clave","Control de cuadros de entrada de WeChat de forma programática a través de la automatización de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Automatisation des réponses aux messages WeChat à l''aide d''Agents spécifiques à la plateforme","Surveillance des conversations WeChat pour des déclencheurs de mots clés","Contrôle des zones de saisie WeChat de manière programmatique via l''automatisation de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von WeChat-Nachrichtenantworten mithilfe plattformspezifischer Agents","Überwachung von WeChat-Konversationen für Schlüsselwortauslöser","Programmatische Steuerung von WeChat-Eingabefeldern über die Benutzeroberflächenautomatisierung"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas de mensagens do WeChat usando Agentes específicos da plataforma","Monitorar conversas do WeChat para disparadores de palavras-chave","Controlar caixas de entrada do WeChat programaticamente via Automação de UI"],"ru":["Автоматизация ответов на сообщения WeChat с помощью агентов, специфичных для платформы","Мониторинг разговоров WeChat для ключевых слов-триггеров","Программное управление полями ввода WeChat через автоматизацию UI"],"ar":["تطبيق تلقائي لاستجابات رسائل WeChat باستخدام وكلاء محددين للمنصة","مراقبة محادثات WeChat للبحث عن الكلمات الرئيسية","التحكم في مربعات الإدخال في WeChat عن طريق برمجة واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.12 for Windows Agent","Requires Swift and Accessibility API for macOS Agent","Limited to WeChat platform"],"zh":["需要Python 3.12用于Windows代理","需要Swift和无障碍API用于macOS代理","仅限微信平台"],"ja":["WindowsエージェントにはPython 3.12が必要","macOSエージェントにはSwiftとアクセシビリティAPIが必要","WeChatプラットフォームのみ"],"ko":["Windows 에이전트에는 Python 3.12가 필요합니다.","macOS 에이전트에는 Swift와 접근성 API가 필요합니다.","웨이신(WeChat) 플랫폼만 해당"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.12 para el Agente de Windows","Requiere Swift y API de Accesibilidad para el Agente de macOS","Limitado a la plataforma WeChat"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.12 pour l''Agent Windows","Nécessite Swift et API d''Accessibilité pour l''Agent macOS","Limité à la plateforme WeChat"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.12 für den Windows-Agent","Benötigt Swift und Accessibility-API für den macOS-Agent","Begrenzt auf die WeChat-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.12 para o Agente do Windows","Requer Swift e Accessibility API para o Agente do macOS","Limitado à plataforma do WeChat"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.12 для агента Windows","Требует Swift и Accessibility API для агента macOS","Ограничен платформой WeChat"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.12 للوكيل نظام Windows","يتطلب Swift و Accessibility API للوكيل نظام macOS","محدود بمنصة WeChat"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
