haltung","Hypothese-basierte Untersuchung und Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Decomposição de problemas complexos","Planejamento adaptável com capacidade de revisão","Análise com capacidade de correção de curso","Soluções multi-etapas que requerem manutenção de contexto","Investigação baseada em hipóteses e depuração"],"ru":["Разложение сложных проблем","Адаптивное планирование с возможностью пересмотра","Анализ с возможностью коррекции курса","Многоэтапные решения, требующие поддержания контекста","Исследование на основе гипотез и отладка"],"ar":["تحليل المشكلات المعقدة","تخطيط مرن مع khảية المراجعة","تحليل مع khảية التصحيح","حلول متعددة المراحل التي تتطلب الحفاظ على السياق","بحث قائم على الفرضيات وتصحيح الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["顺序思考","结构化问题解决","复杂问题分解","自适应规划","分析和调试","多步骤解决方案","假设驱动的调查"],"ja":["順序思考","構造化問題解決","複雑な問題の分解","適応的な計画","分析とデバッグ","多段階の解決策","仮説に基づく調査"],"ko":["순차적思考","구조화된 문제 해결","복잡한 문제 분해","적응형 계획","분석 및 디버깅","다단계 해결책","가설 기반 조사"],"es":["pensamiento secuencial","resolución de problemas","descomposición de problemas","planificación adaptativa","análisis dinámico","soluciones multi-paso","investigación basada en hipótesis","depuración de problemas"],"fr":["pensée séquentielle","résolution de problèmes","décomposition de problèmes","planification adaptative","analyse dynamique","solutions multi-étapes","investigation basée sur des hypothèses","débogage de problèmes"],"de":["sequentielles Denken","Problemlösung","Zerlegung von Problemen","adaptive Planung","dynamische Analyse","mehrschrittige Lösungen","hypothese-basierte Untersuchung","Fehlersuche"],"pt":["pensamento sequencial","resolução de problemas","planejamento adaptável","análise de problemas","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","metodologias ágeis"],"ru":["последовательное мышление","решение проблем","адаптивное планирование","анализ проблем","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","гибкие методологии"],"ar":["التفكير التسلسلي","حل المشكلات","تخطيط مرن","تحليل المشكلات","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","منهجيات مرنة"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sequential-thinking","description":"Apply structured, reflective problem-solving for complex tasks requiring multi-step analysis, revision capability, and hypothesis verification. Use for complex problem decomposition, adaptive planning, analysis needing course correction, problems with unclear scope, multi-step solutions, and hypothesis-driven work.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Sequential Thinking\n\nStructured problem-solving via manageable, reflective thought sequences with dynamic adjustment.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Complex problem decomposition\n- Adaptive planning with revision capability\n- Analysis needing course correction\n- Problems with unclear/emerging scope\n- Multi-step solutions requiring context maintenance\n- Hypothesis-driven investigation/debugging\n\n## Core Process\n\n### 1. Start with Loose Estimate\n```\nThought 1/5: [Initial analysis]\n```\nAdjust dynamically a","body":"# Sequential Thinking\n\nStructured problem-solving via manageable, reflective thought sequences with dynamic adjustment.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Complex problem decomposition\n- Adaptive planning with revision capability\n- Analysis needing course correction\n- Problems with unclear/emerging scope\n- Multi-step solutions requiring context maintenance\n- Hypothesis-driven investigation/debugging\n\n## Core Process\n\n### 1. Start with Loose Estimate\n```\nThought 1/5: [Initial analysis]\n```\nAdjust dynamically as understanding evolves.\n\n### 2. Structure Each Thought\n- Build on previous context explicitly\n- Address one aspect per thought\n- State assumptions, uncertainties, realizations\n- Signal what next thought should address\n\n### 3. Apply Dynamic Adjustment\n- **Expand**: More complexity discovered → increase total\n- **Contract**: Simpler than expected → decrease total\n- **Revise**: New insight invalidates previous → mark revision\n- **Branch**: Multiple approaches → explore alternatives\n\n### 4. Use Revision When Needed\n```\nThought 5/8 [REVISION of Thought 2]: [Corrected understanding]\n- Original: [What was stated]\n- Why revised: [New insight]\n- Impact: [What changes]\n```\n\n### 5. Branch for Alternatives\n```\nThought 4/7 [BRANCH A from Thought 2]: [Approach A]\nThought 4/7 [BRANCH B from Thought 2]: [Approach B]\n```\nCompare explicitly, converge with decision rationale.\n\n### 6. Generate & Verify Hypotheses\n```\nThought 6/9 [HYPOTHESIS]: [Proposed solution]\nThought 7/9 [VERIFICATION]: [Test results]\n```\nIterate until hypothesis verified.\n\n### 7. Complete Only When Ready\nMark final: `Thought N/N [FINAL]`\n\nComplete when:\n- Solution verified\n- All critical aspects addressed\n- Confidence achieved\n- No outstanding uncertainties\n\n## Application Modes\n\n**Explicit**: Use visible thought markers when complexity warrants visible reasoning or user requests breakdown.\n\n**Implicit**: Apply methodology internally for routine problem-solving where thinking aids accuracy without cluttering response.\n\n## Scripts (Optional)\n\nOptional scripts for deterministic validation/tracking:\n- `scripts/process-thought.js` - Validate & track thoughts with history\n- `scripts/format-thought.js` - Format for display (box/markdown/simple)\n\nSee README.md for usage examples. Use when validation/persistence needed; otherwise apply methodology directly.\n\n## References\n\nLoad when deeper understanding needed:\n- `references/core-patterns.md` - Revision & branching patterns\n- `references/examples-api.md` - API design example\n- `references/examples-debug.md` - Debugging example\n- `references/examples-architecture.md` - Architecture decision example\n- `references/advanced-techniques.md` - Spiral refinement, hypothesis testing, convergence\n- `references/advanced-strategies.md` - Uncertainty, revision cascades, meta-thinking\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:23:20.465Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Reasoning Agents requiring structured problem-solving and adaptive planning capabilities.","zh":"适合需要结构化问题解决和自适应规划能力的高级推理代理。","ja":"高度な推論能力と適応的な計画能力を必要とする高度な推論エージェントに適しています。","ko":"구조화된 문제 해결 및 적응형 계획 능력이 필요한 고급 推論 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de razonamiento avanzado que requieren resolución de problemas estructurada y capacidades de planificación adaptativa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de raisonnement avancé nécessitant une résolution de problèmes structurée et des capacités de planification adaptative.","de":"Ideal für Advanced-Reasoning-Agents, die eine strukturierte Problemlösung und adaptive Planungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Raciocínio Avançado que necessitam de resolução de problemas estruturada e capacidades de planejamento adaptativo.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов рассуждений, требующих структурированного решения проблем и адаптивных возможностей планирования.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المتقدمين في الاستدلال الذين يتطلبون حلًا متسلسلاً للمشكلات وقدرات التخطيط التكيفي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to decompose complex problems into manageable thought sequences, utilizing dynamic adjustment and reflective thinking, while maintaining context across multi-step solutions and adapting to unclear or emerging scopes.","zh":"赋予代理分解复杂问题为可管理的思维序列的能力，利用动态调整和反思性思维，同时在多步骤解决方案中保持上下文，并适应不明确或出现的范围。","ja":"複雑な問題を管理可能な思考シーケンスに分解する能力をエージェントに与え、動的調整と反省的思考を利用しながら、複数ステップの解決策でコンテキストを保持し、不明確または出現する範囲に適応します。","ko":"복잡한 문제를 관리 가능한 생각 순서로 분해하는 능력을 에이전트에 부여하여 동적 조정 및 반성적 사고를 활용하면서 다단계 솔루션에서 컨텍스트를 유지하고 불분명하거나 나타나는 범위에 적응할 수 있습니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para descomponer problemas complejos en secuencias de pensamiento manejables, utilizando ajustes dinámicos y pensamiento reflexivo, mientras mantiene el contexto a través de soluciones multi-paso y se adapta