lable reasoning and decision units, enabling diagnosis, design, and optimization in complex real-world scenarios."},"features":{"zh":["模块化技能编排","协作执行链","提高 Rust 开发效率","支持 Rust 的核心知识结构","实现诊断、设计和优化"],"ja":["モジュラーなスキルオーケストレーション","コラボレーション実行チェーン","Rust 開発の効率化","Rust のコアノウハウ構造のサポート","診断、設計、最適化の実現"],"ko":["모듈화된 스킬 오케스트레이션","협업 실행 체인","러스트 개발 효율 향상","러스트의 코어 노하우 구조 지원","진단, 설계, 최적화 구현"],"es":["Orquestación modular de habilidades","Ejecución colaborativa de cadenas de habilidades","Diagnóstico y optimización de código Rust","Soporte para versiones estables de Rust","Política de versión mínima soportada (MSRV)"],"fr":["Orchestration modulaire de compétences","Exécution collaborative de chaînes de compétences","Diagnostic et optimisation de code Rust","Prise en charge des versions stables de Rust","Politique de version minimale prise en charge (MSRV)"],"de":["Modulare Orchestrierung von Fähigkeiten","Kollaborative Ausführung von Fähigkeitsketten","Diagnose und Optimierung von Rust-Code","Unterstützung für stabile Rust-Versionen","Mindestversionsschutzpolitik (MSRV)"],"pt":["Modular skill orchestration","Collaborative execution chains","Callable reasoning and decision units","Diagnosis and optimization in complex scenarios","Version update strategy"],"ru":["Модульная оркестрация навыков","Цепочки совместного выполнения","Вызываемые единицы рассуждения и принятия решений","Диагностика и оптимизация в сложных сценариях","Стратегия обновления версии"],"ar":["التنسيق القائم على الوحدات","سلاسل التنفيذ التعاوني","وحدات التفكير والقرار القابلة للاتصال","التشخيص والتحسين في السيناريوهات المعقدة","استراتيجية تحديث الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust Learner","Rust 开发","AI 能力层","模块化技能编排","协作执行链","Rust 核心知识结构"],"ja":["Rust Learner","Rust 開発","AI 能力層","モジュラーなスキルオーケストレーション","コラボレーション実行チェーン","Rust コアノウハウ構造"],"ko":["Rust Learner","러스트 개발","AI 능력 계층","모듈화된 스킬 오케스트레이션","협업 실행 체인","러스트 코어 노하우 구조"],"es":["rust-learner","aprendizaje de Rust","ingeniería de Rust","orquestación modular","ejecución colaborativa","diagnóstico de código","optimización de código","versiones estables de Rust","MSRV"],"fr":["rust-learner","apprentissage de Rust","ingénierie de Rust","orchestration modulaire","exécution collaborative","diagnostic de code","optimisation de code","versions stables de Rust","MSRV"],"de":["rust-learner","Rust-Lernen","Rust-Engineering","modulare Orchestrierung","kollaborative Ausführung","Code-Diagnose","Code-Optimierung","stabile Rust-Versionen","MSRV"],"pt":["Rust","engenharia Rust","aprendizado de máquina","IA","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de código","práticas de engenharia"],"ru":["Rust","инженерия Rust","машинное обучение","ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация кода","практики инженерии"],"ar":["Rust","هندسة Rust","التعلم الآلي","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الكود","ممارسات الهندسة"]}},"owner":"huiali","repo":"rust-skills","repoPath":"huiali/rust-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rust-learner","description":"Rust learning and ecosystem tracking expert covering version updates, new features, RFC tracking, crate updates, best practice evolution, and learning resources.","bodyPreview":"## Version Update Strategy\n\n### Stable Updates\n\n```bash\n# Check current version\nrustc --version\n\n# Update Rust\nrustup update stable\n\n# View changelog\nrustup doc --changelog\n```\n\n### When to Upgrade\n\n| Scenario | Recommendation |\n|----------|---------------|\n| New project | Use latest stable |\n| Production project | Follow 6-week cycle |\n| Library project | Consider MSRV policy |\n\n### MSRV (Minimum Supported Rust Version)\n\n```toml\n[package]\nrust-version = \"1.70\"  # Declare minimum version\n\n[depen","body":"## Version Update Strategy\n\n### Stable Updates\n\n```bash\n# Check current version\nrustc --version\n\n# Update Rust\nrustup update stable\n\n# View changelog\nrustup doc --changelog\n```\n\n### When to Upgrade\n\n| Scenario | Recommendation |\n|----------|---------------|\n| New project | Use latest stable |\n| Production project | Follow 6-week cycle |\n| Library project | Consider MSRV policy |\n\n### MSRV (Minimum Supported Rust Version)\n\n```toml\n[package]\nrust-version = \"1.70\"  # Declare minimum version\n\n[dependencies]\n# MSRV-sensitive dependencies require care\nserde = { version = \"1.0\", default-features = false }\n```\n\n\n## Solution Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Following Stable Releases\n\n```bash\n# Quarterly update routine\nrustup update stable\ncargo outdated\ncargo audit\ncargo test --all-features\n\n# Read release notes\nrustup doc --changelog\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Tracking Ecosystem Changes\n\n```bash\n# Check for breaking changes\ncargo update --dry-run\n\n# Security audit\ncargo audit\n\n# License check\ncargo deny check licenses\n\n# Check dependency tree\ncargo tree\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Learning New Features\n\n```rust\n// Edition 2024 features\n\n// Inline const (1.79+)\nconst fn compute() -> [u8; 32] {\n    let mut arr = [0u8; 32];\n    // compute at compile time\n    arr\n}\n\n// Never type improvements (1.82+)\nfn diverge() -> ! {\n    panic!(\"never returns\")\n}\n\n// Async fn in trait (1.75+)\ntrait Repository {\n    async fn fetch(&self, id: u64) -> Result<Data, Error>;\n}\n```\n\n\n## Learning Path\n\n### Beginner → Advanced\n\n```\nBasics → Ownership, lifetimes, borrow checker\n   ↓\nIntermediate → Trait objects, generics, closures\n   ↓\nConcurrency → async/await, threads, channels\n   ↓\nAdvanced → unsafe, FFI, performance optimization\n   ↓\nExpert → Macros, type system, design patterns\n```\n\n\n## Information Sources\n\n### Official Channels\n\n| Source | Content | Frequency |\n|--------|---------|-----------|\n| [This Week in Rust](https://this-week-in-rust.org/) | Weekly digest, RFCs, blogs | Weekly |\n| [Rust Blog](https://blog.rust-lang.org/) | Major releases, deep dives | As released |\n| [Rust RFCs](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs) | Design discussions | Ongoing |\n| [Release Notes](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/master/RELEASES.md) | Version changes | Every 6 weeks |\n\n### Community Resources\n\n| Resource | Content |\n|----------|---------|\n| [docs.rs](https://docs.rs/) | Documentation search |\n| [crates.io](https://crates.io/) | Package search |\n| [lib.rs](https://lib.rs/) | Find alternative crates |\n| [Rust Analyzer](https://rust-analyzer.github.io/) | IDE plugin |\n\n\n## Dependency Management\n\n### Regular Updates\n\n```bash\n# Check outdated dependencies\ncargo outdated\n\n# Update compatible versions\ncargo update\n\n# Update to latest (may break)\ncargo upgrade\n```\n\n### Security Audit\n\n```bash\n# Check for known vulnerabilities\ncargo audit\n\n# Check dependency licenses\ncargo deny check licenses\n\n# Analyze dependency tree\ncargo tree -d  # Show duplicates\n```\n\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Quarterly Checklist\n\n```\nEvery 3 months:\n- [ ] Upgrade to latest stable Rust\n- [ ] Run cargo outdated\n- [ ] Run cargo audit\n- [ ] Check dependencies for breaking changes\n- [ ] Evaluate new features worth adopting\n- [ ] Update tooling (clippy, rustfmt)\n```\n\n### Annual Checklist\n\n```\nEvery year:\n- [ ] Consider edition upgrade\n- [ ] Refactor deprecated patterns\n- [ ] Evaluate MSRV policy\n- [ ] Update development toolchain\n- [ ] Review architecture patterns\n```\n\n\n## Learning Resources\n\n### Beginner\n\n- [The Rust Programming Language](https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/) - Official book\n- [Rust by Example](https://doc.rust-lang.org/rust-by-example/) - Example-driven\n- [Rustlings](https://github.com/rust-lang/rustlings) - Interactive exercises\n\n### Intermediate\n\n- [The Rust Reference](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/) - Language reference\n- [Rust Nomicon](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nomicon/) - Unsafe guide\n- [Effective Rust](https://www.lurklurk.org/effective-rust/) - Best practices\n\n### Advanced\n\n- [Rust for Rustaceans](https://rust-for-rustaceans.com/) - Advanced patterns\n- [Async Book](https://rust-lang.github.io/async-book/) - Async/await deep dive\n- [Rust API Guidelines](https://rust-lang.github.io/api-guidelines/) - API design\n\n### Practice\n\n- [Exercism Rust Track](https://exercism.org/tracks/rust) - Practice problems\n- [Rust by Practice](https://practice.rs/) - Hands-on exercises\n- [Advent of Code](https://adventofcode.com/) - Annual coding challenge\n\n\n## Edition Update Strategy\n\n| Edition | Released | Key Features |\n|---------|----------|--------------|\n| 2015 | Original | - |\n| 2018 | Dec 2018 | Module system, NLL |\n| 2021 | Oct 2021 | Disjoint captures, IntoIterator |\n| 2024 | TBD | Gen blocks, async drop |\n\n### Upgrading Editions\n\n```bash\n# Check if upgrade possible\ncargo fix --edition\n\n# Update Cargo.toml\n# edition = \"2024\"\n\n# Test thoroughly\ncargo test --all-features\n```\n\n\n## Review Checklist\n\nWhen learning new Rust features:\n\n- [ ] Feature is stable (not experimental)\n- [ ] Understand the problem it solves\n- [ ] Know when NOT to use it\n- [ ] Aware of trade-offs\n- [ ] Tested in small project first\n- [ ] Read release notes thoroughly\n- [ ] Checked ecosystem adoption\n- [ ] Updated team documentation\n\n\n## Verification Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check Rust version\nrustc --version\nrustup show\n\n# Update toolchain\nrustup update\n\n# Check outdated dependencies\ncargo outdated\n\n# Security audit\ncargo audit\n\n# License compliance\ncargo deny check\n\n# Check for deprecated features\ncargo clippy -- -W deprecated\n```\n\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### 1. Chasing Shiny Features\n\n**Symptom**: Using unstable features in production\n\n```toml\n# ❌ Avoid: nightly features in production\n#![feature(generic_associated_types)]\n\n# ✅ Good: wait for stabilization\n# Use stable alternatives\n```\n\n### 2. Ignoring MSRV\n\n**Symptom**: Breaking downstream users\n\n```toml\n# ✅ Good: declare MSRV\n[package]\nrust-version = \"1.70\"\n\n# Test against MSRV in CI\n# cargo +1.70 test\n```\n\n### 3. Not Reading Release Notes\n\n**Symptom**: Surprised by breaking changes\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Good: read before updating\nrustup doc --changelog\n\n# Check crate changelogs\ncargo info <crate> --version <version>\n```\n\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **rust-ecosystem** - Crate selection and tools\n- **rust-coding** - Best practices and conventions\n- **rust-performance** - Performance improvements\n- **rust-async** - Async/await patterns\n- **rust-error** - Error handling evolution\n\n\n## Localized Reference\n\n- **Chinese version**: [SKILL_ZH.md](./SKILL_ZH.md) - 完整中文版本，包含所有内容\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:23:49.016Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents needing advanced Rust engineering practices and modular skill orchestration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Rust工程实践和模块化技能编排的编码代理。","ja":"高度なRustエンジニアリングの実践とモジュラーなスキルオーケストレーションを必要とするコーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Rust 엔지니어링 실践과 모듈러한 스킬 오케스트레이션이 필요한 코딩 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación que necesitan prácticas de ingeniería avanzadas de Rust y orquestación modular de habilidades.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage ayant besoin de pratiques d''ingénierie Rust avancées et d''orchestration de compétences modulaires.","de":"Perfekt für Codierungsagenten, die erweiterte Rust-Engineering-Praktiken und modulare Fähigkeitsorchestrierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação que necessitam de práticas avançadas de engenharia Rust e orquestração modular de habilidades.","ru":"Идеально для Кодировочных Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые практики инженерии Rust и модульная оркестрация навыков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز الذي يحتاج إلى ممارسات هندسة الرست المتقدمة وتنسيق المهارات الموديولار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to turn Rust''s core knowledge structures into callable reasoning and decision units, enabling diagnosis, design, and optimization in complex real-world scenarios using rustup and MSRV policy, and leveraging collaborative execution chains for efficient project management.","zh":"赋予代理将Rust的核心知识结构转化为可调用推理和决策单元的能力，实现复杂的现实世界场景中的诊断、设计和优化，使用rustup和MSRV策略，并利用协作执行链进行高效的项目管理。","ja":"Rustのコアナレッジ構造を呼び出せる推論および意思決定ユニットに変換するエージェントの能力を付与し、rustupおよびMSRVポリシーを使用して、複雑な現実世界のシナリオにおける診断、設計、最適化を可能にし、協調的な実行チェーンを利用して効率的なプロジェクト管理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Rust의 핵심 지식 구조를 호출 가능한 추론 및 의사 결정 단위로 변환할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 rustup 및 MSRV 정책을 사용하여 복잡한 실제 시나리오에서 진단, 설계 및 최적화를 가능하게 하며, 협력 실행 체인을 활용하여 효율적인 프로젝트 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir las estructuras de conocimiento básicas de Rust en unidades de razonamiento y decisión llamables, lo que permite el diagnóstico, el diseño y la optimización en escenarios complejos del mundo real utilizando rustup y la política de MSRV, y aprovechando cadenas de ejecución colaborativa para una gestión de proyectos eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les structures de connaissances de base de Rust en unités de raisonnement et de décision appelables, permettant ainsi le diagnostic, la conception et l''optimisation dans des scénarios complexes du monde réel en utilisant rustup et la politique MSRV, et en exploitant des chaînes d''exécution collaboratives pour une gestion de projet efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Rusts Kernwissensstrukturen in aufrufbare Argumentations- und Entscheidungseinheiten umzuwandeln, wodurch Diagnose, Design und Optimierung in komplexen realen Szenarien unter Verwendung von rustup und MSRV-Richtlinie ermöglicht werden, und nutzt kollaborative Ausführungsketten für eine effiziente Projektabwicklung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar as estruturas de conhecimento central do Rust em unidades de raciocínio e decisão chamáveis, permitindo diagnóstico, design e otimização em cenários complexos do mundo real usando rustup e política MSRV, e aproveitando cadeias de execução colaborativas para gerenciamento de projeto eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить основные знания Rust в вызываемые единицы рассуждения и принятия решений, позволяя диагностику, проектирование и оптимизацию в сложных реальных сценариях с использованием rustup и политики MSRV, а также использует сотрудничество цепей выполнения для эффективного управления проектами.","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحويل هياكل المعرفة الأساسية للرست إلى وحدات منطقية وقرار قابلة للاتصال، وتمكين التشخيص والتصميم والأمثلية في السيناريوهات الحقيقية المعقدة باستخدام rustup وسياسة MSRV، وتوفير سلاسل تنفيذ تعاونية لفعالية إدارة المشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Rust version updates using rustup","Debugging complex Rust projects with modular skill orchestration","Optimizing Rust library projects with MSRV policy"],"zh":["使用rustup自动更新Rust版本","使用模块化技能编排调试复杂的Rust项目","使用MSRV策略优化Rust库项目"],"ja":["rustupを使用してRustのバージョンを自動更新する","モジュラーなスキルオーケストレーションを使用して複雑なRustプロジェクトをデバッグする","MSRVポリシーを使用してRustライブラリプロジェクトを最適化する"],"ko":["rustup을 사용하여 Rust 버전을 자동으로 업데이트 하는 것","모듈러한 스킬 오케스트레이션을 사용하여 복잡한 Rust 프로젝트를 디버깅하는 것","MSRV 정책을 사용하여 Rust 라이브러리 프로젝트를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de versión de Rust mediante rustup","Depuración de proyectos de Rust complejos con orquestación modular de habilidades","Optimización de proyectos de bibliotecas de Rust con la política de MSRV"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de version de Rust à l''aide de rustup","Débogage de projets Rust complexes avec une orchestration de compétences modulaires","Optimisation des projets de bibliothèques Rust avec la politique MSRV"],"de":["Automatisierung von Rust-Versionen-Updates mit rustup","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Rust-Projekte mit modularem Fähigkeits-Orchestrierung","Optimierung von Rust-Bibliotheksprojekten mit MSRV-Richtlinie"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de versão do Rust usando rustup","Depurar projetos complexos do Rust com orquestração modular de habilidades","Otimizar projetos de biblioteca do Rust com política MSRV"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления версий Rust с помощью rustup","Отлаживать сложные проекты Rust с модульной оркестрацией навыков","Оптимизировать проекты библиотек Rust с политикой MSRV"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات إصدار الرست باستخدام rustup","تصحيح مشاكل مشاريع الرست المعقدة مع تنسيق مهارات موديولار","تحسين مشاريع مكتبات الرست مع سياسة MSRV"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires rustup installation","Rust 1.70 or higher recommended","Limited to Rust programming language"],"zh":["需要安装rustup","推荐Rust 1.70或更高版本","仅限于Rust编程语言"],"ja":["rustupのインストールが必要","Rust 1.70以上を推奨","Rustプログラミング言語のみに限定"],"ko":["rustup 설치가 필요합니다.","Rust 1.70 이상을 권장합니다.","Rust 프로그래밍 언어에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere instalación de rustup","Se recomienda Rust 1.70 o superior","Limitado al lenguaje de programación Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de rustup","Rust 1.70 ou supérieur recommandé","Limité au langage de programmation Rust"],"de":["Benötigt rustup-Installation","Rust 1.70 oder höher empfohlen","Begrenzt auf die Rust-Programmiersprache"],"pt":["Requer instalação do rustup","Rust 1.70 ou superior recomendado","Limitado à linguagem de programação Rust"],"ru":["Требуется установка rustup","Rust 1.70 или выше рекомендуется","Ограничен языком программирования Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت rustup","يوصى بالرست 1.70 أو أعلى","محدود بلغة برمجة الرست"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
