靠性和稳定性","ja":"推論スモークテストツールは、GolangとGPT3ツールを使用してAIモデルのテストを行うソリューションであり、モデルの信頼性と安定性を確保する","ko":"추론 스모크 테스트 도구는 Golang과 GPT3 툴을 사용하여 AI 모델을 테스트하는 솔루션으로, 모델의 신뢰성과 안정성을 보장합니다","es":"El conjunto de habilidades de pruebas de inferencia de humo ofrece una forma rápida de probar herramientas de GPT3 en Go.","fr":"L''ensemble de compétences des tests de fumée d''inférence propose un moyen rapide de tester les outils GPT3 en Go.","de":"Der Satz von Fähigkeiten für Inferenz-Rauchtests bietet eine schnelle Möglichkeit, GPT3-Tools in Go zu testen.","pt":"O inference-smoke-tests é uma ferramenta em Golang para testar a inferência de modelos de linguagem. Execute testes rápidos e confiáveis com o toolkit GPT3","ru":"Inference-smoke-tests - это инструмент на Golang для тестирования инференции языковых моделей. Запускайте быстрые и надежные тесты с помощью инструментария GPT3","ar":"اختبارات الاستدلال الدخاني هو أداة في Golang لاختبار الاستدلال من نماذج اللغة. تشغيل اختبارات سريعة وموثوقة مع أداة GPT3","en":"golang GPT3 tooling"},"definition":{"en":"golang GPT3 tooling"},"features":{"zh":["使用Golang和GPT3工具进行推理烟雾测试","支持快速运行和手动检查","需要OPENAI_API_KEY和Claude凭据","提供详细的playbook文档","支持多种运行模式"],"ja":["GolangとGPT3ツールを使用して推論スモークテストを行う","クイックランとマニュアルチェックをサポート","OPENAI_API_KEYとClaudeの資格情報が必要","詳細なplaybookドキュメントを提供","複数の実行モードをサポート"],"ko":["Golang과 GPT3 툴을 사용하여 추론 스모크 테스트를 수행","快速 실행과 수동 확인을 지원","OPENAI_API_KEY와 Claude 자격 증명이 필요","詳細한 playbook 문서를 제공","다양한 실행 모드를 지원"],"es":["Ejecución rápida de pruebas de inferencia","Compatibilidad con herramientas de GPT3 en Go","Script de inicio rápido para pruebas","Documentación detallada para pruebas manuales","Soporte para API de OpenAI y credenciales de Claude"],"fr":["Exécution rapide des tests d''inférence","Compatibilité avec les outils GPT3 en Go","Script de démarrage rapide pour les tests","Documentation détaillée pour les tests manuels","Prise en charge de l''API OpenAI et des informations d''identification de Claude"],"de":["Schnelle Ausführung von Inferenztests","Kompatibilität mit GPT3-Tools in Go","Schnellstart-Script für Tests","Detaillierte Dokumentation für manuelle Tests","Unterstützung für OpenAI-API und Claude-Anmeldeinformationen"],"pt":["Integração com o toolkit GPT3","Testes rápidos e confiáveis","Suporte a modelos de linguagem","Execução de testes em ambiente de produção","Relatórios detalhados de teste"],"ru":["Интеграция с инструментарием GPT3","Быстрые и надежные тесты","Поддержка языковых моделей","Выполнение тестов в производственной среде","Подробные отчеты о тестировании"],"ar":["دمج مع أداة GPT3","اختبارات سريعة وموثوقة","دعم نماذج اللغة","تشغيل الاختبارات في بيئة الإنتاج","تقارير مفصلة عن الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["推理烟雾测试","Golang","GPT3","AI模型测试","自动化测试","OPENAI_API_KEY","Claude"],"ja":["推論スモークテスト","Golang","GPT3","AIモデルのテスト","自動化テスト","OPENAI_API_KEY","Claude"],"ko":["추론 스모크 테스트","Golang","GPT3","AI 모델 테스트","자동화 테스트","OPENAI_API_KEY","Claude"],"es":["pruebas de inferencia de humo","GPT3","herramientas de GPT3","Go","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","API de OpenAI","credenciales de Claude"],"fr":["tests de fumée d''inférence","GPT3","outils GPT3","Go","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","API OpenAI","informations d''identification de Claude"],"de":["Inferenz-Rauchtests","GPT3","GPT3-Tools","Go","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","OpenAI-API","Claude-Anmeldeinformationen"],"pt":["inference-smoke-tests","Golang","GPT3","testes de inferência","modelos de linguagem","desenvolvimento de software","testes de software","robustez de modelos"],"ru":["inference-smoke-tests","Golang","GPT3","тесты инференции","языковые модели","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","устойчивость моделей"],"ar":["اختبارات الاستدلال الدخاني","Golang","GPT3","اختبارات الاستدلال","نماذج اللغة","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات البرمجيات","متانة النماذج"]}},"owner":"go-go-golems","repo":"geppetto","repoPath":"go-go-golems/geppetto","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.446Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inference-smoke-tests","description":"Run repeatable inference smoke tests using geppetto/pinocchio example binaries (single-pass, streaming, tool-loop, OpenAI Responses thinking) including tmux-driven TUI tests. Use when refactors touch InferenceState/Session/EngineBuilder, tool calling loop, event sinks, provider request formatting, or when you need a quick does inference still work? checklist.","bodyPreview":"# Inference Smoke Tests\n\n## Quick Start (Recommended)\n\nRun the fast suite (geppetto non-TUI + pinocchio agent TUI) via the bundled script:\n\n```bash\nbash geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/scripts/run_smoke.sh --quick\n```\n\nIf you need the full manual checklist, open:\n\n`geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/references/playbook.md`\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- Ensure `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set (for OpenAI Chat + OpenAI Responses).\n- Ensure Claude credentials are available (e.g. `ANTHROPIC_API","body":"# Inference Smoke Tests\n\n## Quick Start (Recommended)\n\nRun the fast suite (geppetto non-TUI + pinocchio agent TUI) via the bundled script:\n\n```bash\nbash geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/scripts/run_smoke.sh --quick\n```\n\nIf you need the full manual checklist, open:\n\n`geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/references/playbook.md`\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- Ensure `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set (for OpenAI Chat + OpenAI Responses).\n- Ensure Claude credentials are available (e.g. `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`) if you want the Claude tool-calling smoke step to pass.\n- Ensure `tmux` is installed (required for non-interactive TUI runs).\n- Expect costs: these tests make real API calls.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n1) Validate provider “thinking” streaming (Responses)?\n- Run `geppetto/cmd/examples/openai-tools` in `--mode thinking`.\n\n2) Validate tool loop orchestration?\n- Run `geppetto/cmd/examples/generic-tool-calling`.\n\n3) Validate Bubble Tea TUI event flow (thinking deltas + final)?\n- Run `pinocchio/cmd/agents/simple-chat-agent` in tmux.\n\n4) Validate Claude tool calling?\n- Run `geppetto/cmd/examples/claude-tools` with `--ai-api-type claude --ai-engine claude-haiku-4-5`.\n\n5) Validate multi-turn chat state persistence?\n- Run pinocchio TUI chat in tmux (manual) and/or pinocchio webchat in browser (manual).\n\n## What “Benefits From InferenceState” (Rules of Thumb)\n\nAlready benefits (multi-turn, cancel-sensitive, tool-loop, strict provider validation):\n- pinocchio TUI chat (`pinocchio/cmd/pinocchio … --chat`)\n- pinocchio agent TUI (`pinocchio/cmd/agents/simple-chat-agent …`)\n- pinocchio webchat (`pinocchio/cmd/web-chat`)\n- geppetto example runners that execute via `geppetto/pkg/inference/core.Session`\n\nCould benefit (optional; mainly consistency/cancel):\n- `pinocchio/cmd/examples/simple-redis-streaming-inference` (transport-focused; currently `eng.RunInference` direct)\n- `pinocchio/cmd/examples/simple-chat` (exercises PinocchioCommand runner; could benefit indirectly if that runner standardizes on `InferenceState`)\n\nDoes not apply (not an inference runner):\n- `geppetto/cmd/examples/citations-event-stream`\n\n## Troubleshooting (Common Failure Modes)\n\n### “OpenAI Responses 400” errors\n- Re-run with higher logging:\n  - Add `--log-level debug --with-caller` where supported.\n- Confirm you’re using the correct provider mode:\n  - `--ai-api-type openai-responses`\n- If the error mentions invalid parameter support (e.g., `temperature` unsupported), it’s model-dependent; reduce parameters and retry.\n\n### TUI doesn’t submit the prompt\n- Some TUIs submit on `Tab` (not `Enter`).\n- Always capture logs to a file and confirm inference actually ran (look for `EventPartialCompletionStart`, `EventFinal`).\n\n## References\n\nWhen you need copy/paste commands for the full sweep, read:\n- `geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/references/playbook.md`\n\nWhen you need to find new example entry points, search:\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"cmd/examples\" -S geppetto/cmd/examples pinocchio/cmd/examples\nrg -n \"cmd/agents\" -S pinocchio/cmd/agents\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:23:51.580Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Golang-based AI Agents needing robust inference testing capabilities with GPT3 tooling.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的推理测试功能的基于Golang的AI代理，尤其是那些使用GPT3工具的代理。","ja":"GolangベースのAIエージェントで、GPT3ツールを使用して強力な推論テスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"GPT3 툴을 사용하여 강력한 추론 테스트 기능이 필요한 Golang 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Golang que necesitan capacidades de prueba de inferencia robustas con herramientas GPT3.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Golang nécessitant des capacités de test d''inférence robustes avec des outils GPT3.","de":"Perfekt für auf Golang basierende KI-Agents, die robuste Inferenztestfunktionen mit GPT3-Tooling benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Golang que precisam de capacidades de teste de inferência robustas com ferramentas GPT3.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Golang, которым требуются надежные возможности тестирования вывода с помощью инструментов GPT3.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى Golang التي تحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار الاستدلال المتين مع أدوات GPT3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run fast inference smoke tests via bundled scripts, leveraging OpenAI API and Claude credentials for seamless integration with geppetto and pinocchio agents, utilizing protocols like bash scripting and API key authentication.","zh":"赋予代理快速运行推理烟雾测试的能力，通过捆绑的脚本利用OpenAI API和Claude凭证实现与geppetto和pinocchio代理的无缝集成，使用bash脚本和API密钥认证等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、OpenAI APIとClaudeの資格情報を使用してgeppettoとpinocchioエージェントとシームレスに統合するバンドルスクリプトを介して、高速な推論の煙霧テストを実行する機能を付与します。bashスクリプトとAPIキー認証などのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트에 빠른 추론 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하고, OpenAI API와 Claude 자격 증명을 사용하여 geppetto 및 pinocchio 에이전트와의 통합을 위해 번들된 스크립트를 통해 bash 스크립팅 및 API 키 인증과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de inferencia rápidas y sencillas mediante scripts empaquetados, aprovechando la API de OpenAI y las credenciales de Claude para una integración sin problemas con los agentes geppetto y pinocchio, utilizando protocolos como scripting de bash y autenticación con clave de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests d''inférence rapides et fumigènes via des scripts regroupés, en exploitant l''API OpenAI et les informations d''identification de Claude pour une intégration transparente avec les agents geppetto et pinocchio, en utilisant des protocoles tels que le scripting bash et l''authentification par clé API.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, schnelle Inferenz-Smoke-Tests über gebündelte Skripte auszuführen, indem es die OpenAI-API und die Claude-Anmeldedaten nutzt, um eine nahtlose Integration mit den geppetto- und pinocchio-Agenten zu ermöglichen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Bash-Scripting und API-Schlüssel-Authentifizierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes de inferência rápidos via scripts embutidos, utilizando a API OpenAI e credenciais Claude para integração transparente com agentes geppetto e pinocchio, utilizando protocolos como script de bash e autenticação por chave de API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять быстрые тесты вывода через встроенные скрипты, используя API OpenAI и учетные данные Claude для бесшовной интеграции с агентами geppetto и pinocchio, используя протоколы, такие как скриптинг bash и аутентификация по ключу API.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشغيل اختبارات الاستدلال السريعة عبر البرامج النصية المرفقة، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI وأدلة اعتماد Claude من أجل التكامل السلس مع وكلاء geppetto وpinocchio، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل 스크립팅 bash وتحقق هوية المفتاح_API."},"useCases":{"en":["Running quick inference smoke tests via the bundled run_smoke.sh script","Validating OpenAI API key setup for Chat and Responses","Debugging inference issues with Claude credentials and API interactions"],"zh":["通过捆绑的run_smoke.sh脚本运行快速推理烟雾测试","验证OpenAI API密钥对于聊天和响应的设置","使用Claude凭证和API交互调试推理问题"],"ja":["バンドルされたrun_smoke.shスクリプトを使用して高速な推論の煙霧テストを実行する","チャットとレスポンスに対するOpenAI APIキーの設定を検証する","Claudeの資格情報とAPIのやり取りを使用して推論の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["번들된 run_smoke.sh 스크립트를 사용하여 빠른 추론 테스트를 실행하는 것","대화 및 응답을 위한 OpenAI API 키 설정을 확인하는 것","클라우드 자격 증명 및 API 상호 작용을 사용하여 추론 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas de inferencia rápidas y sencillas a través del script run_smoke.sh empaquetado","Validar la configuración de la clave de API de OpenAI para Chat y Respuestas","Depurar problemas de inferencia con credenciales de Claude y API de interacción"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests d''inférence rapides et fumigènes via le script run_smoke.sh regroupé","Valider la configuration de la clé API OpenAI pour Chat et Réponses","Déboguer les problèmes d''inférence avec les informations d''identification de Claude et les interactions API"],"de":["Schnelle Inferenz-Smoke-Tests über das gebündelte Skript run_smoke.sh ausführen","Die Konfiguration des OpenAI-API-Schlüssels für Chat und Antworten überprüfen","Inferenzprobleme mit Claude-Anmeldedaten und API-Interaktionen debuggen"],"pt":["Executando testes de inferência rápidos via script run_smoke.sh embutido","Validando configuração de chave de API OpenAI para Chat e Respostas","Depurando problemas de inferência com credenciais Claude e interações de API"],"ru":["Выполнение быстрых тестов вывода через встроенный скрипт run_smoke.sh","Проверка настройки ключа API OpenAI для Чата и Ответов","Отладка проблем вывода с учетными данными Claude и взаимодействиями API"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات الاستدلال السريعة عبر البرنامج النصي المرفق run_smoke.sh","تحقق من إعداد مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI للчат والاستجابات","تصحيح أخطاء الاستدلال باستخدام بيانات اعتماد Claude وتفاعلات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key","Needs Claude credentials","Dependent on bash scripting for automation"],"zh":["需要OpenAI API密钥","需要Claude凭证","依赖于bash脚本进行自动化"],"ja":["OpenAI APIキーが必要","Claudeの資格情報が必要","自動化にはbashスクリプトに依存する"],"ko":["OpenAI API 키가 필요합니다","클라우드 자격 증명이 필요합니다","자동화에는 bash 스크립팅에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere clave de API de OpenAI","Necesita credenciales de Claude","Dependiente de scripting de bash para la automatización"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé API OpenAI","Nécessite des informations d''identification de Claude","Dépendant du scripting bash pour l''automatisation"],"de":["Benötigt einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel","Benötigt Claude-Anmeldedaten","Von Bash-Scripting für die Automatisierung abhängig"],"pt":["Exige Chave de API OpenAI","Necessita credenciais Claude","Dependente de script de bash para automação"],"ru":["Требует ключа API OpenAI","Требует учетных данных Claude","Зависит от скриптинга bash для автоматизации"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI","يتطلب بيانات اعتماد Claude","يعتمد على بروتوكول برمجة bash للت自動ة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
