essite pas l''inspection des détails internes de la mise en œuvre","Permet de tester l''application de manière plus efficace","Améliore la fiabilité des applications"],"de":["API-Tests mit bedingten Überschreibungen","Überprüfung des tatsächlichen Verhaltens der Anwendung","Erfordert keine Untersuchung interner Implementierungsdetails","Ermöglicht es, die Anwendung effektiver zu testen","Verbessert die Zuverlässigkeit der Anwendungen"],"pt":["Teste de comportamento do usuário","Sobrescrita de API condicional","Verificação de parâmetros de API","Simulação de respostas de API","Integração com MCP servers"],"ru":["Тестирование поведения пользователя","Условное переопределение API","Проверка параметров API","Симуляция ответов API","Интеграция с MCP servers"],"ar":["اختبار سلوك المستخدم","تجاوز واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المشروط","تحقق من 매개_variables واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تمثيل استجابات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التكامل مع MCP servers"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API测试","条件重写","MCP服务器","AI代理","ToolHive","API参数","用户面向行为"],"ja":["APIテスト","条件オーバーライド","MCPサーバー","AIエージェント","ToolHive","APIパラメータ","ユーザー向けの動作"],"ko":["API 테스트","조건 오버라이드","MCP 서버","AI 에이전트","ToolHive","API 매개 변수","사용자 중심 동작"],"es":["pruebas de API","anulaciones condicionales","testing de API","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pruebas de software","anulaciones de API","pruebas condicionales","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["tests d''API","remplacements conditionnels","test d''API","développement d''applications","tests de logiciel","remplacements d''API","tests conditionnels","développement de logiciel"],"de":["API-Tests","bedingte Überschreibungen","API-Testing","Anwendungsentwicklung","Software-Tests","API-Überschreibungen","bedingte Tests","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["teste de api","sobrescrita de api","comportamento do usuário","mcp servers","desenvolvimento de software","teste de software","api testing","conditional override"],"ru":["тестирование api","переопределение api","поведение пользователя","mcp servers","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","api тестирование","условное переопределение"],"ar":["اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تجاوز واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","سلوك المستخدم","مخدمات ميسي","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات","اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تجاوز مشروط"]}},"owner":"stacklok","repo":"toolhive-studio","repoPath":"stacklok/toolhive-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-api-overrides","description":"Test that components send correct query parameters or request arguments. Use when testing filtering, sorting, pagination, or any read operation where request parameters matter. Use for test-scoped mock customization.","bodyPreview":"# Testing API Overrides\n\nTest that your code sends correct API parameters by using conditional overrides that respond differently based on the request. This approach tests actual user-facing behavior rather than inspecting internal request details.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**Good tests verify what users see, not implementation details.**\n\nInstead of:\n\n1. ❌ Recording the request and checking query params\n2. ❌ Asserting on internal function calls\n\nDo this:\n\n1. ✅ Set up conditional mocks that respond based","body":"# Testing API Overrides\n\nTest that your code sends correct API parameters by using conditional overrides that respond differently based on the request. This approach tests actual user-facing behavior rather than inspecting internal request details.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**Good tests verify what users see, not implementation details.**\n\nInstead of:\n\n1. ❌ Recording the request and checking query params\n2. ❌ Asserting on internal function calls\n\nDo this:\n\n1. ✅ Set up conditional mocks that respond based on params\n2. ✅ Verify the component renders the expected data\n\nIf the code sends wrong parameters, the mock returns wrong data, the UI shows wrong content, and the test fails. This catches real bugs.\n\n## When to Use Conditional Overrides\n\n- Testing list filtering (e.g., filter by group, status, search term)\n- Testing pagination parameters\n- Testing sort order\n- Any read operation where request parameters affect what data is returned\n\n**Note:** For mutations (create/update/delete), use `recordRequests()` instead. See the **testing-api-assertions** skill.\n\n## conditionalOverride()\n\nReturns different data based on request properties:\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads } from ''@mocks/fixtures/workloads/get''\n\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n  // Predicate: when should this override apply?\n  ({ query }) => query.group === ''archive'',\n  // Transform: what data to return?\n  (data) => ({\n    ...data,\n    workloads: [], // Archive group is empty\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Predicate Function\n\nThe predicate receives parsed request info with easy access to query params, path params, body, and headers:\n\n```typescript\n;({ query, path, body, headers }) => {\n  // Query parameters (pre-parsed)\n  query.group // ''?group=archive'' -> ''archive''\n  query.status // ''?status=running'' -> ''running''\n\n  // Path parameters (from route like /workloads/:name)\n  path.name // for /workloads/:name\n\n  // Request body (for POST/PUT/DELETE)\n  body?.name // parsed JSON body\n\n  // Headers\n  headers.get(''Authorization'')\n\n  return true // or false\n}\n```\n\n### Transform Function\n\nThe transform receives default data and returns modified data:\n\n```typescript\n;(data) => ({\n  ...data, // Spread defaults\n  workloads: data.workloads?.filter(\n    // Modify as needed\n    (w) => w.status === ''running''\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Testing Group Filter\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads } from ''@mocks/fixtures/workloads/get''\n\nit(''shows only workloads from the selected group'', async () => {\n  // Default mock returns workloads from multiple groups\n  // Add conditional override for ''production'' group\n  mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''production'',\n    (data) => ({\n      ...data,\n      workloads: [\n        { name: ''prod-server-1'', group: ''production'', status: ''running'' },\n        { name: ''prod-server-2'', group: ''production'', status: ''running'' },\n      ],\n    })\n  )\n\n  render(<WorkloadsList group=\"production\" />)\n\n  // If component sends ?group=production, it gets the filtered data\n  // If component forgets the param, it gets default data with mixed groups\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(''prod-server-1'')).toBeVisible()\n    expect(screen.getByText(''prod-server-2'')).toBeVisible()\n  })\n\n  // These would appear if the filter param wasn''t sent correctly\n  expect(screen.queryByText(''dev-server'')).not.toBeInTheDocument()\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Testing Empty State\n\n```typescript\nit(''shows empty message when group has no workloads'', async () => {\n  mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''empty-group'',\n    () => ({ workloads: [] })\n  )\n\n  render(<WorkloadsList group=\"empty-group\" />)\n\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(/no workloads found/i)).toBeVisible()\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## Multiple Conditional Overrides\n\nChain multiple overrides for different conditions:\n\n```typescript\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads\n  .conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''production'',\n    () => ({ workloads: productionWorkloads })\n  )\n  .conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''staging'',\n    () => ({ workloads: stagingWorkloads })\n  )\n```\n\nLater overrides wrap earlier ones. If no predicate matches, the default fixture data is returned.\n\n## Simple Overrides (No Condition)\n\nFor test-scoped data changes without conditions, use `.override()`:\n\n```typescript\n// Override for entire test - no condition\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.override(() => ({\n  groups: [{ name: ''only-group'', registered_clients: [] }],\n}))\n\n// Modify default data\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.override((data) => ({\n  ...data,\n  groups: data.groups?.slice(0, 1),\n}))\n```\n\n## Error Responses\n\nUse `.overrideHandler()` for full control over the response:\n\n```typescript\nimport { HttpResponse } from ''msw''\n\n// Return error\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.overrideHandler(() =>\n  HttpResponse.json({ error: ''Server error'' }, { status: 500 })\n)\n\n// Network failure\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.overrideHandler(() => HttpResponse.error())\n```\n\n## Automatic Reset\n\nAll overrides are automatically reset before each test via `resetAllAutoAPIMocks()` in `vitest.setup.ts`. No cleanup needed.\n\n## Reusable Scenarios\n\nWhen the same response override is needed across many tests, define it as a scenario in the fixture instead of duplicating `.override()` calls.\n\n### Defining Scenarios (in fixtures)\n\n```typescript\n// In fixtures/workloads/get.ts\nexport const mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads = AutoAPIMock<...>({\n  workloads: [/* default data */],\n}).scenario(''empty'', (mock) => mock.override(() => ({ workloads: [] })))\n```\n\n### Using Scenarios (in tests)\n\n```typescript\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.activateScenario(''empty'')\n```\n\nScenario names are defined in `renderer/src/common/mocks/scenarioNames.ts`. Use existing names when possible to keep scenarios consolidated.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **testing-with-api-mocks** - Auto-generated mocks and fixture basics\n- **testing-api-assertions** - Verifying mutations with `recordRequests()` (create/update/delete only)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:26:15.713Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API Testing Agents needing conditional API override capabilities for robust user-facing behavior verification.","zh":"非常适合需要条件性API覆盖能力以进行强大的用户面向行为验证的API测试代理。","ja":"条件付きAPIオーバーライド機能を必要とするAPIテストエージェントに最適です。","ko":"조건부 API 오버라이드 기능을 필요로 하는 API 테스트 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba de API que necesitan capacidades de anulación condicional de API para una verificación de comportamiento orientado al usuario robusta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test d''API nécessitant des capacités de substitution conditionnelle d''API pour une vérification robuste du comportement orienté utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für API-Testagenten, die bedingte API-Außerkraftsetzungs-Funktionen für eine robuste Überprüfung des benutzerorientierten Verhaltens benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste de API que necessitam de capacidades de substituição condicional de API para verificação de comportamento de usuário robusto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования API, которым требуются возможности условного переопределения API для проверки надежного пользовательского поведения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تجاوز واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الشرطي لتحقق السلوك المتقدم للمستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test actual user-facing behavior rather than internal implementation details by setting up conditional mocks that respond based on request parameters, utilizing API parameters and conditional overrides for advanced testing.","zh":"使代理能够通过设置条件性模拟来测试实际的用户面向行为，而不是内部实现细节，模拟响应基于请求参数，利用API参数和条件覆盖进行高级测试。","ja":"エージェントが内部実装の詳細ではなく、実際のユーザー向けの動作をテストできるようにし、条件付きモックを設定してリクエストパラメータに基づいて応答し、APIパラメータと条件付きオーバーライドを使用して高度なテストを実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 내부 구현 세부 사항이 아니라 실제 사용자에게 표시되는 동작을 테스트할 수 있도록 하며, 요청 매개 변수에 따라 응답하는 조건부 모의를 설정하여 고급 테스트를 수행하는 데 API 매개 변수와 조건부 오버라이드를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar el comportamiento real orientado al usuario en lugar de los detalles de implementación interna, configurando simulaciones condicionales que responden en función de los parámetros de la solicitud, utilizando parámetros de API y anulaciones condicionales para pruebas avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester le comportement réel orienté utilisateur plutôt que les détails d''implémentation interne en configurant des simulations conditionnelles qui répondent en fonction des paramètres de la demande, en utilisant des paramètres d''API et des substitutions conditionnelles pour des tests avancés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, das tatsächliche benutzerorientierte Verhalten anstelle von internen Implementierungsdetails zu testen, indem bedingte Mocks eingerichtet werden, die basierend auf den Anfrageparametern reagieren, API-Parameter und bedingte Außerkraftsetzungen für erweiterte Tests verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar o comportamento real do usuário em vez de detalhes de implementação interna, configurando mocks condicionais que respondem com base em parâmetros de solicitação, utilizando parâmetros de API e substituições condicionais para testes avançados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать фактическое пользовательское поведение, а не внутренние детали реализации, устанавливая условные макеты, которые реагируют на основе параметров запроса, используя параметры API и условные переопределения для расширенного тестирования.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من اختبار السلوك الفعلي للمستخدم بدلاً من細یات التنفيذ الداخلي من خلال إعداد محاكيات شرطية تستجيب بناءً على معاملات الطلب ، باستخدام معاملات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات والتجاوز الشرطي لاختبارات متقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing API endpoints with mock responses","Validating user-facing behavior with conditional overrides","Debugging API issues with request parameter analysis"],"zh":["使用模拟响应测试API端点","使用条件覆盖验证用户面向行为","使用请求参数分析调试API问题"],"ja":["モック応答を使用してAPIエンドポイントをテストする","条件付きオーバーライドを使用してユーザー向けの動作を検証する","リクエストパラメータ分析を使用してAPIの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["모의 응답을 사용하여 API 엔드포인트 테스트","조건부 오버라이드를 사용하여 사용자에게 표시되는 동작을 확인","요청 매개 변수 분석을 사용하여 API 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Pruebas de puntos de conexión de API con respuestas simuladas","Validación del comportamiento orientado al usuario con anulaciones condicionales","Depuración de problemas de API con análisis de parámetros de solicitud"],"fr":["Test des points de terminaison d''API avec des réponses simulées","Validation du comportement orienté utilisateur avec des substitutions conditionnelles","Débogage des problèmes d''API avec l''analyse des paramètres de la demande"],"de":["Testen von API-Endpunkten mit Mock-Antworten","Validierung des benutzerorientierten Verhaltens mit bedingten Außerkraftsetzungen","Fehlerbehebung bei API-Problemen mit Anfrageparameteranalyse"],"pt":["Testar pontos de extremidade de API com respostas mock","Validar comportamento do usuário com substituições condicionais","Depurar problemas de API com análise de parâmetros de solicitação"],"ru":["Тестирование точек API с макетными ответами","Проверка пользовательского поведения с условными переопределениями","Отладка проблем API с анализом параметров запроса"],"ar":["اختبار نقاط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع استجابات محاكاة","تحقق من سلوك المستخدم مع تجاوزات شرطية","تصحيح أخطاء واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع تحليل معاملات الطلب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API access and knowledge of request parameters","Conditional mocks must be set up manually"],"zh":["需要API访问和请求参数知识","条件模拟需要手动设置"],"ja":["APIへのアクセスとリクエストパラメータの知識が必要","条件付きモックは手動で設定する必要がある"],"ko":["API 액세스 및 요청 매개 변수에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","조건부 모의는 수동으로 설정해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API y conocimiento de los parámetros de la solicitud","Las simulaciones condicionales deben configurarse manualmente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API et une connaissance des paramètres de la demande","Les simulations conditionnelles doivent être configurées manuellement"],"de":["Erfordert API-Zugriff und Kenntnisse der Anfrageparameter","Bedingte Mocks müssen manuell eingerichtet werden"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API e conhecimento dos parâmetros de solicitação","Mocks condicionais devem ser configurados manualmente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API и знания параметров запроса","Условные макеты должны быть настроены вручную"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات ومعرفة معاملات الطلب","يجب تعيين المحاكيات الشرطية يدويا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
