노트","신뢰할 수 있는 합성","연구 효율성 향상","검색의 용이성","다중 단계 연구 지원"],"es":["Producción de notas de papel consistentes y buscables","Declaración de entradas y salidas","Criterios de aceptación y guardrails","Metodología basada en evidencia para prevenir la escritura hueca"],"fr":["Production de notes de papier cohérentes et recherchables","Déclaration des entrées et sorties","Critères d''acceptation et guardrails","Méthodologie basée sur les preuves pour prévenir l''écriture creuse"],"de":["Erstellung konsistenter und durchsuchbarer Papier-Notizen","Deklaration von Eingaben und Ausgaben","Akzeptanzkriterien und Guardrails","Evidenzbasierte Methodik zur Vermeidung von hohler Schreibweise"],"pt":["Criação de notas de papel consistentes","Pesquisabilidade de notas","Melhoria da produtividade em projetos de desenvolvimento","Estruturação de informações de pesquisa","Prevenção de escrita oca"],"ru":["Создание последовательных бумажных заметок","Поисковость заметок","Повышение производительности в проектах разработки","Структуризация информации исследования","Предотвращение пустой записи"],"ar":["إنشاء ملاحظات ورقية متسقة","إمكانية البحث في الملاحظات","تحسين الإنتاجية في مشاريع البرمجة","تنظيم المعلومات البحثية","منع الكتابة الفارغة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["纸质笔记","研究笔记","结构化笔记","研究效率","可靠合成","搜索笔记"],"ja":["ペーパーノーツ","研究ノート","構造化ノート","研究効率","信頼性の高い合成","ノート検索"],"ko":["페이퍼 노트","연구 노트","구조화 노트","연구 효율성","신뢰할 수 있는 합성","노트 검색"],"es":["notas de papel","unidad de ejecución semántica","investigación","síntesis de información","metodología basada en evidencia"],"fr":["notes de papier","unité d''exécution sémantique","recherche","synthèse d''information","méthodologie basée sur les preuves"],"de":["Papier-Notizen","semantische Ausführungseinheit","Forschung","Synthese von Informationen","evidenzbasierte Methodik"],"pt":["notas de papel","pesquisa de desenvolvimento","produtividade de desenvolvedores","organização de informações","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["бумажные заметки","исследование разработки","производительность разработчиков","организация информации","инструменты разработки","повышение производительности"],"ar":["ملاحظات ورقية","بحث تطوير","إنتاجية المطورين","تنظيم المعلومات","أدوات التطوير","تحسين الإنتاجية"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paper-notes","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Paper Notes\n\nProduce consistent, searchable paper notes that later steps (claims, visuals, writing) can reliably synthesize.\n\nThis is still **NO PROSE**: keep notes as bullets / short fields, not narrative paragraphs.\n\n## Role cards (prompt-level guidance)\n\n- **Close Reader**\n  - Mission: extract what is *specific* and *checkable* (setup, method, metrics, limits).\n  - Do: name concrete tasks/benchmarks and what the paper actually measures.\n  - Avoid: generic summary boilerplate that could fit","body":"# Paper Notes\n\nProduce consistent, searchable paper notes that later steps (claims, visuals, writing) can reliably synthesize.\n\nThis is still **NO PROSE**: keep notes as bullets / short fields, not narrative paragraphs.\n\n## Role cards (prompt-level guidance)\n\n- **Close Reader**\n  - Mission: extract what is *specific* and *checkable* (setup, method, metrics, limits).\n  - Do: name concrete tasks/benchmarks and what the paper actually measures.\n  - Avoid: generic summary boilerplate that could fit any paper.\n\n- **Results Recorder**\n  - Mission: capture evaluation anchors that later writing needs.\n  - Do: record task + metric + constraints (budget/tool access) whenever available.\n  - Avoid: copying numbers without the evaluation setting that makes them meaningful.\n\n- **Limitation Logger**\n  - Mission: capture the caveats that change interpretation.\n  - Do: write paper-specific limitations (protocol mismatch, missing ablations, threat model gaps).\n  - Avoid: repeated generic limitations like “may not generalize” without specifics.\n\n\n## When to use\n\n- After you have a core set (and ideally a mapping) and need evidence-ready notes.\n- Before writing a survey draft.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `papers/core_set.csv`\n- Optional: `outline/mapping.tsv` (to prioritize)\n- Optional: `papers/fulltext_index.jsonl` + `papers/fulltext/*.txt` (if running in fulltext mode)\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` (JSONL; one record per paper)\n- `papers/evidence_bank.jsonl` (JSONL; addressable evidence snippets derived from notes; A150++ target: >=7 items/paper on average)\n\n## Decision: evidence depth\n\n- If you have extracted text (`papers/fulltext/*.txt`) → enrich key papers using fulltext snippets and set `evidence_level: \"fulltext\"`.\n- If you only have abstracts (default) → keep long-tail notes abstract-level, but still fully enrich **high-priority** papers (see below).\n\n## Workflow (heuristic)\nUses: `outline/mapping.tsv`, `papers/fulltext_index.jsonl`.\n\n\n1. Ensure **coverage**: every `paper_id` in `papers/core_set.csv` must have one JSONL record.\n2. Use mapping to choose **high-priority papers**:\n   - heavily reused across subsections\n   - pinned classics (ReAct/Toolformer/Reflexion… if in scope)\n3. For high-priority papers, capture:\n   - 3–6 summary bullets (what’s new, what problem setting, what’s the loop)\n   - `method` (mechanism and architecture; what differs from baselines)\n   - `key_results` (benchmarks/metrics; include numbers if available)\n   - `limitations` (specific assumptions/failure modes; avoid generic boilerplate)\n4. For long-tail papers:\n   - keep summary bullets short (abstract-derived is OK)\n   - still include at least one limitation, but make it specific when possible\n5. Assign a stable `bibkey` for each paper for citation generation.\n\n## Quality checklist\n\n- [ ] Coverage: every `paper_id` in `papers/core_set.csv` appears in `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`.\n- [ ] High-priority papers have non-`TODO` method/results/limitations.\n- [ ] Limitations are not copy-pasted across many papers.\n- [ ] `evidence_level` is set correctly (`abstract` vs `fulltext`).\n\n- [ ] Evidence bank: `papers/evidence_bank.jsonl` exists and is dense enough for A150++ (>=7 items/paper on average).\n## Helper script (optional)\n\n### Quick Start\n\n- `python .codex/skills/paper-notes/scripts/run.py --help`\n- `python .codex/skills/paper-notes/scripts/run.py --workspace <workspace_dir>`\n\n### All Options\n\n- See `--help` (this helper is intentionally minimal)\n\n### Examples\n\n- Generate notes, then optionally enrich `priority=high` papers:\n  - Run the helper once, then refine `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` (e.g., add full-text details for key papers and diversify limitations).\n\n### Notes\n\n- The helper writes deterministic metadata/abstract-level notes and marks key papers with `priority=high`.\n- In `pipeline.py --strict` it will be blocked if high-priority notes are incomplete (missing method/key_results/limitations) or contain placeholders.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### Issue: High-priority notes still look like scaffolds\n\n**Symptom**:\n- Quality gate reports missing `method/key_results` or `TODO` placeholders.\n\n**Causes**:\n- Notes were generated from abstracts only; key papers weren’t enriched.\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Fully enrich `priority=high` papers: `method`, ≥1 `key_results`, ≥3 `summary_bullets`, ≥1 concrete `limitations`.\n- If you need full text evidence, run `pdf-text-extractor` in `fulltext` mode for key papers.\n\n#### Issue: Repeated limitations across many papers\n\n**Symptom**:\n- Quality gate reports repeated limitation boilerplate.\n\n**Causes**:\n- Copy-pasted limitations instead of paper-specific failure modes/assumptions.\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Replace boilerplate with paper-specific limitations (setup, data, evaluation gaps, failure cases).\n\n### Recovery Checklist\n\n- [ ] `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` covers all `papers/core_set.csv` paper_ids.\n- [ ] ≥80% of `priority=high` notes satisfy method/results/limitations completeness.\n- [ ] No `TODO` remains in high-priority notes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:26:17.745Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing structured note-taking capabilities for semantic execution units.","zh":"适合需要结构化笔记功能以执行语义执行单元的研究代理。","ja":"構造化されたノートテイキング機能を必要とする研究エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 노트 작성 기능을 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Investigación que necesitan capacidades de toma de notas estructuradas para unidades de ejecución semántica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de capacités de prise de notes structurées pour les unités d''exécution sémantique.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die strukturierte Notizfunktionen für semantische Ausführungseinheiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de capacidades de tomar notas estruturadas para unidades de execução semântica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для исследовательских агентов, которым необходимы структурированные возможности для заметок для семантических единиц выполнения.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء البحث الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات مكتوبة منظم للوحدات التنفيذية الدلالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce consistent, searchable paper notes through evidence-first methodology, utilizing role cards and acceptance criteria to prevent hollow writing and ensure reliable synthesis of claims, visuals, and writing.","zh":"赋予代理生成一致的、可搜索的纸质笔记的能力，通过以证据为先的方法，利用角色卡和验收标准来防止空洞的写作，并确保可靠地合成声明、视觉和写作。","ja":"エージェントが一貫性のある、検索可能なペーパーノートを生成する能力を付与します。証拠を先に置く方法を使用して、役割カードと受け入れ基準を利用して中空の文章を防ぎ、主張、視覚、文章の信頼性の高い合成を確実に行います。","ko":"에이전트가 일관성 있고 검색 가능 한 문서를 생성 할 수있는 기능을 부여합니다. 증거 우선 방법을 사용하여 역할 카드 및 수락 기준을 활용하여 중공 서식을 방지하고 주장, 시각 및 작성의 신뢰할 수있는 합성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir notas de papel consistentes y buscables a través de una metodología basada en la evidencia, utilizando tarjetas de roles y criterios de aceptación para prevenir la escritura hueca y garantizar una síntesis fiable de afirmaciones, visuales y escritura.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des notes de papier cohérentes et recherchables grâce à une méthodologie basée sur les preuves, en utilisant des cartes de rôles et des critères d''acceptation pour prévenir l''écriture creuse et assurer une synthèse fiable des allégations, des visuels et de l''écriture.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente und durchsuchbare Papiernotizen durch eine evidenzbasierte Methodik zu erstellen, indem Rollenkarten und Akzeptanzkriterien verwendet werden, um hohle Schreibweise zu vermeiden und eine zuverlässige Synthese von Behauptungen, Visualisierungen und Schreibweise sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir notas de papel consistentes e pesquisáveis por meio de metodologia baseada em evidências, utilizando cartões de papel e critérios de aceitação para prevenir a escrita oca e garantir a síntese confiável de afirmações, visuais e escrita.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить последовательные и поисковые бумажные заметки посредством методологии, основанной на доказательствах, используя роль карт и критериев приемлемости для предотвращения пустой письменной речи и обеспечения надежной синтеза утверждений, визуальных и письменной речи.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنتاج ملاحظات ورقية منتظمة و قابلة للبحث من خلال منهجية تقوم على الأدلة، باستخدام بطاقات الأدوار و معايير القبول لمنع الكتابة الفارغة وضمان التركيب الموثوق للادعاءات والمرئيات والكتابة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating structured notes for research pipelines","Extracting specific and checkable information from papers","Creating intermediate artifacts for writing and visualization"],"zh":["为研究管道生成结构化笔记","从论文中提取特定且可检查的信息","为写作和可视化创建中间制品"],"ja":["研究パイプラインの構造化されたノートの生成","論文から特定且つチェック可能な情報の抽出","書き込みと視覚化のための中間アーティファクトの作成"],"ko":["연구 파이프 라인에 대한 구조화 된 노트 생성","논문에서 특정하고 확인 가능한 정보 추출","작성 및 시각화를 위한 중간 아티팩트 생성"],"es":["Generación de notas estructuradas para tuberías de investigación","Extracción de información específica y comprobable de artículos","Creación de artefactos intermedios para escritura y visualización"],"fr":["Génération de notes structurées pour les pipelines de recherche","Extraction d''informations spécifiques et vérifiables à partir d''articles","Création d''artefacts intermédiaires pour l''écriture et la visualisation"],"de":["Erstellung strukturierter Notizen für Forschungspipelines","Extraktion spezifischer und überprüfbarer Informationen aus Artikeln","Erstellung von Zwischenartefakten für Schreibweise und Visualisierung"],"pt":["Geração de notas estruturadas para pipelines de pesquisa","Extração de informações específicas e verificáveis de artigos","Criação de artefatos intermediários para escrita e visualização"],"ru":["Генерация структурированных заметок для исследовательских.pipeline","Извлечение конкретной и проверяемой информации из статей","Создание промежуточных артефактов для письма и визуализации"],"ar":["generando ملاحظات منظم للبحث خطوط أنابيب","استخراج المعلومات المحددة و القابلة للتحقق من المقالات","إنشاء هياكل وسيطة للكتابة والتصوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to bullet-point and short-field format","No narrative paragraphs allowed"],"zh":["需要遵守项目符号和短字段格式","不允许使用叙事段落"],"ja":["ブレットポイントと短フィールド形式への準拠が必要","ナレーシブ段落は許可されません"],"ko":["블릿 점과 짧은 필드 형식 준수를 필요로함","내러티브 단락은 허용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere adherencia al formato de punto y campo corto","No se permiten párrafos narrativos"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion au format de point et de champ court","Les paragraphes narratifs ne sont pas autorisés"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Bullet-Point- und Kurzfeldformats","Erzählpunkte sind nicht erlaubt"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao formato de ponto e campo curto","Não são permitidas parágrafos narrativos"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения формата точки и короткого поля","Не допускаются нарративные абзацы"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بتنسيق النقطة والحقول القصيرة","لا يسمح بالفقرات السردية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('chongdashu/phaserjs-oakwoods/playwright-testing', 'community', 'chongdashu', 'phaserjs-oakwoods', 'chongdashu/phaserjs-oakwoods', 'playwright-testing', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z', '2026-02-18T06:26:37.475Z', NULL, '{"id":"chongdashu/phaserjs-oakwoods/playwright-testing","name":"playwright-testing","description":{"zh":"Playwright 测试是一种前端可靠性测试解决方案，帮助开发者确保应用程序的稳定性和可靠性","ja":"Playwright テストはフロントエンドの信頼性テストソリューションで、開発者がアプリケーションの安定性と信頼性を確保するのに役立ちます","ko":"Playwright 테스트는 프론트엔드 신뢰성 테스트 솔루션으로 개발자가 애플리케이션의 안정성과 신뢰성을 보장하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Playwright-testing es una implementación para pruebas de frontend que permite una refactorización segura y rápida","fr":"Playwright-testing est une mise en œuvre de tests frontend qui permet une refactoring sécurisée et rapide","de":"Playwright-testing ist eine Implementierung für Frontend-Tests, die eine sichere und schnelle Refaktorierung ermöglicht","pt":"Playwright-testing é uma implementação de teste de frontend que permite criar testes confiáveis e escaláveis, garantindo a qualidade do seu aplicativo","ru":"Playwright-testing - это реализация фронтенд-тестирования, которая позволяет создавать надежные и масштабируемые тесты, обеспечивающие качество вашего приложения","ar":"Playwright-testing هو تطبيق لاختبار واجهة المستخدم يسمح بإنشاء اختبارات موثوقة ومقтабلة، مما يضمن جودة تطبيقك","en":"A vibe coded implementation of an RPG platformer"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Playwright 测试：前端可靠性测试解决方案","ja":"Playwright テスト：フロントエンドの信頼性テストソリューション","ko":"Playwright 테스트: 프론트엔드 신뢰성 테스트 솔루션","es":"Pruebas de Playwright: confianza rápida para frontend","fr":"Test Playwright : confiance rapide pour le frontend","de":"Playwright-Tests: Schnellvertrauen für Frontend","pt":"Testes de Frontend Confiáveis com Playwright","ru":"Надежное Фронтенд Тестирование с Playwright","ar":"اختبارات واجهة المستخدم الموثوقة مع Playwright","en":"playwright-testing"},"description":{"zh":"Playwright 测试是一种前端可靠性测试解决方案，帮助开发者确保应用程序的稳定性和可靠性","ja":"Playwright テストはフロントエンドの信頼性テストソリューションで、開発者がアプリケーションの安定性と信頼性を確保するのに役立ちます","ko":"Playwright 테스트는 프론트엔드 신뢰성 테스트 솔루션으로 개발자가 애플리케이션의 안정성과 신뢰성을 보장하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Playwright-testing es una implementación para pruebas de frontend que permite una refactorización segura y rápida","fr":"Playwright-testing est une mise en œuvre de tests frontend qui permet une refactoring sécurisée et rapide","de":"Playwright-testing ist eine Implementierung für Frontend-Tests, die eine sichere und schnelle Refaktorierung ermöglicht","pt":"Playwright-testing é uma implementação de teste de frontend que permite criar testes confiáveis e escaláveis, garantindo a qualidade do seu aplicativo","ru":"Playwright-testing - это реализация фронтенд-тестирования, которая позволяет создавать надежные и масштабируемые тесты, обеспечивающие качество вашего прилож...","ar":"Playwright-testing هو تطبيق لاختبار واجهة المستخدم يسمح بإنشاء اختبارات موثوقة ومقтабلة، مما يضمن جودة تطبيقك","en":"A vibe coded implementation of an RPG platformer"},"definition":{"en":"A vibe coded implementation of an RPG platformer"},"features":{"zh":["前端可靠性测试","自动化测试","最大化信号，减少噪音","确保应用程序的稳定性","支持多种测试层","提高测试效率"],"ja":["フロントエンドの信頼性テスト","自動テスト","信号を最大化し、ノイズを減らす","アプリケーションの安定性を確保する","複数のテスト層をサポート","テスト効率を向上させる"],"ko":["프론트엔드 신뢰성 테스트","자동 테스트","신호를 최대화하고 노イズ를 줄임","애플리케이션의 안정성을 보장","다양한 테스트 계층을 지원","테스트 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Pruebas de frontend confiables","Refactorización segura","Eliminación de la no determinismo","Pruebas de capas adecuadas","Observabilidad de la aplicación","Fallos acciónables"],"fr":["Tests frontend fiables","Refactoring sécurisé","Élimination de la non-déterminisme","Tests de couches appropriées","Observabilité de l''application","Défaillances actionnables"],"de":["Zuverlässige Frontend-Tests","Sichere Refaktorierung","Beseitigung von Nichtdeterminismus","Tests von geeigneten Schichten","Beobachtbarkeit der Anwendung","Handhabbare Fehler"],"pt":["Criação de testes confiáveis e escaláveis","Garantia de qualidade do aplicativo","Eliminação de nondeterminismo","Otimização da camada de teste","Observabilidade do aplicativo","Análise de falhas"],"ru":["Создание надежных и масштабируемых тестов","Обеспечение качества приложения","Устранение недетерминизма","Оптимизация слоя тестирования","Наблюдаемость приложения","Анализ сбоев"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات موثوقة ومقتبلة","ضمان جودة التطبيق","إزالة الغير محدد","تحسين طبقة الاختبار","مراقبة التطبيق","تحليل الأعطال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright 测试","前端可靠性测试","自动化测试","信号最大化","噪音减少","应用程序稳定性","测试效率","前端测试","可靠性测试"],"ja":["Playwright テスト","フロントエンドの信頼性テスト","自動テスト","信号最大化","ノイズ減少","アプリケーションの安定性","テスト効率","フロントエンドテスト","信頼性テスト"],"ko":["Playwright 테스트","프론트엔드 신뢰성 테스트","자동 테스트","신호 최대화","노イズ 감소","애플리케이션 안정성","테스트 효율성","프론트엔드 테스트","신뢰성 테스트"],"es":["pruebas de frontend","playwright testing","refactorización segura","confianza rápida","tests de capas","observabilidad de la aplicación","eliminación de la no determinismo","fallos acciónables"],"fr":["tests frontend","playwright testing","refactoring sécurisé","confiance rapide","tests de couches","observabilité de l''application","élimination de la non-déterminisme","défaillances actionnables"],"de":["Frontend-Tests","Playwright-Testing","sichere Refaktorierung","Schnellvertrauen","Tests von Schichten","Beobachtbarkeit der Anwendung","Beseitigung von Nichtdeterminismus","handhabbare Fehler"],"pt":["testes de frontend","playwright","teste de aplicativo","qualidade de software","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados","confiabilidade de testes","escalabilidade de testes"],"ru":["фронтенд-тестирование","playwright","тестирование приложения","качество программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование","надежность тестов","масштабируемость тестов"],"ar":["اختبارات واجهة المستخدم","playwright","اختبار التطبيق","جودة البرمجيات","تنمية البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية","موثوقية الاختبارات","مقطبية الاختبارات"]}},"owner":"chongdashu","repo":"phaserjs-oakwoods","repoPath":"chongdashu/phaserjs-oakwoods","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-testing","description":"Plan, implement, and debug frontend tests: unit/integration/E2E/visual/a11y. Use for Playwright/Cypress/Vitest/Jest/RTL, flaky test triage, CI stabilization, and canvas/WebGL games (Phaser) needing deterministic input + screenshot/state assertions.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Testing\n\nUnlock reliable confidence fast: enable safe refactors by choosing the right test layer, making the app observable, and eliminating nondeterminism so failures are actionable.\n\n## Philosophy: Confidence Per Minute\n\nFrontend tests fail for two reasons: the product is broken, or the test is lying. Your job is to maximize signal and minimize “test is lying”.\n\n**Before writing a test, ask**:\n- What user risk am I covering (money, progression, auth, data loss, “can’t start” crashes","body":"# Frontend Testing\n\nUnlock reliable confidence fast: enable safe refactors by choosing the right test layer, making the app observable, and eliminating nondeterminism so failures are actionable.\n\n## Philosophy: Confidence Per Minute\n\nFrontend tests fail for two reasons: the product is broken, or the test is lying. Your job is to maximize signal and minimize “test is lying”.\n\n**Before writing a test, ask**:\n- What user risk am I covering (money, progression, auth, data loss, “can’t start” crashes)?\n- What’s the narrowest layer that catches this bug class (pure logic vs UI vs full browser)?\n- What nondeterminism exists (time, RNG, async loading, network, animations, fonts, GPU)?\n- What “ready” signal can I wait on besides `setTimeout`?\n- What should a failure print/screenshot so it’s diagnosable in CI?\n\n**Core principles**:\n1. **Test the contract, not the implementation**: assert stable user-meaningful outcomes and public seams.\n2. **Prefer determinism over retries**: make time/RNG/network controllable; remove flake at the source.\n3. **Observe like a debugger**: console errors, network failures, screenshots, and state dumps on failure.\n4. **One critical flow first**: a reliable smoke test beats 50 flaky tests.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\nPick the test type by the cheapest layer that provides the needed confidence:\n\n- **Unit tests** (fastest): pure functions, reducers, validators, math, pathfinding, deterministic simulation steps.\n- **Component/integration tests** (medium): UI behavior with mocked IO (React Testing Library / Vue Testing Library / Testing Library DOM).\n- **E2E tests** (slowest, highest confidence): critical user flows across routing, storage, real bundling/runtime.\n- **Visual regression** (specialized): layout/pixel regressions; for canvas/WebGL, only after locking determinism.\n- **A11y checks**: great for DOM UIs; limited value for pure canvas unless you expose accessible DOM overlays.\n\n## Quick Start (Any Project)\n\n1. **Define 1 smoke flow**: “page loads → user can start → one key action works”.\n2. **Choose runner**:\n   - Prefer **Playwright** for browser E2E + screenshots.\n   - Prefer **Testing Library** for DOM component behavior.\n   - Prefer **unit tests** for logic you can run without a browser.\n3. **Add a “ready” signal** in the app (DOM marker, window flag, or game event) and wait on that.\n4. **Fail loudly**: treat console errors and failed requests as test failures.\n5. **Stabilize**: seed RNG, freeze time, fix viewport/DPR, disable animations, and remove network variability.\n\n## Playwright Patterns (Especially Useful For Games)\n\nUse Playwright when you need “real browser” confidence:\n- Drive input via mouse/keyboard/touch; treat the canvas like the user does.\n- Add a **test seam**: expose a small, stable test API on `window` (read-only state + a few commands).\n- Prefer `waitForFunction`-style readiness over sleep; gate on “scene ready” / “assets loaded” / “first frame rendered”.\n- For screenshots: lock viewport, device scale factor, fonts, and animation timing.\n- For 9-slice / canvas UI regressions: add a dedicated UI harness scene/page and assert via targeted screenshots (see `references/phaser-canvas-testing.md`).\n\nIf using the Playwright MCP tools (browser automation inside Codex), follow the same mindset:\n- Use `browser_console_messages` and `browser_network_requests` to catch silent failures.\n- Use `browser_evaluate` to assert `window.__TEST__` state and to set up deterministic mode.\n- Use `browser_take_screenshot` for visual assertions after determinism is enforced.\n\n## Reconnaissance-Then-Action (Borrowed From Real Debugging)\n\nWhen a UI is dynamic, don’t guess selectors—recon first, then act:\n\nQuick decision guide:\n\n```\nTask → Is it static HTML (no JS runtime needed)?\n  ├─ Yes → read the HTML to find stable selectors/content, then automate\n  └─ No  → treat as dynamic: run the app, wait for readiness, then inspect rendered state\n```\n\n1. **Navigate and wait for readiness**:\n   - For many webapps: wait for a meaningful “loaded” element (preferred).\n   - `networkidle` can help for SPAs, but avoid it if the app uses websockets/polling.\n2. **Capture evidence** (what the user actually sees):\n   - screenshot (full page for DOM; targeted for canvas)\n   - console errors + failed requests\n3. **Discover selectors** from the rendered state:\n   - prefer role/text/label selectors over brittle CSS\n4. **Execute actions** using discovered selectors and re-check state.\n\nCommon pitfall:\n❌ Inspect/interact before the app is ready.\n✅ Wait on an explicit ready signal (DOM marker or `window.__TEST__.ready`), not a sleep.\n\n## Server Lifecycle Helper (Playwright E2E)\n\nWhen the dev server isn’t already running, use the bundled helper as a black box:\n- Run `python scripts/with_server.py --help` first.\n- Start one (or multiple) servers, wait for their ports, then run your test command.\n\nExample:\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py --server \"npm run dev\" --port 5173 -- npm test\n```\n\n## Flake Reduction Checklist\n\n- Replace sleeps with explicit readiness conditions.\n- Control time (`Date.now`, timers), RNG, and animation loops.\n- Make network deterministic (mock, record/replay, or run against a seeded local backend).\n- Eliminate “first-run” differences (asset caches, fonts) or warm them explicitly.\n- Lock environment: viewport, DPR, locale/timezone, and rendering settings.\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **Testing the wrong layer**: E2E tests for pure logic.\nBetter: unit tests for logic; reserve E2E for integration contracts.\n\n❌ **Testing implementation details**: asserting DOM structure/classnames or internal engine objects.\nBetter: assert user-meaningful outputs (text, navigation, score/HP changes) or a small stable test seam.\n\n❌ **Sleep-driven tests**: `wait 2s then click`.\nBetter: wait on explicit readiness (DOM marker, event, `window` flag).\n\n❌ **Uncontrolled randomness**: RNG/time-based behaviors in assertions.\nBetter: seed RNG, freeze time, and assert stable invariants.\n\n❌ **Pixel snapshots without determinism** (especially canvas/WebGL).\nBetter: add deterministic mode first; then screenshot selectively.\n\n❌ **Snapshot explosion**: hundreds of snapshots that no one can interpret.\nBetter: keep snapshots targeted (critical screens); prefer specific assertions for behavior.\n\n❌ **Retries as a strategy**: “just bump retries in CI”.\nBetter: fix readiness and determinism; use retries only as temporary guardrails.\n\n## Variation Guidance (Prevent One-Size-Fits-All)\n\nVary the approach based on:\n- **UI type**: DOM app vs canvas/WebGL game vs hybrid.\n- **Risk**: core revenue/progression flows get E2E first; edge UI polish gets component tests.\n- **CI constraints**: headless-only, limited GPU, slow CPUs, no audio devices.\n- **Test seam availability**: if you can add a stable `window.__TEST__` API, assert state; if not, stick to black-box input/output.\n\n## Remember\n\nYou can make almost any frontend (including canvas/WebGL games) testable by adding a tiny, stable seam for readiness + state. This skill is meant to empower creative, high-signal testing rather than cargo-cult checklists. Aim for tests that are boring to maintain: deterministic, explicit about readiness, and rich in failure evidence. One reliable smoke test is the foundation; everything else compounds from there.\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\nRead these only when needed:\n- `references/playwright-mcp-cheatsheet.md`: patterns for using Playwright MCP tools for assertions, waiting, and diagnostics.\n- `references/phaser-canvas-testing.md`: deterministic mode + hooks for Phaser/canvas/WebGL games.\n- `references/flake-reduction.md`: deeper flake triage and stabilization tactics.\n\nUse these scripts as black boxes (run `--help` first; don’t read source unless you must):\n- `scripts/with_server.py`: start/wait/stop one or more dev servers around a test command.\n- `scripts/imgdiff.py`: lightweight screenshot diff helper (requires `pip install pillow`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:26:37.475Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing reliable and efficient testing of RPG platformers with Playwright","zh":"非常适合需要可靠和高效测试RPG平台游戏的前端代理，使用Playwright","ja":"Playwrightを使ったRPGプラットフォーマーへのフロントエンドエージェントの信頼性の高いテストに最適","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 RPG 플랫폼 게임을 위한 信頼性の高い 테스트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan pruebas confiables y eficientes de plataformas de RPG con Playwright","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend nécessitant des tests fiables et efficaces de plateformes de RPG avec Playwright","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die zuverlässige und effiziente Tests von RPG-Plattformen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de testes confiáveis e eficientes de plataformas de RPG com Playwright","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются надежные и эффективные тесты платформ RPG с Playwright","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى اختبارات موثوقة وفعالة لأنظمة منصة ألعاب تقمص الأدوار مع Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maximize signal and minimize nondeterminism in frontend tests, ensuring reliable confidence through the right test layer and observable apps, while eliminating failures and enabling safe refactors using Playwright''s API","zh":"赋予代理最大化信号和最小化非确定性测试的能力，通过正确的测试层和可观察的应用程序，确保可靠的信心，同时消除故障并使用Playwright的API启用安全重构","ja":"エージェントが信号を最大化し、非決定性テストを最小化することを可能にし、正しいテスト層と観測可能なアプリケーションを介して信頼性の高い信頼性を確保し、PlaywrightのAPIを使用して安全なリファクタリングを可能にし、障害を排除","ko":"에이전트가 신호를 최대화하고 비결정적 테스트를 최소화할 수 있게 해주어, 올바른 테스트 레이어와 관찰 가능한 애플리케이션을 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 신뢰성을 보장하고, Playwright의 API를 사용하여 안전한 리팩토링을 가능하게 하며, 오류를 제거","es":"Habilita a los agentes a maximizar la señal y minimizar la no determinismo en las pruebas frontend, asegurando una confianza confiable a través de la capa de prueba correcta y aplicaciones observables, mientras se eliminan fallos y se habilitan refactorizaciones seguras utilizando la API de Playwright","fr":"Permet aux agents de maximiser le signal et de minimiser la non-déterminisme dans les tests frontend, en garantissant une confiance fiable à travers la bonne couche de test et les applications observables, tout en éliminant les défaillances et en permettant des refactorisations sûres en utilisant l''API de Playwright","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Signal zu maximieren und die Nichtdeterminismus in den Frontend-Tests zu minimieren, indem sie eine zuverlässige Zuversicht durch die richtige Testebene und beobachtbare Anwendungen sicherstellen, während sie Ausfälle beseitigen und sichere Refactorings mithilfe der Playwright-API ermöglichen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a maximizar o sinal e minimizar a não determinismo nos testes de frontend, garantindo confiança confiável por meio da camada de teste certa e aplicativos observáveis, eliminando falhas e permitindo refatorações seguras usando a API do Playwright","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью максимизировать сигнал и минимизировать недетерминизм в фронтенд-тестах, обеспечивая надежную уверенность благодаря правильному тестовому слою и наблюдаемым приложениям, а также устраняя сбои и позволяя безопасно рефакторить с использованием API Playwright","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تعظيم الإشارة وتقليل عدم التحديد في اختبارات واجهة المستخدم، مما يضمن الثقة الموثوقة من خلال طبقة الاختبار الصحيحة والتطبيقات القابلة للملاحظة، مع إزالة الفشل وتتمكن من إعادة هيكلة آمنة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Playwright"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend testing for RPG platformers","Debugging nondeterministic test failures","Optimizing test layers for maximum signal"],"zh":["为RPG平台游戏自动化前端测试","调试非确定性测试故障","优化测试层以获得最大信号"],"ja":["RPGプラットフォーマーのフロントエンドテストの自動化","非決定性テスト障害のデバッグ","テスト層の最適化による最大信号の取得"],"ko":["RPG 플랫폼 게임을 위한 프론트엔드 테스트 자동화","비결정적 테스트 오류 디버깅","테스트 레이어 최적화로 최대 신호 획득"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas frontend para plataformas de RPG","Depuración de fallos de pruebas no deterministas","Optimización de capas de prueba para máximo señal"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests frontend pour les plateformes de RPG","Débogage des défaillances de tests non déterministes","Optimisation des couches de test pour un signal maximum"],"de":["Automatisierung von Frontend-Tests für RPG-Plattformen","Fehlerbehebung bei nicht deterministischen Testfehlern","Optimierung von Testebenen für maximales Signal"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de frontend para plataformas de RPG","Depurar falhas de testes não determinísticos","Otimizar camadas de teste para máximo sinal"],"ru":["Автоматизировать фронтенд-тестирование платформ RPG","Отладить недетерминированные сбои тестов","Оптимизировать тестовые слои для максимального сигнала"],"ar":["تأتمتة اختبار واجهة المستخدم لأنظمة منصة ألعاب تقمص الأدوار","تصحيح أخطاء اختبار غير محددة","تحسين طبقات الاختبار للاشارة القصوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright installation","Frontend testing only","Nondeterminism elimination required for reliable results"],"zh":["需要安装Playwright","仅限前端测试","需要消除非确定性以获得可靠的结果"],"ja":["Playwrightのインストールが必要","フロントエンドテストのみ","信頼性の高い結果を得るために非決定性の排除が必要"],"ko":["Playwright 설치 필요","프론트엔드 테스트만 가능","신뢰할 수 있는 결과를 얻기 위해 비결정성 제거 필요"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Playwright","Pruebas frontend solamente","Eliminación de no determinismo necesaria para resultados confiables"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Playwright","Tests frontend uniquement","Élimination de la non-déterminisme nécessaire pour des résultats fiables"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Installation","Nur Frontend-Tests","Beseitigung von Nichtdeterminismus erforderlich für zuverlässige Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Playwright","Testes de frontend apenas","Eliminação de não determinismo necessária para resultados confiáveis"],"ru":["Требуется установка Playwright","Только фронтенд-тестирование","Устранение недетерминизма необходимо для надежных результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Playwright","اختبارات واجهة المستخدم فقط","مطلوب إزالة عدم التحديد للحصول على نتائج موثوقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gakonst/dotfiles/js', 'community', 'gakonst', 'dotfiles', 'gakonst/dotfiles', 'js', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z', '2026-02-18T06:26:31.610Z', NULL, '{"id":"gakonst/dotfiles/js","name":"js","description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何使用 Vite、React、TanStack Query 和 Cloudflare Worker 搭建 JS 开发环境，并提供了 tmux 布局和 Justfile/CI 配置","ja":"Vite、React、TanStack Query、Cloudflare Worker を使用した JS 開発環境の構築方法と、tmux レイアウト、Justfile/CI 構成について解説","ko":"Vite, React, TanStack Query 및 Cloudflare Worker를 사용하여 JS 개발 환경을 설정하는 방법과 tmux 레이아웃 및 Justfile/CI 구성에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Nuestra configuración de JS incluye Vite, React, TanStack Query y Tailwind para una experiencia de desarrollo óptima","fr":"Notre configuration JS comprend Vite, React, TanStack Query et Tailwind pour une expérience de développement optimale","de":"Unsere JS-Konfiguration umfasst Vite, React, TanStack Query und Tailwind für eine optimale Entwicklungserfahrung","pt":"O JS é um conjunto de ferramentas para desenvolvedores que inclui Vite, React, TanStack e Bun. Fornece uma ponte de console de desenvolvimento para logs de frontend e backend.","ru":"JS - это набор инструментов для разработчиков, включающий Vite, React, TanStack и Bun. Предоставляет консольную связь для логов frontend и backend.","ar":"JS هو مجموعة من الأدوات للمطورين تتضمن Vite و React و TanStack و Bun. يوفر جسرًا للوحة تطوير لوجس واجهة المستخدم والخادم الخلفي.","en":"My dotfiles along with a script to deploy them to your environment."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"JS 开发环境搭建与调试","ja":"JS 開発環境構築とデバッグ","ko":"JS 개발 환경 설정 및 디버깅","es":"Configuración de JS con Vite y React","fr":"Configuration JS avec Vite et React","de":"JS-Konfiguration mit Vite und React","pt":"Trabalho JS: Vite, React, TanStack e Bun","ru":"JS-стек: Vite, React, TanStack и Bun","ar":"مجموعة JS: Vite و React و TanStack و Bun","en":"js"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何使用 Vite、React、TanStack Query 和 Cloudflare Worker 搭建 JS 开发环境，并提供了 tmux 布局和 Justfile/CI 配置","ja":"Vite、React、TanStack Query、Cloudflare Worker を使用した JS 開発環境の構築方法と、tmux レイアウト、Justfile/CI 構成について解説","ko":"Vite, React, TanStack Query 및 Cloudflare Worker를 사용하여 JS 개발 환경을 설정하는 방법과 tmux 레이아웃 및 Justfile/CI 구성에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Nuestra configuración de JS incluye Vite, React, TanStack Query y Tailwind para una experiencia de desarrollo óptima","fr":"Notre configuration JS comprend Vite, React, TanStack Query et Tailwind pour une expérience de développement optimale","de":"Unsere JS-Konfiguration umfasst Vite, React, TanStack Query und Tailwind für eine optimale Entwicklungserfahrung","pt":"O JS é um conjunto de ferramentas para desenvolvedores que inclui Vite, React, TanStack e Bun. Fornece uma ponte de console de desenvolvimento para logs de f...","ru":"JS - это набор инструментов для разработчиков, включающий Vite, React, TanStack и Bun. Предоставляет консольную связь для логов frontend и backend.","ar":"JS هو مجموعة من الأدوات للمطورين تتضمن Vite و React و TanStack و Bun. يوفر جسرًا للوحة تطوير لوجس واجهة المستخدم والخادم الخلفي.","en":"My dotfiles along with a script to deploy them to your environment."},"definition":{"en":"My dotfiles along with a script to deploy them to your environment."},"features":{"zh":["Vite + React + TanStack Query 开发栈","Cloudflare Worker 后端","tmux 布局和服务器日志","Justfile/CI 配置","_dense/no-animation UI 默认值"],"ja":["Vite + React + TanStack Query 開発スタック","Cloudflare Worker バックエンド","tmux レイアウトとサーバーログ","Justfile/CI 構成","_dense/no-animation UI デフォルト値"],"ko":["Vite + React + TanStack Query 개발 스택","Cloudflare Worker 백엔드","tmux 레이아웃 및 서버 로그","Justfile/CI 구성","dense/no-animation UI 기본값"],"es":["Integración con Vite y React","TanStack Query para la gestión de datos","Tailwind para la interfaz de usuario","Compatibilidad con Cloudflare Worker","Consola de desarrollo con tmux"],"fr":["Intégration avec Vite et React","TanStack Query pour la gestion des données","Tailwind pour l''interface utilisateur","Compatibilité avec Cloudflare Worker","Console de développement avec tmux"],"de":["Integration mit Vite und React","TanStack Query für die Datenverwaltung","Tailwind für die Benutzeroberfläche","Kompatibilität mit Cloudflare Worker","Entwicklerkonsole mit tmux"],"pt":["Integração de logs de frontend e backend","Tmux layout para servidores e logs","Interface de usuário densa e sem animações","Suporte a Justfile e CI","Compatibilidade com Vite, React e TanStack","Desempenho aprimorado com Bun"],"ru":["Интеграция логов frontend и backend","Макет Tmux для серверов и логов","Плотный и безанимационный интерфейс пользователя","Поддержка Justfile и CI","Совместимость с Vite, React и TanStack","Улучшенная производительность с Bun"],"ar":["دمج سجلات واجهة المستخدم والخادم الخلفي","مخطط Tmux للخادم وسجلات","واجهة مستخدم كثيفة وبدون حركات","دعم Justfile و CI","توافق مع Vite و React و TanStack","أداء محسن مع Bun"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JS 开发环境","Vite","React","TanStack Query","Cloudflare Worker","tmux","Justfile","CI"],"ja":["JS 開発環境","Vite","React","TanStack Query","Cloudflare Worker","tmux","Justfile","CI"],"ko":["JS 개발 환경","Vite","React","TanStack Query","Cloudflare Worker","tmux","Justfile","CI"],"es":["configuración de JS","Vite","React","TanStack Query","Tailwind","Cloudflare Worker","tmux","desarrollo web","entorno de desarrollo"],"fr":["configuration JS","Vite","React","TanStack Query","Tailwind","Cloudflare Worker","tmux","développement web","environnement de développement"],"de":["JS-Konfiguration","Vite","React","TanStack Query","Tailwind","Cloudflare Worker","tmux","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento js","vite","react","tanstack","bun","logs de frontend","logs de backend","tmux","justfile","ci"],"ru":["разработка js","vite","react","tanstack","bun","логи frontend","логи backend","tmux","justfile","ci"],"ar":["تطوير js","vite","react","tanstack","bun","سجلات واجهة المستخدم","سجلات الخادم الخلفي","tmux","justfile","ci"]}},"owner":"gakonst","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"gakonst/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"js","description":"Use for Vite+React+TanStack Query frontends on Bun/Cloudflare Workers with shadcn/Tailwind—provides dev console bridge, tmux layout, dense/no-motion UI defaults, and Justfile/CI parity.","bodyPreview":"# JS (Vite/React/TanStack/Bun/Workers)\n\n## Overview\nAgent-ready workflow for the preferred JS stack: Vite + React + TanStack Query + Tailwind/shadcn UI on Bun with a Cloudflare Worker backend. Focus: dev console bridge to pipe FE logs to backend logs, tmux layout for servers/logs, dense/no-animation UI defaults, and Justfile/CI parity.\n\n## When to Use\n- Building or debugging this stack.\n- Need frontend logs visible without browser console.\n- Spinning up a fresh dev env for agents with tmux panes","body":"# JS (Vite/React/TanStack/Bun/Workers)\n\n## Overview\nAgent-ready workflow for the preferred JS stack: Vite + React + TanStack Query + Tailwind/shadcn UI on Bun with a Cloudflare Worker backend. Focus: dev console bridge to pipe FE logs to backend logs, tmux layout for servers/logs, dense/no-animation UI defaults, and Justfile/CI parity.\n\n## When to Use\n- Building or debugging this stack.\n- Need frontend logs visible without browser console.\n- Spinning up a fresh dev env for agents with tmux panes and predictable commands.\n- Want square, animation-free, dense UI baseline.\n\n## Core Pattern\n- **Commands (keep CI aligned)**: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`; `pnpm format:check`; `pnpm lint`; `pnpm test -- --runInBand`; `pnpm dev`.\n- **Dev console bridge (dev-only)**: in `src/dev/console-bridge.ts`, wrap `console` methods, POST to `/__dev/fe-logs` when `import.meta.env.DEV`, guard recursion/online state.\n- **Worker receiver**: CF Worker route `/__dev/fe-logs` logs to backend console with timestamp/prefix; dev-only.\n- **tmux layout**: session with panes for Vite (`bun run dev --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173`), Wrangler (`bunx wrangler dev --local`), backend log tail, frontend log tail (Vite log to file). Start layout before debugging.\n- **UI defaults**: square corners, animations off, dense spacing, mobile-first grid. Tailwind base: `* { border-radius: 0; animation: none; transition: none; } :root { color-scheme: light; }`.\n- **TypeScript style**: split type/value imports; data-first funcs; `satisfies` over `as`; prefer `const T extends` for inference; throw typed errors; TSDoc on exports; tests with vitest close to code.\n- **React + TanStack Query**: options-first hooks, explicit `enabled`, reuse query options/helpers, manage cache on identity change, add type tests where useful.\n\n## Verification\n- Trigger `console.error(''boom'')` in dev → appears in backend log tail as `[FE ...] boom`.\n- `curl -X POST http://localhost:8787/__dev/fe-logs -d ''{\"level\":\"info\",\"ts\":0,\"msg\":\"hello\"}'' -H ''Content-Type: application/json''` → shows in backend logs.\n- View at 360px width → layout remains readable, no overflow; no animations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n- Start dev: `pnpm dev` (or `bun run dev --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173`) + `bunx wrangler dev --local`\n- Logs: ensure Vite writes to file (`--logFile logs/frontend.log`); tail in tmux panes.\n- Bridge file: `src/dev/console-bridge.ts`; import in `main.tsx` only in dev.\n- Worker endpoint: `/__dev/fe-logs` dev-only.\n- UI base: radius 0, animations off, dense spacing.\n\n## Red Flags\n- Bridge enabled in production (missing dev guard).\n- Using browser console instead of bridging logs.\n- tmux panes pointing at wrong cwd; missing Justfile parity with CI.\n- Animations/rounded defaults left on; UI not dense/mobile-first.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:26:31.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for JavaScript-focused AI Agents seeking streamlined development with Vite, React, and TanStack Query","zh":"适合专注于JavaScript的AI代理，旨在使用Vite、React和TanStack Query进行流畅开发","ja":"JavaScriptに焦点を当てたAIエージェント向けに、Vite、React、TanStack Queryを使用したストリームライン開発に最適","ko":"JavaScript에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트를 위한)Vite, React 및 TanStack Query를 사용한 개발을 단순화하기에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en JavaScript que buscan un desarrollo fluido con Vite, React y TanStack Query","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur JavaScript qui recherchent un développement fluide avec Vite, React et TanStack Query","de":"Ideal für JavaScript-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Entwicklung mit Vite, React und TanStack Query anstreben","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA focados em JavaScript que buscam desenvolvimento simplificado com Vite, React e TanStack Query","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на JavaScript, ищущих упрощенное развитие с помощью Vite, React и TanStack Query","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتركز على جافا سكريبت الذي يبحث عن تطوير مبسط مع Vite و React و TanStack Query"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bridge frontend and backend logs seamlessly using Cloudflare Workers, while leveraging Bun for efficient package management and Tailwind/shadcn UI for dense, no-animation interfaces, all managed through Justfile and CI parity","zh":"赋予代理无缝桥接前端和后端日志的能力，使用Cloudflare Workers，同时利用Bun进行高效的包管理和Tailwind/shadcn UI进行密集、无动画界面，全部通过Justfile和CI奇偶校验管理","ja":"エージェントにフロントエンドとバックエンドのログをシームレスにブリッジする能力を付与する。Cloudflare Workersを使用し、Bunを使用した効率的なパッケージ管理と、Tailwind/shadcn UIを使用した密度の高い、アニメーションのないインターフェイスを提供する。これらはすべて、JustfileとCIパリティを介して管理される","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 프론트엔드와 백엔드 로그를無шов적으로 연결할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, Bun을 사용한 효율적인 패키지 관리와 Tailwind/shadcn UI를 사용한 밀도 높은, 애니메이션 없는 인터페이스를 제공하며, 모든 것을 Justfile과 CI 일치성을 통해 관리","es":"Permite a los agentes unir registros de frontend y backend de forma transparente utilizando Cloudflare Workers, aprovechando Bun para una gestión de paquetes eficiente y Tailwind/shadcn UI para interfaces densas y sin animaciones, todo gestionado a través de Justfile y paridad de CI","fr":"Permet aux agents de relier les journaux frontend et backend de manière transparente en utilisant Cloudflare Workers, tout en exploitant Bun pour une gestion de packages efficace et Tailwind/shadcn UI pour des interfaces denses et sans animations, le tout géré via Justfile et parité de CI","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Frontend- und Backend-Logs nahtlos mithilfe von Cloudflare Workers zu verbinden, während Bun für eine effiziente Paketverwaltung und Tailwind/shadcn UI für dichte, animationsfreie Schnittstellen genutzt wird, alles über Justfile und CI-Parität geregelt","pt":"Permite que os agentes unam logs de frontend e backend de forma transparente usando Cloudflare Workers, aproveitando Bun para gerenciamento eficiente de pacotes e Tailwind/shadcn UI para interfaces densas e sem animações, tudo gerenciado por meio do Justfile e paridade de CI","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью объединять логи frontend и backend бесшовно с помощью Cloudflare Workers, используя Bun для эффективного управления пакетами и Tailwind/shadcn UI для плотных интерфейсов без анимации, все управляемое через Justfile и паритет CI","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء ربط سجلات الواجهة الأمامية والخلفية بسلاسة باستخدام Cloudflare Workers، مع الاستفادة من Bun لإدارة الحزم بكفاءة واستخدام Tailwind/shadcn UI للواجهات المكتظة بدون حركات، كل ذلك يتم إدارته من خلال Justfile وتوازن CI"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging Vite and React applications with unified logging","Deploying fresh development environments with tailored tmux layouts","Building agent-ready workflows that integrate TanStack Query for data management"],"zh":["使用统一日志调试Vite和React应用程序","部署具有定制的tmux布局的新开发环境","构建集成TanStack Query进行数据管理的代理就绪工作流"],"ja":["統一ログを使用したViteとReactアプリケーションのデバッグ","カスタマイズされたtmuxレイアウトを備えた新しい開発環境のデプロイ","TanStack Queryを使用したデータ管理を統合したエージェント対応ワークフローの構築"],"ko":["통일된 로그를 사용하여 Vite 및 React 애플리케이션 디버깅","사용자 정의 tmux 레이아웃이 포함된 새로운 개발 환경 배포","TanStack Query를 사용한 데이터 관리를 통합한 에이전트 준비 워크플로우 구축"],"es":["Depuración de aplicaciones Vite y React con registro unificado","Implementación de entornos de desarrollo frescos con diseños de tmux personalizados","Creación de flujos de trabajo listos para el agente que integran TanStack Query para la gestión de datos"],"fr":["Débogage d''applications Vite et React avec journalisation unifiée","Déploiement de nouveaux environnements de développement avec des dispositions de tmux sur mesure","Création de flux de travail prêts pour l''agent qui intègrent TanStack Query pour la gestion de données"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von Vite- und React-Anwendungen mit einheitlicher Protokollierung","Bereitstellung von frischen Entwicklungsumgebungen mit maßgeschneiderten tmux-Layouts","Erstellung von agentenbereiten Workflows, die TanStack Query für die Datenverwaltung integrieren"],"pt":["Depuração de aplicativos Vite e React com registro unificado","Implantação de ambientes de desenvolvimento frescos com layouts de tmux personalizados","Criação de fluxos de trabalho prontos para agente que integram TanStack Query para gerenciamento de dados"],"ru":["Отладка приложений Vite и React с унифицированным журналированием","Развертывание свежих сред разработки с настраиваемыми макетами tmux","Создание агент-готовых рабочих процессов, интегрирующих TanStack Query для управления данными"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات Vite و React مع سجل موحد","نشر بيئات تطوير جديدة مع تخطيطات مخصصة ل tmux","بناء سلاسل عمل جاهزة للوكيل التي دمج TanStack Query لإدارة البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare Worker setup for backend logging","Optimized for Bun package manager and specific UI libraries"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare Worker设置用于后端日志记录","针对Bun包管理器和特定UI库进行优化"],"ja":["バックエンドログ記録にCloudflare Workerの設定が必要","Bunパッケージマネージャーと特定のUIライブラリに最適化"],"ko":["백엔드 로깅을 위한 Cloudflare Worker 설정이 필요","Bun 패키지 관리자 및 특정 UI 라이브러리에 최적화"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Cloudflare Worker para registro de backend","Optimizado para el administrador de paquetes Bun y bibliotecas de UI específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Cloudflare Worker pour la journalisation de backend","Optimisé pour le gestionnaire de packages Bun et les bibliothèques d''interface utilisateur spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Cloudflare-Worker-Konfiguration für Backend-Protokollierung","Optimiert für den Paket-Manager Bun und bestimmte Benutzeroberflächenbibliotheken"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Cloudflare Worker para registro de backend","Otimizado para gerenciador de pacotes Bun e bibliotecas de UI específicas"],"ru":["Требует настройки Cloudflare Worker для ведения журнала бэкенда","Оптимизирован для менеджера пакетов Bun и конкретных библиотек UI"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Cloudflare Worker لتسجيل الخلفية","مُحسّن لمدیر حزم Bun ومكتبات واجهة المستخدم المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('huiali/rust-skills/rust-unsafe', 'community', 'huiali', 'rust-skills', 'huiali/rust-skills', 'rust-unsafe', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z', '2026-02-18T06:26:43.659Z', NULL, '{"id":"huiali/rust-skills/rust-unsafe","name":"rust-unsafe","description":{"zh":"Rust 不安全代码是指使用 unsafe 关键字的代码，需要谨慎使用以避免安全风险","ja":"Rust 不安全コードは、unsafe キーワードを使用したコードであり、安全リスクを避けるために慎重に使用する必要があります","ko":"Rust 안전하지 않은 코드는 unsafe 키워드를 사용하는 코드로 안전을 위협할 수 있으므로 주의하여 사용해야 합니다","es":"Rust Unsafe es una capa de capacidad de experto en inteligencia artificial para prácticas de ingeniería de Rust, que permite la creación de unidades de razonamiento y decisión llamables","fr":"Rust Unsafe est une couche de capacité d''expert en intelligence artificielle pour les pratiques d''ingénierie Rust, qui permet la création d''unités de raisonnement et de décision appelables","de":"Rust Unsafe ist eine Expertenfähigkeitsschicht für Rust-Ingenieurpraktiken, die die Erstellung von aufrufbaren Reasoning- und Entscheidungseinheiten ermöglicht","pt":"Rust Unsafe é uma camada de capacidade de especialista em IA para práticas de engenharia Rust, permitindo diagnóstico, design e otimização em cenários complexos","ru":"Rust Unsafe - это слой экспертных возможностей ИИ для инженерных практик Rust, позволяющий диагностику, проектирование и оптимизацию в сложных реальных сценариях","ar":"رست غير آمن هو طبقة من khảیات الخبراء في مجال الذكاء الاصطناعي لتقنيات هندسة رست، مما يسمح بالتشخيص والتصميم والتحسين في سناريوهات معقدة","en":"An AI expert capability layer for Rust engineering practices, centered on modular skill orchestration and collaborative execution chains. It turns Rust’s core knowledge structures into callable reasoning and decision units, enabling diagnosis, design, and optimization in complex real-world scenar..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Rust 不安全代码最佳实践"