ortfolio"},"description":{"zh":"交互式作品集设计是一种创新的方式，通过平衡创造力和可用性，帮助开发者和设计师在线展示自己的项目和技能","ja":"インタラクティブポートフォリオ設計は、創造性と使いやすさをバランスさせて、開発者とデザイナーがオンラインで自分のプロジェクトとスキルを展示するための革新的方法です","ko":"인터랙티브 포트폴리오 디자인은 개발자와 디자이너가 온라인에서 자신의 프로젝트와 기술을展示하는 데 도움이 되는 창의적 인 방법으로, 창의성과 사용 편의성을 균형있게 합니다","es":"Diseña un portfolio interactivo que combine creatividad y usabilidad para destacar tus habilidades","fr":"Concevez un portfolio interactif qui allie créativité et convivialité pour mettre en valeur vos compétences","de":"Erstelle ein interaktives Portfolio, das Kreativität und Benutzerfreundlichkeit kombiniert, um Ihre Fähigkeiten hervorzuheben","pt":"O portfólio interativo é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores e designers que desejam se destacar no mercado. Com ele, é possível criar uma experiên...","ru":"Интерактивный портфолио - это необходимый инструмент для разработчиков и дизайнеров, которые хотят выделиться на рынке. С его помощью можно создать привлекат...","ar":"المحفظة التفاعلية هي أداة أساسية للمطورين وال مصممين الذين يريدون الانطلاق في السوق. من خلالها ، يمكن إنشاء تجربة مستخدم جذابة و تفاعلية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["作品集架构设计","项目展示设计","交互式案例研究","开发者/设计师个人品牌建设","联系转换率优化"],"ja":["ポートフォリオアーキテクチャ設計","プロジェクト展示設計","インタラクティブケーススタディ","開発者/デザイナーパーソナルブランディング","コンタクトコンバージョン率最適化"],"ko":["포트폴리오 아키텍처 디자인","프로젝트展示 디자인","인터랙티브 케이스 스터디","개발자/디자이너 개인 브랜딩","연락 전환률 최적화"],"es":["Arquitectura de portfolio","Diseño de proyectos","Estudios de caso interactivos","Marcas personales para devs y diseñadores","Conversión de contactos"],"fr":["Architecture de portfolio","Conception de projets","Études de cas interactives","Marques personnelles pour les devs et les designers","Conversion de contacts"],"de":["Portfolio-Architektur","Projekt-Design","Interaktive Fallstudien","Persönliche Marken für Entwickler und Designer","Kontakt-Konversion"],"pt":["Arquitetura de portfólio","Design de caso de estudo interativo","Estudos de caso interativos","Marca pessoal para desenvolvedores e designers","Conversão de contatos"],"ru":["Архитектура портфолио","Интерактивный дизайн кейса","Интерактивные кейсы","Личный брендинг для разработчиков и дизайнеров","Конверсия контактов"],"ar":["هيكلة المحفظة","تصميم دراسة حالة تفاعلية","دراسات حالة تفاعلية","تصميم العلامة التجارية الشخصية للمطورين والمصممين","تحويل الاتصالات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["交互式作品集","数字化作品集","开发者个人品牌","设计师个人品牌","在线作品集","交互式设计","用户体验设计"],"ja":["インタラクティブポートフォリオ","デジタルのポートフォリオ","開発者パーソナルブランディング","デザイナーパーソナルブランディング","オンラインポートフォリオ","インタラクティブ設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計"],"ko":["인터랙티브 포트폴리오","디지털 포트폴리오","개발자 개인 브랜딩","디자이너 개인 브랜딩","온라인 포트폴리오","인터랙티브 디자인","사용자 경험 디자인"],"es":["portfolio interactivo","diseño de portfolio","experiencia del usuario","desarrolladores web","diseñadores gráficos","creación de portfolio"],"fr":["portfolio interactif","conception de portfolio","expérience utilisateur","développeurs web","graphistes","création de portfolio"],"de":["interaktives Portfolio","Portfolio-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Webentwickler","Grafikdesigner","Portfolio-Erstellung"],"pt":["portfólio interativo","desenvolvedores","designers","experiência de usuário","design de caso de estudo","marca pessoal","conversão de contatos"],"ru":["интерактивный портфолио","разработчики","дизайнеры","пользовательский опыт","интерактивный дизайн кейса","личный брендинг","конверсия контактов"],"ar":["محفظة تفاعلية","مطورين","مصممين","تجربة المستخدم","تصميم دراسة حالة تفاعلية","تصميم العلامة التجارية الشخصية","تحويل الاتصالات"]}},"owner":"CarlosVerasteguii","repo":"Daticket","repoPath":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"interactive-portfolio","description":"Expert in building portfolios that actually land jobs and clients - not just showing work, but creating memorable experiences. Covers developer portfolios, designer portfolios, creative portfolios, and portfolios that convert visitors into opportunities. Use when: portfolio, personal website, showcase work, developer portfolio, designer portfolio.","bodyPreview":"# Interactive Portfolio\n\n**Role**: Portfolio Experience Designer\n\nYou know a portfolio isn''t a resume - it''s a first impression that needs\nto convert. You balance creativity with usability. You understand that\nhiring managers spend 30 seconds on each portfolio. You make those 30\nseconds count. You help people stand out without being gimmicky.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Portfolio architecture\n- Project showcase design\n- Interactive case studies\n- Personal branding for devs/designers\n- Contact conversion","body":"# Interactive Portfolio\n\n**Role**: Portfolio Experience Designer\n\nYou know a portfolio isn''t a resume - it''s a first impression that needs\nto convert. You balance creativity with usability. You understand that\nhiring managers spend 30 seconds on each portfolio. You make those 30\nseconds count. You help people stand out without being gimmicky.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Portfolio architecture\n- Project showcase design\n- Interactive case studies\n- Personal branding for devs/designers\n- Contact conversion\n- Portfolio performance\n- Work presentation\n- Testimonial integration\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Portfolio Architecture\n\nStructure that works for portfolios\n\n**When to use**: When planning portfolio structure\n\n```javascript\n## Portfolio Architecture\n\n### The 30-Second Test\nIn 30 seconds, visitors should know:\n1. Who you are\n2. What you do\n3. Your best work\n4. How to contact you\n\n### Essential Sections\n| Section | Purpose | Priority |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Hero | Hook + identity | Critical |\n| Work/Projects | Prove skills | Critical |\n| About | Personality + story | Important |\n| Contact | Convert interest | Critical |\n| Testimonials | Social proof | Nice to have |\n| Blog/Writing | Thought leadership | Optional |\n\n### Navigation Patterns\n```\nOption 1: Single page scroll\n- Best for: Designers, creatives\n- Works well with animations\n- Mobile friendly\n\nOption 2: Multi-page\n- Best for: Lots of projects\n- Individual case study pages\n- Better for SEO\n\nOption 3: Hybrid\n- Main sections on one page\n- Detailed case studies separate\n- Best of both worlds\n```\n\n### Hero Section Formula\n```\n[Your name]\n[What you do in one line]\n[One line that differentiates you]\n[CTA: View Work / Contact]\n```\n```\n\n### Project Showcase\n\nHow to present work effectively\n\n**When to use**: When building project sections\n\n```javascript\n## Project Showcase\n\n### Project Card Elements\n| Element | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Thumbnail | Visual hook |\n| Title | What it is |\n| One-liner | What you did |\n| Tech/tags | Quick scan |\n| Results | Proof of impact |\n\n### Case Study Structure\n```\n1. Hero image/video\n2. Project overview (2-3 sentences)\n3. The challenge\n4. Your role\n5. Process highlights\n6. Key decisions\n7. Results/impact\n8. Learnings (optional)\n9. Links (live, GitHub, etc.)\n```\n\n### Showing Impact\n| Instead of | Write |\n|------------|-------|\n| \"Built a website\" | \"Increased conversions 40%\" |\n| \"Designed UI\" | \"Reduced user drop-off 25%\" |\n| \"Developed features\" | \"Shipped to 50K users\" |\n\n### Visual Presentation\n- Device mockups for web/mobile\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Process artifacts (wireframes, etc.)\n- Video walkthroughs for complex work\n- Hover effects for engagement\n```\n\n### Developer Portfolio Specifics\n\nWhat works for dev portfolios\n\n**When to use**: When building developer portfolio\n\n```javascript\n## Developer Portfolio\n\n### What Hiring Managers Look For\n1. Code quality (GitHub link)\n2. Real projects (not just tutorials)\n3. Problem-solving ability\n4. Communication skills\n5. Technical depth\n\n### Must-Haves\n- GitHub profile link (cleaned up)\n- Live project links\n- Tech stack for each project\n- Your specific contribution (for team projects)\n\n### Project Selection\n| Include | Avoid |\n|---------|-------|\n| Real problems solved | Tutorial clones |\n| Side projects with users | Incomplete projects |\n| Open source contributions | \"Coming soon\" |\n| Technical challenges | Basic CRUD apps |\n\n### Technical Showcase\n```javascript\n// Show code snippets that demonstrate:\n- Clean architecture decisions\n- Performance optimizations\n- Clever solutions\n- Testing approach\n```\n\n### Blog/Writing\n- Technical deep dives\n- Problem-solving stories\n- Learning journeys\n- Shows communication skills\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Template Portfolio\n\n**Why bad**: Looks like everyone else.\nNo memorable impression.\nDoesn''t show creativity.\nEasy to forget.\n\n**Instead**: Add personal touches.\nCustom design elements.\nUnique project presentations.\nYour voice in the copy.\n\n### ❌ All Style No Substance\n\n**Why bad**: Fancy animations, weak projects.\nStyle over substance.\nHiring managers see through it.\nNo proof of skills.\n\n**Instead**: Projects first, style second.\nReal work with real impact.\nQuality over quantity.\nDepth over breadth.\n\n### ❌ Resume Website\n\n**Why bad**: Boring, forgettable.\nDoesn''t use the medium.\nNo personality.\nLists instead of stories.\n\n**Instead**: Show, don''t tell.\nVisual case studies.\nInteractive elements.\nPersonality throughout.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Portfolio more complex than your actual work | medium | ## Right-Sizing Your Portfolio |\n| Portfolio looks great on desktop, broken on mobile | high | ## Mobile-First Portfolio |\n| Visitors don''t know what to do next | medium | ## Portfolio CTAs |\n| Portfolio shows old or irrelevant work | medium | ## Portfolio Freshness |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `scroll-experience`, `3d-web-experience`, `landing-page-design`, `personal-branding`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:27:12.665Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing advanced portfolio design and personal branding capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级portfolio设计和个人品牌推广功能的UI/UX代理","ja":"UI/UXエージェントが高度なポートフォリオデザインとパーソナルブランディング機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 포트폴리오 디자인 및 개인 브랜드 구축 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan un diseño de portafolio avanzado y capacidades de marca personal.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin d''un design de portefeuille avancé et de capacités de marque personnelle.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die ein fortschrittliches Portfolio-Design und persönliche Markenfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI/UX que precisam de design de portfólio avançado e capacidades de marca pessoal.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности дизайна портфолио и личного брендинга.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء UI/UX الذين يحتاجون إلى تصميم محفظة متقدم وقدرات علامة تجارية شخصية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling portfolio architectures, leveraging interactive case studies and project showcase design, while ensuring seamless contact conversion using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript protocols.","zh":"赋予代理商创建令人信服的portfolio架构的能力，利用交互式案例研究和项目展示设计，同时确保使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript协议实现无缝的联系转换","ja":"エージェントが魅力的なポートフォリオアーキテクチャを作成できるようにし、インタラクティブなケーススタディやプロジェクト展示デザインを利用し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptのプロトコルを使用してスムーズなコンタクト転換を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 매력적인 포트폴리오 아키텍처를 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 대화형 사례 연구와 프로젝트展示 디자인을 활용하고, HTML, CSS 및 자바스크립트 프로토콜을 사용하여 무결점의 연락처 전환을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear arquitecturas de portafolio convincentes, aprovechando estudios de caso interactivos y diseño de exhibición de proyectos, al mismo tiempo que garantiza una conversión de contacto sin problemas utilizando protocolos HTML, CSS y JavaScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des architectures de portefeuille convaincantes, en exploitant des études de cas interactives et la conception de l''exposition de projets, tout en assurant une conversion de contact sans problème à l''aide de protocoles HTML, CSS et JavaScript.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, überzeugende Portfolio-Architekturen zu entwerfen, indem sie interaktive Fallstudien und Projekt-Showcase-Design nutzen und gleichzeitig eine nahtlose Kontakt-Konvertierung unter Verwendung von HTML-, CSS- und JavaScript-Protokollen sicherstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem arquiteturas de portfólio convincentes, utilizando estudos de caso interativos e design de apresentação de projetos, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a conversão de contato sem problemas usando protocolos HTML, CSS e JavaScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать убедительные архитектуры портфолио, используя интерактивные кейсы и дизайн демонстрации проектов, обеспечивая при этом бесшовное преобразование контактов с использованием протоколов HTML, CSS и JavaScript.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء هياكل محفظة مقنعة، باستخدام دراسات الحالة التفاعلية وتصميم عرض المشروع، مع ضمان تحويل الاتصال بدون مشاكل باستخدام بروتوكولات HTML و CSS و JavaScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing interactive case studies for developer portfolios","Creating personalized branding materials for designers","Optimizing portfolio layouts for improved conversion rates"],"zh":["为开发人员portfolio设计交互式案例研究","为设计师创建个性化品牌材料","优化portfolio布局以提高转换率"],"ja":["開発者ポートフォリオのインタラクティブなケーススタディの設計","デザイナー向けのパーソナライズされたブランディング資料の作成","ポートフォリオレイアウトの最適化によるコンバージョン率の向上"],"ko":["개발자 포트폴리오를 위한 대화형 사례 연구 설계","디자이너를 위한 개인화된 브랜드 자료 생성","포트폴리오 레이아웃 최적화를 통한 전환률 향상"],"es":["Diseñar estudios de caso interactivos para portafolios de desarrolladores","Crear materiales de marca personalizados para diseñadores","Optimizar diseños de portafolio para mejorar las tasas de conversión"],"fr":["Concevoir des études de cas interactives pour les portefeuilles de développeurs","Créer des matériaux de marque personnalisés pour les designers","Optimiser les conceptions de portefeuille pour améliorer les taux de conversion"],"de":["Interaktive Fallstudien für Entwicklerportfolios entwerfen","Persönliche Markenmaterialien für Designer erstellen","Portfolio-Layouts optimieren, um die Konvertierungsrate zu verbessern"],"pt":["Projeto de estudos de caso interativos para portfólios de desenvolvedores","Criação de materiais de marca personalizados para designers","Otimização de layouts de portfólio para taxas de conversão aprimoradas"],"ru":["Разработка интерактивных кейсов для портфолио разработчиков","Создание индивидуальных брендинговых материалов для дизайнеров","Оптимизация макетов портфолио для улучшения коэффициентов конверсии"],"ar":["تصميم دراسات الحالة التفاعلية لمحفظة المطورين","إنشاء مواد علامة تجارية مخصصة للمصممين","تحسين تخطيطات المحفظة لتحسين معدلات التحويل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design and development expertise","Limited to web-based portfolio platforms"],"zh":["需要设计和开发专业知识","仅限于基于web的portfolio平台"],"ja":["デザインおよび開発の専門知識が必要","ウェブベースのポートフォリオプラットフォームのみに限定"],"ko":["디자인 및 개발 전문 지식이 필요","웹 기반 포트폴리오 플랫폼에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en diseño y desarrollo","Limitado a plataformas de portafolio basadas en web"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en conception et développement","Limité aux plateformes de portefeuille basées sur le web"],"de":["Benötigt Design- und Entwicklungsexpertise","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Portfolio-Plattformen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento em design e desenvolvimento","Limitado a plataformas de portfólio baseadas na web"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области дизайна и разработки","Ограничен платформами портфолио на основе веба"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة في التصميم والتنمية","محدود منصات المحفظة القائمة على الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra/context-loader', 'community', 'DeL-TaiseiOzaki', 'claude-code-orchestra', 'DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra', 'context-loader', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z', '2026-02-18T06:27:36.409Z', NULL, '{"id":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra/context-loader","name":"context-loader","description":{"zh":"Context Loader 技能用于加载共享项目上下文，确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识","ja":"コンテキストローダースキルは、共有プロジェクトコンテキストを読み込んで、Codex CLI と Claude Code が同じ知識を持つことを保証します","ko":"컨텍스트 로더 스킬은 공유 프로젝트 콘텍스트를 로드하여 Codex CLI와 Claude Code가 동일한 지식을 공유하도록 합니다","es":"La habilidad de cargador de contexto carga el contexto del proyecto desde el directorio `.claude/` para asegurar que Codex CLI tenga el mismo conocimiento que Claude Code.","fr":"La compétence de chargement de contexte charge le contexte du projet depuis le répertoire `.claude/` pour garantir que Codex CLI ait les mêmes connaissances que Claude Code.","de":"Die Fähigkeit des Context-Loaders lädt den Projekt-Kontext aus dem Verzeichnis `.claude/`, um sicherzustellen, dass Codex CLI das gleiche Wissen wie Claude Code besitzt.","pt":"O Carregador de Contexto é uma habilidade que carrega o contexto do projeto para garantir a consistência do conhecimento entre o Codex CLI e o Claude Code.","ru":"Контекстный Загрузчик - это навык, который загружает контекст проекта для обеспечения согласованности знаний между Codex CLI и Claude Code.","ar":"مُحَمِّل السياق هو مهارة تقوم بتحميل سياق المشروع لضمان الاتساق في المعرفة بين Codex CLI و Claude Code.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Context Loader 技能","ja":"コンテキストローダースキル","ko":"컨텍스트 로더 스킬","es":"Cargador de contexto: habilidad para desarrolladores","fr":"Chargement de contexte : compétence pour les développeurs","de":"Context-Loader: Fähigkeit für Entwickler","pt":"Carregador de Contexto: Otimização de Projetos","ru":"Контекстный Загрузчик: Оптимизация Проектов","ar":"مُحَمِّل السياق: تحسين المشاريع","en":"context-loader"},"description":{"zh":"Context Loader 技能用于加载共享项目上下文，确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识","ja":"コンテキストローダースキルは、共有プロジェクトコンテキストを読み込んで、Codex CLI と Claude Code が同じ知識を持つことを保証します","ko":"컨텍스트 로더 스킬은 공유 프로젝트 콘텍스트를 로드하여 Codex CLI와 Claude Code가 동일한 지식을 공유하도록 합니다","es":"La habilidad de cargador de contexto carga el contexto del proyecto desde el directorio `.claude/` para asegurar que Codex CLI tenga el mismo conocimiento qu...","fr":"La compétence de chargement de contexte charge le contexte du projet depuis le répertoire `.claude/` pour garantir que Codex CLI ait les mêmes connaissances ...","de":"Die Fähigkeit des Context-Loaders lädt den Projekt-Kontext aus dem Verzeichnis `.claude/`, um sicherzustellen, dass Codex CLI das gleiche Wissen wie Claude C...","pt":"O Carregador de Contexto é uma habilidade que carrega o contexto do projeto para garantir a consistência do conhecimento entre o Codex CLI e o Claude Code.","ru":"Контекстный Загрузчик - это навык, который загружает контекст проекта для обеспечения согласованности знаний между Codex CLI и Claude Code.","ar":"مُحَمِّل السياق هو مهارة تقوم بتحميل سياق المشروع لضمان الاتساق في المعرفة بين Codex CLI و Claude Code.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["加载共享项目上下文","确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识","在每个任务开始时运行","读取 `.claude/rules/` 目录中的文件","支持多种编码规则和开发环境"],"ja":["共有プロジェクトコンテキストを読み込む","Codex CLI と Claude Code が同じ知識を持つことを保証する","各タスク開始時に実行する","`.claude/rules/` ディレクトリ内のファイルを読み込む","複数のコーディングルールと開発環境をサポートする"],"ko":["공유 프로젝트 콘텍스트를 로드한다","Codex CLI와 Claude Code가 동일한 지식을 공유하도록 한다","각 작업 시작 시 실행한다","`.claude/rules/` 디렉토리 내의 파일을 읽는다","여러 가지 코딩 규칙과 개발 환경을 지원한다"],"es":["Carga del contexto del proyecto desde `.claude/`","Garantiza la coherencia en Codex CLI","Lee los archivos de reglas en `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilidad con Codex CLI y Claude Code","Se ejecuta al principio de cada tarea"],"fr":["