сть знаний","codex cli","claude code","правила кодирования","конфигурация проекта","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مُحَمِّل السياق","تحسين المشاريع","الاتساق في المعرفة","codex cli","claude code","قواعد البرمجة","تهيئة المشروع","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki","repo":"claude-code-orchestra","repoPath":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-loader","description":"ALWAYS activate this skill at the start of every task. Load project context from .claude/ directory including coding rules, design decisions, and documentation before executing any task.","bodyPreview":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements","body":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements\n├── language.md            # Think in English, respond in Japanese\n├── security.md            # Secrets, validation, SQLi/XSS prevention\n├── testing.md             # TDD, AAA pattern, 80% coverage\n└── codex-delegation.md    # (skip - not relevant for Codex itself)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Load Design Documentation\n\nRead `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` for:\n- Architecture decisions\n- Implementation patterns\n- Library choices and constraints\n- TODO items and open questions\n\n### Step 3: Check Library Documentation\n\nIf the task involves specific libraries, read relevant files from:\n```\n.claude/docs/libraries/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Task\n\nWith the loaded context, execute the requested task following:\n- Coding principles from rules\n- Design decisions from DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from docs\n\n## Key Rules to Remember\n\nAfter loading, always follow these principles:\n\n1. **Simplicity first** - Choose readable code over complex\n2. **Single responsibility** - One function/class does one thing\n3. **Type hints required** - All functions need annotations\n4. **Use uv** - Never use pip directly\n5. **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, validate input, parameterize SQL\n\n## Language Protocol\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: English (variables, functions, comments)\n- **User communication**: Japanese (when reporting back through Claude Code)\n\n## Output\n\nAfter loading context, briefly confirm:\n- Rules loaded\n- Design document status\n- Ready to execute task\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:27:36.409Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Codex CLI Agents needing shared project context synchronization with Claude Code","zh":"非常适合需要与 Claude Code 共享项目上下文同步的 Codex CLI 代理","ja":"Claude Code と共有プロジェクトコンテキストを同期する必要がある Codex CLI エージェントに最適","ko":"Claude Code 와 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 동기화해야 하는 Codex CLI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI de Codex que necesitan sincronización de contexto de proyecto compartido con Claude Code","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI Codex nécessitant une synchronisation de contexte de projet partagé avec Claude Code","de":"Perfekt für Codex-CLI-Agents, die eine gemeinsame Projekt-Kontextsynchronisierung mit Claude Code benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes CLI Codex que necessitam de sincronização de contexto de projeto compartilhado com Claude Code","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Codex CLI, которым требуется синхронизация общего контекста проекта с Claude Code","ar":"مثالي لعميل كودكس CLI الذي يحتاج إلى مزامنة سياق المشروع المشترك مع كلود كود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load shared project context from .claude/ directory, ensuring consistency with Claude Code''s knowledge by reading files such as coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md","zh":"赋予代理从 .claude/ 目录加载共享项目上下文的能力，通过读取 coding-principles.md 和 dev-environment.md 等文件，确保与 Claude Code 的知识一致","ja":"エージェントが .claude/ ディレクトリから共有プロジェクトコンテキストを読み込む機能を提供し、coding-principles.md や dev-environment.md などのファイルを読み取ることで、Claude Code の知識と一致性を保つ","ko":"에이전트가 .claude/ 디렉토리에서 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로드할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 coding-principles.md 및 dev-environment.md와 같은 파일을 읽어 Claude Code의 지식과 일치함을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar el contexto de proyecto compartido desde el directorio .claude/, garantizando la consistencia con el conocimiento de Claude Code al leer archivos como coding-principles.md y dev-environment.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger le contexte de projet partagé à partir du répertoire .claude/, en garantissant la cohérence avec la base de connaissances de Claude Code en lisant des fichiers tels que coding-principles.md et dev-environment.md","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, den gemeinsamen Projekt-Kontext aus dem Verzeichnis .claude/ zu laden, und stellt so die Konsistenz mit dem Wissensstand von Claude Code sicher, indem Dateien wie coding-principles.md und dev-environment.md gelesen werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a carregar o contexto de projeto compartilhado a partir do diretório .claude/, garantindo a consistência com o conhecimento do Claude Code, lendo arquivos como coding-principles.md e dev-environment.md","ru":"Позволяет агентам загружать общий контекст проекта из директории .claude/, обеспечивая согласованность с