,"es":["Validación del comportamiento de la puerta de enlace","Regeneración de la API de OpenAPI","Detección de errores de integración","Sincronización de la API","Compatibilidad con substrato","Soporte para múltiples idiomas"],"fr":["Validation du comportement de la passerelle","Régénération de l''API OpenAPI","Détection des erreurs d''intégration","Synchronisation de l''API","Compatibilité avec le substrat","Support pour plusieurs langues"],"de":["Überprüfung des Verhaltens der Gateways","Regenerierung der OpenAPI","Erkennung von Integrationsfehlern","Synchronisierung der API","Kompatibilität mit Substrat","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen"],"pt":["Validação do comportamento do gateway","Regeneração da OpenAPI a partir da fonte de verdade","Prevenção de problemas de integração","Manutenção da consistência da API","Suporte à atualização da API","Integração com o ecossistema ICN"],"ru":["Валидация поведения шлюза","Регенерация OpenAPI из источника истины","Предотвращение проблем интеграции","Поддержание согласованности API","Поддержка обновления API","Интеграция с экосистемой ICN"],"ar":["التحقق من سلوك البوابة","إعادة إنشاء واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المفتوحة من مصدر الحقيقة","منع مشاكل التكامل","الحفاظ على اتساق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم تحديث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التكامل مع نظام البوابة ICN"]},"keywords":{"zh":["icn-gateway-openapi-sync","OpenAPI","substrate","API同步","一致性","自动同步"],"ja":["icn-gateway-openapi-sync","OpenAPI","substrate","API同期","一貫性","自動同期"],"ko":["icn-gateway-openapi-sync","OpenAPI","substrate","API 동기화","일관성","자동 동기화"],"es":["sincronización de API","ICN Gateway OpenAPI","integración de API","validación de API","regeneración de API","substrato","desarrollo de software","API de OpenAPI"],"fr":["synchronisation de l''API","ICN Gateway OpenAPI","intégration de l''API","validation de l''API","régénération de l''API","substrat","développement de logiciels","API OpenAPI"],"de":["API-Synchronisierung","ICN-Gateway-OpenAPI","API-Integration","API-Validierung","API-Regenerierung","Substrat","Software-Entwicklung","OpenAPI"],"pt":["sincronização OpenAPI","gateway ICN","integração de API","manutenção da API","ecossistema ICN","desenvolvimento de software","API drift","problemas de integração"],"ru":["синхронизация OpenAPI","шлюз ICN","интеграция API","поддержание API","экосистема ICN","разработка программного обеспечения","API дрейф","проблемы интеграции"],"ar":["مزامنة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المفتوحة","بوابة ICN","تكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","صيانة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","نظام البوابة ICN","تطوير البرمجيات","انزلاق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","مشاكل التكامل"]}},"owner":"InterCooperative-Network","repo":"icn","repoPath":"InterCooperative-Network/icn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"icn-gateway-openapi-sync","description":"Keep ICN gateway API behavior, exported OpenAPI spec, and generated TypeScript SDK types in sync. Use when modifying icn-gateway routes, request/response models, auth behavior, or any API shape that can cause OpenAPI/SDK drift.","bodyPreview":"# ICN Gateway OpenAPI Sync\n\nTreat API drift as a blocking integration defect.\n\n## Trigger Conditions\n\nUse this skill when changes touch:\n- `icn/crates/icn-gateway/**`\n- shared API models consumed by gateway endpoints\n- auth/scopes/status codes that affect endpoint contracts\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Validate gateway behavior.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage\n```\n\n2. Regenerate OpenAPI from source of truth.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo build -p icnctl\n./target/debug/icnctl api expo","body":"# ICN Gateway OpenAPI Sync\n\nTreat API drift as a blocking integration defect.\n\n## Trigger Conditions\n\nUse this skill when changes touch:\n- `icn/crates/icn-gateway/**`\n- shared API models consumed by gateway endpoints\n- auth/scopes/status codes that affect endpoint contracts\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Validate gateway behavior.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo test -p icn-gateway --features sled-storage\n```\n\n2. Regenerate OpenAPI from source of truth.\n```bash\ncd icn\ncargo build -p icnctl\n./target/debug/icnctl api export-openapi -o ../docs/api/openapi.generated.yaml\n```\n\n3. Regenerate TypeScript types.\n```bash\ncd sdk/typescript\nnpm ci\nnpm run generate-types\nnpm run check-types\nnpm run build\nnpm test\nnpm run lint\n```\n\n4. Confirm drift status.\n```bash\ngit status --short docs/api/openapi.generated.yaml sdk/typescript\n```\n- If generated artifacts changed, include them in the same PR.\n- If artifacts did not change, state that explicitly.\n\n5. Validate docs alignment.\n- Update docs for changed semantics or response behavior.\n- Ensure auth gating semantics match implementation.\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Do not hand-edit generated OpenAPI/types.\n- Do not hide API changes by skipping regeneration.\n- Keep error/status semantics explicit and documented.\n\n## Output Contract\n\nReturn:\n1. whether gateway API surface changed,\n2. generated files changed or unchanged,\n3. commands run with pass/fail outcome,\n4. follow-up docs/spec tasks if any.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:27:57.161Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing automated OpenAPI synchronization and constraint engine management.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化OpenAPI同步和约束引擎管理的基于Rust的AI代理。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが自動OpenAPI同期と制約エンジン管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 OpenAPI 동기화 및 제약 엔진 관리가 필요한 러스트 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Rust que necesitan una sincronización automática de OpenAPI y una gestión del motor de restricciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Rust nécessitant une synchronisation automatique d''OpenAPI et une gestion du moteur de contraintes.","de":"Perfekt für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte OpenAPI-Synchronisierung und eine Constraint-Engine-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que precisam de sincronização automática da OpenAPI e gerenciamento do mecanismo de restrição.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, требующих автоматической синхронизации OpenAPI и управления механизмом ограничений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى روست التي تحتاج إلى تنسيق.OpenAPI وتشغيل محرك القيود التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce generic constraints and validate gateway behavior using Cargo and the icn-gateway daemon, ensuring seamless integration with shared API models and auth/scopes/status codes through OpenAPI regeneration and synchronization.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行通用约束和使用Cargo以及icn-gateway守护进程验证网关行为的能力，确保与共享API模型和身份验证/范围/状态代码通过OpenAPI重新生成和同步实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがCargoおよびicn-gatewayデーモンを使用して汎用の制約を強制し、ゲートウェイの動作を検証する能力を提供し、OpenAPIの再生成と同期を通じて共有APIモデルおよび認証/スコープ/ステータスコードとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 카고 및 icn-gateway 데몬을 사용하여 일반 제약을 강제하고 게이트웨이 동작을 검증할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여, OpenAPI의 재생성 및 동기화를 통해 공유 API 모델 및 인증/범위/상태 코드와의无缝한 통합을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar restricciones genéricas y a validar el comportamiento de la puerta de enlace utilizando Cargo y el daemon icn-gateway, garantizando una integración fluida con modelos de API compartidos y códigos de estado de autenticación/ámbitos a través de la regeneración y sincronización de OpenAPI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des contraintes génériques et de valider le comportement de la passerelle en utilisant Cargo et le démon icn-gateway, assurant une intégration transparente avec des modèles d''API partagés et des codes d''état d''authentification/étendues à travers la régénération et la synchronisation d''OpenAPI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, generische Constraints durchzusetzen und das Gateway-Verhalten mit Cargo und dem icn-gateway-Daemon zu validieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit gemeinsam genutzten API-Modellen und Auth/Bereich/Statuscodes durch OpenAPI-Regeneration und -Synchronisierung sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor restrições genéricas e validar o comportamento do gateway usando Cargo e o daemon icn-gateway, garantindo uma integração perfeita com modelos de API compartilhados e códigos de status/auth/scopes por meio da regeneração e sincronização da OpenAPI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать.generic ограничения и проверять поведение шлюза с помощью Cargo и демона icn-gateway, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с общими моделями API и кодами состояния/авторизации/объемов через регенерацию и синхронизацию OpenAPI.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض قيود عامة وتحقق سلوك البوابة باستخدام Cargo و daemon icn-gateway، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع نماذج API المشتركة ورموز الحالة / المصادقة / النطاقات من خلال إعادة إنشاء OpenAPI وتنسيقها."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating gateway behavior through automated testing with Cargo","Regenerating OpenAPI specifications from source of truth using icnctl","Enforcing constraints on shared API models and endpoint contracts"],"zh":["通过使用Cargo进行自动化测试来验证网关行为","使用icnctl从事实来源重新生成OpenAPI规范","在共享API模型和端点合同上强制执行约束"],"ja":["Cargoを使用した自動テストを通じてゲートウェイの動作を検証する","icnctlを使用して事実のソースからOpenAPI仕様を再生成する","共有APIモデルおよびエンドポイント契約に制約を強制する"],"ko":["카고를 사용한 자동 테스트를 통해 게이트웨이 동작을 검증","icnctl을 사용하여 진실의 원천에서 OpenAPI 명세를 재생성","공유 API 모델 및 엔드ポイント 계약에 제약을 강제"],"es":["Validar el comportamiento de la puerta de enlace a través de pruebas automatizadas con Cargo","Regenerar especificaciones de OpenAPI desde la fuente de la verdad utilizando icnctl","Aplicar restricciones en modelos de API compartidos y contratos de puntos de conexión"],"fr":["Valider le comportement de la passerelle grâce à des tests automatisés avec Cargo","Régénérer les spécifications d''OpenAPI à partir de la source de vérité en utilisant icnctl","Appliquer des contraintes sur les modèles d''API partagés et les contrats de points de terminaison"],"de":["Validieren des Gateway-Verhaltens durch automatisierte Tests mit Cargo","Regenerieren von OpenAPI-Spezifikationen aus der Quelle der Wahrh