提供块创建、更新和管理功能","ja":"WordPress ブロック開発プラグインは動物シェルター向けのブロック作成、更新、管理機能を提供する","ko":"워드프레스 블록 개발 플러그인은 동물 보호소용 블록 생성, 업데이트, 관리 기능을 제공합니다","es":"El desarrollo de bloques de WordPress es una habilidad fundamental para crear sitios web personalizados y funcionales. Nuestro plugin de refugio de animales ...","fr":"Le développement de blocs WordPress est une compétence essentielle pour créer des sites web personnalisés et fonctionnels. Notre plugin de refuge pour animau...","de":"Die Entwicklung von WordPress-Blöcken ist eine grundlegende Fähigkeit, um individuelle und funktionsreiche Websites zu erstellen. Unser Tierheim-Plugin nutzt...","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é essencial para criar um plugin de abrigo de animais personalizado e eficaz","ru":"Разработка блоков WP необходима для создания настраиваемого и эффективного плагина приюта животных","ar":"يعتبر تطوير كتلة WP ضروريًا لإنشاء ملحق مخصص وفعال لملجأ الحيوانات","en":"WordPress plugin for Animal Shelter"},"definition":{"en":"WordPress plugin for Animal Shelter"},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新块","管理块属性和支持","动态渲染和渲染回调","块弃用和迁移","构建工具集成"],"ja":["ブロックの作成と更新","ブロック属性とサポートの管理","動的レンダリングとレンダリングコールバック","ブロックの廃止と移行","ビルドツールの統合"],"ko":["블록 생성 및 업데이트","블록 속성 및 지원 관리","동적 렌더링 및 렌더링 콜백","블록 폐기 및 마이그레이션","빌드 도구 통합"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques","Actualización de bloques existentes","Edición de archivos block.json","Implementación de renderizado dinámico","Uso de herramientas de creación de bloques como @wordpress/scripts","Compatibilidad con versiones obsoletas de bloques"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs","Mise à jour de blocs existants","Édition de fichiers block.json","Mise en œuvre de rendu dynamique","Utilisation d''outils de création de blocs tels que @wordpress/scripts","Compatibilité avec les versions obsolètes de blocs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke","Aktualisierung bestehender Blöcke","Bearbeitung von block.json-Dateien","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendering","Verwendung von Block-Erstellungstools wie @wordpress/scripts","Kompatibilität mit veralteten Blockversionen"],"pt":["Criação de novos blocos","Atualização de blocos existentes","Alteração de scripts e estilos","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Depreciação e migração de blocos","Ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Изменение скриптов и стилей","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Устаревание и миграция блоков","Инструменты сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تغيير البرامج النصية والأسلوب","إضافة العرض الديناميكي","الاعتراف بالكتل والهجرة","أدوات البناء للكتلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress 块开发","动物收容所","块创建","块更新","动态渲染","块弃用","构建工具"],"ja":["WordPress ブロック開発","動物シェルター","ブロック作成","ブロック更新","動的レンダリング","ブロック廃止","ビルドツール"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 개발","동물 보호소","블록 생성","블록 업데이트","동적 렌더링","블록 폐기","빌드 도구"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques de WordPress","plugin de refugio de animales","block.json","renderizado dinámico","herramientas de creación de bloques","versiones obsoletas de bloques","personalización de sitios web","componentes reutilizables"],"fr":["développement de blocs WordPress","plugin de refuge pour animaux","block.json","rendu dynamique","outils de création de blocs","versions obsolètes de blocs","personnalisation de sites web","composants réutilisables"],"de":["WordPress-Block-Entwicklung","Tierheim-Plugin","block.json","dynamisches Rendering","Block-Erstellungstools","veraltete Blockversionen","Anpassung von Websites","wiederverwendbare Komponenten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","plugin de abrigo de animais","wordpress","blocos personalizados","renderização dinâmica","ferramentas de build","depreciação de blocos","migração de blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","плагин приюта животных","wordpress","настраиваемые блоки","динамическая отрисовка","инструменты сборки","устаревание блоков","миграция блоков"],"ar":["تطوير كتلة wp","ملحق ملجأ الحيوانات","ووردبريس","كتلة مخصصة","العرض الديناميكي","أدوات البناء","الاعتراف بالكتلة","هجرة الكتلة"]}},"owner":"WPdoaction","repo":"animal-shelter","repoPath":"WPdoaction/animal-shelter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:28:01.194Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress Development Agents needing advanced block customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级块自定义功能的WordPress开发代理。","ja":"WordPress開発エージェントが高度なブロックカスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 블록 사용자 지정 기능이 필요한 워드프레스 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de WordPress que necesitan capacidades de personalización de bloques avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement WordPress ayant besoin de capacités de personnalisation de blocs avancées.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Blockanpassungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento do WordPress que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de personalização de blocos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки WordPress, которым необходимы расширенные возможности настройки блоков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير ووردبريس الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تخصيص كتلة متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and update WordPress blocks with dynamic rendering using render.php and render_callback, while leveraging build tooling like @wordpress/scripts and @wordpress/create-block.","zh":"赋予代理创建和更新WordPress块的能力，使用render.php和render_callback进行动态渲染，同时利用构建工具，如@wordpress/scripts和@wordpress/create-block。","ja":"エージェントがWordPressブロックを作成および更新できるようにすることで、render.phpおよびrender_callbackを使用した動的レンダリングを可能にし、同時に@wordpress/scriptsおよび@wordpress/create-blockなどのビルドツールを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 워드프레스 블록을 만들고 업데이트할 수 있도록 하여 render.php 및 render_callback를 사용한 동적 렌더링을 가능하게 하며,同時に @wordpress/scripts 및 @wordpress/create-block 등의 빌드 툴을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y actualizar bloques de WordPress con representación dinámica utilizando render.php y render_callback, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha herramientas de compilación como @wordpress/scripts y @wordpress/create-block.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de mettre à jour des blocs WordPress avec un rendu dynamique en utilisant render.php et render_callback, tout en exploitant les outils de construction tels que @wordpress/scripts et @wordpress/create-block.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, WordPress-Blöcke mit dynamischer Darstellung zu erstellen und zu aktualisieren, indem render.php und render_callback verwendet werden, während gleichzeitig Build-Tools wie @wordpress/scripts und @wordpress/create-block genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e atualizar blocos do WordPress com renderização dinâmica usando render.php e render_callback, aproveitando ferramentas de compilação como @wordpress/scripts e @wordpress/create-block.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и обновлять блоки WordPress с динамической отрисовкой, используя render.php и render_callback, а также использовать инструменты сборки, такие как @wordpress/scripts и @wordpress/create-block.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وتحديث كتل ووردبريس مع تقديم ديناميكي باستخدام render.php و render_callback ، مع الاستفادة من أدوات البناء مثل @wordpress/scripts و @wordpress/create-block."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new blocks with custom attributes and supports","Updating existing blocks with deprecated versions and migrations","Debugging block invalidation and attribute persistence issues"],"zh":["使用自定义属性和支持创建新的块","使用过时版本和迁移更新现有的块","调试块失效和属性持久性问题"],"ja":["カスタム属性とサポートを使用して新しいブロックを作成する","非推奨バージョンと移行を使用して既存のブロックを更新する","ブロックの無効化と属性の永続性に関する問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 지정 속성 및 지원을 사용하여 새로운 블록을 생성하는 것","구 버전 및 마이그레이션을 사용하여 기존 블록을 업데이트하는 것","블록 무효화 및 속성 영속성 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques con atributos personalizados y compatibilidades","Actualización de bloques existentes con versiones obsoletas y migraciones","Depuración de problemas de invalidación de bloques y persistencia de atributos"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs avec des attributs personnalisés et des supports","Mise à jour de blocs existants avec des versions obsolètes et des migrations","Débogage des problèmes d''invalidation de blocs et de persistance d''attributs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke mit benutzerdefinierten Attributen und Unterstützungen","Aktualisierung bestehender Blöcke mit veralteten Versionen und Migrationen","Fehlerbehebung bei Block-Invalidierungs- und Attributpersistenzproblemen"],"pt":["Criar novos blocos com atributos personalizados e suportes","Atualizar blocos existentes com versões obsoletas e migrações","Depurar problemas de invalidação de blocos e persistência de atributos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков с пользовательскими атрибутами и поддержкой","Обновление существующих блоков с устаревшими версиями и миграциями","Отладка проблем с недействительностью блоков и сохранением атрибутов"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة مع سمات مخصصة ودعم","تحديث كتل موجودة مع إصدارات قديمة وترحيل","تصحيح أخطاء في إلغاء صلاحية الكتل واستمرار السمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment","Familiarity with block.json configuration and WordPress scripts"],"zh":["需要WordPress环境","需要对block.json配置和WordPress脚本的熟悉"],"ja":["WordPress環境が必要","block.json構成およびWordPressスクリプトに関する知識が必要"],"ko":["워드프레스 환경이 필요","block.json 구성 및 워드프레스 스크립트에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de WordPress","Conocimiento de la configuración de block.json y los scripts de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress","Connaissance de la configuration de block.json et des scripts WordPress"],"de":["Benötigt eine WordPress-Umgebung","Vertrautheit mit der block.json-Konfiguration und den WordPress-Skripten"],"pt":["Exige ambiente do WordPress","Familiaridade com configuração block.json e scripts do WordPress"],"ru":["Требует среды WordPress","Знакомство с конфигурацией block.json и скриптами WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس","إلمام بتكوين block.json وبرامج ووردبريس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
