von Benutzeroberflächenelementen","Automatisierung der Benutzeroberfläche über Identifikatoren oder natürliche Sprache","Programmatische Steuerung von macOS-Anwendungen","Interaktion mit Benutzeroberflächenelementen über Zugriffs-APIs","Automatisierung von Aufgaben unter macOS","Unterstützung für die macOS-Kommandozeile"],"pt":["Captura de telas com anotações de elementos da UI","Automação de UI com cliques, digitação e rolagem","Controle de aplicações macOS por meio de APIs de acessibilidade","Interacao com elementos da UI por identificador ou linguagem natural","Suporte a automação de tarefas em macOS"],"ru":["Захват экранов с аннотациями элементов UI","Автоматизация UI с помощью кликов, набора текста и прокрутки","Контроль приложений macOS через APIs доступности","Взаимодействие с элементами UI по идентификатору или естественному языку","Поддержка автоматизации задач в macOS"],"ar":["التقاط الشاشات مع التعليقات على عناصر الواجهة","أتمتة الواجهة مع النقرات والكتابة والتمرير","التحكم في تطبيقات ماكوس من خلال واجهات برمجة التطبيقات للوصول","التفاعل مع عناصر الواجهة بواسطة معرف أو لغة طبيعية","دعم أتمتة المهام في ماكوس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["macOS CLI工具","屏幕截图捕获","UI自动化","macOS应用自动化","Accessibility API","自动化测试"],"ja":["macOS CLIツール","スクリーンショットのキャプチャ","UI自動化","macOSアプリケーションの自動化","Accessibility API","自動テスト"],"ko":["macOS CLI 도구","스크린샷 캡처","UI 자동화","macOS 애플리케이션 자동화","Accessibility API","자동화 테스트"],"es":["automatización de macOS","agentes de IA","herramienta de línea de comandos","captura de pantalla","automatización de la interfaz de usuario","accesibilidad APIs","control programático","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["automatisation macOS","agents IA","outil en ligne de commande","capture d''écran","automatisation de l''interface utilisateur","API d''accessibilité","contrôle programmatique","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["macOS-Automatisierung","KI-Agents","CLI-Tool","Bildschirmaufnahme","Benutzeroberflächenautomatisierung","Zugriffs-APIs","programmatische Steuerung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Peekaboo","CLI","macOS","automação de UI","captura de telas","acessibilidade","APIs de acessibilidade","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Peekaboo","CLI","macOS","автоматизация UI","захват экранов","доступность","APIs доступности","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["بيكابو","سطر الأوامر","ماكوس","أتمتة الواجهة","التقاط الشاشات","الوصول","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات للوصول","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"diegopetrucci","repo":"codex-skills","repoPath":"diegopetrucci/codex-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"peekaboo","description":"macOS UI automation and screenshot capture tool. Use when working with macOS applications and needing to: (1) Capture screenshots with UI element annotations, (2) Automate UI interactions (clicking, typing, scrolling), (3) Control applications and windows programmatically, (4) Navigate menus and dialogs, (5) Perform visual analysis of screens, (6) Create multi-step automation workflows. Requires macOS 15.0+ with Screen Recording and Accessibility permissions.","bodyPreview":"# Peekaboo\n\nPeekaboo is a macOS CLI tool that enables AI agents to capture screenshots, interact with UI elements, and automate macOS applications through accessibility APIs.\n\n## Overview\n\nPeekaboo provides programmatic control over macOS UI through three main capabilities:\n\n1. **Screen Capture** - Capture screenshots with annotated UI elements and accessibility IDs\n2. **UI Automation** - Click, type, scroll, and interact with UI elements by identifier or natural language\n3. **Application Contro","body":"# Peekaboo\n\nPeekaboo is a macOS CLI tool that enables AI agents to capture screenshots, interact with UI elements, and automate macOS applications through accessibility APIs.\n\n## Overview\n\nPeekaboo provides programmatic control over macOS UI through three main capabilities:\n\n1. **Screen Capture** - Capture screenshots with annotated UI elements and accessibility IDs\n2. **UI Automation** - Click, type, scroll, and interact with UI elements by identifier or natural language\n3. **Application Control** - Manage windows, applications, menus, and system dialogs\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**Installation:**\n```bash\nbrew install steipete/tap/peekaboo\n```\n\n**Required Permissions:**\n- Screen Recording permission\n- Accessibility permission\n\nCheck permissions:\n```bash\npeekaboo permissions status\npeekaboo permissions grant\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Capture Screenshot with Element Annotations\n\n```bash\n# Capture current screen with UI element IDs\npeekaboo see --mode screen\n\n# Capture specific application\npeekaboo see --app Safari\n\n# Get JSON output for programmatic use\npeekaboo see --app \"Visual Studio Code\" --json-output\n```\n\n### Click UI Elements\n\n```bash\n# Click by element text/identifier\npeekaboo click --on \"Reload this page\"\n\n# Click using snapshot ID for accuracy\npeekaboo see --app Safari --json-output > output.json\nSNAPSHOT=$(jq -r ''.data.snapshot_id'' output.json)\npeekaboo click --on \"Submit\" --snapshot \"$SNAPSHOT\"\n```\n\n### Type Text\n\n```bash\n# Type into focused element\npeekaboo type --text \"Hello World\"\n\n# Clear field first, then type\npeekaboo type --text \"user@example.com\" --clear\n\n# Type with delay between keystrokes\npeekaboo type --text \"password\" --delay-ms 50\n```\n\n### Natural Language Automation\n\n```bash\n# Use AI agent for multi-step tasks\npeekaboo agent \"Open Notes and create a TODO list with three items\"\n\n# Shorthand syntax\npeekaboo \"Take a screenshot of Safari and save to Desktop\"\n\n# Dry run to see planned steps\npeekaboo agent \"Organize Desktop files\" --dry-run\n```\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Screen Capture & Analysis\n\n**See UI Elements:**\n```bash\npeekaboo see --app Safari --retina\n```\n\nCaptures screen with accessibility annotations, returning element IDs that can be used for clicking/interaction.\n\n**Static Screenshots:**\n```bash\npeekaboo image --mode screen --path ~/Desktop/screenshot.png\npeekaboo image --mode window --retina --analyze\n```\n\nOptions: `screen`, `window`, `menu` modes with optional AI analysis.\n\n### 2. Mouse & Keyboard Automation\n\n**Click elements:**\n```bash\npeekaboo click --on \"button_id\"\npeekaboo click --on \"Submit Form\"\n```\n\n**Type text:**\n```bash\npeekaboo type --text \"Search query\"\n```\n\n**Press special keys:**\n```bash\npeekaboo press return\npeekaboo press tab --repeat 3\npeekaboo press escape\n```\n\n**Keyboard shortcuts:**\n```bash\npeekaboo hotkey cmd,s\npeekaboo hotkey cmd,shift,t\n```\n\n**Mouse movements:**\n```bash\npeekaboo move --to 500,500\npeekaboo drag --from 100,200 --to 300,400\npeekaboo scroll --direction down --ticks 5\n```\n\n### 3. Window & Application Management\n\n**Launch/quit applications:**\n```bash\npeekaboo app launch Safari\npeekaboo app quit \"Google Chrome\"\npeekaboo app switch Terminal\n```\n\n**Control windows:**\n```bash\npeekaboo window list\npeekaboo window move --x 100 --y 100\npeekaboo window resize --width 800 --height 600\npeekaboo window set-bounds --x 0 --y 0 --width 1920 --height 1080\n```\n\n**Navigate Spaces:**\n```bash\npeekaboo space list\npeekaboo space switch 2\npeekaboo space move-window 3\n```\n\n### 4. Menu & Dialog Interaction\n\n**Application menus:**\n```bash\npeekaboo menu list --app Safari\npeekaboo menu click --app Safari --path \"File > New Window\"\n```\n\n**Menu bar (status bar):**\n```bash\npeekaboo menubar list\npeekaboo menubar click \"WiFi\"\n```\n\n**Dock operations:**\n```bash\npeekaboo dock list\npeekaboo dock launch Safari\npeekaboo dock right-click Terminal\n```\n\n**System dialogs:**\n```bash\npeekaboo dialog list\npeekaboo dialog click \"OK\"\npeekaboo dialog input --text \"filename.txt\"\npeekaboo dialog file --path \"/Users/user/document.pdf\"\n```\n\n### 5. Workflow Automation\n\n**Scripted workflows:**\n```bash\npeekaboo run workflow.peekaboo.json\n```\n\nWorkflow file format:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"My Workflow\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"action\": \"launch\", \"app\": \"Safari\"},\n    {\"action\": \"type\", \"text\": \"https://example.com\"},\n    {\"action\": \"press\", \"key\": \"return\"},\n    {\"action\": \"sleep\", \"duration\": 1000}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**AI-powered automation:**\n```bash\npeekaboo agent \"Open Calculator and compute 15 * 23\"\npeekaboo agent \"Create a new document in Pages\" --model openai/gpt-5.1\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Element-Based Interaction Workflow\n\nWhen interacting with specific UI elements, use this pattern:\n\n1. Capture screen with element annotations\n2. Extract snapshot ID\n3. Use snapshot ID for accurate element targeting\n\n```bash\n# Step 1: Capture with annotations\npeekaboo see --app Safari --json-output > ui.json\n\n# Step 2: Extract snapshot\nSNAPSHOT=$(jq -r ''.data.snapshot_id'' ui.json)\n\n# Step 3: Interact with elements\npeekaboo click --on \"Reload\" --snapshot \"$SNAPSHOT\"\npeekaboo click --on \"Search\" --snapshot \"$SNAPSHOT\"\n```\n\n### Application Setup Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Launch and configure application window\npeekaboo app launch Safari\npeekaboo sleep --duration 500\npeekaboo window set-bounds --x 0 --y 0 --width 1920 --height 1080\npeekaboo sleep --duration 200\npeekaboo menu click --app Safari --path \"View > Show Toolbar\"\n```\n\n### Screenshot & Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Capture retina screenshot with AI analysis\npeekaboo image --mode screen --retina --analyze --path analysis.png\n```\n\n### Multi-Step Form Filling\n\n```bash\npeekaboo click --on \"Name field\"\npeekaboo type --text \"John Doe\" --clear\npeekaboo press tab\npeekaboo type --text \"john@example.com\"\npeekaboo press tab\npeekaboo type --text \"Message content here\"\npeekaboo click --on \"Submit\"\n```\n\n## AI Model Integration\n\nPeekaboo can use AI models for visual question answering and intelligent automation.\n\n**Supported Providers:**\n- OpenAI (gpt-5.1, gpt-4o)\n- Anthropic (claude-opus-4, claude-sonnet-4)\n- xAI (grok-4-fast)\n- Google (gemini-2.5-flash, gemini-2.5-pro)\n- Local Ollama models\n\n**Configure providers:**\n```bash\nexport PEEKABOO_AI_PROVIDERS=\"openai/gpt-5.1,anthropic/claude-opus-4\"\n\n# Or use interactive configuration\npeekaboo config add\n```\n\n## Utility Commands\n\n**List system resources:**\n```bash\npeekaboo list apps\npeekaboo list windows\npeekaboo list screens\npeekaboo list menubar\n```\n\n**Manage snapshots:**\n```bash\npeekaboo clean --all-snapshots\npeekaboo clean --older-than 7\n```\n\n**Add delays:**\n```bash\npeekaboo sleep --duration 1000  # 1 second\n```\n\n## Complete Command Reference\n\nFor detailed documentation of all commands, options, and parameters, see:\n- [CLI Reference](references/cli_reference.md) - Complete command documentation\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always check permissions first** - Run `peekaboo permissions status` before automation\n2. **Use snapshots for reliability** - Capture UI state before clicking elements for accurate targeting\n3. **Add appropriate delays** - Use `sleep` between commands to allow UI to update\n4. **Use JSON output** - When scripting, use `--json-output` for structured data parsing\n5. **Test in dry-run mode** - Use `--dry-run` with agent commands to preview automation steps\n6. **Prefer natural language** - Use `peekaboo agent` for complex multi-step tasks\n7. **Handle errors gracefully** - Check exit codes and permission status when automation fails\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Permission Issues:**\n```bash\npeekaboo permissions status\npeekaboo permissions grant\n```\n\n**Element Not Found:**\n- Capture fresh snapshot with `peekaboo see`\n- Use `--wait` option to allow UI to load\n- Try natural language description instead of exact text\n\n**Command Fails:**\n- Check application is running: `peekaboo list apps`\n- Verify window is visible: `peekaboo list windows`\n- Ensure sufficient delays between commands\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:28:47.930Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for macOS-focused AI Agents needing advanced UI automation and screenshot capabilities through accessibility APIs.","zh":"非常适合需要通过辅助API进行高级UI自动化和截图功能的macOS专注的AI代理。","ja":"macOSに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、先進的なUI自動化とスクリーンショット機能をアクセシビリティAPIを介して実行する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"macOS에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 접근성 API를 통해 고급 UI 자동화 및 스크린샷 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en macOS que necesitan una automatización de UI avanzada y capacidades de captura de pantalla a través de APIs de accesibilidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur macOS nécessitant une automation de l''interface utilisateur avancée et des capacités de capture d''écran via des API d''accessibilité.","de":"Perfekt für macOS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte UI-Automatisierung und Screenshot-Funktionen über Accessibility-APIs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em macOS que necessitam de automação de UI avançada e capacidades de captura de tela por meio de APIs de acessibilidade.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на macOS, которым необходима расширенная автоматизация UI и возможности захвата экрана через API доступности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على نظام ماك أو إس وهم بحاجة إلى توفير تلقائي متقدم للواجهة البينية وسمات لالتقاط الشاشة من خلال واجهات برمجة التطبيقات للوصول"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture annotated screenshots, interact with UI elements by identifier or natural language, and automate macOS applications through accessibility APIs, leveraging capabilities like screen capture and UI automation.","zh":"使代理能够通过辅助API捕获带注释的屏幕截图，通过标识符或自然语言与UI元素交互，并自动执行macOS应用程序，利用诸如屏幕捕获和UI自动化等功能。","ja":"エージェントがアクセシビリティAPIを介して注釈付きスクリーンショットをキャプチャし、識別子または自然言語でUI要素とやり取りし、macOSアプリケーションを自動化する機能を提供し、スクリーンキャプチャーやUI自動化などの機能を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 접근성 API를 통해 주석이 달린 스크린샷을 캡처하고 식별자 또는 자연어로 UI 요소와 상호 작용하고 macOS 애플리케이션을 자동화하며 화면 캡처 및 UI 자동화 등의 기능을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar capturas de pantalla anotadas, interactuar con elementos de la interfaz de usuario por identificador o lenguaje natural y automatizar aplicaciones de macOS a través de APIs de accesibilidad, aprovechando capacidades como la captura de pantalla y la automatización de la interfaz de usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer des captures d''écran annotées, d''interagir avec des éléments d''interface utilisateur par identifiant ou langage naturel et d''automatiser des applications macOS via des API d''accessibilité, en exploitant des capacités telles que la capture d''écran et l''automatisation de l''interface utilisateur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, annotierte Screenshots zu erfassen, mit UI-Elementen über Identifikator oder natürliche Sprache zu interagieren und macOS-Anwendungen über Accessibility-APIs zu automatisieren, indem es Fähigkeiten wie Bildschirmaufnahme und UI-Automatisierung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar telas com anotações, interagir com elementos de UI por identificador ou linguagem natural e automatizar aplicativos macOS por meio de APIs de acessibilidade, aproveitando recursos como captura de tela e automação de UI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватывать аннотированные экраны, взаимодействовать с элементами UI по идентификатору или естественному языку и автоматизировать приложения macOS через API доступности, используя возможности, такие как захват экрана и автоматизация UI.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من التقاط لقطات الشاشة المُلاحظة، والتفاعل مع عناصر الواجهة البينية من خلال المعرف أو اللغة الطبيعية، وتوفير تلقائي لتطبيقات نظام ماك أو إس من خلال واجهات برمجة التطبيقات للوصول، واستخدام سمة مثل التقاط الشاشة وتوفير تلقائي للواجهة البينية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating macOS application workflows","Capturing screenshots with annotated UI elements","Interacting with UI elements through natural language"],"zh":["自动执行macOS应用程序工作流","捕获带注释的UI元素的屏幕截图","通过自然语言与UI元素交互"],"ja":["macOSアプリケーションのワークフローを自動化する","注釈付きUI要素のスクリーンショットをキャプチャする","自然言語でUI要素とやり取りする"],"ko":["macOS 애플리케이션 워크플로 자동화","주석이 달린 UI 요소의 스크린샷 캡처","자연어로 UI 요소와 상호 작용"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de aplicaciones de macOS","Captura de screenshots con elementos de la interfaz de usuario anotados","Interacción con elementos de la interfaz de usuario a través de lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Automation des flux de travail d''applications macOS","Capture d''écran avec des éléments d''interface utilisateur annotés","Interaction avec des éléments d''interface utilisateur via langage naturel"],"de":["Automatisierung von macOS-Anwendungs-Workflows","Erfassung von Screenshots mit annotierten UI-Elementen","Interaktion mit UI-Elementen über natürliche Sprache"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de aplicativos macOS","Capturar telas com elementos de UI anotados","Interagir com elementos de UI por meio de linguagem natural"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов приложений macOS","Захват экранов с аннотированными элементами UI","Взаимодействие с элементами UI через естественный язык"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتدفقات عمل تطبيقات نظام ماك أو إس","التقاط لقطات الشاشة مع عناصر الواجهة البينية المُلاحظة","التفاعل مع عناصر الواجهة البينية من خلال اللغة الطبيعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["macOS only","Requires accessibility APIs"],"zh":["仅限macOS","需要辅助API"],"ja":["macOSのみ","アクセシビリティAPIが必要"],"ko":["macOS만 해당","접근성 API가 필요"],"es":["Solo macOS","Requiere APIs de accesibilidad"],"fr":["Uniquement macOS","Nécessite des API d''accessibilité"],"de":["Nur macOS","Benötigt Accessibility-APIs"],"pt":["Apenas macOS","Requer APIs de acessibilidade"],"ru":["Только macOS","Требует API доступности"],"ar":["نظام ماك أو إس فقط","يتطلب واجهات برمجة التطبيقات للوصول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
