 ingeniería asistida por AI que permite rastrear y actualizar tareas de implementación de manera eficiente","fr":"ito-tasks est un outil de workflow d''ingénierie assisté par IA qui permet de suivre et de mettre à jour les tâches de mise en œuvre de manière efficace","de":"ito-tasks ist ein KI-gestütztes Engineering-Workflow-Tool, das das Nachverfolgen und Aktualisieren von Implementierungsaufgaben auf effiziente Weise ermöglicht","pt":"O ito-tasks é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para gerenciar tarefas de implementação, permitindo que os desenvolvedores otimizem o fluxo de trabalho de e...","ru":"ito-tasks - это инструмент командной строки для управления задачами реализации, позволяющий разработчикам оптимизировать рабочий процесс инженерии","ar":"ito-tasks هو أداة سطر أوامر لتدبير مهام التنفيذ، مما يسمح للمطورين بتحسين سير عمل الهندسة","en":"AI Assisted Engineering Workflow Tools"},"definition":{"en":"AI Assisted Engineering Workflow Tools"},"features":{"zh":["CLI"," ","start","shelve","unshelve","add"],"ja":["CLI"," ","start","shelve","unshelve","add"],"ko":["CLI"," ","start","shelve","unshelve","add"],"es":["Rastreo y actualización de tareas de implementación","Compatibilidad con formato de tarea de checkbox","Soporte para inicio, pausa y reanudación de tareas","Comandos de línea de comandos para una mayor eficiencia","Integración con herramientas de flujo de trabajo existentes"],"fr":["Suivi et mise à jour des tâches de mise en œuvre","Compatibilité avec le format de tâche de checkbox","Prise en charge du démarrage, de la pause et de la reprise des tâches","Commandes de ligne de commande pour une plus grande efficacité","Intégration avec les outils de workflow existants"],"de":["Nachverfolgen und Aktualisieren von Implementierungsaufgaben","Unterstützung für Checkbox-Format","Unterstützung für Starten, Anhalten und Wiederaufnehmen von Aufgaben","Befehlszeilenbefehle für eine höhere Effizienz","Integration mit bestehenden Workflow-Tools"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de tarefas de implementação","Suporte a tarefas com checkbox","Comandos para iniciar, pausar e concluir tarefas","Compatibilidade com modo compat","Suporte a índices baseados em 1"],"ru":["Управление задачами реализации","Поддержка задач с checkbox","Команды для запуска, приостановки и завершения задач","Совместимость с совместимым режимом","Поддержка индексов, основанных на 1"],"ar":["تدبير مهام التنفيذ","دعم مهام مع مربع اختيار","أوامر لبدء، إيقاف واكمال مهام","التوافق مع وضع التوافق","دعم الفهارس المعتمدة على 1"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ito-tasks","AI","CLI"," "," "," ","start","shelve","unshelve","add"],"ja":["ito-tasks","AI","CLI"," "," "," ","start","shelve","unshelve","add"],"ko":["ito-tasks","AI","CLI"," "," "," ","start","shelve","unshelve","add"],"es":["herramientas de flujo de trabajo de ingeniería","ito-tasks","AI asistida","rastreo de tareas","actualización de tareas","compatibilidad con checkbox","comandos de línea de comandos"],"fr":["outils de workflow d''ingénierie","ito-tasks","IA assistée","suivi de tâches","mise à jour de tâches","compatibilité avec checkbox","commandes de ligne de commande"],"de":["Engineering-Workflow-Tools","ito-tasks","KI-gestützt","Nachverfolgen von Aufgaben","Aktualisieren von Aufgaben","Unterstützung für Checkbox","Befehlszeilenbefehle"],"pt":["ito-tasks","ferramentas de engenharia","fluxo de trabalho de engenharia","gerenciamento de tarefas","engenharia assistida por IA","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["ito-tasks","инструменты инженерии","рабочий процесс инженерии","управление задачами","инженерия с помощью ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ito-tasks","أدوات هندسة","سير عمل الهندسة","تدبير مهام","هندسة مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"withakay","repo":"ito","repoPath":"withakay/ito","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ito-tasks","description":"Use Ito tasks CLI to manage tasks.md (status/next/start/complete/shelve/add).","bodyPreview":"Use the `ito tasks` CLI to track and update implementation tasks for a change.\n\n**Rules**\n\n- Prefer `ito tasks ...` over manual editing of `tasks.md`.\n- Enhanced tasks.md supports `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve`, and `add`.\n- Checkbox-only tasks.md is supported in compat mode (supports in-progress via `[~]` / `ito tasks start`, but no shelving); start/complete tasks by 1-based index.\n\n**Common Commands**\n\n```bash\nito tasks status <change-id>\nito tasks next <change-id>\nito tasks ready","body":"Use the `ito tasks` CLI to track and update implementation tasks for a change.\n\n**Rules**\n\n- Prefer `ito tasks ...` over manual editing of `tasks.md`.\n- Enhanced tasks.md supports `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve`, and `add`.\n- Checkbox-only tasks.md is supported in compat mode (supports in-progress via `[~]` / `ito tasks start`, but no shelving); start/complete tasks by 1-based index.\n\n**Common Commands**\n\n```bash\nito tasks status <change-id>\nito tasks next <change-id>\nito tasks ready                               # Show ready tasks across ALL changes\nito tasks ready <change-id>                   # Show ready tasks for a specific change\nito tasks ready --json                        # JSON output for automation\nito tasks start <change-id> <task-id>\nito tasks complete <change-id> <task-id>\nito tasks complete <change-id> <index>\nito tasks shelve <change-id> <task-id>\nito tasks unshelve <change-id> <task-id>\nito tasks add <change-id> \"<task name>\" --wave <n>\nito tasks show <change-id>\n```\n\n**If tasks.md is missing**\n\n- Create enhanced tracking file: `ito tasks init <change-id>`\n\n**If the user asks \"what should I do next?\"**\n\n- If working on a specific change: Run `ito tasks next <change-id>`\n- If looking for any ready work: Run `ito tasks ready` to see all actionable tasks\n- Follow the printed Action/Verify/Done When for the chosen task.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- If a task is blocked, run `ito tasks status <change-id>` and either resolve blockers or shelve the task (enhanced only).\n- If `ito tasks shelve` fails because the file is checkbox-only, explain that checkbox compat mode does not support shelving.\n- If `ito tasks start` fails in compat mode, it is usually because the task id is not a 1-based index, or another task is already in-progress.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:29:30.747Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Engineering Workflow Agents requiring CLI-based task management and automation via `ito tasks` commands.","zh":"适合需要基于CLI的任务管理和自动化的工程工作流代理，通过`ito tasks`命令实现。","ja":"CLIベースのタスク管理と自動化を必要とするエンジニアリングワークフローエージェントに最適です。`ito tasks`コマンドを使用します。","ko":"CLI 기반의 작업 관리 및 자동화가 필요한 엔지니어링 워크플로 에이전트에 적합합니다. `ito tasks` 명령을 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de flujo de trabajo de ingeniería que requieren administración y automatización de tareas basadas en CLI mediante comandos `ito tasks`.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de workflow d''ingénierie nécessitant une gestion et une automatisation de tâches basées sur CLI via des commandes `ito tasks`.","de":"Ideal für Engineering-Workflow-Agents, die eine CLI-basierte Aufgabenverwaltung und -automatisierung über `ito tasks`-Befehle erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho de Engenharia que exigem gerenciamento de tarefas baseado em CLI e automação via comandos `ito tasks`.","ru":"Идеально для агентов рабочего процесса инженерии, требующих управления задачами на основе CLI и автоматизации через команды `ito tasks`.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء في تدفق العمل الهندسي الذين يتطلبون إدارة المهام القائمة على CLI والتحكم الآلي عبر أوامر `ito tasks`."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track and update implementation tasks for changes using the `ito tasks` CLI, supporting enhanced tasks.md with `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve`, and `add` commands, and compat mode for checkbox-only tasks.md with in-progress tracking via `[~]` and `ito tasks start`.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪和更新实现任务的变化的能力，使用`ito tasks` CLI支持增强的tasks.md，包括`start`、`shelve`、`unshelve`和`add`命令，以及兼容模式下的checkbox-only tasks.md，通过`[~]`和`ito tasks start`进行跟踪。","ja":"エージェントが実装タスクの変更を追跡し、更新する機能を提供します。`ito tasks` CLIを使用して、拡張されたtasks.md（`start`、`shelve`、`unshelve`、`add`コマンド）をサポートし、チェックボックスのみのtasks.mdの互換モードでは、`[~]`と`ito tasks start`を使用して進行状況を追跡します。","ko":"에이전트가 구현 작업의 변경 사항을 추적하고 업데이트할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. `ito tasks` CLI를 사용하여 향상된 tasks.md를 지원하며, 체크박스 전용 tasks.md의 호환성 모드에서는 `[~]` 및 `ito tasks start`를 사용하여 진행 상황을追跡합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un seguimiento y actualizar tareas de implementación para cambios utilizando la CLI `ito tasks`, con soporte para tareas mejoradas con los comandos `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve` y `add`, y modo de compatibilidad para tareas.md solo con casillas de verificación con seguimiento en curso a través de `[~]` y `ito tasks start`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre et de mettre à jour les tâches d''implémentation pour les modifications à l''aide de la CLI `ito tasks`, en prenant en charge les tâches améliorées avec les commandes `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve` et `add`, et le mode de compatibilité pour les tâches.md avec des cases à cocher uniquement avec un suivi en cours via `[~]` et `ito tasks start`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Implementierungsaufgaben für Änderungen mit der `ito tasks`-CLI zu verfolgen und zu aktualisieren, mit Unterstützung für verbesserte Aufgaben mit den Befehlen `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve` und `add`, und Kompatibilitätsmodus für Aufgaben.md mit nur Kontrollkästchen mit laufender Verfolgung über `[~]` und `ito tasks start`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear e atualizar tarefas de implementação para alterações usando o CLI `ito tasks`, com suporte a tarefas melhoradas com comandos `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve` e `add`, e modo de compatibilidade para tarefas.md somente com marcação de seleção com rastreamento em andamento via `[~]` e `ito tasks start`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать и обновлять задачи реализации для изменений с помощью CLI `ito tasks`, поддерживая улучшенные задачи с командами `start`, `shelve`, `unshelve` и `add`, и режим совместимости для задач.md только с флажками с отслеживанием в процессе через `[~]` и `ito tasks start`.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تتبع وتحديث مهام التنفيذ للتغييرات باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `ito tasks` ، مع دعم مهام محسنة بأوامر `start` و `shelve` و `unshelve` و `add` ، ووضع التوافق لمهام.md فقط مع مربع اختيار مع تتبع قيد التقدم عبر `[~]` وأمر `ito tasks start`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task status updates with `ito tasks status <change-id>`","Prioritizing tasks using `ito tasks next <change-id>` and `ito tasks ready`","Managing task implementation using `ito tasks` with enhanced tasks.md support"],"zh":["使用`ito tasks status <change-id>`自动更新任务状态","使用`ito tasks next <change-id>`和`ito tasks ready`优先处理任务","使用`ito tasks`管理任务实现，支持增强的tasks.md"],"ja":["タスクの状態を自動更新するために`ito tasks status <change-id>`を使用する","タスクを優先するために`ito tasks next <change-id>`と`ito tasks ready`を使用する","タスクの実装を管理するために`ito tasks`を使用し、拡張されたtasks.mdをサポートする"],"ko":["`ito tasks status <change-id>`를 사용하여 작업 상태를 자동으로 업데이트합니다","`ito tasks next <change-id>` 및 `ito tasks ready`를 사용하여 작업을 우선 처리합니다","`ito tasks`를 사용하여 작업 구현을 관리하고, 향상된 tasks.md를 지원합니다"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de estado de tarea con `ito tasks status <change-id>`","Priorización de tareas utilizando `ito tasks next <change-id>` y `ito tasks ready`","Administración de la implementación de tareas con `ito tasks` y soporte para tareas mejoradas"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de l''état des tâches avec `ito tasks status <change-id>`","Priorisation des tâches à l''aide de `ito tasks next <change-id>` et `ito tasks ready`","Gestion de la mise en œuvre des tâches avec `ito tasks` et prise en charge des tâches améliorées"],"de":["Automatisierung von Aufgabenstatus-Updates mit `ito tasks status <change-id>`","Priorisierung von Aufgaben mit `ito tasks next <change-id>` und `ito tasks ready`","Verwaltung der Implementierung von Aufgaben mit `ito tasks` und Unterstützung für verbesserte Aufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de status de tarefas com `ito tasks status <change-id>`","Priorizar tarefas usando `ito tasks next <change-id>` e `ito tasks ready`","Gerenciar implementação de tarefas usando `ito tasks` com suporte a tarefas melhoradas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления статуса задач с помощью `ito tasks status <change-id>`","Приоритизировать задачи с помощью `ito tasks next <change-id>` и `ito tasks ready`","Управлять реализацией задач с помощью `ito tasks` с поддержкой улучшенных задач"],"ar":["تutomatizar تحديثات حالة المهام باستخدام `ito tasks status <change-id>`","تحديد الأولوية للمهام باستخدام `ito tasks next <change-id>` و `ito tasks ready`","إدارة تنفيذ المهام باستخدام `ito tasks` مع دعم مهام محسنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `ito tasks` CLI installation and configuration","Compatibility mode limitations for checkbox-only tasks.md","1-based index required for start/complete tasks in compat mode"],"zh":["需要安装和配置`ito tasks` CLI","兼容模式下checkbox-only tasks.md的限制","兼容模式下开始/完成任务需要1基索引"],"ja":["`ito tasks` CLIのインストールと設定が必要","互換モードでのチェックボックスのみのtasks.mdの制限","互換モードでの開始/完了タスクには1基索引が必要"],"ko":["`ito tasks` CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","호환성 모드下的 체크박스 전용 tasks.md의 제한","호환성 모드下的 시작/완료 작업에 1기반 인덱스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de la CLI `ito tasks`","Limitaciones del modo de compatibilidad para tareas.md solo con casillas de verificación","Índice basado en 1 necesario para tareas de inicio/completado en modo de compatibilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de la CLI `ito tasks`","Limitations du mode de compatibilité pour les tâches.md avec des cases à cocher uniquement","Index basé sur 1 requis pour les tâches de démarrage/complétion en mode de compatibilité"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration der `ito tasks`-CLI","Einschränkungen des Kompatibilitätsmodus für Aufgaben.md mit nur Kontrollkästchen","1-basiertes Index erforderlich für Start-/Vervollständigungs-Aufgaben im Kompatibilitätsmodus"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do CLI `ito tasks`","Limitações do modo de compatibilidade para tarefas.md somente com marcação de seleção","Índice baseado em 1 necessário para iniciar/concluir tarefas no modo de compatibilidade"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации CLI `ito tasks`","Ограничения режима совместимости для задач.md только с флажками","Требуется индекс на основе 1 для начала/завершения задач в режиме совместимости"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة واجهة سطر الأوامر `ito tasks`","قيود وضع التوافق لمهام.md فقط مع مربع اختيار","مطلوب فهرس قائم على 1 لبدء/إكمال المهام في وضع التوافق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('akiojin/llmlb/gh-fix-ci', 'community', 'akiojin', 'llmlb', 'akiojin/llmlb', 'gh-fix-ci', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z', '2026-02-18T06:29:00.930Z', NULL, '{"id":"akiojin/llmlb/gh-fix-ci","name":"gh-fix-ci","description":{"zh":"gh-fix-ci是一种分布式LLM路由器，能够自动化修复GitHub CI检查失败，包括合并冲突和更新分支要求等","ja":"gh-fix-ciは、GitHub CIのチェック失敗を自動修復するための分散型LLMルーターであり、合併コンフリクトやブランチ要件の更新などを含む","ko":"gh-fix-ci는 GitHub CI 검사 실패를 자동 수정하는 분산형 LLM 路由器로, 합치기 충돌과 분기 요구 사항 업데이트 등을 포함","es":"gh-fix-ci es una herramienta que inspecciona las solicitudes de extracción para detectar problemas de CI y propone un plan de solución","fr":"gh-fix-ci est un outil qui inspecte les demandes d''extraction pour détecter les problèmes de CI et propose un plan de résolution","de":"gh-fix-ci ist ein Tool, das Pull-Requests auf CI-Probleme überprüft und einen Lösungsplan vorschlägt","pt":"A ferramenta gh-fix-ci é uma solução de roteamento LLM distribuída que otimiza os fluxos de trabalho de CI, fornecendo balanceamento de carga e distribuição automática de modelos.","ru":"Инструмент gh-fix-ci является распределенным решением маршрутизации LLM, которое оптимизирует рабочие процессы CI, обеспечивая балансировку нагрузки и автоматическое распределение моделей.","ar":"أداة gh-fix-ci هي حل توجيه LLM موزع يُحسّن تدفقات العمل في CI، ويقدم توازن الحمل وتوزيع النماذج التلقائي.","en":"Distributed LLM router with load balancing and automatic model distribution"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub CI自动化修复工具","ja":"GitHub CIの自動修復ツール","ko":"GitHub CI 자동 수정 도구","es":"gh-fix-ci: solución de CI automatizada","fr":"gh-fix-ci: solution de CI automatisée","de":"gh-fix-ci: Automatisierte CI-Lösung","pt":"gh-fix-ci: Ferramenta de Roteamento LLM com Balanceamento...","ru":"gh-fix-ci: Распределенный маршрутизатор LLM с балансировк...","ar":"gh-fix-ci: أداة توجيه LLM موزعة مع توازن الحمل","en":"gh-fix-ci"},"description":{"zh":"gh-fix-ci是一种分布式LLM路由器，能够自动化修复GitHub CI检查失败，包括合并冲突和更新分支要求等","ja":"gh-fix-ciは、GitHub CIのチェック失敗を自動修復するための分散型LLMルーターであり、合併コンフリクトやブランチ要件の更新などを含む","ko":"gh-fix-ci는 GitHub CI 검사 실패를 자동 수정하는 분산형 LLM 路由器로, 합치기 충돌과 분기 요구 사항 업데이트 등을 포함","es":"gh-fix-ci es una herramienta que inspecciona las solicitudes de extracción para detectar problemas de CI y propone un plan de solución","fr":"gh-fix-ci est un outil qui inspecte les demandes d''extraction pour détecter les problèmes de CI et propose un plan de résolution","de":"gh-fix-ci ist ein Tool, das Pull-Requests auf CI-Probleme überprüft und einen Lösungsplan vorschlägt","pt":"A ferramenta gh-fix-ci é uma solução de roteamento LLM distribuída que otimiza os fluxos de trabalho de CI, fornecendo balanceamento de carga e distribuição ...","ru":"Инструмент gh-fix-ci является распределенным решением маршрутизации LLM, которое оптимизирует рабочие процессы CI, обеспечивая балансировку нагрузки и автома...","ar":"أداة gh-fix-ci هي حل توجيه LLM موزع يُحسّن تدفقات العمل في CI، ويقدم توازن الحمل وتوزيع النماذج التلقائي.","en":"Distributed LLM router with load balancing and automatic model distribution"},"definition":{"en":"Distributed LLM router with load balancing and automatic model distribution"},"features":{"zh":["自动化修复GitHub CI检查失败","合并冲突检测和修复","更新分支要求","代码审查和反馈","自动化通知和线程解决"],"ja":["GitHub CIのチェック失敗を自動修復","マージコンフリクトの検出と修復","ブランチ要件の更新","コードレビューとフィードバック","自動通知とスレッド解決"],"ko":["GitHub CI 검사 실패 자동 수정","합치기 충돌 감지 및 수정","분기 요구 사항 업데이트","코드 리뷰 및 피드백","自动通知 및 스레드 해결"],"es":["Detección de problemas de CI","Propuesta de plan de solución","Implementación de soluciones después de aprobación explícita","Resolución de hilos de revisión y notificación de revisores","Detección de conflictos de fusión y requisitos de actualización de rama"],"fr":["Détection de problèmes de CI","Proposition d''un plan de résolution","Mise en œuvre de solutions après approbation explicite","Résolution de threads de révision et notification de réviseurs","Détection de conflits de fusion et de mises à jour de branche"],"de":["Erkennung von CI-Problemen","Vorschlag eines Lösungsplans","Umsetzung von Lösungen nach expliziter Genehmigung","Auflösung von Review-Threads und Benachrichtigung von Reviewern","Erkennung von Merge-Konflikten und Branch-Update-Anforderungen"],"pt":["Roteamento LLM distribuído","Balanceamento de carga","Distribuição automática de modelos","Verificação de PRs para CI falhos","Resolução de conflitos de mesclagem","Notificação de revisores"],"ru":["Распределенный маршрутизатор LLM","Балансировка нагрузки","Автоматическое распределение моделей","Проверка PR на ошибки CI","Разрешение конфликтов слияния","Уведомление рецензентов"],"ar":["توجيه LLM موزع","توازن الحمل","توزيع النماذج التلقائي","فحص طلبات الإضافة لآراء CI"," حل مشاكل الدمج","إخطار المراجعين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CI","自动化修复","代码质量","开发效率","LLM路由器","分支管理","代码审查"],"ja":["GitHub CI","自動修復","コード品質","開発効率","LLMルーター","ブランチ管理","コードレビュー"],"ko":["GitHub CI","자동 수정","코드 품질","개발 효율성","LLM 路由器","분기 관리","코드 리뷰"],"es":["gh-fix-ci","CI automatizada","integración continua","detección de problemas","plan de solución","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["gh-fix-ci","CI automatisée","intégration continue","détection de problèmes","plan de résolution","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["gh-fix-ci","Automatisierte CI","kontinuierliche Integration","Problemerkennung","Lösungsplan","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["gh-fix-ci","roteamento LLM","balanceamento de carga","distribuição automática de modelos","otimização de fluxos de trabalho de CI","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","ci/cd"],"ru":["gh-fix-ci","маршрутизатор LLM","балансировка нагрузки","автоматическое распределение моделей","оптимизация рабочих процессов CI","инструменты разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","ci/cd"],"ar":["gh-fix-ci","توجيه LLM","توازن الحمل","توزيع النماذج التلقائي","تحسين تدفقات العمل في CI","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","ci/cd"]}},"owner":"akiojin","repo":"llmlb","repoPath":"akiojin/llmlb","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-fix-ci","description":"Inspect GitHub PR for CI failures, merge conflicts, update-branch requirements, reviewer comments, change requests, and unresolved review threads. Create fix plans and implement after user approval. Resolve review threads and notify reviewers after fixes.","bodyPreview":"# Gh PR Checks Plan Fix\n\n## Overview\n\nUse gh to inspect PRs for:\n\n- Failing CI checks (GitHub Actions)\n- Merge conflicts\n- Update Branch requirements (base branch advanced)\n- Reviewer comments (review summaries, inline comments, issue comments)\n- Change Requests from reviewers\n- Unresolved review threads\n\nThen propose a fix plan, implement after explicit approval, and optionally resolve threads and notify reviewers.\n\n- Depends on the `plan` skill for drafting and approving the fix plan.\n\nPrereq:","body":"# Gh PR Checks Plan Fix\n\n## Overview\n\nUse gh to inspect PRs for:\n\n- Failing CI checks (GitHub Actions)\n- Merge conflicts\n- Update Branch requirements (base branch advanced)\n- Reviewer comments (review summaries, inline comments, issue comments)\n- Change Requests from reviewers\n- Unresolved review threads\n\nThen propose a fix plan, implement after explicit approval, and optionally resolve threads and notify reviewers.\n\n- Depends on the `plan` skill for drafting and approving the fix plan.\n\nPrereq: ensure `gh` is authenticated (for example, run `gh auth login` once), then run `gh auth status` with escalated permissions (include workflow/repo scopes) so `gh` commands succeed.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `repo`: path inside the repo (default `.`)\n- `pr`: PR number or URL (optional; defaults to current branch PR)\n- `mode`: inspection mode (`checks`, `conflicts`, `reviews`, `all`)\n- `max-review-comments`: max reviewer comments to list per category\n- `required-only`: limit CI checks to required checks only (uses `gh pr checks --required`)\n- `gh` authentication for the repo host\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# Inspect all (CI, conflicts, reviews) - default mode\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\"\n\n# CI checks only\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --mode checks\n\n# Conflicts only\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --mode conflicts\n\n# Reviews only (Change Requests + Unresolved Threads)\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --mode reviews\n\n# JSON output\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --json\n\n# Required checks only (if gh supports --required)\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --mode checks --required-only\n\n# Limit review comment output\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --max-review-comments 30\n\n# Resolve all unresolved threads after fixing\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --resolve-threads\n\n# Add a comment to notify reviewers\npython \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\" --repo \".\" --pr \"<number>\" --add-comment \"Fixed all issues. Please re-review.\"\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Verify gh authentication.**\n   - Run `gh auth status` in the repo with escalated scopes (workflow/repo).\n   - If unauthenticated, ask the user to log in before proceeding.\n\n2. **Resolve the PR.**\n   - Prefer the current branch PR: `gh pr view --json number,url`.\n   - If the user provides a PR number or URL, use that directly.\n\n3. **Inspect based on mode:**\n\n   **Conflicts Mode (`--mode conflicts`):**\n   - Check `mergeable` and `mergeStateStatus` fields.\n   - If `CONFLICTING` or `DIRTY`, report conflict details.\n   - If `BEHIND`, report that the base branch advanced and an Update Branch is required.\n   - Suggest resolution steps: fetch base branch, merge/rebase, resolve conflicts.\n\n   **Reviews Mode (`--mode reviews`):**\n   - Fetch reviews with `CHANGES_REQUESTED` state.\n   - Fetch unresolved review threads using GraphQL.\n   - Fetch reviewer comments (review summaries, inline review comments, issue comments).\n   - Display reviewer, comment body, file path, and line number.\n   - Decide if reviewer feedback requires action (any change request, unresolved thread, or reviewer comment).\n\n   **Checks Mode (`--mode checks`):**\n   - Run bundled script to inspect failing CI checks.\n   - Add `--required-only` to limit output to required checks when supported.\n   - Fetch GitHub Actions logs and extract failure snippets.\n   - For external checks (Buildkite, etc.), report URL only.\n\n   **All Mode (`--mode all`):**\n   - Run all inspections above.\n\n4. **Summarize issues for the user.**\n   - Provide clear summary of all detected issues.\n   - Call out conflicts, change requests, unresolved threads, and CI failures.\n\n5. **Create a plan.**\n   - Use the `plan` skill to draft a fix plan and request approval.\n\n6. **Implement after approval.**\n   - Apply the approved plan, summarize diffs/tests.\n\n7. **Resolve review threads (optional).**\n   - With `--resolve-threads`, resolve all unresolved threads via GraphQL mutation.\n   - Requires `Repository Permissions > Contents: Read and Write`.\n\n8. **Notify reviewers (optional).**\n   - With `--add-comment \"message\"`, post a comment to the PR.\n   - Useful for notifying reviewers that issues have been addressed.\n\n9. **Recheck status.**\n   - After changes, suggest re-running `gh pr checks` to confirm.\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### scripts/inspect_pr_checks.py\n\nComprehensive PR inspection tool. Exits non-zero when issues remain.\n\n**Arguments:**\n\n| Argument | Default | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--repo` | `.` | Path inside the target Git repository |\n| `--pr` | (current) | PR number or URL |\n| `--mode` | `all` | Inspection mode: `checks`, `conflicts`, `reviews`, `all` |\n| `--max-lines` | 160 | Max lines for log snippets |\n| `--context` | 30 | Context lines around failure markers |\n| `--max-review-comments` | 50 | Max reviewer comments to list per category |\n| `--required-only` | false | Limit CI checks to required checks only |\n| `--json` | false | Emit JSON output |\n| `--resolve-threads` | false | Resolve unresolved review threads |\n| `--add-comment` | (none) | Add a comment to the PR |\n\n**Exit codes:**\n\n- `0`: No issues found\n- `1`: Issues detected or error occurred\n\n## New Features\n\n### Conflict Detection\n\nDetects merge conflicts via `mergeable` and `mergeStateStatus` fields.\n\n- `CONFLICTING` / `DIRTY`: Conflict detected\n- `BEHIND`: Base branch advanced; Update Branch required\n- `MERGEABLE` / `CLEAN`: No conflicts\n\n### Change Request Handling\n\nFetches reviews with `state == \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\"` and displays:\n\n- Reviewer name\n- Review body\n- Submission timestamp\n\n### Reviewer Comments\n\nFetches reviewer feedback beyond change requests:\n\n- Review summaries with comment bodies\n- Inline review comments (file/line)\n- PR issue comments\n- Marks review action required if any reviewer feedback exists\n\n### Unresolved Review Threads\n\nUses GraphQL to fetch threads where `isResolved == false`:\n\n- File path and line number\n- Thread ID (for resolution)\n- Comment author and body\n- Outdated status\n\n### Resolve Conversation\n\nUse `--resolve-threads` to mark threads as resolved via GraphQL mutation `resolveReviewThread`.\n\n**Required permissions:**\n\n- Fine-grained PAT: `Pull requests` + `Contents: Read and Write`\n- Classic PAT: `repo` scope\n\n### Reviewer Notification\n\nUse `--add-comment \"message\"` to post a summary comment to the PR after fixes.\n\n## Output Examples\n\n### Text Output\n\n```text\nPR #123: Comprehensive Check Results\n============================================================\n\nMERGE STATUS\n------------------------------------------------------------\nMergeable: CONFLICTING\nMerge State: DIRTY\nBase: main <- Head: feature/my-branch\nAction Required: Resolve conflicts before merging\n\nCHANGE REQUESTS\n------------------------------------------------------------\nFrom @reviewer1 (2025-01-15):\n  \"Please fix these issues...\"\n\nUNRESOLVED REVIEW THREADS\n------------------------------------------------------------\n[1] src/main.ts:42\n    Thread ID: PRRT_xxx123\n    @reviewer1: This needs refactoring...\n\nCI FAILURES\n------------------------------------------------------------\nCheck: build\nDetails: https://github.com/...\nFailure snippet:\n  Error: TypeScript compilation failed\n  ...\n============================================================\n```\n\n### JSON Output\n\n```json\n{\n  \"pr\": \"123\",\n  \"conflicts\": {\n    \"hasConflicts\": true,\n    \"mergeable\": \"CONFLICTING\",\n    \"mergeStateStatus\": \"DIRTY\",\n    \"baseRefName\": \"main\",\n    \"headRefName\": \"feature/my-branch\"\n  },\n  \"changeRequests\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 123456,\n      \"reviewer\": \"reviewer1\",\n      \"body\": \"Please fix these issues...\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2025-01-15T12:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unresolvedThreads\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_xxx123\",\n      \"path\": \"src/main.ts\",\n      \"line\": 42,\n      \"comments\": [\n        {\"author\": \"reviewer1\", \"body\": \"This needs refactoring\"}\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"ciFailures\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"build\",\n      \"status\": \"ok\",\n      \"logSnippet\": \"...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:29:00.930Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub-centric AI Agents requiring automated PR inspection and CI fix planning","zh":"适用于需要自动化PR检查和CI修复规划的GitHub中心AI代理的理想选择","ja":"GitHub中心のAIエージェントが自動化されたPRの検査とCIの修復計画を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자동화된 PR 검사 및 CI 수정 계획이 필요한 GitHub 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en GitHub que requieren inspección automatizada de PR y planificación de solución de CI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA centrés sur GitHub nécessitant une inspection automatique des PR et une planification de correction de CI","de":"Ideal für GitHub-zentrierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte PR-Inspektion und CI-Fix-Planung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA centrados no GitHub que requerem inspeção automática de PR e planejamento de correção de CI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на GitHub, требующих автоматического осмотра PR и планирования исправления CI","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المركزين على جيثب الذين يتطلبون فحص自动ي لطلبات السحب و تخطيط إصلاح سي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inspect GitHub PRs for failing CI checks, merge conflicts, and reviewer comments, and propose fix plans using GitHub Actions and automatic model distribution, streamlining the development workflow with load balancing and review thread resolution","zh":"赋予代理检查GitHub PR的失败CI检查、合并冲突和审查者评论的能力，并使用GitHub Actions和自动模型分发提出修复计划，通过负载平衡和审查线程解析简化开发工作流","ja":"GitHub PRの失敗したCIチェック、mergeコンフリクト、レビューコメントを検査し、GitHub Actionsと自動モデルの配布を使用して修正プランを提案する機能をエージェントに与え、ロードバランシングとレビュースレッドの解決を通じて開発ワークフローを簡素化","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub PR의 실패한 CI 검사, 병합 충돌 및 리뷰어 댓글을 검사하고 GitHub Actions 및 자동 모델 배포를 사용하여 수정 계획을 제안하여 로드 밸런싱 및 리뷰 스레드 해결을 통해 개발 워크플ロー简化","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inspeccionar las PR de GitHub para detectar errores en las comprobaciones de CI, conflictos de fusión y comentarios de revisores, y a proponer planes de solución utilizando GitHub Actions y distribución automática de modelos, simplificando el flujo de trabajo de desarrollo con equilibrio de carga y resolución de hilos de revisión","fr":"Permet aux agents d''inspecter les PR GitHub pour les vérifications de CI défaillantes, les conflits de fusion et les commentaires des réviseurs, et de proposer des plans de correction en utilisant GitHub Actions et la distribution automatique de modèles, simplifiant le flux de travail de développement avec l''équilibrage de charge et la résolution des threads de révision","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-PRs auf fehlgeschlagene CI-Prüfungen, Merge-Konflikte und Reviewer-Kommentare zu überprüfen und unter Verwendung von GitHub Actions und automatischer Modellverteilung Korrekturpläne vorzuschlagen, wodurch der Entwicklungsworkflow durch Lastenausgleich und Review-Thread-Auflösung gestreamt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inspecionar PRs do GitHub para verificações de CI com falha, conflitos de mesclagem e comentários de revisores, e propor planos de correção usando GitHub Actions e distribuição automática de modelos, otimizando o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento com balanceamento de carga e resolução de threads de revisão","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью осматривать PR GitHub для проверки CI с неудачами, конфликтов слияния и комментариев рецензентов, и предлагать планы исправления с помощью GitHub Actions и автоматического распределения моделей, оптимизируя рабочий процесс разработки с балансировкой нагрузки и решением потоков ревью","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فحص طلبات السحب على جيثب للتحقق من اختبارات الوحدة مع الفشل والتحديثات المتضاربة وتعليقات المراجعين، واقتراح خطط الإصلاح باستخدام إجراءات جيثب والتوزيع التلقائي للنماذج، وتبسيط تدفق عمل التطوير مع توازن الحمل وحل threads المراجعة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR checks for failing CI builds and proposing fixes","Resolving merge conflicts and updating branch requirements","Implementing fix plans and notifying reviewers after explicit approval"],"zh":["自动化PR检查以查找失败的CI构建并提议修复","解决合并冲突并更新分支要求","实施修复计划并在显式批准后通知审查者"],"ja":["失敗したCIビルドのPRチェックの自動化と修正の提案","マージコンフリクトの解決とブランチ要件の更新","修正プランの実施と明示的な承認後のレビューアへの通知"],"ko":["실패한 CI 빌드에 대한 PR 검사의 자동화 및 수정 제안","병합 충돌의 해결 및 분기 요구 사항의 업데이트","수정 계획의 구현 및 명시적 승인 후 리뷰어에게 통지"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de PR para compilaciones de CI fallidas y proponer soluciones","Resolver conflictos de fusión y actualizar los requisitos de la rama","Implementar planes de solución y notificar a los revisores después de una aprobación explícita"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de PR pour les builds de CI défaillants et proposer des corrections","Résoudre les conflits de fusion et mettre à jour les exigences de la branche","Mettre en œuvre des plans de correction et notifier les réviseurs après une approbation explicite"],"de":["Automatisieren von PR-Prüfungen für fehlgeschlagene CI-Builds und Vorschlagen von Korrekturen","Auflösen von Merge-Konflikten und Aktualisieren der Branch-Anforderungen","Umsetzen von Korrekturplänen und Benachrichtigen der Reviewer nach expliziter Genehmigung"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de PR para compilações de CI com falha e propor correções","Resolver conflitos de mesclagem e atualizar requisitos de branch","Implementar planos de correção e notificar revisores após aprovação explícita"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку PR для сборок CI с неудачами и предлагать исправления","Разрешать конфликты слияния и обновлять требования веток","Реализовывать планы исправления и уведомлять рецензентов после явного одобрения"],"ar":["أتمتة فحص طلبات السحب لاختبارات الوحدة مع الفشل واقتراح الإصلاحات","حل التحديثات المتضاربة وتحديث متطلبات الفرع","تنفيذ خطط الإصلاح وإخطار المراجعين بعد الموافقة الصريحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Depends on the ''plan'' skill for drafting and approving fix plans","Requires GitHub Actions setup and configuration","Limited to GitHub PRs and CI checks"],"zh":["依赖于''计划''技能来草拟和批准修复计划","需要GitHub Actions的设置和配置","仅限于GitHub PR和CI检查"],"ja":["修正プランの草案作成と承認のために''プラン''スキルに依存","GitHub Actionsの設定と構成が必要","GitHub PRとCIチェックのみに限定"],"ko":["수정 계획을 초안 작성 및 승인하기 위한 ''계획'' 기술에 의존","GitHub Actions 설정 및 구성 필요","GitHub PR 및 CI 검사에만 제한"],"es":["Depende de la habilidad ''plan'' para la redacción y aprobación de planes de solución","Requiere la configuración y el ajuste de GitHub Actions","Limitado a PR de GitHub y comprobaciones de CI"],"fr":["Dépend de la compétence ''plan'' pour la rédaction et l''approbation des plans de correction","Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place de GitHub Actions","Limité aux PR GitHub et aux vérifications de CI"],"de":["Hängt von der Fähigkeit ''plan'' für die Erstellung und Genehmigung von Korrekturplänen ab","Erfordert die Einrichtung und Konfiguration von GitHub Actions","Begrenzt auf GitHub-PRs und CI-Prüfungen"],"pt":["Depende da habilidade ''planejamento'' para elaborar e aprovar planos de correção","Requer configuração e setup de GitHub Actions","Limitado a PRs e verificações de CI do GitHub"],"ru":["Зависит от навыка ''планирование'' для составления и утверждения планов исправления","Требует настройки и конфигурации GitHub Actions","Ограничен PR и проверками CI GitHub"],"ar":["يعتمد على مهارة ''تخطيط'' لصياغة وموافقة خطط الإصلاح","يتطلب إعداد وتكوين إجراءات جيثب","محدود لطلبات السحب واختبارات الوحدة على جيثب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
