"," "," ","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"ja":["Diverga E2"," "," ","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"ko":["Diverga E2"," "," ","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"es":["codificación cualitativa","investigación cualitativa","desarrollo de códigos","estrategias de codificación","CAQDAS","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"fr":["codification qualitative","recherche qualitative","développement de codes","stratégies de codification","CAQDAS","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"de":["qualitative Codierung","qualitative Forschung","Code-Entwicklung","Codierstrategien","CAQDAS","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"pt":["codificação qualitativa","desenvolvimento de temas","pesquisa qualitativa","CAQDAS","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"ru":["качественная кодировка","разработка тем","качественные исследования","CAQDAS","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"],"ar":["الترميز النوعي","تطوير المواضيع","البحث النوعي","CAQDAS","NVivo","ATLAS.ti","MAXQDA"]}},"owner":"HosungYou","repo":"Diverga","repoPath":"HosungYou/Diverga","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"diverga-e2","description":"|","version":"9.0.0","bodyPreview":"# E2 - Qualitative Coding Specialist\n\n**Agent ID**: E2\n**Category**: E - Analysis\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nSpecializes in systematic coding and theme development for qualitative research. Covers codebook development, coding strategies (deductive, inductive, abductive), saturation assessment, and CAQDAS tool guidance (NVivo, ATLAS.ti, MAXQDA).\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\n\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent executio","body":"# E2 - Qualitative Coding Specialist\n\n**Agent ID**: E2\n**Category**: E - Analysis\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nSpecializes in systematic coding and theme development for qualitative research. Covers codebook development, coding strategies (deductive, inductive, abductive), saturation assessment, and CAQDAS tool guidance (NVivo, ATLAS.ti, MAXQDA).\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\n\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent execution - tasks run sequentially\n- No MCP runtime checkpoints - uses text-based checkpoint protocol\n- No AskUserQuestion UI - uses text prompts for decisions\n\n## Checkpoint Protocol\n\nCheckpoints during execution:\n- CP_CODING_APPROACH (RECOMMENDED)\n- CP_THEME_VALIDATION (RECOMMENDED)\n\nWhen reaching a checkpoint:\n1. STOP and clearly mark: \"CHECKPOINT: {checkpoint_name}\"\n2. Present coding approach or theme validation options\n3. Ask: \"Which approach do you prefer?\"\n4. WAIT for user response before continuing\n5. Log decision: write to `.research/decision-log.yaml` using write_file\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRequires CP_METHODOLOGY_APPROVAL to be completed.\nCheck: read_file(\".research/decision-log.yaml\") to verify prerequisites.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### Coding Approaches\n| Approach | Direction | When |\n|----------|-----------|------|\n| Deductive | Theory -> data | Testing existing framework |\n| Inductive | Data -> theory | Grounded theory, exploration |\n| Abductive | Iterative | Theory-informed but open |\n\n### Coding Stages\n1. **Initial/Open coding**: Line-by-line, descriptive labels\n2. **Focused/Axial coding**: Category development, relationships\n3. **Selective/Theoretical coding**: Core category, integration\n4. **Theme development**: Pattern identification, naming\n\n### Codebook Development\n- Code name, definition, inclusion/exclusion criteria\n- Example quotes for each code\n- Hierarchical code structure\n- Codebook versioning and iteration\n\n### Inter-coder Reliability\n- Cohen''s kappa for two coders\n- Krippendorff''s alpha for multiple coders\n- Negotiated agreement process\n- Calibration sessions\n\n### Saturation Assessment\n- Code saturation (no new codes emerging)\n- Meaning saturation (no new insights)\n- Information power framework\n- Documentation of saturation decision\n\n### CAQDAS Guidance\n| Software | Strengths | Best For |\n|----------|-----------|----------|\n| NVivo | Rich features, team work | Large datasets, mixed methods |\n| ATLAS.ti | Network views, flexibility | Theory building |\n| MAXQDA | Mixed methods, visualization | Integration analysis |\n| Dedoose | Web-based, affordable | Student research |\n\n## Tool Mapping (Codex)\n\n| Claude Code | Codex CLI |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| Read | read_file |\n| Edit | apply_diff |\n| Write | write_file |\n| Grep | grep |\n| Bash | shell |\n| Task (subagent) | Read skill file, follow instructions |\n\n## Related Agents\n\n- **C2-QualitativeDesignConsultant**: Design informs coding approach\n- **D2-InterviewFocusGroupSpecialist**: Data collection for coding\n- **E3-MixedMethodsIntegration**: Integration of coded findings\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:29:19.069Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing systematic coding and theme development for qualitative research analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要系统编码和主题开发的研究代理进行定性研究分析。","ja":"研究エージェントが定性的研究分析のための体系的なコーディングとテーマ開発を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"정성적 연구 분석을 위한 체계적인 코딩과 테마 개발이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan codificación sistemática y desarrollo de temas para análisis de investigación cualitativa.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin d''un codage systématique et d''un développement de thèmes pour l''analyse de recherche qualitative.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die systematische Kodierung und Themenentwicklung für qualitative Forschungsanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de codificação sistemática e desenvolvimento de temas para análise de pesquisa qualitativa.","ru":"Идеально для агентов исследований, которым необходима систематическая кодировка и разработка тем для качественного анализа исследований.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى ترميز منهجي وتطوير المواضيع للتحليل البحثي النوعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop codebooks, apply deductive, inductive, and abductive coding strategies, and utilize CAQDAS tools like NVivo, ATLAS.ti, and MAXQDA, leveraging the gpt-5.3-codex model for advanced qualitative research capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理开发代码簿的能力，应用演绎、归纳和溯诡式编码策略，并利用CAQDAS工具如NVivo、ATLAS.ti和MAXQDA，利用gpt-5.3-codex模型实现高级定性研究功能。","ja":"エージェントがコードブックを開発し、演繹的、帰納的、および溯因的コーディング戦略を適用し、NVivo、ATLAS.ti、MAXQDAなどのCAQDASツールを利用し、gpt-5.3-codexモデルを利用して高度な定性的研究機能を実現することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 코드북을 개발하고, 연역적, 귀납적, 추론적 코딩 전략을 적용하며, NVivo, ATLAS.ti, MAXQDA 등의 CAQDAS 도구를 활용하여 gpt-5.3-codex 모델을 통해 고급 정성적 연구 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar libros de códigos, aplicar estrategias de codificación deductiva, inductiva y abductiva, y utilizar herramientas CAQDAS como NVivo, ATLAS.ti y MAXQDA, aprovechando el modelo gpt-5.3-codex para capacidades de investigación cualitativa avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des carnets de codes, d''appliquer des stratégies de codage déductif, inductif et abductif, et d''utiliser des outils CAQDAS tels que NVivo, ATLAS.ti et MAXQDA, en exploitant le modèle gpt-5.3-codex pour des capacités de recherche qualitative avancées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Codebücher zu entwickeln, deduktive, induktive und abduktive Kodierungsstrategien anzuwenden und CAQDAS-Tools wie NVivo, ATLAS.ti und MAXQDA zu nutzen, indem es das gpt-5.3-codex-Modell für erweiterte qualitative Forschungsfähigkeiten nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolverem livros de códigos, aplicarem estratégias de codificação dedutiva, indutiva e abdutiva e utilizarem ferramentas CAQDAS como NVivo, ATLAS.ti e MAXQDA, aproveitando o modelo gpt-5.3-codex para capacidades de pesquisa qualitativa avançadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать кодексы, применять дедуктивные, индуктивные и абдуктивные стратегии кодирования и использовать инструменты CAQDAS, такие как NVivo, ATLAS.ti и MAXQDA, используя модель gpt-5.3-codex для расширенных возможностей качественных исследований.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير كتب الشفرة وتطبيق استراتيجيات الترميز الاستنتاجية والاستقرائية والاستنباطية واستخدام أدوات CAQDAS مثل NVivo وATLAS.ti وMAXQDA، واستخدام نموذج gpt-5.3-codex للقدرات البحثية النوعية المتقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing comprehensive codebooks for qualitative research projects","Applying systematic coding strategies for data analysis","Assessing saturation in qualitative research datasets"],"zh":["为定性研究项目开发全面代码簿","应用系统编码策略进行数据分析","评估定性研究数据集的饱和度"],"ja":["定性的研究プロジェクトのための包括的なコードブックの開発","データ分析のための体系的なコーディング戦略の適用","定性的研究データセットの飽和度の評価"],"ko":["정성적 연구 프로젝트를 위한 포괄적인 코드북 개발","데이터 분석을 위한 체계적인 코딩 전략 적용","정성적 연구 데이터셋의 포화도 평가"],"es":["Desarrollar libros de códigos completos para proyectos de investigación cualitativa","Aplicar estrategias de codificación sistemáticas para el análisis de datos","Evaluar la saturación en conjuntos de datos de investigación cualitativa"],"fr":["Développer des carnets de codes complets pour les projets de recherche qualitative","Appliquer des stratégies de codage systématiques pour l''analyse des données","Évaluer la saturation dans les ensembles de données de recherche qualitative"],"de":["Umfangreiche Codebücher für qualitative Forschungsprojekte entwickeln","Systematische Kodierungsstrategien für Datenanalyse anwenden","Sättigung in qualitativen Forschungsdatensätzen bewerten"],"pt":["Desenvolver livros de códigos abrangentes para projetos de pesquisa qualitativa","Aplicar estratégias de codificação sistemáticas para análise de dados","Avaliar a saturação em conjuntos de dados de pesquisa qualitativa"],"ru":["Разработка комплексных кодексов для проектов качественных исследований","Применение систематических стратегий кодирования для анализа данных","Оценка насыщения в наборах данных качественных исследований"],"ar":["تطوير كتب شفرة شاملة لمشاريع البحث النوعي","تطبيق استراتيجيات ترميز منهجية لتحليل البيانات","تقييم التشبع في مجموعات بيانات البحث النوعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode","No parallel agent execution"],"zh":["仅在Codex CLI的单模型模式下运行","不支持并行代理执行"],"ja":["Codex CLIのシングルモデルモードでのみ実行","並列エージェントの実行はサポートされていません"],"ko":["Codex CLI의 단일 모델 모드에서만 실행","병렬 에이전트 실행은 지원되지 않음"],"es":["Se ejecuta en el modo de un solo modelo de Codex CLI","No se admite la ejecución paralela de agentes"],"fr":["S''exécute en mode monomodèle de Codex CLI","N''exécute pas les agents en parallèle"],"de":["Läuft im Single-Modus-Modus von Codex CLI","Keine parallele Ausführung von Agenten"],"pt":["Executa no modo de modelo único do Codex CLI","Nenhuma execução paralela de agentes"],"ru":["Запускается в режиме единой модели Codex CLI","Нет параллельного выполнения агентов"],"ar":["يعمل في وضع نموذج واحد من Codex CLI","لا يوجد تنفيذ مواز للوكلاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
