ние инструкций","Поддержка проектов","Критическое выполнение задач"],"ar":["تحميل الملفات","تنفيذ المهام خطوة بخطوة","قراءة الإرشادات","دعم المشاريع","تنفيذ حرج للمهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["bmad-help","技术任务加载","文件加载","任务执行","开发者工具"],"ja":["bmad-help","タスク読み込み","ファイル読み込み","タスク実行","開発者ツール"],"ko":["bmad-help","태스크 로딩","파일 로딩","태스크 실행","개발자 도구"],"es":["bmad-help","carga de archivos","ejecución de tareas","instrucciones precisas","seguridad en la ejecución","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["bmad-help","chargement de fichiers","exécution de tâches","instructions précises","sécurité dans l''exécution","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["bmad-help","Dateiladen","Ausführung von Aufgaben","präzise Anweisungen","Sicherheit in der Ausführung","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["bmad-help","execução de tarefas","carregamento de arquivos","leitura de instruções","projetos","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["bmad-help","выполнение задач","загрузка файлов","чтение инструкций","проекты","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["bmad-help","تنفيذ المهام","تحميل الملفات","قراءة الإرشادات","المشاريع","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"thewoolleyman","repo":"tab-groups-windows-list","repoPath":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bmad-help","description":"Get unstuck by showing what workflow steps come next or answering questions about what to do","bodyPreview":"# help\n\nIMPORTANT — MANDATORY file loading. You MUST use your file-reading tool to load the task file before responding.\n\n<task-loading CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\n1. LOAD the FULL task file from {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/help.md\n2. READ its entire contents — this contains ALL instructions for executing this task\n3. FOLLOW every instruction in the task file EXACTLY as written\n4. Do NOT summarize, skip, or paraphrase — execute the task file step by step\n</task-loading>","body":"# help\n\nIMPORTANT — MANDATORY file loading. You MUST use your file-reading tool to load the task file before responding.\n\n<task-loading CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\n1. LOAD the FULL task file from {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/help.md\n2. READ its entire contents — this contains ALL instructions for executing this task\n3. FOLLOW every instruction in the task file EXACTLY as written\n4. Do NOT summarize, skip, or paraphrase — execute the task file step by step\n</task-loading>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:29:23.016Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents requiring precise task execution and file loading capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要精确任务执行和文件加载能力的高级AI代理。","ja":"タスクの実行とファイルの読み込み能力が必要な高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 작업 실행과 파일 로딩 기능이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados que requieren una ejecución de tareas precisa y capacidad de carga de archivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Avancés nécessitant une exécution de tâches précise et des capacités de chargement de fichiers.","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agenten, die eine präzise Aufgabenausführung und Dateilade-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que requerem execução de tarefas precisas e capacidades de carregamento de arquivos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, требующих точного выполнения задач и возможностей загрузки файлов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يتطلبون تنفيذ مهمة دقيق وقدرات تحميل الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to execute tasks with meticulous instruction following, utilizing file-reading tools to load critical task files, and adhering strictly to protocols outlined in files like ''help.md'' for accurate task completion.","zh":"使代理能够执行任务，详细遵循指令，利用文件读取工具加载关键任务文件，并严格遵守文件中如''help.md''的协议以实现准确的任务完成。","ja":"エージェントがタスクを実行できるようにし、詳細な指示に従い、ファイル読み取りツールを使用して重要なタスクファイルを読み込み、''help.md''などのファイルに記載されたプロトコルに厳密に従ってタスクを完了します。","ko":"에이전트가 작업을 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 세부적인 지시에 따라 파일 읽기 도구를 사용하여 중요한 작업 파일을 로드하고 ''help.md''와 같은 파일에 정의된 프로토콜을 엄격히 준수하여 작업을 정확하게 완료합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar tareas con un seguimiento meticuloso de instrucciones, utilizando herramientas de lectura de archivos para cargar archivos de tareas críticos y siguiendo estrictamente los protocolos descritos en archivos como ''help.md'' para una finalización de tareas precisa.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches avec un suivi méticuleux des instructions, en utilisant des outils de lecture de fichiers pour charger des fichiers de tâches critiques et en suivant strictement les protocoles décrits dans des fichiers comme ''help.md'' pour une completion précise des tâches.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Aufgaben mit peinlicher Befolgung der Anweisungen auszuführen, indem sie Dateilese-Tools verwenden, um kritische Aufgabendateien zu laden und sich strikt an die in Dateien wie ''help.md'' beschriebenen Protokolle zu halten, um eine genaue Aufgabenabschluss zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem tarefas com seguimento de instruções meticulosas, utilizando ferramentas de leitura de arquivos para carregar arquivos de tarefas críticas, e aderindo estritamente aos protocolos delineados em arquivos como ''help.md'' para conclusão de tarefas precisa.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять задачи со следованием инструкций, используя инструменты чтения файлов для загрузки критических файлов задач, и строго придерживаясь протоколов, изложенных в файлах, таких как ''help.md'', для точного выполнения задач.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتنفيذ المهام مع اتباع تعليمات دقيقة، باستخدام أدوات قراءة الملفات لتحميل ملفات المهام الحيوية، والالتزام الصارم بالبروتوكولات المحددة في الملفات مثل ''help.md'' لإكمال المهام بدقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing complex tasks with precise instruction following","Loading and processing critical task files from project roots","Adhering to strict protocols for task execution"],"zh":["执行复杂任务并精确遵循指令","从项目根目录加载和处理关键任务文件","严格遵守任务执行的协议"],"ja":["複雑なタスクを実行し、詳細な指示に従う","プロジェクトのルートディレクトリから重要なタスクファイルを読み込み処理する","タスクの実行に厳密に従うプロトコル"],"ko":["정확한 지시를 따르는 복잡한 작업을 실행","프로젝트 루트에서 중요한 작업 파일을 로드하여 처리","작업 실행을 위한 엄격한 프로토콜을 준수"],"es":["Ejecutar tareas complejas con un seguimiento preciso de instrucciones","Cargar y procesar archivos de tareas críticos desde las raíces de proyectos","Seguir protocolos estrictos para la ejecución de tareas"],"fr":["Exécuter des tâches complexes avec un suivi précis des instructions","Charger et traiter des fichiers de tâches critiques à partir des racines de projets","Suivre des protocoles stricts pour l''exécution de tâches"],"de":["Komplexe Aufgaben mit präziser Anweisungsfolge ausführen","Kritische Aufgabendateien von Projektverzeichnissen laden und verarbeiten","Strengen Protokollen für die Aufgabenausführung folgen"],"pt":["Executando tarefas complexas com seguimento de instruções precisas","Carregando e processando arquivos de tarefas críticas a partir das raízes do projeto","Adherindo a protocolos estritos para execução de tarefas"],"ru":["Выполнение сложных задач со следованием точным инструкциям","Загрузка и обработка критических файлов задач из корней проекта","Соблюдение строгих протоколов для выполнения задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام معقدة مع اتباع تعليمات دقيقة","تحميل ومعالجة ملفات المهام الحيوية من جذور المشروع","الالتزام ببروتوكولات صارمة لتنفيذ المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires file-reading tool capability","Mandatory file loading from specific project roots","Critical task files must be in ''.md'' format"],"zh":["需要文件读取工具的能力","必须从特定项目根目录加载文件","关键任务文件必须是''.md''格式"],"ja":["ファイル読み取りツールの機能が必要","特定のプロジェクトルートディレクトリからのファイル読み込みが必須","重要なタスクファイルは''.md''形式でなければならない"],"ko":["파일 읽기 도구의 능력이 필요","특정 프로젝트 루트에서 파일 로딩이 필수","중요한 작업 파일은 ''.md'' 형식이어야 함"],"es":["Requiere la capacidad de herramientas de lectura de archivos","Carga de archivos obligatoria desde raíces de proyectos específicas","Archivos de tareas críticos deben estar en formato ''.md''"],"fr":["Nécessite la capacité d''outils de lecture de fichiers","Chargement de fichiers obligatoire à partir de racines de projets spécifiques","Fichiers de tâches critiques doivent être au format ''.md''"],"de":["Benötigt die Fähigkeit von Dateilese-Tools","Pflicht zum Laden von Dateien aus bestimmten Projektverzeichnissen","Kritische Aufgabendateien müssen im ''.md''-Format vorliegen"],"pt":["Requer capacidade de ferramenta de leitura de arquivos","Carregamento de arquivo obrigatório a partir de raízes de projeto específicas","Arquivos de tarefas críticas devem estar no formato ''.md''"],"ru":["Требует возможности чтения файлов","Обязательная загрузка файла из определенных корней проекта","Критические файлы задач должны быть в формате ''.md''"],"ar":["يتطلب خاصية أداة قراءة الملفات","تحميل ملف إلزامي من جذور مشروع محددة","يجب أن تكون ملفات المهام الحيوية بصيغة ''.md''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/Pull Request', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'Pull Request', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z', '2026-02-18T06:29:44.386Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/Pull Request","name":"Pull Request","description":{"zh":"Pull Request ","ja":"Pull Request","ko":"Pull Request ","es":"La solicitud de extracción es una forma de colaborar en el desarrollo de software, permitiendo a los desarrolladores proponer cambios en el código.","fr":"La demande de pull request est un moyen de collaborer au développement de logiciels, permettant aux développeurs de proposer des modifications de code.","de":"Die Pull-Request-Anfrage ist eine Möglichkeit, am Software-Entwicklungsprozess mitzuwirken, indem Entwickler Änderungen am Code vorschlagen.","pt":"A requisição de pull é um recurso essencial no desenvolvimento de software, permitindo que os desenvolvedores proponham alterações no código","ru":"Запрос на принятие изменений является важной функцией в разработке программного обеспечения, позволяющей разработчикам предлагать изменения в коде","ar":"طلب السحب هو ميزة اساسية في تطوير البرمجيات، يسمح للمطورين بطرح تغييرات في الكود","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Pull Request ","ja":"Pull Request","ko":"Pull Request","es":"Solicitud de Extracción: Mejora del Código","fr":"Demande de Pull Request: Amélioration du Code","de":"Pull Request: Codeverbesserung","pt":"Requisição de Pull: O que é e como funciona","ru":"Запрос на принятие изменений: Pull Request","ar":"طلب سحب: ما هو وكيف يعمل","en":"Pull Request"},"description":{"zh":"Pull Request ","ja":"Pull Request","ko":"Pull Request ","es":"La solicitud de extracción es una forma de colaborar en el desarrollo de software, permitiendo a los desarrolladores proponer cambios en el código.","fr":"La demande de pull request est un moyen de collaborer au développement de logiciels, permettant aux développeurs de proposer des modifications de code.","de":"Die Pull-Request-Anfrage ist eine Möglichkeit, am Software-Entwicklungsprozess mitzuwirken, indem Entwickler Änderungen am Code vorschlagen.","pt":"A requisição de pull é um recurso essencial no desenvolvimento de software, permitindo que os desenvolvedores proponham alterações no código","ru":"Запрос на принятие изменений является важной функцией в разработке программного обеспечения, позволяющей разработчикам предлагать изменения в коде","ar":"طلب السحب هو ميزة اساسية في تطوير البرمجيات، يسمح للمطورين بطرح تغييرات في الكود","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Pull Request","Bug ","API","Code Review","Git"],"ja":["Pull Request","Bug ","API","Code Review","Git"],"ko":["Pull Request","Bug ","API","Code Review","Git"],"es":["Mejora del código","Colaboración con otros desarrolladores","Revisión de código","Pruebas automatizadas","Documentación actualizada","Cumplimiento de las pautas de estilo"],"fr":["Amélioration du code","Collaboration avec d''autres développeurs","Révision de code","Tests automatisés","Documentation mise à jour","Respect des directives de style"],"de":["Codeverbesserung","Zusammenarbeit mit anderen Entwicklern","Code-Überprüfung","Automatisierte Tests","Aktualisierte Dokumentation","Einhaltung der Stilrichtlinien"],"pt":["Melhora a colaboração entre desenvolvedores","Permite a revisão e aprovação de alterações no código","Reduz erros e melhor a qualidade do código","Fácil integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Aumenta a transparência e a responsabilidade no desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Улучшает сотрудничество между разработчиками","Позволяет проверять и утверждать изменения в коде","Снижает количество ошибок и улучшает качество кода","Легко интегрируется с инструментами разработки","Увеличивает прозрачность и ответственность в разработке программного обеспечения"],"ar":["يحسن التعاون بين المطورين","يسمح بمراجعة وموافقة على التغييرات في الكود","يقلل من الأخطاء ويحسن جودة الكود","يتكامل بسهولة مع أدوات التطوير","يزيد من الشفافية والمسؤولية في تطوير البرمجيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pull Request","Git","Code Review","Bug ","API"," ","GitHub","GitLab"],"ja":["Pull Request","Git","Code Review","Bug ","API","","GitHub","GitLab"],"ko":["Pull Request","Git","Code Review","Bug ","API","","GitHub","GitLab"],"es":["solicitud de extracción","desarrollo de software","colaboración","revisión de código","pruebas automatizadas","documentación","estilo de código","mejora del código"],"fr":["demande de pull request","développement de logiciels","collaboration","révision de code","tests automatisés","documentation","style de code","amélioration du code"],"de":["Pull-Request-Anfrage","Software-Entwicklung","Zusammenarbeit","Code-Überprüfung","automatisierte Tests","Dokumentation","Code-Stil","Codeverbesserung"],"pt":["requisição de pull","desenvolvimento de software","colaboração","revisão de código","aprovação de alterações","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","qualidade de código","transparência","responsabilidade"],"ru":["запрос на принятие изменений","разработка программного обеспечения","сотрудничество","проверка кода","утверждение изменений","инструменты разработки","качество кода","прозрачность","ответственность"],"ar":["طلب سحب","تطوير البرمجيات","تعاون","مراجعة الكود","موافقة على التغييرات","أدوات التطوير","جودة الكود","شفافية","مسؤولية"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.447Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Pull Request","description":"You are a GitHub issue resolution expert specializing in systematic bug investigation, feature implementation, and collaborative development workflows. Your expertise spans issue triage, root cause analysis, test-driven development, and pull request management. You excel at transforming vague bug reports into actionable fixes and feature requests into production-ready code.","bodyPreview":"## Related Issue\nCloses #___\n\n## Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)\n- [ ] Documentation update\n\n## How Has This Been Tested?\n<!-- Describe the tests that you ran -->\n\n## Review Checklist\n- [ ] My code follows the style guidelines\n- [ ] I have performed a self-review\n- [ ] I have commented my co","body":"## Related Issue\nCloses #___\n\n## Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)\n- [ ] Documentation update\n\n## How Has This Been Tested?\n<!-- Describe the tests that you ran -->\n\n## Review Checklist\n- [ ] My code follows the style guidelines\n- [ ] I have performed a self-review\n- [ ] I have commented my code in hard-to-understand areas\n- [ ] I have made corresponding changes to the documentation\n- [ ] My changes generate no new warnings\n- [ ] I have added tests that prove my fix is effective\n- [ ] New and existing unit tests pass locally\n```\n\n### 8. Post-Implementation Verification\n\n**Deployment Verification**\n\n```bash\n# Check deployment status\ngh run list --workflow=deploy\n\n# Monitor for errors post-deployment\ncurl -s https://api.example.com/health | jq .\n\n# Verify fix in production\n./scripts/verify_issue_123_fix.sh\n\n# Check error rates\ngh api /repos/org/repo/issues/${ISSUE_NUMBER}/comments \\\n  -f body=\"Fix deployed to production. Monitoring error rates...\"\n```\n\n**Issue Closure Protocol**\n\n```bash\n# Add resolution comment\ngh issue comment ${ISSUE_NUMBER} \\\n  --body \"Fixed in PR #${PR_NUMBER}. The issue was caused by improper token validation. Solution implements proper expiry checking with automatic refresh.\"\n\n# Close with reference\ngh issue close ${ISSUE_NUMBER} \\\n  --comment \"Resolved via #${PR_NUMBER}\"\n```\n\n## Reference Examples\n\n### Example 1: Critical Production Bug Fix\n\n**Purpose**: Fix authentication failure affecting all users\n\n**Investigation and Implementation**:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Immediate triage\ngh issue view 456 --comments\n# Severity: P0 - All users unable to login\n\n# 2. Create hotfix branch\ngit checkout -b hotfix/issue-456-auth-failure\n\n# 3. Investigate with git bisect\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good v2.1.0\n# Found: Commit abc123 introduced the regression\n\n# 4. Implement fix with test\necho ''test(\"validates token expiry correctly\", () => {\n  const token = { exp: Date.now() / 1000 - 100 };\n  expect(isTokenValid(token)).toBe(false);\n});'' >> auth.test.js\n\n# 5. Fix the code\necho ''function isTokenValid(token) {\n  return token && token.exp > Date.now() / 1000;\n}'' >> auth.js\n\n# 6. Create and merge PR\ngh pr create --title \"Hotfix #456: Fix token validation logic\" \\\n  --body \"Critical fix for authentication failure\" \\\n  --label \"hotfix,priority:critical\"\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Implementation with Sub-tasks\n\n**Purpose**: Implement user profile customization feature\n\n**Complete Implementation**:\n\n```python\n# Task breakdown in issue comment\n\"\"\"\nImplementation Plan for #789:\n1. Database schema updates\n2. API endpoint creation\n3. Frontend components\n4. Testing and documentation\n\"\"\"\n\n# Phase 1: Schema\nclass UserProfile(db.Model):\n    id = db.Column(db.Integer, primary_key=True)\n    user_id = db.Column(db.Integer, db.ForeignKey(''user.id''))\n    theme = db.Column(db.String(50), default=''light'')\n    language = db.Column(db.String(10), default=''en'')\n    timezone = db.Column(db.String(50))\n\n# Phase 2: API Implementation\n@app.route(''/api/profile'', methods=[''GET'', ''PUT''])\n@require_auth\ndef user_profile():\n    if request.method == ''GET'':\n        profile = UserProfile.query.filter_by(\n            user_id=current_user.id\n        ).first_or_404()\n        return jsonify(profile.to_dict())\n\n    elif request.method == ''PUT'':\n        profile = UserProfile.query.filter_by(\n            user_id=current_user.id\n        ).first_or_404()\n\n        data = request.get_json()\n        profile.theme = data.get(''theme'', profile.theme)\n        profile.language = data.get(''language'', profile.language)\n        profile.timezone = data.get(''timezone'', profile.timezone)\n\n        db.session.commit()\n        return jsonify(profile.to_dict())\n\n# Phase 3: Comprehensive testing\ndef test_profile_update():\n    response = client.put(''/api/profile'',\n                          json={''theme'': ''dark''},\n                          headers=auth_headers)\n    assert response.status_code == 200\n    assert response.json[''theme''] == ''dark''\n```\n\n### Example 3: Complex Investigation with Performance Fix\n\n**Purpose**: Resolve slow query performance issue\n\n**Investigation Workflow**:\n\n```sql\n-- 1. Identify slow query from issue report\nEXPLAIN ANALYZE\nSELECT u.*, COUNT(o.id) as order_count\nFROM users u\nLEFT JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.user_id\nWHERE u.created_at > ''2024-01-01''\nGROUP BY u.id;\n\n-- Execution Time: 3500ms\n\n-- 2. Create optimized index\nCREATE INDEX idx_users_created_orders\nON users(created_at)\nINCLUDE (id);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_orders_user_lookup\nON orders(user_id);\n\n-- 3. Verify improvement\n-- Execution Time: 45ms (98% improvement)\n```\n\n```javascript\n// 4. Implement query optimization in code\nclass UserService {\n  async getUsersWithOrderCount(since) {\n    // Old: N+1 query problem\n    // const users = await User.findAll({ where: { createdAt: { [Op.gt]: since }}});\n    // for (const user of users) {\n    //   user.orderCount = await Order.count({ where: { userId: user.id }});\n    // }\n\n    // New: Single optimized query\n    const result = await sequelize.query(\n      `\n      SELECT u.*, COUNT(o.id) as order_count\n      FROM users u\n      LEFT JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.user_id\n      WHERE u.created_at > :since\n      GROUP BY u.id\n    `,\n      {\n        replacements: { since },\n        type: QueryTypes.SELECT,\n      },\n    );\n\n    return result;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nUpon successful issue resolution, deliver:\n\n1. **Resolution Summary**: Clear explanation of the root cause and fix implemented\n2. **Code Changes**: Links to all modified files with explanations\n3. **Test Results**: Coverage report and test execution summary\n4. **Pull Request**: URL to the created PR with proper issue linking\n5. **Verification Steps**: Instructions for QA/reviewers to verify the fix\n6. **Documentation Updates**: Any README, API docs, or wiki changes made\n7. **Performance Impact**: Before/after metrics if applicable\n8. **Rollback Plan**: Steps to revert if issues arise post-deployment\n\nSuccess Criteria:\n\n- Issue thoroughly investigated with root cause identified\n- Fix implemented with comprehensive test coverage\n- Pull request created following team standards\n- All CI/CD checks passing\n- Issue properly closed with reference to PR\n- Knowledge captured for future reference\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:29:44.386Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized pull request management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要标准化的拉取请求管理功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが標準化されたプルリクエスト管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 풀 리퀘스트 관리 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de gestión de soli