":"React Three Fiber と Poimandres エコシステムのベストプラクティス ガイド、60 個以上のルールと 11 のカテゴリを含む","ko":"React Three Fiber와 Poimandres 생태계의 최고의 관행 가이드, 60개 이상의 규칙과 11개의 범주를 포함","es":"Guía completa para React Three Fiber y el ecosistema de Poimandres, con 60+ reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","fr":"Guide complet pour React Three Fiber et l''écosystème Poimandres, avec 60+ règles pour optimiser les performances","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden für React Three Fiber und das Poimandres-Ökosystem, mit 60+ Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"Guia de melhores práticas para React Three Fiber e o ecossistema Poimandres, com 60+ regras em 11 categorias","ru":"Справка по лучшим практикам для React Three Fiber и экосистемы Poimandres, содержащая 60+ правил в 11 категориях","ar":"دليل لأفضل الممارسات لري액ت ثري فايبر وبيئة بويماندريس، مع 60+ قاعدة في 11 فئة","en":"a \"playground\" to learn running the Copilot CLI and SDK isolated in Docker"},"definition":{"en":"a \"playground\" to learn running the Copilot CLI and SDK isolated in Docker"},"features":{"zh":["60+ 条规则和 11 个类别","优化 React Three Fiber 性能","正确使用 Drei 辅助函数","管理状态以 Zustand","实现后处理和物理效果"],"ja":["60 個以上のルールと 11 のカテゴリ","React Three Fiber のパフォーマンスを最適化","Drei ヘルパー関数を正しく使用","状態を Zustand で管理","ポスト処理と物理エフェクトを実装"],"ko":["60개 이상의 규칙과 11개의 범주","React Three Fiber 성능 최적화","Drei 헬퍼 함수를 올바르게 사용","상태를 Zustand로 관리","후처리와 물리 효과 구현"],"es":["60+ reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","11 categorías para facilitar la implementación","Guías para la escritura de componentes R3F","Optimización de re-renders","Uso correcto de Drei helpers","Gestión de estado con Zustand"],"fr":["60+ règles pour optimiser les performances","11 catégories pour faciliter la mise en œuvre","Guides pour l''écriture de composants R3F","Optimisation des re-renders","Utilisation correcte des helpers Drei","Gestion de l''état avec Zustand"],"de":["60+ Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","11 Kategorien für eine einfache Implementierung","Anleitungen für die Erstellung von R3F-Komponenten","Optimierung von Re-renders","Korrekter Einsatz von Drei-Hilfen","Verwaltung von Zustand mit Zustand"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas para R3F","Uso correto de helpers Drei","Gestão de estado com Zustand","Implementação de pós-processamento e física"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики для R3F","Правильное использование хелперов Drei","Управление состоянием с Zustand","Реализация постобработки и физики"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات لري액ت ثري فايبر","استخدام مساعدين Drei بشكل صحيح","إدارة الحالة مع Zustand","تنفيذ المعالجة اللاحقة والفيزياء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Three Fiber","最佳实践","性能优化","Drei","Zustand","后处理","物理效果"],"ja":["React Three Fiber","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","Drei","Zustand","ポスト処理","物理エフェクト"],"ko":["React Three Fiber","최선의 관행","성능 최적화","Drei","Zustand","후처리","물리 효과"],"es":["React Three Fiber","optimización de rendimiento","Poimandres","Three.js","Drei helpers","Zustand","re-renders","componentes R3F"],"fr":["React Three Fiber","optimisation des performances","Poimandres","Three.js","helpers Drei","Zustand","re-renders","composants R3F"],"de":["React Three Fiber","Leistungsoptimierung","Poimandres","Three.js","Drei-Hilfen","Zustand","Re-renders","R3F-Komponenten"],"pt":["React Three Fiber","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","R3F","Drei","Zustand","Three.js","React"],"ru":["React Three Fiber","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","R3F","Drei","Zustand","Three.js","React"],"ar":["ري액ت ثري فايبر","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","R3F","Drei","Zustand","Three.js","ري액ت"]}},"owner":"deadronos","repo":"copilot-chat-playground","repoPath":"deadronos/copilot-chat-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"r3f-best-practices","description":"React Three Fiber (R3F) and Poimandres ecosystem best practices. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing R3F code. Triggers on tasks involving @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, zustand, @react-three/postprocessing, @react-three/rapier, or leva.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@r","body":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@react-three/drei** - Useful helpers and abstractions\n- **@react-three/postprocessing** - Post-processing effects\n- **@react-three/rapier** - Physics engine\n- **zustand** - State management\n- **leva** - Debug GUI\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Performance & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `perf-` |\n| 2 | useFrame & Animation | CRITICAL | `frame-` |\n| 3 | Component Patterns | HIGH | `component-` |\n| 4 | Canvas & Setup | HIGH | `canvas-` |\n| 5 | Drei Helpers | MEDIUM-HIGH | `drei-` |\n| 6 | Loading & Suspense | MEDIUM-HIGH | `loading-` |\n| 7 | State Management | MEDIUM | `state-` |\n| 8 | Events & Interaction | MEDIUM | `events-` |\n| 9 | Post-processing | MEDIUM | `postpro-` |\n| 10 | Physics (Rapier) | LOW-MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 11 | Leva (Debug GUI) | LOW | `leva-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Performance & Re-renders (CRITICAL)\n\n- `perf-never-set-state-in-useframe` - NEVER call setState in useFrame\n- `perf-isolate-state` - Isolate components that need React state\n- `perf-zustand-selectors` - Use Zustand selectors, not entire store\n- `perf-transient-subscriptions` - Use transient subscriptions for continuous values\n- `perf-memo-components` - Memoize expensive components\n- `perf-keys-for-lists` - Use stable keys for dynamic lists\n- `perf-avoid-inline-objects` - Avoid creating objects/arrays in JSX\n- `perf-dispose-auto` - Understand R3F auto-dispose behavior\n\n### 2. useFrame & Animation (CRITICAL)\n\n- `frame-priority` - Use priority for execution order\n- `frame-delta-time` - Always use delta for animations\n- `frame-conditional-subscription` - Disable useFrame when not needed\n- `frame-destructure-state` - Destructure only what you need\n- `frame-render-on-demand` - Use invalidate() for on-demand rendering\n- `frame-avoid-heavy-computation` - Move heavy work outside useFrame\n\n### 3. Component Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `component-jsx-elements` - Use JSX for Three.js objects\n- `component-attach-prop` - Use attach for non-standard properties\n- `component-primitive` - Use primitive for existing objects\n- `component-extend` - Use extend() for custom classes\n- `component-forwardref` - Use forwardRef for reusable components\n- `component-dispose-null` - Set dispose={null} on shared resources\n\n### 4. Canvas & Setup (HIGH)\n\n- `canvas-size-container` - Canvas fills parent container\n- `canvas-camera-default` - Configure camera via prop\n- `canvas-gl-config` - Configure WebGL context\n- `canvas-shadows` - Enable shadows at Canvas level\n- `canvas-frameloop` - Choose appropriate frameloop mode\n- `canvas-events` - Configure event handling\n- `canvas-linear-flat` - Use linear/flat for correct colors\n\n### 5. Drei Helpers (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `drei-use-gltf` - useGLTF with preloading\n- `drei-use-texture` - useTexture for texture loading\n- `drei-environment` - Environment for realistic lighting\n- `drei-orbit-controls` - OrbitControls from Drei\n- `drei-html` - Html for DOM overlays\n- `drei-text` - Text for 3D text\n- `drei-instances` - Instances for optimized instancing\n- `drei-use-helper` - useHelper for debug visualization\n- `drei-bounds` - Bounds to fit camera\n- `drei-center` - Center to center objects\n- `drei-float` - Float for floating animation\n\n### 6. Loading & Suspense (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `loading-suspense` - Wrap async components in Suspense\n- `loading-preload` - Preload assets with useGLTF.preload\n- `loading-use-progress` - useProgress for loading UI\n- `loading-lazy-components` - Lazy load heavy components\n- `loading-error-boundary` - Handle loading errors\n\n### 7. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-zustand-store` - Create focused Zustand stores\n- `state-avoid-objects-in-store` - Be careful with Three.js objects\n- `state-subscribeWithSelector` - Fine-grained subscriptions\n- `state-persist` - Persist state when needed\n- `state-separate-concerns` - Separate stores by concern\n\n### 8. Events & Interaction (MEDIUM)\n\n- `events-pointer-events` - Use pointer events on meshes\n- `events-stop-propagation` - Prevent event bubbling\n- `events-cursor-pointer` - Change cursor on hover\n- `events-raycast-filter` - Filter raycasting\n- `events-event-data` - Understand event data structure\n\n### 9. Post-processing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `postpro-effect-composer` - Use EffectComposer\n- `postpro-common-effects` - Common effects reference\n- `postpro-selective-bloom` - SelectiveBloom for optimized glow\n- `postpro-custom-shader` - Create custom effects\n- `postpro-performance` - Optimize post-processing\n\n### 10. Physics Rapier (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-setup` - Basic Rapier setup\n- `physics-body-types` - dynamic, fixed, kinematic\n- `physics-colliders` - Choose appropriate colliders\n- `physics-events` - Handle collision events\n- `physics-api-ref` - Use ref for physics API\n- `physics-performance` - Optimize physics\n\n### 11. Leva (LOW)\n\n- `leva-basic` - Basic Leva usage\n- `leva-folders` - Organize with folders\n- `leva-conditional` - Hide in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/perf-never-set-state-in-useframe.md\nrules/drei-use-gltf.md\nrules/state-zustand-selectors.md\n```\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `../R3F_BEST_PRACTICES.md`\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### NEVER setState in useFrame\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - 60 re-renders per second!\nfunction BadComponent() {\n  const [position, setPosition] = useState(0);\n  useFrame(() => {\n    setPosition(p => p + 0.01); // NEVER DO THIS\n  });\n  return <mesh position-x={position} />;\n}\n\n// GOOD - Mutate refs directly\nfunction GoodComponent() {\n  const meshRef = useRef();\n  useFrame(() => {\n    meshRef.current.position.x += 0.01;\n  });\n  return <mesh ref={meshRef} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Zustand Selectors\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useGameStore();\n\n// GOOD - Only re-renders when playerX changes\nconst playerX = useGameStore(state => state.playerX);\n\n// BETTER - No re-renders, direct mutation\nuseFrame(() => {\n  const { value } = useStore.getState();\n  ref.current.position.x = value;\n});\n```\n\n### Drei useGLTF\n\n```jsx\nimport { useGLTF } from ''@react-three/drei'';\n\nfunction Model() {\n  const { scene } = useGLTF(''/model.glb'');\n  return <primitive object={scene} />;\n}\n\n// Preload for instant loading\nuseGLTF.preload(''/model.glb'');\n```\n\n### Suspense Loading\n\n```jsx\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Suspense fallback={<Loader />}>\n        <Model />\n      </Suspense>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:30:31.870Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React Three Fiber integration and optimization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React Three Fiber 集成和优化技术的前端代理。","ja":"React Three Fiber の高度な統合と最適化技術を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Three Fiber 통합 및 최적화 기술이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan integración y técnicas de optimización avanzadas de React Three Fiber.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une intégration et de techniques d''optimisation avancées de React Three Fiber.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte React Three Fiber-Integration und -Optimierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de integração e otimização do React Three Fiber.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые техники интеграции и оптимизации React Three Fiber.","ar":"مثالي لأعضاء الوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتكامل وتنشيط React Three Fiber."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Three Fiber performance by applying 60+ rules across 11 categories, utilizing libraries like @react-three/fiber and @r3f/drei, and managing state with Zustand, while implementing post-processing or physics.","zh":"通过应用 60 多条规则跨 11 个类别，利用 @react-three/fiber 和 @r3f/drei 等库，并使用 Zustand 管理状态，同时实现后处理或物理效果，从而使代理能够优化 React Three Fiber 性能。","ja":"60 を超えるルールを 11 のカテゴリにわたって適用し、@react-three/fiber や @r3f/drei などのライブラリを利用し、Zustand で状態を管理し、ポストプロセッシングまたは物理を実装することで、エージェントが React Three Fiber のパフォーマンスを最適化できるようにします。","ko":"60개 이상의 규칙을 11개 카테고리에 걸쳐 적용하고, @react-three/fiber 및 @r3f/drei 등의 라이브러리를 활용하며, Zustand로 상태를 관리하고, 후처리 또는 물리 효과를 구현함으로써 에이전트가 React Three Fiber 성능을 최적화 할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el rendimiento de React Three Fiber aplicando más de 60 reglas en 11 categorías, utilizando bibliotecas como @react-three/fiber y @r3f/drei, y gestionando el estado con Zustand, al mismo tiempo que implementa el procesamiento posterior o la física.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React Three Fiber en appliquant plus de 60 règles dans 11 catégories, en utilisant des bibliothèques telles que @react-three/fiber et @r3f/drei, et en gérant l''état avec Zustand, tout en implementant le post-traitement ou la physique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Leistung von React Three Fiber zu optimieren, indem sie über 60 Regeln in 11 Kategorien anwenden, Bibliotheken wie @react-three/fiber und @r3f/drei verwenden und den Zustand mit Zustand verwalten, während sie gleichzeitig die Nachbearbeitung oder Physik implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React Three Fiber aplicando 60+ regras em 11 categorias, utilizando bibliotecas como @react-three/fiber e @r3f/drei, e gerenciando estado com Zustand, além de implementar pós-processamento ou física.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность React Three Fiber, применяя 60+ правил в 11 категориях, используя библиотеки как @react-three/fiber и @r3f/drei, и управляя состоянием с Zustand, а также реализуя постобработку или физику.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين أداء React Three Fiber من خلال تطبيق أكثر من 60 قاعدة في 11 فئة، واستخدام مكتبات مثل @react-three/fiber و @r3f/drei، وإدارة الحالة مع Zustand، بالإضافة إلى تنفيذ المعالجة اللاحقة أو الفيزياء."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing R3F component re-renders for better performance","Implementing Drei helpers correctly for enhanced scene management","Managing complex state with Zustand in React Three Fiber applications"],"zh":["优化 R3F 组件重渲染以获得更好的性能","正确实现 Drei 辅助工具以增强场景管理","使用 Zustand 在 React Three Fiber 应用程序中管理复杂状态"],"ja":["R3F コンポーネントの再描画を最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる","Drei ヘルパーを正しく実装してシーン管理を強化する","Zustand を使用して React Three Fiber アプリケーションで複雑な状態を管理する"],"ko":["R3F 컴포넌트의 재 렌더링을 최적화하여 성능을 개선하는 것","Drei 헬퍼를 올바르게 구현하여 장면 관리를 강화하는 것","Zustand를 사용하여 React Three Fiber 애플리케이션에서 복잡한 상태를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las re-renderezas de componentes R3F para una mejor rendimiento","Implement