description":{"zh":"LangChain智能代理开发专家，专注于生产级AI系统的开发和部署","ja":"LangChainエージェント開発の専門家、生産レベルのAIシステムの開発と展開に焦点を当て","ko":"LangChain 에이전트 개발 전문가, 생산급 AI 시스템 개발 및 배포에 중점","es":"LangChain-Agent es una plataforma de observabilidad de IA para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM. Ofrece ingestión de OTLP, almacenamiento de DuckDB y convencio...","fr":"LangChain-Agent est une plateforme d''observabilité de l''IA pour les charges de travail GenAI/LLM. Elle offre l''ingestion OTLP, le stockage DuckDB et les conv...","de":"LangChain-Agent ist eine Plattform für die Beobachtung von KI für GenAI/LLM-Workloads. Sie bietet OTLP-Erfassung, DuckDB-Speicherung und semantische Konventi...","pt":"O LangChain é uma plataforma de observabilidade de IA para cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM, com suporte a OTLP e DuckDB","ru":"LangChain - платформа для наблюдения за ИИ для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM, с поддержкой OTLP и DuckDB","ar":"لانغ تشين هو منصة مراقبة ذكاء اصطناعي لحملات عمل جين إيه آي/إل إل إم، مع دعم أو تي إل بي و داك دي بي","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["支持OTLP摄取","使用DuckDB存储","遵循AI遥测的语义约定","支持LangGraph和RAG系统","提供向量搜索和AI代理架构"],"ja":["OTLPの取り込みをサポート","DuckDBを使用してストレージ","AIテレメトリのセマンティック規約を遵守","LangGraphとRAGシステムをサポート","ベクトル検索とAIエージェントアーキテクチャを提供"],"ko":["OTLP 수신 지원","DuckDB 저장소 사용","AI 원격 측정의 의미적 규약 준수","LangGraph 및 RAG 시스템 지원","벡터 검색 및 AI 에이전트 아키텍처 제공"],"es":["Ingestión de OTLP","Almacenamiento de DuckDB","Convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA","Soporte para GenAI/LLM","Desarrollo de sistemas de inteligencia artificial de nivel de producción"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP","Stockage DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA","Prise en charge de GenAI/LLM","Développement de systèmes d''intelligence artificielle de niveau de production"],"de":["OTLP-Erfassung","DuckDB-Speicherung","Semantische Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie","Unterstützung für GenAI/LLM","Entwicklung von Produktions-IA-Systemen"],"pt":["Suporte a OTLP para ingestão de dados","Armazenamento de dados com DuckDB","Convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA","Desenvolvimento de agentes LangChain para produção","Integração com LangGraph e RAG systems","Suporte a vector search e arquiteturas de agentes de IA"],"ru":["Поддержка OTLP для ингестии данных","Хранение данных с помощью DuckDB","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ","Разработка агентов LangChain для производства","Интеграция с LangGraph и RAG systems","Поддержка векторного поиска и архитектур агентов ИИ"],"ar":["دعم أو تي إل بي لاستيعاب البيانات","تخزين البيانات باستخدام داك دي بي","اتفاقيات دلالية لمراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير وكلاء لانغ تشين للانتاج","التكامل مع لانغ جراف و أنظمة راج","دعم البحث المتجه والهياكل المعمارية لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain","AI观测","LangGraph","RAG系统","向量搜索","AI代理架构","生产级AI系统","GenAI","LLM"],"ja":["LangChain","AI観測","LangGraph","RAGシステム","ベクトル検索","AIエージェントアーキテクチャ","生産レベルのAIシステム","GenAI","LLM"],"ko":["LangChain","AI 관찰","LangGraph","RAG 시스템","벡터 검색","AI 에이전트 아키텍처","생산급 AI 시스템","GenAI","LLM"],"es":["LangChain-Agent","desarrollo de IA","GenAI","LLM","observabilidad de IA","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetría de IA"],"fr":["LangChain-Agent","développement de l''IA","GenAI","LLM","observabilité de l''IA","OTLP","DuckDB","télémétrie de l''IA"],"de":["LangChain-Agent","KI-Entwicklung","GenAI","LLM","Beobachtung von KI","OTLP","DuckDB","KI-Telemetrie"],"pt":["LangChain","Observabilidade de IA","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","Desenvolvimento de agentes","LangGraph","RAG systems","Vector search"],"ru":["LangChain","Наблюдение за ИИ","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","Разработка агентов","LangGraph","RAG systems","Векторный поиск"],"ar":["لانغ تشين","مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","جين إيه آي","إل إل إم","أو تي إل بي","داك دي بي","تطوير الوكلاء","لانغ جراف","أنظمة راج","البحث المتجه"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain-agent","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  argument-hint: \"<agent-type> [options]\"\nplugin:\n  name: \"llm-application-dev\"\n  description: \"LLM application development with LangGraph, RAG systems, vector search, and AI agent architectures for Claude 4.5 and GPT-5.2\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# LangChain/LangGraph Agent Development Expert\n\nYou are an expert LangChain agent developer specializing in production-grade AI systems using LangChain 0.1+ and La","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  argument-hint: \"<agent-type> [options]\"\nplugin:\n  name: \"llm-application-dev\"\n  description: \"LLM application development with LangGraph, RAG systems, vector search, and AI agent architectures for Claude 4.5 and GPT-5.2\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# LangChain/LangGraph Agent Development Expert\n\nYou are an expert LangChain agent developer specializing in production-grade AI systems using LangChain 0.1+ and LangGraph.\n\n## Context\n\nBuild sophisticated AI agent system for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n- Use latest LangChain 0.1+ and LangGraph APIs\n- Implement async patterns throughout\n- Include comprehensive error handling and fallbacks\n- Integrate LangSmith for observability\n- Design for scalability and production deployment\n- Implement security best practices\n- Optimize for cost efficiency\n\n## Essential Architecture\n\n### LangGraph State Management\n\n```python\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph, MessagesState, START, END\nfrom langgraph.prebuilt import create_react_agent\nfrom langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\n\nclass AgentState(TypedDict):\n    messages: Annotated[list, \"conversation history\"]\n    context: Annotated[dict, \"retrieved context\"]\n```\n\n### Model & Embeddings\n\n- **Primary LLM**: Claude Sonnet 4.5 (`claude-sonnet-4-5`)\n- **Embeddings**: Voyage AI (`voyage-3-large`) - officially recommended by Anthropic for Claude\n- **Specialized**: `voyage-code-3` (code), `voyage-finance-2` (finance), `voyage-law-2` (legal)\n\n## Agent Types\n\n1. **ReAct Agents**: Multi-step reasoning with tool usage\n   - Use `create_react_agent(llm, tools, state_modifier)`\n   - Best for general-purpose tasks\n\n2. **Plan-and-Execute**: Complex tasks requiring upfront planning\n   - Separate planning and execution nodes\n   - Track progress through state\n\n3. **Multi-Agent Orchestration**: Specialized agents with supervisor routing\n   - Use `Command[Literal[\"agent1\", \"agent2\", END]]` for routing\n   - Supervisor decides next agent based on context\n\n## Memory Systems\n\n- **Short-term**: `ConversationTokenBufferMemory` (token-based windowing)\n- **Summarization**: `ConversationSummaryMemory` (compress long histories)\n- **Entity Tracking**: `ConversationEntityMemory` (track people, places, facts)\n- **Vector Memory**: `VectorStoreRetrieverMemory` with semantic search\n- **Hybrid**: Combine multiple memory types for comprehensive context\n\n## RAG Pipeline\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_voyageai import VoyageAIEmbeddings\nfrom langchain_pinecone import PineconeVectorStore\n\n# Setup embeddings (voyage-3-large recommended for Claude)\nembeddings = VoyageAIEmbeddings(model=\"voyage-3-large\")\n\n# Vector store with hybrid search\nvectorstore = PineconeVectorStore(\n    index=index,\n    embedding=embeddings\n)\n\n# Retriever with reranking\nbase_retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(\n    search_type=\"hybrid\",\n    search_kwargs={\"k\": 20, \"alpha\": 0.5}\n)\n```\n\n### Advanced RAG Patterns\n\n- **HyDE**: Generate hypothetical documents for better retrieval\n- **RAG Fusion**: Multiple query perspectives for comprehensive results\n- **Reranking**: Use Cohere Rerank for relevance optimization\n\n## Tools & Integration\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_core.tools import StructuredTool\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n\nclass ToolInput(BaseModel):\n    query: str = Field(description=\"Query to process\")\n\nasync def tool_function(query: str) -> str:\n    # Implement with error handling\n    try:\n        result = await external_call(query)\n        return result\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"Error: {str(e)}\"\n\ntool = StructuredTool.from_function(\n    func=tool_function,\n    name=\"tool_name\",\n    description=\"What this tool does\",\n    args_schema=ToolInput,\n    coroutine=tool_function\n)\n```\n\n## Production Deployment\n\n### FastAPI Server with Streaming\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.responses import StreamingResponse\n\n@app.post(\"/agent/invoke\")\nasync def invoke_agent(request: AgentRequest):\n    if request.stream:\n        return StreamingResponse(\n            stream_response(request),\n            media_type=\"text/event-stream\"\n        )\n    return await agent.ainvoke({\"messages\": [...]})\n```\n\n### Monitoring & Observability\n\n- **LangSmith**: Trace all agent executions\n- **Prometheus**: Track metrics (requests, latency, errors)\n- **Structured Logging**: Use `structlog` for consistent logs\n- **Health Checks**: Validate LLM, tools, memory, and external services\n\n### Optimization Strategies\n\n- **Caching**: Redis for response caching with TTL\n- **Connection Pooling**: Reuse vector DB connections\n- **Load Balancing**: Multiple agent workers with round-robin routing\n- **Timeout Handling**: Set timeouts on all async operations\n- **Retry Logic**: Exponential backoff with max retries\n\n## Testing & Evaluation\n\n```python\nfrom langsmith.evaluation import evaluate\n\n# Run evaluation suite\neval_config = RunEvalConfig(\n    evaluators=[\"qa\", \"context_qa\", \"cot_qa\"],\n    eval_llm=ChatAnthropic(model=\"claude-sonnet-4-5\")\n)\n\nresults = await evaluate(\n    agent_function,\n    data=dataset_name,\n    evaluators=eval_config\n)\n```\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### State Graph Pattern\n\n```python\nbuilder = StateGraph(MessagesState)\nbuilder.add_node(\"node1\", node1_func)\nbuilder.add_node(\"node2\", node2_func)\nbuilder.add_edge(START, \"node1\")\nbuilder.add_conditional_edges(\"node1\", router, {\"a\": \"node2\", \"b\": END})\nbuilder.add_edge(\"node2\", END)\nagent = builder.compile(checkpointer=checkpointer)\n```\n\n### Async Pattern\n\n```python\nasync def process_request(message: str, session_id: str):\n    result = await agent.ainvoke(\n        {\"messages\": [HumanMessage(content=message)]},\n        config={\"configurable\": {\"thread_id\": session_id}}\n    )\n    return result[\"messages\"][-1].content\n```\n\n### Error Handling Pattern\n\n```python\nfrom tenacity import retry, stop_after_attempt, wait_exponential\n\n@retry(stop=stop_after_attempt(3), wait=wait_exponential(multiplier=1, min=4, max=10))\nasync def call_with_retry():\n    try:\n        return await llm.ainvoke(prompt)\n    except Exception as e:\n        logger.error(f\"LLM error: {e}\")\n        raise\n```\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Initialize LLM with Claude Sonnet 4.5\n- [ ] Setup Voyage AI embeddings (voyage-3-large)\n- [ ] Create tools with async support and error handling\n- [ ] Implement memory system (choose type based on use case)\n- [ ] Build state graph with LangGraph\n- [ ] Add LangSmith tracing\n- [ ] Implement streaming responses\n- [ ] Setup health checks and monitoring\n- [ ] Add caching layer (Redis)\n- [ ] Configure retry logic and timeouts\n- [ ] Write evaluation tests\n- [ ] Document API endpoints and usage\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use async**: `ainvoke`, `astream`, `aget_relevant_documents`\n2. **Handle errors gracefully**: Try/except with fallbacks\n3. **Monitor everything**: Trace, log, and metric all operations\n4. **Optimize costs**: Cache responses, use token limits, compress memory\n5. **Secure secrets**: Environment variables, never hardcode\n6. **Test thoroughly**: Unit tests, integration tests, evaluation suites\n7. **Document extensively**: API docs, architecture diagrams, runbooks\n8. **Version control state**: Use checkpointers for reproducibility\n\n---\n\nBuild production-ready, scalable, and observable LangChain agents following these patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:32:49.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing LangChain-based logging and observability capabilities for GenAI/LLM workloads.","zh":"适用于需要基于 LangChain 的日志记录和可观察性能力的高级 AI 代理，特别适用于 GenAI/LLM 工作负载。","ja":"LangChainベースのログ記録および可観測性機能を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに最適です。特にGenAI/LLMワークロードに適しています。","ko":"LangChain 기반 로깅 및 관측 가능성 기능이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 GenAI/LLM 작업에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan capacidades de registro y observabilidad basadas en LangChain para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA avancés ayant besoin de capacités de journalisation et d''observabilité basées sur LangChain pour les charges de travail GenAI/LLM.","de":"Perfekt für fortgeschrittene KI-Agents, die LangChain-basierte Protokollierungs- und Überwachungsfunktionen für GenAI/LLM-Workloads benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de capacidades de registro e observabilidade baseadas em LangChain para cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуются возможности ведения журнала и наблюдаемости на основе LangChain для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى سجلات وتوفر إمكانيات المراقبة القائمة على LangChain لعمليات العمل GenAI/LLM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ingest logs via OTLP, store them in DuckDB, and apply semantic conventions for AI telemetry, enhancing observability and debugging of LangChain and LangGraph applications, particularly for Claude 4.5 and GPT-5.2 architectures.","zh":"赋予代理通过 OTLP 摄取日志、将其存储在 DuckDB 中并应用语义约定以进行 AI 遥测的能力，从而增强 LangChain 和 LangGraph 应用程序的可观察性和调试，特别适用于 Claude 4.5 和 GPT-5.2 架构。","ja":"OTLPを介してログを摄取し、DuckDBに保存し、AIテレメトリのためのセマンティック規約を適用することで、LangChainおよびLangGraphアプリケーション、特にClaude 4.5およびGPT-5.2アーキテクチャの可観測性およびデバッグを強化するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 OTLP를 통해 로그를 수집하고 DuckDB에 저장하고 AI 원격 측정을 위한 의미 규약을 적용하여 LangChain 및 LangGraph 애플리케이션의 관측 가능성 및 디버깅을 강화할 수 있도록 하며, 특히 Claude 4.5 및 GPT-5.2 아키텍처에 적합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ingerir registros a través de OTLP, almacenarlos en DuckDB y aplicar convenciones semánticas para la telemetría de IA, mejorando la observabilidad y la depuración de las aplicaciones LangChain y LangGraph, particularmente para las arquitecturas Claude 4.5 y GPT-5.2.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''ingérer des journaux via OTLP, de les stocker dans DuckDB et d''appliquer des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA, améliorant ainsi l''observabilité et le débogage des applications LangChain et LangGraph, en particulier pour les architectures Claude 4.5 et GPT-5.2.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Logs über OTLP zu importieren, sie in DuckDB zu speichern und semantische Konventionen für die KI-Telemetrie anzuwenden, wodurch die Überwachung und Fehlersuche von LangChain- und LangGraph-Anwendungen, insbesondere für die Architekturen Claude 4.5 und GPT-5.2, verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ingerir logs via OTLP, armazená-los no DuckDB e aplicar convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA, melhorando a observabilidade e a depuração de aplicações LangChain e LangGraph, particularmente para arquiteturas Claude 4.5 e GPT-5.2.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью принимать журналы через OTLP, хранить их в DuckDB и применять семантические соглашения для телеметрии ИИ, повышая наблюдаемость и отладку приложений LangChain и LangGraph, особенно для архитектур Claude 4.5 и GPT-5.2.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من استهلاك السجلات من خلال OTLP وتخزينها في DuckDB وتطبيق الاتفاقيات المعمارية للاتصالات الهاتفية الاصطناعية، وتحسين القدرة على المراقبة وتصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات LangChain و LangGraph، ولا سيما لعمارة كلود 4.5 و GPT-5.2."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing AI model performance with LangGraph","Debugging GenAI/LLM workloads using OTLP ingestion","Optimizing LangChain agent architectures for production environments"],"zh":["使用 LangGraph 分析 AI 模型性能","使用 OTLP 摄取调试 GenAI/LLM 工作负载","优化 LangChain 代理架构以适用于生产环境"],"ja":["LangGraphを使用してAIモデルのパフォーマンスを分析する","OTLPを使用してGenAI/LLMワークロードをデバッグする","LangChainエージェントアーキテクチャをプロダクション環境に最適化する"],"ko":["LangGraph를 사용하여 AI 모델 성능 분석","OTLP를 사용하여 GenAI/LLM 작업 디버깅","LangChain 에이전트 아키텍처를 프로덕션 환경에 최적화"],"es":["Análisis del rendimiento de modelos de IA con LangGraph","Depuración de cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM mediante la ingesta de OTLP","Optimización de arquitecturas de agentes de LangChain para entornos de producción"],"fr":["Analyse des performances des modèles d''IA avec LangGraph","Débogage des charges de travail GenAI/LLM à l''aide de l''ingestion OTLP","Optimisation des architectures d''agents LangChain pour les environnements de production"],"de":["Analyse der Leistung von KI-Modellen mit LangGraph","Fehlersuche bei GenAI/LLM-Workloads mithilfe der OTLP-Importfunktion","Optimierung von LangChain-Agenten-Architekturen für Produktionsumgebungen"],"pt":["Analisar o desempenho do modelo de IA com LangGraph","Depurar cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM usando ingestão de OTLP","Otimizar arquiteturas de agentes de LangChain para ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Анализ производительности модели ИИ с LangGraph","Отладка рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM с помощью ингестии OTLP","Оптимизация архитектур агентов LangChain для производственных сред"],"ar":["تحليل أداء نموذج الذكاء الاصطناعي مع LangGraph","تصحيح أخطاء في عمليات العمل GenAI/LLM باستخدام استهلاك OTLP","تحسين هياكل وكيل LangChain للبيئات الإنتاجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion capabilities","DuckDB storage dependency","Compatibility limited to LangChain 0.1+ and specific LLM architectures like Claude 4.5 and GPT-5.2"],"zh":["需要 OTLP 摄取功能","依赖于 DuckDB 存储","兼容性仅限于 LangChain 0.1+ 及特定 LLM 架构，如 Claude 4.5 和 GPT-5.2"],"ja":["OTLP摄取機能が必要","DuckDBストレージへの依存","LangChain 0.1+およびClaude 4.5およびGPT-5.2などの特定のLLMアーキテクチャへの互換性のみ"],"ko":["OTLP 수집 기능 필요","DuckDB 저장소 종속성","LangChain 0.1+ 및 Claude 4.5, GPT-5.2와 같은 특정 LLM 아키텍처에 대한 호환성만"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de ingesta de OTLP","Dependencia de almacenamiento de DuckDB","Compatibilidad limitada a LangChain 0.1+ y arquitecturas LLM específicas como Claude 4.5 y GPT-5.2"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''ingestion OTLP","Dépendance de stockage DuckDB","Compatibilité limitée à LangChain 0.1+ et à des architectures LLM spécifiques comme Claude 4.5 et GPT-5.2"],"de":["Erfordert OTLP-Importfunktionen","Abhängigkeit vom DuckDB-Speicher","Kompatibilität beschränkt auf LangChain 0.1+ und spezifische LLM-Architekturen wie Claude 4.5 und GPT-5.2"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de ingestão de OTLP","Dependência de armazenamento do DuckDB","Compatibilidade limitada à LangChain 0.1+ e arquiteturas de LLM específicas, como Claude 4.5 e GPT-5.2"],"ru":["Требует возможностей ингестии OTLP","Зависимость от хранилища DuckDB","Ограниченная совместимость с LangChain 0.1+ и определенными архитектурами LLM, такими как Claude 4.5 и GPT-5.2"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات استهلاك OTLP","اعتماد على تخزين DuckDB","توافق محدود مع LangChain 0.1+ وعمارة محددة من LLM، مثل كلود 4.5 و GPT-5.2"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
