 ","ja":"ancplua-ecosystem AI ","ko":"ancplua-ecosystem AI ","es":"La plataforma de observabilidad AI para GenAI/LLM ofrece una solución integral para monitorear y analizar logs","fr":"La plateforme d''observabilité AI pour GenAI/LLM offre une solution intégrale pour surveiller et analyser les logs","de":"Die AI-Observability-Plattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads bietet eine umfassende Lösung für die Überwachung und Analyse von Logs","pt":"A plataforma ancplua-ecosystem é uma solução de observabilidade de IA para cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM, com recursos como ingestão de OTLP e armazenament...","ru":"Платформа ancplua-ecosystem является решением для наблюдаемости ИИ для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM, с функциями seperti ингестии OTLP и хранения в DuckDB","ar":"منصة ancplua-ecosystem هي حل مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحميل العمل من GenAI/LLM، مع ميزات مثل استيعاب OTLP وتخزين في DuckDB","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["OTLP ","DuckDB ","AI ","Roslyn ","NET.Sdk","ErrorOrX"],"ja":["OTLP ","DuckDB ","AI ","Roslyn ","NET.Sdk","ErrorOrX"],"ko":["OTLP ","DuckDB ","AI ","Roslyn ","NET.Sdk","ErrorOrX"],"es":["Ingestión de OTLP","Almacenamiento con DuckDB","Convenciones semánticas para telemetría AI","Generación de analizadores","Observabilidad para GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP","Stockage avec DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie AI","Génération d''analyseurs","Observabilité pour GenAI/LLM"],"de":["OTLP-Ingestion","Speicherung mit DuckDB","Semantische Konventionen für AI-Telemetrie","Generierung von Analyse-Tools","Observability für GenAI/LLM-Workloads"],"pt":["Ingestão de OTLP","Armazenamento em DuckDB","Convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA","Suporte a cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM","Análise e monitoramento de desempenho"],"ru":["Ингестия OTLP","Хранение в DuckDB","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ","Поддержка рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM","Анализ и мониторинг производительности"],"ar":["استيعاب OTLP","تخزين في DuckDB","اتفاقيات семантиكية للاتصالات الذكية","دعم تحميل العمل من GenAI/LLM","تحليل ومراقبة الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ancplua-ecosystem","AI ","OTLP","DuckDB","Roslyn","NET.Sdk","ErrorOrX","AI ","GenAI","LLM"],"ja":["ancplua-ecosystem","AI ","OTLP","DuckDB","Roslyn","NET.Sdk","ErrorOrX","AI ","GenAI","LLM"],"ko":["ancplua-ecosystem","AI ","OTLP","DuckDB","Roslyn","NET.Sdk","ErrorOrX","AI ","GenAI","LLM"],"es":["observabilidad AI","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetría AI","desarrollo de software","análisis de logs"],"fr":["observabilité AI","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","télémétrie AI","développement de logiciels","analyse de logs"],"de":["AI-Observability","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","AI-Telemetrie","Software-Entwicklung","Log-Analyse"],"pt":["observabilidade de IA","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetria de IA","cargas de trabalho de IA","desempenho de IA"],"ru":["наблюдаемость ИИ","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","телеметрия ИИ","рабочие нагрузки ИИ","производительность ИИ"],"ar":["مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","اتصالات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحميل العمل من الذكاء الاصطناعي","الأداء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ancplua-ecosystem","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\n# none\n```\n\n\n# ANcpLua Ecosystem Context\n\n## Repository Hierarchy\n\n```\nANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities  ← SOURCE OF TRUTH for Roslyn helpers\n        ↓\n    ┌───┴───┬─────────────┬─────────────────┐\n    ↓       ↓             ↓                 ↓\nANcpLua  ANcpLua       ErrorOrX         qyl\n.NET.Sdk .Analyzers   (generator)   (observability)\n    ↓       ↓             ↓                 ↓\n    └───┬───┴─────────────┴─────────────────┘\n        ↓\n  ┌─────┴─────┐\n  ↓           ↓\nServic","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\n# none\n```\n\n\n# ANcpLua Ecosystem Context\n\n## Repository Hierarchy\n\n```\nANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities  ← SOURCE OF TRUTH for Roslyn helpers\n        ↓\n    ┌───┴───┬─────────────┬─────────────────┐\n    ↓       ↓             ↓                 ↓\nANcpLua  ANcpLua       ErrorOrX         qyl\n.NET.Sdk .Analyzers   (generator)   (observability)\n    ↓       ↓             ↓                 ↓\n    └───┬───┴─────────────┴─────────────────┘\n        ↓\n  ┌─────┴─────┐\n  ↓           ↓\nServiceDefaults  Template\n(instrumentation) (clean arch)\n```\n\n## Source of Truth Locations\n\n| Concern | Source of Truth | Do NOT Duplicate In |\n|---------|-----------------|---------------------|\n| Roslyn utilities | `ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities` | Any repo |\n| MSBuild SDK patterns | `ANcpLua.NET.Sdk` | Consumer projects |\n| Analyzer patterns | `ANcpLua.Analyzers` | Other generators |\n| ErrorOr endpoint patterns | `ErrorOrX` | Template, consumers |\n| OTel instrumentation | `ServiceDefaults1` | qyl, consumers |\n| TypeSpec schemas | `qyl/core/specs/` | Generated code |\n\n## Key Shared Utilities (from Roslyn.Utilities)\n\nBefore writing ANY helper code in dependent repos, check if these exist:\n\n| Utility | Location | Purpose |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| `EquatableArray<T>` | `EquatableArray.cs` | Value-equality arrays for generator caching |\n| `DiagnosticFlow<T>` | `DiagnosticFlow.cs` | Railway-oriented error accumulation |\n| `SymbolMatch.*` | `Matching/` | Fluent symbol pattern matching DSL |\n| `Guard.NotNull()` | `Guard.cs` | Argument validation with CallerArgumentExpression |\n| `*.OrEmpty()` | `EnumerableExtensions.cs` | Null-safe collection operations |\n| `*.GetOrNull()` | `TryExtensions.cs` | Dictionary/collection safe access |\n| `TypeSymbolExtensions` | `TypeSymbolExtensions.cs` | Type hierarchy analysis |\n\n## Repository Summaries\n\n### ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities`\n**Purpose**: Shared Roslyn helper library (17,200+ lines)\n**Key exports**: EquatableArray, DiagnosticFlow, SymbolMatch, Guard, Extensions\n**Consumers**: ErrorOrX.Generators, ANcpLua.Analyzers, qyl generators\n\n### ANcpLua.NET.Sdk\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.NET.Sdk`\n**Purpose**: Opinionated MSBuild SDK with auto-injection\n**Key features**: CPM enforcement, analyzer injection, test framework setup, polyfills\n**Consumers**: All other repos via `global.json`\n\n### ANcpLua.Analyzers\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Analyzers`\n**Purpose**: 44 Roslyn diagnostics (AL0001-AL0044) with code fixes\n**Key patterns**: ALAnalyzer base class, OperationHelper, WellKnownTypes\n**Auto-injected by**: ANcpLua.NET.Sdk\n\n### ErrorOrX\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/ErrorOrX`\n**Purpose**: Source generator converting ErrorOr<T> → ASP.NET endpoints\n**Key patterns**: Minimal interface principle, AOT wrapper pattern, smart binding\n**Dependencies**: ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities for pipeline helpers\n\n### qyl\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/qyl`\n**Purpose**: AI observability platform (OTLP collector + GenAI analytics)\n**Key patterns**: TypeSpec-first, DuckDB storage, MCP server, SSE streaming\n**Protocol**: BCL-only types in qyl.protocol\n\n### ServiceDefaults1\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/ServiceDefaults1`\n**Purpose**: Zero-config OTel instrumentation for GenAI + DB\n**Key patterns**: Interceptors, runtime decorators, OTel SemConv v1.39\n**Entry point**: `builder.UseQyl()` → `app.MapQylEndpoints()`\n\n### Template\n**Path**: `/Users/ancplua/Template/Template/src`\n**Purpose**: Clean Architecture ASP.NET Core template\n**Key patterns**: EndpointGroupBase, MediatR CQRS, layered architecture\n**Based on**: Jason Taylor''s CleanArchitecture template\n\n## Cohesion Principles\n\n1. **Single Source of Truth** — Never duplicate logic that exists upstream\n2. **Minimal Interface** — Use smallest API surface (e.g., ErrorOr: IsError/Errors/Value only)\n3. **Breaking Changes OK** — Public API stability is secondary to code quality\n4. **Compile-Time > Runtime** — Prefer source generators over reflection\n5. **Null = Empty** — Collections treat null as empty throughout\n6. **Fully Qualified Names** — Generated code uses `global::` to avoid conflicts\n\n## Cross-Repo Refactoring Checklist\n\nWhen optimizing code across repos:\n\n1. **Check Roslyn.Utilities first** — Does a utility already exist?\n2. **Consider upstreaming** — Should this helper live in Roslyn.Utilities?\n3. **Update consumers** — If changing Roslyn.Utilities, bump version in all repos\n4. **Verify build chain** — Changes cascade: Utilities → SDK → Analyzers → ErrorOrX\n\n## Executable Scripts\n\n### Check All Repos Build\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# check-all-builds.sh - Verify entire ecosystem builds\nset -e\nREPOS=(\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.NET.Sdk\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Analyzers\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ErrorOrX\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/qyl\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ServiceDefaults1\"\n)\n\nfor repo in \"${REPOS[@]}\"; do\n  echo \"=== Building $(basename \"$repo\") ===\"\n  cd \"$repo\"\n  dotnet build *.slnx --no-restore -v q || { echo \"FAILED: $repo\"; exit 1; }\ndone\necho \"=== All repos build successfully ===\"\n```\n\n### Run All Tests\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# run-all-tests.sh - Full test suite across ecosystem\nset -e\nREPOS=(\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Analyzers\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ErrorOrX\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/qyl\"\n  \"/Users/ancplua/ServiceDefaults1\"\n)\n\nfor repo in \"${REPOS[@]}\"; do\n  echo \"=== Testing $(basename \"$repo\") ===\"\n  cd \"$repo\"\n  dotnet test --solution *.slnx --no-build -v q || { echo \"FAILED: $repo\"; exit 1; }\ndone\necho \"=== All tests pass ===\"\n```\n\n### Check NuGet Versions\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# check-versions.sh - Compare local vs NuGet versions\nPACKAGES=(\"ancplua.net.sdk\" \"ancplua.analyzers\" \"ancplua.roslyn.utilities\")\n\nfor pkg in \"${PACKAGES[@]}\"; do\n  echo \"=== $pkg ===\"\n  curl -s \"https://api.nuget.org/v3-flatcontainer/$pkg/index.json\" | jq -r ''.versions[-1]''\ndone\n```\n\n## Common Build Commands\n\n```bash\n# Any repo\ndotnet build *.slnx\ndotnet test --solution *.slnx\n\n# After Roslyn.Utilities changes\ncd /Users/ancplua/ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities && dotnet pack -c Release\n# Then update Directory.Packages.props in consumers\n```\n\n## Version Coordination\n\nAll repos use Central Package Management. Key versions to keep aligned:\n\n| Package | Purpose | Update Together |\n|---------|---------|-----------------|\n| `ANcpLua.Roslyn.Utilities` | Roslyn helpers | All generators |\n| `Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp` | Roslyn APIs | All analyzers/generators |\n| `xunit.v3` + `xunit.v3.mtp-v2` | Testing | All test projects |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:33:05.816Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Observability Agents needing advanced AI telemetry and log analysis capabilities with OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 AI 遥测和日志分析能力的可观察性代理，支持 OTLP 引流和 DuckDB 存储。","ja":"OTLP 経由でのインジェストと DuckDB ストレージに対応した、先進的な AI テレメトリとログ分析機能を必要とする Observability エージェントに最適です。","ko":"OTLP 수집 및 DuckDB 저장소와 함께 고급 AI 원격 측정 및 로그 분석 기능을 필요한 관찰 가능성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de observabilidad que necesitan capacidades de telemetría y análisis de registros de AI avanzados con ingesta de OTLP y almacenamiento de DuckDB.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''observabilité qui ont besoin de capacités de télémétrie et d''analyse de journaux d''IA avancées avec ingestion de OTLP et stockage de DuckDB.","de":"Perfekt für Observability-Agents, die erweiterte AI-Telemetrie- und Log-Analysefunktionen mit OTLP-Eintrag und DuckDB-Speicherung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Observabilidade que precisam de capacidades avançadas de telemetria de IA e análise de logs com ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов наблюдаемости, которым требуются продвинутые возможности телеметрии ИИ и анализа журналов с ингестией OTLP и хранилищем DuckDB.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل المراقبة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل تелеметريا الذكاء الاصطناعي وسجلات مع استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to collect and analyze AI workload logs using semantic conventions for telemetry, providing insights into GenAI/LLM performance with OTLP and DuckDB, and enabling advanced observability features.","zh":"赋予代理收集和分析 AI 工作负载日志的能力，使用遥测的语义约定，提供有关 GenAI/LLM 性能的洞察，支持 OTLP 和 DuckDB，并实现高级可观察性功能。","ja":"エージェントが AI ワークロード ログを収集および分析できるようにし、テレメトリのセマンティック規約を使用して GenAI/LLM のパフォーマンスに関する洞察を提供し、OTLP および DuckDB をサポートして、先進的な可観測性機能を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 AI 워크로드 로그를 수집 및 분석할 수 있도록 하여 테레메트리에 대한 의미적 규칙을 사용하여 GenAI/LLM 성능에 대한洞察을 제공하고 OTLP 및 DuckDB를 지원하여 고급 관찰 기능을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recopilar y analizar registros de cargas de trabajo de AI utilizando convenciones semánticas para la telemetría, proporcionando información sobre el rendimiento de GenAI/LLM con OTLP y DuckDB, y habilitando funciones de observabilidad avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de collecter et d''analyser les journaux de charge de travail d''IA en utilisant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie, fournissant des informations sur les performances de GenAI/LLM avec OTLP et DuckDB, et activant des fonctionnalités d''observabilité avancées.","de":"Ermöglich es Agents, AI-Workload-Logs mithilfe semantischer Konventionen für die Telemetrie zu sammeln und zu analysieren, und gibt Einblicke in die Leistung von GenAI/LLM mit OTLP und DuckDB, und aktiviert erweiterte Observability-Funktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coletar e analisar logs de carga de trabalho de IA usando convenções semânticas para telemetria, fornecendo insights sobre o desempenho do GenAI/LLM com OTLP e DuckDB, e habilitando recursos avançados de observabilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью собирать и анализировать журналы рабочей нагрузки ИИ, используя семантические конвенции для телеметрии, обеспечивая представление о производительности GenAI/LLM с OTLP и DuckDB, и предоставляя расширенные функции наблюдаемости.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من جمع وتحليل سجلات حمولة العمل الذكية باستخدام الاتفاقيات الدلالية لتелемتريا، وتوفير رؤى حول أداء GenAI/LLM مع OTLP وDuckDB، وتفعيل ميزات متقدمة للمراقبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing GenAI/LLM workload logs for performance optimization","Implementing semantic conventions for AI telemetry data","Ingesting logs using OTLP for centralized monitoring"],"zh":["分析 GenAI/LLM 工作负载日志以优化性能","实现 AI 遥测数据的语义约定","使用 OTLP 引流进行集中监控"],"ja":["パフォーマンス最適化のための GenAI/LLM ワークロード ログの分析","AI テレメトリ データのセマンティック規約の実装","OTLP 経由での集中監視のためのログのインジェスト"],"ko":["성능 최적화를 위한 GenAI/LLM 워크로드 로그 분석","AI 원격 측정 데이터의 의미 규칙 구현","集中 모니터링을 위한 OTLP 수집 로그"],"es":["Analizar registros de cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM para la optimización del rendimiento","Implementar convenciones semánticas para datos de telemetría de AI","Ingerir registros utilizando OTLP para la monitorización centralizada"],"fr":["Analyser les journaux de charge de travail de GenAI/LLM pour l''optimisation des performances","Mettre en œuvre des conventions sémantiques pour les données de télémétrie d''IA","Ingestion de journaux à l''aide de OTLP pour la surveillance centralisée"],"de":["Analysieren von GenAI/LLM-Workload-Logs zur Leistungsoptimierung","Implementieren semantischer Konventionen für AI-Telemetriedaten","Eintragen von Logs unter Verwendung von OTLP für die zentrale Überwachung"],"pt":["Analisar logs de carga de trabalho do GenAI/LLM para otimização de desempenho","Implementar convenções semânticas para dados de telemetria de IA","Ingerir logs usando OTLP para monitoramento centralizado"],"ru":["Анализировать журналы рабочей нагрузки GenAI/LLM для оптимизации производительности","Реализовывать семантические конвенции для данных телеметрии ИИ","Поглощать журналы с использованием OTLP для централизованного мониторинга"],"ar":["تحليل سجلات حمولة العمل GenAI/LLM لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ الاتفاقيات الدلالية لبيانات تелемتريا الذكاء الاصطناعي","استهلاك السجلات باستخدام OTLP للرصد المركزي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion compatibility","DuckDB storage dependency","Specifically designed for GenAI/LLM workloads"],"zh":["需要 OTLP 引流兼容性","依赖于 DuckDB 存储","专门为 GenAI/LLM 工作负载设计"],"ja":["OTLP 経由でのインジェストの互換性が必要","DuckDB ストレージに依存","GenAI/LLM ワークロード専用に設計"],"ko":["OTLP 수집 호환성이 필요","DuckDB 저장소 의존","GenAI/LLM 워크로드専用 설계"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la ingesta de OTLP","Dependencia del almacenamiento de DuckDB","Diseñado específicamente para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec l''ingestion de OTLP","Dépendance du stockage de DuckDB","Conçu spécifiquement pour les charges de travail de GenAI/LLM"],"de":["Erfordert OTLP-Eingabe-Kompatibilität","DuckDB-Speicherabhängigkeit","Speziell für GenAI/LLM-Workloads konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com ingestão OTLP","Dependência de armazenamento DuckDB","Projetado especificamente para cargas de trabalho do GenAI/LLM"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с ингестией OTLP","Зависимость от хранилища DuckDB","Разработан специально для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع استهلاك OTLP","اعتماد على تخزين DuckDB","مصمم خصيصًا لتحملات العمل GenAI/LLM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
