pports d''utilisation des compétences","Optimisation des compétences basée sur l''utilisation récente"],"de":["Verbesserung der Fähigkeiten von Codex","Verwendung von Skripten und Tools für Entwickler","Analyse von Codex-Protokollen","Validierung der Fähigkeitsstruktur","Erzeugung von Berichten über die Fähigkeitsnutzung","Optimierung der Fähigkeiten basierend auf der aktuellen Nutzung"],"pt":["Melhoria contínua das habilidades do Codex","Análise de uso real recente","Otimização de scripts","Relatórios de auditoria","Validação de estrutura de habilidades"],"ru":["Постоянное улучшение навыков Codex","Анализ недавнего реального использования","Оптимизация скриптов","Отчеты об аудите","Валидация структуры навыков"],"ar":["تحسين مستمر لمهارات Codex","تحليل الاستخدام الحقيقي الأخير","تحسين البرامج النصية","تقارير التدقيق","تحقق من هيكل المهارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["oe-codex-upskill-overnight","技能提升","Codex","Python","脚本","技术","持续改进","最近的真实使用情况"],"ja":["oe-codex-upskill-overnight","スキルアップ","Codex","Python","スクリプト","技術","継続的な改善","最近の実際の使用状況"],"ko":["oe-codex-upskill-overnight","기술 향상","Codex","Python","스크립트","기술","지속적인 개선","최근의 실제 사용 상황"],"es":["mejora de habilidades de Codex","desarrollo de habilidades de Codex","scripts para desarrolladores","herramientas para desarrolladores","análisis de registros de Codex","validación de estructura de habilidades","optimización de habilidades","uso de habilidades de Codex","informes de uso de habilidades"],"fr":["amélioration des compétences de Codex","développement des compétences de Codex","scripts pour développeurs","outils pour développeurs","analyse des journaux de Codex","validation de la structure des compétences","optimisation des compétences","utilisation des compétences de Codex","rapports d''utilisation des compétences"],"de":["Verbesserung der Fähigkeiten von Codex","Entwicklung der Fähigkeiten von Codex","Skripte für Entwickler","Tools für Entwickler","Analyse von Codex-Protokollen","Validierung der Fähigkeitsstruktur","Optimierung der Fähigkeiten","Nutzung der Fähigkeiten von Codex","Berichte über die Fähigkeitsnutzung"],"pt":["oe-codex-upskill-overnight","melhoria de habilidades","codex","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de scripts","análise de uso"],"ru":["oe-codex-upskill-overnight","улучшение навыков","codex","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация скриптов","анализ использования"],"ar":["oe-codex-upskill-overnight","تحسين المهارات","codex","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين البرامج النصية","تحليل الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"shami-ah","repo":"OpenEvent-AI","repoPath":"shami-ah/OpenEvent-AI","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oe-codex-upskill-overnight","description":"Audits the last 1–2 days of Codex sessions/logs to see how skills/scripts were used, then suggests improvements (and can apply small fixes to SKILL.md + bundled scripts when requested).","bodyPreview":"# oe-codex-upskill-overnight\n\n## Goal\n\nUpskill Codex by continuously improving skills and bundled scripts based on *recent real usage* (last ~24–48h).\n\n## Quick start (read-only)\n\n1. Generate a report from recent Codex logs:\n   - `python .codex/skills/oe-codex-upskill-overnight/scripts/audit_codex_skill_usage.py --days 2`\n2. Pick the **top 1–3** high-signal changes (keep it PR-sized).\n3. Validate skills structure:\n   - `python scripts/skills/validate_skills.py --skills-dir .codex/skills`\n\n## Wha","body":"# oe-codex-upskill-overnight\n\n## Goal\n\nUpskill Codex by continuously improving skills and bundled scripts based on *recent real usage* (last ~24–48h).\n\n## Quick start (read-only)\n\n1. Generate a report from recent Codex logs:\n   - `python .codex/skills/oe-codex-upskill-overnight/scripts/audit_codex_skill_usage.py --days 2`\n2. Pick the **top 1–3** high-signal changes (keep it PR-sized).\n3. Validate skills structure:\n   - `python scripts/skills/validate_skills.py --skills-dir .codex/skills`\n\n## What to improve (high leverage)\n\n- **Frontmatter description**: Make trigger conditions concrete (symptoms + domain keywords) so the right skill fires without guesswork.\n- **Bundle scripts for repeated command sequences**: If a shell snippet gets repeated across sessions, turn it into `scripts/<thing>.py|.sh` inside the skill and update the skill to “run the script”.\n- **Progressive disclosure**: If a SKILL.md is large/noisy, move details into `references/` and keep SKILL.md as a navigation + workflow.\n- **Guardrails**: Add “do not run long commands / do not modify working tree unless asked” where it prevents recurring footguns.\n\n## Apply changes (only when requested)\n\nIf asked to implement fixes:\n\n1. Keep the patch small and focused (one skill at a time).\n2. Prefer adding/adjusting scripts over expanding SKILL.md prose.\n3. Re-run:\n   - `python scripts/skills/validate_skills.py --skills-dir .codex/skills`\n4. If you changed a Python script, at minimum:\n   - `python -m py_compile .codex/skills/oe-codex-upskill-overnight/scripts/audit_codex_skill_usage.py`\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Default to **report + suggestions** (read-only).\n- Do not run installs, formatters, servers, or full test suites unless explicitly requested.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:34:35.951Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code needing continuous skill improvement based on recent usage data.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code这样的AI代理，它们需要根据最近的使用数据持续改进技能。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。最近の使用データに基づいて継続的にスキルを改善する必要があります。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 최근 사용 데이터를 기반으로 지속적으로 스킬을 개선해야 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que necesitan una mejora continua de habilidades basada en datos de uso recientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code qui ont besoin d''une amélioration continue des compétences basée sur les données d''utilisation récentes.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die eine kontinuierliche Fertigkeitsverbesserung auf der Grundlage von aktuellen Nutzungsdaten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que necessitam de melhoria contínua de habilidades com base em dados de uso recente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которым требуется непрерывное улучшение навыков на основе недавних данных об использовании.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إيه آي مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين مستمر للخبرات استنادًا إلى بيانات الاستخدام الحديثة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to upskill Codex by analyzing recent logs, generating reports, and validating skills structure using Python scripts like audit_codex_skill_usage.py and validate_skills.py, thereby enhancing their overall performance and adaptability.","zh":"使代理能够通过分析最近的日志、生成报告以及使用Python脚本（如audit_codex_skill_usage.py和validate_skills.py）验证技能结构来提高Codex的技能，从而提高它们的整体性能和适应性。","ja":"エージェントが最近のログを分析し、レポートを生成し、Pythonスクリプト（例：audit_codex_skill_usage.pyおよびvalidate_skills.py）を使用してスキル構造を検証することで、Codexのスキルを向上させ、全体的なパフォーマンスと適応性を高めることができます。","ko":"에이전트가 최근 로그를 분석하고 보고서를 생성하며 Python 스크립트(audit_codex_skill_usage.py 및 validate_skills.py와 같은)를 사용하여 스킬 구조를 검증함으로써 Codex의 스킬을 향상시키고 전체적인 성능과 적응성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mejorar las habilidades de Codex analizando registros recientes, generando informes y validando la estructura de habilidades mediante scripts de Python como audit_codex_skill_usage.py y validate_skills.py, mejorando así su rendimiento general y adaptabilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''améliorer les compétences de Codex en analysant les journaux récents, en générant des rapports et en validant la structure des compétences à l''aide de scripts Python tels que audit_codex_skill_usage.py et validate_skills.py, améliorant ainsi leur performance globale et leur adaptabilité.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Fähigkeiten von Codex zu verbessern, indem sie kürzlich erstellte Protokolle analysieren, Berichte generieren und die Fähigkeitsstruktur mithilfe von Python-Skripten wie audit_codex_skill_usage.py und validate_skills.py überprüfen, wodurch ihre Gesamtleistung und Anpassungsfähigkeit verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a melhorar as habilidades do Codex analisando registros recentes, gerando relatórios e validando a estrutura de habilidades usando scripts Python como audit_codex_skill_usage.py e validate_skills.py, melhorando assim seu desempenho geral e adaptabilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью улучшить навыки Codex путем анализа недавних журналов, генерации отчетов и проверки структуры навыков с помощью скриптов Python, таких как audit_codex_skill_usage.py и validate_skills.py, тем самым улучшая их общую производительность и адаптивность.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعزيز مهارات Codex من خلال تحليل السجلات الحديثة وإنشاء تقارير وتصديق هيكل المهارات باستخدام نصوص بايثون مثل audit_codex_skill_usage.py و validate_skills.py، وبالتالي تعزيز أدائهم العام ومرونتهم."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing recent Codex logs to identify high-signal changes","Generating reports to inform data-driven decisions on skill improvements","Validating skills structure to ensure consistency and quality"],"zh":["分析最近的Codex日志以识别高信号变化","生成报告以告知数据驱动的决策对于技能改进","验证技能结构以确保一致性和质量"],"ja":["最近のCodexログを分析してハイシグナルな変更を特定する","レポートを生成してデータドリブンの意思決定を支援することでスキルの改善に関する情報を提供する","スキルの構造を検証して一貫性と品質を確保する"],"ko":["最近의 Codex 로그를 분석하여 고신호 변경 사항을 식별하는 것","보고서를 생성하여 데이터 기반의 의사 결정을 지원하고 스킬 개선에 대한 정보를 제공하는 것","스킬 구조를 검증하여 일관성과 品質을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Analizar registros recientes de Codex para identificar cambios de alta señal de forma oportuna","Generar informes para tomar decisiones basadas en datos sobre mejoras de habilidades","Validar la estructura de habilidades para garantizar la coherencia y la calidad"],"fr":["Analyser les journaux récents de Codex pour identifier les changements à haute valeur de signal","Générer des rapports pour éclairer les décisions basées sur les données relatives aux améliorations des compétences","Valider la structure des compétences pour assurer la cohérence et la qualité"],"de":["Analysieren von aktuellen Codex-Protokollen, um wichtige Änderungen zu erkennen","Erstellen von Berichten, um datengetriebene Entscheidungen über Fertigkeitsverbesserungen zu treffen","Überprüfen der Fähigkeitsstruktur, um Konsistenz und Qualität sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Analisar registros recentes do Codex para identificar alterações de alto sinal","Gerar relatórios para informar decisões baseadas em dados sobre melhorias de habilidades","Validar estrutura de habilidades para garantir consistência e qualidade"],"ru":["Анализ недавних журналов Codex для выявления изменений с высоким сигналом","Генерация отчетов для информирования решений, основанных на данных, о улучшении навыков","Проверка структуры навыков для обеспечения согласованности и качества"],"ar":["تحليل السجلات الحديثة لبرنامج Codex لتحديد التغييرات ذات الإشارة القوية","إنشاء تقارير لإبلاغ القرارات القائمة على البيانات حول تحسين المهارات","تصديق هيكل المهارات لضمان الاتساق والجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Codex skills improvement","Needs recent usage data (last ~24-48h) for effective analysis"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限于Codex技能的改进","需要最近的使用数据（大约最近24-48小时）进行有效分析"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Codexスキルの改善のみに限定される","効果的な分析には最近の使用データ（約過去24-48時間）が必要"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요함","Codex 스킬 개선에만 한정됨","유효한 분석을 위해서는 최근 사용 데이터(최근 24-48시간 정도)가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python","Limitado a la mejora de habilidades de Codex","Necesita datos de uso recientes (últimas ~24-48h) para un análisis efectivo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité à l''amélioration des compétences de Codex","Nécessite des données d''utilisation récentes (dernières ~24-48h) pour une analyse efficace"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Verbesserung der Fähigkeiten von Codex","Benötigt aktuelle Nutzungsdaten (letzten ~24-48h) für eine effektive Analyse"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado à melhoria de habilidades do Codex","Necessita de dados de uso recente (últimas ~24-48h) para análise eficaz"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен улучшением навыков Codex","Требует недавних данных об использовании (последние ~24-48ч) для эффективного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدود بتحسين مهارات Codex","يحتاج إلى بيانات استخدام حديثة (الأخيرة ~24-48 ساعة) للتحليل الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
