形象","ja":"ポップアップの転換率最適化（Popup CRO）とは、高転換率のポップアップを作成してユーザーエクスペリエンスとブランドイメージを向上させることです","ko":"팝업 전환율 최적화（Popup CRO）は 전환율을 높이고 사용자 경험과 브랜드 이미지를 개선하는 팝업 창 만들기입니다","es":"La optimización de popups CRO implica crear ventanas emergentes que convierten sin dañar la percepción de la marca. Aprende a hacerlo de manera efectiva.","fr":"L''optimisation des popups CRO consiste à créer des fenêtres émergentes qui convertissent sans nuire à la perception de la marque. Apprenez à le faire de mani...","de":"Die Optimierung von Popups CRO beinhaltet die Erstellung von Overlay-Fenstern, die umwandeln, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu schädigen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ...","pt":"Otimização de popups CRO para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a criar popups que convertem sem afetar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO для разработчиков. Узнайте, как создавать попапы, которые конвертируют без ущерба для бренда.","ar":"تحسين نافذة منبثقة CRO للسواقين. تعلم كيفية إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون المساس بالعلامة التجارية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建高转化率的弹出窗口","提升用户体验和品牌形象","优化弹出窗口的设计和内容","提高电子邮件和新闻稿的转化率","分析和优化弹出窗口的性能"],"ja":["高転換率のポップアップを作成する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスとブランドイメージを向上させる","ポップアップのデザインとコンテンツを最適化する","メールとニュースレターの転換率を向上させる","ポップアップのパフォーマンスを分析して最適化する"],"ko":["전환율을 높이는 팝업 창 만들기","사용자 경험과 브랜드 이미지를 개선하기","팝업 창의 디자인과 콘텐츠를 최적화하기","이메일과 뉴스레터의 전환율을 높이기","팝업 창의 성능을 분석하고 최적화하기"],"es":["Creación de popups personalizados","Optimización para dispositivos móviles","Análisis de comportamiento del usuario","Pruebas A/B para maximizar la conversión","Integración con herramientas de marketing","Diseño responsivo para una mejor experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Création de popups personnalisés","Optimisation pour les appareils mobiles","Analyse du comportement de l''utilisateur","Tests A/B pour maximiser la conversion","Intégration avec des outils de marketing","Conception réactive pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Popups","Optimierung für mobile Geräte","Analyse des Benutzerverhaltens","A/B-Tests zur Maximierung der Umwandlung","Integration mit Marketing-Tools","Reaktives Design für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversão","Melhores práticas de CRO para popups","Criação de popups personalizados","Análise de desempenho de popups","Otimização para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсии","Лучшие практики CRO для попапов","Создание индивидуальных попапов","Анализ производительности попапов","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة منبثقة لتحويل","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين率 التحويل للنوافذ المنبثقة","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة","تحليل أداء النافذة المنبثقة","تحسين للجوالات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["弹出式转化率优化","Popup CRO","转化率优化","用户体验","品牌形象","电子邮件营销","新闻稿营销"],"ja":["ポップアップの転換率最適化","Popup CRO","転換率最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ブランドイメージ","メールマーケティング","ニュースレターマーケティング"],"ko":["팝업 전환율 최적화","Popup CRO","전환율 최적화","사용자 경험","브랜드 이미지","이메일 마케팅","뉴스레터 마케팅"],"es":["optimización de popups","CRO para popups","popups personalizados","diseño de popups","pruebas A/B para popups","integración de popups con marketing","popups para sitios web","mejora de la conversión con popups"],"fr":["optimisation des popups","CRO pour les popups","popups personnalisés","conception de popups","tests A/B pour les popups","intégration des popups avec le marketing","popups pour les sites web","amélioration de la conversion avec les popups"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups","CRO für Popups","benutzerdefinierte Popups","Design von Popups","A/B-Tests für Popups","Integration von Popups mit Marketing","Popups für Websites","Verbesserung der Umwandlung mit Popups"],"pt":["otimização de popups","CRO para popups","conversão de popups","melhores práticas de CRO","criação de popups personalizados","análise de desempenho de popups"],"ru":["оптимизация попапов","CRO для попапов","конверсия попапов","лучшие практики CRO","создание индивидуальных попапов","анализ производительности попапов"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة منبثقة","تحسين率 التحويل للنوافذ المنبثقة","تحويل نافذة منبثقة","أفضل الممارسات لتحسينrate التحويل","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة","تحليل أداء النافذة المنبثقة"]}},"owner":"nadavyigal","repo":"Running-coach-","repoPath":"nadavyigal/Running-coach-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:34:37.743Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents specializing in conversion rate optimization and user experience enhancement.","zh":"非常适合专门从事转化率优化和用户体验增强的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが転換率の最適化とユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上に特化する場合に最適です。","ko":"전환률 최적화 및 사용자 경험 향상을 전문으로 하는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing especializados en optimización de tasas de conversión y mejora de la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans l''optimisation du taux de conversion et l''amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die auf Konversionsratenoptimierung und Verbesserung der Benutzeroberfläche spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing especializados em otimização da taxa de conversão e melhoria da experiência do usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, специализирующихся на оптимизации коэффициента конверсии и улучшении пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التسويق المتخصصة في تحسين معدل التحويل وتحسين تجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create targeted popups and modals that convert without annoying users, leveraging product marketing context and optimizing for email/newsletter capture, all while preserving brand perception through strategic popup design and implementation using context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","zh":"赋予代理创建有针对性的弹出窗口和模态窗口，能够在不打扰用户的情况下转化，利用产品营销背景并优化电子邮件/新闻稿捕获，同时通过战略性的弹出窗口设计和实现来保持品牌感知，使用 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 中的背景。","ja":"エージェントが、ユーザーを邪魔せずにコンバージョンできるターゲットを絞ったポップアップとモーダルを作成できるようにし、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを利用し、メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャを最適化し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のコンテキストを使用して戦略的なポップアップの設計と実装を通じてブランドの認識を維持する。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자를 방해하지 않고 전환될 수 있는 타겟팅된 팝업과 모달을 생성할 수 있도록 하는 동시에 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 이메일/뉴스레터 캡처를 최적화하고 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 컨텍스트를 사용하여 전략적인 팝업 디자인 및 구현을 통해 브랜드 인식을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ventanas emergentes y modales dirigidos que conviertan sin molestar a los usuarios, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos y optimizando la captura de correo electrónico/boletín, todo mientras se mantiene la percepción de la marca a través del diseño y la implementación estratégica de ventanas emergentes utilizando el contexto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fenêtres contextuelles et des modals ciblés qui convertissent sans agacer les utilisateurs, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits et en optimisant la capture d''adresses e-mail/lettres d''information, le tout en préservant la perception de la marque grâce à une conception et une mise en œuvre stratégiques de fenêtres contextuelles en utilisant le contexte de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gezielte Popups und Modals zu erstellen, die ohne die Benutzer zu stören konvertieren, den Kontext des Produktmarketings nutzt und die E-Mail/Newsletter-Erfassung optimiert, während die Markenwahrnehmung durch strategisches Popup-Design und -Implementierung unter Verwendung des Kontexts von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` erhalten bleibt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem popups e modais direcionados que convertem sem irritar os usuários, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produto e otimizando para captura de e-mail/informativo, preservando a percepção da marca por meio de design e implementação estratégica de popups usando contexto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать целевые всплывающие окна и модальные окна, которые конвертируют без раздражения пользователей, используя контекст продуктивного маркетинга и оптимизируя для захвата электронной почты/новостей, сохраняя при этом восприятие бренда через стратегический дизайн и реализацию всплывающих окон с использованием контекста из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة ومرئيات مستهدفة تُحوّل دون إزعاج المستخدمين، مستفيدة من سياق تسويق المنتج ومتوفرة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني/النشرة الإخبارية، مع الحفاظ على تصور العلامة التجارية من خلال تصميم وتنفيذ نوافذ منبثقة إستراتيجية باستخدام السياق من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing non-intrusive email capture popups","Optimizing modal layouts for better conversion rates","Analyzing user interaction with popups to improve brand perception"],"zh":["设计非侵入式电子邮件捕获弹出窗口","优化模态窗口布局以提高转化率","分析用户与弹出窗口的交互以提高品牌感知"],"ja":["侵入性のないメールキャプチャーポップアップを設計する","コンバージョン率の向上のためにモーダルレイアウトを最適化する","ブランドの認識を向上させるためにポップアップとのユーザーのやりとりを分析する"],"ko":["침입성이 아닌 이메일 캡처 팝업을 설계합니다","전환율을 높이기 위해 모달 레이아웃을 최적화합니다","브랜드 인식을 향상시키기 위해 팝업과의 사용자 상호작용을 분석합니다"],"es":["Diseñar ventanas emergentes de captura de correo electrónico no intrusivas","Optimizar diseños de modals para mejores tasas de conversión","Analizar la interacción del usuario con las ventanas emergentes para mejorar la percepción de la marca"],"fr":["Concevoir des fenêtres contextuelles de capture d''adresses e-mail non intrusives","Optimiser les dispositions de modals pour de meilleurs taux de conversion","Analyser l''interaction de l''utilisateur avec les fenêtres contextuelles pour améliorer la perception de la marque"],"de":["Entwerfen von nicht aufdringlichen E-Mail-Erfassungs-Popups","Optimieren von Modal-Layouts für bessere Konversionsraten","Analysieren der Benutzerinteraktion mit Popups, um die Markenwahrnehmung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Projetando popups de captura de e-mail não intrusivos","Otimizando layouts de modais para melhores taxas de conversão","Analisando interação do usuário com popups para melhorar a percepção da marca"],"ru":["Проектирование неинтрузивных всплывающих окон для захвата электронной почты","Оптимизация макетов модальных окон для лучших коэффициентов конверсии","Анализ взаимодействия пользователя с всплывающими окнами для улучшения восприятия бренда"],"ar":["تصميم نوافذ منبثقة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني غير المتطفلة","تحسين تخطيطات المرئيات من أجل تحسين معدلات التحويل","تحليل تفاعل المستخدم مع النوافذ المنبثقة لتحسين تصور العلامة التجارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of product marketing context","Dependent on existence of `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要了解产品营销背景","依赖 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的存在以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキストを理解する必要がある","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` の存在に依存して最適なパフォーマンスを実現する"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 이해해야 합니다","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 존재에 의존하여 최적의 성능을实现합니다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del contexto de marketing de productos","Depende de la existencia de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du contexte de marketing de produits","Dépend de l''existence de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis des Produktmarketing-Kontexts","Hängt von der Existenz von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für optimale Leistung ab"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do contexto de marketing de produto","Depende da existência de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует понимания контекста продуктивного маркетинга","Зависит от существования `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم سياق تسويق المنتج","يعتمد على وجود `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` من أجل الأداء الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
