"zh":"Gemini 沙盒配置是一种元技能，用于配置 Gemini CLI 的沙盒隔离，确保潜在危险的操作与主机系统隔离","ja":"Gemini サンドボックス設定は、Gemini CLI のサンドボックス分離を設定するためのメタスキルであり、潜在的に危険な操作をホストシステムから分離します","ko":"Gemini 샌드박스 구성은 Gemini CLI의 샌드박스 분리 설정을 위한 메타 스킬로, 잠재적으로 위험한 작업을 호스트 시스템에서 분리합니다","es":"Gemini Sandbox Configuration es una aplicación de gestión de activos de marca Electron+Svelte+Cagent para configurar el aislamiento de sandbox de Gemini CLI","fr":"Gemini Sandbox Configuration est une application de gestion d''actifs de marque Electron+Svelte+Cagent pour configurer l''isolement de sandbox de Gemini CLI","de":"Gemini Sandbox Configuration ist eine Electron+Svelte+Cagent-App für die Konfiguration der Sandbox-Isolation von Gemini CLI","pt":"A configuração de sandbox da Gemini CLI é uma meta-habilidade para isolar operações perigosas do sistema host","ru":"Конфигурация песочницы Gemini CLI — это мета-навык для изоляции потенциально опасных операций от системы-хоста","ar":"تكوين sandbox جيميني CLI هو مهارة siêu لتفريغ العمليات الخطرة من نظام المضيف","en":"Electron+Svelte+Cagent brand asset management app"},"definition":{"en":"Electron+Svelte+Cagent brand asset management app"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Electron、Svelte 和 Cagent 构建安全的品牌资产管理应用","配置 Gemini CLI 的沙盒隔离","确保潜在危险的操作与主机系统隔离","支持多种开发语言和框架","提供安全可靠的资产管理解决方案"],"ja":["Electron、Svelte、Cagent を使用して安全なブランド資産管理アプリを構築する","Gemini CLI のサンドボックス分離を設定する","潜在的に危険な操作をホストシステムから分離する","複数の開発言語とフレームワークをサポートする","安全で信頼性の高い資産管理ソリューションを提供する"],"ko":["Electron, Svelte, Cagent를 사용하여 안전한 브랜드 자산 관리 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","Gemini CLI의 샌드박스 분리 설정","잠재적으로 위험한 작업을 호스트 시스템에서 분리합니다","다수의 개발 언어와 프레임워크를 지원합니다","안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 자산 관리 솔루션을 제공합니다"],"es":["Aislamiento de sandbox para operaciones seguras","Configuración de Gemini CLI","Integración con Electron y Svelte","Gestión de activos de marca con Cagent","Seguridad mejorada para operaciones peligrosas"],"fr":["Isolement de sandbox pour des opérations sécurisées","Configuration de Gemini CLI","Intégration avec Electron et Svelte","Gestion d''actifs de marque avec Cagent","Sécurité améliorée pour les opérations dangereuses"],"de":["Sandbox-Isolation für sichere Operationen","Konfiguration von Gemini CLI","Integration mit Electron und Svelte","Verwaltung von Markenaktiven mit Cagent","Erhöhte Sicherheit für gefährliche Operationen"],"pt":["Isolamento de operações perigosas","Configuração de sandbox personalizada","Integração com Electron e Svelte","Gerenciamento de ativos de marca com Cagent","Suporte à CLI"],"ru":["Изоляция потенциально опасных операций","Настройка индивидуальной песочницы","Интеграция с Electron и Svelte","Управление брендовыми активами с помощью Cagent","Поддержка CLI"],"ar":["عزل العمليات الخطرة","تكوين sandbox مخصص","التكامل مع Electron و Svelte","إدارة الموجودات التجارية مع Cagent","دعم CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gemini 沙盒配置","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","品牌资产管理","安全隔离","沙盒分离","开发语言","框架"],"ja":["Gemini サンドボックス設定","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","ブランド資産管理","セキュリティ分離","サンドボックス分離","開発言語","フレームワーク"],"ko":["Gemini 샌드박스 구성","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","브랜드 자산 관리","보안 분리","샌드박스 분리","개발 언어","프레임워크"],"es":["configuración de sandbox","Gemini CLI"," Electron","Svelte","Cagent","seguridad de operaciones","aislamiento de sandbox"],"fr":["configuration de sandbox","Gemini CLI","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","sécurité des opérations","isolement de sandbox"],"de":["Sandbox-Konfiguration","Gemini CLI","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","Sicherheit von Operationen","Sandbox-Isolation"],"pt":["sandbox da Gemini CLI","configuração de sandbox","isolamento de operações perigosas","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","gerenciamento de ativos de marca"],"ru":["песочница Gemini CLI","настройка песочницы","изоляция потенциально опасных операций","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","управление брендовыми активами"],"ar":["sandbox جيميني CLI","تكوين sandbox","عزل العمليات الخطرة","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","إدارة الموجودات التجارية"]}},"owner":"alchimie-di-circe","repo":"Extractor-desktop-app","repoPath":"alchimie-di-circe/Extractor-desktop-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gemini-sandbox-configuration","description":"Central authority for Gemini CLI sandboxing and isolation. Covers Docker, Podman, macOS Seatbelt profiles, and security boundaries. Use when enabling sandboxing, choosing sandbox methods, configuring Seatbelt profiles, or troubleshooting sandbox issues. Delegates 100% to gemini-cli-docs for official documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Gemini Sandbox Configuration\n\n## MANDATORY: Invoke gemini-cli-docs First\n\n> **STOP - Before providing ANY response about Gemini sandboxing:**\n>\n> 1. **INVOKE** `gemini-cli-docs` skill\n> 2. **QUERY** for the specific sandbox topic\n> 3. **BASE** responses EXCLUSIVELY on official documentation loaded\n\n## Overview\n\nMeta-skill for configuring Gemini CLI''s sandbox isolation. Sandboxing isolates potentially dangerous operations from your host system.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Keywords:** sandbox,","body":"# Gemini Sandbox Configuration\n\n## MANDATORY: Invoke gemini-cli-docs First\n\n> **STOP - Before providing ANY response about Gemini sandboxing:**\n>\n> 1. **INVOKE** `gemini-cli-docs` skill\n> 2. **QUERY** for the specific sandbox topic\n> 3. **BASE** responses EXCLUSIVELY on official documentation loaded\n\n## Overview\n\nMeta-skill for configuring Gemini CLI''s sandbox isolation. Sandboxing isolates potentially dangerous operations from your host system.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Keywords:** sandbox, docker, podman, seatbelt, isolation, container, safe execution, -s flag, GEMINI_SANDBOX\n\n**Use this skill when:**\n\n- Enabling sandboxing for the first time\n- Choosing between sandbox methods\n- Configuring Seatbelt profiles (macOS)\n- Troubleshooting sandbox issues\n- Understanding security boundaries\n\n## Sandbox Methods\n\n| Method | Platform | Isolation |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Docker | All | Full container |\n| Podman | All | Rootless container |\n| Seatbelt | macOS | Process sandbox |\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Enable via Command Flag\n\n```bash\ngemini -s -p \"command\"\n```\n\n### Enable via Environment\n\n```bash\nexport GEMINI_SANDBOX=true\ngemini \"command\"\n\n# Or specify method\nexport GEMINI_SANDBOX=docker\nexport GEMINI_SANDBOX=podman\nexport GEMINI_SANDBOX=sandbox-exec\n```\n\n### Enable via Settings\n\nAdd to `settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"sandbox\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr specify method:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"sandbox\": \"docker\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Seatbelt Profiles (macOS)\n\nSet via `SEATBELT_PROFILE` environment variable:\n\n| Profile | Writes | Network |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `permissive-open` (default) | Restricted | Allowed |\n| `permissive-closed` | Restricted | Blocked |\n| `permissive-proxied` | Restricted | Via proxy |\n| `restrictive-open` | Strict | Allowed |\n| `restrictive-closed` | Strict | Blocked |\n\n## Custom Sandbox Flags\n\nFor container-based sandboxing, inject custom flags:\n\n```bash\nexport SANDBOX_FLAGS=\"--security-opt label=disable\"\n```\n\n## Keyword Registry (Delegates to gemini-cli-docs)\n\n| Topic | Query Keywords |\n| --- | --- |\n| Enable | `enable sandbox`, `-s flag`, `GEMINI_SANDBOX` |\n| Docker | `docker sandbox`, `container isolation` |\n| Podman | `podman sandbox`, `rootless container` |\n| Seatbelt | `seatbelt profiles`, `sandbox-exec macos` |\n| Custom flags | `SANDBOX_FLAGS`, `custom docker flags` |\n| Troubleshooting | `sandbox troubleshooting`, `operation not permitted` |\n\n## Quick Decision Tree\n\n**What do you want to do?**\n\n1. **Enable sandbox quickly** -> Use `-s` flag\n2. **Make it persistent** -> Add to settings.json\n3. **Use Docker** -> Set `GEMINI_SANDBOX=docker`\n4. **Use stricter macOS** -> Set `SEATBELT_PROFILE=restrictive-closed`\n5. **Debug issues** -> Use `DEBUG=1 gemini -s`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| \"Operation not permitted\" | Sandbox restriction | Expected behavior |\n| \"Docker not found\" | Docker not running | Start Docker daemon |\n| Network blocked | Restrictive profile | Use `permissive-open` |\n| Missing commands | Not in sandbox image | Add to custom Dockerfile |\n\n## Security Notes\n\n- Sandboxing reduces but doesn''t eliminate all risks\n- Use most restrictive profile that allows your work\n- GUI applications may not work in sandbox\n- Container overhead is minimal after first build\n\n## Verification Checkpoint\n\n- [ ] Did I invoke gemini-cli-docs skill?\n- [ ] Did official documentation load?\n- [ ] Is my response based EXCLUSIVELY on official docs?\n\n## Test Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Enable Sandbox\n\n**Query**: \"How do I enable sandboxing in Gemini CLI?\"\n**Expected Behavior**:\n\n- Skill activates on \"sandbox\" keyword\n- Delegates to gemini-cli-docs for configuration options\n**Success Criteria**: User receives -s flag and settings.json configuration\n\n### Scenario 2: macOS Seatbelt\n\n**Query**: \"How do I configure Seatbelt profiles for Gemini CLI?\"\n**Expected Behavior**:\n\n- Skill activates on \"seatbelt\" or \"macos sandbox\"\n- Provides SEATBELT_PROFILE environment variable options\n**Success Criteria**: User receives profile comparison table\n\n### Scenario 3: Troubleshoot Sandbox\n\n**Query**: \"Getting ''operation not permitted'' in Gemini sandbox\"\n**Expected Behavior**:\n\n- Skill activates on \"sandbox troubleshooting\" or \"operation not permitted\"\n- Explains expected sandbox restrictions\n**Success Criteria**: User understands behavior is expected and gets workarounds\n\n## References\n\nQuery `gemini-cli-docs` for official documentation on:\n\n- \"sandbox\"\n- \"seatbelt profiles\"\n- \"docker sandbox\"\n\n## Version History\n\n- v1.1.0 (2025-12-01): Added Test Scenarios section\n- v1.0.0 (2025-11-25): Initial release\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:34:49.385Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing secure sandbox isolation for potentially dangerous operations","zh":"非常适合需要安全沙箱隔离的高级AI代理，用于可能危险的操作","ja":"安全なサンドボックス分離が必要な高度なAIエージェントに最適で、潜在的に危険な操作を行う","ko":"보안 샌드박스 분리를 필요로 하는 고급 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 잠재적으로 위험한 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan aislamiento de sandbox seguro para operaciones potencialmente peligrosas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA avancés qui ont besoin d''un isolement de sandbox sécurisé pour des opérations potentiellement dangereuses","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die ein sicheres Sandbox-Isolierung für potenziell gefährliche Operationen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de isolamento de sandbox seguro para operações potencialmente perigosas","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуется безопасная изоляция песочницы для потенциально опасных операций","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء المتقدمة التي تحتاج إلى عزل الحماية للمنطقة المخصصة للأعمال المحتملة الخطرة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure Gemini CLI''s sandbox isolation, ensuring safe and secure execution of operations by utilizing Electron, Svelte, and Cagent brand asset management, while strictly adhering to official documentation loaded via gemini-cli-docs","zh":"赋予代理配置Gemini CLI的沙箱隔离的能力，通过利用Electron、Svelte和Cagent品牌资产管理，确保操作的安全和安全执行，同时严格遵循通过gemini-cli-docs加载的官方文档","ja":"Gemini CLIのサンドボックス分離を構成するためのエージェントの能力を付与し、Electron、Svelte、およびCagentブランドのアセット管理を利用して、公式ドキュメントをgemini-cli-docs経由で読み込むことで、操作の安全かつセキュアな実行を保証する","ko":"에이전트에게 Gemini CLI의 샌드박스 분리를 구성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, Electron, Svelte 및 Cagent 브랜드의 자산 관리를 사용하여, gemini-cli-docs를 통해 로드한 공식 문서를 엄격히遵守하면서, 작업의 안전하고 보안적인 실행을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar el aislamiento de sandbox de Gemini CLI, asegurando la ejecución segura y segura de las operaciones mediante la utilización de Electron, Svelte y la gestión de activos de la marca Cagent, mientras se adhiere estrictamente a la documentación oficial cargada a través de gemini-cli-docs","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer l''isolement de sandbox de Gemini CLI, assurant l''exécution sûre et sécurisée des opérations en utilisant Electron, Svelte et la gestion d''actifs de la marque Cagent, tout en respectant strictement la documentation officielle chargée via gemini-cli-docs","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Sandbox-Isolierung von Gemini CLI zu konfigurieren, um eine sichere und sichere Ausführung von Operationen unter Verwendung von Electron, Svelte und der Vermögensverwaltung der Marke Cagent zu gewährleisten, während sie sich strikt an die offizielle Dokumentation hält, die über gemini-cli-docs geladen wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar a isolamento de sandbox do Gemini CLI, garantindo a execução segura e segura das operações utilizando Electron, Svelte e gestão de ativos da marca Cagent, enquanto adere estritamente à documentação oficial carregada via gemini-cli-docs","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конфигурировать изоляцию песочницы Gemini CLI, обеспечивая безопасное и защищенное выполнение операций с помощью Electron, Svelte и управления брендовыми активами Cagent, при этом строго соблюдая официальную документацию, загружаемую через gemini-cli-docs","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تكوين عزل الحماية لمنطقة العمل الخاصة بخدمة Gemini CLI، مما يضمن تنفيذ العمليات بأمان وبدقة باستخدام إلكترون وسفلت وجستور للعلامة التجارية Cagent، مع الالتزام الصارم بالتوثيق الرسمي الذي يتم تحميله من خلال gemini-cli-docs"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring sandbox environments for sensitive operations","Isolating potentially dangerous operations from host systems","Querying official documentation for specific sandbox topics via gemini-cli-docs"],"zh":["为敏感操作配置沙箱环境","将潜在危险的操作与主机系统隔离","通过gemini-cli-docs查询特定沙箱主题的官方文档"],"ja":["機密操作用のサンドボックス環境を構成する","潜在的に危険な操作をホストシステムから分離する","特定のサンドボックスのトピックについて、公式ドキュメントをgemini-cli-docs経由で照会する"],"ko":["민감한 작업을 위한 샌드박스 환경 구성"," 잠재적으로 위험한 작업을 호스트 시스템에서 분리","특정 샌드박스 주제에 대한 공식 문서를 gemini-cli-docs를 통해 조회"],"es":["Configuración de entornos 