表的一致性","ja":"Changelog ルート管理はバージョン管理の重要な部分であり、根の ChangeLog エントリを更新し、バージョンリストの一貫性を維持することを含む","ko":"Changelog 루트 관리는 버전 관리의 중요한 부분으로, 루트 ChangeLog 항목을 업데이트 하고 버전 목록의 일관성을 유지하는 것을 포함합니다","es":"Changelog-root actualiza la entrada de registro de cambios raíz y mantiene la versión de lanzamiento y las listas de versiones consistentes","fr":"Changelog-root met à jour l''entrée du journal des modifications racine et maintient la version de publication et les listes de versions cohérentes","de":"Changelog-root aktualisiert den Eintrag im Änderungsprotokoll der Root-Version und hält die Release-Version und die Versionslisten konsistent","pt":"O Changelog Root ajuda a manter a versão e lista de lançamentos consistentes. Atualize a entrada de ChangeLog com facilidade.","ru":"Changelog Root помогает поддерживать версию и список релизов последовательными. Обновите запись ChangeLog легко.","ar":"شجرة سجل التغيير تساعد في الحفاظ على الإصدار وقائمة الإصدارات متسقة. قم بتحديث إدخال سجل التغيير بسهولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["更新根 ChangeLog 条目","保持版本列表的一致性","识别变更类型（补丁、次要、主要）","计算目标版本","保持版本管理的最佳实践"],"ja":["根の ChangeLog エントリを更新する","バージョンリストの一貫性を維持する","変更タイプ（パッチ、ミノル、メジャー）を識別する","対象バージョンを計算する","バージョン管理のベストプラクティスを維持する"],"ko":["루트 ChangeLog 항목을 업데이트합니다","버전 목록의 일관성을 유지합니다","변경 유형（패치, 마이너, 메이저）을 식별합니다","대상 버전을 계산합니다","버전 관리의 모범 사례를 유지합니다"],"es":["Actualiza la entrada de registro de cambios raíz","Mantiene la versión de lanzamiento y las listas de versiones consistentes","Identifica el tipo de cambio (patch, minor, major)","Lee la entrada superior en ChangeLog","Calcula la versión objetivo desde la última versión publicada"],"fr":["Met à jour l''entrée du journal des modifications racine","Maintient la version de publication et les listes de versions cohérentes","Identifie le type de modification (patch, minor, major)","Lit l''entrée supérieure dans ChangeLog","Calcule la version cible à partir de la dernière version publiée"],"de":["Aktualisiert den Eintrag im Änderungsprotokoll der Root-Version","Hält die Release-Version und die Versionslisten konsistent","Identifiziert den Änderungstyp (patch, minor, major)","Liest den oberen Eintrag in ChangeLog","Berechnet die Zielversion aus der letzten veröffentlichten Version"],"pt":["Atualize a entrada de ChangeLog","Mantenha a versão e lista de lançamentos consistentes","Identifique o tipo de alteração","Leia a entrada superior em ChangeLog","Compute a versão alvo"],"ru":["Обновите запись ChangeLog","Сохраняйте версию и список релизов последовательными","Определите тип изменения","Прочитайте верхнюю запись в ChangeLog","Рассчитайте целевую версию"],"ar":["قم بتحديث إدخال سجل التغيير","احتفظ بإصدار وقائمة الإصدارات متسقة","حدد نوع التغيير","اقرأ الإدخال العلوي في سجل التغيير","احسب الإصدار المستهدف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Changelog 管理","版本管理","变更管理","补丁版本","次要版本","主要版本","版本一致性"],"ja":["Changelog 管理","バージョン管理","変更管理","パッチバージョン","ミノルバージョン","メジャーバージョン","バージョンの一貫性"],"ko":["Changelog 관리","버전 관리","변경 관리","패치 버전","마이너 버전","메이저 버전","버전 일관성"],"es":["changelog-root","registro de cambios","versiones de software","actualización de versiones","tipo de cambio","patch","minor","major"],"fr":["changelog-root","journal des modifications","versions de logiciel","mise à jour de versions","type de modification","patch","minor","major"],"de":["changelog-root","Änderungsprotokoll","Software-Versionen","Versionen aktualisieren","Änderungstyp","patch","minor","major"],"pt":["Changelog Root","ChangeLog","versão","lançamentos","atualização","desenvolvimento","ferramenta","consistência"],"ru":["Changelog Root","ChangeLog","версия","релиз","обновление","разработка","инструмент","последовательность"],"ar":["شجرة سجل التغيير","سجل التغيير","إصدار","إصدارات","تحديث","تطوير","أداة","اتساق"]}},"owner":"ts-klassen","repo":"qrpc","repoPath":"ts-klassen/qrpc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"changelog-root","description":"Update the repository root ChangeLog and keep the root release version metadata in sync. Use when updating the root version or syncing subsystem/package version lists in ChangeLog; touches ChangeLog at repo root and the release version in rebar.config. If you are not sure which changelog-* skill to read, read this first.","bodyPreview":"# Changelog Root\n\n## Overview\n\nUpdate the root ChangeLog entry and keep the root release version and version lists consistent.\n\n## Versioning\n\n1. Identify the change type (patch, minor, major). Ask if unclear.\n2. Read the top entry in `ChangeLog` and note whether it is `UNRELEASED`.\n3. Find the latest released version from the first dated entry.\n4. Compute the target version from the latest released version and the change type:\n   - Patch: fixes, docs, or internal changes without new features.","body":"# Changelog Root\n\n## Overview\n\nUpdate the root ChangeLog entry and keep the root release version and version lists consistent.\n\n## Versioning\n\n1. Identify the change type (patch, minor, major). Ask if unclear.\n2. Read the top entry in `ChangeLog` and note whether it is `UNRELEASED`.\n3. Find the latest released version from the first dated entry.\n4. Compute the target version from the latest released version and the change type:\n   - Patch: fixes, docs, or internal changes without new features.\n   - Minor: new features or notable behavior changes.\n   - Major: breaking changes.\n5. Apply one of these states:\n   - No `UNRELEASED` entry: insert a new `UNRELEASED` entry at the top with the target version.\n   - `UNRELEASED` exists but target version is higher: update the `* VERSION:` line to the target version.\n   - `UNRELEASED` exists and target version is the same or lower: keep the `* VERSION:` line unchanged.\n6. Never downgrade an existing `UNRELEASED` version.\n7. Update `rebar.config` at `{release, {qrpc, \"X.Y.Z\"}, ...}` to match the `UNRELEASED` version.\n8. Do not replace `UNRELEASED` with a date; only do that at release time.\n\n## Scope and Forbidden Reads\n\nOnly edit the repository root `ChangeLog`. Do not open or modify any other ChangeLog files in the repo. It is forbidden to read `apps/*/ChangeLog` or `config/pkgsrc/files/*/*/ChangeLog` for this task unless you edited them or asked to do so.\n\n## Subsystem Versioning\n\nRefresh `* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:` from `apps/*/src/*.app.src` (`vsn` values) if you edited them or asked to do so. Keep the existing order and formatting. Do not read new ChangeLog files just for this. If you are not sure what to do, skip this section.\n\n## Package Versioning\n\nRefresh `* PACKAGE VERSIONS:` from `config/pkgsrc/files/meta-pkgs/*/Makefile` (`DISTNAME` versions) if you edited those meta-pkg files or were asked to do so. Keep the existing order and formatting. Do not add versions for non-meta packages; their ChangeLogs (example: `config/pkgsrc/files/audio/voicevox_core/ChangeLog`) do not affect the root ChangeLog. Do not read new ChangeLog files just for this. If you are not sure what to do, skip this section.\n\n## Change Description\n\nAppend the new change line(s) under the version lists in the `UNRELEASED` entry.\n\n## Formatting Rules\n\nUse the existing ChangeLog formatting:\n- Use a header line like `UNRELEASED  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>` or `YYYY-MM-DD  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>`.\n- Keep a blank line after the header.\n- Use tabs for indentation and `*` bullets, matching the file.\n- Use 2 new lines in between entries.\n\n## Example Requests\n\n- \"Update ChangeLog\"\n- \"Update ChangeLog as minor update\"\n- \"Update the root ChangeLog and rebar.config release version to 0.2.0.\"\n\n## Example scenario\n\n### No UNRELEASED\n\ncurrent file:\n\n```\n2025-12-25  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tInitial setup.\n```\n\nupdated file:\n\n```\nUNRELEASED  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.2.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tAdded some feature.\n\n\n2025-12-25  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tInitial setup.\n```\n\n### UNRELEASED 0.1.1 to 0.2.0\n\ncurrent file:\n\n```\nUNRELEASED  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.1\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tFixed some bug.\n\n\n2025-12-25  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tInitial setup.\n```\n\nupdated file:\n\n```\nUNRELEASED  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.2.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tFixed some bug.\n\tAdded some feature.\n\n\n2025-12-25  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tInitial setup.\n```\n\n### append to UNRELEASED\n\ncurrent file:\n\n```\nUNRELEASED  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.2.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tAdded some feature.\n\n\n2025-12-25  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tInitial setup.\n```\n\nupdated file:\n\n```\nUNRELEASED  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.2.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tAdded some feature.\n\tAdded more feature.\n\n\n2025-12-25  ts-klassen  <qrpc@su-shiki.com>\n\n\t* VERSION: 0.1.0\n\t* SUBSYSTEM VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc: 0.1.0\n\t\t* q_tut: 0.3.0\n\t\t* q_vvx: 0.1.0\n\t* PACKAGE VERSIONS:\n\t\t* qrpc-devel: 0.1.0\n\t\t* qrpc-prod: 0.1.0\n\tInitial setup.\n```\n\n## Related skills\n\n- changelog-pkg\n  - If you edited a file under ./config/pkgsrc, read this too if you haven''t.\n- changelog-app\n  - If you edited a file under ./apps, read this too if you haven''t.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:36:10.938Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing automated ChangeLog management and version consistency.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更日志管理和版本一致性的版本控制代理。","ja":"自動化された変更ログ管理とバージョンの一貫性が必要なバージョン管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 관리 및 버전 일관성이 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Control de Versiones que necesitan una gestión automatizada de ChangeLog y coherencia de versiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contrôle de Version nécessitant une gestion automatique de ChangeLog et une cohérence de version.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die eine automatisierte ChangeLog-Verwaltung und Versionskonsistenz benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que necessitam de gerenciamento automático de ChangeLog e consistência de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, которым требуется автоматизированное управление журналом изменений и согласованность версий.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التحكم في الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة سجل التغييرات الآلية وتوافق الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update root ChangeLog entries and maintain consistent versioning by identifying change types, such as patch, minor, or major, and computing target versions based on the latest released version.","zh":"赋予代理更新根变更日志条目和维护一致的版本控制的能力，通过识别更改类型（如补丁、次要或主要），并根据最新发布的版本计算目标版本。","ja":"エージェントにルートの変更ログエントリを更新し、パッチ、・マイナー、またはメジャーのような変更タイプを識別し、最新のリリースバージョンに基づいてターゲットバージョンを計算することにより、バージョニングを一貫して維持する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 루트 변경 로그 항목을 업데이트하고 일관된 버전 관리를 유지할 수 있게 해주는 기능을 제공합니다. 패치, 보조 또는 주요와 같은 변경 유형을 식별하고 최신 릴리스 버전에 따라 대상 버전을 계산합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a actualizar las entradas de ChangeLog de raíz y mantener una versionado coherente identificando los tipos de cambios, como parches, menores o mayores, y calculando las versiones objetivo en función de la última versión publicada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour les entrées de ChangeLog de base et de maintenir une versionnage cohérent en identifiant les types de modifications, tels que des correctifs, des mineures ou des majeures, et en calculant les versions cibles en fonction de la dernière version publiée.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Stamm-ChangeLog-Einträge zu aktualisieren und ein konsistentes Versionieren durch die Identifizierung von Änderungstypen wie Patches, Minor- oder Major-Änderungen und die Berechnung der Zielversionen auf der Grundlage der letzten veröffentlichten Version zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar entradas de ChangeLog de raiz e manter a versão consistente, identificando tipos de alterações, como patch, menor ou maior, e computando versões alvo com base na versão mais recente lançada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обновлять записи журнала изменений корневого уровня и поддерживать согласованную версию, определяя типы изменений, такие как патч, минор или мажор, и вычисляя целевые версии на основе последней выпущенной версии.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تحديث إدخالات سجل التغييرات الجذرية والحفاظ على إصدار متسق من خلال تحديد أنواع التغييرات، مثل التصحيح أو الرئيسي أو الثانوي، و حساب الإصدارات المستهدفة بناءً على أحدث إصدار منتشر."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating the root ChangeLog entry","Maintaining consistent version lists","Computing target versions based on change types"],"zh":["更新根变更日志条目","维护一致的版本列表","根据更改类型计算目标版本"],"ja":["ルートの変更ログエントリを更新する","一貫したバージョンリストを維持する","変更タイプに基づいてターゲットバージョンを計算する"],"ko":["루트 변경 로그 항목 更新","일관된 버전 목록 유지","변경 유형에 따른 대상 버전 계산"],"es":["Actualizar la entrada de ChangeLog de raíz","Mantener listas de versiones coherentes","Calcular versiones objetivo en función de los tipos de cambios"],"fr":["Mettre à jour l''entrée de ChangeLog de base","Maintenir des listes de versions cohérentes","Calculer les versions cibles en fonction des types de modifications"],"de":["Aktualisieren des Stamm-ChangeLog-Eintrags","Beibehaltung konsistenter Versionslisten","Berechnen der Zielversionen basierend auf den Änderungstypen"],"pt":["Atualizar a entrada de ChangeLog de raiz","Manter listas de versões consistentes","Calcular versões alvo com base nos tipos de alterações"],"ru":["Обновление записи журнала изменений корневого уровня","Поддержание согласованных списков версий","Вычисление целевых версий на основе типов изменений"],"ar":["تحديث إدخال سجل التغييرات الجذري","الحفاظ على قوائم الإصدارات المتسقة","حساب الإصدارات المستهدفة بناءً على أنواع التغييرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ChangeLog file","Limited to specific versioning schemes","May require manual clarification of change types"],"zh":["需要访问变更日志文件","仅限于特定的版本控制方案","可能需要手动澄清更改类型"],"ja":["変更ログファイルへのアクセスが必要","特定のバージョニングスキームに限定される","変更タイプの手動での明確化が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["변경 로그 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","특정 버전 관리 체계에만 제한","변경 유형에 대한 수동 澄清이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo ChangeLog","Limitado a esquemas de versionado específicos","Puede requerir una aclaración manual de los tipos de cambios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier ChangeLog","Limité à des schémas de versionnage spécifiques","Peut nécessiter une clarification manuelle des types de modifications"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die ChangeLog-Datei","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Versionschemata","Kann eine manuelle Klarstellung der Änderungstypen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo ChangeLog","Limitado a esquemas de versionamento específicos","Pode requerer esclarecimento manual dos tipos de alterações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу журнала изменений","Ограничен конкретными схемами версионирования","Может потребовать ручного уточнения типов изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف سجل التغييرات","محدود بمخططات الإصدار الخاصة","يمكن أن يتطلب توضيحًا يدويا لأنواع التغييرات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CheekyCodexConjurer/aera-chart-engine/shadow_coder', 'community', 'CheekyCodexConjurer', 'aera-chart-engine', 'CheekyCodexConjurer/aera-chart-engine', 'shadow_coder', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.448Z', '2026-02-18T06:36:03.069Z', NULL, '{"id":"CheekyCodexConjurer/aera-chart-engine/shadow_coder","name":"shadow_coder","description":{"zh":"影子编码器是一种实现平行路径的 strangler-fig 迁移的技术，通过创建平行路径、镜像接口和添加适配器来提高代码质量","ja":"シャドウコーダーはストラングラー・フィグ移行の平行パスを実現する技術で、平行パスを作成し、インターフェースをミラーリングし、適応器を追加してコードの品質を向上させる","ko":"샤�多우 코더는 스트랭글러 피그 마이그레이션의 평행 경로를 구현하는 기술로, 평행 경로를 생성하고 인터페이스를 미러링하며 어댑터를 추가하여 코드 품질을 향상시킵니다","es":"Shadow_coder permite migraciones strangler-fig seguras con caminos paralelos, mejorando la seguridad y eficiencia de tus proyectos de desarrollo de software","fr":"Shadow_coder permet des migrations strangler-fig sécurisées avec des chemins parallèles, améliorant la sécurité et l''efficacité de vos projets de développement de logiciels","de":"Shadow_coder ermöglicht sichere strangler-fig-Migrationen mit parallelen Pfaden, verbessert die Sicherheit und Effizienz Ihrer Software-Entwicklungsprojekte","pt":"O shadow_coder permite migrações de estrangulamento com caminhos paralelos seguros. Isso melhora a eficiência do código e reduz riscos.","ru":"Shadow_coder позволяет выполнять миграции-удушения с безопасными параллельными путями. Это улучшает эффективность кода и снижает риски.","ar":"يسمح shadow_coder بإجراء هجرات الخنق مع مسارات موازية آمنة. هذا يتحسن من كفاءة الرمز ويقلل من المخاطر.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"影子编码器 - 实现平行路径的 strangler-fig 迁移","ja":"シャドウコーダー - 平行パスのストラングラー・フィグ移行を可能に","ko":"샤�多우 코더 - 평행 경로의 스트랭글러 피그 마이그레이션","es":"shadow_coder: Migraciones Seguras con Caminos Paralelos","fr":"shadow_coder : Migration avec chemins parallèles sécurisés","de":"shadow_coder: Sichere Migrationen mit parallelen Pfaden",