가능한 아티팩트 명명 및 검증"],"es":["Crea paquetes de entrega limpios y consistentes","Incluye un prompt que se ajusta al entorno objetivo","Establece criterios de aceptación y no objetivos explícitos","Nomenclatura de artefactos predecible y validación"],"fr":["Crée des packages de handoff propres et cohérents","Inclut un prompt qui correspond à l''environnement cible","Établit des critères d''acceptation et de non-objectifs explicites","Nomination d''artefacts prévisible et validation"],"de":["Erstellt saubere und konsistente Handoff-Pakete","Enthält ein Prompt, das zum Zielumfeld passt","Legt explizite Akzeptanz- und Nicht-Zielkriterien fest","Vorhersehbare Benennung von Artefakten und Validierung"],"pt":["Criação de pacotes de handoff limpos e eficientes","Definição de critérios de aceitação explícitos","Nomenclatura de artefatos previsíveis","Validação de uploads consistentes","Suporte a vários ambientes de destino"],"ru":["Создание чистых и эффективных пакетов handoff","Определение явных критериев приемки","Предсказуемое название артефактов","Валидация последовательных загрузок","Поддержка нескольких целевых сред"],"ar":["إنشاء حزم 手وف نظيفة وفعالة","تعريف معايير القبول الصريحة","تسمية الملفات المتوقعة","التحقق من الملفات المرفوعة المتسقة","دعم البيئات المستهدفة المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["终端AI助手","软件工程任务","交接包","repomixbundle","提示","接受标准","非目标","工件命名","验证"],"ja":["ターミナルAIアシスタント","ソフトウェアエンジニアリングタスク","ハンドオフパッケージ","repomixバンドル","プロンプト","受け入れ基準","非目標","アーティファクト命名","検証"],"ko":["터미널 AI 어시스턴트","소프트웨어 엔지니어링 태스크","인도 패키지","repomix 번들","프롬프트","수락 기준","비목표","아티팩트 명명","검증"],"es":["ingeniería de software","entrega de paquetes","asistente de AI","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas","optimización de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["ingénierie logicielle","livraison de packages","assistant d''AI","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches","optimisation de workflow"],"de":["Software-Engineering","Lieferung von Paketen","AI-Assistent","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Optimierung von Workflow"],"pt":["engenharia de software","handoff","AI","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","pacotes de handoff","critérios de aceitação"],"ru":["инженерия программного обеспечения","handoff","ИИ","инструмент разработки","пакеты handoff","критерии приемки"],"ar":["هندسة البرمجيات","هاندوف","أي","أداة تطوير","حزم هاندوف","معايير القبول"]}},"owner":"yusifeng","repo":"formax","repoPath":"yusifeng/formax","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","description":"Use when preparing a Formax code handoff: selecting files, generating repomix bundles, and writing a high-quality prompt for WebGPT or another coding agent with clear constraints and validation scope.","bodyPreview":"# formax-repomix-handoff-workflow\n\n## Goal\nCreate a clean handoff package for another AI with:\n- the smallest correct repomix bundle\n- a prompt that matches the target environment\n- explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals\n- predictable artifact naming + validation (so uploads stay consistent)\n\n## Where to change what\n- All handoff artifacts live in one folder: `repomix-output/`\n- Bundle output: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt`\n- Handoff prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-promp","body":"# formax-repomix-handoff-workflow\n\n## Goal\nCreate a clean handoff package for another AI with:\n- the smallest correct repomix bundle\n- a prompt that matches the target environment\n- explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals\n- predictable artifact naming + validation (so uploads stay consistent)\n\n## Where to change what\n- All handoff artifacts live in one folder: `repomix-output/`\n- Bundle output: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt`\n- Handoff prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-prompt.md`\n- File manifest notes: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-files.md`\n- Template references: `references/prompt-templates.md`\n\n> Required hygiene: each new pack run must clear previous files in `repomix-output/` first, so users can upload that folder as-is without manual file picking.\n\n## Pack tiers (default taxonomy)\nUse exactly one tier label in bundle filename:\n\n- `minimal`: changed runtime files + direct dependencies + adjacent tests.\n- `core`: `minimal` + only critical contract/design docs needed for intent.\n- `full`: broad context pack for deep investigations (cross-subsystem docs/tests).\n\nExample names:\n- `repomix-topic-minimal.txt`\n- `repomix-topic-core.txt`\n- `repomix-topic-full.txt`\n\n## Patterns\n1. Classify target runtime first\n- `Static consumer` (e.g., WebGPT): cannot run local commands or tests.\n- `Executable agent` (repo access): can run local commands/tests.\n\n2. Pick a pack tier first (`minimal` / `core` / `full`)\n- Default to `minimal`.\n- Upgrade to `core` only when architecture/contracts matter.\n- Use `full` only when root cause plausibly spans multiple subsystems.\n\n3. Build the include set for that tier\n- Include changed runtime files + direct dependencies + adjacent tests.\n- Include only docs needed for intent/constraints at the chosen tier.\n- Avoid unrelated folders to keep context small.\n\n4. Pack with deterministic command (single folder, auto-clean)\n```sh\nbunx repomix . \\\n  --style plain \\\n  --no-git-sort-by-changes \\\n  -o repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  --include \"<comma-separated-file-list>\"\n```\nOr use the helper script:\n```sh\nbash .codex/skills/formax-repomix-handoff-workflow/scripts/build-repomix.sh \\\n  repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  \"<comma-separated-file-list>\"\n```\nThe helper script will:\n- create `repomix-output/` if missing\n- delete previous files under `repomix-output/` (except `.gitkeep`)\n- write the new bundle into `repomix-output/`\n\n5. Write prompt + file manifest with naming convention\n- Prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-prompt.md`\n- Manifest: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-files.md`\n- Always use **repo-relative paths** in prompt + manifest (no machine absolute paths).\n\n6. Write prompt with explicit boundaries\n- State known symptoms.\n- State hard constraints (what must not change).\n- Define deliverables (root cause model, options, recommended plan, test/validation matrix).\n- Include acceptance criteria with observable assertions.\n\n7. Run artifact validation (required)\n```sh\nbash .codex/skills/formax-repomix-handoff-workflow/scripts/check-handoff-artifacts.sh \\\n  repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  <topic>\n```\nThis check enforces:\n- Bundle/prompt/manifest files all exist.\n- Prompt and manifest reference the current bundle name.\n- Manifest references the prompt filename.\n- Prompt + manifest do not contain local absolute paths.\n\n8. Sanity-check before handoff\n- `repomix-output/` only contains current-round artifacts.\n- Bundle exists and includes the expected files.\n- Prompt has no impossible instructions for the target runtime.\n- Prompt does not ask static consumers to run commands.\n- Naming is topic-driven and consistent across all three artifacts.\n\nSee `references/prompt-templates.md` for copy-ready templates.\n\n## Tests to update\n- No repository tests required for creating the handoff itself.\n- If target is executable, include a suggested minimal test list in the handoff prompt.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Never include `bun run test:coverage` in a static-consumer prompt.\n- Never assume the other AI can read files outside the provided bundle unless explicitly attached.\n- Keep asks decision-oriented first (root cause/options) before patch implementation.\n- Prefer concrete acceptance checks over vague goals.\n- Avoid mixing unrelated bugfixes into one handoff package.\n- Never leak machine absolute paths (e.g., `/Users/...`) in prompt/manifest.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:36:42.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Software Engineering Agents requiring streamlined handoff workflows with minimal repomix bundles and precise prompt matching","zh":"适合需要简化交接工作流程、最小化repomix包和精确提示匹配的软件工程代理","ja":"ソフトウェアエンジニアリングエージェントがストリームライン化されたハンドオフワークフローと最小のrepomixバンドル、および正確なプロンプトマッチングを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"소프트웨어 엔지니어링 에이전트가 스트림 라인화된 핸드오버 워크플로우와 최소한의 repomix 번들을 필요로 할 때 이상적","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Ingeniería de Software que requieren flujos de trabajo de entrega optimizados con paquetes de repomix mínimos y coincidencia de promtps precisa","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Ingénierie Logicielle nécessitant des flux de travail de passation optimisés avec des bundles repomix minimaux et une correspondance de promtps précise","de":"Ideal für Software-Engineering-Agenten, die optimierte Handoff-Workflows mit minimalen Repomix-Bundles und präziser Prompt-Übereinstimmung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Engenharia de Software que requerem fluxos de trabalho de handoff otimizados com pacotes de repomix mínimos e combinação de prompts precisa","ru":"Идеально для агентов программной инженерии, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов handoff с минимальными пакетами repomix и точным сопоставлением подсказок","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الهندسيين البرمجية الذين يتطلبون سير عمل handoff مبسط مع حزم repomix قليلية والحصول على تطابق دقيق للمطالبات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create clean handoff packages with predictable artifact naming and validation, utilizing repomix bundles and explicit acceptance criteria, all while ensuring consistency in uploads via the terminal-first interface inspired by Claude Code v2.0.67","zh":"赋予代理创建干净的交接包的能力，具有可预测的工件命名和验证，利用repomix包和显式接受标准，同时确保通过终端优先接口的上传一致性，该接口的灵感来自Claude Code v2.0.67","ja":"エージェントがクリーンなハンドオフパッケージを作成できるようにし、予測可能なアーティファクト命名と検証を使用し、repomixバンドルと明示的な受け入れ基準を利用し、Claude Code v2.0.67にインスパイアされたターミナルファーストインターフェースを介したアップロードの一貫性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 깨끗한 핸드오버 패키지를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 예측 가능한 아티팩트命名 및 검증을 사용하고, repomix 번들 및 명시적 수용 기준을 활용하며, Claude Code v2.0.67에 영감을 받은 터미널 우선 인터페이스를 통해 업로드 일관성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear paquetes de entrega limpios con nombres de artefactos predecibles y validación, utilizando bundles de repomix y criterios de aceptación explícitos, todo mientras se garantiza la consistencia en las cargas a través de la interfaz de terminal inspirada en Claude Code v2.0.67","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des packages de passation propres avec des noms d''artefacts prévisibles et une validation, en utilisant des bundles repomix et des critères d''acceptation explicites, le tout tout en garantissant la cohérence des téléchargements via l''interface de terminal inspirée de Claude Code v2.0.67","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, saubere Handoff-Pakete mit vorhersehbaren Artefakt-Namen und Validierung zu erstellen, indem Repomix-Bundles und explizite Akzeptanzkriterien verwendet werden, während die Konsistenz bei Uploads über die terminal-erste Schnittstelle, die von Claude Code v2.0.67 inspiriert ist, gewährleistet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar pacotes de handoff limpos com nomes de artefatos previsíveis e validação, utilizando pacotes de repomix e critérios de aceitação explícitos, garantindo assim a consistência nos uploads via a interface terminal-first inspirada no Claude Code v2.0.67","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать чистые пакеты handoff с предсказуемыми именами артефактов и проверкой, используя пакеты repomix и явные критерии приемки, обеспечивая при этом согласованность загрузок через терминальный интерфейс, вдохновленный Claude Code v2.0.67","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء حزم handoff نظيفة مع أسماء الملفات القابلة للتنبؤ والتحقق، باستخدام حزم repomix ومعايير القبول الصريحة، مع ضمان الاتساق في التحميلات عبر واجهة Terminal-First التي تعتمد على Claude Code v2.0.67"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of minimal correct repomix bundles for efficient handoffs","Generating prompts that accurately match target environments for seamless integration","Validating artifact naming and ensuring upload consistency across handoff workflows"],"zh":["自动创建最小的正确repomix包以实现高效的交接","生成与目标环境无缝集成的准确匹配提示","验证工件命名并确保交接工作流中的上传一致性"],"ja":["効率的なハンドオフのために最小の正しいrepomixバンドルを作成する","ターゲット環境とのシームレスな統合のために正確なマッチングプロンプトを生成する","アーティファクト命名の検証とハンドオフワークフローでのアップロードの一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["효율적인 핸드오버를 위한 최소한의 올바른 repomix 번들 생성","타겟 환경과 무결점 통합을 위한 정확한 매칭 프롬프트 생성","아티팩트 명명 규칙 검증 및 핸드오버 워크플로우에서 업로드 일관성 보장"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de bundles de repomix mínimos correctos para entregas eficientes","Generar promtps que coincidan con precisión con los entornos de destino para una integración sin problemas","Validar los nombres de los artefactos y garantizar la consistencia de las cargas en los flujos de trabajo de entrega"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de bundles repomix minimaux corrects pour des passations efficaces","Générer des promtps qui correspondent avec précision aux environnements cibles pour une intégration sans problème","Valider les noms des artefacts et assurer la cohérence des téléchargements dans les flux de travail de passation"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von minimalen, korrekten Repomix-Bundles für effiziente Handoffs","Generieren von Prompts, die genau mit den Zielumgebungen übereinstimmen, für eine nahtlose Integration","Validieren von Artefakt-Namen und Gewährleisten der Konsistenz bei Uploads in Handoff-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de pacotes de repomix mínimos corretos para handoffs eficientes","Gerar prompts que correspondem com precisão aos ambientes de destino para integração sem problemas","Validar a nomenclatura de artefatos e garantir a consistência de upload em fluxos de trabalho de handoff"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание минимально правильных пакетов repomix для эффективных handoff","Генерировать подсказки, точно соответствующие целевым средам для бесшовной интеграции","Проверять именование артефактов и обеспечивать согласованность загрузок в рабочих процессах handoff"],"ar":["توفير تلقيني لإنشاء حزم repomix الصحيحة القليلة لعمليات Handoff الفعالة","генерировать مطالبات دقيقة مطابقة للبيئات المستهدفة من أجل التكامل السلس","التحقق من أسماء الملفات وضمان الاتساق في التحميلات عبر سير عمل Handoff"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires terminal-first interface compatibility","Inspired by Claude Code v2.0.67, may require adjustments for other AI assistant versions","Handoff artifacts must be stored in the designated ''repomix-output/'' folder"],"zh":["需要终端优先接口兼容性","受Claude Code v2.0.67启发，可能需要适应其他AI助手版本","交接工件必须存储在指定的''repomix-output/''文件夹中"],"ja":["ターミナルファーストインターフェースの互換性が必要","Claude Code v2.0.67にインスパイアされており、他のAIアシスタントバージョンに適応する必要がある可能性がある","ハンドオフアーティファクトは指定された''repomix-output/''フォルダに保存する必要がある"],"ko":["터미널 우선 인터페이스 호환성이 필요","Claude Code v2.0.67에 영감을 받았으므로, 다른 AI 어시스턴트 버전에 맞추기 위한 조정이 필요할 수 있음","핸드오버 아티팩트는 지정된 ''repomix-output/'' 폴더에 저장되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la interfaz de terminal","Inspirado en Claude Code v2.0.67, puede requerir ajustes para otras versiones de asistentes de IA","Los artefactos de entrega deben almacenarse en la carpeta ''repomix-output/'' designada"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec l''interface de terminal","Inspiré de Claude Code v2.0.67, peut nécessiter des ajustements pour d''autres versions d''assistants d''IA","Les artefacts de passation doivent être stockés dans le dossier ''repomix-output/'' désigné"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit der Terminal-Schnittstelle","Inspirierte von Claude Code v2.0.67, kann Anpassungen für andere Versionen von KI-Assistenten erfordern","Handoff-Artefakte müssen im bestimmten ''repomix-output/''-Verzeichnis gespeichert werden"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com a interface terminal-first","Inspirado no Claude Code v2.0.67, pode exigir ajustes para outras versões de assistentes de IA","Os artefatos de handoff devem ser armazenados na pasta ''repomix-output/'' designada"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с терминальным интерфейсом","Вдохновленный Claude Code v2.0.67, может требовать корректировок для других версий помощников ИИ","Артефакты handoff должны храниться в назначенной папке ''repomix-output/''"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع واجهة Terminal-First","مستوحى من Claude Code v2.0.67، قد يتطلب تعديلات لنسخ أخرى من مساعدي الذكاء الاصطناعي","يجب تخزين ملفات Handoff في المجلد المحدد ''repomix-output/''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
