폼","es":"Hookcode Preview Highlight: Automatización de revisión de...","fr":"Hookcode Preview Highlight: Automatisation de la révision...","de":"Hookcode Preview Highlight: Automatisierung der Code-Über...","pt":"HookCode Preview Highlight: Automatize Revisão de Código","ru":"HookCode Preview Highlight: Автоматизация Код Ревью","ar":"هوك كود معاينة تعليم: أتمتة مراجعة الكود","en":"hookcode-preview-highlight"},"description":{"zh":"HookCode 预览高亮是代码审查和自动化平台，支持实时代码审查和自动化，通过 Webhooks 和对话触发 CLI 编码助手","ja":"HookCode プレビュー ハイライトはコード レビューと自動化プラットフォーム、リアルタイム コード レビューと自動化をサポート、Webhooks と会話を介して CLI コーディング アシスタントをトリガー","ko":"HookCode预览 하이라이트는 코드 리뷰 및 자동화 플랫폼, 실시간 코드 리뷰 및 자동화를 지원, Webhooks 및 대화를 통해 CLI 코딩 어시스턴트를 트리거","es":"Hookcode Preview Highlight es una plataforma de revisión de código y automatización que facilita la ejecución de tareas y la depuración de código","fr":"Hookcode Preview Highlight est une plateforme de révision de code et d''automatisation qui facilite l''exécution de tâches et le débogage de code","de":"Hookcode Preview Highlight ist eine Plattform für die Code-Überprüfung und Automatisierung, die die Ausführung von Aufgaben und die Fehlersuche im Code erlei...","pt":"O HookCode Preview Highlight é uma plataforma de revisão de código que automatiza tarefas de desenvolvimento através de conversas e Webhooks.","ru":"HookCode Preview Highlight — платформа код ревью, автоматизирующая задачи разработки через разговоры и Вебхуки.","ar":"هوك كود معاينة تعليم هو منصة مراجعة كود تُ自動ة مهام التطوير من خلال المحادثات والويب هوك","en":"HookCode is an intelligent code review and automation platform that elegantly triggers CLI coding assistants through conversations and Webhooks. It supports ..."},"definition":{"en":"HookCode is an intelligent code review and automation platform that elegantly triggers CLI coding assistants through conversations and Webhooks. It supports independent deployment and provides a visual console for real-time task execution monitoring."},"features":{"zh":["支持实时代码审查和自动化","通过 Webhooks 和对话触发 CLI 编码助手","支持独立部署和实时任务执行监控","提供 JS 请求脚本和协议说明","支持跨域 iframe 桥接"],"ja":["リアルタイム コード レビューと自動化をサポート","Webhooks と会話を介して CLI コーディング アシスタントをトリガー","独立デプロイとリアルタイム タスク実行監視をサポート","JS リクエスト スクリプトとプロトコル ノートを提供","クロスオリジン iframe ブリッジをサポート"],"ko":["실시간 코드 리뷰 및 자동화를 지원","Webhooks 및 대화를 통해 CLI 코딩 어시스턴트를 트리거","독립 배포 및 실시간 작업 실행 모니터링을 지원","JS 요청 스크립트 및 프로토콜 설명 제공","크로스オリ진 iframe 브리지를 지원"],"es":["Automatización de la revisión de código","Ejecución de tareas en tiempo real","Depuración de código con highlight","Compatibilidad con Webhooks y CLI","Consola visual para la ejecución de tareas","Soporte para selecciones de CSS y texto"],"fr":["Automatisation de la révision de code","Exécution de tâches en temps réel","Débogage de code avec highlight","Compatibilité avec Webhooks et CLI","Console visuelle pour l''exécution de tâches","Prise en charge des sélections de CSS et de texte"],"de":["Automatisierung der Code-Überprüfung","Ausführung von Aufgaben in Echtzeit","Fehlersuche im Code mit Highlight","Kompatibilität mit Webhooks und CLI","Visuelle Konsole für die Aufgabenausführung","Unterstützung für CSS- und Textauswahl"],"pt":["Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Revisão de código inteligente","Suporte a deploy independente","Console visual para monitoramento de tarefas","Suporte a seletores CSS e texto","Handshake de ponte para iframes de origem cruzada"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач разработки","Интеллектуальный код ревью","Поддержка независимого deploy","Визуальный консоль для мониторинга задач","Поддержка селекторов CSS и текста","Хэндшейк моста для кросс-оригин iframes"],"ar":["أتمتة مهام التطوير","مراجعة كود ذكية","دعم النشر المستقل","واجهة مرئية لمراقبة المهام","دعم محددات CSS والنص","握手 الجسر لإطارات الأصل العابر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HookCode","代码审查","自动化","Webhooks","CLI 编码助手","实时代码审查","独立部署","JS 请求脚本"],"ja":["HookCode","コード レビュー","自動化","Webhooks","CLI コーディング アシスタント","リアルタイム コード レビュー","独立デプロイ","JS リクエスト スクリプト"],"ko":["HookCode","코드 리뷰","자동화","Webhooks","CLI 코딩 어시스턴트","실시간 코드 리뷰","독립 배포","JS 요청 스크립트"],"es":["automatización de revisión de código","hookcode preview highlight","desarrollo de software","revisión de código","depuración de código","webhooks","CLI","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["automatisation de la révision de code","hookcode preview highlight","développement de logiciels","révision de code","débogage de code","webhooks","CLI","développement d''applications"],"de":["automatisierung der code-überprüfung","hookcode preview highlight","softwareentwicklung","code-überprüfung","fehlersuche im code","webhooks","CLI","anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de código","automatização de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","plataforma de revisão de código","HookCode","Preview Highlight","Webhooks","conversas","deploy independente"],"ru":["код ревью","автоматизация задач","разработка программного обеспечения","платформа код ревью","HookCode","Preview Highlight","Вебхуки","разговоры","независимый deploy"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","أتمتة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","منصة مراجعة الكود","هوك كود","معاينة تعليم","الويب هوك","المحادثات","النشر المستقل"]}},"owner":"hookvibe","repo":"hookcode","repoPath":"hookvibe/hookcode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hookcode-preview-highlight","description":"End-to-end workflow for HookCode preview DOM highlighting check/start/stop previews, install dependencies, send highlight commands, and verify preview bridge readiness via PAT-authenticated APIs. Use when debugging cross-origin preview iframes, validating bridge integration, or scripting highlight requests against task-group previews.","bodyPreview":"# Hookcode Preview Highlight\n\n\n## Overview\n\n\nThis skill ships JS request scripts (with `.env` loading) and protocol notes for the complete preview highlight flow: check preview status, start previews, install dependencies if needed, send highlight commands, and stop previews after debugging. It also explains the bridge handshake required for cross-origin iframes so you can confirm whether highlight commands are actually reaching the preview DOM. Selector rules now include CSS selectors plus text","body":"# Hookcode Preview Highlight\n\n\n## Overview\n\n\nThis skill ships JS request scripts (with `.env` loading) and protocol notes for the complete preview highlight flow: check preview status, start previews, install dependencies if needed, send highlight commands, and stop previews after debugging. It also explains the bridge handshake required for cross-origin iframes so you can confirm whether highlight commands are actually reaching the preview DOM. Selector rules now include CSS selectors plus text/attribute matchers (for example `text:Save`, `attr:data-testid=cta`, `data:testid=cta`, `aria:label=Search`, `role:button`, or loose `data-testid=cta`). If a highlight command includes `targetUrl`, the preview UI will auto-navigate to that URL (and push it to the iframe history) unless the user locks auto-navigation in the toolbar. Target URL matching now supports route patterns like `:id`, `*`, `**`, hash/query wildcards, and `||` alternatives to avoid unnecessary navigation.\n<!-- Document auto-navigation + lock behavior for highlight target URLs. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n<!-- Document selector matcher rules in the skill overview. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n<!-- Document advanced targetUrl route matching rules in the skill overview. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Query preview status to discover instance names and availability before highlighting.\n- Start preview instances or install dependencies when the dev server is missing.\n- Send highlight commands with selector/mode/color/padding/scroll options via the backend API.\n- Send optional bubble tooltip payloads alongside highlights (text + placement + theme).\n- Provide CLI flags that map one-to-one with highlight + bubble payload fields.\n<!-- Expand highlight capability coverage to include bubble payloads. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n- Support selector matcher rules like `text:`, `attr:`, `data:`, `aria:`, `role:`, and `testid:` when CSS selectors are not enough.\n<!-- Describe selector matcher capabilities for highlight requests. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- Auto-navigate previews when `targetUrl` is supplied, with a lock toggle and route-matching rules to keep the current URL stable.\n<!-- Explain auto-navigation support in the preview highlight skill. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- Verify bridge readiness by checking `subscribers` and bridge error responses.\n- Stop previews after debugging to free ports and resources.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Copy `.env.example` → `.env` inside this skill folder and fill in `HOOKCODE_API_BASE_URL`, `HOOKCODE_PAT`, and `HOOKCODE_TASK_GROUP_ID` (optional: `HOOKCODE_PREVIEW_INSTANCE`).\n2. Fetch preview status to confirm instance names:\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_status.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n3. Send a highlight command (highlight parameters must be passed via CLI flags):\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_highlight.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId> \\\n  --instance app \\\n  --selector \".page-kicker\"\n```\n\n4. Send a highlight + bubble command:\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_highlight.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId> \\\n  --instance app \\\n  --selector \".page-kicker\" \\\n  --target-url \"/add\" \\\n  --bubble-text \"Update this headline\" \\\n  --bubble-placement right \\\n  --bubble-theme dark\n```\n<!-- Document bubble highlight example for CLI usage. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n\nSet these in `.env` (or override via CLI flags). Highlight-specific options are CLI-only.\n\n| Variable | Purpose | Used by |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `HOOKCODE_API_BASE_URL` | Base URL of the HookCode backend (for example `http://127.0.0.1:4000`). | All scripts |\n| `HOOKCODE_PAT` | PAT token for API authentication. | All scripts |\n| `HOOKCODE_TASK_GROUP_ID` | Default task group id to target. | All scripts |\n| `HOOKCODE_PREVIEW_INSTANCE` | Default preview instance name (for example `app`). | `preview_highlight.mjs` |\n\n## Operations (HTTP)\n\n### 1) Get preview status\n\n**Endpoint**: `GET /api/task-groups/:id/preview/status`\n\n**Purpose**: Confirm the preview is configured, see instance names, and check `running/starting` status before highlighting.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_status.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_status.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n### 2) Start preview\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/start`\n\n**Purpose**: Start all configured preview instances so the highlight API can reach a running dev server.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_start.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_start.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n### 3) Install preview dependencies\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/dependencies/install`\n\n**Purpose**: Run dependency installation without starting the dev server. Use this when highlight requests fail because the dev server never started.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_dependencies_install.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_dependencies_install.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n### 4) Send highlight command\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/:instance/highlight`\n\n**Purpose**: Forward a DOM highlight command to the preview iframe bridge.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_highlight.mjs`\n\n**Parameters**:\n- `selector` (required): CSS selector to highlight (max length 200); supports matcher rules like `text:`, `attr:`, `data:`, `aria:`, `role:`, `testid:`, or loose `data-testid=...`.\n<!-- Document selector matcher rules in the parameter list. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- `targetUrl` (optional): preview URL or path to navigate to before highlighting; matching supports `:param`, `*`, `**`, query/hash wildcards (e.g. `/users/:id?tab=*`), and `||` alternatives (first entry is used for navigation).\n<!-- Document target URL route matching behavior in the parameter list. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n\n**TargetUrl matching rules**:\n- `:param` matches a single path segment (e.g. `/users/:id`).\n- `*` matches any characters within a segment; `**` matches across segments (e.g. `/projects/**/settings`).\n- Query rules only require params you declare; use `?tab` for any value or `?tab=*` for wildcard values.\n- Hash rules accept wildcards like `#section-*`.\n- `||` separates alternatives; the first entry is used for navigation if auto-navigation is needed.\n<!-- Detail targetUrl route matching rules in the skill docs. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- `padding` (optional): number of pixels around the element (0-64, default 4).\n- `color` (optional): CSS color string for outline/glow (max length 40).\n- `mode` (optional): `outline` or `mask` (default `outline`).\n- `scrollIntoView` (optional): `true`/`false` (default `false`).\n- `bubble` (optional): object for tooltip rendering near the highlight.\n  - `text` (required when bubble provided): text content to display (1-280 chars).\n  - `placement` (optional): `top` | `right` | `bottom` | `left` | `auto` (default `auto`); auto prefers bottom/top and flips when space is insufficient to avoid clipping.\n  <!-- Document bubble placement flipping rules to avoid clipped tooltips. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n  - `align` (optional): `start` | `center` | `end` (default `center`).\n  - `offset` (optional): number of pixels between highlight and bubble (0-64, default `10`).\n  - `maxWidth` (optional): max width in px (120-640, default `320`).\n  - `theme` (optional): `dark` | `light` (default `dark`).\n  - `background` (optional): bubble background CSS color override.\n  - `textColor` (optional): bubble text color override.\n  - `borderColor` (optional): bubble border color override.\n  - `radius` (optional): bubble corner radius in px (0-24, default `12`).\n  - `arrow` (optional): `true`/`false` to show the pointer (default `true`).\n- `requestId` (optional): client-defined id for tracking.\n<!-- Expand highlight parameter docs to include bubble payload fields. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n**Response**:\n- `success`, `requestId`, `subscribers`, and optional `targetUrl` echo for navigation-aware clients.\n<!-- Document highlight response fields including targetUrl echo. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_highlight.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId> \\\n  --instance app \\\n  --selector \".page-kicker\" \\\n  --mode outline \\\n  --color \"#ff4d4f\" \\\n  --padding 4 \\\n  --scroll true \\\n  --bubble-text \"Edit this title\" \\\n  --bubble-placement top \\\n  --bubble-align center \\\n  --bubble-offset 12 \\\n  --bubble-theme dark\n```\n<!-- Add bubble flag example to highlight CLI sample. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n### 5) Stop preview\n\n**Endpoint**: `POST /api/task-groups/:id/preview/stop`\n\n**Purpose**: Stop preview instances after debugging to free ports and resources.\n\n**Script**: `scripts/preview_stop.mjs`\n\n```bash\nnode .codex/skills/hookcode-preview-highlight/scripts/preview_stop.mjs \\\n  --task-group <taskGroupId>\n```\n\n## Bridge requirements (must be installed in the preview app)\n\n- Copy `shared/preview-bridge.js` into the preview project and import it in the app entry file.\n- The bridge answers a `hookcode:preview:ping` handshake from HookCode. Only after the handshake does the frontend forward highlight commands.\n- A highlight API response with `subscribers: 0` usually means the preview UI is not connected or the bridge did not answer the ping.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **`preview_not_running`** (409): Start the preview first or check the instance name.\n- **`selector_required` / `selector_not_found`** (response from bridge): verify the selector exists in the preview DOM.\n- The bridge now retries selector resolution with `querySelectorAll`, simple id/class/tag fallbacks, and open shadow-root scans; when in doubt, send a stable CSS selector that maps to a visible element.\n<!-- Note selector fallback strategies in troubleshooting guidance. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- If a `targetUrl` is supplied but the preview does not navigate, check whether the auto-navigation lock button is enabled in the preview toolbar.\n<!-- Document auto-navigation lock behavior in troubleshooting guidance. docs/en/developer/plans/previewhighlightselector20260204/task_plan.md previewhighlightselector20260204 -->\n- **`bubble_text_required`**: a bubble payload was supplied without valid `text`.\n- **`fetch failed`**: the backend is unreachable; check `HOOKCODE_API_BASE_URL` and local network access.\n- **`subscribers: 0`**: the preview UI is not listening or the bridge script is missing.\n<!-- Document bubble-specific error messaging. docs/en/developer/plans/jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48/task_plan.md jemhyxnaw3lt4qbxtr48 -->\n\n## References\n\n- `references/highlight-protocol.md` for full protocol details and bridge message formats.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:37:52.699Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring automated CLI coding assistants and real-time task execution monitoring through Webhooks and conversations.","zh":"适合需要自动化CLI编码助手和通过Webhooks和会话进行实时任务执行监控的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが自動化されたCLIコーディングアシスタントとWebhooksおよび会話を介したリアルタイムタスク実行モニタリングを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"自动화된 CLI 코딩 어시스턴트와 Webhooks 및 대화를 통해 실시간 작업 실행 모니터링이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren asistentes de codificación de CLI automatizados y monitoreo de ejecución de tareas en tiempo real a través de Webhooks y conversaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des assistants de codage de CLI automatisés et un suivi d''exécution de tâches en temps réel via des Webhooks et des conversations.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die automatisierte CLI-Coding-Assistenten und Echtzeit-Aufgaben-Ausführungsüberwachung über Webhooks und Konversationen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem assistentes de codificação automatizados CLI e monitoramento de execução de tarefas em tempo real por meio de Webhooks e conversas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, требующих автоматизированных помощников CLI и мониторинга выполнения задач в режиме реального времени через вебхуки и разговоры.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود التي تتطلب مساعدين تلقائيين CLI ومراقبة تنفيذ المهام في الوقت الفعلي من خلال الويب هوك والمحادثات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger intelligent code reviews, automate dependency installations, and send highlight commands through JS request scripts, utilizing .env loading and protocol notes for seamless cross-origin iframe handshakes and CSS selector rules.","zh":"赋予代理触发智能代码审查、自动化依赖项安装以及通过JS请求脚本发送高亮命令的能力，利用.env加载和协议注释实现无缝的跨源iframe握手和CSS选择器规则。","ja":"エージェントに、.envの読み込みとプロトコル注釈を使用してシームレスなクロスオリジンiframハンドシェイクとCSSセレクタールールを実現するJSリクエストスクリプトを使用して、インテリジェントなコードレビューをトリガーし、依存関係のインストールを自動化し、高ライトコマンドを送信する機能を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 지능형 코드 리뷰를 트리거하고 의존성 설치를 자동화하며 JS 요청 스크립트를 통해 하이라이트 명령을 보낼 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, .env 로딩과 프로토콜 주석을 사용하여 무결점 크로스オリ진 iframe 핸드シェ이크와 CSS 선택기 규칙을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desencadenar revisiones de código inteligentes, automatizar instalaciones de dependencias y enviar comandos de resaltado a través de scripts de solicitud de JS, utilizando la carga de .env y notas de protocolo para apretones de manos de iframes de origen cruzado y reglas de selectores de CSS sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher des révisions de code intelligentes, d''automatiser les installations de dépendances et d''envoyer des commandes de mise en évidence via des scripts de requête JS, en utilisant le chargement de .env et les notes de protocole pour des poignées de main d''iframes d''origine croisée et des règles de sélecteurs de CSS sans interruption.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, intelligente Code-Reviews auszulösen, Abhängigkeitsinstallationen zu automatisieren und Highlight-Befehle über JS-Anfrage-Skripte zu senden, wobei .env-Ladung und Protokollnotizen für nahtlose Cross-Origin-Iframe-Handshakes und CSS-Selektor-Regeln verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acionar revisões de código inteligentes, automatizar instalações de dependências e enviar comandos de realce por meio de scripts de solicitação JS, utilizando o carregamento .env e notas de protocolo para apertos de mão de iframe de origem cruzada sem problemas e regras de seletor CSS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать интеллектуальные проверки кода, автоматизировать установку зависимостей и отправлять команды подсветки через скрипты запросов JS, используя загрузку .env и заметки протокола для бесшовного рукопожатия iframe между источниками и правил селекторов CSS.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل مراجعات كود ذكية، وتأتمة تركيب التبعيات، وإرسال أوامر تhighlight من خلال سكريبتات طلب JS، باستخدام تحميل .env وملاحظات البروتوكول ل握 الأيفرام handshake العابرة للمصدر بدون مشاكل وقواعد محدد CSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code preview status checks","Triggering dependency installations for preview environments","Debugging highlight commands through real-time preview DOM monitoring"],"zh":["自动化代码预览状态检查","触发预览环境的依赖安装","通过实时预览DOM监控调试高亮命令"],"ja":["コードプレビューのステータスチェックの自動化","プレビュー環境の依存関係のインストールのトリガー","リアルタイムプレビュードムモニタリングを使用したハイライトコマンドのデバッグ"],"ko":["코드 미리 보기 상태 검사 자동화","미리 보기 환경의 종속성 설치 트리거","실시간 미리 보기 DOM 모니터링을 통한 하이라이트 명령 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones de estado de vista previa de código","Desencadenamiento de instalaciones de dependencias para entornos de vista previa","Depuración de comandos de resaltado a través de monitoreo de DOM de vista previa en tiempo real"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de statut d''aperçu de code","Déclenchement d''installations de dépendances pour les environnements d''aperçu","Débogage des commandes de mise en évidence via le suivi du DOM d''aperçu en temps réel"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Vorschau-Status-Überprüfungen","Auslösen von Abhängigkeitsinstallationen für Vorschau-Umgebungen","Fehlerbehebung von Highlight-Befehlen durch Echtzeit-Vorschau-DOM-Überwachung"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de status de pré-visualização de código","Acionar instalações de dependências para ambientes de pré-visualização","Depurar comandos de realce por meio de monitoramento de DOM de pré-visualização em tempo real"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки статуса предварительного просмотра кода","Запускать установки зависимостей для сред предварительного просмотра","Отлаживать команды подсветки через мониторинг DOM предварительного просмотра в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["تأتمة فحص حالة معاينة الكود","تشغيل تركيب التبعيات لأماكن معاينة","تصحيح أوامر التhighlight من خلال مراقبة DOM المعاينة في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires independent deployment setup","Dependent on Webhook and conversation-based triggers","Limited to JS request scripts with .env loading"],"zh":["需要独立的部署设置","依赖于Webhook和会话触发","仅限于具有.env加载的JS请求脚本"],"ja":["独立したデプロイ設定が必要","Webhookおよび会話ベースのトリガーに依存",".envの読み込みを使用したJSリクエストスクリプトのみに限定"],"ko":["독립적인 배포 설정이 필요","Webhook 및 대화 기반 트리거에 종속",".env 로딩을 사용하는 JS 요청 스크립트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de implementación independiente","Dependiente de desencadenadores basados en Webhooks y conversaciones","Limitado a scripts de solicitud de JS con carga de .env"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de déploiement indépendante","Dépendant de déclencheurs basés sur les Webhooks et les conversations","Limité aux scripts de requête JS avec chargement de .env"],"de":["Erfordert eine unabhängige Bereitstellungs-Konfiguration","Abhängig von Webhook- und Konversations-basierten Auslösern","Begrenzt auf JS-Anfrage-Skripte mit .env-Ladung"],"pt":["Exige configuração de implantação independente","Depende de gatilhos baseados em Webhooks e conversas","Limitado a scripts de solicitação JS com carregamento .env"],"ru":["Требует независимой настройки развертывания","Зависит от триггеров на основе вебхуков и разговоров","Ограничен скриптами запросов JS с загрузкой .env"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد نشر مستقل","يعتمد على محفزات قائمة على الويب هوك والمحادثات","محدود بسكريبتات طلب JS مع تحميل .env"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xx-suzuki/astro-sandbox/markup-checker', 'community', 'xx-suzuki', 'astro-sandbox', 'xx-suzuki/astro-sandbox', 'markup-checker', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:37:23.334Z', NULL, '{"id":"xx-suzuki/astro-sandbox/markup-checker","name":"markup-checker","description":{"zh":"markup-checker是一个快速的网页标记检查工具，帮助开发者检查和修复网页标记错误","ja":"markup-checkerは、開発者がWebページのマークアップエラーをチェックして修復するのを支援する高速のツールです","ko":"markup-checker는 개발자가 웹 페이지 마크업 오류를 확인하고 수정하는 것을 지원하는 빠른 도구입니다","es":"El comprobador de marcado de acceso es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a identificar y solucionar problemas de accesibilidad en sus sitios web.","fr":"Le vérificateur de balisage d''accessibilité est un outil qui aide les développeurs à identifier et résoudre les problèmes d''accessibilité sur leurs sites Web.","de":"Der Zugriffs-Markup-Prüfer ist ein Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Zugriffsprobleme auf ihren Websites zu identifizieren und zu beheben.","pt":"O Verificador de Markup é uma ferramenta de análise de código que ajuda a identificar problemas de acessibilidade e qualidade no seu projeto Astro.","ru":"Проверка разметки - это инструмент для анализа кода, который помогает выявить проблемы с доступностью и качеством в вашем проекте Astro.","ar":"مفحط صياغة هو أداة لتحليل الشفرة تساعد في تحديد مشاكل إمكانية الوصول ونوعية الشفرة في مشروعك Astro.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"markup-checker：快速的网页标记检查工具","ja":"markup-checker：高速のマークアップチェッカーツール","ko":"markup-checker: 빠른 웹 페이지 마크업 체크 도구","es":"Comprobador de marcado de acceso","fr":"Vérificateur de balisage d''accessibilité","de":"Zugriffs-Markup-Prüfer","pt":"Verificador de Markup: Ferramenta de Análise de Código","ru":"Проверка разметки: инструмент для анализа кода","ar":"مفحط صياغة: أداة لتحليل الشفرة","en":"markup-checker"},"description":{"zh":"markup-checker是一个快速的网页标记检查工具，帮助开发者检查和修复网页标记错误","ja":"markup-checkerは、開発者がWebページのマークアップエラーをチェックして修復するのを支援する高速のツールです","ko":"markup-checker는 개발자가 웹 페이지 마크업 오류를 확인하고 수정하는 것을 지원하는 빠른 도구입니다","es":"El comprobador de marcado de acceso es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a identificar y solucionar problemas de accesibilidad en sus sitios web.","fr":"Le vérificateur de balisage d''accessibilité est un outil qui aide les développeurs à identifier et résoudre les problèmes d''accessibilité sur leurs sites Web.","de":"Der Zugriffs-Markup-Prüfer ist ein Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Zugriffsprobleme auf ihren Websites zu identifizieren und zu beheben.","pt":"O Verificador de Markup é uma ferramenta de análise de código que ajuda a identificar problemas de acessibilidade e qualidade no seu projeto Astro.","ru":"Проверка разметки - это инструмент для анализа кода, который помогает выявить проблемы с доступностью и качеством в вашем проекте Astro.","ar":"مفحط صياغة هو أداة لتحليل الشفرة تساعد في تحديد مشاكل إمكانية الوصول ونوعية الشفرة في مشروعك Astro.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速检查网页标记错误","修复网页标记错误","提高网页可访问性","提高网页兼容性","支持npm运行"],"ja":["Webページのマークアップエラーの迅速なチェック","Webページのマークアップエラーの修復","Webページのアクセシビリティの向上","Webページの互換性の向上","npmによる実行のサポート"],"ko":["웹 페이지 마크업 오류의 빠른 확인","웹 페이지 마크업 오류의 수정","웹 페이지의 접근성 향상","웹 페이지의 호환성 향상","npm 실행 지원"],"es":["Verificación de marcado de acceso","Informes de errores detallados","Integración con Astro y npm","Comprobación de accesibilidad con W3C y markuplint","Resultados en formato de texto"],"fr":["Vérification de balisage d''accessibilité","Rapports d''erreurs détaillés","Intégration avec Astro et npm","Vérification d''accessibilité avec W3C et markuplint","Résultats au format texte"],"de":["Überprüfung von Zugriffs-Markup","Detaillierte Fehlerberichte","Integration mit Astro und npm","Überprüfung von Zugriffsfähigkeit mit W3C und markuplint","Ergebnisse im Textformat"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios de validação","Análise de código para problemas de acessibilidade","Integração com Astro para validação de markup","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de relatório","Fácil integração com pipelines de CI/CD"],"ru":["Генерация отчетов о валидации","Анализ кода для проблем с доступностью","Интеграция с Astro для валидации разметки","Поддержка нескольких форматов отчетов","Легкая интеграция с конвейерами CI/CD"],"ar":["توليد تقارير التحقق","تحليل الشفرة لمشاكل إمكانية الوصول","التكامل مع Astro لتحقق الصياغة","دعم عدة صيغ لتقارير","التكامل السهل مع خطوط أنابيب CI/CD"]},"keywords":{"zh":["markup-checker","网页标记检查","网页可访问性","网页兼容性","npm工具","前端开发"],"ja":["markup-checker","Webページのマークアップチェック","Webページのアクセシビリティ","Webページの互換性","npmツール","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["markup-checker","웹 페이지 마크업 체크","웹 페이지 접근성","웹 페이지 호환성","npm 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["comprobador de marcado de acceso","accesibilidad web","desarrollo web","herramientas de accesibilidad","Astro","npm","W3C","markuplint"],"fr":["vérificateur de balisage d''accessibilité","accessibilité web","développement web","outils d''accessibilité","Astro","npm","W3C","markuplint"],"de":["Zugriffs-Markup-Prüfer","Zugriffsfähigkeit Web","Webentwicklung","Zugriffsfähigkeits-Tools","Astro","npm","W3C","markuplint"],"pt":["verificador de markup","análise de código","acessibilidade","validação de markup","astro","npm","relatórios de validação","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["проверка разметки","анализ кода","доступность","валидация разметки","astro","npm","отчеты о валидации","веб-разработка"],"ar":["مفحط صياغة","تحليل الشفرة","إمكانية الوصول","تحقق الصياغة","astro","npm","تقارير التحقق","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"xx-suzuki","repo":"astro-sandbox","repoPath":"xx-suzuki/astro-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"markup-checker","description":"最低限のアクセシビリティ（ラベル、フォーカス、aria、見出し構造、キーボード操作）のチェックが必要な時に使う。フォームや対話UIの修正時にも使う。","bodyPreview":"# A11y Checker Lite\n\n## Quick use\n- Run `npm run audit` to generate `./report-w3c.txt`\n- Review `./dist/**/*.html` results in the report (line numbers are for generated HTML)\n- Map issues back to Astro sources by searching for stable snippets/classes\n- Fix Astro files first, then re-run `npm run audit` for confirmation\n\n## Workflow (this project)\n- Use dist HTML for validation (W3C + markuplint) because Astro parsing can raise false syntax errors\n- Read `report-w3c.txt` and list issues per HTML","body":"# A11y Checker Lite\n\n## Quick use\n- Run `npm run audit` to generate `./report-w3c.txt`\n- Review `./dist/**/*.html` results in the report (line numbers are for generated HTML)\n- Map issues back to Astro sources by searching for stable snippets/classes\n- Fix Astro files first, then re-run `npm run audit` for confirmation\n\n## Workflow (this project)\n- Use dist HTML for validation (W3C + markuplint) because Astro parsing can raise false syntax errors\n- Read `report-w3c.txt` and list issues per HTML file with line numbers\n- For each issue, locate source Astro:\n  - Open the dist HTML around the line and copy a short snippet\n  - Use `rg -n \"snippet\"` in `src/` to find the Astro component/page\n  - Prefer matching by class names, aria attributes, or text content\n  - If snippet only appears in build output, trace from `src/pages` to referenced components\n- Report findings with Astro file paths when found; otherwise include dist path with a note\n\n## Output format\n- Findings list with file references (Astro preferred)\n- Fixes applied (what changed + where)\n- Remaining issues (if any)\n- If source not found: include dist file + line and explain how to locate\n\n## Execution policy\n- Do not stop after analysis; continue to apply fixes to Astro files\n- If multiple valid fixes exist, choose the simplest one that preserves behavior\n- Only ask for confirmation when the change is ambiguous or risky\n- After fixes, re-run `npm run audit` and report the new results\n\n## References\n- See `references/rules.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:37:23.334Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Accessibility Agents needing advanced W3C markup validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级W3C标记验证功能的无障碍代理。","ja":"高度なW3Cマークアップ検証機能を必要とするアクセシビリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 W3C 마크업 유효성 검증 기능이 필요한 접근성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de accesibilidad que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de validación de marcado W3C.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''accessibilité ayant besoin de capacités de validation de balises W3C avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Accessibility-Agents, die erweiterte W3C-Markup-Validierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Acessibilidade que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de validação de marcação W3C.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов доступности, которым требуются расширенные возможности проверки разметки W3C.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الإمكانية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحقق صحة تحسين W3C."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate HTML markup using W3C and markuplint, generating detailed reports in .txt format for easy issue tracking and resolution, and integrating with npm for automated auditing.","zh":"赋予代理验证HTML标记的能力，使用W3C和markuplint生成详细的.txt格式报告，以便跟踪和解决问题，并与npm集成以进行自动审计。","ja":"W3Cおよびmarkuplintを使用してHTMLマークアップを検証するエージェントをEmpowerし、問題の追跡および解決のための詳細な.txt形式のレポートを生成し、自動監査のためのnpmとの統合を行う。","ko":"W3C 및 markuplint를 사용하여 HTML 마크업을 검증할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 문제 추적 및 해결을 위한詳細한 .txt 형식의 보고서를 생성하고 자동 감사를 위한 npm과 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar el marcado HTML utilizando W3C y markuplint, generando informes detallados en formato .txt para un seguimiento y resolución de problemas sencillos, e integrándose con npm para una auditoría automatizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider le code HTML en utilisant W3C et markuplint, en générant des rapports détaillés au format .txt pour un suivi et une résolution des problèmes faciles, et en s''intégrant avec npm pour une audit automatique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, HTML-Markup mithilfe von W3C und markuplint zu validieren, detaillierte Berichte im .txt-Format für einfache Fehlerverfolgung und -behebung zu generieren und sich in npm für eine automatisierte Überprüfung zu integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar a marcação HTML usando W3C e markuplint, gerando relatórios detalhados no formato .txt para fácil acompanhamento e resolução de problemas, e integrando com npm para auditoria automatizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять разметку HTML с помощью W3C и markuplint, генерируя подробные отчеты в формате .txt для легкого отслеживания и решения проблем, а также интегрируется с npm для автоматизированной аудитории.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من التحقق من صحة تحسين HTML باستخدام W3C وmarkuplint، وإنتاج تقارير مفصلة بالتنسيق .txt من أجل تتبع الأخطاء وحلها بسهولة، ودمجها مع npm من أجل التدقيق الآلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Astro-generated HTML for accessibility issues","Generating W3C compliance reports for dist HTML files","Debugging markup errors using stable snippets and classes"],"zh":["验证Astro生成的HTML的无障碍问题","为dist HTML文件生成W3C兼容性报告","使用稳定的代码片段和类调试标记错误"],"ja":["Astro生成のHTMLのアクセシビリティ問題の検証","dist HTMLファイルのW3C準拠レポートの生成","安定したコードスニペットとクラスを使用したマークアップエラーのデバッグ"],"ko":["Astro 생성 HTML의 접근성 문제 검증","dist HTML 파일의 W3C 호환성 보고서 생성","안정적인 코드 조각 및 클래스를 사용한 마크업 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Validar HTML generado por Astro para problemas de accesibilidad","Generar informes de cumplimiento W3C para archivos HTML de distribución","Depurar errores de marcado mediante fragmentos y clases estables"],"fr":["Valider le HTML généré par Astro pour les problèmes d''accessibilité","Générer des rapports de conformité W3C pour les fichiers HTML de distribution","Déboguer les erreurs de balisage à l''aide de fragments et de classes stables"],"de":["Astro-generiertes HTML auf Accessibility-Probleme validieren","W3C-Konformitätsberichte für Verteilungs-HTML-Dateien generieren","Markierungsfehler mithilfe stabiler Snippets und Klassen debuggen"],"pt":["Validar problemas de acessibilidade em HTML gerado pelo Astro","Gerar relatórios de conformidade W3C para arquivos HTML de distribuição","Depurar erros de marcação usando snippets e classes estáveis"],"ru":["Проверять проблемы доступности в HTML, сгенерированном Astro","Генерировать отчеты о соответствии W3C для файлов HTML дистрибутива","Отлаживать ошибки разметки с помощью стабильных сниппетов и классов"],"ar":["التحقق من مشاكل إمكانية الوصول في HTML التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة Astro","إنتاج تقارير مطابقة W3C لملفات HTML الموزعة","تصحيح أخطاء التحسين باستخدام مقتطفات وفصول مستقرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm environment","Limited to HTML validation using W3C and markuplint"],"zh":["需要npm环境","仅限于使用W3C和markuplint进行HTML验证"],"ja":["npm環境が必要","W3Cおよびmarkuplintを使用したHTML検証のみ"],"ko":["npm 환경 필요","W3C 및 markuplint를 사용한 HTML 검증만"],"es":["Requiere entorno npm","Limitado a la validación de HTML utilizando W3C y markuplint"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement npm","Limité à la validation de HTML à l''aide de W3C et markuplint"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf HTML-Validierung mit W3C und markuplint"],"pt":["Requer ambiente npm","Limitado à validação de HTML usando W3C e markuplint"],"ru":["Требуется среда npm","Ограничен проверкой HTML с помощью W3C и markuplint"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة npm","محدود بالتحقق من صحة HTML باستخدام W3C وmarkuplint"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mbtz/morningweave/issue-tracking', 'community', 'mbtz', 'morningweave', 'mbtz/morningweave', 'issue-tracking', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:37:23.271Z', NULL, '{"id":"mbtz/morningweave/issue-tracking","name":"issue-tracking","description":{"zh":"使用 tk 命令行工具进行 issue 跟踪，支持查看、开始、关闭 issue 等功能","ja":"tk コマンドラインツールを使用して issue をトラックし、表示、開始、閉じるなどの機能をサポート","ko":"tk 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 이슈를 추적하고 지원되는 기능은 보기, 시작, 닫기 등입니다","es":"La herramienta de seguimiento de problemas tk te permite gestionar y seguir problemas en tu proyecto de manera eficiente","fr":"L''outil de suivi des problèmes tk vous permet de gérer et de suivre les problèmes de votre projet de manière efficace","de":"Das Problemmelde-Tool tk ermöglicht es Ihnen, Probleme in Ihrem Projekt effizient zu verfolgen und zu verwalten","pt":"O tk é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para rastrear problemas no repositório. Ele oferece comandos para listar, visualizar e gerenciar problemas de forma eficiente.","ru":"Tk - это инструмент командной строки для отслеживания ошибок в репозитории. Он предлагает команды для просмотра, детального просмотра и управления ошибками эффективно.","ar":"tk هو أداة سطر الأوامر لتتبع المشكلات في المستودع. وهي توفر أوامر لاستعراض وتصفح وإدارة المشكلات بفعالية","en":"Helper CLI tool for curating news from SOME platforms"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Issue Tracking 工具","ja":"Issue Tracking ツール","ko":"이슈 추적 도구","es":"Herramienta de seguimiento de problemas con tk","fr":"Outil de suivi des problèmes avec tk","de":"Problemmelde-Tool mit tk","pt":"Ferramenta de Rastreamento de Problemas","ru":"Инструмент отслеживания ошибок","ar":"أداة تتبع المشكلات","en":"issue-tracking"},"description":{"zh":"使用 tk 命令行工具进行 issue 跟踪，支持查看、开始、关闭 issue 等功能","ja":"tk コマンドラインツールを使用して issue をトラックし、表示、開始、閉じるなどの機能をサポート","ko":"tk 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 이슈를 추적하고 지원되는 기