art <id>`.\n- Close work with `tk close <id>`.\n- Tickets live in `.tickets/` and should be committed with related code changes.\n\nReference: `references/tk-quickref.md`.","body":"Use `tk` for issue tracking in this repo.\n\n- List ready work with `tk ready`.\n- View details with `tk show <id>`.\n- Mark work in progress with `tk start <id>`.\n- Close work with `tk close <id>`.\n- Tickets live in `.tickets/` and should be committed with related code changes.\n\nReference: `references/tk-quickref.md`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:37:23.271Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined issue tracking and project management capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined issue tracking and project management capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined issue tracking and project management capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined issue tracking and project management capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan un seguimiento de problemas y capacidades de gestión de proyectos simplificados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un suivi de problèmes et de capacités de gestion de projet simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die ein vereinfachtes Problem- und Projektmanagement benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de rastreamento e gerenciamento de projetos simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы оптимизированные возможности отслеживания и управления проектами.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير العميل التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات تتبع قضايا ومشاريع مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage tickets using the `tk` CLI tool, supporting features like listing ready work with `tk ready`, viewing details with `tk show <id>`, and marking work in progress with `tk start <id>`, a