rende a crear y administrar tiendas con facilidad","fr":"Les magasins SolidJS offrent une gestion d''état complexe avec une réactivité fine. Découvrez comment créer et gérer des magasins avec SolidJS","de":"SolidJS-Stores bieten eine komplexe Zustandsverwaltung mit feiner Reaktivität. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Stores mit SolidJS erstellen und verwalten","pt":"O SolidJS Store fornece uma forma eficaz de gerenciar estados complexos. Aprenda a criar lojas reativas para objetos e arrays.","ru":"SolidJS Store предоставляет эффективный способ управления сложными состояниями. Узнайте, как создавать реактивные магазины для объектов и массивов.","ar":"يتوفر متجر SolidJS بطريقة فعالة لإدارة الحالات المعقدة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء متاجر تفاعلية للأشياء والصفائف.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["SolidJS","API"," ","Fine-grained"," "],"ja":["SolidJS","API","","Fine-grained",""],"ko":["SolidJS","API","","Fine-grained",""],"es":["Gestión de estado compleja con reactividad fine-grained","Acceso directo a propiedades sin necesidad de funciones getter","Creación de tiendas con facilidad","Administración de tiendas con SolidJS","Reactividad fine-grained para objetos y arrays"],"fr":["Gestion d''état complexe avec une réactivité fine","Accès direct aux propriétés sans nécessité de fonctions getter","Création de magasins avec facilité","Gestion de magasins avec SolidJS","Réactivité fine pour les objets et les tableaux"],"de":["Komplexe Zustandsverwaltung mit feiner Reaktivität","Direkter Zugriff auf Eigenschaften ohne Getter-Funktionen","Erstellung von Stores mit Leichtigkeit","Verwaltung von Stores mit SolidJS","Feine Reaktivität für Objekte und Arrays"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estados complexos","Reatividade granular para objetos e arrays","Acesso direto às propriedades sem funções de getter","Criação de lojas reativas para objetos e arrays","Fine-grained reactivity"],"ru":["Управление сложными состояниями","Мелкозернистая реактивность для объектов и массивов","Прямой доступ к свойствам без функций Getter","Создание реактивных магазинов для объектов и массивов","Fine-grained reactivity"],"ar":["إدارة الحالات المعقدة","تفاعل ناعم للأشياء والصفائف","الوصول المباشر إلى الخصائص بدون دوال الحصول","إنشاء متاجر تفاعلية للأشياء والصفائف","Fine-grained reactivity"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SolidJS","Store","React","JavaScript","Front-end","State Management"],"ja":["SolidJS","Store","React","JavaScript","Front-end","State Management"],"ko":["SolidJS","Store","React","JavaScript","Front-end","State Management"],"es":["SolidJS stores","gestión de estado compleja","reactividad fine-grained","creación de tiendas","administración de tiendas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","frameworks JavaScript","bibliotecas de JavaScript"],"fr":["magasins SolidJS","gestion d''état complexe","réactivité fine","création de magasins","gestion de magasins","développement d''applications","frameworks JavaScript","bibliothèques JavaScript"],"de":["SolidJS-Stores","komplexe Zustandsverwaltung","feine Reaktivität","Erstellung von Stores","Verwaltung von Stores","Anwendungsentwicklung","JavaScript-Frameworks","JavaScript-Bibliotheken"],"pt":["SolidJS Store","Gerenciamento de estado","Reatividade granular","Lojas reativas","Desenvolvimento web","JavaScript","SolidJS"],"ru":["SolidJS Store","Управление состоянием","Мелкозернистая реактивность","Реактивные магазины","Веб-разработка","JavaScript","SolidJS"],"ar":["متجر SolidJS","إدارة الحالة","تفاعل ناعم","متاجر تفاعلية","تطوير الويب","جافا سكريبت","SolidJS"]}},"owner":"vallafederico","repo":"solid-ai-rules","repoPath":"vallafederico/solid-ai-rules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"solid-core-stores","description":"SolidJS stores: createStore for complex state, direct property access, path syntax for updates, produce for immutable mutations, reconcile for diffing, createMutable for proxy-based stores, unwrap for raw data.","bodyPreview":"# SolidJS Store Utilities\n\nComplete guide to managing complex state with SolidJS stores. Stores provide fine-grained reactivity for objects and arrays, making them ideal for complex state management.\n\n## createStore Basics\n\nStores manage complex data structures (objects, arrays) with fine-grained reactivity. Access properties directly - no getter functions needed.\n\n```tsx\nimport { createStore } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\n// Initialize store\nconst [store, setStore] = createStore({\n  userCount: 3,","body":"# SolidJS Store Utilities\n\nComplete guide to managing complex state with SolidJS stores. Stores provide fine-grained reactivity for objects and arrays, making them ideal for complex state management.\n\n## createStore Basics\n\nStores manage complex data structures (objects, arrays) with fine-grained reactivity. Access properties directly - no getter functions needed.\n\n```tsx\nimport { createStore } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\n// Initialize store\nconst [store, setStore] = createStore({\n  userCount: 3,\n  users: [\n    { id: 0, username: \"felix909\", location: \"England\", loggedIn: false },\n    { id: 1, username: \"tracy634\", location: \"Canada\", loggedIn: true },\n  ],\n});\n\n// Access properties directly (not store.users())\nreturn <div>Users: {store.userCount}</div>;\n```\n\n**Key differences from signals:**\n- Direct property access: `store.users` not `store.users()`\n- Nested reactivity: changes to nested properties trigger updates automatically\n- Path syntax: update specific nested paths with setter\n\n## Store Getters\n\nStores support getters for derived values:\n\n```tsx\nconst [state, setState] = createStore({\n  user: {\n    firstName: \"John\",\n    lastName: \"Smith\",\n    get fullName() {\n      return `${this.firstName} ${this.lastName}`;\n    },\n  },\n});\n\n// Access getter\nreturn <div>{state.user.fullName}</div>;\n```\n\n## Store Setters\n\nUse path syntax to update stores. Objects are shallowly merged. Set to `undefined` to delete properties.\n\n```tsx\n// Shallow merge\nsetStore({ firstName: \"Johnny\", middleName: \"Lee\" });\n// Result: { firstName: ''Johnny'', middleName: ''Lee'', lastName: ''Miller'' }\n\n// Function form\nsetStore((state) => ({ \n  preferredName: state.firstName, \n  lastName: \"Milner\" \n}));\n\n// Path syntax for nested updates\nsetStore(\"users\", 0, \"loggedIn\", true);\n\n// Delete property\nsetStore(\"middleName\", undefined);\n// In TypeScript: setStore(\"middleName\", undefined!);\n```\n\n## Path Syntax\n\nPath syntax provides flexible ways to update nested structures:\n\n```tsx\n// Update array element by index\nsetStore(\"users\", 0, { loggedIn: true });\n\n// Update with function\nsetStore(\"users\", 3, \"loggedIn\", (loggedIn) => !loggedIn);\n\n// Filter and update\nsetStore(\"users\", (user) => user.username.startsWith(\"t\"), \"loggedIn\", false);\n\n// Add to array\nsetStore(\"tasks\", state.tasks.length, {\n  id: state.tasks.length,\n  text: \"New task\",\n  completed: false,\n});\n```\n\n## produce - Immutable Mutations\n\nUse `produce` for Immer-style mutations. Simplifies complex nested updates:\n\n```tsx\nimport { produce } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\nconst [state, setState] = createStore({\n  user: { name: \"John\", age: 30 },\n  list: [\"book\", \"pen\"],\n});\n\n// Mutate inside produce\nsetState(\n  produce((state) => {\n    state.user.name = \"Jane\";\n    state.list.push(\"pencil\");\n  })\n);\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Familiar mutation syntax\n- Multiple property updates in one call\n- Better readability for complex updates\n\n## reconcile - Data Diffing\n\nUse `reconcile` to efficiently diff and merge data changes. Perfect for API responses or immutable data:\n\n```tsx\nimport { reconcile } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\n// Subscribe to observable\nconst unsubscribe = store.subscribe(({ todos }) => {\n  setState(\"todos\", reconcile(todos));\n});\nonCleanup(() => unsubscribe());\n\n// With options\nsetState(\n  \"todos\",\n  reconcile(newTodos, {\n    key: \"id\",      // Match items by id\n    merge: false,   // Replace non-matching items\n  })\n);\n```\n\n**Options:**\n- `key`: Property to match items (default: `\"id\"`)\n- `merge`: When `true`, morphs previous data to new value. When `false`, replaces non-matching items.\n\n## createMutable - Proxy-Based Stores\n\nCreate mutable proxy stores for MobX/Vue compatibility or external system integration:\n\n```tsx\nimport { createMutable } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\nconst state = createMutable({\n  someValue: 0,\n  list: [],\n});\n\n// Direct mutation\nstate.someValue = 5;\nstate.list.push(anotherValue);\n\n// Getters and setters\nconst user = createMutable({\n  firstName: \"John\",\n  lastName: \"Smith\",\n  get fullName() {\n    return `${this.firstName} ${this.lastName}`;\n  },\n  set setFullName(value) {\n    [this.firstName, this.lastName] = value.split(\" \");\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Note:** Prefer `createStore` for better unidirectional flow. Use `createMutable` only when needed for compatibility.\n\n## modifyMutable - Batch Mutable Updates\n\nBatch multiple mutable store changes to trigger a single update:\n\n```tsx\nimport { modifyMutable, reconcile, produce } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\nconst state = createMutable({\n  user: { firstName: \"John\", lastName: \"Smith\" },\n});\n\n// Multiple updates trigger multiple renders\nstate.user.firstName = \"Jane\";\nstate.user.lastName = \"Doe\";\n\n// Batch with reconcile\nmodifyMutable(\n  state.user,\n  reconcile({\n    firstName: \"Jane\",\n    lastName: \"Doe\",\n  })\n);\n\n// Batch with produce\nmodifyMutable(\n  state,\n  produce((state) => {\n    state.user.firstName = \"Jane\";\n    state.user.lastName = \"Doe\";\n  })\n);\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Single render cycle for multiple changes\n- Works with `reconcile` and `produce`\n- Better performance for complex updates\n\n## unwrap - Extract Raw Data\n\nGet underlying data without proxy wrapping:\n\n```tsx\nimport { unwrap } from \"solid-js/store\";\n\nconst rawData = unwrap(store);\n// Use for debugging, serialization, or third-party integrations\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use stores for complex state:**\n   - Objects and arrays\n   - Multiple related values\n   - Nested data structures\n\n2. **Use signals for simple state:**\n   - Single primitive values\n   - Simple counters\n   - Toggle flags\n\n3. **Prefer `createStore` over `createMutable`:**\n   - Better unidirectional flow\n   - More predictable updates\n   - Use `produce` for mutation-style syntax\n\n4. **Use `produce` for complex updates:**\n   - Multiple property changes\n   - Array manipulations\n   - Nested object updates\n\n5. **Use `reconcile` for external data:**\n   - API responses\n   - Observable subscriptions\n   - Immutable data updates\n\n6. **Access properties in tracking scopes:**\n   - Properties accessed outside tracking scopes won''t be reactive\n   - Use `createEffect` to establish tracking\n\n```tsx\n// Not reactive\nsetState(\"numberOfTasks\", state.tasks.length);\n\n// Reactive\ncreateEffect(() => {\n  setState(\"numberOfTasks\", state.tasks.length);\n});\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Task List with Stores\n\n```tsx\nimport { createStore } from \"solid-js/store\";\nimport { For } from \"solid-js\";\n\nfunction TaskList() {\n  const [state, setState] = createStore({\n    tasks: [],\n    numberOfTasks: 0,\n  });\n\n  const addTask = (text) => {\n    setState(\"tasks\", state.tasks.length, {\n      id: state.tasks.length,\n      text,\n      completed: false,\n    });\n    setState(\"numberOfTasks\", state.tasks.length + 1);\n  };\n\n  const toggleTask = (id) => {\n    setState(\n      \"tasks\",\n      (task) => task.id === id,\n      \"completed\",\n      (completed) => !completed\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <h1>My Task List</h1>\n      <span>You have {state.numberOfTasks} task(s) today!</span>\n      <For each={state.tasks}>\n        {(task) => (\n          <div>\n            <input\n              type=\"checkbox\"\n              checked={task.completed}\n              onChange={() => toggleTask(task.id)}\n            />\n            <span>{task.text}</span>\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </For>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Using produce for Complex Updates\n\n```tsx\nconst toggleTask = (id) => {\n  setState(\n    produce((state) => {\n      const task = state.tasks.find((t) => t.id === id);\n      if (task) {\n        task.completed = !task.completed;\n      }\n    })\n  );\n};\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:37:48.220Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fine-grained reactivity with SolidJS stores.","zh":"非常适合需要使用SolidJS存储进行细粒度响应的前端代理。","ja":"SolidJSストアを使用した細粒度のリアクティビティが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"SolidJS 저장소를 사용한 세밀한 반응성으로 프론트엔드 에이전트가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan reactividad granular con tiendas de SolidJS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une réactivité granulaire avec les magasins SolidJS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine feinkörnige Reaktivität mit SolidJS-Speichern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de reatividade granular com lojas SolidJS.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется тонкая реактивность с магазинами SolidJS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تفاعل دقيق مع مخازن SolidJS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex state with fine-grained reactivity using SolidJS stores, providing direct access to properties without getter functions, and utilizing libraries like SolidJS for efficient state management.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂状态的能力，使用SolidJS存储实现细粒度的响应，提供直接访问属性的方法而无需getter函数，并利用SolidJS等库实现高效的状态管理。","ja":"SolidJSストアを使用して、getter関数を使用せずにプロパティに直接アクセスし、SolidJSなどのライブラリを使用して効率的な状態管理を実現することで、複雑な状態を細粒度のリアクティビティで管理するエージェントを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 SolidJS 저장소를 사용하여 세밀한 반응성으로 복잡한 상태를 관리하고, getter 함수 없이 속성에 직접 접근하며, SolidJS 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 효율적인 상태 관리를 thực現할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar estados complejos con reactividad granular utilizando tiendas de SolidJS, proporcionando acceso directo a propiedades sin funciones getter y utilizando bibliotecas como SolidJS para una gestión de estado eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des états complexes avec une réactivité granulaire en utilisant des magasins SolidJS, en fournissant un accès direct aux propriétés sans fonctions getter et en utilisant des bibliothèques comme SolidJS pour une gestion d''état efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Zustände mit feinkörniger Reaktivität zu verwalten, indem SolidJS-Speicher verwendet werden, direkten Zugriff auf Eigenschaften ohne Getter-Funktionen bietet und Bibliotheken wie SolidJS für eine effiziente Zustandsverwaltung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar estado complexo com reatividade granular usando lojas SolidJS, fornecendo acesso direto às propriedades sem funções getter e utilizando bibliotecas como SolidJS para gerenciamento eficiente de estado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложным состоянием с тонкой реактивностью с помощью магазинов SolidJS, обеспечивая прямой доступ к свойствам без функций-получателей и использует библиотеки như SolidJS для эффективного управления состоянием.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إدارة الحالة المعقدة مع التفاعل الدقيق باستخدام مخازن SolidJS، ويتوفر الوصول المباشر إلى الخصائص بدون دوال الحصول، ويعتمد على المكتبات مثل SolidJS لإدارة الحالة بفعالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing complex data structures with fine-grained reactivity","Creating stores for objects and arrays","Accessing properties directly without getter functions"],"zh":["使用细粒度的响应管理复杂的数据结构","为对象和数组创建存储","直接访问属性而无需getter函数"],"ja":["細粒度のリアクティビティを使用して複雑なデータ構造を管理する","オブジェクトと配列のストアを作成する","getter関数を使用せずにプロパティに直接アクセスする"],"ko":["세밀한 반응성을 사용하여 복잡한 데이터 구조를 관리하는 것","객체와 배열에 대한 저장소를 생성하는 것","getter 함수를 사용하지 않고 속성에 직접 접근하는 것"],"es":["Gestión de estructuras de datos complejas con reactividad granular","Creación de tiendas para objetos y matrices","Acceso a propiedades directamente sin funciones getter"],"fr":["Gestion de structures de données complexes avec une réactivité granulaire","Création de magasins pour des objets et des tableaux","Accès aux propriétés directement sans fonctions getter"],"de":["Verwaltung komplexer Datenstrukturen mit feinkörniger Reaktivität","Erstellung von Speichern für Objekte und Arrays","Direkter Zugriff auf Eigenschaften ohne Getter-Funktionen"],"pt":["Gerenciar estruturas de dados complexas com reatividade granular","Criar lojas para objetos e matrizes","Acessar propriedades diretamente sem funções getter"],"ru":["Управлять сложными структурами данных с тонкой реактивностью","Создавать магазины для объектов и массивов","Доступ к свойствам напрямую без функций-получателей"],"ar":["إدارة هياكل البيانات المعقدة مع التفاعل الدقيق","إنشاء مخازن للكائنات والصفوف","الوصول إلى الخصائص مباشرة بدون دوال الحصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SolidJS library","Limited to managing complex state with fine-grained reactivity"],"zh":["需要SolidJS库","仅限于使用细粒度的响应管理复杂状态"],"ja":["SolidJSライブラリが必要","複雑な状態を細粒度のリアクティビティで管理することのみ"],"ko":["SolidJS 라이브러리가 필요함","세밀한 반응성을 사용하여 복잡한 상태를 관리하는 것에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca SolidJS","Limitado a la gestión de estados complejos con reactividad granular"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque SolidJS","Limité à la gestion d''états complexes avec une réactivité granulaire"],"de":["Benötigt die SolidJS-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung komplexer Zustände mit feinkörniger Reaktivität"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca SolidJS","Limitado a gerenciar estado complexo com reatividade granular"],"ru":["Требует библиотеку SolidJS","Ограничен управлением сложным состоянием с тонкой реактивностью"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة SolidJS","محدود بإدارة الحالة المعقدة مع التفاعل الدقيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
