trôle","Intégration avec les systèmes de gestion de flux de travail","Personnalisation de la réponse à l''approbation"],"de":["Aufzeichnung von Genehmigungsentscheidungen","Implementierung von effizienten Workflows","Verbesserung der Auditez und Kontrolle","Integration mit Workflow-Management-Systemen","Anpassung der Antwort auf Genehmigungen"],"pt":["Registra decisões de aprovação","Recebe contexto e ID de sessão como entradas","Suporta decisões de aprovação, negação e revisão","Permite especificar o respondente","Melhora a auditoria e o controle de decisões"],"ru":["Регистрирует решения об одобрении","Получает контекст и идентификатор сессии в качестве входных данных","Поддерживает решения об одобрении, отклонении и рассмотрении","Позволяет указать ответчика","Повышает аудит и контроль решений"],"ar":["تسجل قرارات الموافقة","تستقبل السياق ومعرّف الجلسة كمدخلات","تدعم قرارات الموافقة والرفض والمراجعة","تسمح بتحديد المستجيب","تحسن التدقيق ومراقبة القرارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["工作流响应审批","审批决策","审计","审批请求","工作流程","安全上下文","会话标识"],"ja":["ワークフロー対応承認","承認決定","監査","承認リクエスト","ワークフロー","安全なコンテキスト","セッション識別子"],"ko":["워크플로우 승인 응답","승인 결정","감사","승인 요청","워크플로우","안전한 컨텍스트","세션 식별자"],"es":["respuesta a aprobación","flujos de trabajo","auditoría","control","desarrollo de software","gestión de flujos de trabajo","integración de sistemas","personalización de respuestas"],"fr":["réponse à l''approbation","flux de travail","audit","contrôle","développement de logiciels","gestion de flux de travail","intégration de systèmes","personnalisation de réponses"],"de":["Antwort auf Genehmigungen","Workflows","Auditez","Kontrolle","Software-Entwicklung","Workflow-Management","Systemintegration","Anpassung von Antworten"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho de aprovação","resposta de aprovação","auditoria de decisões","controle de decisões","desenvolvimento de software","integração de sistemas"],"ru":["рабочий процесс одобрения","ответ на одобрение","аудит решений","контроль решений","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция систем"],"ar":["سير عمل الموافقة","استجابة الموافقة","تدقيق القرارات","مراقبة القرارات","تطوير البرمجيات","تكامل الأنظمة"]}},"owner":"venikman","repo":"fpf-foundry","repoPath":"venikman/fpf-foundry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow/respond-to-approval","description":"Records a response to an approval request.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Workflow: Respond to Approval\n\n## 1. Context\n\nThis skill records an approval decision linked to a prior approval request for auditability and gating.\n\n## 2. Inputs\n\n- **context** (required): Bounded context name (safe path segment).\n- **session_id** (required): Session identifier (safe path segment).\n- **approval_id** (required): Approval identifier (safe path segment).\n- **decision** (required): Approval decision (`approved`, `denied`, `needs-review`).\n- **responded_by** (optional): Responder","body":"# Workflow: Respond to Approval\n\n## 1. Context\n\nThis skill records an approval decision linked to a prior approval request for auditability and gating.\n\n## 2. Inputs\n\n- **context** (required): Bounded context name (safe path segment).\n- **session_id** (required): Session identifier (safe path segment).\n- **approval_id** (required): Approval identifier (safe path segment).\n- **decision** (required): Approval decision (`approved`, `denied`, `needs-review`).\n- **responded_by** (optional): Responder label.\n- **notes** (optional): Response notes or conditions.\n- **agent_model** (optional): Agent model identifier.\n- **role_assignment** (optional): RoleAssignment for U.Work logging (default: Strategist).\n- **decisions** (optional): Semicolon-delimited DRR ids/paths.\n- **timestamp_start** (optional): ISO-8601 timestamp for deterministic output.\n\n## 3. Outputs\n\n- `runtime/contexts/<context>/approvals/<session_id>.<approval_id>.<timestamp>.response.md`\n\n## 4. Procedure\n\n1. Validate inputs and confirm the approval request exists.\n2. Write the approval response record with the decision.\n3. Emit U.Work via `telemetry/log-work` when available.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:38:21.119Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing integrated approval tracking and auditability features.","zh":"非常适合需要集成审批跟踪和可审计性功能的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"ワークフロー自動化エージェントが統合された承認の追跡と監査可能性の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"통합된 승인 추적 및 감사 가능성 기능이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de flujos de trabajo que necesitan características de seguimiento y auditoría de aprobaciones integradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow nécessitant des fonctionnalités de suivi et d''auditorat d''approbation intégrées.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die integrierte Genehmigungsverfolgungs- und Auditfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que necessitam de recursos de rastreamento e auditoria de aprovação integrados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым необходимы встроенные функции отслеживания и аудита утверждений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين في تدفقات العمل الذين يحتاجون إلى ميزات تتبع ومراجعة الموافقة المتكاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to record approval decisions linked to prior requests using safe path segments, enabling advanced workflow gating and auditability through inputs like context, session_id, approval_id, and decision.","zh":"赋予代理记录与之前请求相关的审批决策的能力，使用安全路径段，通过上下文、会话ID、审批ID和决策等输入实现高级工作流控制和可审计性。","ja":"エージェントに、以前のリクエストにリンクされた承認の決定を記録する機能を提供し、安全なパスセグメントを使用して、コンテキスト、セッションID、承認ID、決定などの入力で高度なワークフローゲートと監査可能性を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에 이전 요청에 연결된 승인 결정을 기록할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고, 안전한 경로 세그먼트를 사용하여, 컨텍스트, 세션 ID, 승인 ID 및 결정과 같은 입력을 통해 고급 워크플로 게이트 및 감사 가능성을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a registrar decisiones de aprobación vinculadas a solicitudes anteriores utilizando segmentos de ruta seguros, lo que permite una puerta de flujo de trabajo avanzada y auditoría a través de entradas como contexto, session_id, approval_id y decisión.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enregistrer des décisions d''approbation liées aux demandes précédentes en utilisant des segments de chemin sécurisés, ce qui permet une gestion avancée du flux de travail et une auditabilité via des entrées comme le contexte, session_id, approval_id et décision.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Genehmigungsentscheidungen zu erfassen, die mit vorherigen Anfragen verknüpft sind, unter Verwendung sicherer Pfadsegmente, wodurch erweiterte Workflow-Steuerung und Auditierbarkeit durch Eingaben wie Kontext, session_id, approval_id und Entscheidung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a registrar decisões de aprovação vinculadas a solicitações anteriores usando segmentos de caminho seguro, permitindo portas de fluxo de trabalho avançadas e auditoria por meio de entradas como contexto, session_id, approval_id e decisão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью записывать решения об утверждении, связанные с предыдущими запросами, используя защищенные сегменты пути, что позволяет реализовывать расширенные ворота рабочих процессов и аудит через входные данные, такие как контекст, session_id, approval_id и решение.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تسجيل قرارات الموافقة المرتبطة بالطلبات السابقة باستخدام مقاطع المسار الآمنة، مما يتيح بوابات تدفق العمل المتقدمة ومراجعة المدخلات مثل السياق و session_id و approval_id و القرار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating approval workflows with decision tracking","Generating audit logs for approval requests and responses","Gating workflows based on approval decisions like approved, denied, or needs-review"],"zh":["使用决策跟踪自动化审批工作流","为审批请求和响应生成审计日志","根据审批决策（如批准、拒绝或需要审查）对工作流进行控制"],"ja":["決定追跡を使用して承認ワークフローを自動化する","承認リクエストとレスポンスの監査ログを生成する","承認の決定（承認、拒否、またはレビューが必要など）に基づいてワークフローをゲートする"],"ko":["결정 추적을 사용하여 승인 워크플ロー 자동화","승인 요청 및 응답에 대한 감사 로그 생성","승인 결정(승인, 거부 또는 검토 필요 등)에 따라 워크플로우 게이트"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de aprobación con seguimiento de decisiones","Generar registros de auditoría para solicitudes y respuestas de aprobación","Controlar flujos de trabajo en función de decisiones de aprobación como aprobado, denegado o necesita revisión"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''approbation avec suivi des décisions","Générer des journaux d''audit pour les demandes et réponses d''approbation","Contrôler les flux de travail en fonction des décisions d''approbation comme approuvé, refusé ou nécessite examen"],"de":["Automatisierung von Genehmigungsworkflows mit Entscheidungsverfolgung","Erzeugen von Audit-Protokollen für Genehmigungsanfragen und -antworten","Steuerung von Workflows basierend auf Genehmigungsentscheidungen wie genehmigt, abgelehnt oder benötigt Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de aprovação com rastreamento de decisões","Gerar logs de auditoria para solicitações e respostas de aprovação","Portas de fluxo de trabalho com base em decisões de aprovação como aprovado, negado ou precisa-revisão"],"ru":["Автоматизация потоков утверждений с отслеживанием решений","Генерация журналов аудита для запросов и ответов на утверждение","Ворота рабочих процессов на основе решений об утверждении, таких как утверждено, отклонено или требует рассмотрения"],"ar":["أتمتة تدفقات العمل للموافقة مع تتبع القرارات","توليد سجلات مراجعة لطلبات واستجابات الموافقة","بوابات تدفق العمل على أساس قرارات الموافقة مثل المعتمد، المرفوض أو يحتاج إلى مراجعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bounded context name for safe path segmentation","Needs session identifier and approval identifier for tracking","Limited to approval decisions of approved, denied, or needs-review"],"zh":["需要有界上下文名称用于安全路径分段","需要会话标识符和审批标识符用于跟踪","仅限于批准、拒绝或需要审查的审批决策"],"ja":["安全なパスセグメント化のために境界付きコンテキスト名が必要","トラッキングのためにセッション識別子と承認識別子が必要","承認の決定が承認、拒否、またはレビューが必要に限定される"],"ko":["안전한 경로 분할을 위해 경계가 있는 컨텍스트 이름이 필요","추적을 위해 세션 식별자 및 승인 식별자가 필요","승인 결정을 승인, 거부 또는 검토 필요로 제한"],"es":["Requiere un nombre de contexto acotado para la segmentación de ruta segura","Necesita un identificador de sesión y un identificador de aprobación para el seguimiento","Limitado a decisiones de aprobación de aprobado, denegado o necesita revisión"],"fr":["Nécessite un nom de contexte borné pour la segmentation de chemin sécurisé","Nécessite un identifiant de session et un identifiant d''approbation pour le suivi","Limité aux décisions d''approbation approuvé, refusé ou nécessite examen"],"de":["Benötigt einen begrenzten Kontextnamen für sichere Pfadsegmentierung","Benötigt eine Sitzungs-ID und eine Genehmigungs-ID für die Verfolgung","Begrenzt auf Genehmigungsentscheidungen wie genehmigt, abgelehnt oder benötigt Überprüfung"],"pt":["Exige nome de contexto limitado para segmentação de caminho seguro","Necessita de identificador de sessão e identificador de aprovação para rastreamento","Limitado a decisões de aprovação de aprovado, negado ou precisa-revisão"],"ru":["Требует ограниченного имени контекста для безопасной сегментации пути","Требует идентификатора сессии и идентификатора утверждения для отслеживания","Ограничен решениями об утверждении, такими как утверждено, отклонено или требует рассмотрения"],"ar":["يتطلب اسم سياق محدد لتقسيم المسار الآمن","يحتاج إلى معرّف جلسة ومعرّف موافقة للتتبع","محدود بقرارات الموافقة مثل المعتمد، المرفوض أو يحتاج إلى مراجعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('goodnight000/KittyCourt/rag-implementation', 'community', 'goodnight000', 'KittyCourt', 'goodnight000/KittyCourt', 'rag-implementation', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:38:07.187Z', NULL, '{"id":"goodnight000/KittyCourt/rag-implementation","name":"rag-implementation","description":{"zh":"RAG实现是指使用外部知识源构建提供准确、有根据的响应的LLM应用。它可以应用于问答系统、聊天机器人、语义搜索等领域","ja":"RAG実装は、外部知識源を使用して正確で裏付けられた応答を提供するLLMアプリケーションを構築することを指します。これは、質問回答システム、チャットボット、セマンティック検索などに適用できます","ko":"RAG 구현은 외부 지식 소스를 사용하여 정확하고 근거 있는 응답을 제공하는 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것을 의미합니다. 이는 질문 답변 시스템, 챗봇, 의미 검색 등에 적용할 수 있습니다","es":"La implementación de RAG permite crear aplicaciones LLM que proporcionan respuestas precisas y basadas en conocimientos externos","fr":"La mise en œuvre de RAG permet de créer des applications LLM qui fournissent des réponses précises et basées sur des connaissances externes","de":"Die Implementierung von RAG ermöglicht die Erstellung von LLM-Anwendungen, die genaue und auf externen Wissen basierende Antworten liefern","pt":"A Implementação RAG permite construir aplicações LLM com respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo.","ru":"Реализация RAG позволяет создавать приложения LLM с точными и обоснованными ответами.","ar":"تنفيذ RAG يسمح ببناء تطبيقات LLM مع استجابات دقيقة ومستندة إلى مصادر معرفة خارجية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RAG实现：构建准确的LLM应用","ja":"RAG実装：正確なLLMアプリケーションを構築","ko":"RAG 구현: 정확한 LLM 애플리케이션 구축","es":"Implementación RAG para LLM","fr":"Mise en œuvre de RAG pour les LLM","de":"RAG-Implementierung für LLM","pt":"Implementação RAG para Respostas Precisas","ru":"Реализация RAG для точных ответов","ar":"تنفيذ RAG للاستجابات الدقيقة","en":"rag-implementation"},"description":{"zh":"RAG实现是指使用外部知识源构建提供准确、有根据的响应的LLM应用。它可以应用于问答系统、聊天机器人、语义搜索等领域","ja":"RAG実装は、外部知識源を使用して正確で裏付けられた応答を提供するLLMアプリケーションを構築することを指します。これは、質問回答システム、チャットボット、セマンティック検索などに適用できます","ko":"RAG 구현은 외부 지식 소스를 사용하여 정확하고 근거 있는 응답을 제공하는 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것을 의미합니다. 이는 질문 답변 시스템, 챗봇, 의미 검색 등에 적용할 수 있습니다","es":"La implementación de RAG permite crear aplicaciones LLM que proporcionan respuestas precisas y basadas en conocimientos externos","fr":"La mise en œuvre de RAG permet de créer des applications LLM qui fournissent des réponses précises et basées sur des connaissances externes","de":"Die Implementierung von RAG ermöglicht die Erstellung von LLM-Anwendungen, die genaue und auf externen Wissen basierende Antworten liefern","pt":"A Implementação RAG permite construir aplicações LLM com respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo.","ru":"Реализация RAG позволяет создавать приложения LLM с точными и обоснованными ответами.","ar":"تنفيذ RAG يسمح ببناء تطبيقات LLM مع استجابات دقيقة ومستندة إلى مصادر معرفة خارجية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["构建准确的问答系统","创建提供当前、事实信息的聊天机器人","实现语义搜索","减少幻觉","启用LLM访问领域特定知识","构建文档助手"],"ja":["正確な質問回答システムを構築","現在、事実情報を提供するチャットボットを作成","セマンティック検索を実装","幻覚を減らす","LLMがドメイン特有の知識にアクセスできるようにする","ドキュメントアシスタントを構築"],"ko":["정확한 질문 답변 시스템 구축","현재, 사실 정보를 제공하는 챗봇 생성","의미 검색 구현","환각 감소","LLM이 도메인 특정 지식에 액세스할 수 있도록启用","문서 도우미 구축"],"es":["Creación de sistemas de preguntas y respuestas sobre documentos propietarios","Desarrollo de chatbots con información actual y precisa","Implementación de búsquedas semánticas con consultas de lenguaje natural","Reducción de alucinaciones con respuestas basadas en conocimientos","Habilitación de LLM para acceder a conocimientos específicos de dominio","Creación de asistentes de documentación"],"fr":["Création de systèmes de questions et réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Développement de chatbots avec des informations actuelles et précises","Mise en œuvre de recherches sémantiques avec des requêtes de langage naturel","Réduction des hallucinations avec des réponses basées sur des connaissances","Activation de LLM pour accéder à des connaissances spécifiques de domaine","Création d''assistants de documentation"],"de":["Erstellung von Frage- und Antwortsystemen über eigene Dokumente","Entwicklung von Chatbots mit aktuellen und genauen Informationen","Implementierung von semantischen Suchen mit natürlichen Sprachabfragen","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen mit wissensbasierten Antworten","Aktivierung von LLM für den Zugriff auf domänen-spezifisches Wissen","Erstellung von Dokumentationsassistenten"],"pt":["Respostas precisas com conhecimento externo","Redução de alucinações com respostas baseadas em fatos","Acesso a conhecimento específico de domínio","Implementação de busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Criação de sistemas de Q&A e chatbots informados","Assistentes de documentação avançados"],"ru":["Точные ответы с внешними знаниями","Снижение галлюцинаций с ответами, основанными на фактах","Доступ к специфичному знанию домена","Реализация семантического поиска с естественными языковыми запросами","Создание информированных систем Q&A и чат-ботов","Продвинутые помощники документации"],"ar":["استجابات دقيقة مع معرفة خارجية","تقليل الهلوسات مع استجابات مستندة إلى الحقائق","الوصول إلى معرفة محددة للنطاق","تنفيذ بحث دلالي مع استفسارات لغة طبيعية","إنشاء أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة وчат بوتات مستنيرة","مساعدات توثيق متقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAG实现","LLM应用","外部知识源","问答系统","聊天机器人","语义搜索","幻觉减少","领域特定知识"],"ja":["RAG実装","LLMアプリケーション","外部知識源","質問回答システム","チャットボット","セマンティック検索","幻覚減少","ドメイン特有の知識"],"ko":["RAG 구현","LLM 애플리케이션","외부 지식 소스","질문 답변 시스템","챗봇","의미 검색","환각 감소","도메인 특정 지식"],"es":["RAG","LLM","recuperación de información","generación de lenguaje","aplicaciones de lenguaje natural","procesamiento de lenguaje natural","inteligencia artificial","chatbots","sistemas de preguntas y respuestas"],"fr":["RAG","LLM","récupération d''informations","génération de langage","applications de langage naturel","traitement de langage naturel","intelligence artificielle","chatbots","systèmes de questions et réponses"],"de":["RAG","LLM","Informationswiederherstellung","Sprachgenerierung","Anwendungen von natürlicher Sprache","Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache","künstliche Intelligenz","Chatbots","Frage- und Antwortsysteme"],"pt":["RAG","LLM","Geração de linguagem natural","Recuperação de informações","Respostas precisas","Conhecimento externo","Busca semântica","Sistemas de Q&A","Chatbots","Assistentes de documentação"],"ru":["RAG","LLM","Генерация естественного языка","Извлечение информации","Точные ответы","Внешние знания","Семантический поиск","Системы Q&A","Чат-боты","Помощники документации"],"ar":["RAG","LLM","توليد اللغة الطبيعية","استرجاع المعلومات","استجابات دقيقة","معرفة خارجية","بحث دلالي","أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة","تشات بوتات","مساعدات توثيق"]}},"owner":"goodnight000","repo":"KittyCourt","repoPath":"goodnight000/KittyCourt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rag-implementation","description":"Build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems for LLM applications with vector databases and semantic search. Use when implementing knowledge-grounded AI, building document Q&A systems, or integrating LLMs with external knowledge bases.","bodyPreview":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n-","body":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n- Creating research tools with source citation\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. Vector Databases\n**Purpose**: Store and retrieve document embeddings efficiently\n\n**Options:**\n- **Pinecone**: Managed, scalable, fast queries\n- **Weaviate**: Open-source, hybrid search\n- **Milvus**: High performance, on-premise\n- **Chroma**: Lightweight, easy to use\n- **Qdrant**: Fast, filtered search\n- **FAISS**: Meta''s library, local deployment\n\n### 2. Embeddings\n**Purpose**: Convert text to numerical vectors for similarity search\n\n**Models:**\n- **text-embedding-ada-002** (OpenAI): General purpose, 1536 dims\n- **all-MiniLM-L6-v2** (Sentence Transformers): Fast, lightweight\n- **e5-large-v2**: High quality, multilingual\n- **Instructor**: Task-specific instructions\n- **bge-large-en-v1.5**: SOTA performance\n\n### 3. Retrieval Strategies\n**Approaches:**\n- **Dense Retrieval**: Semantic similarity via embeddings\n- **Sparse Retrieval**: Keyword matching (BM25, TF-IDF)\n- **Hybrid Search**: Combine dense + sparse\n- **Multi-Query**: Generate multiple query variations\n- **HyDE**: Generate hypothetical documents\n\n### 4. Reranking\n**Purpose**: Improve retrieval quality by reordering results\n\n**Methods:**\n- **Cross-Encoders**: BERT-based reranking\n- **Cohere Rerank**: API-based reranking\n- **Maximal Marginal Relevance (MMR)**: Diversity + relevance\n- **LLM-based**: Use LLM to score relevance\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\n\n# 1. Load documents\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'', glob=\"**/*.txt\")\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\n# 2. Split into chunks\ntext_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len\n)\nchunks = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# 3. Create embeddings and vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(chunks, embeddings)\n\n# 4. Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=OpenAI(),\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 4}),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# 5. Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What are the main features?\"})\nprint(result[''result''])\nprint(result[''source_documents''])\n```\n\n## Advanced RAG Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hybrid Search\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import BM25Retriever, EnsembleRetriever\n\n# Sparse retriever (BM25)\nbm25_retriever = BM25Retriever.from_documents(chunks)\nbm25_retriever.k = 5\n\n# Dense retriever (embeddings)\nembedding_retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 5})\n\n# Combine with weights\nensemble_retriever = EnsembleRetriever(\n    retrievers=[bm25_retriever, embedding_retriever],\n    weights=[0.3, 0.7]\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Query Retrieval\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers.multi_query import MultiQueryRetriever\n\n# Generate multiple query perspectives\nretriever = MultiQueryRetriever.from_llm(\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    llm=OpenAI()\n)\n\n# Single query → multiple variations → combined results\nresults = retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"What is the main topic?\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Contextual Compression\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ContextualCompressionRetriever\nfrom langchain.retrievers.document_compressors import LLMChainExtractor\n\ncompressor = LLMChainExtractor.from_llm(llm)\n\ncompression_retriever = ContextualCompressionRetriever(\n    base_compressor=compressor,\n    base_retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever()\n)\n\n# Returns only relevant parts of documents\ncompressed_docs = compression_retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"query\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Parent Document Retriever\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ParentDocumentRetriever\nfrom langchain.storage import InMemoryStore\n\n# Store for parent documents\nstore = InMemoryStore()\n\n# Small chunks for retrieval, large chunks for context\nchild_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=400)\nparent_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=2000)\n\nretriever = ParentDocumentRetriever(\n    vectorstore=vectorstore,\n    docstore=store,\n    child_splitter=child_splitter,\n    parent_splitter=parent_splitter\n)\n```\n\n## Document Chunking Strategies\n\n### Recursive Character Text Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len,\n    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \" \", \"\"]  # Try these in order\n)\n```\n\n### Token-Based Splitting\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import TokenTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = TokenTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=512,\n    chunk_overlap=50\n)\n```\n\n### Semantic Chunking\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import SemanticChunker\n\nsplitter = SemanticChunker(\n    embeddings=OpenAIEmbeddings(),\n    breakpoint_threshold_type=\"percentile\"\n)\n```\n\n### Markdown Header Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter\n\nheaders_to_split_on = [\n    (\"#\", \"Header 1\"),\n    (\"##\", \"Header 2\"),\n    (\"###\", \"Header 3\"),\n]\n\nsplitter = MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter(headers_to_split_on=headers_to_split_on)\n```\n\n## Vector Store Configurations\n\n### Pinecone\n```python\nimport pinecone\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Pinecone\n\npinecone.init(api_key=\"your-api-key\", environment=\"us-west1-gcp\")\n\nindex = pinecone.Index(\"your-index-name\")\n\nvectorstore = Pinecone(index, embeddings.embed_query, \"text\")\n```\n\n### Weaviate\n```python\nimport weaviate\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Weaviate\n\nclient = weaviate.Client(\"http://localhost:8080\")\n\nvectorstore = Weaviate(client, \"Document\", \"content\", embeddings)\n```\n\n### Chroma (Local)\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\nvectorstore = Chroma(\n    collection_name=\"my_collection\",\n    embedding_function=embeddings,\n    persist_directory=\"./chroma_db\"\n)\n```\n\n## Retrieval Optimization\n\n### 1. Metadata Filtering\n```python\n# Add metadata during indexing\nchunks_with_metadata = []\nfor i, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n    chunk.metadata = {\n        \"source\": chunk.metadata.get(\"source\"),\n        \"page\": i,\n        \"category\": determine_category(chunk.page_content)\n    }\n    chunks_with_metadata.append(chunk)\n\n# Filter during retrieval\nresults = vectorstore.similarity_search(\n    \"query\",\n    filter={\"category\": \"technical\"},\n    k=5\n)\n```\n\n### 2. Maximal Marginal Relevance\n```python\n# Balance relevance with diversity\nresults = vectorstore.max_marginal_relevance_search(\n    \"query\",\n    k=5,\n    fetch_k=20,  # Fetch 20, return top 5 diverse\n    lambda_mult=0.5  # 0=max diversity, 1=max relevance\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Reranking with Cross-Encoder\n```python\nfrom sentence_transformers import CrossEncoder\n\nreranker = CrossEncoder(''cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2'')\n\n# Get initial results\ncandidates = vectorstore.similarity_search(\"query\", k=20)\n\n# Rerank\npairs = [[query, doc.page_content] for doc in candidates]\nscores = reranker.predict(pairs)\n\n# Sort by score and take top k\nreranked = sorted(zip(candidates, scores), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)[:5]\n```\n\n## Prompt Engineering for RAG\n\n### Contextual Prompt\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Use the following context to answer the question. If you cannot answer based on the context, say \"I don''t have enough information.\"\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Citations\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question based on the context below. Include citations using [1], [2], etc.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer (with citations):\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Confidence\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question using the context. Provide a confidence score (0-100%) for your answer.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\nConfidence:\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Evaluation Metrics\n\n```python\ndef evaluate_rag_system(qa_chain, test_cases):\n    metrics = {\n        ''accuracy'': [],\n        ''retrieval_quality'': [],\n        ''groundedness'': []\n    }\n\n    for test in test_cases:\n        result = qa_chain({\"query\": test[''question'']})\n\n        # Check if answer matches expected\n        accuracy = calculate_accuracy(result[''result''], test[''expected''])\n        metrics[''accuracy''].append(accuracy)\n\n        # Check if relevant docs were retrieved\n        retrieval_quality = evaluate_retrieved_docs(\n            result[''source_documents''],\n            test[''relevant_docs'']\n        )\n        metrics[''retrieval_quality''].append(retrieval_quality)\n\n        # Check if answer is grounded in context\n        groundedness = check_groundedness(\n            result[''result''],\n            result[''source_documents'']\n        )\n        metrics[''groundedness''].append(groundedness)\n\n    return {k: sum(v)/len(v) for k, v in metrics.items()}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/vector-databases.md**: Detailed comparison of vector DBs\n- **references/embeddings.md**: Embedding model selection guide\n- **references/retrieval-strategies.md**: Advanced retrieval techniques\n- **references/reranking.md**: Reranking methods and when to use them\n- **references/context-window.md**: Managing context limits\n- **assets/vector-store-config.yaml**: Configuration templates\n- **assets/retriever-pipeline.py**: Complete RAG pipeline\n- **assets/embedding-models.md**: Model comparison and benchmarks\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Chunk Size**: Balance between context and specificity (500-1000 tokens)\n2. **Overlap**: Use 10-20% overlap to preserve context at boundaries\n3. **Metadata**: Include source, page, timestamp for filtering and debugging\n4. **Hybrid Search**: Combine semantic and keyword search for best results\n5. **Reranking**: Improve top results with cross-encoder\n6. **Citations**: Always return source documents for transparency\n7. **Evaluation**: Continuously test retrieval quality and answer accuracy\n8. **Monitoring**: Track retrieval metrics in production\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Poor Retrieval**: Check embedding quality, chunk size, query formulation\n- **Irrelevant Results**: Add metadata filtering, use hybrid search, rerank\n- **Missing Information**: Ensure documents are properly indexed\n- **Slow Queries**: Optimize vector store, use caching, reduce k\n- **Hallucinations**: Improve grounding prompt, add verification step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:38:07.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents seeking to integrate Retrieval-Augmented Generation for accurate and grounded responses.","zh":"非常适合寻求集成检索增强生成（RAG）技术以提供准确且基于事实的响应的高级语言代理。","ja":"正確で事実に基づいた応答を提供するために検索拡張生成（RAG）の統合を求める高度な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확하고 사실에 기반한 응답을 위해 검색 증강 생성(RAG) 통합을 추구하는 고급 언어 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados que buscan integrar Generación mejorada con Recuperación para respuestas precisas y basadas en hechos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langage Avancés cherchant à intégrer la Génération améliorée par la Recherche pour des réponses précises et fondées.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Sprachagenten, die Retrieval-erweiterte Generierung für genaue und fundierte Antworten integrieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados que buscam integrar Geração Aumentada por Recuperação para respostas precisas e fundamentadas.","ru":"Идеально для Продвинутых Языковых Агентов, стремящихся интегрировать Генерацию, Усиленную Извлечением, для точных и обоснованных ответов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة متقدم يبحث عن دمج التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع للحصول على استجابات دقيقة ومبنية على أساس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to access external knowledge sources, reducing hallucinations and enabling the provision of factual information through protocols like semantic search and natural language queries, leveraging Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) techniques.","zh":"使代理能够访问外部知识源，减少幻觉，并通过语义搜索和自然语言查询等协议，利用检索增强生成（RAG）技术来提供事实信息。","ja":"外部知識ソースへのアクセスを可能にし、幻覚を減らし、意味検索や自然言語クエリなどのプロトコルを通じて、検索拡張生成（RAG）技術を活用して事実情報を提供できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 외부 지식 소스에 접근하여 환각을 줄이고 의미 검색 및 자연어 쿼리와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 사실 정보를 제공할 수 있도록 하며, 검색 증강 생성(RAG) 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a acceder a fuentes de conocimiento externas, reduciendo alucinaciones y permitiendo la provisión de información factual a través de protocolos como búsqueda semántica y consultas de lenguaje natural, aprovechando técnicas de Generación mejorada con Recuperación (RAG).","fr":"Permet aux agents d''accéder à des sources de connaissances externes, réduisant les hallucinations et permettant la fourniture d''informations factuelles via des protocoles tels que la recherche sémantique et les requêtes de langage naturel, en exploitant les techniques de Génération améliorée par la Recherche (RAG).","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, auf externe Wissensquellen zuzugreifen, Halluzinationen zu reduzieren und die Bereitstellung von faktischen Informationen durch Protokolle wie semantische Suche und natürliche Sprachabfragen zu ermöglichen, indem Retrieval-erweiterte Generierung (RAG)-Techniken genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acessar fontes de conhecimento externas, reduzindo alucinações e permitindo a fornecer informações factuais por meio de protocolos como busca semântica e consultas de linguagem natural, utilizando técnicas de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação (RAG).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью доступа к внешним источникам знаний, снижая аллюзии и позволяя предоставлять фактическую информацию через протоколы, такие как семантический поиск и запросы естественного языка, используя техники Генерации, Усиленной Извлечением (RAG).","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من الوصول إلى مصادر معرفة خارجية، وتقليل الوهم، وتمكينه من تقديم معلومات حقيقية من خلال بروتوكولات مثل البحث الدلالي والاستفسارات اللغوية الطبيعية، باستخدام تقنيات التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع (RAG)."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Q&A systems over proprietary documents","Creating chatbots with current, factual information","Reducing hallucinations in LLM responses with grounded, retrieval-based answers"],"zh":["在专有文档上实施问答系统","创建具有最新事实信息的聊天机器人","通过基于检索的、有根据的答案减少LLM响应中的幻觉"],"ja":["独自文書を対象としたQ&Aシステムの実装","最新の事実情報を備えたチャットボットの作成","検索に基づく確固たる回答によるLLM応答の幻覚の低減"],"ko":["독점 문서에 대한 질의응답 시스템 구현","최신 사실 정보를 갖춘 챗봇 생성","검색 기반의 근거 있는 답변으로 LLM 응답의 환각 현상 감소"],"es":["Implementar sistemas de preguntas y respuestas sobre documentos propiedad","Crear chatbots con información factual actual","Reducir alucinaciones en respuestas de LLM con respuestas basadas en recuperación y fundamentadas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de questions-réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Créer des chatbots avec des informations factuelles actuelles","Réduire les hallucinations dans les réponses de LLM avec des réponses basées sur la recherche et fondées"],"de":["Implementierung von Q&A-Systemen über eigene Dokumente","Erstellung von Chatbots mit aktuellen, faktischen Informationen","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen in LLM-Antworten mit fundierten, retrieval-basierten Antworten"],"pt":["Implementar sistemas de Perguntas e Respostas sobre documentos proprietários","Criar chatbots com informações atuais e factuais","Reduzir alucinações em respostas de LLM com respostas baseadas em recuperação e fundamentadas"],"ru":["Реализация систем Вопросов и Ответов над собственными документами","Создание чат-ботов с актуальной и фактической информацией","Снижение аллюзий в ответах LLM с ответами, основанными на извлечении и обоснованными"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة الأسئلة والأجوبة على وثائق مملوكة","إنشاء روبوتات الدردشة مع معلومات حقيقية ومحدّثة","تقليل الأوهام في استجابات LLM مع إجابات مبنية على الاسترجاع والمبررة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with external knowledge sources","Dependent on the quality and relevance of the external knowledge base"],"zh":["需要与外部知识源集成","依赖于外部知识库的质量和相关性"],"ja":["外部知識ソースとの統合が必要","外部知識ベースの品質と関連性に依存"],"ko":["외부 지식 소스와의 통합 필요","외부 지식 베이스의 품질 및 관련성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con fuentes de conocimiento externas","Depende de la calidad y relevancia de la base de conocimiento externa"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des sources de connaissances externes","Dépend de la qualité et de la pertinence de la base de connaissances externe"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit externen Wissensquellen","Hängt von der Qualität und Relevanz der externen Wissensbasis ab"],"pt":["Requer integração com fontes de conhecimento externas","Depende da qualidade e relevância da base de conhecimento externa"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с внешними источниками знаний","Зависит от качества и релевантности внешней базы знаний"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع مصادر معرفة خارجية","يعتمد على جودة وملاءمة قاعدة المعرفة الخارجية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
