,"تحليل مشاكل انهيار التطبيق وتتبع المكدس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["调试策略","系统调试","性能优化","崩溃转储","堆栈跟踪","内存泄漏","代码调试"],"ja":["デバッグ戦略","systematicデバッグ","パフォーマンス最適化","クラッシュダンプ","スタックトレース","メモリリーク","コードデバッグ"],"ko":["디버깅 전략","시스템 디버깅","성능 최적화","크래시 덤프","스택 트레이스","메모리 리크","코드 디버깅"],"es":["depuración de código","estrategias de depuración","herramientas de depuración","análisis de rendimiento","solución de problemas","depuración en producción","análisis de volcados de memoria","seguimientos de la pila","perfilar rendimiento de la aplicación","investigación de fugas de memoria"],"fr":["débogage de code","stratégies de débogage","outils de débogage","analyse des performances","résolution de problèmes","débogage en production","analyse de dumps de mémoire","traces de la pile","profiler les performances de l''application","investigation de fuites de mémoire"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung","Fehlerbehebungsstrategien","Fehlerbehebungstools","Leistungsanalyse","Problemlösung","Fehlerbehebung in der Produktion","Analyse von Speicherauszügen","Stacktraces","Leistungsoptimierung der Anwendung","Ermittlung von Speicherlecks"],"pt":["depuração de código","estratégias de depuração","desenvolvimento de software","identificação de bugs","análise de desempenho","entendimento de código"],"ru":["отладка кода","стратегии отладки","разработка программного обеспечения","выявление ошибок","анализ производительности","понимание кода"],"ar":["فحص الكود","استراتيجيات فحص الأخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","تحديد الأخطاء","تحليل الأداء","فهم الكود"]}},"owner":"goodnight000","repo":"KittyCourt","repoPath":"goodnight000/KittyCourt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debugging-strategies","description":"Master systematic debugging techniques, profiling tools, and root cause analysis to efficiently track down bugs across any codebase or technology stack. Use when investigating bugs, performance issues, or unexpected behavior.","bodyPreview":"# Debugging Strategies\n\nTransform debugging from frustrating guesswork into systematic problem-solving with proven strategies, powerful tools, and methodical approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Tracking down elusive bugs\n- Investigating performance issues\n- Understanding unfamiliar codebases\n- Debugging production issues\n- Analyzing crash dumps and stack traces\n- Profiling application performance\n- Investigating memory leaks\n- Debugging distributed systems\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. The S","body":"# Debugging Strategies\n\nTransform debugging from frustrating guesswork into systematic problem-solving with proven strategies, powerful tools, and methodical approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Tracking down elusive bugs\n- Investigating performance issues\n- Understanding unfamiliar codebases\n- Debugging production issues\n- Analyzing crash dumps and stack traces\n- Profiling application performance\n- Investigating memory leaks\n- Debugging distributed systems\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. The Scientific Method\n\n**1. Observe**: What''s the actual behavior?\n**2. Hypothesize**: What could be causing it?\n**3. Experiment**: Test your hypothesis\n**4. Analyze**: Did it prove/disprove your theory?\n**5. Repeat**: Until you find the root cause\n\n### 2. Debugging Mindset\n\n**Don''t Assume:**\n- \"It can''t be X\" - Yes it can\n- \"I didn''t change Y\" - Check anyway\n- \"It works on my machine\" - Find out why\n\n**Do:**\n- Reproduce consistently\n- Isolate the problem\n- Keep detailed notes\n- Question everything\n- Take breaks when stuck\n\n### 3. Rubber Duck Debugging\n\nExplain your code and problem out loud (to a rubber duck, colleague, or yourself). Often reveals the issue.\n\n## Systematic Debugging Process\n\n### Phase 1: Reproduce\n\n```markdown\n## Reproduction Checklist\n\n1. **Can you reproduce it?**\n   - Always? Sometimes? Randomly?\n   - Specific conditions needed?\n   - Can others reproduce it?\n\n2. **Create minimal reproduction**\n   - Simplify to smallest example\n   - Remove unrelated code\n   - Isolate the problem\n\n3. **Document steps**\n   - Write down exact steps\n   - Note environment details\n   - Capture error messages\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Gather Information\n\n```markdown\n## Information Collection\n\n1. **Error Messages**\n   - Full stack trace\n   - Error codes\n   - Console/log output\n\n2. **Environment**\n   - OS version\n   - Language/runtime version\n   - Dependencies versions\n   - Environment variables\n\n3. **Recent Changes**\n   - Git history\n   - Deployment timeline\n   - Configuration changes\n\n4. **Scope**\n   - Affects all users or specific ones?\n   - All browsers or specific ones?\n   - Production only or also dev?\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Form Hypothesis\n\n```markdown\n## Hypothesis Formation\n\nBased on gathered info, ask:\n\n1. **What changed?**\n   - Recent code changes\n   - Dependency updates\n   - Infrastructure changes\n\n2. **What''s different?**\n   - Working vs broken environment\n   - Working vs broken user\n   - Before vs after\n\n3. **Where could this fail?**\n   - Input validation\n   - Business logic\n   - Data layer\n   - External services\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Test & Verify\n\n```markdown\n## Testing Strategies\n\n1. **Binary Search**\n   - Comment out half the code\n   - Narrow down problematic section\n   - Repeat until found\n\n2. **Add Logging**\n   - Strategic console.log/print\n   - Track variable values\n   - Trace execution flow\n\n3. **Isolate Components**\n   - Test each piece separately\n   - Mock dependencies\n   - Remove complexity\n\n4. **Compare Working vs Broken**\n   - Diff configurations\n   - Diff environments\n   - Diff data\n```\n\n## Debugging Tools\n\n### JavaScript/TypeScript Debugging\n\n```typescript\n// Chrome DevTools Debugger\nfunction processOrder(order: Order) {\n    debugger;  // Execution pauses here\n\n    const total = calculateTotal(order);\n    console.log(''Total:'', total);\n\n    // Conditional breakpoint\n    if (order.items.length > 10) {\n        debugger;  // Only breaks if condition true\n    }\n\n    return total;\n}\n\n// Console debugging techniques\nconsole.log(''Value:'', value);                    // Basic\nconsole.table(arrayOfObjects);                   // Table format\nconsole.time(''operation''); /* code */ console.timeEnd(''operation'');  // Timing\nconsole.trace();                                 // Stack trace\nconsole.assert(value > 0, ''Value must be positive'');  // Assertion\n\n// Performance profiling\nperformance.mark(''start-operation'');\n// ... operation code\nperformance.mark(''end-operation'');\nperformance.measure(''operation'', ''start-operation'', ''end-operation'');\nconsole.log(performance.getEntriesByType(''measure''));\n```\n\n**VS Code Debugger Configuration:**\n```json\n// .vscode/launch.json\n{\n    \"version\": \"0.2.0\",\n    \"configurations\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"node\",\n            \"request\": \"launch\",\n            \"name\": \"Debug Program\",\n            \"program\": \"${workspaceFolder}/src/index.ts\",\n            \"preLaunchTask\": \"tsc: build - tsconfig.json\",\n            \"outFiles\": [\"${workspaceFolder}/dist/**/*.js\"],\n            \"skipFiles\": [\"<node_internals>/**\"]\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"node\",\n            \"request\": \"launch\",\n            \"name\": \"Debug Tests\",\n            \"program\": \"${workspaceFolder}/node_modules/jest/bin/jest\",\n            \"args\": [\"--runInBand\", \"--no-cache\"],\n            \"console\": \"integratedTerminal\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Python Debugging\n\n```python\n# Built-in debugger (pdb)\nimport pdb\n\ndef calculate_total(items):\n    total = 0\n    pdb.set_trace()  # Debugger starts here\n\n    for item in items:\n        total += item.price * item.quantity\n\n    return total\n\n# Breakpoint (Python 3.7+)\ndef process_order(order):\n    breakpoint()  # More convenient than pdb.set_trace()\n    # ... code\n\n# Post-mortem debugging\ntry:\n    risky_operation()\nexcept Exception:\n    import pdb\n    pdb.post_mortem()  # Debug at exception point\n\n# IPython debugging (ipdb)\nfrom ipdb import set_trace\nset_trace()  # Better interface than pdb\n\n# Logging for debugging\nimport logging\nlogging.basicConfig(level=logging.DEBUG)\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n\ndef fetch_user(user_id):\n    logger.debug(f''Fetching user: {user_id}'')\n    user = db.query(User).get(user_id)\n    logger.debug(f''Found user: {user}'')\n    return user\n\n# Profile performance\nimport cProfile\nimport pstats\n\ncProfile.run(''slow_function()'', ''profile_stats'')\nstats = pstats.Stats(''profile_stats'')\nstats.sort_stats(''cumulative'')\nstats.print_stats(10)  # Top 10 slowest\n```\n\n### Go Debugging\n\n```go\n// Delve debugger\n// Install: go install github.com/go-delve/delve/cmd/dlv@latest\n// Run: dlv debug main.go\n\nimport (\n    \"fmt\"\n    \"runtime\"\n    \"runtime/debug\"\n)\n\n// Print stack trace\nfunc debugStack() {\n    debug.PrintStack()\n}\n\n// Panic recovery with debugging\nfunc processRequest() {\n    defer func() {\n        if r := recover(); r != nil {\n            fmt.Println(\"Panic:\", r)\n            debug.PrintStack()\n        }\n    }()\n\n    // ... code that might panic\n}\n\n// Memory profiling\nimport _ \"net/http/pprof\"\n// Visit http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/\n\n// CPU profiling\nimport (\n    \"os\"\n    \"runtime/pprof\"\n)\n\nf, _ := os.Create(\"cpu.prof\")\npprof.StartCPUProfile(f)\ndefer pprof.StopCPUProfile()\n// ... code to profile\n```\n\n## Advanced Debugging Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Binary Search Debugging\n\n```bash\n# Git bisect for finding regression\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad                    # Current commit is bad\ngit bisect good v1.0.0            # v1.0.0 was good\n\n# Git checks out middle commit\n# Test it, then:\ngit bisect good   # if it works\ngit bisect bad    # if it''s broken\n\n# Continue until bug found\ngit bisect reset  # when done\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Differential Debugging\n\nCompare working vs broken:\n\n```markdown\n## What''s Different?\n\n| Aspect       | Working         | Broken          |\n|--------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Environment  | Development     | Production      |\n| Node version | 18.16.0         | 18.15.0         |\n| Data         | Empty DB        | 1M records      |\n| User         | Admin           | Regular user    |\n| Browser      | Chrome          | Safari          |\n| Time         | During day      | After midnight  |\n\nHypothesis: Time-based issue? Check timezone handling.\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Trace Debugging\n\n```typescript\n// Function call tracing\nfunction trace(target: any, propertyKey: string, descriptor: PropertyDescriptor) {\n    const originalMethod = descriptor.value;\n\n    descriptor.value = function(...args: any[]) {\n        console.log(`Calling ${propertyKey} with args:`, args);\n        const result = originalMethod.apply(this, args);\n        console.log(`${propertyKey} returned:`, result);\n        return result;\n    };\n\n    return descriptor;\n}\n\nclass OrderService {\n    @trace\n    calculateTotal(items: Item[]): number {\n        return items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price, 0);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Technique 4: Memory Leak Detection\n\n```typescript\n// Chrome DevTools Memory Profiler\n// 1. Take heap snapshot\n// 2. Perform action\n// 3. Take another snapshot\n// 4. Compare snapshots\n\n// Node.js memory debugging\nif (process.memoryUsage().heapUsed > 500 * 1024 * 1024) {\n    console.warn(''High memory usage:'', process.memoryUsage());\n\n    // Generate heap dump\n    require(''v8'').writeHeapSnapshot();\n}\n\n// Find memory leaks in tests\nlet beforeMemory: number;\n\nbeforeEach(() => {\n    beforeMemory = process.memoryUsage().heapUsed;\n});\n\nafterEach(() => {\n    const afterMemory = process.memoryUsage().heapUsed;\n    const diff = afterMemory - beforeMemory;\n\n    if (diff > 10 * 1024 * 1024) {  // 10MB threshold\n        console.warn(`Possible memory leak: ${diff / 1024 / 1024}MB`);\n    }\n});\n```\n\n## Debugging Patterns by Issue Type\n\n### Pattern 1: Intermittent Bugs\n\n```markdown\n## Strategies for Flaky Bugs\n\n1. **Add extensive logging**\n   - Log timing information\n   - Log all state transitions\n   - Log external interactions\n\n2. **Look for race conditions**\n   - Concurrent access to shared state\n   - Async operations completing out of order\n   - Missing synchronization\n\n3. **Check timing dependencies**\n   - setTimeout/setInterval\n   - Promise resolution order\n   - Animation frame timing\n\n4. **Stress test**\n   - Run many times\n   - Vary timing\n   - Simulate load\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Performance Issues\n\n```markdown\n## Performance Debugging\n\n1. **Profile first**\n   - Don''t optimize blindly\n   - Measure before and after\n   - Find bottlenecks\n\n2. **Common culprits**\n   - N+1 queries\n   - Unnecessary re-renders\n   - Large data processing\n   - Synchronous I/O\n\n3. **Tools**\n   - Browser DevTools Performance tab\n   - Lighthouse\n   - Python: cProfile, line_profiler\n   - Node: clinic.js, 0x\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Production Bugs\n\n```markdown\n## Production Debugging\n\n1. **Gather evidence**\n   - Error tracking (Sentry, Bugsnag)\n   - Application logs\n   - User reports\n   - Metrics/monitoring\n\n2. **Reproduce locally**\n   - Use production data (anonymized)\n   - Match environment\n   - Follow exact steps\n\n3. **Safe investigation**\n   - Don''t change production\n   - Use feature flags\n   - Add monitoring/logging\n   - Test fixes in staging\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Reproduce First**: Can''t fix what you can''t reproduce\n2. **Isolate the Problem**: Remove complexity until minimal case\n3. **Read Error Messages**: They''re usually helpful\n4. **Check Recent Changes**: Most bugs are recent\n5. **Use Version Control**: Git bisect, blame, history\n6. **Take Breaks**: Fresh eyes see better\n7. **Document Findings**: Help future you\n8. **Fix Root Cause**: Not just symptoms\n\n## Common Debugging Mistakes\n\n- **Making Multiple Changes**: Change one thing at a time\n- **Not Reading Error Messages**: Read the full stack trace\n- **Assuming It''s Complex**: Often it''s simple\n- **Debug Logging in Prod**: Remove before shipping\n- **Not Using Debugger**: console.log isn''t always best\n- **Giving Up Too Soon**: Persistence pays off\n- **Not Testing the Fix**: Verify it actually works\n\n## Quick Debugging Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## When Stuck, Check:\n\n- [ ] Spelling errors (typos in variable names)\n- [ ] Case sensitivity (fileName vs filename)\n- [ ] Null/undefined values\n- [ ] Array index off-by-one\n- [ ] Async timing (race conditions)\n- [ ] Scope issues (closure, hoisting)\n- [ ] Type mismatches\n- [ ] Missing dependencies\n- [ ] Environment variables\n- [ ] File paths (absolute vs relative)\n- [ ] Cache issues (clear cache)\n- [ ] Stale data (refresh database)\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/debugging-tools-guide.md**: Comprehensive tool documentation\n- **references/performance-profiling.md**: Performance debugging guide\n- **references/production-debugging.md**: Debugging live systems\n- **assets/debugging-checklist.md**: Quick reference checklist\n- **assets/common-bugs.md**: Common bug patterns\n- **scripts/debug-helper.ts**: Debugging utility functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:38:08.714Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing systematic problem-solving capabilities for tracking down elusive bugs and investigating performance issues","zh":"非常适合需要系统化问题解决能力来跟踪难以捉摸的bug和调查性能问题的代码分析代理","ja":"コード分析エージェントが難しいバグを追跡し、パフォーマンスの問題を調査するための体系的な問題解決能力を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"흔하지 않은 버그를 추적하고 성능 문제를 조사하기 위한 체계적인 문제 해결 능력이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades sistemáticas de resolución de problemas para rastrear errores esquivos e investigar problemas de rendimiento","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code ayant besoin de capacités de résolution de problèmes systématiques pour traquer les bugs insaisissables et investiguer les problèmes de performance","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die systematische Problemlösungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um schwer fassbare Fehler aufzuspüren und Leistungsprobleme zu untersuchen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de resolução sistemática de problemas para rastrear bugs difíceis de encontrar e investigar problemas de desempenho","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы системные возможности решения проблем для отслеживания неуловимых ошибок и расследования проблем с производительностью","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات حل المشكلات المنهجية لتعقب الأخطاء الخفية والتحقيق في مشاكل الأداء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply methodical approaches and utilize powerful tools for debugging, including analyzing crash dumps and stack traces, profiling application performance, and investigating memory leaks in distributed systems using proven strategies","zh":"赋予代理应用系统化方法并利用强大的工具进行调试，包括分析崩溃转储和栈跟踪、分析应用程序性能和使用成熟策略在分布式系统中调查内存泄漏","ja":"エージェントが体系的なアプローチを適用し、強力なツールを使用してデバッグを行うことができるようにし、クラッシュダンプとスタックトレースの分析、パフォーマンスの分析、および分散システムでのメモリーリークの調査を行う","ko":"에이전트가 체계적인 접근 방식을 적용하고 강력한 도구를 사용하여 디버깅을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 크래시 덤프 및 스택 추적 분석, 애플리케이션 성능 분석 및 분산 시스템에서 메모리 누수 조사 등","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar enfoques metódicos y utilizar herramientas potentes para la depuración, incluyendo el análisis de volcados de memoria y trazas de pila, la generación de perfiles de rendimiento de aplicaciones y la investigación de fugas de memoria en sistemas distribuidos utilizando estrategias probadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des approches méthodiques et d''utiliser des outils puissants pour le débogage, y compris l''analyse des vidages mémoire et des traces de pile, le profilage des performances applicatives et l''investigation des fuites mémoire dans les systèmes distribués en utilisant des stratégies éprouvées","de":"Ermöglicht Agents methodische Ansätze anzuwenden und leistungsstarke Tools für das Debugging zu nutzen, einschließlich der Analyse von Speicherabbildern und Stack-Traces, der Profilerstellung von Anwendungsleistung und der Untersuchung von Speicherlecks in verteilten Systemen mit bewährten Strategien","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar abordagens metódicas e a utilizar ferramentas poderosas para depuração, incluindo a análise de dumps de crash e rastreios de pilha, perfil de desempenho da aplicação e investigação de vazamentos de memória em sistemas distribuídos usando estratégias comprovadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять методические подходы и использовать мощные инструменты для отладки, включая анализ дампов аварий и трассировки стека, профилирование производительности приложения и расследование утечек памяти в распределенных системах с помощью проверенных стратегий","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق نهج منهجية واستخدام أدوات قوية للتصحيح، بما في ذلك تحليل الذاكرة التخزينية للتحطم وتتبع المكدس، ومحاكاة أداء التطبيق والتحقيق في تسربات الذاكرة في الأنظمة الموزعة باستخدام استراتيجيات مجربة"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging production issues with systematic problem-solving","Investigating performance issues in unfamiliar codebases","Analyzing crash dumps and stack traces for error resolution"],"zh":["使用系统化问题解决调试生产问题","在不熟悉的代码库中调查性能问题","分析崩溃转储和栈跟踪以解决错误"],"ja":["体系的な問題解決を使用して生産問題をデバッグする","未知のコードベースでパフォーマンスの問題を調査する","クラッシュダンプとスタックトレースを分析してエラーを解決する"],"ko":["체계적인 문제 해결을 사용하여 생산 문제를 디버깅","익숙하지 않은 코드베이스에서 성능 문제를 조사","크래시 덤프 및 스택 추적을 분석하여 오류를 해결"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de producción con resolución sistemática de problemas","Investigación de problemas de rendimiento en bases de código no familiares","Análisis de volcados de memoria y trazas de pila para la resolución de errores"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de production avec résolution systématique de problèmes","Investigation des problèmes de performance dans des bases de code non familières","Analyse des vidages mémoire et des traces de pile pour la résolution d''erreurs"],"de":["Debugging von Produktionsproblemen mit systematischer Problemlösung","Untersuchung von Leistungsproblemen in unbekannten Codebasen","Analyse von Speicherabbildern und Stack-Traces zur Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de produção com resolução sistemática de problemas","Investigação de problemas de desempenho em código não familiar","Análise de dumps de crash e rastreios de pilha para resolução de erros"],"ru":["Отладка проблем производства с системным решением проблем","Расследование проблем производительности в незнакомом коде","Анализ дампов аварий и трассировки стека для решения ошибок"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الإنتاج مع حل منهجي للمشكلات","التحقيق في مشاكل الأداء في قواعد الكود غير المألوفة","تحليل الذاكرة التخزينية للتحطم وتتبع المكدس لحل الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires programming knowledge","May require additional tools or libraries for specific debugging tasks"],"zh":["需要编程知识","可能需要额外的工具或库来执行特定的调试任务"],"ja":["プログラミング知識が必要","特定のデバッグタスクを実行するには追加のツールまたはライブラリが必要となる"],"ko":["프로그래밍 지식이 필요","특정 디버깅 작업을 수행하려면 추가 도구 또는 라이브러리가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación","Puede requerir herramientas o bibliotecas adicionales para tareas específicas de depuración"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation","Peut nécessiter des outils ou bibliothèques supplémentaires pour des tâches de débogage spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Programmierkenntnisse","Kann zusätzliche Tools oder Bibliotheken für spezifische Debugging-Aufgaben erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de programação","Pode exigir ferramentas ou bibliotecas adicionais para tarefas de depuração específicas"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования","Может требовать дополнительных инструментов или библиотек для специфических задач отладки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالبرمجة","يمكن أن يتطلب أدوات أو مكتبات إضافية لمهام التصحيح الخاصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vallafederico/solid-ai-rules/solid-router-advanced', 'community', 'vallafederico', 'solid-ai-rules', 'vallafederico/solid-ai-rules', 'solid-router-advanced', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:38:27.634Z', NULL, '{"id":"vallafederico/solid-ai-rules/solid-router-advanced","name":"solid-router-advanced","description":{"zh":"Solid Router 高级路由模式提供组件化路由和配置化路由两种方式，帮助开发者轻松管理路由","ja":"Solid Router のアドバンスドルーティング機能は、コンポーネントベースのルーティングとコンフィグベースのルーティングの 2 つの方法を提供し、開発者がルーティングを簡単に管理できるようにします","ko":"Solid Router 고급 라우팅 기능은 컴포넌트 기반 라우팅과 구성 기반 라우팅 두 가지 방법을 제공하여 개발자가 라우팅을 쉽게 관리할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Solid Router Advanced permite definir rutas utilizando componentes JSX o configuraciones. Ideal para aplicaciones complejas.","fr":"Solid Router Advanced permet de définir des routes à l''aide de composants JSX ou de configurations. Idéal pour les applications complexes.","de":"Solid Router Advanced ermöglicht die Definition von Routen mithilfe von JSX-Komponenten oder Konfigurationen. Ideal für komplexe Anwendungen.","pt":"O Solid Router é uma biblioteca para criar rotas avançadas em aplicações SolidJS. Ele oferece recursos como roteamento baseado em componentes e configuração.","ru":"Solid Router — это библиотека для создания продвинутых маршрутов в приложениях SolidJS. Она предлагает такие возможности, как маршрутизация на основе компонентов и конфигурации.","ar":"Solid Router هو مكتبة لإنشاء مسارات متقدمة في تطبيقات SolidJS. يقدم ميزات مثل التوجيه القائم على المكونات والتهيئة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Solid Router 高级路由模式","ja":"Solid Router アドバンスドルーティング","ko":"Solid Router 고급 라우팅","es":"Enrutador Avanzado de Solid Router","fr":"Routeur Avancé de Solid Router","de":"Erweiterter Solid-Router","pt":"Rotas Avançadas com Solid Router","ru":"Продвинутый Маршрутизатор Solid","ar":"توجيه متقدم مع Solid Router","en":"solid-router-advanced"},"description":{"zh":"Solid Router 高级路由模式提供组件化路由和配置化路由两种方式，帮助开发者轻松管理路由","ja":"Solid Router のアドバンスドルーティング機能は、コンポーネントベースのルーティングとコンフィグベースのルーティングの 2 つの方法を提供し、開発者がルーティングを簡単に管理できるようにします","ko":"Solid Router 고급 라우팅 기능은 컴포넌트 기반 라우팅과 구성 기반 라우팅 두 가지 방법을 제공하여 개발자가 라우팅을 쉽게 관리할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Solid Router Advanced permite definir rutas utilizando componentes JSX o configuraciones. Ideal para aplicaciones complejas.","fr":"Solid Router Advanced permet de définir des routes à l''aide de composants JSX ou de configurations. Idéal pour les applications complexes.","de":"Solid Router Advanced ermöglicht die Definition von Routen mithilfe von JSX-Komponenten oder Konfigurationen. Ideal für komplexe Anwendungen.","pt":"O Solid Router é uma biblioteca para criar rotas avançadas em aplicações SolidJS. Ele oferece recursos como roteamento baseado em componentes e configuração.","ru":"Solid Router — это библиотека для создания продвинутых маршрутов в приложениях SolidJS. Она предлагает такие возможности, как маршрутизация на основе компоне...","ar":"Solid Router هو مكتبة لإنشاء مسارات متقدمة في تطبيقات SolidJS. يقدم ميزات مثل التوجيه القائم على المكونات والتهيئة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["组件化路由","配置化路由","支持懒加载","简单易用","高性能"],"ja":["コンポーネントベースのルーティング","コンフィグベースのルーティング","遅延読み込みのサポート","シンプルで使いやすい","高性能"],"ko":["컴포넌트 기반 라우팅","구성 기반 라우팅","지연 로딩 지원","간단하고 사용하기 쉽습니다","고성능"],"es":["Enrutamiento basado en componentes","Enrutamiento basado en configuraciones","Carga diferida de componentes","Definición de rutas utilizando JSX","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones complejas"],"fr":["Routage basé sur les composants","Routage basé sur les configurations","Chargement différé des composants","Définition des routes à l''aide de JSX","Compatibilité avec les applications complexes"],"de":["Komponentenbasiertes Routing","Konfigurbasiertes Routing","Verzögertes Laden von Komponenten","Definition von Routen mithilfe von JSX","Kompatibilität mit komplexen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Roteamento baseado em componentes","Roteamento baseado em configuração","Carregamento lento de componentes","Suporte a rotas aninhadas","Facilidade de uso e configuração"],"ru":["Маршрутизация на основе компонентов","Маршрутизация на основе конфигурации","Ленивая загрузка компонентов","Поддержка вложенных маршрутов","Легкость использования и конфигурации"],"ar":["التوجيه القائم على المكونات","التوجيه القائم على التهيئة","تحميل المكونات البطيء","دعم المسارات المتراكبة","سهولة الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Solid Router","高级路由模式","组件化路由","配置化路由","懒加载","路由管理"],"ja":["Solid Router","アドバンスドルーティング","コンポーネントベースのルーティング","コンフィグベースのルーティング","遅延読み込み","ルーティング管理"],"ko":["Solid Router","고급 라우팅","컴포넌트 기반 라우팅","구성 기반 라우팅","지연 로딩","라우팅 관리"],"es":["Solid Router","enrutamiento avanzado","aplicaciones web","desarrollo web","JSX","rutas basadas en componentes","rutas basadas en configuraciones"],"fr":["Solid Router","routage avancé","applications web","développement web","JSX","routes basées sur les composants","routes basées sur les configurations"],"de":["Solid Router","erweitertes Routing","Webanwendungen","Webentwicklung","JSX","komponentenbasiertes Routing","konfigurbasiertes Routing"],"pt":["Solid Router","Roteamento avançado","SolidJS","Desenvolvimento web","Roteamento baseado em componentes","Roteamento baseado em configuração","Carregamento lento","Rotas aninhadas"],"ru":["Solid Router","Продвинутый маршрутизатор","SolidJS","Веб-разработка","Маршрутизация на основе компонентов","Маршрутизация на основе конфигурации","Ленивая загрузка","Вложенные маршруты"],"ar":["Solid Router","توجيه متقدم","SolidJS","تطوير الويب","التوجيه القائم على المكونات","التوجيه القائم على التهيئة","تحميل المكونات البطيء","المسارات المتراكبة"]}},"owner":"vallafederico","repo":"solid-ai-rules","repoPath":"vallafederico/solid-ai-rules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"solid-router-advanced","description":"Solid Router advanced: preloading routes, streaming with Suspense, revalidation (automatic/manual), layouts, response helpers (json/redirect/reload), protected routes.","bodyPreview":"# Solid Router Advanced Patterns\n\n## Routing Setup\n\n### Component-Based Routing (JSX)\n\nDefine routes using JSX components:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Router, Route } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\n<Router>\n  <Route path=\"/\" component={Home} />\n  <Route path=\"/about\" component={About} />\n</Router>\n```\n\n### Config-Based Routing\n\nDefine routes using config objects (useful for lazy loading):\n\n```tsx\nimport { lazy } from \"solid-js\";\nimport { Router } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst routes = [\n  {\n    path: \"/\",\n    c","body":"# Solid Router Advanced Patterns\n\n## Routing Setup\n\n### Component-Based Routing (JSX)\n\nDefine routes using JSX components:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Router, Route } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\n<Router>\n  <Route path=\"/\" component={Home} />\n  <Route path=\"/about\" component={About} />\n</Router>\n```\n\n### Config-Based Routing\n\nDefine routes using config objects (useful for lazy loading):\n\n```tsx\nimport { lazy } from \"solid-js\";\nimport { Router } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst routes = [\n  {\n    path: \"/\",\n    component: lazy(() => import(\"./routes/index\")),\n  },\n  {\n    path: \"/about\",\n    component: lazy(() => import(\"./routes/about\")),\n  }\n];\n\n<Router>{routes}</Router>\n```\n\n**Best practice:** Use `lazy()` with config-based routing for code splitting.\n\n## Preloading\n\n### Route Preloading\n\nPreload data before navigation:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Route, query, createAsync } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst getProductQuery = query(async (id: string) => {\n  // Fetch product\n}, \"product\");\n\nfunction ProductPage(props) {\n  const product = createAsync(() => getProductQuery(props.params.id));\n  return <div>{product()?.title}</div>;\n}\n\nfunction preloadProduct({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {\n  getProductQuery(params.id);\n}\n\nfunction Routes() {\n  return (\n    <Route \n      path=\"/products/:id\" \n      component={ProductPage} \n      preload={preloadProduct}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Preloading triggers:**\n- On hover over links (user intent)\n- During route rendering (ensure data ready)\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Data ready when component renders\n- No loading spinners on navigation\n- Better perceived performance\n\n### Preload with Intent\n\n```tsx\nfunction preloadData({ params, intent }) {\n  if (intent === \"preload\") {\n    // Only prefetch, don''t wait\n    getProductQuery(params.id);\n  } else {\n    // During navigation, ensure data is ready\n    return getProductQuery(params.id);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Streaming\n\n### Suspense Boundaries\n\nCreate independent streaming boundaries:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Suspense, For } from \"solid-js\";\nimport { query, createAsync } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst getAccountStatsQuery = query(async () => {\n  // Slow query\n}, \"accountStats\");\n\nconst getRecentTransactionsQuery = query(async () => {\n  // Fast query\n}, \"recentTransactions\");\n\nfunction Dashboard() {\n  const stats = createAsync(() => getAccountStatsQuery());\n  const transactions = createAsync(() => getRecentTransactionsQuery());\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>Dashboard</h1>\n      \n      <Suspense fallback={<p>Loading stats...</p>}>\n        <For each={stats()}>\n          {(stat) => <div>{stat.label}: {stat.value}</div>}\n        </For>\n      </Suspense>\n      \n      <Suspense fallback={<p>Loading transactions...</p>}>\n        <For each={transactions()}>\n          {(transaction) => <div>{transaction.description}</div>}\n        </For>\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nEach `<Suspense>` creates independent boundary - fast queries render while slow ones stream.\n\n### Disabling Streaming\n\nUse `deferStream: true` for SEO-critical data:\n\n```tsx\nconst article = createAsync(() => getArticleQuery(), {\n  deferStream: true // Wait for data before initial HTML\n});\n\nreturn <h1>{article()?.title}</h1>; // Always in initial HTML\n```\n\n## Revalidation\n\n### Automatic Revalidation\n\nAfter actions complete successfully, all active queries revalidate automatically.\n\n### Manual Revalidation\n\n```tsx\nimport { revalidate } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst refreshUser = async () => {\n  await updateUserData();\n  // Revalidate specific query\n  revalidate(getUserQuery.keyFor(userId));\n  \n  // Revalidate all instances of query\n  revalidate(getUserQuery.key);\n  \n  // Revalidate multiple queries\n  revalidate([getUserQuery.key, getPostsQuery.key]);\n};\n```\n\n### Selective Revalidation\n\nUse `json` helper to control revalidation:\n\n```tsx\nimport { json } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst createPostAction = action(async (formData: FormData) => {\n  const newPost = await db.createPost(formData);\n  \n  // Only revalidate posts query, not user query\n  return json(newPost, { \n    revalidate: \"posts\" \n  });\n}, \"createPost\");\n\n// Disable automatic revalidation\nreturn json(newPost, { revalidate: [] });\n```\n\n## Response Helpers\n\n### json\n\nReturn JSON with revalidation control:\n\n```tsx\nimport { json } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst getData = query(async () => {\n  return json(\n    { data: \"value\" },\n    {\n      revalidate: [\"posts\", \"users\"],\n      headers: { \"Cache-Control\": \"max-age=60\" },\n      status: 200\n    }\n  );\n}, \"data\");\n```\n\n### redirect\n\n```tsx\nimport { redirect } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst loginAction = action(async (formData: FormData) => {\n  await authenticate(formData);\n  throw redirect(\"/dashboard\"); // Or return redirect(...)\n}, \"login\");\n```\n\n### reload\n\n```tsx\nimport { reload } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst refreshAction = action(async () => {\n  await invalidateCache();\n  throw reload(); // Reload current route data\n}, \"refresh\");\n```\n\n## Layouts\n\n### Root Layout\n\n```tsx\nimport { Router } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nconst Layout = (props) => (\n  <>\n    <header>Header</header>\n    {props.children}\n    <footer>Footer</footer>\n  </>\n);\n\n<Router root={Layout}>\n  <Route path=\"/\" component={Home} />\n</Router>\n```\n\n### Nested Layouts\n\n```tsx\nfunction PageWrapper(props) {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>Users</h1>\n      {props.children}\n      <A href=\"/\">Back Home</A>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n<Router>\n  <Route path=\"/users\" component={PageWrapper}>\n    <Route path=\"/\" component={Users} />\n    <Route path=\"/:id\" component={User} />\n  </Route>\n</Router>\n```\n\n## Route Configuration\n\n```tsx\nimport type { RouteDefinition } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\nexport const route = {\n  preload({ params, location, intent }) {\n    // Preload logic\n    if (intent === \"preload\") {\n      getProductQuery(params.id);\n    } else {\n      return getProductQuery(params.id);\n    }\n  }\n} satisfies RouteDefinition;\n\nexport default function Page() {\n  return <div>Content</div>;\n}\n```\n\n## Protected Routes\n\n```tsx\nconst getProtectedData = query(async () => {\n  if (!isAuthenticated()) {\n    throw redirect(\"/login\");\n  }\n  return await fetchProtectedData();\n}, \"protectedData\");\n\nfunction ProtectedPage() {\n  const data = createAsync(() => getProtectedData(), { deferStream: true });\n  return <div>{data()}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n**Important:** Use `deferStream: true` - server-side redirects can''t occur after streaming starts.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```tsx\nimport { ErrorBoundary } from \"solid-js\";\n\nfunction DataComponent() {\n  const data = createAsync(() => fetchData());\n  \n  return (\n    <ErrorBoundary fallback={(err) => <div>Error: {err.message}</div>}>\n      <Suspense fallback={<div>Loading...</div>}>\n        <div>{data()}</div>\n      </Suspense>\n    </ErrorBoundary>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Rendering Modes\n\n### SPA (Single Page Application)\n\nClient-side routing without SSR. Configure redirects for CDN/hosting:\n\n**Netlify** (`public/_redirects`):\n```\n/*   /index.html   200\n```\n\n**Vercel** (`vercel.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"rewrites\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### SSR (Server-Side Rendering)\n\nEnable SSR by passing URL to Router:\n\n```tsx\nimport { isServer } from \"solid-js/web\";\nimport { Router } from \"@solidjs/router\";\n\n<Router url={isServer ? req.url : \"\"}>\n  {/* routes */}\n</Router>\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n- SEO optimization\n- Faster initial page load\n- Server-side data preloading\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. Preload important routes - Better navigation performance\n2. Use streaming for non-critical data - Faster perceived performance\n3. Use `deferStream` for SEO-critical data - Include in initial HTML\n4. Revalidate selectively - Only revalidate what changed\n5. Define layouts for consistent UI organization\n6. Use `redirect` for server-side navigation (authentication, etc.)\n7. Wrap async data with `<Suspense>` and `<ErrorBoundary>`\n8. Configure redirects for SPA deployment\n\n1. Preload important routes - Better navigation performance\n2. Use streaming for non-critical data - Faster perceived performance\n3. Use `deferStream` for SEO-critical data - Include in initial HTML\n4. Revalidate selectively - Only revalidate what changed\n5. Define layouts for consistent UI organization\n6. Use `redirect` for server-side navigation (authentication, etc.)\n7. Wrap async data with `<Suspense>` and `<ErrorBoundary>`\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:38:27.634Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced routing capabilities with SolidJS","zh":"非常适合需要使用 SolidJS 的高级路由功能的前端代理","ja":"SolidJS を使用した高度なルーティング機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"SolidJS를 사용한 고급 라우팅 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de enrutamiento avanzadas con SolidJS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de routage avancées avec SolidJS","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Routing-Funktionen mit SolidJS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de roteamento avançadas com SolidJS","ru":"Идеально для агентов фронтенда, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности маршрутизации с SolidJS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات التوجيه المتقدمة مع SolidJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define routes using JSX components or config objects, enabling efficient client-side routing with @solidjs/router and supporting lazy loading with solid-js","zh":"赋予代理定义路由的能力，使用 JSX 组件或配置对象，实现 @solidjs/router 和 solid-js 的高效客户端路由，并支持延迟加载","ja":"エージェントが JSX コンポーネントまたは構成オブジェクトを使用してルートを定義する機能を提供し、@solidjs/router と solid-js を使用した効率的なクライアント側ルーティングを実現し、遅延ロードをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 JSX 컴포넌트 또는 구성 개체를 사용하여 라우트를 정의할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 @solidjs/router 및 solid-js를 사용한 효율적인 클라이언트 측 라우팅을 구현하고 지연 로딩을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir rutas utilizando componentes JSX o objetos de configuración, lo que permite un enrutamiento eficiente del lado del cliente con @solidjs/router y admite la carga diferida con solid-js","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des routes à l''aide de composants JSX ou d''objets de configuration, permettant ainsi un routage efficace côté client avec @solidjs/router et prenant en charge le chargement différé avec solid-js","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Routen mithilfe von JSX-Komponenten oder Konfigurationsobjekten zu definieren, was ein effizientes Client-Seitige-Routing mit @solidjs/router und Unterstützung für Lazy-Loading mit solid-js ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir rotas usando componentes JSX ou objetos de configuração, permitindo roteamento eficiente do lado do cliente com @solidjs/router e suportando carregamento lento com solid-js","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять маршруты с использованием компонентов JSX или объектов конфигурации, обеспечивая эффективную маршрутизацию на стороне клиента с @solidjs/router и поддержку ленивой загрузки с solid-js","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعريف المسارات باستخدام مكونات JSX أو كائنات التكوين، وتمكين التوجيه الفعال للجانب العميل مع @solidjs/router ودعم التحميل الكسول مع solid-js"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring component-based routing for complex web applications","Implementing config-based routing for lazy loading optimization","Defining routes with path parameters for dynamic content"],"zh":["为复杂 Web 应用程序配置基于组件的路由","实现基于配置的路由以优化延迟加载","定义带有路径参数的路由以实现动态内容"],"ja":["複雑な Web アプリケーションのコンポーネントベースのルーティングを構成","遅延ロードの最適化のために構成ベースのルーティングを実装","動的コンテンツを実現するためにパスパラメータを持つルートを定義"],"ko":["복잡한 웹 애플리케이션을 위한 컴포넌트 기반 라우팅 구성","지연 로딩 최적화를 위한 구성 기반 라우팅 구현","동적 콘텐츠를 위한 경로 매개변수가 있는 라우트 정의"],"es":["Configuración de enrutamiento basado en componentes para aplicaciones web complejas","Implementación de enrutamiento basado en configuración para la optimización de la carga diferida","Definición de rutas con parámetros de ruta para contenido dinámico"],"fr":["Configuration du routage basé sur les composants pour les applications Web complexes","Mise en œuvre du routage basé sur la configuration pour l''optimisation du chargement différé","Définition des routes avec des paramètres de chemin pour le contenu dynamique"],"de":["Konfiguration von komponentenbasiertem Routing für komplexe Webanwendungen","Implementierung von konfigurationsbasiertem Routing für die Optimierung der Lazy-Loading","Definition von Routen mit Pfadparametern für dynamischen Inhalt"],"pt":["Configurando roteamento baseado em componentes para aplicações web complexas","Implementando roteamento baseado em configuração para otimização de carregamento lento","Definindo rotas com parâmetros de caminho para conteúdo dinâmico"],"ru":["Настройка маршрутизации на основе компонентов для сложных веб-приложений","Реализация маршрутизации на основе конфигурации для оптимизации ленивой загрузки","Определение маршрутов с параметрами пути для динамического контента"],"ar":["تكوين توجيه مكونات لمواقع الويب المعقدة","تنفيذ التوجيه القائم على التكوين لتحسين التحميل الكسول","تحديد المسارات مع معلمات المسار للcontents الديناميكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @solidjs/router and solid-js libraries","Limited to SolidJS framework"],"zh":["需要 @solidjs/router 和 solid-js 库","仅限于 SolidJS 框架"],"ja":["@solidjs/router と solid-js ライブラリが必要","SolidJS フレームワークのみに限定"],"ko":["@solidjs/router 및 solid-js 라이브러리가 필요","SolidJS 프레임워크에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere las bibliotecas @solidjs/router y solid-js","Limitado al marco de trabajo SolidJS"],"fr":["Nécessite les bibliothèques @solidjs/router et solid-js","Limité au framework SolidJS"],"de":["Benötigt die Bibliotheken @solidjs/router und solid-js","Begrenzt auf das SolidJS-Framework"],"pt":["Requer as bibliotecas @solidjs/router e solid-js","Limitado ao framework SolidJS"],"ru":["Требует библиотек @solidjs/router и solid-js","Ограничен фреймворком SolidJS"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبات @solidjs/router و solid-js","محدود بالإطار العمل SolidJS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
