e le frontend et le backend","Utilisation d''Electron, Svelte et Cagent","Création d''exigences de backend","Amélioration de la collaboration entre les équipes"],"de":["Dokumentation von Datenanforderungen","Effektive Kommunikation zwischen Frontend und Backend","Verwendung von Electron, Svelte und Cagent","Erstellung von Backend-Anforderungen","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit zwischen Teams"],"pt":["Documentação de requisitos de dados","Integração com Electron e Svelte","Uso de Cagent para gerenciamento de ativos","Comunicação eficaz entre frontend e backend","Flexibilidade na definição de requisitos"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным","Интеграция с Electron и Svelte","Использование Cagent для управления активами","Эффективная коммуникация между фронтендом и бэкендом","Гибкость в определении требований"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات البيانات","التكامل مع Electron و Svelte","استخدام Cagent لإدارة الأصول","التواصل الفعال بين الواجهة الأمامية والخلفية","المرونة في تعريف المتطلبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发","后端数据需求","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","品牌资产管理","要件管理"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発","バックエンドのデータ要件","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","ブランドアセット管理","要件管理"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발","백엔드 데이터 요구 사항","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","브랜드 자산 관리","요구사항 관리"],"es":["requisitos de backend","frontend developer","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","documentación de datos","comunicación entre frontend y backend"],"fr":["exigences de backend","développeur frontend","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","documentation de données","communication entre le frontend et le backend"],"de":["Backend-Anforderungen","Frontend-Entwickler","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","Dokumentation von Daten","Kommunikation zwischen Frontend und Backend"],"pt":["requisitos de backend","desenvolvimento frontend","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","gerenciamento de ativos","comunicação eficaz"],"ru":["требования бэкенда","фронтенд-разработка","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","управление активами","эффективная коммуникация"],"ar":["متطلبات الخلفية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","إدارة الأصول","التواصل الفعال"]}},"owner":"alchimie-di-circe","repo":"Extractor-desktop-app","repoPath":"alchimie-di-circe/Extractor-desktop-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":"Document frontend data needs for backend developers. Use when frontend needs to communicate API requirements to backend, or user says backend requirements, what data do I need, API requirements, or is describing data needs for a UI.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to re","body":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to render this screen?\n- What actions should the user be able to perform?\n- What business rules affect the UI?\n- What states and errors should I handle?\n\n**You''re requesting, not demanding.** Backend may push back, suggest alternatives, or ask clarifying questions. That''s healthy collaboration.\n\n---\n\n## What You Own vs. What Backend Owns\n\n| Frontend Owns | Backend Owns |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| What data is needed | How data is structured |\n| What actions exist | Endpoint design |\n| UI states to handle | Field names, types |\n| User-facing validation | API conventions |\n| Display requirements | Performance/caching |\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Describe the Feature\n\nBefore listing requirements:\n\n1. **What is this?** — Screen, flow, component\n2. **Who uses it?** — User type, permissions\n3. **What''s the goal?** — What does success look like?\n\n### Step 2: List Data Needs\n\nFor each screen/component, describe:\n\n**Data I need to display:**\n- What information appears on screen?\n- What''s the relationship between pieces?\n- What determines visibility/state?\n\n**Actions user can perform:**\n- What can the user do?\n- What''s the expected outcome?\n- What feedback should they see?\n\n**States I need to handle:**\n- Loading, empty, error, success\n- Edge cases (partial data, expired, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Surface Uncertainties\n\nList what you''re unsure about:\n- Business rules you don''t fully understand\n- Edge cases you''re not sure how to handle\n- Places where you''re guessing\n\n**These invite backend to clarify or push back.**\n\n### Step 4: Leave Room for Discussion\n\nEnd with open questions:\n- \"Would it make sense to...?\"\n- \"Should I expect...?\"\n- \"Is there a simpler way to...?\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nCreate `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Backend Requirements: <Feature Name>\n\n## Context\n[What we''re building, who it''s for, what problem it solves]\n\n## Screens/Components\n\n### <Screen/Component Name>\n**Purpose**: What this screen does\n\n**Data I need to display**:\n- [Description of data piece, not field name]\n- [Another piece]\n- [Relationships between pieces]\n\n**Actions**:\n- [Action description] → [Expected outcome]\n- [Another action] → [Expected outcome]\n\n**States to handle**:\n- **Empty**: [When/why this happens]\n- **Loading**: [What''s being fetched]\n- **Error**: [What can go wrong, what user sees]\n- **Special**: [Any edge cases]\n\n**Business rules affecting UI**:\n- [Rule that changes what''s visible/enabled]\n- [Permissions that affect actions]\n\n### <Next Screen/Component>\n...\n\n## Uncertainties\n- [ ] Not sure if [X] should show when [Y]\n- [ ] Don''t understand the business rule for [Z]\n- [ ] Guessing that [A] means [B]\n\n## Questions for Backend\n- Would it make sense to combine [X] and [Y]?\n- Should I expect [Z] to always be present?\n- Is there existing data I can reuse for [W]?\n\n## Discussion Log\n[Backend responses, decisions made, changes to requirements]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Good vs. Bad Requests\n\n### Bad (Dictating Implementation)\n> \"I need a GET /api/contracts endpoint that returns an array with fields: id, title, status, created_at\"\n\n### Good (Describing Needs)\n> \"I need to show a list of contracts. Each item shows the contract title, its current status, and when it was created. User should be able to filter by status.\"\n\n### Bad (Assuming Structure)\n> \"The provider object should be nested inside the contract response\"\n\n### Good (Describing Relationship)\n> \"For each contract, I need to show who the provider is (their name and maybe logo)\"\n\n### Bad (No Context)\n> \"I need contract data\"\n\n### Good (With Context)\n> \"On the dashboard, there''s a ''Recent Contracts'' widget showing the 5 most recent contracts. User clicks one to go to detail page.\"\n\n---\n\n## Encouraging Pushback\n\nInclude these prompts in your requirements:\n\n- \"Let me know if this doesn''t make sense for how the data is structured\"\n- \"Open to suggestions on a better approach\"\n- \"Not sure if this is the right way to think about it\"\n- \"Push back if this complicates things unnecessarily\"\n\n**Good collaboration = frontend describes the problem, backend proposes the solution.**\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NO IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS**—don''t specify endpoints, methods, field names\n- **DESCRIBE, DON''T PRESCRIBE**—say what you need, not how to provide it\n- **INCLUDE CONTEXT**—why you need it helps backend make better choices\n- **SURFACE UNKNOWNS**—don''t hide confusion, invite clarification\n- **INVITE PUSHBACK**—explicitly ask for backend''s input\n- **UPDATE THE DOC**—add backend responses to Discussion Log\n- **STAY HUMBLE**—you''re asking, not demanding\n\n---\n\n## After Backend Responds\n\nUpdate the requirements doc:\n1. Add responses to Discussion Log\n2. Adjust requirements based on feedback\n3. Mark resolved uncertainties\n4. Note any decisions made\n\nThe doc becomes the source of truth for what was agreed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:39:21.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing seamless frontend-to-backend communication for Electron and Svelte applications","zh":"适合需要无缝前端到后端通信的全栈代理，特别是Electron和Svelte应用","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがElectronおよびSvelteアプリケーションでフロントエンドからバックエンドへのシームレスなコミュニケーションを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"전체 스택 에이전트가 Electron 및 Svelte 애플리케이션에서 프론트엔드에서 백엔드로의 무결점 통신을 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan una comunicación sin problemas del frontend al backend para aplicaciones de Electron y Svelte","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''une communication fluide du frontend au backend pour les applications Electron et Svelte","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Kommunikation vom Frontend zum Backend für Electron- und Svelte-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de comunicação sem interrupções do frontend para o backend para aplicações Electron e Svelte","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым требуется бесперебойная связь между frontend и backend для приложений Electron и Svelte","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملين الذين يحتاجون إلى اتصال بدون انقطاع من الجزء الأمامي إلى الجزء الخلفي لتطبيقات Electron و Svelte"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to effectively document frontend data needs using Markdown, generating backend requirements in `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files, and leveraging Cagent brand asset management apps without worrying about implementation details like endpoints or API structures","zh":"赋予代理有效记录前端数据需求的能力，使用Markdown生成后端需求，在`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`文件中，并利用Cagent品牌资产管理应用程序，而无需担心诸如端点或API结构等实现细节","ja":"エージェントがフロントエンドのデータ要件を効果的に文書化できるようにし、Markdownを使用して`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`ファイルにバックエンドの要件を生成し、Cagentブランドのアセット管理アプリを使用することで、エンドポイントやAPI構造などの実装の詳細を心配することなく","ko":"프론트엔드 데이터 요구 사항을 효과적으로 문서화하고 Markdown를 사용하여 `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` 파일에 백엔드 요구 사항을 생성하며 Cagent 브랜드 자산 관리 애플리케이션을 사용하여 엔드포인트 또는 API 구조などの 구현 세부 정보를 걱정하지 않도록 에이전트에게 권한을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a documentar eficazmente las necesidades de datos del frontend utilizando Markdown, generando requisitos de backend en archivos `.claude/docs/ai/<nombre-de-característica>/backend-requirements.md` y aprovechando aplicaciones de gestión de activos de marca Cagent sin preocuparse por detalles de implementación como puntos de conexión o estructuras de API","fr":"Permet aux agents de documenter efficacement les besoins de données du frontend en utilisant Markdown, en générant des exigences de backend dans des fichiers `.claude/docs/ai/<nom-de-fonctionnalité>/backend-requirements.md` et en exploitant les applications de gestion d''actifs de marque Cagent sans se soucier des détails d''implémentation tels que les points de terminaison ou les structures d''API","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Datennutzung des Frontends effektiv mit Markdown zu dokumentieren, Back-end-Anforderungen in Dateien `.claude/docs/ai/<funktionsname>/backend-requirements.md` zu erstellen und Cagent-Markenverwaltungs-Apps ohne Sorge um Implementierungsdetails wie Endpunkte oder API-Strukturen zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a documentar efetivamente as necessidades de dados do frontend usando Markdown, gerando requisitos de backend em arquivos `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` e aproveitando aplicativos de gerenciamento de ativos da marca Cagent sem se preocupar com detalhes de implementação como endpoints ou estruturas de API","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно документировать потребности frontend в данных с помощью Markdown, генерируя требования к backend в файлах `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` и использует приложения для управления брендом Cagent без беспокойства о деталях реализации, таких как конечные точки или структуры API","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توثيق احتياجات البيانات الأمامية بشكل فعال باستخدام Markdown ، وتوليد متطلبات الخلفية في ملفات `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` ، واستخدام تطبيقات إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية Cagent دون القلق بشأن تفاصيل التنفيذ مثل النقاط النهائية أو بنية واجهة البرنامج"},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting data requirements for Electron apps","Generating backend requirements for Svelte projects","Communicating frontend needs to backend teams using standardized Markdown files"],"zh":["记录Electron应用的数据要求","为Svelte项目生成后端要求","使用标准化的Markdown文件将前端需求与后端团队进行沟通"],"ja":["Electronアプリのデータ要件を文書化する","Svelteプロジェクトのバックエンド要件を生成する","標準化されたMarkdownファイルを使用して、フロントエンドの要件をバックエンドチームに伝達する"],"ko":["Electron 애플리케이션의 데이터 요구 사항을 문서화","Svelte 프로젝트의 백엔드 요구 사항을 생성","표준화된 Markdown 파일을 사용하여 프론트엔드 요구 사항을 백엔드 팀에 전달"],"es":["Documentar las necesidades de datos para aplicaciones de Electron","Generar requisitos de backend para proyectos de Svelte","Comunicar las necesidades del frontend a los equipos de backend utilizando archivos de Markdown estandarizados"],"fr":["Documenter les besoins de données pour les applications Electron","Générer des exigences de backend pour les projets Svelte","Communiquer les besoins du frontend aux équipes de backend en utilisant des fichiers Markdown standardisés"],"de":["Dokumentation der Datennutzung für Electron-Anwendungen","Erstellung von Back-end-Anforderungen für Svelte-Projekte","Kommunikation der Frontend-Anforderungen an die Back-end-Teams unter Verwendung standardisierter Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Documentação de requisitos de dados para aplicativos Electron","Geração de requisitos de backend para projetos Svelte","Comunicação de necessidades do frontend para equipes de backend usando arquivos Markdown padronizados"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным для приложений Electron","Генерация требований к backend для проектов Svelte","Передача потребностей frontend командам backend с помощью стандартизированных файлов Markdown"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات البيانات لتطبيقات Electron","توليد متطلبات الخلفية لمشاريع Svelte","التفاعل مع احتياجات الجزء الأمامي إلى فرق الخلفية باستخدام ملفات Markdown المعيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["No implementation details allowed in documentation","Requires adherence to specific documentation format in `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files","Focused on what data is needed, not how it is implemented"],"zh":["文档中不允许包含实现细节","要求遵循`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`文件中的特定文档格式","关注于需要什么数据，而不是如何实现"],"ja":["文書化では実装の詳細を含めることはできない","`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`ファイルに特定の文書化形式に従う必要がある","何のデータが必要かではなく、どのように実装するかという点に焦点を当てる"],"ko":["문서에는 구현 세부 정보를 포함할 수 없음","`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` 파일의 특정 문서화 형식에 따라야 함","데이터가 필요한지 여부에 초점을 맞추지 말고 구현 방법에 초점을 맞추어야 함"],"es":["No se permiten detalles de implementación en la documentación","Requiere la adhesión a un formato de documentación específico en archivos `.claude/docs/ai/<nombre-de-característica>/backend-requirements.md`","Se centra en qué datos son necesarios, no en cómo se implementan"],"fr":["Aucun détail d''implémentation n''est autorisé dans la documentation","Exige l''adhesion à un format de documentation spécifique dans des fichiers `.claude/docs/ai/<nom-de-fonctionnalité>/backend-requirements.md`","Se concentre sur les données nécessaires, et non sur la façon dont elles sont mises en œuvre"],"de":["In der Dokumentation sind keine Implementierungsdetails erlaubt","Erfordert die Einhaltung eines bestimmten Dokumentationsformats in Dateien `.claude/docs/ai/<funktionsname>/backend-requirements.md`","Konzentriert sich auf die benötigten Daten, nicht auf deren Implementierung"],"pt":["Não são permitidos detalhes de implementação na documentação","Exige aderência a um formato de documentação específico em arquivos `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Focado no que os dados são necessários, não em como são implementados"],"ru":["В документации не допускаются детали реализации","Требуется соблюдение специфического формата документации в файлах `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Сосредоточен на том, какие данные необходимы, а не на том, как они реализуются"],"ar":["لا يسمح بتفاصيل التنفيذ في Tài liệu","يتطلب الالتزام بتنسيق محدد للتوثيق في ملفات `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","يركز على ما هي البيانات المطلوبة ، وليس على كيفية تنفيذها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Sologa/codex-pipeline/denario', 'community', 'Sologa', 'codex-pipeline', 'Sologa/codex-pipeline', 'denario', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:39:25.274Z', NULL, '{"id":"Sologa/codex-pipeline/denario","name":"denario","description":{"zh":"Denario是一种多智能体AI系统，用于自动化科学研究工作流，包括数据分析、假设生成、方法开发和论文撰写","ja":"Denarioは、データ分析、仮説の生成、方法の開発、論文の作成を含む科学研究ワークフローを自動化するマルチエージェントAIシステムです","ko":"Denario는 데이터 분석, 가설 생성, 방법 개발 및 논문 작성 등을 포함한 과학 연구 워크플로를 자동화하는 멀티 에이전트 AI 시스템입니다","es":"Denario es un sistema de IA multiagente que automatiza flujos de trabajo de investigación científica. Genera hipótesis, desarrolla metodologías y analiza datos","fr":"Denario est un système d''IA multiagent qui automatise les flux de travail de recherche scientifique. Il génère des hypothèses, développe des méthodologies et analyse des données","de":"Denario ist ein multiagentes KI-System, das wissenschaftliche Forschungsprozesse automatisiert. Es generiert Hypothesen, entwickelt Methoden und analysiert Daten","pt":"Denario é um sistema de inteligência artificial multiagente projetado para automatizar fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica. Ele orquestra vários agentes especializados para lidar com geração de hipóteses, desenvolvimento de metodologia, análise computacional e redação de artigos","ru":"Denario - это многоагентная система искусственного интеллекта, предназначенная для автоматизации потоков научных исследований. Она координирует работу нескольких специализированных агентов для обработки генерации гипотез, разработки методологии, компьютерного анализа и написания статей","ar":"ديناريو هو نظام ذكاء اصطناعي متعدد الوكلاء مصمم لتوفير سير عمل البحث العلمي. وهو يرتبط مع العديد من الوكلاء المتخصصين لمعالجة توليد الفرضيات، وتطوير المنهجية، والتحليل الحاسوبي، وكتابه المقالات","en":"研究 codex 使用 skill 生成 survey 這件事"},"seo":{"ti