","ru":"Обновить Все: Оптимизация Зависимостей","ar":"تحديث كل شيء: تحسين الإعتماديات","en":"update-everything"},"description":{"zh":"update-everything 技术用于更新 workspace 中的依赖关系，验证 linting、builds 和测试，并捕获和总结警告和弃用信息","ja":"update-everything 技術は、ワークスペース内の依存関係を更新し、linting、ビルド、テストを検証し、警告と廃止予定の情報を捕捉して要約する","ko":"update-everything 기술은 workspace 의존성을 업데이트하고 linting, 빌드, 테스트를 확인하며 경고와 사용 중단 정보를 캡처하고 요약","es":"Actualiza todas las dependencias en tu espacio de trabajo y verifica la linting, los builds y las pruebas. Captura y resume advertencias y deprecaciones.","fr":"Met à jour toutes les dépendances dans votre espace de travail et vérifiez la linting, les builds et les tests. Capturez et résumez les avertissements et les...","de":"Aktualisiert alle Abhängigkeiten in Ihrem Arbeitsbereich und überprüft die Linting, Builds und Tests. Erfasst und fasst Warnungen und Veraltungen zusammen.","pt":"O skill update-everything atualiza todas as dependências no workspace, verifica linting, builds e testes e captura advertências e depreciações.","ru":"Умение update-everything обновляет все зависимости в workspace, проверяет linting, builds и тесты и фиксирует предупреждения и устаревшие версии.","ar":"المهارة update-everything تحديث جميع الإعتماديات في مساحة العمل وتراقب linting و builds واختبارات وتسجل تحذيرات وإلغاء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["更新 workspace 中的依赖关系","验证 linting、builds 和测试","捕获和总结警告和弃用信息","支持 nvm 安装和使用","确保项目的稳定性和安全性"],"ja":["ワークスペース内の依存関係を更新","linting、ビルド、テストを検証","警告と廃止予定の情報を捕捉して要約","nvm のインストールと使用をサポート","プロジェクトの安定性とセキュリティを確保"],"ko":["workspace 의존성을 업데이트","linting, 빌드, 테스트 확인","경고와 사용 중단 정보 캡처 및 요약","nvm 설치 및 사용 지원","프로젝트의 안정성과 보안 유지"],"es":["Actualiza dependencias","Verifica linting","Verifica builds","Verifica tests","Captura advertencias","Resume deprecaciones"],"fr":["Met à jour les dépendances","Vérifie la linting","Vérifie les builds","Vérifie les tests","Capture les avertissements","Résumé des dépréciations"],"de":["Aktualisiert Abhängigkeiten","Überprüft Linting","Überprüft Builds","Überprüft Tests","Erfasst Warnungen","Zusammenfassung von Veraltungen"],"pt":["Atualização de dependências","Verificação de linting","Verificação de builds","Verificação de testes","Captura de advertências e depreciações"],"ru":["Обновление зависимостей","Проверка linting","Проверка builds","Проверка тестов","Фиксация предупреждений и устаревших версий"],"ar":["تحديث الإعتماديات","فحص linting","فحص builds","فحص اختبارات","تسجيل تحذيرات وإلغاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["update-everything","workspace 依赖更新","代码验证","linting","builds","测试","nvm","项目稳定性","代码安全"],"ja":["update-everything","ワークスペースの依存関係の更新","コードの検証","linting","ビルド","テスト","nvm","プロジェクトの安定性","コードのセキュリティ"],"ko":["update-everything","workspace 의존성 업데이트","코드 검증","linting","빌드","테스트","nvm","프로젝트 안정성","코드 보안"],"es":["actualizar dependencias","verificar linting","verificar builds","verificar tests","capturar advertencias","resumen de deprecaciones","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["mettre à jour les dépendances","vérifier la linting","vérifier les builds","vérifier les tests","capturer les avertissements","résumé des dépréciations","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Abhängigkeiten aktualisieren","Linting überprüfen","Builds überprüfen","Tests überprüfen","Warnungen erfassen","Zusammenfassung von Veraltungen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["atualizar dependências","verificar linting","verificar builds","verificar testes","capturar advertências","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de código"],"ru":["обновить зависимости","проверить linting","проверить builds","проверить тесты","фиксация предупреждений","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация кода"],"ar":["تحديث الإعتماديات","فحص linting","فحص builds","فحص اختبارات","تسجيل تحذيرات","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الكود"]}},"owner":"a2f0","repo":"tearleads","repoPath":"a2f0/tearleads","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update-everything","description":"Update all dependencies across the repo (including Ruby/iOS/Android), fix lint/type/test issues, and prepare the PR for merge.","bodyPreview":"# Update Everything\n\nUpdate all dependencies in the workspace (especially under `packages/`) and verify linting, builds, and tests. Capture and summarize warnings/deprecations.\n\n## Preflight\n\n- Confirm you are not on `main`; create/switch branches before running updates.\n- Start from a clean `git status` or note existing changes so you do not clobber them.\n- `nvm` must be available in an interactive shell PATH; if missing, stop and report the blocker.\n- Run `nvm install && nvm use` to match `.nv","body":"# Update Everything\n\nUpdate all dependencies in the workspace (especially under `packages/`) and verify linting, builds, and tests. Capture and summarize warnings/deprecations.\n\n## Preflight\n\n- Confirm you are not on `main`; create/switch branches before running updates.\n- Start from a clean `git status` or note existing changes so you do not clobber them.\n- `nvm` must be available in an interactive shell PATH; if missing, stop and report the blocker.\n- Run `nvm install && nvm use` to match `.nvmrc`.\n- Never install or update Node with Homebrew in this workflow.\n- Ensure platform tooling is available (pnpm, bundler, CocoaPods, Android SDK). If something is missing, continue where possible and flag the gap in the final summary.\n\n## Workflow\n\nUse the shared script to perform the standard update flow:\n\n```bash\n./scripts/updateEverything.sh\n```\n\nThis now includes `nvm install && nvm use` (hard-fails if `nvm` is unavailable) and an automatic toolchain sync step before dependency updates.\n\nOptional toggles (set to `1` as needed): `SKIP_TOOLCHAIN_SYNC`, `SKIP_TOOLCHAIN_NODE`, `SKIP_TOOLCHAIN_ANDROID`, `SKIP_RUBY`, `SKIP_CAP_SYNC`, `SKIP_POD_CLEAN`, `SKIP_MAESTRO`, `SKIP_TESTS`, `SKIP_BUILD`, `SKIP_LINT`, `SKIP_UPDATE`, `SKIP_INSTALL`.\n\nAdditional toolchain controls:\n\n- `TOOLCHAIN_SYNC_MAX_ANDROID_JUMP=<n>`: limit Android API-level bump in one run (default: `1`)\n- `TOOLCHAIN_SYNC_ALLOW_RUNTIME_MISMATCH=1`: continue even when active `node` runtime differs from updated `.nvmrc`\n\nScript exits early on dependency hygiene checks—fix then rerun:\n\n- Caret/tilde ranges in `dependencies`/`devDependencies` are blocked. Pin versions where reported.\n- Pinned `peerDependencies` must match `packages/client/package.json` versions. Align the peer versions to the client version before rerunning.\n- `@capacitor/*` versions in `packages/client/package.json` must match the resolved versions in `packages/client/ios/App/Podfile.lock` (when present). Align and rerun sync/pod install if mismatched.\n\n## Automatic Toolchain Sync\n\n`./scripts/updateEverything.sh` runs `./scripts/syncToolchainVersions.sh --apply` before package updates:\n\n1. **Node/Electron**: reads `electron` from `packages/client/package.json`, resolves its bundled Node version from `https://releases.electronjs.org/releases.json`, then aligns:\n   - `.nvmrc`\n   - `package.json` `engines.node`\n2. **Android SDK levels**: reads latest stable platform API from `https://dl.google.com/android/repository/repository2-1.xml`, then bumps:\n   - `packages/client/android/variables.gradle` `compileSdkVersion`\n   - `packages/client/android/variables.gradle` `targetSdkVersion`\n3. **Ansible playbooks**: uses the Node major version from step 1 (or falls back to `.nvmrc`) to align:\n   - `ansible/playbooks/main.yml` `nodejs_major_version`\n   - `ansible/playbooks/tuxedo.yml` `nodejs_major_version`\n\nGuardrails:\n\n- Android bumps are capped by `TOOLCHAIN_SYNC_MAX_ANDROID_JUMP` to avoid large blind jumps.\n- If Node files are updated and active runtime does not match `.nvmrc`, the toolchain script exits so you can run `nvm use` and rerun.\n\n## Fastlane and Ruby Gems Update\n\nFastlane and other Ruby gems should be updated as part of the dependency update process:\n\n```bash\ncd packages/client\nbundle update fastlane\n```\n\nTo update all gems (not just fastlane):\n\n```bash\ncd packages/client\nbundle update\n```\n\n**When to update fastlane**: Always check for fastlane updates when:\n\n- Running a full dependency update\n- Encountering App Store Connect API errors\n- Seeing deprecation warnings from fastlane actions\n\n**Verify the update**: After updating, run a dry-run to ensure fastlane still works:\n\n```bash\ncd packages/client\nbundle exec fastlane ios build_release --dry_run\n```\n\n**Important**: The `Gemfile.lock` must be committed along with other dependency changes.\n\n## Node.js Version Alignment (Electron)\n\nNode alignment is now automatic via toolchain sync. For manual fallback, when updating `electron`, align Node.js versions:\n\n1. Check Electron''s bundled Node.js version at <https://releases.electronjs.org/>.\n2. Update `.nvmrc` to match (e.g., `v22.21.1`).\n3. Update `engines.node` in `package.json` to the same major range (e.g., `>=22.21.1 <23`).\n\n## Gradle Wrapper Update\n\nOnly if a new Gradle version is available:\n\n1. Edit `packages/client/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties`.\n2. Update `distributionUrl` (e.g., `gradle-8.12-all.zip`).\n3. Delete the existing JAR: `rm packages/client/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar`.\n4. Run `./packages/client/scripts/downloadGradleWrapper.sh`.\n5. Validate: `cd packages/client/android && ./gradlew assembleDebug`.\n\n## Native Module Rebuilds\n\nWhen updating packages with native Node.js addons (e.g., `better-sqlite3-multiple-ciphers`), they may need rebuilding. Symptoms:\n\n```text\nError: The module ''better_sqlite3.node'' was compiled against NODE_MODULE_VERSION 143.\nThis version of Node.js requires NODE_MODULE_VERSION 127.\n```\n\nFix by rebuilding the module:\n\n```bash\ncd packages/cli\nnpm rebuild better-sqlite3-multiple-ciphers\n```\n\nThe client package runs `electron-rebuild` via postinstall, but CLI uses system Node and may need manual rebuild.\n\n## Biome Schema Migration\n\nWhen biome is updated, migrate the schema:\n\n```bash\npnpm biome migrate --write\n```\n\n## pdfjs-dist and react-pdf Version Coupling\n\n**CRITICAL**: `pdfjs-dist` must match the version expected by `react-pdf`. Check with:\n\n```bash\ncat packages/client/node_modules/react-pdf/package.json | grep ''\"pdfjs-dist\"''\n```\n\nIf versions differ, revert pdfjs-dist to match react-pdf''s dependency. The update script should NOT update pdfjs-dist independently.\n\n## Researching Breaking Changes\n\nAfter updates, review changelogs for major version bumps:\n\n1. **Check pnpm output** for deprecated subdependencies (transitive - usually not actionable)\n2. **Review GitHub releases** for direct deps:\n   - Capacitor plugins: <https://github.com/ionic-team/capacitor-plugins/releases>\n   - Biome: <https://github.com/biomejs/biome/releases>\n   - pdfjs-dist: <https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/releases>\n   - i18next: <https://github.com/i18next/i18next/releases>\n3. **Document deprecations** in the PR for future reference\n\n## Known Acceptable Warnings\n\nThese warnings are expected and do not require action:\n\n- **electron-builder peer dependency mismatches**: Internal conflicts between `dmg-builder`/`electron-builder-squirrel-windows` tracked upstream\n- **Deprecated transitive dependencies**: `glob`, `rimraf`, `inflight` etc. are deep deps resolved when upstream updates\n\n## Drizzle-ORM Peer Dependency Conflicts\n\nWhen `drizzle-orm` is used across multiple packages, its optional peer dependencies (like `sql.js`) can resolve to different versions. This causes TypeScript errors like:\n\n```text\nTypes have separate declarations of a private property ''shouldInlineParams''.\nType ''SQL<unknown>'' is not assignable to type ''SQL<unknown>''.\n```\n\n**Diagnosis**: Run `pnpm why sql.js --recursive` to see version mismatches.\n\n**Fix**: Add a pnpm override in root `package.json`:\n\n```json\n\"pnpm\": {\n  \"overrides\": {\n    \"sql.js\": \"1.14.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen run `pnpm install` to apply.\n\n## Known Flaky CI Issues\n\nSome CI failures are transient infrastructure issues:\n\n### Android Instrumented Tests Packaging\n\n`capacitor-community-sqlite:packageDebugAndroidTest` may fail with `PackageAndroidArtifact$IncrementalSplitterRunnable` error. **Fix**: Rerun workflow (Gradle cache issue).\n\n### PDF Worker E2E Tests\n\nPDF loading tests may timeout after pdfjs-dist updates (shows \"Loading...\" instead of \"Page 1 of\"). **Fix**: Check for version mismatch with react-pdf - see \"pdfjs-dist and react-pdf Version Coupling\" section.\n\n### iOS Maestro \"App crashed or stopped\" Across Random Flows\n\niOS Maestro may fail with:\n\n```text\nApp crashed or stopped while executing flow\n```\n\nThe failing flow can vary (`database-reset-setup`, `sync-login-landscape-keyboard`, `orphan-cleanup`, etc.). In `maestro.log`, this often appears as:\n\n```text\nXCTestDriver request failed ... \"Application com.tearleads.app is not running\"\n```\n\nimmediately after `Launch app \"com.tearleads.app\" with clear state`.\n\n**Fix**:\n\n1. Rerun only the failed iOS Maestro workflow/job.\n2. If `CI Gate` already failed due to that first attempt, rerun `CI Gate` after the iOS rerun is green.\n\n## Warnings/Deprecations\n\nCollect warnings/deprecations from `pnpm`, bundler, CocoaPods, Gradle, and test runs. Summarize them in the final response along with any required follow-ups.\n\n## Finish\n\n- Review changes with `git status` and `git diff`.\n- **Verify `packages/client/ios/App/Podfile.lock` is staged** if iOS dependencies changed (the script regenerates it via `pod install`).\n- Commit and push using `$commit-and-push`.\n- Prepare the PR for merging using `$enter-merge-queue`.\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nThe update script and its sub-commands produce thousands of lines of output. Suppress stdout where only the exit code matters:\n\n```bash\n# Suppress verbose output - only show errors\n./scripts/updateEverything.sh >/dev/null\n\n# Or capture to file for debugging later\n./scripts/updateEverything.sh > /tmp/update.log 2>&1\n```\n\nWhen running individual commands manually:\n\n```bash\npnpm install >/dev/null\npnpm build >/dev/null\npnpm test:coverage >/dev/null\nbundle install >/dev/null\npod install --repo-update >/dev/null\n./gradlew assembleDebug >/dev/null\n```\n\nOn failure, stderr is preserved. Re-run without suppression to debug.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:39:33.899Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated dependency updates and linting verification.","zh":"非常适合需要自动依赖更新和linting验证的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動依存関係更新とlintingの検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 종속성 업데이트와 linting 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan actualizaciones de dependencias automatizadas y verificación de linting.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant des mises à jour de dépendances automatisées et une vérification de linting.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die automatisierte Abhängigkeitsaktualisierungen und Linting-Verifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated dependency updates and linting verification.","ru":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated dependency updates and linting verification.","ar":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated dependency updates and linting verification."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update all dependencies in the workspace, verify linting, builds, and tests, and capture warnings and deprecations using nvm and git, ensuring a clean and up-to-date codebase with interactive shell PATH availability.","zh":"赋予代理更新工作区中的所有依赖项、验证linting、构建和测试，并使用nvm和git捕获警告和弃用通知，确保代码库干净且最新，并具有交互式shell PATH可用性。","ja":"エージェントにワークスペース内のすべての依存関係を更新し、linting、ビルド、テストを検証し、nvmとgitを使用して警告と非推奨通知をキャプチャする機能を提供し、コードベースをクリーンに保ち、最新の状態にしておき、インタラクティブシェルのPATHが利用可能になる。","ko":"에이전트가 작업공간의 모든 종속성을 업데이트하고 linting, 빌드 및 테스트를 확인하며 nvm 및 git를 사용하여 경고 및 사용 중단 알림을 캡처하여 코드베이스를 깨끗하고 최신 상태로 유지하며 대화형 셸 PATH가 사용 가능하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a actualizar todas las dependencias en el espacio de trabajo, verificar linting, compilaciones y pruebas, y capturar advertencias y deprecaciones utilizando nvm y git, asegurando una base de código limpia y actualizada con disponibilidad de ruta de shell interactivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour toutes les dépendances dans l''espace de travail, de vérifier le linting, les constructions et les tests, et de capturer les avertissements et les dépréciations en utilisant nvm et git, garantissant une base de code propre et à jour avec une disponibilité de chemin de shell interactif.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, alle Abhängigkeiten im Arbeitsbereich zu aktualisieren, Linting, Builds und Tests zu überprüfen und Warnungen und Veraltungen mit nvm und git zu erfassen, um eine saubere und aktuelle Codebasis mit interaktiver Shell-Pfadverfügbarkeit sicherzustellen.","pt":"Empowers agents to update all dependencies in the workspace, verify linting, builds, and tests, and capture warnings and deprecations using nvm and git, ensuring a clean and up-to-date codebase with interactive shell PATH availability.","ru":"Empowers agents to update all dependencies in the workspace, verify linting, builds, and tests, and capture warnings and deprecations using nvm and git, ensuring a clean and up-to-date codebase with interactive shell PATH availability.","ar":"Empowers agents to update all dependencies in the workspace, verify linting, builds, and tests, and capture warnings and deprecations using nvm and git, ensuring a clean and up-to-date codebase with interactive shell PATH availability."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dependency updates under packages/","Verifying linting and builds for workspace consistency","Debugging warnings and deprecations in the codebase"],"zh":["在packages/下自动执行依赖更新","验证工作区的一致性linting和构建","调试代码库中的警告和弃用"],"ja":["packages/以下で依存関係を自動更新する","ワークスペースの整合性をlintingとビルドで検証する","コードベース内の警告と非推奨をデバッグする"],"ko":["packages/ 아래에서 종속성을 자동으로 업데이트함","작업공간의 일관성을 linting 및 빌드로 확인함","코드베이스 내의 경고 및 사용 중단을 디버깅함"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de dependencias bajo packages/","Verificar linting y compilaciones para la coherencia del espacio de trabajo","Depurar advertencias y deprecaciones en la base de código"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de dépendances sous packages/","Vérifier le linting et les constructions pour la cohérence de l''espace de travail","Déboguer les avertissements et les dépréciations dans la base de code"],"de":["Automatisieren von Abhängigkeitsaktualisierungen unter packages/","Überprüfen von Linting und Builds für die Konsistenz des Arbeitsbereichs","Debuggen von Warnungen und Veraltungen in der Codebasis"],"pt":["Automating dependency updates under packages/","Verifying linting and builds for workspace consistency","Debugging warnings and deprecations in the codebase"],"ru":["Automating dependency updates under packages/","Verifying linting and builds for workspace consistency","Debugging warnings and deprecations in the codebase"],"ar":["Automating dependency updates under packages/","Verifying linting and builds for workspace consistency","Debugging warnings and deprecations in the codebase"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires nvm availability in interactive shell PATH","Needs a clean git status or noted existing changes","Must not be run on the main branch"],"zh":["需要交互式shell PATH中有nvm可用","需要干净的git状态或已记录的现有更改","不能在主分支上运行"],"ja":["インタラクティブシェルのPATHにnvmを利用可能にする必要がある","クリーンなgitの状態、または既存の変更を記録する必要がある","メインブランチ上では実行できない"],"ko":["대화형 셸 PATH에서 nvm을 사용할 수 있어야 함","깨끗한 git 상태 또는 기록된 기존 변경이 필요함","메인 브랜치에서 실행할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere la disponibilidad de nvm en la ruta de shell interactivo","Necesita un estado de git limpio o cambios existentes anotados","No debe ejecutarse en la rama principal"],"fr":["Nécessite la disponibilité de nvm dans le chemin de shell interactif","A besoin d''un état de git propre ou de modifications existantes notées","Ne doit pas être exécuté sur la branche principale"],"de":["Erfordert die Verfügbarkeit von nvm im interaktiven Shell-Pfad","Benötigt einen sauberen Git-Status oder angezeigte vorhandene Änderungen","Darf nicht im Hauptzweig ausgeführt werden"],"pt":["Requires nvm availability in interactive shell PATH","Needs a clean git status or noted existing changes","Must not be run on the main branch"],"ru":["Requires nvm availability in interactive shell PATH","Needs a clean git status or noted existing changes","Must not be run on the main branch"],"ar":["Requires nvm availability in interactive shell PATH","Needs a clean git status or noted existing changes","Must not be run on the main branch"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
