ungen","Referenzen","Zitierdichte","Inhalts-Gesundheit"],"pt":["Pipeline Auditor","análise de conteúdo","qualidade de conteúdo","vazamento de placeholders","drift de escopo de citação","densidade de citação","regressão","survey","deep"],"ru":["Пайплайн-аудитор","анализ контента","качество контента","утечка плейсхолдеров","дрейф цитаты","плотность цитаты","регрессия","survey","deep"],"ar":["مراجع الأنابيب","تحليل المحتوى","جودة المحتوى","تسرب المحتوى المقرر","漂خانه المراجع","كثافة المراجع","الانحدار","survey","deep"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pipeline-auditor","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Pipeline Auditor (draft audit + regression)\n\nPurpose: a deterministic “regression test” for the writing stage.\n\nIt answers:\n- did we leak placeholders or planner talk?\n- did citation scope drift?\n- did the draft fall back to generator voice (navigation/narration templates)?\n- is citation density/health sufficient for a survey-like draft?\n\nThis skill is analysis-only. It does not edit content. For `survey`/`deep`, style/citation-shape violations are blocking by default.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `output/DR","body":"# Pipeline Auditor (draft audit + regression)\n\nPurpose: a deterministic “regression test” for the writing stage.\n\nIt answers:\n- did we leak placeholders or planner talk?\n- did citation scope drift?\n- did the draft fall back to generator voice (navigation/narration templates)?\n- is citation density/health sufficient for a survey-like draft?\n\nThis skill is analysis-only. It does not edit content. For `survey`/`deep`, style/citation-shape violations are blocking by default.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `output/DRAFT.md`\n- `outline/outline.yml`\n- Optional (recommended):\n  - `outline/evidence_bindings.jsonl`\n  - `citations/ref.bib`\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `output/AUDIT_REPORT.md`\n\n## What it checks (deterministic)\n\nA150++ citation targets (used by the auditor):\n- Per-H3: >=12 unique citations (deep: >=14).\n- Global: >=150 unique citations across the full draft (recommended target: 165; deep floor: 165).\n\n- Placeholder leakage: ellipsis (`...`, `…`), TODO markers, scaffold tags.\n- Outline alignment: section/subsection order vs `outline/outline.yml`.\n- Survey tables (survey deliverable): require >=2 Markdown tables in the merged draft (index tables live in `outline/tables_index.md`) (inserted by `section-merger` from `outline/tables_appendix.md`).\n- Paper voice anti-patterns:\n  - narration templates (`This subsection ...`, `In this subsection ...`)\n  - slide navigation (`Next, we move ...`, `We now turn to ...`)\n  - pipeline voice (`this run`, “pipeline/stage/workspace” in prose)\n- Evidence-policy disclaimer spam: repeated “abstract-only/title-only/provisional” boilerplate inside H3 bodies.\n- Meta survey-guidance phrasing: `survey synthesis/comparisons should ...`.\n- Synthesis stem repetition: repeated `Taken together, ...` and similar high-signal generator stems.\n- Numeric claim context: numbers without minimal evaluation context tokens (benchmark/dataset/metric/budget/cost).\n- Citation health (if `citations/ref.bib` exists): undefined keys, duplicates, basic formatting red flags.\n- Citation-shape hard gate (`survey`/`deep`): no adjacent citation blocks (`[@a] [@b]`), no duplicate keys inside one block (`[@a; @a]`), and per-H3 mid-sentence citation ratio >=30%.\n- Citation scope (if `outline/evidence_bindings.jsonl` exists): citations used per H3 should stay within the bound evidence set.\n\n## How to use the report (routing table)\n\nTreat `output/AUDIT_REPORT.md` as a “what to fix next” router.\n\nCommon FAIL families -> responsible stage/skill:\n\n- Placeholders / leaked scaffolds\n  - Fix: C2–C4 artifacts are not clean. Route to `subsection-briefs` / `evidence-draft` / `writer-context-pack`, then rewrite affected sections.\n\n- Missing overview tables (draft has <2 tables)\n  - Fix: ensure `table-schema` + `appendix-table-writer` produced `outline/tables_appendix.md` (>=2 tables, citation-backed, no placeholders), then rerun `section-merger` (tables insert as an Appendix block by default).\n\n- Planner talk in transitions / narrator bridges\n  - Fix: rerun `transition-weaver` (and ensure briefs include `bridge_terms` / `contrast_hook`), then re-merge.\n\n- Narration templates / slide navigation inside H3\n  - Fix: rewrite the failing `sections/S*.md` via `writer-selfloop` (local, section-level) or `subsection-polisher`.\n\n- Evidence-policy disclaimer spam\n  - Fix: keep evidence policy once in Intro/Related Work (front matter), delete repeats in H3 (use `draft-polisher` or local section rewrites).\n\n- Citation scope drift (out-of-scope bibkeys)\n  - Fix: either (a) rewrite the subsection to stay in-scope, or (b) fix mapping/bindings (`section-mapper` → `evidence-binder`) and regenerate packs.\n\n- Global unique citations too low\n  - Fix: `citation-diversifier` → `citation-injector` (NO NEW FACTS), then `draft-polisher`.\n\n- Intro/Related Work too thin / too few cites\n  - Fix: rewrite the corresponding `sections/S<sec_id>.md` front-matter file via `writer-selfloop` (front-matter path) using dense positioning + method paragraph.\n\n## Prevention guidance (what upstream writers should do)\n\nIf you want the auditor to PASS *without* a heavy polish loop:\n- Start each H3 with a content claim + thesis (avoid narration templates).\n- Use explicit contrasts and at least one evaluation anchor paragraph.\n- Embed citations per claim (avoid trailing cite dumps).\n- Put evidence-policy limitations once in the front matter, not in every H3.\n\n## Script\n\n### Quick Start\n\n- `python .codex/skills/pipeline-auditor/scripts/run.py --help`\n- `python .codex/skills/pipeline-auditor/scripts/run.py --workspace workspaces/<ws>`\n\n### All Options\n\n- `--workspace <dir>`\n- `--unit-id <U###>` (optional; for logs)\n- `--inputs <semicolon-separated>` (rare override; prefer defaults)\n- `--outputs <semicolon-separated>` (rare override; default writes `output/AUDIT_REPORT.md`)\n- `--checkpoint <C#>` (optional)\n\n### Examples\n\n- Run audit after `global-reviewer` and before LaTeX/PDF:\n  - `python .codex/skills/pipeline-auditor/scripts/run.py --workspace workspaces/<ws>`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: audit fails due to undefined citations\n\nFix:\n- Regenerate citations with `citation-verifier` and ensure `citations/ref.bib` contains every cited key.\n\n### Issue: audit fails due to narration-style navigation phrases\n\nFix:\n- Rewrite as argument bridges (content-bearing handoffs, no navigation commentary) in the failing `sections/*` files, then re-merge.\n\n### Issue: audit fails due to \"unique citations too low\"\n\nFix:\n- Run `citation-diversifier` to produce `output/CITATION_BUDGET_REPORT.md`.\n- Apply it via `citation-injector` (edits `output/DRAFT.md`, writes `output/CITATION_INJECTION_REPORT.md`).\n- Then run `draft-polisher` → `global-reviewer` → auditor.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:39:35.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Content Generation Agents requiring rigorous writing stage validation and semantic execution units.","zh":"适用于需要严格的写作阶段验证和语义执行单元的内容生成代理。","ja":"コンテンツ生成エージェントが厳格な書き込み段階の検証とセマンティック実行ユニットを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"내용 생성 에이전트가 엄격한 작성 단계 검증 및 의미 실행 단위를 요구할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Contenido que requieren una validación rigurosa de la etapa de escritura y unidades de ejecución semántica.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Génération de Contenu nécessitant une validation rigoureuse de l''étape d''écriture et des unités d''exécution sémantique.","de":"Ideal für Inhalts-Generierungsagenten, die eine strenge Validierung der Schreibphase und semantische Ausführungseinheiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que exigem uma validação rigorosa da etapa de escrita e unidades de execução semântica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по генерации контента, требующих строгой валидации стадии написания и семантических единиц выполнения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطلبون إنتاج محتوى يتطلب التحقق الدقيق من مرحلة الكتابة ووحدات التنفيذ الدلالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect placeholder leaks, citation scope drift, and generator voice fallbacks through evidence-first methodology and structured intermediate artifacts, ensuring sufficient citation density and health for survey-like drafts.","zh":"通过基于证据的方法论和结构化的中间文物，赋予代理检测占位符泄漏、引用范围漂移和生成器语音回退的能力，确保足够的引用密度和健康度，以用于调查类草稿。","ja":"エビデンスファーストの方法論と構造化された中間アーティファクトを通じて、代理はプレイスホルダー漏れ、引用範囲のドリフト、生成器ボイスのフォールバックを検出できるようになり、調査のような下書きに対する十分な引用密度とヘルスを確保します。","ko":"증거 기반 방법론과 구조화된 중간 아티팩트를 통해 에이전트는 플레이스홀더 누출, 인용 범위漂移 및 생성기 음성 폴백을 감지할 수 있으므로 조사와 같은 초안에 대한 충분한 인용 밀도와 건강을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes detectar fugas de marcadores de posición, desviaciones del alcance de las citas y retrocesos de la voz del generador a través de una metodología basada en la evidencia y artefactos intermedios estructurados, garantizando una densidad y salud de citación suficientes para borradores de tipo encuesta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter les fuites de marqueurs de position, les dérives de portée de citation et les retours en arrière de la voix du générateur grâce à une méthodologie basée sur les preuves et des artefacts intermédiaires structurés, garantissant une densité et une santé de citation suffisantes pour les brouillons de type enquête.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Leckagen von Platzhaltern, Zitierbereichsdrift und Generatorsprachrückfälle durch eine evidenzbasierte Methodik und strukturierte Zwischenartefakte zu erkennen, wodurch eine ausreichende Zitierdichte und -gesundheit für umfragenähnliche Entwürfe gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar vazamentos de espaçadores, derivação do escopo de citação e falhas de voz do gerador por meio de metodologia baseada em evidências e artefatos intermediários estruturados, garantindo densidade e saúde de citação suficientes para rascunhos do tipo de pesquisa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать утечки плейсхолдеров, отклонение объема цитат и откат голоса генератора через evidence-first-методологию и структурированные промежуточные артефакты, обеспечивая достаточную плотность и здоровье цитат для черновиков, похожих на опрос.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من كشف تسربات المحلّات وانتقال نطاق الإشارة وتراجع صوت المولّد من خلال منهجية قائمة على الأدلة ووثائق وسيطة منسّقة، مما يضمن كثافة وصحة الإشارة الكافية لنماذج المسودات الشبيهة بالاستطلاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing drafts for placeholder leaks and planner talk","Validating citation scope and density in survey-like drafts","Detecting generator voice fallbacks in navigation and narration templates"],"zh":["审计草稿以检测占位符泄漏和计划者对话","验证调查类草稿中的引用范围和密度","检测导航和讲述模板中的生成器语音回退"],"ja":["プレイスホルダーの漏れやプランナー対話を検出するために草稿を監査する","調査のような下書きの中で引用範囲と密度を検証する","ナビゲーションとナレーションテンプレートの中で生成器ボイスのフォールバックを検出する"],"ko":["플레이스홀더 누출 및 플래너 대화를 감지하기 위해 초안을 감사함","조사와 같은 초안에서 인용 범위 및 밀도를 검증함","탐색 및 이야기를 위한 템플릿에서 생성기 음성 폴백을 감지함"],"es":["Auditoría de borradores para fugas de marcadores de posición y habla de planificador","Validación del alcance y densidad de las citas en borradores de tipo encuesta","Detección de retrocesos de la voz del generador en plantillas de navegación y narración"],"fr":["Audit de brouillons pour les fuites de marqueurs de position et la parole du planificateur","Validation de la portée et de la densité des citations dans les brouillons de type enquête","Détection des retours en arrière de la voix du générateur dans les modèles de navigation et de narration"],"de":["Prüfung von Entwürfen auf Leckagen von Platzhaltern und Planersprache","Validierung des Zitierbereichs und der Zitierdichte in umfragenähnlichen Entwürfen","Erkennung von Generatorsprachrückfällen in Navigation- und Erzählvorlagen"],"pt":["Auditoria de rascunhos para vazamentos de espaçadores e linguagem de planejamento","Validação do escopo e densidade de citação em rascunhos do tipo de pesquisa","Detecção de falhas de voz do gerador em modelos de navegação e narração"],"ru":["Проверка черновиков на утечки плейсхолдеров и язык планирования","Валидация объема и плотности цитат в черновиках, похожих на опрос","Обнаружение откатов голоса генератора в шаблонах навигации и повествования"],"ar":["فتح مسودات لكشف تسربات المحلّات ولغة التخطيط","التحقق من نطاق الإشارة وكثافتها في نماذج المسودات الشبيهة بالاستطلاع","كشف تراجع صوت المولّد في قوالب التنقل والرواية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Analysis-only, does not edit content","Requires input/output declarations and acceptance criteria","Style and citation-shape violations are blocking by default for survey/deep drafts"],"zh":["仅限分析，不编辑内容","需要输入/输出声明和接受标准","样式和引用形状的违规行为默认情况下会阻塞调查/深度草稿"],"ja":["分析のみであり、コンテンツの編集は行わない","入力/出力宣言と受け入れ基準が必要","スタイルと引用形状の違反はデフォルトで調査/深い下書きをブロックする"],"ko":["분석 전용으로, 내용을 편집하지 않음","입력/출력 선언 및 수락 기준이 필요함","스타일 및 인용 형태의 위반은 기본적으로 조사/깊은 초안을 차단함"],"es":["Sólo análisis, no edita contenido","Requiere declaraciones de entrada/salida y criterios de aceptación","Las violaciones de estilo y forma de cita son bloqueantes de forma predeterminada para borradores de encuesta/profundos"],"fr":["Analyse uniquement, ne modifie pas le contenu","Nécessite des déclarations d''entrée/sortie et des critères d''acceptation","Les violations de style et de forme de citation sont bloquantes par défaut pour les brouillons de type enquête/profonds"],"de":["Nur Analyse, bearbeitet keinen Inhalt","Benötigt Eingabe/Ausgabe-Erklärungen und Akzeptanzkriterien","Stil- und Zitierformverletzungen sind standardmäßig blockierend für Umfragen/Tiefentwürfe"],"pt":["Apenas análise, não edita o conteúdo","Exige declarações de entrada/saída e critérios de aceitação","Violações de estilo e forma de citação são bloqueadoras por padrão para rascunhos profundos/pesquisas"],"ru":["Только анализ, не редактирует контент","Требует объявлений входа/выхода и критериев приемлемости","Нарушения стиля и формы цитат являются блокирующими по умолчанию для глубоких/исследовательских черновиков"],"ar":["تحليل فقط، لا يعدّل المحتوى","يتطلب إعلانات الإدخال والإخراج ومعيار القبول","انتهاكات الأسلوب و形状 الإشارة هي حجب افتراضي لنماذج المسودات العميقة/الاستطلاعية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills/idea-pool-expander', 'community', 'WILLOSCAR', 'research-units-pipeline-skills', 'WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills', 'idea-pool-expander', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:39:50.437Z', NULL, '{"id":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills/idea-pool-expander","name":"idea-pool-expander","description":{"zh":"Idea Pool Expander 技术是一种 operator 驱动的技能，用于扩大创意思维并生成 idea 候选池","ja":"Idea Pool Expander 技術は、オペレータ駆動のスキルで、創造的思考を拡大し、アイデア候補池を生成する","ko":"Idea Pool Expander 기술은 오퍼레이터 구동 스킬로, 아이디어 확장 및 후보 아이디어 풀 생성","es":"El Idea Pool Expander es una habilidad que amplía el conjunto de ideas de manera controlada y auditable, generando un gran conjunto de candidatos a ideas innovadoras","fr":"L''Idea Pool Expander est une compétence qui développe l''ensemble des idées de manière contrôlée et auditable, générant un grand ensemble de candidats à idées innovantes","de":"Der Idea Pool Expander ist eine Fähigkeit, die das Ensemble von Ideen kontrolliert und auditable erweitert, um ein großes Ensemble innovativer Ideenkandidaten zu generieren","pt":"O Idea Pool Expander é uma ferramenta que cria um grande pool de candidatos a ideias, garantindo que sejam contáveis e auditáveis.","ru":"Расширитель Пула Идеи - это инструмент, создающий большой пул кандидатов на идеи, обеспечивающий их контролируемость и аудит.","ar":"موسع حفظة الأفكار هو أداة لإنشاء حفظة كبيرة من المرشحين للأفكار، مع الحفاظ على السيطرة والمراجعة","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Idea Pool Expander 技术 - 扩大创意思维","ja":"Idea Pool Expander 技術 - 創造的拡大","ko":"Idea Pool Expander 기술 - 아이디어 확장","es":"Idea Pool Expander: Amplía tus ideas de forma controlada","fr":"Idea Pool Expander : Développez vos idées de manière cont...","de":"Idea Pool Expander: Erweitern Sie Ihre Ideen kontrolliert","pt":"Idea Pool Expander: Ferramenta de Expansão de Ideias","ru":"Расширитель Пула Идеи: Инструмент для Генерации Идей","ar":"مُوسِّع حُفظة الأفكار: أداة لتوسيع الأفكار","en":"idea-pool-expander"},"description":{"zh":"Idea Pool Expander 技术是一种 operator 驱动的技能，用于扩大创意思维并生成 idea 候选池","ja":"Idea Pool Expander 技術は、オペレータ駆動のスキルで、創造的思考を拡大し、アイデア候補池を生成する","ko":"Idea Pool Expander 기술은 오퍼레이터 구동 스킬로, 아이디어 확장 및 후보 아이디어 풀 생성","es":"El Idea Pool Expander es una habilidad que amplía el conjunto de ideas de manera controlada y auditable, generando un gran conjunto de candidatos a ideas inn...","fr":"L''Idea Pool Expander est une compétence qui développe l''ensemble des idées de manière contrôlée et auditable, générant un grand ensemble de candidats à idées...","de":"Der Idea Pool Expander ist eine Fähigkeit, die das Ensemble von Ideen kontrolliert und auditable erweitert, um ein großes Ensemble innovativer Ideenkandidate...","pt":"O Idea Pool Expander é uma ferramenta que cria um grande pool de candidatos a ideias, garantindo que sejam contáveis e auditáveis.","ru":"Расширитель Пула Идеи - это инструмент, создающий большой пул кандидатов на идеи, обеспечивающий их контролируемость и аудит.","ar":"موسع حفظة الأفكار هو أداة لإنشاء حفظة كبيرة من المرشحين للأفكار، مع الحفاظ على السيطرة والمراجعة","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents ..."},"definition":{"en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"features":{"zh":["扩大创意思维","生成 idea 候选池","operator 驱动","输出 IDEA_SHORTLIST.md","支持多种输入格式"],"ja":["創造的思考を拡大","アイデア候補池を生成","オペレータ駆動","IDEA_SHORTLIST.md を出力","複数の入力形式をサポート"],"ko":["아이디어 확장","아이디어 후보 풀 생성","오퍼레이터 구동","IDEA_SHORTLIST.md 출력","다중 입력 형식 지원"],"es":["Generación de un gran conjunto de ideas innovadoras","Control y auditoría de las ideas generadas","Declaración de entradas y salidas","Criterios de aceptación y guardrails","Compatibilidad con formatos de archivo como MD y JSONL","Integración con otros skills como el idea-shortlist-curator"],"fr":["Génération d''un grand ensemble d''idées innovantes","Contrôle et audit des idées générées","Déclaration des entrées et des sorties","Critères d''acceptation et gardes-fous","Compatibilité avec des formats de fichier tels que MD et JSONL","Intégration avec d''autres compétences comme le idea-shortlist-curator"],"de":["Generierung eines großen Ensembles innovativer Ideen","Kontrolle und Audit der generierten Ideen","Deklaration von Eingaben und Ausgaben","Akzeptanzkriterien und Schutzmechanismen","Kompatibilität mit Dateiformaten wie MD und JSONL","Integration mit anderen Fähigkeiten wie dem idea-shortlist-curator"],"pt":["Criação de um grande pool de candidatos a ideias","Controle e auditoria das ideias","Utilização de operadores para expansão de ideias","Integração com outros skills para curadoria de ideias","Saída em formato de arquivo Markdown"],"ru":["Создание большого пула кандидатов на идеи","Контроль и аудит идей","Использование операторов для генерации идей","Интеграция с другими навыками для курирования идей","Выходные данные в формате файла Markdown"],"ar":["إنشاء حفظة كبيرة من المرشحين للأفكار","السيطرة والمراجعة للأفكار","استخدام المشغلين لتوسيع الأفكار","التكامل مع مهارات أخرى لCuradoria الأفكار","إخراج البيانات في شكل ملف Markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Idea Pool Expander","创意思维","operator 驱动","研究管道","idea 候选池","开发效率"],"ja":["Idea Pool Expander","創造的思考","オペレータ駆動","研究パイプライン","アイデア候補池","開発効率"],"ko":["Idea Pool Expander","창의적 사고","오퍼레이터 구동","연구 파이프라인","아이디어 후보 풀","개발 효율성"],"es":["Idea Pool Expander","generación de ideas","control de ideas","auditoría de ideas","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","ai","inteligencia artificial","procesos de investigación"],"fr":["Idea Pool Expander","génération d''idées","contrôle d''idées","audit d''idées","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","ai","intelligence artificielle","processus de recherche"],"de":["Idea Pool Expander","Ideengenerierung","Idekontrolle","Ideenaudit","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen","ai","künstliche Intelligenz","Forschungsprozesse"],"pt":["Idea Pool Expander","expansão de ideias","ferramenta de expansão de ideias","controle de ideias","auditoria de ideias","operadores de expansão de ideias"],"ru":["Расширитель Пула Идеи","генерация идей","инструмент для генерации идей","контроль идей","аудит идей","операторы для генерации идей"],"ar":["موسع حفظة الأفكار","توسيع الأفكار","أداة لتوسيع الأفكار","السيطرة على الأفكار","المراجعة الأفكار","المشغلين لتوسيع الأفكار"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"idea-pool-expander","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Idea Pool Expander (operator-driven)\n\nGoal: create a **big pool** of idea candidates that genuinely expands thinking, but remains controllable and auditable.\n\nThis skill writes the **Idea Pool** section of `output/IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`.\nThe final shortlist is handled by `idea-shortlist-curator`.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `output/IDEA_BRIEF.md`\n- `outline/taxonomy.yml`\n- `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`\n- `papers/core_set.csv`\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `output/IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`\n\n## Operators (use explicitly)\n\nUse these opera","body":"# Idea Pool Expander (operator-driven)\n\nGoal: create a **big pool** of idea candidates that genuinely expands thinking, but remains controllable and auditable.\n\nThis skill writes the **Idea Pool** section of `output/IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`.\nThe final shortlist is handled by `idea-shortlist-curator`.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `output/IDEA_BRIEF.md`\n- `outline/taxonomy.yml`\n- `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`\n- `papers/core_set.csv`\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `output/IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`\n\n## Operators (use explicitly)\n\nUse these operator families to force diversity. Target >=6/8 families represented.\n\n1) Counterfactual / constraint flip\n2) Failure-mode-first\n3) Evaluation protocol swap (task/metric/budget)\n4) Component swap in an agent loop\n5) Combination with explicit assumptions\n6) Cross-domain analogy import\n7) Negative-result mining\n8) System/product constraints (cost/latency/auditability)\n\n## Procedure (best-of-N, then write)\n\n1) Read the contract from `output/IDEA_BRIEF.md`\n- Scope / exclusions / constraints\n- Targets: pool size range, shortlist size, operator mix (default 50/50)\n\n2) Use `outline/taxonomy.yml` as the idea map\n- Ensure the pool covers multiple clusters (avoid all ideas collapsing into one bucket).\n\n3) Use `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` to avoid fantasy ideas\n- Prefer ideas that respond to explicit limitations/failure modes recorded in notes.\n\n4) Multi-sample within each operator family (best-of-N)\n- For each operator family, generate 2-3 alternative mini-sets.\n- Choose the best mini-set by: novelty, clarity, falsifiability.\n\n5) Write the Idea Pool into `output/IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`\n- Pool size: 60-90 (hard min 60)\n- Each idea is a short card (3-6 lines):\n  - Tier label (Tier-0 Wild / Tier-1 Plausible / Tier-2 Ready)\n  - Operator tag\n  - One-liner problem statement\n  - Key assumption\n  - How to falsify (1 sentence)\n  - Evidence pointers:\n    - Tier-0: optional\n    - Tier-1/2: required (>=1 `paper_id` from `papers/core_set.csv`)\n\n6) Add a small \"Pool Diagnostics\" block\n- Counts by tier\n- Counts by operator family\n- Coverage across taxonomy clusters\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- `output/IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` contains an \"Idea Pool\" section with 60-90 ideas.\n- Operator coverage >=6/8.\n- Every Tier-1/2 idea includes at least one pointer to `papers/core_set.csv` (paper_id).\n- Cards are short; no long paragraphs.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: pool feels repetitive / not expanding\n\nFix:\n- Increase operator coverage (force missing families).\n- Add at least 5 ideas that are *failure-mode-first* and 5 that are *evaluation-protocol-swap*.\n\n### Issue: too many wild ideas\n\nFix:\n- Convert some Tier-0 into Tier-1 by attaching at least one `paper_id` pointer.\n- Or explicitly tag as \"needs verification\" and keep it out of the final shortlist.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:39:50.437Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing structured idea generation and semantic execution units.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化思想生成和语义执行单元的研究代理。","ja":"構造化されたアイデア生成とセマンティック実行ユニットを必要とする研究エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 아이디어 생성과 의미 실행 단위를 필요로 하는 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan generación de ideas estructuradas y unidades de ejecución semántica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de génération d''idées structurées et d''unités d''exécution sémantiques.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die strukturierte Ideengenerierung und semantische Ausführungseinheiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de geração de ideias estruturadas e unidades de execução semântica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для исследовательских агентов, которым необходима структурированная генерация идей и семантические блоки выполнения.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات البحث التي تحتاج إلى توليد أفكار منظم ووحدات تنفيذ دلالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to expand idea pools using evidence-first methodology, structured intermediate artifacts, and guardrails, leveraging inputs like `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, and `core_set.csv` to generate controllable and auditable idea candidates.","zh":"赋予代理扩展思想库的能力，使用基于证据的方法论、结构化中间文物和护栏，利用诸如 `IDEA_BRIEF.md`、`taxonomy.yml`、`paper_notes.jsonl` 和 `core_set.csv` 的输入来生成可控和可审计的思想候选者。","ja":"エージェントにアイデアプールを拡張する機能を付与し、エビデンスファーストの方法論、構造化された中間アーティファクト、ガードレールを使用し、`IDEA_BRIEF.md`、`taxonomy.yml`、`paper_notes.jsonl`、`core_set.csv` などの入力を活用して、制御可能で監査可能なアイデア候補を生成します。","ko":"에이전트에 아이디어 풀을 확장하는 기능을 부여하여 증거 기반의 방법론, 구조화된 중간 아티팩트, 가드레일을 사용하고 `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv` 등의 입력을 활용하여 제어 가능하고 감사 가능한 아이디어 후보를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a expandir los grupos de ideas utilizando la metodología basada en evidencia, artefactos intermedios estructurados y guardrails, aprovechando entradas como `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl` y `core_set.csv` para generar candidatos de ideas controlables y auditables.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''élargir les groupes d''idées en utilisant la méthodologie basée sur les preuves, les artefacts intermédiaires structurés et les barrières de sécurité, en exploitant des entrées comme `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl` et `core_set.csv` pour générer des candidats d''idées contrôlables et auditable.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Ideenpools mithilfe der evidenzbasierten Methodik, strukturierter Zwischenartefakte und Schutzbarrieren zu erweitern, indem sie Eingaben wie `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl` und `core_set.csv` nutzen, um kontrollierbare und überprüfbare Ideenkandidaten zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a expandir os conjuntos de ideias utilizando metodologia baseada em evidências, artefatos intermediários estruturados e guardrails, aproveitando entradas como `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl` e `core_set.csv` para gerar candidatos de ideias controláveis e auditáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расширять пулы идей с помощью методологии, основанной на доказательствах, структурированных промежуточных артефактов и ограничений, используя входные данные, такие как `IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl` и `core_set.csv`, для генерации контролируемых и аудиторных кандидатов идей.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توسيع مجموعات الأفكار باستخدام منهجية مبنية على الأدلة، ووحدات وسيطة منسقة، وحدود أمان، واستخدام مدخلات مثل `IDEA_BRIEF.md`، و `taxonomy.yml`، و `paper_notes.jsonl`، و `core_set.csv` لتوليد مرشحين أفكار قابلين للتحكم والمراجعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` files","Expanding idea pools with semantic execution units","Creating structured intermediate artifacts for research pipelines"],"zh":["生成 `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` 文件","使用语义执行单元扩展思想库","为研究流水线创建结构化中间文物"],"ja":[" `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` ファイルを生成する","セマンティック実行ユニットを使用してアイデアプールを拡張する","研究パイプラインの構造化された中間アーティファクトを作成する"],"ko":[" `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` 파일을 생성하는 것","의미 실행 단위를 사용하여 아이디어 풀을 확장하는 것","연구 파이프라인을 위한 구조화된 중간 아티팩트를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generación de archivos `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`","Ampliación de los grupos de ideas con unidades de ejecución semántica","Creación de artefactos intermedios estructurados para tuberías de investigación"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`","Élargissement des groupes d''idées avec des unités d''exécution sémantiques","Création d''artefacts intermédiaires structurés pour les pipelines de recherche"],"de":["Generierung von `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`-Dateien","Erweiterung von Ideenpools mit semantischen Ausführungseinheiten","Erstellung von strukturierten Zwischenartefakten für Forschungspipelines"],"pt":["Gerar arquivos `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`","Expandir conjuntos de ideias com unidades de execução semântica","Criar artefatos intermediários estruturados para pipelines de pesquisa"],"ru":["Генерировать файлы `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`","Расширять пулы идей с помощью семантических блоков выполнения","Создавать структурированные промежуточные артефакты для исследовательских конвейеров"],"ar":["توليد ملفات `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`","توسيع مجموعات الأفكار باستخدام وحدات التنفيذ الدلالية","إنشاء هياكل وسيطة منسقة لأنابيب البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific input files (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)","Output is limited to `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` format"],"zh":["需要特定的输入文件（`IDEA_BRIEF.md`、`taxonomy.yml`、`paper_notes.jsonl`、`core_set.csv`）","输出仅限于 `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` 格式"],"ja":["特定の入力ファイル（`IDEA_BRIEF.md`、`taxonomy.yml`、`paper_notes.jsonl`、`core_set.csv`）が必要","出力は `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` 形式のみ"],"ko":["특정 입력 파일(`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)이 필요","출력은 `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` 형식만 가능"],"es":["Requiere archivos de entrada específicos (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)","La salida está limitada al formato `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers d''entrée spécifiques (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)","La sortie est limitée au format `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`"],"de":["Benötigt bestimmte Eingabedateien (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)","Die Ausgabe ist auf das Format `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md` beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer arquivos de entrada específicos (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)","A saída é limitada ao formato `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`"],"ru":["Требует специальных входных файлов (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`, `taxonomy.yml`, `paper_notes.jsonl`, `core_set.csv`)","Выходные данные ограничены форматом `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات مدخلة محددة (`IDEA_BRIEF.md`، و `taxonomy.yml`، و `paper_notes.jsonl`، و `core_set.csv`)","النتائج محدودة بتنسيق `IDEA_SHORTLIST.md`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
