総合的な定性研究設計を提供するエージェントで、VS-Researchを適用して常套手段を避け、最適な定性戦略を提案します","ko":"diverga-c2 설계 전문가는 종합적인 질적 연구 설계를 제공하는 에이전트로, VS-Research를 적용하여 일반적인 방법을 피하고 최적의 질적 전략을 제안합니다","es":"Diverga C2 es un especialista en diseño de investigación cualitativa que aplica VS-Research para proponer estrategias óptimas","fr":"Diverga C2 est un spécialiste de la conception de recherche qualitative qui applique VS-Research pour proposer des stratégies optimales","de":"Diverga C2 ist ein Fachmann für qualitative Forschungsdesign, der VS-Research anwendet, um optimale Strategien vorzuschlagen","pt":"O Diverga C2 é um especialista em design qualitativo que aplica VS-Research para desenvolver estratégias ótimas","ru":"Diverga C2 - это специалист по качественному дизайну, который применяет VS-Research для разработки оптимальных стратегий","ar":"دايفرجا C2 خبير تصميم نوعي يطبق VS-Research لتطوير استراتيجيات أمثل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["高级定性研究设计","避免常规方法","提出最优质的定性策略","应用VS-Research","支持多种传统"],"ja":["総合的な定性研究設計","常套手段の回避","最適な定性戦略の提案","VS-Researchの適用","複数の伝統のサポート"],"ko":["종합적인 질적 연구 설계","일반적인 방법의 피회","최적의 질적 전략의 제안","VS-Research의 적용","複数의 전통의 지원"],"es":["Aplica VS-Research para evitar enfoques sobreutilizados","Propone estrategias cualitativas óptimas","Diseña investigaciones cualitativas comprehensivas","Utiliza el modelo gpt-5.3-codex","Se ejecuta en modo degradado de Codex CLI"],"fr":["Applique VS-Research pour éviter les approches surutilisées","Propose des stratégies qualitatives optimales","Conçoit des recherches qualitatives complètes","Utilise le modèle gpt-5.3-codex","S''exécute en mode dégradé de Codex CLI"],"de":["Wendet VS-Research an, um übernutzte Ansätze zu vermeiden","Schlägt optimale qualitative Strategien vor","Entwirft umfassende qualitative Forschungen","Nutzt das Modell gpt-5.3-codex","Wird im abgespeckten Modus von Codex CLI ausgeführt"],"pt":["Especialista em design qualitativo","Aplica VS-Research","Desenvolve estratégias ótimas","Executa tarefas em modo sequencial","Utiliza o modelo gpt-5.3-codex"],"ru":["Специалист по качественному дизайну","Применяет VS-Research","Разрабатывает оптимальные стратегии","Выполняет задачи в последовательном режиме","Использует модель gpt-5.3-codex"],"ar":["خبير تصميم نوعي","يطبق VS-Research","يطور استراتيجيات أمثل","ينفذ المهام في وضع متسلسل","يستخدم نموذج gpt-5.3-codex"]},"keywords":{"zh":["定性研究设计","高级设计专家","VS-Research","避免常规方法","最优质的定性策略","多种传统"],"ja":["定性研究設計","総合的な設計コンサルタント","VS-Research","常套手段の回避","最適な定性戦略","複数の伝統"],"ko":["질적 연구 설계","종합적인 설계 전문가","VS-Research","일반적인 방법의 피회","최적의 질적 전략","複数의 전통"],"es":["investigación cualitativa","diseño de investigación","VS-Research","gpt-5.3-codex","Codex CLI","estrategias cualitativas","investigación óptima","agente de investigación","Diverga C2"],"fr":["recherche qualitative","conception de recherche","VS-Research","gpt-5.3-codex","Codex CLI","stratégies qualitatives","recherche optimale","agent de recherche","Diverga C2"],"de":["qualitative Forschung","Forschungsdesign","VS-Research","gpt-5.3-codex","Codex CLI","qualitative Strategien","optimale Forschung","Forschungsagent","Diverga C2"],"pt":["design qualitativo","VS-Research","estratégias ótimas","desenvolvimento de software","gpt-5.3-codex","agente de design"],"ru":["качественный дизайн","VS-Research","оптимальные стратегии","разработка программного обеспечения","gpt-5.3-codex","агент дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم نوعي","VS-Research","استراتيجيات أمثل","تطوير البرمجيات","gpt-5.3-codex","خبير تصميم"]}},"owner":"HosungYou","repo":"Diverga","repoPath":"HosungYou/Diverga","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"diverga-c2","description":"|","version":"9.0.0","bodyPreview":"# C2 - Qualitative Design Consultant\n\n**Agent ID**: C2\n**Category**: C - Design & Meta-Analysis\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive qualitative research design specialist. Applies VS-Research to avoid overused approaches (generic phenomenology) and proposes context-optimal qualitative strategies across multiple traditions.\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\n\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent execution - tasks run seq","body":"# C2 - Qualitative Design Consultant\n\n**Agent ID**: C2\n**Category**: C - Design & Meta-Analysis\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive qualitative research design specialist. Applies VS-Research to avoid overused approaches (generic phenomenology) and proposes context-optimal qualitative strategies across multiple traditions.\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\n\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent execution - tasks run sequentially\n- No MCP runtime checkpoints - uses text-based checkpoint protocol\n- No AskUserQuestion UI - uses text prompts for decisions\n\n## Checkpoint Protocol\n\nCheckpoints during execution:\n- CP_METHODOLOGY_APPROVAL (REQUIRED)\n- CP_VS_001 (REQUIRED)\n\nWhen reaching a checkpoint:\n1. STOP and clearly mark: \"CHECKPOINT: {checkpoint_name}\"\n2. Present qualitative approach options with VS T-Scores\n3. Ask: \"Which qualitative approach would you like to proceed with?\"\n4. WAIT for user response before continuing\n5. Log decision: write to `.research/decision-log.yaml` using write_file\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRequires CP_PARADIGM_SELECTION and CP_RESEARCH_DIRECTION to be completed.\nCheck: read_file(\".research/decision-log.yaml\") to verify prerequisites.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### Qualitative Traditions\n| Tradition | Focus | Data | Analysis |\n|-----------|-------|------|----------|\n| Phenomenology | Lived experience | In-depth interviews | Meaning units |\n| Grounded Theory | Theory generation | Interviews, observations | Constant comparison |\n| Case Study | Bounded system | Multiple sources | Cross-case analysis |\n| Narrative Inquiry | Life stories | Narratives, documents | Restorying |\n| Ethnography | Cultural patterns | Fieldwork, observation | Thick description |\n| Action Research | Change process | Participatory data | Cycles of reflection |\n\n### Quality Criteria\n- Credibility (internal validity equivalent)\n- Transferability (external validity equivalent)\n- Dependability (reliability equivalent)\n- Confirmability (objectivity equivalent)\n- Authenticity (unique to qualitative)\n\n### VS 3-Phase Process\n- Phase 1: Identify modal approaches (generic phenomenology T=0.90)\n- Phase 2: Context-optimal tradition alternatives\n- Phase 3: Execute with full design specification including sampling, data collection, analysis plan\n\n### Sampling Strategies\n- Purposive, theoretical, snowball, criterion-based\n- Saturation assessment guidelines\n- Sample size justification by tradition\n\n## Tool Mapping (Codex)\n\n| Claude Code | Codex CLI |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| Read | read_file |\n| Edit | apply_diff |\n| Write | write_file |\n| Grep | grep |\n| Bash | shell |\n| Task (subagent) | Read skill file, follow instructions |\n\n## Related Agents\n\n- **A5-ParadigmWorldviewAdvisor**: Paradigm informs tradition selection\n- **E2-QualitativeCodingSpecialist**: Coding approach aligned with tradition\n- **D2-InterviewFocusGroupSpecialist**: Interview protocol development\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:39:41.577Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Research Agents requiring advanced qualitative research design capabilities, particularly those utilizing VS-Research methodologies.","zh":"适合需要高级定性研究设计能力的研究代理，特别是那些使用VS-Research方法的代理。","ja":"VS-Research手法を利用する高度な定性的研究設計能力を必要とするリサーチエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 질적 연구 설계 기능이 필요한 연구 에이전트, 특히 VS-Research 방법론을 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de investigación que requieren capacidades avanzadas de diseño de investigación cualitativa, particularmente aquellos que utilizan metodologías de investigación VS-Research.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche nécessitant des capacités de conception de recherche qualitative avancées, en particulier ceux utilisant les méthodologies de recherche VS-Research.","de":"Ideal für Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte qualitative Forschungsdesign-Fähigkeiten erfordern, insbesondere solche, die VS-Research-Methoden verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de pesquisa que requerem capacidades avançadas de design de pesquisa qualitativa, particularmente aqueles que utilizam metodologias de VS-Pesquisa.","ru":"Идеально для исследовательских агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей качественного исследования, особенно тех, кто использует методологии VS-Research.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البحث الذي يتطلب مهارات تصميم بحث نوعية متقدمة، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم منهجيات VS-البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to propose context-optimal qualitative strategies across multiple research traditions, leveraging the gpt-5.3-codex model to avoid overused approaches like generic phenomenology, and integrating with Codex CLI for streamlined task execution.","zh":"赋予代理提出跨多个研究传统的上下文最优定性策略的能力，利用gpt-5.3-codex模型避免过度使用的方法，如一般现象学，并与Codex CLI集成以实现流畅的任务执行。","ja":"エージェントが複数の研究伝統を横断したコンテキスト最適な定性的戦略を提案する能力を提供し、gpt-5.3-codexモデルを利用して一般的な現象論 gibi 過度に使用されているアプローチを避け、Codex CLIと統合してタスクの実行を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 연구 전통을 아우르는 컨텍스트 최적의 질적 전략을 제안할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, gpt-5.3-codex 모델을 활용하여 일반적인 현상학과 같은 과도한 접근 방식을 피하고, Codex CLI와 통합하여 작업 실행을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proponer estrategias cualitativas óptimas en contexto a través de múltiples tradiciones de investigación, aprovechando el modelo gpt-5.3-codex para evitar enfoques sobreutilizados como la fenomenología genérica, e integrándose con Codex CLI para una ejecución de tareas optimizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de proposer des stratégies qualitatives optimales dans le contexte de multiples traditions de recherche, en exploitant le modèle gpt-5.3-codex pour éviter les approches trop utilisées comme la phénoménologie générique, et en s''intégrant avec Codex CLI pour une exécution de tâches rationalisée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kontextoptimale qualitative Strategien über mehrere Forschungstraditionen hinweg vorzuschlagen, indem es das gpt-5.3-codex-Modell nutzt, um übermäßig genutzte Ansätze wie generische Phänomenologie zu vermeiden und sich in Codex CLI für eine optimierte Aufgabenausführung integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a propor estratégias qualitativas ótimas de contexto em várias tradições de pesquisa, aproveitando o modelo gpt-5.3-codex para evitar abordagens muito usadas como a fenomenologia genérica e integrando com o Codex CLI para execução de tarefas simplificada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предлагать контекстно-оптимальные качественные стратегии в нескольких исследовательских традициях, используя модель gpt-5.3-codex для избежания слишком часто используемых подходов, таких как общая феноменология, и интегрируя с Codex CLI для оптимизации выполнения задач.","ar":"يمكن العميل من اقتراح استراتيجيات نوعية مثالية للسياق عبر تقاليد بحث متعددة، مستفيدا من نموذج gpt-5.3-codex لتجنب المناهج الم过ستخدمة مثل الفينومينولوجيا العامة، ودمجها مع Codex CLI لتنفيذ المهمة الميسر."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing comprehensive qualitative research studies","Developing context-specific qualitative data collection strategies","Analyzing and avoiding methodological biases in research design"],"zh":["设计综合的定性研究研究","开发特定上下文的定性数据收集策略","分析和避免研究设计中的方法偏差"],"ja":["包括的な定性的研究研究の設計","特定のコンテキストに特化した定性的データ収集戦略の開発","研究設計における方法バイアスの分析と回避"],"ko":["포괄적인 질적 연구 연구의 설계","특정 컨텍스트에 특화된 질적 데이터 수집 전략의 개발","연구 설계에서의 방법 편향 분석 및 피회"],"es":["Diseñar estudios de investigación cualitativa comprehensivos","Desarrollar estrategias de recopilación de datos cualitativos específicas del contexto","Analizar y evitar sesgos metodológicos en el diseño de la investigación"],"fr":["Concevoir des études de recherche qualitative complètes","Développer des stratégies de collecte de données qualitatives spécifiques au contexte","Analyser et éviter les biais méthodologiques dans la conception de la recherche"],"de":["Umfassende qualitative Forschungsstudien entwerfen","Kontextspezifische qualitative Datenerfassungsstrategien entwickeln","Methodologische Verzerrungen in der Forschungsdesignanalyse und -vermeidung"],"pt":["Projeto de estudos de pesquisa qualitativa abrangentes","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de coleta de dados qualitativos específicos de contexto","Análise e evasão de vieses metodológicos no design da pesquisa"],"ru":["Проектирование всесторонних качественных исследовательских исследований","Разработка контекстно-специфических стратегий сбора качественных данных","Анализ и избежание методологических предубеждений в исследовательском дизайне"],"ar":["تصميم دراسات بحث نوعية شاملة","تطوير استراتيجيات جمع بيانات نوعية محددة للسياق","تحليل وتجنب التحيزات المنهجية في تصميم البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Runs in single-model mode, limiting parallel agent execution","Requires compatibility with Codex CLI''s degraded mode"],"zh":["仅运行在单模型模式，限制了并行代理执行","需要与Codex CLI的降级模式兼容"],"ja":["シングルモデルモードでのみ実行され、並列エージェントの実行が制限される","Codex CLIのデグレードモードとの互換性が必要"],"ko":["단일 모델 모드에서만 실행되어 병렬 에이전트 실행이 제한됨","Codex CLI의 비상 모드와의 호환성이 필요함"],"es":["Se ejecuta en modo de modelo único, lo que limita la ejecución paralela de agentes","Requiere compatibilidad con el modo degradado de Codex CLI"],"fr":["Fonctionne en mode modèle unique, limitant l''exécution parallèle des agents","Nécessite une compatibilité avec le mode dégradé de Codex CLI"],"de":["Läuft im Einmodus, was die parallele Ausführung von Agenten einschränkt","Benötigt Kompatibilität mit dem abgesenkten Modus von Codex CLI"],"pt":["Executa no modo de modelo único, limitando a execução paralela do agente","Requer compatibilidade com o modo degradado do Codex CLI"],"ru":["Работает в одноп��ельном режиме, ограничивая параллельную выполнение агента","Требует совместимости с деградированным режимом Codex CLI"],"ar":["يعمل في وضع نموذج واحد، مما يحد من تنفيذ العميل الموازي","يتطلب التوافق مع الوضع المتدهور من Codex CLI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
