ement"],"de":["Code-Review in zwei Schritten","Automatische Verifizierung nach Code-Änderungen","Einhalten von Konventionen und Code-Qualität","Konfigurierbarer Arbeitsablauf","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Dois passos de revisão","Verificação de alterações de código não registradas","Verificação condicional após a primeira verificação","Gatilho automático após implementação de recursos","Garantia de qualidade e conformidade com convenções"],"ru":["Два этапа проверки","Проверка незарегистрированных изменений кода","Условная проверка после первой проверки","Автоматический триггер после реализации функций","Гарантия качества и соответствия конвенциям"],"ar":["عمليتان للفحص","فحص التغييرات غير المسجلة للكود","فحص شرطي بعد الفحص الأول","مفعمل تلقائي بعد تنفيذ الميزات","ضمان الجودة والامتثال للتقاليد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["双重代码审查","代码质量","约定遵守","代码审查","自动化代码审查","代码开发"],"ja":["デュアルパスコードレビュー","コード品質","規約遵守","コードレビュー","自動コードレビュー","コード開発"],"ko":["이중 패스 코드 리뷰","코드 품질","규약 준수","코드 리뷰","자동 코드 리뷰","코드 개발"],"es":["revisión de código","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","convenciones de código","flujo de trabajo","automatización","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["révision de code","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","conventions de code","flux de travail","automatisation","outils de développement"],"de":["Code-Review","Softwareentwicklung","Code-Qualität","Code-Konventionen","Arbeitsablauf","Automatisierung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["revisão de código","fluxo de trabalho","qualidade de código","conformidade com convenções","desenvolvimento de software","revisão de código dual-pass"],"ru":["проверка кода","рабочий поток","качество кода","соответствие конвенциям","разработка программного обеспечения","двойной просмотр кода"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","تدفق العمل","جودة الكود","الامتثال للتقاليد","تطوير البرمجيات","مراجعة الكود المزدوجة"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dual-pass-review","description":"Use AFTER any code changes (feature implementation, bug fix, refactor) to enforce mandatory dual-pass review. First pass reviews unstaged changes for correctness and convention compliance. Second pass ONLY executes if first pass made any corrections. Ensures work follows project conventions, development rules, and best practices before task completion.","bodyPreview":"# Dual-Pass Code Review Workflow\n\nMandatory review checkpoint that runs after any code changes to ensure quality and convention compliance.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Every code change requires verification before task completion.**\n\nTwo review passes:\n1. **First Pass**: Review unstaged changes for correctness + convention compliance\n2. **Second Pass**: Conditional - ONLY if first pass made changes, review again\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger AUTOMATICALLY after:\n- Feature implementation (`/cook`, `/code`)","body":"# Dual-Pass Code Review Workflow\n\nMandatory review checkpoint that runs after any code changes to ensure quality and convention compliance.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Every code change requires verification before task completion.**\n\nTwo review passes:\n1. **First Pass**: Review unstaged changes for correctness + convention compliance\n2. **Second Pass**: Conditional - ONLY if first pass made changes, review again\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger AUTOMATICALLY after:\n- Feature implementation (`/cook`, `/code`)\n- Bug fixes (`/fix`, `/debug`)\n- Refactoring (`/refactor`)\n- Any edit/write operations that modify code\n\n## Review Dimensions\n\n### 1. Task Correctness\n- [ ] Changes address the original task/requirement\n- [ ] No missing pieces or incomplete logic\n- [ ] Edge cases handled appropriately\n- [ ] No unintended side effects\n\n### 2. Project Conventions\n- [ ] Follows Clean Architecture layers\n- [ ] Uses correct repository pattern (service-specific, not generic)\n- [ ] CQRS patterns: Command + Handler + Result in ONE file\n- [ ] Entity patterns: static expressions, computed properties have empty `set { }`\n- [ ] Frontend: correct base class hierarchy\n- [ ] Frontend: BEM class naming on ALL elements\n\n### 3. Development Rules Compliance\n- [ ] YAGNI - No unnecessary features/abstractions\n- [ ] KISS - Simplest solution that works\n- [ ] DRY - No code duplication (search first, reuse existing)\n- [ ] Logic in LOWEST layer (Entity > Service > Component)\n- [ ] DTO mapping in DTO class, not handler\n- [ ] Side effects in event handlers, not command handlers\n\n### 4. Code Quality\n- [ ] No syntax errors, code compiles\n- [ ] Meaningful naming\n- [ ] Single Responsibility Principle\n- [ ] Proper error handling\n- [ ] No security vulnerabilities\n\n## Execution Protocol\n\n### Step 1: Get Unstaged Changes\n\n```bash\n# Check for unstaged changes\ngit status --short\n\n# Get full diff of unstaged changes\ngit diff\n\n# Get diff of staged changes (if any)\ngit diff --staged\n```\n\n### Step 2: First Pass Review\n\nFor EACH changed file, verify:\n\n```markdown\n## First Pass Review Checklist\n\n### File: [filename]\n\n**Task Correctness:**\n- [ ] Addresses original requirement\n- [ ] Logic is complete and correct\n- [ ] No missing edge cases\n\n**Convention Compliance:**\n- [ ] Follows platform patterns from AGENTS.md\n- [ ] Uses correct base classes\n- [ ] Naming conventions followed\n- [ ] BEM classes on all template elements (frontend)\n\n**Development Rules:**\n- [ ] YAGNI/KISS/DRY compliance\n- [ ] Logic in correct layer\n- [ ] No anti-patterns (side effects in handlers, generic repos, etc.)\n\n**Quality:**\n- [ ] Compiles without errors\n- [ ] No security issues\n- [ ] Proper error handling\n```\n\n### Step 3: First Pass Corrections\n\nIf issues found:\n1. Document each issue clearly\n2. Fix issues immediately\n3. Track that corrections were made\n\n```markdown\n## First Pass Corrections Made\n\n1. [File:Line] - [Issue] → [Fix Applied]\n2. [File:Line] - [Issue] → [Fix Applied]\n...\n```\n\n### Step 4: Conditional Second Pass\n\n**CRITICAL DECISION POINT:**\n\n```\nIF first_pass_made_changes == true:\n    EXECUTE full second pass review\nELSE:\n    SKIP second pass, proceed to summary\n```\n\n### Step 5: Second Pass Review (If Needed)\n\nRe-run complete review on current unstaged changes:\n\n```bash\n# Get fresh diff after corrections\ngit diff\n```\n\nVerify ALL checklist items again:\n- Task correctness\n- Convention compliance\n- Development rules\n- Code quality\n\n### Step 6: Generate Summary\n\n```markdown\n## Dual-Pass Review Summary\n\n**First Pass:**\n- Files reviewed: [count]\n- Issues found: [count]\n- Corrections made: [yes/no]\n\n**Second Pass:**\n- Executed: [yes/no]\n- Reason: [first pass made changes / first pass clean]\n- Additional issues: [count if executed]\n\n**Final Status:** [APPROVED / NEEDS ATTENTION]\n\n**Remaining Concerns:**\n- [List any minor items for future consideration]\n```\n\n## Common Issues to Check\n\n### Backend Anti-Patterns\n\n```csharp\n// Side effect in handler (WRONG)\nawait notificationService.SendAsync(...);\n// → Move to UseCaseEvents/ event handler\n\n// Generic repository (WRONG)\nIPlatformRootRepository<Entity>\n// → Use service-specific: IMyServiceRootRepository<Entity>\n\n// Mapping in handler (WRONG)\nvar entity = new Entity { Name = req.Name };\n// → Use DTO.MapToEntity() or Command.MapToNewEntity()\n\n// Missing eager loading (WRONG)\nawait repo.GetAllAsync(...)\n// → Add: ct, e => e.Related\n```\n\n### Frontend Anti-Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Missing BEM class (WRONG)\n<div><span>{{ name }}</span></div>\n// → <div class=\"user-card__content\"><span class=\"user-card__name\">{{ name }}</span></div>\n\n// Missing untilDestroyed (WRONG)\nthis.data$.subscribe(...)\n// → this.data$.pipe(this.untilDestroyed()).subscribe(...)\n\n// Logic in component (WRONG)\nreadonly types = [{ value: 1, label: ''Type A'' }];\n// → Move to Entity: static readonly dropdownOptions = [...]\n\n// Direct HttpClient (WRONG)\nconstructor(private http: HttpClient) {}\n// → Extend PlatformApiService\n```\n\n## Integration with Workflows\n\nThis skill is the FINAL step before task completion in:\n\n| Workflow | Sequence (Updated) |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| Feature | plan → cook → test → **dual-pass-review** → docs-update → watzup |\n| Bug Fix | debug → plan → fix → test → **dual-pass-review** |\n| Refactor | plan → code → test → **dual-pass-review** |\n\n## Review Commands\n\n```bash\n# Quick convention check\ngrep -r \"IPlatformRootRepository\" --include=\"*.cs\"  # Should be service-specific\ngrep -r \"new Entity {\" --include=\"*Handler.cs\"  # Should be in DTO\ngrep -r \"SendAsync\\|NotifyAsync\" --include=\"*CommandHandler.cs\"  # Should be in event handler\n\n# Frontend checks\ngrep -r \"class=\\\"\\\"\" --include=\"*.html\"  # Empty class (suspicious)\ngrep -r \"subscribe()\" --include=\"*.ts\" | grep -v \"untilDestroyed\"  # Missing cleanup\n```\n\n## Key Rules\n\n1. **NEVER skip first pass** - Always review unstaged changes\n2. **Second pass is CONDITIONAL** - Only if first pass made corrections\n3. **Be honest and brutal** - Flag all issues, don''t be lenient\n4. **Evidence-based** - Cite specific files and lines\n5. **Follow project conventions** - Check AGENTS.md patterns\n\n## Output Format\n\nAlways end with clear status:\n\n```markdown\n---\n**Review Status:** [APPROVED / CORRECTIONS NEEDED]\n**Passes Executed:** [1 / 2]\n**Ready for Commit:** [Yes / No]\n---\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:40:24.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring rigorous dual-pass verification for quality and convention compliance.","zh":"适合需要严格双重验证以确保质量和惯例遵从性的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが品質と規約遵守に対する厳格な二重検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 품질 및 규약 준수를 위한 엄격한 이중 검증을 요구하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren una verificación dual de dos pasos rigurosa para la calidad y el cumplimiento de convenciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une vérification rigoureuse à double passage pour la qualité et la conformité aux conventions.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine strenge Zwei-Pass-Verifizierung für Qualität und Konformität mit Konventionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem verificação dual-pass rigorosa para qualidade e conformidade com convenções.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих строгой двойной проверки для качества и соответствия требованиям.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استعراض الشفرة الذي يتطلب التحقق المزدوج للجودة ومطابقة الاتفاقيات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce mandatory review checkpoints, ensuring every code change undergoes two review passes for correctness and convention compliance, utilizing conditional second-pass reviews and triggering automatically after feature implementation.","zh":"赋予代理人强制执行必需的审查检查点的能力，确保每个代码更改经过两次审查以确保正确性和惯例遵从性，利用条件性二次审查，并在功能实现后自动触发。","ja":"コードの変更が正しさと規約遵守性を確保するために2回のレビューを受けることを保証するために、エージェントが必須のレビュー検査点を実施することを可能にします。条件付きの2回目のレビューを利用し、機能の実装後に自動的にトリガーします。","ko":"에이전트가 필수적인 검토 체크 포인트를 강제 적용할 수 있도록 하여, 코드 변경이 올바름과 규약 준수를 보장하기 위해 두 번의 검토를 받게 함으로써, 조건부 두 번째 검토를 활용하고 기능 구현 후 자동으로 트리거합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar puntos de revisión obligatorios, asegurando que cada cambio de código sufra dos pasos de revisión para la corrección y el cumplimiento de convenciones, utilizando revisiones condicionales de segundo paso y activándose automáticamente después de la implementación de funciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des points de révision obligatoires, en garantissant que chaque modification de code subit deux passes de révision pour la correction et la conformité aux conventions, en utilisant des révisions conditionnelles de deuxième passe et en se déclenchant automatiquement après la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, obligatorische Überprüfungspunkte durchzusetzen, sodass jede Codeänderung zwei Überprüfungspassagen für Richtigkeit und Konformität mit Konventionen durchläuft, unter Verwendung von bedingten Zweitpass-Überprüfungen und automatischer Auslösung nach der Implementierung von Funktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor pontos de verificação de revisão obrigatórios, garantindo que todas as alterações de código sejam submetidas a duas revisões para correção e conformidade com convenções, utilizando revisões condicionais de segunda passagem e acionando automaticamente após a implementação de recursos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать обязательные контрольные точки обзора, гарантируя, что каждый изменение кода проходит два обзора для правильности и соответствия требованиям, используя условные повторные обзоры и срабатывая автоматически после реализации функций.","ar":"يمكن العميل من فرض نقاط مراجعة إجبارية، وضمان خضوع كل تغيير في الشفرة لمراجعتين لضمان الصحة والامتثال للمواصفات، باستخدام مراجعات مشروطة للجولة الثانية وتفعيلها تلقائيًا بعد تنفيذ الميزات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews after feature implementation","Enforcing convention compliance through dual-pass verification","Streamlining quality assurance with conditional second-pass reviews"],"zh":["功能实现后自动化代码审查","通过双重验证强制执行惯例遵从性","使用条件性二次审查简化质量保证"],"ja":["機能実装後にコードレビューを自動化する","二重検証を通じて規約遵守を強制する","条件付きの二次レビューを使用して品質保証を最適化する"],"ko":["기능 구현 후 코드 리뷰 자동화","이중 검증을 통해 규약 준수를 강제 적용","조건부 두 번째 검토를 사용하여 품질 보증을 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código después de la implementación de funciones","Aplicar el cumplimiento de convenciones a través de la verificación de dos pasos","Optimizar la garantía de calidad con revisiones condicionales de segundo paso"],"fr":["Automatiser les révisions de code après la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités","Assurer la conformité aux conventions grâce à la vérification à double passage","Optimiser l''assurance qualité avec des révisions conditionnelles de deuxième passe"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews nach der Implementierung von Funktionen","Durchsetzen von Konformität mit Konventionen durch Zwei-Pass-Verifizierung","Optimieren der Qualitätssicherung mit bedingten Zweitpass-Überprüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código após implementação de recursos","Impor conformidade com convenções por meio de verificação dual-pass","Otimizar garantia de qualidade com revisões condicionais de segunda passagem"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзор кода после реализации функций","Обеспечивать соответствие требованиям посредством двойной проверки","Оптимизировать обеспечение качества с помощью условных повторных обзоров"],"ar":["توسيع مراجعة الشفرة تلقائيًا بعد تنفيذ الميزات","فرض امتثال المواصفات من خلال التحقق المزدوج","تسهيل ضمان الجودة باستخدام المراجعات المشروطة للجولة الثانية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project root and AGENTS.md file","Conditional second-pass review only triggers if first pass makes changes"],"zh":["需要访问项目根目录和AGENTS.md文件","条件性二次审查仅在第一次审查进行更改时触发"],"ja":["プロジェクトのルートディレクトリとAGENTS.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","条件付きの二次レビューは、最初のレビューが変更を行った場合のみトリガーされます"],"ko":["프로젝트 루트 디렉토리와 AGENTS.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","조건부 두 번째 검토는 첫 번째 검토가 변경을 수행할 때만 트리거"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la raíz del proyecto y al archivo AGENTS.md","La revisión condicional de segundo paso solo se activa si el primer paso realiza cambios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la racine du projet et au fichier AGENTS.md","La révision conditionnelle de deuxième passe ne se déclenche que si le premier passe effectue des modifications"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Projektwurzel und die Datei AGENTS.md","Die bedingte Zweitpass-Überprüfung wird nur ausgelöst, wenn der erste Pass Änderungen vornimmt"],"pt":["Exige acesso à raiz do projeto e ao arquivo AGENTS.md","Revisão condicional de segunda passagem é acionada apenas se a primeira passagem fizer alterações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к корню проекта и файлу AGENTS.md","Условный повторный обзор срабатывает только если первый обзор внес изменения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الجذر المشروع وملف AGENTS.md","المراجعة المشروطة للجولة الثانية تت hoạt فقط إذا قامت الجولة الأولى بتعديلات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
