vars.yml e platforms.yml","Otimização de tarefas com tool tasks em .task/tools/","Main Taskfile.yml minimalista","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas em .task/languages/"],"ru":["Модульный дизайн для задач и рабочих процессов","Разделение конфигурации на файлы vars.yml и platforms.yml","Оптимизация задач с помощью tool tasks в .task/tools/","Минималистичный Main Taskfile.yml","Поддержка нескольких языков в .task/languages/"],"ar":["تصميم مودولي للمهام وسير العمل","فصل الإعدادات في ملفات vars.yml و platforms.yml","تحسين المهام باستخدام أدوات المهام في .task/tools/","ملف Taskfile.yml الرئيسي مصغر","دعم اللغات المتعددة في .task/languages/"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Taskfile最佳实践","模块化设计","配置分离","工作流内部编排","工具任务分离","Taskfile性能优化"],"ja":["Taskfileベストプラクティス","モジュラー設計","構成の分離","ワークフローの内部編成","ツールタスクの分離","Taskfileパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Taskfile 최고의 실천","모듈식 설계","구성 분리","작업 흐름 내부 编成","도구任务 분리","Taskfile 성능 최적화"],"es":["Taskfile","automatización de tareas","diseño modular","configuración de tareas","flujos de trabajo","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Taskfile","automatisation de tâches","conception modulaire","configuration de tâches","flux de travail","outils de développement"],"de":["Taskfile","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","modulares Design","Aufgabenkonfiguration","Arbeitsabläufe","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Taskfile","melhores práticas","otimização","workflow de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de tarefas","configuração de tarefas"],"ru":["Taskfile","рекомендации","оптимизация","рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения","управление задачами","конфигурация задач"],"ar":["ملف المهام","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين","سير عمل التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المهام","إعدادات المهام"]}},"owner":"kreuzberg-dev","repo":"html-to-markdown","repoPath":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"taskfile-best-practices-guidelines","description":"","bodyPreview":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: high\n\n# Taskfile Best Practices & Guidelines\n\n**Modular Design Principles**:\n\n- Each language gets its own task file in `.task/languages/`\n- Workflows (build, test, lint, e2e) are orchestrated internally in `.task/workflows/`\n- Configuration separated into `.task/config/` (vars.yml, platforms.yml)\n- Tool tasks in `.task/tools/` (version-sync, pdfium, pre-commit, docs, smoke)\n- Main Taskfile.yml is minimal - just","body":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: high\n\n# Taskfile Best Practices & Guidelines\n\n**Modular Design Principles**:\n\n- Each language gets its own task file in `.task/languages/`\n- Workflows (build, test, lint, e2e) are orchestrated internally in `.task/workflows/`\n- Configuration separated into `.task/config/` (vars.yml, platforms.yml)\n- Tool tasks in `.task/tools/` (version-sync, pdfium, pre-commit, docs, smoke)\n- Main Taskfile.yml is minimal - just includes and top-level entry points\n\n**Creating New Task Files**:\n\n1. Create `.task/languages/{language}.yml` for language-specific tasks\n1. Include in main Taskfile.yml: `{language}: taskfile: .task/languages/{language}.yml`\n1. Use namespace pattern: `task {language}:build`, `task {language}:test`\n1. Support BUILD_PROFILE for dev/release/ci variants\n1. Include both `.dev` and `.release` variants of build/test tasks\n\n**Variable Management**:\n\n- Global variables in `.task/config/vars.yml` (BUILD_PROFILE, VERSION, paths, OS/ARCH)\n- Platform-specific in `.task/config/platforms.yml` (EXE_EXT, LIB_EXT, NUM_CPUS)\n- Language-specific vars in language files (e.g., PYTHON_VERSION, RUST_LOG)\n- Avoid hardcoding paths; use {{.ROOT}}, {{.CRATES_DIR}}, {{.PACKAGES_DIR}}, {{.TARGET_DIR}}\n- Use {{.BUILD_PROFILE}} to determine debug vs. release builds\n- Use {{.OS}}, {{.ARCH}}, {{.EXE_EXT}}, {{.LIB_EXT}} for cross-platform support\n\n**Task Naming Convention**:\n\n- Language tasks: `task {language}:{action}` (e.g., rust:build, python:test, node:lint)\n- Workflow tasks: `task {workflow}:{scope}` (e.g., build:all, test:all:fast, lint:check)\n- Tool tasks: `task {tool}:{action}` (e.g., version:sync, pdfium:install)\n- Variants: `:dev`, `:release`, `:ci`, `:fast`, `:check`\n\n**Task Description Standards**:\n\n- Write task `desc` field for every task (used in `task --list`)\n- Be descriptive: \"Build Rust core in release mode\" not just \"Build Rust\"\n- Include BUILD_PROFILE if relevant: \"Lint Python (uses ruff, mypy)\"\n\n**Cross-Platform Considerations**:\n\n- Test commands on Windows, Linux, macOS before committing\n- Use Taskfile path conventions (forward slashes converted automatically)\n- Set `platforms: [linux, darwin]` or `platforms: [windows]` if OS-specific\n- Use ENV variables for library paths: LD_LIBRARY_PATH (Linux), DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH (macOS)\n\n**Error Handling**:\n\n- Always set `requires: [\"task\"]` or ensure task is available\n- Use `ignore_error: true` sparingly; prefer explicit error handling\n- Run pre-flight checks (e.g., version checks) in setup tasks\n- Clear error messages for dependencies (e.g., \"Install Rust via rustup\")\n\n**Caching & Performance**:\n\n- Leverage {{.NUM_CPUS}} for parallel builds: `cargo build -j {{.NUM_CPUS}}`\n- Cache dependencies between CI runs (Cargo.lock, npm-lock.yaml, etc.)\n- Use `:fast` variants for quick validation; full tests in separate task\n- Reuse tasks: `task rust:build` instead of duplicating build commands\n\n**Documentation & Discovery**:\n\n- Run `task --list` to see all available tasks (requires good desc fields)\n- Run `task {language}:` to list all tasks in a namespace\n- Update README when adding new major workflows\n- Link to task files from docs when documenting CLI usage\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:40:36.865Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing structured task automation and Modular Design Principles","zh":"非常适合需要结构化任务自动化和模块化设计原则的 DevOps 代理","ja":"DevOps エージェントが構造化されたタスク自動化とモジュラー設計原則を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"구조화된 작업 자동화와 모듈러 설계 원칙이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan automatización de tareas estructuradas y principios de diseño modulares","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une automatisation de tâches structurées et de principes de conception modulaires","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenautomatisierung und modulare Entwurfsprinzipien benötigen","pt":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing structured task automation and Modular Design Principles","ru":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing structured task automation and Modular Design Principles","ar":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing structured task automation and Modular Design Principles"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate workflows internally using streaming parsers and built-in OCR, while maintaining a minimal main Taskfile.yml, and utilizes configuration separation into vars.yml and platforms.yml, and leverages tool tasks in .task/tools/","zh":"赋予代理内部编排工作流的能力，使用流媒体解析器和内置 OCR，同时保持最小的主 Taskfile.yml，并利用 vars.yml 和 platforms.yml 的配置分离，并利用 .task/tools/ 中的工具任务","ja":"エージェントが内部でワークフローをオーケストレーションできるようにし、ストリーミングパーサーとビルトインOCRを使用しながら、最小のメインタスクファイル.ymlを維持し、vars.ymlとplatforms.ymlのコンフィギュレーション分離を利用し、.task/tools/にあるツールタスクを利用","ko":"에이전트가 내부적으로 워크플ロー를 오케스트레이션 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 스트리밍 파서와 내장 OCR을 사용하여 최소한의 메인 Taskfile.yml을 유지하며, vars.yml 및 platforms.yml의 구성 분리를 활용하며, .task/tools/ 에 있는 툴 태스크를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar flujos de trabajo internamente utilizando analizador de transmisiones y OCR integrado, manteniendo un archivo Taskfile.yml mínimo, y utiliza la separación de configuración en vars.yml y platforms.yml, y aprovecha las tareas de herramientas en .task/tools/","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer des flux de travail internes en utilisant des analyseurs de diffusion et de l''OCR intégré, tout en maintenant un fichier Taskfile.yml minimal, et utilise la séparation de la configuration dans vars.yml et platforms.yml, et tire parti des tâches d''outils dans .task/tools/","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, interne Workflows mithilfe von Streaming-Parsern und integriertem OCR zu orchestrieren, während ein minimales Haupt-Taskfile.yml beibehalten wird, und nutzt die Konfigurationstrennung in vars.yml und platforms.yml, und nutzt Tool-Aufgaben in .task/tools/","pt":"Empowers agents to orchestrate workflows internally using streaming parsers and built-in OCR, while maintaining a minimal main Taskfile.yml, and utilizes configuration separation into vars.yml and platforms.yml, and leverages tool tasks in .task/tools/","ru":"Empowers agents to orchestrate workflows internally using streaming parsers and built-in OCR, while maintaining a minimal main Taskfile.yml, and utilizes configuration separation into vars.yml and platforms.yml, and leverages tool tasks in .task/tools/","ar":"Empowers agents to orchestrate workflows internally using streaming parsers and built-in OCR, while maintaining a minimal main Taskfile.yml, and utilizes configuration separation into vars.yml and platforms.yml, and leverages tool tasks in .task/tools/"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating build, test, lint, and e2e workflows","Generating structured data from 56+ document formats","Debugging taskfile configurations using separated vars.yml and platforms.yml"],"zh":["自动化构建、测试、lint 和 e2e 工作流","从 56+ 种文档格式生成结构化数据","使用分离的 vars.yml 和 platforms.yml 调试任务文件配置"],"ja":["ビルド、テスト、lint、e2e ワークフローの自動化","56 種類以上のドキュメント形式から構造化データを生成","分離された vars.yml と platforms.yml を使用してタスクファイルのコンフィギュレーションをデバッグ"],"ko":["빌드, 테스트, lint, e2e 워크플로우의 자동화","56종 이상의 문서 형식에서 구조화된 데이터 생성","분리된 vars.yml 및 platforms.yml을 사용하여 태스크 파일 구성 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de compilación, prueba, lint y e2e","Generar datos estructurados a partir de 56+ formatos de documentos","Depurar configuraciones de taskfile utilizando vars.yml y platforms.yml separados"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de construction, de test, de lint et de e2e","Générer des données structurées à partir de 56+ formats de documents","Déboguer les configurations de taskfile en utilisant des vars.yml et des platforms.yml séparés"],"de":["Automatisieren von Build-, Test-, Lint- und e2e-Workflows","Erzeugen von strukturierten Daten aus 56+ Dokumentenformaten","Debuggen von Taskfile-Konfigurationen unter Verwendung von getrennten vars.yml und platforms.yml"],"pt":["Automating build, test, lint, and e2e workflows","Generating structured data from 56+ document formats","Debugging taskfile configurations using separated vars.yml and platforms.yml"],"ru":["Automating build, test, lint, and e2e workflows","Generating structured data from 56+ document formats","Debugging taskfile configurations using separated vars.yml and platforms.yml"],"ar":["Automating build, test, lint, and e2e workflows","Generating structured data from 56+ document formats","Debugging taskfile configurations using separated vars.yml and platforms.yml"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .task directory structure","Limited to Taskfile.yml syntax and configuration"],"zh":["需要 .task 目录结构","仅限于 Taskfile.yml 语法和配置"],"ja":[".task ディレクトリ構造が必要","Taskfile.yml の構文とコンフィギュレーションのみに限定"],"ko":[".task 디렉토리 구조가 필요","Taskfile.yml의 구문 및 구성에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere estructura de directorio .task","Limitado a la sintaxis y configuración de Taskfile.yml"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de répertoire .task","Limité à la syntaxe et à la configuration de Taskfile.yml"],"de":["Benötigt .task-Verzeichnisstruktur","Begrenzt auf Taskfile.yml-Syntax und -Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requires .task directory structure","Limited to Taskfile.yml syntax and configuration"],"ru":["Requires .task directory structure","Limited to Taskfile.yml syntax and configuration"],"ar":["Requires .task directory structure","Limited to Taskfile.yml syntax and configuration"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
