Kommentare für komplexe Logik","Komponenten-Diagramme für Software-Architekturen","Aktualisierung von README-Dateien","Generierung von Architektur-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de documentação de API","Comentários de código para lógica complexa","Atualização de arquivos README","Geração de documentação de arquitetura","Suporte a XML docs para APIs públicas","Suporte a TODO/FIXME para dívida técnica"],"ru":["Создание документации API","Комментарии кода для сложной логики","Обновление файлов README","Генерация документации архитектуры","Поддержка XML-документов для публичных API","Поддержка TODO/FIXME для технического долга"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق API","شرح الكود لل_logic_ المعقدة","تحديث ملفات README","إنشاء وثائق هندسة","دعم وثائق XML ل_APIs_ العامة","دعم TODO/FIXME للديون الفنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["任务文档","自动化文档","代码注释","API文档","架构文档","技术债","XML文档","内联注释","文档工作流"],"ja":["タスクドキュメンテーション","ドキュメントの自動化","コードコメント","APIドキュメント","構造ドキュメント","技術債","XMLドキュメント","インラインコメント","ドキュメントワークフロー"],"ko":["작업 문서화","문서 자동화","코드 주석","API 문서","아키텍처 문서","기술 부채","XML 문서","인라인 주석","문서 작업 흐름"],"es":["documentación de tareas","documentación de API","comentarios de código","diagramas de componentes","arquitectura de software","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["documentation de tâches","documentation d''API","commentaires de code","diagrammes de composants","architecture de logiciels","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Aufgaben-Dokumentation","API-Dokumentation","Code-Kommentare","Komponenten-Diagramme","Software-Architektur","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["documentação de tarefas","fluxo de trabalho de API","comentários de código","arquitetura de software","desenvolvimento de software","API documentation","code comments","software architecture"],"ru":["документация задач","рабочий процесс API","комментарии кода","архитектура программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","API документация","комментарии кода","архитектура ПО"],"ar":["توثيق المهام","تدفق عمل وثائق API","شرح الكود","هندسة البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","وثائق API","شرح الكود","هندسة البرامج"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tasks-documentation","description":"Use for WRITING documentation with ready-to-use code templates (C# XML docs, TypeScript JSDoc, API docs, README patterns). Best for implementing actual documentation, adding code comments, and creating docs from scratch. NOT for documentation planning (use documentation instead).","bodyPreview":"# Documentation Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating API documentation\n- Writing code comments\n- Updating README files\n- Generating architecture documentation\n\n## Documentation Types\n\n### 1. Code Comments\n\n- XML docs for public APIs\n- Inline comments for complex logic\n- TODO/FIXME for technical debt\n\n### 2. API Documentation\n\n- Endpoint descriptions\n- Request/response schemas\n- Error codes and handling\n\n### 3. Architecture Documentation\n\n- Component diagrams\n- Data flow documentation","body":"# Documentation Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating API documentation\n- Writing code comments\n- Updating README files\n- Generating architecture documentation\n\n## Documentation Types\n\n### 1. Code Comments\n\n- XML docs for public APIs\n- Inline comments for complex logic\n- TODO/FIXME for technical debt\n\n### 2. API Documentation\n\n- Endpoint descriptions\n- Request/response schemas\n- Error codes and handling\n\n### 3. Architecture Documentation\n\n- Component diagrams\n- Data flow documentation\n- Integration guides\n\n## Pattern 1: C# XML Documentation\n\n```csharp\n/// <summary>\n/// Saves or updates an employee entity.\n/// </summary>\n/// <remarks>\n/// This command handles both create and update operations.\n/// For new employees, the Id should be null or empty.\n/// </remarks>\n/// <example>\n/// <code>\n/// var command = new SaveEmployeeCommand\n/// {\n///     Name = \"John Doe\",\n///     Email = \"john@example.com\"\n/// };\n/// var result = await handler.HandleAsync(command, cancellationToken);\n/// </code>\n/// </example>\npublic sealed class SaveEmployeeCommand : PlatformCqrsCommand<SaveEmployeeCommandResult>\n{\n    /// <summary>\n    /// The unique identifier of the employee.\n    /// Null or empty for new employees.\n    /// </summary>\n    public string? Id { get; set; }\n\n    /// <summary>\n    /// The employee''s full name.\n    /// </summary>\n    /// <value>Must be non-empty and max 200 characters.</value>\n    public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n}\n\n/// <summary>\n/// Represents a unique expression for finding an employee.\n/// </summary>\n/// <param name=\"companyId\">The company identifier.</param>\n/// <param name=\"userId\">The user identifier.</param>\n/// <returns>An expression that matches the unique employee.</returns>\npublic static Expression<Func<Employee, bool>> UniqueExpr(string companyId, string userId)\n    => e => e.CompanyId == companyId && e.UserId == userId;\n```\n\n## Pattern 2: TypeScript JSDoc\n\n````typescript\n/**\n * Manages the feature list state and operations.\n *\n * @example\n * ```typescript\n * @Component({\n *   providers: [FeatureListStore]\n * })\n * export class FeatureListComponent {\n *   constructor(private store: FeatureListStore) {\n *     store.loadItems();\n *   }\n * }\n * ```\n */\n@Injectable()\nexport class FeatureListStore extends PlatformVmStore<FeatureListState> {\n  /**\n   * Loads items from the API with current filters.\n   *\n   * @remarks\n   * This effect automatically tracks loading state under the key ''loadItems''.\n   * Use `isLoading$(''loadItems'')` to check loading status.\n   *\n   * @see {@link FeatureApiService.getList}\n   */\n  public loadItems = this.effectSimple(() => /* ... */);\n\n  /**\n   * Updates the filter criteria and resets to first page.\n   *\n   * @param filters - Partial filter object to merge with current filters\n   *\n   * @example\n   * ```typescript\n   * // Filter by status\n   * store.setFilters({ status: FeatureStatus.Active });\n   *\n   * // Filter by search text\n   * store.setFilters({ searchText: ''keyword'' });\n   * ```\n   */\n  public setFilters(filters: Partial<FeatureFilters>): void {\n    // ...\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Represents a feature entity from the API.\n */\nexport interface FeatureDto {\n  /** Unique identifier */\n  id: string;\n\n  /** Display name of the feature */\n  name: string;\n\n  /**\n   * Current status of the feature.\n   * @default FeatureStatus.Draft\n   */\n  status: FeatureStatus;\n}\n````\n\n## Pattern 3: API Endpoint Documentation\n\n```csharp\n/// <summary>\n/// Employee management endpoints.\n/// </summary>\n[ApiController]\n[Route(\"api/[controller]\")]\n[PlatformAuthorize]\npublic class EmployeeController : PlatformBaseController\n{\n    /// <summary>\n    /// Retrieves a paginated list of employees.\n    /// </summary>\n    /// <param name=\"query\">Query parameters for filtering and pagination.</param>\n    /// <returns>Paginated list of employees.</returns>\n    /// <response code=\"200\">Returns the employee list.</response>\n    /// <response code=\"400\">Invalid query parameters.</response>\n    /// <response code=\"401\">Unauthorized - authentication required.</response>\n    /// <response code=\"403\">Forbidden - insufficient permissions.</response>\n    [HttpGet]\n    [ProducesResponseType(typeof(GetEmployeeListQueryResult), StatusCodes.Status200OK)]\n    [ProducesResponseType(typeof(ProblemDetails), StatusCodes.Status400BadRequest)]\n    public async Task<IActionResult> GetList([FromQuery] GetEmployeeListQuery query)\n        => Ok(await Cqrs.SendAsync(query));\n\n    /// <summary>\n    /// Creates or updates an employee.\n    /// </summary>\n    /// <param name=\"command\">Employee data to save.</param>\n    /// <returns>The saved employee.</returns>\n    /// <response code=\"200\">Employee saved successfully.</response>\n    /// <response code=\"400\">Validation failed.</response>\n    /// <response code=\"404\">Employee not found (for updates).</response>\n    [HttpPost]\n    [ProducesResponseType(typeof(SaveEmployeeCommandResult), StatusCodes.Status200OK)]\n    [ProducesResponseType(typeof(ValidationProblemDetails), StatusCodes.Status400BadRequest)]\n    [ProducesResponseType(typeof(ProblemDetails), StatusCodes.Status404NotFound)]\n    public async Task<IActionResult> Save([FromBody] SaveEmployeeCommand command)\n        => Ok(await Cqrs.SendAsync(command));\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 4: README Documentation\n\n```markdown\n# Feature Name\n\nBrief description of what this feature does.\n\n## Overview\n\nMore detailed explanation of the feature''s purpose and functionality.\n\n## Architecture\n```\n\n┌─────────────────┐ ┌──────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐\n│ Frontend │────▶│ API Layer │────▶│ Domain Layer │\n│ Component │ │ Controller │ │ Entity │\n└─────────────────┘ └──────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘\n\n````\n\n## Usage\n\n### Backend\n\n```csharp\n// Example usage\nvar command = new SaveFeatureCommand { Name = \"Example\" };\nvar result = await handler.HandleAsync(command, cancellationToken);\n````\n\n### Frontend\n\n```typescript\n// Example usage\nthis.store.loadItems();\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n| Setting        | Description               | Default |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- | ------- |\n| `MaxItems`     | Maximum items per page    | 50      |\n| `CacheTimeout` | Cache duration in seconds | 300     |\n\n## API Endpoints\n\n| Method | Endpoint            | Description           |\n| ------ | ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| GET    | `/api/feature`      | List features         |\n| POST   | `/api/feature`      | Create/update feature |\n| DELETE | `/api/feature/{id}` | Delete feature        |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Code | Description          |\n| ---- | -------------------- |\n| 400  | Invalid request data |\n| 404  | Feature not found    |\n| 409  | Conflict (duplicate) |\n\n## Related\n\n- Entity documentation examples in this section\n- API reference examples in this section\n\n````\n\n## Pattern 5: Inline Code Comments\n\n```csharp\nprotected override async Task<SaveEmployeeCommandResult> HandleAsync(\n    SaveEmployeeCommand request, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n{\n    // Step 1: Determine if this is a create or update operation\n    var isCreate = request.Id.IsNullOrEmpty();\n\n    // Step 2: Get or create the entity\n    var employee = isCreate\n        ? request.MapToNewEntity()\n            .With(e => e.CreatedBy = RequestContext.UserId())\n        : await repository.GetByIdAsync(request.Id, cancellationToken)\n            .EnsureFound($\"Employee not found: {request.Id}\")\n            .Then(existing => request.UpdateEntity(existing));\n\n    // Step 3: Validate business rules\n    // NOTE: This checks for duplicate codes within the same company\n    await employee.ValidateAsync(repository, cancellationToken).EnsureValidAsync();\n\n    // Step 4: Persist changes\n    // The repository automatically raises entity events for cross-service sync\n    var saved = await repository.CreateOrUpdateAsync(employee, cancellationToken);\n\n    // Step 5: Return result\n    return new SaveEmployeeCommandResult\n    {\n        Employee = new EmployeeDto(saved)\n    };\n}\n````\n\n## Documentation Guidelines\n\n### DO\n\n- Document public APIs with XML/JSDoc\n- Explain \"why\" not \"what\"\n- Include usage examples\n- Keep documentation close to code\n- Update docs when code changes\n\n### DON''T\n\n- State the obvious\n- Leave TODO comments indefinitely\n- Write documentation that duplicates code\n- Create separate docs that become stale\n\n## Comment Types\n\n| Type             | When to Use               |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `/// <summary>`  | Public API documentation  |\n| `// Explanation` | Complex logic explanation |\n| `// TODO:`       | Planned improvements      |\n| `// FIXME:`      | Known issues              |\n| `// HACK:`       | Temporary workarounds     |\n| `// NOTE:`       | Important information     |\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Public APIs have XML/JSDoc documentation\n- [ ] Complex logic has explanatory comments\n- [ ] Examples are provided where helpful\n- [ ] Documentation is accurate and up-to-date\n- [ ] No obvious/redundant comments\n- [ ] TODO/FIXME items are actionable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:40:29.112Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents requiring automated documentation workflows for API documentation, code comments, and architecture diagrams.","zh":"适用于需要自动化文档工作流的技术写作代理，包括API文档、代码注释和架构图。","ja":"APIドキュメント、コードコメント、建築図の自動化ドキュメントワークフローを必要とするテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適。","ko":"API 문서, 코드 주석 및 아키텍처 다이어그램을 위한 자동화된 문서 작업 흐름을 필요로 하는 기술 문서 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de escritura técnica que requieren flujos de trabajo de documentación automatizados para la documentación de API, comentarios de código y diagramas de arquitectura.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de rédaction technique nécessitant des flux de travail de documentation automatisés pour la documentation d''API, les commentaires de code et les diagrammes d''architecture.","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten, die automatisierte Dokumentationsworkflows für API-Dokumentation, Code-Kommentare und Architekturdiagramme benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que exigem fluxos de trabalho de documentação automatizados para documentação de API, comentários de código e diagramas de arquitetura.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, требующих автоматизированных рабочих процессов документации для документации API, комментариев кода и диаграмм архитектуры.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية التي تتطلب سير عمل توثيق أتمتيكي لتوثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات والتعليقات على الشفرة ومخططات الهندسة المعمارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality documentation using XML docs, inline comments, and TODO/FIXME tags, while also supporting endpoint descriptions, request/response schemas, and component diagrams, all through a standardized documentation workflow.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量文档的能力，使用XML文档、内联注释和TODO/FIXME标签，同时支持端点描述、请求/响应模式和组件图，所有通过标准化的文档工作流。","ja":"XMLドキュメント、インラインコメント、TODO/FIXMEタグを使用して、高品質のドキュメントを生成するエージェントを可能にし、エンドポイントの説明、リクエスト/レスポンススキーマ、コンポーネントダイアグラムもサポートし、すべて標準化されたドキュメントワークフローを通じて。","ko":"XML 문서, 인라인 주석 및 TODO/FIXME 태그를 사용하여 높은 품질의 문서를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 엔드ポイント 설명, 요청/응답 스키마 및 구성 요소 다이어그램도 지원하며, 모든 표준화된 문서 작업 흐름을 통해 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación de alta calidad utilizando documentos XML, comentarios en línea y etiquetas TODO/FIXME, y también admite descripciones de puntos finales, esquemas de solicitud/respuesta y diagramas de componentes, todo a través de un flujo de trabajo de documentación estandarizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation de haute qualité en utilisant des documents XML, des commentaires en ligne et des balises TODO/FIXME, tout en prenant en charge les descriptions d''endpoints, les schémas de requête/réponse et les diagrammes de composants, le tout via un flux de travail de documentation standardisé.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Dokumentationen unter Verwendung von XML-Dokumenten, Inline-Kommentaren und TODO/FIXME-Tags zu erstellen, und unterstützt auch Endpunktbeschreibungen, Anfrage/Antwortschemata und Komponentendiagramme, alles über einen standardisierten Dokumentationsworkflow.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentação de alta qualidade usando documentos XML, comentários inline e tags TODO/FIXME, além de suportar descrições de endpoint, esquemas de solicitação/resposta e diagramas de componentes, todos por meio de um fluxo de trabalho de documentação padronizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать документацию высокого качества с помощью документов XML, встроенных комментариев и тегов TODO/FIXME, а также поддерживает описания конечных точек, схемы запроса/ответа и диаграммы компонентов, все через стандартизированный рабочий процесс документации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء توثيق عالي الجودة باستخدام وثائق XML والتعليقات المتضمنة وسلاسل TODO/FIXME، بالإضافة إلى دعم وصفات النقاط النهائية ومخططات الطلب/الاستجابة ومخططات المكونات، كل ذلك من خلال سير عمل توثيق معياري."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API documentation updates","Generating code comments for complex logic","Creating architecture diagrams for component visualization"],"zh":["自动更新API文档","为复杂逻辑生成代码注释","创建组件可视化的架构图"],"ja":["APIドキュメントの自動更新","複雑なロジックのコードコメントの生成","コンポーネントの視覚化のためのアーキテクチャ図の作成"],"ko":["API 문서 자동 업데이트","복잡한 로직을 위한 코드 주석 생성","구성 요소 시각화를 위한 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de la documentación de API","Generar comentarios de código para lógica compleja","Crear diagramas de arquitectura para la visualización de componentes"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de la documentation d''API","Générer des commentaires de code pour une logique complexe","Créer des diagrammes d''architecture pour la visualisation de composants"],"de":["Automatisierung von API-Dokumentationsaktualisierungen","Erstellung von Code-Kommentaren für komplexe Logik","Erstellung von Architekturdiagrammen für die Visualisierung von Komponenten"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação de API","Gerar comentários de código para lógica complexa","Criar diagramas de arquitetura para visualização de componentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации API","Генерировать комментарии кода для сложной логики","Создавать диаграммы архитектуры для визуализации компонентов"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديثات وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إنشاء تعليقات على الشفرة للمنطق المعقد","إنشاء مخططات الهندسة المعمارية لتصور المكونات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project root directory","Limited to specific documentation types (code comments, API documentation, architecture documentation)"],"zh":["需要访问项目根目录","仅限于特定文档类型（代码注释、API文档、架构文档）"],"ja":["プロジェクトルートディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","特定のドキュメントタイプ（コードコメント、APIドキュメント、アーキテクチャドキュメント）に限定"],"ko":["프로젝트 루트 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","특정 문서 유형(코드 주석, API 문서, 아키텍처 문서)으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio raíz del proyecto","Limitado a tipos de documentación específicos (comentarios de código, documentación de API, documentación de arquitectura)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire racine du projet","Limité à des types de documentation spécifiques (commentaires de code, documentation d''API, documentation d''architecture)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Stammverzeichnis des Projekts","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Dokumentationstypen (Code-Kommentare, API-Dokumentation, Architekturdokumentation)"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao diretório raiz do projeto","Limitado a tipos de documentação específicos (comentários de código, documentação de API, documentação de arquitetura)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к корневому каталогу проекта","Ограничен определёнными типами документации (комментарии кода, документация API, документация архитектуры)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل الجذري للمشروع","محدود بنوع معين من التوثيق (تعليقات الشفرة، توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، توثيق الهندسة المعمارية)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
