fr":"rust-actor : Couche de capacités d''expert en IA pour Rust","de":"rust-actor: KI-Expertenfähigkeitenschicht für Rust","pt":"Rust Actor: Camada de Capacidade de Experto em IA","ru":"Rust Actor: Слой экспертных возможностей ИИ","ar":"Rust Actor: طبقة قابلة لل扩展 لمهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"rust-actor"},"description":{"zh":"Rust Actor框架是一个AI专家能力层，用于Rust工程实践，提供模块化技能编排和协作执行链","ja":"Rust Actorフレームワークは、Rustエンジニアリングの実践に使用されるAI専門家能力層です","ko":"Rust Actor 프레임워크는 Rust 엔지니어링 실습을 위한 AI 전문가 능력 계층입니다","es":"rust-actor es una capa de habilidades de experto en IA para Rust que permite la orquestación modular y la ejecución colaborativa en escenarios complejos","fr":"rust-actor est une couche de capacités d''expert en IA pour Rust qui permet l''orchestration modulaire et l''exécution collaborative dans des scénarios complexes","de":"rust-actor ist eine KI-Expertenfähigkeitenschicht für Rust, die eine modulare Orchestrierung und kollaborative Ausführung in komplexen Szenarien ermöglicht","pt":"Rust Actor é uma camada de capacidade de expert em IA para práticas de engenharia Rust, permitindo a criação de soluções escaláveis e flexíveis","ru":"Rust Actor — это слой экспертных возможностей ИИ для практик инженерии Rust, позволяющий создавать масштабируемые и гибкие решения","ar":"Rust Actor هو طبقة قابلة لل扩展 لمهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي لعمليات هندسة Rust، مما يسمح بإنشاء حلول قابلة للتحسين ومرونة","en":"An AI expert capability layer for Rust engineering practices, centered on modular skill orchestration and collaborative execution chains. It turns Rust’s cor..."},"definition":{"en":"An AI expert capability layer for Rust engineering practices, centered on modular skill orchestration and collaborative execution chains. It turns Rust’s core knowledge structures into callable reasoning and decision units, enabling diagnosis, design, and optimization in complex real-world scenarios."},"features":{"zh":["模块化技能编排","协作执行链","诊断和设计","优化复杂实世界场景","基于Rust的核心知识结构"],"ja":["モジュラーなスキルオーケストレーション","コ