cação para Desenvolve...","ru":"Контекстный Охотник: Инструмент для Общения Между Агентами","ar":"صياد السياق: أداة اتصال لتقنيي البرمجيات","en":"context-hunter"},"description":{"zh":"Context Hunter是一种代码重用和优化工具，帮助开发者在代码库中找到类似问题的解决方案","ja":"Context Hunterはコードの再利用と最適化ツールで、開発者がコードベース内で類似の問題解決策を見つけるのを支援します","ko":"컨텍스트 헌터는 코드 재사용 및 최적화 도구로 개발자가 코드베이스 내에서 유사한 문제 해결책을 찾는 것을 지원합니다","es":"Context Hunter es una herramienta de comunicación que ayuda a los desarrolladores a encontrar patrones existentes en el código y mejorar su implementación","fr":"Context Hunter est un outil de communication qui aide les développeurs à trouver des modèles existants dans le code et à améliorer leur mise en œuvre","de":"Context Hunter ist ein Kommunikations-Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, bestehende Muster im Code zu finden und ihre Implementierung zu verbessern","pt":"O Context Hunter é uma ferramenta de comunicação para desenvolvedores que ajuda a identificar padrões existentes no código e melhorar a colaboração entre equ...","ru":"Контекстный Охотник - это инструмент для общения между разработчиками, который помогает выявить существующие закономерности в коде и улучшить сотрудничество ...","ar":"صياد السياق هو أداة اتصال لتقنيي البرمجيات التي تساعد في تحديد الأنماط الحالية في الكود وتحسين التعاون بين الفرق","en":"Agent-to-Agent MCP communication tool for feedback requests"},"definition":{"en":"Agent-to-Agent MCP communication tool for feedback requests"},"features":{"zh":["发现现有模式","跟踪数据流","识别实用工具","优化代码重用","提高开发效率"],"ja":["既存のパターンを発見","データフローを追跡","ユーティリティを識別","コードの再利用を最適化","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["기존 패턴 발견","데이터 흐름 추적","유틸리티 식별","코드 재사용 최적화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Búsqueda de características análogas","Seguimiento del flujo de datos","Identificación de utilidades existentes","Mejora de la implementación","Análisis de patrones de caché y validación","Gestión de errores"],"fr":["Recherche de fonctionnalités analogues","Suivi du flux de données","Identification des utilitaires existants","Amélioration de la mise en œuvre","Analyse des modèles de cache et de validation","Gestion des erreurs"],"de":["Suche nach analogen Funktionen","Verfolgung des Datenflusses","Identifizierung bestehender Hilfsprogramme","Verbesserung der Implementierung","Analyse von Cach- und Validierungsmustern","Fehlerverwaltung"],"pt":["Identificação de padrões existentes no código","Melhoria da colaboração entre equipes","Otimização do desenvolvimento de software","Análise de fluxo de dados","Identificação de utilitários existentes"],"ru":["Выявление существующих закономерностей в коде","Улучшение сотрудничества между командами","Оптимизация разработки программного обеспечения","Анализ потока данных","Выявление существующих утилит"],"ar":["تحديد الأنماط الحالية في الكود","تحسين التعاون بين الفرق","تنظيم تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل تدفق البيانات","تحديد أدوات المساعدة الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码重用","代码优化","开发效率","Agent-to-Agent","MCP通信","反馈请求","代码库"],"ja":["コードの再利用","コードの最適化","開発効率","Agent-to-Agent","MCP通信","フィードバックリクエスト","コードベース"],"ko":["코드 재사용","코드 최적화","개발 효율성","에이전트 간","MCP 통신","피드백 요청","코드베이스"],"es":["Context Hunter","herramienta de comunicación","desarrollo de software","patrones de código","mejora de la implementación","análisis de código","desarrolladores","programación","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["Context Hunter","outil de communication","développement de logiciels","modèles de code","amélioration de la mise en œuvre","analyse de code","développeurs","programmation","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Context Hunter","Kommunikations-Tool","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Muster","Verbesserung der Implementierung","Code-Analyse","Entwickler","Programmierung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["Context Hunter","comunicação entre agentes","desenvolvimento de software","padrões de código","colaboração entre equipes","otimização de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Контекстный Охотник","общение между агентами","разработка программного обеспечения","закономерности кода","сотрудничество между командами","оптимизация разработки"],"ar":["صياد السياق","اتصال بين الوكلاء","تطوير البرمجيات","أنماط الكود","تعاون بين الفرق","تنظيم التطوير"]}},"owner":"MrLesk","repo":"agents-council","repoPath":"MrLesk/agents-council","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-hunter","description":"Discover codebase patterns, conventions, and unwritten rules before making changes. Use when implementing features, fixing bugs, or refactoring code.","bodyPreview":"# Context Hunter\n\nBefore writing code, investigate how similar problems are already solved in this codebase.\n\n## Before Implementation\n\n### Discover Existing Patterns\n\n1. **Find analogous features**: Search for code that solves similar problems. Study it before proposing your approach.\n2. **Trace data flow**: How does similar data move through the system? Note caching, validation, and error handling patterns.\n3. **Identify utilities**: Search for existing helpers before creating new ones.\n\n### D","body":"# Context Hunter\n\nBefore writing code, investigate how similar problems are already solved in this codebase.\n\n## Before Implementation\n\n### Discover Existing Patterns\n\n1. **Find analogous features**: Search for code that solves similar problems. Study it before proposing your approach.\n2. **Trace data flow**: How does similar data move through the system? Note caching, validation, and error handling patterns.\n3. **Identify utilities**: Search for existing helpers before creating new ones.\n\n### Detect Unwritten Conventions\n\nLook for implicit rules encoded in the codebase:\n\n- **Schema patterns**: `deleted_at` columns indicate soft-deletion. Audit columns indicate tracking requirements.\n- **Naming patterns**: Note consistency in `user_id` vs `userId` vs `userID`.\n- **Test patterns**: What''s tested thoroughly reveals team priorities.\n\n### Verify Assumptions\n\n- Run the test suite to understand current state\n- Check linter and formatter configs\n- Read recent commits in affected areas\n- Examine database schemas for constraints\n\n## During Implementation\n\n### Match Existing Code\n\nYour changes should be indistinguishable from existing code:\n\n- Use the same patterns, abstractions, and utilities\n- Follow the same error handling approach\n- Respect module boundaries\n- Match naming conventions exactly\n\n### Surface Concerns\n\nWhen you discover conflicts between requirements and existing patterns:\n\n- Ask clarifying questions before proceeding\n- Flag risks you''ve identified\n- Offer alternatives that align with codebase conventions\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore proposing changes, confirm:\n\n- [ ] Studied analogous features in the codebase\n- [ ] Checked for reusable utilities\n- [ ] Reviewed test patterns for similar functionality\n- [ ] Noted naming and schema conventions\n- [ ] Verified approach matches existing patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:41:28.945Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing efficient MCP communication and feedback request capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效MCP通信和反馈请求能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が効率的なMCP通信とフィードバック要求の機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 효율적인 MCP 통신 및 피드백 요청 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing efficient MCP communication and feedback request capabilities.","fr":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing efficient MCP communication and feedback request capabilities.","de":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing efficient MCP communication and feedback request capabilities.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de comunicação MCP eficiente e capacidades de solicitação de feedback.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих эффективного общения MCP и возможностей запроса обратной связи.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى اتصال MCP فعال وقدرات طلب обратية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to investigate existing code patterns, trace data flow, and identify utilities, leveraging MCP communication for feedback requests and utilizing protocols like Agent-to-Agent communication.","zh":"赋予代理调查现有代码模式、跟踪数据流和识别实用程序的能力，利用MCP通信进行反馈请求，并利用代理间通信等协议。","ja":"エージェントに既存のコードパターンを調査し、データフローを追跡し、ユーティリティを特定する能力を与え、MCP通信を使用してフィードバック要求を行い、エージェント間通信などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에 기존 코드 패턴을 조사하고 데이터 흐름을 추적하고 유틸리티를 식별하는 능력을 부여하여 MCP 통신을 사용하여 피드백 요청을 하며 에이전트 간 통신 등의 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to investigate existing code patterns, trace data flow, and identify utilities, leveraging MCP communication for feedback requests and utilizing protocols like Agent-to-Agent communication.","fr":"Empowers agents to investigate existing code patterns, trace data flow, and identify utilities, leveraging MCP communication for feedback requests and utilizing protocols like Agent-to-Agent communication.","de":"Empowers agents to investigate existing code patterns, trace data flow, and identify utilities, leveraging MCP communication for feedback requests and utilizing protocols like Agent-to-Agent communication.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar padrões de código existentes, rastrear o fluxo de dados e identificar utilitários, aproveitando a comunicação MCP para solicitações de feedback e utilizando protocolos como comunicação Agente-para-Agente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью исследовать существующие шаблоны кода, отслеживать поток данных и определять утилиты, используя MCP для запросов обратной связи и протоколы, такие как общение агент-агент.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من التحقيق في أنماط الكود الموجودة وتتبع تدفق البيانات وتحديد الأدوات، مستفيداً من اتصال MCP لطلبات التغذية الراجعة واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل اتصال العميل-العميل"},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering analogous features in codebases","Tracing data flow for caching and validation","Identifying existing utilities for reuse"],"zh":["在代码库中发现类似的功能","跟踪数据流以用于缓存和验证","识别现有的实用程序以进行重用"],"ja":["コードベースで類似の機能を発見する","キャッシングとバリデーションのためにデータフローを追跡する","再利用のために既存のユーティリティを特定する"],"ko":["코드베이스에서 유사한 기능을 발견하는 것","캐싱 및 검증을 위해 데이터 흐름을 추적하는 것","재사용을 위해 기존 유틸리티를 식별하는 것"],"es":["Discovering analogous features in codebases","Tracing data flow for caching and validation","Identifying existing utilities for reuse"],"fr":["Discovering analogous features in codebases","Tracing data flow for caching and validation","Identifying existing utilities for reuse"],"de":["Discovering analogous features in codebases","Tracing data flow for caching and validation","Identifying existing utilities for reuse"],"pt":["Descobrir recursos análogos em bases de código","Rastrear fluxo de dados para cache e validação","Identificar utilitários existentes para reutilização"],"ru":["Обнаружение аналогичных функций в базах кода","Отслеживание потока данных для кэширования и проверки","Определение существующих утилит для повторного использования"],"ar":["اكتشاف الميزات الشبيهة في قواعد البيانات","تتبع تدفق البيانات للتخزين المؤقت والتحقق","تحديد الأدوات الموجودة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Agent-to-Agent MCP communication setup","Limited to codebases with existing similar problems"],"zh":["需要代理间MCP通信设置","仅限于具有现有类似问题的代码库"],"ja":["エージェント間のMCP通信設定が必要","既存の類似の問題を持つコードベースのみに限定される"],"ko":["에이전트 간 MCP 통신 설정이 필요합니다.","기존의 유사한 문제를 가진 코드베이스에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requires Agent-to-Agent MCP communication setup","Limited to codebases with existing similar problems"],"fr":["Requires Agent-to-Agent MCP communication setup","Limited to codebases with existing similar problems"],"de":["Requires Agent-to-Agent MCP communication setup","Limited to codebases with existing similar problems"],"pt":["Exige configuração de comunicação MCP Agente-para-Agente","Limitado a bases de código com problemas semelhantes existentes"],"ru":["Требует настройки общения MCP агент-агент","Ограничен для баз кода с существующими похожими проблемами"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد اتصال MCP عميل-عميل","محدود بقواعد البيانات التي تمتلك مشاكل شبيهة موجودة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jandragsbaek/codex-template/seo-audit', 'community', 'jandragsbaek', 'codex-template', 'jandragsbaek/codex-template', 'seo-audit', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z', '2026-02-18T06:41:41.065Z', NULL, '{"id":"jandragsbaek/codex-template/seo-audit","name":"seo-audit","description":{"zh":"SEO审计工具帮助您找出网站的SEO问题，并提供改进搜索引擎排名的建议","ja":"SEOオーディットツールは、WebサイトのSEO問題を特定し、検索エンジンランキングの向上に関するアドバイスを提供する","ko":"SEO 감사 도구는 웹 사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 검색 엔진 순위 향상을 위한 제안을 제공합니다","es":"El análisis de SEO identifica problemas y proporciona recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento en búsqueda orgánica","fr":"L''audit SEO identifie les problèmes et fournit des recommandations pour améliorer la performance de recherche organique","de":"Das SEO-Audit identifiziert Probleme und liefert Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Leistung bei der organischen Suche","pt":"A análise SEO é um processo de identificação de problemas de otimização de busca e fornecimento de recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca.","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс выявления проблем оптимизации поиска и предоставления рекомендаций для улучшения показателей поиска.","ar":"فحص تحسين محركات البحث هو عملية لتحديد مشاكل تحسين البحث وتقديم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SEO 审计工具 - 提升搜索引擎排名","ja":"SEO オーディットツール - 検索エンジンランキングの向上","ko":"SEO 감사 도구 - 검색 엔진 순위 향상","es":"Análisis de SEO: Mejora tu posición en buscadores","fr":"Audit SEO: Améliorez votre référencement","de":"SEO-Audit: Verbessern Sie Ihre Suchmaschinen-Platzierung","pt":"Análise SEO - Otimização de Desempenho de Busca","ru":"Аудит SEO - Улучшение Органического Поиска","ar":"فحص تحسين محركات البحث - تحسين أداء البحث العضوي","en":"seo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"SEO审计工具帮助您找出网站的SEO问题，并提供改进搜索引擎排名的建议","ja":"SEOオーディットツールは、WebサイトのSEO問題を特定し、検索エンジンランキングの向上に関するアドバイスを提供する","ko":"SEO 감사 도구는 웹 사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 검색 엔진 순위 향상을 위한 제안을 제공합니다","es":"El análisis de SEO identifica problemas y proporciona recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento en búsqueda orgánica","fr":"L''audit SEO identifie les problèmes et fournit des recommandations pour améliorer la performance de recherche organique","de":"Das SEO-Audit identifiziert Probleme und liefert Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Leistung bei der organischen Suche","pt":"A análise SEO é um processo de identificação de problemas de otimização de busca e fornecimento de recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca.","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс выявления проблем оптимизации поиска и предоставления рекомендаций для улучшения показателей поиска.","ar":"فحص تحسين محركات البحث هو عملية لتحديد مشاكل تحسين البحث وتقديم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["网站分析","SEO问题识别","搜索引擎排名优化","性能改进建议","技术支持"],"ja":["Webサイト分析","SEO問題の特定","検索エンジンランキングの向上","パフォーマンス改善の提案","テクニカルサポート"],"ko":["웹 사이트 분석","SEO 문제 식별","검색 엔진 순위 향상","성능 개선 제안","기술 지원"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de sitio web","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento","Mejora de la posición en buscadores","Análisis de competidores","Informes personalizados"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse de site web","Recommandations pour améliorer la performance","Amélioration de la position dans les moteurs de recherche","Analyse des concurrents","Rapports personnalisés"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Website-Analyse","Empfehlungen zur Leistungsverbesserung","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinen-Platzierung","Wettbewerbsanalyse","Individuelle Berichte"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de otimização de busca","Análise de estrutura de site e conteúdo","Avaliação de links e autoridade do site","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de palavras-chave e competidores"],"ru":["Выявление проблем оптимизации поиска","Анализ структуры сайта и контента","Оценка ссылок и авторитета сайта","Рекомендации для улучшения показателей поиска","Анализ ключевых слов и конкурентов"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل تحسين البحث","تحليل هيكل الموقع والمحتوى","تقييم الروابط والسلطة الموقع","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","تحليل الكلمات الرئيسية والمنافسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO审计","搜索引擎优化","网站分析","排名优化","性能改进","技术支持"],"ja":["SEOオーディット","検索エンジン最適化","Webサイト分析","ランキングの向上","パフォーマンス改善","テクニカルサポート"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹 사이트 분석","순위 향상","성능 개선","기술 지원"],"es":["análisis de SEO","mejora de SEO","posición en buscadores","optimización de sitio web","análisis de competidores","informes de SEO","recomendaciones de SEO","SEO para desarrolladores"],"fr":["audit SEO","amélioration de SEO","position dans les moteurs de recherche","optimisation de site web","analyse des concurrents","rapports SEO","recommandations SEO","SEO pour développeurs"],"de":["SEO-Audit","SEO-Optimierung","Suchmaschinen-Platzierung","Website-Optimierung","Wettbewerbsanalyse","SEO-Berichte","SEO-Empfehlungen","SEO für Entwickler"],"pt":["análise SEO","otimização de busca","desempenho de busca","visibilidade de site","palavras-chave","links de qualidade","autoridade do site"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация поиска","показатели поиска","видимость сайта","ключевые слова","качественные ссылки","авторитет сайта"],"ar":["فحص تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين البحث","أداء البحث","رؤية الموقع","الكلمات الرئيسية","روابط جودة","سلطة الموقع"]}},"owner":"jandragsbaek","repo":"codex-template","repoPath":"jandragsbaek/codex-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:41:41.065Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing in-depth site analysis and actionable recommendations.","zh":"非常适合需要对网站进行深入分析和提供可行建议的SEO优化代理","ja":"SEO最適化エージェントがサイトの詳細な分析と実行可能な推奨事項を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"사이트에 대한 심층 분석 및 실행 가능한 제안이 필요한 SEO 최적화 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que necesitan un análisis de sitios en profundidad y recomendaciones concretas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de SEO ayant besoin d''une analyse approfondie de sites et de recommandations concrètes.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die eine umfassende Seitenanalyse und handhabbare Empfehlungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de SEO que precisam de análise aprofundada do site e recomendações viáveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по оптимизации SEO, которым требуется глубокий анализ сайта и действенные рекомендации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين محركات البحث الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل موقع متعمق وتوصيات قابلة للتنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide data-driven recommendations using site context and product marketing information, leveraging file formats like `.md` and protocols for efficient auditing.","zh":"赋予代理识别SEO问题和使用网站上下文及产品营销信息提供数据驱动的建议的能力，利用`.md`等文件格式和协议实现高效的审计","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を識別し、サイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティング情報を使用してデータ駆動型の推奨事項を提供する機能を提供し、`.md`などのファイル形式やプロトコルを使用して効率的な監査を実現","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 사이트 컨텍스트 및 제품 마케팅 정보를 사용하여 데이터 驅動형 제안을 제공할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, `.md`와 같은 파일 형식 및 프로토콜을 사용하여 효율적인 감사를 thực現","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y a proporcionar recomendaciones basadas en datos utilizando el contexto del sitio y la información de marketing de productos, aprovechando formatos de archivo como `.md` y protocolos para una auditoría eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations basées sur les données en utilisant le contexte du site et les informations de marketing de produits, en exploitant des formats de fichiers tels que `.md` et des protocoles pour une audit efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und datengetriebene Empfehlungen unter Verwendung des Seitenkontexts und der Produktmarketinginformationen zu liefern, indem es Dateiformate wie `.md` und Protokolle für eine effiziente Auditing nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações baseadas em dados usando o contexto do site e informações de marketing de produtos, aproveitando formatos de arquivo como `.md` e protocolos para auditoria eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять рекомендации, основанные на данных, используя контекст сайта и информацию о маркетинге продукта, используя форматы файлов, такие как `.md`, и протоколы для эффективной проверки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات مدعومة بالبيانات باستخدام سياق الموقع ومعلومات تسويق المنتج، واستخدام تنسيقات الملفات مثل `.md` وبروتوكولات للتدقيق الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structure for search engine optimization","Generating actionable recommendations for improving organic search performance","Analyzing site context for tailored SEO strategies"],"zh":["审计网站结构以进行搜索引擎优化","生成改进有机搜索性能的可行建议","分析网站上下文以制定量身定制的SEO策略"],"ja":["検索エンジン最適化のためにウェブサイト構造を監査","有機検索パフォーマンスを改善するための実行可能な推奨事項を生成","カスタマイズされたSEO戦略を策定するためのサイトコンテキストを分析"],"ko":["검색 엔진 최적화를 위해 웹사이트 구조 감사","유기적 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 제안 생성","맞춤형 SEO 전략을 수립하기 위한 사이트 컨텍스트 분석"],"es":["Auditoría de la estructura del sitio web para la optimización de los motores de búsqueda","Generación de recomendaciones concretas para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica","Análisis del contexto del sitio para estrategias de SEO personalizadas"],"fr":["Audit de la structure du site web pour l''optimisation des moteurs de recherche","Génération de recommandations concrètes pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique","Analyse du contexte du site pour des stratégies de SEO sur mesure"],"de":["Prüfung der Website-Struktur für die Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Generierung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung","Analyse des Seitenkontexts für maßgeschneiderte SEO-Strategien"],"pt":["Auditoria da estrutura do site para otimização de mecanismos de busca","Geração de recomendações viáveis para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica","Análise do contexto do site para estratégias de SEO personalizadas"],"ru":["Проверка структуры сайта для оптимизации поисковых систем","Генерация действенных рекомендаций для улучшения результатов органического поиска","Анализ контекста сайта для индивидуальных стратегий SEO"],"ar":["تدقيق هيكل الموقع لتحسين محركات البحث","توليد توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي","تحليل سياق الموقع لاستراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context and product marketing information","Dependent on existence of `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` file"],"zh":["需要访问网站上下文和产品营销信息","依赖于`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件的存在"],"ja":["サイトコンテキストと製品マーケティング情報へのアクセスが必要","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルの存在に依存"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 및 제품 마케팅 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 존재에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al contexto del sitio y a la información de marketing de productos","Depende de la existencia del archivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au contexte du site et aux informations de marketing de produits","Dépend de l''existence du fichier `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Seitenkontext und die Produktmarketinginformationen","Hängt von der Existenz der Datei `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao contexto do site e informações de marketing de produtos","Depende da existência do arquivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`"],"ru":["Требует доступа к контексту сайта и информации о маркетинге продукта","Зависит от существования файла `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سياق الموقع ومعلومات تسويق المنتج","يعتمد على وجود ملف `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
