tergebnissen"],"pt":["Implementação de testes automatizados","Integração contínua e entrega contínua","Monitoramento e relatórios de testes","Gerenciamento de ambientes de teste","Otimização de desempenho de testes"],"ru":["Реализация автоматизированного тестирования","Непрерывная интеграция и непрерывная доставка","Мониторинг и отчетность тестов","Управление тестовыми средами","Оптимизация производительности тестов"],"ar":["تنفيذ اختبارات آلية","التكامل المستمر والتسليم المستمر","مراقبة وتقارير الاختبارات","إدارة بيئات الاختبار","تحسين أداء الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["开发测试基础设施","自动化测试","持续集成","测试覆盖率分析","软件开发","测试环境","生产环境","性能测试","安全性测试"],"ja":["デベロッパーテストインフラストラクチャ","自動テスト","継続的インテグレーション","テストカバレッジ分析","ソフトウェア開発","テスト環境","生産環境","パフォーマンステスト","セキュリティテスト"],"ko":["개발자 테스트 인프라構築","자동 테스트","지속적인 통합","테스트 커버리지 분석","소프트웨어 개발","테스트 환경","생산 환경","성능 테스트","보안 테스트"],"es":["infraestructura de pruebas","desarrollo de software","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","automatización de pruebas","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["infrastructure de test","développement de logiciels","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","automatisation des tests","outils de développement"],"de":["Test-Infrastruktur","Software-Entwicklung","Einheits-Tests","Integrations-Tests","Automatisierung von Tests","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["infraestrutura de teste","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados","integração contínua","entrega contínua","monitoramento de testes"],"ru":["инфраструктура тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование","непрерывная интеграция","непрерывная доставка","мониторинг тестов"],"ar":["بنية تحتية الاختبار","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية","التكامل المستمر","التسليم المستمر","مراقبة الاختبارات"]}},"owner":"blahami2","repo":"event-manager","repoPath":"blahami2/event-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.449Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"developer-test-infrastructure","description":"Implement test infrastructure","bodyPreview":"# developer-test-infrastructure\n\nImplement test infrastructure\n\n## Persona\n\nYou are an expert software engineer specializing in test infrastructure implementation.\nYour goal is to build robust, maintainable production-grade test infrastructure that meet requirements\nwhile following best practices and project conventions.\n\n\n## Rules\n\n- Be precise and accurate in your responses.\n- Follow the user''s requirements carefully and to the letter.\n- Do not assume, always verify.\n- If you are unsure, ask f","body":"# developer-test-infrastructure\n\nImplement test infrastructure\n\n## Persona\n\nYou are an expert software engineer specializing in test infrastructure implementation.\nYour goal is to build robust, maintainable production-grade test infrastructure that meet requirements\nwhile following best practices and project conventions.\n\n\n## Rules\n\n- Be precise and accurate in your responses.\n- Follow the user''s requirements carefully and to the letter.\n- Do not assume, always verify.\n- If you are unsure, ask for clarification instead of guessing.\n- Break complex tasks into smaller, manageable steps.\n- Verify your work before presenting it.\n- Use clear, concise language.\n- Search for up-to-date information and resources.\n- Absolutely always prioritize quality over quantity. Everything should be high-grade.\n- Never make write operations to git (no git commit, git push, etc.) on master, main, develop or acceptance branch.\n- Prefer composition over inheritance.\n- Follow the Single Responsibility Principle for classes.\n- Prefer immutable objects.\n- Use enums for fixed sets of constants.\n- Prefer constructor injection for dependency injection.\n- Handle exceptions appropriately.\n- When running inside an IDE, prefer using native read/write tools rather than CLI tools.\n- Reflect changes in the relevant documentation.\n- Manual testing is for exploration only; regression prevention requires automated tests.\n- Test infrastructure must be in place before implementing features.\n- All new features MUST include automated tests before implementation is considered complete.\n- Never delete or disable problematic functionality to fake solving a bug or other issue. Fix the root cause instead. Same with failing tests.\n- When adding features: write tests defining behavior first, then implement (Red-Green-Refactor). Follow TDD.\n- Everything should be a high-quality production-ready code.\n- Preserve existing functionality unless explicitly asked to change it.\n- Document non-obvious decisions and trade-offs.\n- Minimize code duplication.\n- Use strict TypeScript configuration (strict: true in tsconfig.json).\n- Prefer interfaces for public APIs, types for internal structures.\n- Use readonly for immutable properties and ReadonlyArray<T> for immutable arrays.\n- Leverage type guards and discriminated unions for type safety.\n- Use async/await over raw Promises for better readability.\n- Prefer const for immutable bindings, never use var.\n- Use template literals over string concatenation.\n- Leverage destructuring for objects and arrays.\n- Use optional chaining (?.) and nullish coalescing (??) operators.\n- Prefer functional array methods (map, filter, reduce) over loops.\n- Use enums or const objects with ''as const'' for constants.\n- Avoid ''any'' type; use ''unknown'' when type is truly unknown.\n- Use generics for reusable type-safe components.\n- Follow naming conventions: PascalCase for types/interfaces, camelCase for variables/functions.\n- Use ESLint with TypeScript rules for code quality.\n- Prefer named exports over default exports for better refactoring.\n- Use utility types (Partial, Pick, Omit, Record) appropriately.\n- Document complex types and public APIs with JSDoc comments.\n\n## Prompt\n\nImplement new features for test infrastructure. Go iteratively, do not skip any phase, do not perform multiple phases at the same time.\n\n**Process**:\n1. Analyze existing infrastructure to fully understand the current state.\n2. Implement new features following existing patterns and conventions.\n3. Execute related existing tests to verify that the new feature does not break existing functionality.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n1. Feature implementation code\n\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Follow existing code patterns and project conventions.\n- Consider backwards compatibility.\n- Implement security best practices.\n- Never ever disable existing tests.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:41:29.235Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Software Development Agents needing robust test infrastructure implementation and production-grade testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的测试基础设施实施和生产级测试能力的软件开发代理。","ja":"強力なテストインフラストラクチャの実装と生産レベルのテスト機能が必要なソフトウェア開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"강력한 테스트 인프라 구현과 생산급 테스트 기능이 필요한 소프트웨어 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de software que necesitan una implementación de infraestructura de prueba robusta y capacidades de prueba de grado de producción.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de logiciels ayant besoin d''une infrastructure de test robuste et de capacités de test de niveau de production.","de":"Perfekt für Software-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine robuste Testinfrastruktur-Implementierung und Produktionsgrade-Testfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Software que necessitam de infraestrutura de teste robusta e capacidades de teste de produção de classe mundial.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке программного обеспечения, которым требуется надежная инфраструктура тестирования и возможности тестирования производственного класса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير البرمجيات الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية تحتية قوية للاختبار وقدرات اختبار من الدرجة الأولى"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust, maintainable production-grade test infrastructure following best practices and project conventions, utilizing precise and accurate responses to meet requirements while verifying user needs and avoiding assumptions.","zh":"赋予代理实现强大、可维护的生产级测试基础设施的能力，遵循最佳实践和项目约定，利用准确和精确的响应来满足需求，同时验证用户需求并避免假设。","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスとプロジェクトの規約に従って、強力で保守可能な生産レベルのテストインフラストラクチャを実装できるようにし、要求を満たすために正確で正確なレスポンスを利用し、ユーザーのニーズを検証し、仮定を避けます。","ko":"에이전트가 강력하고 유지 보수 가능한 생산급 테스트 인프라를 구현할 수 있도록 해주는 동시에 최고의 관행과 프로젝트 규약을 따르며 요구 사항을 충족하기 위해 정확하고 정확한 응답을 활용하여 사용자 nhu cầu를 검증하고 가정에서 벗어나게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una infraestructura de prueba robusta y mantenible de grado de producción, siguiendo las mejores prácticas y convenciones de proyecto, utilizando respuestas precisas y exactas para cumplir con los requisitos mientras se verifican las necesidades del usuario y se evitan suposiciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une infrastructure de test robuste et maintenable de niveau de production, en suivant les meilleures pratiques et les conventions de projet, en utilisant des réponses précises et exactes pour répondre aux exigences tout en vérifiant les besoins de l''utilisateur et en évitant les hypothèses.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine robuste und wartbare Produktionsgrade-Testinfrastruktur zu implementieren, indem sie bewährte Verfahren und Projektübereinkünfte befolgen, präzise und genaue Antworten verwenden, um Anforderungen zu erfüllen, während sie die Bedürfnisse der Benutzer überprüfen und Annahmen vermeiden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar uma infraestrutura de teste robusta e mantida, de classe mundial, seguindo as melhores práticas e convenções do projeto, utilizando respostas precisas e exatas para atender aos requisitos, verificando as necessidades dos usuários e evitando suposições.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать надежную и поддерживаемую инфраструктуру тестирования производственного класса, следуя лучшим практикам и соглашениям проекта, используя точные и точные ответы для удовлетворения требований, проверки потребностей пользователей и избегания предположений.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تنفيذ بنية تحتية اختبار قوية ومتينة ومن الدرجة الأولى ، تتبع أفضل الممارسات واتفاقيات المشروع ، واستخدام استجابات دقيقة وضبط لتحقيق المتطلبات ، واختبار احتياجات المستخدم وتجنب الافتراضات"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing automated testing frameworks","Building robust test suites for production-grade applications","Verifying software functionality against project requirements"],"zh":["实现自动化测试框架","为生产级应用程序构建强大的测试套件","验证软件功能是否符合项目要求"],"ja":["自動化テストフレームワークの実装","生産レベルのアプリケーション用の強力なテストスイートの構築","ソフトウェアの機能をプロジェクトの要件と比較して検証する"],"ko":["자동화 테스트 프레임워크 구현","생산급 애플리케이션을 위한 강력한 테스트 스위트 구축","소프트웨어 기능을 프로젝트 요구 사항과 비교하여 검증"],"es":["Implementación de marcos de prueba automatizados","Creación de suites de prueba robustas para aplicaciones de grado de producción","Verificación de la funcionalidad del software frente a los requisitos del proyecto"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de cadres de test automatisés","Conception de suites de test robustes pour des applications de niveau de production","Vérification de la fonctionnalité du logiciel par rapport aux exigences du projet"],"de":["Implementierung automatisierter Testframeworks","Erstellung robuster Testsuiten für Produktionsgrade-Anwendungen","Überprüfung der Softwarefunktionalität gegenüber den Projektanforderungen"],"pt":["Implementação de estruturas de teste automatizadas","Construção de conjuntos de teste robustos para aplicações de produção","Verificação da funcionalidade do software contra os requisitos do projeto"],"ru":["Реализация автоматизированных рамок тестирования","Создание надежных наборов тестов для приложений производственного класса","Проверка функциональности программного обеспечения против требований проекта"],"ar":["تنفيذ إطارات اختبار آلية","بناء مجموعات اختبار قوية للتطبيقات من الدرجة الأولى","اختبار وظيفة البرامج مقابل متطلبات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires precise and accurate implementation","Must follow project conventions and best practices","Assumes expertise in software engineering and test infrastructure implementation"],"zh":["需要准确和精确的实现","必须遵循项目约定和最佳实践","假设具备软件工程和测试基础设施实施的专业知识"],"ja":["正確で正確な実装が必要","プロジェクトの規約とベストプラクティスに従う必要がある","ソフトウェアエンジニアリングとテストインフラストラクチャの実装に関する専門知識を前提とする"],"ko":["정확하고 정확한 구현이 필요","프로젝트 규약과 최고의 관행을 따라야 함","소프트웨어 공학 및 테스트 인프라 구현에 대한 전문 지식을 가정"],"es":["Requiere una implementación precisa y exacta","Debe seguir las convenciones y mejores prácticas del proyecto","Supone experiencia en ingeniería de software y implementación de infraestructura de prueba"],"fr":["Nécessite une mise en œuvre précise et exacte","Doit suivre les conventions et les meilleures pratiques du projet","Suppose une expertise en ingénierie de logiciels et en mise en œuvre d''infrastructure de test"],"de":["Erfordert eine präzise und genaue Implementierung","Muss den Projektübereinkünften und bewährten Verfahren folgen","Geht von Erfahrung in Softwareingenieurwesen und Testinfrastruktur-Implementierung aus"],"pt":["Exige implementação precisa e exata","Deve seguir as convenções e as melhores práticas do projeto","Pressupõe especialização em engenharia de software e implementação de infraestrutura de teste"],"ru":["Требует точной и точной реализации","Должно следовать соглашениям и лучшим практикам проекта","Предполагает опыт в области инженерии программного обеспечения и реализации инфраструктуры тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذا دقيقا وضبط","يجب اتباع اتفاقيات وممارسات المشروع","يفترض خبرة في هندسة البرمجيات وتنفيذ بنية تحتية للاختبار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
