chitecture decisions\n- Implementation patterns\n- Library choices and constraints\n- TODO items and open questions\n\n### Step 3: Check Library Documentation\n\nIf the task involves specific libraries, read relevant files from:\n```\n.claude/docs/libraries/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Task\n\nWith the loaded context, execute the requested task following:\n- Coding principles from rules\n- Design decisions from DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from docs\n\n## Key Rules to Remember\n\nAfter loading, always follow these principles:\n\n1. **Simplicity first** - Choose readable code over complex\n2. **Single responsibility** - One function/class does one thing\n3. **Type hints required** - All functions need annotations\n4. **Use uv** - Never use pip directly\n5. **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, validate input, parameterize SQL\n\n## Language Protocol\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: English (variables, functions, comments)\n- **User communication**: Japanese (when reporting back through Claude Code)\n\n## Output\n\nAfter loading context, briefly confirm:\n- Rules loaded\n- Design document status\n- Ready to execute task\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:42:25.810Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Codex CLI Agents needing shared project context synchronization with Claude Code","zh":"非常适合需要与 Claude Code 共享项目上下文同步的 Codex CLI Agents","ja":"Claude Code とのプロジェクトコンテキストの同期が必要な Codex CLI エージェントに最適","ko":"Claude Code와 프로젝트 컨텍스트 동기화가 필요한 Codex CLI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI de Codex que necesitan sincronización de contexto de proyecto compartido con Claude Code","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI Codex ayant besoin d''une synchronisation de contexte de projet partagé avec Claude Code","de":"Perfekt für Codex-CLI-Agents, die eine gemeinsame Projekt-Kontextsynchronisierung mit Claude Code benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes CLI Codex que precisam de sincronização de contexto de projeto compartilhado com Claude Code","ru":"Ид