c Codex CLI et Claude Code","Lit tous les fichiers dans `.claude/rules/`","Prend en charge la charge des règles de codage et des environnements de développement","S''active au début de chaque tâche pour charger le contexte du projet","Améliore l''efficiencité dans le développement de projets"],"de":["Lädt den Kontext des Projekts aus dem Verzeichnis `.claude/`","Sichert die Konsistenz in der Entwicklung mit Codex CLI und Claude Code","Liest alle Dateien in `.claude/rules/`","Unterstützt die Lade von Codierregeln und Entwicklungsumgebungen","Wird zu Beginn jeder Aufgabe aktiviert, um den Kontext des Projekts zu laden","Verbessert die Effizienz in der Entwicklung von Projekten"],"pt":["Carregamento de regras de codificação","Leitura de arquivos em `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilidade com Codex CLI e Claude Code","Melhoria da experiência do desenvolvedor","Suporte a diretórios personalizados"],"ru":["Загрузка правил кодирования","Чтение файлов в `.claude/rules/`","Совместимость с Codex CLI и Claude Code","Улучшение опыта разработчика","Поддержка пользовательских директорий"],"ar":["تحميل قواعد الترميز","قراءة الملفات في `.claude/rules/`","الت tươngث مع Codex CLI و Claude Code","تحسين تجربة المطور","دعم الدلائل المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Context Loader","共享项目上下文","Codex CLI","Claude Code","开发效率","项目配置"],"ja":["コンテキストローダー","共有プロジェクト コンテキスト","Codex CLI","Claude Code","開発効率","プロジェクト設定"],"ko":["컨텍스트 로더","공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트","Codex CLI","Claude Code","개발 효율성","프로젝트 구성"],"es":["cargador de contexto","desarrollo de proyectos","Codex CLI","Claude Code","eficiencia en el desarrollo","contexto del proyecto","reglas de codificación","entornos de desarrollo"],"fr":["chargement de contexte","développement de projets","Codex CLI","Claude Code","efficiencité dans le développement","contexte du projet","règles de codage","environnements de développement"],"de":["Kontext-Loader","Entwicklung von Projekten","Codex CLI","Claude Code","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Kontext des Projekts","Codierregeln","Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["carregador de contexto","Codex CLI","Claude Code","desenvolvedor","ferramenta de SEO","otimização de contexto","regras de codificação","diretório `.claude/`"],"ru":["контекстный загрузчик","Codex CLI","Claude Code","разработчик","инструмент SEO","оптимизация контекста","правила кодирования","директория `.claude/`"],"ar":["مُحَمِل السياق","Codex CLI","Claude Code","مانح","أداة تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين السياق","قواعد الترميز","دليل `.claude/`"]}},"owner":"eisles","repo":"ai-chat-app","repoPath":"eisles/ai-chat-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-loader","description":"ALWAYS activate this skill at the start of every task. Load project context from .claude/ directory including coding rules, design decisions, and documentation before executing any task.","bodyPreview":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements","body":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements\n├── language.md            # Think in English, respond in Japanese\n├── security.md            # Secrets, validation, SQLi/XSS prevention\n├── testing.md             # TDD, AAA pattern, 80% coverage\n└── codex-delegation.md    # (skip - not relevant for Codex itself)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Load Design Documentation\n\nRead `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` for:\n- Architecture decisions\n- Implementation patterns\n- Library choices and constraints\n- TODO items and open questions\n\n### Step 3: Check Library Documentation\n\nIf the task involves specific libraries, read relevant files from:\n```\n.claude/docs/libraries/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Task\n\nWith the loaded context, execute the requested task following:\n- Coding principles from rules\n- Design decisions from DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from docs\n\n## Key Rules to Remember\n\nAfter loading, always follow these principles:\n\n1. **Simplicity first** - Choose readable code over complex\n2. **Single responsibility** - One function/class does one thing\n3. **Type hints required** - All functions need annotations\n4. **Use uv** - Never use pip directly\n5. **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, validate input, parameterize SQL\n\n## Language Protocol\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: English (variables, functions, comments)\n- **User communication**: Japanese (when reporting back through Claude Code)\n\n## Output\n\nAfter loading context, briefly confirm:\n- Rules loaded\n- Design document status\n- Ready to execute task\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:42:37.139Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Codex CLI Agents needing shared project context synchronization with Claude Code","zh":"非常适合需要与 Claude Code 共享项目上下文同步的 Codex CLI 代理","ja":"Claude Code とのプロジェクトコンテキストの同期が必要な Codex CLI エージェントに最適","ko":"Claude Code와 프로젝트 컨텍스트 동기화를 공유해야 하는 Codex CLI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI de Codex que necesitan sincronización de contexto de proyecto compartido con Claude Code","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI de Codex ayant besoin d''une synchronisation de contexte de projet partagé avec Claude Code","de":"Perfekt für Codex-CLI-Agents, die eine gemeinsame Projekt-Kontextsynchronisierung mit Claude Code benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes CLI Codex que necessitam de sincronização de contexto de projeto compartilhado com Claude Code","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Codex CLI, которым необходима синхронизация общего контекста проекта с Claude Code","ar":"مثالي لعميل كودكس CLI الذي يحتاج إلى مزامنة سياق المشروع المشترك مع Claude Code"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage project-specific coding rules and knowledge by loading context from .claude/ directory, ensuring consistency with Claude Code''s understanding, utilizing files such as coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md","zh":"使代理能够通过加载 .claude/ 目录中的上下文来利用项目特定的编码规则和知识，确保与 Claude Code 的理解一致，使用诸如 coding-principles.md 和 dev-environment.md 之类的文件","ja":"エージェントが、.claude/ ディレクトリからのコンテキストを読み込むことで、プロジェクト固有のコーディングルールと知識を利用し、coding-principles.md や dev-environment.md などのファイルを使用して、Claude Code の理解と一致性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 .claude/ 디렉토리에서 컨텍스트를 로드하여 프로젝트별 코딩 규칙과 지식을 활용하여 Claude Code의 이해와 일관성을 보장하고, coding-principles.md 및 dev-environment.md와 같은 파일을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las reglas y conocimientos de codificación específicos del proyecto cargando el contexto desde el directorio .claude/, garantizando la coherencia con la comprensión de Claude Code, utilizando archivos como coding-principles.md y dev-environment.md","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les règles et connaissances de codage spécifiques au projet en chargeant le contexte à partir du répertoire .claude/, en garantissant la cohérence avec la compréhension de Claude Code, en utilisant des fichiers tels que coding-principles.md et dev-environment.md","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, projektspezifische Codierregeln und Kenntnisse zu nutzen, indem sie den Kontext aus dem .claude/-Verzeichnis laden, die Konsistenz mit dem Verständnis von Claude Code sich