 codificación desde `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilidad con múltiples modelos de lenguaje","Evaluación y comparación de modelos de lenguaje","Integración con Codex CLI y Claude Code","Carga de contexto de proyecto compartido"],"fr":["Chargement des règles de codage depuis `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilité avec plusieurs modèles de langage","Évaluation et comparaison des modèles de langage","Intégration avec Codex CLI et Claude Code","Chargement du contexte de projet partagé"],"de":["Laden von Codierregeln aus `.claude/rules/`","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Sprachmodellen","Bewertung und Vergleich von Sprachmodellen","Integration mit Codex CLI und Claude Code","Laden des gemeinsamen Projekt-Kontexts"],"pt":["Carregamento de regras de codificação","Leitura de arquivos de regras","Compatibilidade com Codex CLI e Claude Code","Garantia de consistência do conhecimento","Suporte a múltiplos cenários de treinamento"],"ru":["Загрузка правил кодирования","Чтение файлов правил","Совместимость с Codex CLI и Claude Code","Гарантия согласованности знаний","Поддержка нескольких сценариев обучения"],"ar":["تحميل قواعد الترميز","قراءة ملفات القواعد","التوافق مع Codex CLI و Claude Code","ضمان الاتساق في المعرفة","دعم سيناريوهات التدريب المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Context Loader","加载项目上下文","Codex CLI","Claude Code","开发人员","技术"],"ja":["コンテキストローダー","プロジェクトのコンテキストを読み込み","Codex CLI","Claude Code","開発者","テクノロジー"],"ko":["컨텍스트 로더","프로젝트 컨텍스트 로드","Codex CLI","Claude Code","개발자","기술"],"es":["cargador de contexto","comparación de modelos de lenguaje","evaluación de modelos de lenguaje","Codex CLI","Claude Code","reglas de codificación","contexto de proyecto compartido","entrenamiento de modelos de lenguaje"],"fr":["chargement de contexte","comparaison de modèles de langage","évaluation de modèles de langage","Codex CLI","Claude Code","règles de codage","contexte de projet partagé","formation de modèles de langage"],"de":["Kontext-Loader","Vergleich von Sprachmodellen","Bewertung von Sprachmodellen","Codex CLI","Claude Code","Codierregeln","gemeinsamer Projekt-Kontext","Schulung von Sprachmodellen"],"pt":["Carregador de Contexto","LLM","Cenários de treinamento","Codex CLI","Claude Code","Regras de codificação","Consistência do conhecimento","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Контекстный Загрузчик","LLM","Сценарии обучения","Codex CLI","Claude Code","Правила кодирования","Согласованность знаний","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["حمل السياق","LLM","سيناريوهات التدريب","Codex CLI","Claude Code","قواعد الترميز","الاتساق في المعرفة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"miyataSUPER","repo":"ai-kommon-llm-evaluation","repoPath":"miyataSUPER/ai-kommon-llm-evaluation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-loader","description":"ALWAYS activate this skill at the start of every task. Load project context from .claude/ directory including coding rules, design decisions, and documentation before executing any task.","bodyPreview":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements","body":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements\n├── language.md            # Think in English, respond in Japanese\n├── security.md            # Secrets, validation, SQLi/XSS prevention\n├── testing.md             # TDD, AAA pattern, 80% coverage\n└── codex-delegation.md    # (skip - not relevant for Codex itself)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Load Design Documentation\n\nRead `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` for:\n- Architecture decisions\n- Implementation patterns\n- Library choices and constraints\n- TODO items and open questions\n\n### Step 3: Check Library Documentation\n\nIf the task involves specific libraries, read relevant files from:\n```\n.claude/docs/libraries/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Task\n\nWith the loaded context, execute the requested task following:\n- Coding principles from rules\n- Design decisions from DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from docs\n\n## Key Rules to Remember\n\nAfter loading, always follow these principles:\n\n1. **Simplicity first** - Choose readable code over complex\n2. **Single responsibility** - One function/class does one thing\n3. **Type hints required** - All functions need annotations\n4. **Use uv** - Never use pip directly\n5. **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, validate input, parameterize SQL\n\n## Language Protocol\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: English (variables, functions, comments)\n- **User communication**: Japanese (when reporting back through Claude Code)\n\n## Output\n\nAfter loading context, briefly confirm:\n- Rules loaded\n- Design document status\n- Ready to execute task\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:42:44.728Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-LLM Coaching Agents needing shared project context synchronization","zh":"非常适合需要共享项目上下文同步的多LLM教练代理","ja":"多くのLLMコーチングエージェントが共有プロジェクトコンテキストの同期を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트 동기화를 필요로 하는 다중 LLM 코칭 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Coaching Multi-LLM que necesitan sincronización de contexto de proyecto compartido","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de coaching Multi-LLM nécessitant une synchronisation de contexte de projet partagé","de":"Perfekt für Multi-LLM-Coaching-Agenten, die eine gemeinsame Projekt-Kontextsynchronisierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Coaching Multi-LLM que necessitam de sincronização de contexto de projeto compartilhado","ru":"Идеально для агентов Multi-LLM Coaching, которым требуется синхронизация общего контекста проекта","ar":"مثالي لعميل تدريب Multi-LLM الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق سياق المشروع المشترك"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load shared project context from .claude/ directory, ensuring consistency with Claude Code through Codex CLI, utilizing files like coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md for informed decision-making","zh":"赋予代理加载共享项目上下文的能力，从.claude/目录中加载，通过Codex CLI确保与Claude Code的一致性，利用coding-principles.md和dev-environment.md等文件进行明智的决策","ja":"エージェントに共有プロジェクトコンテキストをロードする能力を与え、.claude/ディレクトリからロードし、Codex CLIを介してClaude Codeとの一致性を確保し、coding-principles.mdやdev-environment.mdなどのファイルを使用して情報に基づいた決定を下す","ko":"에이전트가 共享 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로드할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 .claude/ 디렉토리에서 로드하고 Codex CLI를 통해 Claude Code와의 일관성을 보장하며 coding-principles.md 및 dev-environment.md 등의 파일을 사용하여 정보에基づいた 의사결정을 내림","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar el contexto de proyecto compartido desde el directorio .claude/, garantizando la coherencia con Claude Code a través de Codex CLI, utilizando archivos como coding-principles.md y dev-environment.md para una toma de decisiones informada","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger le contexte de projet partagé à partir du répertoire .claude/, en garantissant la cohérence avec Claude Code via Codex CLI, en utilisant des fichiers tels que coding-principles.md et dev-environment.md pour une prise de décision éclairée","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den gemeinsamen Projekt-Kontext aus dem Verzeichnis .claude/ zu laden, die Konsistenz mit Claude Code über Codex CLI sicherzustellen, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie coding-principles.md und dev-environment.md für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung","pt":"Permite que os agentes carreguem o contexto de projeto compartilhado do diretório .claude/, garantindo a consistência com o Claude Code por meio do Codex CLI, utilizando arquivos como coding-principles.md e dev-environment.md para tomar decisões informadas","ru":"Позволяет агентам загружать общий контекст проекта из директории .claude/, обеспечивая согласованность с Claude Code через Codex CLI, используя файлы như coding-principles.md и dev-environment.md для принятия обоснованных решений","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتحميل سياق المشروع المشترك من الدليل .claude/، مما يضمن الاتساق مع Claude Code من خلال Codex CLI، باستخدام ملفات مثل coding-principles.md و dev-environment.md لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing project context for coaching scenarios","Synchronizing coding rules across LLMs","Ensuring consistency in development environments"],"zh":["为教练场景初始化项目上下文","在LLM中同步编码规则","确保开发环境的一致性"],"ja":["コーチングシナリオのプロジェクトコンテキストを初期化","LLM間でコーディングルールを同期","開発環境の一貫性を確保"],"ko":["코칭 시나리오를 위한 프로젝트 컨텍스트 초기화","LLM 간 코딩 규칙 동기화","개발 환경의 일관성 보장"],"es":["Inicializar el contexto del proyecto para escenarios de coaching","Sincronizar las reglas de codificación en varios LLM","Garantizar la coherencia en los entornos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Initialiser le contexte du projet pour les scénarios de coaching","Synchroniser les règles de codage entre les LLM","Assurer la cohérence dans les environnements de développement"],"de":["Initialisieren des Projekt-Kontexts für Coaching-Szenarien","Synchronisieren der Codierregeln über mehrere LLM hinweg","Sicherstellen der Konsistenz in den Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Inicializar o contexto do projeto para cenários de treinamento","Sincronizar regras de codificação em LLMs","Garantir a consistência em ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Инициализировать контекст проекта для сценариев обучения","Синхронизировать правила кодирования в LLM","Обеспечить согласованность в средах разработки"],"ar":["ت初ييز سياق المشروع لسيناريوهات التدريب","تماشى قواعد الترميز عبر LLMs","ضمان الاتساق في بيئات التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .claude/ directory setup","Limited to Codex CLI and Claude Code compatibility"],"zh":[".claude/目录设置是必需的","仅限于Codex CLI和Claude Code的兼容性"],"ja":[".claude/ディレクトリの設定が必要","Codex CLIとClaude Codeの互換性のみに限定"],"ko":[".claude/ 디렉토리 설정이 필요","Codex CLI 및 Claude Code의 호환성에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la configuración del directorio .claude/","Limitado a la compatibilidad con Codex CLI y Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du répertoire .claude/","Limité à la compatibilité avec Codex CLI et Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des Verzeichnisses .claude/","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität mit Codex CLI und Claude Code"],"pt":["Requer configuração do diretório .claude/","Limitado à compatibilidade com Codex CLI e Claude Code"],"ru":["Требуется настройка директории .claude/","Ограничен совместимостью с Codex CLI и Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد الدليل .claude/","محدود بالتوافق مع Codex CLI و Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
