ucción de bloques","Deprecaciones y migraciones de bloques"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs","Mise à jour de blocs existants","Résolution de problèmes de blocs invalides","Implémentation de rendu dynamique","Utilisation d''outils de construction de blocs","Dépréciations et migrations de blocs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke","Aktualisierung bestehender Blöcke","Lösung von Problemen mit ungültigen Blöcken","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendern","Verwendung von Build-Tools für Blöcke","Veraltungen und Migrationen von Blöcken"],"pt":["Criação de novos blocos","Atualização de blocos existentes","Personalização de atributos","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Depreciação e migração de blocos","Ferramentas de construção para blocos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Настройка атрибутов","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Устаревание и миграция блоков","Инструменты для создания блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تخصيص السمات","إضافة تحرير ديناميكي","الاستبعاد والهجرة للكتل","أدوات بناء للكتل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress 块开发","块创建","块更新","动态渲染","块迁移","WordPress 开发","块管理"],"ja":["WordPress ブロック開発","ブロック作成","ブロック更新","動的レンダリング","ブロック移行","WordPress 開発","ブロック管理"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 개발","블록 생성","블록 업데이트","동적 렌더링","블록 마이그레이션","워드프레스 개발","블록 관리"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques WP","creación de bloques","actualización de bloques","solución de problemas de bloques","renderizado dinámico","herramientas de construcción de bloques","deprecaciones de bloques","migraciones de bloques","WordPress","WPVulnerability"],"fr":["développement de blocs WP","création de blocs","mise à jour de blocs","résolution de problèmes de blocs","rendu dynamique","outils de construction de blocs","dépréciations de blocs","migrations de blocs","WordPress","WPVulnerability"],"de":["WP-Block-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Blöcken","Aktualisierung von Blöcken","Lösung von Problemen mit Blöcken","dynamisches Rendern","Build-Tools für Blöcke","Veraltungen von Blöcken","Migrationen von Blöcken","WordPress","WPVulnerability"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress","wpvulnerability","blocos personalizados","criação de blocos","atualização de blocos","personalização de atributos","renderização dinâmica","depreciação de blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","wordpress","wpvulnerability","пользовательские блоки","создание блоков","обновление блоков","настройка атрибутов","динамическая отрисовка","устаревание блоков"],"ar":["تطوير كتلة wp","ووردبريس","wpvulnerability","كتلة مخصصة","إنشاء كتلة","تحديث الكتل","تخصيص السمات","تحرير ديناميكي","الاستبعاد للكتل"]}},"owner":"javiercasares","repo":"wpvulnerability","repoPath":"javiercasares/wpvulnerability","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:43:10.699Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress Development Agents needing advanced block customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级块自定义功能的WordPress开发代理。","ja":"WordPress開発エージェントが高度なブロックカスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 블록 사용자 지정 기능이 필요한 WordPress 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de WordPress que necesitan capacidades de personalización de bloques avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement WordPress ayant besoin de capacités de personnalisation de blocs avancées.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Blockanpassungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do WordPress que necessitam de capacidades de personalização de blocos avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке WordPress, которым необходимы расширенные возможности настройки блоков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير ووردبريس الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تخصيص كتلة متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage custom WordPress blocks, leveraging tools like @wordpress/scripts and @wordpress/create-block, while handling block deprecations and migrations through deprecated versions and wp-env.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理自定义WordPress块的能力，利用@wordpress/scripts和@wordpress/create-block等工具，同时通过弃用版本和wp-env处理块弃用和迁移。","ja":"エージェントが@wordpress/scriptsや@wordpress/create-blockなどのツールを利用してカスタムWordPressブロックを作成・管理することを可能にし、ブロックの非推奨化や移行を非推奨バージョンやwp-envで処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 @wordpress/scripts와 @wordpress/create-blockなどの 도구를 사용하여 사용자 지정 WordPress 블록을 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며,弃用 버전 및 wp-env를 통해 블록弃用 및 마이그레이션을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar bloques personalizados de WordPress, aprovechando herramientas como @wordpress/scripts y @wordpress/create-block, y manejando la obsolescencia y las migraciones de bloques a través de versiones en desuso y wp-env.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des blocs WordPress personnalisés, en exploitant des outils tels que @wordpress/scripts et @wordpress/create-block, tout en gérant les obsolèscences et les migrations de blocs via des versions obsolètes et wp-env.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Blöcke zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem es Tools wie @wordpress/scripts und @wordpress/create-block nutzt und Blockveraltungen und -migrationen über veraltete Versionen und wp-env handhabt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar blocos personalizados do WordPress, aproveitando ferramentas como @wordpress/scripts e @wordpress/create-block, além de lidar com o desuso e migrações de blocos por meio de versões descontinuadas e wp-env.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять пользовательскими блоками WordPress, используя инструменты seperti @wordpress/scripts и @wordpress/create-block, а также обрабатывая устаревание и миграции блоков через устаревшие версии и wp-env.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء وإدارة كتل ووردبريس المخصصة، واستخدام أدوات مثل @wordpress/scripts و @wordpress/create-block، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع الإلغاء والمهاجرة من الكتل من خلال الإصدارات القديمة و wp-env."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new blocks with dynamic rendering using render.php","Updating existing blocks with changed block.json attributes","Debugging block invalidation and attribute persistence issues"],"zh":["使用render.php实现动态渲染的新块创建","更新现有块的block.json属性","调试块失效和属性持久性问题"],"ja":["render.phpを使用して動的レンダリングの新しいブロックを作成する","既存のブロックのblock.json属性を更新する","ブロックの無効化と属性の永続性に関する問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["render.php를 사용하여 동적 렌더링의 새로운 블록을 생성합니다.","기존 블록의 block.json 속성을 업데이트합니다.","블록의 무효화 및 속성의 영속성 문제를 디버깅합니다."],"es":["Crear nuevos bloques con representación dinámica utilizando render.php","Actualizar bloques existentes con atributos block.json modificados","Depurar problemas de invalidación de bloques y persistencia de atributos"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux blocs avec un rendu dynamique en utilisant render.php","Mettre à jour des blocs existants avec des attributs block.json modifiés","Déboguer les problèmes d''invalidation de blocs et de persistance d''attributs"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Blöcken mit dynamischer Darstellung unter Verwendung von render.php","Aktualisieren von bestehenden Blöcken mit geänderten block.json-Attributen","Debuggen von Blockinvalidierungs- und Attributpersistenzproblemen"],"pt":["Criar novos blocos com renderização dinâmica usando render.php","Atualizar blocos existentes com atributos block.json alterados","Depurar problemas de invalidação de blocos e persistência de atributos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков с динамической отрисовкой, используя render.php","Обновление существующих блоков с измененными атрибутами block.json","Отладка проблем с недействительностью блоков и сохранением атрибутов"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة مع تقديم ديناميكي باستخدام render.php","تحديث الكتل الحالية مع سمة block.json المعدلة","تصحيح أخطاء إلغاء الكتل وضمان استمرار السمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment","WP Block Development expertise needed","Compatibility issues with older WordPress versions possible"],"zh":["需要WordPress环境","需要WP块开发专业知识","可能与旧版本的WordPress不兼容"],"ja":["WordPress環境が必要","WPブロック開発の専門知識が必要","古いバージョンのWordPressと互換性の問題が発生する可能性あり"],"ko":["WordPress 환경이 필요합니다.","WP 블록 개발 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","구 버전의 WordPress와 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de WordPress","Se necesita experiencia en desarrollo de bloques de WP","Posibles problemas de compatibilidad con versiones anteriores de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress","Une expertise en développement de blocs WP est nécessaire","Des problèmes de compatibilité avec les anciennes versions de WordPress sont possibles"],"de":["Benötigt eine WordPress-Umgebung","WP-Block-Entwicklungsexpertise erforderlich","Mögliche Kompatibilitätsprobleme mit älteren WordPress-Versionen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente do WordPress","É necessário conhecimento em desenvolvimento de blocos do WP","Problemas de compatibilidade com versões mais antigas do WordPress são possíveis"],"ru":["Требуется среда WordPress","Необходимы знания в области разработки блоков WP","Возможны проблемы с совместимостью со старыми версиями WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس","مطلوب خبرة في تطوير كتل ووردبريس","يمكن أن تحدث مشاكل في التوافق مع إصدارات ووردبريس القديمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
