式，帮助开发者提高开发效率","ja":"WP ブロック開発は、WordPress ブロックを作成および管理する方法で、開発者の開発効率を向上させます","ko":"워드프레스 블록 개발은 워드프레스 블록을 생성하고 관리하는 방식으로 개발자의 개발 효율을 높여줍니다","es":"El desarrollo de bloques WP permite crear y personalizar bloques en WordPress. Aprende a utilizar esta habilidad para mejorar tu sitio web","fr":"Le développement de blocs WP permet de créer et de personnaliser des blocs WordPress. Découvrez comment utiliser cette compétence pour améliorer votre site web","de":"Die WP-Block-Entwicklung ermöglicht das Erstellen und Anpassen von Blöcken in WordPress. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Fähigkeit nutzen können, um Ihre Website...","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP permite criar e personalizar blocos no WordPress. Aprenda a usar essa habilidade para melhorar sua experiência de desenvolvimento","ru":"Разработка блоков WP позволяет создавать и настраивать блоки в WordPress. Узнайте, как использовать эту habilidade для улучшения вашего опыта разработки","ar":"تطوير الكتلة WP يسمح بإنشاء وتخصيص الكتل في ووردبريس. تعلم كيفية استخدام هذه المهارة لتحسين تجربة التطوير الخاصة بك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新块","更改 block.json 文件","修复块无效或保存问题","添加动态渲染","块弃用和迁移","构建工具"],"ja":["ブロックの作成と更新","block.json ファイルの変更","ブロックの無効化または保存の問題の修正","動的レンダリングの追加","ブロックの廃止と移行","ビルドツール"],"ko":["블록 생성 및 업데이트","block.json 파일 변경","블록 무효 또는 저장 문제 해결","동적 렌더링 추가","블록 폐기 및 이전","빌드 도구"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques","Actualización de bloques existentes","Edición de block.json","Implementación de renderizado dinámico","Deprecación y migración de bloques"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs","Mise à jour de blocs existants","Édition de block.json","Mise en œuvre de rendu dynamique","Dépréciation et migration de blocs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke","Aktualisierung bestehender Blöcke","Bearbeitung von block.json","Implementierung dynamischer Renderung","Veraltete und Migration von Blöcken"],"pt":["Criação de novos blocos","Atualização de blocos existentes","Edição de arquivos block.json","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Depreciação e migração de blocos","Ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Редактирование файлов block.json","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Устаревание и миграция блоков","Инструменты сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تحرير ملفات block.json","إضافة تحرير ديناميكي","الاستبعاد والهجرة الكتل","أدوات بناء للكتلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress 块","块开发","block.json","动态渲染","块弃用","构建工具","WordPress 开发","块创建","块更新"],"ja":["WP ブロック","ブロック開発","block.json","動的レンダリング","ブロック廃止","ビルドツール","WordPress 開発","ブロック作成","ブロック更新"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록","블록 개발","block.json","동적 렌더링","블록 폐기","빌드 도구","워드프레스 개발","블록 생성","블록 업데이트"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques WP","WordPress","bloques","personalización","creación de bloques","block.json","renderizado dinámico"],"fr":["développement de blocs WP","WordPress","blocs","personnalisation","création de blocs","block.json","rendu dynamique"],"de":["WP-Block-Entwicklung","WordPress","Blöcke","Anpassung","Erstellung von Blöcken","block.json","dynamische Renderung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress","blocos","criação de blocos","personalização de blocos","block.json","renderização dinâmica","depreciação de blocos","migração de blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","wordpress","блоки","создание блоков","настройка блоков","block.json","динамическая отрисовка","устаревание блоков","миграция блоков"],"ar":["تطوير الكتلة wp","ووردبريس","الكتلة","إنشاء الكتلة","تخصيص الكتلة","block.json","تحرير ديناميكي","الاستبعاد الكتلة","هجرة الكتلة"]}},"owner":"javiercasares","repo":"cloudfest-wporgdownload","repoPath":"javiercasares/cloudfest-wporgdownload","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:43:15.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress Development Agents specializing in Gutenberg block creation and maintenance.","zh":"非常适合专门从事Gutenberg块创建和维护的WordPress开发代理。","ja":"Gutenbergブロックの作成とメンテナンスを専門とするWordPress開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구텐베르크 블록 생성 및 유지 관리를専門とする 워드프레스 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de WordPress especializados en la creación y mantenimiento de bloques de Gutenberg.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement WordPress spécialisés dans la création et la maintenance de blocs Gutenberg.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf die Erstellung und Wartung von Gutenberg-Blöcken spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do WordPress especializados na criação e manutenção de blocos Gutenberg.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке WordPress, специализирующихся на создании и обслуживании блоков Gutenberg.","ar":"مثالي لموكلات تطوير ووردبريس المتخصصة في إنشاء كتلة جوتنبرج والصيانة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct manipulation of WordPress block architecture through block.json configuration, dynamic PHP rendering, and automated build tooling. Provides specialized capabilities for handling block deprecations, migrations, and resolving common persistence issues like invalid blocks or attribute saving problems.","zh":"通过block.json配置、动态PHP渲染和自动化构建工具启用对WordPress块架构的直接操作。提供处理块弃用、迁移和解决常见持久性问题（如无效块或属性保存问题）的专用功能。","ja":"block.json構成、動的PHPレンダリング、自動化ビルドツールを介して、WordPressブロックアーキテクチャを直接操作できるようにします。ブロックの非推奨、移行、および一般的な永続性の問題（無効なブロックまたは属性の保存の問題など）に対処するための特別な機能を提供します。","ko":"블록.json 구성, 동적 PHP 렌더링 및 자동화 빌드 도구를 통해 워드프레스 블록 아키텍처를 직접 조작할 수 있습니다. 블록의废止, 마이그레이션 및 일반적인 영속성 문제(유효하지 않은 블록 또는 속성 저장 문제 등)를 처리하기 위한 특수한 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la manipulación directa de la arquitectura de bloques de WordPress a través de la configuración de block.json, renderizado dinámico de PHP y herramientas de compilación automatizadas. Proporciona capacidades especializadas para el manejo de deprecaciones de bloques, migraciones y la resolución de problemas de persistencia comunes como bloques inválidos o problemas de guardado de atributos.","fr":"Permet la manipulation directe de l''architecture de blocs WordPress via la configuration de block.json, le rendu dynamique PHP et les outils de construction automatisés. Fournit des capacités spécialisées pour la gestion des dépréciations de blocs, les stratégies de migration et la résolution de problèmes de persistance courants comme les blocs invalides ou les problèmes de sauvegarde d''attributs.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Manipulation der WordPress-Blockarchitektur über die block.json-Konfiguration, dynamische PHP-Renderung und automatisierte Build-Tools. Bietet spezialisierte Fähigkeiten für die Verwaltung von Block-Abonnements, Migrationsstrategien und die Lösung häufiger Persistenzprobleme wie ungültige Blöcke oder Attributspeicherprobleme.","pt":"Permite a manipulação direta da arquitetura de blocos do WordPress por meio da configuração block.json, renderização dinâmica do PHP e ferramentas de compilação automatizadas. Fornece capacidades especializadas para lidar com depreciações de blocos, migrações e resolver problemas comuns de persistência, como blocos inválidos ou problemas de salvamento de atributos.","ru":"Позволяет直接 манипулировать архитектурой блоков WordPress посредством конфигурации block.json, динамической отрисовки PHP и автоматизированных инструментов сборки. Предоставляет специализированные возможности для обработки устаревших блоков, миграций и решения общих проблем с сохранением, таких как недействительные блоки или проблемы с сохранением атрибутов.","ar":"يمكّن من التعامل المباشر مع هندسة كتلة ووردبريس من خلال تكوين block.json والتحويل الديناميكي لPHP وأدوات البناء الآلية. يوفر إمكانيات متخصصة لمعالجة الإصدارات القديمة من الكتل والهجرة وحل مشاكل الثبات الشائعة مثل الكتل غير الصالحة أو مشاكل حفظ السمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Gutenberg blocks with @wordpress/create-block","Configuring block.json attributes, scripts, and supported features","Implementing dynamic rendering via render.php or render_callback","Managing block deprecations and migration strategies","Debugging block validation and attribute persistence issues"],"zh":["使用@wordpress/create-block创建新的Gutenberg块","配置block.json属性、脚本和支持的功能","通过render.php或render_callback实现动态渲染","管理块弃用和迁移策略","调试块验证和属性持久性问题"],"ja":["新しいGutenbergブロックを作成するために@wordpress/create-blockを使用する","block.jsonの属性、スクリプト、およびサポートされる機能を構成する","render.phpまたはrender_callbackを介して動的レンダリングを実現する","ブロックの非推奨と移行戦略を管理する","ブロックの検証と属性の永続性の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["@wordpress/create-block를 사용하여 새로운 구텐베르크 블록을 생성한다","블록.json 속성, 스크립트 및 지원되는 기능을 구성한다","render.php 또는 render_callback를 통해 동적 렌더링을 구현한다","블록의废止 및 마이그레이션 전략을 관리한다","블록의 유효성 검사 및 속성의 영속성 문제를 디버깅한다"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques de Gutenberg con @wordpress/create-block","Configuración de atributos de block.json, scripts y características compatibles","Implementación de renderizado dinámico a través de render.php o render_callback","Gestión de deprecaciones de bloques y estrategias de migración","Depuración de problemas de validación de bloques y persistencia de atributos"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs Gutenberg avec @wordpress/create-block","Configuration des attributs de block.json, des scripts et des fonctionnalités prises en charge","Mise en œuvre du rendu dynamique via render.php ou render_callback","Gestion des dépréciations de blocs et des stratégies de migration","Débogage des problèmes de validation de blocs et de persistance d''attributs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Gutenberg-Blöcke mit @wordpress/create-block","Konfiguration von block.json-Attributen, Skripten und unterstützten Funktionen","Implementierung der dynamischen Renderung über render.php oder render_callback","Verwaltung von Block-Abonnements und Migrationsstrategien","Fehlerbehebung bei Blockvalidierungs- und Attributpersistenzproblemen"],"pt":["Criar novos blocos Gutenberg com @wordpress/create-block","Configurar atributos block.json, scripts e recursos suportados","Implementar renderização dinâmica via render.php ou render_callback","Gerenciar depreciações de blocos e estratégias de migração","Depurar problemas de validação de blocos e persistência de atributos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков Gutenberg с помощью @wordpress/create-block","Настройка атрибутов block.json, скриптов и поддерживаемых функций","Реализация динамической отрисовки через render.php или render_callback","Управление устаревшими блоками и стратегиями миграции","Отладка проблем валидации блоков и сохранения атрибутов"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جوتنبرج جديدة باستخدام @wordpress/create-block","تكوين سمات block.json والسكريبتات والميزات المدعومة","تنفيذ العرض الديناميكي عبر render.php أو render_callback","إدارة الإصدارات القديمة من الكتل وстратегيات الهجرة","تصحيح مشاكل التحقق من الكتل وثبات السمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment with Gutenberg support","Dependent on @wordpress/scripts build toolchain","Limited to WordPress block ecosystem architecture"],"zh":["需要具有Gutenberg支持的WordPress环境","依赖于@wordpress/scripts构建工具链","仅限于WordPress块生态系统架构"],"ja":["GutenbergをサポートするWordPress環境が必要","@wordpress/scriptsビルドツールチェーンに依存する","WordPressブロックエコシステムアーキテクチャに限定される"],"ko":["구텐베르크를 지원하는 워드프레스 환경이 필요하다","@wordpress/scripts 빌드 도구 체인에 의존한다","워드프레스 블록 에코システム 아키텍처에 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de WordPress con soporte para Gutenberg","Dependiente de la cadena de herramientas de compilación @wordpress/scripts","Limitado a la arquitectura del ecosistema de bloques de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress avec un support pour Gutenberg","Dépendant de la chaîne d''outils de construction @wordpress/scripts","Limité à l''architecture de l''écosystème de blocs WordPress"],"de":["Benötigt eine WordPress-Umgebung mit Gutenberg-Unterstützung","Abhängig von der Build-Toolchain @wordpress/scripts","Begrenzt auf die Architektur des WordPress-Block-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Exige um ambiente WordPress com suporte a Gutenberg","Depende da cadeia de ferramentas de compilação @wordpress/scripts","Limitado à arquitetura do ecossistema de blocos do WordPress"],"ru":["Требует среды WordPress с поддержкой Gutenberg","Зависит от цепочки инструментов сборки @wordpress/scripts","Ограничен архитектурой экосистемы блоков WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس بدعم لجوتنبرج","يعتمد على سلسلة أدوات البناء @wordpress/scripts","محدود بهندسة النظام البيئي لكتلة ووردبريس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
