ive-change","ar":"أرشفة التغييرات مع openspec-archive-change","en":"openspec-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change技能用于实验工作流中变更的存档，通过选项指定变更名称或从对话上下文推断","ja":"openspec-archive-changeスキルは、実験ワークフロー中的の変更をアーカイブするために使用され、変更名を指定するオプションまたは会話のコンテキストから推測することができます","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬은 실험 워크플로우에서 변경을 보관하는 데 사용되며 변경 이름을 지정하거나 대화 상의 맥락에서 추론할 수 있습니다","es":"El skill openspec-archive-change permite archivar cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental","fr":"Le skill openspec-archive-change permet d''archiver les modifications terminées dans le workflow expérimental","de":"Der Skill openspec-archive-change ermöglicht das Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta que arquiva mudanças completadas no fluxo de trabalho experimental. Ele permite que os desenvolvedores gerenciem s...","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент, который архивирует завершенные изменения в экспериментальном рабочем процессе. Он позволяет разработчикам эффективн...","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لتخزين التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي. يسمح للمطورين بإدارة تغييراتهم بفعالية.","en":"Alisson''s Portifolio and More"},"definition":{"en":"Alisson''s Portifolio and More"},"features":{"zh":["实验工作流中的变更存档","选项指定变更名称","从对话上下文推断变更名称","仅显示活动变更","使用AskUserQuestion工具"],"ja":["実験ワークフロー中的の変更アーカイブ","変更名のオプション指定","会話のコンテキストから変更名の推測","アクティブな変更のみの表示","AskUserQuestionツールの使用"],"ko":["실험 워크플로우에서 변경 보관","변경 이름의 선택적 지정","대화 상의 맥락에서 변경 이름의 추론","활성 변경만 표시","AskUserQuestion 툴 사용"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados","Seleccionar cambios disponibles","Utilizar la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Mostrar solo cambios activos","Utilizar el comando openspec list --json"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications terminées","Sélectionner les modifications disponibles","Utiliser l''outil AskUserQuestion","Afficher uniquement les modifications actives","Utiliser la commande openspec list --json"],"de":["Änderungen archivieren","Verfügbare Änderungen auswählen","Die AskUserQuestion-Tools verwenden","Nur aktive Änderungen anzeigen","Den Befehl openspec list --json verwenden"],"pt":["Arquivamento de mudanças completadas","Gerenciamento de mudanças eficiente","Integração com o fluxo de trabalho experimental","Ferramenta de seleção de mudanças","Suporte a vários formatos de saída"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений","Эффективное управление изменениями","Интеграция с экспериментальным рабочим процессом","Инструмент выбора изменений","Поддержка нескольких форматов вывода"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","إدارة التغييرات بفعالية","التكامل مع تدفق العمل التجريبي","أداة اختيار التغييرات","دعم عدة صيغ إخراج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验工作流","变更存档","开发效率","技术技能","AskUserQuestion"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験ワークフロー","変更アーカイブ","開発効率","技術スキル","AskUserQuestion"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험 워크플로우","변경 보관","개발 효율성","기술 스킬","AskUserQuestion"],"es":["openspec-archive-change","flujo de trabajo experimental","archivar cambios","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["openspec-archive-change","workflow expérimental","archiver les modifications","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","développement de logiciels"],"de":["openspec-archive-change","experimenteller Workflow","Änderungen archivieren","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivamento de mudanças","fluxo de trabalho experimental","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de mudanças"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивирование изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление изменениями"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة التغييرات"]}},"owner":"alissonbgs","repo":"ali-journey","repoPath":"alissonbgs/ali-journey","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:13.314Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring efficient experimental workflow management and archival capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效实验工作流管理和存档功能的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"効率的な実験ワークフローの管理とアーカイブ機能を必要とするワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 실험 워크플로우 관리 및 보관 기능이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Flujo de Trabajo que requieren una gestión y capacidad de archivo de flujo de trabajo experimental eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Workflow nécessitant une gestion et des capacités d''archivage de workflow expérimental efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine effiziente experimentelle Workflow-Verwaltung und Archivierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que exigem gestão eficiente de fluxo de trabalho experimental e capacidades de arquivamento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, требующих эффективного управления экспериментальными рабочими процессами и возможностей архивирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائية التي تتطلب إدارة تدفق عمل تجريبي فعالة وقدرات أرشفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in experimental workflows using the openspec-archive-change skill, leveraging JSON output from openspec list and the AskUserQuestion tool for seamless user interaction and change selection, including schema utilization for each change.","zh":"通过openspec-archive-change技能，利用openspec list的JSON输出和AskUserQuestion工具，实现代理对实验工作流中已完成更改的存档，实现无缝的用户交互和更改选择，包括每个更改的模式利用。","ja":"openspec-archive-changeスキルを使用して、openspec listのJSON出力とAskUserQuestionツールを活用し、エージェントが実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブできるようにし、シームレスなユーザーインタラクションと変更の選択を実現し、各変更のスキーマ利用を含む。","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬을 사용하여 openspec list의 JSON 출력과 AskUserQuestion 툴을 활용하여 에이전트가 실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경을 보관할 수 있도록 하며, 무결점의 사용자 상호작용 및 변경 선택을 구현하며, 각 변경의 스키마 활용을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en los flujos de trabajo experimentales utilizando la habilidad openspec-archive-change, aprovechando la salida JSON de openspec list y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para una interacción y selección de cambios del usuario sin problemas, incluyendo la utilización de esquemas para cada cambio.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en utilisant la compétence openspec-archive-change, en exploitant la sortie JSON de openspec list et de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une interaction utilisateur et une sélection de modifications sans problème, y compris l''utilisation de schémas pour chaque modification.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows mithilfe der Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change zu archivieren, indem JSON-Ausgaben von openspec list und das Tool AskUserQuestion für eine nahtlose Benutzerinteraktion und Änderungsauswahl genutzt werden, einschließlich der Nutzung von Schemata für jede Änderung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais usando a habilidade openspec-archive-change, aproveitando a saída JSON da lista openspec e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para interação de usuário sem interrupção e seleção de alterações, incluindo a utilização de esquema para cada alteração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах с помощью навыка openspec-archive-change, используя выходные данные JSON из списка openspec и инструмент AskUserQuestion для бесшовного взаимодействия с пользователем и выбора изменений, включая использование схемы для каждого изменения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفقات العمل التجريبية باستخدام مهارة openspec-archive-change، واستخدام إخراج JSON من قائمة openspec وأداة AskUserQuestion من أجل تفاعل مستخدم بدون انقطاع واختيار التغييرات، بما في ذلك استخدام مخطط لكل تغيير."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed experimental workflow changes","Managing active changes through the openspec list command","Prompting users for change selection using the AskUserQuestion tool"],"zh":["存档已完成的实验工作流更改","通过openspec list命令管理活动更改","使用AskUserQuestion工具提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["完了した実験ワークフローの変更をアーカイブする","openspec listコマンドを使用してアクティブな変更を管理する","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーに変更の選択を促す"],"ko":["완료된 실험 워크플로우 변경을 보관하는 것","openspec list 명령을 사용하여 활성 변경을 관리하는 것","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자에게 변경 선택을 요청하는 것"],"es":["Archivar los cambios completados en los flujos de trabajo experimentales","Gestionar los cambios activos a través del comando openspec list","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen cambios con la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Gérer les modifications actives à l''aide de la commande openspec list","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner des modifications à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Aktive Änderungen über den Befehl openspec list verwalten","Benutzern Änderungsauswahl mit dem Tool AskUserQuestion anbieten"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações de fluxo de trabalho experimental concluídas","Gerenciamento de alterações ativas por meio do comando openspec list","Solicitação de seleção de alterações ao usuário usando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений экспериментального рабочего процесса","Управление активными изменениями с помощью команды openspec list","Запрос выбора изменений у пользователя с помощью инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة لتدفق العمل التجريبي","إدارة التغييرات النشطة من خلال أمر قائمة openspec","طلب اختيار التغييرات من المستخدم باستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec command-line tool access","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to active, non-archived changes"],"zh":["需要openspec命令行工具的访问","依赖于会话上下文来推断更改名称","仅限于活动、未存档的更改"],"ja":["openspecコマンドラインツールへのアクセスが必要","変更名の推論に会話のコンテキストに依存する","アクティブでアーカイブされていない変更のみに限定される"],"ko":["openspec 명령줄 툴에 대한 액세스가 필요","변경 이름 추론에 대화 문脈에 의존","활성 및 보관되지 않은 변경만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la herramienta de línea de comandos openspec","Depende del contexto de conversación para inferir el nombre del cambio","Limitado a cambios activos y no archivados"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''outil de ligne de commande openspec","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour inférer le nom du changement","Limité aux modifications actives et non archivées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das openspec-Befehlszeilen-Tool","Hängt vom Konversationskontext ab, um den Änderungsnamen abzuleiten","Begrenzt auf aktive, nicht archivierte Änderungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à ferramenta de linha de comando openspec","Dependente do contexto de conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado a alterações ativas, não arquivadas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к командной строке инструмента openspec","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен активными, не архивированными изменениями"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة سطر الأوامر openspec","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة غير المأرشفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
