datedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:01.262Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Management Agents needing advanced task archiving capabilities in experimental workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要高级任务归档功能的工作流管理代理，特别是在实验工作流中。","ja":"実験的ワークフローで高度なタスクアーカイブ機能を必要とするワークフローマネージメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 작업 아카이브 기능이 필요한 워크플로우 관리 에이전트에 적합하며, 특히 실험적인 워크플로우에서 유용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de flujos de trabajo que necesitan capacidades de archivado de tareas avanzadas en flujos de trabajo experimentales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de workflow nécessitant des capacités de archivage de tâches avancées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Aufgabenarchivierungsfunktionen in experimentellen Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Fluxo de Trabalho que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de arquivamento de tarefas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления рабочим процессом, которым требуются расширенные возможности архивации задач в экспериментальных рабочих процессах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة تدفق العمل الذي يحتاج إلى امکانات متقدمة لأرشفة المهام في سلاسل العمل التجريبية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in a task tree structure using the openspec-archive-change command, integrating with the openspec list --json tool for retrieving available changes and the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling active changes and schema inference.","zh":"赋予代理使用openspec-archive-change命令在任务树结构中归档已完成的更改的能力，并与openspec list --json工具集成以检索可用更改，并使用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户选择，同时处理活动更改和模式推理。","ja":"openspec-archive-changeコマンドを使用してタスクツリーストラクチャで完了した変更をアーカイブする機能をエージェントに与え、openspec list --jsonツールと統合して利用可能な変更を取得し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーの選択を行い、同時にアクティブな変更とスキーマ推論を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 openspec-archive-change 명령을 사용하여 작업 트리 구조에서 완료된 변경 사항을 아카이브 할 수있는 기능을 제공하며, openspec list --json 도구와 통합하여 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 검색하고, AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자 선택을 수행하며,同時에 활성 변경 및 스키마 추론을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en una estructura de árbol de tareas utilizando el comando openspec-archive-change, integrándose con la herramienta openspec list --json para recuperar los cambios disponibles y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, todo mientras se manejan los cambios activos y la inferencia de esquemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications complètes dans une structure d''arbre de tâches en utilisant la commande openspec-archive-change, en intégrant l''outil openspec list --json pour récupérer les modifications disponibles et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, le tout en gérant les modifications actives et l''inférence de schémas.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, abgeschlossene Änderungen in einer Aufgabenbaumstruktur mit dem Befehl openspec-archive-change zu archivieren, integriert mit dem Tool openspec list --json zum Abrufen verfügbarer Änderungen und dem Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerauswahl, während aktive Änderungen und Schemainferenz gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em uma estrutura de árvore de tarefas usando o comando openspec-archive-change, integrando com a ferramenta openspec list --json para recuperar alterações disponíveis e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção do usuário, lidando com alterações ativas e inferência de esquema.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в структуре дерева задач с помощью команды openspec-archive-change, интегрируя с инструментом openspec list --json для получения доступных изменений и инструментом AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, при этом обрабатывая активные изменения и вывод схемы.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في هيكل شجرة المهام باستخدام أمر openspec-archive-change، متكامل مع أداة openspec list --json لاسترجاع التغييرات المتاحة وأداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، مع التعامل مع التغييرات النشطة والاستدلال الهيكلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed experimental workflow changes","Managing task trees with active change filtering","Inferring change names from conversation context"],"zh":["归档已完成的实验工作流更改","使用活动更改过滤管理任务树","从会话上下文推断更改名称"],"ja":["完了した実験的ワークフローの変更をアーカイブする","アクティブな変更のフィルタリングを使用してタスクツリーを管理する","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推論する"],"ko":["완료된 실험 워크플로우 변경 사항을 아카이브하는 것","활성 변경 필터링을 사용하여 작업 트리 관리","대화의 맥락에서 변경 이름을 추론하는 것"],"es":["Archivar cambios de flujo de trabajo experimental completados","Gestionar árboles de tareas con filtrado de cambios activos","Inferir nombres de cambios a partir del contexto de conversación"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications de flux de travail expérimental complètes","Gérer des arbres de tâches avec un filtrage de modifications actives","Inférer les noms de modifications à partir du contexte de conversation"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Aufgabenbäume mit aktiver Änderungsfilterung verwalten","Änderungsnamen aus dem Gesprächskontext ableiten"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações de fluxo de trabalho experimental concluídas","Gerenciamento de árvores de tarefas com filtragem de alterações ativas","Inferência de nomes de alterações do contexto da conversa"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе","Управление деревом задач с фильтрацией активных изменений","Вывод имен изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سلاسل العمل التجريبية","إدارة أشجار المهام مع تصفية التغييرات النشطة","استدلال أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec tool installation","Limited to active, non-archived changes","Dependent on user input or conversation context for change name inference"],"zh":["需要openspec工具安装","仅限活动、未归档的更改","依赖于用户输入或会话上下文进行更改名称推理"],"ja":["openspecツールのインストールが必要","アクティブでアーカイブされていない変更のみ","変更名の推論にはユーザーの入力または会話のコンテキストが必要"],"ko":["openspec 도구 설치 필요","활성이고 아카이브되지 않은 변경 사항만","변경 이름 추론에는 사용자 입력 또는 대화의 맥락이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta openspec","Limitado a cambios activos y no archivados","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario o del contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre del cambio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil openspec","Limité aux modifications actives et non archivées","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur ou du contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de modification"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des openspec-Tools","Begrenzt auf aktive, nicht archivierte Änderungen","Abhängig von Benutzereingaben oder Gesprächskontext für die Änderungsnameninferenz"],"pt":["Requer instalação da ferramenta openspec","Limitado a alterações ativas, não arquivadas","Dependente da entrada do usuário ou contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента openspec","Ограничен активными, неархивированными изменениями","Зависит от ввода пользователя или контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة openspec","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة غير المأرشفة","يعتمد على إدخال المستخدم أو سياق المحادثة لاستدلال اسم التغيير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
