geは実験ワークフローでの完了変更をアーカイブするために使用され、コマンドラインまたはインタラクティブ方式で変更を選択することができます","ko":"openspec-archive-change는 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경 사항을 보관하는 데 사용되며 명령줄 또는 상호 작용 방식으로 변경을 선택할 수 있습니다","es":"El skill openspec-archive-change archiva los cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental.","fr":"Le skill openspec-archive-change archive les modifications terminées dans le flux de travail expérimental.","de":"Der Skill openspec-archive-change archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow.","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar mudanças concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental. Veja como usar.","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент для архивирования завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе. Описание использования.","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لتخزين التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي. شاهد وصف الاستخدام.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持通过命令行或交互式方式选择变更","自动获取可用变更列表","支持用户选择和确认变更","实现变更的存档和管理","集成AskUserQuestion工具"],"ja":["コマンドラインまたはインタラクティブ方式で変更を選択することができます","利用可能な変更の一覧を自動的に取得","ユーザーの選択と確認をサポート","変更のアーカイブと管理を実現","AskUserQuestionツールを統合"],"ko":["명령줄 또는 상호 작용 방식으로 변경을 선택할 수 있습니다","사용 가능한 변경 사항 목록을 자동으로 가져옵니다","사용자 선택과 확인을 지원합니다","변경 사항의 보관 및 관리를 구현합니다","AskUserQuestion 도구를 통합합니다"],"es":["Archiva cambios completados","Permite seleccionar cambios disponibles","Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Muestra solo cambios activos","Utiliza el comando openspec list --json"],"fr":["Archive les modifications terminées","Permet de sélectionner les modifications disponibles","Utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion","Affiche uniquement les modifications actives","Utilise la commande openspec list --json"],"de":["Archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen","Ermöglicht die Auswahl verfügbarer Änderungen","Verwendet das Tool AskUserQuestion","Zeigt nur aktive Änderungen an","Verwendet den Befehl openspec list --json"],"pt":["Arquivar mudanças concluídas","Seleção de mudanças ativas","Uso do AskUserQuestion tool","Execução de comandos openspec","Trabalho com fluxo de trabalho experimental","Suporte à inferência de contexto de conversa"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений","Выбор активных изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Выполнение команд openspec","Работа с экспериментальным рабочим процессом","Поддержка вывода контекста разговора"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","اختيار التغييرات النشطة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","تنفيذ أوامر openspec","العمل مع تدفق العمل التجريبي","دعم استنتاج سياق المحادثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验工作流","变更存档","命令行工具","交互式方式","AskUserQuestion","变更管理"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験ワークフロー","変更のアーカイブ","コマンドラインツール","インタラクティブ方式","AskUserQuestion","変更管理"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험 워크플로우","변경 사항 보관","명령줄 도구","상호 작용 방식","AskUserQuestion","변경 관리"],"es":["openspec","archivar cambios","flujo de trabajo experimental","skill de AI","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"fr":["openspec","archiver les modifications","flux de travail expérimental","skill d''IA","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"de":["openspec","Änderungen archivieren","experimenteller Workflow","AI-Skill","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivar mudanças","fluxo de trabalho experimental","AskUserQuestion tool","comandos openspec","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de mudanças"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивирование изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","AskUserQuestion инструмент","команды openspec","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление изменениями"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","أداة AskUserQuestion","أوامر openspec","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة التغييرات"]}},"owner":"kbayrak","repo":"openspec","repoPath":"kbayrak/openspec","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:11.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing workflow management and change archival capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要工作流管理和变更存档功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがワークフローの管理と変更のアーカイブ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 워크플로우 관리 및 변경 기록 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan administración de flujos de trabajo y capacidades de archivo de cambios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de gestion de workflow et de fonctionnalités d''archivage des modifications.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine Workflow-Verwaltung und Änderungsarchivierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho e capacidades de arquivamento de alterações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности управления рабочим процессом и архивации изменений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إدارة سير العمل وقدرات أرشفة التغييرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in experimental workflows using the openspec-archive-change skill, leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool and running openspec list --json commands to handle change selection and inference from conversation context.","zh":"通过使用 openspec-archive-change 技能，利用 AskUserQuestion 工具并运行 openspec list --json 命令来处理实验工作流中已完成的更改存档，实现对话上下文的推理和更改选择。","ja":"openspec-archive-change スキルを使用して、AskUserQuestion ツールと openspec list --json コマンドを実行し、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブし、会話のコンテキストから変更を推測する機能をエージェントに与える。","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬을 사용하여 AskUserQuestion 툴과 openspec list --json 명령을 실행하여 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경을 보관하고 대화 맥락에서 변경을 추론하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales utilizando la habilidad openspec-archive-change, aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion y ejecutando comandos openspec list --json para manejar la selección y la inferencia de cambios desde el contexto de la conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en utilisant la compétence openspec-archive-change, en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion et en exécutant des commandes openspec list --json pour gérer la sélection et l''inférence des modifications à partir du contexte de la conversation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows zu archivieren, indem sie die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change nutzen, das Tool AskUserQuestion ausnutzen und Befehle wie openspec list --json ausführen, um die Änderungsauswahl und -inferenz aus dem Konversationskontext zu handhaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais usando a habilidade openspec-archive-change, aproveitando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion e executando comandos openspec list --json para lidar com a seleção de alterações e inferência do contexto da conversa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах с помощью навыка openspec-archive-change, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion и выполняя команды openspec list --json для обработки выбора изменений и вывода из контекста разговора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير العمل التجريبي باستخدام مهارة openspec-archive-change، مستفيداً من أداة AskUserQuestion وتنفيذ أوامر openspec list --json لمعالجة اختيار التغييرات والاستدلال من سياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed changes in experimental workflows","Inferring change names from conversation context","Prompting users for change selection"],"zh":["在实验工作流中存档已完成的更改","从对话上下文推断更改名称","提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測する","ユーザーに変更の選択を促す"],"ko":["실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경을 보관하는 것","대화 맥락에서 변경 이름을 추론하는 것","사용자에게 변경 선택을 요청하는 것"],"es":["Archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales","Inferir nombres de cambios desde el contexto de la conversación","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen los cambios"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Inférer les noms de modifications à partir du contexte de la conversation","Inciter les utilisateurs à sélectionner les modifications"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Änderungsnamen aus dem Konversationskontext ableiten","Benutzer auffordern, Änderungen auszuwählen"],"pt":["Arquivamento de alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais","Inferência de nomes de alterações do contexto da conversa","Solicitação de seleção de alterações aos usuários"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных изменений в экспериментальных рабочих процессах","Вывод названий изменений из контекста разговора","Запрос выбора изменений у пользователей"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير العمل التجريبي","استدلال أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة","تحفيز المستخدمين على اختيار التغييرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Needs access to conversation context for change inference","Limited to active changes not already archived"],"zh":["需要 openspec 的安装和配置","需要访问对话上下文以进行更改推理","仅限于尚未存档的活动更改"],"ja":["openspec のインストールと設定が必要","変更の推測のために会話のコンテキストへのアクセスが必要","アーカイブされていないアクティブな変更のみに制限される"],"ko":["openspec 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","변경 추론을 위해 대화 맥락에 액세스해야 합니다","아직 보관되지 않은 활성 변경만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Necesita acceso al contexto de la conversación para la inferencia de cambios","Limitado a cambios activos que no estén ya archivados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de la conversation pour l''inférence des modifications","Limité aux modifications actives qui n''ont pas encore été archivées"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext für die Änderungsinferenz","Begrenzt auf aktive Änderungen, die noch nicht archiviert wurden"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do openspec","Necessita acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência de alterações","Limitado a alterações ativas que ainda não foram arquivadas"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации openspec","Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода изменений","Ограничен активными изменениями, которые еще не были архивированы"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستدلال التغييرات","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة التي لم يتم أرشفتها بعد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
