スと開発効率を最適化","ko":"React Three Fiber 최고의 실践 가이드, 11개의 카테고리의 60+ 규칙을 포함하여 성능과 개발 효율을 최적화","es":"React Three Fiber es una biblioteca para renderizar Three.js en React. Esta guía ofrece mejores prácticas para optimizar el rendimiento","fr":"React Three Fiber est une bibliothèque pour rendre Three.js en React. Ce guide propose des meilleures pratiques pour optimiser les performances","de":"React Three Fiber ist eine Bibliothek zum Rendern von Three.js in React. Dieser Leitfaden bietet Best Practices für Leistungsverbesserungen","pt":"Guia abrangente para React Three Fiber e o ecossistema Poimandres, com 60+ regras em 11 categorias","ru":"Полное руководство по React Three Fiber и экосистеме Poimandres, содержащее 60+ правил в 11 категориях","ar":"دليل شامل ل React Three Fiber وبيئة Poimandres، مع أكثر من 60 قاعدة في 11 فئة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["60+ 条最佳实践规则","11 个类别的优化指南","优化 React Three Fiber 性能","提高开发效率","使用 Drei 辅助工具","管理 Zustand 状态"],"ja":["60+ のベストプラクティスルール","11 カテゴリーの最適化ガイドライン","React Three Fiber パフォーマンスの最適化","開発効率の向上","Drei ヘルパーの使用","Zustand 状態の管理"],"ko":["60+ 개의 베스트 프랙티스 규칙","11개의 카테고리의 최적화 가이드라인","React Three Fiber 성능 최적화","개발 효율성 향상","Drei 헬퍼 사용","Zustand 상태 관리"],"es":["60+ reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","11 categorías de mejores prácticas","Uso correcto de Drei helpers","Gestión de estado con Zustand","Implementación de post-procesamiento y física"],"fr":["60+ règles pour optimiser les performances","11 catégories de meilleures pratiques","Utilisation correcte des helpers Drei","Gestion de l''état avec Zustand","Mise en œuvre du post-traitement et de la physique"],"de":["60+ Regeln für Leistungsverbesserungen","11 Kategorien von Best Practices","Korrekter Einsatz von Drei-Hilfsfunktionen","Zustandsverwaltung mit Zustand","Implementierung von Postprocessing und Physik"],"pt":["60+ regras para melhorar o desempenho","11 categorias para facilitar a navegação","Dicas para otimizar re-renders","Uso correto de helpers Drei","Gestão de estado com Zustand","Implementação de pós-processamento e física"],"ru":["60+ правил для улучшения производительности","11 категорий для упрощения навигации","Советы для оптимизации повторного рендеринга","Правильное использование хелперов Drei","Управление состоянием с Zustand","Реализация пост-процессинга и физики"],"ar":["60+ قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","11 فئة لتسهيل التنقل","نصائح لتحسين إعادة العرض","استخدام helpers Drei بشكل صحيح","إدارة الحالة مع Zustand","تنفيذ المعالجة اللاحقة والفيزياء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Three Fiber","最佳实践","性能优化","开发效率","Three.js","Drei","Zustand"],"ja":["React Three Fiber","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","開発効率","Three.js","Drei","Zustand"],"ko":["React Three Fiber","최상의 실践","성능 최적화","개발 효율성","Three.js","Drei","Zustand"],"es":["React Three Fiber","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","Three.js","Drei helpers","Zustand","post-procesamiento","física"],"fr":["React Three Fiber","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","Three.js","helpers Drei","Zustand","post-traitement","physique"],"de":["React Three Fiber","Best Practices","Leistungsverbesserungen","Three.js","Drei-Hilfsfunktionen","Zustand","Postprocessing","Physik"],"pt":["React Three Fiber","Melhores práticas","Desempenho","Re-renders","Drei helpers","Zustand","Pós-processamento","Física","Ecossistema Poimandres"],"ru":["React Three Fiber","Лучшие практики","Производительность","Повторное рендеринг","Хелперы Drei","Zustand","Пост-процессинг","Физика","Экосистема Poimandres"],"ar":["React Three Fiber","أفضل الممارسات","الأداء","إعادة العرض","helpers Drei","Zustand","المعالجة اللاحقة","الفيزياء","بيئة Poimandres"]}},"owner":"deadronos","repo":"gpu-conway-life","repoPath":"deadronos/gpu-conway-life","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"r3f-best-practices","description":"React Three Fiber (R3F) and Poimandres ecosystem best practices. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing R3F code. Triggers on tasks involving @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, zustand, @react-three/postprocessing, @react-three/rapier, or leva.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@r","body":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@react-three/drei** - Useful helpers and abstractions\n- **@react-three/postprocessing** - Post-processing effects\n- **@react-three/rapier** - Physics engine\n- **zustand** - State management\n- **leva** - Debug GUI\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Performance & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `perf-` |\n| 2 | useFrame & Animation | CRITICAL | `frame-` |\n| 3 | Component Patterns | HIGH | `component-` |\n| 4 | Canvas & Setup | HIGH | `canvas-` |\n| 5 | Drei Helpers | MEDIUM-HIGH | `drei-` |\n| 6 | Loading & Suspense | MEDIUM-HIGH | `loading-` |\n| 7 | State Management | MEDIUM | `state-` |\n| 8 | Events & Interaction | MEDIUM | `events-` |\n| 9 | Post-processing | MEDIUM | `postpro-` |\n| 10 | Physics (Rapier) | LOW-MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 11 | Leva (Debug GUI) | LOW | `leva-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Performance & Re-renders (CRITICAL)\n\n- `perf-never-set-state-in-useframe` - NEVER call setState in useFrame\n- `perf-isolate-state` - Isolate components that need React state\n- `perf-zustand-selectors` - Use Zustand selectors, not entire store\n- `perf-transient-subscriptions` - Use transient subscriptions for continuous values\n- `perf-memo-components` - Memoize expensive components\n- `perf-keys-for-lists` - Use stable keys for dynamic lists\n- `perf-avoid-inline-objects` - Avoid creating objects/arrays in JSX\n- `perf-dispose-auto` - Understand R3F auto-dispose behavior\n\n### 2. useFrame & Animation (CRITICAL)\n\n- `frame-priority` - Use priority for execution order\n- `frame-delta-time` - Always use delta for animations\n- `frame-conditional-subscription` - Disable useFrame when not needed\n- `frame-destructure-state` - Destructure only what you need\n- `frame-render-on-demand` - Use invalidate() for on-demand rendering\n- `frame-avoid-heavy-computation` - Move heavy work outside useFrame\n\n### 3. Component Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `component-jsx-elements` - Use JSX for Three.js objects\n- `component-attach-prop` - Use attach for non-standard properties\n- `component-primitive` - Use primitive for existing objects\n- `component-extend` - Use extend() for custom classes\n- `component-forwardref` - Use forwardRef for reusable components\n- `component-dispose-null` - Set dispose={null} on shared resources\n\n### 4. Canvas & Setup (HIGH)\n\n- `canvas-size-container` - Canvas fills parent container\n- `canvas-camera-default` - Configure camera via prop\n- `canvas-gl-config` - Configure WebGL context\n- `canvas-shadows` - Enable shadows at Canvas level\n- `canvas-frameloop` - Choose appropriate frameloop mode\n- `canvas-events` - Configure event handling\n- `canvas-linear-flat` - Use linear/flat for correct colors\n\n### 5. Drei Helpers (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `drei-use-gltf` - useGLTF with preloading\n- `drei-use-texture` - useTexture for texture loading\n- `drei-environment` - Environment for realistic lighting\n- `drei-orbit-controls` - OrbitControls from Drei\n- `drei-html` - Html for DOM overlays\n- `drei-text` - Text for 3D text\n- `drei-instances` - Instances for optimized instancing\n- `drei-use-helper` - useHelper for debug visualization\n- `drei-bounds` - Bounds to fit camera\n- `drei-center` - Center to center objects\n- `drei-float` - Float for floating animation\n\n### 6. Loading & Suspense (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `loading-suspense` - Wrap async components in Suspense\n- `loading-preload` - Preload assets with useGLTF.preload\n- `loading-use-progress` - useProgress for loading UI\n- `loading-lazy-components` - Lazy load heavy components\n- `loading-error-boundary` - Handle loading errors\n\n### 7. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-zustand-store` - Create focused Zustand stores\n- `state-avoid-objects-in-store` - Be careful with Three.js objects\n- `state-subscribeWithSelector` - Fine-grained subscriptions\n- `state-persist` - Persist state when needed\n- `state-separate-concerns` - Separate stores by concern\n\n### 8. Events & Interaction (MEDIUM)\n\n- `events-pointer-events` - Use pointer events on meshes\n- `events-stop-propagation` - Prevent event bubbling\n- `events-cursor-pointer` - Change cursor on hover\n- `events-raycast-filter` - Filter raycasting\n- `events-event-data` - Understand event data structure\n\n### 9. Post-processing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `postpro-effect-composer` - Use EffectComposer\n- `postpro-common-effects` - Common effects reference\n- `postpro-selective-bloom` - SelectiveBloom for optimized glow\n- `postpro-custom-shader` - Create custom effects\n- `postpro-performance` - Optimize post-processing\n\n### 10. Physics Rapier (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-setup` - Basic Rapier setup\n- `physics-body-types` - dynamic, fixed, kinematic\n- `physics-colliders` - Choose appropriate colliders\n- `physics-events` - Handle collision events\n- `physics-api-ref` - Use ref for physics API\n- `physics-performance` - Optimize physics\n\n### 11. Leva (LOW)\n\n- `leva-basic` - Basic Leva usage\n- `leva-folders` - Organize with folders\n- `leva-conditional` - Hide in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/perf-never-set-state-in-useframe.md\nrules/drei-use-gltf.md\nrules/state-zustand-selectors.md\n```\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `../R3F_BEST_PRACTICES.md`\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### NEVER setState in useFrame\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - 60 re-renders per second!\nfunction BadComponent() {\n  const [position, setPosition] = useState(0);\n  useFrame(() => {\n    setPosition(p => p + 0.01); // NEVER DO THIS\n  });\n  return <mesh position-x={position} />;\n}\n\n// GOOD - Mutate refs directly\nfunction GoodComponent() {\n  const meshRef = useRef();\n  useFrame(() => {\n    meshRef.current.position.x += 0.01;\n  });\n  return <mesh ref={meshRef} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Zustand Selectors\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useGameStore();\n\n// GOOD - Only re-renders when playerX changes\nconst playerX = useGameStore(state => state.playerX);\n\n// BETTER - No re-renders, direct mutation\nuseFrame(() => {\n  const { value } = useStore.getState();\n  ref.current.position.x = value;\n});\n```\n\n### Drei useGLTF\n\n```jsx\nimport { useGLTF } from ''@react-three/drei'';\n\nfunction Model() {\n  const { scene } = useGLTF(''/model.glb'');\n  return <primitive object={scene} />;\n}\n\n// Preload for instant loading\nuseGLTF.preload(''/model.glb'');\n```\n\n### Suspense Loading\n\n```jsx\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Suspense fallback={<Loader />}>\n        <Model />\n      </Suspense>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:18.516Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced 3D visualization capabilities with React Three Fiber","zh":"非常适合需要高级 3D 可视化功能的前端代理，特别是使用 React Three Fiber","ja":"React Three Fiber を使用して高度な 3D ビジュアライゼーション機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適","ko":"React Three Fiber를 사용하여 고급 3D 시각화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades de visualización 3D avanzadas con React Three Fiber","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de visualisation 3D avancées avec React Three Fiber","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte 3D-Visualisierungsfähigkeiten mit React Three Fiber benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de visualização 3D avançadas com React Three Fiber","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности 3D-визуализации с React Three Fiber","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات مرئية ثلاثية الأبعاد متقدمة مع React Three Fiber"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Three Fiber performance, utilize Drei helpers correctly, and manage state with Zustand, while implementing post-processing or physics, all within the Poimandres ecosystem using libraries like @react-three/fiber","zh":"赋予代理优化 React Three Fiber 性能、正确利用 Drei 辅助工具、使用 Zustand 管理状态，并在 Poimandres 生态系统中使用类似 @react-three/fiber 的库实现后处理或物理效果","ja":"React Three Fiber のパフォーマンスを最適化し、Drei ヘルパーを正しく使用し、Zustand で状態を管理し、Poimandres 生態系で @react-three/fiber ライブラリを使用してポストプロセッシングまたは物理を実装することでエージェントをエンパワーチェントする","ko":"React Three Fiber 성능을 최적화하고 Drei 헬퍼를 올바르게 사용하며 Zustand로 상태를 관리하고 Poimandres 생태계에서 @react-three/fiber 라이브러리를 사용하여 후처리 또는 물리 효과를 구현함으로써 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento de React Three Fiber, utilizar ayudantes de Drei de forma correcta y gestionar el estado con Zustand, al mismo tiempo que implementan el procesamiento posterior o la física, todo dentro del ecosistema de Poimandres utilizando bibliotecas como @react-three/fiber","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React Three Fiber, d''utiliser correctement les aides Drei et de gérer l''état avec Zustand, tout en implémentant le post-traitement ou la physique, le tout dans l''écosystème de Poimandres en utilisant des bibliothèques comme @react-three/fiber","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Leistung von React Three Fiber zu optimieren, Drei-Helferlein richtig zu verwenden und den Zustand mit Zustand zu verwalten, während sie das Nachbearbeiten oder die Physik implementieren, alles innerhalb des Poimandres-Ökosystems unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie @react-three/fiber","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React Three Fiber, utilizar os helpers Drei corretamente e gerenciar o estado com Zustand, ao mesmo tempo em que implementam pós-processamento ou física, tudo dentro do ecossistema Poimandres usando bibliotecas como @react-three/fiber","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность React Three Fiber, использовать хелперы Drei правильно и управлять состоянием с помощью Zustand, реализуя постобработку или физику, все в экосистеме Poimandres с использованием библиотек seperti @react-three/fiber","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين أداء React Three Fiber، واستخدام مساعدات Drei بشكل صحيح، وإدارة الحالة مع Zustand، مع تنفيذ المعالجة اللاحقة أو الفيزياء، كل ذلك داخل نظام بيومندرز باستخدام مكتبات مثل @react-three/fiber"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing R3F component re-renders","Implementing post-processing effects with Three.js","Managing complex state with Zustand in R3F applications"],"zh":["优化 R3F 组件重新渲染","使用 Three.js 实现后处理效果","在 R3F 应用程序中使用 Zustand 管理复杂状态"],"ja":["R3F コンポーネントの再描画を最適化する","Three.js を使用してポストプロセッシング効果を実装する","R3F アプリケーションで Zustand を使用して複雑な状態を管理する"],"ko":["R3F 컴포넌트 재렌더링 최적화","Three.js를 사용하여 후처리 효과 구현","R3F 애플리케이션에서 Zustand를 사용하여 복잡한 상태 관리"],"es":["Optimizar las re-renderezas de componentes R3F","Implementar efectos de post-procesamiento con Three.js","Gestionar estados complejos con Zustand en aplicaciones R3F"],"fr":["Optimiser les ré-rendus de composants R3F","Implémenter des effets de post-traitement avec Three.js","Gérer des états complexes avec Zustand dans les applications R3F"],"de":["Die Neu-Rendern von R3F-Komponenten optimieren","Post-Bearbeitungseffekte mit Three.js implementieren","Komplexe Zustände mit Zustand in R3F-Anwendungen verwalten"],"pt":["Otimizar a re-renderização de componentes R3F","Implementar efeitos de pós-processamento com Three.js","Gerenciar estado complexo com Zustand em aplicações R3F"],"ru":["Оптимизировать повторную отрисовку компонентов R3F","Реализовать эффекты постобработки с помощью Three.js","Управлять сложным состоянием с помощью Zustand в приложениях R3F"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة렌дер组件 R3F","تنفيذ تأثيرات المعالجة اللاحقة مع Three.js","إدارة حالة معقدة مع Zustand في تطبيقات R3F"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Three Fiber and Three.js setup","Limited to React ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 React Three Fiber 和 Three.js 设置","仅限 React 生态系统"],"ja":["React Three Fiber と Three.js の設定が必要","React エコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["React Three Fiber 및 Three.js 설정이 필요","React 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de React Three Fiber y Three.js","Limitado al ecosistema de React"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de React Three Fiber et Three.js","Limité à l''écosystème de React"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von React Three Fiber und Three.js","Begrenzt auf das React-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer configuração do React Three Fiber e Three.js","Limitado ao ecossistema React"],"ru":["Требует настройки React Three Fiber и Three.js","Ограничен экосистемой React"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React Three Fiber و Three.js","محدود بنظام رياكت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
