ation neuer Three.js-Projekte","Empfehlungen für das Schreiben und Überprüfen von Code","Leistungsoptimierung und Lösung von Speicherproblemen"],"pt":["100+ regras de otimização de desempenho","17 categorias de otimização","Baseado em diretrizes oficiais do Three.js","Suporte a custom shaders (GLSL ou TSL)","Implementação de recursos WebGPU","Otimização de memória e desempenho"],"ru":["100+ правил оптимизации производительности","17 категорий оптимизации","Основано на официальных руководствах Three.js","Поддержка пользовательских шейдеров (GLSL или TSL)","Реализация функций WebGPU","Оптимизация памяти и производительности"],"ar":["100+ قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","17 فئة لتحسين الأداء","مبني على إرشادات رسمية لثري جيه اس","دعم شادر مخصص (جلسل أو تسل)","تنفيذ ميزات ويب جي بي يو","تحسين الذاكرة والأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Three.js 优化","Three.js 性能优化","Three.js 内存优化","Three.js 最佳实践","Three.js 开发指南","WebGL 优化"],"ja":["Three.js 最適化","Three.js パフォーマンス最適化","Three.js メモリ最適化","Three.js ベストプラクティス","Three.js 開発ガイド","WebGL 最適化"],"ko":["Three.js 최적화","Three.js 성능 최적화","Three.js 메모리 최적화","Three.js 최적화 가이드","Three.js 개발 가이드","WebGL 최적화"],"es":["Three.js","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","WebGPU","GLSL","TSL","memoria","rendimiento"],"fr":["Three.js","optimisation des performances","meilleures pratiques","développement d''applications","WebGPU","GLSL","TSL","mémoire","performances"],"de":["Three.js","Leistungsoptimierung","beste Praktiken","Anwendungsentwicklung","WebGPU","GLSL","TSL","Speicher","Leistung"],"pt":["Three.js","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual","realidade aumentada","WebGPU","custom shaders","vazamentos de memória","estabilidade de aplicativos"],"ru":["Three.js","оптимизация производительности","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность","дополненная реальность","WebGPU","пользовательские шейдеры","утечки памяти","стабильность приложений"],"ar":["ثري جيه اس","تحسين الأداء","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي","الواقع المعزز","ويب جي بي يو","شادر مخصص","تسربات الذاكرة","استقرار التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"deadronos","repo":"gpu-conway-life","repoPath":"deadronos/gpu-conway-life","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"three-best-practices","description":"Three.js performance optimization and best practices guidelines. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing Three.js code. Triggers on tasks involving 3D scenes, WebGL/WebGPU rendering, geometries, materials, textures, lighting, shaders, or TSL.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Three.js Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Three.js applications. Contains 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n> Based on official guidelines from Three.js `llms` branch maintained by mrdoob.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Three.js project\n- Writing or reviewing Three.js code\n- Optimizing performance or fixing memory leaks\n- Working with custom shaders (GLSL or TSL)\n- Implementing WebGPU features\n- Buil","body":"# Three.js Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Three.js applications. Contains 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n> Based on official guidelines from Three.js `llms` branch maintained by mrdoob.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Three.js project\n- Writing or reviewing Three.js code\n- Optimizing performance or fixing memory leaks\n- Working with custom shaders (GLSL or TSL)\n- Implementing WebGPU features\n- Building VR/AR experiences with WebXR\n- Integrating physics engines\n- Optimizing for mobile devices\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 0 | Modern Setup & Imports | FUNDAMENTAL | `setup-` |\n| 1 | Memory Management & Dispose | CRITICAL | `memory-` |\n| 2 | Render Loop Optimization | CRITICAL | `render-` |\n| 3 | Geometry & Buffer Management | HIGH | `geometry-` |\n| 4 | Material & Texture Optimization | HIGH | `material-` |\n| 5 | Lighting & Shadows | MEDIUM-HIGH | `lighting-` |\n| 6 | Scene Graph Organization | MEDIUM | `scene-` |\n| 7 | Shader Best Practices (GLSL) | MEDIUM | `shader-` |\n| 8 | TSL (Three.js Shading Language) | MEDIUM | `tsl-` |\n| 9 | Loading & Assets | MEDIUM | `loading-` |\n| 10 | Camera & Controls | LOW-MEDIUM | `camera-` |\n| 11 | Animation System | MEDIUM | `animation-` |\n| 12 | Physics Integration | MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 13 | WebXR / VR / AR | MEDIUM | `webxr-` |\n| 14 | Audio | LOW-MEDIUM | `audio-` |\n| 15 | Mobile Optimization | HIGH | `mobile-` |\n| 16 | Production | HIGH | `error-`, `migration-` |\n| 17 | Debug & DevTools | LOW | `debug-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 0. Modern Setup (FUNDAMENTAL)\n\n- `setup-use-import-maps` - Use Import Maps, not old CDN scripts\n- `setup-choose-renderer` - WebGLRenderer (default) vs WebGPURenderer (TSL/compute)\n- `setup-animation-loop` - Use `renderer.setAnimationLoop()` not manual RAF\n- `setup-basic-scene-template` - Complete modern scene template\n\n### 1. Memory Management (CRITICAL)\n\n- `memory-dispose-geometry` - Always dispose geometries\n- `memory-dispose-material` - Always dispose materials and textures\n- `memory-dispose-textures` - Dispose dynamically created textures\n- `memory-dispose-render-targets` - Always dispose WebGLRenderTarget\n- `memory-dispose-recursive` - Use recursive disposal for hierarchies\n- `memory-dispose-on-unmount` - Dispose in React cleanup/unmount\n- `memory-renderer-dispose` - Dispose renderer when destroying view\n- `memory-reuse-objects` - Reuse geometries and materials\n\n### 2. Render Loop (CRITICAL)\n\n- `render-single-raf` - Single requestAnimationFrame loop\n- `render-conditional` - Render on demand for static scenes\n- `render-delta-time` - Use delta time for animations\n- `render-avoid-allocations` - Never allocate in render loop\n- `render-cache-computations` - Cache expensive computations\n- `render-frustum-culling` - Enable frustum culling\n- `render-update-matrix-manual` - Disable auto matrix updates for static objects\n- `render-pixel-ratio` - Limit pixel ratio to 2\n- `render-antialias-wisely` - Use antialiasing judiciously\n\n### 3. Geometry (HIGH)\n\n- `geometry-buffer-geometry` - Always use BufferGeometry\n- `geometry-merge-static` - Merge static geometries\n- `geometry-instanced-mesh` - Use InstancedMesh for identical objects\n- `geometry-lod` - Use Level of Detail for complex models\n- `geometry-index-buffer` - Use indexed geometry\n- `geometry-vertex-count` - Minimize vertex count\n- `geometry-attributes-typed` - Use appropriate typed arrays\n- `geometry-interleaved` - Consider interleaved buffers\n\n### 4. Materials & Textures (HIGH)\n\n- `material-reuse` - Reuse materials across meshes\n- `material-simplest-sufficient` - Use simplest material that works\n- `material-texture-size-power-of-two` - Power-of-two texture dimensions\n- `material-texture-compression` - Use compressed textures (KTX2/Basis)\n- `material-texture-mipmaps` - Enable mipmaps appropriately\n- `material-texture-anisotropy` - Use anisotropic filtering for floors\n- `material-texture-atlas` - Use texture atlases\n- `material-avoid-transparency` - Minimize transparent materials\n- `material-onbeforecompile` - Use onBeforeCompile for shader mods (or TSL)\n\n### 5. Lighting & Shadows (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `lighting-limit-lights` - Minimize dynamic lights\n- `lighting-bake-static` - Bake lighting for static scenes\n- `lighting-shadow-camera-tight` - Fit shadow camera tightly\n- `lighting-shadow-map-size` - Choose appropriate shadow resolution\n- `lighting-shadow-selective` - Enable shadows selectively\n- `lighting-shadow-cascade` - Use CSM for large scenes\n- `lighting-probe` - Use Light Probes\n\n### 6. Scene Graph (MEDIUM)\n\n- `scene-group-objects` - Use Groups for organization\n- `scene-layers` - Use Layers for selective rendering\n- `scene-visible-toggle` - Use visible flag, not add/remove\n- `scene-flatten-static` - Flatten static hierarchies\n- `scene-name-objects` - Name objects for debugging\n- `scene-object-pooling` - Use object pooling\n\n### 7. Shaders GLSL (MEDIUM)\n\n- `shader-precision` - Use appropriate precision\n- `shader-avoid-branching` - Minimize branching\n- `shader-precompute-cpu` - Precompute on CPU\n- `shader-avoid-discard` - Avoid discard, use alphaTest\n- `shader-texture-lod` - Use textureLod for known mip levels\n- `shader-uniform-arrays` - Prefer uniform arrays\n- `shader-varying-interpolation` - Use flat when appropriate\n- `shader-chunk-injection` - Use Three.js shader chunks\n\n### 8. TSL - Three.js Shading Language (MEDIUM)\n\n- `tsl-why-use` - Use TSL instead of onBeforeCompile\n- `tsl-setup-webgpu` - WebGPU setup for TSL\n- `tsl-complete-reference` - Full TSL type system and functions\n- `tsl-material-slots` - Material node properties reference\n- `tsl-node-materials` - Use NodeMaterial classes\n- `tsl-basic-operations` - Types, operations, swizzling\n- `tsl-functions` - Creating TSL functions with Fn()\n- `tsl-conditionals` - If, select, loops in TSL\n- `tsl-textures` - Textures and triplanar mapping\n- `tsl-post-processing` - bloom, blur, dof, ao\n- `tsl-compute-shaders` - GPGPU and compute operations\n- `tsl-glsl-to-tsl` - GLSL to TSL translation\n\n### 9. Loading & Assets (MEDIUM)\n\n- `loading-draco-compression` - Use Draco for large meshes\n- `loading-gltf-preferred` - Use glTF format\n- `gltf-loading-optimization` - Full loader setup with DRACO/Meshopt/KTX2\n- `loading-progress-feedback` - Show loading progress\n- `loading-async-await` - Use async/await for loading\n- `loading-lazy` - Lazy load non-critical assets\n- `loading-cache-assets` - Enable caching\n- `loading-dispose-unused` - Unload unused assets\n\n### 10. Camera & Controls (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `camera-near-far` - Set tight near/far planes\n- `camera-fov` - Choose appropriate FOV\n- `camera-controls-damping` - Use damping for smooth controls\n- `camera-resize-handler` - Handle resize properly\n- `camera-orbit-limits` - Set orbit control limits\n\n### 11. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `animation-system` - AnimationMixer, blending, morph targets, skeletal\n\n### 12. Physics (MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-integration` - Rapier, Cannon-es integration patterns\n\n### 13. WebXR (MEDIUM)\n\n- `webxr-setup` - VR/AR buttons, controllers, hit testing\n\n### 14. Audio (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `audio-spatial` - PositionalAudio, HRTF, spatial sound\n\n### 15. Optimization (HIGH)\n\n- `mobile-optimization` - Mobile-specific optimizations and checklist\n- `raycasting-optimization` - BVH, layers, GPU picking\n\n### 16. Production (HIGH)\n\n- `error-handling-recovery` - WebGL context loss and recovery\n- `migration-checklist` - Breaking changes by version\n\n### 17. Debug (LOW)\n\n- `debug-stats` - Use Stats.js\n- `debug-helpers` - Use built-in helpers\n- `debug-gui` - Use lil-gui for tweaking\n- `debug-renderer-info` - Check renderer.info\n- `debug-conditional` - Remove debug code in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/setup-use-import-maps.md\nrules/memory-dispose-geometry.md\nrules/tsl-complete-reference.md\nrules/mobile-optimization.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- BAD code example with explanation\n- GOOD code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Modern Import Maps\n\n```html\n<script type=\"importmap\">\n{\n  \"imports\": {\n    \"three\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/build/three.module.js\",\n    \"three/addons/\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/examples/jsm/\",\n    \"three/tsl\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/build/three.tsl.js\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Proper Disposal\n\n```javascript\nfunction disposeObject(obj) {\n  if (obj.geometry) obj.geometry.dispose();\n  if (obj.material) {\n    if (Array.isArray(obj.material)) {\n      obj.material.forEach(m => m.dispose());\n    } else {\n      obj.material.dispose();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSL Basic Usage\n\n```javascript\nimport { texture, uv, color, time, sin } from ''three/tsl'';\n\nconst material = new THREE.MeshStandardNodeMaterial();\nmaterial.colorNode = texture(map).mul(color(0xff0000));\nmaterial.colorNode = color(0x00ff00).mul(sin(time).mul(0.5).add(0.5));\n```\n\n### Mobile Detection\n\n```javascript\nconst isMobile = /Android|iPhone|iPad|iPod/i.test(navigator.userAgent);\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, isMobile ? 1.5 : 2));\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:26.353Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Rendering Agents needing optimized Three.js performance and compatibility with WebGPU features","zh":"适合需要优化Three.js性能和兼容WebGPU功能的图形渲染代理","ja":"Three.jsのパフォーマンスを最適化し、WebGPU機能との互換性が必要なグラフィックスレンダリングエージェントに適しています","ko":"Three.js 성능을 최적화하고 WebGPU 기능과 호환되는 그래픽스 렌더링 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de renderizado de gráficos que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de Three.js y compatibilidad con las características de WebGPU","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rendering graphique nécessitant des performances optimisées de Three.js et une compatibilité avec les fonctionnalités WebGPU","de":"Perfekt für Graphics-Rendering-Agents, die ein optimiertes Three.js-Performance und Kompatibilität mit WebGPU-Funktionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Renderização Gráfica que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do Three.js e compatibilidade com recursos do WebGPU","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов графики, требующих оптимизированной производительности Three.js и совместимости с функциями WebGPU","ar":"مثالي لعميل العرض الرسومي الذي يحتاج إلى أداء محسن لبرامج Three.js ومتوافق مع ميزات WebGPU"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop high-performance Three.js applications by providing 100+ rules across 17 categories for optimization, including best practices for working with custom shaders like GLSL or TSL, and implementing WebGPU features for enhanced graphics rendering","zh":"通过提供超过100条规则和17个类别的优化，包括使用自定义着色器（如GLSL或TSL）和实现WebGPU功能以增强图形渲染的最佳实践，赋予代理开发高性能Three.js应用程序的能力","ja":"カスタムシェーダー（GLSLやTSLなど）を使用したベストプラクティスやWebGPU機能の実装など、17のカテゴリにわたる100以上のルールを提供し、エージェントが高パフォーマンスのThree.jsアプリケーションを開発できるようにします","ko":"100개 이상의 규칙과 17개의 카테고리를 제공하여 커스텀 셰이더(GLSL 또는 TSL)를 사용한最佳实践 및 WebGPU 기능을 구현하여 그래픽스 렌더링을增强하고 에이전트가 고성능 Three.js 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones de alto rendimiento de Three.js proporcionando más de 100 reglas en 17 categorías para la optimización, incluyendo las mejores prácticas para trabajar con sombreadores personalizados como GLSL o TSL, y la implementación de características de WebGPU para un renderizado de gráficos mejorado","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Three.js à haute performance en fournissant plus de 100 règles dans 17 catégories pour l''optimisation, y compris les meilleures pratiques pour travailler avec des shaders personnalisés comme GLSL ou TSL, et la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités WebGPU pour un rendu graphique amélioré","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Three.js-Anwendungen mit hoher Leistung zu entwickeln, indem sie über 100 Regeln in 17 Kategorien für die Optimierung bereitstellen, einschließlich der besten Praktiken für die Arbeit mit benutzerdefinierten Shadern wie GLSL oder TSL und der Implementierung von WebGPU-Funktionen für ein verbessertes Grafikrendering","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam aplicações de alto desempenho do Three.js, fornecendo mais de 100 regras em 17 categorias para otimização, incluindo as melhores práticas para trabalhar com sombreadores personalizados como GLSL ou TSL e implementar recursos do WebGPU para renderização gráfica aprimorada","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать высокопроизводительные приложения Three.js, предоставляя более 100 правил в 17 категориях для оптимизации, включая лучшие практики для работы с пользовательскими шейдерами, такими как GLSL или TSL, и реализацию функций WebGPU для улучшенной графики","ar":"يمكن للعميل تطوير تطبيقات عالية الأداء لبرامج Three.js من خلال توفير أكثر من 100 قاعدة في 17 فئة لتحسين الأداء، بما في ذلك أفضل الممارسات للعمل مع ظلال مخصصة مثل GLSL أو TSL وتنفيذ ميزات WebGPU لتحسين العرض الرسومي"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing Three.js project performance","Debugging memory leaks in custom shaders","Implementing WebGPU features for enhanced graphics rendering"],"zh":["优化Three.js项目性能","调试自定义着色器中的内存泄漏","实现WebGPU功能以增强图形渲染"],"ja":["Three.jsプロジェクトのパフォーマンスを最適化する","カスタムシェーダー内のメモリリークをデバッグする","WebGPU機能を実装してグラフィックスレンダリングを強化する"],"ko":["Three.js 프로젝트 성능 최적화","커스텀 셰이더 내 메모리 누수 디버깅","WebGPU 기능 구현을 통해 그래픽스 렌더링增强"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de proyectos Three.js","Depurar fugas de memoria en sombreadores personalizados","Implementar características de WebGPU para un renderizado de gráficos mejorado"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des projets Three.js","Déboguer les fuites de mémoire dans les shaders personnalisés","Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités WebGPU pour un rendu graphique amélioré"],"de":["Die Leistung von Three.js-Projekten optimieren","Speicherlecks in benutzerdefinierten Shadern debuggen","WebGPU-Funktionen für ein verbessertes Grafikrendering implementieren"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho de projetos do Three.js","Depurar vazamentos de memória em sombreadores personalizados","Implementar recursos do WebGPU para renderização gráfica aprimorada"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность проектов Three.js","Отладить утечки памяти в пользовательских шейдерах","Реализовать функции WebGPU для улучшенной графики"],"ar":["تحسين أداء مشاريع Three.js","تصحيح تسربات الذاكرة في ظلال مخصصة","تنفيذ ميزات WebGPU لتحسين العرض الرسومي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Three.js and GLSL or TSL for custom shaders","Specific to Three.js applications"],"zh":["需要Three.js和GLSL或TSL的知识来使用自定义着色器","仅适用于Three.js应用程序"],"ja":["カスタムシェーダーを使用するにはThree.jsとGLSLまたはTSLの知識が必要","Three.jsアプリケーションにのみ適用可能"],"ko":["커스텀 셰이더를 사용하려면 Three.js 및 GLSL 또는 TSL에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","Three.js 애플리케이션에만 적용 가능"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Three.js y GLSL o TSL para sombreadores personalizados","Específico para aplicaciones de Three.js"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Three.js et GLSL ou TSL pour les shaders personnalisés","Spécifique aux applications Three.js"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Three.js und GLSL oder TSL für benutzerdefinierte Shader","Spezifisch für Three.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do Three.js e GLSL ou TSL para sombreadores personalizados","Específico para aplicações do Three.js"],"ru":["Требует знания Three.js и GLSL или TSL для пользовательских шейдеров","Конкретно для приложений Three.js"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة برامج Three.js و GLSL أو TSL لظلال مخصصة","محدد لتطبيقات Three.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
