hercheable avec des recommandations prioritaires"],"de":["50+ Designstile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","Suchbare Datenbank mit priorisierten Empfehlungen"],"pt":["50+ estilos de design","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей дизайна","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 руководств по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ نمطًا من التصميم","97 لوحة ألوان","57 زوجًا من الخطوط","99 إرشادات لتحسين الخبرة","25 نوعًا من الرسومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI 设计","UX 设计","网页设计","移动应用设计","设计指南","设计智能"],"ja":["UI デザイン","UX デザイン","Web デザイン","モバイルアプリデザイン","デザインガイド","デザインインテリジェンス"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","웹 디자인","모바일 애플리케이션 디자인","디자인 가이드","디자인 인텔리전스"],"es":["diseño de aplicaciones web","diseño de aplicaciones móviles","experiencia de usuario","UX","UI","guía de diseño","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","combinaciones de fuentes"],"fr":["conception d''applications web","conception d''applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","UX","UI","guide de conception","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","combinaisons de polices"],"de":["Design von Web-Anwendungen","Design von Mobile-Anwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","UX","UI","Designleitfaden","Designstile","Farbpaletten","Schriftkombinationen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","design de interfaces","experiência do usuário","guias de design","estilos de design","paletas de cores"],"ru":["дизайн ui/ux","дизайн интерфейсов","опыт пользователя","руководства по дизайну","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تصميم الخبرة","دليل التصميم","أنماط التصميم","لوحات الألوان","تحسين الخبرة"]}},"owner":"plantrungnampl","repo":"realtime_board","repoPath":"plantrungnampl/realtime_board","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:44.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX指南和网页及移动应用建议的设计导向型Agent。","ja":"デザインに焦点を当てたエージェントが、Webおよびモバイルアプリケーション向けの包括的なUI/UXガイドラインと推奨事項を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"디자인 중심의 에이전트가 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 포괄적인 UI/UX 지침 및 권장 사항을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en diseño que necesitan pautas y recomendaciones de UI/UX integrales para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des directives et des recommandations UI/UX complètes pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Design que necessitam de diretrizes e recomendações abrangentes de UI/UX para aplicações web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым необходимы комплексные рекомендации и руководства по UI/UX для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المهتمين بالتصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات وتوصيات شاملة لويب/واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم لتصميمات الويب والتطبيقات المحمولة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines across 9 technology stacks, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations for efficient design decision-making.","zh":"通过利用50+样式、97个色彩调色板和57个字体配对，同时确保在9个技术栈中遵守99个UX指南，利用可搜索的数据库和基于优先级的推荐，实现高效的设计决策，赋予代理创建视觉效果吸引人和用户友好的界面的能力。","ja":"50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントのペアを活用し、9つのテクノロジースタックにわたる99のUXガイドラインに準拠することで、検索可能なデータベースと優先順位に基づく推奨事項を利用して効率的なデザインの意思決定を行い、エージェントが視覚的に魅力があり、ユーザーフレンドリーなインターフェイスを作成できるようにします。","ko":"50개 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 조합을 활용하여 9개의 기술 스택에 걸쳐 99개의 UX 가이드라인을 준수하면서 검색 가능한 데이터베이스와 우선순위 기반의 권장 사항을 사용하여 효율적인 디자인 의사결정을 가능하게 하여 에이전트가 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visualmente atractivas y fáciles de usar mediante el aprovechamiento de más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el cumplimiento de 99 pautas de UX en 9 pilas tecnológicas, utilizando bases de datos buscables con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades para una toma de decisiones de diseño eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes et conviviales en exploitant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en assurant le respect de 99 directives UX sur 9 piles technologiques, en utilisant des bases de données consultables avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités pour une prise de décision de conception efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie mehr als 50 Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen nutzen, während sie gleichzeitig die Einhaltung von 99 UX-Richtlinien in 9 Technologiestacks sicherstellen, indem sie durchsuchbare Datenbanken mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen für effizientes Design-Entscheidungsfinden nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes e amigáveis ao usuário, aproveitando mais de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo ao mesmo tempo o cumprimento de 99 diretrizes de UX em 9 pilhas de tecnologia, utilizando bancos de dados pesquisáveis com recomendações baseadas em prioridade para tomada de decisão de design eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные и удобные для пользователя интерфейсы, используя более 50 стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 пар-font, обеспечивая при этом соблюдение 99 руководств по UX в 9 технологических стэках, используя поисковые базы данных с рекомендациями, основанными на приоритете, для эффективного принятия решений по дизайну.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم جذابة وبسيطة الاستخدام من خلال استخدام أكثر من 50 نمطًا و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من الخطوط، مع ضمان الامتثال ل99 توجيهًا لتحسين تجربة المستخدم عبر 9 مجموعات تقنية، باستخدام قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث مع توصيات تقوم على الأولوية لاتخاذ قرارات تصميم فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimal color schemes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing fixes based on established guidelines","Building landing pages or dashboards that adhere to best practices for user experience"],"zh":["使用最佳色彩方案和字体设计新的UI组件或页面","查看代码中的UX问题并根据既定的指南实施修复","构建符合用户体验最佳实践的登陆页面或仪表盘"],"ja":["最適な色彩スキームとフォントを使用して新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","コード内のUXの問題を確認し、既定のガイドラインに基づいて修正を実施する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスのベストプラクティスに準拠したランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["최적의 색상 구성표와 글꼴을 사용하여 새로운 UI 구성 요소 또는 페이지를 설계합니다.","코드에서 UX 문제를 검토하고 확립된 지침에 따라 수정을 구현합니다.","사용자 경험의 모범 사례에 따라 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축합니다."],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con esquemas de color y tipografía óptimos","Revisar el código para problemas de UX e implementar soluciones en función de las pautas establecidas","Crear páginas de destino o paneles de control que se adhieran a las mejores prácticas para la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec des schémas de couleur et une typographie optimaux","Examiner le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre des correctifs sur la base des directives établies","Créer des pages de destination ou des tableaux de bord qui adhèrent aux meilleures pratiques pour l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Neue Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten oder -Seiten mit optimalen Farbschemata und Typografie entwerfen","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und Lösungen auf der Grundlage etablierter Richtlinien implementieren","Landingpages oder Dashboards erstellen, die den Best Practices für die Benutzererfahrung entsprechen"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes de UI ou páginas com esquemas de cor e tipografia ótimos","Revisar o código para problemas de UX e implementar soluções com base em diretrizes estabelecidas","Construir páginas de destino ou dashboards que aderem às melhores práticas para experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Разработка новых компонентов UI или страниц с оптимальными цветовыми схемами и типографией","Проверка кода на проблемы с UX и реализация исправлений на основе установленных руководств","Создание целевых страниц или панелей управления, соответствующих лучшим практикам для опыта пользователя"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع مخططات الألوان والخطوط المثالية","مراجعة الشفرة للقضايا المتعلقة بتجربة المستخدم وتنفيذ الإصلاحات بناءً على الإرشادات المحددة","بناء صفحات الهبوط أو لوحات التحكم التي تتماشى مع أفضل الممارسات لتجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to a searchable database for design recommendations","Limited to web and mobile application design"],"zh":["需要访问可搜索的数据库以获取设计建议","仅限于网页和移动应用程序设计"],"ja":["デザインの推奨事項を得るために検索可能なデータベースへのアクセスが必要","Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションの設計に限定される"],"ko":["디자인 제안을 얻기 위해 검색 가능한 데이터베이스에 액세스해야 함","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una base de datos buscable para recomendaciones de diseño","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à une base de données consultable pour les recommandations de conception","Limité à la conception d''applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf eine durchsuchbare Datenbank für Design-Empfehlungen","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a um banco de dados pesquisável para recomendações de design","Limitado ao design de aplicações web e móveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к поисковой базе данных для рекомендаций по дизайну","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث لتوصيات التصميم","محدود بتصميم تطبيقات الويب والتطبيقات المحمولة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'TheerasakPing', 'video-downloader-tauri', 'TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z', '2026-02-18T06:44:46.174Z', NULL, '{"id":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一款设计智能指南，包含全面设计资源，包括样式、色板、字体配对和用户体验指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、スタイル、カラーパレット、フォントペア、ユーザーエクスペリエンスガイドラインなど、包括的な設計リソースを含む設計インテリジェンス","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 스타일, 컬러 팰릿, 폰트 페어링, 사용자 경험 가이드라인 등을 포함하는 포괄적인 디자인 리소스를 제공하는 디자인 인텔리전스","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles con 50+ estilos y 97 paletas de colores","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles avec 50+ styles et 97 palettes de couleurs","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen mit 50+ Stilen und 97 Farbpaletten","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móvel, com 50+ estilos e 97 paletas de cores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб- и мобильных приложений, содержащее 50+ стилей и 97 цветовых палитр.","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، يحتوي على 50+ نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max - 设计智能指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max - デザインインテリジェンス","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max - 디자인 인텔리전스","es":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guía de diseño inteligente","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max : Guide de conception intelligente","de":"UI/UX Pro Max: Leitfaden für Design-Intelligenz","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guia de Design Inteligente","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max: Комплексное руководство по дизайну","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس: دليل التصميم الذكي","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一款设计智能指南，包含全面设计资源，包括样式、色板、字体配对和用户体验指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、スタイル、カラーパレット、フォントペア、ユーザーエクスペリエンスガイドラインなど、包括的な設計リソースを含む設計インテリジェンス","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 스타일, 컬러 팰릿, 폰트 페어링, 사용자 경험 가이드라인 등을 포함하는 포괄적인 디자인 리소스를 제공하는 디자인 인텔리전스","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles con 50+ estilos y 97 paletas de colores","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles avec 50+ styles et 97 palettes de couleurs","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen mit 50+ Stilen und 97 Farbpaletten","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móvel, com 50+ estilos e 97 paletas de cores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб- и мобильных приложений, содержащее 50+ стилей и 97 цветовых палитр.","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، يحتوي على 50+ نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"definition":{"en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"features":{"zh":["50+样式","97色板","57字体配对","99用户体验指南","25种图表类型"],"ja":["50+スタイル","97カラーパレット","57フォントペア","99ユーザーエクスペリエンスガイドライン","25種類のチャートタイプ"],"ko":["50+ 스타일","97 컬러 팰릿","57 폰트 페어링","99 사용자 경험 가이드라인","25 가지 차트 유형"],"es":["50+ estilos de diseño","97 paletas de colores","57 combinaciones de fuentes","99 guidelines de UX","Base de datos searchable"],"fr":["50+ styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs","57 combinaisons de polices","99 lignes directrices d''UX","Base de données searchable"],"de":["50+ Designstile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","Suchbare Datenbank"],"pt":["50+ estilos de design","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей дизайна","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 рекомендаций по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ نمطًا من التصميم","97 لوحة ألوان","57 اتحادًا للخطوط","99 توجيهًا لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","25 نوعًا من الرسومات البيانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计智能","设计指南","用户体验","设计资源"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","設計インテリジェンス","設計ガイドライン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","設計リソース"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","디자인 가이드라인","사용자 경험","디자인 리소스"],"es":["diseño de UI","diseño de UX","guía de diseño","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","experiencia del usuario","design thinking","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["conception de UI","conception de UX","guide de conception","applications web","applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","design thinking","développement de logiciels"],"de":["UI-Design","UX-Design","Designleitfaden","Webanwendungen","Mobile-Anwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","Design Thinking","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["ui/ux design","desenvolvimento web","aplicações móvel","guias de design","estilos de design","paletas de cores"],"ru":["дизайн ui/ux","веб-разработка","мобильные приложения","руководства по дизайну","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры"],"ar":["تصميم ui/ux","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات الجوال","دلائل التصميم","أنماط التصميم","ألواح الألوان"]}},"owner":"TheerasakPing","repo":"video-downloader-tauri","repoPath":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:46.174Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidance and video downloader app development with Tauri, React, and Rust.","zh":"非常适合需要全面的UI/UX设计指导和使用Tauri、React及Rust进行视频下载器应用开发的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが包括的なUI/UX設計の指針とTauri、React、Rustを使用したビデオダウンローダーアプリの開発を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전체적인 UI/UX 디자인 가이드와 Tauri, React, Rust를 사용한 비디오 다운로드 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan orientación integral sobre diseño de UI/UX y desarrollo de aplicaciones de descarga de videos con Tauri, React y Rust.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une orientation complète sur la conception UI/UX et le développement d''applications de téléchargement de vidéos avec Tauri, React et Rust.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die umfassende UI/UX-Design-Anleitung und Videodownloader-App-Entwicklung mit Tauri, React und Rust benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de orientação abrangente sobre design de UI/UX e desenvolvimento de aplicativos de download de vídeo com Tauri, React e Rust.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется всестороннее руководство по设计у UI/UX и разработке приложений для скачивания видео с использованием Tauri, React и Rust.","ar":"مثالي لويب فرنت اند الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة حول تصميم الواجهة و تجربة المستخدم وتطوير تطبيقات تنزيل الفيديو مع Tauri و React و Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually stunning web and mobile applications with 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring seamless UX with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types, all searchable and prioritized, utilizing Tauri, React, and Rust for robust video downloader apps.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉效果惊人的网页和移动应用的能力，拥有50+风格、97种颜色调色板和57种字体配对，同时确保无缝的用户体验，拥有99条指南和25种图表类型，所有这些都可以搜索和优先排序，利用Tauri、React和Rust来构建强大的视频下载器应用。","ja":"エージェントが50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントのペアを使用して視覚的に 驚くようなウェブおよびモバイルアプリケーションを作成できるようにし、99のガイドラインと25種類のチャートタイプを使用してシームレスなUXを保証することで、検索可能で優先順位付けされたTauri、React、Rustを使用した強力なビデオダウンローダーアプリを構築します。","ko":"에이전트가 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97가지 색상 팔레트, 57가지 폰트 조합을 사용하여 시각적으로惊くような 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 99개의 가이드라인과 25가지 차트 유형을 사용하여 무결점의 사용자 경험을 보장하며, 모두 검색 가능하고 우선 순위가 지정된 Tauri, React, Rust를 사용한 강력한 비디오 다운로드 애플리케이션을 구축합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones web y móviles visualmente impresionantes con más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, al mismo tiempo que garantiza una experiencia de usuario sin problemas con 99 pautas y 25 tipos de gráficos, todos búsqueda y priorizados, utilizando Tauri, React y Rust para aplicaciones de descarga de videos robustas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications web et mobiles visuellement époustouflantes avec plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 combinaisons de polices, tout en assurant une expérience utilisateur sans problème avec 99 lignes directrices et 25 types de graphiques, tous recherchables et priorisés, en utilisant Tauri, React et Rust pour des applications de téléchargement de vidéos robustes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell atemberaubende Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen mit über 50 Stilen, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen zu erstellen, während gleichzeitig eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung mit 99 Richtlinien und 25 Charttypen sichergestellt wird, alle durchsuchbar und priorisiert, unter Verwendung von Tauri, React und Rust für robuste Videodownloader-Apps.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicações web e móveis visualmente deslumbrantes com 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo uma experiência de usuário perfeita com 99 diretrizes e 25 tipos de gráficos, todos pesquisáveis e priorizados, utilizando Tauri, React e Rust para aplicativos de download de vídeo robustos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально потрясающие веб- и мобильные приложения с 50+ стилями, 97 цветовыми палитрами и 57 комбинациями шрифтов, обеспечивая бесперебойную UX с 99 руководствами и 25 типами графиков, все из которых можно искать и расставлять приоритеты, используя Tauri, React и Rust для создания прочных приложений для скачивания видео.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات ويب وموبايل متقنة بصريًا مع أكثر من 50 نمطًا و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من خطوط الكتابة، مع ضمان تجربة مستخدم بدون عوائق مع 99 إرشادًا و25 نوعًا من الرسوم البيانية، وكلها قابلة للبحث وتحديد الأولويات، باستخدام Tauri وReact وRust لتطبيقات تنزيل الفيديو القوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive UI components with React","Selecting harmonious color palettes and typography for web applications","Reviewing Rust code for UX issues in video downloader apps","Building intuitive landing pages and dashboards with Tauri"],"zh":["使用React设计响应式UI组件","为网页应用选择和谐的颜色调色板和字体","检查Rust代码中的UX问题以用于视频下载器应用","使用Tauri构建直观的登陆页面和仪表盘"],"ja":["Reactを使用してレスポンシブなUIコンポーネントを設計する","ウェブアプリケーションに調和のとれたカラーパレットとフォントを選択する","ビデオダウンローダーアプリケーションで使用するためのRustコードのUXの問題を確認する","Tauriを使用して直感的なランディングページとダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["React를 사용하여 반응형 UI 컴포넌트를 설계함","웹 애플리케이션에 조화로운 색상 팔레트와 폰트를 선택함","비디오 다운로드 애플리케이션에서 사용하기 위한 Rust 코드의 UX 문제 점검","Tauri를 사용하여 직관적인 랜딩 페이지와 대시보드를 구축함"],"es":["Diseñar componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos con React","Seleccionar paletas de colores y tipografía armoniosas para aplicaciones web","Revisar el código Rust para problemas de UX en aplicaciones de descarga de videos","Crear páginas de aterrizaje y paneles de control intuitivos con Tauri"],"fr":["Concevoir des composants d''interface utilisateur responsives avec React","Sélectionner des palettes de couleurs et des typographies harmonieuses pour les applications web","Réviser le code Rust pour les problèmes d''UX dans les applications de téléchargement de vidéos","Créer des pages d''accueil et des tableaux de bord intuitifs avec Tauri"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit React","Auswählen von harmonischen Farbpaletten und Typografie für Webanwendungen","Überprüfen von Rust-Code auf UX-Probleme in Videodownloader-Apps","Erstellen von intuitiven Landingpages und Dashboards mit Tauri"],"pt":["Projetar componentes de UI responsivos com React","Selecionar paletas de cores e tipografia harmônicas para aplicações web","Revisar código Rust para problemas de UX em aplicativos de download de vídeo","Construir páginas de destino e dashboards intuitivos com Tauri"],"ru":["Проектировать адаптивные компоненты UI с использованием React","Выбирать гармоничные цветовые палитры и типографику для веб-приложений","Проверять код Rust на проблемы с UX в приложениях для скачивания видео","Создавать интуитивно понятные страницы назначения и панели управления с помощью Tauri"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم التكيفية باستخدام React","اختيار لوحات الألوان والخطوط المتوافقة لتطبيقات الويب","مراجعة كود Rust لمشاكل تجربة المستخدم في تطبيقات تنزيل الفيديو","بناء صفحات الهبوط واللوحات التفاعلية باستخدام Tauri"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Tauri, React, and Rust for implementation","Limited to web and mobile application design"],"zh":["需要Tauri、React和Rust的知识来实现","仅限于网页和移动应用设计"],"ja":["実装するにはTauri、React、Rustの知識が必要","ウェブおよびモバイルアプリケーションデザインに限定される"],"ko":["구현을 위해 Tauri, React, Rust에 대한 지식이 필요함","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Tauri, React y Rust para la implementación","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Tauri, React et Rust pour la mise en œuvre","Limité à la conception d''applications web et mobiles"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse von Tauri, React und Rust für die Implementierung","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Tauri, React e Rust para implementação","Limitado ao design de aplicações web e móvel"],"ru":["Требует знания Tauri, React и Rust для реализации","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Tauri وReact وRust للتطبيق","محدود بتصميم التطبيقات الويب والموبايل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Sologa/codex-pipeline/gh-address-comments', 'community', 'Sologa', 'codex-pipeline', 'Sologa/codex-pipeline', 'gh-address-comments', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z', '2026-02-18T06:45:01.636Z', NULL, '{"id":"Sologa/codex-pipeline/gh-address-comments","name":"gh-address-comments","description":{"zh":"本文介绍了 gh-address-comments Skill 的使用方法，用于自动处理 GitHub 评论","ja":"この記事では、GitHub コメントを自動的に処理するために使用する gh-address-comments Skill の使用方法について説明します","ko":"이 문서는 GitHub 댓글을 자동으로 처리하는 데 사용되는 gh-address-comments Skill의 사용 방법을 설명합니다","es":"El manipulador de comentarios de PR con gh es una herramienta para encontrar y responder comentarios de PR abiertos","fr":"Le gestionnaire de commentaires PR avec gh est un outil pour trouver et répondre aux commentaires de PR ouverts","de":"Der PR-Kommentar-Handler mit gh ist ein Tool, um offene PR-Kommentare zu finden und zu beantworten","pt":"O skill gh-address-comments ajuda a gerenciar comentários de PR no GitHub, melhorando a produtividade dos desenvolvedores","ru":"Навык gh-address-comments помогает управлять комментариями PR в GitHub, повышая производительность разработчиков","ar":"المهارة gh-address-comments تساعد في إدارة تعليقات طلب السحب في جيت هاب، وتحسين إنتاجية المطورين","en":"研究 codex 使用 skill 生成 survey 這件事"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"gh-address-comments 技术指南","ja":"gh-address-comments 技術ガイド","ko":"gh-address-comments 기술 가이드","es":"Manipulador de comentarios de PR con gh","fr":"Gestionnaire de commentaires PR avec gh","de":"PR-Kommentar-Handler mit gh","pt":"Gerenciador de Comentários de PR do GitHub","ru":"Управление комментариями PR в GitHub","ar":"مدير تعليقات طلب السحب في جيت هاب","en":"gh-address-comments"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍了 gh-address-comments Skill 的使用方法，用于自动处理 GitHub 评论","ja":"この記事では、GitHub コメントを自動的に処理するために使用する gh-address-comments Skill の使用方法について説明します","ko":"이 문서는 GitHub 댓글을 자동으로 처리하는 데 사용되는 gh-address-comments Skill의 사용 방법을 설명합니다","es":"El manipulador de comentarios de PR con gh es una herramienta para encontrar y responder comentarios de PR abiertos","fr":"Le gestionnaire de commentaires PR avec gh est un outil pour trouver et répondre aux commentaires de PR ouverts","de":"Der PR-Kommentar-Handler mit gh ist ein Tool, um offene PR-Kommentare zu finden und zu beantworten","pt":"O skill gh-address-comments ajuda a gerenciar comentários de PR no GitHub, melhorando a produtividade dos desenvolvedores","ru":"Навык gh-address-comments помогает управлять комментариями PR в GitHub, повышая производительность разработчиков","ar":"المهارة gh-address-comments تساعد في إدارة تعليقات طلب السحب في جيت هاب، وتحسين إنتاجية المطورين","en":"研究 codex 使用 skill 生成 survey 這件事"},"definition":{"en":"研究 codex 使用 skill 生成 survey 這件事"},"features":{"zh":["自动处理 GitHub 评论","使用 gh CLI 运行命令","支持提升网络访问权限","确保 gh 认证和授权","支持沙盒环境"],"ja":["GitHub コメントを自動的に処理","gh CLI を使用してコマンドを実行","ネットワークアクセスを昇格する機能","gh 認証と認可を確実にする","サンドボックス環境をサポート"],"ko":["GitHub 댓글을 자동으로 처리","gh CLI를 사용하여 명령을 실행","네트워크 접근 권한을 상승","gh 인증 및 권한 부여 확인","샌드박스 환경 지원"],"es":["Inspecciona comentarios que necesitan atención","Ejecuta comandos gh con acceso de red elevado","Requiere autenticación gh","Soporta sandboxing con permisos escalados","Permite encontrar PR abiertos para la rama actual"],"fr":["Inspecte les commentaires qui nécessitent une attention","Exécutez des commandes gh avec un accès réseau élevé","Nécessite une authentification gh","Prend en charge le sandboxing avec des autorisations élevées","Permet de trouver les PR ouverts pour la branche actuelle"],"de":["Überprüft Kommentare, die Aufmerksamkeit benötigen","Führt gh-Befehle mit erweitertem Netzwerkzugriff aus","Benötigt gh-Authentifizierung","Unterstützt Sandboxing mit erhöhten Berechtigungen","Ermöglicht das Finden offener PR für den aktuellen Branch"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de comentários de PR","Integração com o GitHub","Aumento da produtividade","Autenticação segura","Suporte a workflows e repositórios"],"ru":["Управление комментариями PR","Интеграция с GitHub","Повышение производительности","Безопасная аутентификация","Поддержка рабочих процессов и репозиториев"],"ar":["إدارة تعليقات طلب السحب","التكامل مع جيت هاب","زيادة الإنتاجية","التحقق الآمن","دعم سير العمل والمستودعات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["gh-address-comments","GitHub 评论","自动处理","gh CLI","网络访问权限","认证和授权"],"ja":["gh-address-comments","GitHub コメント","自動処理","gh CLI","ネットワークアクセス","認証と認可"],"ko":["gh-address-comments","GitHub 댓글","자동 처리","gh CLI","네트워크 접근","인증 및 권한"],"es":["manipulador de comentarios de PR","gh CLI","comandos gh","autenticación gh","sandboxing","permisos escalados","PR abiertos","rama actual"],"fr":["gestionnaire de commentaires PR","gh CLI","commandes gh","authentification gh","sandboxing","autorisations élevées","PR ouverts","branche actuelle"],"de":["PR-Kommentar-Handler","gh CLI","gh-Befehle","gh-Authentifizierung","Sandboxing","erhöhte Berechtigungen","offene PR","aktueller Branch"],"pt":["GitHub","PR","comentários","gerenciamento","produtividade","desenvolvedores","autenticação","workflows","repositórios"],"ru":["GitHub","PR","комментарии","управление","производительность","разработчики","аутентификация","рабочие процессы","репозитории"],"ar":["جيت هاب","طلب السحب","تعليقات","إدارة","إنتاجية","مطورين","التحقق","سير العمل","مستودعات"]}},"owner":"Sologa","repo":"codex-pipeline","repoPath":"Sologa/codex-pipeline","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-address-comments","description":"Help address review/issue comments on the open GitHub PR for the current branch using gh CLI; verify gh auth first and prompt the user to authenticate if not logged in.","bodyPreview":"# PR Comment Handler\n\nGuide to find the open PR for the current branch and address its comments with gh CLI. Run all `gh` commands with elevated network access.\n\nPrereq: ensure `gh` is authenticated (for example, run `gh auth login` once), then run `gh auth status` with escalated permissions (include workflow/repo scopes) so `gh` commands succeed. If sandboxing blocks `gh auth status`, rerun it with `sandbox_permissions=require_escalated`.\n\n## 1) Inspect comments needing attention\n- Run scripts/","body":"# PR Comment Handler\n\nGuide to find the open PR for the current branch and address its comments with gh CLI. Run all `gh` commands with elevated network access.\n\nPrereq: ensure `gh` is authenticated (for example, run `gh auth login` once), then run `gh auth status` with escalated permissions (include workflow/repo scopes) so `gh` commands succeed. If sandboxing blocks `gh auth status`, rerun it with `sandbox_permissions=require_escalated`.\n\n## 1) Inspect comments needing attention\n- Run scripts/fetch_comments.py which will print out all the comments and review threads on the PR\n\n## 2) Ask the user for clarification\n- Number all the review threads and comments and provide a short summary of what would be required to apply a fix for it\n- Ask the user which numbered comments should be addressed\n\n## 3) If user chooses comments\n- Apply fixes for the selected comments\n\nNotes:\n- If gh hits auth/rate issues mid-run, prompt the user to re-authenticate with `gh auth login`, then retry.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:45:01.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub Automation Agents needing to address PR comments with gh CLI","zh":"非常适合需要使用 gh CLI 回复 PR 评论的 GitHub 自动化代理","ja":"GitHub の自動化エージェントが gh CLI で PR コメントに応答する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"gh CLI로 PR 댓글에 응답해야 하는 GitHub 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de GitHub que necesitan abordar comentarios de PR con gh CLI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation GitHub ayant besoin de traiter les commentaires de PR avec gh CLI","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-Automatisierungsagenten, die PR-Kommentare mit gh CLI bearbeiten müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação do GitHub que precisam abordar comentários de PR com gh CLI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов GitHub Automation, которым необходимо обращаться к комментариям PR с помощью gh CLI","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي غيت هب يحتاج إلى معالجة تعليقات.Pull Request باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر gh"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inspect comments needing attention, ensuring seamless interaction with GitHub using gh commands, including elevated network access and workflow/repo scopes for authentication","zh":"赋予代理检查需要关注的评论的能力，确保使用 gh 命令与 GitHub 进行无缝交互，包括提高网络访问和工作流/存储库范围的身份验证","ja":"注目が必要なコメントを検査するエージェントの能力を付与し、gh コマンドを使用して GitHub とシームレスに相互作用することを保証する、ネットワークへのアクセスとワークフロー/リポジトリのスコープの認証を含む","ko":"주의가 필요한 댓글을 검사할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 gh 명령을 사용하여 GitHub와의无缝한 상호 작용을 보장하며, 네트워크 액세스 및 워크플로/리포지토리 범위의 인증을 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inspeccionar comentarios que requieren atención, garantizando una interacción fluida con GitHub mediante comandos gh, incluyendo acceso de red elevado y ámbitos de flujo de trabajo/repo para autenticación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''inspecter les commentaires nécessitant une attention, garantissant une interaction fluide avec GitHub à l''aide de commandes gh, y compris un accès réseau élevé et des étendues de workflow/repo pour l''authentification","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kommentare zu überprüfen, die Aufmerksamkeit erfordern, und stellt so eine nahtlose Interaktion mit GitHub über gh-Befehle sicher, einschließlich erhöhten Netzwerkzugriffs und Workflow/Repo-Bereichen für Authentifizierung","pt":"Concede poder aos agentes para inspecionar comentários que necessitam de atenção, garantindo interação sem problemas com o GitHub usando comandos gh, incluindo acesso de rede elevado e escopos de fluxo de trabalho/repositório para autenticação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять комментарии, требующие внимания, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие с GitHub с помощью команд gh, включая повышенный доступ к сети и области действия рабочих процессов/репозиториев для аутентификации","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فحص التعليقات التي تحتاج إلى الانتباه، مما يضمن التفاعل السلس مع غيت هب باستخدام أوامر gh، بما في ذلك الوصول الشبكي المعزز ونطاقات سير العمل والمستودعات للتحقق"},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting comments needing attention","Automating PR comment handling with gh CLI","Ensuring authenticated access to GitHub repositories"],"zh":["检查需要关注的评论","使用 gh CLI 自动处理 PR 评论","确保对 GitHub 存储库的身份验证访问"],"ja":["注目が必要なコメントの検査","gh CLI を使用した PR コメントの自動化","GitHub リポジトリへの認証アクセスの確保"],"ko":["주의가 필요한 댓글检查","gh CLI를 사용한 PR 댓글 자동 처리","GitHub 리포지토리에 대한 인증된 액세스 보장"],"es":["Inspeccionar comentarios que requieren atención","Automatizar el manejo de comentarios de PR con gh CLI","Garantizar el acceso autenticado a los repositorios de GitHub"],"fr":["Inspecter les commentaires nécessitant une attention","Automatiser la gestion des commentaires de PR avec gh CLI","Assurer un accès authentifié aux référentiels GitHub"],"de":["Kommentare überprüfen, die Aufmerksamkeit erfordern","Automatisieren der PR-Kommentarverwaltung mit gh CLI","Authentifizierten Zugriff auf GitHub-Repositorys sicherstellen"],"pt":["Inspecionar comentários que necessitam de atenção","Automatizar o manuseio de comentários de PR com gh CLI","Garantir acesso autenticado aos repositórios do GitHub"],"ru":["Проверка комментариев, требующих внимания","Автоматизация обработки комментариев PR с помощью gh CLI","Обеспечение аутентифицированного доступа к репозиториям GitHub"],"ar":["فحص التعليقات التي تحتاج إلى الانتباه","آليّة التعامل مع تعليقات.Pull Request باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","ضمان الوصول المُوثق إلى مستودعات غيت هب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh authentication and authorization","Needs escalated permissions for workflow/repo scopes","Dependent on gh CLI installation and configuration"],"zh":["需要 gh 身份验证和授权","需要提高的权限用于工作流/存储库范围","依赖于 gh CLI 的安装和配置"],"ja":["gh の認証と認可が必要","ワークフロー/リポジトリのスコープに対する昇格された権限が必要","gh CLI のインストールと構成に依存"],"ko":["gh 인증 및 인가 필요","워크플로우/리포지토리 범위에 대한昇格된 권한 필요","gh CLI 설치 및 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere autenticación y autorización de gh","Necesita permisos elevados para ámbitos de flujo de trabajo/repo","Dependiente de la instalación y configuración de gh CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification et une autorisation gh","Nécessite des autorisations élevées pour les étendues de workflow/repo","Dépend de l''installation et de la configuration de gh CLI"],"de":["Benötigt gh-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung","Benötigt erhöhte Berechtigungen für Workflow/Repo-Bereiche","Abhängig von der Installation und Konfiguration von gh CLI"],"pt":["Exige autenticação e autorização gh","Necessita de permissões elevadas para escopos de fluxo de trabalho/repositório","Dependente da instalação e configuração do gh CLI"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации и авторизации gh","Требует повышенных разрешений для областей действия рабочих процессов/репозиториев","Зависит от установки и конфигурации gh CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب التحقق والتصريح من خلال gh","يحتاج إلى صلاحيات معززة لمجالات سير العمل والمستودعات","يعتمد على تثبيت وتكوين واجهة سطر الأوامر gh"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('michaelwsd/ecommerce-demo/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'michaelwsd', 'ecommerce-demo', 'michaelwsd/ecommerce-demo', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z', '2026-02-18T06:44:55.183Z', NULL, '{"id":"michaelwsd/ecommerce-demo/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max 是一个全面的设计指南，包含 50+ 样式、97 色板、57 字体组合等，帮助开发者创建优质的用户体验","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max は、包括的なデザインガイドです。50 種類以上のスタイル、97 種類の色板、57 種類のフォント組み合わせなどを含み、開発者が高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンスを作成するのを支援します","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 포괄적인 디자인 가이드로, 50종 이상의 스타일, 97종의 색상 팔레트, 57종의 폰트 조합 등을 포함하여 개발자가 고품질의 사용자 경험을 만들 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles, con recursos para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles, avec des ressources pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen, mit Ressourcen zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, contendo estilos, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e diretrizes de UX","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб и мобильных приложений, содержащее стили, цветовые палитры, комбинации шрифтов и рекомендации по UX","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو دليل التصميم الشامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، ويحتوي على أنماط وصفيفات ألوان وتركيبات خطوط وتوجيهات تجربة المستخدم","en":"simple ecommerce site demo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max 设计指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max デザインガイド","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max 디자인 가이드","es":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guía de diseño para aplicaciones web y móv...","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guide de conception pour applications web ...","de":"UI/UX Pro Max: Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwend...","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guia de Design para Aplicativos Web e Móveis","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max: Комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max: دليل التصميم الذكي للويب والتطبيقات المحمولة","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max 是一个全面的设计指南，包含 50+ 样式、97 色板、57 字体组合等，帮助开发者创建优质的用户体验","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max は、包括的なデザインガイドです。50 種類以上のスタイル、97 種類の色板、57 種類のフォント組み合わせなどを含み、開発者が高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンスを作成するのを支援します","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 포괄적인 디자인 가이드로, 50종 이상의 스타일, 97종의 색상 팔레트, 57종의 폰트 조합 등을 포함하여 개발자가 고품질의 사용자 경험을 만들 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles, con recursos para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles, avec des ressources pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen, mit Ressourcen zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, contendo estilos, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e diretrizes de UX","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб и мобильных приложений, содержащее стили, цветовые палитры, комбинации шрифтов и рекомендации ...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو دليل التصميم الشامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، ويحتوي على أنماط وصفيفات ألوان وتركيبات خطوط وتوجيهات تجربة المستخدم","en":"simple ecommerce site demo"},"definition":{"en":"simple ecommerce site demo"},"features":{"zh":["50+ 样式","97 色板","57 字体组合","99 UX 指南","25 种图表类型"],"ja":["50 種類以上のスタイル","97 種類の色板","57 種類のフォント組み合わせ","99 の UX ガイドライン","25 種類のチャートタイプ"],"ko":["50종 이상의 스타일","97종의 색상 팔레트","57종의 폰트 조합","99개의 UX 가이드라인","25종의 차트 타입"],"es":["50+ estilos de diseño","97 paletas de colores","57 combinaciones de fuentes","99 directrices de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"fr":["50+ styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs","57 combinaisons de polices","99 lignes directrices d''UX","25 types de graphiques"],"de":["50+ Designstile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","25 Chart-Typen"],"pt":["50+ estilos de design","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей дизайна","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 рекомендаций по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ نمط تصميم","97 صفيفة ألوان","57 تركيبة خطوط","99 توجيهات تجربة المستخدم","25 نوع من الرسومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX 设计","网页设计","移动应用设计","用户体验","设计指南","前端开发"],"ja":["UI/UX デザイン","Web デザイン","モバイルアプリケーションデザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","デザインガイド","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["UI/UX 디자인","웹 디자인","모바일 애플리케이션 디자인","사용자 경험","디자인 가이드","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño ui/ux","guía de diseño","experiencia del usuario","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","combinaciones de fuentes"],"fr":["conception ui/ux","guide de conception","expérience utilisateur","applications web","applications mobiles","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","combinaisons de polices"],"de":["design ui/ux","designleitfaden","benutzererfahrung","web-anwendungen","mobile-anwendungen","designstile","farbpaletten","schriftkombinationen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento móvel","interface de usuário","experiência do usuário","guias de design"],"ru":["ui/ux дизайн","веб-разработка","мобильная разработка","интерфейс пользователя","опыт пользователя","руководства по дизайну"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","تطوير الجوال","واجهة المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","دلائل التصميم"]}},"owner":"michaelwsd","repo":"ecommerce-demo","repoPath":"michaelwsd/ecommerce-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:44:55.183Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidance and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX设计指导和网页及移动应用程序设计建议的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが包括的なUI/UX設計ガイダンスとWebおよびモバイルアプリケーションの設計提案が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"전면 에이전트가 포괄적인 UI/UX 디자인 가이드와 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션에 대한 디자인 제안이 필요한 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan orientación y recomendaciones de diseño de UI/UX integrales para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une orientation et de recommandations de conception UI/UX complètes pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Design-Anleitungen und Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidance and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidance and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidance and recommendations for web and mobile applications."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines across 9 technology stacks, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations for efficient design decision-making.","zh":"通过利用50+样式、97种颜色调色板和57种字体配对，同时确保遵守9个技术栈中的99个UX指南，并使用带有优先级推荐的可搜索数据库，赋予代理创建视觉上吸引人和用户友好的界面的能力，从而实现高效的设计决策。","ja":"50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペアを活用し、9つのテクノロジースタックの中の99のUXガイドラインに従うことを保証し、優先順位に基づいた推奨機能を備えた検索可能なデータベースを使用することで、エージェントが視覚的に魅力的でユーザーフレンドリーなインターフェースを作成する能力を付与し、効率的な設計の意思決定を実現します。","ko":"50개 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트 및 57개의 폰트 페어를 활용하여 9개의 기술 스택 중 99개의 UX 가이드ライン을 준수하도록 보장하고, 우선 순위 기반의 추천 기능을 갖춘 검색 가능한 데이터베이스를 사용하여 에이전트가 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 효율적인 디자인 의사 결정을实现합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear interfaces visualmente atractivas y fáciles de usar aprovechando más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, al tiempo que garantiza el cumplimiento de 99 pautas de UX en 9 pilas tecnológicas, utilizando bases de datos buscables con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades para una toma de decisiones de diseño eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes et conviviales en exploitant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en garantissant le respect de 99 directives d''UX sur 9 piles technologiques, en utilisant des bases de données consultables avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités pour une prise de décision de conception efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie mehr als 50 Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen nutzen und gleichzeitig die Einhaltung von 99 UX-Richtlinien in 9 Technologie-Stacks sicherstellen, wobei sie durchsuchbare Datenbanken mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen für effizientes Design-Entscheidungsfinden verwenden.","pt":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines across 9 technology stacks, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations for efficient design decision-making.","ru":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines across 9 technology stacks, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations for efficient design decision-making.","ar":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines across 9 technology stacks, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations for efficient design decision-making."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color schemes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing fixes based on provided guidelines","Building landing pages or dashboards that incorporate best practices for user experience"],"zh":["使用优化的颜色方案和字体设计新的UI组件或页面","根据提供的指南审查代码以查找UX问题并实施修复","构建集成了用户体验最佳实践的登陆页面或仪表板"],"ja":["最適化された色彩スキームとタイポグラフィーを使用して新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","提供されたガイドラインに従ってコードをレビューしてUXの問題を特定し、修正を実施する","ユーザー体験のベストプラクティスを統合したランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["최적화된 색상 구성표 및 타이포그래피를 사용하여 새로운 UI 구성 요소 또는 페이지를 설계합니다.","제공된 가이드라인에 따라 코드를 검토하여 UX 문제를 찾고 수정을 구현합니다.","사용자 경험의 모범 사례를 통합한 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축합니다."],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con esquemas de color y tipografía optimizados","Revisar el código para problemas de UX e implementar soluciones en función de las pautas proporcionadas","Crear páginas de destino o paneles de control que incorporen las mejores prácticas para la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec des schémas de couleur et de typographie optimisés","Examiner le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre des co