enn es sicher ist","Aktualisierung des Vertrauens in die Befehle"],"pt":["Identificação de comandos executáveis","Registro de comandos com confiança","Verificação de comandos destrutivos","Atualização de confiança","Suporte a Makefile, package manifests e CI configs"],"ru":["Определение выполняемых команд","Запись команд с уверенностью","Проверка разрушительных команд","Обновление уверенности","Поддержка Makefile, package manifests и CI configs"],"ar":["تحديد الأوامر القابلة للتشغيل","تسجيل الأوامر بثقة","فحص الأوامر التدميرية","تحديث الثقة","دعم Makefile و package manifests و CI configs"]},"keywords":{"zh":["detect_commands","可运行命令","Makefile","包清单","CI配置","命令识别","工作效率","开发工具"],"ja":["detect_commands","実行可能なコマンド","Makefile","パッケージマニフェスト","CI構成","コマンド識別","作業効率","開発ツール"],"ko":["detect_commands","실행 가능한 명령어","Makefile","패키지 매니페스트","CI 구성","명령어 식별","작업 효율","개발 도구"],"es":["detect_commands","AERA","investigación cuantitativa","comandos ejecutables","Makefile","CI","COMMANDS.md","COMMANDS.json"],"fr":["detect_commands","AERA","recherche quantitative","commandes exécutables","Makefile","CI","COMMANDS.md","COMMANDS.json"],"de":["detect_commands","AERA","quantitative Forschung","ausführbare Befehle","Makefile","CI","COMMANDS.md","COMMANDS.json"],"pt":["detecção de comandos","comandos executáveis","AERA","desenvolvimento de software","teste de software","lint de código","formatação de código","construção de software"],"ru":["обнаружение команд","выполняемые команды","AERA","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","lint кода","форматирование кода","сборка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اكتشاف الأوامر","أوامر قابلة للتشغيل","AERA","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات","lint الشفرة","تنسيق الشفرة","بناء البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"CheekyCodexConjurer","repo":"quant-lab","repoPath":"CheekyCodexConjurer/quant-lab","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.450Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"detect_commands","description":"Infer and verify install/test/lint/build commands for the repo.","bodyPreview":"## Purpose\nIdentify runnable commands and record them with confidence.\n\n## Steps\n1. Search for Makefile, package manifests, CI configs.\n2. Propose install/test/lint/format/build commands.\n3. Record in `COMMANDS.md` and `COMMANDS.json`.\n4. Verify when safe, and update confidence.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Mark unverified commands with low confidence.\n- Do not execute destructive commands.","body":"## Purpose\nIdentify runnable commands and record them with confidence.\n\n## Steps\n1. Search for Makefile, package manifests, CI configs.\n2. Propose install/test/lint/format/build commands.\n3. Record in `COMMANDS.md` and `COMMANDS.json`.\n4. Verify when safe, and update confidence.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Mark unverified commands with low confidence.\n- Do not execute destructive commands.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:46:10.204Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","zh":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","ja":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","ko":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","es":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","fr":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","de":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","pt":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","ru":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows.","ar":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated command detection and recording for quantitative research and backtesting workflows."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify and propose runnable commands, including install, test, lint, format, and build commands, while ensuring safety through confidence tracking and verification, utilizing files like Makefile, package manifests, and CI configs, and outputting to formats like `COMMANDS.md` and `COMMANDS.json`.","zh":"Empowers agents to identify and propose runnable commands, including install, test, lint, format, and build commands, while ensuring safety through confidence tracking and verification, utilizing files like Makefile, package manifests, and CI configs, and outputting to formats like `COMMANDS.md` and `COMMANDS.json`.","ja":"Empowers agents to identify and propose runnable commands, including install, test, lint, format, and build commands, while ensuring safety through confidence tracking and verification, utilizing files like Makefile, package manifests, and CI configs, and outputting to formats like `COMMANDS.md` and `COMMANDS.json`.","ko":"Empowers agents to identify and propose runnable commands, including install, test, lint, format, and build commands, while ensuring safety through confidence tracking and verification, utilizing files like Makefile, package manifests, and CI configs, and outputting to formats like `COMMANDS.md` and `COMMANDS.json`.","es":"Empowers agents to identify and propose runnable commands, including install, test, lint, format, and build commands, while ensuring safety through confidence tracking and verification, utilizing files like Makefile, package manifests, and CI configs, and outputting to formats like `COMMANDS.md` and `CO