tos. Aprende a hacerlo de manera efectiva con nuestro enfoque","fr":"L''analyse de besoins est essentielle pour la réussite des projets. Apprenez à le faire de manière efficace avec notre approche","de":"Die Anforderungsanalyse ist entscheidend für den Erfolg von Projekten. Lernen Sie, wie Sie es effektiv tun mit unserem Ansatz","pt":"Análise de requisitos é um processo fundamental para garantir a entrega de projetos de alta qualidade","ru":"Анализ требований является основным процессом для обеспечения доставки проектов высокого качества","ar":"تحليل المتطلبات هو عملية أساسية لضمان تسليم مشاريع ذات جودة عالية","en":"Listen to YouTube. Anywhere."},"definition":{"en":"Listen to YouTube. Anywhere."},"features":{"zh":["需求重述","需求类型识别","预期用户价值定义","业务价值定义","依赖关系确认"],"ja":["要件の再述","要件タイプの識別","期待されるユーザー価値の定義","ビジネス価値の定義","依存関係の確認"],"ko":["요구 사항 재술","요구 사항 유형 식별","期待 사용자 가치 정의","비즈니스 가치 정의","의존 관계 확인"],"es":["Restablece los requisitos en un párrafo corto","Identifica el tipo de requisito","Define el valor esperado para el usuario y el negocio","Lee la documentación del proyecto y el código antes de llegar a conclusiones","Utiliza MCP/Context7 para confirmar dependencias o restricciones de API"],"fr":["Réénonce les besoins en un paragraphe court","Identifie le type de besoin","Définissez la valeur attendue pour l''utilisateur et l''entreprise","Lisez la documentation du projet et le code avant de tirer des conclusions","Utilisez MCP/Context7 pour confirmer les dépendances ou les contraintes d''API"],"de":["Formulieren Sie die Anforderungen in einem kurzen Absatz","Identifizieren Sie den Anforderungstyp","Definieren Sie den erwarteten Nutzen für den Benutzer und das Unternehmen","Lesen Sie die Projektunterlagen und den Code, bevor Sie Schlussfolgerungen ziehen","Verwenden Sie MCP/Context7, um Abhängigkeiten oder API-Beschränkungen zu bestätigen"],"pt":["Definição de valor para usuários e negócios","Análise de requisitos contra metas e arquitetura","Identificação de tipo de requisito","Leitura de documentação de projeto e código","Uso de ferramentas para confirmar dependências"],"ru":["Определение ценности для пользователей и бизнеса","Анализ требований против целей и архитектуры","Идентификация типа требования","Чтение документации проекта и кода","Использование инструментов для подтверждения зависимостей"],"ar":["تحديد القيمة للمستخدمين والاعمال","تحليل المتطلبات مقابل الأهداف والهيكل","تحديد نوع المتطلب","قراءة وثائق المشروع والكود","استخدام الأدوات لتأكيد الارتباطات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["需求分析","项目管理","软件开发","需求类型","用户价值","业务价值"],"ja":["要件分析","プロジェクト管理","ソフトウェア開発","要件タイプ","ユーザー価値","ビジネス価値"],"ko":["요구 사항 분석","프로젝트 관리","소프트웨어 개발","요구 사항 유형","사용자 가치","비즈니스 가치"],"es":["análisis de requisitos","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos","requisitos de proyecto","análisis de necesidades","mejora de la calidad"],"fr":["analyse de besoins","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets","besoins de projet","analyse de nécessités","amélioration de la qualité"],"de":["Anforderungsanalyse","Softwareentwicklung","Projektmanagement","Projektanforderungen","Bedarfsanalyse","Qualitätsverbesserung"],"pt":["análise de requisitos","desenvolvimento de software","projeto de sistema","requisitos de negócio","arquitetura de sistema","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["анализ требований","разработка программного обеспечения","проект системы","бизнес-требования","архитектура системы","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تحليل المتطلبات","تطوير البرمجيات","مشروع النظام","متطلبات العمل","هيكل النظام","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"aizhimou","repo":"pigeon-pod","repoPath":"aizhimou/pigeon-pod","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"requirements-analysis","description":"Analyze product/feature requirements for the PigeonPod project with software engineering rigor. Use when users ask to evaluate a requirements value, feasibility, architecture fit, implementation impact, risk, delivery scope, or tradeoffs. Always inspect current repository docs/code first (especially architecture and README files), then use MCP tools (including Context7) to verify external library/framework/API constraints before concluding.","bodyPreview":"# Requirements Analysis\n\nAnalyze requirements against PigeonPod goals, current architecture, and implementation reality.\n\n## Follow This Workflow\n\n1. Restate the requirement in one short paragraph.\n2. Identify requirement type: `feature`, `enhancement`, `bugfix`, `non-functional`, `integration`, or `migration`.\n3. Define expected user value and business value.\n4. Read relevant project docs and code before giving conclusions.\n5. Use MCP/Context7 to confirm dependency or API constraints when exter","body":"# Requirements Analysis\n\nAnalyze requirements against PigeonPod goals, current architecture, and implementation reality.\n\n## Follow This Workflow\n\n1. Restate the requirement in one short paragraph.\n2. Identify requirement type: `feature`, `enhancement`, `bugfix`, `non-functional`, `integration`, or `migration`.\n3. Define expected user value and business value.\n4. Read relevant project docs and code before giving conclusions.\n5. Use MCP/Context7 to confirm dependency or API constraints when external libraries/services are involved.\n6. Evaluate architecture fit, implementation complexity, data impact, and operational impact.\n7. Propose an implementation strategy with phased scope (`MVP`, `next`, `later`).\n8. Output a decision with explicit rationale and open questions.\n\n## Read Local Context First\n\nPrioritize these files for PigeonPod:\n\n- `README.md`\n- `dev-docs/architecture/architecture-design-en.md`\n- `backend/src/main/resources/application.yml`\n- `backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/*.sql`\n- Relevant backend packages under `backend/src/main/java/top/asimov/pigeon/`\n- Relevant frontend routes/components under `frontend/src/pages/` and `frontend/src/components/`\n\nUse fast discovery commands when needed:\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"keyword|concept|module\" backend/src/main/java frontend/src dev-docs README.md\nrg --files dev-docs/\n```\n\n## Use Context7 and MCP Deliberately\n\nUse Context7/MCP when the requirement depends on framework/library/service behavior, version constraints, configuration, or integration details.\n\nTypical triggers:\n\n- Spring Boot/MyBatis-Plus/Sa-Token behavior or config decisions\n- React/Mantine/React Router/i18next/Axios constraints\n- YouTube Data API v3 limits/quotas/contract details\n- RSS/Podcasting namespace compatibility details\n- yt-dlp options/behavior and compatibility implications\n\nRules:\n\n- Resolve library ID first, then query focused questions.\n- Prefer primary/official docs and version-aware guidance.\n- Distinguish facts from inference.\n- If docs conflict with local implementation, prioritize local code reality and call out the gap.\n\n## Evaluate With These Dimensions\n\nAssess each dimension explicitly:\n\n1. Value Alignment: Match with PigeonPod core goals (YouTube-to-podcast conversion, auto-sync/download, feed usability, operations simplicity).\n2. Feasibility: Confirm technical possibility with current stack and constraints.\n3. Architecture Fit: Check compatibility with backend service boundaries, scheduler/event flow, DB schema, and frontend route/state model.\n4. Data and Migration Impact: Identify new fields/tables, migration requirements, backfill, and backward compatibility.\n5. API and Contract Impact: Identify REST/RSS contract changes and consumer compatibility risks.\n6. Security and Compliance: Review auth, permissions, secrets/API keys, abuse vectors.\n7. Performance and Cost: Estimate queue pressure, I/O/download load, external API quota consumption, and storage growth.\n8. Testability and Operability: Define unit/integration/e2e coverage and monitoring/logging needs.\n\n## Produce This Output Format\n\nUse this structure in final analysis:\n\n```markdown\n## Requirement Summary\n- User request:\n- Requirement type:\n- Assumptions:\n\n## Value Assessment\n- User value:\n- Product/business value:\n- Priority suggestion: High/Medium/Low\n\n## Feasibility and Architecture Fit\n- Current touchpoints:\n- Proposed changes:\n- Architecture fit verdict: Good/Partial/Poor\n\n## Impact Analysis\n- Backend impact:\n- Frontend impact:\n- Database/migration impact:\n- External dependency impact:\n- Security/performance/ops impact:\n\n## Delivery Plan\n- MVP scope:\n- Non-MVP scope:\n- Estimated complexity: S/M/L/XL\n- Key risks and mitigations:\n\n## Decision\n- Recommendation: Proceed / Proceed with constraints / Defer / Reject\n- Reasoning:\n- Open questions:\n```\n\n## Decision Heuristics\n\n- Recommend `Proceed` when value is clear, fit is good, and risk is manageable.\n- Recommend `Proceed with constraints` when value is high but scope/risk needs staged delivery.\n- Recommend `Defer` when value exists but prerequisites are missing.\n- Recommend `Reject` when requirement conflicts with core goals or creates disproportional cost/risk.\n\n## Quality Bar\n\nBefore finalizing, verify all checks:\n\n- Base conclusions on repository evidence, not assumptions only.\n- Confirm external-library/API claims through Context7/MCP when relevant.\n- Separate facts, assumptions, and unknowns.\n- Include at least one feasible implementation path.\n- Include explicit tradeoffs and rollback/fallback considerations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:47:18.748Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Agents needing structured requirements analysis against project goals and architecture.","zh":"非常适合需要对项目目标和架构进行结构化需求分析的技术代理。","ja":"プロジェクトの目標とアーキテクチャに対する構造化された要件分析が必要なテクニカルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 목표와 아키텍처에 대한 구조화된 요구 사항 분석이 필요한 기술 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Técnicos que necesitan un análisis de requisitos estructurados contra los objetivos y la arquitectura del proyecto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents techniques ayant besoin d''une analyse de besoins structurée par rapport aux objectifs et à l''architecture du projet.","de":"Perfekt für technische Agenten, die eine strukturierte Anforderungsanalyse gegenüber den Projekzielen und der Architektur benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Técnicos que necessitam de análise de requisitos estruturados contra metas e arquitetura do projeto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов, которым требуется структурированный анализ требований в отношении целей и архитектуры проекта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تقني يحتاج إلى تحليل متطلبات منظم مقابل أهداف ومعمارية المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to categorize requirements into types such as feature, enhancement, bugfix, non-functional, integration, or migration, and evaluate them based on expected user and business value, utilizing project documentation and APIs like MCP/Context7 for dependency confirmation.","zh":"赋予代理将需求分类为功能、增强、bug修复、非功能、集成或迁移等类型，并根据预期的用户和商业价值进行评估，利用项目文档和MCP/Context7等API进行依赖关系确认。","ja":"エージェントが要件を機能、強化、バグ修正、非機能、統合、または移行などのタイプに分類し、プロジェクトのドキュメントとMCP/Context7などのAPIを使用して依存関係を確認することで、予想されるユーザーとビジネス価値に基づいてそれらを評価することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 요구 사항을 기능, 개선, 버그 수정, 비기능, 통합 또는 마이그레이션과 같은 유형으로 분류하여 dự期 사용자 및 비즈니스 가치에 따라 평가할 수 있도록 하며, 프로젝트 문서 및 MCP/Context7과 같은 API를 사용하여 종속성 확인을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a categorizar los requisitos en tipos como característica, mejora, corrección de errores, no funcional, integración o migración, y evaluarlos en función del valor esperado por el usuario y el negocio, utilizando la documentación del proyecto y las API como MCP/Context7 para la confirmación de dependencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents de catégoriser les besoins en types tels que fonctionnalité, amélioration, correction de bogue, non fonctionnel, intégration ou migration, et de les évaluer en fonction de la valeur attendue par l''utilisateur et l''entreprise, en utilisant la documentation du projet et les API comme MCP/Context7 pour la confirmation des dépendances.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Anforderungen in Arten wie Funktion, Verbesserung, Fehlerbehebung, nicht-funktionale, Integration oder Migration einzuteilen und diese anhand des erwarteten Nutzwerts für den Benutzer und das Geschäft zu bewerten, unter Verwendung der Projektdokumentation und APIs wie MCP/Context7 für die Abhängigkeitsbestätigung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a categorizar requisitos em tipos como recurso, melhoria, correção de bug, não funcional, integração ou migração, e avaliá-los com base no valor esperado do usuário e do negócio, utilizando documentação do projeto e APIs como MCP/Context7 para confirmação de dependência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью категоризировать требования по типу, такому как функция, улучшение, исправление бага, нефункциональное, интеграция или миграция, и оценивать их на основе ожидаемой ценности для пользователя и бизнеса, используя документацию проекта и API, такие как MCP/Context7, для подтверждения зависимостей.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من تصنيف المتطلبات إلى أنواع مثل ميزة وتحسين وتصحيح عيب ووظيفة غير وظيفية وتكامل أو هجرة، وتقييمها بناءً على القيمة المتوقعة للمستخدم والأعمال، باستخدام توثيق المشروع وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات مثل MCP/Context7 للتأكد من الارتباطات."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing requirements against current project architecture","Categorizing and prioritizing requirements based on user and business value","Validating requirement feasibility using MCP/Context7 for dependency checks"],"zh":["分析需求与当前项目架构的兼容性","根据用户和商业价值对需求进行分类和优先级排序","使用MCP/Context7进行依赖关系检查以验证需求的可行性"],"ja":["現在のプロジェクトアーキテクチャに対する要件分析","ユーザーとビジネス価値に基づいて要件を分類して優先順位を付ける","MCP/Context7を使用して依存関係を確認して要件の実現可能性を検証する"],"ko":["현재 프로젝트 아키텍처에 대한 요구 사항 분석","사용자 및 비즈니스 가치에 따라 요구 사항을 분류하고 우선 순위를 지정","MCP/Context7을 사용하여 종속성 확인을 통해 요구 사항의 실현 가능성을 검증"],"es":["Analizar los requisitos frente a la arquitectura actual del proyecto","Clasificar y priorizar los requisitos en función del valor para el usuario y el negocio","Validar la viabilidad de los requisitos utilizando MCP/Context7 para comprobaciones de dependencias"],"fr":["Analyser les besoins par rapport à l''architecture actuelle du projet","Classer et prioriser les besoins en fonction de la valeur pour l''utilisateur et l''entreprise","Valider la faisabilité des besoins en utilisant MCP/Context7 pour les vérifications de dépendances"],"de":["Anforderungen gegen die aktuelle Projekarchitektur analysieren","Anforderungen nach Benutzer- und Geschäftswert kategorisieren und priorisieren","Die Machbarkeit von Anforderungen unter Verwendung von MCP/Context7 für Abhängigkeitsprüfungen validieren"],"pt":["Analisar requisitos contra a arquitetura atual do projeto","Categorizar e priorizar requisitos com base no valor do usuário e do negócio","Validar a viabilidade dos requisitos usando MCP/Context7 para verificações de dependência"],"ru":["Анализ требований относительно текущей архитектуры проекта","Категоризация и определение приоритета требований на основе ценности для пользователя и бизнеса","Проверка осуществимости требований с использованием MCP/Context7 для проверки зависимостей"],"ar":["تحليل المتطلبات مقابل هيكل المشروع الحالي","تصنيف وتحديد أولويات المتطلبات بناءً على قيمة المستخدم والأعمال","التحقق من قابليّة المتطلبات باستخدام MCP/Context7 للتحقق من الارتباطات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation and codebase","Dependent on MCP/Context7 for API constraints and dependency checks"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档和代码库","依赖于MCP/Context7进行API约束和依赖关系检查"],"ja":["プロジェクトのドキュメントとコードベースへのアクセスが必要","MCP/Context7に依存してAPI制約と依存関係の確認を行う"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서 및 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","MCP/Context7에 종속되어 API 제약 및 종속성 확인을 수행"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación y al código base del proyecto","Depende de MCP/Context7 para las restricciones de API y las comprobaciones de dependencias"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation et au code base du projet","Dépend de MCP/Context7 pour les contraintes d''API et les vérifications de dépendances"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdokumentation und den Codebase","Hängt von MCP/Context7 für API-Einschränkungen und Abhängigkeitsprüfungen ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do projeto e ao código-fonte","Dependente de MCP/Context7 para restrições de API e verificações de dependência"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта и кодовой базе","Зависит от MCP/Context7 для ограничений API и проверки зависимостей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق المشروع وقاعدة الشفرة","يعتمد على MCP/Context7 للقيود وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات والتحقق من الارتباطات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
