por impacto","Melhorias de desempenho para aplicações React e Next.js"],"ru":["57 правил в 8 категориях","Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода","Приоритизация правил по воздействию","Улучшения производительности для приложений React и Next.js"],"ar":["57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت و نيكست.جس","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التطبيقات وتوليد الكود","تحديد الأولويات للقواعد حسب التأثير","تحسينات الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت و نيكست.جس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","性能优化","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成","应用性能","速度优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","パフォーマンス最適化","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","アプリのパフォーマンス","速度最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React","성능 최적화","React 최적화 가이드","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","애플리케이션 성능","속도 최적화"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","refactorización automática","carga de datos","rendimiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","refactorisation automatisée","chargement de données","performances des applications"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","automatisierte Refaktorierung","Datenladung","Leistung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Performance optimization","React best practices"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики React"],"ar":["فيرسيل ري액ت","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","ري액ت","نيكست.جس","تطوير الويب","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات لري액ت"]}},"owner":"SHUAXINDIARY","repo":"Arknights","repoPath":"SHUAXINDIARY/Arknights","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:47:30.787Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 和 Next.js 性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js の高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 리액트와 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte React- und Next.js-Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide for better client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 和 Next.js 应用，使用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别，根据影响进行优先排序，并利用 Vercel 的全面性能优化指南实现更好的客户端和服务器端数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"React と Next.js アプリケーションを対象に、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用し、インパクトに基づいて優先順位を付けて、Vercel の包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを活用して、更に優れたクライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得とバンドル最適化を実現する自動リファクタリングとコード生成の機能をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"리액트와 Next.js 애플리케이션을 위한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성 기능을 에이전트에 제공하여 57개의 규칙을 8개 카테고리에서 사용하고 影響에 따라 우선순위를 정하며 Vercel의 포괄적인 성능 최적화 가이드를 활용하여 더 나은 클라이언트 사이드 및 서버 사이드 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía integral de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel para una mejor recuperación y optimización de datos del lado del cliente y del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide complet d''optimisation des performances de Vercel pour une meilleure récupération et optimisation des données côté client et serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem sie 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwenden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind, und die umfassende Leistungsoptimierungsanleitung von Vercel für eine bessere Client- und Server-seitige Datenerfassung und Bündeloptimierung nutzen.","pt":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide for better client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization.","ru":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide for better client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization.","ar":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide for better client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with improved data fetching strategies","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"],"zh":["自动化 React 组件的代码审查以发现性能问题","生成优化的 Next.js 页面并改进数据获取策略","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能和可维护性"],"ja":["React コンポーネントのコードレビューを自動化してパフォーマンスの問題を発見する","最適化された Next.js ページを生成し、データ取得戦略を改善する","既存の React と Next.js コードをリファクタリングして、パフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화하여 성능 문제를 발견하는 것","최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성하고 데이터 가져오기 전략을 개선하는 것","既存의 리액트와 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하여 성능과 유지보수성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en componentes de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con estrategias de recuperación de datos mejoradas","Reestructurar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento y mantenimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec des stratégies d''extraction de données améliorées","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances et une meilleure maintenance"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Komponenten","Erzeugen von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit verbesserten Datenabrufstrategien","Neustrukturieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with improved data fetching strategies","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"],"ru":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with improved data fetching strategies","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"],"ar":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with improved data fetching strategies","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to React and Next.js applications","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines and rules for optimization"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js","仅限于 React 和 Next.js 应用","依赖于 Vercel 的指南和规则进行优化"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","React と Next.js アプリケーションに限定される","最適化のために Vercel のガイドとルールに依存する"],"ko":["리액트와 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요함","리액트와 Next.js 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","최적화를 위해 Vercel의 가이드와 규칙에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones de React y Next.js","Dependiente de las directrices y reglas de Vercel para la optimización"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications React et Next.js","Dépendant des directives et des règles de Vercel pour l''optimisation"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","Abhängig von den Richtlinien und Regeln von Vercel für die Optimierung"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to React and Next.js applications","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines and rules for optimization"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to React and Next.js applications","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines and rules for optimization"],"ar":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to React and Next.js applications","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines and rules for optimization"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
