ormes de documentation JSDoc pour les fonctions","Normes de documentation JSDoc pour les classes et les modules","Normes de documentation JSDoc pour les types et les composants web","Configuration de ESLint pour garantir la qualité du code","Modèles de documentation pour tous les éléments de code"],"de":["JSDoc-Dokumentationsstandards für Funktionen","JSDoc-Dokumentationsstandards für Klassen und Module","JSDoc-Dokumentationsstandards für Typen und Webkomponenten","ESLint-Konfiguration für die Sicherstellung der Codequalität","Dokumentationsmuster für alle Codeelemente"],"pt":["Padrões de sintaxe JSDoc","Tags e atributos necessários","Configuração do ESLint","Padrões de documentação para funções, classes e módulos","Exemplos de documentação para tipos e componentes web"],"ru":["Стандарты синтаксиса JSDoc","Теги и атрибуты, необходимые для документации","Настройка ESLint","Стандарты документации для функций, классов и модулей","Примеры документации для типов и веб-компонентов"],"ar":["معايير صياغة JSDoc","العلامات والسمات المطلوبة","إعداد ESLint","معايير توثيق الدوال والفئات والوحدات","أمثلة توثيق للنماذج ومكونات الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CUI-JSDoc","JSDoc 文档标准","JavaScript 文档","CUI JavaScript 项目","函数文档","类文档","模块文档"],"ja":["CUI-JSDoc","JSDoc ドキュメント標準","JavaScript ドキュメント","CUI JavaScript プロジェクト","関数ドキュメント","クラスドキュメント","モジュールドキュメント"],"ko":["CUI-JSDoc","JSDoc 문서 표준","JavaScript 문서","CUI JavaScript 프로젝트","함수 문서","클래스 문서","모듈 문서"],"es":["JSDoc","documentación JavaScript","estándares de documentación","CUI JavaScript","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","ESLint","patrones de documentación"],"fr":["JSDoc","documentation JavaScript","normes de documentation","CUI JavaScript","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","ESLint","modèles de documentation"],"de":["JSDoc","JavaScript-Dokumentation","Dokumentationsstandards","CUI-JavaScript","Softwareentwicklung","Codequalität","ESLint","Dokumentationsmuster"],"pt":["JSDoc","documentação JavaScript","padrões de documentação","CUI JavaScript","desenvolvimento de software","ESLint","sintaxe JSDoc","tags JSDoc","documentação de código"],"ru":["JSDoc","документация JavaScript","стандарты документации","CUI JavaScript","разработка программного обеспечения","ESLint","синтаксис JSDoc","теги JSDoc","документирование кода"],"ar":["JSDoc","توثيق جافاسكريبت","معايير توثيق","CUI جافاسكريبت","تطوير البرمجيات","ESLint","صياغة JSDoc","علامات JSDoc","توثيق الشفرة"]}},"owner":"JongminChung","repo":"engineering","repoPath":"JongminChung/engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cui-jsdoc","description":"JSDoc documentation standards for JavaScript functions, classes, modules, and web components","bodyPreview":"# JSDoc Documentation Standards\n\n**REFERENCE MODE**: This skill provides reference material. Load specific standards on-demand based on current task.\n\n## Overview\n\nProvides JSDoc documentation standards for CUI JavaScript projects covering functions, classes, modules, types, and web components.\n\n## Standards Documents\n\n- **jsdoc-essentials.md** - Core JSDoc syntax, required tags, ESLint setup, writing style\n- **jsdoc-patterns.md** - Documentation patterns for all code element types with examples","body":"# JSDoc Documentation Standards\n\n**REFERENCE MODE**: This skill provides reference material. Load specific standards on-demand based on current task.\n\n## Overview\n\nProvides JSDoc documentation standards for CUI JavaScript projects covering functions, classes, modules, types, and web components.\n\n## Standards Documents\n\n- **jsdoc-essentials.md** - Core JSDoc syntax, required tags, ESLint setup, writing style\n- **jsdoc-patterns.md** - Documentation patterns for all code element types with examples\n\n## What This Skill Provides\n\n### JSDoc Essentials\n\n- ESLint plugin configuration and rules\n- Documentation requirements (mandatory vs optional)\n- Required and optional tags (@param, @returns, @throws, @example, @since, @see, @deprecated)\n- Type annotations (basic types, unions, custom types)\n- Writing style guidelines (present tense, active voice, clear language)\n- Build integration (npm scripts, jsdoc.conf.json)\n- Validation and common mistakes\n\n### Documentation Patterns\n\n- **Functions**: Simple, async, complex with nested parameters\n- **Classes**: Declaration, constructor, methods, inheritance\n- **Modules**: File overview, exports, constants\n- **Types**: Custom types (@typedef), callbacks, union/literal types\n- **Web Components**: Lit components, properties, events, CSS properties\n- **Quality Examples**: Good vs bad documentation patterns\n\n## When to Activate\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Documenting JavaScript code (functions, classes, modules)\n- Building web components (Lit or vanilla custom elements)\n- Setting up JSDoc and ESLint integration\n- Reviewing code documentation quality\n- Updating documentation after refactoring\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Identify what to document** - Check if element is mandatory (public APIs) or optional\n2. **Apply appropriate pattern** - Use pattern from jsdoc-patterns.md for code element type\n3. **Include required tags** - @param, @returns, @throws, @example for public functions\n4. **Follow writing style** - Present tense, active voice, specific descriptions\n5. **Validate** - Run ESLint to check documentation completeness\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Required for Public Functions\n\n- Brief description\n- @param (all parameters with types)\n- @returns (for non-void returns)\n- @throws (all possible errors)\n- @example (for complex functions)\n\n### Required for Classes\n\n- @class tag with description\n- Constructor documentation\n- Public method documentation\n\n### Required for Modules\n\n- @fileoverview\n- @module tag\n- Export documentation\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. Document as you code - Don''t defer documentation\n2. Be specific - Avoid vague descriptions\n3. Document all errors - Use @throws for all exceptions\n4. Provide examples - Show realistic usage\n5. Keep synchronized - Update docs when code changes\n6. Validate with ESLint - Run linting before commit\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- Missing @param, @returns, or @throws\n- Vague descriptions (\"processes data\")\n- Parameter names not matching function signature\n- No examples for complex functions\n- Outdated documentation after refactoring\n\n## Integration\n\nWorks with:\n\n- **cui-javascript** skill - Core JavaScript development\n- **cui-javascript-unit-testing** skill - Test documentation\n- ESLint for automated validation\n- JSDoc CLI for documentation generation\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Workflow: Analyze JSDoc Violations\n\nAnalyzes JavaScript files for JSDoc compliance violations and returns structured results for command orchestration.\n\n**When to use**: To identify missing or incomplete JSDoc documentation across files or directories.\n\n**Steps**:\n\n1. **Run violation analysis script**\n\n    Script: `pm-dev-frontend:cui-jsdoc` → `jsdoc.py`\n\n    ```bash\n    # Analyze entire directory\n    python3 .plan/execute-script.py pm-dev-frontend:cui-jsdoc:jsdoc analyze --directory src/\n\n    # Analyze single file\n    python3 .plan/execute-script.py pm-dev-frontend:cui-jsdoc:jsdoc analyze --file src/utils/formatter.js\n\n    # Analyze only for missing JSDoc (skip syntax checks)\n    python3 .plan/execute-script.py pm-dev-frontend:cui-jsdoc:jsdoc analyze --directory src/ --scope missing\n\n    # Analyze only JSDoc syntax issues\n    python3 .plan/execute-script.py pm-dev-frontend:cui-jsdoc:jsdoc analyze --directory src/ --scope syntax\n    ```\n\n2. **Process violation results**\n    - Review violations categorized by severity:\n        - **CRITICAL**: Exported/public API without JSDoc\n        - **WARNING**: Internal function without JSDoc, missing @param/@returns\n        - **SUGGESTION**: Missing optional tags (@example, @fileoverview)\n    - Note `fix_suggestion` for each violation\n\n3. **Prioritize fixes**\n    - Fix CRITICAL violations first (exported functions/classes)\n    - Address WARNING violations next\n    - SUGGESTION items are optional improvements\n\n**JSON Output Contract**:\n\n```json\n{\n    \"status\": \"violations_found\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"violations\": [\n            {\n                \"file\": \"src/utils/validator.js\",\n                \"line\": 45,\n                \"type\": \"missing_jsdoc\",\n                \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\",\n                \"target\": \"function validateEmail\",\n                \"message\": \"Exported function missing JSDoc documentation\",\n                \"fix_suggestion\": \"Add JSDoc block with @param and @returns tags\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"files_analyzed\": [\"src/utils/validator.js\", \"...\"]\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n        \"total_files\": 15,\n        \"files_with_violations\": 6,\n        \"critical\": 5,\n        \"warnings\": 12,\n        \"suggestions\": 3,\n        \"total_violations\": 20\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Violation types detected**:\n\n- `missing_jsdoc` - Function/class entirely missing JSDoc\n- `missing_class_doc` - Class without documentation\n- `missing_constructor_doc` - Constructor with parameters undocumented\n- `missing_param` - @param tag missing for parameter\n- `missing_param_type` - Type annotation missing in @param\n- `missing_returns` - @returns tag missing for return value\n- `missing_fileoverview` - No @fileoverview at file level\n\n**Scope options**:\n\n- `all` - Check for missing JSDoc and syntax issues (default)\n- `missing` - Only check for missing JSDoc documentation\n- `syntax` - Only check JSDoc syntax and completeness\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:48:26.873Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing standardized documentation for CUI projects","zh":"适合需要标准化文档的JavaScript代理用于CUI项目","ja":"CUIプロジェクトの標準化ドキュメントが必要なJavaScriptエージェントに最適","ko":"CUI 프로젝트를 위한 표준화된 문서가 필요한 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de JavaScript que necesitan documentación estandarizada para proyectos de CUI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript ayant besoin d''une documentation standardisée pour les projets CUI","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die standardisierte Dokumentation für CUI-Projekte benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes JavaScript que necessitam de documentação padronizada para projetos CUI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, которым требуется стандартизированная документация для проектов CUI","ar":"مثالي لعميل JavaScript الذي يحتاج إلى توثيق معياري لمشاريع CUI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality JSDoc documentation for functions, classes, modules, types, and web components, utilizing core JSDoc syntax, required tags, and ESLint setup for consistent writing style","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的JSDoc文档的能力，用于函数、类、模块、类型和Web组件，利用核心JSDoc语法、所需标签和ESLint设置以保持一致的写作风格","ja":"エージェントが関数、クラス、モジュール、タイプ、Webコンポーネントの高品質なJSDocドキュメントを生成できるようにし、コアJSDoc構文、必要なタグ、ESLint設定を使用して一貫した書き方を保つ","ko":"에이전트가 함수, 클래스, 모듈, 유형, 웹 컴포넌트의 높은 품질의 JSDoc 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 핵심 JSDoc 구문, 필요한 태그, ESLint 설정을 사용하여 일관된 작성 스타일을 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación de alta calidad JSDoc para funciones, clases, módulos, tipos y componentes web, utilizando la sintaxis básica de JSDoc, etiquetas requeridas y configuración de ESLint para un estilo de escritura coherente","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation JSDoc de haute qualité pour les fonctions, les classes, les modules, les types et les composants web, en utilisant la syntaxe de base de JSDoc, les balises requises et la configuration ESLint pour un style d''écriture cohérent","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige JSDoc-Dokumentationen für Funktionen, Klassen, Module, Typen und Web-Komponenten zu generieren, indem sie die grundlegende JSDoc-Syntax, erforderliche Tags und ESLint-Setup für einen konsistenten Schreibstil nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentação de alta qualidade JSDoc para funções, classes, módulos, tipos e componentes da web, utilizando a sintaxe core JSDoc, tags necessárias e configuração do ESLint para estilo de escrita consistente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать документацию высокого качества JSDoc для функций, классов, модулей, типов и веб-компонентов, используя основную синтаксис JSDoc, обязательные теги и настройку ESLint для согласованного стиля написания","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء توثيق جودة عالية ل JSDoc للأدوات، والفصول الدراسية، والوحدات، والأنواع، ومكونات الويب، وذلك باستخدام بناء الجملة الأساسي ل JSDoc، ووسوم متطلبات، وإعداد ESLint لتنسيق الكتابة المتسق"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating documentation for CUI JavaScript projects","Creating standardized documentation patterns for code elements","Validating JSDoc syntax for ESLint compatibility"],"zh":["为CUI JavaScript项目生成文档","为代码元素创建标准化的文档模式","验证JSDoc语法以确保ESLint兼容性"],"ja":["CUI JavaScriptプロジェクトのドキュメントを生成する","コード要素の標準化されたドキュメントパターンを作成する","ESLintとの互換性を確保するためにJSDoc構文を検証する"],"ko":["CUI 자바스크립트 프로젝트에 대한 문서 생성","코드 요소에 대한 표준화된 문서 패턴 생성","ESLint와의 호환성을 보장하기 위해 JSDoc 구문을 검증"],"es":["Generación de documentación para proyectos de JavaScript de CUI","Creación de patrones de documentación estandarizados para elementos de código","Validación de la sintaxis JSDoc para la compatibilidad con ESLint"],"fr":["Génération de documentation pour les projets JavaScript CUI","Création de modèles de documentation standardisés pour les éléments de code","Validation de la syntaxe JSDoc pour la compatibilité avec ESLint"],"de":["Generierung von Dokumentationen für CUI-JavaScript-Projekte","Erstellung standardisierter Dokumentationsmuster für Code-Elemente","Validierung der JSDoc-Syntax für die Kompatibilität mit ESLint"],"pt":["Geração de documentação para projetos JavaScript CUI","Criação de padrões de documentação padronizados para elementos de código","Validação da sintaxe JSDoc para compatibilidade com ESLint"],"ru":["Генерация документации для проектов JavaScript CUI","Создание стандартизированных шаблонов документации для элементов кода","Проверка синтаксиса JSDoc на совместимость с ESLint"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق لمشاريع CUI JavaScript","إنشاء أنماط توثيقية معيارية لمكونات الكود","التحقق من بناء الجملة ل JSDoc لمتطلبات ESLint"]},"limitations":{"en":["Reference material only, load specific standards on-demand","CUI JavaScript projects only","Requires understanding of JSDoc documentation standards"],"zh":["仅参考资料，按需加载特定标准","仅适用于CUI JavaScript项目","需要了解JSDoc文档标准"],"ja":["参考資料のみ、特定の規格を必要に応じて読み込む","CUI JavaScriptプロジェクトのみ","JSDocドキュメント規格の理解が必要"],"ko":["참조 자료만, 특정 표준을 필요에 따라 로드","CUI 자바스크립트 프로젝트만","JSDoc 문서 표준에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Material de referencia solamente, carga de normas específicas bajo demanda","Proyectos de CUI JavaScript solamente","Requiere comprensión de los estándares de documentación JSDoc"],"fr":["Matériel de référence seulement, chargement de normes spécifiques à la demande","Projets JavaScript CUI uniquement","Nécessite une compréhension des normes de documentation JSDoc"],"de":["Nur Referenzmaterial, Laden spezifischer Standards auf Abruf","Nur CUI-JavaScript-Projekte","Benötigt Verständnis für JSDoc-Dokumentationsstandards"],"pt":["Material de referência apenas, carregue padrões específicos sob demanda","Projetos CUI JavaScript apenas","Exige compreensão dos padrões de documentação JSDoc"],"ru":["Только справочный материал, загрузка специфических стандартов по требованию","Только проекты CUI JavaScript","Требует понимания стандартов документации JSDoc"],"ar":["مادة مرجعية فقط، قم بتحميل المعايير المحددة عند الطلب","مشاريع CUI JavaScript فقط","يتطلب فهم معايير توثيق JSDoc"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
