recherche itératifs","Mécanismes de prise de décision démocratiques","Documentation systématique des processus de changement"],"de":["Entwurf von Studien zur partizipativen Aktionsforschung","Zusammenarbeit zwischen Forschern und Interessengruppen","Iterative Forschungszyklen","Demokratische Entscheidungsmechanismen","Systematische Dokumentation von Veränderungsprozessen"],"pt":["Ciclos de pesquisa iterativos","Processos de investigação democráticos","Mecanismos de compartilhamento de poder","Documentação sistemática de processos de mudança"],"ru":["Итеративные циклы исследования","Демократические процессы исследования","Механизмы распределения власти","Систематическая документация процессов изменения"],"ar":["دورات بحث متكررة","عمليات استفسار ديمقراطية","آليات لمشاركة السلطة","توثيق منهجي لعمليات التغيير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["参与式行动研究","AI代理","研究促进","实践变革","迭代研究","民主询问"],"ja":["参加型アクションリサーチ","AIエージェント","研究促進","実践変革","イテレーティブ研究","民主的インクワイア"],"ko":["참여형 액션 리서치","AI 에이전트","연구 촉진","실천 변환","반복 연구","민주적 탐구"],"es":["investigación acción","participativa","colaboración","ciclos de investigación","democracia","documentación de procesos","herramientas de investigación","desarrollo de investigaciones"],"fr":["recherche-action","participative","collaboration","cycles de recherche","démocratie","documentation de processus","outils de recherche","développement de recherches"],"de":["Aktionsforschung","partizipativ","Zusammenarbeit","Forschungszyklen","Demokratie","Dokumentation von Prozessen","Forschungstools","Forschungsentwicklung"],"pt":["pesquisa ação participativa","colaboração entre pesquisadores","mudanças transformadoras","ciclos de pesquisa iterativos","processos de investigação democráticos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["участковая исследовательская деятельность","сотрудничество между исследователями","трансформационные изменения","итеративные циклы исследования","демократические процессы исследования","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["البحث الإجرائي المشارك","التعاون بين الباحثين","التغييرات التحويلية","دورات البحث المتكررة","عمليات الاستفسار الديمقراطية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"HosungYou","repo":"Diverga","repoPath":"HosungYou/Diverga","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"diverga-h2","description":"|","version":"9.0.0","bodyPreview":"# H2-ActionResearchFacilitator\n\n**Agent ID**: H2\n**Category**: H - Specialized\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nDesigns and guides participatory action research (PAR) studies where researchers and stakeholders collaborate to investigate real-world problems and implement transformative change. Specializes in iterative research cycles, democratic inquiry processes, power-sharing mechanisms, and systematic documentation of change processes.\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\nThis agent runs in Codex","body":"# H2-ActionResearchFacilitator\n\n**Agent ID**: H2\n**Category**: H - Specialized\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nDesigns and guides participatory action research (PAR) studies where researchers and stakeholders collaborate to investigate real-world problems and implement transformative change. Specializes in iterative research cycles, democratic inquiry processes, power-sharing mechanisms, and systematic documentation of change processes.\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent execution - tasks run sequentially\n- No MCP runtime checkpoints - uses text-based checkpoint protocol\n- No AskUserQuestion UI - uses text prompts for decisions\n\n## Checkpoint Protocol\n\n### Checkpoints During Execution\n- CP_METHODOLOGY_APPROVAL (Required): Must approve action research methodology design.\n\nWhen reaching checkpoint:\n1. STOP and clearly mark: \"CHECKPOINT: CP_METHODOLOGY_APPROVAL\"\n2. Present action research design options with VS T-Scores\n3. Ask: \"Which action research approach would you like to proceed with? (A/B/C)\"\n4. WAIT for user response before continuing\n5. Log decision: write_file(\".research/decision-log.yaml\") to record\n\n## Prerequisites\nCheck: read_file(\".research/decision-log.yaml\") - CP_PARADIGM_SELECTION should be completed.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### Action Research Cycles\n\n1. **Kemmis & McTaggart (Classic Four-Phase)**\n   PLAN -> ACT -> OBSERVE -> REFLECT -> PLAN (revised) in spiral of cycles\n\n2. **Lewin''s Model**\n   Fact-finding -> Planning -> Action -> Evaluation in iterative loops\n\n3. **Participatory Action Research (PAR)**\n   Community-driven with power-sharing and democratic decision-making\n\n4. **Design-Based Research (DBR)**\n   Iterative design, implementation, analysis, and redesign in educational contexts\n\n### Stakeholder Collaboration\n- Stakeholder mapping and engagement strategies\n- Power analysis and power-sharing mechanisms\n- Democratic inquiry processes\n- Community advisory board design\n- Co-researcher training programs\n\n### Change Documentation\n- Systematic recording of change processes\n- Cycle-by-cycle documentation templates\n- Evidence of transformation tracking\n- Participant voice integration\n- Reflexive practice journals\n\n### Quality Criteria (Action Research-Specific)\n- Democratic validity (stakeholder participation)\n- Outcome validity (problem resolution)\n- Process validity (adequate inquiry)\n- Catalytic validity (transformation capacity)\n- Dialogic validity (peer review of process)\n\n## Output Format\n\nProduces action research design package with:\n- AR approach recommendation with justification\n- Cycle planning template (phases, activities, timeline)\n- Stakeholder engagement plan\n- Data collection methods per cycle\n- Change documentation framework\n- Quality assurance strategies (5 validity criteria)\n- Ethics considerations for participatory research\n- Reflexive practice framework\n\n## Tool Mapping (Codex)\n| Claude Code | Codex CLI |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| Read | read_file |\n| Edit | apply_diff |\n| Write | write_file |\n| Grep | grep |\n| Bash | shell |\n| Task (subagent) | Read skill file, follow instructions |\n\n## Related Agents\n- **C2-QualitativeDesignConsultant**: Broader qualitative design\n- **A4-ResearchEthicsAdvisor**: Ethics for participatory research\n- **D2-InterviewFocusGroupSpecialist**: Data collection methods\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:49:20.328Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Research Agents requiring participatory action research and collaborative problem-solving capabilities.","zh":"适合需要参与式行动研究和协作问题解决能力的高级研究代理。","ja":"参加型アクションリサーチや共同の問題解決能力を必要とする高度な研究エージェントに適しています。","ko":"참여형 행동 연구와 협력적 문제 해결 능력이 필요한 고급 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Investigación Avanzada que requieren investigación de acción participativa y capacidades de resolución de problemas colaborativos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche avancée nécessitant une recherche-action participative et des capacités de résolution de problèmes collaboratifs.","de":"Ideal für Advanced Research Agents, die partizipative Aktionsforschung und kollaborative Problemlösungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa Avançada que exigem pesquisa-ação participativa e capacidades de resolução colaborativa de problemas.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых исследовательских агентов, требующих участия в исследовательских действиях и возможностей совместного решения проблем.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثية المتقدمة التي تتطلب أبحاث العمل المشاركة والقدرات على حل المشكلات التعاونية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and guide iterative research cycles, leveraging democratic inquiry processes and power-sharing mechanisms, while systematically documenting change processes using gpt-5.3-codex models and Codex CLI.","zh":"赋予代理设计和指导迭代研究循环的能力，利用民主探究过程和权力共享机制，同时使用 gpt-5.3-codex 模型和 Codex CLI 系统地记录变化过程。","ja":"エージェントに反復研究サイクルの設計とガイドを可能にし、民主的な探究プロセスや権限の共有メカニズムを利用し、gpt-5.3-codex モデルと Codex CLI を使用して変更プロセスを体系的に文書化します。","ko":"에이전트가 반복 연구 주기를 설계하고 안내할 수 있도록 하며, 민주적인 탐구 과정과 권한 공유 메커니즘을 활용하고, gpt-5.3-codex 모델과 Codex CLI를 사용하여 변경 프로세스를 체계적으로 문서화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y guiar ciclos de investigación iterativos, aprovechando procesos de investigación democrática y mecanismos de reparto de poder, mientras documenta sistemáticamente los procesos de cambio utilizando modelos gpt-5.3-codex y Codex CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de guider des cycles de recherche itératifs, en exploitant les processus d''enquête démocratique et les mécanismes de partage du pouvoir, tout en documentant systématiquement les processus de changement à l''aide de modèles gpt-5.3-codex et de Codex CLI.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, iterative Forschungszyklen zu entwerfen und zu leiten, indem sie demokratische Forschungsprozesse und Mechanismen zur Machtteilung nutzen und gleichzeitig die Veränderungsprozesse mithilfe von gpt-5.3-codex-Modellen und Codex CLI systematisch dokumentieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e guiar ciclos de pesquisa iterativos, utilizando processos de inquérito democrático e mecanismos de compartilhamento de poder, enquanto documenta sistematicamente os processos de mudança usando modelos gpt-5.3-codex e Codex CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и направлять итеративные исследовательские циклы, используя демократические процессы расследования и механизмы распределения власти, а также систематически документировать процессы изменения с помощью моделей gpt-5.3-codex и Codex CLI.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم و توجيه دورات البحث التكرارية، باستخدام عمليات الاستجواب الديمقراطية و آليات مشاركة السلطة، في حين توثيق عمليات التغيير بشكل منهجي باستخدام نماذج gpt-5.3-codex و Codex CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Facilitating participatory action research studies","Implementing transformative change through collaborative inquiry","Documenting and analyzing iterative research cycles"],"zh":["促进参与式行动研究研究","通过合作探究实施变革性改变","记录和分析迭代研究循环"],"ja":["参加型アクションリサーチ研究の促進","共同の探究による変革的変化の実施","反復研究サイクルの記録と分析"],"ko":["참여형 행동 연구 연구의 촉진","협력적 탐구를 통한 변혁적 변화의 구현","반복 연구 주기의 기록 및 분석"],"es":["Facilitar estudios de investigación de acción participativa","Implementar un cambio transformador a través de una investigación colaborativa","Documentar y analizar ciclos de investigación iterativos"],"fr":["Faciliter les études de recherche-action participative","Mettre en œuvre un changement transformateur par le biais d''une enquête collaborative","Documenter et analyser les cycles de recherche itératifs"],"de":["Partizipative Aktionsforschungsstudien erleichtern","Transformative Veränderungen durch kollaborative Forschung umsetzen","Iterative Forschungszyklen dokumentieren und analysieren"],"pt":["Facilitar estudos de pesquisa-ação participativa","Implementar mudança transformadora por meio de inquérito colaborativo","Documentar e analisar ciclos de pesquisa iterativos"],"ru":["Облегчение участия в исследовательских действиях","Реализация трансформационных изменений посредством совместного расследования","Документирование и анализ итеративных исследовательских циклов"],"ar":["تسهيل دراسات أبحاث العمل المشاركة","تنفيذ التغيير التحويلي من خلال الاستجواب التعاوني","توثيق وتحليل دورات البحث التكرارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Runs in Codex CLI Degraded Mode","Requires gpt-5.3-codex model compatibility"],"zh":["在 Codex CLI 降级模式下运行","需要 gpt-5.3-codex 模型兼容性"],"ja":["Codex CLI 低下モードでの実行","gpt-5.3-codex モデルとの互換性の必要性"],"ko":["Codex CLI 저하 모드에서 실행","gpt-5.3-codex 모델과의 호환성 필요"],"es":["Se ejecuta en modo degradado de Codex CLI","Requiere compatibilidad con el modelo gpt-5.3-codex"],"fr":["S''exécute en mode dégradé de Codex CLI","Nécessite la compatibilité avec le modèle gpt-5.3-codex"],"de":["Läuft im abgespeckten Modus von Codex CLI","Benötigt Kompatibilität mit dem gpt-5.3-codex-Modell"],"pt":["Executa no Modo Degradado do Codex CLI","Exige compatibilidade com o modelo gpt-5.3-codex"],"ru":["Работает в режиме ухудшения Codex CLI","Требует совместимости с моделью gpt-5.3-codex"],"ar":["يعمل في وضع التدهور لشركة Codex CLI","يتطلب توافقا مع نموذج gpt-5.3-codex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jaxxstorm/landlord/openspec-new-change', 'community', 'jaxxstorm', 'landlord', 'jaxxstorm/landlord', 'openspec-new-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z', '2026-02-18T06:49:08.735Z', NULL, '{"id":"jaxxstorm/landlord/openspec-new-change","name":"openspec-new-change","description":{"zh":"开启新变更使用实验性构件驱动方法，通过输入变更名称或描述来启动过程","ja":"実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用して新しい変更を開始します。変更名または説明を入力してプロセスを起動します","ko":"실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법을 사용하여 새로운 변경을 시작합니다. 변경 이름이나 설명을 입력하여 프로세스를 시작합니다","es":"OpenSpec es una herramienta que permite iniciar un nuevo cambio utilizando un enfoque experimental de artifact-driven. Proporciona una forma flexible de describir lo que se quiere construir o arreglar.","fr":"OpenSpec est un outil qui permet de lancer un nouveau changement en utilisant une approche expérimentale d''artifact-driven. Il offre une façon flexible de décrire ce que vous voulez construire ou réparer.","de":"OpenSpec ist ein Tool, mit dem Sie eine neue Änderung starten können, indem Sie den experimentellen Ansatz von artifact-driven verwenden. Es bietet eine flexible Möglichkeit, zu beschreiben, was Sie bauen oder reparieren möchten.","pt":"O skill ''openspec-new-change'' permite iniciar uma nova alteração usando a abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos, melhorando o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","ru":"Навык ''openspec-new-change'' позволяет запустить новое изменение с помощью экспериментального подхода, основанного на артефактах, улучшая рабочий процесс разработки","ar":"المهارة ''openspec-new-change'' تسمح ببدء تغيير جديد باستخدام النهج التجريبي القائم على المكونات، و تحسين تدفق العمل التطويري","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"开启新变更：实验性构件驱动方法","ja":"新しい変更を開始：実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチ","ko":"새로운 변경 시작: 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법","es":"Inicia un nuevo cambio con OpenSpec","fr":"Lancer un nouveau changement avec OpenSpec","de":"Starte