perimentos","engenharia de recursos","avaliação de modelos","produção de sistemas de IA/ML","ciência de dados","aprendizado de máquina"],"ru":["старший ученый-датасаентист","системы AI/ML производственного класса","инструменты для проектирования экспериментов","инженерия признаков","оценка моделей","производство систем AI/ML","наука о данных","машинное обучение"],"ar":["عالمي المستوى لمهارات العلومية البيانات الرئاسي","أنظمة الإنتاج من ذكاء اصطناعي و मशين ليرنينج","أدوات تصميم التجارب","هندسة الميزات","تقييم النماذج","دعم الإنتاج لأنظمة الإنتاج من ذكاء اصطناعي و مشين ليرنينج","العلوم البيانات","مашين ليرنينج"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"senior-data-scientist","description":"World-class data science skill for statistical modeling, experimentation, causal inference, and advanced analytics. Expertise in Python (NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn), R, SQL, statistical methods, A/B testing, time series, and business intelligence. Includes experiment design, feature engineering, model evaluation, and stakeholder communication. Use when designing experiments, building predictive models, performing causal analysis, or driving data-driven decisions.","bodyPreview":"# Senior Data Scientist\n\nWorld-class senior data scientist skill for production-grade AI/ML/Data systems.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Main Capabilities\n\n```bash\n# Core Tool 1\npython scripts/experiment_designer.py --input data/ --output results/\n\n# Core Tool 2  \npython scripts/feature_engineering_pipeline.py --input data/ --output features/ --config config.yaml\n\n# Core Tool 3\npython scripts/model_evaluation_suite.py --input features/ --output evaluation/ --config config.yaml\n```\n\n## Core Expertise\n\nThis","body":"# Senior Data Scientist\n\nWorld-class senior data scientist skill for production-grade AI/ML/Data systems.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Main Capabilities\n\n```bash\n# Core Tool 1\npython scripts/experiment_designer.py --input data/ --output results/\n\n# Core Tool 2  \npython scripts/feature_engineering_pipeline.py --input data/ --output features/ --config config.yaml\n\n# Core Tool 3\npython scripts/model_evaluation_suite.py --input features/ --output evaluation/ --config config.yaml\n```\n\n## Core Expertise\n\nThis skill covers world-class capabilities in:\n\n- Advanced production patterns and architectures\n- Scalable system design and implementation\n- Performance optimization at scale\n- MLOps and DataOps best practices\n- Real-time processing and inference\n- Distributed computing frameworks\n- Model deployment and monitoring\n- Security and compliance\n- Cost optimization\n- Team leadership and mentoring\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n**Languages:** Python, SQL, R, Scala, Go\n**ML Frameworks:** PyTorch, TensorFlow, Scikit-learn, XGBoost\n**Data Tools:** Spark, Airflow, dbt, Kafka, Databricks\n**LLM Frameworks:** LangChain, LlamaIndex, DSPy\n**Deployment:** Docker, Kubernetes, AWS/GCP/Azure\n**Monitoring:** MLflow, Weights & Biases, Prometheus\n**Databases:** PostgreSQL, BigQuery, Snowflake, Pinecone\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n### 1. Statistical Methods Advanced\n\nComprehensive guide available in `references/statistical_methods_advanced.md` covering:\n\n- Advanced patterns and best practices\n- Production implementation strategies\n- Performance optimization techniques\n- Scalability considerations\n- Security and compliance\n- Real-world case studies\n\n### 2. Experiment Design Frameworks\n\nComplete workflow documentation in `references/experiment_design_frameworks.md` including:\n\n- Step-by-step processes\n- Architecture design patterns\n- Tool integration guides\n- Performance tuning strategies\n- Troubleshooting procedures\n\n### 3. Feature Engineering Patterns\n\nTechnical reference guide in `references/feature_engineering_patterns.md` with:\n\n- System design principles\n- Implementation examples\n- Configuration best practices\n- Deployment strategies\n- Monitoring and observability\n\n## Production Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Scalable Data Processing\n\nEnterprise-scale data processing with distributed computing:\n\n- Horizontal scaling architecture\n- Fault-tolerant design\n- Real-time and batch processing\n- Data quality validation\n- Performance monitoring\n\n### Pattern 2: ML Model Deployment\n\nProduction ML system with high availability:\n\n- Model serving with low latency\n- A/B testing infrastructure\n- Feature store integration\n- Model monitoring and drift detection\n- Automated retraining pipelines\n\n### Pattern 3: Real-Time Inference\n\nHigh-throughput inference system:\n\n- Batching and caching strategies\n- Load balancing\n- Auto-scaling\n- Latency optimization\n- Cost optimization\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Development\n\n- Test-driven development\n- Code reviews and pair programming\n- Documentation as code\n- Version control everything\n- Continuous integration\n\n### Production\n\n- Monitor everything critical\n- Automate deployments\n- Feature flags for releases\n- Canary deployments\n- Comprehensive logging\n\n### Team Leadership\n\n- Mentor junior engineers\n- Drive technical decisions\n- Establish coding standards\n- Foster learning culture\n- Cross-functional collaboration\n\n## Performance Targets\n\n**Latency:**\n- P50: < 50ms\n- P95: < 100ms\n- P99: < 200ms\n\n**Throughput:**\n- Requests/second: > 1000\n- Concurrent users: > 10,000\n\n**Availability:**\n- Uptime: 99.9%\n- Error rate: < 0.1%\n\n## Security & Compliance\n\n- Authentication & authorization\n- Data encryption (at rest & in transit)\n- PII handling and anonymization\n- GDPR/CCPA compliance\n- Regular security audits\n- Vulnerability management\n\n## Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Experiment design\npython scripts/experiment_designer.py --input data/ --output results/ --verbose\n\n# Feature engineering\npython scripts/feature_engineering_pipeline.py --input data/ --output features/ --config config.yaml\n\n# Model evaluation\npython scripts/model_evaluation_suite.py --input features/ --output evaluation/ --config config.yaml\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- Advanced Patterns: `references/statistical_methods_advanced.md`\n- Implementation Guide: `references/experiment_design_frameworks.md`\n- Technical Reference: `references/feature_engineering_patterns.md`\n- Automation Scripts: `scripts/` directory\n\n## Senior-Level Responsibilities\n\nAs a world-class senior professional:\n\n1. **Technical Leadership**\n   - Drive architectural decisions\n   - Mentor team members\n   - Establish best practices\n   - Ensure code quality\n\n2. **Strategic Thinking**\n   - Align with business goals\n   - Evaluate trade-offs\n   - Plan for scale\n   - Manage technical debt\n\n3. **Collaboration**\n   - Work across teams\n   - Communicate effectively\n   - Build consensus\n   - Share knowledge\n\n4. **Innovation**\n   - Stay current with research\n   - Experiment with new approaches\n   - Contribute to community\n   - Drive continuous improvement\n\n5. **Production Excellence**\n   - Ensure high availability\n   - Monitor proactively\n   - Optimize performance\n   - Respond to incidents\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:48:53.054Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced data analysis and machine learning capabilities for production-grade systems.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据分析和机器学习能力的AI代理，用于生产级系统。","ja":"AIエージェントが高度なデータ分析と機械学習の機能を必要とする場合、生産レベルのシステムに最適です。","ko":"고급 데이터 분석과 기계 학습 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 프로덕션급 시스템을 위한 것입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan análisis de datos avanzados y capacidades de aprendizaje automático para sistemas de producción.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une analyse de données avancée et de capacités d''apprentissage automatique pour des systèmes de production.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Datenanalyse- und Machine-Learning-Funktionen für Produktions-Systeme benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de análise de dados avançada e capacidades de aprendizado de máquina para sistemas de produção de classe mundial.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа данных и машинного обучения для производственных систем.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى تحليل بيانات متقدم وقدرات تعلم الآلة لأنظمة الإنتاج من الدرجة الأولى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design experiments, engineer features, and evaluate models using Python scripts, YAML configuration files, and data stored in various formats, leveraging tools like experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py, and model_evaluation_suite.py.","zh":"赋予代理设计实验、工程特征和使用Python脚本、YAML配置文件以及存储在各种格式中的数据来评估模型的能力，利用诸如experiment_designer.py、feature_engineering_pipeline.py和model_evaluation_suite.py等工具。","ja":"エージェントに実験の設計、特徴量エンジニアリング、モデル評価を行う能力を付与します。Pythonスクリプト、YAML構成ファイル、およびさまざまな形式で格納されたデータを使用して、experiment_designer.py、feature_engineering_pipeline.py、およびmodel_evaluation_suite.pyなどのツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 실험을 설계하고, 특징을 엔지니어링하고, 모델을 평가할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. Python 스크립트, YAML 구성 파일 및 다양한 형식으로 저장된 데이터를 사용하여 experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py 및 model_evaluation_suite.py와 같은 도구를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar experimentos, ingeniería de características y evaluar modelos utilizando scripts de Python, archivos de configuración YAML y datos almacenados en varios formatos, aprovechando herramientas como experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py y model_evaluation_suite.py.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des expériences, d''ingénierie de fonctionnalités et d''évaluer des modèles en utilisant des scripts Python, des fichiers de configuration YAML et des données stockées dans divers formats, en exploitant des outils tels que experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py et model_evaluation_suite.py.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Experimente zu entwerfen, Features zu engineeren und Modelle unter Verwendung von Python-Skripten, YAML-Konfigurationsdateien und in verschiedenen Formaten gespeicherten Daten zu bewerten, indem es Tools wie experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py und model_evaluation_suite.py nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar experimentos, engenharia de recursos e avaliar modelos usando scripts Python, arquivos de configuração YAML e dados armazenados em vários formatos, aproveitando ferramentas como experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py e model_evaluation_suite.py.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать эксперименты, инженерные особенности и оценивать модели с помощью скриптов Python, файлов конфигурации YAML и данных, хранящихся в различных форматах, используя инструменты как experiment_designer.py, feature_engineering_pipeline.py и model_evaluation_suite.py.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم التجارب وتصميم الميزات وتقييم النماذج باستخدام نصوص برمجة بايثون وملفات تكوين YAML والبيانات المخزنة بطرق مختلفة، واستخدام أدوات مثل experiment_designer.py و feature_engineering_pipeline.py و model_evaluation_suite.py."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data preprocessing with feature_engineering_pipeline.py","Evaluating model performance with model_evaluation_suite.py","Designing experiments with experiment_designer.py"],"zh":["使用feature_engineering_pipeline.py自动化数据预处理","使用model_evaluation_suite.py评估模型性能","使用experiment_designer.py设计实验"],"ja":["feature_engineering_pipeline.pyを使用してデータの前処理を自動化する","model_evaluation_suite.pyを使用してモデルのパフォーマンスを評価する","experiment_designer.pyを使用して実験を設計する"],"ko":["feature_engineering_pipeline.py를 사용하여 데이터 전처리를 자동화합니다.","model_evaluation_suite.py를 사용하여 모델 성능을 평가합니다.","experiment_designer.py를 사용하여 실험을 설계합니다."],"es":["Automatización de la preprocesamiento de datos con feature_engineering_pipeline.py","Evaluación del rendimiento del modelo con model_evaluation_suite.py","Diseño de experimentos con experiment_designer.py"],"fr":["Automatisation de la prétraitement des données avec feature_engineering_pipeline.py","Évaluation des performances du modèle avec model_evaluation_suite.py","Conception d''expériences avec experiment_designer.py"],"de":["Automatisierung der Daten-Vorverarbeitung mit feature_engineering_pipeline.py","Bewertung der Modellleistung mit model_evaluation_suite.py","Entwurf von Experimenten mit experiment_designer.py"],"pt":["Automatizar a pré-processamento de dados com feature_engineering_pipeline.py","Avaliar o desempenho do modelo com model_evaluation_suite.py","Projetar experimentos com experiment_designer.py"],"ru":["Автоматизировать предварительную обработку данных с помощью feature_engineering_pipeline.py","Оценить производительность модели с помощью model_evaluation_suite.py","Проектировать эксперименты с помощью experiment_designer.py"],"ar":["توفير مسبق للمعالجة البيانات باستخدام feature_engineering_pipeline.py","تقييم أداء النموذج باستخدام model_evaluation_suite.py","تصميم التجارب باستخدام experiment_designer.py"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Needs access to data and results directories","Dependent on config.yaml for configuration"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要访问数据和结果目录","依赖于config.yaml进行配置"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","データと結果ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","config.yamlに依存して構成する"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","데이터와 결과 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","config.yaml에 의존하여 구성합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Necesita acceso a directorios de datos y resultados","Dependiente de config.yaml para la configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","A besoin d''un accès aux répertoires de données et de résultats","Dépend de config.yaml pour la configuration"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Benötigt Zugriff auf Daten- und Ergebnisverzeichnisse","Abhängig von config.yaml für die Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Necessita acesso a diretórios de dados e resultados","Dependente de config.yaml para configuração"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Требует доступа к каталогам данных и результатов","Зависит от config.yaml для конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى دليل البيانات والنتائج","يعتمد على config.yaml للتدبير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Metta-AI/tribal-village/worldgen-hub-variation', 'community', 'Metta-AI', 'tribal-village', 'Metta-AI/tribal-village', 'worldgen-hub-variation', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z', '2026-02-18T06:50:06.304Z', NULL, '{"id":"Metta-AI/tribal-village/worldgen-hub-variation","name":"worldgen-hub-variation","description":{"zh":"Worldgen Hub 变体生成是一种用于优化游戏地图生成的技术，通过调整放置和清除来提升游戏体验","ja":"Worldgen Hub バリエーションは、ゲームマップ生成を最適化する技術であり、配置とクリアランスを調整してゲーム体験を向上させる","ko":"월드젠 허브 변형 생성은 게임 맵 생성을 최적화하는 기술로, 배치와 해상도를 조정하여 게임 경험을 향상시킨다","es":"La variación de Worldgen Hub permite ajustar el lugar de spawn mientras se mantiene la claridad de la carretera.","fr":"La variation de Worldgen Hub permet d''ajuster l''emplacement de spawn tout en maintenant la clarté de la route.","de":"Die Variation von Worldgen Hub ermöglicht es, den Spawn-Ort anzupassen, während die Straßenfreiheit erhalten bleibt.","pt":"O Worldgen Hub Variation permite ajustar a colocação do hub enquanto preserva o clearance de estradas. Inspecte o código em src/spawn.nim.","ru":"Вариация Worldgen Hub позволяет регулировать размещение хаба, сохраняя проезд дорог. Осмотрите код в src/spawn.nim.","ar":"سماح تنوع محور Worldgen بضبط وضع المحور مع الحفاظ على المساحة الطرقية. قم بفحص الكود في src/spawn.nim.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Worldgen Hub 变体生成","ja":"ワールドジェネレーター ハブ バリエーション","ko":"월드젠 허브 변형 생성","es":"Variación de Worldgen Hub","fr":"Variation de Worldgen Hub","de":"Worldgen-Hub-Variation","pt":"Variação Worldgen Hub","ru":"Вариация Worldgen Hub","ar":"تنوع محور Worldgen","en":"worldgen-hub-variation"},"description":{"zh":"Worldgen Hub 变体生成是一种用于优化游戏地图生成的技术，通过调整放置和清除来提升游戏体验","ja":"Worldgen Hub バリエーションは、ゲームマップ生成を最適化する技術であり、配置とクリアランスを調整してゲーム体験を向上させる","ko":"월드젠 허브 변형 생성은 게임 맵 생성을 최적화하는 기술로, 배치와 해상도를 조정하여 게임 경험을 향상시킨다","es":"La variación de Worldgen Hub permite ajustar el lugar de spawn mientras se mantiene la claridad de la carretera.","fr":"La variation de Worldgen Hub permet d''ajuster l''emplacement de spawn tout en maintenant la clarté de la route.","de":"Die Variation von Worldgen Hub ermöglicht es, den Spawn-Ort anzupassen, während die Straßenfreiheit erhalten bleibt.","pt":"O Worldgen Hub Variation permite ajustar a colocação do hub enquanto preserva o clearance de estradas. Inspecte o código em src/spawn.nim.","ru":"Вариация Worldgen Hub позволяет регулировать размещение хаба, сохраняя проезд дорог. Осмотрите код в src/spawn.nim.","ar":"سماح تنوع محور Worldgen بضبط وضع المحور مع الحفاظ على المساحة الطرقية. قم بفحص الكود في src/spawn.nim.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化放置和清除","提升游戏体验","支持多种地图类型","高性能生成算法","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["配置とクリアランスの最適化","ゲーム体験の向上","多種類のマップタイプをサポート","高性能の生成アルゴリズム","容易に統合と拡張が可能"],"ko":["배치와 해상도의 최적화","게임 경험의 향상","다양한 맵 유형 지원","고성능 생성 알고리즘","쉽게 통합과 확장이 가능"],"es":["Ajuste de lugar de spawn","Mantenimiento de la claridad de la carretera","Personalización de la experiencia del juego","Flexibilidad en el diseño del juego","Mejora de la inmersión del jugador"],"fr":["Ajustement de l''emplacement de spawn","Maintenance de la clarté de la route","Personnalisation de l''expérience de jeu","Flexibilité dans la conception de jeu","Amélioration de l''immersion du joueur"],"de":["Anpassung des Spawn-Ortes","Beibehaltung der Straßenfreiheit","Anpassung der Spiel-Erfahrung","Flexibilität im Spiel-Design","Verbesserung der Spieler-Immersion"],"pt":["Ajuste de colocação do hub","Preservação de clearance de estradas","Inspeção de código em src/spawn.nim","Personalização de ambientes de jogo","Otimização de layouts de hubs"],"ru":["Корректировка размещения хаба","Сохранение проезда дорог","Осмотр кода в src/spawn.nim","Настройка игровых сред","Оптимизация раскладки хабов"],"ar":["ضبط وضع المحور","الحفاظ على المساحة الطرقية","فحص الكود في src/spawn.nim","تخصيص بيئات الألعاب","تحسين تخطيط المحاور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Worldgen Hub","游戏地图生成","放置和清除","游戏开发技术","游戏体验优化","地图类型"],"ja":["Worldgen Hub","ゲームマップ生成","配置とクリアランス","ゲーム開発技術","ゲーム体験の最適化","マップタイプ"],"ko":["월드젠 허브","게임 맵 생성","배치와 해상도","게임 개발 기술","게임 경험 최적화","맵 유형"],"es":["worldgen hub","variación de worldgen hub","personalización de juegos","diseño de juegos","experiencia del jugador","inmersión del jugador","claridad de la carretera"],"fr":["worldgen hub","variation de worldgen hub","personnalisation de jeux","conception de jeux","expérience de joueur","immersion du joueur","clarté de la route"],"de":["worldgen hub","worldgen-hub-variation","anpassung von spielen","spiel-design","spieler-erfahrung","spieler-immersion","straßenfreiheit"],"pt":["Worldgen Hub","Variação de hubs","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Programação de jogos","Ambientes de jogo","Otimização de layouts"],"ru":["Worldgen Hub","Вариация хабов","Разработка игр","Программирование игр","Игровые среды","Оптимизация раскладки"],"ar":["محور Worldgen","تنوع المحاور","تطوير الألعاب","برمجة الألعاب","بيئات الألعاب","تحسين التخطيط"]}},"owner":"Metta-AI","repo":"tribal-village","repoPath":"Metta-AI/tribal-village","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"worldgen-hub-variation","description":"Make the trading hub feel more organic without blocking roads.","bodyPreview":"# Worldgen Hub Variation\n\n## Workflow\n- Inspect hub placement in `src/spawn.nim`.\n- Adjust placement while preserving road clearance.\n- Summarize changes.","body":"# Worldgen Hub Variation\n\n## Workflow\n- Inspect hub placement in `src/spawn.nim`.\n- Adjust placement while preserving road clearance.\n- Summarize changes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:50:06.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Procedural Generation Agents needing advanced world-building capabilities with precise hub placement control.","zh":"非常适合需要高级世界构建功能和精确中心放置控制的程序生成代理。","ja":"手順的生成エージェントに適しています。高度なワールドビルディング機能と精密なハブ配置制御が必要です。","ko":"고급 세계 구축 기능과 정확한 허브 배치 제어가 필요한 절차적 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación procedural que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de mundos con control preciso de colocación de centros.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération procédurale nécessitant des capacités de création de monde avancées avec un contrôle précis du placement des hubs.","de":"Perfekt für Procedural-Generation-Agents, die erweiterte Weltbaumöglichkeiten mit präziser Hub-Platzierungskontrolle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de geração procedural que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de construção de mundos com controle preciso de colocação de hubs.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов процедурной генерации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности создания мира с точным контролем размещения хабов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل العميل الإجرائي الذي يحتاج إلى возможности بناء عالم متقدمة مع سيطرة دقيقة على وضع المراكز."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to modify and optimize hub placement in source code files like `src/spawn.nim`, ensuring road clearance while summarizing changes, utilizing Nim programming language for customized world generation.","zh":"赋予代理在源代码文件（如 `src/spawn.nim`）中修改和优化中心放置的能力，确保道路清除同时总结更改，利用Nim编程语言进行自定义世界生成。","ja":"エージェントは、ソースコードファイル（例： `src/spawn.nim`）でハブの配置を変更、最適化することができ、道路のクリアランスを確保し、変更をまとめることができ、Nimプログラミング言語を使用してカスタム世界生成を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 소스 코드 파일(`src/spawn.nim`과 같은 파일)에서 허브 배치를 수정하고 최적화 할 수 있으며, 도로 정리를 보장하고 변경 사항을 요약하며 Nim 프로그래밍 언어를 사용하여 사용자 정의 세계 생성을 수행 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes modificar y optimizar la colocación de centros en archivos de código fuente como `src/spawn.nim`, garantizando la limpieza de carreteras mientras se resumen los cambios, utilizando el lenguaje de programación Nim para la generación de mundos personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de modifier et d''optimiser le placement des hubs dans des fichiers de code source tels que `src/spawn.nim`, en garantissant la libération des routes tout en résumant les modifications, en utilisant le langage de programmation Nim pour la génération de mondes personnalisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Platzierung von Hubs in Quellcode-Dateien wie `src/spawn.nim` zu ändern und zu optimieren, um Straßenfreiheit zu gewährleisten, während Änderungen zusammengefasst werden, wobei die Nim-Programmiersprache für die benutzerdefinierte Weltgenerierung verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a modificarem e otimizarem a colocação de hubs em arquivos de código-fonte como `src/spawn.nim`, garantindo a limpeza da estrada enquanto resume as alterações, utilizando a linguagem de programação Nim para geração de mundos personalizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью изменять и оптимизировать размещение хабов в файлах исходного кода, таких как `src/spawn.nim`, обеспечивая проезд по дороге при одновременном суммировании изменений, используя язык программирования Nim для настраиваемой генерации мира.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تعديل وتحسين وضع المراكز في ملفات شفرة المصدر مثل `src/spawn.nim` ، مع ضمان وضوح الطريق أثناء تلخيص التغييرات ، باستخدام لغة Nim البرمجية لتوليد عالم مخصص."},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting and adjusting hub placement for customized world generation","Preserving road clearance in procedurally generated environments","Summarizing changes to hub placement for iterative design"],"zh":["检查和调整中心放置以进行自定义世界生成","在程序生成环境中保持道路清除","总结中心放置的更改以进行迭代设计"],"ja":["カスタム世界生成のためのハブ配置の検査と調整","手順的生成環境での道路クリアランスの保持","ハブ配置の変更のまとめを通じたイテレーティブデザイン"],"ko":["사용자 정의 세계 생성을 위한 허브 배치 검사 및 조정","절차적 생성 환경에서 도로 정리 유지","반복적 설계를 위한 허브 배치 변경 요약"],"es":["Inspeccionar y ajustar la colocación de centros para la generación de mundos personalizados","Preservar la limpieza de carreteras en entornos generados proceduralmente","Resumir los cambios en la colocación de centros para el diseño iterativo"],"fr":["Inspecter et ajuster le placement des hubs pour la génération de mondes personnalisés","Préserver la libération des routes dans les environnements générés de manière procédurale","Résumer les modifications apportées au placement des hubs pour la conception itérative"],"de":["Überprüfen und Anpassen der Hub-Platzierung für die benutzerdefinierte Weltgenerierung","Straßenfreiheit in procedural generierten Umgebungen bewahren","Änderungen an der Hub-Platzierung für das iterative Design zusammenfassen"],"pt":["Inspecionar e ajustar a colocação de hubs para geração de mundos personalizada","Preservar a limpeza da estrada em ambientes gerados proceduralmente","Resumir as alterações na colocação de hubs para design iterativo"],"ru":["Осмотр и корректировка размещения хабов для настраиваемой генерации мира","Сохранение проезда по дороге в процедурно сгенерированных средах","Суммирование изменений в размещении хабов для итеративного проектирования"],"ar":["فحص وتعديل وضع المراكز لتوليد عالم مخصص","الحفاظ على وضوح الطريق في البيئات المولدة إجرائيا","تلخيص التغييرات في وضع المراكز للتصميم التكراري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to source code files like `src/spawn.nim`","Nim programming language knowledge necessary","Manual adjustment and summary of changes needed"],"zh":["需要访问源代码文件，如 `src/spawn.nim`","需要Nim编程语言的知识","需要手动调整和总结更改"],"ja":["ソースコードファイル（例： `src/spawn.nim`）へのアクセスが必要","Nimプログラミング言語の知識が必要","変更の手動調整とまとめが必要"],"ko":["소스 코드 파일(`src/spawn.nim`과 같은 파일) 액세스가 필요합니다.","Nim 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","변경 사항에 대한 수동 조정 및 요약이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de código fuente como `src/spawn.nim`","Conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Nim es necesario","Ajuste y resumen manual de los cambios necesarios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de code source tels que `src/spawn.nim`","Connaissance du langage de programmation Nim est nécessaire","Ajustement et résumé manuel des modifications nécessaires"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Quellcode-Dateien wie `src/spawn.nim`","Kenntnisse der Nim-Programmiersprache sind erforderlich","Manuelle Anpassung und Zusammenfassung der Änderungen erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de código-fonte como `src/spawn.nim`","Conhecimento da linguagem de programação Nim necessário","Ajuste e resumo manual das alterações necessário"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам исходного кода, таким как `src/spawn.nim`","Необходимо знание языка программирования Nim","Требуется ручная корректировка и суммирование изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات شفرة المصدر مثل `src/spawn.nim`","معارف لغة Nim البرمجية ضرورية","التعديل والتلخيص اليدوي للتغييرات ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cacr92/WeReply/refactoring', 'community', 'cacr92', 'WeReply', 'cacr92/WeReply', 'refactoring', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z', '2026-02-18T06:50:15.994Z', NULL, '{"id":"cacr92/WeReply/refactoring","name":"refactoring","description":{"zh":"代码重构是指在不改变代码功能的情况下，优化代码结构，提高可读性和可维护性","ja":"リファクタリングは、コードの機能を変更せずにコード構造を最適化して可読性とメンテナンス性を向上させること","ko":"리팩토링은 코드의 기능을 변경하지 않고 코드 구조를 최적화하여 가독성과 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것","es":"El refactoring es el proceso de reestructurar el código para mejorar su calidad y mantenerabilidad sin alterar su funcionalidad","fr":"Le refactoring est le processus de réorganiser le code pour améliorer sa qualité et sa maintenabilité sans altérer sa fonctionnalité","de":"Refactoring ist der Prozess der Umstrukturierung des Codes, um dessen Qualität und Wartbarkeit zu verbessern, ohne dessen Funktionalität zu ändern","en":"微信聊天自动回复助手"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码重构技巧","ja":"リファクタリングスキル","ko":"리팩토링 기술","es":"Refactorización de código: técnicas y mejores prácticas","fr":"Refactoring de code : techniques et meilleures pratiques","de":"Code-Refactoring: Techniken und Best Practices","en":"refactoring"},"description":{"zh":"代码重构是指在不改变代码功能的情况下，优化代码结构，提高可读性和可维护性","ja":"リファクタリングは、コードの機能を変更せずにコード構造を最適化して可読性とメンテナンス性を向上させること","ko":"리팩토링은 코드의 기능을 변경하지 않고 코드 구조를 최적화하여 가독성과 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것","es":"El refactoring es el proceso de reestructurar el código para mejorar su calidad y mantenerabilidad sin alterar su funcionalidad","fr":"Le refactoring est le processus de réorganiser le code pour améliorer sa qualité et sa maintenabilité sans altérer sa fonctionnalité","de":"Refactoring ist der Prozess der Umstrukturierung des Codes, um dessen Qualität und Wartbarkeit zu verbessern, ohne dessen Funktionalität zu ändern","en":"微信聊天自动回复助手"},"definition":{"en":"微信聊天自动回复助手"},"features":{"zh":["不改变代码功能的结构优化","复杂逻辑拆分与命名优化","重复逻辑抽取与简化","行为不变，先保功能","小步提交，随时可回滚"],"ja":["コードの機能を変更せずに構造を最適化","複雑なロジックを分割して命名を最適化","重複するロジックを抽出して簡略化","動作を変えずに機能を保つ","小さなステップでコミットしていつでもロールバックできる"],"ko":["코드의 기능을 변경하지 않고 구조를 최적화","복잡한 로직을 분割하여命名을 최적화","重複하는 로직을抽出하여簡略화","동작을 변경하지 않고 기능을 보장","작은 단계로 커밋하여 언제든지 롤백할 수 있다"],"es":["Mejora la claridad y mantenabilidad del código","Reduce la complejidad y los errores","Incrementa la eficiencia y la productividad","Permite la reutilización de código","Facilita la depuración y el testing"],"fr":["Améliore la clarté et la maintenabilité du code","Réduit la complexité et les erreurs","Augmente l''efficacité et la productivité","Permet la réutilisation de code","Facilite la débogage et les tests"],"de":["Verbessert die Klarheit und Wartbarkeit des Codes","Reduziert die Komplexität und die Fehler","Erhöht die Effizienz und die Produktivität","Ermöglicht die Wiederverwendung von Code","Erleichtert die Fehlersuche und das Testen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码重构","软件开发","代码优化","可读性","可维护性","结构优化","复杂逻辑","重复逻辑"],"ja":["リファクタリング","ソフトウェア開発","コード最適化","可読性","メンテナンス性","構造最適化","複雑なロジック","重複するロジック"],"ko":["리팩토링","소프트웨어 개발","코드 최적화","가독성","유지 보수성","구조 최적화","복잡한 로직","重複하는 로직"],"es":["refactorización de código","mejora de código","mantenabilidad del código","claridad del código","eficiencia del código","reutilización de código","depuración de código","testing de código"],"fr":["refactoring de code","amélioration de code","maintenabilité du code","clarté du code","efficacité du code","réutilisation de code","débogage de code","tests de code"],"de":["Code-Refactoring","Code-Optimierung","Wartbarkeit des Codes","Klarheit des Codes","Effizienz des Codes","Wiederverwendung von Code","Fehlersuche im Code","Testen von Code"]}},"owner":"cacr92","repo":"WeReply","repoPath":"cacr92/WeReply","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refactoring","description":"当用户要求重构、清理代码、降低复杂度、消除重复或改善可维护性时使用。","bodyPreview":"# Refactoring Skill\n\n## 适用范围\n- 不改变功能的结构优化\n- 复杂逻辑拆分与命名优化\n- 重复逻辑抽取与简化\n\n## 关键规则（Critical Rules）\n- 行为不变，先保功能\n- 小步提交，随时可回滚\n- 每步都有验证（测试或可复现路径）\n- 涉及表格 UI 时，保持紧凑行高规范（默认 th/td padding 6px 10px、line-height 1.2；表格内 Tag 紧凑化）\n\n## 重构流程\n1. 明确当前行为与问题点\n2. 设计最小改动方案\n3. 小步修改并验证\n4. 复核命名与边界条件\n\n## 常见切入点\n- 过长函数：拆分为可复用小函数\n- 重复逻辑：抽取到单一位置\n- 复杂条件：使用早返回或拆分分支\n- 魔法值：提取为具名常量\n\n## 检查清单\n- [ ] 行为一致且可验证\n- [ ] 改动范围最小\n- [ ] 命名更清晰、重复更少\n- [ ] 表格行高与内边距保持紧凑统一","body":"# Refactoring Skill\n\n## 适用范围\n- 不改变功能的结构优化\n- 复杂逻辑拆分与命名优化\n- 重复逻辑抽取与简化\n\n## 关键规则（Critical Rules）\n- 行为不变，先保功能\n- 小步提交，随时可回滚\n- 每步都有验证（测试或可复现路径）\n- 涉及表格 UI 时，保持紧凑行高规范（默认 th/td padding 6px 10px、line-height 1.2；表格内 Tag 紧凑化）\n\n## 重构流程\n1. 明确当前行为与问题点\n2. 设计最小改动方案\n3. 小步修改并验证\n4. 复核命名与边界条件\n\n## 常见切入点\n- 过长函数：拆分为可复用小函数\n- 重复逻辑：抽取到单一位置\n- 复杂条件：使用早返回或拆分分支\n- 魔法值：提取为具名常量\n\n## 检查清单\n- [ ] 行为一致且可验证\n- [ ] 改动范围最小\n- [ ] 命名更清晰、重复更少\n- [ ] 表格行高与内边距保持紧凑统一\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:50:15.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Optimization Agents needing structured refactoring capabilities for improved code readability and maintainability.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化重构能力以提高代码可读性和可维护性的代码优化代理。","ja":"コードの可読性と保守性を向上させるための構造化されたリファクタリング機能を必要とするコード最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"코드의 가독성과 유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위한 구조화된 리팩토링 기능을 필요로 하는 코드 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de código que necesitan capacidades de refactorización estructurada para mejorar la legibilidad y mantenibilidad del código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de code nécessitant des capacités de refactoring structurées pour améliorer la lisibilité et la maintenabilité du code.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Optimierungsagenten, die strukturierte Refactoring-Fähigkeiten für verbesserte Code-Lesbarkeit und Wartbarkeit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Código que necessitam de capacidades de refatoração estruturadas para melhorar a legibilidade e manutenibilidade do código.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации кода, которым требуются структурированные возможности рефакторинга для улучшения читаемости и поддерживаемости кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحسين الكودية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات إعادة هيكلة منظمة لتحسين قراءة و صيانة الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform behavior-preserving structure optimizations, leveraging techniques such as extracting repeat logic, simplifying complex conditions, and renaming for clarity, all while ensuring minimal change and verifiable functionality through small-step submissions and continuous validation.","zh":"赋予代理执行行为保留结构优化的能力，利用诸如提取重复逻辑、简化复杂条件和重命名以提高清晰度等技术，同时通过小步提交和持续验证确保最小的更改和可验证的功能。","ja":"エージェントが動作を保ったままの構造最適化を実行する能力を付与します。繰り返しのロジックを抽出する、複雑な条件を簡素化する、そして明確性のために名前を変更するなどのテクニックを利用し、小さなステップでの提出と継続的な検証を通じて、最小限の変更と検証可能な機能を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 동작을 유지한 상태에서 구조 최적화를 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 반복 로직을 추출하거나 복잡한 조건을 단순화하거나 명확성을 위해 이름을 변경하는 등의 기술을 활용하며, 작은 단계의 제출과 지속적인 검증을 통해 최소한의 변경과 검증 가능한 기능을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar optimizaciones de estructura que preservan el comportamiento, aprovechando técnicas como la extracción de lógica repetida, la simplificación de condiciones complejas y el cambio de nombre para mayor claridad, todo ello garantizando un cambio mínimo y una funcionalidad verificable a través de envíos de pequeños pasos y validación continua.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des optimisations de structure qui préservent le comportement, en exploitant des techniques telles que l''extraction de la logique répétée, la simplification de conditions complexes et le renommage pour plus de clarté, le tout en garantissant un changement minimal et une fonctionnalité vérifiable grâce à des soumissions par petites étapes et une validation continue.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, verhaltenserhaltende Struktur-Optimierungen durchzuführen, indem sie Techniken wie das Extrahieren wiederholter Logik, das Vereinfachen komplexer Bedingungen und das Umbenennen für größere Klarheit nutzen, und dabei einen minimalen Aufwand und eine verifizierbare Funktionalität durch schrittweise Einreichungen und kontinuierliche Überprüfung gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar otimizações de estrutura que preservam o comportamento, aproveitando técnicas como extração de lógica repetida, simplificação de condições complexas e renomeação para clareza, garantindo mudanças mínimas e funcionalidade verificável por meio de envios em pequenas etapas e validação contínua.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять оптимизации структуры, сохраняющие поведение, используя такие техники, как извлечение повторяющейся логики, упрощение сложных условий и переименование для ясности, обеспечивая при этом минимальные изменения и проверяемую функциональность посредством пошаговых отправок и непрерывной проверки.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من أداء تحسينات هيكلية تحافظ على السلوك، مستفيدة من تقنيات مثل استخراج المنطق المتكرر، وتبسيط الشروط المعقدة وإعادة التسمية من أجل الوضوح، مع ضمان التغييرات الصغيرة والوظائف القابلة للتحقق من خلال الإرسال بالمراحل الصغيرة والتحقق المستمر."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring long functions into reusable smaller ones","Simplifying repeat logic by abstracting to single locations","Improving table UI consistency by adhering to tight padding and line-height standards"],"zh":["将长函数重构为可重用的较小函数","通过抽象到单个位置来简化重复逻辑","通过遵循紧密的填充和行高标准来改善表格UI的一致性"],"ja":["長い関数を再利用可能な小さい関数にリファクタリングする","繰り返しのロジックを単一の場所に抽出することで簡素化する","タイトなパディングと行の高さの標準に従うことで、テーブルUIの一貫性を改善する"],"ko":["긴 함수를 재사용 가능한 작은 함수로 리팩토링하는 것","반복 로직을 단일 위치로 추출하여 단순화하는 것","타이트한 패딩과 라인 높이 표준을 준수하여 테이블 UI의 일관성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de funciones largas en funciones más pequeñas y reutilizables","Simplificación de lógica repetida mediante la abstracción a ubicaciones únicas","Mejora de la coherencia de la interfaz de usuario de la tabla al adherirse a estándares de relleno y altura de línea ajustados"],"fr":["Réorganisation de fonctions longues en fonctions plus petites et réutilisables","Simplification de la logique répétée en l''abstrayant en des emplacements uniques","Amélioration de la cohérence de l''interface utilisateur de tableau en adhérant à des normes de padding et de hauteur de ligne serrées"],"de":["Umstrukturierung langer Funktionen in wiederverwendbare kleinere Funktionen","Vereinfachung wiederholter Logik durch Abstraktion an einzelne Orte","Verbesserung der Konsistenz der Tabellen-Benutzeroberfläche durch Einhaltung strenger Polster- und Zeilenhöhenstandards"],"pt":["Refatoração de funções longas em funções menores reutilizáveis","Simplificação de lógica repetida por abstração para locais únicos","Melhoria da consistência da interface do usuário da tabela mediante a adesão a padrões de preenchimento e altura de linha rigorosos"],"ru":["Рефакторинг длинных функций в переиспользуемые более короткие","Упрощение повторяющейся логики путем абстракции в единичные места","Улучшение согласованности интерфейса таблицы путем соблюдения строгих стандартов заполнения и высоты строки"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الدوال الطويلة إلى دوال أصغر قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تبسيط المنطق المتكرر من خلال التبstrasl إلى مواقع فريدة","تحسين الاتساق في واجهة المستخدم للجدول عن طريق الالتزام بمعايير الحشو وارتفاع الخط الصارمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thorough understanding of existing codebase behavior","Applies to code structure optimization without altering functionality"],"zh":["需要对现有代码库行为有彻底的理解","仅适用于代码结构优化，不改变功能"],"ja":["既存のコードベースの動作について徹底的に理解する必要がある","コードの構造最適化のみに適用され、機能を変更しない"],"ko":["既存의 코드베이스 동작에 대한 철저한 이해가 필요하다","코드 구조 최적화에만 적용되며, 기능을 변경하지 않는다"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión exhaustiva del comportamiento de la base de código existente","Se aplica a la optimización de la estructura del código sin alterar la funcionalidad"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension approfondie du comportement de la base de code existante","S''applique à l''optimisation de la structure du code sans modifier la fonctionnalité"],"de":["Erfordert ein umfassendes Verständnis des Verhaltens der bestehenden Codebasis","Wird auf die Optimierung der Code-Struktur ohne Funktionsänderung angewendet"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão aprofundada do comportamento da base de código existente","Aplica-se à otimização da estrutura de código sem alterar a funcionalidade"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания поведения существующей базы кода","Применяется к оптимизации структуры кода без изменения функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا متعمقًا لسلوك قاعدة الشفرة الحالية","يطبق على تحسين هيكل الشفرة دون تغيير الوظيفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mhbdev/git-pal/tailwindcss', 'community', 'mhbdev', 'git-pal', 'mhbdev/git-pal', 'tailwindcss', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z', '2026-02-18T06:49:38.261Z', NULL, '{"id":"mhbdev/git-pal/tailwindcss","name":"tailwindcss","description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能提供了用于样式化JARVIS AI Assistant界面的实用程序CSS，创建一致且可维护的HUD设计","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキルは、JARVIS AI AssistantのインターフェースをスタイリングするためのユーティリティファーストCSSを提供し、一貫性と保守性のあるHUDデザインを作成","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 스킬은 JARVIS AI Assistant 인터페이스를 스타일링하기 위한 유틸리티 퍼스트 CSS를 제공하여 일관성과 유지 보수 가능한 HUD 디자인을 생성","es":"Tailwind CSS es un framework de estilo que permite crear diseños de HUD consistentes y mantenibles para la interfaz del asistente AI JARVIS","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un framework de style qui permet de créer des conceptions de HUD cohérentes et maintenables pour l''interface de l''assistant AI JARVIS","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Styling-Framework, das die Erstellung konsistenter und wartbarer HUD-Designs für die JARVIS-KI-Assistenten-Oberfläche ermöglicht","pt":"Tailwind CSS é um framework de CSS que permite criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e responsivas","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это фреймворк CSS, который позволяет создавать индивидуальные и адаптивные интерфейсы пользователя","ar":"تيلويند سي إس إس هو إطار عمل سي إس إس يسمح بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتجاوبة","en":"Your friendly neighborhood GitPal!"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキル","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 스킬","es":"Desarrollo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Développement avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS","pt":"Desenvolvimento com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Разработка с Tailwind CSS","ar":"تطوير تيلويند سي إس إس","en":"tailwindcss"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能提供了用于样式化JARVIS AI Assistant界面的实用程序CSS，创建一致且可维护的HUD设计","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキルは、JARVIS AI AssistantのインターフェースをスタイリングするためのユーティリティファーストCSSを提供し、一貫性と保守性のあるHUDデザインを作成","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 스킬은 JARVIS AI Assistant 인터페이스를 스타일링하기 위한 유틸리티 퍼스트 CSS를 제공하여 일관성과 유지 보수 가능한 HUD 디자인을 생성","es":"Tailwind CSS es un framework de estilo que permite crear diseños de HUD consistentes y mantenibles para la interfaz del asistente AI JARVIS","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un framework de style qui permet de créer des conceptions de HUD cohérentes et maintenables pour l''interface de l''assistant AI JARVIS","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Styling-Framework, das die Erstellung konsistenter und wartbarer HUD-Designs für die JARVIS-KI-Assistenten-Oberfläche ermöglicht","pt":"Tailwind CSS é um framework de CSS que permite criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e responsivas","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это фреймворк CSS, который позволяет создавать индивидуальные и адаптивные интерфейсы пользователя","ar":"تيلويند سي إس إس هو إطار عمل سي إس إس يسمح بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتجاوبة","en":"Your friendly neighborhood GitPal!"},"definition":{"en":"Your friendly neighborhood GitPal!"},"features":{"zh":["实用程序CSS框架","一致且可维护的HUD设计","响应式布局","动画过渡","低风险的样式框架","用于全息UI面板样式"],"ja":["ユーティリティファーストCSSフレームワーク","一貫性と保守性のあるHUDデザイン","レスポンシブレイアウト","アニメーション遷移","低リスクのスタイリングフレームワーク","ホログラフィックUIパネルスタイリング"],"ko":["유틸리티 퍼스트 CSS 프레임워크","일관성과 유지 보수 가능한 HUD 디자인","반응형 레이아웃","애니메이션 전환","저위험의 스타일링 프레임워크","홀로그래픽 UI 패널 스타일링"],"es":["Diseño de HUD con utilidades de CSS","Diseños de panel de UI holográfico","Diseños de layout de HUD responsivos","Utilidades de animación para transiciones","Estructura de archivo dividida","Patrones avanzados en la carpeta de referencias"],"fr":["Conception de HUD avec des utilités de CSS","Conceptions de panneau d''UI holographique","Conceptions de layout de HUD responsives","Utilités d''animation pour transitions","Structure de fichier divisée","Modèles avancés dans le dossier de références"],"de":["HUD-Design mit CSS-Utility","Holografische UI-Panel-Designs","Responsives HUD-Layout-Design","Animations-Utilities für Übergänge","Getrennte Dateistruktur","Erweiterte Muster im Verzeichnis der Referenzen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de layouts responsivos","Utilitários de animação para transições","Padrões avançados de design","Integração com outros frameworks de CSS","Documentação completa e suporte à comunidade"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Разработка адаптивных макетов","Утилиты анимации для переходов","Продвинутые шаблоны дизайна","Интеграция с другими фреймворками CSS","Полная документация и поддержка сообщества"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير تخطيطات متجاوبة","أدوات التحرير للتحولات","قوالب تصميم متقدمة","التكامل مع إطارات عمل سي إس إس الأخرى","توثيق كامل ودعم المجتمع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","实用程序CSS","HUD设计","响应式布局","动画过渡","全息UI","低风险的样式框架","CSS开发","前端开发"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","ユーティリティファーストCSS","HUDデザイン","レスポンシブレイアウト","アニメーション遷移","ホログラフィックUI","低リスクのスタイリングフレームワーク","CSS開発","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","유틸리티 퍼스트 CSS","HUD 디자인","반응형 레이아웃","애니메이션 전환","홀로그래픽 UI","저위험의 스타일링 프레임워크","CSS 개발","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","diseño de HUD","CSS utilitario","framework de estilo","asistente AI","interfaz de usuario","diseño de panel de UI","diseño de layout de HUD","animación de transición"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","conception de HUD","CSS utilitaire","framework de style","assistant AI","interface utilisateur","conception de panneau d''UI","conception de layout de HUD","animation de transition"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","HUD-Design","CSS-Utility","Styling-Framework","KI-Assistent","Benutzeroberfläche","UI-Panel-Design","HUD-Layout-Design","Übergangsanimation"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento web","Interface de usuário","Layout responsivo","Animção","Utility-first","Framework de CSS","Desenvolvimento de software","Tecnologia da informação"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","Веб-разработка","Интерфейс пользователя","Адаптивный макет","Анимация","Utility-first","Фреймворк CSS","Разработка программного обеспечения","Информационные технологии"],"ar":["تيلويند سي إس إس","تطوير الويب","واجهة المستخدم","تخطيط متجاوب","التحرير","Utility-First","إطار عمل سي إس إس","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"mhbdev","repo":"git-pal","repoPath":"mhbdev/git-pal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss","description":"Tailwind CSS utility-first styling for JARVIS UI components","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development Skill\n\n> **File Organization**: This skill uses split structure. See `references/` for advanced patterns.\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nThis skill provides Tailwind CSS expertise for styling the JARVIS AI Assistant interface with utility-first CSS, creating consistent and maintainable HUD designs.\n\n**Risk Level**: LOW - Styling framework with minimal security surface\n\n**Primary Use Cases**:\n- Holographic UI panel styling\n- Responsive HUD layouts\n- Animation utilities for transition","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development Skill\n\n> **File Organization**: This skill uses split structure. See `references/` for advanced patterns.\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nThis skill provides Tailwind CSS expertise for styling the JARVIS AI Assistant interface with utility-first CSS, creating consistent and maintainable HUD designs.\n\n**Risk Level**: LOW - Styling framework with minimal security surface\n\n**Primary Use Cases**:\n- Holographic UI panel styling\n- Responsive HUD layouts\n- Animation utilities for transitions\n- Custom JARVIS theme configuration\n\n## 2. Core Responsibilities\n\n### 2.1 Fundamental Principles\n\n1. **TDD First**: Write component tests before styling implementation\n2. **Performance Aware**: Optimize CSS output size and rendering performance\n3. **Utility-First**: Compose styles from utility classes, extract components when patterns repeat\n4. **Design System**: Define JARVIS color palette and spacing in config\n5. **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first with breakpoint utilities\n6. **Dark Mode Default**: HUD is always dark-themed\n7. **Accessibility**: Maintain sufficient contrast ratios\n\n## 3. Implementation Workflow (TDD)\n\n### 3.1 TDD Process for Styled Components\n\nFollow this workflow for every styled component:\n\n#### Step 1: Write Failing Test First\n\n```typescript\n// tests/components/HUDPanel.test.ts\nimport { describe, it, expect } from ''vitest''\nimport { mount } from ''@vue/test-utils''\nimport HUDPanel from ''~/components/HUDPanel.vue''\n\ndescribe(''HUDPanel'', () => {\n  it(''renders with correct JARVIS theme classes'', () => {\n    const wrapper = mount(HUDPanel, {\n      props: { title: ''System Status'' }\n    })\n\n    const panel = wrapper.find(''[data-testid=\"hud-panel\"]'')\n    expect(panel.classes()).toContain(''bg-jarvis-bg-panel/80'')\n    expect(panel.classes()).toContain(''border-jarvis-primary/30'')\n    expect(panel.classes()).toContain(''backdrop-blur-sm'')\n  })\n\n  it(''applies responsive grid layout'', () => {\n    const wrapper = mount(HUDPanel)\n    const grid = wrapper.find(''[data-testid=\"panel-grid\"]'')\n\n    expect(grid.classes()).toContain(''grid-cols-1'')\n    expect(grid.classes()).toContain(''md:grid-cols-2'')\n    expect(grid.classes()).toContain(''lg:grid-cols-3'')\n  })\n\n  it(''shows correct status indicator colors'', async () => {\n    const wrapper = mount(HUDPanel, {\n      props: { status: ''active'' }\n    })\n\n    const indicator = wrapper.find(''[data-testid=\"status-indicator\"]'')\n    expect(indicator.classes()).toContain(''bg-jarvis-primary'')\n    expect(indicator.classes()).toContain(''animate-pulse'')\n\n    await wrapper.setProps({ status: ''error'' })\n    expect(indicator.classes()).toContain(''bg-jarvis-danger'')\n  })\n\n  it(''maintains accessibility focus styles'', () => {\n    const wrapper = mount(HUDPanel)\n    const button = wrapper.find(''button'')\n\n    expect(button.classes()).toContain(''focus:ring-2'')\n    expect(button.classes()).toContain(''focus:outline-none'')\n  })\n})\n```\n\n#### Step 2: Implement Minimum to Pass\n\n```vue\n<!-- components/HUDPanel.vue -->\n<template>\n  <div\n    data-testid=\"hud-panel\"\n    class=\"bg-jarvis-bg-panel/80 border border-jarvis-primary/30 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-4\"\n  >\n    <div\n      data-testid=\"panel-grid\"\n      class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"\n    >\n      <slot />\n    </div>\n    <span\n      data-testid=\"status-indicator\"\n      :class=\"statusClasses\"\n    />\n    <button class=\"focus:ring-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-jarvis-primary\">\n      Action\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { computed } from ''vue''\n\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  title?: string\n  status?: ''active'' | ''warning'' | ''error'' | ''inactive''\n}>()\n\nconst statusClasses = computed(() => ({\n  ''bg-jarvis-primary animate-pulse'': props.status === ''active'',\n  ''bg-jarvis-warning'': props.status === ''warning'',\n  ''bg-jarvis-danger'': props.status === ''error'',\n  ''bg-gray-500'': props.status === ''inactive''\n}))\n</script>\n```\n\n#### Step 3: Refactor if Needed\n\nExtract repeated patterns to @apply directives:\n\n```css\n/* assets/css/components.css */\n@layer components {\n  .hud-panel {\n    @apply bg-jarvis-bg-panel/80 border border-jarvis-primary/30 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-4;\n  }\n\n  .hud-grid {\n    @apply grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Step 4: Run Full Verification\n\n```bash\n# Run all style-related tests\nnpm run test -- --grep \"HUDPanel\"\n\n# Check for unused CSS\nnpx tailwindcss --content ''./components/**/*.vue'' --output /dev/null\n\n# Verify build size\nnpm run build && ls -lh .output/public/_nuxt/*.css\n```\n\n## 4. Performance Patterns\n\n### 4.1 Purge Optimization\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js\n// Good: Specific content paths\nexport default {\n  content: [\n    ''./components/**/*.{vue,js,ts}'',\n    ''./layouts/**/*.vue'',\n    ''./pages/**/*.vue'',\n    ''./composables/**/*.ts''\n  ]\n}\n\n// Bad: Too broad, includes unused files\nexport default {\n  content: [''./src/**/*'']  // Includes tests, stories, etc.\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 JIT Mode Efficiency\n\n```javascript\n// Good: Let JIT generate only used utilities\nexport default {\n  mode: ''jit'',  // Default in v3+\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      // Only extend what you need\n      colors: {\n        jarvis: {\n          primary: ''#00ff41'',\n          secondary: ''#0891b2''\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Bad: Defining unused variants\nexport default {\n  variants: {\n    extend: {\n      backgroundColor: [''active'', ''group-hover'', ''disabled'']  // May not use all\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4.3 @apply Extraction Strategy\n\n```vue\n<!-- Good: Extract when pattern repeats 3+ times -->\n<style>\n@layer components {\n  .btn-jarvis {\n    @apply px-4 py-2 rounded font-medium transition-all duration-200\n           focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<!-- Bad: @apply for single-use styles -->\n<style>\n.my-unique-element {\n  @apply p-4 m-2 text-white;  /* Just use utilities in template */\n}\n</style>\n```\n\n### 4.4 Responsive Breakpoints Efficiency\n\n```vue\n<!-- Good: Mobile-first, minimal breakpoints -->\n<div class=\"p-2 md:p-4 lg:p-6\">\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4\">\n</div>\n\n<!-- Bad: Redundant breakpoint definitions -->\n<div class=\"p-2 sm:p-2 md:p-4 lg:p-4 xl:p-6\">\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2\">\n</div>\n```\n\n### 4.5 Dark Mode Efficiency\n\n```javascript\n// Good: Single dark mode strategy (JARVIS is always dark)\nexport default {\n  darkMode: ''class'',  // Use ''class'' for explicit control\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        jarvis: {\n          bg: {\n            dark: ''#0a0a0f'',  // Define dark colors directly\n            panel: ''#111827''\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Bad: Light/dark variants when app is always dark\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900\">  // Unnecessary light styles\n```\n\n### 4.6 Animation Performance\n\n```javascript\n// Good: GPU-accelerated properties\nexport default {\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      keyframes: {\n        glow: {\n          ''0%, 100%'': { opacity: ''0.5'' },  // opacity is GPU-accelerated\n          ''50%'': { opacity: ''1'' }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Bad: Layout-triggering properties\nkeyframes: {\n  resize: {\n    ''0%'': { width: ''100px'' },  // Triggers layout recalc\n    ''100%'': { width: ''200px'' }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. Technology Stack & Versions\n\n### 5.1 Recommended Versions\n\n| Package | Version | Notes |\n|---------|---------|-------|\n| tailwindcss | ^3.4.0 | Latest with JIT mode |\n| @nuxtjs/tailwindcss | ^6.0.0 | Nuxt integration |\n| tailwindcss-animate | ^1.0.0 | Animation utilities |\n\n### 5.2 Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js\nexport default {\n  content: [\n    ''./components/**/*.{vue,js,ts}'',\n    ''./layouts/**/*.vue'',\n    ''./pages/**/*.vue'',\n    ''./composables/**/*.ts'',\n    ''./plugins/**/*.ts''\n  ],\n  darkMode: ''class'',\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        jarvis: {\n          primary: ''#00ff41'',\n          secondary: ''#0891b2'',\n          warning: ''#f59e0b'',\n          danger: ''#ef4444'',\n          bg: {\n            dark: ''#0a0a0f'',\n            panel: ''#111827''\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      fontFamily: {\n        mono: [''JetBrains Mono'', ''monospace''],\n        display: [''Orbitron'', ''sans-serif'']\n      },\n      animation: {\n        ''pulse-slow'': ''pulse 3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite'',\n        ''scan'': ''scan 2s linear infinite'',\n        ''glow'': ''glow 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate''\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        scan: {\n          ''0%'': { transform: ''translateY(-100%)'' },\n          ''100%'': { transform: ''translateY(100%)'' }\n        },\n        glow: {\n          ''0%'': { boxShadow: ''0 0 5px #00ff41'' },\n          ''100%'': { boxShadow: ''0 0 20px #00ff41'' }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    require(''@tailwindcss/forms''),\n    require(''tailwindcss-animate'')\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 6. Implementation Patterns\n\n### 6.1 HUD Panel Component\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div class=\"\n    relative\n    bg-jarvis-bg-panel/80\n    border border-jarvis-primary/30\n    rounded-lg\n    p-4\n    backdrop-blur-sm\n    shadow-lg shadow-jarvis-primary/10\n  \">\n    <!-- Scanline overlay -->\n    <div class=\"\n      absolute inset-0\n      bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-jarvis-primary/5 to-transparent\n      animate-scan\n      pointer-events-none\n    \" />\n\n    <!-- Content -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n      <h3 class=\"\n        font-display\n        text-jarvis-primary\n        text-lg\n        uppercase\n        tracking-wider\n        mb-2\n      \">\n        {{ title }}\n      </h3>\n      <slot />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### 6.2 Status Indicator\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n    <span :class=\"[\n      ''w-2 h-2 rounded-full'',\n      {\n        ''bg-jarvis-primary animate-pulse'': status === ''active'',\n        ''bg-jarvis-warning'': status === ''warning'',\n        ''bg-jarvis-danger animate-ping'': status === ''error'',\n        ''bg-gray-500'': status === ''inactive''\n      }\n    ]\" />\n    <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">{{ label }}</span>\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### 6.3 Button Variants\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <button :class=\"[\n    ''px-4 py-2 rounded font-medium transition-all duration-200'',\n    ''focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-jarvis-bg-dark'',\n    {\n      ''bg-jarvis-primary text-black hover:bg-jarvis-primary/90 focus:ring-jarvis-primary'':\n        variant === ''primary'',\n      ''bg-transparent border border-jarvis-secondary text-jarvis-secondary hover:bg-jarvis-secondary/10 focus:ring-jarvis-secondary'':\n        variant === ''secondary'',\n      ''bg-jarvis-danger text-white hover:bg-jarvis-danger/90 focus:ring-jarvis-danger'':\n        variant === ''danger''\n    }\n  ]\">\n    <slot />\n  </button>\n</template>\n```\n\n## 7. Quality Standards\n\n### 7.1 Accessibility\n\n```vue\n<!-- Good - Sufficient contrast -->\n<span class=\"text-jarvis-primary\"><!-- #00ff41 on dark bg --></span>\n\n<!-- Good - Focus visible -->\n<button class=\"focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jarvis-primary focus:outline-none\">\n\n<!-- Good - Screen reader text -->\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Status: Active</span>\n```\n\n## 8. Common Mistakes & Anti-Patterns\n\n### 8.1 Anti-Patterns\n\n#### Avoid: Excessive Custom CSS\n\n```vue\n<!-- Bad - Custom CSS when utilities exist -->\n<style>\n.custom-panel {\n  padding: 1rem;\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\n}\n</style>\n\n<!-- Good - Use utilities -->\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg\">\n```\n\n#### Avoid: Inconsistent Spacing\n\n```vue\n<!-- Bad - Mixed spacing values -->\n<div class=\"p-3 mt-5 mb-2\">\n\n<!-- Good - Consistent scale -->\n<div class=\"p-4 my-4\">\n```\n\n#### Avoid: Hardcoded Colors\n\n```vue\n<!-- Bad - Hardcoded hex -->\n<div class=\"text-[#00ff41]\">\n\n<!-- Good - Theme color -->\n<div class=\"text-jarvis-primary\">\n```\n\n## 9. Pre-Implementation Checklist\n\n### Phase 1: Before Writing Code\n\n- [ ] Write component tests for expected class applications\n- [ ] Verify JARVIS theme colors are defined in config\n- [ ] Check content paths include all source files\n- [ ] Review existing components for reusable patterns\n\n### Phase 2: During Implementation\n\n- [ ] Use utilities before custom CSS\n- [ ] Apply consistent spacing scale (4, 8, 12, 16...)\n- [ ] Include focus states for all interactive elements\n- [ ] Test responsive breakpoints at each size\n- [ ] Use theme colors, never hardcoded hex values\n\n### Phase 3: Before Committing\n\n- [ ] All component tests pass: `npm test`\n- [ ] Build completes without CSS errors: `npm run build`\n- [ ] Check CSS bundle size hasn''t grown unexpectedly\n- [ ] Verify no unused @apply extractions\n- [ ] Test accessibility with keyboard navigation\n\n## 10. Summary\n\nTailwind CSS provides utility-first styling for JARVIS:\n\n1. **TDD**: Write tests for class applications before implementation\n2. **Performance**: Optimize content paths and use JIT mode\n3. **Theme**: Define JARVIS colors and fonts in config\n4. **Utilities**: Compose styles from utilities, extract patterns with @apply\n5. **Accessibility**: Maintain focus states and sufficient contrast\n\n**Remember**: The JARVIS HUD has a distinct visual identity - maintain consistency with the theme configuration and test all styling with vitest.\n\n---\n\n**References**:\n- `references/advanced-patterns.md` - Complex layout patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:49:38.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing utility-first CSS styling for responsive and maintainable interfaces.","zh":"非常适合需要基于实用性CSS样式的响应式和可维护界面的前端代理。","ja":"ユーティリティ第一のCSSスタイリングが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"유틸리티 우선 CSS 스타일링이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan estilos de CSS de utilidad primera para interfaces responsivas y mantenibles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de styles CSS de première utilité pour des interfaces responsives et maintenables.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Utility-First-CSS-Styling für responsive und wartbare Schnittstellen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de estilização de CSS com utilidade em primeiro lugar para interfaces responsivas e mantidas.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым нужен CSS-стиль с утилитой в первую очередь для отзывчивых и поддерживаемых интерфейсов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق CSS بأولوية ل_interfaces الرد والمحتفظ بها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create consistent and maintainable HUD designs using utility-first CSS, enabling responsive HUD layouts and animation utilities for seamless transitions with Tailwind CSS.","zh":"使能代理创建一致且可维护的HUD设计，使用实用性CSS，实现响应式HUD布局和过渡效果的动画工具，使用Tailwind CSS实现无缝过渡。","ja":"エージェントが一貫性と維持可能なHUDデザインを作成できるようにし、ユーティリティ第一のCSSを使用してレスポンシブHUDレイアウトとアニメーション ユーティリティを実現し、Tailwind CSSを使用してシームレスな遷移を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 일관성 있고 유지 보수 가능한 HUD 디자인을 만들 수 있도록 하여, 유틸리티 우선 CSS를 사용하여 반응형 HUD 레이아웃과 애니메이션 유틸리티를 구현하고, Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 무결점 전환을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños de HUD coherentes y mantenibles utilizando CSS de utilidad primera, lo que permite diseños de HUD responsivos y utilidades de animación para transiciones sin problemas con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions de HUD cohérentes et maintenables en utilisant le CSS de première utilité, ce qui permet des dispositions de HUD responsives et des utilités d''animation pour des transitions sans problème avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, konsistente und wartbare HUD- Designs unter Verwendung von Utility-First-CSS zu erstellen, wodurch responsive HUD-Layouts und Animations-Utilities für nahtlose Übergänge mit Tailwind CSS ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos de HUD consistentes e mantidos usando CSS com utilidade em primeiro lugar, permitindo layouts de HUD responsivos e utilitários de animação para transições sem problemas com o Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать последовательные и поддерживаемые конструкции HUD, используя CSS с утилитой в первую очередь, что позволяет создавать отзывчивые макеты HUD и утилиты анимации для бесшовных переходов с помощью Tailwind CSS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء تصاميم HUD متسقة ومحتفظ بها باستخدام CSS بأولوية ل_UTIL، مما يسمح بإعدادات HUD الرد وب