, chore, docs, refactor, test","scope","English"],"es":["Comunicación efectiva en japonés","Comentarios de código y mensajes de commit en inglés","Seguimiento de Conventional Commits","Uso de tipos de commit como fix, feat, chore, docs, refactor y test","Uso de ámbito cuando sea claro"],"fr":["Communication efficace en japonais","Commentaires de code et messages de commit en anglais","Suivi de Conventional Commits","Utilisation de types de commit tels que fix, feat, chore, docs, refactor et test","Utilisation de la portée lorsque cela est clair"],"de":["Effektive Kommunikation auf Japanisch","Code-Kommentare und Commit-Mitteilungen auf Englisch","Verfolgung von Conventional Commits","Verwendung von Commit-Typen wie fix, feat, chore, docs, refactor und test","Verwendung des Umfangs, wenn dieser klar ist"],"pt":["Modelo prático para construir habilidades de agentes de IA","Uso de Python, FastAPI e DDD","Estrutura para escrever commites e mensagens de commit claras","Seguimento das convenções de commit","Suporte à comunicação em japonês","Comentários de código e mensagens de commit em inglês"],"ru":["Практический шаблон для построения навыков агентов ИИ","Использование Python, FastAPI и DDD","Структура для написания коммитов и сообщений о коммитах rõчно","Следование конвенциям коммита","Поддержка общения на японском языке","Комментарии кода и сообщения о коммитах на английском языке"],"ar":["نموذج عملي لبناء مهارات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام Python و FastAPI و DDD","هيكل لكتابة التعهدات ورسائل التعهد بشكل واضح","التزام بالاتفاقيات التعهد","دعم الاتصال باللغة اليابانية","تعليقات الكود ورسائل التعهد باللغة الإنجليزية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI Agent Skill","Python","FastAPI","Domain-Driven Design","Conventional Commits","Commit Message","Code Comments"],"ja":["AI Agent Skill","Python","FastAPI","DDD","Conventional Commits","Commit Message","Code Comments"],"ko":["AI Agent Skill","Python","FastAPI","DDD","Conventional Commits","Commit Message","Code Comments"],"es":["commit","AI Agent Skills","Python","FastAPI","DDD","Conventional Commits","desarrollo de software","programación","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["commit","Compétences d''agent AI","Python","FastAPI","DDD","Conventional Commits","développement de logiciels","programmation","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["commit","AI-Agent-Fähigkeiten","Python","FastAPI","DDD","Conventional Commits","Softwareentwicklung","Programmierung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["commit","habilidades de agentes de IA","Python","FastAPI","DDD","convenções de commit","comunicação em japonês","comentários de código"],"ru":["коммит","навыки агентов ИИ","Python","FastAPI","DDD","конвенции коммита","общение на японском языке","комментарии кода"],"ar":["التعهد","مهارات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","Python","FastAPI","DDD","اتفاقيات التعهد","التواصل باللغة اليابانية","تعليقات الكود"]}},"owner":"iktakahiro","repo":"python-fastapi-ddd-skill","repoPath":"iktakahiro/python-fastapi-ddd-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Prepare and create git commits in this repository using Conventional Commits; use when the user asks to commit or split commits for a task.","bodyPreview":"# Commit\n\n## Communication\n\n- Communicate with the developer in Japanese.\n- Write code comments and commit messages in English.\n\n## Commit message\n\nFollow Conventional Commits: <https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/>\n\n```text\n<type>[optional scope]: <description>\n\n[optional body]\n```\n\nUse these types:\n\n- fix\n- feat\n- chore\n- docs\n- refactor\n- test\n\nUse scope when clear (directory name or skill name). Examples:\n\n- docs(python-fastapi-ddd-skill): expand DDD reference notes\n- chore(codex):","body":"# Commit\n\n## Communication\n\n- Communicate with the developer in Japanese.\n- Write code comments and commit messages in English.\n\n## Commit message\n\nFollow Conventional Commits: <https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/>\n\n```text\n<type>[optional scope]: <description>\n\n[optional body]\n```\n\nUse these types:\n\n- fix\n- feat\n- chore\n- docs\n- refactor\n- test\n\nUse scope when clear (directory name or skill name). Examples:\n\n- docs(python-fastapi-ddd-skill): expand DDD reference notes\n- chore(codex): adjust local SKILL instructions\n\n## Commit workflow\n\n- Review changes with `git status` and `git diff`.\n- This repo has no mandatory pre-commit command; do not run Node/bun/turbo checks.\n- If the user explicitly asks to commit everything (e.g., \"全体\", \"全部\", \"commit all\"), include all working tree changes without asking for confirmation.\n- Otherwise, do not ask about unrelated changes. Leave unrelated files untouched and stage only the files relevant to the task.\n- Do not bundle all task changes into a single commit. Split commits by logical change units and scope/intent (e.g., README updates vs feature changes).\n- Commit directly without extra confirmation.\n- After committing, report a brief summary of created commits.\n- Push only when the user asks.\n- Do not amend commits unless the user asks.\n\n## Allowed dot directories\n\n- `.claude`\n- `.codex`\n- `.cursor`\n- `.vscode`\n- `.kiro`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:51:25.016Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Maintenance Agents needing standardized commit message formatting with Conventional Commits.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交消息格式的代码维护代理，使用标准的提交消息格式。","ja":"Conventional Commitsを使用した標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式を必要とするコードメンテナンスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준적인 커밋 메시지 형식을 필요로 하는 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de mantenimiento de código que necesitan un formato de mensaje de confirmación estandarizado con Conventional Commits.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de maintenance de code nécessitant un format de message de commit standardisé avec Conventional Commits.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Wartungsagenten, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Nachrichtenformat mit Conventional Commits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que necessitam de formatação de mensagens de commit padronizadas com Commits Convencionais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обслуживанию кода, которым необходима стандартизированная форматировка коммит-сообщений с помощью Конвенциональных коммитов.","ar":"เหมาะ للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق رسائل الالتزام الموحدة باستخدام الالتزامات التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write informative commit messages using Conventional Commits specification, including types such as fix, feat, and chore, with optional scope and body, while maintaining English comments and Japanese developer communication.","zh":"赋予代理使用Conventional Commits规范编写信息丰富的提交消息的能力，包括fix、feat和chore等类型，具有可选的范围和正文，同时保持英文注释和日文开发者沟通。","ja":"Conventional Commitsの仕様を使用して、fix、feat、choreなどのタイプを含む情報豊富なコミットメッセージをエージェントに書くことができるようにします。スコープとボディはオプションです。また、英語のコメントと日本語の開発者コミュニケーションを維持します。","ko":"Conventional Commits 사양을 사용하여 fix, feat, chore 등의 유형을 포함하는 정보가 풍부한 커밋 메시지를 에이전트가 작성할 수 있도록 합니다. 범위와 본문은 선택 사항이며, 영어 주석 및 일본어 개발자 커뮤니케이션을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir mensajes de commit informativos utilizando la especificación Conventional Commits, incluyendo tipos como fix, feat y chore, con ámbito y cuerpo opcionales, manteniendo comentarios en inglés y comunicación de desarrolladores en japonés.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des messages de commit informatifs en utilisant la spécification Conventional Commits, notamment des types tels que fix, feat et chore, avec une portée et un corps optionnels, tout en maintenant des commentaires en anglais et une communication de développeurs en japonais.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, informative Commit-Nachrichten unter Verwendung der Conventional Commits-Spezifikation zu schreiben, einschließlich Typen wie fix, feat und chore, mit optionaler Umfang und Textkörper, während Englisch-Kommentare und Japanisch-Entwicklerkommunikation beibehalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever mensagens de commit informativas usando a especificação Conventional Commits, incluindo tipos como fix, feat e chore, com escopo e corpo opcionais, mantendo comentários em inglês e comunicação de desenvolvedores em japonês.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать информативные коммит-сообщения, используя спецификацию Конвенциональных коммитов, включая типы, такие как fix, feat и chore, с необязательным объёмом и телом, сохраняя английские комментарии и японскую коммуникацию разработчиков.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية كتابة رسائل الالتزام الإعلامية باستخدام مواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية، بما في ذلك أنواع مثل إصلاح و ميزة و مهام، مع نطاق و جسم اختياري، مع الحفاظ على التعليقات باللغة الإنجليزية والتواصل بين المطورين باللغة اليابانية."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit messages across projects","Automating commit message validation","Generating change logs based on commit history"],"zh":["项目间的提交消息标准化","自动提交消息验证","根据提交历史生成更改日志"],"ja":["プロジェクト間のコミットメッセージの標準化","自動コミットメッセージの検証","コミット履歴に基づく変更ログの生成"],"ko":["프로젝트 간 커밋 메시지 표준화","자동 커밋 메시지 검증","커밋 기록을 기반으로 변경 로그 생성"],"es":["Estandarizar mensajes de commit en proyectos","Automatizar la validación de mensajes de commit","Generar registros de cambios en función del historial de commit"],"fr":["Standardiser les messages de commit dans les projets","Automatiser la validation des messages de commit","Générer des journaux de modifications en fonction de l''historique de commit"],"de":["Standardisieren von Commit-Nachrichten in Projekten","Automatisieren der Commit-Nachrichten-Validierung","Erstellen von Änderungsprotokollen auf der Grundlage der Commit-Historie"],"pt":["Padronizar mensagens de commit em projetos","Automatizar validação de mensagens de commit","Gerar registros de alterações com base no histórico de commit"],"ru":["Стандартизировать коммит-сообщения в проектах","Автоматизировать проверку коммит-сообщений","Генерировать журналы изменений на основе истории коммитов"],"ar":["توحيد رسائل الالتزام في المشاريع","تأتمة التحقق من صحة رسائل الالتزام","توليد سجلات التغييرات بناءً على تاريخ الالتزام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits v1.0.0 specification","Limited to English comments and Japanese communication"],"zh":["需要遵守Conventional Commits v1.0.0规范","仅限英文注释和日文通信"],"ja":["Conventional Commits v1.0.0の仕様に従う必要がある","英語のコメントと日本語のコミュニケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Conventional Commits v1.0.0 사양을 따라야 함","영어 주석 및 일본어 커뮤니케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a la especificación Conventional Commits v1.0.0","Limitado a comentarios en inglés y comunicación en japonés"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhesion à la spécification Conventional Commits v1.0.0","Limité aux commentaires en anglais et à la communication en japonais"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Conventional Commits-Spezifikation v1.0.0","Begrenzt auf Englisch-Kommentare und Japanisch-Kommunikation"],"pt":["Exige aderência à especificação Conventional Commits v1.0.0","Limitado a comentários em inglês e comunicação em japonês"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения спецификации Конвенциональных коммитов v1.0.0","Ограничен английскими комментариями и японской коммуникацией"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية v1.0.0","محدود بالتعليقات باللغة الإنجليزية والتواصل باللغة اليابانية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
