ompatibilité avec README.md","Garantie de cohérence entre le code et la documentation","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Automatische Aktualisierung der Dokumentation","Synchronisation zwischen Code und Dokumentation","Dreistufige Dokumentenstruktur","Kompatibilität mit README.md","Gewährleistung der Konsistenz zwischen Code und Dokumentation","Verbesserung der EntwicklerEffizienz"],"pt":["Sincronização automática de documentação","Atualizações imediatas após alterações no código","Estrutura de documentação em três níveis","Suporte à documentação root em README.md","Garantia de consistência na documentação","Integração com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматическая синхронизация документации","Мгновенные обновления после изменений в коде","Трехуровневая структура документации","Поддержка корневой документации в README.md","Гарантия согласованности документации","Интеграция с рабочими процессами разработки"],"ar":["مراجعة تلقائية للتوثيق","تحديثات فورية بعد التغييرات في الكود","هيكل توثيق ثلاثي المستوى","دعم التوثيق الجذري في README.md","ضمان الاتساق في التوثيق","دمج مع تدفقات العمل التطويرية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动文档同步","代码变更","文档更新","开发效率","文档准确性","README.md","三层文档结构"],"ja":["自動ドキュメント同期","コードの変更","ドキュメント更新","開発効率","ドキュメントの正確性","README.md","三層ドキュメント構造"],"ko":["자동 문서 동기화","코드 변경","문서 업데이트","개발 효율성","문서 정확성","README.md","3계층 문서 구조"],"es":["doc-sync","arquitectura de documentación","sincronización de código","desarrollo de software","documentación automática","eficiencia del desarrollo","coherencia de código","patrones de documentación"],"fr":["doc-sync","architecture de documentation","synchronisation de code","développement de logiciels","documentation automatique","efficacité du développement","cohérence de code","modèles de documentation"],"de":["doc-sync","Dokumentenarchitektur","Code-Synchronisation","Software-Entwicklung","automatische Dokumentation","Entwickler-Effizienz","Code-Konsistenz","Dokumentationsmuster"],"pt":["doc-sync","sincronização de documentação","desenvolvimento de software","documentação automática","README.md","desenvolvimento ágil","integração contínua","entrega contínua"],"ru":["doc-sync","синхронизация документации","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматическая документация","README.md","гибкая разработка","продолженная интеграция","продолженная доставка"],"ar":["doc-sync","مراجعة التوثيق","تطوير البرمجيات","توثيق تلقائي","README.md","تطوير مرن","تكامل مستمر","توصيل مستمر"]}},"owner":"LixvYang","repo":"common-skills","repoPath":"LixvYang/common-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-sync","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Doc-Sync: Self-Documenting Architecture\n\nThis Skill enforces a strict documentation synchronization pattern where code changes automatically update all related documentation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Documentation = Code**: Any functional, architectural, or implementation change MUST update its corresponding documentation immediately after work completes.\n\n## Three-Level Documentation Structure\n\n### Level 1: Root Documentation (README.md)\n\nEvery project root MUST have a `README.md` that states:","body":"# Doc-Sync: Self-Documenting Architecture\n\nThis Skill enforces a strict documentation synchronization pattern where code changes automatically update all related documentation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Documentation = Code**: Any functional, architectural, or implementation change MUST update its corresponding documentation immediately after work completes.\n\n## Three-Level Documentation Structure\n\n### Level 1: Root Documentation (README.md)\n\nEvery project root MUST have a `README.md` that states:\n\n```markdown\n# Project Documentation Sync Contract\n\n**CRITICAL**: Any feature, architecture, or implementation update MUST update:\n1. This root README.md (high-level changes)\n2. The relevant folder''s folder.md (structure changes)\n3. All affected files'' header annotations (implementation changes)\n\nAfter completing ANY work, update documentation BEFORE committing.\n```\n\n### Level 2: Folder Documentation (folder.md)\n\n**Every folder** MUST contain a `folder.md` file with:\n\n```markdown\n# Folder Architecture\n\n## Overview (max 3 lines)\n[Brief description of this folder''s purpose and scope]\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Role | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| filename.ext | [role: controller/service/model/util] | [what it does] |\n| filename2.ext | [role] | [what it does] |\n\n---\n**SYNC ALERT**: If this folder changes (files added/removed/renamed), UPDATE THIS FILE.\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```markdown\n# src/auth Module\n\n## Overview\nAuthentication and authorization layer handling JWT validation, session management, and role-based access control.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Role | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| index.ts | Controller | HTTP routing, request validation |\n| service.ts | Service | Business logic, token generation |\n| model.ts | Model | TypeBox schemas, DTOs |\n| middleware.ts | Middleware | Request interception, guards |\n\n---\nSYNC ALERT: If this folder changes, UPDATE THIS FILE.\n```\n\n### Level 3: File Header Annotations\n\n**Every source file** MUST start with:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: [external dependencies: imports, env vars, services]\n * OUTPUT: [what this exports/provides: functions, types, values]\n * POSITION: [local role in system architecture: controller/service/model/util]\n *\n * SYNC: If this file changes, UPDATE this header AND the parent folder.md\n */\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n**Controller** (`index.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: Request (Express/Elysia), body validation schemas\n * OUTPUT: HTTP responses, status codes, error handlers\n * POSITION: Entry point - handles HTTP layer only\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nimport { service } from ''./service''\n\nexport const handler = (req: Request) => service.process(req)\n```\n\n**Service** (`service.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: Validated request data, database client, external APIs\n * OUTPUT: Business logic results, domain entities\n * POSITION: Core logic - decoupled from HTTP, pure business rules\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nexport const process = (data: Data) => { /* ... */ }\n```\n\n**Model** (`model.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: TypeBox/T, Zod, or validation library\n * OUTPUT: Validation schemas, TypeScript types, DTOs\n * POSITION: Data contract - defines interface between layers\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nimport { t } from ''elysia''\n\nexport const UserSchema = t.Object({ /* ... */ })\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen creating or modifying code:\n\n1. **Before coding**: Read existing folder.md to understand context\n2. **During coding**: Focus on implementation\n3. **After coding (MANDATORY)**:\n   - Update file header (INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION)\n   - Update folder.md if structure changed\n   - Update README.md if architecture changed\n   - Commit ONLY after all docs updated\n\n## Commands\n\n### Create new file with template:\n```bash\n# Creates file with doc-sync header\ncat > src/newFile.ts << ''EOF''\n/**\n * INPUT: [TODO]\n * OUTPUT: [TODO]\n * POSITION: [TODO]\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nEOF\n```\n\n### Check documentation coverage:\n```bash\n# Find folders missing folder.md\nfind . -type d -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" -not -path \"*/.git/*\" | while read dir; do\n  if [ ! -f \"$dir/folder.md\" ]; then\n    echo \"Missing: $dir/folder.md\"\n  fi\ndone\n\n# Find files missing header annotations\ngrep -rL \"INPUT:\" src/ || echo \"All files have headers\"\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore committing, verify:\n\n- [ ] Root README.md updated (for architectural changes)\n- [ ] Every affected folder has folder.md\n- [ ] Every folder.md lists all files with roles\n- [ ] Every file has INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION header\n- [ ] SYNC reminders present in all folder.md and file headers\n- [ ] No \"TODO\" in INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION fields\n\n## Examples\n\nSee [examples/](examples/) for complete project structures:\n- `basic-auth/` - Simple auth module with full doc-sync\n- `ecommerce/` - Multi-module project\n- `api-service/` - Layered architecture\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Update immediately**: Don''t batch doc updates\n- **Be specific**: INPUT should list actual imports, not \"various\"\n- **Keep POSITION brief**: One line describing architectural role\n- **Folder overview max 3 lines**: Keep it scannable\n- **Use tables**: folder.md files section MUST use markdown table\n- **No exceptions**: Even test files need headers\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Don''t**:\n- Leave \"TODO\" in headers\n- Update docs in separate PR\n- Skip folder.md for \"simple\" folders\n- Copy-paste headers without updating INPUT/OUTPUT\n- Write POSITION as \"utility file\" (be specific: \"validation utility for user input\")\n\n✅ **Do**:\n- Update docs as part of the same commit\n- Run validation checklist before push\n- Treat docs as code, not comments\n- Review folder.md changes in code review\n\n## Advanced: Nested Folder Sync\n\nFor deep hierarchies, each level updates its parent:\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── folder.md (mentions modules/ as subdirectory)\n└── modules/\n    ├── folder.md (lists auth/, user/ subdirs)\n    └── auth/\n        ├── folder.md (lists index.ts, service.ts, model.ts)\n        └── index.ts (has INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION)\n```\n\nWhen `auth/index.ts` changes:\n1. Update its header\n2. Update `auth/folder.md`\n3. Update `modules/folder.md`\n4. Update `src/folder.md` (if role changed)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:51:58.190Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Maintenance Agents needing automated documentation updates.","zh":"非常适合需要自动更新文档的代码维护代理。","ja":"コードメンテナンスエージェントが自動ドキュメント更新を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 유지 보수 에이전트가 자동 문서 업데이트를 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de mantenimiento de código que necesitan actualizaciones automatizadas de documentación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de maintenance de code ayant besoin de mises à jour automatiques de documentation.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Wartungsagenten, die automatisierte Dokumentenaktualisierungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que necessitam de atualizações de documentação automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по обслуживанию кода, которым необходимы автоматические обновления документации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل صيانة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات وثائقية آليّة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a strict documentation synchronization pattern, ensuring that code changes automatically update related Markdown documentation, including README.md files, using a three-level documentation structure.","zh":"赋予代理执行严格的文档同步模式的能力，确保代码更改自动更新相关的Markdown文档，包括README.md文件，使用三层文档结构。","ja":"エージェントが厳格なドキュメント同期パターンを実施できるようにし、コードの変更が関連するMarkdownドキュメント、包括README.mdファイルを自動的に更新する、三層のドキュメント構造を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 문서 동기화 패턴을 적용할 수 있도록 하여 코드 변경이 관련 Markdown 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하도록 하며, README.md 파일을 포함하여 3단계 문서 구조를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un patrón estricto de sincronización de documentación, asegurando que los cambios de código actualicen automáticamente la documentación relacionada en Markdown, incluyendo archivos README.md, utilizando una estructura de documentación de tres niveles.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un modèle strict de synchronisation de documentation, garantissant que les modifications de code mettent à jour automatiquement la documentation Markdown associée, y compris les fichiers README.md, en utilisant une structure de documentation à trois niveaux.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein strenges Dokumentensynchronisationsmuster durchzusetzen, damit Codeänderungen automatisch die zugehörige Markdown-Dokumentation aktualisieren, einschließlich README.md-Dateien, unter Verwendung einer dreistufigen Dokumentenstruktur.","pt":"Permite que os agentes imponham um padrão estrito de sincronização de documentação, garantindo que as alterações de código atualizem automaticamente a documentação relacionada em Markdown, incluindo arquivos README.md, utilizando uma estrutura de documentação de três níveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить строгий шаблон синхронизации документации, гарантируя, что изменения кода автоматически обновляют связанную документацию в формате Markdown, включая файлы README.md, с использованием трехуровневой структуры документации.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتطبيق نمط متزامن صارم للوثائق، مما يضمن أن يتم تحديث التغييرات في الشفرة تلقائيًا لتطابق الوثائق المرتبطة بالشفرة في صيغة Markdown، بما في ذلك ملفات README.md، باستخدام هيكل وثائقي من ثلاثة مستويات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates after code changes","Generating consistent README.md files","Synchronizing functional and architectural documentation"],"zh":["代码更改后自动更新文档","生成一致的README.md文件","同步功能和架构文档"],"ja":["コード変更後のドキュメント自動更新","一貫性のあるREADME.mdファイルの生成","機能とアーキテクチャドキュメントの同期"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 문서 자동 업데이트","일관된 README.md 파일 생성","기능 및 아키텍처 문서 동기화"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de documentación después de cambios de código","Generar archivos README.md coherentes","Sincronizar documentación funcional y arquitectónica"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de documentation après des modifications de code","Générer des fichiers README.md cohérents","Synchroniser la documentation fonctionnelle et architecturale"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumentenaktualisierungen nach Codeänderungen","Erstellen konsistenter README.md-Dateien","Synchronisieren von funktionaler und architektonischer Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação após alterações de código","Gerar arquivos README.md consistentes","Sincronizar documentação funcional e arquitetônica"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации после изменений кода","Генерировать последовательные файлы README.md","Синхронизировать функциональную и архитектурную документацию"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات آلية للوثائق بعد تغييرات في الشفرة","إنشاء ملفات README.md متسقة","متزامنة الوثائق الوظيفية والهيكلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to documentation = code principle","Limited to Markdown documentation format"],"zh":["需要严格遵守文档等同于代码的原则","仅限Markdown文档格式"],"ja":["ドキュメント=コードの原則に厳格に従う必要がある","Markdownドキュメント形式のみに限定される"],"ko":["문서는 코드와 동일한 원칙을 엄격히 지켜야 함","Markdown 문서 형식만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión al principio de documentación = código","Limitado al formato de documentación Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte au principe de documentation = code","Limité au format de documentation Markdown"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung des Dokumentations- = -Code-Prinzips","Begrenzt auf das Markdown-Dokumentenformat"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita ao princípio de documentação = código","Limitado ao formato de documentação Markdown"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения принципа документация = код","Ограничен форматом документации Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب امتثالاً صارماً لمبدأ الوثيقة = الشفرة","محدود بصيغة الوثائق Markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HerbertGao/qsl-cardhub/openspec-ff-change', 'community', 'HerbertGao', 'qsl-cardhub', 'HerbertGao/qsl-cardhub', 'openspec-ff-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z', '2026-02-18T06:51:25.170Z', NULL, '{"id":"HerbertGao/qsl-cardhub/openspec-ff-change","name":"openspec-ff-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change 技术文档，用于快速完成产出物创建，包括变更目录创建和产出物构建顺序获取","ja":"openspec-ff-change 技術文書は、迅速に成果物を作成するために、変更ディレクトリの作成と成果物の構築順序の取得を含む","ko":"openspec-ff-change 기술 문서는 빠르게 성과물을 생성하기 위해 변경 디렉토리 생성과 성과물의 구축 순서를 얻는 기능을 포함","es":"openspec-ff-change es una habilidad que permite la creación rápida de cambios. Genera un cambio con un solo comando y sigue los pasos para completar la implementación","fr":"openspec-ff-change est une compétence qui permet la création rapide de changements. Générez un changement avec une seule commande et suivez les étapes pour compléter la mise en œuvre","de":"openspec-ff-change ist eine Fähigkeit, die den schnellen Aufbau von Änderungen ermöglicht. Erstellen Sie eine Änderung mit einem einzigen Befehl und folgen Sie den Schritten zur Vervollständigung der Implementierung","pt":"O openspec-ff-change é uma ferramenta que permite criar mudanças rapidamente, fornecendo uma maneira eficiente de gerar diretórios e obter a ordem de construção de artefatos.","ru":"openspec-ff-change - это инструмент, который позволяет быстро создавать изменения, предоставляя эффективный способ генерации директорий и получения порядка сборки артефактов","ar":"openspec-ff-change هو أداة تمكنك من إنشاء التغييرات بسرعة، مما يوفر وسيلة فعالة لإنشاء الدلائل والحصول على ترتيب بناء الملفات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change 技术文档","ja":"openspec-ff-change 技術文書","ko":"openspec-ff-change 기술 문서","es":"openspec-ff-change: Creación Rápida de Cambios","fr":"openspec-ff-change: Création Rapide de Changements","de":"openspec-ff-change: Schneller Aufbau von Änderungen","pt":"Crie Mudanças Rápidas com openspec-ff-change","ru":"Быстрое Создание Изменений с openspec-ff-change","ar":"إنشاء تغييرات سريعة مع openspec-ff-change","en":"openspec-ff-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change 技术文档，用于快速完成产出物创建，包括变更目录创建和产出物构建顺序获取","ja":"openspec-ff-change 技術文書は、迅速に成果物を作成するために、変更ディレクトリの作成と成果物の構築順序の取得を含む","ko":"openspec-ff-change 기술 문서는 빠르게 성과물을 생성하기 위해 변경 디렉토리 생성과 성과물의 구축 순서를 얻는 기능을 포함","es":"openspec-ff-change es una habilidad que permite la creación rápida de cambios. Genera un cambio con un solo comando y sigue los pasos para completar la imple...","fr":"openspec-ff-change est une compétence qui permet la création rapide de changements. Générez un changement avec une seule commande et suivez les étapes pour c...","de":"openspec-ff-change ist eine Fähigkeit, die den schnellen Aufbau von Änderungen ermöglicht. Erstellen Sie eine Änderung mit einem einzigen Befehl und folgen S...","pt":"O openspec-ff-change é uma ferramenta que permite criar mudanças rapidamente, fornecendo uma maneira eficiente de gerar diretórios e obter a ordem de constru...","ru":"openspec-ff-change - это инструмент, который позволяет быстро создавать изменения, предоставляя эффективный способ генерации директорий и получения порядка с...","ar":"openspec-ff-change هو أداة تمكنك من إنشاء التغييرات بسرعة، مما يوفر وسيلة فعالة لإنشاء الدلائل والحصول على ترتيب بناء الملفات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速创建变更目录","获取产出物构建顺序","支持开发者快速完成产出物创建","使用 openspec-cn 工具","支持 kebab-case 名称推导","开发者友好界面"],"ja":["迅速に変更ディレクトリを作成","成果物の構築順序を取得","開発者が迅速に成果物を作成することをサポート","openspec-cn ツールを使用","kebab-case 名称の推論をサポート","開発者向けのインターフェース"],"ko":["빠르게 변경 디렉토리를 생성","성과물의 구축 순서를 얻음","개발자가 빠르게 성과물을 생성하는 것을 지원","openspec-cn 툴을 사용","kebab-case 이름의 推론을 지원","개발자를 위한 인터페이스"],"es":["Creación rápida de cambios","Generación de cambios con un solo comando","Simplificación del proceso de creación","Soporte para la creación de cambios personalizados","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Création rapide de changements","Génération de changements avec une seule commande","Simplification du processus de création","Prise en charge de la création de changements personnalisés","Intégration avec des outils de développement existants"],"de":["Schneller Aufbau von Änderungen","Erstellung von Änderungen mit einem einzigen Befehl","Vereinfachung des Erstellungsprozesses","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Änderungen","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Criação rápida de diretórios","Geração automática de kebab-case","Obtenção da ordem de construção de artefatos","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Criação de mudanças personalizadas"],"ru":["Быстрая генерация директорий","Автоматическое создание kebab-case","Получение порядка сборки артефактов","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Создание пользовательских изменений"],"ar":["إنشاء دلائل سريع","إنشاء تلقائي ل kebab-case","الحصول على ترتيب بناء الملفات","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","إنشاء تغييرات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-ff-change","快速创建产出物","开发者技术文档","变更目录创建","产出物构建顺序","openspec-cn 工具","kebab-case 名称推导"],"ja":["openspec-ff-change","迅速な成果物作成","開発者技術文書","変更ディレクトリの作成","成果物の構築順序","openspec-cn ツール","kebab-case 名称の推論"],"ko":["openspec-ff-change","빠른 성과물 생성","개발자 기술 문서","변경 디렉토리 생성","성과물의 구축 순서","openspec-cn 툴","kebab-case 이름의 推론"],"es":["creación de cambios","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","openspec-ff-change","changements","desarrollo ágil"],"fr":["création de changements","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","openspec-ff-change","changements","développement agile"],"de":["Änderungserstellung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","openspec-ff-change","Änderungen","agiles Entwicklung"],"pt":["openspec-ff-change","criação de mudanças","automação de diretórios","kebab-case","ordem de construção de artefatos","ferramenta de automação"],"ru":["openspec-ff-change","создание изменений","автоматизация директорий","kebab-case","порядок сборки артефактов","инструмент автоматизации"],"ar":["openspec-ff-change","إنشاء التغييرات","أتمتة الدلائل","kebab-case","ترتيب بناء الملفات","أداة أتمتة"]}},"owner":"HerbertGao","repo":"qsl-cardhub","repoPath":"HerbertGao/qsl-cardhub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"快速创建实现所需的所有产出物。当用户想要快速创建实现所需的所有产出物，而不是逐个创建时使用。","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"快速完成产出物创建 - 一次性生成开始实现所需的一切。\n\n**输入**：用户的请求应包含变更名称（kebab-case）或对他们想要构建内容的描述。\n\n**步骤**\n\n1. **如果没有提供明确的输入，询问他们想要构建什么**\n\n   使用 **AskUserQuestion tool**（开放式，无预设选项）询问：\n   > \"您想要处理什么变更？请描述您想要构建或修复的内容。\"\n\n   根据他们的描述，推导出一个 kebab-case 名称（例如：\"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`）。\n\n   **重要提示**：在不了解用户想要构建什么的情况下，请勿继续。\n\n2. **创建变更目录**\n   ```bash\n   openspec-cn new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   这将在 `openspec/changes/<name>/` 创建一个脚手架变更。\n\n3. **获取产出物构建顺序**\n   ```bash\n   openspec-cn status --change \"<name>\" --json","body":"快速完成产出物创建 - 一次性生成开始实现所需的一切。\n\n**输入**：用户的请求应包含变更名称（kebab-case）或对他们想要构建内容的描述。\n\n**步骤**\n\n1. **如果没有提供明确的输入，询问他们想要构建什么**\n\n   使用 **AskUserQuestion tool**（开放式，无预设选项）询问：\n   > \"您想要处理什么变更？请描述您想要构建或修复的内容。\"\n\n   根据他们的描述，推导出一个 kebab-case 名称（例如：\"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`）。\n\n   **重要提示**：在不了解用户想要构建什么的情况下，请勿继续。\n\n2. **创建变更目录**\n   ```bash\n   openspec-cn new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   这将在 `openspec/changes/<name>/` 创建一个脚手架变更。\n\n3. **获取产出物构建顺序**\n   ```bash\n   openspec-cn status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   解析 JSON 以获取：\n   - `applyRequires`: 实现前所需的产出物 ID 数组（例如：`[\"tasks\"]`）\n   - `artifacts`: 所有产出物及其状态和依赖项的列表\n\n4. **按顺序创建产出物直到准备好应用**\n\n   使用 **TodoWrite tool** 跟踪产出物的进度。\n\n   按依赖顺序循环遍历产出物（没有待处理依赖项的产出物优先）：\n\n   a. **对于每个 `ready`（依赖项已满足）的产出物**：\n      - 获取指令：\n        ```bash\n        openspec-cn instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - 指令 JSON 包括：\n        - `context`：项目背景（对你的约束 - 不要包含在输出中）\n        - `rules`：产出物特定规则（对你的约束 - 不要包含在输出中）\n        - `template`：用于输出文件的结构\n        - `instruction`：此产出物类型的模式特定指导\n        - `outputPath`：写入产出物的位置\n        - `dependencies`：已完成的产出物，用于读取上下文\n      - 读取任何已完成的依赖文件以获取上下文\n      - 使用 `template` 作为结构创建产出物文件\n      - 应用 `context` 和 `rules` 作为约束 - 但不要将它们复制到文件中\n      - 显示简短进度：\"✓ 已创建 <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **继续直到所有 `applyRequires` 产出物完成**\n      - 创建每个产出物后，重新运行 `openspec-cn status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - 检查 `applyRequires` 中的每个产出物 ID 在 artifacts 数组中是否具有 `status: \"done\"`\n      - 当所有 `applyRequires` 产出物完成时停止\n\n   c. **如果产出物需要用户输入**（上下文不清楚）：\n      - 使用 **AskUserQuestion tool** 进行澄清\n      - 然后继续创建\n\n5. **显示最终状态**\n   ```bash\n   openspec-cn status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**输出**\n\n完成所有产出物后，总结：\n- 变更名称和位置\n- 已创建产出物的列表及简要描述\n- 准备就绪：\"所有产出物已创建！准备好实现。\"\n- 提示：\"运行 `/opsx:apply` 或要求我实现以开始处理任务。\"\n\n**产出物创建指南**\n\n- 遵循每个产出物类型的 `openspec-cn instructions` 中的 `instruction` 字段\n- 模式定义了每个产出物应包含的内容 - 遵循它\n- 在创建新产出物之前阅读依赖产出物以获取上下文\n- 使用 `template` 作为输出文件的结构 - 填充其各个部分\n- **重要提示**：`context` 和 `rules` 是对你的约束，而不是文件内容\n  - 不要将 `<context>`、`<rules>`、`<project_context>` 块复制到产出物中\n  - 这些引导你编写内容，但不应出现在输出中\n\n**护栏**\n- 创建实现所需的所有产出物（由 Schema 的 `apply.requires` 定义）\n- 在创建新产出物之前始终阅读依赖产出物\n- 如果上下文极其不清楚，询问用户 - 但倾向于做出合理的决定以保持势头\n- 如果同名变更已存在，建议继续处理该变更\n- 在继续下一个之前，验证写入后每个产出物文件是否存在\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:51:25.170Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated change management and scaffolded project setup.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更管理和脚手架项目设置的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化された変更管理とスケルトン プロジェクト設定が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 관리와 스캐폴드 프로젝트 설정이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gestión de cambios automatizada y configuración de proyecto con andamios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de changements automatisée et d''une configuration de projet avec échafaudage.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Änderungsverwaltung und eine projektierte Einrichtung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de alterações automatizado e configuração de projeto com estrutura.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим автоматизированный менеджмент изменений и настройка проекта с каркасом.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيون الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة التغييرات الآليّة وتركيب المشروع المُقوّم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline change implementation using kebab-case naming conventions and the openspec-cn tool, facilitating the creation of new change directories and retrieval of build orders in JSON format.","zh":"赋予代理人员使用短横线命名约定和 openspec-cn 工具来简化变更实施，方便创建新变更目录并以 JSON 格式检索构建订单。","ja":"エージェントがケバブケース命名規則と openspec-cn ツールを使用して変更の実装をストリームライン化できるようにし、新しい変更ディレクトリの作成と JSON 形式のビルド注文の取得を容易にします。","ko":"에이전트가 케밥 케이스命명 규칙과 openspec-cn 툴을 사용하여 변경 구현을 간소화하며, 새로운 변경 디렉토리의 생성과 JSON 형식의 빌드 순서를 검색하는 것을容易하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar la implementación de cambios utilizando convenciones de nomenclatura en kebab-case y la herramienta openspec-cn, lo que facilita la creación de nuevos directorios de cambios y la recuperación de pedidos de compilación en formato JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser la mise en œuvre des changements en utilisant les conventions de nommage en kebab-case et l''outil openspec-cn, ce qui facilite la création de nouveaux répertoires de changements et la récupération des commandes de build au format JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Änderungsimplementierung mithilfe von kebab-case-Namenskonventionen und dem openspec-cn-Tool zu rationalisieren, was die Erstellung neuer Änderungsverzeichnisse und die Abrufung von Build-Anweisungen im JSON-Format erleichtert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes simplifiquem a implementação de alterações usando convenções de nomenclatura em kebab-case e a ferramenta openspec-cn, facilitando a criação de novos diretórios de alterações e a recuperação de ordens de compilação no formato JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить внедрение изменений с помощью соглашений об именовании в kebab-case и инструмента openspec-cn, облегчая создание новых директорий изменений и получение заказов на сборку в формате JSON.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تبسيط تنفيذ التغييرات باستخدام الاتفاقيات المسمّاة بالحالة كباب واداة openspec-cn، وتسهيل إنشاء مُجلدات التغييرات الجديدة واسترجاع أوامر البناء بتنسيق JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of new change directories with openspec-cn","Generating kebab-case names for changes based on user descriptions","Retrieving build orders for changes in JSON format using openspec-cn status"],"zh":["使用 openspec-cn 自动创建新变更目录","根据用户描述为变更生成短横线命名","使用 openspec-cn 状态以 JSON 格式检索变更的构建订单"],"ja":["openspec-cn を使用して新しい変更ディレクトリを作成する","ユーザーの説明に基づいて変更にケバブケース命名を生成する","openspec-cn のステータスを使用して JSON 形式の変更のビルド注文を取得する"],"ko":["openspec-cn을 사용하여 새로운 변경 디렉토리를 자동으로 생성한다","사용자의 설명을 기준으로 변경에 케밥 케이스命명 규칙을 생성한다","openspec-cn 상태를 사용하여 JSON 형식의 변경의 빌드 순서를 검색한다"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de nuevos directorios de cambios con openspec-cn","Generar nombres en kebab-case para cambios en función de las descripciones del usuario","Recuperar pedidos de compilación para cambios en formato JSON utilizando openspec-cn status"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de nouveaux répertoires de changements avec openspec-cn","Générer des noms en kebab-case pour les changements en fonction des descriptions de l''utilisateur","Récupérer les commandes de build pour les changements au format JSON en utilisant openspec-cn status"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung neuer Änderungsverzeichnisse mit openspec-cn","Generierung von kebab-case-Namen für Änderungen basierend auf den Benutzerbeschreibungen","Abrufen von Build-Anweisungen für Änderungen im JSON-Format mithilfe von openspec-cn status"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de novos diretórios de alterações com openspec-cn","Gerar nomes em kebab-case para alterações com base em descrições de usuário","Recuperar ordens de compilação para alterações em formato JSON usando openspec-cn status"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание новых директорий изменений с openspec-cn","Генерировать имена в kebab-case для изменений на основе описаний пользователя","Получать заказы на сборку для изменений в формате JSON с помощью openspec-cn status"],"ar":["توفير آليّة إنشاء مُجلدات التغييرات الجديدة مع openspec-cn","توليد أسماء بالحالة كباب للتغييرات استناداً إلى وصفات المُستخدم","استرجاع أوامر البناء للتغييرات بتنسيق JSON باستخدام openspec-cn status"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec-cn tool installation","Needs user input for change description or kebab-case name","Limited to openspec-cn compatible projects"],"zh":["需要安装 openspec-cn 工具","需要用户输入变更描述或短横线命名","仅限于 openspec-cn 兼容的项目"],"ja":["openspec-cn ツールのインストールが必要","変更の説明またはケバブケース命名のユーザー入力が必要","openspec-cn と互換性のあるプロジェクトに限定される"],"ko":["openspec-cn 툴의 설치가 필요하다","변경 설명 또는 케밥 케이스命명에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요하다","openspec-cn과 호환되는 프로젝트로 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta openspec-cn","Necesita la entrada del usuario para la descripción del cambio o el nombre en kebab-case","Limitado a proyectos compatibles con openspec-cn"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil openspec-cn","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la description du changement ou le nom en kebab-case","Limité aux projets compatibles avec openspec-cn"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des openspec-cn-Tools","Benötigt die Eingabe des Benutzers für die Änderungsbeschreibung oder den kebab-case-Namen","Begrenzt auf openspec-cn-kompatible Projekte"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da ferramenta openspec-cn","Necessita de entrada de usuário para descrição de alteração ou nome em kebab-case","Limitado a projetos compatíveis com openspec-cn"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента openspec-cn","Требует ввода пользователя для описания изменений или имени в kebab-case","Ограничен проектами, совместимыми с openspec-cn"],"ar":["يتطلّب تركيب اداة openspec-cn","يحتاج إلى مدخلات المُستخدم لوصف التغيير أو اسم الحالة كباب","محدود بمشاريع متوافقة مع openspec-cn"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
