r pour les développeurs","de":"Die OpenAI-Dokumentation bietet autorisierte und aktuelle Anleitungen für Entwickler","pt":"Acesse a documentação oficial do OpenAI para desenvolvedores e obtenha orientação atualizada.","ru":"Доступ к официальной документации OpenAI для разработчиков и получение актуальных рекомендаций.","ar":"إمكانية الوصول إلى وثائق OpenAI الرسمية للمطورين والحصول على إرشادات حديثة.","en":"jaunt, dont code."},"definition":{"en":"jaunt, dont code."},"features":{"zh":["提供开发者文档和指导","支持使用mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs搜索文档","支持使用mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc获取文档","优先使用MCP服务器获取结果","如果MCP服务器无结果则回退到网页搜索"],"ja":["開発者ドキュメントとガイダンスを提供","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docsを使用して文書を検索","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_docを使用して文書を取得","MCPサーバーを使用して結果を取得","MCPサーバーに結果がなければウェブ検索に回帰"],"ko":["개발자 문서와 가이드를 제공","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs를 사용하여 문서를 검색","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc를 사용하여 문서를 가져옴","MCP 서버를 사용하여 결과를 가져옴","MCP 서버에 결과가 없으면 웹 검색으로 돌아감"],"es":["Búsqueda de documentación de OpenAI","Acceso a la documentación oficial de OpenAI","Uso de MCP para buscar y recuperar documentación","Priorización de la documentación de MCP sobre la búsqueda web","Compatibilidad con la API de OpenAI"],"fr":["Recherche de documentation OpenAI","Accès à la documentation officielle d''OpenAI","Utilisation de MCP pour rechercher et récupérer la documentation","Priorisation de la documentation MCP sur la recherche web","Compatibilité avec l''API OpenAI"],"de":["Suche nach OpenAI-Dokumentation","Zugang zur offiziellen OpenAI-Dokumentation","Verwendung von MCP zur Suche und Wiederherstellung von Dokumentation","Priorisierung der MCP-Dokumentation gegenüber der Web-Suche","Kompatibilität mit der OpenAI-API"],"pt":["Busca por documentos relevantes","Recuperação de seções exatas de documentos","Priorização dos documentos oficiais","Fallback para busca na web quando necessário"],"ru":["Поиск релевантных документов","Извлечение точных разделов документов","Приоритет официальных документов","Переход к поиску в Интернете при необходимости"],"ar":["بحث عن وثائق ذات صلة","استرجاع أقسام دقيقة من الوثائق","التفضيل للوثائق الرسمية","الرجوع إلى البحث على الويب عند الحاجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI","开发者文档","MCP服务器","文档搜索","开发者指导","AI开发"],"ja":["OpenAI","開発者ドキュメント","MCPサーバー","文書検索","開発者ガイダンス","AI開発"],"ko":["OpenAI","개발자 문서","MCP 서버","문서 검색","개발자 가이드","AI 개발"],"es":["documentación de OpenAI","desarrollo de OpenAI","API de OpenAI","MCP","desarrollo de IA","documentación para desarrolladores","OpenAI para desarrolladores","herramientas de desarrollo de OpenAI"],"fr":["documentation OpenAI","développement OpenAI","API OpenAI","MCP","développement d''IA","documentation pour les développeurs","OpenAI pour les développeurs","outils de développement OpenAI"],"de":["OpenAI-Dokumentation","OpenAI-Entwicklung","OpenAI-API","MCP","KI-Entwicklung","Dokumentation für Entwickler","OpenAI für Entwickler","Entwicklungstools von OpenAI"],"pt":["OpenAI","Documentação para desenvolvedores","Desenvolvimento de IA","API do OpenAI","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Guia rápido para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["OpenAI","Документация для разработчиков","Разработка ИИ","API OpenAI","Инструменты разработки","Быстрый старт для разработчиков"],"ar":["OpenAI","وثائق المطورين","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI","أدوات التطوير","دليل سريع للمطورين"]}},"owner":"ijindal1","repo":"jaunt","repoPath":"ijindal1/jaunt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-docs","description":"Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI products or APIs and needs up-to-date official documentation with citations (for example: Codex, Responses API, Chat Completions, Apps SDK, Agents SDK, Realtime, model capabilities or limits); prioritize OpenAI docs MCP tools and restrict any fallback browsing to official OpenAI domains.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sectio","body":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sections and quote/paraphrase accurately.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__list_openai_docs` only when you need to browse or discover pages without a clear query.\n\n## OpenAI product snapshots\n\n1. Apps SDK: Build ChatGPT apps by providing a web component UI and an MCP server that exposes your app''s tools to ChatGPT.\n2. Responses API: A unified endpoint designed for stateful, multimodal, tool-using interactions in agentic workflows.\n3. Chat Completions API: Generate a model response from a list of messages comprising a conversation.\n4. Codex: OpenAI''s coding agent for software development that can write, understand, review, and debug code.\n5. gpt-oss: Open-weight OpenAI reasoning models (gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b) released under the Apache 2.0 license.\n6. Realtime API: Build low-latency, multimodal experiences including natural speech-to-speech conversations.\n7. Agents SDK: A toolkit for building agentic apps where a model can use tools and context, hand off to other agents, stream partial results, and keep a full trace.\n\n## If MCP server is missing\n\nIf MCP tools fail or no OpenAI docs resources are available:\n\n1. Run the install command yourself: `codex mcp add openaiDeveloperDocs --url https://developers.openai.com/mcp`\n2. If it fails due to permissions/sandboxing, immediately retry the same command with escalated permissions and include a 1-sentence justification for approval. Do not ask the user to run it yet.\n3. Only if the escalated attempt fails, ask the user to run the install command.\n4. Ask the user to restart Codex.\n5. Re-run the doc search/fetch after restart.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the product scope (Codex, OpenAI API, or ChatGPT Apps SDK) and the task.\n2. Search docs with a precise query.\n3. Fetch the best page and the specific section needed (use `anchor` when possible).\n4. Answer with concise guidance and cite the doc source.\n5. Provide code snippets only when the docs support them.\n\n## Quality rules\n\n- Treat OpenAI docs as the source of truth; avoid speculation.\n- Keep quotes short and within policy limits; prefer paraphrase with citations.\n- If multiple pages differ, call out the difference and cite both.\n- If docs do not cover the user’s need, say so and offer next steps.\n\n## Tooling notes\n\n- Always use MCP doc tools before any web search for OpenAI-related questions.\n- If the MCP server is installed but returns no meaningful results, then use web search as a fallback.\n- When falling back to web search, restrict to official OpenAI domains (developers.openai.com, platform.openai.com) and cite sources.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:52:10.487Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing authoritative OpenAI developer documentation and guidance from the MCP server","zh":"适合需要权威的 OpenAI 开发者文档和 MCP 服务器指导的 AI 代理","ja":"OpenAI 開発者ドキュメントと MCP サーバーのガイダンスを必要とする AI エージェントに最適","ko":"OpenAI 개발자 문서 및 MCP 서버의 가이드가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan documentación y orientación autorizadas de OpenAI de los desarrolladores y del servidor MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de documentation et de conseils autorisés de OpenAI pour les développeurs et du serveur MCP","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die autorisierte OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation und Anleitung vom MCP-Server benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de documentação de desenvolvedor autoritativa da OpenAI e orientação do servidor MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется авторитетная документация для разработчиков OpenAI и руководство от сервера MCP","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى وثائق مطور OpenAI الموثوقة والإرشاد من خادم MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to search and fetch relevant OpenAI documentation using the `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` and `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` tools, prioritizing the developer docs MCP server over web searches for accurate results","zh":"赋予代理搜索和获取相关 OpenAI 文档的能力，使用 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` 和 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` 工具，以开发者文档 MCP 服务器为优先，确保准确的结果","ja":"エージェントに OpenAI ドキュメントを検索して取得する能力を与え、`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` と `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` ツールを使用し、開発者ドキュメントの MCP サーバーを優先して、正確な結果を得る","ko":"에이전트가 관련 OpenAI 문서를 검색하고 가져올 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` 및 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` 도구를 사용하여 개발자 문서의 MCP 서버를 우선하여 정확한 결과를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar y recuperar documentación de OpenAI relevante utilizando las herramientas `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` y `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`, priorizando el servidor MCP de documentación para desarrolladores sobre búsquedas web para obtener resultados precisos","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher et de récupérer la documentation OpenAI pertinente en utilisant les outils `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` et `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`, en donnant la priorité au serveur MCP de documentation pour les développeurs plutôt qu''aux recherches Web pour obtenir des résultats précis","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, relevante OpenAI-Dokumentation mithilfe der Tools `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` und `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` zu suchen und abzurufen, wobei der MCP-Server für Entwicklerdokumentation Vorrang vor Web-Suchen für genaue Ergebnisse hat","pt":"Capacita os agentes a pesquisar e buscar documentação relevante da OpenAI usando as ferramentas `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` e `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`, priorizando o servidor MCP de documentação do desenvolvedor em vez de pesquisas na web para obter resultados precisos","ru":"Позволяет агентам искать и получать соответствующую документацию OpenAI с помощью инструментов `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` и `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`, отдавая приоритет серверу MCP с документацией для разработчиков перед веб-поиском для получения точных результатов","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من البحث عن واستجلب وثائق OpenAI ذات الصلة باستخدام أدوات `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` و `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`، مع إعطاء الأولوية لخادم MCP لوثائق المطورين على عمليات البحث على الويب للحصول على نتائج دقيقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching OpenAI developer documentation for specific topics","Fetching exact sections of OpenAI documentation for reference","Resolving OpenAI-related questions using the MCP server"],"zh":["搜索 OpenAI 开发者文档中的特定主题","获取 OpenAI 文档的特定部分以供参考","使用 MCP 服务器解决 OpenAI 相关问题"],"ja":["OpenAI 開発者ドキュメントの中での特定のトピックを検索","OpenAI ドキュメントの特定のセクションを参照するために取得","MCP サーバーを使用して OpenAI 関連の質問を解決"],"ko":["OpenAI 개발자 문서에서 특정 주제를 검색","참조를 위해 OpenAI 문서의 특정 섹션을 가져옴","MCP 서버를 사용하여 OpenAI 관련 질문을 해결"],"es":["Buscar documentación de desarrollador de OpenAI sobre temas específicos","Recuperar secciones exactas de la documentación de OpenAI para referencia","Resolver preguntas relacionadas con OpenAI utilizando el servidor MCP"],"fr":["Rechercher la documentation OpenAI pour les développeurs sur des sujets spécifiques","Récupérer des sections exactes de la documentation OpenAI pour référence","Résoudre les questions liées à OpenAI en utilisant le serveur MCP"],"de":["OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation über spezifische Themen suchen","Exakte Abschnitte der OpenAI-Dokumentation für Referenzzwecke abrufen","OpenAI-bezogene Fragen mithilfe des MCP-Servers lösen"],"pt":["Pesquisar documentação de desenvolvedor da OpenAI para tópicos específicos","Buscar seções exatas da documentação da OpenAI para referência","Resolver questões relacionadas à OpenAI usando o servidor MCP"],"ru":["Поиск документации для разработчиков OpenAI по конкретным темам","Получение точных разделов документации OpenAI для справки","Решение вопросов, связанных с OpenAI, с использованием сервера MCP"],"ar":["البحث في وثائق مطور OpenAI عن مواضيع محددة","جلب أقسام محددة من وثائق OpenAI للرجوع إليها","حل الأسئلة المتعلقة بـ OpenAI باستخدام خادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation and access to the MCP server","Falls back to web search if MCP server returns no meaningful results"],"zh":["需要安装和访问 MCP 服务器","如果 MCP 服务器返回没有意义的结果，则回退到网络搜索"],"ja":["MCP サーバーのインストールとアクセスが必要","MCP サーバーが意味のない結果を返した場合、ウェブ検索にフォールバック"],"ko":["MCP 서버의 설치 및 액세스가 필요","MCP 서버가 의미없는 결과를 반환하는 경우 웹 검색으로 폴백"],"es":["Requiere instalación y acceso al servidor MCP","Vuelve a la búsqueda en la web si el servidor MCP no devuelve resultados significativos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et l''accès au serveur MCP","Revertit à la recherche Web si le serveur MCP ne retourne pas de résultats significatifs"],"de":["Benötigt Installation und Zugriff auf den MCP-Server","Fällt auf die Web-Suche zurück, wenn der MCP-Server keine sinnvollen Ergebnisse zurückgibt"],"pt":["Requer instalação e acesso ao servidor MCP","Recorre à pesquisa na web se o servidor MCP não retornar resultados significativos"],"ru":["Требует установки и доступа к серверу MCP","Переходит к веб-поиску, если сервер MCP не возвращает значимых результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت والوصول إلى خادم MCP","يتراجع إلى البحث على الويب إذا لم يُرجع خادم MCP نتائج ذات معنى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
