yectos de investigación","fr":"Paper Finder est un système de découverte et de priorisation d''articles de recherche pour les projets de recherche","de":"Paper Finder ist ein System zur Entdeckung und Priorisierung von Forschungsartikeln für Forschungsprojekte","pt":"O Paper Finder é uma ferramenta de descoberta sistemática de artigos de pesquisa para projetos de pesquisa.","ru":"Paper Finder - это инструмент системного поиска научных статей для исследовательских проектов.","ar":"Paper Finder هو أداة لاكتشاف المقالة البحثية بشكل منهجي لمشاريع البحث.","en":"Artificial Intelligence research: News from the Future | Generated by Idea Explorer on 2026-02-10"},"definition":{"en":"Artificial Intelligence research: News from the Future | Generated by Idea Explorer on 2026-02-10"},"features":{"zh":["","","",""],"ja":["","","",""],"ko":["","","",""],"es":["Búsqueda sistemática de artículos de investigación","Priorización de artículos según relevancia","Búsqueda rápida de artículos con la opción --mode fast","Compatibilidad con scripts de ayuda para una integración fácil","Ideal para revisar literatura, encontrar trabajos relacionados y establecer referencias"],"fr":["Recherche systématique d''articles de recherche","Priorisation des articles en fonction de leur pertinence","Recherche rapide d''articles avec l''option --mode fast","Compatibilité avec les scripts d''aide pour une intégration facile","Idéal pour les revues de littérature, la recherche de travaux liés et l''établissement de références"],"de":["Systematische Entdeckung von Forschungsartikeln","Priorisierung von Artikeln nach Relevanz","Schnelle Suche nach Artikeln mit der Option --mode fast","Kompatibilität mit Hilfs-Skripten für eine einfache Integration","Ideal für Literaturübersichten, die Suche nach verwandten Arbeiten und die Festlegung von Referenzen"],"pt":["Descoberta sistemática de artigos de pesquisa","Priorização de artigos para revisão da literatura","Busca rápida de artigos relacionados","Encontrar artigos de baseline para experimentos","Construir uma lista de citações para artigos de pesquisa"],"ru":["Системный поиск научных статей","Приоритизация статей для обзора литературы","Быстрый поиск связанных статей","Найти статьи базовой линии для экспериментов","Создать список цитат для научных статей"],"ar":["اكتشاف منهجي لمقالات البحث","ترتيب الأولوية للمقالات لمراجعة الأدب","بحث سريع عن مقالات ذات صلة","finding مقالات خط الأساس لل exper","بناء قائمة المراجع لمقالات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","Paper Finder","","","",""],"ja":["AI","Paper Finder","","","",""],"ko":["AI","Paper Finder","","","",""],"es":["Paper Finder","descubrimiento de artículos de investigación","priorización de artículos","revisión de literatura","búsqueda de trabajos relacionados","establecimiento de referencias","inteligencia artificial","investigación científica"],"fr":["Paper Finder","découverte d''articles de recherche","priorisation d''articles","revue de littérature","recherche de travaux liés","établissement de références","intelligence artificielle","recherche scientifique"],"de":["Paper Finder","Entdeckung von Forschungsartikeln","Priorisierung von Artikeln","Literaturübersicht","Suche nach verwandten Arbeiten","Festlegung von Referenzen","künstliche Intelligenz","wissenschaftliche Forschung"],"pt":["Paper Finder","descoberta de artigos de pesquisa","revisão da literatura","inteligência artificial","pesquisa científica","artigos de pesquisa","citações"],"ru":["Paper Finder","поиск научных статей","обзор литературы","искусственный интеллект","научные исследования","научные статьи","цитаты"],"ar":["Paper Finder","ابحث عن أبحاث علمية","مراجعة الأدب","الذكاء الاصطناعي","البحث العلمي","مقالات البحث","المراجع"]}},"owner":"Hypogenic-AI","repo":"news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude","repoPath":"Hypogenic-AI/news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paper-finder","description":"Find and search for academic papers using the paper-finder service. Use when conducting literature review, searching for related work, finding baseline papers, or looking for methodology references.","bodyPreview":"# Paper Finder\n\nSystematic paper discovery and prioritization for research projects.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting a literature review\n- Looking for related work on a topic\n- Finding baseline papers for experiments\n- Searching for methodology references\n- Building a citation list for a research paper\n\n## How to Use\n\nRun the helper script from your workspace:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/find_papers.py \"your research topic\"\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--mode fast` (default): Quick searc","body":"# Paper Finder\n\nSystematic paper discovery and prioritization for research projects.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting a literature review\n- Looking for related work on a topic\n- Finding baseline papers for experiments\n- Searching for methodology references\n- Building a citation list for a research paper\n\n## How to Use\n\nRun the helper script from your workspace:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/find_papers.py \"your research topic\"\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--mode fast` (default): Quick search\n- `--mode diligent`: Thorough search (recommended for comprehensive review)\n- `--format json`: Output as JSON instead of text\n\nExample:\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/find_papers.py \"hypothesis generation with large language models\" --mode fast\n```\n\n## Search Strategy\n\n### Query Formulation\n\nUse structured queries for better results:\n\n1. **Core concept + Method**: \"transformer attention mechanism\"\n2. **Problem + Domain**: \"few-shot learning natural language processing\"\n3. **Technique + Application**: \"graph neural networks drug discovery\"\n\n### Multi-Stage Search\n\n1. **Broad scan**: Start with general topic terms\n2. **Focused dive**: Use specific method/technique names from initial results\n3. **Citation chase**: Search for highly-cited papers referenced in relevant work\n\n## Citation Prioritization\n\n### Relevance Tiers\n\n| Relevance Score | Priority | Action |\n|-----------------|----------|--------|\n| 3 (High) | Must read | Download PDF, read fully, cite |\n| 2 (Medium) | Should read | Read abstract + intro, cite if relevant |\n| 1 (Low) | Optional | Skim abstract, cite only if needed |\n| 0 (Not relevant) | Skip | Do not include |\n\n### Citation Count Thresholds\n\n| Category | Citation Count | Interpretation |\n|----------|----------------|----------------|\n| Seminal | 1000+ | Foundational work, must cite |\n| Well-established | 100-999 | Widely accepted, cite if relevant |\n| Recent/Emerging | 10-99 | Current research, cite for novelty |\n| New | <10 | Very recent, check publication venue |\n\n### Venue Tiers (ML/AI Focus)\n\n**Tier 1** (Top venues, high credibility):\n- NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, ACL, EMNLP, CVPR, ICCV\n\n**Tier 2** (Strong venues):\n- AAAI, IJCAI, NAACL, COLING, ECCV, WACV\n\n**Tier 3** (Good venues):\n- *ACL workshops, COLM, EACL, CoNLL\n\n**Preprints** (arXiv):\n- Check for peer-reviewed version first\n- Cite arXiv only if no published version exists\n\n## Screening Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Title Screening\n- Review titles from search results\n- Mark papers as \"include\", \"exclude\", or \"maybe\"\n- Goal: ~50% reduction\n\n### Phase 2: Abstract Screening\n- Read abstracts for included/maybe papers\n- Evaluate: relevance, methodology, findings\n- Goal: Identify key papers for deeper reading\n\n### Phase 3: Full-Text Review\n- Download and read full PDFs for key papers\n- Extract: methods, results, limitations, citations\n- Use the PDF chunker for detailed reading (see below)\n\n## Output Structure\n\nReturns relevance-ranked papers with:\n- Title, authors, year\n- Abstract (already extracted)\n- URL for download\n- Relevance score (0-3, focus on papers with score >= 2)\n- Citation count\n\n## After Finding Papers\n\n1. Download PDFs for papers with relevance >= 2\n2. Read abstracts first (already provided in output)\n3. Only read full PDFs for most relevant papers\n4. Write notes to literature_review.md immediately\n5. Track citations for references.bib\n\n## Reading Large PDFs\n\nUse the PDF chunker to split papers into smaller PDF files that can be read directly.\nThis preserves all formatting perfectly (unlike text extraction which loses formatting).\n\n**Dependencies:**\n```bash\n# Using uv (recommended):\nuv add pypdf\n\n# Or with pip:\npip install pypdf\n```\n\n**How to run:**\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/paper-finder/scripts/pdf_chunker.py <pdf_path>\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--pages-per-chunk N`: Number of pages per chunk (default: 1)\n- `--output-dir DIR`: Output directory (default: `<pdf_dir>/pages`)\n\n**Output:**\n- Creates PDF chunk files: `<pdf_name>_chunk_001.pdf`, `<pdf_name>_chunk_002.pdf`, etc.\n- Creates a manifest: `<pdf_name>_manifest.txt` listing all chunks with page ranges\n\n**Integration with screening workflow:**\n1. Run the chunker on papers before detailed reading\n2. For abstract skimming: read only chunk 1 (page 1 or pages 1-3)\n3. For deep reading: read ALL chunk PDFs sequentially, writing notes after each\n4. Check the manifest to see how many chunks exist\n5. IMPORTANT: Do not skip chunks - methodology and results are in later chunks\n\n## If Paper-Finder Service Not Running\n\nThe script will show a fallback message. Use manual search instead:\n- arXiv: https://arxiv.org\n- Semantic Scholar: https://www.semanticscholar.org\n- Papers with Code: https://paperswithcode.com\n- Google Scholar: https://scholar.google.com\n\nManual search works well - paper-finder is just a convenience for faster, more targeted results.\n\n## References\n\nSee `references/` folder for:\n- `search_strategies.md`: Detailed search query formulation\n- `prioritization_guide.md`: Extended prioritization criteria\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:52:56.152Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing systematic paper discovery and prioritization for literature reviews and research projects.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化论文发现和优先排序的研究型代理，用于文献综述和研究项目。","ja":"研究エージェントが論文の体系的な発見と優先順位付けを必要とする文献レビューと研究プロジェクトに最適です。","ko":"연구 에이전트가 문헌 검토와 연구 프로젝트를 위해 체계적인 논문 발견과 우선순위를 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan un descubrimiento y priorización sistemáticos de documentos para revisiones de literatura y proyectos de investigación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin d''une découverte et d''une priorisation systématiques de documents pour les revues de littérature et les projets de recherche.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die ein systematisches Auffinden und Priorisieren von Dokumenten für Literaturübersichten und Forschungsprojekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de descoberta e priorização sistemáticas de artigos para revisões da literatura e projetos de pesquisa.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-исследователей, которым необходима систематическая обнаружение и приоритезация статей для обзоров литературы и исследовательских проектов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى اكتشاف وترتيب منهجي للوثائق من أجل استعراض الأدبيات ومشاريع البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently search for related work, baseline papers, and methodology references using Python scripts, providing quick and systematic paper discovery with options like --mode fast for accelerated searches.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Python脚本高效搜索相关工作、基线论文和方法参考的能力，提供快速和系统化的论文发现，并具有加速搜索的选项，如--mode fast。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトを使用して関連する仕事、ベースライン論文、方法参考を効率的に検索するエージェントの能力を提供し、--mode fastなどのオプションを使用して加速された検索を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 파이썬 스크립트를 사용하여 관련 작업, 기준 논문 및 방법 참조를 효율적으로 검색할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 빠르고 체계적인 논문 발견을 제공하며 --mode fast와 같은 옵션을 사용하여 가속 검색을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes buscar de forma eficiente trabajos relacionados, documentos de referencia de base y referencias de metodología utilizando scripts de Python, proporcionando un descubrimiento rápido y sistemático de documentos con opciones como --mode fast para búsquedas aceleradas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher efficacement les travaux liés, les documents de référence de base et les références de méthodologie en utilisant des scripts Python, fournissant une découverte rapide et systématique de documents avec des options comme --mode fast pour des recherches accélérées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, effizient nach verwandten Arbeiten, Basisdokumenten und Methodenreferenzen zu suchen, indem sie Python-Skripte verwenden, und bietet so ein schnelles und systematisches Auffinden von Dokumenten mit Optionen wie --mode fast für beschleunigte Suchen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a procurar de forma eficiente trabalhos relacionados, artigos de referência e referências de metodologia usando scripts Python, fornecendo descoberta rápida e sistemática de artigos com opções como --mode fast para pesquisas aceleradas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно искать связанные работы, базовые статьи и ссылки на методологию с помощью скриптов Python, обеспечивая быстрое и систематическое обнаружение статей с опциями, такими как --mode fast для ускоренных поисков.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على البحث بكفاءة عن الأعمال المرتبطة والأوراق المرجعية ومراجع المنهجية باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون، مما يوفر اكتشافًا سريعًا ومنهجيًا للوثائق مع خيارات مثل --mode fast للبحوث المتسارعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating literature reviews for research projects","Finding baseline papers for experiments","Generating citation lists for research papers","Searching for methodology references"],"zh":["自动化研究项目的文献综述","找到实验的基线论文","为研究论文生成引用列表","搜索方法参考"],"ja":["研究プロジェクトの文献レビューを自動化する","実験のベースライン論文を探す","研究論文の引用リストを生成する","方法参考を検索する"],"ko":["연구 프로젝트를 위한 문헌 검토 자동화","실험을 위한 기준 논문 찾기","연구 논문을 위한 인용 목록 생성","방법 참고 문헌 검색"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de literatura para proyectos de investigación","Encontrar documentos de referencia de base para experimentos","Generar listas de citas para documentos de investigación","Buscar referencias de metodología"],"fr":["Automatiser les revues de littérature pour les projets de recherche","Trouver les documents de référence de base pour les expériences","Générer des listes de citations pour les documents de recherche","Rechercher des références de méthodologie"],"de":["Automatisieren von Literaturübersichten für Forschungsprojekte","Auffinden von Basisdokumenten für Experimente","Erstellen von Zitierlisten für Forschungsdokumente","Suchen nach Methodenreferenzen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões da literatura para projetos de pesquisa","Encontrar artigos de referência para experimentos","Gerar listas de citações para artigos de pesquisa","Procurar referências de metodologia"],"ru":["Автоматизация обзоров литературы для исследовательских проектов","Поиск базовых статей для экспериментов","Генерация списков цитат для исследовательских статей","Поиск ссылок на методологию"],"ar":["توفير مراجعة الأدبيات آليًا لمشاريع البحث","إيجاد الأوراق المرجعية للتجارب","توليد قوائم الإشارات لمنشورات البحث","البحث عن مراجع المنهجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Dependent on script execution with specific topic input"],"zh":["需要Python环境","依赖于脚本执行和特定主题输入"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","スクリプトの実行と特定のトピック入力に依存する"],"ko":["파이썬 환경이 필요함","스크립트 실행 및 특정 주제 입력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python","Depende de la ejecución de scripts con una entrada de tema específica"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépend de l''exécution de scripts avec une entrée de sujet spécifique"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Hängt von der Ausführung von Skripten mit spezifischer Themeneingabe ab"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependente da execução do script com entrada de tópico específico"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависит от выполнения скрипта с конкретным входным топиком"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","يعتمد على تنفيذ السكريبت مع مدخل موضوع محدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dspangenberg/twc-ui/tailwindcss-development', 'community', 'dspangenberg', 'twc-ui', 'dspangenberg/twc-ui', 'tailwindcss-development', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:53:06.035Z', NULL, '{"id":"dspangenberg/twc-ui/tailwindcss-development","name":"tailwindcss-development","description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能，用于创建响应式和可访问的React组件，优化Inertia.js和Laravel Precognition","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキルは、レスポンシブでアクセシブルなReactコンポーネントを作成し、Inertia.jsとLaravel Precognitionを最適化するために使用","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 스킬은 반응형 및 접근성이 좋은 React 컴포넌트를 생성하고 Inertia.js 및 Laravel Precognition을 최적화하는 데 사용","es":"Tailwind CSS es un framework de CSS que te permite crear componentes personalizados y accesibles para tus proyectos React","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un framework CSS qui vous permet de créer des composants personnalisés et accessibles pour vos projets React","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein CSS-Framework, mit dem Sie benutzerdefinierte und zugängliche Komponenten für Ihre React-Projekte erstellen können","pt":"O Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores que desejam criar componentes React personalizados e acessíveis.","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это мощный инструмент для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать настраиваемые и доступные компоненты React.","ar":"تايلويند سي إس إس هو أداة قوية للمطورين الذين يريدون إنشاء مكونات رياكت قابلة للوصول وتخصيصها.","en":"DRY-er, more accessible shadcn/ui-alike React Aria components, optimized for Inertia.js with Laravel''s Precognition feature build in."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발","es":"Desarrollo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Développement avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Tailwind CSS-Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Разработка с Tailwind CSS","ar":"تطوير تايلويند سي إس إس","en":"tailwindcss-development"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能，用于创建响应式和可访问的React组件，优化Inertia.js和Laravel Precognition","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキルは、レスポンシブでアクセシブルなReactコンポーネントを作成し、Inertia.jsとLaravel Precognitionを最適化するために使用","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 스킬은 반응형 및 접근성이 좋은 React 컴포넌트를 생성하고 Inertia.js 및 Laravel Precognition을 최적화하는 데 사용","es":"Tailwind CSS es un framework de CSS que te permite crear componentes personalizados y accesibles para tus proyectos React","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un framework CSS qui vous permet de créer des composants personnalisés et accessibles pour vos projets React","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein CSS-Framework, mit dem Sie benutzerdefinierte und zugängliche Komponenten für Ihre React-Projekte erstellen können","pt":"O Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores que desejam criar componentes React personalizados e acessíveis.","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это мощный инструмент для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать настраиваемые и доступные компоненты React.","ar":"تايلويند سي إس إس هو أداة قوية للمطورين الذين يريدون إنشاء مكونات رياكت قابلة للوصول وتخصيصها.","en":"DRY-er, more accessible shadcn/ui-alike React Aria components, optimized for Inertia.js with Laravel''s Precognition feature build in."},"definition":{"en":"DRY-er, more accessible shadcn/ui-alike React Aria components, optimized for Inertia.js with Laravel''s Precognition feature build in."},"features":{"zh":["响应式设计","暗黑模式支持","可访问性优化","Inertia.js集成","Laravel Precognition支持"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード対応","アクセシビリティ最適化","Inertia.js統合","Laravel Precognitionサポート"],"ko":["반응형 디자인","다크 모드 지원","접근성 최적화","Inertia.js 통합","Laravel Precognition 지원"],"es":["Creación de componentes personalizados con Tailwind CSS","Optimización para Inertia.js y Laravel","Diseño responsivo y dark mode","Extracción de patrones repetidos en componentes","Depuración de problemas de espaciado y diseño"],"fr":["Création de composants personnalisés avec Tailwind CSS","Optimisation pour Inertia.js et Laravel","Conception responsive et dark mode","Extraction de modèles répétitifs en composants","Débogage des problèmes d''espacement et de conception"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Komponenten mit Tailwind CSS","Optimierung für Inertia.js und Laravel","Responsives Design und Dark Mode","Extraktion von wiederkehrenden Mustern in Komponenten","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen mit Abständen und Layout"],"pt":["Criação de componentes React personalizados","Acessibilidade e compatibilidade com Inertia.js","Otimização para Laravel com Precognition","Padrões de design responsivos","Modo escuro personalizado"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых компонентов React","Доступность и совместимость с Inertia.js","Оптимизация для Laravel с Precognition","Отзывчивые шаблоны дизайна","Персонализированный темный режим"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات رياكت قابلة للوصول وتخصيصها","التوافق مع إنيرتيا جس وتصميمات الويب القابلة للوصول","تحسين الأداء مع لارافيل وبريسيجنشن","تصميمات الويب القابلة للوصول","الوضع الداكن المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","React","Inertia.js","Laravel Precognition","响应式设计","暗黑模式","可访问性优化"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","React","Inertia.js","Laravel Precognition","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","アクセシビリティ最適化"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","React","Inertia.js","Laravel Precognition","반응형 디자인","다크 모드","접근성 최적화"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","React","Inertia.js","Laravel","desarrollo web","componentes personalizados","diseño responsivo","dark mode","accesibilidad"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","React","Inertia.js","Laravel","développement web","composants personnalisés","conception responsive","dark mode","accessibilité"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","React","Inertia.js","Laravel","Webentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","responsives Design","Dark Mode","Zugänglichkeit"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento React","Inertia.js","Laravel","Precognition","Acessibilidade","Design responsivo","Modo escuro"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","Разработка React","Inertia.js","Laravel","Precognition","Доступность","Отзывчивый дизайн","Темный режим"],"ar":["تايلويند سي إس إس","تطوير رياكت","إنيرتيا جس","لارافيل","بريسيجنشن","التوافق","تصميمات الويب القابلة للوصول","الوضع الداكن"]}},"owner":"dspangenberg","repo":"twc-ui","repoPath":"dspangenberg/twc-ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:53:06.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined CSS development with Tailwind CSS v4 and Inertia.js integration.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Tailwind CSS v4和Inertia.js集成进行流畅CSS开发的前端代理。","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4とInertia.jsの統合を使用してスムーズなCSS開発が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4와 Inertia.js 통합을 사용하여 원활한 CSS 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de CSS optimizado con Tailwind CSS v4 y la integración de Inertia.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un développement de CSS rationalisé avec Tailwind CSS v4 et l''intégration d''Inertia.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes CSS-Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS v4 und Inertia.js-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de CSS simplificado com Tailwind CSS v4 e integração com Inertia.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим упрощенный разработка CSS с помощью Tailwind CSS v4 и интеграции с Inertia.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير CSS مبسط مع Tailwind CSS v4 ودمج Inertia.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive, dark mode-compatible, and accessible React Aria components using Tailwind CSS classes, optimized for Laravel''s Precognition feature and Inertia.js, while following DRY principles and existing project conventions.","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式、暗黑模式兼容和无障碍的React Aria组件的能力，使用Tailwind CSS类，针对Laravel的Precognition功能和Inertia.js进行优化，同时遵循DRY原则和现有项目约定。","ja":"エージェントが、Tailwind CSSクラスを使用して、レスポンシブでダークモード対応のReact Ariaコンポーネントを作成できるようにし、LaravelのPrecognition機能とInertia.jsに最適化され、DRY原則と既存のプロジェクト規約に従ったものになる。","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 반응형, 다크 모드 호환 및 접근성 있는 React Aria 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Laravel의 Precognition 기능과 Inertia.js에 최적화되며 DRY 원칙과 기존 프로젝트 규약을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de React Aria responsivos, compatibles con el modo oscuro y accesibles, utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS, optimizados para la función Precognition de Laravel e Inertia.js, siguiendo los principios DRY y las convenciones de proyecto existentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants React Aria responsifs, compatibles avec le mode sombre et accessibles, en utilisant des classes Tailwind CSS, optimisés pour la fonction Precognition de Laravel et Inertia.js, tout en suivant les principes DRY et les conventions de projet existantes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, responsive, dunklem Modus-kompatible und zugängliche React-Aria-Komponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zu erstellen, die für die Precognition-Funktion von Laravel und Inertia.js optimiert sind und den DRY-Prinzipien und bestehenden Projekt-Konventionen folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes React Aria responsivos, compatíveis com o modo escuro e acessíveis, usando classes Tailwind CSS, otimizados para o recurso Precognition do Laravel e Inertia.js, seguindo os princípios DRY e as convenções de projeto existentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые, совместимые с темным режимом и доступные компоненты React Aria, используя классы Tailwind CSS, оптимизированные для функции Precognition Laravel и Inertia.js, придерживаясь принципов DRY и существующих проектных соглашений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مكونات React Aria المتجاوبة والمدعمة للوضع المظلم وسهلة الوصول باستخدام فصول Tailwind CSS، متوافقة مع ميزة Precognition من Laravel و Inertia.js، مع اتباع مبادئ DRY والتقاليد المشروعة للمشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing responsive design patterns with Tailwind CSS","Debugging spacing or layout issues in React components","Extracting repeated patterns into reusable components with Tailwind CSS classes","Activating dark mode support in web applications using Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["使用Tailwind CSS实现响应式设计模式","在React组件中调试间距或布局问题","使用Tailwind CSS类将重复模式提取为可重用组件","在Web应用程序中使用Tailwind CSS激活暗黑模式支持"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSを使用してレスポンシブデザインパターンを実装する","Reactコンポーネントのスペーシングまたはレイアウトの問題をデバッグする","Tailwind CSSクラスを使用して繰り返しのパターンを再利用可能なコンポーネントに抽出する","WebアプリケーションでTailwind CSSを使用してダークモードのサポートを有効にする"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 반응형 디자인 패턴을 구현하는 것","React 컴포넌트의 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅하는 것","Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 반복되는 패턴을 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트로 추출하는 것","웹 애플리케이션에서 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 다크 모드 지원을 활성화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar patrones de diseño responsivos con Tailwind CSS","Depurar problemas de espaciado o diseño en componentes de React","Extraer patrones repetidos en componentes reutilizables con clases de Tailwind CSS","Activar la compatibilidad con el modo oscuro en aplicaciones web utilizando Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modèles de conception responsifs avec Tailwind CSS","Déboguer des problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition dans les composants React","Extraire des modèles répétitifs en composants réutilisables avec des classes Tailwind CSS","Activer la prise en charge du mode sombre dans les applications web en utilisant Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Implementierung responsiver Designmuster mit Tailwind CSS","Fehlerbehebung von Abstands- oder Layoutproblemen in React-Komponenten","Extrahieren von wiederholten Mustern in wiederverwendbare Komponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen","Aktivieren der Dunkelmodus-Unterstützung in Webanwendungen mit Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de design responsivos com Tailwind CSS","Depuração de problemas de espaçamento ou layout em componentes React","Extração de padrões repetidos em componentes reutilizáveis com classes Tailwind CSS","Ativação do suporte ao modo escuro em aplicações web usando Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Реализация отзывчивых дизайн-паттернов с помощью Tailwind CSS","Отладка проблем с пробелами или макетом в компонентах React","Извлечение повторяющихся паттернов в переиспользуемые компоненты с классами Tailwind CSS","Активация поддержки темного режима в веб-приложениях с помощью Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط تصميم متجاوبة مع Tailwind CSS","تصحيح أخطاء التباعد أو تخطيط المكونات React","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة إلى مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع فصول Tailwind CSS","تفعيل دعم الوضع المظلم في التطبيقات الويب باستخدام Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Tailwind CSS project setup","Optimized for Inertia.js and Laravel''s Precognition feature","Limited to React Aria components and Tailwind CSS v4 patterns"],"zh":["需要现有的Tailwind CSS项目设置","针对Inertia.js和Laravel的Precognition功能进行优化","仅限于React Aria组件和Tailwind CSS v4模式"],"ja":["既存のTailwind CSSプロジェクト設定が必要","Inertia.jsとLaravelのPrecognition機能に最適化されています","React AriaコンポーネントとTailwind CSS v4パターンに限定されています"],"ko":["기존의 Tailwind CSS 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다","Inertia.js와 Laravel의 Precognition 기능에 최적화되어 있습니다","React Aria 컴포넌트와 Tailwind CSS v4 패턴으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de proyecto de Tailwind CSS existente","Optimizado para Inertia.js y la función Precognition de Laravel","Limitado a componentes de React Aria y patrones de Tailwind CSS v4"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Tailwind CSS existante","Optimisé pour Inertia.js et la fonction Precognition de Laravel","Limité aux composants React Aria et aux modèles Tailwind CSS v4"],"de":["Benötigt eine bestehende Tailwind-CSS-Projekt-Konfiguration","Optimiert für Inertia.js und die Precognition-Funktion von Laravel","Begrenzt auf React-Aria-Komponenten und Tailwind-CSS-v4-Muster"],"pt":["Requer configuração de projeto Tailwind CSS existente","Otimizado para Inertia.js e recurso Precognition do Laravel","Limitado a componentes React Aria e padrões Tailwind CSS v4"],"ru":["Требуется существующая настройка проекта Tailwind CSS","Оптимизирован для Inertia.js и функции Precognition Laravel","Ограничен компонентами React Aria и паттернами Tailwind CSS v4"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Tailwind CSS موجود","مُتَوَفَر لِ Inertia.js وميزة Precognition من Laravel","محدود بمكونات React Aria وأنماط Tailwind CSS v4"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
