е с родным кодом iOS","Разработка приложений React Native","Использование API Expo Modules","Создание модулей с помощью bunx create-expo-module"],"ar":["إنشاء وحدات إكسبو مخصصة","التفاعل معshiv iOS الأصلي","تطوير تطبيقات ري액ت نيتيف","استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات إكسبو","إنشاء هيكل لوحدات مع bunx create-expo-module"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 模块","React Native","本机 iOS 代码","Expo 模块 API","模块开发","移动应用开发","跨平台开发","JavaScript 开发","iOS 开发"],"ja":["Expo モジュール","React Native","ネイティブの iOS コード","Expo モジュール API","モジュール開発","モバイル アプリ開発","クロスプラットフォーム開発","JavaScript 開発","iOS 開発"],"ko":["Expo 모듈","React Native","네이티브 iOS 코드","Expo 모듈 API","모듈 개발","모바일 앱 개발","크로스 플랫폼 개발","JavaScript 개발","iOS 개발"],"es":["módulos Expo","React Native","código iOS nativo","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","API de Expo Modules","funcionalidad ampliada"],"fr":["modules Expo","React Native","code iOS natif","développement d''applications mobiles","API de Expo Modules","fonctionnalités étendues"],"de":["Expo-Module","React Native","nativer iOS-Code","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Expo-Modules-API","erweiterte Funktionalität"],"pt":["módulos expo","react native","código ios nativo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","api expo modules","bunx create-expo-module"],"ru":["модули expo","react native","родной код ios","разработка приложений","api expo modules","bunx create-expo-module"],"ar":["وحدات إكسبو","ري액ت نيتيف","shiv ios الأصلي","تطوير التطبيقات","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات إكسبو","bunx create-expo-module"]}},"owner":"thiskevinwang","repo":"ai","repoPath":"thiskevinwang/ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.451Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-modules","description":"Guide for authoring and developing Expo modules using the Expo Modules API.","bodyPreview":"# Developing Expo Modules\n\nThis skill helps you create and develop expo-modules for React Native app to call native iOS code.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create or modify Expo modules for React Native applications.\n- Interface with native iOS code using the Expo Modules API.\n\n## Creating a new Expo module\n\nThis only needs to be done once per module.\n\n1. Run `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` to scaffold a new local Expo module.\n2. Follow the prompts to se","body":"# Developing Expo Modules\n\nThis skill helps you create and develop expo-modules for React Native app to call native iOS code.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create or modify Expo modules for React Native applications.\n- Interface with native iOS code using the Expo Modules API.\n\n## Creating a new Expo module\n\nThis only needs to be done once per module.\n\n1. Run `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` to scaffold a new local Expo module.\n2. Follow the prompts to set up your module.\n\n## Developing\n\n1. Navigate to your module directory, likely `./modules/<your-module-name>`.\n2. Make code changes to the .ts and .swift files as needed.\n\n## Building and testing\n\nEach time you make changes to the native code, you need to rebuild the native bundle and run the app.\n\n```\nbunx expo run:ios \\\n  --device \"Kevin''s iPhone\" \\\n  --scheme tindeqtrackerdev\n```\n\n## Further reading\n\n[Module API Reference](https://docs.expo.dev/modules/module-api/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:52:43.886Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for React Native Agents needing seamless integration with native iOS code through Expo Modules API.","zh":"适用于需要通过Expo模块API与原生iOS代码无缝集成的React Native代理。","ja":"ExpoモジュールAPIを介してネイティブiOSコードとシームレスに統合する必要があるReact Nativeエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Expo 모듈 API를 통해 네이티브 iOS 코드와無縫으로 통합해야 하는 React Native 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de React Native que necesitan una integración perfecta con el código nativo de iOS a través de la API de módulos de Expo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents React Native nécessitant une intégration transparente avec le code natif iOS via l''API de modules Expo.","de":"Ideal für React-Native-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit nativem iOS-Code über die Expo-Module-API benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes React Native que necessitam de integração perfeita com código iOS nativo por meio da API de Módulos Expo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов React Native, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с родным кодом iOS через API модулей Expo.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء React Native الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع رمز iOS الأصلي من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Expo Modules."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and modify Expo modules for interfacing with native iOS code, leveraging the Expo Modules API and React Native framework, and utilizing commands like `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` for scaffolding new modules.","zh":"赋予代理创建和修改Expo模块以与原生iOS代码接口的能力，利用Expo模块API和React Native框架，并使用命令如`bunx create-expo-module@latest --local`来创建新模块的脚手架。","ja":"エージェントがExpoモジュールAPIとReact Nativeフレームワークを利用して、ネイティブiOSコードとインターフェースするExpoモジュールを作成および変更する能力を提供し、`bunx create-expo-module@latest --local`などのコマンドを使用して新しいモジュールのスキャフォールディングを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Expo 모듈 API와 React Native 프레임워크를 활용하여 네이티브 iOS 코드와 인터페이스하는 Expo 모듈을 생성 및 수정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` 등의 명령어를 사용하여 새로운 모듈의 스캐폴딩을 수행한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y modificar módulos de Expo para interactuar con el código nativo de iOS, aprovechando la API de módulos de Expo y el marco de React Native, y utilizando comandos como `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` para crear nuevos módulos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de modifier des modules Expo pour faire interface avec le code natif iOS, en exploitant l''API de modules Expo et le framework React Native, et en utilisant des commandes comme `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` pour créer de nouveaux modules.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Expo-Module zu erstellen und zu modifizieren, um mit nativem iOS-Code zu kommunizieren, indem sie die Expo-Module-API und das React-Native-Framework nutzen und Befehle wie `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` für das Erstellen neuer Module verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e modificar módulos Expo para interface com código iOS nativo, aproveitando a API de Módulos Expo e o framework React Native, e utilizando comandos como `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` para criar estruturas de módulos novos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и модифицировать модули Expo для взаимодействия с родным кодом iOS, используя API модулей Expo и фреймворк React Native, и используя команды типа `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` для создания новых модулей.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتعديل موديلات Expo للتعامل مع رمز iOS الأصلي، واستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Expo Modules وإطار العمل React Native، واستخدام أوامر مثل `bunx create-expo-module@latest --local` لإنشاء هيكل للمكونات الجديدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom Expo modules for React Native applications","Interfacing with native iOS code using the Expo Modules API","Modifying existing Expo modules for enhanced functionality"],"zh":["为React Native应用程序创建自定义Expo模块","使用Expo模块API与原生iOS代码接口","修改现有的Expo模块以增强功能"],"ja":["React Nativeアプリケーション用のカスタムExpoモジュールを作成する","ExpoモジュールAPIを使用してネイティブiOSコードとインターフェースする","既存のExpoモジュールを修正して機能を強化する"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 Expo 모듈 생성","Expo 모듈 API를 사용하여 네이티브 iOS 코드와 인터페이스","기존 Expo 모듈을 수정하여 기능을 향상"],"es":["Creación de módulos personalizados de Expo para aplicaciones de React Native","Interfaz con el código nativo de iOS utilizando la API de módulos de Expo","Modificación de módulos de Expo existentes para una funcionalidad mejorada"],"fr":["Création de modules Expo personnalisés pour les applications React Native","Interface avec le code natif iOS à l''aide de l''API de modules Expo","Modification de modules Expo existants pour une fonctionnalité améliorée"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Expo-Module für React-Native-Anwendungen","Schnittstelle mit nativem iOS-Code unter Verwendung der Expo-Module-API","Modifizierung bestehender Expo-Module für erweiterte Funktionalität"],"pt":["Criar módulos Expo personalizados para aplicações React Native","Interface com código iOS nativo usando a API de Módulos Expo","Modificar módulos Expo existentes para funcionalidade aprimorada"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских модулей Expo для приложений React Native","Взаимодействие с родным кодом iOS с помощью API модулей Expo","Модификация существующих модулей Expo для улучшения функциональности"],"ar":["إنشاء موديلات Expo مخصصة لتطبيقات React Native","التفاعل مع رمز iOS الأصلي باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Expo Modules","تعديل موديلات Expo الحالية لتحسين الوظائف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to iOS native code integration"],"zh":["需要React Native环境","仅限于iOS原生代码集成"],"ja":["React Native環境が必要","iOSネイティブコード統合のみに限定される"],"ko":["React Native 환경이 필요","iOS 네이티브 코드 통합에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React Native","Limitado a la integración de código nativo de iOS"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native","Limité à l''intégration de code natif iOS"],"de":["Benötigt React-Native-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Integration von nativem iOS-Code"],"pt":["Exige ambiente React Native","Limitado à integração de código iOS nativo"],"ru":["Требует среды React Native","Ограничен интеграцией с родным кодом iOS"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native","محدود بدمج رمز iOS الأصلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('danielcastro-dev/speclet/speclet-loop', 'community', 'danielcastro-dev', 'speclet', 'danielcastro-dev/speclet', 'speclet-loop', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:52:54.296Z', NULL, '{"id":"danielcastro-dev/speclet/speclet-loop","name":"speclet-loop","description":{"zh":"Speclet 循环技能是自动化执行 Speclet 工作流的一种方式，通过迭代完成任务。","ja":"Speclet ループスキルは Speclet ワークフローを自動化する方法で、反復処理によってタスクを完了します。","ko":"Speclet 루프 스킬은 Speclet 워크플ロー 자동화를 위한 방법으로, 반복 처리를 통해 태스크를 완료합니다.","es":"Speclet Loop es una habilidad que automatiza una iteración autónoma del flujo de trabajo Speclet, implementando historias y realizando controles de calidad","fr":"Speclet Loop est une compétence qui automatise une itération autonome du workflow Speclet, en implémentant des histoires et en effectuant des contrôles de qualité","de":"Speclet Loop ist eine Fähigkeit, die eine autarke Iteration des Speclet-Workflows automatisiert, indem sie Geschichten implementiert und Qualitätskontrollen durchführt","pt":"O Speclet Loop é uma habilidade que executa uma iteração autônoma do workflow Speclet, implementando histórias e realizando verificações de qualidade","ru":"Speclet Loop — это навык, который выполняет одну автономную итерацию workflow Speclet, реализуя истории и проводя проверки качества","ar":"Speclet Loop هو مهارة تنفذ iteration واحدة ذاتية من workflow Speclet، وتنفذ القصص وتنفذ فحوصات الجودة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Speclet 循环技能 - 自动化工作流","ja":"Speclet ループスキル - 自動化ワークフロー","ko":"Speclet 루프 스킬 - 자동화 워크플로","es":"Speclet Loop: Automatiza flujos de trabajo","fr":"Speclet Loop : Automatiser les workflows","de":"Speclet Loop: Automatisiere Arbeitsabläufe","pt":"Speclet Loop: Automatize Iterações de Workflow","ru":"Speclet Loop: Автоматизируйте Итерации Workflow","ar":"Speclet Loop: أتمتة الإ_iterations من Workflow","en":"speclet-loop"},"description":{"zh":"Speclet 循环技能是自动化执行 Speclet 工作流的一种方式，通过迭代完成任务。","ja":"Speclet ループスキルは Speclet ワークフローを自動化する方法で、反復処理によってタスクを完了します。","ko":"Speclet 루프 스킬은 Speclet 워크플ロー 자동화를 위한 방법으로, 반복 처리를 통해 태스크를 완료합니다.","es":"Speclet Loop es una habilidad que automatiza una iteración autónoma del flujo de trabajo Speclet, implementando historias y realizando controles de calidad","fr":"Speclet Loop est une compétence qui automatise une itération autonome du workflow Speclet, en implémentant des histoires et en effectuant des contrôles de qu...","de":"Speclet Loop ist eine Fähigkeit, die eine autarke Iteration des Speclet-Workflows automatisiert, indem sie Geschichten implementiert und Qualitätskontrollen ...","pt":"O Speclet Loop é uma habilidade que executa uma iteração autônoma do workflow Speclet, implementando histórias e realizando verificações de qualidade","ru":"Speclet Loop — это навык, который выполняет одну автономную итерацию workflow Speclet, реализуя истории и проводя проверки качества","ar":"Speclet Loop هو مهارة تنفذ iteration واحدة ذاتية من workflow Speclet، وتنفذ القصص وتنفذ فحوصات الجودة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动执行 Speclet 工作流","提高开发效率","迭代完成任务","支持多语言"],"ja":["Speclet ワークフローの自動実行","開発の効率化","タスクの反復処理","多言語対応"],"ko":["Speclet 워크플로우 자동 실행","개발 효율성 향상","태스크 반복 처리","다국어 지원"],"es":["Ejecuta iteraciones autónomas del flujo de trabajo Speclet","Implementa historias y realiza controles de calidad","Actualiza spec.json con el estado de las historias","Agrega aprendizajes a progress.md","Se puede utilizar repetidamente hasta completar todas las historias"],"fr":["Exécute des itérations autonomes du workflow Speclet","Implémente des histoires et effectue des contrôles de qualité","Met à jour spec.json avec l''état des histoires","Ajoute des apprentissages à progress.md","Peut être utilisé à plusieurs reprises jusqu''à ce que toutes les histoires soient complètes"],"de":["Führt autarke Iterationen des Speclet-Workflows aus","Implementiert Geschichten und führt Qualitätskontrollen durch","Aktualisiert spec.json mit dem Status der Geschichten","Fügt Lerninhalte zu progress.md hinzu","Kann wiederholt verwendet werden, bis alle Geschichten abgeschlossen sind"],"pt":["Executa iterações autônomas do workflow Speclet","Implementa histórias com prioridade alta","Realiza verificações de qualidade","Comita alterações se as verificações passarem","Atualiza spec.json com o resultado das verificações","Anexa aprendizados ao progress.md"],"ru":["Выполняет автономные итерации workflow Speclet","Реализует истории с высокой приоритетностью","Проводит проверки качества","Фиксирует изменения, если проверки пройдены","Обновляет spec.json с результатами проверок","Добавляет знания в progress.md"],"ar":["تنفذ الإ_iterations ذاتية من workflow Speclet","تنفذ القصص ذات الأولوية العالية","تنفذ فحوصات الجودة","ترسل التعديلات إذا نجحت الفحوصات","تحديث spec.json بالنتائج الفحوصات","الملحقات المعرفة في progress.md"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Speclet 循环技能","自动化工作流","开发效率","Speclet 工作流","迭代完成"],"ja":["Speclet ループスキル","自動化ワークフロー","開発の効率化","Speclet ワークフロー","反復処理"],"ko":["Speclet 루프 스킬","자동화 워크플로","개발 효율성","Speclet 워크플로","반복 처리"],"es":["Speclet Loop","automatización de flujos de trabajo","desarrollo de software","pruebas de calidad","gestión de historias","automatización de iteraciones","Speclet workflow","desarrollo ágil"],"fr":["Speclet Loop","automatisation de workflows","développement de logiciels","tests de qualité","gestion d''histoires","automatisation d''itérations","workflow Speclet","développement agile"],"de":["Speclet Loop","Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Software-Entwicklung","Qualitätskontrollen","Geschichten-Management","Automatisierung von Iterationen","Speclet-Workflow","Agile-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Speclet Loop","Automação de workflow","Desenvolvimento de software","Iterações de workflow","Verificações de qualidade","Implementação de histórias","Comita de alterações","Atualização de spec.json"],"ru":["Speclet Loop","Автоматизация workflow","Разработка программного обеспечения","Итерации workflow","Проверки качества","Реализация историй","Фиксация изменений","Обновление spec.json"],"ar":["Speclet Loop","تأتمتة الإ_iterations من Workflow","تطوير البرمجيات","الإ_iterations من Workflow","فحوصات الجودة","تنفيذ القصص","إرسال التعديلات","تحديث spec.json"]}},"owner":"danielcastro-dev","repo":"speclet","repoPath":"danielcastro-dev/speclet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"speclet-loop","description":"Execute one autonomous iteration - implement the next story from spec.json","bodyPreview":"# Speclet Loop Skill\n\nExecute one autonomous iteration of the Speclet workflow.\n\n## What I Do\n\n- Pick the highest priority story where `passes: false`\n- Implement that single story\n- Run quality checks\n- Commit if checks pass\n- Update spec.json with `passes: true`\n- Append learnings to progress.md\n\n## When to Use Me\n\nUse this repeatedly until all stories are complete:\n\n```\n/ralph-loop\n```\n\nKeep using until you see `✅ COMPLETE`.\n\n## Your Task\n\n### Step 1: Read Context\n\n```\nRead .speclet/spec.json","body":"# Speclet Loop Skill\n\nExecute one autonomous iteration of the Speclet workflow.\n\n## What I Do\n\n- Pick the highest priority story where `passes: false`\n- Implement that single story\n- Run quality checks\n- Commit if checks pass\n- Update spec.json with `passes: true`\n- Append learnings to progress.md\n\n## When to Use Me\n\nUse this repeatedly until all stories are complete:\n\n```\n/ralph-loop\n```\n\nKeep using until you see `✅ COMPLETE`.\n\n## Your Task\n\n### Step 1: Read Context\n\n```\nRead .speclet/spec.json\nRead .speclet/progress.md (if exists)\n```\n\nCheck the `## Codebase Patterns` section first.\n\n### Step 2: Verify Branch\n\nCheck you''re on the correct branch from spec `branch` field.\n\n```bash\ngit branch\ngit status\n```\n\nIf not on correct branch, checkout or create it.\n\n### Step 3: Pick Next Story\n\nFind the story with:\n- `passes: false`\n- Lowest `priority` number\n\nIf ALL stories have `passes: true`, skip to Stop Condition.\n\n### Step 4: Implement Story\n\nImplement the single story:\n- Follow existing code patterns\n- Meet acceptance criteria exactly\n- Minimal changes (no scope creep)\n\n### Step 5: Quality Checks\n\nBefore committing:\n\n```bash\nnpm run build  # or your project''s build command\n```\n\nRun `lsp_diagnostics` on modified files - must be clean.\n\nFor UI stories: verify in browser.\n\n### Step 6: Commit\n\nIf checks pass:\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"feat([scope]): [STORY-ID] - [Story Title]\"\ngit push origin [branch]\n```\n\n### Step 7: Update spec.json\n\nUpdate the completed story:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"STORY-X\",\n  \"passes\": true,\n  \"notes\": \"[Any learnings]\"\n}\n```\n\n### Step 8: Update progress.md\n\nAPPEND to `.speclet/progress.md`:\n\n```markdown\n---\n\n## YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM - [STORY-ID]: [Title]\n\n- **Implemented:** [What was done]\n- **Files changed:** \n  - `path/to/file.ts` - [what changed]\n- **Learnings:**\n  - [Patterns discovered]\n  - [Gotchas encountered]\n```\n\nIf you discovered a **reusable pattern**, add it to `## Codebase Patterns` at TOP of progress.md.\n\n### Step 9: Update AGENTS.md (if applicable)\n\nAdd valuable, reusable knowledge to AGENTS.md in edited directories.\n\n## Stop Condition\n\n**If ALL stories have `passes: true`:**\n\n```\n✅ COMPLETE - All stories passing.\n\nSummary:\n- Feature: [name]\n- Branch: [branch]\n- Stories completed: [N]\n\nReady to create PR.\n```\n\n**If stories remain:** End response normally. Use this skill again for next story.\n\n## Error Recovery\n\n### After 3 failed attempts\n1. Stop\n2. Document what was tried\n3. Ask user for help\n\n## Rules\n\n- **ONE story per iteration**\n- **Commit frequently** - One story = one commit\n- **Keep CI green** - Never commit broken code\n- **Update passes AFTER commit**\n- **No type suppression** - Never use `as any` or `@ts-ignore`\n\n## Global Rules\n\n### Always Show Recommendation + Reason\n\nWhen asking questions with options, ALWAYS:\n1. Mark the recommended option with ⭐\n2. Add `**Reason for recommendation:**` explaining why\n\n**Example format:**\n```\n1. [Question]?\n   A. Option A\n   B. Option B ⭐ Recommended — [brief reason]\n   C. Option C\n\n   **Reason for recommendation:** [Detailed explanation of why B is best]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:52:54.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated Speclet workflow iteration and quality checks.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 Speclet 工作流迭代和质量检查的开发代理。","ja":"Speclet ワークフロー イテレーションと品質チェックの自動化が必要な開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 Speclet 워크플로우 반복 및 품질 검사가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan iteración de flujo de trabajo de Speclet automatizada y controles de calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une itération de flux de travail Speclet automatisée et de contrôles de qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Iteration des Speclet-Workflows und Qualitätskontrollen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de iteração de fluxo de trabalho automatizada do Speclet e verificações de qualidade.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная итерация рабочего процесса Speclet и проверки качества.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكيل التي تحتاج إلى تكرار دورة عمل Speclet 자동 و فحص الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute autonomous iterations of the Speclet workflow, implementing stories, running quality checks, and committing changes using JSON files and markdown progress tracking.","zh":"赋予代理执行 Speclet 工作流的自治迭代，实施故事，运行质量检查，并使用 JSON 文件和 markdown 进度跟踪提交更改。","ja":"エージェントに Speclet ワークフローの自律的なイテレーションを実行する権限を与え、ストーリーを実装し、品質チェックを実行し、JSON ファイルと markdown 進度追跡を使用して変更をコミットします。","ko":"에이전트가 Speclet 워크플로우의 자율적인 반복을 실행하도록 하여, 스토리를 구현하고, 품질 검사를 실행하고, JSON 파일 및 markdown 진행 상황 추적을 사용하여 변경 사항을 커밋합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar iteraciones autónomas del flujo de trabajo de Speclet, implementar historias, ejecutar controles de calidad y realizar cambios utilizando archivos JSON y seguimiento de progreso en markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des itérations autonomes du flux de travail Speclet, de mettre en œuvre des histoires, d''exécuter des contrôles de qualité et de réaliser des modifications en utilisant des fichiers JSON et un suivi de progression en markdown.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, autarke Iterationen des Speclet-Workflows durchzuführen, Geschichten umzusetzen, Qualitätskontrollen durchzuführen und Änderungen über JSON-Dateien und Markdown-Fortschrittsverfolgung vorzunehmen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar iterações autônomas do fluxo de trabalho do Speclet, implementando histórias, executando verificações de qualidade e commitando alterações usando arquivos JSON e acompanhamento de progresso em markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять автономные итерации рабочего процесса Speclet, реализуя истории, запуская проверки качества и фиксируя изменения с использованием файлов JSON и отслеживания прогресса в markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل التكرارات المستقلة لدورة عمل Speclet، وتنفيذ القصص، وتشغيل فحوصات الجودة، وتعديل التغييرات باستخدام ملفات JSON وتعقب التقدم بلوحة markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Speclet workflow iterations","Implementing and testing individual stories","Updating spec.json and progress.md files"],"zh":["自动化 Speclet 工作流迭代","实施和测试单个故事","更新 spec.json 和 progress.md 文件"],"ja":["Speclet ワークフロー イテレーションの自動化","個別のストーリーの実装とテスト","spec.json と progress.md ファイルの更新"],"ko":["Speclet 워크플로우 반복의 자동화","개별 스토리의 구현 및 테스트","spec.json 및 progress.md 파일의 업데이트"],"es":["Automatización de iteraciones del flujo de trabajo de Speclet","Implementación y prueba de historias individuales","Actualización de archivos spec.json y progress.md"],"fr":["Automatisation des itérations du flux de travail Speclet","Mise en œuvre et test d''histoires individuelles","Mise à jour des fichiers spec.json et progress.md"],"de":["Automatisierung von Iterationen des Speclet-Workflows","Implementierung und Testen einzelner Geschichten","Aktualisierung der Dateien spec.json und progress.md"],"pt":["Automatizar iterações do fluxo de trabalho do Speclet","Implementar e testar histórias individuais","Atualizar arquivos spec.json e progress.md"],"ru":["Автоматизировать итерации рабочего процесса Speclet","Реализовывать и тестировать отдельные истории","Обновлять файлы spec.json и progress.md"],"ar":["تأتمة تكرار دورة عمل Speclet","تنفيذ واختبار القصص الفردية","تحديث ملفات spec.json و progress.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to .speclet/spec.json file","Limited to Speclet workflow only"],"zh":["需要访问 .speclet/spec.json 文件","仅限 Speclet 工作流"],"ja":[".speclet/spec.json ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Speclet ワークフローのみに限定"],"ko":[".speclet/spec.json 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","Speclet 워크플로우만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo .speclet/spec.json","Limitado al flujo de trabajo de Speclet solo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier .speclet/spec.json","Limité au flux de travail Speclet uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei .speclet/spec.json","Begrenzt auf den Speclet-Workflow"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo .speclet/spec.json","Limitado apenas ao fluxo de trabalho do Speclet"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу .speclet/spec.json","Ограничен только рабочим процессом Speclet"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملف .speclet/spec.json","محدود فقط بدورة عمل Speclet"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('FrontMage/codex_helper/node-llm-web-automation', 'community', 'FrontMage', 'codex_helper', 'FrontMage/codex_helper', 'node-llm-web-automation', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:53:07.634Z', NULL, '{"id":"FrontMage/codex_helper/node-llm-web-automation","name":"node-llm-web-automation","description":{"zh":"Node LLM Web 自动化是一个使用 Electron UI 和 Puppeteer runner 实现 SmartEdu 自动化的工具","ja":"Node LLM Web オートメーションは、Electron UI と Puppeteer runner を使用して SmartEdu の自動化を実現するツールです","ko":"Node LLM Web 자동화는 Electron UI와 Puppeteer runner를 사용하여 SmartEdu 자동화를 구현하는 도구입니다","es":"La automatización web Node LLM es una herramienta para convertir la exploración de páginas en un flujo de automatización de bajo costo.","fr":"L''automatisation web Node LLM est un outil pour convertir l''exploration de pages en un flux d''automatisation à faible coût.","de":"Die Node LLM Web-Automatisierung ist ein Tool, um die Seitenexploration in einen kostengünstigen Automatisierungsfluss umzuwandeln.","pt":"A Automação Web Node LLM é uma solução de automação de baixo custo que utiliza Node.js e Puppeteer para automatizar tarefas","ru":"Node LLM Веб-Автоматизация - это низкозатратное решение для автоматизации, которое использует Node.js и Puppeteer для автоматизации задач","ar":"تأتيير تلقائي ويب نود إل إم هو حل التأتيير منخفض التكلفة الذي يستخدم Node.js و Puppeteer لتأتيير المهام","en":"Electron UI + Puppeteer runner for SmartEdu automation"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Node LLM Web 自动化","ja":"Node LLM Web オートメーション","ko":"Node LLM Web 자동화","es":"Automatización web Node LLM","fr":"Automatisation web Node LLM","de":"Node LLM Web-Automatisierung","pt":"Automação Web Node LLM: Fluxo de Automação de Baixo Custo","ru":"Node LLM Веб-Автоматизация: Низкозатратный Поток Автомати...","ar":"تأتيير تلقائي ويب نود إل إم: تدفق التأتيير منخفض التكلفة","en":"node-llm-web-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Node LLM Web 自动化是一个使用 Electron UI 和 Puppeteer runner 实现 SmartEdu 自动化的工具","ja":"Node LLM Web オートメーションは、Electron UI と Puppeteer runner を使用して SmartEdu の自動化を実現するツールです","ko":"Node LLM Web 자동화는 Electron UI와 Puppeteer runner를 사용하여 SmartEdu 자동화를 구현하는 도구입니다","es":"La automatización web Node LLM es una herramienta para convertir la exploración de páginas en un flujo de automatización de bajo costo.","fr":"L''automatisation web Node LLM est un outil pour convertir l''exploration de pages en un flux d''automatisation à faible coût.","de":"Die Node LLM Web-Automatisierung ist ein Tool, um die Seitenexploration in einen kostengünstigen Automatisierungsfluss umzuwandeln.","pt":"A Automação Web Node LLM é uma solução de automação de baixo custo que utiliza Node.js e Puppeteer para automatizar tarefas","ru":"Node LLM Веб-Автоматизация - это низкозатратное решение для автоматизации, которое использует Node.js и Puppeteer для автоматизации задач","ar":"تأتيير تلقائي ويب نود إل إم هو حل التأتيير منخفض التكلفة الذي يستخدم Node.js و Puppeteer لتأتيير المهام","en":"Electron UI + Puppeteer runner for SmartEdu automation"},"definition":{"en":"Electron UI + Puppeteer runner for SmartEdu automation"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Electron UI 实现自动化","使用 Puppeteer runner 驱动 UI","支持手动步骤的暂停和恢复","支持多种结束条件","使用 LLM 实现 DOM 候选项选择"],"ja":["Electron UI を使用して自動化を実現","Puppeteer runner を使用して UI を駆動","手動ステップの暂停と再開をサポート","複数の終了条件をサポート","LLM を使用して DOM 候補を選択"],"ko":["Electron UI를 사용하여 자동화를 구현","Puppeteer runner를 사용하여 UI를 구동","수동 단계의 일시 중지와 재개 지원","다중 종료 조건 지원","LLM을 사용하여 DOM 후보를 선택"],"es":["Automatización de tareas web","Integración con Puppeteer","Flujos de automatización deterministas","Soporte para múltiples URLs de entrada","Pausa y reanudación de la automatización"],"fr":["Automatisation des tâches web","Intégration avec Puppeteer","Flux d''automatisation déterministes","Prise en charge de plusieurs URLs d''entrée","Pause et reprise de l''automatisation"],"de":["Automatisierung von Web-Aufgaben","Integration mit Puppeteer","Deterministische Automatisierungsflüsse","Unterstützung für mehrere Eingabe-URLs","Pausieren und Fortsetzen der Automatisierung"],"pt":["Fluxo de automação de baixo custo","Utiliza Node.js e Puppeteer","Automação de tarefas web","Determinística e eficiente","Suporte a múltiplos checkpoints"],"ru":["Низкозатратный поток автоматизации","Использует Node.js и Puppeteer","Автоматизация веб-задач","Детерминированная и эффективная","Поддержка нескольких контрольных точек"],"ar":["تدفق التأتيير منخفض التكلفة","يستخدم Node.js و Puppeteer","تأتيير المهام على الويب","محدد وفعّال","دعم نقطة التوقف المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Node.js","LLM","Web 自动化","Electron UI","Puppeteer runner","SmartEdu","自动化流程","DOM 候选项"],"ja":["Node.js","LLM","Web オートメーション","Electron UI","Puppeteer runner","SmartEdu","自動化フロー","DOM 候補"],"ko":["Node.js","LLM","Web 자동화","Electron UI","Puppeteer runner","SmartEdu","자동화 흐름","DOM 후보"],"es":["automatización web","Node LLM","Puppeteer","automatización de tareas","desarrollo web","Node.js"],"fr":["automatisation web","Node LLM","Puppeteer","automatisation des tâches","développement web","Node.js"],"de":["Web-Automatisierung","Node LLM","Puppeteer","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Web-Entwicklung","Node.js"],"pt":["automação web","node llm","puppeteer","fluxo de automação","baixo custo","desenvolvimento web","automatização de tarefas"],"ru":["веб-автоматизация","node llm","puppeteer","поток автоматизации","низкозатратный","веб-разработка","автоматизация задач"],"ar":["تأتيير الويب","نود إل إم","ببتيير","تدفق التأتيير","منخفض التكلفة","تطوير الويب","تأتيير المهام"]}},"owner":"FrontMage","repo":"codex_helper","repoPath":"FrontMage/codex_helper","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"node-llm-web-automation","description":"Build or update Node.js + LLM API workflows that replace Codex/MCP UI exploration for web automation at lower cost. Use when a user asks to productize page-structure discovery into a Node runner (Puppeteer/Playwright) with LLM-based element selection, deterministic playback control, cost controls, logging, and fallback paths.","bodyPreview":"# Node LLM Web Automation\n\n## Overview\n\nTurn manual Codex-driven page exploration into a low-cost Node.js automation flow that uses a single LLM call to pick DOM candidates, then drives the UI deterministically.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Define the automation scope\n\n- List entry URLs (login, course detail, list page).\n- Mark manual steps (captcha, 2FA) and provide a pause + resume checkpoint.\n- Decide the end condition (completion badge, video end, DOM state change).\n\n### 2) Implement deterministic c","body":"# Node LLM Web Automation\n\n## Overview\n\nTurn manual Codex-driven page exploration into a low-cost Node.js automation flow that uses a single LLM call to pick DOM candidates, then drives the UI deterministically.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Define the automation scope\n\n- List entry URLs (login, course detail, list page).\n- Mark manual steps (captcha, 2FA) and provide a pause + resume checkpoint.\n- Decide the end condition (completion badge, video end, DOM state change).\n\n### 2) Implement deterministic candidate scanning\n\n- Collect clickable candidates from all frames (anchors, buttons, list items).\n- Attach metadata: text, href, data-key/resourceId, tag/class, domIndex, frame URL.\n- Run heuristic filtering first; only call LLM if needed.\n\n### 3) LLM selection (single shot)\n\n- Send a minimal payload with the candidate list and a strict JSON schema.\n- Parse JSON defensively; fall back to heuristic ordering if parsing fails.\n- Cache the selection per page to avoid repeated calls.\n\n### 4) Execute playback loop\n\n- Click the selected item, wait for `video` to appear, force mute + playbackRate.\n- Poll progress every N seconds; stop when progress reaches 100% or completion DOM appears.\n- On failure: dump DOM + screenshot + current URL for support.\n\n### 5) Cost controls and reliability\n\n- Avoid LLM calls during long playback; only use it for selection.\n- Keep payload small (truncate text, drop large attributes).\n- Use timeouts and retries for video start.\n\n## References\n\n- See `references/node-llm-runner.md` for prompt templates, candidate schema, and error-handling patterns.\n\n## Notes for this repo\n\n- If working inside `codex_helper`, start from `tools/simple-runner-manual.js` and adapt it to the target site.\n- Keep the LLM call optional; prefer heuristic selection when possible.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:53:07.634Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Automation Agents needing low-cost Node.js automation flows with Electron UI and Puppeteer runner","zh":"非常适合需要低成本 Node.js 自动化流程的 Web 自动化代理，使用 Electron UI 和 Puppeteer 运行器","ja":"低コストの Node.js オートメーション フローと Electron UI、Puppeteer ランナーを必要とする Web オートメーション エージェントに最適","ko":"低 비용의 Node.js 자동화 흐름과 Electron UI, Puppeteer 런너를 필요로 하는 웹 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización web que necesitan flujos de automatización de Node.js de bajo costo con interfaz de usuario Electron y ejecutor Puppeteer","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation web nécessitant des flux d''automatisation Node.js à faible coût avec une interface utilisateur Electron et un exécuteur Puppeteer","de":"Perfekt für Web-Automationsagenten, die niedrigkosten-Node.js-Automatisierungsflüsse mit Electron-Benutzeroberfläche und Puppeteer-Ausführer benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação da Web que precisam de fluxos de automação de baixo custo do Node.js com interface do usuário Electron e executor Puppeteer","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-агентов автоматизации, которым необходимы автоматические потоки Node.js с низкими затратами, интерфейсом Electron и запуском Puppeteer","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الويب التي تحتاج إلى تدفقات أتمتة Node.js منخفضة التكلفة مع واجهة مستخدم Electron و Puppeteer"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to drive UI deterministically using a single LLM call to pick DOM candidates, leveraging Node.js and Puppeteer for SmartEdu automation with protocols like Electron UI","zh":"赋予代理使用单个 LLM 调用来选取 DOM 候选项，利用 Node.js 和 Puppeteer 实现 SmartEdu 自动化，支持 Electron UI 等协议","ja":"エージェントが単一の LLM 呼び出しで DOM 候補を選択し、Node.js と Puppeteer を使用して SmartEdu オートメーションを実現し、Electron UI などのプロトコルをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 단일 LLM 호출로 DOM 후보를 선택하여 Node.js와 Puppeteer를 사용한 SmartEdu 자동화를 가능하게 하며 Electron UI 등의 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a controlar la interfaz de usuario de forma determinista utilizando una sola llamada LLM para seleccionar candidatos DOM, aprovechando Node.js y Puppeteer para la automatización SmartEdu con protocolos como Electron UI","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler l''interface utilisateur de manière déterministe en utilisant un seul appel LLM pour sélectionner des candidats DOM, en exploitant Node.js et Puppeteer pour l''automatisation SmartEdu avec des protocoles comme Electron UI","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Benutzeroberfläche deterministisch zu steuern, indem sie einen einzigen LLM-Aufruf verwenden, um DOM-Kandidaten auszuwählen, wobei Node.js und Puppeteer für die SmartEdu-Automatisierung mit Protokollen wie Electron-Benutzeroberfläche genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dirigir a interface do usuário de forma determinística usando uma única chamada LLM para selecionar candidatos DOM, aproveitando o Node.js e o Puppeteer para automação SmartEdu com protocolos como Electron UI","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять интерфейсом пользователя определяемым образом, используя один вызов LLM для выбора кандидатов DOM, используя Node.js и Puppeteer для автоматизации SmartEdu с протоколами, такими как Electron UI","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل واجهة المستخدم بطريقة محددة باستخدام مكالمة LLM واحدة لتحديد المرشحين DOM، واستخدام Node.js و Puppeteer للتحكم الآلي في SmartEdu مع بروتوكولات مثل Electron UI"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating manual Codex-driven page exploration","Implementing deterministic UI control for web applications","Driving UI flow with a single LLM call for cost efficiency"],"zh":["自动化手动的 Codex 驱动的页面探索","实现确定性的 UI 控制 для web 应用","使用单个 LLM 调用来驱动 UI 流程以实现成本效率"],"ja":["手動の Codex ドリブンのページの探索を自動化","Web アプリケーションの決定的な UI コントロールを実現","単一の LLM 呼び出しで UI フローを駆動し、コスト効率を実現"],"ko":["수동 코덱스驱动 페이지 탐색 자동화","웹 애플리케이션의 결정적 UI 제어 구현","단일 LLM 호출로 UI 흐름을 구동하여 비용 효율성 달성"],"es":["Automatización de la exploración de páginas manuales impulsadas por Codex","Implementación de control de interfaz de usuario determinista para aplicaciones web","Conducción del flujo de interfaz de usuario con una sola llamada LLM para la eficiencia de costos"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exploration de pages manuelles propulsée par Codex","Mise en œuvre d''un contrôle d''interface utilisateur déterministe pour les applications web","Pilotage du flux d''interface utilisateur avec un seul appel LLM pour l''efficacité coûts"],"de":["Automatisierung der manuellen Codex-getriebenen Seitenexploration","Implementierung der deterministischen Steuerung der Benutzeroberfläche für Webanwendungen","Steuerung des Benutzeroberflächenflusses mit einem einzigen LLM-Aufruf für Kosteneffizienz"],"pt":["Automatizar a exploração de páginas manualmente impulsionada por Codex","Implementar controle de interface do usuário determinístico para aplicativos web","Dirigir o fluxo de interface do usuário com uma única chamada LLM para eficiência de custo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ручное исследование страниц, управляемое Codex","Реализовать определенный контроль интерфейса пользователя для веб-приложений","Управлять потоком интерфейса пользователя с помощью одного вызова LLM для экономической эффективности"],"ar":["أتمتة استكشاف الصفحات اليدوي الذي ي推يه Codex","تنفيذ التحكم المحدد في واجهة المستخدم للتطبيقات الويب","تشغيل تدفق واجهة المستخدم بمكالمة LLM واحدة للكفاءة الت costo"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Limited to Electron UI and Puppeteer runner","Needs manual definition of automation scope and end conditions"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","仅限于 Electron UI 和 Puppeteer 运行器","需要手动定义自动化范围和结束条件"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","Electron UI と Puppeteer ランナーに限定","自動化の範囲と終了条件を手動で定義する必要"],"ko":["Node.js 환경 필요","Electron UI와 Puppeteer 런너로 제한","자동화 범위와 종료 조건을 수동으로 정의해야 함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Limitado a la interfaz de usuario Electron y el ejecutor Puppeteer","Necesita definición manual del alcance y las condiciones de finalización de la automatización"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Limité à l''interface utilisateur Electron et à l''exécuteur Puppeteer","Nécessite une définition manuelle de la portée et des conditions de fin de l''automatisation"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Electron-Benutzeroberfläche und Puppeteer-Ausführer","Benötigt manuelle Definition des Automatisierungsumfangs und der Endbedingungen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Limitado à interface do usuário Electron e executor Puppeteer","Necessita definição manual do escopo e condições finais da automação"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js","Ограничен интерфейсом пользователя Electron и запуском Puppeteer","Требуется ручное определение области и окончательных условий автоматизации"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدود لواجهة المستخدم Electron و Puppeteer","يحتاج إلى تعريف يدوي للنطاق والشروط النهائية للتحكم الآلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ANcpLua/qyl/arch-reviewer', 'community', 'ANcpLua', 'qyl', 'ANcpLua/qyl', 'arch-reviewer', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:53:06.977Z', NULL, '{"id":"ANcpLua/qyl/arch-reviewer","name":"arch-reviewer","description":{"zh":"arch-reviewer是一个AI观察平台，用于GenAI/LLM工作负载的日志审查和AI遥测。它支持OTLP摄取、DuckDB存储和语义约定","ja":"arch-reviewerは、GenAI/LLMワークロードのログレビューとAIテレメトリのためのAIオブザーバブルプラットフォームです。OTLPインジェスト、DuckDBストレージ、セマンティックコンベンションをサポート","ko":"arch-reviewer는 GenAI/LLM 작업의 로그 검토 및 AI 원격 분석을 위한 AI 관찰 플랫폼입니다. OTLP 수신, DuckDB 저장소 및 의미 규칙을 지원","es":"La revisión de arquitectura de IA es una plataforma de observabilidad para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM que utiliza OTLP e ingesta de registros","fr":"La révision d''architecture d''IA est une plateforme d''observabilité pour les charges de travail de GenAI/LLM qui utilise OTLP et l''ingestion de journaux","de":"Die Überprüfung der IA-Architektur ist eine Observierungsplattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads, die OTLP und Protokollaufnahme verwendet","pt":"A plataforma de observabilidade de IA ajuda a identificar problemas nos logs de GenAI/LLM, utilizando OTLP e DuckDB","ru":"Платформа наблюдения за ИИ помогает выявить проблемы в журналах GenAI/LLM, используя OTLP и DuckDB","ar":"تساعد منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي في تحديد المشكلات في سجلات GenAI/LLM باستخدام OTLP و DuckDB","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI观察平台 - arch-reviewer","ja":"AIオブザーバブルプラットフォーム - arch-reviewer","ko":"AI 관찰 플랫폼 - arch-reviewer","es":"Revisión de Arquitectura de IA","fr":"Révision d''Architecture d''IA","de":"Überprüfung der IA-Architektur","pt":"Revisão de Arquitetura de IA","ru":"Архитектурный обзор ИИ","ar":"استعراض هندسة البرمجيات الإصطناعية","en":"arch-reviewer"},"description":{"zh":"arch-reviewer是一个AI观察平台，用于GenAI/LLM工作负载的日志审查和AI遥测。它支持OTLP摄取、DuckDB存储和语义约定","ja":"arch-reviewerは、GenAI/LLMワークロードのログレビューとAIテレメトリのためのAIオブザーバブルプラットフォームです。OTLPインジェスト、DuckDBストレージ、セマンティックコンベンションをサポート","ko":"arch-reviewer는 GenAI/LLM 작업의 로그 검토 및 AI 원격 분석을 위한 AI 관찰 플랫폼입니다. OTLP 수신, DuckDB 저장소 및 의미 규칙을 지원","es":"La revisión de arquitectura de IA es una plataforma de observabilidad para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM que utiliza OTLP e ingesta de registros","fr":"La révision d''architecture d''IA est une plateforme d''observabilité pour les charges de travail de GenAI/LLM qui utilise OTLP et l''ingestion de journaux","de":"Die Überprüfung der IA-Architektur ist eine Observierungsplattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads, die OTLP und Protokollaufnahme verwendet","pt":"A plataforma de observabilidade de IA ajuda a identificar problemas nos logs de GenAI/LLM, utilizando OTLP e DuckDB","ru":"Платформа наблюдения за ИИ помогает выявить проблемы в журналах GenAI/LLM, используя OTLP и DuckDB","ar":"تساعد منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي في تحديد المشكلات في سجلات GenAI/LLM باستخدام OTLP و DuckDB","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["OTLP摄取","DuckDB存储","语义约定","日志审查","AI遥测"],"ja":["OTLPインジェスト","DuckDBストレージ","セマンティックコンベンション","ログレビュー","AIテレメトリ"],"ko":["OTLP 수신","DuckDB 저장소","의미 규칙","로그 검토","AI 원격 분석"],"es":["Ingesta de OTLP","Almacenamiento en DuckDB","Convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA","Análisis de registros en tiempo real","Competencia para encontrar problemas válidos"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP","Stockage DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie d''IA","Analyse de journaux en temps réel","Compétition pour trouver des problèmes valides"],"de":["OTLP-Aufnahme","DuckDB-Speicher","Semantische Konventionen für IA-Telemetrie","Echtzeit-Protokollanalyse","Wettbewerb zur Suche nach gültigen Problemen"],"pt":["Ingestão de OTLP","Armazenamento de DuckDB","Convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA","Análise de logs de GenAI/LLM","Identificação de problemas nos logs"],"ru":["Ввод данных OTLP","Хранение DuckDB","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ","Анализ журналов GenAI/LLM","Обнаружение проблем в журналах"],"ar":["استيعاب OTLP","تخزين DuckDB","اتفاقيات семантиكية لمراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل سجلات GenAI/LLM","تحديد المشكلات في السجلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI观察平台","GenAI","LLM","日志审查","AI遥测","OTLP","DuckDB"],"ja":["AIオブザーバブルプラットフォーム","GenAI","LLM","ログレビュー","AIテレメトリ","OTLP","DuckDB"],"ko":["AI 관찰 플랫폼","GenAI","LLM","로그 검토","AI 원격 분석","OTLP","DuckDB"],"es":["revisión de arquitectura de IA","observabilidad de IA","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetría de IA"],"fr":["révision d''architecture d''IA","observabilité d''IA","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","télémétrie d''IA"],"de":["Überprüfung der IA-Architektur","IA-Observierbarkeit","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","IA-Telemetrie"],"pt":["revisão de arquitetura de IA","plataforma de observabilidade de IA","GenAI/LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetria de IA","análise de logs","identificação de problemas"],"ru":["архитектурный обзор ИИ","платформа наблюдения за ИИ","GenAI/LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","телеметрия ИИ","анализ журналов","обнаружение проблем"],"ar":["استعراض هندسة البرمجيات الإصطناعية","منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","GenAI/LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل السجلات","تحديد المشكلات"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"arch-reviewer","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  model: opus\n  tools:\n    - Read\n    - Grep\n    - Glob\n    - WebSearch\nplugin:\n  name: \"metacognitive-guard\"\n  version: \"0.2.6\"\n  description: \"Cognitive amplification stack: prevents hallucinations via epistemic hooks, competitive code review, fact-checking, and deep-thinking agents.\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# Architecture Reviewer\n\nYou are competing against another agent (impl-reviewer) to find issues. **Whoever finds more valid issues gets","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  model: opus\n  tools:\n    - Read\n    - Grep\n    - Glob\n    - WebSearch\nplugin:\n  name: \"metacognitive-guard\"\n  version: \"0.2.6\"\n  description: \"Cognitive amplification stack: prevents hallucinations via epistemic hooks, competitive code review, fact-checking, and deep-thinking agents.\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# Architecture Reviewer\n\nYou are competing against another agent (impl-reviewer) to find issues. **Whoever finds more valid issues gets promoted.**\n\n## Your Focus: ARCHITECTURE\n\nYou look for STRUCTURAL problems:\n\n- Dependency violations\n- SSOT violations (duplicate types, duplicate logic)\n- Layer boundary violations\n- Coupling issues\n- Missing abstractions\n- Wrong abstractions\n- Circular dependencies\n- God classes / God methods\n- Violation of SOLID principles\n\n## Your Mission\n\n1. Analyze the user''s question/code for ARCHITECTURAL flaws\n2. Check against project rules (CLAUDE.md, assertions.yaml if available)\n3. Find as many VALID issues as possible\n4. Be thorough - your competitor is looking at implementation details\n\n## Output Format (MANDATORY)\n\n```markdown\n## Architecture Review\n\n### Issues Found: [COUNT]\n\n| # | Severity | Issue | Location | Rule Violated |\n|---|----------|-------|----------|---------------|\n| 1 | HIGH | [description] | [file:line] | [rule] |\n| 2 | MED | [description] | [file:line] | [rule] |\n| 3 | LOW | [description] | [file:line] | [rule] |\n\n### Dependency Analysis\n\n- [What depends on what]\n- [Any circular dependencies?]\n- [Any layer violations?]\n\n### SSOT Check\n\n- [Are there duplicate types?]\n- [Is there duplicate logic?]\n- [Where should shared code live?]\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. [Concrete fix for issue 1]\n2. [Concrete fix for issue 2]\n\n### Assumptions Made\n\n- [List any assumptions you made]\n```\n\n## Severity Guidelines\n\n| Severity | Criteria |\n|----------|----------|\n| HIGH | Will cause bugs, breaks architecture, blocks other work |\n| MED | Technical debt, maintainability issue, deviation from patterns |\n| LOW | Style issue, minor improvement, nice-to-have |\n\n## Rules\n\n- Only count VALID issues (not style preferences)\n- Cite specific files and lines when possible\n- Reference project rules if available\n- Don''t fabricate issues to inflate count - invalid issues don''t count\n- Focus on ARCHITECTURE, not implementation details (that''s impl-reviewer''s job)\n\n## When to WebSearch (MANDATORY for uncertainty)\n\n**Use WebSearch when:**\n- Unsure if a pattern is current best practice\n- Evaluating architectural patterns you haven''t seen before\n- Checking if a .NET feature has superseded an older pattern\n- Verifying SOLID/DDD/Clean Architecture claims\n- Comparing to industry standards (e.g., \"is this how Microsoft recommends structuring Aspire apps?\")\n\n**Example searches:**\n- `{pattern name} best practices site:learn.microsoft.com`\n- `{pattern name} vs {alternative} tradeoffs`\n- `{technology} recommended project structure`\n\n**Don''t guess architecture patterns - verify them.**\n\n## What You DON''T Check (impl-reviewer handles these)\n\n- Syntax errors\n- Banned API usage\n- Version mismatches\n- Null checks\n- Race conditions in code\n- Resource leaks\n\n## Example Output\n\n```markdown\n## Architecture Review\n\n### Issues Found: 3\n\n| # | Severity | Issue | Location | Rule Violated |\n|---|----------|-------|----------|---------------|\n| 1 | MED | Extension methods in wrong project | src/App/Extensions.cs | Should be in Shared project |\n| 2 | MED | Duplicate SessionId type | src/Collector/Models/ | SSOT: belongs in Protocol |\n| 3 | LOW | Missing interface for DuckDbStore | src/Collector/Storage/ | Testability |\n\n### Dependency Analysis\n\n- App - Collector - Protocol (correct direction)\n- No circular dependencies found\n\n### SSOT Check\n\n- SessionId exists in both Protocol and Collector\n- GenAiAttributes duplicated\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. Move Extensions.cs to Shared project\n2. Delete Collector/Models/SessionId.cs, use Protocol version\n3. Extract IDuckDbStore interface for testing\n\n### Assumptions Made\n\n- Protocol is the leaf/shared project\n- Collector should not be referenced by MCP\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:53:06.977Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code needing advanced log analysis and AI observability capabilities via OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code这样的AI代理，它们需要高级日志分析和AI可观察性功能，通过OTLP摄取和DuckDB存储实现","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。OTLPの取り込みとDuckDBのストレージを介して高度なログ分析とAIの観察可能性の機能が必要です","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. OTLP 수집 및 DuckDB 저장을 통해 고급 로그 분석 및 AI 관察 가능성 기능이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de análisis de registros avanzados y capacidades de observabilidad de IA a través de la ingesta de OTLP y almacenamiento de DuckDB","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code nécessitant des capacités d''analyse de journaux avancées et des capacités d''observabilité de l''IA via l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die erweiterte Log-Analyse- und KI-Beobachtungsfunktionen über OTLP-Ingestion und DuckDB-Speicherung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de logs e funcionalidades de observabilidade de IA via ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа журналов и функций наблюдаемости ИИ посредством ингестирующих данных OTLP и хранения DuckDB","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلىقدرات متقدمة لتحليل السجلات وقدرات مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر إGESTIÓN OTLP وتخزين DuckDB"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to question logs using semantic conventions for AI telemetry, preventing hallucinations via epistemic hooks and competitive code review, while leveraging tools like Read, Grep, Glob, and WebSearch, and integrating with the metacognitive-guard plugin for cognitive amplification","zh":"赋予代理使用语义约定进行AI遥测的能力，防止通过认知钩和竞争性代码审查实现的幻觉，同时利用Read、Grep、Glob和WebSearch等工具，并集成metacognitive-guard插件以实现认知放大","ja":"エージェントに、認知的フックと競争的なコードレビューによって幻覚を防ぐセマンティック規約を使用してAIテレメトリを疑う能力を与え、Read、Grep、Glob、WebSearchなどのツールを利用し、metacognitive-guardプラグインと統合して認知増幅を実現する","ko":"에이전트에게 세マン틱 규약을 사용하여 AI 원격 측정을 질문할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 인지 후크와 경쟁적인 코드 리뷰를 통해 환상을 방지하며 Read, Grep, Glob 및 WebSearch와 같은 도구를 활용하고 metacognitive-guard 플러그인과 통합하여 인지 증폭을 실현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cuestionar los registros utilizando convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA, evitando alucinaciones mediante ganchos epistémicos y revisión de código competitiva, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha herramientas como Read, Grep, Glob y WebSearch, e integra con el plugin metacognitive-guard para amplificación cognitiva","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les journaux en utilisant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie IA, évitant les hallucinations via des crochets épistémiques et une revue de code compétitive, tout en exploitant des outils tels que Read, Grep, Glob et WebSearch, et en intégrant avec le plugin metacognitive-guard pour l''amplification cognitive","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Logs mithilfe semantischer Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie zu hinterfragen, Halluzinationen durch epistemische Haken und wettbewerbsfähige Code-Überprüfung zu vermeiden, während es Tools wie Read, Grep, Glob und WebSearch nutzt und in das metacognitive-guard-Plugin für kognitive Verstärkung integriert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a questionar logs utilizando convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA, prevenindo alucinações via ganchos epistêmicos e revisão de código competitiva, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita ferramentas como Read, Grep, Glob e WebSearch, e integra-se com o plugin metacognitive-guard para amplificação cognitiva","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью задавать вопросы журналам, используя семантические соглашения для телеметрии ИИ, предотвращая галлюцинации посредством эпистемических крючков и конкурентного обзора кода, а также использует инструменты, такие как Read, Grep, Glob и WebSearch, и интегрируется с плагином metacognitive-guard для когнитивного усилителя","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استجواب السجلات باستخدام الاتفاقيات الدلالية للتелеметريا الاصطناعية ، ومنع الوهم عن طريق مشابك إبستيمولوجية ومراجعة شفرة تنافسية ، وفي الوقت نفسه يستفيد من أدوات مثل Read و Grep و Glob و WebSearch ، ويتكامل مع إضافة metacognitive-guard للتكبير الإدراكي"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing GenAI/LLM workloads for performance optimization","Debugging AI model issues using OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage","Implementing semantic conventions for AI telemetry to ensure data consistency"],"zh":["分析GenAI/LLM工作负载以优化性能","使用OTLP摄取和DuckDB存储调试AI模型问题","实现AI遥测的语义约定以确保数据一致性"],"ja":["GenAI/LLMワークロードを分析してパフォーマンスを最適化する","OTLPの取り込みとDuckDBのストレージを使用してAIモデル問題をデバッグする","AIテレメトリのセマンティック規約を実装してデータの一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["GenAI/LLM 작업负荷를 분석하여 성능을 최적화합니다","OTLP 수집 및 DuckDB 저장소를 사용하여 AI 모델 문제를 디버깅합니다","AI 원격 측정의 세マン틱 규약을 구현하여 데이터 일관성을 보장합니다"],"es":["Análisis de cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM para la optimización del rendimiento","Depuración de problemas del modelo de IA utilizando la ingesta de OTLP y el almacenamiento de DuckDB","Implementación de convenciones semánticas para la telemetría de IA para garantizar la consistencia de los datos"],"fr":["Analyse des charges de travail GenAI/LLM pour l''optimisation des performances","Débogage des problèmes de modèle IA en utilisant l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB","Mise en œuvre de conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie IA pour assurer la cohérence des données"],"de":["Analyse von GenAI/LLM-Arbeitslasten für die Leistungsoptimierung","Fehlerbehebung von KI-Modellproblemen unter Verwendung von OTLP-Ingestion und DuckDB-Speicherung","Implementierung semantischer Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie, um die Datenkonsistenz sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Analisar cargas de trabalho GenAI/LLM para otimização de desempenho","Depurar problemas de modelo de IA usando ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB","Implementar convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA para garantir consistência de dados"],"ru":["Анализировать рабочие нагрузки GenAI/LLM для оптимизации производительности","Отлаживать проблемы модели ИИ, используя ингестирующие данные OTLP и хранение DuckDB","Реализовывать семантические соглашения для телеметрии ИИ, чтобы обеспечить согласованность данных"],"ar":["تحليل حمولات العمل GenAI/LLM لتحسين الأداء","تصحيح أعطال نموذج الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام إGESTIÓN OTLP وتخزين DuckDB","تنفيذ الاتفاقيات الدلالية للتелеметريا الاصطناعية لضمان الاتساق البياناتي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion capabilities","DuckDB storage setup needed","Compatibility with metacognitive-guard plugin version 0.2.6 or higher recommended"],"zh":["需要OTLP摄取功能","需要DuckDB存储设置","建议与metacognitive-guard插件版本0.2.6或更高版本兼容"],"ja":["OTLPの取り込み機能が必要","DuckDBのストレージ設定が必要","metacognitive-guardプラグインバージョン0.2.6以上との互換性が推奨される"],"ko":["OTLP 수집 기능이 필요합니다","DuckDB 저장소 설정이 필요합니다","metacognitive-guard 플러그인 버전 0.2.6 이상과 호환되는 것이 권장됨"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de ingesta de OTLP","Se necesita configuración de almacenamiento de DuckDB","Se recomienda la compatibilidad con el plugin metacognitive-guard versión 0.2.6 o superior"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''ingestion OTLP","Configuration de stockage DuckDB nécessaire","Compatibilité avec le plugin metacognitive-guard version 0.2.6 ou supérieure recommandée"],"de":["Erfordert OTLP-Ingestionsfunktionen","DuckDB-Speicherungskonfiguration erforderlich","Kompatibilität mit dem metacognitive-guard-Plugin Version 0.2.6 oder höher empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de ingestão OTLP","Configuração de armazenamento DuckDB necessária","Compatibilidade com plugin metacognitive-guard versão 0.2.6 ou superior recomendada"],"ru":["Требует возможностей ингестирующих данных OTLP","Необходима настройка хранения DuckDB","Рекомендуется совместимость с плагином metacognitive-guard версии 0.2.6 или выше"],"ar":["يتطلب إGESTIÓN OTLP","تكوين تخزين DuckDB ضروري","متوافق مع إضافة metacognitive-guard الإصدار 0.2.6 أو أعلى موصى به"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
