angierung und Extraktion von Ergebnissen","Unterstützung für KI-Agents","Protokollversion 1.0.0"],"pt":["Ingestão de documentos","Incorporação de conteúdo","Divisão de documentos","Reclassificação de resultados","Extração de informações","Integração com agentes de IA"],"ru":["Ингестия документов","Встраивание контента","Чанкинг документов","Реранкинг результатов","Извлечение информации","Интеграция с агентами ИИ"],"ar":["استيعاب المستندات","الدمج المحتوى","تقسيم المستندات","إعادة تصنيف النتائج","استخراج المعلومات","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Semantik","plugin"," ","API","1.0.0"," "," "],"ja":["Semantik","plugin"," ","API","1.0.0"," "," "],"ko":["Semantik","plugin"," ","API","1.0.0"," "," "],"es":["desarrollo de plugins semantik","motor de búsqueda semántico autoalojado","ingesta de documentos","incrustación y chunking","reordenamiento y extracción","agentes de IA","protocolo de versión 1.0.0"],"fr":["développement de plugins semantik","moteur de recherche sémantique auto-hébergé","ingestion de documents","incrustation et chunking","réordonnancement et extraction","agents IA","protocole de version 1.0.0"],"de":["semantik-plugin-entwicklung","selbstgehostete semantische suchmaschine","dokumenten-ingestion","einbettung und chunking","neurangierung und extraktion","ki-agents","protokollversion 1.0.0"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de plugin semantik","motor de busca semântico","ingestão de documentos","incorporação de conteúdo","divisão de documentos","reclassificação de resultados","extração de informações","integração com agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["разработка плагина семантик","семантический поисковый движок","ингестия документов","встраивание контента","чанкинг документов","реранкинг результатов","извлечение информации","интеграция с агентами ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير مكون إضافي семانتيك","محرك بحث دلالي","استيعاب المستندات","الدمج المحتوى","تقسيم المستندات","إعادة تصنيف النتائج","استخراج المعلومات","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"jbmiller10","repo":"semantik-plugin-template","repoPath":"jbmiller10/semantik-plugin-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"semantik-plugin-development","description":"Create semantik plugins (connectors, embeddings, chunkers, rerankers, extractors, agents). Use when developing plugins, creating new integrations, or asking about plugin patterns, protocols, or testing.","bodyPreview":"# Semantik Plugin Development\n\nThis skill helps you create plugins for Semantik, a self-hosted semantic search engine. Plugins extend Semantik''s capabilities for document ingestion, embedding, chunking, reranking, extraction, and AI agents.\n\n## Protocol Version\n\n**Current Version:** 1.0.0\n\nBreaking changes to protocols increment the major version. Your plugins continue to work as long as they satisfy the protocol interface.\n\n## Security Note\n\nPlugins run **in-process** with the main Semantik app","body":"# Semantik Plugin Development\n\nThis skill helps you create plugins for Semantik, a self-hosted semantic search engine. Plugins extend Semantik''s capabilities for document ingestion, embedding, chunking, reranking, extraction, and AI agents.\n\n## Protocol Version\n\n**Current Version:** 1.0.0\n\nBreaking changes to protocols increment the major version. Your plugins continue to work as long as they satisfy the protocol interface.\n\n## Security Note\n\nPlugins run **in-process** with the main Semantik application (no sandboxing). Only install plugins you trust. See [Security Guide](security-guide.md) for details.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nCreate a minimal connector plugin in 5 minutes:\n\n```python\n# my_connector.py\nfrom typing import ClassVar, Any, AsyncIterator\nimport hashlib\n\nclass MyConnector:\n    PLUGIN_ID: ClassVar[str] = \"my-connector\"\n    PLUGIN_TYPE: ClassVar[str] = \"connector\"\n    PLUGIN_VERSION: ClassVar[str] = \"1.0.0\"\n\n    def __init__(self, config: dict[str, Any]) -> None:\n        self._config = config\n\n    async def authenticate(self) -> bool:\n        return True\n\n    async def load_documents(self, source_id: int | None = None) -> AsyncIterator[dict[str, Any]]:\n        content = \"Document content...\"\n        yield {\n            \"content\": content,\n            \"unique_id\": \"doc-1\",\n            \"source_type\": self.PLUGIN_ID,\n            \"metadata\": {},\n            \"content_hash\": hashlib.sha256(content.encode()).hexdigest(),\n        }\n\n    @classmethod\n    def get_config_fields(cls) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:\n        return []\n\n    @classmethod\n    def get_secret_fields(cls) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:\n        return []\n\n    @classmethod\n    def get_manifest(cls) -> dict[str, Any]:\n        return {\"id\": cls.PLUGIN_ID, \"type\": cls.PLUGIN_TYPE, \"version\": cls.PLUGIN_VERSION,\n                \"display_name\": \"My Connector\", \"description\": \"Custom connector\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Plugin Types\n\n| Type | Purpose | Key Method | Template |\n|------|---------|------------|----------|\n| `connector` | Ingest documents from sources | `load_documents()` | [connector.py](../../../templates/connector.py) |\n| `embedding` | Convert text to vectors | `embed_texts()` | [embedding.py](../../../templates/embedding.py) |\n| `chunking` | Split documents into chunks | `chunk()` | [chunking.py](../../../templates/chunking.py) |\n| `reranker` | Reorder search results | `rerank()` | [reranker.py](../../../templates/reranker.py) |\n| `extractor` | Extract entities/metadata | `extract()` | [extractor.py](../../../templates/extractor.py) |\n| `agent` | LLM-powered capabilities | `execute()` | [agent.py](../../../templates/agent.py) |\n\n**Type-specific guides:**\n- [Connector Guide](connector-guide.md) - Document sources, async iterators\n- [Embedding Guide](embedding-guide.md) - Query/document modes, dimensions\n- [Chunking Guide](chunking-guide.md) - Text segmentation strategies\n- [Reranker Guide](reranker-guide.md) - Cross-encoder reranking\n- [Extractor Guide](extractor-guide.md) - Entity and metadata extraction\n- [Agent Guide](agent-guide.md) - LLM agents, streaming, context\n\n**Cross-cutting guides:**\n- [Testing Guide](testing-guide.md) - Contract tests, mocks, fixtures\n- [Security Guide](security-guide.md) - Trust model, best practices\n- [Advanced Guide](advanced-guide.md) - Health checks, dependencies, migration\n\n---\n\n## Development Approach\n\n### Protocol-Based (Recommended)\n\nUse plain Python classes with no semantik imports. Plugins are validated by structural typing (duck typing):\n\n```python\nclass MyPlugin:\n    PLUGIN_ID: ClassVar[str] = \"my-plugin\"\n    PLUGIN_TYPE: ClassVar[str] = \"connector\"  # or embedding, chunking, etc.\n    PLUGIN_VERSION: ClassVar[str] = \"1.0.0\"\n    # ... implement required methods\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Zero dependencies on semantik\n- Develop in separate repository\n- Distribute via PyPI or git\n- No version conflicts\n\n### ABC-Based (Advanced)\n\nInherit from semantik base classes when you need access to internal utilities:\n\n```python\nfrom shared.connectors.base import BaseConnector\n\nclass MyConnector(BaseConnector):\n    # ... inherit helper methods\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- Building embedding plugins with GPU management\n- Need access to shared utilities\n- Developing internal/builtin plugins\n\n---\n\n## Required Class Variables\n\nEvery plugin must define:\n\n```python\nfrom typing import ClassVar, Any\n\nclass MyPlugin:\n    PLUGIN_ID: ClassVar[str] = \"my-plugin\"      # Unique ID (lowercase, hyphens)\n    PLUGIN_TYPE: ClassVar[str] = \"connector\"    # One of 6 types\n    PLUGIN_VERSION: ClassVar[str] = \"1.0.0\"     # Semantic version\n```\n\nSome plugin types require additional class variables:\n\n| Type | Additional Variables |\n|------|---------------------|\n| `connector` | `METADATA` (dict with name, description, icon) |\n| `embedding` | `INTERNAL_NAME`, `API_ID`, `PROVIDER_TYPE`, `METADATA` |\n| `chunking` | (none) |\n| `reranker` | (none) |\n| `extractor` | (none) |\n| `agent` | (none) |\n\n---\n\n## Manifest Method\n\nAll plugins must implement `get_manifest()`:\n\n```python\n@classmethod\ndef get_manifest(cls) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    return {\n        \"id\": cls.PLUGIN_ID,\n        \"type\": cls.PLUGIN_TYPE,\n        \"version\": cls.PLUGIN_VERSION,\n        \"display_name\": \"My Plugin\",\n        \"description\": \"What the plugin does\",\n        # Optional fields:\n        \"author\": \"Your Name\",\n        \"license\": \"MIT\",\n        \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/...\",\n        \"requires\": [\"other-plugin\"],  # Dependencies\n        \"capabilities\": {},  # Plugin-specific capabilities\n    }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Config Fields (UI)\n\nDefine configuration fields for the Semantik UI:\n\n```python\n@classmethod\ndef get_config_fields(cls) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:\n    return [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"base_url\",\n            \"type\": \"text\",        # text, password, number, boolean, select\n            \"label\": \"Base URL\",\n            \"description\": \"API endpoint\",\n            \"required\": True,\n            \"placeholder\": \"https://api.example.com\",\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"model\",\n            \"type\": \"select\",\n            \"label\": \"Model\",\n            \"options\": [\"model-a\", \"model-b\"],\n            \"default\": \"model-a\",\n        },\n    ]\n```\n\n### Secret Fields\n\nMark fields that contain secrets (encrypted at rest):\n\n```python\n@classmethod\ndef get_secret_fields(cls) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:\n    return [\n        {\"name\": \"api_key\", \"label\": \"API Key\", \"required\": True},\n    ]\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\nUse the `_env` suffix pattern for secrets:\n\n```python\n# In config schema - user enters env var name\n\"api_key_env\": \"OPENAI_API_KEY\"\n\n# At runtime, semantik resolves it\nconfig = {\"api_key\": \"sk-actual-key-value\"}  # Resolved\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Manual Verification\n\n```bash\npip install -e .\npython -c \"\nfrom my_plugin import MyConnector\nprint(f''ID: {MyConnector.PLUGIN_ID}'')\nprint(f''Type: {MyConnector.PLUGIN_TYPE}'')\nprint(f''Manifest: {MyConnector.get_manifest()}'')\n\"\n```\n\n### Protocol Validation\n\n```python\nimport pytest\n\nclass TestMyPlugin:\n    def test_has_required_attributes(self):\n        assert hasattr(MyPlugin, \"PLUGIN_ID\")\n        assert hasattr(MyPlugin, \"PLUGIN_TYPE\")\n        assert hasattr(MyPlugin, \"PLUGIN_VERSION\")\n        assert MyPlugin.PLUGIN_TYPE == \"connector\"\n\n    def test_manifest_format(self):\n        manifest = MyPlugin.get_manifest()\n        assert \"id\" in manifest\n        assert \"type\" in manifest\n        assert \"display_name\" in manifest\n\n    @pytest.mark.asyncio\n    async def test_core_functionality(self):\n        plugin = MyPlugin(config={})\n        # Test plugin-specific methods\n```\n\n### With Semantik Test Mixins\n\nIf semantik is installed:\n\n```python\nfrom shared.plugins.testing.contracts import ConnectorProtocolTestMixin\n\nclass TestMyConnector(ConnectorProtocolTestMixin):\n    plugin_class = MyConnector\n```\n\n---\n\n## Packaging\n\n### pyproject.toml\n\n```toml\n[project]\nname = \"semantik-plugin-myconnector\"\nversion = \"1.0.0\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.10\"\ndependencies = []  # Your dependencies only\n\n[project.entry-points.\"semantik.plugins\"]\nmy-connector = \"my_plugin.connector:MyConnector\"\n\n[build-system]\nrequires = [\"hatchling\"]\nbuild-backend = \"hatchling.build\"\n```\n\nSee [templates/pyproject.toml](../../../templates/pyproject.toml) for a complete template.\n\n### Entry Point Format\n\n```\nplugin-id = \"module.path:ClassName\"\n```\n\n- `plugin-id`: Should match `PLUGIN_ID`\n- `module.path`: Python import path\n- `ClassName`: Your plugin class\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Development\npip install -e .\n\n# From git\npip install git+https://github.com/you/semantik-plugin-myconnector.git\n\n# Via Semantik API\nPOST /api/v2/plugins/install\n{\"install_command\": \"git+https://github.com/...\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Plugin Not Loading\n\n1. Check entry point is registered:\n   ```bash\n   pip show semantik-plugin-myconnector\n   ```\n\n2. Verify PLUGIN_TYPE is valid:\n   ```python\n   assert PLUGIN_TYPE in [\"connector\", \"embedding\", \"chunking\", \"reranker\", \"extractor\", \"agent\"]\n   ```\n\n3. Check for import errors:\n   ```python\n   try:\n       from my_plugin import MyConnector\n   except ImportError as e:\n       print(f\"Error: {e}\")\n   ```\n\n### Validation Errors\n\n| Error | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| `missing required keys: {''content''}` | Add all required fields to returned dict |\n| `Invalid role: ''xyz''` | Use valid string from MESSAGE_ROLES |\n| `content_hash must be 64 characters` | Use `hashlib.sha256(text.encode()).hexdigest()` |\n\n### Async Issues\n\nAll I/O methods must be async:\n\n```python\n# Wrong\ndef load_documents(self):\n    yield {\"content\": \"...\"}\n\n# Right\nasync def load_documents(self) -> AsyncIterator[dict]:\n    yield {\"content\": \"...\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Templates\n\nReady-to-use templates in `templates/`:\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `connector.py` | Document source connector |\n| `embedding.py` | Embedding model provider |\n| `chunking.py` | Text chunking strategy |\n| `reranker.py` | Search result reranker |\n| `extractor.py` | Entity/metadata extractor |\n| `agent.py` | LLM-powered agent |\n| `pyproject.toml` | Package configuration |\n\nCopy a template and modify:\n\n```bash\ncp templates/connector.py my_connector.py\n# Edit PLUGIN_ID, PLUGIN_VERSION, and implement methods\n```\n\n---\n\n## Data Format Reference\n\n### Connector Documents (IngestedDocumentDict)\n\n```python\n{\n    \"content\": str,              # Full text (required)\n    \"unique_id\": str,            # Unique identifier (required)\n    \"source_type\": str,          # Your PLUGIN_ID (required)\n    \"metadata\": dict,            # Source metadata (required)\n    \"content_hash\": str,         # SHA-256, 64 hex chars (required)\n    \"file_path\": str | None,     # Local path (optional)\n}\n```\n\n### Chunk Format (ChunkDict)\n\n```python\n{\n    \"content\": str,              # Chunk text (required)\n    \"metadata\": {                # Chunk metadata (required)\n        \"chunk_index\": int,\n        \"start_offset\": int,\n        \"end_offset\": int,\n    },\n    \"chunk_id\": str | None,      # Unique ID (optional)\n    \"embedding\": list[float] | None,  # Pre-computed (optional)\n}\n```\n\n### Rerank Result (RerankResultDict)\n\n```python\n{\n    \"index\": int,                # Original document index (required)\n    \"score\": float,              # Relevance score (required)\n    \"text\": str | None,          # Document text (optional)\n    \"metadata\": dict | None,     # Metadata (optional)\n}\n```\n\n### Agent Message (AgentMessageDict)\n\n```python\n{\n    \"id\": str,                   # Unique ID (required)\n    \"role\": str,                 # user, assistant, system, tool_call, tool_result, error\n    \"type\": str,                 # text, thinking, tool_use, tool_output, partial, final, error\n    \"content\": str,              # Message content (required)\n    \"timestamp\": str,            # ISO 8601 (required)\n    \"is_partial\": bool,          # Streaming partial (optional)\n    \"sequence_number\": int,      # Message order (optional)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Getting Help\n\n- **Semantik docs**: See `semantik/docs/external-plugins.md` for protocol details\n- **Protocol reference**: See `semantik/docs/plugin-protocols.md` for full specifications\n- **Examples**: Check `semantik/packages/shared/plugins/builtins/` for built-in plugins\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:55:01.329Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced semantic search capabilities through plugin development for Semantik","zh":"非常适合需要通过Semantik插件开发来实现高级语义搜索功能的AI代理","ja":"Semantikのプラグイン開発を通じて高度なセマンティック検索機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Semantik의 플러그인 개발을 통해 고급 의미 검색 기능을 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽한 솔루션","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda semántica avanzadas a través del desarrollo de plugins para Semantik","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités de recherche sémantique avancées via le développement de plugins pour Semantik","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte semantische Suchfunktionen durch Plugin-Entwicklung für Semantik benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de busca semântica avançadas por meio do desenvolvimento de plugins para Semantik","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы расширенные возможности семантического поиска через разработку плагинов для Semantik","ar":"مثالي لعمليات 智能 الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات بحث دلالية متقدمة من خلال تطوير البرامج المساعدة لبرنامج Semantik"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend Semantik''s capabilities for document ingestion, embedding, chunking, reranking, extraction, and AI agents using protocol version 1.0.0, ensuring seamless integration and security through in-process execution","zh":"赋予代理扩展Semantik的功能，以实现文档摄取、嵌入、分块、重新排名、提取，并确保使用协议版本1.0.0的AI代理的无缝集成和安全性，通过进程内执行","ja":"エージェントにSemantikの機能を拡張する力を与え、ドキュメントの摄取、埋め込み、チャンキング、再ランキング、抽出を行い、プロトコルバージョン1.0.0を使用するAIエージェントのシームレスな統合とセキュリティを、プロセス内実行を通じて確保する","ko":"에이전트에게 세만틱의 기능을 확장할 수 있는 힘을 부여하여 문서摄取, 삽입, 분할, 재정렬, 추출 등을 수행하며 프로토콜 버전 1.0.0을 사용하는 AI 에이전트의 무결점 통합 및 보안을 프로세스 내 실행을 통해 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar las capacidades de Semantik para la ingesta de documentos, incrustación, división, reordenación, extracción y agentes de IA que utilizan la versión de protocolo 1.0.0, garantizando una integración y seguridad sin problemas a través de la ejecución en proceso","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre les capacités de Semantik pour l''ingestion de documents, l''incorporation, la division, la réorganisation, l''extraction et les agents IA utilisant la version de protocole 1.0.0, assurant une intégration et une sécurité sans problème grâce à l''exécution en processeus","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Fähigkeiten von Semantik für die Dokumenten-Einbindung, Einbettung, Chunking, Neubewertung, Extraktion und KI-Agents, die Protokollversion 1.0.0 verwenden, zu erweitern, und stellt so eine nahtlose Integration und Sicherheit durch die Ausführung im Prozess sicher","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender as capacidades do Semantik para ingestão de documentos, incorporação, divisão em pedaços, reclassificação, extração e agentes de IA que usam a versão 1.0.0 do protocolo, garantindo uma integração perfeita e segurança por meio da execução no processo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расширить возможности Semantik для ингести документов, встраивания, чанкинга, переупорядочения, извлечения и агентов ИИ, использующих версию протокола 1.0.0, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию и безопасность посредством выполнения в процессе","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من توسيع قدرات Semantik لاستيعاب الوثائق ودمجها وتقسيمها وإعادة تصنيفها واستخراجها ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يستخدمون الإصدار 1.0.0 من بروتوكول ، مما يضمن التكامل السلس والسلامة من خلال التنفيذ في العملية"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom plugins for document ingestion and processing","Creating advanced embedding and chunking algorithms for semantic search","Implementing AI-powered reranking and extraction techniques for enhanced search results"],"zh":["为文档摄取和处理开发自定义插件","为语义搜索创建高级嵌入和分块算法","实现AI驱动的重新排名和提取技术以增强搜索结果"],"ja":["ドキュメントの摄取と処理のためのカスタムプラグインを開発する","セマンティック検索のための高度な埋め込みとチャンキングアルゴリズムを作成する","検索結果の強化のためのAI駆動の再ランキングと抽出技術を実装する"],"ko":["문서摄取 및 처리를 위한 사용자 지정 플러그인 개발","의미 검색을 위한 고급 삽입 및 분할 알고리즘 생성","검색 결과 향상을 위한 AI 기반 재정렬 및 추출 기술 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar plugins personalizados para la ingesta y procesamiento de documentos","Crear algoritmos de incrustación y división avanzados para la búsqueda semántica","Implementar técnicas de reordenación y extracción impulsadas por IA para resultados de búsqueda mejorados"],"fr":["Développer des plugins personnalisés pour l''ingestion et le traitement de documents","Créer des algorithmes d''incorporation et de division avancés pour la recherche sémantique","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de réorganisation et d''extraction pilotées par l''IA pour des résultats de recherche améliorés"],"de":["Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Plugins für die Dokumenten-Einbindung und -Verarbeitung","Erstellung von fortschrittlichen Einbettungs- und Chunking-Algorithmen für die semantische Suche","Implementierung von KI-gesteuerten Reranking- und Extraktions-Techniken für verbesserte Suchergebnisse"],"pt":["Desenvolver plugins personalizados para ingestão e processamento de documentos","Criar algoritmos avançados de incorporação e divisão em pedaços para busca semântica","Implementar técnicas de reclassificação e extração impulsionadas por IA para resultados de busca aprimorados"],"ru":["Разработка собственных плагинов для ингести и обработки документов","Создание расширенных алгоритмов встраивания и чанкинга для семантического поиска","Реализация методов переупорядочения и извлечения, основанных на ИИ, для улучшения результатов поиска"],"ar":["تطوير برامج مساعدة مخصصة لاستيعاب الوثائق والمعالجة","إنشاء خوارزميات متقدمة لدمج وتقسيم للبحث الدلالي","تنفيذ تقنيات إعادة تصنيف واستخراج مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي للحصول على نتائج بحث محسّنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with protocol version 1.0.0","Plugins run in-process with the main Semantik app, posing potential security risks if not properly validated"],"zh":["需要与协议版本1.0.0兼容","插件在主Semantik应用程序中进程内运行，如果没有正确验证，可能会带来潜在的安全风险"],"ja":["プロトコルバージョン1.0.0との互換性が必要","プラグインはメインのSemantikアプリケーション内でプロセス内実行されるため、適切に検証しないと潜在的なセキュリティリスクをもたらす"],"ko":["프로토콜 버전 1.0.0와의 호환성이 필요","플러그인은 메인 세만틱 애플리케이션에서 프로세스 내 실행되므로 적절하게 검증하지 않으면 잠재적인 보안 위험을 초래할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la versión de protocolo 1.0.0","Los plugins se ejecutan en proceso con la aplicación principal de Semantik, lo que plantea posibles riesgos de seguridad si no se validan correctamente"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec la version de protocole 1.0.0","Les plugins s''exécutent en processeus avec l''application principale de Semantik, ce qui pose des risques de sécurité potentiels si ils ne sont pas validés correctement"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit der Protokollversion 1.0.0","Plugins werden im Prozess mit der Hauptanwendung von Semantik ausgeführt, was potenzielle Sicherheitsrisiken darstellt, wenn sie nicht ordnungsgemäß validiert werden"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com a versão 1.0.0 do protocolo","Os plugins são executados no processo principal do Semantik, o que pode representar riscos de segurança potenciais se não forem validados corretamente"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с версией протокола 1.0.0","Плагины выполняются в процессе основного приложения Semantik, что может представлять потенциальные риски безопасности, если они не будут правильно проверены"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع الإصدار 1.0.0 من البروتوكول","تُشغّل البرامج المساعدة في عملية برنامج Semantik الرئيسية ، مما قد يشكّل مخاطر أمنية محتملة إذا لم يتم التحقق منها بشكل صحيح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yellinzero/aico/aico-backend-task-breakdown', 'community', 'yellinzero', 'aico', 'yellinzero/aico', 'aico-backend-task-breakdown', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:54:43.299Z', NULL, '{"id":"yellinzero/aico/aico-backend-task-breakdown","name":"aico-backend-task-breakdown","description":{"zh":"AI 后端任务分解允许您快速建立 AI 团队并立即开始工作。通过任务分解和文件命名规范，简化您的开发流程","ja":"AI バックエンドタスクブレークダウンにより、即座に AI チームを構築し、すぐに作業を開始できます","ko":"AI 백엔드 태스크 분해를 통해 몇 초 만에 AI 팀을 구축하고 즉시 작업을 시작할 수 있습니다","es":"Desglose de tareas de backend de AI para empezar a trabajar de inmediato. Sigue nuestras reglas críticas para crear y gestionar tareas de manera efectiva.","fr":"Décomposition de tâches de backend d''IA pour commencer à travailler immédiatement. Suivez nos règles critiques pour créer et gérer des tâches de manière efficace.","de":"Aufgabenzerlegung von Backend von KI, um sofort mit der Arbeit zu beginnen. Befolgen Sie unsere kritischen Regeln, um Aufgaben effektiv zu erstellen und zu verwalten.","pt":"Divida tarefas de backend para sua equipe de IA de forma eficiente e comece a trabalhar imediatamente","ru":"Разбейте задачи бэкенда для вашей команды ИИ быстро и эффективно","ar":"قسم مهام الخلفية لفريقك الاصطناعي بفعالية وبدء العمل على الفور","en":"Build your AI team in seconds, start working immediately"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI 后端任务分解 - 即刻开始您的 AI 团队建设","ja":"AI バックエンドタスクブレークダウン - 今すぐ始める","ko":"AI 백엔드 태스크 분해 - 즉시 시작하기","es":"Desglose de tareas de backend de AI en segundos","fr":"Décomposition de tâches de backend d''IA en quelques secondes","de":"Backend-Aufgabenzerlegung von KI in Sekundenschnelle","pt":"Divisão de Tarefas de Backend AI","ru":"Разбивка задач бэкенда AI","ar":"تقسيم مهام الخلفية الإصدار","en":"aico-backend-task-breakdown"},"description":{"zh":"AI 后端任务分解允许您快速建立 AI 团队并立即开始工作。通过任务分解和文件命名规范，简化您的开发流程","ja":"AI バックエンドタスクブレークダウンにより、即座に AI チームを構築し、すぐに作業を開始できます","ko":"AI 백엔드 태스크 분해를 통해 몇 초 만에 AI 팀을 구축하고 즉시 작업을 시작할 수 있습니다","es":"Desglose de tareas de backend de AI para empezar a trabajar de inmediato. Sigue nuestras reglas críticas para crear y gestionar tareas de manera efectiva.","fr":"Décomposition de tâches de backend d''IA pour commencer à travailler immédiatement. Suivez nos règles critiques pour créer et gérer des tâches de manière effi...","de":"Aufgabenzerlegung von Backend von KI, um sofort mit der Arbeit zu beginnen. Befolgen Sie unsere kritischen Regeln, um Aufgaben effektiv zu erstellen und zu v...","pt":"Divida tarefas de backend para sua equipe de IA de forma eficiente e comece a trabalhar imediatamente","ru":"Разбейте задачи бэкенда для вашей команды ИИ быстро и эффективно","ar":"قسم مهام الخلفية لفريقك الاصطناعي بفعالية وبدء العمل على الفور","en":"Build your AI team in seconds, start working immediately"},"definition":{"en":"Build your AI team in seconds, start working immediately"},"features":{"zh":["快速建立 AI 团队","即时开始工作","任务分解","文件命名规范","简化开发流程"],"ja":["AI チームの迅速な構築","即時の作業開始","タスクブレークダウン","ファイル命名規則","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["AI 팀의 빠른 구축","즉시 작업 시작","태스크 분해","파일命名 규칙","개발 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Creación de archivos de tareas de manera eficiente","Gestión de tareas existentes de forma efectiva","Patrón de nombramiento de archivos único","Verificación de archivos de tareas existentes","Actualización de tareas existentes de forma segura"],"fr":["Création de fichiers de tâches de manière efficace","Gestion de tâches existantes de façon efficace","Modèle de nommage de fichiers unique","Vérification de fichiers de tâches existants","Mise à jour de tâches existantes de manière sécurisée"],"de":["Erstellung von Aufgabendateien auf effiziente Weise","Verwaltung von bestehenden Aufgaben auf effektive Weise","Einzigartiges Dateinamensmuster","Überprüfung von bestehenden Aufgabendateien","Sichere Aktualisierung von bestehenden Aufgaben"],"pt":["Crie arquivos de tarefas personalizados","Verifique arquivos de tarefas existentes","Atualize tarefas existentes","Crie novas tarefas","Gerencie tarefas de desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["Создайте пользовательские файлы задач","Проверьте существующие файлы задач","Обновите существующие задачи","Создайте новые задачи","Управляйте задачами разработки ИИ"],"ar":["انشئ ملفات مهام مخصصة","تحقق من ملفات المهام الحالية","تحديث المهام الحالية","انشئ مهام جديدة","ادارة مهام تطوير الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 后端任务分解","AI 团队建设","任务分解","文件命名规范","开发流程简化","AI 开发"],"ja":["AI バックエンドタスクブレークダウン","AI チーム構築","タスクブレークダウン","ファイル命名規則","開発プロセス簡素化","AI 開発"],"ko":["AI 백엔드 태스크 분해","AI 팀 구축","태스크 분해","파일命名 규칙","개발 프로세스 간소화","AI 개발"],"es":["desglose de tareas de backend de AI","creación de equipo de AI","gestión de tareas de backend","patrón de nombramiento de archivos","verificación de archivos de tareas existentes","actualización de tareas existentes"],"fr":["décomposition de tâches de backend d''IA","création d''équipe d''IA","gestion de tâches de backend","modèle de nommage de fichiers","vérification de fichiers de tâches existants","mise à jour de tâches existantes"],"de":["Aufgabenzerlegung von Backend von KI","Erstellung von KI-Team","Verwaltung von Backend-Aufgaben","Dateinamensmuster","Überprüfung von bestehenden Aufgabendateien","Sichere Aktualisierung von bestehenden Aufgaben"],"pt":["divisão de tarefas de backend","desenvolvimento de IA","gerenciamento de tarefas","arquivos de tarefas","tarefas personalizadas","desenvolvimento de software","equipe de IA"],"ru":["разбивка задач бэкенда","разработка ИИ","управление задачами","файлы задач","пользовательские задачи","разработка программного обеспечения","команда ИИ"],"ar":["تقسيم مهام الخلفية","تطوير الاصطناعي","ادارة المهام","ملفات المهام","مهام مخصصة","تطوير البرمجيات","فريق الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"yellinzero","repo":"aico","repoPath":"yellinzero/aico","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aico-backend-task-breakdown","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Task Breakdown\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - READ FIRST\n\n**BEFORE doing anything, you MUST:**\n\n1. **CHECK EXISTING TASK FILE FIRST**:\n   - ALWAYS check if `story-{story-name}.md` already exists in `docs/reference/backend/tasks/`\n   - If exists: READ it and continue from current progress (add new tasks or update existing ones)\n   - If not exists: Create new task breakdown file\n   - **NEVER re-break down existing tasks**\n\n2. **FILE NAMING**:\n   - Pattern: `story-{story-name}.md` (single file per story","body":"# Task Breakdown\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - READ FIRST\n\n**BEFORE doing anything, you MUST:**\n\n1. **CHECK EXISTING TASK FILE FIRST**:\n   - ALWAYS check if `story-{story-name}.md` already exists in `docs/reference/backend/tasks/`\n   - If exists: READ it and continue from current progress (add new tasks or update existing ones)\n   - If not exists: Create new task breakdown file\n   - **NEVER re-break down existing tasks**\n\n2. **FILE NAMING**:\n   - Pattern: `story-{story-name}.md` (single file per story)\n   - Example: `story-user-profile.md`\n   - All tasks for this story go into this ONE file\n   - Tasks are separated by `---` dividers\n\n3. **MULTIPLE TASKS IN ONE FILE**:\n   - One file contains ALL tasks for the story\n   - Each task = independently testable section\n   - Clear scope and acceptance criteria per task\n   - Tasks numbered sequentially (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)\n\n4. **ALWAYS SAVE TO CORRECT PATH**:\n   - Path: `docs/reference/backend/tasks/story-{story-name}.md`\n   - NO exceptions, NO other locations\n\n5. **READ CONTEXT FIRST**:\n   - Read story from `docs/reference/pm/stories/`\n   - Read constraints from `docs/reference/backend/constraints.md`\n\n## Language Configuration\n\nBefore generating any content, check `aico.json` in project root for `language` field to determine the output language. If not set, default to English.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Read story/PRD**: Load from `docs/reference/pm/stories/` or `docs/reference/pm/versions/`\n2. **Read constraints**: Load technical constraints\n3. **Identify components**: What backend layers are needed\n4. **Identify interactions**: What APIs and data flows are needed\n5. **Break into tasks**: Independently testable, single responsibility, by architecture layer\n6. **Order by dependencies**: Types → DB → Repository → Service → API → Tests\n7. **Generate single file**: Create `story-{story-name}.md` with all tasks in sections\n8. **Update Story file**: Add \"Related Tasks\" section to story file with link to task file\n9. **Summary**: Show created file and next steps\n\n## Task File Format\n\nSee [Task File Template](references/task-file-template.md) for complete structure.\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Single file contains all tasks for the story\n- Tasks numbered sequentially (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)\n- Each task has: Description, Context, Acceptance Criteria, Scope, Implementation Steps\n- Progress section at the end tracks completion\n- Both story-based and standalone use the same format (only filename differs)\n- Backend tasks ordered by architecture layers: Types → DB → Repository → Service → API → Tests\n\n## Updating Story File\n\nAfter generating the task file, **ALWAYS** update the story file to add the \"Related Tasks\" section:\n\n```markdown\n## Related Tasks\n\n### Backend Tasks\n\nTask breakdown: [docs/reference/backend/tasks/story-user-profile.md](../backend/tasks/story-user-profile.md)\n\n**Progress**: 0/6 tasks completed\n\n- [ ] Task 1: Define Types\n- [ ] Task 2: Database Schema\n- [ ] Task 3: Repository Layer\n- [ ] Task 4: Service Layer\n- [ ] Task 5: API Endpoints\n- [ ] Task 6: Add Tests\n```\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Add this section at the end of the story file (before any existing notes)\n- Include link to the task file\n- Use `- [ ]` checkboxes for each task (will be checked when task completes)\n- List tasks in execution order (Types → DB → Repository → Service → API → Tests)\n- Keep the section organized by frontend/backend if both exist\n- Include progress counter (X/Y tasks completed)\n\n## Output Example\n\nAfter breaking down \"user-profile\" story:\n\n```\nCreated task file for story ''user-profile'':\n\n✓ docs/reference/backend/tasks/story-user-profile.md\n\nTask breakdown includes:\n- Task 1: Define Types (setup)\n- Task 2: Database Schema (feature)\n- Task 3: Repository Layer (feature)\n- Task 4: Service Layer (feature)\n- Task 5: API Endpoints (feature)\n- Task 6: Add Tests (testing)\n\nTotal: 6 tasks\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review task breakdown in story-user-profile.md\n2. Use /backend.plan to add detailed steps to specific tasks\n3. Use /backend.implement to start executing tasks\n```\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- ALWAYS create a single file containing all tasks for the story\n- MUST use `story-{story-name}.md` naming (NOT multiple files)\n- ALWAYS include test tasks at the end\n- MUST note dependencies between tasks (in each task''s metadata)\n- Keep tasks focused - not too big, not too small\n- Each task section is self-contained with clear acceptance criteria\n- Separate tasks with `---` dividers\n- Include Story Progress section at the end of file\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- ❌ Tasks too large (full feature) → ✅ Break into layers\n- ❌ Tasks too small (add one field) → ✅ Group related work\n- ❌ Skip dependencies → ✅ Note which tasks depend on others\n- ❌ Forget testing → ✅ Always include test tasks\n- ❌ Create multiple files → ✅ Use single file with multiple task sections\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:54:43.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing structured task breakdown capabilities for backend development.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化任务分解能力的任务管理代理的后端开发。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントがバックエンド開発のための構造化されたタスク分解機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 태스크 분할 기능을 필요로 하는 태스크 관리 에이전트의 백엔드 개발에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de tareas que necesitan capacidades de desglose de tareas estructuradas para el desarrollo de backend.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant des capacités de décomposition de tâches structurées pour le développement backend.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die strukturierte Aufgabenabbrechnungsfunktionen für die Backend-Entwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de capacidades de quebra de tarefas estruturadas para desenvolvimento backend.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих структурированного разбиения задач для разработки бэкенда.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المهام التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تحليل المهام المنظمة لتطوير الخلفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage tasks efficiently by checking existing task files, creating new task breakdown files, and updating existing ones, all while following critical rules and using Markdown file format (.md) with specific naming conventions like ''story-{story-name}.md''.","zh":"使代理能够通过检查现有的任务文件、创建新的任务分解文件以及更新现有的文件来高效地管理任务，同时遵循关键规则并使用Markdown文件格式（.md）和特定的命名约定，如''story-{story-name}.md''。","ja":"エージェントが既存のタスクファイルを確認し、新しいタスク分解ファイルを作成し、既存のファイルを更新することでタスクを効率的に管理できるようにし、重要な規則に従い、Markdownファイル形式（.md）と特定の命名規則（例：''story-{story-name}.md''）を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 기존의 태스크 파일을 확인하고 새로운 태스크 분할 파일을 생성하고 기존의 파일을 업데이트함으로써 태스크를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 중요한 규칙을 따르고 Markdown 파일 형식(.md) 및 특정命명 규칙(예: ''story-{story-name}.md'')을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar tareas de manera eficiente mediante la verificación de archivos de tareas existentes, la creación de nuevos archivos de desglose de tareas y la actualización de los existentes, siguiendo reglas críticas y utilizando el formato de archivo Markdown (.md) con convenciones de nomenclatura específicas como ''story-{story-name}.md''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tâches de manière efficace en vérifiant les fichiers de tâches existants, en créant de nouveaux fichiers de décomposition de tâches et en mettant à jour les existants, tout en suivant des règles critiques et en utilisant le format de fichier Markdown (.md) avec des conventions de nommage spécifiques comme ''story-{story-name}.md''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Aufgaben effizient zu verwalten, indem sie vorhandene Aufgabendateien überprüfen, neue Aufgabenabbrechnungsdateien erstellen und vorhandene aktualisieren, während sie kritische Regeln befolgen und das Markdown-Dateiformat (.md) mit spezifischen Benennungskonventionen wie ''story-{story-name}.md'' verwenden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem tarefas de forma eficiente, verificando arquivos de tarefas existentes, criando novos arquivos de quebra de tarefas e atualizando os existentes, seguindo regras críticas e utilizando o formato de arquivo Markdown (.md) com convenções de nomenclatura específicas, como ''story-{nome-da-história}.md''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять задачами, проверяя существующие файлы задач, создавая новые файлы разбиения задач и обновляя существующие, соблюдая критические правила и используя формат файла Markdown (.md) с конкретными соглашениями об именах, такими как ''story-{имя-истории}.md''.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إدارة المهام بفعالية من خلال التحقق من ملفات المهام الحالية وإنشاء ملفات تحليل مهام جديدة وتحديث الملفات الحالية، مع اتباع القواعد الحرجة واستخدام تنسيق ملف Markdown (.md) مع اتفاقيات تسمية محددة مثل ''story-{اسم-القصة}.md''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task breakdown for new backend stories","Updating existing task files with new progress","Creating standardized task management workflows"],"zh":["为新的后端故事自动化任务分解","用新的进度更新现有的任务文件","创建标准化的任务管理工作流"],"ja":["新しいバックエンドストーリーのタスク分解を自動化する","新しい進度で既存のタスクファイルを更新する","標準化されたタスク管理ワークフローを作成する"],"ko":["新的 백엔드 스토리의 태스크 분할을 자동화하는 것","新的 진행 상황으로 기존의 태스크 파일을 업데이트하는 것","표준화된 태스크 관리 워크플ローを作成하는 것"],"es":["Automatización del desglose de tareas para nuevas historias de backend","Actualización de archivos de tareas existentes con nuevos progresos","Creación de flujos de trabajo de gestión de tareas estandarizados"],"fr":["Automatisation de la décomposition de tâches pour les nouvelles histoires de backend","Mise à jour des fichiers de tâches existants avec de nouveaux progrès","Création de flux de travail de gestion de tâches standardisés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenabbrechnung für neue Backend-Geschichten","Aktualisierung von vorhandenen Aufgabendateien mit neuen Fortschritten","Erstellung standardisierter Aufgabenmanagement-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar a quebra de tarefas para novas histórias de backend","Atualizar arquivos de tarefas existentes com novo progresso","Criar fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de tarefas padronizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разбиение задач для новых историй бэкенда","Обновлять существующие файлы задач с новым прогрессом","Создавать стандартизированные рабочие процессы управления задачами"],"ar":["تحسين تحليل المهام لتسجيلات الخلفية الجديدة","تحديث ملفات المهام الحالية بالتقدم الجديد","إنشاء سير عمل إدارة مهام معيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to file naming conventions","Must check for existing task files before creating new ones"],"zh":["需要严格遵守文件命名约定","必须在创建新文件之前检查现有的任务文件"],"ja":["ファイル命名規則の厳格な遵守が必要","新しいファイルを作成する前に既存のタスクファイルを確認する必要がある"],"ko":["파일命명 규칙을 엄격히遵守해야 함","新的 파일을 생성하기 전에 기존의 태스크 파일을 확인해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión a las convenciones de nomenclatura de archivos","Debe verificar la existencia de archivos de tareas antes de crear nuevos"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte aux conventions de nommage de fichiers","Doit vérifier l''existence de fichiers de tâches avant d''en créer de nouveaux"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung der Dateibenennungskonventionen","Muss die Existenz von Aufgabendateien überprüfen, bevor neue erstellt werden"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita às convenções de nomenclatura de arquivos","Deve verificar a existência de arquivos de tarefas antes de criar novos"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения соглашений об именах файлов","Должен проверять существование файлов задач перед созданием новых"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباعًا صارمًا لاتفاقيات تسمية الملفات","يجب التحقق من وجود ملفات المهام قبل إنشاء ملفات جديدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
