"body":"## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:55:50.906Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced web animation capabilities with libraries like p5.js and GSAP.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Web动画能力的前端代理，支持像p5.js和GSAP这样的库。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高級なWebアニメーション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。p5.jsやGSAPのようなライブラリをサポートしています。","ko":"고급 웹 애니메이션 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며 p5.js 및 GSAP와 같은 라이브러리를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de animación web avanzadas con bibliotecas como p5.js y GSAP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités de animation web avancées avec des bibliothèques comme p5.js et GSAP.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Web-Animationsfunktionen mit Bibliotheken wie p5.js und GSAP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de animação web com bibliotecas como p5.js e GSAP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности веб-анимации с использованием библиотек, таких как p5.js и GSAP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحريك الويب باستخدام مكتبات مثل p5.js و GSAP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate deterministic SVG animations and interactive simulations using protocols like WebSockets and WebRTC, while supporting various file formats such as .svg, .json, and .glb.","zh":"赋予代理生成确定性SVG动画和交互式模拟的能力，使用WebSockets和WebRTC等协议，同时支持诸如.svg、.json和.glb等多种文件格式。","ja":"WebSocketsやWebRTCなどのプロトコルを使用して、決定的なSVGアニメーションやインタラクティブなシミュレーションを生成するエージェントの能力を提供します。.svg、.json、.glbなどの様々なファイル形式をサポートしています。","ko":"WebSockets 및 WebRTC를 포함한 프로토콜을 사용하여 결정적 SVG 애니메이션 및 상호작용 시뮬레이션을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며 .svg, .json, .glb와 같은 다양한 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar animaciones SVG deterministas y simulaciones interactivas utilizando protocolos como WebSockets y WebRTC, y soporta varios formatos de archivo como .svg, .json y .glb.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des animations SVG déterministes et des simulations interactives en utilisant des protocoles tels que WebSockets et WebRTC, tout en prenant en charge divers formats de fichiers tels que .svg, .json et .glb.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, deterministische SVG-Animationen und interaktive Simulationen unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie WebSockets und WebRTC zu erzeugen, und unterstützt verschiedene Dateiformate wie .svg, .json und .glb.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerarem animações SVG determinísticas e simulações interativas usando protocolos como WebSockets e WebRTC, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta vários formatos de arquivo, como .svg, .json e .glb.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать детерминированные анимации SVG и интерактивные симуляции с использованием протоколов, таких как WebSockets и WebRTC, при этом поддерживая различные форматы файлов, такие как .svg, .json и .glb.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد تحريكات SVG محددة و симуляت تفاعلية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل WebSockets و WebRTC، مع دعم تنسيقات الملفات المختلفة مثل .svg و .json و .glb."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive 3D animations for web applications","Creating dynamic SVG flow fields for hero sections","Debugging animation performance issues with Chrome DevTools"],"zh":["为Web应用程序生成交互式3D动画","创建动态SVG流场用于英雄区","使用Chrome DevTools调试动画性能问题"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション用のインタラクティブ3Dアニメーションを生成する","ヒーローセクション用の動的SVG流体フィールドを作成する","Chrome DevToolsを使用してアニメーションのパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 상호작용 3D 애니메이션 생성","영웅 섹션을 위한 동적 SVG 흐름 필드 생성","Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 애니메이션 성능 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D interactivas para aplicaciones web","Crear campos de flujo SVG dinámicos para secciones de héroe","Depurar problemas de rendimiento de animación con Chrome DevTools"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D interactives pour des applications web","Créer des champs de flux SVG dynamiques pour les sections de héros","Déboguer les problèmes de performances d''animation avec Chrome DevTools"],"de":["Interaktive 3D-Animationen für Webanwendungen generieren","Dynamische SVG-Flussfelder für Hero-Abschnitte erstellen","Animationsleistungsprobleme mit Chrome DevTools debuggen"],"pt":["Gerar animações 3D interativas para aplicações web","Criar campos de fluxo SVG dinâmicos para seções de heróis","Depurar problemas de desempenho de animação com o Chrome DevTools"],"ru":["Генерировать интерактивные 3D-анимации для веб-приложений","Создавать динамические поля потока SVG для секций героев","Отлаживать проблемы производительности анимации с помощью Chrome DevTools"],"ar":["توليد تحريكات 3D التفاعلية ل تطبيقات الويب","إنشاء مجالات تدفق SVG ديناميكية لأقسام الأبطال","تصحيح أخطاء أداء التحريك باستخدام أدوات تطوير كروميوم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a compatible JavaScript environment","Limited support for older browser versions","Dependent on library compatibility and updates"],"zh":["需要兼容的JavaScript环境","对旧版浏览器版本支持有限","依赖于库的兼容性和更新"],"ja":["互換性のあるJavaScript環境が必要","古いバージョンのブラウザのサポートが限定されている","ライブラリの互換性と更新に依存している"],"ko":["호환되는 JavaScript 환경이 필요","오래된 브라우저 버전의 지원이 제한됨","라이브러리 호환성 및 업데이트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de JavaScript compatible","Soporte limitado para versiones de navegador más antiguas","Dependiente de la compatibilidad y las actualizaciones de la biblioteca"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JavaScript compatible","Prise en charge limitée des versions de navigateur plus anciennes","Dépendante de la compatibilité et des mises à jour de la bibliothèque"],"de":["Benötigt eine kompatible JavaScript-Umgebung","Begrenzte Unterstützung für ältere Browser-Versionen","Abhängig von der Bibliothekskompatibilität und -aktualisierungen"],"pt":["Exige um ambiente JavaScript compatível","Suporte limitado para versões mais antigas de navegadores","Dependente da compatibilidade e atualizações de bibliotecas"],"ru":["Требует совместимой среды JavaScript","Ограниченная поддержка более старых версий браузеров","Зависит от совместимости и обновлений библиотек"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافا سكريبت متوافقة","دعم محدود لأ phiên bản أقدم من المتصفحات","يعتمد على توافق و تحديثات المكتبات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/design-system-setup', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'design-system-setup', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:55:57.630Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/design-system-setup","name":"design-system-setup","description":{"zh":"设计系统设置用于初始化设计系统，包括设计令牌、组件模式和文档","ja":"デザインシステム設定は、デザイントークン、コンポーネントパターン、ドキュメントを含むデザインシステムを初期化します","ko":"디자인 시스템 설정은 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 패턴, 문서를 포함한 디자인 시스템을 초기화합니다","es":"El sistema de diseño se inicializa con tokens y patrones de componentes para un desarrollo de UI consistente","fr":"Le système de design est initialisé avec des jetons et des modèles de composants pour un développement d''UI cohérent","de":"Das Design-System wird mit Token und Komponentenmustern initialisiert, um eine konsistente UI-Entwicklung zu ermöglichen","pt":"O sistema de design é inicializado com tokens, padrões de componentes e documentação para um desenvolvimento de UI consistente","ru":"Система дизайна инициализируется с токенами, шаблонами компонентов и документацией для последовательного развития UI","ar":"يتم تهيئة نظام التصميم مع الرموز وأنماط المكونات والوثائق من أجل تطوير واجهة المستخدم المتسقة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"设计系统初始化 - 设计系统设置","ja":"デザインシステム設定 - 初期化","ko":"디자인 시스템 설정 - 초기화","es":"Configuración de sistema de diseño","fr":"Configuration du système de design","de":"Design-System-Setup","pt":"Configuração de Sistema de Design","ru":"Настройка системы дизайна","ar":"إعداد نظام التصميم","en":"design-system-setup"},"description":{"zh":"设计系统设置用于初始化设计系统，包括设计令牌、组件模式和文档","ja":"デザインシステム設定は、デザイントークン、コンポーネントパターン、ドキュメントを含むデザインシステムを初期化します","ko":"디자인 시스템 설정은 디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 패턴, 문서를 포함한 디자인 시스템을 초기화합니다","es":"El sistema de diseño se inicializa con tokens y patrones de componentes para un desarrollo de UI consistente","fr":"Le système de design est initialisé avec des jetons et des modèles de composants pour un développement d''UI cohérent","de":"Das Design-System wird mit Token und Komponentenmustern initialisiert, um eine konsistente UI-Entwicklung zu ermöglichen","pt":"O sistema de design é inicializado com tokens, padrões de componentes e documentação para um desenvolvimento de UI consistente","ru":"Система дизайна инициализируется с токенами, шаблонами компонентов и документацией для последовательного развития UI","ar":"يتم تهيئة نظام التصميم مع الرموز وأنماط المكونات والوثائق من أجل تطوير واجهة المستخدم المتسقة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计令牌化","组件模式化","文档生成","一致的UI开发","可定制的预设"],"ja":["デザイントークン化","コンポーネントパターン化","ドキュメント生成","一貫したUI開発","カスタマイズ可能なプリセット"],"ko":["디자인 토큰화","컴포넌트 패턴화","문서 생성","일관된 UI 개발","사용자 정의 가능한 프리셋"],"es":["Inicialización de sistema de diseño con tokens","Creación de patrones de componentes","Generación de documentación","Comprobación de directorio `.ui-design/`","Detección de sistema de diseño existente"],"fr":["Initialisation du système de design avec des jetons","Création de modèles de composants","Génération de documentation","Vérification du répertoire `.ui-design/`","Détection du système de design existant"],"de":["Initialisierung des Design-Systems mit Token","Erstellung von Komponentenmustern","Generierung von Dokumentation","Überprüfung des Verzeichnisses `.ui-design/`","Erkennung des bestehenden Design-Systems"],"pt":["Inicialização do sistema de design com tokens","Criação de padrões de componentes","Geração de documentação","Verificação de diretório existente","Criação de diretório de design"],"ru":["Инициализация системы дизайна с токенами","Создание шаблонов компонентов","Генерация документации","Проверка существующего каталога","Создание каталога дизайна"],"ar":["تهيئة نظام التصميم مع الرموز","إنشاء أنماط المكونات","توليد الوثائق","فحص الدليل الموجود","إنشاء دليل التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计系统","设计系统设置","设计令牌","组件模式","UI开发","一致性","可定制"],"ja":["デザインシステム","デザインシステム設定","デザイントークン","コンポーネントパターン","UI開発","一貫性","カスタマイズ"],"ko":["디자인 시스템","디자인 시스템 설정","디자인 토큰","컴포넌트 패턴","UI 개발","일관성","사용자 정의"],"es":["sistema de diseño","tokens de diseño","patrones de componentes","desarrollo de UI","diseño de interfaz de usuario","configuración de sistema de diseño"],"fr":["système de design","jetons de design","modèles de composants","développement d''UI","conception d''interface utilisateur","configuration du système de design"],"de":["Design-System","Design-Token","Komponentenmuster","UI-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Design-System-Setup"],"pt":["sistema de design","desenvolvimento de UI","tokens de design","padrões de componentes","documentação de design","inicialização do sistema de design"],"ru":["система дизайна","разработка UI","токены дизайна","шаблоны компонентов","документация дизайна","инициализация системы дизайна"],"ar":["نظام التصميم","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","رموز التصميم","أنماط المكونات","وثائق التصميم","تهيئة نظام التصميم"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-system-setup","description":"Initialize a design system with tokens","bodyPreview":"---\ndescription: \"Initialize a design system with tokens\"\nargument-hint: \"[--preset minimal|standard|comprehensive]\"\n---\n\n# Design System Setup\n\nInitialize a design system with design tokens, component patterns, and documentation. Creates a foundation for consistent UI development.\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\n1. Check if `.ui-design/` directory exists:\n   - If exists with `design-system.json`: Ask to update or reinitialize\n   - If not: Create `.ui-design/` directory\n\n2. Detect existing design system","body":"---\ndescription: \"Initialize a design system with tokens\"\nargument-hint: \"[--preset minimal|standard|comprehensive]\"\n---\n\n# Design System Setup\n\nInitialize a design system with design tokens, component patterns, and documentation. Creates a foundation for consistent UI development.\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\n1. Check if `.ui-design/` directory exists:\n   - If exists with `design-system.json`: Ask to update or reinitialize\n   - If not: Create `.ui-design/` directory\n\n2. Detect existing design system indicators:\n   - Check for `tailwind.config.js` with custom theme\n   - Check for CSS custom properties in global styles\n   - Check for existing token files (tokens.json, theme.ts, etc.)\n   - Check for design system packages (chakra, radix, shadcn, etc.)\n\n3. Load project context:\n   - Read `conductor/tech-stack.md` if exists\n   - Detect styling approach (CSS, Tailwind, styled-components, etc.)\n   - Detect TypeScript usage\n\n4. If existing design system detected:\n\n   ```\n   I detected an existing design system configuration:\n\n   - {detected_system}\n\n   Would you like to:\n   1. Integrate with existing system (add missing tokens)\n   2. Replace with new design system\n   3. View current configuration\n   4. Cancel\n\n   Enter number:\n   ```\n\n## Interactive Configuration\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n\n- Ask ONE question per turn\n- Wait for user response before proceeding\n- Build complete specification before generating files\n\n### Q1: Design System Preset (if not provided)\n\n```\nWhat level of design system do you need?\n\n1. Minimal   - Colors, typography, spacing only\n               Best for: Small projects, rapid prototyping\n\n2. Standard  - Colors, typography, spacing, shadows, borders, breakpoints\n               Best for: Most projects, good balance of flexibility\n\n3. Comprehensive - Full token system with semantic naming, component tokens,\n                   animation, and documentation\n               Best for: Large projects, design teams, long-term maintenance\n\nEnter number:\n```\n\n### Q2: Brand Colors\n\n```\nLet''s define your brand colors.\n\nEnter your primary brand color (hex code, e.g., #3B82F6):\n```\n\nAfter receiving primary:\n\n```\nPrimary color: {color}\n\nNow enter your secondary/accent color (or press enter to auto-generate):\n```\n\n### Q3: Color Mode Support\n\n```\nWhat color modes should the design system support?\n\n1. Light mode only\n2. Dark mode only\n3. Light and dark modes\n4. Light, dark, and system preference\n\nEnter number:\n```\n\n### Q4: Typography\n\n```\nWhat font family should be used?\n\n1. System fonts (fastest loading, native feel)\n   font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', ...\n\n2. Inter (modern, highly readable)\n3. Open Sans (friendly, versatile)\n4. Roboto (clean, Google standard)\n5. Custom (provide name)\n\nEnter number or font name:\n```\n\n### Q5: Spacing Scale\n\n```\nWhat spacing scale philosophy?\n\n1. Linear (4px base)\n   4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64\n\n2. Geometric (4px base, 1.5x multiplier)\n   4, 6, 9, 14, 21, 32, 48, 72\n\n3. Tailwind-compatible\n   0, 1, 2, 4, 6, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64\n\n4. Custom (provide values)\n\nEnter number:\n```\n\n### Q6: Border Radius\n\n```\nWhat corner radius style?\n\n1. Sharp    - 0px (no rounding)\n2. Subtle   - 4px (slight rounding)\n3. Moderate - 8px (noticeable rounding)\n4. Rounded  - 12px (significant rounding)\n5. Pill     - 9999px for buttons, 16px for cards\n\nEnter number:\n```\n\n### Q7: Output Format\n\n```\nHow should the design tokens be output?\n\n1. CSS Custom Properties (works everywhere)\n2. Tailwind config (tailwind.config.js extension)\n3. JavaScript/TypeScript module\n4. JSON tokens (Design Token Community Group format)\n5. Multiple formats (all of the above)\n\nEnter number:\n```\n\n### Q8: Component Guidelines (Comprehensive only)\n\nIf comprehensive preset selected:\n\n```\nShould I generate component design guidelines?\n\nThese include:\n- Button variants and states\n- Form input patterns\n- Card/container patterns\n- Typography hierarchy\n- Icon usage guidelines\n\n1. Yes, generate all guidelines\n2. Yes, but let me select which ones\n3. No, tokens only\n\nEnter number:\n```\n\n## State Management\n\nCreate `.ui-design/setup_state.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"preset\": \"standard\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"primary\": \"#3B82F6\",\n    \"secondary\": \"#8B5CF6\"\n  },\n  \"color_modes\": [\"light\", \"dark\"],\n  \"typography\": {\n    \"family\": \"Inter\",\n    \"scale\": \"1.25\"\n  },\n  \"spacing\": \"linear\",\n  \"radius\": \"moderate\",\n  \"output_formats\": [\"css\", \"tailwind\"],\n  \"current_step\": 1,\n  \"started_at\": \"ISO_TIMESTAMP\"\n}\n```\n\n## Token Generation\n\n### 1. Generate Color Palette\n\nFrom primary and secondary colors, generate:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"primary\": {\n      \"50\": \"#EFF6FF\",\n      \"100\": \"#DBEAFE\",\n      \"200\": \"#BFDBFE\",\n      \"300\": \"#93C5FD\",\n      \"400\": \"#60A5FA\",\n      \"500\": \"#3B82F6\",\n      \"600\": \"#2563EB\",\n      \"700\": \"#1D4ED8\",\n      \"800\": \"#1E40AF\",\n      \"900\": \"#1E3A8A\",\n      \"950\": \"#172554\"\n    },\n    \"secondary\": { ... },\n    \"neutral\": {\n      \"50\": \"#F9FAFB\",\n      \"100\": \"#F3F4F6\",\n      \"200\": \"#E5E7EB\",\n      \"300\": \"#D1D5DB\",\n      \"400\": \"#9CA3AF\",\n      \"500\": \"#6B7280\",\n      \"600\": \"#4B5563\",\n      \"700\": \"#374151\",\n      \"800\": \"#1F2937\",\n      \"900\": \"#111827\",\n      \"950\": \"#030712\"\n    },\n    \"semantic\": {\n      \"success\": \"#22C55E\",\n      \"warning\": \"#F59E0B\",\n      \"error\": \"#EF4444\",\n      \"info\": \"#3B82F6\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Generate Typography Scale\n\n```json\n{\n  \"typography\": {\n    \"fontFamily\": {\n      \"sans\": \"Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', sans-serif\",\n      \"mono\": \"ui-monospace, ''Fira Code'', monospace\"\n    },\n    \"fontSize\": {\n      \"xs\": \"0.75rem\",\n      \"sm\": \"0.875rem\",\n      \"base\": \"1rem\",\n      \"lg\": \"1.125rem\",\n      \"xl\": \"1.25rem\",\n      \"2xl\": \"1.5rem\",\n      \"3xl\": \"1.875rem\",\n      \"4xl\": \"2.25rem\",\n      \"5xl\": \"3rem\"\n    },\n    \"fontWeight\": {\n      \"normal\": \"400\",\n      \"medium\": \"500\",\n      \"semibold\": \"600\",\n      \"bold\": \"700\"\n    },\n    \"lineHeight\": {\n      \"tight\": \"1.25\",\n      \"normal\": \"1.5\",\n      \"relaxed\": \"1.75\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Generate Spacing Scale\n\n```json\n{\n  \"spacing\": {\n    \"0\": \"0\",\n    \"1\": \"0.25rem\",\n    \"2\": \"0.5rem\",\n    \"3\": \"0.75rem\",\n    \"4\": \"1rem\",\n    \"5\": \"1.25rem\",\n    \"6\": \"1.5rem\",\n    \"8\": \"2rem\",\n    \"10\": \"2.5rem\",\n    \"12\": \"3rem\",\n    \"16\": \"4rem\",\n    \"20\": \"5rem\",\n    \"24\": \"6rem\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Generate Additional Tokens\n\n```json\n{\n  \"borderRadius\": {\n    \"none\": \"0\",\n    \"sm\": \"0.125rem\",\n    \"base\": \"0.25rem\",\n    \"md\": \"0.375rem\",\n    \"lg\": \"0.5rem\",\n    \"xl\": \"0.75rem\",\n    \"2xl\": \"1rem\",\n    \"full\": \"9999px\"\n  },\n  \"boxShadow\": {\n    \"sm\": \"0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05)\",\n    \"base\": \"0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)\",\n    \"md\": \"0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)\",\n    \"lg\": \"0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)\",\n    \"xl\": \"0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)\"\n  },\n  \"breakpoints\": {\n    \"sm\": \"640px\",\n    \"md\": \"768px\",\n    \"lg\": \"1024px\",\n    \"xl\": \"1280px\",\n    \"2xl\": \"1536px\"\n  },\n  \"animation\": {\n    \"duration\": {\n      \"fast\": \"150ms\",\n      \"normal\": \"300ms\",\n      \"slow\": \"500ms\"\n    },\n    \"easing\": {\n      \"ease\": \"cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)\",\n      \"easeIn\": \"cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1)\",\n      \"easeOut\": \"cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1)\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## File Generation\n\n### Core Design System File\n\nCreate `.ui-design/design-system.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"{project_name} Design System\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"created\": \"ISO_TIMESTAMP\",\n  \"preset\": \"{preset}\",\n  \"tokens\": {\n    \"colors\": { ... },\n    \"typography\": { ... },\n    \"spacing\": { ... },\n    \"borderRadius\": { ... },\n    \"boxShadow\": { ... },\n    \"breakpoints\": { ... },\n    \"animation\": { ... }\n  },\n  \"colorModes\": [\"light\", \"dark\"],\n  \"outputFormats\": [\"css\", \"tailwind\"]\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Custom Properties\n\nCreate `.ui-design/tokens/tokens.css`:\n\n```css\n/* Design System Tokens - Generated */\n/* Do not edit directly. Regenerate with /ui-design:design-system-setup */\n\n:root {\n  /* Colors - Primary */\n  --color-primary-50: #eff6ff;\n  --color-primary-100: #dbeafe;\n  --color-primary-500: #3b82f6;\n  --color-primary-600: #2563eb;\n  --color-primary-700: #1d4ed8;\n\n  /* Colors - Neutral */\n  --color-neutral-50: #f9fafb;\n  --color-neutral-100: #f3f4f6;\n  --color-neutral-500: #6b7280;\n  --color-neutral-900: #111827;\n\n  /* Colors - Semantic */\n  --color-success: #22c55e;\n  --color-warning: #f59e0b;\n  --color-error: #ef4444;\n  --color-info: #3b82f6;\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --font-family-sans: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n  --font-family-mono: ui-monospace, \"Fira Code\", monospace;\n\n  --font-size-xs: 0.75rem;\n  --font-size-sm: 0.875rem;\n  --font-size-base: 1rem;\n  --font-size-lg: 1.125rem;\n  --font-size-xl: 1.25rem;\n  --font-size-2xl: 1.5rem;\n\n  /* Spacing */\n  --spacing-1: 0.25rem;\n  --spacing-2: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-4: 1rem;\n  --spacing-6: 1.5rem;\n  --spacing-8: 2rem;\n\n  /* Border Radius */\n  --radius-sm: 0.125rem;\n  --radius-base: 0.25rem;\n  --radius-md: 0.375rem;\n  --radius-lg: 0.5rem;\n\n  /* Shadows */\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\n  --shadow-base: 0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n\n  /* Animation */\n  --duration-fast: 150ms;\n  --duration-normal: 300ms;\n  --ease-default: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n\n/* Dark Mode */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  :root {\n    --color-neutral-50: #111827;\n    --color-neutral-100: #1f2937;\n    --color-neutral-500: #9ca3af;\n    --color-neutral-900: #f9fafb;\n  }\n}\n\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  --color-neutral-50: #111827;\n  --color-neutral-100: #1f2937;\n  --color-neutral-500: #9ca3af;\n  --color-neutral-900: #f9fafb;\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Config Extension\n\nCreate `.ui-design/tokens/tailwind.config.js`:\n\n```javascript\n// Design System Tailwind Extension\n// Import and spread in your tailwind.config.js\n\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        primary: {\n          50: \"#EFF6FF\",\n          100: \"#DBEAFE\",\n          200: \"#BFDBFE\",\n          300: \"#93C5FD\",\n          400: \"#60A5FA\",\n          500: \"#3B82F6\",\n          600: \"#2563EB\",\n          700: \"#1D4ED8\",\n          800: \"#1E40AF\",\n          900: \"#1E3A8A\",\n          950: \"#172554\",\n        },\n        // ... other colors\n      },\n      fontFamily: {\n        sans: [\"Inter\", \"-apple-system\", \"BlinkMacSystemFont\", \"sans-serif\"],\n        mono: [\"ui-monospace\", \"Fira Code\", \"monospace\"],\n      },\n      // ... other tokens\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### TypeScript Module\n\nCreate `.ui-design/tokens/tokens.ts`:\n\n```typescript\n// Design System Tokens - Generated\n// Do not edit directly.\n\nexport const colors = {\n  primary: {\n    50: \"#EFF6FF\",\n    // ... full palette\n  },\n  // ... other color groups\n} as const;\n\nexport const typography = {\n  fontFamily: {\n    sans: \"Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\",\n    mono: \"ui-monospace, ''Fira Code'', monospace\",\n  },\n  fontSize: {\n    xs: \"0.75rem\",\n    // ... full scale\n  },\n} as const;\n\nexport const spacing = {\n  1: \"0.25rem\",\n  // ... full scale\n} as const;\n\n// Type exports for TypeScript consumers\nexport type ColorToken = keyof typeof colors;\nexport type SpacingToken = keyof typeof spacing;\n```\n\n## Documentation Generation (Comprehensive preset)\n\nCreate `.ui-design/docs/design-system.md`:\n\n````markdown\n# Design System Documentation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis design system provides the foundation for consistent UI development.\n\n## Colors\n\n### Primary Palette\n\n| Token       | Value   | Usage                  |\n| ----------- | ------- | ---------------------- |\n| primary-500 | #3B82F6 | Primary actions, links |\n| primary-600 | #2563EB | Hover state            |\n| primary-700 | #1D4ED8 | Active state           |\n\n### Semantic Colors\n\n| Token   | Value   | Usage                               |\n| ------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| success | #22C55E | Success messages, positive actions  |\n| warning | #F59E0B | Warning messages, caution           |\n| error   | #EF4444 | Error messages, destructive actions |\n\n## Typography\n\n### Scale\n\n| Name | Size     | Usage            |\n| ---- | -------- | ---------------- |\n| xs   | 0.75rem  | Captions, labels |\n| sm   | 0.875rem | Secondary text   |\n| base | 1rem     | Body text        |\n| lg   | 1.125rem | Emphasized body  |\n| xl   | 1.25rem  | Subheadings      |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse spacing tokens for consistent margins and padding:\n\n- `spacing-1` (4px): Tight spacing\n- `spacing-2` (8px): Compact spacing\n- `spacing-4` (16px): Default spacing\n- `spacing-6` (24px): Comfortable spacing\n- `spacing-8` (32px): Loose spacing\n\n## Usage\n\n### CSS Custom Properties\n\n```css\n.button {\n  background: var(--color-primary-500);\n  padding: var(--spacing-2) var(--spacing-4);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n}\n```\n````\n\n### Tailwind\n\n```html\n<button class=\"bg-primary-500 px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Click me</button>\n```\n\n```\n\n## Completion\n\nUpdate state and display summary:\n\n```\n\nDesign System Setup Complete!\n\nCreated files:\n\n- .ui-design/design-system.json (master configuration)\n- .ui-design/tokens/tokens.css (CSS custom properties)\n- .ui-design/tokens/tailwind.config.js (Tailwind extension)\n- .ui-design/tokens/tokens.ts (TypeScript module)\n- .ui-design/docs/design-system.md (documentation)\n\nQuick start:\n\n1. CSS: @import ''.ui-design/tokens/tokens.css'';\n2. Tailwind: Spread in your tailwind.config.js\n3. TypeScript: import { colors } from ''.ui-design/tokens/tokens'';\n\nNext steps:\n\n1. Review and customize tokens as needed\n2. Run /ui-design:create-component to build with your design system\n3. Run /ui-design:design-review to validate existing UI against tokens\n\nNeed to modify tokens? Run /ui-design:design-system-setup --preset {preset}\n\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If conflicting config detected: Offer merge strategies\n- If file write fails: Report error, suggest manual creation\n- If color generation fails: Provide manual palette input option\n- If tailwind not detected: Skip tailwind output, inform user\n```\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:55:57.630Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI Development Agents needing standardized design system initialization with tokens","zh":"非常适合需要标准化设计系统初始化的 UI 开发代理，使用令牌","ja":"UI 開発エージェントが標準化されたデザインシステムの初期化にトークンを使用する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"토큰을 사용하여 표준화된 디자인 시스템 초기화를 필요로 하는 UI 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de UI que necesitan una inicialización de sistema de diseño estandarizado con tokens","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''UI nécessitant une initialisation de système de conception standardisée avec des jetons","de":"Perfekt für UI-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine standardisierte Design-System-Initialisierung mit Tokens benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de UI que necessitam de inicialização de sistema de design padronizado com tokens","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки UI, которым необходима стандартизированная инициализация системы дизайна с помощью токенов","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى نظام تصميم معياري مع INITIALIZE باستخدام رموز"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create a foundation for consistent UI development using design tokens, component patterns, and documentation, supporting presets like minimal, standard, or comprehensive, and interacting with the `.ui-design/` directory and `design-system.json` files","zh":"赋予代理创建一致的 UI 开发基础的能力，使用设计令牌、组件模式和文档，支持如最小、标准或综合的预设，并与 `.ui-design/` 目录和 `design-system.json` 文件交互","ja":"デザイントークン、コンポーネントパターン、ドキュメントを使用して一貫した UI 開発の基礎を tạoるためのエージェントをEmpowerし、最小、標準、または包括的なプリセットをサポートし、`.ui-design/` ディレクトリと `design-system.json` ファイルとやり取り","ko":"디자인 토큰, 컴포넌트 패턴 및 문서를 사용하여 일관된 UI 개발의基础를 만들 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고, 최소, 표준 또는 포괄적인 사전 설정을 지원하며, `.ui-design/` 디렉토리 및 `design-system.json` 파일과 상호 작용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear una base para un desarrollo de UI coherente utilizando tokens de diseño, patrones de componentes y documentación, que admite presets como mínimo, estándar o integral, y interactúa con el directorio `.ui-design/` y los archivos `design-system.json`","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une base pour un développement d''UI cohérent en utilisant des jetons de conception, des modèles de composants et de la documentation, qui prend en charge des presets tels que minimal, standard ou complet, et interagit avec le répertoire `.ui-design/` et les fichiers `design-system.json`","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine Grundlage für eine konsistente UI-Entwicklung zu schaffen, indem sie Design-Tokens, Komponentenmuster und Dokumentation verwenden, die Presets wie minimal, standard oder umfassend unterstützt und mit dem Verzeichnis `.ui-design/` und den Dateien `design-system.json` interagiert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar uma base para o desenvolvimento de UI consistente usando tokens de design, padrões de componentes e documentação, suportando presets como mínimo, padrão ou abrangente, e interagindo com o diretório `.ui-design/` e arquivos `design-system.json`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создать основу для последовательного развития UI с помощью токенов дизайна, шаблонов компонентов и документации, поддерживает пресеты, такие как минимальный, стандартный или всесторонний, и взаимодействует с директорий `.ui-design/` и файлами `design-system.json`","ar":"يمنح الوكيل إمكانية إنشاء أساس متسق لتطوير واجهة المستخدم باستخدام رموز التصميم وأنماط المكونات والتوثيق، ودعم الإعدادات المسبقة مثل الحد الأدنى أو المعيار أو الشامل، والتفاعل مع 目录 `.ui-design/` وملفات `design-system.json`"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing a design system with tokens","Updating existing design systems","Creating consistent UI components"],"zh":["使用令牌初始化设计系统","更新现有的设计系统","创建一致的 UI 组件"],"ja":["トークンを使用してデザインシステムを初期化","既存のデザインシステムを更新","一貫した UI コンポーネントを作成"],"ko":["토큰을 사용하여 디자인 시스템 초기화","기존 디자인 시스템 업데이트","일관된 UI 컴포넌트 생성"],"es":["Inicializar un sistema de diseño con tokens","Actualizar sistemas de diseño existentes","Crear componentes de UI coherentes"],"fr":["Initialiser un système de conception avec des jetons","Mettre à jour des systèmes de conception existants","Créer des composants d''UI cohérents"],"de":["Ein Design-System mit Tokens initialisieren","Vorhandene Design-Systeme aktualisieren","Konsistente UI-Komponenten erstellen"],"pt":["Inicializar um sistema de design com tokens","Atualizar sistemas de design existentes","Criar componentes de UI consistentes"],"ru":["Инициализировать систему дизайна с помощью токенов","Обновить существующие системы дизайна","Создать последовательные компоненты UI"],"ar":["초기화 نظام التصميم مع الرموز","تحديث أنظمة التصميم الحالية","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to create or update `.ui-design/` directory","Limited to JSON-based design system configuration"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来创建或更新 `.ui-design/` 目录","仅限于基于 JSON 的设计系统配置"],"ja":["`.ui-design/` ディレクトリを作成または更新するためのファイルシステムアクセスが必要","JSON ベースのデザインシステム構成にのみ限られる"],"ko":["`.ui-design/` 디렉토리를 생성 또는 업데이트하기 위한 파일 시스템 액세스 필요","JSON 기반 디자인 시스템 구성에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para crear o actualizar el directorio `.ui-design/`","Limitado a la configuración de sistema de diseño basada en JSON"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour créer ou mettre à jour le répertoire `.ui-design/`","Limité à la configuration du système de conception basée sur JSON"],"de":["Benötigt Dateizugriff, um das Verzeichnis `.ui-design/` zu erstellen oder zu aktualisieren","Begrenzt auf JSON-basierte Design-System-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para criar ou atualizar o diretório `.ui-design/`","Limitado à configuração do sistema de design baseada em JSON"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для создания или обновления директории `.ui-design/`","Ограниченная конфигурация системы дизайна на основе JSON"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لإنشاء أو تحديث الدليل `.ui-design/`","محدود بالتكوين القائم على JSON لنظام التصميم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ANcpLua/qyl/epistemic-checkpoint', 'community', 'ANcpLua', 'qyl', 'ANcpLua/qyl', 'epistemic-checkpoint', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:56:16.734Z', NULL, '{"id":"ANcpLua/qyl/epistemic-checkpoint","name":"epistemic-checkpoint","description":{"zh":"Epistemic Checkpoint 是一个用于 GenAI/LLM 工作负载的 AI 可观察性平台，提供强大的日志检查和验证功能","ja":"Epistemic Checkpoint は、GenAI/LLM ワークロード用の AI オブザーバビリティ プラットフォームです。強力なログの検証機能を提供します","ko":"Epistemic Checkpoint는 GenAI/LLM 워크로드를 위한 AI 관측 가능성 플랫폼으로, 강력한 로그 검증 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Epistemic-checkpoint es una plataforma de observabilidad de IA para GenAI/LLM que ofrece ingesta OTLP y almacenamiento DuckDB","fr":"Epistemic-checkpoint est une plateforme d''observabilité de l''IA pour GenAI/LLM qui propose une ingestion OTLP et un stockage DuckDB","de":"Epistemic-checkpoint ist eine KI-Beobachtungsplattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads mit OTLP-Einbindung und DuckDB-Speicherung","pt":"Epistemic Checkpoint é uma plataforma de observabilidade para GenAI/LLM que ajuda a prevenir alucinações. Com OTLP e DuckDB, é possível monitorar e analisar dados de forma eficaz","ru":"Эпистемический Чекпоинт - это платформа для мониторинга GenAI/LLM, которая помогает предотвратить галлюцинации. С помощью OTLP и DuckDB можно эффективно отслеживать и анализировать данные","ar":"نقطة التحقق الإبستيمولوجية هي منصة مراقبة للذكاء الاصطناعي/LLM تساعد على منع الهلوسة. باستخدام OTLP و DuckDB، يمكن مراقبة و تحليل البيانات بفعالية","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Epistemic Checkpoint - AI 可观察性平台","ja":"Epistemic Checkpoint - AI オブザーバビリティ プラットフォーム","ko":"Epistemic Checkpoint - AI 관측 가능성 플랫폼","es":"Punto de verificación epistémico para GenAI/LLM","fr":"Point de vérification épistémique pour GenAI/LLM","de":"Epistemischer Checkpoint für GenAI/LLM","pt":"Epistemic Checkpoint: Plataforma de Observabilidade para ...","ru":"Эпистемический Чекпоинт: Платформа для Мониторинга GenAI/LLM","ar":"نقطة التحقق الإبستيمولوجية: منصة مراقبة للذكاء الاصطناعي/LLM","en":"epistemic-checkpoint"},"description":{"zh":"Epistemic Checkpoint 是一个用于 GenAI/LLM 工作负载的 AI 可观察性平台，提供强大的日志检查和验证功能","ja":"Epistemic Checkpoint は、GenAI/LLM ワークロード用の AI オブザーバビリティ プラットフォームです。強力なログの検証機能を提供します","ko":"Epistemic Checkpoint는 GenAI/LLM 워크로드를 위한 AI 관측 가능성 플랫폼으로, 강력한 로그 검증 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Epistemic-checkpoint es una plataforma de observabilidad de IA para GenAI/LLM que ofrece ingesta OTLP y almacenamiento DuckDB","fr":"Epistemic-checkpoint est une plateforme d''observabilité de l''IA pour GenAI/LLM qui propose une ingestion OTLP et un stockage DuckDB","de":"Epistemic-checkpoint ist eine KI-Beobachtungsplattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads mit OTLP-Einbindung und DuckDB-Speicherung","pt":"Epistemic Checkpoint é uma plataforma de observabilidade para GenAI/LLM que ajuda a prevenir alucinações. Com OTLP e DuckDB, é possível monitorar e analisar ...","ru":"Эпистемический Чекпоинт - это платформа для мониторинга GenAI/LLM, которая помогает предотвратить галлюцинации. С помощью OTLP и DuckDB можно эффективно отсл...","ar":"نقطة التحقق الإبستيمولوجية هي منصة مراقبة للذكاء الاصطناعي/LLM تساعد على منع الهلوسة. باستخدام OTLP و DuckDB، يمكن مراقبة و تحليل البيانات بفعالية","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["OTLP 吸收","DuckDB 存储","语义约定","强大的日志检查","验证功能","防止 hallucinations"],"ja":["OTLP 経由でのデータ受信","DuckDB へのデータ保存","セマンティック規約","強力なログの検証","検証機能","hallucinations の防止"],"ko":["OTLP 수신","DuckDB 저장","의미 규약","강력한 로그 검증","검증 기능","hallucinations 방지"],"es":["Ingesta OTLP para la recopilación de datos","Almacenamiento DuckDB para el análisis de datos","Convenios semánticos para la telemetría de IA","Verificación de la exactitud de los datos","Prevención de alucinaciones en la respuesta a preguntas"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP pour la collecte de données","Stockage DuckDB pour l''analyse de données","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA","Vérification de l''exactitude des données","Prévention des hallucinations dans les réponses aux questions"],"de":["OTLP-Einbindung für die Datenerfassung","DuckDB-Speicherung für die Datenanalyse","Semantische Konventionen für die KI-Telemetrie","Überprüfung der Genauigkeit der Daten","Verhinderung von Halluzinationen bei der Beantwortung von Fragen"],"pt":["OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","Semantic conventions for AI telemetry","Prevenção de alucinações","Análise de dados eficaz"],"ru":["Ввод данных OTLP","Хранение данных DuckDB","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ","Предотвращение галлюцинаций","Эффективный анализ данных"],"ar":["استيعاب OTLP","تخزين DuckDB","اتفاقيات семантиكية للاتصالات الاصطناعية","منع الهلوسة","تحليل البيانات الفعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 可观察性","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","语义约定","日志检查","验证","hallucinations"],"ja":["AI オブザーバビリティ","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","セマンティック規約","ログの検証","検証","hallucinations"],"ko":["AI 관측 가능성","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","의미 규약","로그 검증","검증","hallucinations"],"es":["GenAI","LLM","observabilidad de IA","ingesta OTLP","almacenamiento DuckDB","telemetría de IA","verificación de datos","prevención de alucinaciones"],"fr":["GenAI","LLM","observabilité de l''IA","ingestion OTLP","stockage DuckDB","télémétrie de l''IA","vérification des données","prévention des hallucinations"],"de":["GenAI","LLM","KI-Beobachtung","OTLP-Einbindung","DuckDB-Speicherung","KI-Telemetrie","Datenüberprüfung","Halluzinationsverhinderung"],"pt":["Epistemic Checkpoint","GenAI","LLM","Observabilidade","OTLP","DuckDB","Prevenção de alucinações","Análise de dados"],"ru":["Эпистемический Чекпоинт","GenAI","LLM","Мониторинг","OTLP","DuckDB","Предотвращение галлюцинаций","Анализ данных"],"ar":["نقطة التحقق الإبستيمولوجية","الذكاء الاصطناعي","LLM","المراقبة","OTLP","DuckDB","منع الهلوسة","تحليل البيانات"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"epistemic-checkpoint","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nplugin:\n  name: \"metacognitive-guard\"\n  version: \"0.2.6\"\n  description: \"Cognitive amplification stack: prevents hallucinations via epistemic hooks, competitive code review, fact-checking, and deep-thinking agents.\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# Epistemic Checkpoint\n\nForce verification before answering questions involving versions, dates, status, or \"current\" state.\n\n## Purpose\n\nPrevents the ROOT CAUSE of hallucinations - not just blocking wrong output, but pr","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nplugin:\n  name: \"metacognitive-guard\"\n  version: \"0.2.6\"\n  description: \"Cognitive amplification stack: prevents hallucinations via epistemic hooks, competitive code review, fact-checking, and deep-thinking agents.\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# Epistemic Checkpoint\n\nForce verification before answering questions involving versions, dates, status, or \"current\" state.\n\n## Purpose\n\nPrevents the ROOT CAUSE of hallucinations - not just blocking wrong output, but preventing wrong\nREASONING. Claude''s training data is stale; this skill forces verification before forming beliefs.\n\n## Triggers\n\nActivate this skill when the question involves ANY of:\n\n- Software versions (.NET, Node, React, Python, etc.)\n- Release status (preview, LTS, GA, RC, deprecated)\n- \"Current\" or \"latest\" anything\n- Dates that might be after training cutoff\n- Package versions\n- API deprecations\n\n## MANDATORY Protocol\n\n### Step 1: Recognize Uncertainty\n\nSay to yourself: **\"My training data may be stale for: [topic]\"**\n\n### Step 2: Check Local Ground Truth\n\n```text\nRead ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/blackboard/assertions.yaml\nSearch for relevant entries\n```\n\nIf found - use that value with high confidence.\n\n### Step 3: If Not in Assertions - WebSearch\n\n```text\nWebSearch(\"[software] [version] release date site:official-docs\")\nWebSearch(\"[software] LTS release 2025\")\n```\n\nPrefer official sources:\n\n- microsoft.com/dotnet for .NET\n- nodejs.org for Node\n- python.org for Python\n\n### Step 4: State Verified Facts\n\nSay: **\"Based on [source], [software] [version] is [status] as of [date].\"**\n\n### Step 5: THEN Proceed\n\nOnly now answer the actual question with the verified baseline.\n\n## Red Flag Thoughts (REJECT THESE)\n\n| If you think... | Actually do... |\n|-----------------|----------------|\n| \"I''m pretty sure .NET 10 is...\" | WebSearch to verify |\n| \"This is probably still preview\" | Check assertions.yaml |\n| \"I remember this from training\" | Training is stale, verify |\n| \"This is a simple factual question\" | Simple facts are often WRONG |\n| \"The user said it''s preview\" | User might be wrong too, verify |\n\n## Anti-Pattern Examples\n\n**WRONG:**\n\n```text\n\"If targeting .NET 10 preview, use C# 14 extension types...\"\n```\n\n**CORRECT:**\n\n```text\n\"Let me verify .NET 10 status... [WebSearch] ...\n.NET 10 is LTS (released November 2025), not preview.\nStandard extension methods work fine.\"\n```\n\n**WRONG:**\n\n```text\n\"React 19 is still in beta, so...\"\n```\n\n**CORRECT:**\n\n```text\n\"Checking React 19 status... [WebSearch] ...\nReact 19 was released December 2024 as stable.\nProceeding with React 19 stable patterns.\"\n```\n\n## Common Danger Patterns\n\n| Topic | Danger Pattern | Likely Truth |\n|-------|----------------|--------------|\n| .NET | \"preview\", \"not released\" | .NET 10 LTS since Nov 2025 |\n| React | \"beta\", \"experimental\" | React 19 stable since Dec 2024 |\n| Node | \"current\" without version | Always specify exact version |\n| Python | \"3.x is latest\" | Verify - 3.13+ exists |\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen this skill activates, structure your verification as:\n\n```text\nEpistemic Checkpoint\n\nClaim to verify: [what you were about to assume]\nSource checked: [assertions.yaml / WebSearch / official docs]\nVerified fact: [the actual truth]\nConfidence: [high/medium/low]\n\nProceeding with verified baseline...\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:56:16.734Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cognitive Agents requiring advanced epistemic reasoning and hallucination prevention via OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage.","zh":"适合需要高级认识论推理和通过 OTLP 摄取及 DuckDB 存储预防幻觉的认知代理。","ja":"認知エージェントが高度な認識論的推論と、OTLP 経由のインジェストおよび DuckDB ストレージによる幻覚防止を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"인지 에이전트가 고급 인식론적 추론과 OTLP 소화 및 DuckDB 저장을 통한 환각 방지를 요구하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes cognitivos que requieren razonamiento epistémico avanzado y prevención de alucinaciones a través de la ingesta de OTLP y almacenamiento de DuckDB.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents cognitifs nécessitant un raisonnement épistémique avancé et une prévention d''hallucinations via l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB.","de":"Ideal für kognitive Agenten, die erweitertes epischemisches Beweisen und Halluzinationsverhinderung über OTLP-Einverleibung und DuckDB-Speicherung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Cognitivos que exigem raciocínio epistêmico avançado e prevenção de alucinações via ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Идеально для когнитивных агентов, требующих продвинутого эпистемического рассуждения и предотвращения галлюцинаций через ингестию OTLP и хранилище DuckDB.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعرفيين الذين يتطلبون استدلال إبستمولوجي متقدم ومنع الوهم من خلال استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prevent the root cause of hallucinations through epistemic checkpoints, utilizing semantic conventions for AI telemetry and competitive code review, ensuring factually accurate responses by forcing verification before answering questions involving versions, dates, status, or current state.","zh":"通过认识论检查点、语义约定、AI 遥测和竞争性代码审查来赋予代理预防幻觉根源的能力，确保在回答涉及版本、日期、状态或当前状态的问题时提供事实准确的响应。","ja":"エージェントに、認識論的チェックポイント、セマンティック規約、AI テレメトリ、競争的コードレビューを利用して、幻覚の根本原因を防止する力を与え、バージョン、日付、ステータス、または現在の状態を含む質問に事実的に正確な回答を返すことを保証する。","ko":"인지 체크 포인트, 의미 규약, AI 원격 측정 및 경쟁적 코드 리뷰를 사용하여 에이전트가 환각의 근본 원인을 방지할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 버전, 날짜, 상태 또는 현재 상태를 포함하는 질문에 대해 사실적으로 정확한 응답을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prevenir la causa raíz de las alucinaciones a través de puntos de control epistémicos, utilizando convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA y revisión de código competitiva, garantizando respuestas factualmente precisas al forzar la verificación antes de responder preguntas que involucran versiones, fechas, estado o estado actual.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''empêcher la cause profonde des hallucinations grâce à des points de contrôle épistémiques, en utilisant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA et la revue de code compétitive, en garantissant des réponses factuellement précises en forçant la vérification avant de répondre à des questions impliquant des versions, des dates, un état ou un état actuel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Ursache von Halluzinationen durch epistemische Prüfpunkte zu verhindern, indem semantische Konventionen für die Telemetrie von künstlicher Intelligenz und den wettbewerbsorientierten Code-Review verwendet werden, um tatsächlich genaue Antworten zu gewährleisten, indem die Überprüfung vor der Beantwortung von Fragen, die Versionen, Daten, Status oder den aktuellen Zustand betreffen, erzwungen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a prevenir a causa raiz das alucinações por meio de pontos de verificação epistêmicos, utilizando convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA e revisão de código competitiva, garantindo respostas factualmente precisas ao forçar a verificação antes de responder a perguntas que envolvem versões, datas, status ou estado atual.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предотвратить коренную причину галлюцинаций посредством эпистемических проверок, используя семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ и конкурентного код-ревью, гарантируя фактически точные ответы, заставляя проверку перед ответом на вопросы, включающие версии, даты, статус или текущее состояние.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على منع السبب الجذري للاوهام من خلال نقاط التفتيش الإبستيمولوجية، باستخدام الاتفاقيات الدلالية للتелемترية الاصطناعية والمراجعة التنافسية للشفرة، وضمان إجابات دقيقة من حيث الحقيقة من خلال إجبار التحقق قبل الإجابة على الأسئلة المتعلقة بالإصدارات والأتواريخ والحالة أو الحالة الحالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Preventing hallucinations in GenAI/LLM workloads","Implementing metacognitive guards for cognitive amplification","Enforcing epistemic hooks for deep-thinking agents"],"zh":["防止 GenAI/LLM 工作负载中的幻觉","为认知放大实现元认知防护","为深度思考代理强制执行认识论钩子"],"ja":["GenAI/LLM ワークロードにおける幻覚の防止","認知増幅のためのメタ認知ガードの実装","深い思考エージェントのための認識論的フックの実施"],"ko":["GenAI/LLM 작업량에서 환각을 방지하는 것","인지 증폭을 위한 메타 인지 가드 구현","깊은 사고 에이전트를 위한 인식론적 후크의 적용"],"es":["Prevenir alucinaciones en cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM","Implementar guardias metacognitivas para amplificación cognitiva","Establecer ganchos epistémicos para agentes de pensamiento profundo"],"fr":["Prévenir les hallucinations dans les charges de travail GenAI/LLM","Mettre en œuvre des gardes métacognitifs pour l''amplification cognitive","Mettre en place des crochets épistémiques pour les agents de réflexion approfondie"],"de":["Halluzinationen in GenAI/LLM-Arbeitslasten verhindern","Metakognitive Wächter für kognitive Verstärkung implementieren","Epistemische Haken für tiefschürfende Agenten einrichten"],"pt":["Prevenção de alucinações em cargas de trabalho GenAI/LLM","Implementação de guardas metacognitivos para amplificação cognitiva","Aplicação de ganchos epistêmicos para agentes de pensamento profundo"],"ru":["Предотвращение галлюцинаций в рабочих нагрузках GenAI/LLM","Реализация метакогнитивных охранников для когнитивного усилителя","Внедрение эпистемических крючков для агентов глубокого мышления"],"ar":["منع الوهم في حمولات العمل GenAI/LLM","تنفيذ حراس ما بعد إدراكي للتعزيز الإدراكي","تطبيق مشابك إبستيمولوجية لعميل التفكير العميق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion capabilities","DuckDB storage necessary","Limited to GenAI/LLM workloads"],"zh":["需要 OTLP 摄取能力","需要 DuckDB 存储","仅限 GenAI/LLM 工作负载"],"ja":["OTLP インジェスト機能が必要","DuckDB ストレージが必要","GenAI/LLM ワークロードに限定"],"ko":["OTLP 소화 기능이 필요","DuckDB 저장소가 필요","GenAI/LLM 작업량으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de ingesta de OTLP","Almacenamiento de DuckDB necesario","Limitado a cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''ingestion OTLP","Stockage DuckDB nécessaire","Limité aux charges de travail GenAI/LLM"],"de":["Benötigt OTLP-Einverleibungsfähigkeiten","DuckDB-Speicherung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf GenAI/LLM-Arbeitslasten"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de ingestão OTLP","Armazenamento DuckDB necessário","Limitado a cargas de trabalho GenAI/LLM"],"ru":["Требует возможностей ингестии OTLP","Необходимо хранилище DuckDB","Ограничен рабочими нагрузками GenAI/LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات استهلاك OTLP","يتم الحاجة إلى تخزين DuckDB","محدود بحمولات العمل GenAI/LLM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('francoisrob/dotfiles/restio-ticket-triage', 'community', 'francoisrob', 'dotfiles', 'francoisrob/dotfiles', 'restio-ticket-triage', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:56:14.613Z', NULL, '{"id":"francoisrob/dotfiles/restio-ticket-triage","name":"restio-ticket-triage","description":{"zh":"Restio Ticket Triage","ja":"RestioID","ko":"Restio ","es":"Restio Ticket Triage es una herramienta que analiza tickets de soporte de forma eficiente, extrayendo IDs de ticket y recuperando detalles para un análisis rápido.","fr":"Restio Ticket Triage est un outil qui analyse les tickets de support de manière efficace, en extrayant les IDs de ticket et en récupérant les détails pour une analyse rapide.","de":"Restio Ticket Triage ist ein Tool, das Support-Tickets effizient analysiert, indem es Ticket-IDs extrahiert und Details abruft, um eine schnelle Analyse zu ermöglichen.","pt":"O Restio Ticket Triage é uma ferramenta que automatiza a análise de tickets de suporte, fornecendo uma visão geral clara do problema.","ru":"Restio Тriage Билетов - это инструмент, который автоматизирует анализ тикетов поддержки, предоставляя четкий обзор проблемы.","ar":"أداة Restio Ticket Triage تتيح أتمتة عملية تحليل تذاكر الدعم، وتقديم نظرة عامة واضحة للمشكلة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Restio Ticket Triage","ja":"Restio ","ko":"Restio ","es":"Restio Ticket Triage: Análisis de Tickets de Soporte","fr":"Restio Ticket Triage : Analyse des Tickets de Support","de":"Restio Ticket Triage: Analyse von Support-Tickets","pt":"Restio Ticket Triage - Automatize a Análise de Tickets","ru":"Restio Тriage Билетов - Автоматизируйте Анализ","ar":"ترياج تذاكر Restio - أتمتة التحليل","en":"restio-ticket-triage"},"description":{"zh":"Restio Ticket Triage","ja":"RestioID","ko":"Restio ","es":"Restio Ticket Triage es una herramienta que analiza tickets de soporte de forma eficiente, extrayendo IDs de ticket y recuperando detalles para un análisis r...","fr":"Restio Ticket Triage est un outil qui analyse les tickets de support de manière efficace, en extrayant les IDs de ticket et en récupérant les détails pour un...","de":"Restio Ticket Triage ist ein Tool, das Support-Tickets effizient analysiert, indem es Ticket-IDs extrahiert und Details abruft, um eine schnelle Analyse zu e...","pt":"O Restio Ticket Triage é uma ferramenta que automatiza a análise de tickets de suporte, fornecendo uma visão geral clara do problema.","ru":"Restio Тriage Билетов - это инструмент, который автоматизирует анализ тикетов поддержки, предоставляя четкий обзор проблемы.","ar":"أداة Restio Ticket Triage تتيح أتمتة عملية تحليل تذاكر الدعم، وتقديم نظرة عامة واضحة للمشكلة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["ID","Git","Restio","MCP","API","ID"],"ja":["ID","Git","Restio","MCP","API","ID"],"ko":["ID","Git","Restio","MCP","API","ID"],"es":["Extracción de IDs de ticket","Recuperación de detalles de ticket","Análisis rápido de problemas","Preparación de una rama de Git limpia","Análisis de solo lectura antes de editar"],"fr":["Extraction des IDs de ticket","Récupération des détails de ticket","Analyse rapide des problèmes","Préparation d''une branche Git propre","Analyse en lecture seule avant de modifier"],"de":["Extraktion von Ticket-IDs","Abruf von Ticket-Details","Schnelle Analyse von Problemen","Vorbereitung einer sauberen Git-Branche","Nur-Lese-Analyse vor dem Bearbeiten"],"pt":["Extração de ID de ticket","Análise de detalhes do ticket","Criação de branch limpo no Git","Análise somente leitura antes de edições"],"ru":["Извлечение ID тикета","Анализ деталей тикета","Создание чистой ветки в Git","Только чтение анализа до редактирования"],"ar":["استخراج رقم التذكرة","تحليل تفاصيل التذكرة","إنشاء فرع نظيف في Git","تحليل القراءة فقط قبل التعديلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Restio Ticket Triage","Restio","Ticket Triage","Git","MCP","API","ID","Restio","DevOps","Ticket"],"ja":["Restio Ticket Triage","Restio","Ticket Triage","Git","MCP","API","ID","Restio","DevOps","Ticket"],"ko":["Restio Ticket Triage","Restio","Ticket Triage","Git","MCP","API","ID","Restio","DevOps","Ticket"],"es":["análisis de tickets de soporte","automatización de tickets","herramientas de soporte","Restio Ticket Triage","gestión de tickets","análisis de problemas"],"fr":["analyse de tickets de support","automatisation de tickets","outils de support","Restio Ticket Triage","gestion de tickets","analyse de problèmes"],"de":["Analyse von Support-Tickets","Automatisierung von Tickets","Support-Tools","Restio Ticket Triage","Ticket-Management","Problemanalyse"],"pt":["automação de análise de tickets","ferramenta de suporte","desenvolvimento de software","Restio Ticket Triage","análise de tickets","suporte técnico"],"ru":["автоматизация анализа тикетов","инструмент поддержки","разработка программного обеспечения","Restio Тriage Билетов","анализ тикетов","техническая поддержка"],"ar":["أتمتة تحليل التذاكر","أداة الدعم","تطوير البرمجيات","ترياج تذاكر Restio","تحليل التذاكر","الدعم الفني"]}},"owner":"francoisrob","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"francoisrob/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"restio-ticket-triage","description":"Handle Restio support tickets when the user provides a ticket ID like XX-### (e.g., YYYYY-##: TASK - ...). Use this skill to fetch the ticket via the restio-support MCP, prepare git branches, summarize the ticket, and request confirmation before making any code changes.","bodyPreview":"# Restio Ticket Triage\n\n## Overview\nFetch a Restio support ticket by ID, prepare a clean git branch, and provide a read-only analysis before any edits.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Parse ticket ID\n- Accept inputs like `XX-###: TASK - ...` or `YYYYY-##`.\n- Extract the leading ticket ID in the form `^[A-Z]{2,5}-\\d+`.\n- If no valid ID is found, ask the user to provide it.\n\n### 2) Fetch ticket details (read-only)\n- Use MCP `restio-support.get_case` with the extracted ID.\n- Summarize the ticket: problem stat","body":"# Restio Ticket Triage\n\n## Overview\nFetch a Restio support ticket by ID, prepare a clean git branch, and provide a read-only analysis before any edits.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Parse ticket ID\n- Accept inputs like `XX-###: TASK - ...` or `YYYYY-##`.\n- Extract the leading ticket ID in the form `^[A-Z]{2,5}-\\d+`.\n- If no valid ID is found, ask the user to provide it.\n\n### 2) Fetch ticket details (read-only)\n- Use MCP `restio-support.get_case` with the extracted ID.\n- Summarize the ticket: problem statement, reported behavior, environment, and acceptance criteria.\n\n### 3) Research only\n- Use `serena` to locate relevant code and tests.\n- Identify likely touch points and risks.\n- Do not modify files yet.\n\n### 4) Ask for confirmation\n- Present a concise summary of findings and a proposed plan.\n- Ask the user to confirm before making any code changes.\n\n### 5) Prepare git branches (after confirmation)\n- Ask the user to confirm branch switching before executing git commands.\n- If the repo has uncommitted changes, stop and ask the user before switching branches.\n- Determine the primary dev branch:\n  1. Prefer `develop` if it exists on `origin`.\n  2. Else prefer `development` if it exists on `origin`.\n  3. Else use the remote default from `origin/HEAD`.\n  4. Else fall back to `main`, then `master`.\n- Checkout that branch, pull latest (ff-only), then create/switch to a branch named exactly the ticket ID (e.g., `YYYYY-##`) unless already on it.\n## Constraints\n- Read-only until the user confirms.\n- Do not spawn sub-agents unless explicitly authorized.\n- Avoid destructive git commands; never reset or overwrite without approval.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:56:14.613Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Support Agents needing automated ticket analysis and triage capabilities with Restio support tickets.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化票据分析和分类功能的支持代理，尤其是对于Restio支持票据。","ja":"サポートエージェントが自動化されたチケット分析およびトリアージ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。特にRestioサポートチケットの場合に効果的です。","ko":"자동화된 티켓 분석 및 분류 기능이 필요한 지원 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 Restio 지원 티켓의 경우에 효과적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de soporte que necesitan análisis y capacidad de triage automatizados de tickets con tickets de soporte de Restio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de support ayant besoin d''une analyse et de capacités de triage de tickets automatisées avec les tickets de support Restio.","de":"Perfekt für Support-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Ticket-Analyse und Triage-Fähigkeiten mit Restio-Support-Tickets benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Suporte que precisam de análise e triagem de tickets automatizadas com suporte a tickets do Restio.","ru":"Идеально для агентов поддержки, которым необходимы автоматизированные возможности анализа и триажа билетов с поддержкой билетов Restio.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات دعم الاحتياج إلى تحليل تذاكر وترشيح آلي مع دعم تذاكر Restio."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch and analyze Restio support tickets using MCP restio-support.get_case, providing read-only summaries and preparation of clean git branches for efficient issue resolution.","zh":"赋予代理人使用MCP restio-support.get_case来获取和分析Restio支持票据的能力，提供只读摘要并为高效问题解决做好准备，以便编辑和解决支持票据。","ja":"エージェントがMCP restio-support.get_caseを使用してRestioサポートチケットを取得および分析する機能を提供し、読み取り専用のサマリーを提供し、効率的な問題解決のためにクリーンなGitブランチの準備を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 MCP restio-support.get_case를 사용하여 Restio 지원 티켓을 가져와 분석할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 읽기 전용 요약을 제공하고, 효율적인 문제 해결을 위해 깨끗한 Git 브랜치의 준비를 도와줍니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar y analizar tickets de soporte de Restio usando MCP restio-support.get_case, proporcionando resúmenes de solo lectura y preparación de ramas limpias de Git para una resolución eficiente de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer et d''analyser les tickets de support Restio en utilisant MCP restio-support.get_case, fournissant des résumés en lecture seule et une préparation de branches Git propres pour une résolution efficace des problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Restio-Support-Tickets mithilfe von MCP restio-support.get_case abzurufen und zu analysieren, indem sie schreibgeschützte Zusammenfassungen und die Vorbereitung sauberer Git-Branches für eine effiziente Problemlösung bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar e analisar tickets de suporte do Restio usando MCP restio-support.get_case, fornecendo resumos somente leitura e preparação de branches git limpos para resolução eficiente de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получения и анализа билетов поддержки Restio с помощью MCP restio-support.get_case, обеспечивая чтение-only резюме и подготовку чистых веток git для эффективного решения проблем.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرجاع وتحليل تذاكر الدعم من Restio باستخدام MCP restio-support.get_case، مع تقديم ملخصات للقراءة فقط وتهيئة فروع جيت نظيفة للتصالح الفعال للمشكلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ticket ID parsing from various input formats","Fetching and summarizing Restio support ticket details for rapid analysis","Preparing clean git branches for editing and resolving support tickets"],"zh":["从各种输入格式自动解析票据ID","获取和总结Restio支持票据详细信息以进行快速分析","准备干净的Git分支以便编辑和解决支持票据"],"ja":["さまざまな入力形式からのチケットIDの自動解析","Restioサポートチケットの詳細を取得し、迅速な分析を行う","サポートチケットの編集および解決のためにクリーンなGitブランチを準備する"],"ko":["さまざま한 입력 형식에서 티켓 ID를 자동으로 파싱","Restio 지원 티켓의 세부 정보를 가져와 신속하게 분석","지원 티켓을 편집 및 해결하기 위한 깨끗한 Git 브랜치 준비"],"es":["Automatización del análisis de ID de ticket desde varios formatos de entrada","Recuperación y resumen de detalles de tickets de soporte de Restio para un análisis rápido","Preparación de ramas limpias de Git para la edición y resolución de tickets de soporte"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''analyse de l''ID de ticket à partir de différents formats d''entrée","Récupération et résumé des détails des tickets de support Restio pour une analyse rapide","Préparation de branches Git propres pour l''édition et la résolution des tickets de support"],"de":["Automatisierung der Analyse von Ticket-IDs aus verschiedenen Eingabeformaten","Abruf und Zusammenfassung von Details zu Restio-Support-Tickets für eine schnelle Analyse","Vorbereitung sauberer Git-Branches für die Bearbeitung und Lösung von Support-Tickets"],"pt":["Automatizar análise de ID de ticket de vários formatos de entrada","Buscar e resumir detalhes de tickets de suporte do Restio para análise rápida","Preparar branches git limpos para edição e resolução de tickets de suporte"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ ID билета из различных форматов ввода","Получать и суммировать детали билетов поддержки Restio для быстрого анализа","Подготавливать чистые ветки git для редактирования и решения билетов поддержки"],"ar":["تتميم تحليل تعريف التذكرة من صيغ مدخلات متعددة","استرجاع وتلخيص تفاصيل تذاكر الدعم من Restio لتحليل سريع","تهيئة فروع جيت نظيفة للتعديل والتصالح لتذاكر الدعم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires valid Restio support ticket ID in a specific format","Dependent on MCP restio-support.get_case functionality","Limited to read-only analysis before any edits"],"zh":["需要有效的Restio支持票据ID并且格式必须符合特定要求","依赖于MCP restio-support.get_case功能","仅限于编辑之前的只读分析"],"ja":["特定の形式の有効なRestioサポートチケットIDが必要","MCP restio-support.get_case機能に依存する","編集前の読み取り専用分析に限定される"],"ko":["특정 형식의 유효한 Restio 지원 티켓 ID가 필요","MCP restio-support.get_case 기능에 의존","편집 전 읽기 전용 분석에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere un ID de ticket de soporte de Restio válido en un formato específico","Dependiente de la funcionalidad de MCP restio-support.get_case","Limitado al análisis de solo lectura antes de cualquier edición"],"fr":["Nécessite un ID de ticket de support Restio valide dans un format spécifique","Dépendant de la fonctionnalité de MCP restio-support.get_case","Limité à l''analyse en lecture seule avant toute édition"],"de":["Erfordert eine gültige ID für Restio-Support-Tickets in einem bestimmten Format","Abhängig von der Funktionalität von MCP restio-support.get_case","Begrenzt auf schreibgeschützte Analyse vor jeder Bearbeitung"],"pt":["Requer ID de ticket de suporte do Restio válido em um formato específico","Dependente da funcionalidade MCP restio-support.get_case","Limitado à análise somente leitura antes de qualquer edição"],"ru":["Требует действительного ID билета поддержки Restio в определенном формате","Зависит от функциональности MCP restio-support.get_case","Ограничен чтение-only анализом до каких-либо правок"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريف تذكرة دعم Restio صالحًا بتنسيق معين","يعتمد على وظيفة MCP restio-support.get_case","محدود بالتحليل للقراءة فقط قبل أي تعديلات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
