 웹 콘텐츠를 WCAG 2.2 지침에 따라 감사하고 구체적인 수정 전략을 제공하는 포괄적인 가이드입니다","es":"Guía completa para auditar contenido web contra las pautas WCAG 2.2 con estrategias de remediación efectivas","fr":"Guide complet pour auditer le contenu web contre les directives WCAG 2.2 avec des stratégies de remédiation efficaces","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden zur Prüfung von Webinhalten gegen die WCAG-2.2-Richtlinien mit effektiven Remediationsstrategien","pt":"Guia abrangente para auditoria de conteúdo web contra diretrizes WCAG 2.2 com estratégias de remediação acessível","ru":"Комплексное руководство по аудиту веб-контента против руководящих принципов WCAG 2.2 с стратегиями доступного исправления","ar":"دليل شامل لتدقيق المحتوى الويب ضد إرشادات WCAG 2.2 مع استراتيجيات تصحيح ميسرة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["审计 web 内容以符合 WCAG 2.2 指南","提供可行的修复策略","帮助实现 ADA/Section 508 要求","实现 VPAT 合规","提高 web 内容的无障碍性","减少访问性诉讼风险"],"ja":["web コンテンツを WCAG 2.2 ガイドラインに準拠させるためのオーディット","実行可能な修復戦略の提供","ADA/Section 508 要求の達成への支援","VPAT 適合の実現","web コンテンツのアクセシビリティの向上","アクセシビリティ訴訟のリスク削減"],"ko":["웹 콘텐츠를 WCAG 2.2 지침에 따라 감사","구체적인 수정 전략 제공","ADA/Section 508 요구사항 충족 지원","VPAT 적합성 달성","웹 콘텐츠의 접근성 향상","접근성 소송 위험 감소"],"es":["Auditoría de contenido web contra WCAG 2.2","Estrategias de remediación para violaciones WCAG","Implementación de componentes accesibles","Preparación para demandas de accesibilidad","Cumplimiento de ADA/Sección 508","Logro de la conformidad VPAT"],"fr":["Audit de contenu web contre les directives WCAG 2.2","Stratégies de remédiation pour les violations WCAG","Mise en œuvre de composants accessibles","Préparation aux poursuites pour accessibilité","Conformité ADA/Section 508","Réalisations de la conformité VPAT"],"de":["Prüfung von Webinhalten gegen die WCAG-2.2-Richtlinien","Remediationsstrategien für WCAG-Verletzungen","Implementierung von barrierefreien Komponenten","Vorbereitung auf Barrierefreiheitsklagen","Einhaltung von ADA/Abschnitt 508","Erreichung der VPAT-Konformität"],"pt":["Auditoria de conteúdo web contra WCAG 2.2","Estratégias de remediação acessível","Implementação de componentes acessíveis","Preparação para processos judiciais de acessibilidade","Cumprimento dos requisitos ADA/Seção 508","Alcance da conformidade VPAT"],"ru":["Аудит веб-контента против WCAG 2.2","Стратегии доступного исправления","Реализация доступных компонентов","Подготовка к судебным разбирательствам по доступности","Соблюдение требований ADA/Секции 508","Достижение соответствия VPAT"],"ar":["تدقيق المحتوى الويب ضد WCAG 2.2","استراتيجيات تصحيح ميسرة","تنفيذ مكونات ميسرة","الاستعداد للقضايا القانونية المتعلقة بالوصول","الامتثال لمتطلبات ADA/القسم 508","تحقيق مطابقة VPAT"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WCAG 审计模式","web 无障碍","WCAG 2.2","ADA/Section 508","VPAT","访问性审计","修复策略","无障碍设计"],"ja":["WCAG オーディット パターン","web アクセシビリティ","WCAG 2.2","ADA/Section 508","VPAT","アクセシビリティ オーディット","修復戦略","アクセシブル デザイン"],"ko":["WCAG 감사 패턴","웹 접근성","WCAG 2.2","ADA/Section 508","VPAT","접근성 감사","수정 전략","접근성 디자인"],"es":["accesibilidad web","WCAG 2.2","auditoría de accesibilidad","remediación WCAG","componentes accesibles","ADA","Sección 508","VPAT","barrierefreiheit"],"fr":["accessibilité web","WCAG 2.2","audit d''accessibilité","remédiation WCAG","composants accessibles","ADA","Section 508","VPAT","accessibilité"],"de":["Web-Accessibility","WCAG 2.2","Barrierefreiheitsprüfung","WCAG-Remediation","barrierefreie Komponenten","ADA","Abschnitt 508","VPAT","Barrierefreiheit"],"pt":["WCAG 2.2","auditoria de acessibilidade","remediação acessível","desenvolvimento web acessível","ADA","Seção 508","VPAT","acessibilidade web","desenvolvedores web"],"ru":["WCAG 2.2","аудит доступности","доступное исправление","доступное веб-разработка","ADA","Секция 508","VPAT","веб-доступность","веб-разработчики"],"ar":["WCAG 2.2","تدقيق إمكانية الوصول","تصحيح ميسر","تطوير الويب الميسر","ADA","القسم 508","VPAT","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","مطوري الويب"]}},"owner":"CarlosVerasteguii","repo":"Daticket","repoPath":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wcag-audit-patterns","description":"Conduct WCAG 2.2 accessibility audits with automated testing, manual verification, and remediation guidance. Use when auditing websites for accessibility, fixing WCAG violations, or implementing accessible design patterns.","bodyPreview":"# WCAG Audit Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to auditing web content against WCAG 2.2 guidelines with actionable remediation strategies.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Conducting accessibility audits\n- Fixing WCAG violations\n- Implementing accessible components\n- Preparing for accessibility lawsuits\n- Meeting ADA/Section 508 requirements\n- Achieving VPAT compliance\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You need legal advice or formal certification\n- You only want a quick automated scan without manual veri","body":"# WCAG Audit Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to auditing web content against WCAG 2.2 guidelines with actionable remediation strategies.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Conducting accessibility audits\n- Fixing WCAG violations\n- Implementing accessible components\n- Preparing for accessibility lawsuits\n- Meeting ADA/Section 508 requirements\n- Achieving VPAT compliance\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You need legal advice or formal certification\n- You only want a quick automated scan without manual verification\n- You cannot access the UI or source for remediation work\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run automated scans (axe, Lighthouse, WAVE) to collect initial findings.\n2. Perform manual checks (keyboard navigation, focus order, screen reader flows).\n3. Map each issue to a WCAG criterion, severity, and remediation guidance.\n4. Re-test after fixes and document residual risk and compliance status.\n\nRefer to `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid claiming legal compliance without expert review.\n- Keep evidence of test steps and results for audit trails.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:55:48.386Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Accessibility Agents needing comprehensive WCAG 2.2 guideline audits and remediation strategies.","zh":"适合需要全面WCAG 2.2指南审计和补救策略的无障碍代理。","ja":"WCAG 2.2ガイドラインの徹底的な監査と是正戦略が必要なアクセシビリティエージェントに最適。","ko":"전면적인 WCAG 2.2 가이드라인 감사 및 복구 전략이 필요한 접근성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Accesibilidad que necesitan auditorías y estrategias de remediación integrales de las pautas WCAG 2.2.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''accessibilité ayant besoin d''audits et de stratégies de remédiation complètes des lignes directrices WCAG 2.2.","de":"Ideal für Accessibility-Agents, die umfassende Audits und Strategien zur Behebung der WCAG 2.2-Richtlinien benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Acessibilidade que necessitam de auditorias abrangentes das diretrizes WCAG 2.2 e estratégias de remediação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов доступности, которым необходимы всесторонние аудиты руководства WCAG 2.2 и стратегии исправления.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكلاء إمكانية الوصول الذين يحتاجون إلى تدقيقات شاملة لإرشادات WCAG 2.2 و استراتيجيات تصحيح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough accessibility audits, identify WCAG violations, and implement actionable remediation strategies using ADA/Section 508 requirements and VPAT compliance protocols, ensuring accessible web content for all users.","zh":"赋予代理进行彻底的无障碍审计、识别WCAG违规行为并实施可行的补救策略，使用ADA/第508节要求和VPAT合规协议，确保所有用户的无障碍网络内容。","ja":"エージェントがWCAG違反を特定し、ADA/セクション508の要件とVPATコンプライアンスプロトコルを使用して是正策略を実施するための徹底的なアクセシビリティ監査を実施できるようにし、すべてのユーザーにアクセス可能なWebコンテンツを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 철저한 접근성 감사와 WCAG 위반을 식별하고 ADA/508節 요구 사항 및 VPAT 준수 프로토콜을 사용하여 시정 전략을 구현하여 모든 사용자가 접근 가능한 웹 콘텐츠를 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de accesibilidad exhaustivas, identificar violaciones de la WCAG y implementar estrategias de remediación eficaces utilizando los requisitos de la ADA/Sección 508 y los protocolos de cumplimiento de VPAT, garantizando contenido web accesible para todos los usuarios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits d''accessibilité complets, d''identifier les violations de la WCAG et de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de remédiation efficaces en utilisant les exigences de l''ADA/Section 508 et les protocoles de conformité VPAT, garantissant un contenu Web accessible à tous les utilisateurs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Barrierefreiheitsaudits durchzuführen, WCAG-Verstöße zu identifizieren und wirksame Behebungsstrategien unter Verwendung der Anforderungen von ADA/Abschnitt 508 und der VPAT-Konformitätsprotokolle umzusetzen, um so für alle Benutzer zugängliche Webinhalte sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de acessibilidade abrangentes, identificar violações da WCAG e implementar estratégias de remediação eficazes usando requisitos ADA/Seção 508 e protocolos de conformidade VPAT, garantindo conteúdo web acessível para todos os usuários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты доступности, выявлять нарушения WCAG и реализовывать действенные стратегии исправления с использованием требований ADA/Секции 508 и протоколов соответствия VPAT, обеспечивая доступность веб-контента для всех пользователей.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء تدقيقات شاملة لإمكانية الوصول، وتحديد انتهاكات WCAG، وتنفيذ استراتيجيات تصحيح قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام متطلبات ADA/المادة 508 وبروتوكولات الامتثال لبروتوكول VPAT، مما يضمن المحتوى الإلكتروني المتاح لجميع المستخدمين."},"useCases":{"en":["Conducting manual accessibility audits for WCAG 2.2 compliance","Implementing accessible components for inclusive web design","Preparing web content for accessibility lawsuits and VPAT compliance"],"zh":["进行WCAG 2.2合规性的手动无障碍审计","为包容性网页设计实施可访问的组件","为无障碍诉讼和VPAT合规准备网页内容"],"ja":["WCAG 2.2コンプライアンスのための手動アクセシビリティ監査の実施","包容的なWebデザインのためのアクセス可能なコンポーネントの実装","アクセシビリティ訴訟とVPATコンプライアンスのためのWebコンテンツの準備"],"ko":["WCAG 2.2 규정 준수를 위한 수동 접근성 감사를 수행하는こと","포괄적인 웹 디자인을 위한 접근 가능한 구성 요소를 구현하는 것","접근성 소송 및 VPAT 규정 준수를 위한 웹 콘텐츠 준비"],"es":["Realizar auditorías de accesibilidad manuales para el cumplimiento de la WCAG 2.2","Implementar componentes accesibles para un diseño web inclusivo","Preparar contenido web para demandas de accesibilidad y cumplimiento de VPAT"],"fr":["Réalisant des audits d''accessibilité manuels pour la conformité à la WCAG 2.2","Mettre en œuvre des composants accessibles pour un design Web inclusif","Préparer le contenu Web pour les poursuites en matière d''accessibilité et la conformité VPAT"],"de":["Durchführen manueller Barrierefreiheitsaudits für die Einhaltung der WCAG 2.2","Implementieren von zugänglichen Komponenten für ein inklusives Webdesign","Vorbereiten von Webinhalten für Barrierefreiheitsklagen und VPAT-Konformität"],"pt":["Realizar auditorias manuais de acessibilidade para conformidade com WCAG 2.2","Implementar componentes acessíveis para design web inclusivo","Preparar conteúdo web para processos judiciais de acessibilidade e conformidade VPAT"],"ru":["Проведение ручных аудитов доступности для соответствия WCAG 2.2","Реализация доступных компонентов для инклюзивного веб-дизайна","Подготовка веб-контента к судебным делам по доступности и соответствию VPAT"],"ar":["إجراء تدقيقات يدوية لإمكانية الوصول للامتثال ل WCAG 2.2","تنفيذ مكونات قابلة للوصول لتصميم الويب الشامل","تحضير المحتوى الإلكتروني للقضايا القانونية المتعلقة بإمكانية الوصول وامتثال بروتوكول VPAT"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for legal advice or formal certification","Requires manual verification for accurate audit results"],"zh":["不适合法律建议或正式认证","需要手动验证以获得准确的审计结果"],"ja":["法的なアドバイスや正式な認証には適していない","正確な監査結果を得るために手動での検証が必要"],"ko":["법률 자문 또는 공식 인증에는 적합하지 않음","정확한 감사 결과를 얻기 위해 수동 확인이 필요"],"es":["No es adecuado para asesoramiento legal o certificación formal","Requiere verificación manual para resultados de auditoría precisos"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté pour les conseils juridiques ou la certification formelle","Nécessite une vérification manuelle pour des résultats d''audit précis"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für Rechtsberatung oder formale Zertifizierung","Benötigt manuelle Überprüfung für genaue Audit-Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Não adequado para consultoria jurídica ou certificação formal","Exige verificação manual para resultados de auditoria precisos"],"ru":["Не подходит для юридических консультаций или официальной сертификации","Требует ручной верификации для точных результатов аудита"],"ar":["غير مناسب للتشاور القانوني أو الشهادة الرسمية","يتطلب التحقق اليدوي لنتائج التدقيق الدقيقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vallafederico/solid-ai-rules/solidstart-websocket', 'community', 'vallafederico', 'solid-ai-rules', 'vallafederico/solid-ai-rules', 'solidstart-websocket', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:56:27.950Z', NULL, '{"id":"vallafederico/solid-ai-rules/solidstart-websocket","name":"solidstart-websocket","description":{"zh":"SolidStart WebSocket 是一个实验性的功能，允许开发者实现实时双向通信。通过本指南，学习如何在 SolidStart 中启用 WebSocket 支持","ja":"SolidStart WebSocket は実験的な機能であり、開発者がリアルタイムの双方向通信を実現できるようにします。このガイドでは、SolidStart で WebSocket サポートを有効にする方法を説明します","ko":"SolidStart WebSocket은 실험적인 기능으로 개발자가 실시간 양방향 통신을 구현할 수 있습니다. 이 가이드에서는 SolidStart에서 WebSocket 지원을 활성화하는 방법을 설명합니다","es":"SolidStart WebSocket es una característica experimental que permite la comunicación en tiempo real. Aprende a configurarla para chat, notificaciones y actualizaciones en vivo.","fr":"SolidStart WebSocket est une fonctionnalité expérimentale qui permet la communication en temps réel. Découvrez comment la configurer pour les chat, les notifications et les mises à jour en direct.","de":"SolidStart WebSocket ist eine experimentelle Funktion, die die Echtzeitkommunikation ermöglicht. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie für Chat, Benachrichtigungen und Live-Updates konfigurieren.","pt":"SolidStart WebSocket é uma funcionalidade experimental que permite comunicação em tempo real","ru":"SolidStart WebSocket — это экспериментальная функция, которая позволяет осуществлять реальное время","ar":"SolidStart WebSocket هو ميزة تجريبية تتيح التواصل في الوقت الفعلي","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SolidStart WebSocket 实现实时双向通信","ja":"SolidStart WebSocket を使用した双方向リアルタイム通信","ko":"SolidStart WebSocket을 사용한 실시간 양방향 통신","es":"SolidStart WebSocket: Guía Completa","fr":"SolidStart WebSocket : Guide Complète","de":"SolidStart WebSocket: Vollständige Anleitung","pt":"SolidStart WebSocket: Guia Completo","ru":"SolidStart WebSocket: Полное Руководство","ar":"SolidStart WebSocket: دليل كامل","en":"solidstart-websocket"},"description":{"zh":"SolidStart WebSocket 是一个实验性的功能，允许开发者实现实时双向通信。通过本指南，学习如何在 SolidStart 中启用 WebSocket 支持","ja":"SolidStart WebSocket は実験的な機能であり、開発者がリアルタイムの双方向通信を実現できるようにします。このガイドでは、SolidStart で WebSocket サポートを有効にする方法を説明します","ko":"SolidStart WebSocket은 실험적인 기능으로 개발자가 실시간 양방향 통신을 구현할 수 있습니다. 이 가이드에서는 SolidStart에서 WebSocket 지원을 활성화하는 방법을 설명합니다","es":"SolidStart WebSocket es una característica experimental que permite la comunicación en tiempo real. Aprende a configurarla para chat, notificaciones y actual...","fr":"SolidStart WebSocket est une fonctionnalité expérimentale qui permet la communication en temps réel. Découvrez comment la configurer pour les chat, les notif...","de":"SolidStart WebSocket ist eine experimentelle Funktion, die die Echtzeitkommunikation ermöglicht. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie für Chat, Benachrichtigungen und L...","pt":"SolidStart WebSocket é uma funcionalidade experimental que permite comunicação em tempo real","ru":"SolidStart WebSocket — это экспериментальная функция, которая позволяет осуществлять реальное время","ar":"SolidStart WebSocket هو ميزة تجريبية تتيح التواصل في الوقت الفعلي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实验性的 WebSocket 支持","实时双向通信","适用于聊天、通知和更新","通过配置文件启用","支持 HTTP 路由"],"ja":["実験的な WebSocket サポート","リアルタイムの双方向通信","チャット、通知、更新に適しています","構成ファイルを使用して有効化","HTTP ルーティングをサポート"],"ko":["실험적인 WebSocket 지원","실시간 양방향 통신","채팅, 알림, 업데이트에 적합","구성 파일을 사용하여 활성화","HTTP 라우팅 지원"],"es":["Comunicación en tiempo real","Puntos de conexión de WebSocket","Configuración experimental","Soporte para chat y notificaciones","Actualizaciones en vivo"],"fr":["Communication en temps réel","Points de terminaison WebSocket","Configuration expérimentale","Prise en charge des chat et des notifications","Mises à jour en direct"],"de":["Echtzeitkommunikation","WebSocket-Endpunkte","Experimentelle Konfiguration","Unterstützung für Chat und Benachrichtigungen","Live-Updates"],"pt":["Comunicação em tempo real","Suporte a endpoints WebSocket","Configuração experimental","Integração com SolidStart","Comunicação bidirecional"],"ru":["Реальное время","Поддержка конечных точек WebSocket","Экспериментальная конфигурация","Интеграция с SolidStart","Бидирекциональная связь"],"ar":["التواصل في الوقت الفعلي","دعم لنقاط النهاية WebSocket","تكوين تجريبي","التكامل مع SolidStart","التواصل الثنائي الاتجاه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SolidStart","WebSocket","实时通信","双向通信","实验性功能","配置文件","HTTP 路由"],"ja":["SolidStart","WebSocket","リアルタイム通信","双方向通信","実験的な機能","構成ファイル","HTTP ルーティング"],"ko":["SolidStart","WebSocket","실시간 통신","양방향 통신","실험적인 기능","구성 파일","HTTP 라우팅"],"es":["SolidStart WebSocket","Comunicación en tiempo real","Puntos de conexión de WebSocket","Desarrollo web","Chat en vivo","Notificaciones en tiempo real"],"fr":["SolidStart WebSocket","Communication en temps réel","Points de terminaison WebSocket","Développement web","Chat en direct","Notifications en temps réel"],"de":["SolidStart WebSocket","Echtzeitkommunikation","WebSocket-Endpunkte","Webentwicklung","Live-Chat","Echtzeitbenachrichtigungen"],"pt":["SolidStart WebSocket","Comunicação em tempo real","Endpoints WebSocket","Configuração experimental","Desenvolvimento web","SolidStart"],"ru":["SolidStart WebSocket","Реальное время","Конечные точки WebSocket","Экспериментальная конфигурация","Веб-разработка","SolidStart"],"ar":["SolidStart WebSocket","التواصل في الوقت الفعلي","نقاط النهاية WebSocket","تكوين تجريبي","تطوير الويب","SolidStart"]}},"owner":"vallafederico","repo":"solid-ai-rules","repoPath":"vallafederico/solid-ai-rules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"solidstart-websocket","description":"SolidStart WebSocket: experimental WebSocket endpoints, connection handling, message events, real-time communication, bidirectional data flow.","bodyPreview":"# SolidStart WebSocket\n\nComplete guide to WebSocket endpoints in SolidStart. Enable real-time bidirectional communication for chat, notifications, and live updates.\n\n## Setup\n\n**Note:** WebSocket support is experimental and may change in future releases.\n\n### Enable in Config\n\n```tsx\n// app.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig } from \"@solidjs/start/config\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  server: {\n    experimental: {\n      websocket: true,\n    },\n  },\n}).addRouter({\n  name: \"ws\",\n  type: \"http\",","body":"# SolidStart WebSocket\n\nComplete guide to WebSocket endpoints in SolidStart. Enable real-time bidirectional communication for chat, notifications, and live updates.\n\n## Setup\n\n**Note:** WebSocket support is experimental and may change in future releases.\n\n### Enable in Config\n\n```tsx\n// app.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig } from \"@solidjs/start/config\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  server: {\n    experimental: {\n      websocket: true,\n    },\n  },\n}).addRouter({\n  name: \"ws\",\n  type: \"http\",\n  handler: \"./src/ws.ts\",\n  target: \"server\",\n  base: \"/ws\",\n});\n```\n\n### WebSocket Handler\n\n```tsx\n// src/ws.ts\nimport { eventHandler } from \"vinxi/http\";\n\nexport default eventHandler({\n  handler() {},\n  websocket: {\n    async open(peer) {\n      console.log(\"Connection opened:\", peer.id, peer.url);\n    },\n    async message(peer, msg) {\n      const message = msg.text();\n      console.log(\"Message received:\", peer.id, message);\n    },\n    async close(peer, details) {\n      console.log(\"Connection closed:\", peer.id);\n    },\n    async error(peer, error) {\n      console.error(\"WebSocket error:\", peer.id, error);\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Connection Lifecycle\n\n### Open Event\n\nCalled when client connects:\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async open(peer) {\n    // Store connection\n    connections.set(peer.id, peer);\n    \n    // Send welcome message\n    peer.send(\"Welcome!\");\n    \n    // Broadcast to others\n    broadcast(\"User connected\", peer.id);\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Message Event\n\nHandle incoming messages:\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async message(peer, msg) {\n    const data = msg.text(); // or msg.json() for JSON\n    \n    // Handle different message types\n    if (data.startsWith(\"/\")) {\n      handleCommand(peer, data);\n    } else {\n      broadcast(data, peer.id);\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Close Event\n\nClean up on disconnect:\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async close(peer, details) {\n    // Remove from connections\n    connections.delete(peer.id);\n    \n    // Broadcast disconnect\n    broadcast(\"User disconnected\", peer.id);\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Error Event\n\nHandle errors:\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async error(peer, error) {\n    console.error(\"Error for peer:\", peer.id, error);\n    // Handle error, possibly close connection\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Client Connection\n\n### Basic Client\n\n```tsx\nfunction useWebSocket(url: string) {\n  const [socket, setSocket] = createSignal<WebSocket | null>(null);\n  const [messages, setMessages] = createSignal<string[]>([]);\n\n  onMount(() => {\n    const ws = new WebSocket(url);\n\n    ws.onopen = () => {\n      setSocket(ws);\n    };\n\n    ws.onmessage = (event) => {\n      setMessages((prev) => [...prev, event.data]);\n    };\n\n    ws.onclose = () => {\n      setSocket(null);\n    };\n\n    ws.onerror = (error) => {\n      console.error(\"WebSocket error:\", error);\n    };\n\n    onCleanup(() => {\n      ws.close();\n    });\n  });\n\n  const send = (message: string) => {\n    socket()?.send(message);\n  };\n\n  return { socket, messages, send };\n}\n```\n\n### Usage in Component\n\n```tsx\nfunction Chat() {\n  const { messages, send } = useWebSocket(\"ws://localhost:3000/ws\");\n  const [input, setInput] = createSignal(\"\");\n\n  const handleSend = () => {\n    send(input());\n    setInput(\"\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <For each={messages()}>\n        {(msg) => <div>{msg}</div>}\n      </For>\n      <input\n        value={input()}\n        onInput={(e) => setInput(e.target.value)}\n      />\n      <button onClick={handleSend}>Send</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Message Handling\n\n### Text Messages\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async message(peer, msg) {\n    const text = msg.text();\n    // Handle text message\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### JSON Messages\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async message(peer, msg) {\n    const data = msg.json();\n    // Handle JSON message\n    if (data.type === \"chat\") {\n      broadcast(data, peer.id);\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Binary Messages\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async message(peer, msg) {\n    const buffer = msg.arrayBuffer();\n    // Handle binary data\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Broadcasting\n\n### Broadcast to All\n\n```tsx\nconst connections = new Map<string, any>();\n\nwebsocket: {\n  async message(peer, msg) {\n    const message = msg.text();\n    \n    // Broadcast to all connected peers\n    for (const [id, conn] of connections) {\n      if (id !== peer.id) {\n        conn.send(message);\n      }\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Broadcast to Room\n\n```tsx\nconst rooms = new Map<string, Set<string>>();\n\nfunction joinRoom(peerId: string, roomId: string) {\n  if (!rooms.has(roomId)) {\n    rooms.set(roomId, new Set());\n  }\n  rooms.get(roomId)!.add(peerId);\n}\n\nfunction broadcastToRoom(roomId: string, message: string, excludeId?: string) {\n  const room = rooms.get(roomId);\n  if (room) {\n    for (const peerId of room) {\n      if (peerId !== excludeId) {\n        const peer = connections.get(peerId);\n        peer?.send(message);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Chat Application\n\n```tsx\n// src/ws.ts\nconst connections = new Map();\nconst messages: string[] = [];\n\nexport default eventHandler({\n  handler() {},\n  websocket: {\n    async open(peer) {\n      connections.set(peer.id, peer);\n      // Send message history\n      peer.send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"history\", messages }));\n    },\n    async message(peer, msg) {\n      const data = JSON.parse(msg.text());\n      \n      if (data.type === \"message\") {\n        messages.push(data.text);\n        // Broadcast to all\n        for (const [id, conn] of connections) {\n          conn.send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"message\", text: data.text }));\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    async close(peer) {\n      connections.delete(peer.id);\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Real-Time Notifications\n\n```tsx\nwebsocket: {\n  async message(peer, msg) {\n    const { userId, notification } = JSON.parse(msg.text());\n    \n    // Send to specific user\n    const userPeer = findPeerByUserId(userId);\n    if (userPeer) {\n      userPeer.send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"notification\", data: notification }));\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Live Updates\n\n```tsx\n// Server-side data updates\nfunction notifyClients(data: any) {\n  for (const [id, peer] of connections) {\n    peer.send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"update\", data }));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Handle reconnection:**\n   - Implement reconnection logic on client\n   - Handle connection drops gracefully\n\n2. **Manage connections:**\n   - Track active connections\n   - Clean up on disconnect\n   - Limit connection count if needed\n\n3. **Validate messages:**\n   - Validate incoming messages\n   - Sanitize user input\n   - Handle malformed data\n\n4. **Error handling:**\n   - Handle errors gracefully\n   - Log errors for debugging\n   - Close connections on critical errors\n\n5. **Rate limiting:**\n   - Limit message frequency\n   - Prevent abuse\n   - Implement throttling\n\n## Limitations\n\n- **Experimental**: API may change\n- **Nitro dependency**: Requires Nitro server support\n- **Scaling**: Consider message queue for multiple servers\n\n## Summary\n\n- **Experimental feature**: Enable in config\n- **Event handlers**: open, message, close, error\n- **Client connection**: Use WebSocket API\n- **Broadcasting**: Send to multiple peers\n- **Real-time**: Perfect for chat, notifications, live updates\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:56:27.950Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Real-time Communication Agents requiring bidirectional WebSocket connectivity in SolidStart applications.","zh":"适用于需要在 SolidStart 应用程序中实现双向 WebSocket 连接的实时通信代理。","ja":"SolidStart アプリケーションで双方向の WebSocket 接続を必要とするリアルタイム通信エージェントに最適です。","ko":"SolidStart 애플리케이션에서 양방향 WebSocket 연결을 필요로 하는 실시간 통신 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Comunicación en Tiempo Real que requieren conectividad bidireccional de WebSocket en aplicaciones de SolidStart.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Communication en Temps Réel nécessitant une connectivité WebSocket bidirectionnelle dans les applications SolidStart.","de":"Ideal für Echtzeit-Kommunikationsagenten, die bidirektionale WebSocket-Verbindungen in SolidStart-Anwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Comunicação em Tempo Real que exigem conectividade bidirecional WebSocket em aplicações SolidStart.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов реального времени, требующих двусторонней связности WebSocket в приложениях SolidStart.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التواصل في الوقت الفعلي التي تتطلب اتصال WebSocket ثنائي الاتجاه في تطبيقات SolidStart."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish real-time bidirectional communication for chat, notifications, and live updates using WebSocket endpoints in SolidStart, enabling experimental features like websocket support in the server configuration.","zh":"赋予代理在 SolidStart 中使用 WebSocket 端点建立实时双向通信的能力，用于聊天、通知和实时更新，并支持服务器配置中的实验性 WebSocket 功能。","ja":"SolidStart の WebSocket エンドポイントを使用してチャット、通知、リアルタイム更新のためのリアルタイム双方向通信を確立するエージェントを可能にし、サーバー構成の WebSocket サポートなどの実験的な機能を有効にします。","ko":"에이전트가 SolidStart의 WebSocket 엔드포인트를 사용하여 채팅, 알림 및 실시간 업데이트를 위한 실시간 양방향 통신을 설정할 수 있도록 하며, 서버 구성의 WebSocket 지원과 같은 실험적 기능을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer comunicación bidireccional en tiempo real para chat, notificaciones y actualizaciones en vivo utilizando puntos de conexión de WebSocket en SolidStart, lo que permite características experimentales como el soporte de WebSocket en la configuración del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir une communication bidirectionnelle en temps réel pour le chat, les notifications et les mises à jour en direct en utilisant les points de terminaison WebSocket dans SolidStart, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités expérimentales telles que le support de WebSocket dans la configuration du serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bidirektionale Echtzeitkommunikation für Chat, Benachrichtigungen und Live-Updates über WebSocket-Endpunkte in SolidStart zu etablieren, wodurch experimentelle Funktionen wie WebSocket-Unterstützung in der Serverkonfiguration ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estabelecer comunicação bidirecional em tempo real para chat, notificações e atualizações ao vivo usando pontos de extremidade WebSocket no SolidStart, permitindo recursos experimentais como suporte a websocket na configuração do servidor.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность установления двусторонней связи в реальном времени для чата, уведомлений и обновлений в режиме реального времени с использованием конечных точек WebSocket в SolidStart, что позволяет использовать экспериментальные функции, такие как поддержка websocket в настройках сервера.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء اتصال ثنائي الاتجاه في الوقت الفعلي للчат والإشعارات والتحديثات الحية باستخدام نقاط النهاية WebSocket في SolidStart ، وتمكين الميزات التجريبية مثل دعم الويب سوكت في إعدادات الخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Enabling real-time chat functionality in web applications","Implementing live update notifications for users","Debugging WebSocket connections in SolidStart applications"],"zh":["在 Web 应用程序中启用实时聊天功能","为用户实施实时更新通知","在 SolidStart 应用程序中调试 WebSocket 连接"],"ja":["Web アプリケーションでリアルタイムチャット機能を有効にする","ユーザーにリアルタイム更新通知を実装する","SolidStart アプリケーションで WebSocket 接続をデバッグする"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션에서 실시간 채팅 기능을 활성화하는 것","사용자에게 실시간 업데이트를 알리는 것","SolidStart 애플리케이션에서 WebSocket 연결을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Habilitar la funcionalidad de chat en tiempo real en aplicaciones web","Implementar notificaciones de actualización en vivo para los usuarios","Depurar conexiones de WebSocket en aplicaciones de SolidStart"],"fr":["Activer la fonctionnalité de chat en temps réel dans les applications Web","Mettre en œuvre des notifications de mise à jour en direct pour les utilisateurs","Déboguer les connexions WebSocket dans les applications SolidStart"],"de":["Aktivieren der Echtzeit-Chat-Funktionalität in Webanwendungen","Implementieren von Live-Update-Benachrichtigungen für Benutzer","Debuggen von WebSocket-Verbindungen in SolidStart-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Habilitar funcionalidade de chat em tempo real em aplicações web","Implementar notificações de atualização ao vivo para usuários","Depurar conexões WebSocket em aplicações SolidStart"],"ru":["Включение функции чата в реальном времени в веб-приложениях","Реализация уведомлений об обновлении в реальном времени для пользователей","Отладка связности WebSocket в приложениях SolidStart"],"ar":["تمكين وظيفة الدردشة في الوقت الفعلي في التطبيقات الويب","تنفيذ إشعارات التحديث المباشر للمستخدمين","تصحيح أخطاء اتصال الويب سوكت في تطبيقات SolidStart"]},"limitations":{"en":["WebSocket support is experimental and may change in future releases","Requires configuration changes in the server settings to enable websocket support"],"zh":["WebSocket 支持是实验性的，可能会在未来的版本中发生变化","需要在服务器设置中进行配置更改以启用 WebSocket 支持"],"ja":["WebSocket サポートは実験的であり、将来的に変更される可能性があります","WebSocket サポートを有効にするためにサーバー設定で構成の変更が必要です"],"ko":["WebSocket 지원은 실험적이며 향후 버전에서 변경될 수 있습니다","WebSocket 지원을 활성화하기 위해 서버 설정에서 구성 변경이 필요합니다"],"es":["El soporte de WebSocket es experimental y puede cambiar en versiones futuras","Requiere cambios de configuración en la configuración del servidor para habilitar el soporte de WebSocket"],"fr":["Le support de WebSocket est expérimental et peut changer dans les versions futures","Nécessite des modifications de configuration dans les paramètres du serveur pour activer le support de WebSocket"],"de":["Die WebSocket-Unterstützung ist experimentell und kann in zukünftigen Versionen geändert werden","Erfordert Konfigurationsänderungen in den Servereinstellungen, um die WebSocket-Unterstützung zu aktivieren"],"pt":["O suporte ao WebSocket é experimental e pode mudar em lançamentos futuros","Exige alterações de configuração nos ajustes do servidor para habilitar o suporte ao websocket"],"ru":["Поддержка WebSocket является экспериментальной и может измениться в будущих выпусках","Требует изменений в настройках сервера для включения поддержки websocket"],"ar":["دعم الويب سوكت هو تجريبي وقد يتغير في الإصدارات المستقبلية","يتطلب تغييرات في إعدادات الخادم لتمكين دعم الويب سوكت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gscalzo/gscalzo.github.io/writing-linkedin-posts', 'community', 'gscalzo', 'gscalzo.github.io', 'gscalzo/gscalzo.github.io', 'writing-linkedin-posts', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:56:31.456Z', NULL, '{"id":"gscalzo/gscalzo.github.io/writing-linkedin-posts","name":"writing-linkedin-posts","description":{"zh":"LinkedIn","ja":"LinkedIn","ko":"LinkedIn ","es":"Crea publicaciones de LinkedIn auténticas y atractivas que impulsan el compromiso y establecen liderazgo de pensamiento","fr":"Rédigez des publications LinkedIn engageantes et authentiques qui favorisent l''engagement et le leadership","de":"Erstelle authentische und ansprechende LinkedIn-Beiträge, die Engagement und Thought Leadership fördern","pt":"Crie posts no LinkedIn autênticos e envolventes que impulsionam o engajamento e estabelecem liderança de pensamento","ru":"Создавайте аутентичные и увлекательные посты в LinkedIn, которые стимулируют вовлеченность и устанавливают лидерство в мыслях","ar":"أنشئ منشورات لينكد إن أصيلة ومركزة تولد تفاعلا وتقود الفكر","en":"Giordano''s amazing website"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LinkedIn ","ja":"LinkedIn","ko":"LinkedIn ","es":"Escribe publicaciones de LinkedIn auténticas","fr":"Rédigez des publications LinkedIn engageantes","de":"Erstelle authentische LinkedIn-Beiträge","pt":"Escreva Posts no LinkedIn como um Profissional","ru":"Написание эффективных постов в LinkedIn","ar":"كتابة منشورات لينكد إن مثل المحترفين","en":"writing-linkedin-posts"},"description":{"zh":"LinkedIn","ja":"LinkedIn","ko":"LinkedIn ","es":"Crea publicaciones de LinkedIn auténticas y atractivas que impulsan el compromiso y establecen liderazgo de pensamiento","fr":"Rédigez des publications LinkedIn engageantes et authentiques qui favorisent l''engagement et le leadership","de":"Erstelle authentische und ansprechende LinkedIn-Beiträge, die Engagement und Thought Leadership fördern","pt":"Crie posts no LinkedIn autênticos e envolventes que impulsionam o engajamento e estabelecem liderança de pensamento","ru":"Создавайте аутентичные и увлекательные посты в LinkedIn, которые стимулируют вовлеченность и устанавливают лидерство в мыслях","ar":"أنشئ منشورات لينكد إن أصيلة ومركزة تولد تفاعلا وتقود الفكر","en":"Giordano''s amazing website"},"definition":{"en":"Giordano''s amazing website"},"features":{"zh":["LinkedIn","API","SDK"," "," "],"ja":["LinkedIn","API","SDK"," "," "],"ko":["LinkedIn","API","SDK"," "," "],"es":["Autenticidad sobre rendimiento","Experiencias reales con reflexión honesta","Perspectivas específicas del trabajo real","Admitir lo que no se sabe"],"fr":["Authenticité plutôt que performance","Expériences réelles avec réflexion honnête","Perspectives spécifiques du travail réel","Admettre ce que l''on ne sait pas"],"de":["Authentizität anstelle von Leistung","Echte Erfahrungen mit ehrlicher Reflexion","Spezifische Einblicke in die eigene Arbeit","Zugeben, was man nicht weiß"],"pt":["Autenticidade sobre desempenho","Compartilhamento de experiências reais","Dicas específicas do trabalho","Admissão de erros e fraquezas"],"ru":["Аутентичность над производительностью","Обмен реальным опытом","Конкретные советы из реальной работы","Признание ошибок и слабостей"],"ar":["الأصالة على الأداء","مشاركة الخبرات الحقيقية","نصائح محددة من العمل الفعلي","الإعتراف بالأخطاء وال弱_points"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LinkedIn","API","SDK"," "," "," "],"ja":["LinkedIn","API","SDK"," "," "," "],"ko":["LinkedIn","API","SDK"," "," "," "],"es":["publicaciones de LinkedIn","liderazgo de pensamiento","contenido auténtico","engagement en LinkedIn","estrategia de contenido","marketing en redes sociales"],"fr":["publications LinkedIn","leadership de pensée","contenu authentique","engagement sur LinkedIn","stratégie de contenu","marketing sur les réseaux sociaux"],"de":["LinkedIn-Beiträge","Thought Leadership","authentischer Inhalt","Engagement auf LinkedIn","Inhaltsstrategie","Social-Media-Marketing"],"pt":["escrever posts no linkedin","linkedin marketing","conteúdo de qualidade","engajamento no linkedin","liderança de pensamento","autenticidade na comunicação"],"ru":["написание постов в linkedin","маркетинг в linkedin","качественный контент","вовлеченность в linkedin","лидерство в мыслях","аутентичность в коммуникации"],"ar":["كتابة منشورات لينكد إن","تسويق لينكد إن","محتوى عالي الجودة","التفاعل على لينكد إن","قيادة الفكر","الأصالة في التواصل"]}},"owner":"gscalzo","repo":"gscalzo.github.io","repoPath":"gscalzo/gscalzo.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-linkedin-posts","description":"Create engaging, authentic LinkedIn posts like a Top Voice. Use this skill when asked to write LinkedIn content, social media posts for LinkedIn, professional thought leadership content, or help with LinkedIn engagement strategy. Triggers include requests for LinkedIn posts, professional social content, thought leadership pieces, or viral/engaging LinkedIn content.","bodyPreview":"# LinkedIn Post Writer\n\nCreate engaging, authentic LinkedIn posts that drive meaningful engagement and establish thought leadership.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Authenticity Over Performance\n\nLinkedIn has matured. Readers can spot manufactured vulnerability and engagement bait instantly. The posts that resonate now are genuinely useful or genuinely human—not optimized for virality.\n\nWhat works:\n- Real experiences with honest reflection\n- Specific insights from your actual work\n- Admitting what you","body":"# LinkedIn Post Writer\n\nCreate engaging, authentic LinkedIn posts that drive meaningful engagement and establish thought leadership.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Authenticity Over Performance\n\nLinkedIn has matured. Readers can spot manufactured vulnerability and engagement bait instantly. The posts that resonate now are genuinely useful or genuinely human—not optimized for virality.\n\nWhat works:\n- Real experiences with honest reflection\n- Specific insights from your actual work\n- Admitting what you don''t know\n- Sharing without needing validation\n\nWhat doesn''t:\n- Performed vulnerability for engagement\n- Stories that feel too perfectly structured\n- Lessons that sound like motivational posters\n\n### One Idea Per Post\n\nThe biggest mistake is cramming multiple tips, stories, or angles into one post. Focus on:\n- One core idea\n- One story\n- One insight\n- One lesson\n\nIf you have five points, that''s five posts.\n\n### Value Without Strings\n\nEvery post must educate, inspire, or entertain. Ask: \"Would I find this valuable if a stranger posted it?\" Not \"Will this get engagement?\"\n\n## Building Your Signature Voice\n\nTop Voices don''t just post well—they''re recognizable. Their perspective, style, and focus areas are consistent.\n\n### Define Your POV\n\nAnswer these before writing:\n- What topic do I have genuine expertise in?\n- What''s my contrarian belief in my industry?\n- What perspective do I bring that others don''t?\n- What would I want to be known for saying?\n\n### Consistency Markers\n\nDevelop 2-3 recognizable elements:\n- A recurring theme or topic area\n- A consistent tone (analytical, warm, direct, witty)\n- A signature format you''re known for\n- Phrases or frameworks you''ve coined\n\n### Voice Calibration\n\nYour LinkedIn voice should be:\n- More polished than a text to a friend\n- Less formal than a company memo\n- As smart as your best work conversations\n- As human as your real personality\n\n## Post Anatomy\n\n### The Hook (Lines 1-2)\n\nThe first 2-3 lines appear before \"See more\" and determine everything.\n\n**Modern hooks that work** (avoid overused patterns):\n\n| Type | Example | Why It Works |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| **Honest admission** | \"I''ve been wrong about remote work.\" | Genuine, not performed |\n| **Specific observation** | \"I''ve noticed something in every founder who scaled past $10M.\" | Credibility + curiosity |\n| **Direct challenge** | \"Most career advice optimizes for the wrong thing.\" | Provokes thought |\n| **Unexpected angle** | \"The best hire I made had the worst resume.\" | Subverts expectations |\n| **Simple truth** | \"Nobody talks about how lonely leadership is.\" | Resonates emotionally |\n\n**Hooks to retire**:\n- \"This one thing made me $X\" (feels like a scam ad)\n- \"The CEO pulled me aside and said...\" (overused curiosity bait)\n- \"I''m excited to announce...\" (corporate and skippable)\n- \"[Number] words that changed my life\" (too formulaic)\n\nSee `references/hooks.md` for comprehensive examples.\n\n### The Body\n\nStructure for scannability:\n- Short paragraphs (1-3 sentences max)\n- Line breaks between thoughts\n- Bullet points for lists (but don''t overuse)\n- Bold for emphasis sparingly\n\n**Storytelling framework**:\n1. Set the scene (briefly—one sentence)\n2. Introduce tension or conflict\n3. Show the turning point\n4. Deliver the insight\n5. Make it applicable to the reader\n\n### The Close\n\nEnd with purpose, not desperation:\n\n**Good closes**:\n- Genuine question that invites perspective\n- Specific call to action (\"Bookmark this for your next negotiation\")\n- Reflection that lingers (\"Something to sit with this week\")\n\n**Avoid**:\n- \"Agree?\" (lazy)\n- \"Comment YES if...\" (engagement bait)\n- \"Share this with someone who needs it\" (needy)\n- \"Follow me for more\" (salesy)\n\n## Vulnerability Done Right\n\nAuthentic sharing builds connection. Performed vulnerability destroys trust.\n\n### Strategic Vulnerability vs. Exploitation\n\n**Share when**:\n- The experience taught you something others can learn\n- You''ve processed it enough to offer perspective\n- It serves the reader, not your need for validation\n- Time has passed and you have hindsight\n\n**Don''t share when**:\n- The wound is still fresh\n- You''re seeking sympathy, not providing value\n- It could harm others involved\n- It feels performative even to you\n\n### The Vulnerability Test\n\nBefore posting something personal, ask:\n1. Am I sharing this to help others or to process my own feelings?\n2. Would I be comfortable if this went viral?\n3. Does this include genuine insight or just pain?\n4. Have I protected others who were involved?\n\n## Post Formats\n\n### Story Post\nBest for: Personal experiences, lessons learned, career moments\n\n```\n[Hook - honest admission or surprising outcome]\n\n[One sentence of context]\n\n[What happened - the tension or challenge]\n\n[The turning point]\n\n[What you learned]\n\n[Question or reflection for reader]\n```\n\n### List Post\nBest for: Frameworks, actionable advice, curated insights\n\n```\n[Hook - clear value promise]\n\n[Why this matters - one sentence]\n\n1. [Point with brief context]\n2. [Point with brief context]\n3. [Point with brief context]\n(3-7 items max)\n\n[Closing insight or question]\n```\n\n### Contrarian Post\nBest for: Challenging conventional wisdom (with substance)\n\n```\n[Your contrarian position, stated directly]\n\n[The common belief you''re challenging]\n\n[Your reasoning - why you see it differently]\n\n[Evidence or experience]\n\n[Nuanced conclusion - acknowledge complexity]\n\n[Invite discussion]\n```\n\n**Contrarian guardrails**:\n- Have genuine expertise on the topic\n- Argue against ideas, not people\n- Offer an alternative, not just criticism\n- Acknowledge what the other side gets right\n- Be open to being wrong\n\n### Observation Post\nBest for: Industry insights, trends, patterns you''ve noticed\n\n```\n[What you''ve observed]\n\n[Specific evidence or examples]\n\n[Why it matters]\n\n[Your interpretation]\n\n[Question to test if others see it too]\n```\n\n## Media Formats\n\nText-only posts aren''t the only option. Different formats serve different purposes.\n\n### Document/Carousel Posts\n- Higher save rates and extended engagement\n- Best for: step-by-step guides, frameworks, before/after\n- Keep to 5-10 slides\n- Each slide should stand alone\n- End with a summary or CTA slide\n\n### Image Posts\n- Use when visual adds genuine value (charts, diagrams, photos from events)\n- Avoid: stock photos, generic graphics, memes (unless that''s your brand)\n- Native uploads outperform links\n\n### Polls\n- Good for: genuine market research, sparking discussion\n- Bad for: obvious questions, engagement farming\n- Always follow up with your take on the results\n\n### Video\n- LinkedIn favors native video over links\n- Keep under 90 seconds for most content\n- Captions are essential (most watch muted)\n- Face-to-camera builds personal connection\n\n## Engagement Strategy\n\nWhat happens after you post matters as much as what you post.\n\n### The First Hour\n\nLinkedIn''s algorithm weighs early engagement heavily:\n- Respond to every comment in the first 60 minutes\n- Ask follow-up questions to extend conversations\n- Thank people genuinely, not generically\n\n### Comment Quality\n\nYour comments on others'' posts build your brand too:\n- Add insight, not just agreement\n- Share relevant experience\n- Ask thoughtful follow-up questions\n- Avoid \"Great post!\" without substance\n\n### What Not to Do\n\n- Engagement pods (LinkedIn detects and penalizes these)\n- Asking people to \"comment for a free resource\"\n- Posting and disappearing\n- Commenting just to get visibility\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n### Tone Spectrum\n\nFind your spot on each scale:\n\n```\nCorporate ←————————→ Casual\nReserved ←————————→ Vulnerable\nAnalytical ←————————→ Emotional\nSerious ←————————→ Playful\n```\n\nMost Top Voices sit slightly right of center on each.\n\n### Length\n- Optimal: 150-300 words (enough for depth, short enough to finish)\n- Maximum: 3,000 characters\n- Use whitespace generously—dense text kills engagement\n\n### Formatting Rules\n- Never use hashtags inline with text\n- Place 3-5 hashtags at the very end, after a line break\n- One emoji max, if any (overuse signals inauthenticity)\n- Use \"I\" not \"we\" for personal posts\n\n## What to Avoid\n\n**Content anti-patterns**:\n- \"I''m excited to announce...\" (corporate speak)\n- Humblebrags disguised as lessons\n- Recycled viral post formats (the airport conversation, the Uber driver wisdom)\n- Posting others'' frameworks without credit\n- Tragedy exploitation (using global events for engagement)\n\n**Engagement anti-patterns**:\n- \"Comment YES if you agree\"\n- \"Share this with 3 people\"\n- Tagging people who didn''t ask to be tagged\n- Posting controversial takes you don''t actually believe\n- Fake questions where you just want to share your answer\n\n**Format anti-patterns**:\n- Every. Sentence. As. Its. Own. Line.\n- Excessive emoji strings\n- ALL CAPS FOR EMPHASIS\n- Hashtag stuffing\n\n## Content Categories That Perform\n\n1. **Career lessons** - Failures, pivots, decisions made\n2. **Behind-the-scenes** - Real work experiences, how things actually work\n3. **Industry insights** - Patterns you''ve noticed, trends you''re seeing\n4. **How-to frameworks** - Actionable processes readers can apply\n5. **Contrarian takes** - Challenge assumptions (with substance)\n6. **Personal milestones** - Only when tied to broader insights\n\n## References\n\n- `references/hooks.md` - Complete hook patterns with examples\n- `references/examples.md` - Full post examples demonstrating best practices\n\n## Quick Checklist Before Posting\n\n1. **Hook**: Would this stop MY scroll?\n2. **Focus**: Is there ONE clear idea?\n3. **Value**: Would I find this useful if someone else posted it?\n4. **Authenticity**: Does this sound like me, not \"LinkedIn me\"?\n5. **Format**: Is it scannable with short paragraphs?\n6. **Close**: Does it invite genuine engagement?\n7. **Vulnerability check**: Am I sharing to help or to process?\n8. **Cringe test**: Will I be proud of this post in a year?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:56:31.456Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing authentic LinkedIn post creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要真实LinkedIn帖子创建能力的语言代理。","ja":"本物のLinkedIn投稿作成機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"진정한 LinkedIn 게시물 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de creación de publicaciones de LinkedIn auténticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de langage ayant besoin de capacités de création de publications LinkedIn authentiques.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die authentische LinkedIn-Beitragserstellungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades de criação de postagens do LinkedIn autênticas.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым необходимы функции создания аутентичных постов LinkedIn.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة بحاجة إلى إمكانيات إنشاء منشورات LinkedIn حقيقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft engaging LinkedIn posts that drive meaningful engagement and establish thought leadership, leveraging core principles like authenticity over performance, and incorporating real experiences with honest reflection, specific insights from actual work, and admitting vulnerabilities.","zh":"赋能代理制作引人入胜的LinkedIn帖子，以推动有意义的互动并建立思想领导力，其利用核心原则（如真实性优于表现），并结合真实体验与诚实反思、来自实际工作的具体见解以及承认自身弱点。","ja":"パフォーマンスより真正性といった核心原則を活用し、実体験と率直な反省、実際の仕事からの具体的な洞察、脆弱性の承認を組み込むことで、意味のあるエンゲージメントを促進し、思想のリーダーシップを確立する、魅力的なLinkedIn投稿をエージェントが作成できるようにします。","ko":"성과보다 진정성 같은 핵심 원칙을 활용하고, 실제 경험과 정직한 성찰, 실제 작업에서 얻은 구체적인 통찰, 그리고 취약점 인정을 포함시켜 의미 있는 참여를 유도하고 사상 리더십을确立하는 매력적인 LinkedIn 게시물을 제작할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear publicaciones de LinkedIn atractivas que generen un compromiso significativo y establezcan el liderazgo de thought, aprovechando principios básicos como la autenticidad sobre el rendimiento, e incorporando experiencias reales con reflexiones honestas, ideas específicas de trabajo real y admitiendo vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des publications LinkedIn engageantes qui favorisent un engagement significatif et établissent un leadership de pensée, en exploitant des principes fondamentaux tels que l''authenticité plutôt que la performance, et en intégrant des expériences réelles avec des réflexions honnêtes, des idées spécifiques issues d''un travail réel et en admettant des vulnérabilités.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ansprechende LinkedIn-Beiträge zu erstellen, die ein sinnvolles Engagement fördern und Thought Leadership etablieren, indem sie grundlegende Prinzipien wie Authentizität gegenüber Leistung nutzt und reale Erfahrungen mit ehrlichen Reflexionen, spezifischen Erkenntnissen aus tatsächlicher Arbeit und Zulassung von Verwundbarkeiten einbezieht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar postagens do LinkedIn envolventes que impulsionam um engajamento significativo e estabelecem liderança de pensamento, aproveitando princípios fundamentais como autenticidade em vez de desempenho, e incorporando experiências reais com reflexão honesta, insights específicos de trabalho real e admitindo vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные посты LinkedIn, которые стимулируют осмысленное взаимодействие и устанавливают лидерство в области мысли, используя основные принципы, такие как аутентичность над результативностью, и включающие реальный опыт с честным размышлением, конкретные идеи из фактической работы и признание уязвимостей.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إنشاء منشورات LinkedIn جذابة تحفز التفاعل المهم وتأسيس قيادة الفكر، مستفيدة من المبادئ الأساسية مثل الأصالة على الأداء، ودمج الخبرات الحقيقية مع التأمل الصادق، والرؤى المحددة من العمل الفعلي، والإعتراف بالضعف."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating authentic and human-centered LinkedIn posts","Creating thought leadership content that resonates with readers","Crafting posts that incorporate real experiences and honest reflections"],"zh":["生成真实且以人为本的LinkedIn帖子","创建能引起读者共鸣的思想领导力内容","制作包含真实体验和诚实反思的帖子"],"ja":["本物的で人間中心のLinkedIn投稿の生成","読者に共鳴する思想リーダーシップコンテンツの作成","実体験と率直な反省を組み込んだ投稿の作成"],"ko":["진정성 있고 인간 중심의 LinkedIn 게시물 생성","독자에게 공감을 불러일으키는 사상 리더십 콘텐츠 제작","실제 경험과 정직한 성찰을 포함한 게시물 제작"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de LinkedIn auténticas y centradas en el ser humano","Crear contenido de liderazgo de thought que resuene con los lectores","Crear publicaciones que incorporen experiencias reales y reflexiones honestas"],"fr":["Générer des publications LinkedIn authentiques et centrées sur l''humain","Créer du contenu de leadership de pensée qui résonne avec les lecteurs","Créer des publications qui intègrent des expériences réelles et des réflexions honnêtes"],"de":["Authentische und menschenzentrierte LinkedIn-Beiträge generieren","Thought-Leadership-Inhalte erstellen, die bei den Lesern Anklang finden","Beiträge erstellen, die reale Erfahrungen und ehrliche Reflexionen einbeziehen"],"pt":["Geração de postagens do LinkedIn autênticas e centradas no ser humano","Criação de conteúdo de liderança de pensamento que ressoa com os leitores","Criação de postagens que incorporam experiências reais e reflexões honestas"],"ru":["Генерация аутентичных и ориентированных на человека постов LinkedIn","Создание контента лидерства мысли, который резонирует с читателями","Создание постов, которые включают реальный опыт и честное размышление"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات LinkedIn حقيقية ومركزة على الإنسان","creating محتوى قيادة الفكر الذي يرنّ مع القراء","إنشاء منشورات تدمج الخبرات الحقيقية والتأمل الصادق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of LinkedIn''s matured audience and their ability to spot manufactured content","Limited to text-based content creation, no support for multimedia posts","Effectiveness depends on agent''s ability to provide genuine and useful insights"],"zh":["需要理解LinkedIn成熟受众及其识别虚假内容的能力","仅限于基于文本的内容创建，不支持多媒体帖子","有效性取决于代理提供真实且有价值见解的能力"],"ja":["LinkedInの成熟したオーディエンスと、作為的なコンテンツを見抜く彼らの能力の理解が必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ作成に限定され、マルチメディア投稿はサポートしない","効果性は、エージェントが本物で有用な洞察を提供する能力に依存する"],"ko":["LinkedIn의 성숙한 관객과 조작된 콘텐츠를识别하는 그들의 능력에 대한 이해 필요","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성으로 제한되며, 멀티미디어 게시물은 지원하지 않음","효과성은 에이전트가 진정성 있고 유용한 통찰력을 제공하는 능력에 따라 달라짐"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la audiencia madura de LinkedIn y su capacidad para detectar contenido fabricado","Limitado a la creación de contenido basado en texto, sin soporte para publicaciones multimedia","La efectividad depende de la capacidad del agente para proporcionar ideas genuinas y útiles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du public mature de LinkedIn et de sa capacité à détecter un contenu fabriqué","Limité à la création de contenu basé sur le texte, sans support pour les publications multimédias","L''efficacité dépend de la capacité de l''agent à fournir des idées authentiques et utiles"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis der ausgereiften Zielgruppe von LinkedIn und deren Fähigkeit, hergestellten Inhalt zu erkennen","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von textbasiertem Inhalt, keine Unterstützung für Multimedia-Beiträge","Die Wirksamkeit hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, echte und nützliche Erkenntnisse zu liefern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da audiência madura do LinkedIn e sua capacidade de detectar conteúdo fabricado","Limitado à criação de conteúdo baseado em texto, sem suporte para postagens multimídia","Efetividade depende da capacidade do agente de fornecer insights genuínos e úteis"],"ru":["Требует понимания зрелой аудитории LinkedIn и их способности обнаруживать сфабрикованный контент","Ограничен созданием текстового контента, без поддержки постов с мультимедиа","Эффективность зависит от способности агента предоставлять подлинные и полезные идеи"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الجمهور الناضج من LinkedIn وقدرتهم على اكتشاف المحتوى المصنوع","محدود بإنشاء المحتوى القائم على النص، بدون دعم لمنشورات الوسائط المتعددة","فعالية تعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على تقديم رؤى حقيقية ومفيدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list/bmad-review-adversarial-general', 'community', 'thewoolleyman', 'tab-groups-windows-list', 'thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list', 'bmad-review-adversarial-general', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z', '2026-02-18T06:56:38.231Z', NULL, '{"id":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list/bmad-review-adversarial-general","name":"bmad-review-adversarial-general","description":{"zh":"对抗性审查通用技能是一种提高代码安全性的技术，通过审查代码以检测潜在的安全漏洞。","ja":"アドバーサリアルレビュー一般スキルは、コードのセキュリティを高める技術で、潜在的なセキュリティホールを検出するためにコードをレビューします。","ko":"대응적 리뷰 일반 스킬은 코드 보안을 강화하는 기술로 코드를 검토하여 잠재적인 보안 취약점을 탐지합니다.","es":"La revisión adversaria general es una técnica que ayuda a identificar vulnerabilidades en el código. Ayuda a mejorar la seguridad del software","fr":"La révision adversaire générale est une technique qui aide à identifier les vulnérabilités dans le code. Elle améliore la sécurité des logiciels","de":"Die adversarial Review allgemein ist eine Technik, die dabei hilft, Schwachstellen im Code zu identifizieren. Sie verbessert die Sicherheit der Software","pt":"A revisão adversarial geral é uma técnica de segurança que visa identificar vulnerabilidades em sistemas de software.","ru":"Общий адверсарный обзор - это метод безопасности, направленный на выявление уязвимостей в системах программного обеспечения.","ar":"استعراض معارض عام هو تقنية أمنية تهدف إلى تحديد الثغرات الأمنية في أنظمة البرمجيات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"对抗性审查通用技能","ja":"アドバーサリアルレビュー一般スキル","ko":"대응적 리뷰 일반 스킬","es":"Revisión Adversaria General: Desarrollo y Seguridad","fr":"Révision Adversaire Générale : Développement et Sécurité","de":"Adversarial Review Allgemein: Entwicklung und Sicherheit","pt":"Revisão Adversarial Geral: Técnicas de Segurança em Desen...","ru":"Обзор адверсарного общего: методы безопасности в разработке","ar":"استعراض معارض عام: تقنيات الأمن في التطوير","en":"bmad-review-adversarial-general"},"description":{"zh":"对抗性审查通用技能是一种提高代码安全性的技术，通过审查代码以检测潜在的安全漏洞。","ja":"アドバーサリアルレビュー一般スキルは、コードのセキュリティを高める技術で、潜在的なセキュリティホールを検出するためにコードをレビューします。","ko":"대응적 리뷰 일반 스킬은 코드 보안을 강화하는 기술로 코드를 검토하여 잠재적인 보안 취약점을 탐지합니다.","es":"La revisión adversaria general es una técnica que ayuda a identificar vulnerabilidades en el código. Ayuda a mejorar la seguridad del software","fr":"La révision adversaire générale est une technique qui aide à identifier les vulnérabilités dans le code. Elle améliore la sécurité des logiciels","de":"Die adversarial Review allgemein ist eine Technik, die dabei hilft, Schwachstellen im Code zu identifizieren. Sie verbessert die Sicherheit der Software","pt":"A revisão adversarial geral é uma técnica de segurança que visa identificar vulnerabilidades em sistemas de software.","ru":"Общий адверсарный обзор - это метод безопасности, направленный на выявление уязвимостей в системах программного обеспечения.","ar":"استعراض معارض عام هو تقنية أمنية تهدف إلى تحديد الثغرات الأمنية في أنظمة البرمجيات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高代码安全性","检测潜在的安全漏洞","审查代码以确保安全","支持多种编程语言","易于集成到现有项目中"],"ja":["コードのセキュリティを高める","潜在的なセキュリティホールを検出","コードをレビューしてセキュリティを確保","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","既存のプロジェクトに簡単に統合"],"ko":["코드 보안 강화"," 잠재적인 보안 취약점 탐지","코드 검토를 통해 보안 보장","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","기존 프로젝트에 쉽게 통합"],"es":["Identificación de vulnerabilidades","Mejora de la seguridad","Análisis de código","Desarrollo de software seguro","Técnica de revisión"],"fr":["Identification des vulnérabilités","Amélioration de la sécurité","Analyse de code","Développement de logiciels sécurisés","Technique de révision"],"de":["Identifizierung von Schwachstellen","Verbesserung der Sicherheit","Code-Analyse","Entwicklung sicherer Software","Überprüfungstechnik"],"pt":["Técnicas de teste de penetração","Análise de vulnerabilidades","Desenvolvimento de sistemas seguros","Implementação de controles de segurança","Análise de riscos e ameaças","Otimização de desempenho de sistemas"],"ru":["Методы тестирования на проникновение","Анализ уязвимостей","Разработка безопасных систем","Реализация средств безопасности","Анализ рисков и угроз","Оптимизация производительности систем"],"ar":["تقنيات اختبار الاختراق","تحليل الثغرات الأمنية","تطوير أنظمة آمنة","تنفيذ ضوابط أمنية","تحليل المخاطر والتهديدات","تحسين أداء الأنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["对抗性审查","代码安全","安全漏洞","代码审查","安全测试","代码优化"],"ja":["アドバーサリアルレビュー","コードセキュリティ","セキュリティホール","コードレビュー","セキュリティテスト","コード最適化"],"ko":["대응적 리뷰","코드 보안","보안 취약점","코드 리뷰","보안 테스트","코드 최적화"],"es":["revisión adversaria","seguridad del software","desarrollo de software","análisis de código","vulnerabilidades","seguridad informática"],"fr":["révision adversaire","sécurité des logiciels","développement de logiciels","analyse de code","vulnérabilités","sécurité informatique"],"de":["adversarial Review","Sicherheit der Software","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Analyse","Schwachstellen","IT-Sicherheit"],"pt":["revisão adversarial geral","segurança em desenvolvimento","técnicas de segurança","desenvolvimento de software","testes de penetração","análise de vulnerabilidades","controles de segurança","desenvolvimento de sistemas seguros"],"ru":["общий адверсарный обзор","безопасность в разработке","методы безопасности","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование на проникновение","анализ уязвимостей","средства безопасности","разработка безопасных систем"],"ar":["استعراض معارض عام","أمن التطوير","تقنيات الأمن","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار الاختراق","تحليل الثغرات الأمنية","ضوابط أمنية","تطوير أنظمة آمنة"]}},"owner":"thewoolleyman","repo":"tab-groups-windows-list","repoPath":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bmad-review-adversarial-general","description":"Cynically review content and produce findings","bodyPreview":"# Adversarial Review (General)\n\nRead the entire task file at: _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml\n\nFollow all instructions in the task file exactly as written.","body":"# Adversarial Review (General)\n\nRead the entire task file at: _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml\n\nFollow all instructions in the task file exactly as written.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:56:38.231Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents requiring in-depth analysis and review of adversarial tasks in XML formats.","zh":"适用于需要对XML格式的对抗任务进行深入分析和审查的高级语言代理。","ja":"XML形式の対抗タスクの詳細な分析およびレビューを必要とする高度な言語エージェントに適しています。","ko":"XML 형식의 적대적 작업에 대한 심층 분석 및 검토가 필요한 고급 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados que requieren un análisis y revisión en profundidad de tareas adversas en formatos XML.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langage Avancés nécessitant une analyse et une révision approfondies de tâches adverses au format XML.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Sprachagenten, die eine umfassende Analyse und Überprüfung von konträren Aufgaben in XML-Formaten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados que exigem análise e revisão aprofundadas de tarefas adversárias em formatos XML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Продвинутых Языковых Агентов, требующих глубокого анализа и обзора враждебных задач в форматах XML.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة متقدم يتطلب تحليلًا ومراجعة متعمقين لمهام معارضة بالتنسيق XML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to meticulously follow instructions in task files like _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml, providing precise analysis and review capabilities using XML parsing and task execution protocols.","zh":"赋予代理精确地遵循任务文件（如_bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml）中的指令，利用XML解析和任务执行协议提供精确的分析和审查能力。","ja":"_bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xmlなどのタスクファイルの指示に正確に従うことで、XMLパーサーとタスク実行プロトコルを使用して、精確な分析とレビューキャパビリティを提供するエージェントをEmpowersします。","ko":"_bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml과 같은 작업 파일의 지침을 정확하게 따르도록 에이전트를 권장하여 XML 파싱 및 작업 실행 프로토콜을 사용하여 정확한 분석 및 검토 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a seguir instrucciones de manera meticulosa en archivos de tareas como _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml, proporcionando capacidades de análisis y revisión precisas utilizando protocolos de análisis y ejecución de tareas XML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre avec précision les instructions contenues dans des fichiers de tâches tels que _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml, offrant des capacités d''analyse et de révision précises en utilisant les protocoles d''analyse et d''exécution de tâches XML.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Anweisungen in Aufgabendateien wie _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml peinlich genau zu befolgen und präzise Analyse- und Überprüfungsfähigkeiten unter Verwendung von XML-Analyse- und Aufgaben-Ausführungsprotokollen bereitzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a seguir instruções de formameticulosas em arquivos de tarefas como _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml, fornecendo capacidades de análise e revisão precisas usando protocolos de análise e execução de tarefas XML.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тщательно следовать инструкциям в файлах задач, таких как _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml, обеспечивая точные возможности анализа и обзора с помощью протоколов парсинга и выполнения задач XML.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على اتباع الإرشادات بطرق دقيقة في ملفات المهام مثل _bmad/core/tasks/review-adversarial-general.xml، وتوفير قدرات تحليل ومراجعة دقيقة باستخدام بروتوكولات تحليل وتنفيذ مهام XML."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing task files for adversarial review","Executing instructions from XML files with precision","Reviewing general tasks for compliance with given formats"],"zh":["分析任务文件以进行对抗性审查","从XML文件中精确执行指令","审查一般任务以确保遵守给定的格式"],"ja":["対抗レビューのためのタスクファイルの分析","XMLファイルからの指示の正確な実行","与えられた形式の遵守を確保するための一般タスクのレビュー"],"ko":["적대적 검토를 위한 작업 파일 분석","XML 파일에서 지침을 정확하게 실행","주어진 형식의 준수를 보장하기 위한 일반 작업 검토"],"es":["Análisis de archivos de tareas para revisión adversa","Ejecución de instrucciones de archivos XML con precisión","Revisión de tareas generales para cumplimiento con formatos dados"],"fr":["Analyse de fichiers de tâches pour révision adverse","Exécution d''instructions à partir de fichiers XML avec précision","Révision de tâches générales pour conformité aux formats donnés"],"de":["Analyse von Aufgabendateien für konträre Überprüfung","Ausführung von Anweisungen aus XML-Dateien mit Präzision","Überprüfung von allgemeinen Aufgaben für die Einhaltung vorgegebener Formate"],"pt":["Analisar arquivos de tarefas para revisão adversária","Executar instruções de arquivos XML com precisão","Revisar tarefas gerais para conformidade com formatos dados"],"ru":["Анализ файлов задач для обзора враждебных задач","Выполнение инструкций из файлов XML с точностью","Проверка общих задач на соответствие заданным форматам"],"ar":["تحليل ملفات المهام لمراجعة معارضة","تنفيذ الإرشادات من ملفات XML بدقة","مراجعة المهام العامة للامتثال للتنسيقات المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific task files like review-adversarial-general.xml","Needs exact instruction following capabilities"],"zh":["需要访问特定的任务文件，如review-adversarial-general.xml","需要精确的指令跟随能力"],"ja":["review-adversarial-general.xmlなどの特定のタスクファイルへのアクセスが必要","正確な指示の実行能力が必要"],"ko":["review-adversarial-general.xml과 같은 특정 작업 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","정확한 지침을 따르는 기능이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de tareas específicos como review-adversarial-general.xml","Necesita capacidades de seguimiento de instrucciones exactas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de tâches spécifiques tels que review-adversarial-general.xml","Nécessite des capacités de suivi d''instructions exactes"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf bestimmte Aufgabendateien wie review-adversarial-general.xml","Benötigt Fähigkeiten zur genauen Befolgung von Anweisungen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de tarefas específicos como review-adversarial-general.xml","Necessita de capacidades de seguimento de instruções exatas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к конкретным файлам задач, таким как review-adversarial-general.xml","Требует возможностей точного выполнения инструкций"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات مهام محددة مثل review-adversarial-general.xml","يحتاج إلى قدرات متابعة تعليمات دقيقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
