O","ja":"Solid.jsのSSRレンダリングコアスキルは、サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用してシングルページアプリのパフォーマンスとSEOを向上させる技術です","ko":"Solid.js의 SSR 렌더링 코어 스킬은 서버 측에서 단일 페이지 애플리케이션을 렌더링하여 성능과 SEO를 개선하는 기술입니다","es":"El renderizado de núcleo sólido con SSR permite mejorar el rendimiento y la experiencia del usuario en aplicaciones de Solid","fr":"Le rendering de core solide avec SSR permet d''améliorer les performances et l''expérience utilisateur dans les applications Solid","de":"Das solide Core-Rendering mit SSR ermöglicht die Verbesserung der Leistung und Benutzererfahrung in Solid-Anwendungen","pt":"O rendering em núcleo sólido é uma técnica de renderização que melhora a performance da sua aplicação web. Aprenda como usá-la com SSR","ru":"Рендеринг в твердом ядре - это техника рендеринга, которая улучшает производительность вашего веб-приложения. Узнайте, как использовать ее с SSR","ar":"تجسيد النواة الصلبة هو تقنية تجسيد تحسن أداء تطبيقك على الويب. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع SSR","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["服务器端渲染","提高单页应用性能","改善SEO","使用Solid.js渲染","支持客户端渲染"],"ja":["サーバーサイドレンダリング","シングルページアプリのパフォーマンス向上","SEOの改善","Solid.jsを使用したレンダリング","クライアントサイドレンダリングのサポート"],"ko":["서버 측 렌더링","단일 페이지 애플리케이션의 성능 개선","SEO 개선","Solid.js를 사용한 렌더링","클라이언트 측 렌더링 지원"],"es":["Renderizado en el servidor","Mejora del rendimiento","Experiencia del usuario mejorada","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones de Solid","Facilidad de implementación"],"fr":["Rendering sur le serveur","Amélioration des performances","Expérience utilisateur améliorée","Compatibilité avec les applications Solid","Facilité de mise en œuvre"],"de":["Serverseitiges Rendering","Leistungsverbesserung","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibilität mit Solid-Anwendungen","Einfache Implementierung"],"pt":["Melhora a performance da aplicação","Renderiza aplicações em tempo de execução","Utiliza o servidor para renderizar","Compatível com aplicações web modernas","Fácil de implementar"],"ru":["Улучшает производительность приложения","Рендерит приложения во время выполнения","Использует сервер для рендеринга","Совместим с современными веб-приложениями","Легко реализуется"],"ar":["تحسن أداء التطبيق","تجسيد التطبيقات في وقت التشغيل","استخدام الخادم لتجسيد","متوافق مع التطبيقات الويب الحديثة","سهل التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Solid.js","SSR渲染","服务器端渲染","单页应用","性能优化","SEO优化"],"ja":["Solid.js","SSRレンダリング","サーバーサイドレンダリング","シングルページアプリ","パフォーマンス最適化","SEO最適化"],"ko":["Solid.js","SSR 렌더링","서버 측 렌더링","단일 페이지 애플리케이션","성능 최적화","SEO 최적화"],"es":["renderizado de núcleo sólido","SSR","aplicaciones de Solid","rendimiento","experiencia del usuario","renderizado en el servidor","desarrollo web","tecnologías web"],"fr":["rendering de core solide","SSR","applications Solid","performances","expérience utilisateur","rendering sur le serveur","développement web","technologies web"],"de":["solides Core-Rendering","SSR","Solid-Anwendungen","Leistung","Benutzererfahrung","Serverseitiges Rendering","Webentwicklung","Webtechnologien"],"pt":["rendering em núcleo sólido","ssr","renderização no servidor","aplicações web","performance","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["рендеринг в твердом ядре","ssr","серверный рендеринг","веб-приложения","производительность","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تجسيد النواة الصلبة","ssr","تجسيد الخادم","تطبيقات الويب","الأداء","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"vallafederico","repo":"solid-ai-rules","repoPath":"vallafederico/solid-ai-rules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"solid-core-rendering-ssr","description":"SolidJS rendering and SSR: render() for client, hydrate() for SSR hydration, renderToString/renderToStream for server rendering, isServer check.","bodyPreview":"# Rendering and SSR\n\n## Client-Side Rendering\n\n### render()\n\nMounts Solid app to DOM. Browser entry point for SPAs.\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nconst dispose = render(() => <App />, document.getElementById(\"app\")!);\n```\n\n**Critical:** First argument must be a function, not JSX directly.\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Correct\nrender(() => <App />, element)\n\n// ❌ Wrong - calls App before render sets up tracking\nrender(<App />, element)\n```\n\nReturns dispose function to unmount app:\n\n```tsx\nconst","body":"# Rendering and SSR\n\n## Client-Side Rendering\n\n### render()\n\nMounts Solid app to DOM. Browser entry point for SPAs.\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nconst dispose = render(() => <App />, document.getElementById(\"app\")!);\n```\n\n**Critical:** First argument must be a function, not JSX directly.\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Correct\nrender(() => <App />, element)\n\n// ❌ Wrong - calls App before render sets up tracking\nrender(<App />, element)\n```\n\nReturns dispose function to unmount app:\n\n```tsx\nconst dispose = render(() => <App />, element);\n// Later...\ndispose();\n```\n\n## Server-Side Rendering\n\n### hydrate()\n\nHydrates server-rendered HTML. Client entry point for SSR apps.\n\n```tsx\nimport { hydrate } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nconst dispose = hydrate(() => <App />, document.getElementById(\"app\")!);\n```\n\nAttempts to rehydrate DOM that was already rendered on server. Must match server output.\n\n### renderToString()\n\nRenders component to HTML string (synchronous).\n\n```tsx\nimport { renderToString } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nconst html = renderToString(() => <App />);\n```\n\n### renderToStringAsync()\n\nRenders component to HTML string (asynchronous). Handles Suspense boundaries.\n\n```tsx\nimport { renderToStringAsync } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nconst html = await renderToStringAsync(() => <App />);\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- App has async data fetching\n- Suspense boundaries need resolution\n- Server-side data loading required\n\n### renderToStream()\n\nStreams HTML to response. Progressive rendering for better performance.\n\n```tsx\nimport { renderToStream } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nconst stream = renderToStream(() => <App />);\n\n// Pipe to response\nstream.pipeTo(response.writable);\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Faster Time to First Byte (TTFB)\n- Progressive HTML delivery\n- Better perceived performance\n\n### HydrationScript\n\nBootstrap hydration before Solid runtime loads. Captures events before JS loads.\n\n```tsx\nimport { HydrationScript, generateHydrationScript } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\n// As component (JSX)\n<HydrationScript \n  nonce={nonce}\n  eventNames={[\"click\", \"input\"]}\n/>\n\n// As function (HTML string)\nconst script = generateHydrationScript({\n  nonce: nonce,\n  eventNames: [\"click\", \"input\"]\n});\n```\n\n**Options:**\n- `nonce`: CSP nonce for script tag\n- `eventNames`: Events to capture before JS loads (default: `[\"click\", \"input\"]`)\n\n**Use case:** Progressive enhancement - capture user interactions before hydration completes.\n\n## Server Detection\n\n### isServer\n\nCheck if code is running on server.\n\n```tsx\nimport { isServer } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\nif (isServer) {\n  // Server-only code\n  console.log(\"Running on server\");\n} else {\n  // Client-only code\n  console.log(\"Running on client\");\n}\n```\n\n**Use cases:**\n- Conditional imports\n- Server-only initialization\n- Platform-specific code\n\n**Note:** Bundlers eliminate dead code based on this constant.\n\n### DEV\n\nDevelopment-only features. Removed in production builds.\n\n```tsx\nimport { DEV } from \"solid-js\";\nimport { isServer } from \"solid-js/web\";\n\n// Only runs in development (client-side)\nif (DEV && !isServer) {\n  console.log(\"Development mode\");\n}\n```\n\n**Use cases:**\n- Development debugging\n- Dev-only features\n- Library development\n- Conditional code for dev/prod\n\n**Note:** `DEV` is always defined on server, so combine with `isServer` check for client-only dev code.\n\n## SSR Best Practices\n\n1. **Match server and client output:**\n   - Use `hydrate()` with matching server-rendered HTML\n   - Ensure component order is identical\n\n2. **Handle async data:**\n   - Use `renderToStringAsync()` for Suspense\n   - Preload data on server when possible\n\n3. **Streaming:**\n   - Use `renderToStream()` for better performance\n   - Progressive rendering improves TTFB\n\n4. **Avoid hydration mismatches:**\n   - Don''t use `Math.random()` or `Date.now()` in render\n   - Use `createUniqueId()` for stable IDs\n   - Check `isServer` for platform-specific code\n\n5. **NoHydration for static content:**\n   - Wrap static content in `<NoHydration>` to skip hydration\n   - Reduces client-side JavaScript\n\n## Example: Full SSR Setup\n\n**Server (entry-server.tsx):**\n```tsx\nimport { renderToStream } from \"solid-js/web\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\nexport async function handler(request: Request) {\n  const stream = renderToStream(() => <App />);\n  return new Response(stream, {\n    headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"text/html\" }\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**Client (entry-client.tsx):**\n```tsx\nimport { hydrate } from \"solid-js/web\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\nhydrate(() => <App />, document.getElementById(\"app\")!);\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:57:31.908Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient client-side rendering and server-side rendering capabilities with SolidJS","zh":"非常适合需要在客户端和服务器端高效渲染的前端代理，特别是使用 SolidJS 的场景","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがクライアント側のレンダリングとサーバー側のレンダリングの両方を効率的に行う必要がある場合に最適です。特に SolidJS を使用する場合に適しています","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 효율적으로 처리해야 하는 경우에 적합하며, SolidJS를 사용하는 경우에 특히 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de renderizado del lado del cliente y del servidor con SolidJS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de rendu côté client et côté serveur avec SolidJS","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die effiziente Client-Seitige-Renderung und Server-Seitige-Renderung-Fähigkeiten mit SolidJS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de renderização de cliente eficiente e capacidades de renderização de servidor com SolidJS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются эффективные возможности рендеринга на стороне клиента и сервера с SolidJS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تقديم عميل جانب العميل وفواقص جانب الخادم بكفاءة مع SolidJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly mount Solid apps to the DOM, utilizing the render function from solid-js/web, while handling critical rendering nuances such as tracking setup and JSX invocation","zh":"使代理能够无缝地将 Solid 应用程序挂载到 DOM 中，利用 solid-js/web 中的渲染函数，同时处理关键的渲染细节，如跟踪设置和 JSX 调用","ja":"エージェントが Solid アプリケーションを DOM にシームレスにマウントできるようにし、solid-js/web のレンダリング関数を利用しながら、トラッキングの設定や JSX の呼び出しなどの重要なレンダリングの細かい部分を処理します","ko":"에이전트가 Solid 애플리케이션을 DOM에 무縫으로 마운트할 수 있도록 하며, solid-js/web의 렌더링 함수를 사용하면서 트래킹 설정이나 JSX 호출 등과 같은 중요한 렌더링의 세부 사항을 처리합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a montar aplicaciones Solid de forma transparente en el DOM, utilizando la función de renderizado desde solid-js/web, mientras maneja matices críticos de renderizado como la configuración de seguimiento y la invocación de JSX","fr":"Permet aux agents de monter des applications Solid de manière transparente sur le DOM, en utilisant la fonction de rendu depuis solid-js/web, tout en gérant les nuances critiques de rendu telles que la configuration du suivi et l''invocation de JSX","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Solid-Apps nahtlos in das DOM einzubinden, indem sie die Render-Funktion von solid-js/web verwenden, während sie kritische Render-Nuancen wie die Tracking-Konfiguration und die JSX-Aufruf behandeln","pt":"Habilita os agentes a montar aplicativos Solid no DOM de forma transparente, utilizando a função de renderização do solid-js/web, enquanto lida com nuances críticas de renderização, como configuração de rastreamento e invocação de JSX","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовного монтирования приложений Solid в DOM, используя функцию рендеринга из solid-js/web, при этом обрабатывая критические нюансы рендеринга, такие как настройка отслеживания и вызов JSX","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تركيب تطبيقات Solid على DOM بشكل متسلسل، مع استخدام دالة العرض من solid-js/web، مع معالجة دقة العرض الحاسمة مثل إعداد التتبع واستدعاء JSX"},"useCases":{"en":["Rendering Single-Page Applications with SolidJS","Implementing Server-Side Rendering for improved SEO","Unmounting apps with the dispose function for efficient resource management"],"zh":["使用 SolidJS 渲染单页应用程序","实现服务器端渲染以提高 SEO","使用 dispose 函数卸载应用程序以实现资源的高效管理"],"ja":["SolidJS を使用したシングルページアプリケーションのレンダリング","SEO の向上のためサーバーサイドレンダリングの実装","dispose 関数を使用したアプリケーションのアンマウントによる効率的なリソース管理"],"ko":["SolidJS를 사용한 단일 페이지 애플리케이션 렌더링","SEO 개선을 위한 서버 측 렌더링 구현","dispose 함수를 사용한 애플리케이션 마운트 해제를 통한 효율적인 리소스 관리"],"es":["Renderizado de Aplicaciones de Página Única con SolidJS","Implementación de Renderizado del Lado del Servidor para una mejor SEO","Desmontaje de aplicaciones con la función dispose para una gestión eficiente de recursos"],"fr":["Renderisation d''applications à page unique avec SolidJS","Mise en œuvre du rendu côté serveur pour une meilleure SEO","Désinstallation d''applications avec la fonction dispose pour une gestion efficace des ressources"],"de":["Rendern von Single-Page-Anwendungen mit SolidJS","Implementierung von Server-Seitigem-Rendern für verbesserte SEO","Abmontieren von Apps mit der dispose-Funktion für effizientes Ressourcen-Management"],"pt":["Renderização de Aplicativos de Página Única com SolidJS","Implementação de Renderização de Servidor para SEO melhorado","Desmontagem de aplicativos com a função dispose para gerenciamento eficiente de recursos"],"ru":["Рендеринг одностраниценных приложений с SolidJS","Реализация рендеринга на стороне сервера для улучшения SEO","Отключение приложений с помощью функции dispose для эффективного управления ресурсами"],"ar":["تجسيد تطبيقات صفحة واحدة مع SolidJS","تنفيذ تقديم جانب الخادم لتحسين محركات البحث","فك تثبيت التطبيقات مع دالة dispose لإدارة الموارد بكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SolidJS environment","Must invoke render function with a function as the first argument, not JSX directly"],"zh":["需要 SolidJS 环境","必须使用函数作为第一个参数调用渲染函数，而不是直接使用 JSX"],"ja":["SolidJS 環境が必要","レンダリング関数を呼び出すときは、JSX を直接使用するのではなく、関数を最初の引数として使用する必要がある"],"ko":["SolidJS 환경이 필요하다","렌더링 함수를 호출할 때는 JSX를 직접 사용하는 대신 함수를 첫 번째 인수로 사용해야 한다"],"es":["Requiere entorno SolidJS","Debe invocar la función de renderizado con una función como primer argumento, no JSX directamente"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement SolidJS","Doit invoquer la fonction de rendu avec une fonction comme premier argument, et non JSX directement"],"de":["Benötigt SolidJS-Umgebung","Muss die Render-Funktion mit einer Funktion als erstem Argument aufrufen, nicht direkt JSX"],"pt":["Exige ambiente SolidJS","Deve invocar a função de renderização com uma função como primeiro argumento, não JSX diretamente"],"ru":["Требует среды SolidJS","Должно вызывать функцию рендеринга с функцией как первым аргументом, а не JSX напрямую"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة SolidJS","يجب استدعاء دالة العرض مع دالة كمعامل أول، وليس JSX مباشرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
