["Vermeiden Sie willkürliche Verzögerungen in den Tests","Verbessern Sie die Stabilität der Tests","Reduzieren Sie Fehler und Ausfälle in den Tests","Ermöglicht es, auf die Erfüllung einer bestimmten Bedingung zu warten","Ist kompatibel mit GH Copilot"],"pt":["Evita atrasos aleatórios","Melhora a confiabilidade dos testes","Permite aguardar até que uma condição específica seja atendida","Reduz a complexidade dos testes","Melhora a eficiência dos testes"],"ru":["Избегает случайных задержек","Улучшает надежность тестов","Позволяет ожидать до тех пор, пока не будет выполнено определенное условие","Снижает сложность тестов","Улучшает эффективность тестов"],"ar":["يتجنب التأخيرات العشوائية","يحسن موثوقية الاختبارات","يسمح بالانتظار حتى تتم إرضاء شرط معين","يقلل من تعقيد الاختبارات","يحسن كفاءة الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["条件等待","测试优化","时序问题","代码可靠性","测试效率","自动化测试"],"ja":["条件ベースの待機","テストの最適化","タイミング問題","コードの信頼性","テストの効率","自動テスト"],"ko":["조건 기반 대기","테스트 최적화","타이밍 문제","코드의 신뢰성","테스트의 효율","자동 테스트"],"es":["espera basada en condiciones","pruebas de software","estabilidad de tests","retrasos arbitrarios","GH Copilot","desarrollo de software","pruebas automatizadas","tecnologías de prueba"],"fr":["attente basée sur des conditions","tests de logiciel","stabilité des tests","retards arbitraires","GH Copilot","développement de logiciel","tests automatisés","technologies de test"],"de":["bedingungs-basiertes Warten","Software-Tests","Stabilität der Tests","willkürliche Verzögerungen","GH Copilot","Software-Entwicklung","automatisierte Tests","Test-Technologien"],"pt":["espera baseada em condições","testes de software","desenvolvimento de software","confiabilidade dos testes","eficiência dos testes","complexidade dos testes","tecnologia de teste"],"ru":["ожидание на основе условий","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","надежность тестов","эффективность тестов","сложность тестов","технология тестирования"],"ar":["الانتظار المستند إلى الشروط","اختبارات البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","موثوقية الاختبارات","كفاءة الاختبارات","تعقيد الاختبارات","تكنولوجيا الاختبار"]}},"owner":"AlabamaMike","repo":"copilot-agents","repoPath":"AlabamaMike/copilot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"condition-based-waiting","description":"Use when tests have race conditions, timing dependencies, or inconsistent pass/fail behavior - replaces arbitrary timeouts with condition polling to wait for actual state changes, eliminating flaky tests from timing guesses","bodyPreview":"# Condition-Based Waiting\n\n## Overview\n\nFlaky tests often guess at timing with arbitrary delays. This creates race conditions where tests pass on fast machines but fail under load or in CI.\n\n**Core principle:** Wait for the actual condition you care about, not a guess about how long it takes.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Test uses setTimeout/sleep?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Document WHY timeout needed\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use condi","body":"# Condition-Based Waiting\n\n## Overview\n\nFlaky tests often guess at timing with arbitrary delays. This creates race conditions where tests pass on fast machines but fail under load or in CI.\n\n**Core principle:** Wait for the actual condition you care about, not a guess about how long it takes.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Test uses setTimeout/sleep?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Document WHY timeout needed\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use condition-based waiting\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Test uses setTimeout/sleep?\" -> \"Testing timing behavior?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" -> \"Document WHY timeout needed\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Testing timing behavior?\" -> \"Use condition-based waiting\" [label=\"no\"];\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- Tests have arbitrary delays (`setTimeout`, `sleep`, `time.sleep()`)\n- Tests are flaky (pass sometimes, fail under load)\n- Tests timeout when run in parallel\n- Waiting for async operations to complete\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n- Testing actual timing behavior (debounce, throttle intervals)\n- Always document WHY if using arbitrary timeout\n\n## Core Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ BEFORE: Guessing at timing\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 50));\nconst result = getResult();\nexpect(result).toBeDefined();\n\n// ✅ AFTER: Waiting for condition\nawait waitFor(() => getResult() !== undefined);\nconst result = getResult();\nexpect(result).toBeDefined();\n```\n\n## Quick Patterns\n\n| Scenario | Pattern |\n|----------|---------|\n| Wait for event | `waitFor(() => events.find(e => e.type === ''DONE''))` |\n| Wait for state | `waitFor(() => machine.state === ''ready'')` |\n| Wait for count | `waitFor(() => items.length >= 5)` |\n| Wait for file | `waitFor(() => fs.existsSync(path))` |\n| Complex condition | `waitFor(() => obj.ready && obj.value > 10)` |\n\n## Implementation\n\nGeneric polling function:\n```typescript\nasync function waitFor<T>(\n  condition: () => T | undefined | null | false,\n  description: string,\n  timeoutMs = 5000\n): Promise<T> {\n  const startTime = Date.now();\n\n  while (true) {\n    const result = condition();\n    if (result) return result;\n\n    if (Date.now() - startTime > timeoutMs) {\n      throw new Error(`Timeout waiting for ${description} after ${timeoutMs}ms`);\n    }\n\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 10)); // Poll every 10ms\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee @example.ts for complete implementation with domain-specific helpers (`waitForEvent`, `waitForEventCount`, `waitForEventMatch`) from actual debugging session.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**❌ Polling too fast:** `setTimeout(check, 1)` - wastes CPU\n**✅ Fix:** Poll every 10ms\n\n**❌ No timeout:** Loop forever if condition never met\n**✅ Fix:** Always include timeout with clear error\n\n**❌ Stale data:** Cache state before loop\n**✅ Fix:** Call getter inside loop for fresh data\n\n## When Arbitrary Timeout IS Correct\n\n```typescript\n// Tool ticks every 100ms - need 2 ticks to verify partial output\nawait waitForEvent(manager, ''TOOL_STARTED''); // First: wait for condition\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 200));   // Then: wait for timed behavior\n// 200ms = 2 ticks at 100ms intervals - documented and justified\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n1. First wait for triggering condition\n2. Based on known timing (not guessing)\n3. Comment explaining WHY\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging session (2025-10-03):\n- Fixed 15 flaky tests across 3 files\n- Pass rate: 60% → 100%\n- Execution time: 40% faster\n- No more race conditions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T06:59:25.936Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test Automation Agents requiring reliable and efficient waiting mechanisms in GH copilot environments","zh":"适用于需要在GH copilot环境中可靠且高效的等待机制的测试自动化代理","ja":"GH copilot環境で信頼性の高い待機メカニズムを必要とするテスト自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"GH copilot 환경에서 안정적이고 효율적인 대기 메커니즘을 요구하는 테스트 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de pruebas que requieren mecanismos de espera confiables y eficientes en entornos de GH copilot","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de tests nécessitant des mécanismes d''attente fiables et efficaces dans les environnements GH copilot","de":"Ideal für Testautomatisierungsagenten, die zuverlässige und effiziente Wartemechanismen in GH-Copilot-Umgebungen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Testes que exigem mecanismos de espera confiáveis e eficientes em ambientes GH copilot","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации тестирования, требующих надежных и эффективных механизмов ожидания в средах GH copilot","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إختبار الآلية التي تتطلب آليات انتظار موثوقة وفعالة في بيئات GH copilot"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to wait for actual conditions, eliminating flaky tests and race conditions by using custom setTimeout/sleep alternatives, and documenting the reasoning behind timeout needs","zh":"赋予代理等待实际条件的能力，通过使用自定义setTimeout/sleep替代品消除不稳定的测试和竞争条件，并记录超时需求的理由","ja":"実際の条件を待つ能力をエージェントに与え、カスタムsetTimeout/sleepの代替品を使用して不安定なテストとレースコンディションを排除し、タイムアウトの必要性の理由を文書化する","ko":"실제 조건을 기다릴 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 커스텀 setTimeout/sleep 대안을 사용하여 불안정한 테스트와 경쟁 조건을 제거하고, 타임아웃 필요성의 이유를 문서화함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a esperar condiciones reales, eliminando pruebas inestables y condiciones de carrera mediante el uso de alternativas personalizadas de setTimeout/sleep y documentando la justificación detrás de las necesidades de tiempo de espera","fr":"Permet aux agents d''attendre des conditions réelles, éliminant les tests instables et les conditions de course en utilisant des alternatives personnalisées de setTimeout/sleep et en documentant la justification derrière les besoins de délai d''attente","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, auf tatsächliche Bedingungen zu warten, eliminiert flaky Tests und Rennbedingungen, indem sie benutzerdefinierte setTimeout/sleep-Alternativen verwenden und die Begründung hinter den Timeout-Bedarfen dokumentieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a esperar por condições reais, eliminando testes instáveis e condições de corrida ao usar alternativas personalizadas de setTimeout/sleep e documentar o raciocínio por trás das necessidades de tempo limite","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ожидать фактических условий, устраняя нестабильные тесты и гонки за использованием пользовательских альтернатив setTimeout/sleep и документирования обоснования необходимости таймаутов","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على الانتظار للشروط الفعلية، وإliminación الاختبارات غير المستقرة و ظروف السباق من خلال استخدام البدائل المخصصة من setTimeout/sleep و توثيق المنطق وراء احتياجات توقيت"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing reliable test automation for CI environments","Debugging timing-related issues in test suites","Optimizing test execution speed by reducing arbitrary delays"],"zh":["在CI环境中实现可靠的测试自动化","调试测试套件中的与时间相关的问题","通过减少任意延迟来优化测试执行速度"],"ja":["CI環境で信頼性の高いテスト自動化を実現する","テストスイートのタイミング関連の問題をデバッグする","任意の遅延を減らしてテスト実行の速度を最適化する"],"ko":["CI 환경에서 안정적인 테스트 자동화를 구현하는 것","테스트 스위트의 타이밍 관련 문제를 디버깅하는 것","임의의 지연을 줄여 테스트 실행 속도를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de automatización de pruebas confiable para entornos de CI","Depuración de problemas relacionados con la temporización en conjuntos de pruebas","Optimización de la velocidad de ejecución de pruebas al reducir retrasos arbitrarios"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''une automatisation de tests fiable pour les environnements CI","Débogage des problèmes liés à la temporisation dans les suites de tests","Optimisation de la vitesse d''exécution des tests en réduisant les retards arbitraires"],"de":["Implementierung zuverlässiger Testautomatisierung für CI-Umgebungen","Fehlerbehebung bei zeitbezogenen Problemen in Test-Suiten","Optimierung der Testausführungsgeschwindigkeit durch Reduzierung willkürlicher Verzögerungen"],"pt":["Implementação de automação de teste confiável para ambientes de integração contínua","Depuração de problemas relacionados à temporização em conjuntos de testes","Otimização da velocidade de execução de testes reduzindo atrasos arbitrários"],"ru":["Реализация надёжной автоматизации тестирования для сред непрерывной интеграции","Отладка проблем, связанных с временными задержками в наборах тестов","Оптимизация скорости выполнения тестов за счет уменьшения произвольных задержек"],"ar":["تنفيذ إختبار آلي موثوق في بيئات التكامل المستمر","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالتوقيت في مجموعات الإختبار","تحسين سرعة تنفيذ الإختبار من خلال تقليل التأخيرات التعسفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires custom agent implementation for GH copilot","May need additional documentation for timeout justifications"],"zh":["需要为GH copilot实现自定义代理","可能需要额外的文档来说明超时的理由"],"ja":["GH copilot用にカスタムエージェントを実装する必要がある","タイムアウトの正当性のための追加の文書化が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["GH copilot를 위한 커스텀 에이전트 구현이 필요","타임아웃의 정당성을 위한 추가 문서화가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere implementación personalizada de agente para GH copilot","Puede necesitar documentación adicional para justificar los tiempos de espera"],"fr":["Nécessite une mise en œuvre personnalisée de l''agent pour GH copilot","Peut nécessiter une documentation supplémentaire pour justifier les besoins de délai d''attente"],"de":["Benötigt eine benutzerdefinierte Implementierung des Agents für GH-Copilot","Kann zusätzliche Dokumentation für die Rechtfertigung von Timeout-Bedarfen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige implementação personalizada de agente para GH copilot","Pode precisar de documentação adicional para justificar os timeout"],"ru":["Требует индивидуальной реализации агента для GH copilot","Может потребовать дополнительной документации для обоснования таймаутов"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ وكيل مخصص لبيئة GH copilot","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى توثيق إضافي لمبرر توقيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
