lioration de l''efficacité et des performances"],"de":["45 Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine bessere Organisation","Leitfaden für die Implementierung von Daten","Automatische Refactorierung und Codegenerierung","Optimierung von Bundles","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Leistung"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","Melhoria da segurança","Guia de refatoração de código","45 regras para otimização","8 categorias de otimização","Priorização de impacto"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Улучшение безопасности","Руководство по рефакторингу кода","45 правил для оптимизации","8 категорий оптимизации","Приоритизация воздействия"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","تحسين الأمان","دليل إعادة هيكلة الكود","45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحسين الأداء","التحديد الأهمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 优化","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","安全性优化","React 最佳实践","Next.js 最佳实践"],"ja":["Vercel React","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","セキュリティ最適化","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","리액트 최적화","넥스트.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","보안 최적화","리액트 최적화 가이드","넥스트.js 최적화 가이드"],"es":["Vercel React","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","eficiencia","rendimiento","bundles"],"fr":["Vercel React","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","meilleures pratiques","développement web","efficacité","performances","bundles"],"de":["Vercel React","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Best-Practices","Webentwicklung","Effizienz","Leistung","Bundles"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","Segurança","Refatoração de código","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","Безопасность","Рефакторинг кода","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["تفيركل رياكت","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","الأمان","إعادة هيكلة الكود","رياكت","نتجس","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"JudeTejada","repo":"Quick-Links","repoPath":"JudeTejada/Quick-Links","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:00:44.260Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React和Next.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"ReactおよびNext.jsの高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Solid-js for efficient management and bookmarking of best practices, including data fetching and bundling optimization.","zh":"使代理能够使用45条规则跨8个类别自动化重构和代码生成，按照影响程度优先，并利用Solid-js进行高效管理和最佳实践的书签，包括数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"エージェントがReactおよびNext.jsアプリケーションに対して45のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって影響度に基づいて優先順位付けし、Solid-jsを使用して効率的な管理とベストプラクティスのブックマークを行い、データの取得とバンドルの最適化を含む自動リファクタリングとコード生成を実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 8개 범주에 걸쳐 45개의 규칙을 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 매기고, Solid-js를 사용하여 효율적인 관리와 모범 사례의 북마크를 수행하고, 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando Solid-js para una gestión eficiente y el marcado de las mejores prácticas, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y el empaquetado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant Solid-js pour une gestion efficace et le signet des meilleures pratiques, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refaktorierung und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, priorisiert nach Auswirkung, und Solid-js für eine effiziente Verwaltung und Lesezeichen der Best Practices nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js usando 45 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e aproveitando o Solid-js para gerenciamento eficiente e marcação de boas práticas, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js с использованием 45 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по влиянию, и использует Solid-js для эффективного управления и закладки лучших практик, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ت автоматиزم إعادة هيكلة وتوليد التعليمات البرمجية للتطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير، ويتوفر على Solid-js لإدارة فعالة وتصنيف أفضل الممارسات، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components and Next.js pages","Generating optimized code for client and server-side data fetching","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability","Optimizing bundling for faster application loading"],"zh":["为新的React组件和Next.js页面自动化性能优化","为客户端和服务器端数据获取生成优化代码","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以提高性能和可维护性","优化捆绑包以加快应用程序加载"],"ja":["新しいReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページのパフォーマンス最適化の自動化","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得のための最適化コードの生成","既存のReactとNext.jsコードのリファクタリングによるパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性の向上","バンドルの最適化によるアプリケーションのロードの高速化"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지의 성능 최적화 자동화","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 데이터 가져오기에 대한 최적화 코드 생성","기존 React 및 Next.js 코드의 리팩토링을 통한 성능 및 유지 보수성 향상","번들 최적화를 통한 애플리케이션 로드 속도 향상"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React y páginas de Next.js","Generar código optimizado para la recuperación de datos del lado del cliente y del servidor","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad","Optimizar el empaquetado para una carga de aplicaciones más rápida"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React et les pages Next.js","Générer du code optimisé pour la récupération de données côté client et côté serveur","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances et maintenabilité","Optimiser le regroupement pour un chargement d''applications plus rapide"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für die Datenabruf auf Client- und Serverseite","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit","Optimieren des Bündelns für ein schnelleres Laden von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React e páginas Next.js","Gerar código otimizado para busca de dados do lado do cliente e servidor","Refatorar o código React e Next.js existente para melhor desempenho e manutenção","Otimizar o empacotamento para carregamento de aplicativos mais rápido"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React и страниц Next.js","Генерировать оптимизированный код для извлечения данных на стороне клиента и сервера","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности и поддержки","Оптимизировать пакетирование для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["ت автоматиزم تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js الجديدة","توليد التعليمات البرمجية المُحسّنة لاسترجاع البيانات على جانب العميل والخادم","إعادة هيكلة التعليمات البرمجية الحالية لتطبيقات React و Next.js لتحسين الأداء والصيانة","تحسين التحزيم لتحميل التطبيقات بشكل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications built with React and Next.js","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines for best practices"],"zh":["需要了解React和Next.js生态系统","仅限于使用React和Next.js构建的应用","依赖于Vercel的最佳实践指南"],"ja":["ReactおよびNext.jsのエコシステムの知識が必要","ReactおよびNext.jsで構築されたアプリケーションに限定","Vercelのベストプラクティスのガイドラインに依存"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계에 대한 이해가 필요","React 및 Next.js로 구축된 응용 프로그램에만 제한","Vercel의 모범 사례 가이드에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones construidas con React y Next.js","Dependiente de las directrices de Vercel para las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances des écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux applications construites avec React et Next.js","Dépendant des directives de Vercel pour les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die mit React und Next.js erstellt wurden","Abhängig von den Richtlinien von Vercel für die Best Practices"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações construídas com React e Next.js","Dependente das diretrizes da Vercel para as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, построенных с использованием React и Next.js","Зависит от рекомендаций Vercel по лучшим практикам"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببيئات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية باستخدام React و Next.js","يعتمد على إرشادات Vercel لأفضل الممارسات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
