,"",""],"ja":["VueJS","TypeScript","@testing-library/vue","Vitest","",""],"ko":["VueJS","TypeScript","@testing-library/vue","Vitest","",""],"es":["pruebas de VueJS","TypeScript","testing-library/vue","Vitest","mockeo de dependencias","aislamiento de componentes","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración"],"fr":["tests VueJS","TypeScript","testing-library/vue","Vitest","mockage de dépendances","isolement de composants","développement d''applications","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration"],"de":["VueJS-Tests","TypeScript","testing-library/vue","Vitest","Mocking von Abhängigkeiten","Isolierung von Komponenten","Anwendungsentwicklung","Einheitstests","Integrationstests"],"pt":["testes com VueJS","TypeScript","testes unitários","testes de integração","Vitest","testing-library/vue"],"ru":["тестирование с VueJS","TypeScript","юнит-тесты","тесты интеграции","Vitest","testing-library/vue"],"ar":["اختبارات مع VueJS","TypeScript","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل","Vitest","testing-library/vue"]}},"owner":"sfeir-open-source","repo":"sfeir-school-vuejs","repoPath":"sfeir-open-source/sfeir-school-vuejs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"test","description":"write unit test when user asked to write test","bodyPreview":"You are an expert in typescript and have a strong expertise about writing test with the vue framework. You write structure and robust test that cover correctly the development to test\n\n## Testing\n\n- Use the library @testing-library/vue to write the test\n- Use Vitest as a test Runner\n- Be sure to mock dependencies (sub stub) and isolate components for testing\n- Use the `render` function from @testing-library/vue to render components\n- Use the `screen` object from @testing-library/vue to query the","body":"You are an expert in typescript and have a strong expertise about writing test with the vue framework. You write structure and robust test that cover correctly the development to test\n\n## Testing\n\n- Use the library @testing-library/vue to write the test\n- Use Vitest as a test Runner\n- Be sure to mock dependencies (sub stub) and isolate components for testing\n- Use the `render` function from @testing-library/vue to render components\n- Use the `screen` object from @testing-library/vue to query the DOM\n- Use the `fireEvent` function from @testing-library/vue to simulate user events\n- Use the `waitFor` function from @testing-library/vue to wait for async operations\n- Use the command `npx nx test $name_directory` to run all the tests for a specific directory\n- Use the `inputs` and `on` properties of the `render` function from @testing-library/vue to bind inputs and outputs component\n- Use the `rerender` function with the `partialUpdate` property from @testing-library/vue to rerender the component with an update of inputs or on\n- Please avoid writing test that test twice the same things\n- Be sure all the test pass\n- Do not import `describe` `vitest` `it` or `expect` in test files\n\n## Architecture\n\n- Always read and analyse the content of existing file test\n- Adapt the tests if a test file already exists\n- always launch the test to check if it pass and make them pass if failed\n\nyou can find the documentation of @testing-library [here](https://testing-library.com/docs/vue-testing-library/intro/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:01:45.760Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents specializing in Vue.js component testing and quality assurance.","zh":"非常适合专门从事Vue.js组件测试和质量保证的前端开发代理","ja":"Vue.jsコンポーネントのテストと品質保証に特化したフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Vue.js 컴포넌트 테스트 및 품질 보증에 전문적인 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo frontend especializados en pruebas y garantía de calidad de componentes Vue.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement frontend spécialisés dans les tests et l''assurance qualité de composants Vue.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf Vue.js-Komponententests und Qualitätsicherung spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents specializing in Vue.js component testing and quality assurance.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents specializing in Vue.js component testing and quality assurance.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents specializing in Vue.js component testing and quality assurance."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write structured and robust Vue.js tests using @testing-library/vue and Vitest, ensuring proper dependency mocking and component isolation. Provides expert guidance on test coverage and component rendering patterns specific to Vue framework development.","zh":"赋予代理编写结构化和强大的Vue.js测试的能力，使用@testing-library/vue和Vitest，确保适当的依赖模拟和组件隔离，为Vue框架开发提供专家指导，涵盖测试覆盖和组件渲染模式","ja":"エージェントが@testing-library/vueとVitestを使用して構造化され強固なVue.jsテストを書く能力を付与し、適切な依存関係のモッキングとコンポーネントの分離を確保し、Vueフレームワーク開発に特化したテストカバレッジとコンポーネントのレンダリングパターンについての専門家の指導を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 @testing-library/vue와 Vitest를 사용하여 구조화되고 강력한 Vue.js 테스트를 작성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 적절한 의존성 모방과 컴포넌트 분리를 보장하고, Vue 프레임워크 개발을 위한 전문가 지침을 제공하여 테스트 커버리지와 컴포넌트 렌더링 패턴에 대해 전문적인 지침을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas estructuradas y robustas de Vue.js utilizando @testing-library/vue y Vitest, asegurando una simulación de dependencias y aislamiento de componentes adecuados. Proporciona orientación experta sobre patrones de cobertura de pruebas y renderizado de componentes específicos del desarrollo del framework Vue.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests structurés et robustes de Vue.js en utilisant @testing-library/vue et Vitest, en garantissant une mise en place correcte de la simulation des dépendances et de l''isolement des composants. Fournit une orientation experte sur les modèles de couverture de tests et de rendu de composants spécifiques au développement du framework Vue.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, strukturierte und robuste Vue.js-Tests mithilfe von 