s-composants","Isoler les composants pour des tests ciblés","Interroger les composants rendus en utilisant des modèles de bibliothèque de tests"],"de":["Schreiben von Einheitstests für Vue-Komponenten","Mocking von Abhängigkeiten und Unterkomponenten","Isolieren von Komponenten für fokussierte Tests","Abfragen von gerenderten Komponenten unter Verwendung von Testing-Bibliotheksmustern"],"pt":["Writing unit tests for Vue components","Mocking dependencies and stubbing sub-components","Isolating components for focused testing","Querying rendered components using Testing Library patterns"],"ru":["Writing unit tests for Vue components","Mocking dependencies and stubbing sub-components","Isolating components for focused testing","Querying rendered components using Testing Library patterns"],"ar":["Writing unit tests for Vue components","Mocking dependencies and stubbing sub-components","Isolating components for focused testing","Querying rendered components using Testing Library patterns"]},"limitations":{"en":["Vue.js framework specific only","Requires @testing-library/vue and Vitest setup","Focuses on component-level testing rather than E2E"],"zh":["仅限于Vue.js框架","需要@testing-library/vue和Vitest设置","专注于组件级别的测试而不是E2E"],"ja":["Vue.jsフレームワークのみに対応","@testing-library/vueとVitestの設定が必要","コンポーネントレベルのテストに焦点を当ててE2Eではなく"],"ko":["Vue.js 프레임워크에만 해당","@testing-library/vue 및 Vitest 설정이 필요","컴포넌트 수준의 테스트에 중점을 둔 E2E가 아님"],"es":["Específico solo del framework Vue.js","Requiere configuración de @testing-library/vue y Vitest","Se centra en las pruebas a nivel de componente en lugar de E2E"],"fr":["Spécifique uniquement au framework Vue.js","Nécessite une configuration de @testing-library/vue et Vitest","Se concentre sur les tests au niveau des composants plutôt que sur E2E"],"de":["Nur spezifisch für das Vue.js-Framework","Benötigt @testing-library/vue- und Vitest-Setup","Konzentriert sich auf Komponententests anstelle von E2E"],"pt":["Vue.js framework specific only","Requires @testing-library/vue and Vitest setup","Focuses on component-level testing rather than E2E"],"ru":["Vue.js framework specific only","Requires @testing-library/vue and Vitest setup","Focuses on component-level testing rather than E2E"],"ar":["Vue.js framework specific only","Requires @testing-library/vue and Vitest setup","Focuses on component-level testing rather than E2E"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
