"développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Codex-Testfähigkeit","lokale Erkennung von Fähigkeiten","Fähigkeitsentwicklung","Fähigkeitstests","Codex","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["habilidades de teste","detecção de habilidades locais","codex-test-skill","desenvolvimento de habilidades","testes de codex","habilidades de codex"],"ru":["навыки тестирования","обнаружение локальных навыков","codex-test-skill","разработка навыков","тесты codex","навыки codex"],"ar":["مهارات الاختبار","اكتشاف المهارات المحلية","codex-test-skill","تطوير المهارات","اختبارات Codex","مهارات Codex"]}},"owner":"cortesi","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cortesi/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codex-test-skill","description":"A test local skill for Codex. Use when testing Codex-specific local skills.","bodyPreview":"# Codex Test Skill\n\nThis is a test skill for verifying Codex local skills detection.\n\n## Instructions\n\nConfirm that you are running the codex-test-skill when invoked.","body":"# Codex Test Skill\n\nThis is a test skill for verifying Codex local skills detection.\n\n## Instructions\n\nConfirm that you are running the codex-test-skill when invoked.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:01:35.858Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Agent Developer Tools requiring local skills detection verification during Codex integration.","zh":"对于需要本地技能检测验证的代理开发者工具与Codex集成至关重要。","ja":"Codex統合中にローカルスキル検証を必要とするエージェント開発者ツールに不可欠です。","ko":"Codex 통합 중 로컬 스킬 감지 검증이 필요한 에이전트 개발자 도구에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para las herramientas de desarrollo de agentes que requieren verificación de detección de habilidades locales durante la integración de Codex.","fr":"Essentiel pour les outils de développement d''agents nécessitant une vérification de détection de compétences locales lors de l''intégration de Codex.","de":"Wesentlich für Agent-Entwicklertools, die eine Überprüfung der lokalen Fähigkeitsdetektion während der Codex-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Essential for Agent Developer Tools requiring local skills detection verification during Codex integration.","ru":"Essential for Agent Developer Tools requiring local skills detection verification during Codex integration.","ar":"Essential for Agent Developer Tools requiring local skills detection verification during Codex integration."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables immediate verification of Codex''s local skills detection capabilities, confirming proper skill recognition and execution when invoked. This provides critical validation for agent development workflows and plugin ecosystem testing.","zh":"支持立即验证Codex的本地技能检测能力，确认调用时的正确技能识别与执行。这为代理开发工作流和插件生态系统测试提供了关键验证。","ja":"Codexのローカルスキル検出能力を即座に検証し、呼び出し時の適切なスキル認識と実行を確認できます。これはエージェント開発ワークフローとプラグインエコシステムテストに重要な検証を提供します。","ko":"Codex의 로컬 스킬 감지 기능을 즉시 검증하여 호출 시 적절한 스킬 인식과 실행을 확인할 수 있습니다. 이는 에이전트 개발 워크플로우와 플러그인 생태계 테스트에 중요한 검증을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la verificación inmediata de las capacidades de detección de habilidades locales de Codex, confirmando el reconocimiento y la ejecución adecuados de las habilidades cuando se invocan. Esto proporciona una validación crítica para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de agentes y pruebas de ecosistemas de complementos.","fr":"Permet une vérification immédiate des capacités de détection de compétences locales de Codex, confirmant la reconnaissance et l''exécution appropriées des compétences lorsqu''elles sont invoquées. Cela fournit une validation critique pour les flux de travail de développement d''agents et les tests d''écosystèmes de plug-ins.","de":"Ermöglicht die unmittelbare Überprüfung der Fähigkeitsdetektionsfunktionen von Codex, wodurch eine ordnungsgemäße Erkennung und Ausführung von Fähigkeiten bei der Invocation bestätigt wird. Dies bietet eine kritische Validierung für Arbeitsabläufe der Agentenentwicklung und Plug-in-Ökosystemtests.","pt":"Enables immediate verification of Codex''s local skills detection capabilities, confirming proper skill recognition and execution when invoked. This provides critical validation for agent development workflows and plugin ecosystem testing.","ru":"Enables immediate verification of Codex''s local skills detection capabilities, confirming proper skill recognition and execution when invoked. This provides critical validation for agent development workflows and plugin ecosystem testing.","ar":"Enables immediate verification of Codex''s local skills detection capabilities, confirming proper skill recognition and execution when invoked. This provides critical validation for agent development workflows and plugin ecosystem testing."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing Codex skills detection mechanisms","Verifying local skill integration workflows","Debugging agent plugin recognition systems","Validating skill invocation protocols"],"zh":["测试Codex技能检测机制","验证本地技能集成工作流","调试代理插件识别系统","验证技能调用协议"],"ja":["Codexスキル検出メカニズムのテスト","ローカルスキル統合ワークフローの検証","エージェントプラグイン認識システムのデバッグ","スキル呼び出しプロトコルの検証"],"ko":["Codex 스킬 감지 메커니즘 테스트","로컬 스킬 통합 워크플로우 검증","에이전트 플러그인 인식 시스템 디버깅","스킬 호출 프로토콜 검증"],"es":["Pruebas de los mecanismos de detección de habilidades de Codex","Verificación de flujos de trabajo de integración de habilidades locales","Depuración de sistemas de reconocimiento de complementos de agentes","Validación de protocolos de invocación de habilidades"],"fr":["Tests des mécanismes de détection de compétences de Codex","Vérification des flux de travail d''intégration de compétences locales","Débogage des systèmes de reconnaissance de plug-ins d''agents","Validation des protocoles d''invocation de compétences"],"de":["Tests der Fähigkeitsdetektionsmechanismen von Codex","Überprüfung der Arbeitsabläufe für die Integration lokaler Fähigkeiten","Fehlerbehebung bei der Erkennung von Agenten-Plug-ins","Validierung von Fähigkeitsaufrufprotokollen"],"pt":["Testing Codex skills detection mechanisms","Verifying local skill integration workflows","Debugging agent plugin recognition systems","Validating skill invocation protocols"],"ru":["Testing Codex skills detection mechanisms","Verifying local skill integration workflows","Debugging agent plugin recognition systems","Validating skill invocation protocols"],"ar":["Testing Codex skills detection mechanisms","Verifying local skill integration workflows","Debugging agent plugin recognition systems","Validating skill invocation protocols"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Codex environment verification only","Provides no additional functionality beyond detection confirmation","Requires active Codex instance for proper execution"],"zh":["仅限于Codex环境验证","除检测确认外不提供额外功能","需要活动的Codex实例才能正确执行"],"ja":["Codex環境検証のみに限定","検出確認以外の追加機能を提供しない","適切な実行にはアクティブなCodexインスタンスが必要"],"ko":["Codex 환경 검증으로만 제한됨","감지 확인 외 추가 기능 제공 안 함","정상 실행을 위해 활성 Codex 인스턴스 필요"],"es":["Limitado solo a la verificación del entorno de Codex","No proporciona funcionalidad adicional más allá de la confirmación de la detección","Requiere una instancia activa de Codex para una ejecución adecuada"],"fr":["Limité à la vérification de l''environnement de Codex uniquement","N''offre aucune fonctionnalité supplémentaire au-delà de la confirmation de la détection","Nécessite une instance active de Codex pour une exécution correcte"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung der Codex-Umgebung","Bietet keine zusätzliche Funktionalität über die Bestätigung der Detektion hinaus","Benötigt eine aktive Codex-Instanz für eine ordnungsgemäße Ausführung"],"pt":["Limited to Codex environment verification only","Provides no additional functionality beyond detection confirmation","Requires active Codex instance for proper execution"],"ru":["Limited to Codex environment verification only","Provides no additional functionality beyond detection confirmation","Requires active Codex instance for proper execution"],"ar":["Limited to Codex environment verification only","Provides no additional functionality beyond detection confirmation","Requires active Codex instance for proper execution"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
