a eficiencia. Aprende a utilizar estas habilidades para optim...","fr":"Les outils de workflow d''ingénierie assistés par IA améliorent la productivité et l''efficacité. Apprenez à utiliser ces compétences pour optimiser vos projets.","de":"KI-gestützte Engineering-Workflow-Tools verbessern die Produktivität und Effizienz. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Fähigkeiten nutzen können, um Ihre Projekte z...","pt":"As ferramentas de workflow de engenharia assistidas por IA ajudam a melhorar a produtividade e a eficiência nos projetos de desenvolvimento","ru":"Инструменты рабочего процесса инженерии с помощью ИИ помогают повысить производительность и эффективность в проектах разработки","ar":"أدوات سير عمل الهندسة مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي تساعد على تحسين الإنتاجية والكفاءة في مشاريع التطوير","en":"AI Assisted Engineering Workflow Tools"},"definition":{"en":"AI Assisted Engineering Workflow Tools"},"features":{"zh":["AI","ITO","API","CLI","OpenCode"],"ja":["AI","ITO","API","CLI","OpenCode"],"ko":["AI","ITO","API","CLI","OpenCode"],"es":["Acceso a habilidades de IA para mejorar la productividad","Herramientas de flujo de trabajo de ingeniería personalizadas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes"," Mejora de la eficiencia y la precisión en los proyectos","Acceso a una comunidad de desarrolladores y expertos en IA"],"fr":["Accès à des compétences IA pour améliorer la productivité","Outils de workflow d''ingénierie personnalisés","Intégration avec les outils de développement existants","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la précision dans les projets","Accès à une communauté de développeurs et d''experts en IA"],"de":["Zugang zu KI-Fähigkeiten für verbesserte Produktivität","Angepasste Engineering-Workflow-Tools","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Genauigkeit in Projekten","Zugang zu einer Community von Entwicklern und KI-Experten"],"pt":["Automatização de tarefas","Otimização de processos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Análise de dados e relatórios","Suporte a equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач","Оптимизация процессов","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Анализ данных и отчеты","Поддержка команд разработки"],"ar":["تأتمة المهام","تحسين العمليات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحليل البيانات والتقرير","دعم فرق التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","ITO","AI","API","CLI","OpenCode","AI"],"ja":["AI","ITO","AI","API","CLI","OpenCode","AI"],"ko":["AI","ITO","AI","API","CLI","OpenCode","AI"],"es":["herramientas de flujo de trabajo de ingeniería","IA asistida","productividad","eficiencia","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","herramientas de desarrollo","competencias de IA"],"fr":["outils de workflow d''ingénierie","IA assistée","productivité","efficacité","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","outils de développement","compétences IA"],"de":["Engineering-Workflow-Tools","KI-gestützt","Produktivität","Effizienz","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Entwicklungstools","KI-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["ferramentas de workflow de engenharia","IA no desenvolvimento","produtividade no desenvolvimento","eficiência no desenvolvimento","automatização de tarefas","otimização de processos"],"ru":["инструменты рабочего процесса инженерии","ИИ в разработке","производительность в разработке","эффективность в разработке","автоматизация задач","оптимизация процессов"],"ar":["أدوات سير عمل الهندسة","الذكاء الاصطناعي في التطوير","الإنتاجية في التطوير","الكفاءة في التطوير","تأتمة المهام","تحسين العمليات"]}},"owner":"withakay","repo":"ito","repoPath":"withakay/ito","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-ito-skills","description":"Use when discovering, finding, invoking, or loading skills. Ensures skills are invoked BEFORE responding. Establishes skill priority and usage patterns for OpenCode, Claude Code, and Codex.","bodyPreview":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n### OpenCode\n\nUse the native `skill` tool:\n\n```bash\n# List all available skills\nskill list\n\n# Load a specific skill\nskill load ito-brainstor","body":"<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nIf you think there is even a 1% chance a skill might apply to what you are doing, you ABSOLUTELY MUST invoke the skill.\n\nIF A SKILL APPLIES TO YOUR TASK, YOU DO NOT HAVE A CHOICE. YOU MUST USE IT.\n\nThis is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n## How to Access Skills\n\n### OpenCode\n\nUse the native `skill` tool:\n\n```bash\n# List all available skills\nskill list\n\n# Load a specific skill\nskill load ito-brainstorming\n```\n\nSkill locations:\n- Project skills: `.opencode/skills/`\n- User skills: `~/.config/opencode/skills/`\n\n### Claude Code\n\nUse the `mcp_skill` function:\n\n```\nmcp_skill with name=\"ito-brainstorming\"\n```\n\nSkill locations:\n- Project skills: `.claude/skills/`\n\n### Codex\n\nRead skill files directly:\n\n```bash\ncat .codex/skills/ito-brainstorming/SKILL.md\n```\n\nSkill locations:\n- Project skills: `.codex/skills/`\n- User skills: `~/.codex/skills/`\n\n### Detecting Your Harness\n\n- **OpenCode**: Has `skill` tool available, `.opencode/` directory\n- **Claude Code**: Has `mcp_skill` function, `.claude/` directory\n- **Codex**: Has `.codex/` directory, no native skill tool\n\n# Using Skills\n\n## The Rule\n\n**Invoke relevant or requested skills BEFORE any response or action.** Even a 1% chance a skill might apply means that you should invoke the skill to check. If an invoked skill turns out to be wrong for the situation, you don''t need to use it.\n\n## Red Flags\n\nThese thoughts mean STOP—you''re rationalizing:\n\n| Thought | Reality |\n|---------|---------|\n| \"This is just a simple question\" | Questions are tasks. Check for skills. |\n| \"I need more context first\" | Skill check comes BEFORE clarifying questions. |\n| \"Let me explore the codebase first\" | Skills tell you HOW to explore. Check first. |\n| \"I can check git/files quickly\" | Files lack conversation context. Check for skills. |\n| \"Let me gather information first\" | Skills tell you HOW to gather information. |\n| \"This doesn''t need a formal skill\" | If a skill exists, use it. |\n| \"I remember this skill\" | Skills evolve. Read current version. |\n| \"This doesn''t count as a task\" | Action = task. Check for skills. |\n| \"The skill is overkill\" | Simple things become complex. Use it. |\n| \"I''ll just do this one thing first\" | Check BEFORE doing anything. |\n| \"This feels productive\" | Undisciplined action wastes time. Skills prevent this. |\n| \"I know what that means\" | Knowing the concept ≠ using the skill. Invoke it. |\n\n## Skill Priority\n\nWhen multiple skills could apply, use this order:\n\n1. **Process skills first** (brainstorming, debugging) - these determine HOW to approach the task\n2. **Implementation skills second** (frontend-design, mcp-builder) - these guide execution\n\n\"Let''s build X\" → brainstorming first, then implementation skills.\n\"Fix this bug\" → debugging first, then domain-specific skills.\n\n## Skill Types\n\n**Rigid** (TDD, debugging): Follow exactly. Don''t adapt away discipline.\n\n**Flexible** (patterns): Adapt principles to context.\n\nThe skill itself tells you which.\n\n## User Instructions\n\nInstructions say WHAT, not HOW. \"Add X\" or \"Fix Y\" doesn''t mean skip workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:01:53.208Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Engineering Agents requiring structured workflow automation and enhanced problem-solving capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化工作流自动化和增强问题解决能力的AI工程代理。","ja":"構造化されたワークフローの自動化と問題解決能力の強化が必要なAIエンジニアリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 워크플로 자동화 및 문제 해결 능력 향상이 필요한 AI 엔지니어링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ingeniería de IA que requieren automatización de flujo de trabajo estructurado y capacidades de resolución de problemas mejoradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie d''IA nécessitant une automatisation de workflow structurée et des capacités de résolution de problèmes améliorées.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Engineering-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Workflow-Automatisierung und erweiterte Problemlösungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Engenharia de IA que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho estruturado e capacidades avançadas de resolução de problemas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для инженерных агентов ИИ, требующих автоматизации структурированных рабочих процессов и расширенных возможностей решения проблем.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء هندسة الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى أتمتة سير العمل المنظم وقدرات متطورة لحل المشكلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage ITO''s engineering workflow tools for systematic problem-solving and task execution. Provides access to specialized skills like ito-brainstor through native OpenCode integration, enabling deterministic workflow automation.","zh":"赋予代理使用ITO的工程工作流工具进行系统化问题解决和任务执行的能力。通过原生OpenCode集成提供访问专用技能如ito-brainstor的功能，从而实现确定性工作流自动化。","ja":"ITOのエンジニアリングワークフローツールを使用した体系的な問題解決とタスク実行をエージェントに実現させる。ネイティブのOpenCode統合を通じて、ito-brainstorなどの専用スキルへのアクセスを提供し、決定論的なワークフローオートメーションを実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 ITO의 엔지니어링 워크플로우 툴을 사용하여 체계적인 문제 해결 및 태스크 실행을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. 네이티브 OpenCode 통합을 통해 ito-brainstor와 같은 전문 스킬에 액세스할 수 있어 결정론적 워크플로우 자동화가 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las herramientas de flujo de trabajo de ingeniería de ITO para la resolución sistemática de problemas y la ejecución de tareas. Proporciona acceso a habilidades especializadas como ito-brainstor a través de la integración nativa de OpenCode, lo que permite la automatización de flujos de trabajo determinista.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les outils de workflow d''ingénierie d''ITO pour la résolution systématique de problèmes et l''exécution de tâches. Fournit un accès à des compétences spécialisées comme ito-brainstor via l''intégration native d''OpenCode, permettant l''automatisation de workflow déterministe.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Engineering-Workflow-Tools von ITO für systematische Problemlösung und Aufgabenausführung zu nutzen. Bietet Zugriff auf spezialisierte Fähigkeiten wie ito-brainstor durch native OpenCode-Integration, ermöglicht deterministische Workflow-Automatisierung.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a utilizar as ferramentas de fluxo de trabalho de engenharia da ITO para resolução sistemática de problemas e execução de tarefas. Fornece acesso a habilidades especializadas, como o ito-brainstor, por meio da integração nativa com o OpenCode, permitindo a automação determinística de fluxos de trabalho.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать инструменты инженерных рабочих процессов ITO для систематического решения проблем и выполнения задач. Обеспечивает доступ к специализированным навыкам, таким как ito-brainstor, через нативную интеграцию OpenCode, что позволяет осуществлять детерминированную автоматизацию рабочих процессов.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من أدوات سير عمل الهندسة من ITO للحل المنهجي للمشكلات وتنفيذ المهام. يوفر الوصول إلى مهارات متخصصة مثل ito-brainstor من خلال التكامل الأصلي مع OpenCode، مما يتيح أتمتة سير العمل الحتمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating engineering workflow processes","Loading specialized problem-solving skills","Executing structured task decomposition","Integrating with OpenCode skill ecosystem"],"zh":["自动化工程工作流程","加载专用问题解决技能","执行结构化任务分解","与OpenCode技能生态系统集成"],"ja":["エンジニアリングワークフロープロセスの自動化","専用問題解決スキルのロード","構造化タスク分解の実行","OpenCodeスキルエコシステムとの統合"],"ko":["엔지니어링 워크플로우 프로세스 자동화","전문 문제 해결 스킬 로드","구조화된 태스크 분해 실행","OpenCode 스킬 에코시스템 통합"],"es":["Automatización de procesos de flujo de trabajo de ingeniería","Carga de habilidades de resolución de problemas especializadas","Ejecución de descomposición de tareas estructuradas","Integración con el ecosistema de habilidades de OpenCode"],"fr":["Automatisation de processus de workflow d''ingénierie","Chargement de compétences de résolution de problèmes spécialisées","Exécution de décomposition de tâches structurées","Intégration avec l''écosystème de compétences d''OpenCode"],"de":["Automatisierung von Engineering-Workflow-Prozessen","Laden von spezialisierten Problemlösungsfähigkeiten","Ausführung von strukturierter Aufgabenzerlegung","Integration mit dem OpenCode-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Automatização de processos de fluxo de trabalho de engenharia","Carregamento de habilidades especializadas de resolução de problemas","Execução de decomposição estruturada de tarefas","Integração com o ecossistema de habilidades do OpenCode"],"ru":["Автоматизация процессов инженерных рабочих процессов","Загрузка специализированных навыков решения проблем","Выполнение структурированной декомпозиции задач","Интеграция с экосистемой навыков OpenCode"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات سير عمل الهندسة","تحميل مهارات متخصصة لحل المشكلات","تنفيذ تحليل المهام المنظم","التكامل مع نظام مهارات OpenCode البيئي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenCode environment access","Dependent on ITO skill ecosystem availability","Mandatory skill invocation when applicable"],"zh":["需要OpenCode环境访问","依赖ITO技能生态系统的可用性","在适用时强制技能调用"],"ja":["OpenCode環境へのアクセスが必要","ITOスキルエコシステムの可用性に依存","適用可能な場合の強制スキル呼び出し"],"ko":["OpenCode 환경 액세스가 필요","ITO 스킬 에코시스템의 가용성에 의존","적용 가능한 경우 강제 스킬 호출"],"es":["Requiere acceso al entorno de OpenCode","Dependiente de la disponibilidad del ecosistema de habilidades de ITO","Invocación de habilidades obligatoria cuando sea aplicable"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''environnement OpenCode","Dépend de la disponibilité de l''écosystème de compétences d''ITO","Invocation de compétences obligatoire lorsque cela est applicable"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die OpenCode-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit des ITO-Fähigkeits-Ökosystems","Pflichtinvokation von Fähigkeiten wenn anwendbar"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao ambiente OpenCode","Dependente da disponibilidade do ecossistema de habilidades da ITO","Invocação obrigatória de habilidade quando aplicável"],"ru":["Требует доступа к среде OpenCode","Зависит от доступности экосистемы навыков ITO","Обязательный вызов навыка, когда применимо"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيئة OpenCode","يعتمد على توفر نظام مهارات ITO البيئي","استدعاء إلزامي للمهارة عند الاقتضاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
