ivos","ru":"Fetch Unresolved Comments - Инструмент управления активами","ar":"Fetch Unresolved Comments - أداة إدارة الأصول","en":"fetch-unresolved-comments"},"description":{"zh":"fetch-unresolved-comments是一个Electron+Svelte+Cagent品牌资产管理应用，用于获取GitHub PR中未解决的评论","ja":"fetch-unresolved-commentsはElectron+Svelte+Cagentブランドアセット管理アプリで、GitHubのPRから未解決のコメントを取得します","ko":"fetch-unresolved-comments는 Electron+Svelte+Cagent 브랜드 자산 관리 애플리케이션으로 GitHub PR에서 미해결 댓글을 가져옵니다","es":"Esta habilidad utiliza la API de GraphQL de GitHub para recuperar comentarios de revisión de PR no resueltos","fr":"Cette compétence utilise l''API GraphQL de GitHub pour récupérer des commentaires de révision de PR non résolus","de":"Diese Fähigkeit verwendet die GitHub-GraphQL-API, um unbeantwortete PR-Überprüfungskommentare abzurufen","pt":"A ferramenta Fetch Unresolved Comments usa a API GraphQL do GitHub para recuperar apenas comentários de thread de revisão não resolvidos de um pull request","ru":"Инструмент Fetch Unresolved Comments использует API GraphQL GitHub для получения только неразрешенных комментариев к обзору из запроса на вытягивание","ar":"تستخدم أداة Fetch Unresolved Comments واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL من GitHub لاسترجاع تعليقات المراجعة غير المحلولة فقط من طلب السحب","en":"Electron+Svelte+Cagent brand asset management app"},"definition":{"en":"Electron+Svelte+Cagent brand asset management app"},"features":{"zh":["使用GitHub的GraphQL API","获取PR中未解决的评论","过滤已解决和过时的反馈","支持环境变量配置","构建PR URL"],"ja":["GitHubのGraphQL APIを使用","PRの未解決のコメントを取得","既に解決されたフィードバックをフィルタ","環境変数の設定をサポート","PR URLの構築"],"ko":["GitHub의 GraphQL API 사용","PR의 미해결 댓글 가져오기","이미 해결된 피드백 필터링","환경 변수 설정 지원","PR URL 구성"],"es":["Recupera comentarios de revisión de PR no resueltos","Utiliza la API de GraphQL de GitHub","Filtrado de comentarios resueltos y obsoletos","Compatibilidad con Electron, Svelte y Cagent","Obtención de URL de PR a partir de variables de entorno"],"fr":["Récupère des commentaires de révision de PR non résolus","Utilise l''API GraphQL de GitHub","Filtrage des commentaires résolus et obsolètes","Compatibilité avec Electron, Svelte et Cagent","Récupération de l''URL de PR à partir de variables d''environnement"],"de":["Abrufen unbeantworteter PR-Überprüfungskommentare","Verwendung der GitHub-GraphQL-API","Filtern von beantworteten und veralteten Kommentaren","Kompatibilität mit Electron, Svelte und Cagent","Abrufen der PR-URL aus Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Recupera comentários de revisão não resolvidos","Usa a API GraphQL do GitHub","Filtro de comentários resolvidos e desatualizados","Compatível com Electron e Svelte","Gerenciamento de ativos da marca Cagent"],"ru":["Извлекает неразрешенные комментарии к обзору","Использует API GraphQL GitHub","Фильтрует разрешенные и устаревшие комментарии","Совместим с Electron и Svelte","Управление брендовыми активами Cagent"],"ar":["استرجاع تعليقات المراجعة غير المحلولة","استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL من GitHub","مرشح تعليقات المراجعة المحلولة والقديمة","متوافق مع Electron و Svelte","إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية Cagent"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub PR","GraphQL API","未解决评论","代码审查","Electron","Svelte","Cagent"],"ja":["GitHub PR","GraphQL API","未解決のコメント","コードレビュー","Electron","Svelte","Cagent"],"ko":["GitHub PR","GraphQL API","미해결 댓글","코드 리뷰","Electron","Svelte","Cagent"],"es":["comentarios de revisión de PR","API de GraphQL de GitHub","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","desarrollo de software","gestión de repositorios"],"fr":["commentaires de révision de PR","API GraphQL de GitHub","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","développement de logiciels","gestion de dépôts"],"de":["PR-Überprüfungskommentare","GitHub-GraphQL-API","Electron","Svelte","Cagent","Software-Entwicklung","Repositoriums-Verwaltung"],"pt":["fetch unresolved comments","github api graphql","pull request comments","electron","svelte","cagent brand asset management","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["fetch unresolved comments","github api graphql","комментарии к запросам на вытягивание","electron","svelte","управление брендовыми активами cagent","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["fetch unresolved comments","github api graphql","تعليقات طلبات السحب","electron","svelte","إدارة أصول العلامة التجارية cagent","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"alchimie-di-circe","repo":"Extractor-desktop-app","repoPath":"alchimie-di-circe/Extractor-desktop-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fetch-unresolved-comments","description":"Fetch unresolved PR review comments using GitHub GraphQL API, filtering out resolved and outdated feedback.","bodyPreview":"# Fetch Unresolved PR Review Comments\n\nUses GitHub''s GraphQL API to fetch only unresolved review thread comments from a pull request.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- You need to get only unresolved review comments from a PR\n- You want to filter out already-resolved and outdated feedback\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Get PR URL**:\n\n   - First check for environment variables:\n     - If `PR_NUMBER` and `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` are set, construct URL as `https://github.com/${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}/pull/${PR_NUMBER}`\n   - Otherw","body":"# Fetch Unresolved PR Review Comments\n\nUses GitHub''s GraphQL API to fetch only unresolved review thread comments from a pull request.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- You need to get only unresolved review comments from a PR\n- You want to filter out already-resolved and outdated feedback\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Get PR URL**:\n\n   - First check for environment variables:\n     - If `PR_NUMBER` and `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` are set, construct URL as `https://github.com/${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}/pull/${PR_NUMBER}`\n   - Otherwise:\n     - Use `gh pr view --json url -q ''.url''` to get the current branch''s PR URL\n\n2. **Run the skill**:\n\n   ```bash\n   uv run skills fetch-unresolved-comments <pr_url>\n   ```\n\n   Example:\n\n   ```bash\n   uv run skills fetch-unresolved-comments https://github.com/mlflow/mlflow/pull/18327\n   ```\n\n   The script automatically reads the GitHub token from:\n\n   - `GITHUB_TOKEN` or `GH_TOKEN` environment variables, or\n   - `gh auth token` command if environment variables are not set\n\n## Example Output\n\n```json\n{\n  \"total\": 3,\n  \"by_file\": {\n    \".github/workflows/resolve.yml\": [\n      {\n        \"thread_id\": \"PRRT_kwDOAL...\",\n        \"line\": 40,\n        \"startLine\": null,\n        \"diffHunk\": \"@@ -0,0 +1,245 @@\\n+name: resolve...\",\n        \"comments\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": 2437935275,\n            \"body\": \"We can remove this once we get the key.\",\n            \"author\": \"harupy\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-17T00:53:20Z\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"id\": 2437935276,\n            \"body\": \"Good catch, I''ll update it.\",\n            \"author\": \"contributor\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-17T01:10:15Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \".gitignore\": [\n      {\n        \"thread_id\": \"PRRT_kwDOAL...\",\n        \"line\": 133,\n        \"startLine\": null,\n        \"diffHunk\": \"@@ -130,0 +133,2 @@\\n+.claude/*\",\n        \"comments\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": 2437935280,\n            \"body\": \"Should we add this to .gitignore?\",\n            \"author\": \"reviewer\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2025-10-17T01:15:42Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:01:26.274Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub Integration Agents needing to streamline pull request feedback with GraphQL API capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要使用GraphQL API功能简化拉取请求反馈的GitHub集成代理。","ja":"GraphQL API機能を使用してプルリクエストのフィードバックを簡素化する必要があるGitHub統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GraphQL API 기능을 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트 피드백을 간소화해야 하는 GitHub 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de integración de GitHub que necesitan simplificar la retroalimentación de solicitudes de extracción con capacidades de API de GraphQL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration GitHub qui ont besoin de rationaliser les commentaires de demande d''extraction avec des capacités d''API GraphQL.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-Integration-Agenten, die die Rückmeldung zu Pull-Anfragen mit GraphQL-API-Funktionen rationalisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração do GitHub que precisam simplificar o feedback de solicitações de pull com capacidades da API GraphQL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции GitHub, которым необходимо упростить обратную связь по запросам на вытягивание с возможностями API GraphQL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تكامل GitHub الذي يحتاج إلى تسهيل ملاحظات طلب السحب باستخدام قابليات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الرسومية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to filter out resolved comments and focus on outstanding issues by leveraging GitHub''s GraphQL API to fetch unresolved review thread comments from pull requests, utilizing environment variables like PR_NUMBER and GITHUB_REPOSITORY.","zh":"通过利用GitHub的GraphQL API来获取拉取请求中的未解决审查线程评论，使用环境变量如PR_NUMBER和GITHUB_REPOSITORY，从而使代理能够过滤掉已解决的评论并专注于未解决的问题。","ja":"GitHubのGraphQL APIを使用してプルリクエストからの未解決のレビュースレッドコメントを取得し、PR_NUMBERやGITHUB_REPOSITORYなどの環境変数を使用して、エージェントが解決済みのコメントをフィルタリングし、未解決の問題に集中できるようにします。","ko":"GitHub의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트의 미해결 리뷰 스레드 댓글을 가져오고, PR_NUMBER 및 GITHUB_REPOSITORY와 같은 환경 변수를 사용하여 에이전트가 해결된 댓글을 필터링하고 미해결 문제에 집중할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a filtrar los comentarios resueltos y centrarse en los problemas pendientes mediante la utilización de la API de GraphQL de GitHub para recuperar comentarios de revisión de hilos no resueltos de solicitudes de extracción, utilizando variables de entorno como PR_NUMBER y GITHUB_REPOSITORY.","fr":"Permet aux agents de filtrer les commentaires résolus et de se concentrer sur les problèmes en suspens en exploitant l''API GraphQL de GitHub pour récupérer les commentaires de fil de révision non résolus des demandes d''extraction, en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme PR_NUMBER et GITHUB_REPOSITORY.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gelöste Kommentare auszufiltern und sich auf ausstehende Probleme zu konzentrieren, indem sie die GitHub-GraphQL-API nutzen, um ungelöste Review-Thread-Kommentare aus Pull-Anfragen abzurufen, und Umgebungsvariablen wie PR_NUMBER und GITHUB_REPOSITORY verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a filtrar comentários resolvidos e se concentrar em problemas pendentes, aproveitando a API do GraphQL do GitHub para buscar comentários de threads de revisão não resolvidos de solicitações de pull, utilizando variáveis de ambiente como PR_NUMBER e GITHUB_REPOSITORY.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью фильтровать решенные комментарии и сосредоточиться на невыполленных проблемах, используя API GraphQL GitHub для получения нерешенных комментариев потоков ревью из запросов на вытягивание, используя переменные среды, такие как PR_NUMBER и GITHUB_REPOSITORY.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تصفية التعليقات المحلولة والتركيز على القضايا المعلقة من خلال استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub الرسومية لاسترجاع تعليقات المستعرضات غير المحلولة من طلبات السحب، واستخدام متغيرات البيئة مثل PR_NUMBER و GITHUB_REPOSITORY."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the collection of unresolved PR review comments","Streamlining pull request feedback by filtering out resolved comments","Enhancing issue tracking by integrating with GitHub''s GraphQL API"],"zh":["自动收集未解决的PR审查评论","通过过滤已解决评论来简化拉取请求反馈","通过集成GitHub的GraphQL API来增强问题跟踪"],"ja":["未解決のPRレビューコメントの自動収集","解決済みのコメントをフィルタリングすることでプルリクエストのフィードバックを簡素化","GitHubのGraphQL APIとの統合による問題追跡の強化"],"ko":["미해결 풀 리퀘스트 리뷰 댓글의 자동 수집","해결된 댓글을 필터링하여 풀 리퀘스트 피드백을 간소화","GitHub의 GraphQL API와의 통합을 통한 이슈 추적 강화"],"es":["Automatizar la recopilación de comentarios de revisión de PR no resueltos","Racionalizar la retroalimentación de solicitudes de extracción filtrando los comentarios resueltos","Mejorar el seguimiento de problemas integrándose con la API de GraphQL de GitHub"],"fr":["Automatiser la collecte de commentaires de révision de demande d''extraction non résolus","Rationaliser la rétroaction des demandes d''extraction en filtrant les commentaires résolus","Améliorer le suivi des problèmes en intégrant l''API GraphQL de GitHub"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erfassung ungelöster PR-Review-Kommentare","Rationalisieren der Rückmeldung zu Pull-Anfragen durch Ausfiltern gelöster Kommentare","Verbessern der Problemmeldung durch Integration mit der GitHub-GraphQL-API"],"pt":["Automatizar a coleta de comentários de revisão de PR não resolvidos","Simplificar o feedback de solicitação de pull filtrando comentários resolvidos","Melhorar o acompanhamento de problemas integrando-se com a API do GraphQL do GitHub"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сбор нерешенных комментариев ревью PR","Упростить обратную связь по запросам на вытягивание, фильтруя решенные комментарии","Улучшить отслеживание проблем, интегрируясь с API GraphQL GitHub"],"ar":["أتمتة جمع تعليقات مراجعة طلبات السحب غير المحلولة","تبسيط ملاحظات طلب السحب من خلال تصفية التعليقات المحلولة","تحسين تتبع القضايا من خلال التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub الرسومية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub GraphQL API access","Needs environment variables PR_NUMBER and GITHUB_REPOSITORY set","Limited to fetching unresolved review thread comments from pull requests"],"zh":["需要GitHub GraphQL API访问","需要设置环境变量PR_NUMBER和GITHUB_REPOSITORY","仅限于从拉取请求中获取未解决审查线程评论"],"ja":["GitHub GraphQL APIへのアクセスが必要","環境変数PR_NUMBERとGITHUB_REPOSITORYを設定する必要がある","プルリクエストからの未解決のレビュースレッドコメントの取得のみ"],"ko":["GitHub GraphQL API 접근이 필요","환경 변수 PR_NUMBER 및 GITHUB_REPOSITORY를 설정해야 함","풀 리퀘스트로부터 미해결 리뷰 스레드 댓글을 가져오는 것만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GraphQL de GitHub","Necesita que las variables de entorno PR_NUMBER y GITHUB_REPOSITORY estén establecidas","Limitado a la recuperación de comentarios de hilos de revisión no resueltos de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GraphQL de GitHub","Nécessite que les variables d''environnement PR_NUMBER et GITHUB_REPOSITORY soient définies","Limité à la récupération de commentaires de fil de révision non résolus des demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-GraphQL-API","Benötigt, dass die Umgebungsvariablen PR_NUMBER und GITHUB_REPOSITORY festgelegt sind","Begrenzt auf das Abrufen ungelöster Review-Thread-Kommentare aus Pull-Anfragen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do GraphQL do GitHub","Necessita que as variáveis de ambiente PR_NUMBER e GITHUB_REPOSITORY sejam definidas","Limitado à busca de comentários de threads de revisão não resolvidos de solicitações de pull"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GraphQL GitHub","Требует, чтобы переменные среды PR_NUMBER и GITHUB_REPOSITORY были установлены","Ограничен получением нерешенных комментариев потоков ревью из запросов на вытягивание"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub الرسومية","يتطلب تعيين متغيرات البيئة PR_NUMBER و GITHUB_REPOSITORY","محدود بالحصول على تعليقات المستعرضات غير المحلولة من طلبات السحب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
