 código de mane...","fr":"Guide complet d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js. Contient 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour réfacturer et générer du code...","de":"Umfassender Leistungsoptimierungs-Leitfaden für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen. Enthält 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für automatisierte Refaktorisierung und Cod...","en":"🗿 EternalCode.pl website crafted with Next.js v16 & TypeScript."},"definition":{"en":"🗿 EternalCode.pl website crafted with Next.js v16 & TypeScript."},"features":{"zh":["57 条性能优化规则","8 个优化类别","自动重构和代码生成","适用于 React 和 Next.js 应用","优化数据获取和代码复用","提高应用性能和用户体验"],"ja":["57 ルールのパフォーマンス最適化","8 カテゴリーの最適化","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","React と Next.js アプリケーション対応","データ取得とコードの再利用の最適化","アプリケーションのパフォーマンスとユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["57개의 성능 최적화 규칙","8개의 최적화 카테고리","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","리액트와 넥스트.js 애플리케이션 지원","데이터 가져오기와 코드 재사용 최적화","애플리케이션 성능과 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["57 reglas en 8 categorías para optimizar el rendimiento","Guía para refactorizar y generar código de manera automática","Optimización de la carga de datos en el cliente y servidor","Mejora de la eficiencia y el rendimiento de las aplicaciones","Compatibilidad con React y Next.js","Priorización de reglas por impacto para una refactorización eficaz"],"fr":["57 règles dans 8 catégories pour optimiser les performances","Guide pour réfacturer et générer du code de manière automatisée","Optimisation du chargement de données sur le client et le serveur","Amélioration de l''efficacité et des performances des applications","Compatibilité avec React et Next.js","Priorisation des règles par impact pour une réfacturation efficace"],"de":["57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für Leistungsoptimierung","Leitfaden für automatisierte Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung","Optimierung der Datenladung auf Client- und Server-Seite","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Leistung von Anwendungen","Kompatibilität mit React und Next.js","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung für eine effiziente Refaktorisierung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 开发","Next.js 开发","Web 性能优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React 開発","Next.js 開発","Web パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","리액트 최적화 가이드","넥스트.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","리액트 개발","넥스트.js 개발","웹 성능 최적화"],"es":["Vercel React","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","mejores prácticas","refactorización","generación de código","carga de datos","eficiencia","rendimiento"],"fr":["Vercel React","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","bonnes pratiques","réfacturation","génération de code","chargement de données","efficacité","performances"],"de":["Vercel React","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Best Practices","Refaktorisierung","Codegenerierung","Datenladung","Effizienz","Leistung"]}},"owner":"EternalCodeTeam","repo":"website","repoPath":"EternalCodeTeam/website","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:02:17.379Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがReactとNext.jsのアプリケーションパフォーマンスを最適化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"리액트와 Next.js 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento óptimo de aplicaciones React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un rendimiento optimisé des applications React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein optimiertes React- und Next.js-Anwendungsverhalten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 приложений React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى أداء محسن لتطبيقات React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, leveraging Next.js v16 and TypeScript for comprehensive performance optimization.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别的自动重构和代码生成能力，根据影响进行优先排序，利用 Next.js v16 和 TypeScript 进行全面性能优化。","ja":"エージェントは、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用して自動リファクタリングとコード生成を行い、影響度に基づいて優先順位を付けて、Next.js v16 と TypeScript を使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 8개의 카테고리에 걸쳐 57개의 규칙을 사용하여 자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성을 수행할 수 있으며, 영향에 따라 우선순위를 정하여 Next.js v16과 TypeScript를 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, aprovechando Next.js v16 y TypeScript para una optimización integral del rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, en exploitant Next.js v16 et TypeScript pour une optimisation complète des performances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind und Next.js v16 und TypeScript für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código usando 57 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, aproveitando o Next.js v16 e o TypeScript para uma otimização abrangente de desempenho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по степени влияния, используя Next.js v16 и TypeScript для комплексной оптимизации производительности.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تutomation إعادة هيكلة و توليد الكود باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير، مستفيدا من Next.js v16 و TypeScript لتحسين الأداء الشامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components and Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better bundling and data fetching"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以发现性能问题","生成优化的 React 组件和 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以改善捆绑和数据获取"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を発見するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化された React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの生成","バンドルとデータ取得の改善のための既存の React と Next.js コードのリファクタリング"],"ko":["성능 문제를 발견하기 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지 생성","번들링과 데이터 가져오기 개선을 위한 기존 리액트와 Next.js 코드 리팩토링"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generación de componentes React y páginas Next.js optimizadas","Refactorización de código React y Next.js existente para un mejor empaquetado y recuperación de datos"],"fr":["Automatisation des revues de code pour les problèmes de performances","Génération de composants React et de pages Next.js optimisés","Refactoring du code React et Next.js existant pour un meilleur regroupement et récupération de données"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generierung von optimierten React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Refactoring von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für ein besseres Bündeln und DatenAbruf"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React e páginas Next.js otimizados","Refatorar código React e Next.js existente para uma melhor combinação e busca de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React и страницы Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для более лучшей сборки и извлечения данных"],"ar":["توسيع مراجعة الكود للعثور على مشاكل في الأداء","توليد مكونات React وصفحات Next.js المُحسّنة","إعادة هيكلة الكود الحالي ل React و Next.js من أجل تحسين التجميع والاسترجاع البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Specific to Vercel React best practices","Limited to TypeScript and Next.js v16"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 的知识","特定于 Vercel React 最佳实践","仅限于 TypeScript 和 Next.js v16"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","Vercel React ベストプラクティスに特有","TypeScript と Next.js v16 に限定"],"ko":["리액트와 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요","Vercel 리액트 최고의 실践에 특정","타입스크립트와 Next.js v16로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Específico para las mejores prácticas de React de Vercel","Limitado a TypeScript y Next.js v16"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Spécifique aux meilleures pratiques React de Vercel","Limité à TypeScript et Next.js v16"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Spezifisch für die besten Praktiken von Vercel React","Begrenzt auf TypeScript und Next.js v16"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React e Next.js","Específico para as melhores práticas do React do Vercel","Limitado ao TypeScript e Next.js v16"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Конкретно для лучших практик React от Vercel","Ограничен TypeScript и Next.js v16"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ب React و Next.js","محدد لأفضل الممارسات ل React من Vercel","محدود بالتايب سكريبت و Next.js v16"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Coachzas/email-ai-ingestion-pipeline/vercel-react-best-practices', 'community', 'Coachzas', 'email-ai-ingestion-pipeline', 'Coachzas/email-ai-ingestion-pipeline', 'vercel-react-best-practices', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z', '2026-02-18T07:02:48.921Z', NULL, '{"id":"Coachzas/email-ai-ingestion-pipeline/vercel-react-best-practices","name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":{"zh":"Vercel React 最佳实践指南是一份综合的性能优化指南，包含 57 条规则，帮助开发者优化 React 和 Next.js 应用","ja":"Vercel React ベストプラクティスガイドは、React と Next.js アプリのパフォーマンスを最適化するための包括的なガイドです","ko":"Vercel React 최적화 가이드는 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 포괄적인 가이드입니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 57 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 57 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js, com 57 regras em 8 categorias","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для React и Next.js, содержащее 57 правил в 8 категориях","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js، يتضمن 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vercel React 最佳实践指南","ja":"Vercel React ベストプラクティスガイド","ko":"Vercel React 최적화 가이드","es":"Mejores prácticas de Vercel para React","fr":"Meilleures pratiques Vercel pour React","de":"Vercel React Best Practices","pt":"Melhores Práticas Vercel React","ru":"Лучшие практики Vercel React","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لتفعل Vercel","en":"vercel-react-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"Vercel React 最佳实践指南是一份综合的性能优化指南，包含 57 条规则，帮助开发者优化 React 和 Next.js 应用","ja":"Vercel React ベストプラクティスガイドは、React と Next.js アプリのパフォーマンスを最適化するための包括的なガイドです","ko":"Vercel React 최적화 가이드는 React와 Next.js