e dados"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации правил","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга кода","Оптимизация бандлов для лучшей производительности","Лучшие практики для написания компонентов React","Руководство для реализации поиска данных"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لترتيب الأولويات للقواعد","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التلقائية للرمز","تحسين الحزم لتحقيق أفضل أداء","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة مكونات React","دليل لتنفيذ بحث البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","性能优化","React 优化","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成","应用效率"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","アプリケーションの効率"],"ko":["Vercel React","최적화 가이드","성능 최적화","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","애플리케이션의 효율성"],"es":["vercel react","mejores prácticas react","optimización de rendimiento react","next.js performance","react optimization","vercel best practices","react desarrollo","next.js desarrollo"],"fr":["vercel react","meilleures pratiques react","optimisation des performances react","next.js performance","react optimisation","vercel best practices","react développement","next.js développement"],"de":["vercel react","vercel best practices","react leistungsoptimierung","next.js leistung","react optimierung","vercel entwickler","react entwickler","next.js entwickler"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Programação","Tecnologia"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Программирование","Технологии"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تطوير الويب","البرمجة","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"Coachzas","repo":"email-ai-ingestion-pipeline","repoPath":"Coachzas/email-ai-ingestion-pipeline","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:02:48.921Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React和Next.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なReactとNext.jsのパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide for improved client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，适用于React和Next.js应用，使用57条规则，跨8个类别，按影响力优先排序，并利用Vercel的综合性能优化指南来改进客户端和服务器端数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"エージェントにReactとNext.jsアプリケーションの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって影響度に優先順位を付けて適用し、Vercelの包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを利用してクライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得とバンドル最適化を改善します。","ko":"리액트와 넥스트.js 애플리케이션에 대한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 에이전트에게 가능하게 하며, 57개의 규칙을 8개의 범주에 걸쳐 영향력에 따라 우선 순위를 정하여 적용하며, 버셀의 포괄적인 성능 최적화 가이드를 利用하여 클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 개선합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía integral de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel para una mejor obtención de datos del cliente y del servidor y optimización de empaquetado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réfactorisation et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide complet d''optimisation des performances de Vercel pour une meilleure récupération de données client et serveur et optimisation du regroupement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind und Vercels umfassenden Leistungsoptimierungsleitfaden für eine verbesserte Client- und Server-seitige Datenabfrage und Bundle-Optimierung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js usando 57 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e aproveitando o guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho da Vercel para melhorar a obtenção de dados do cliente e do servidor e a otimização de empacotamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, ранжированных по воздействию, и используя всесторонний гид по оптимизации производительности Vercel для улучшения извлечения данных клиента и сервера и оптимизации пакетирования.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تutomation تحسين وتوليد رمز لبرامج React و Next.js باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات ، مصنفة حسب التأثير ، وتوفير دليل شامل لتحسين الأداء من Vercel لتحسين استرجاع البيانات جانب العميل والخادم وتحسين التعبئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with improved data fetching strategies","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"],"zh":["自动化检查React组件的性能问题","生成优化的Next.js页面，具有改进的数据获取策略","重构现有的React和Next.js代码，以获得更好的性能和可维护性"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのパフォーマンス問題の自動化チェック","改善されたデータ取得戦略を備えた最適化されたNext.jsページの生成","既存のReactとNext.jsコードのリファクタリングにより、パフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트의 성능 문제 자동화 체크","데이터 가져오기 전략 개선된 최적화된 넥스트.js 페이지 생성","기존 리액트 및 넥스트.js 코드 리팩토링을 통한 성능 및 유지보수성 향상"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en componentes de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con estrategias de obtención de datos mejoradas","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec des stratégies d''obtention de données améliorées","Réfactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances et maintenabilité"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit verbesserten Datenabfragemethoden","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com estratégias de obtenção de dados aprimoradas","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho e manutenção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в компонентах React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с улучшенными стратегиями получения данных","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["توفير مراجعة التلقائية للرمز لمشاكل الأداء في مكونات React","توليد صفحات Next.js المُحسنة مع استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات المحسنة","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي من أجل أداء ومحتوى أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to Vercel''s predefined rules and categories","May require additional configuration for custom or complex applications"],"zh":["需要React和Next.js的知识","仅限于Vercel的预定义规则和类别","可能需要为自定义或复杂应用程序进行额外配置"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsの知識が必要","Vercelの事前定義されたルールとカテゴリに限定される","カスタムまたは複雑なアプリケーションの場合、追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["리액트 및 넥스트.js 지식 필요","버셀의 사전 정의된 규칙 및 범주로 제한됨","사용자 정의 또는 복잡한 애플리케이션의 경우 추가 구성이 필요한 경우가 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a las reglas y categorías predefinidas por Vercel","Puede requerir configuración adicional para aplicaciones personalizadas o complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux règles et catégories prédéfinies par Vercel","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des applications personnalisées ou complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf die von Vercel vorgegebenen Regeln und Kategorien","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für benutzerdefinierte oder komplexe Anwendungen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado às regras e categorias predefinidas da Vercel","Pode exigir configuração adicional para aplicações personalizadas ou complexas"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен предопределенными правилами и категориями Vercel","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для пользовательских или сложных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود بالقواعد والفئات المحددة مسبقا من Vercel","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا للبرامج المخصصة أو المعقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
