8 categorias","Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","Refatoração automática e geração de código","Priorização por impacto","Guia para implementação de busca de dados","Otimização de bundles"],"ru":["57 правил в 8 категориях","Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","Автоматическая рефакторинг и генерация кода","Приоритизация по влиянию","Руководство по реализации поиска данных","Оптимизация пакетов"],"ar":["57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js","إعادة هيكلة و توليد التعليمات البرمجية تلقائيًا","التحديد بالأثر","دليل لتنفيذ عملية استرجاع البيانات","تحسين الحزم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 应用优化","Next.js 应用优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React アプリ最適化","Next.js アプリ最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 최적화 가이드","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 애플리케이션 최적화","Next.js 애플리케이션 최적화"],"es":["mejores prácticas de Vercel","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","rendimiento de aplicaciones","refactorización automática","generación de código"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques Vercel","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","performances des applications","refactoring automatique","génération de code"],"de":["Vercel Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Leistung von Anwendungen","automatische Refactoring","Codegenerierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Refatoração","Geração de código","Otimização de bundles"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Рефакторинг","Генерация кода","Оптимизация пакетов"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تطوير الويب","إعادة هيكلة","توليد التعليمات البرمجية","تحسين الحزم"]}},"owner":"azizbekdevuz","repo":"rumi-ai","repoPath":"azizbekdevuz/rumi-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:02:59.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のアプリケーション パフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan un rendimiento óptimo de aplicaciones React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''un rendement optimisé des applications React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes Leistungsverhalten von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de frontend que precisam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 реактивного и Next.js приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن لتطبيقات React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s performance optimization guide for client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，适用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，使用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别，按影响力优先，并利用 Vercel 的性能优化指南进行客户端和服务器端数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって影響順に優先し、Vercel のパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを使用してクライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得とバンドル最適化を行う。","ko":"React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지에 대한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 8개 범주에 걸쳐 57개의 규칙을 영향력에 따라 우선순위로 지정하며, Vercel의 성능 최적화 가이드를 사용하여 클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel para la obtención y empaquetado de datos del lado del cliente y del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide d''optimisation des performances de Vercel pour la récupération et l''optimisation de bundle de données côté client et côté serveur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refaktorierung und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert und unter Nutzung der Leistungsoptimierungsanleitung von Vercel für die Client- und Server-seitige Datenerfassung und Bundle-Optimierung angewendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js usando 57 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto e utilizando o guia de otimização de desempenho da Vercel para busca e otimização de dados do lado do cliente e servidor.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, рейтинговых по воздействию, и используя руководство Vercel по оптимизации производительности для извлечения данных клиента и серверной части и оптимизации пакетов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير تلقائي لإعادة الهيكلة وتوليد الشفرة لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنّفة حسب التأثير، واستخدام دليل Vercel لتحسين الأداء لاسترجاع البيانات من جانب العميل وخادم الجانب والتحسين التعبئي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Reviewing code for performance issues and implementing data fetching best practices"],"zh":["自动优化新 React 组件的性能","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能","审查代码以查找性能问题并实施数据获取最佳实践"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンスを自動的に最適化する","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化された Next.js ページを生成する","既存の React と Next.js コードを再構成してパフォーマンスを向上させる","コードをレビューしてパフォーマンスの問題を特定し、データ取得のベストプラクティスを実施する"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트의 성능을 자동으로 최적화한다","서버 측 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성한다","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하여 성능을 개선한다","코드를 검토하여 성능 문제를 식별하고 데이터 가져오기 최적화 방법을 구현한다"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con renderizado del lado del servidor","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Revisar el código en busca de problemas de rendimiento y aplicar las mejores prácticas de obtención de datos"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu côté serveur","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Examiner le code pour les problèmes de performances et mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de récupération de données"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Erzeugen von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Server-seitigem Rendering","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für eine bessere Leistung","Überprüfen des Codes auf Leistungsprobleme und Umsetzen der besten Praktiken für die Datenerfassung"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização no servidor","Refatorar o código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho","Revisar o código para problemas de desempenho e implementar as melhores práticas de busca de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной отрисовкой","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Проверять код на наличие проблем с производительностью и реализовывать лучшие практики извлечения данных"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React الجديدة","توليد صفحات Next.js المُحسّنة مع تقديم الخادم","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة الحالية ل React و Next.js من أجل أداء أفضل","مراجعة الشفرة لمشاكل الأداء وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لاسترجاع البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application","Limited to frontend client application optimization"],"zh":["需要 React 或 Next.js 应用程序","仅限于前端客户端应用程序优化"],"ja":["React または Next.js アプリケーションが必要","フロントエンド クライアント アプリケーションの最適化のみ"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 애플리케이션이 필요합니다","프론트엔드 클라이언트 애플리케이션 최적화만 지원"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación de React o Next.js","Limitado a la optimización de aplicaciones de cliente de frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite une application React ou Next.js","Limité à l''optimisation des applications clientes de frontend"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von Client-Anwendungen für Frontend"],"pt":["Requer aplicativo React ou Next.js","Limitado à otimização de aplicativos de cliente frontend"],"ru":["Требуется приложение React или Next.js","Ограничен оптимизацией клиентских приложений frontend"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق React أو Next.js","محدود بتحسين تطبيقات العميل الأمامي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
