ab-case","AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["مراقبة التغييرات","كشف التغييرات","تنبيه التغييرات","النهج التجريبي","الارتفاعات","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion"]}},"owner":"jaxxstorm","repo":"sentinel","repoPath":"jaxxstorm/sentinel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:03:05.572Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated change management and experimental artifact-driven approaches.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更管理和实验性基于构件方法的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化された変更管理と実験的なアーティファクト駆動型アプローチを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 관리 및 실험적인 아티팩트 기반 접근 방식이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gestión de cambios automatizada y enfoques experimentales impulsados por artefactos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de changement automatisée et d''approches expérimentales basées sur des artefacts.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsbots, die eine automatisierte Änderungsverwaltung und experimentelle, an Artefakten orientierte Ansätze benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gerenciamento de alterações automatizado e abordagens experimentais baseadas em artefatos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное управление изменениями и экспериментальные подходы, основанные на артефактах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويريين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة التغييرات الآلية والمنهجيات التجريبية القائمة على المكونات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to initiate new changes using kebab-case names or descriptions, leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended user input and deriving change names from user descriptions, all while utilizing experimental artifact-driven methodologies.","zh":"赋予代理人使用短横线命名法或描述来启动新变化的能力，利用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行开放性用户输入，并从用户描述中推导出变化名称，同时利用实验性的基于构件方法论。","ja":"エージェントがケバブケース名または説明を使用して新しい変更を開始することを可能にし、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してオープンエンドユーザー入力を利用し、ユーザー説明から変更名を導出し、実験的なアーティファクト駆動型方法論を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 케밥 케이스 이름 또는 설명을 사용하여 새로운 변경을 시작할 수 있도록 하며, AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 개방형 사용자 입력을 활용하고, 사용자 설명에서 변경 이름을 유추하며, 실험적인 아티팩트 기반 접근 방식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar nuevos cambios utilizando nombres o descripciones en formato kebab-case, aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la entrada de usuario de preguntas abiertas y derivando nombres de cambios de descripciones de usuarios, todo mientras se utilizan metodologías experimentales impulsadas por artefactos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''initier de nouveaux changements en utilisant des noms ou des descriptions au format kebab-case, en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la saisie utilisateur de questions ouvertes et en dérivant les noms de changement à partir de descriptions d''utilisateurs, le tout en utilisant des méthodologies expérimentales basées sur des artefacts.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, neue Änderungen mit kebab-case-Namen oder -Beschreibungen zu initiieren, indem die AskUserQuestion-Tool für offene Benutzereingaben genutzt wird und Änderungsnamen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen abgeleitet werden, während experimentelle, an Artefakten orientierte Methoden verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a iniciar novas alterações usando nomes ou descrições em kebab-case, aproveitando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para entrada de usuário aberta e derivando nomes de alterações de descrições de usuário, tudo isso utilizando metodologias experimentais baseadas em artefatos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инициировать новые изменения, используя имена или описания в kebab-case, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для открытого ввода пользователя и получая имена изменений из описаний пользователя, все это при использовании экспериментальных подходов, основанных на артефактах.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من启动 التغييرات الجديدة باستخدام أسماء أو описات بالشكل kebab-case، والاستفادة من أداة AskUserQuestion للإدخال المفتوح للمستخدمين واستخلاص أسماء التغييرات من описات المستخدمين، وكل ذلك باستخدام منهجيات تجريبية قائمة على المكونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating change initiation with kebab-case naming conventions","Generating new change requests based on user descriptions","Deriving change names from open-ended user input using the AskUserQuestion tool"],"zh":["使用短横线命名约定自动化变更启动","根据用户描述生成新的变更请求","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具从开放性用户输入中推导出变更名称"],"ja":["ケバブケース命名規約を使用した変更開始の自動化","ユーザー説明に基づいて新しい変更リクエストを生成する","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してオープンエンドユーザー入力から変更名を導出する"],"ko":["케밥 케이스 명명 규칙을 사용한 변경 시작 자동화","사용자 설명을 기반으로 새로운 변경 요청을 생성하는 것","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 개방형 사용자 입력에서 변경 이름을 유추하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la iniciación de cambios con convenciones de nomenclatura kebab-case","Generación de nuevas solicitudes de cambio en función de las descripciones de los usuarios","Derivación de nombres de cambios de la entrada de usuario de preguntas abiertas utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''initiation de changements avec des conventions de nommage kebab-case","Génération de nouvelles demandes de changement sur la base de descriptions d''utilisateurs","Déduction de noms de changement à partir de la saisie utilisateur de questions ouvertes en utilisant l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Automatisierung der Änderungsinitiierung mit kebab-case-Benennungskonventionen","Erzeugung neuer Änderungsanfragen auf Basis von Benutzerbeschreibungen","Ableitung von Änderungsnamen aus offener Benutzereingabe mithilfe des AskUserQuestion-Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar a inicialização de alterações com convenções de nomenclatura em kebab-case","Gerar novos pedidos de alteração com base em descrições de usuário","Derivar nomes de alterações de entrada de usuário aberta usando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Автоматизировать инициацию изменений с использованием соглашений об именах в kebab-case","Генерировать новые запросы на изменения на основе описаний пользователя","Получать имена изменений из открытого ввода пользователя, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["تأتمتة بدء التغييرات باستخدام الاتفاقيات المتبعة في التسمية بالشكل kebab-case","توليد طلبات تغيير جديدة بناءً على وصفات المستخدم","استخلاص أسماء التغييرات من إدخال المستخدم المفتوح باستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear user input or description of the change","Dependent on the AskUserQuestion tool for user interaction"],"zh":["需要清晰的用户输入或对变化的描述","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户交互"],"ja":["明確なユーザー入力または変更の説明が必要","ユーザーとのやり取りにはAskUserQuestionツールに依存する"],"ko":["明确한 사용자 입력 또는 변경 설명이 필요함","사용자 상호작용에는 AskUserQuestion 툴에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de usuario clara o descripción del cambio","Dependiente de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la interacción con el usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur claire ou une description du changement","Dépend de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour l''interaction avec l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Benutzereingabe oder Beschreibung der Änderung","Abhängig vom AskUserQuestion-Tool für die Benutzerinteraktion"],"pt":["Exige entrada de usuário clara ou descrição da alteração","Depende da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para interação com o usuário"],"ru":["Требует четкого ввода пользователя или описания изменения","Зависит от инструмента AskUserQuestion для взаимодействия с пользователем"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم الواضح أو وصف التغيير","يعتمد على أداة AskUserQuestion للتفاعل مع المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
