 de cambio en kebab-case","Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Permite la creación de cambios personalizados"],"fr":["Lancez un nouveau changement avec l''approche expérimentale d''artefacts","Demandez à l''utilisateur une description de ce qu''il souhaite construire","Dériver un nom de changement en kebab-case","Utilisez l''outil AskUserQuestion","Permet la création de changements personnalisés"],"de":["Starten Sie eine neue Änderung mit dem experimentellen Artefakt-Ansatz","Fordern Sie den Benutzer auf, eine Beschreibung dessen zu geben, was er erstellen möchte","Leiten Sie einen Änderungsname in kebab-case ab","Verwenden Sie das Tool AskUserQuestion","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Änderungen"],"pt":["Inicie uma nova alteração com facilidade","Abordagem baseada em artefatos","Fornecer nome ou descrição do cambio","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Derivação de nome em kebab-case","Desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Начните новое изменение с легкостью","Подход на основе артефактов","Предоставьте имя или описание изменения","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Выделение имени в kebab-case","Эффективная разработка"],"ar":["ابدأ تغييرًا جديدًا بسهولة","النهج القائم على المكونات","قدم اسمًا أو وصفًا للتغيير","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","استخراج الاسم في صيغة kebab-case","التطوير الفعّال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-new-change","实验性构件驱动方法","开始新的变更","AskUserQuestion工具","kebab-case名称","开发者工具"],"ja":["openspec-new-change","実験的アーティファクト駆動アプローチ","新しい変更の開始","AskUserQuestionツール","kebab-case名称","開発者ツール"],"ko":["openspec-new-change","실험적 아티팩트駆동 접근법","新的 변경의 시작","AskUserQuestionツール","kebab-case 이름","개발자 도구"],"es":["nuevo cambio","artefactos experimentales","desarrollo de software","skill de cambio","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","desarrollo ágil"],"fr":["nouveau changement","artefacts expérimentaux","développement de logiciels","skill de changement","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","développement agile"],"de":["neue Änderung","experimentelle Artefakte","Softwareentwicklung","Änderungsskill","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","agiles Entwicklung"],"pt":["abordagem experimental","alterações","artefatos","desenvolvimento","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case","eficiência","facilidade","cambio"],"ru":["экспериментальный подход","изменения","артефакты","разработка","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case","эффективность","легкость","изменение"],"ar":["النهج التجريبي","التغييرات","المكونات","التطوير","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case","الفعالية","السهولة","التغيير"]}},"owner":"carlosapgomes","repo":"eqmd","repoPath":"carlosapgomes/eqmd","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:03:06.954Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Agile Development Agents requiring dynamic project initialization and artifact-driven workflow management.","zh":"适用于需要动态项目初始化和基于工件的工作流管理的敏捷开发代理的理想选择。","ja":"動的プロジェクト初期化とアーティファクト駆動のワークフローマネジメントを必要とするアジャイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"다이나믹 프로젝트 초기화 및 아티팩트 기반 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 애자일 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo ágil que requieren una inicialización de proyecto dinámica y una gestión de flujo de trabajo basada en artefactos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Agile nécessitant une initialisation de projet dynamique et une gestion de flux de travail basée sur les artefacts.","de":"Ideal für Agile-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine dynamische Projektinitialisierung und eine artefaktbasierte Workflow-Verwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Ágil que exigem inicialização de projeto dinâmica e gestão de fluxo de trabalho baseada em artefatos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Agile-разработки, требующих динамической инициализации проектов и управления рабочим процессом на основе артефактов.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء تنمية مرنة الذين يتطلبون تهيئة مشروع ديناميكية وإدارة تدفق عمل قائم على الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to initiate new changes using an experimental artifact-driven approach, leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended user input and deriving kebab-case names for project organization, all while integrating with descriptions and change names in kebab-case format.","zh":"赋予代理使用实验性的基于工件的方法来启动新的更改，利用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行开放式用户输入，并从用户描述中推导出短横线命名法的名称，同时集成描述和更改名称以短横线命名法格式。","ja":"エージェントが実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用して新しい変更を開始できるようにし、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してオープンエンドユーザー入力を可能にし、ユーザーの説明からケバブケースの名前を導出し、説明と変更名をケバブケース形式で統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 실험적인 아티팩트 기반 접근 방식을 사용하여 새로운 변경을 시작할 수 있도록 하며, AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 개방형 사용자 입력을 가능하게 하고, 사용자 설명에서 케밥 케이스 이름을 유도하며, 설명 및 변경 이름을 케밥 케이스 형식으로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar nuevos cambios utilizando un enfoque experimental basado en artefactos, aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la entrada de usuario de preguntas abiertas y derivando nombres en formato kebab-case para la organización de proyectos, todo mientras se integra con descripciones y nombres de cambios en formato kebab-case.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''initier de nouveaux changements en utilisant une approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts, en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une saisie utilisateur à questions ouvertes et en dérivant des noms en format kebab-case pour l''organisation de projets, le tout en s''intégrant avec des descriptions et des noms de changements au format kebab-case.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Änderungen mithilfe eines experimentellen, artefaktbasierten Ansatzes zu initiieren, der das Tool AskUserQuestion für offene Benutzereingaben nutzt und kebab-case-Namen für die Projektorganisation ableitet, während es sich in Beschreibungen und Änderungsnamen im kebab-case-Format integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a iniciar novas alterações usando uma abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos, utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para entrada de usuário aberta e derivando nomes em formato kebab-case para organização de projetos, tudo isso integrando-se com descrições e nomes de alterações no formato kebab-case.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инициировать новые изменения с помощью экспериментального подхода, основанного на артефактах, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для открытого ввода пользователя и получая имена в формате kebab-case для организации проектов, все это интегрируясь с описаниями и именами изменений в формате kebab-case.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إطلاق التغييرات الجديدة باستخدام نهج تجريبي قائم على الملفات، مستخدمين أداة AskUserQuestion لمدخلات المستخدم المفتوحة واستخراج أسماء المشاريع في تنسيق kebab-case، مع التكامل مع_descriptions وأسماء التغييرات بتنسيق kebab-case."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new projects with user-defined change names","Deriving kebab-case names from user descriptions for organized project structures","Managing artifact-driven workflows for experimental projects"],"zh":["使用用户定义的更改名称初始化新项目","从用户描述中推导出短横线命名法的名称以组织项目结构","管理实验项目的基于工件的工作流"],"ja":["ユーザー定義の変更名を使用して新しいプロジェクトを初期化する","ユーザーの説明からケバブケースの名前を導出してプロジェクト構造を整理する","実験プロジェクトのアーティファクト駆動ワークフローを管理する"],"ko":["사용자 정의 변경 이름을 사용하여 새로운 프로젝트를 초기화하는 것","사용자 설명에서 케밥 케이스 이름을 유도하여 프로젝트 구조를 조직화하는 것","실험 프로젝트를 위한 아티팩트 기반 워크플로우를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos proyectos con nombres de cambios definidos por el usuario","Derivación de nombres en formato kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuario para estructuras de proyectos organizadas","Gestión de flujos de trabajo basados en artefactos para proyectos experimentales"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux projets avec des noms de changements définis par l''utilisateur","Déduction de noms au format kebab-case à partir de descriptions utilisateur pour des structures de projets organisées","Gestion de flux de travail basés sur les artefacts pour les projets expérimentaux"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer Projekte mit benutzerdefinierten Änderungsnamen","Ableitung von kebab-case-Namen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen für organisierte Projektstrukturen","Verwaltung von artefaktbasierten Workflows für experimentelle Projekte"],"pt":["Inicializar novos projetos com nomes de alterações definidos pelo usuário","Derivar nomes em formato kebab-case a partir de descrições de usuário para estruturas de projeto organizadas","Gerenciar fluxos de trabalho baseados em artefatos para projetos experimentais"],"ru":["Инициализация новых проектов с именами изменений, определенных пользователем","Получение имен в формате kebab-case из описаний пользователя для организованных структур проектов","Управление рабочими процессами на основе артефактов для экспериментальных проектов"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع جديدة بأسماء التغييرات المحددة من قبل المستخدم","استخراج أسماء المشاريع بتنسيق kebab-case من описات المستخدم من أجل هيكل مشروع منظم","إدارة تدفق العمل القائم على الملفات للمشاريع التجريبية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for change name or description","Dependent on the AskUserQuestion tool for user interaction"],"zh":["需要用户输入更改名称或描述","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户交互"],"ja":["変更名または説明のユーザー入力を必要とする","ユーザーとのやり取りにAskUserQuestionツールに依存する"],"ko":["변경 이름 또는 설명에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요함","사용자 상호 작용을 위해 AskUserQuestion 툴에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para el nombre o la descripción del cambio","Depende de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la interacción con el usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une saisie utilisateur pour le nom ou la description du changement","Dépend de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour l''interaction avec l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingaben für den Änderungsnamen oder die Beschreibung","Hängt vom Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerinteraktion ab"],"pt":["Exige entrada de usuário para nome de alteração ou descrição","Dependente da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para interação do usuário"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для имени изменения или описания","Зависит от инструмента AskUserQuestion для взаимодействия с пользователем"],"ar":["يتطلب مدخلات المستخدم لأسماء التغييرات أو الوصف","يعتمد على أداة AskUserQuestion للتفاعل مع المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
