ctuels et autorisés pour les développeurs","de":"Die OpenAI-Dokumentation bietet aktuelle und autorisierte Anleitungen für Entwickler","pt":"Acesse a documentação oficial do OpenAI para desenvolvedores e obtenha orientação atualizada sobre as ferramentas do MCP.","ru":"Доступ к официальной документации OpenAI для разработчиков и получение актуальных рекомендаций по инструментам MCP.","ar":"الوصول إلى وثائق OpenAI الرسمية للمطورين والحصول على إرشادات حديثة حول أدوات MCP.","en":"自用备份"},"definition":{"en":"自用备份"},"features":{"zh":["使用 MCP 服务器搜索 OpenAI 文档","快速找到相关文档","获取最新的 OpenAI 相关信息","优先使用 MCP 服务器而不是 web 搜索","开发者相关的最新信息"],"ja":["MCP サーバーを使用して OpenAI ドキュメントを検索","関連ドキュメントを迅速に探す","最新の OpenAI 関連情報を入手","MCP サーバーを web 検索よりも優先する","開発者向けの最新情報"],"ko":["MCP 서버를 사용하여 OpenAI 문서를 검색","관련 문서를 빠르게 찾기","최신 OpenAI 관련 정보를 얻기","MCP 서버를 웹 검색보다 우선으로 사용","개발자 관련 최신 정보"],"es":["Búsqueda de documentación de OpenAI","Acceso a la documentación oficial de OpenAI","Herramientas de desarrollo de OpenAI","Soporte para proyectos de desarrollo","Documentación actualizada y autorizada"],"fr":["Recherche de documentation OpenAI","Accès à la documentation officielle d''OpenAI","Outils de développement OpenAI","Support pour les projets de développement","Documentation à jour et autorisée"],"de":["Suche nach OpenAI-Dokumentation","Zugriff auf die offizielle OpenAI-Dokumentation","OpenAI-Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für Entwicklungsprojekte","Aktuelle und autorisierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Pesquisa de documentos do OpenAI","Acesso às ferramentas do MCP","Orientação atualizada para desenvolvedores","Respostas precisas para perguntas do OpenAI","Priorização das ferramentas do MCP sobre a pesquisa na web"],"ru":["Поиск документов OpenAI","Доступ к инструментам MCP","Актуальные рекомендации для разработчиков","Точные ответы на вопросы OpenAI","Приоритет инструментов MCP над поиском в интернете"],"ar":["بحث وثائق OpenAI","الوصول إلى أدوات MCP","إرشادات حديثة للمطورين","إجابات دقيقة للأسئلة المتعلقة ب OpenAI","الأولوية لأدوات MCP على البحث على الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI 文档","MCP 服务器","开发者文档","最新信息","快速搜索","权威来源","开发者工具","AI 文档"],"ja":["OpenAI ドキュメント","MCP サーバー","開発者ドキュメント","最新情報","迅速検索","権威的な情報源","開発者ツール","AI ドキュメント"],"ko":["OpenAI 문서","MCP 서버","개발자 문서","최신 정보","빠른 검색","권위적인 출처","개발자 도구","AI 문서"],"es":["documentación de OpenAI","desarrollo de OpenAI","herramientas de OpenAI","soporte de OpenAI","recursos de OpenAI","desarrollo de IA","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["documentation OpenAI","développement OpenAI","outils OpenAI","support OpenAI","ressources OpenAI","développement d''IA","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["OpenAI-Dokumentation","OpenAI-Entwicklung","OpenAI-Tools","OpenAI-Unterstützung","OpenAI-Ressourcen","KI-Entwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["OpenAI","Documentação do OpenAI","Ferramentas do MCP","Desenvolvedores","Orientação técnica","Pesquisa de documentos","Respostas precisas","Priorização das ferramentas do MCP"],"ru":["OpenAI","Документация OpenAI","Инструменты MCP","Разработчики","Технические рекомендации","Поиск документов","Точные ответы","Приоритет инструментов MCP"],"ar":["OpenAI","وثائق OpenAI","أدوات MCP","المطورين","الإرشادات الفنية","بحث الوثائق","الإجابات الدقيقة","الأولوية لأدوات MCP"]}},"owner":"242282218","repo":"xzcccc_smart_media","repoPath":"242282218/xzcccc_smart_media","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-docs","description":"Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI products or APIs and needs up-to-date official documentation with citations (for example: Codex, Responses API, Chat Completions, Apps SDK, Agents SDK, Realtime, model capabilities or limits); prioritize OpenAI docs MCP tools and restrict any fallback browsing to official OpenAI domains.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sectio","body":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sections and quote/paraphrase accurately.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__list_openai_docs` only when you need to browse or discover pages without a clear query.\n\n## OpenAI product snapshots\n\n1. Apps SDK: Build ChatGPT apps by providing a web component UI and an MCP server that exposes your app''s tools to ChatGPT.\n2. Responses API: A unified endpoint designed for stateful, multimodal, tool-using interactions in agentic workflows.\n3. Chat Completions API: Generate a model response from a list of messages comprising a conversation.\n4. Codex: OpenAI''s coding agent for software development that can write, understand, review, and debug code.\n5. gpt-oss: Open-weight OpenAI reasoning models (gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b) released under the Apache 2.0 license.\n6. Realtime API: Build low-latency, multimodal experiences including natural speech-to-speech conversations.\n7. Agents SDK: A toolkit for building agentic apps where a model can use tools and context, hand off to other agents, stream partial results, and keep a full trace.\n\n## If MCP server is missing\n\nIf MCP tools fail or no OpenAI docs resources are available:\n\n1. Run the install command yourself: `codex mcp add openaiDeveloperDocs --url https://developers.openai.com/mcp`\n2. If it fails due to permissions/sandboxing, immediately retry the same command with escalated permissions and include a 1-sentence justification for approval. Do not ask the user to run it yet.\n3. Only if the escalated attempt fails, ask the user to run the install command.\n4. Ask the user to restart Codex.\n5. Re-run the doc search/fetch after restart.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the product scope (Codex, OpenAI API, or ChatGPT Apps SDK) and the task.\n2. Search docs with a precise query.\n3. Fetch the best page and the specific section needed (use `anchor` when possible).\n4. Answer with concise guidance and cite the doc source.\n5. Provide code snippets only when the docs support them.\n\n## Quality rules\n\n- Treat OpenAI docs as the source of truth; avoid speculation.\n- Keep quotes short and within policy limits; prefer paraphrase with citations.\n- If multiple pages differ, call out the difference and cite both.\n- If docs do not cover the user’s need, say so and offer next steps.\n\n## Tooling notes\n\n- Always use MCP doc tools before any web search for OpenAI-related questions.\n- If the MCP server is installed but returns no meaningful results, then use web search as a fallback.\n- When falling back to web search, restrict to official OpenAI domains (developers.openai.com, platform.openai.com) and cite sources.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:03:15.050Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing authoritative OpenAI developer documentation and guidance","zh":"非常适合需要权威的 OpenAI 开发者文档和指导的 AI 代理","ja":"OpenAI 開発者ドキュメントやガイダンスを必要とする AI エージェントに最適","ko":"OpenAI 개발자 문서 및 가이드가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan documentación y orientación autorizada de desarrolladores de OpenAI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de documentation et de conseils autorisés des développeurs d''OpenAI","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die autorisierte OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation und -anleitung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que necessitam de documentação e orientação autorizadas de desenvolvedores da OpenAI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется авторитетная документация и руководство разработчиков OpenAI","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الإيضاح الذكية التي تحتاج إلى توثيق وتوجيه مطورين OpenAI موثوق به"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize the OpenAI developer docs MCP server for precise and current information, leveraging tools like `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` and `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` for efficient knowledge retrieval, prioritizing MCP tools over web searches","zh":"使代理能够利用 OpenAI 开发者文档 MCP 服务器获取精确和最新的信息，利用像 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` 和 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` 这样的工具进行高效的知识检索，优先使用 MCP 工具而不是网络搜索","ja":"OpenAI 開発者ドキュメント MCP サーバーを使用して正確で最新の情報を取得できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` や `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` などのツールを使用して効率的な知識の取得を行い、MCP ツールを Web 検索よりも優先する","ko":"에이전트가 OpenAI 개발자 문서 MCP 서버를 사용하여 정확하고 최신 정보를 검색할 수 있도록 하며, `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` 및 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 효율적인 지식 검색을 수행하며, MCP 도구를 웹 검색보다 우선하여 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar el servidor de documentación de desarrolladores de OpenAI de MCP para obtener información precisa y actualizada, aprovechando herramientas como `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` y `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` para una recuperación de conocimientos eficiente, priorizando las herramientas de MCP sobre las búsquedas web","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser le serveur de documentation des développeurs d''OpenAI de MCP pour obtenir des informations précises et à jour, en exploitant des outils comme `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` et `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` pour une récupération efficace des connaissances, en donnant la priorité aux outils de MCP par rapport aux recherches web","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation-MCP-Server zu nutzen, um präzise und aktuelle Informationen zu erhalten, indem Tools wie `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` und `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` für eine effiziente Wissensrückgewinnung eingesetzt werden, MCP-Tools gegenüber Websuchen priorisierend","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem o servidor de documentação de desenvolvedores da OpenAI MCP para obter informações precisas e atualizadas, utilizando ferramentas como `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` e `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` para recuperação eficiente de conhecimento, priorizando as ferramentas MCP em relação às pesquisas na web","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать сервер документации разработчиков OpenAI MCP для получения точной и актуальной информации, используя инструменты seperti `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` и `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` для эффективного извлечения знаний, отдавая предпочтение инструментам MCP над веб-поиском","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من استخدام خادم وثائق مطورين OpenAI MCP لاستخلاص المعلومات الدقيقة والمحدثة، باستخدام أدوات مثل `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` و `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` لاسترجاع المعرفة بكفاءة، وأعطى الأولوية لأدوات MCP على عمليات البحث على الويب"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching OpenAI developer docs for specific API guidance","Fetching exact documentation sections for reference","Providing accurate and up-to-date information on OpenAI-related queries"],"zh":["搜索 OpenAI 开发者文档以获取特定的 API 指南","获取确切的文档节以供参考","提供有关 OpenAI 相关查询的准确和最新信息"],"ja":["特定の API ガイダンスを取得するために OpenAI 開発者ドキュメントを検索する","参照用に正確なドキュメントのセクションを取得する","OpenAI 関連のクエリについて正確で最新の情報を提供する"],"ko":["특정 API 가이드를 얻기 위해 OpenAI 개발자 문서를 검색","참고용으로 정확한 문서 섹션을 가져오기","OpenAI 관련 쿼리에 대해 정확하고 최신 정보 제공"],"es":["Buscar documentación de desarrolladores de OpenAI para obtener orientación específica de API","Recuperar secciones exactas de documentación para referencia","Proporcionar información precisa y actualizada sobre consultas relacionadas con OpenAI"],"fr":["Rechercher la documentation des développeurs d''OpenAI pour obtenir des conseils spécifiques d''API","Récupérer des sections exactes de documentation pour référence","Fournir des informations précises et à jour sur les requêtes liées à OpenAI"],"de":["OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation nach spezifischer API-Anleitung durchsuchen","Exakte Dokumentationsabschnitte zur Referenz abrufen","Genauere und aktuelle Informationen zu OpenAI-bezogenen Anfragen bereitstellen"],"pt":["Pesquisar documentação de desenvolvedores da OpenAI para orientação de API específica","Buscar seções exatas de documentação para referência","Fornecer informações precisas e atualizadas sobre consultas relacionadas à OpenAI"],"ru":["Поиск документации разработчиков OpenAI для конкретного руководства по API","Поиск точных разделов документации для ссылки","Предоставление точной и актуальной информации по запросам, связанным с OpenAI"],"ar":["بحث وثائق مطورين OpenAI لإرشادات API محددة","استرجاع أقسام وثائق دقيقة للاستشهاد","توفير معلومات دقيقة ومحدثة حول استفسارات متعلقة ب OpenAI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI developer docs MCP server installation"," Falls back to web search if MCP server returns no meaningful results"],"zh":["需要安装 OpenAI 开发者文档 MCP 服务器","如果 MCP 服务器返回没有有意义的结果，则回退到网络搜索"],"ja":["OpenAI 開発者ドキュメント MCP サーバーのインストールが必要","MCP サーバーが意味のある結果を返さない場合、Web 検索にフォールバックする"],"ko":["OpenAI 개발자 문서 MCP 서버 설치 필요","MCP 서버가 유의미한 결과를 반환하지 않는 경우 웹 검색으로 폴백"],"es":["Requiere instalación del servidor de documentación de desarrolladores de OpenAI de MCP","Vuelve a la búsqueda web si el servidor de MCP no devuelve resultados significativos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du serveur de documentation des développeurs d''OpenAI de MCP","Revertit à la recherche web si le serveur de MCP ne retourne pas de résultats significatifs"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation-MCP-Servers","Fällt auf die Websuche zurück, wenn der MCP-Server keine sinnvollen Ergebnisse zurückgibt"],"pt":["Requer instalação do servidor de documentação de desenvolvedores da OpenAI MCP","Recorre à pesquisa na web se o servidor MCP não retornar resultados significativos"],"ru":["Требует установки сервера документации разработчиков OpenAI MCP","Переходит к веб-поиску, если сервер MCP не возвращает осмысленные результаты"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت خادم وثائق مطورين OpenAI MCP","يعود إلى البحث على الويب إذا لم يُرجع خادم MCP نتائج ذات معنى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
