mienta de desarrollo que permite agregar estilos a componentes y páginas web de manera rápida y eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil de développement qui permet d''ajouter des styles aux composants et pages web de manière rapide et efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Entwicklungstool, das das Hinzufügen von Styles zu Komponenten und Webseiten ermöglicht","pt":"O Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores que permite criar estilos personalizados para componentes e páginas web","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это инструмент для разработчиков, который позволяет создавать индивидуальные стили для компонентов и веб-страниц","ar":"تايلويند سي إس إس هو أداة لمطوري الويب لإنشاء أنماط مخصصة للمكونات وصفحات الويب","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["响应式设计支持","暗黑模式实现","重复模式提取","间距和布局调试","简单的类名使用"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザインのサポート","ダークモードの実装","繰り返しのパターン抽出","スペーシングとレイアウトのデバッグ","シンプルなクラス名の使用"],"ko":["반응형 디자인 지원","다크 모드 구현","반복 패턴 추출","간격 및 레이아웃 디버깅","단순한 클래스 이름 사용"],"es":["Estilos personalizados para componentes y páginas web","Diseño responsivo","Modo oscuro","Patrones de diseño reutilizables","Depuración de espaciado y diseño"],"fr":["Styles personnalisés pour les composants et les pages web","Conception responsive","Mode sombre","Modèles de conception réutilisables","Débogage de l''espacement et de la conception"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Styles für Komponenten und Webseiten","Responsives Design","Dunkles Design","Wiederverwendbare Designmuster","Fehlerbehebung bei Abständen und Design"],"pt":["Criação de estilos personalizados para componentes","Desenvolvimento de páginas responsivas","Implementação de modo noturno","Extração de padrões repetidos em componentes","Depuração de problemas de espaçamento ou layout"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных стилей для компонентов","Разработка адаптивных страниц","Реализация темного режима","Извлечение повторяющихся шаблонов в компонентах","Отладка проблем с отступами или макетом"],"ar":["إنشاء أنماط مخصصة للمكونات","تطوير صفحات ذات تصميم مستجيب","تنفيذ وضع الليل","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة في المكونات","تصحيح أخطاء الفواصل أو تصميم الصفحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","响应式设计","暗黑模式","CSS框架","前端开发","Web开发"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","CSSフレームワーク","フロントエンド開発","Web開発"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","반응형 디자인","다크 모드","CSS 프레임워크","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","estilos personalizados","diseño responsivo","modo oscuro","patrones de diseño","depuración de espaciado","CSS"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","styles personnalisés","conception responsive","mode sombre","modèles de conception","débogage de l''espacement","CSS"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Styles","responsives Design","dunkles Design","Designmuster","Fehlerbehebung bei Abständen","CSS"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","estilos personalizados","componentes responsivos","modo noturno","debugging de layout"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","индивидуальные стили","адаптивные компоненты","темный режим","отладка макета"],"ar":["تايلويند سي إس إس","تطوير الويب","أنماط مخصصة","مكونات ذات تصميم مستجيب","وضع الليل","تصحيح أخطاء التصميم"]}},"owner":"ndeblauw","repo":"kartoffel","repoPath":"ndeblauw/kartoffel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:03:38.462Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS styling with Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and responsive design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效CSS样式的前端代理，使用Tailwind CSS v4模式和响应式设计能力。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なCSSスタイリングを必要とする場合に最適で、Tailwind CSS v4パターンとレスポンシブデザイン機能を使用できます。","ko":"효율적인 CSS 스타일링이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Tailwind CSS v4 패턴과 반응형 디자인 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un estilo CSS eficiente con patrones de Tailwind CSS v4 y capacidades de diseño responsivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un style CSS efficace avec des modèles Tailwind CSS v4 et des capacités de conception réactive.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine effiziente CSS-Stilisierung mit Tailwind-CSS-v4-Mustern und responsivem Design benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de estilização CSS eficiente com padrões do Tailwind CSS v4 e capacidades de design responsivo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима эффективная стилизация CSS с использованием шаблонов Tailwind CSS v4 и возможностей адаптивного дизайна.","ar":"مثالي ليعملاء واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق CSS فعال باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS v4 وقدرات التصميم الاستجابي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize Tailwind CSS classes for styling HTML, leveraging existing project conventions and implementing dark mode, while debugging spacing or layout issues with ease, utilizing responsive design principles.","zh":"赋予代理利用Tailwind CSS类来样式HTML，利用现有的项目约定并实现暗黑模式，同时轻松调试间距或布局问题，利用响应式设计原则。","ja":"エージェントがTailwind CSSクラスを使用してHTMLをスタイリングし、既存のプロジェクト規約を利用し、ダークモードを実装し、レスポンシブデザイン原則を使用して間隔やレイアウトの問題を簡単にデバッグできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML을 스타일링할 수 있으며, 기존 프로젝트 규약을 활용하고 다크 모드를 구현하며, 반응형 디자인 원리를 사용하여 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 쉽게 디버깅할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar clases de Tailwind CSS para dar estilo a HTML, aprovechando las convenciones del proyecto existente e implementando el modo oscuro, mientras depuran problemas de espaciado o diseño con facilidad, utilizando principios de diseño responsivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des classes Tailwind CSS pour styler le HTML, en exploitant les conventions de projet existantes et en mettant en œuvre le mode sombre, tout en déboguant les problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition avec facilité, en utilisant des principes de conception réactive.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zur Stilisierung von HTML zu verwenden, vorhandene ProjektKonventionen zu nutzen und den Dunkelmodus zu implementieren, während sie Probleme mit Abständen oder Layouts mithilfe responsiver Designprinzipien leicht debuggen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem classes do Tailwind CSS para estilização de HTML, aproveitando convenções de projeto existentes e implementando modo escuro, além de depurar problemas de espaçamento ou layout com facilidade, utilizando princípios de design responsivo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать классы Tailwind CSS для стилизации HTML, используя существующие проектные конвенции и реализуя темный режим, а также отлаживать проблемы с пробелами или макетом с легкостью, используя принципы адаптивного дизайна.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من استخدام فئات Tailwind CSS لتنسيق HTML، واستخدام الاتفاقيات المشروع الحالية وتنفيذ الوضع الداكن، بالإضافة إلى تصحيح أخطاء المسافة أو تخطيط بسهولة، باستخدام مبادئ التصميم الاستجابي."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding styles to components or pages with Tailwind CSS","Implementing dark mode and responsive design","Debugging spacing or layout issues with Tailwind CSS classes"],"zh":["使用Tailwind CSS为组件或页面添加样式","实现暗黑模式和响应式设计","使用Tailwind CSS类调试间距或布局问题"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSを使用してコンポーネントまたはページにスタイルを追加する","ダークモードとレスポンシブデザインを実装する","Tailwind CSSクラスを使用して間隔やレイアウトの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 컴포넌트 또는 페이지에 스타일을 추가하는 것","다크 모드와 반응형 디자인을 구현하는 것","Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Agregar estilos a componentes o páginas con Tailwind CSS","Implementar el modo oscuro y el diseño responsivo","Depurar problemas de espaciado o diseño con clases de Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Ajouter des styles aux composants ou pages avec Tailwind CSS","Mettre en œuvre le mode sombre et la conception réactive","Déboguer les problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition avec des classes Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Stile hinzufügen zu Komponenten oder Seiten mit Tailwind CSS","Dunkelmodus und responsives Design implementieren","Probleme mit Abständen oder Layouts mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen debuggen"],"pt":["Adicionar estilos a componentes ou páginas com Tailwind CSS","Implementar modo escuro e design responsivo","Depurar problemas de espaçamento ou layout com classes do Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Добавление стилей к компонентам или страницам с помощью Tailwind CSS","Реализация темного режима и адаптивного дизайна","Отладка проблем с пробелами или макетом с помощью классов Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["إضافة أنماط إلى المكونات أو الصفحات باستخدام Tailwind CSS","تنفيذ الوضع الداكن والتصميم الاستجابي","تصحيح أخطاء المسافة أو التخطيط باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of HTML and Tailwind CSS conventions","Limited to Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation"],"zh":["需要HTML和Tailwind CSS约定的知识","仅限于Tailwind CSS v4模式和文档"],"ja":["HTMLとTailwind CSS規約の知識が必要","Tailwind CSS v4パターンとドキュメントのみに限定"],"ko":["HTML과 Tailwind CSS 규약에 대한 지식이 필요","Tailwind CSS v4 패턴과 문서에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de HTML y convenciones de Tailwind CSS","Limitado a patrones y documentación de Tailwind CSS v4"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en HTML et en conventions Tailwind CSS","Limité aux modèles et à la documentation Tailwind CSS v4"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von HTML und Tailwind-CSS-Konventionen","Begrenzt auf Muster und Dokumentation von Tailwind CSS v4"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de HTML e convenções do Tailwind CSS","Limitado a padrões e documentação do Tailwind CSS v4"],"ru":["Требует знания HTML и конвенций Tailwind CSS","Ограничен шаблонами и документацией Tailwind CSS v4"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة HTML وأتفاقيات Tailwind CSS","محدود بنماط ووثائق Tailwind CSS v4"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ndeblauw/geo.gezondheidsmakers.be/tailwindcss-development', 'community', 'ndeblauw', 'geo.gezondheidsmakers.be', 'ndeblauw/geo.gezondheidsmakers.be', 'tailwindcss-development', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z', '2026-02-18T07:04:21.461Z', NULL, '{"id":"ndeblauw/geo.gezondheidsmakers.be/tailwindcss-development","name":"tailwindcss-development","description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能，用于构建响应式和可维护的Web应用程序","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキルを使用して、レスポンシブでメンテナンス性の高いWebアプリケーションを構築する","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 기술을 사용하여 반응형 및 유지 보수 가능한 웹 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Tailwind CSS es una herramienta para agregar estilos a componentes y páginas web de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil pour ajouter des styles aux composants et pages web de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Tool, um Styles zu Komponenten und Webseiten effizient hinzuzufügen","en":"Geo services for intranet.gezondheidsmakers.be"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发指南","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発ガイド","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 가이드","es":"Desarrollo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Développement avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Tailwind CSS Entwicklung","en":"tailwindcss-development"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS开发技能，用于构建响应式和可维护的Web应用程序","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発スキルを使用して、レスポンシブでメンテナンス性の高いWebアプリケーションを構築する","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발 기술을 사용하여 반응형 및 유지 보수 가능한 웹 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Tailwind CSS es una herramienta para agregar estilos a componentes y páginas web de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil pour ajouter des styles aux composants et pages web de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Tool, um Styles zu Komponenten und Webseiten effizient hinzuzufügen","en":"Geo services for intranet.gezondheidsmakers.be"},"definition":{"en":"Geo services for intranet.gezondheidsmakers.be"},"features":{"zh":["响应式设计","暗黑模式","样式优化","组件化","调试工具"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","スタイル最適化","コンポーネント化","デバッグツール"],"ko":["반응형 디자인","다크 모드","스타일 최적화","컴포넌트화","디버깅 도구"],"es":["Estilos personalizados para componentes y páginas","Diseño responsivo","Modo oscuro","Patrones reutilizables","Depuración de espaciado y diseño"],"fr":["Styles personnalisés pour les composants et les pages","Conception réactive","Mode sombre","Modèles réutilisables","Débogage de l''espacement et de la conception"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Styles für Komponenten und Seiten","Responsives Design","Dunkles Design","Wiederverwendbare Muster","Fehlerbehebung bei Abständen und Design"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","响应式设计","暗黑模式","样式优化","组件化","CSS框架"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","スタイル最適化","コンポーネント化","CSSフレームワーク"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","반응형 디자인","다크 모드","스타일 최적화","컴포넌트화","CSS 프레임워크"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","estilos personalizados","diseño responsivo","modo oscuro","patrones reutilizables","depuración de espaciado","framework CSS"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","styles personnalisés","conception réactive","mode sombre","modèles réutilisables","débogage de l''espacement","framework CSS"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Styles","responsives Design","dunkles Design","wiederverwendbare Muster","Fehlerbehebung bei Abständen","CSS-Framework"]}},"owner":"ndeblauw","repo":"geo.gezondheidsmakers.be","repoPath":"ndeblauw/geo.gezondheidsmakers.be","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:21.461Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS styling and responsive design capabilities with Tailwind CSS","zh":"非常适合需要高效CSS样式和响应式设计能力的前端代理，特别是使用Tailwind CSS","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なCSSスタイリングとレスポンシブデザイン機能を必要とする場合に最適です。特にTailwind CSSを使用する場合に","ko":"프런트엔드 에이전트가 효율적인 CSS 스타일링과 반응형 디자인 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다. 특히 Tailwind CSS를 사용하는 경우에","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un estilo de CSS eficiente y capacidades de diseño responsivo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un style CSS efficace et de capacités de conception réactive avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente CSS-Stilisierung und Responsive-Design-Fähigkeiten mit Tailwind CSS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de estilização CSS eficiente e capacidades de design responsivo com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима эффективная стилизация CSS и возможности адаптивного дизайна с помощью Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى أسلوب CSS فعال وسمات تصميم مستجيب مع Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to style HTML components using Tailwind CSS classes, leveraging existing conventions for consistent design, and streamlining development with responsive design, dark mode implementation, and layout debugging using Tailwind CSS v4 patterns","zh":"赋予代理使用Tailwind CSS类来样式HTML组件的能力，利用现有的约定来实现一致的设计，并通过使用Tailwind CSS v4模式来简化开发，包括响应式设计、暗黑模式实现和布局调试","ja":"エージェントがTailwind CSSクラスを使用してHTMLコンポーネントをスタイリングできるようにし、既存の規則を利用して一貫性のあるデザインを実現し、Tailwind CSS v4パターンを使用して開発を簡素化します。レスポンシブデザイン、ダークモードの実装、レイアウトのデバッグなど","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML 컴포넌트를 스타일링할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 일관된 디자인을 구현하고, Tailwind CSS v4 패턴을 사용하여 개발을 간소화합니다. 반응형 디자인, 다크 모드 구현, 레이아웃 디버깅 등","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dar estilo a componentes HTML utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS, aprovechando las convenciones existentes para un diseño coherente y agilizando el desarrollo con diseño responsivo, implementación de modo oscuro y depuración de diseño utilizando patrones de Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Permet aux agents de styler des composants HTML à l''aide de classes Tailwind CSS, en exploitant les conventions existantes pour une conception cohérente et en accélérant le développement avec une conception réactive, une mise en œuvre du mode sombre et un débogage de disposition en utilisant des modèles Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, HTML-Komponenten mithilfe von Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zu stylen, indem sie bestehende Konventionen für ein konsistentes Design nutzen und die Entwicklung mit responsivem Design, Dark-Mode-Implementierung und Layout-Debugging mithilfe von Tailwind-CSS-v4-Mustern beschleunigen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estilizar componentes HTML usando classes Tailwind CSS, aproveitando convenções existentes para design consistente e agilizando o desenvolvimento com design responsivo, implementação de modo escuro e depuração de layout usando padrões Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стилизовать компоненты HTML с помощью классов Tailwind CSS, используя существующие соглашения для согласованного дизайна и оптимизируя разработку с помощью адаптивного дизайна, реализации темного режима и отладки макета с помощью шаблонов Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تطبيق أنماط على مكونات HTML باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS، مستفيداً من الاتفاقيات الحالية لتصميم متسق وتسريع التطوير باستخدام تصميم مستجيب وتنفيذ وضع مظلم وتصحيح خطأ في التصميم باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS v4"},"useCases":{"en":["Styling components with Tailwind CSS classes","Implementing responsive design for mobile and desktop views","Debugging spacing or layout issues with Tailwind CSS utilities"],"zh":["使用Tailwind CSS类来样式组件","为移动和桌面视图实现响应式设计","使用Tailwind CSS实用程序来调试间距或布局问题"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSクラスを使用してコンポーネントをスタイリングする","モバイルとデスクトップのビューにレスポンシブデザインを実装する","Tailwind CSSユーティリティを使用してスペースやレイアウトの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 컴포넌트를 스타일링한다","모바일과 데스크톱 뷰에 반응형 디자인을 구현한다","Tailwind CSS 유틸리티를 사용하여 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅한다"],"es":["Estilizar componentes con clases de Tailwind CSS","Implementar un diseño responsivo para vistas móviles y de escritorio","Depur