":"Tailwind CSS는 반응형 및 사용자 지정 웹 인터페이스를 구축하기 위한 강력한 CSS 프레임워크입니다","es":"Tailwind CSS es una herramienta de estilo que permite agregar estilos a componentes y páginas web de manera rápida y eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil de style qui permet d''ajouter des styles aux composants et pages web de manière rapide et efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Styling-Tool, das es ermöglicht, Styles zu Komponenten und Webseiten schnell und effizient hinzuzufügen","pt":"Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta para desenvolver componentes e páginas responsivas com estilos personalizados. Aprenda a utilizá-la para melhorar sua produtivi...","ru":"Tailwind CSS — это инструмент для разработки компонентов и страниц с адаптивным дизайном и индивидуальными стилями. Узнайте, как им пользоваться, чтобы повыс...","ar":"تايلويند سي إس إس هي أداة لإنشاء مكونات وصفحات مستجيبة مع أنماط مخصصة. تعلم كيفية استخدامها لتحسين إنتاجيتك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["响应式设计","暗黑模式支持","预设类样式","自定义组件","调试工具"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード対応","事前定義されたクラススタイル","カスタムコンポーネント","デバッグツール"],"ko":["반응형 디자인","다크 모드 지원","미리 정의된 클래스 스타일","사용자 지정 컴포넌트","디버깅 도구"],"es":["Estilos personalizados para componentes y páginas web","Diseño responsivo","Modo oscuro","Patrones de estilo reutilizables","Depuración de espaciado y diseños"],"fr":["Styles personnalisés pour les composants et les pages web","Conception responsice","Mode sombre","Modèles de style réutilisables","Débogage de l''espacement et des conceptions"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Styles für Komponenten und Webseiten","Responsives Design","Dunkles Theme","Wiederverwendbare Styling-Muster","Fehlerbehebung von Abständen und Layouts"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas responsivas","Estilos personalizados com classes Tailwind CSS","Suporte a design responsivo","Implementação de dark mode","Depuração de problemas de layout e espaçamento"],"ru":["Разработка компонентов и страниц с адаптивным дизайном","Индивидуальные стили с помощью классов Tailwind CSS","Поддержка адаптивного дизайна","Реализация темного режима","Отладка проблем с макетом и расстоянием"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات وصفحات مستجيبة","أنماط مخصصة باستخدام فئات تايلويند سي إس إس","دعم التصميم المستجيب","تنفيذ وضع الظلام","تصحيح أخطاء في التصميم والت间ات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","CSS框架","响应式设计","暗黑模式","前端开发","Web开发","CSS开发"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","CSSフレームワーク","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","フロントエンド開発","Web開発","CSS開発"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","CSS 프레임워크","반응형 디자인","다크 모드","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발","CSS 개발"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","estilos personalizados","diseño responsivo","modo oscuro","patrones de estilo","depuración de espaciado","CSS"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","styles personnalisés","conception responsice","mode sombre","modèles de style","débogage de l''espacement","CSS"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Styles","responsives Design","dunkles Theme","Styling-Muster","Fehlerbehebung von Abständen","CSS"],"pt":["tailwind css","desenvolvimento web","componentes responsivos","estilos personalizados","design responsivo","dark mode","depuração de layout"],"ru":["tailwind css","веб-разработка","адаптивные компоненты","индивидуальные стили","адаптивный дизайн","темный режим","отладка макета"],"ar":["تايلويند سي إس إس","تطوير الويب","مكونات مستجيبة","أنماط مخصصة","تصميم مستجيب","وضع الظلام","تصحيح أخطاء في التصميم"]}},"owner":"quanthubllc","repo":"kip","repoPath":"quanthubllc/kip","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:04.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring efficient CSS styling and responsive design capabilities with Tailwind CSS","zh":"适用于需要高效CSS样式和响应式设计能力的前端代理，支持Tailwind CSS","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なCSSスタイリングとレスポンシブデザインの機能を必要とする場合に最適。Tailwind CSSをサポート","ko":"効率적인 CSS 스타일링 및 반응형 디자인 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. Tailwind CSS 지원","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren un estilo CSS eficiente y capacidades de diseño responsivo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant un style CSS efficient et des capacités de conception réactive avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die ein effizientes CSS-Styling und Responsive-Design-Fähigkeiten mit Tailwind CSS erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem estilização CSS eficiente e capacidades de design responsivo com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих эффективного стилирования CSS и возможностей адаптивного дизайна с Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق CSS فعال وسمات تصميم مرن مع Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize Tailwind CSS classes for styling HTML, leveraging existing project conventions and implementing responsive design, dark mode, and debugging spacing issues with precision, all while following detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation","zh":"赋予代理使用Tailwind CSS类进行HTML样式设置，利用现有的项目约定，实现响应式设计、暗黑模式和调试间距问题，所有操作都遵循详细的Tailwind CSS v4模式和文档","ja":"エージェントがTailwind CSSクラスを使用してHTMLのスタイリングを行い、既存のプロジェクト規約を活用し、レスポンシブデザイン、ダークモード、スペーシングの問題のデバッグを実施し、詳細なTailwind CSS v4パターンとドキュメントに従う","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML 스타일링을 수행하고 기존 프로젝트 규약을 활용하여 반응형 디자인, 다크 모드 및 간격 문제를 디버깅하고 자세한 Tailwind CSS v4 패턴 및 문서를 따름","es":"Permite a los agentes utilizar clases de Tailwind CSS para dar estilo a HTML, aprovechando las convenciones de proyecto existentes e implementando diseño responsivo, modo oscuro y depuración de problemas de espaciado con precisión, siguiendo patrones y documentación detallados de Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des classes Tailwind CSS pour styler le HTML, en exploitant les conventions de projet existantes et en mettant en œuvre une conception réactive, un mode sombre et un débogage des problèmes d''espacement avec précision, en suivant les modèles et la documentation détaillés de Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zur Formatierung von HTML zu verwenden, indem sie bestehende Projektkonventionen nutzen und responsives Design, dunkles Design und Debugging von Platzierungsproblemen mit Präzision implementieren, unter Einhaltung detaillierter Muster und Dokumentationen von Tailwind CSS v4","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem classes Tailwind CSS para estilização de HTML, aproveitando convenções de projeto existentes e implementando design responsivo, modo escuro e depuração de problemas de espaçamento com precisão, seguindo padrões e documentação detalhados do Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать классы Tailwind CSS для стилизации HTML, используя существующие проектные конвенции и реализуя адаптивный дизайн, темный режим и отладку проблем пробелов с точностью, следуя подробным шаблонам и документации Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخدام فئات Tailwind CSS لتنسيق HTML، واستخدام الاتفاقيات الحالية للمشروع وتنفيذ تصميم مرن ووضع الليل وتصحيح مشاكل المسافات بدقة، اتباعًا للنماذج والتوثيق المفصّل لبرنامج Tailwind CSS v4"},"useCases":{"en":[" Styling components and pages with Tailwind CSS classes","Implementing responsive design for adaptive layouts","Debugging spacing or layout issues with Tailwind CSS utilities"],"zh":["使用Tailwind CSS类样式化组件和页面","实现响应式设计以适应自适应布局","使用Tailwind CSS实用程序调试间距或布局问题"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSクラスを使用してコンポーネントとページをスタイリングする","レスポンシブデザインを実装して適応型レイアウトに対応する","Tailwind CSSユーティリティを使用してスペーシングまたはレイアウトの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 컴포넌트 및 페이지를 스타일링함","반응형 디자인을 구현하여 적응형 레이아웃에 대응함","Tailwind CSS 유틸리티를 사용하여 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅함"],"es":["Estilismo de componentes y páginas con clases de Tailwind CSS","Implementación de diseño responsivo para diseños adaptables","Depuración de problem