para criação de GIFs","Otimização para uso em mensagens e emojis","Compatibilidade com bibliotecas de imagem como PIL"],"ru":["Размеры GIF-файлов для Slack","Параметры FPS, цвета и продолжительность","Рабочий процесс создания GIF-файлов","Оптимизация для использования в сообщениях и эмодзи","Совместимость с библиотеками изображений, такими как PIL"],"ar":["أحجام صور GIF للاسلاك","معايير FPS و الألوان و المدة","تدفق عمل لإنشاء صور GIF","تحسين للاستخدام في الرسائل و الرموز التعبيرية","توافق مع مكتبات الصور مثل PIL"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slack GIF","GIF Creator","优化 GIF","开发工具","Python 库","PIL 库","GIF 动画"],"ja":["Slack GIF","GIF 作成ツールキット","最適化された GIF","開発ツール","Python ライブラリ","PIL ライブラリ","GIF アニメーション"],"ko":["Slack GIF","GIF 생성 도구","최적화된 GIF","개발 도구","Python 라이브러리","PIL 라이브러리","GIF 애니메이션"],"es":["creador de GIF para Slack","GIF animados para Slack","optimización de GIF para Slack","utilidades para GIF","biblioteca PIL","GIFBuilder","desarrollo de GIF","GIF para plataforma de mensajería"],"fr":["créateur de GIF pour Slack","GIF animés pour Slack","optimisation de GIF pour Slack","utilitaires pour GIF","bibliothèque PIL","GIFBuilder","développement de GIF","GIF pour plateforme de messagerie"],"de":["Slack GIF Ersteller","animierte GIFs für Slack","GIF-Optimierung für Slack","Utilities für GIF","PIL-Bibliothek","GIFBuilder","GIF-Entwicklung","GIF für Messaging-Plattform"],"pt":["Criador de GIFs para Slack","GIFs animados para Slack","Otimização de GIFs para Slack","Dimensionamento de GIFs","Parâmetros de GIFs","Fluxo de trabalho de criação de GIFs"],"ru":["Создатель GIF для Slack","Анимированные GIF-файлы для Slack","Оптимизация GIF-файлов для Slack","Размеры GIF-файлов","Параметры GIF-файлов","Рабочий процесс создания GIF-файлов"],"ar":["مُصمم صور GIF لاسلاك","صور GIF المتحركة للاسلاك","تحسين صور GIF للاسلاك","أحجام صور GIF","معايير صور GIF","تدفق عمل لإنشاء صور GIF"]}},"owner":"bakwankawa","repo":"lazy-code-skill","repoPath":"bakwankawa/lazy-code-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:14.564Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced animated GIF creation capabilities for Slack optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级动画GIF创建功能以优化Slack的视觉内容代理。","ja":"Slackの最適化のために高度なアニメーションGIF作成機能を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適です。","ko":"슬랙 최적화를 위해 고급 애니메이션 GIF 생성 기능이 필요한 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de GIF animados para la optimización de Slack.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création de GIF animés pour l''optimisation de Slack.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Erstellung von animierten GIFs für die Slack-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de GIFs animados para otimização do Slack.","ru":"Идеально для агентов визуального контента, которым требуются продвинутые возможности создания анимированных GIF для оптимизации Slack.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء الصور GIF المتحركة لتحسين Slack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate optimized animated GIFs using Python and the PIL library, with customizable parameters such as FPS, colors, and duration, to create engaging visual content for Slack.","zh":"赋予代理生成使用Python和PIL库的优化动画GIF的能力，具有可自定义的参数，如FPS、颜色和持续时间，以创建引人入胜的视觉内容用于Slack。","ja":"PythonとPILライブラリを使用して最適化されたアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントをEmpowersする、FPS、色、期間などのカスタマイズ可能なパラメータを備えて、Slack用の魅力的なビジュアルコンテンツを作成する。","ko":"Python 및 PIL 라이브러리를 사용하여 최적화된 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하는 에이전트를 강화하여 FPS, 색상, 기간 등의 사용자 정의 가능한 매개변수를備えて 슬랙을 위한 매력적인 시각적 콘텐츠를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIF animados optimizados utilizando Python y la biblioteca PIL, con parámetros personalizables como FPS, colores y duración, para crear contenido visual atractivo para Slack.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIF animés optimisés en utilisant Python et la bibliothèque PIL, avec des paramètres personnalisables tels que les FPS, les couleurs et la durée, pour créer du contenu visuel engageant pour Slack.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, optimierte animierte GIFs mit Python und der PIL-Bibliothek zu generieren, mit anpassbaren Parametern wie FPS, Farben und Dauer, um ansprechende visuelle Inhalte für Slack zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar GIFs animados otimizados usando Python e a biblioteca PIL, com parâmetros personalizáveis como FPS, cores e duração, para criar conteúdo visual atraente para o Slack.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать оптимизированные анимированные GIF, используя Python и библиотеку PIL, с настраиваемыми параметрами, такими как FPS, цвета и продолжительность, для создания привлекательного визуального контента для Slack.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من generar GIFs المتحركة المُحسّنة باستخدام Python ومكتبة PIL، مع معلمات قابلة للتخصيص مثل FPS والألوان والمدة، لإنشاء محتوى مرئي جذاب للslack."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating animated emoji GIFs for Slack","Creating optimized message GIFs with specific dimensions","Customizing GIF parameters for smaller file sizes"],"zh":["为Slack生成动画emoji GIF","创建具有特定尺寸的优化消息GIF","自定义GIF参数以实现较小的文件大小"],"ja":["Slack用のアニメーションemoji GIFの生成","特定のサイズの最適化メッセージGIFの作成","GIFパラメータのカスタマイズによるファイルサイズの縮小"],"ko":["슬랙을 위한 애니메이션 이모티콘 GIF 생성","특정 크기의 최적화된 메시지 GIF 생성","GIF 매개변수 사용자 정의를 통한 파일 크기 감소"],"es":["Generar GIF de emoji animados para Slack","Crear GIF de mensajes optimizados con dimensiones específicas","Personalizar parámetros de GIF para tamaños de archivo más pequeños"],"fr":["Générer des GIF d''emoji animés pour Slack","Créer des GIF de messages optimisés avec des dimensions spécifiques","Personnaliser les paramètres de GIF pour des tailles de fichiers plus petites"],"de":["Erstellen von animierten Emoji-GIFs für Slack","Erstellen von optimierten Nachrichten-GIFs mit bestimmten Dimensionen","Anpassen von GIF-Parametern für kleinere Dateigrößen"],"pt":["Geração de GIFs de emojis animados para o Slack","Criação de GIFs de mensagens otimizados com dimensões específicas","Personalização de parâmetros de GIF para tamanhos de arquivo menores"],"ru":["Генерация анимированных GIF-изображений эмодзи для Slack","Создание оптимизированных GIF-изображений сообщений с определенными размерами","Настройка параметров GIF для меньших размеров файла"],"ar":["إنشاء الصور GIF المتحركة للأشكال التعبيرية لبرنامج Slack","إنشاء رسائل GIF محسّنة بأبعاد محددة","تخصيص معلمات الصور GIF لأحجام الملفات الأصغر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and PIL library","GIF duration limited to under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs","Specific dimension requirements for Slack compatibility"],"zh":["需要Python和PIL库","GIF持续时间限制在3秒以下，适用于emoji GIF","特定尺寸要求以适应Slack兼容性"],"ja":["PythonとPILライブラリの必要性","GIFの期間が3秒以下に制限される、emoji GIFに適している","Slackとの互換性を確保するための特定のサイズの要件"],"ko":["Python 및 PIL 라이브러리가 필요","GIF 기간이 3초 이하로 제한됨, 이모티콘 GIF에 적합","슬랙との 호환성을 보장하기 위한 특정 크기 요구 사항"],"es":["Requiere Python y la biblioteca PIL","La duración del GIF está limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIF de emoji","Requisitos de dimensiones específicos para la compatibilidad con Slack"],"fr":["Nécessite Python et la bibliothèque PIL","La durée du GIF est limitée à moins de 3 secondes pour les GIF d''emoji","Exigences de dimensions spécifiques pour la compatibilité avec Slack"],"de":["Benötigt Python und die PIL-Bibliothek","Die Dauer des GIF ist auf unter 3 Sekunden für Emoji-GIFs begrenzt","Bestimmte Dimensionserfordernisse für die Slack-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Requer Python e biblioteca PIL","Duração do GIF limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emojis","Requisitos de dimensão específicos para compatibilidade com o Slack"],"ru":["Требуется Python и библиотека PIL","Продолжительность GIF ограничена менее 3 секундами для GIF-изображений эмодзи","Конкретные требования к размерам для совместимости со Slack"],"ar":["يتطلب Python ومكتبة PIL","محدود مدة الصورة GIF إلى أقل من 3 ثوانٍ لصور GIF للأشكال التعبيرية","متطلبات الأبعاد المحددة للتوافق مع برنامج Slack"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
