o de PDF con Python y herramientas de línea de comandos.","fr":"Ce guide couvre les opérations de base de traitement de PDF avec Python et les outils de ligne de commande.","de":"Dieser Leitfaden behandelt die grundlegenden Operationen für die Verarbeitung von PDF-Dateien mit Python und Kommandozeilentools.","pt":"Este guia cobre operações básicas de processamento de PDF em Python, incluindo leitura e extração de texto.","ru":"Это руководство охватывает основные операции обработки PDF в Python, включая чтение и извлечение текста.","ar":"هذا الدليل يغطي العمليات الأساسية لمعالجة PDF في Python، بما في ذلك قراءة واستخراج النص.","en":"agent-skills: Skills 中文本土化适配版"},"definition":{"en":"agent-skills: Skills 中文本土化适配版"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Python 库进行 PDF 处理","合并 PDF 文件","提取 PDF 文本","使用命令行工具进行 PDF 处理","支持多种 PDF 操作"],"ja":["Python ライブラリを使用した PDF 処理","PDF ファイルの合併","PDF テキストの抽出","コマンドラインツールを使用した PDF 処理","複数の PDF 操作をサポート"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리를 사용한 PDF 처리","PDF 파일 合并","PDF 텍스트 추출","명령줄 도구를 사용한 PDF 처리","다양한 PDF 작업 지원"],"es":["Extracción de texto de archivos PDF","Combinación de varios archivos PDF","Manipulación de páginas y contenido de PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python como pypdf","Trabajo con herramientas de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Extraction de texte de fichiers PDF","Combinaison de plusieurs fichiers PDF","Manipulation de pages et de contenu de PDF","Utilisation de bibliothèques Python comme pypdf","Travail avec des outils de ligne de commande"],"de":["Textextraktion aus PDF-Dateien","Kombination mehrerer PDF-Dateien","Manipulation von Seiten und Inhalten von PDF-Dateien","Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf","Arbeit mit Kommandozeilentools"],"pt":["Leitura de PDF","Extração de texto","Mesclagem de PDF","Criação de PDF","Edição de PDF"],"ru":["Чтение PDF","Извлечение текста","Объединение PDF","Создание PDF","Редактирование PDF"],"ar":["قراءة PDF","استخراج النص","دمج PDF","إنشاء PDF","تحرير PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF 处理","Python 库","命令行工具","PDF 合并","PDF 文本提取","PDF 分割","PDF 操作"],"ja":["PDF 処理","Python ライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","PDF 合併","PDF テキスト抽出","PDF 分割","PDF 操作"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","PDF 合并","PDF 텍스트 추출","PDF 분할","PDF 작업"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","pypdf","extracción de texto pdf","combinación de pdf","manipulación de pdf","herramientas de línea de comandos pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","pypdf","extraction de texte pdf","combinaison de pdf","manipulation de pdf","outils de ligne de commande pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pypdf","textextraktion pdf","kombination von pdf","manipulation von pdf","kommandozeilentools pdf"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","pypdf","leitura de pdf","extração de texto","mesclagem de pdf","criação de pdf","edição de pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","pypdf","чтение pdf","извлечение текста","объединение pdf","создание pdf","редактирование pdf"],"ar":["معالجة pdf","python pdf","pypdf","قراءة pdf","استخراج النص","دمج pdf","إنشاء pdf","تحرير pdf"]}},"owner":"MarcelLeon","repo":"skills-zh","repoPath":"MarcelLeon/skills-zh","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"全面的 PDF 操作工具包，用于提取文本和表格、创建新 PDF、合并/拆分文档以及处理表单。当 Claude 需要填写 PDF 表单或以编程方式大规模处理、生成或分析 PDF 文档时使用。","bodyPreview":"# PDF 处理指南\n\n## 概述\n\n本指南涵盖使用 Python 库和命令行工具的基本 PDF 处理操作。对于高级功能、JavaScript 库和详细示例，请参见 reference.md。如果您需要填写 PDF 表单，请阅读 forms.md 并遵循其说明。\n\n## 快速入门\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# 读取 PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"页数：{len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# 提取文本\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python 库\n\n### pypdf - 基本操作\n\n#### 合并 PDF\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.p","body":"# PDF 处理指南\n\n## 概述\n\n本指南涵盖使用 Python 库和命令行工具的基本 PDF 处理操作。对于高级功能、JavaScript 库和详细示例，请参见 reference.md。如果您需要填写 PDF 表单，请阅读 forms.md 并遵循其说明。\n\n## 快速入门\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# 读取 PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"页数：{len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# 提取文本\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python 库\n\n### pypdf - 基本操作\n\n#### 合并 PDF\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### 拆分 PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### 提取元数据\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"标题：{meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"作者：{meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"主题：{meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"创建者：{meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### 旋转页面\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # 顺时针旋转 90 度\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - 文本和表格提取\n\n#### 提取带布局的文本\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### 提取表格\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"第 {i+1} 页上的表格 {j+1}：\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### 高级表格提取\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # 检查表格是否不为空\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# 合并所有表格\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - 创建 PDF\n\n#### 基本 PDF 创建\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# 添加文本\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"你好世界！\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"这是用 reportlab 创建的 PDF\")\n\n# 添加线条\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# 保存\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### 创建多页 PDF\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# 添加内容\ntitle = Paragraph(\"报告标题\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"这是报告的正文。\" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# 第 2 页\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"第 2 页\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"第 2 页的内容\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# 构建 PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## 命令行工具\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# 提取文本\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# 提取保留布局的文本\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# 提取特定页面\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # 第 1-5 页\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# 合并 PDF\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# 拆分页面\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# 旋转页面\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # 将第 1 页旋转 90 度\n\n# 移除密码\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk（如果可用）\n```bash\n# 合并\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# 拆分\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# 旋转\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## 常见任务\n\n### 从扫描的 PDF 中提取文本\n```python\n# 需要：pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# 将 PDF 转换为图像\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR 每一页\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"第 {i+1} 页：\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### 添加水印\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# 创建水印（或加载现有的）\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# 应用于所有页面\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### 提取图像\n```bash\n# 使用 pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# 这会提取所有图像为 output_prefix-000.jpg、output_prefix-001.jpg 等\n```\n\n### 密码保护\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# 添加密码\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## 快速参考\n\n| 任务 | 最佳工具 | 命令/代码 |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| 合并 PDF | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| 拆分 PDF | pypdf | 每个文件一页 |\n| 提取文本 | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| 提取表格 | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| 创建 PDF | reportlab | Canvas 或 Platypus |\n| 命令行合并 | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR 扫描的 PDF | pytesseract | 首先转换为图像 |\n| 填写 PDF 表单 | pdf-lib 或 pypdf（参见 forms.md）| 参见 forms.md |\n\n## 后续步骤\n\n- 对于高级 pypdfium2 用法，参见 reference.md\n- 对于 JavaScript 库（pdf-lib），参见 reference.md\n- 如果您需要填写 PDF 表单，请遵循 forms.md 中的说明\n- 对于故障排除指南，参见 reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:22.549Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF处理功能的文档分析代理。","ja":"高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de documents nécessitant des capacités de traitement de PDF avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности обработки PDF.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة ملفات PDF."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text, merge, and manipulate PDF documents using Python libraries like pypdf, providing seamless integration with various PDF formats and tools.","zh":"使代理能够使用像pypdf这样的Python库来提取文本、合并和操作PDF文档，并与各种PDF格式和工具实现无缝集成。","ja":"pypdfなどのPythonライブラリを使用してテキストを抽出、結合、操作し、様々なPDF形式やツールとの無縫な統合を実現します。","ko":"pypdf와 같은 Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 텍스트 추출, 결합 및 조작을 가능하게 하며 다양한 PDF 형식 및 도구와의无缝集成을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer texto, combinar y manipular documentos PDF utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf, lo que proporciona una integración sin problemas con varios formatos y herramientas de PDF.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte, de fusionner et de manipuler des documents PDF en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf, ce qui fournit une intégration transparente avec divers formats et outils de PDF.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Text zu extrahieren, zu kombinieren und PDF-Dokumente mit Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf zu manipulieren, was eine nahtlose Integration mit verschiedenen PDF-Formaten und -Tools bietet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam texto, mesclam e manipulem documentos PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf, fornecendo integração perfeita com vários formatos e ferramentas PDF.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать текст, объединять и манипулировать документами PDF с помощью библиотек Python, таких как pypdf, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию с различными форматами и инструментами PDF.","ar":"تمكن العميل من استخراج النص ودمج وتحويل مستندات PDF باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf، مما يوفر تكاملًا دون انقطاع مع مختلف تنسيقات وأدوات PDF."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF documents","Merging multiple PDF files into a single document","Automating PDF form filling"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取文本","合并多个PDF文件到单个文档","自动化PDF表单填充"],"ja":["PDF文書からテキストを抽出する","複数のPDFファイルを1つの文書に結合する","PDFフォームの自動入力"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 텍스트 추출","여러 PDF 파일을 단일 문서로 결합","PDF 양식 자동 채우기"],"es":["Extraer texto de documentos PDF","Combinar varios archivos PDF en un solo documento","Automatizar el llenado de formularios PDF"],"fr":["Extraire du texte de documents PDF","Fusionner plusieurs fichiers PDF en un seul document","Automatiser le remplissage de formulaires PDF"],"de":["Text aus PDF-Dokumenten extrahieren","Mehrere PDF-Dateien in ein einzelnes Dokument zusammenfügen","Automatisieren des Ausfüllens von PDF-Formularen"],"pt":["Extração de texto de documentos PDF","Mesclagem de vários arquivos PDF em um único documento","Automação de preenchimento de formulários PDF"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из документов PDF","Объединение нескольких файлов PDF в один документ","Автоматизация заполнения форм PDF"],"ar":["استخراج النص من مستندات PDF","دمج ملفات PDF متعددة في مستند واحد","أتمتة تعبئة استمارات PDF"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x installation","Limited to PDF format only","Dependent on pypdf library"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x安装","仅限PDF格式","依赖于pypdf库"],"ja":["Python 3.xのインストールが必要","PDF形式のみ対応","pypdfライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Python 3.x 설치 필요","PDF 형식만対応","pypdf 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python 3.x","Limitado solo al formato PDF","Dependiente de la biblioteca pypdf"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python 3.x","Limité uniquement au format PDF","Dépendant de la bibliothèque pypdf"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python 3.x-Installation","Nur auf PDF-Format beschränkt","Abhängig von der pypdf-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Python 3.x","Limitado apenas ao formato PDF","Dependente da biblioteca pypdf"],"ru":["Требует установку Python 3.x","Ограничен только форматом PDF","Зависит от библиотеки pypdf"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون 3.x","محدود بتنسيق PDF فقط","يعتمد على مكتبة pypdf"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
