dores","fr":"evolve: Apprentissage Autonome pour Développeurs","de":"evolve: Autonomes Lernen für Entwickler","pt":"Evolve: Aprendizado Autônomo para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Эволюция: Автономное Обучение для Разработчиков","ar":"تطور: تعلم ذاتي للطورين","en":"evolve"},"description":{"zh":"Evolve 技术是 Claude Code 的一项技能，实现自主目标实现和迭代学习，通过原子化架构和 PDCA 执行","ja":"Evolve 技術は、Claude Code の一項スキルです。自律的な目標達成とイテレーティブ学習を実現し、原子化アーキテクチャと PDCA 実行を使用します","ko":"Evolve 기술은 Claude Code의 기술로 자동 목표 달성과 반복 학습을 구현하며, 원자화 아키텍처와 PDCA 실행을 사용합니다","es":"evolve es una habilidad de Claude Code que permite a los desarrolladores alcanzar metas de manera autónoma a través del aprendizaje iterativo y la mejora con...","fr":"evolve est une compétence de Claude Code qui permet aux développeurs d''atteindre des objectifs de manière autonome grâce à l''apprentissage itératif et à l''am...","de":"evolve ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude Code, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Ziele auf autonome Weise durch iteratives Lernen und kontinuierliche Verbesserung z...","pt":"Evolve é uma habilidade de código Claude que permite o aprendizado autônomo e a melhoria contínua para alcançar metas. Ele utiliza uma arquitetura modular pa...","ru":"Эволюция - это навык кода Claude, который позволяет автономному обучению и непрерывному улучшению для достижения целей. Он использует модульную архитектуру д...","ar":"تطور هو مهارة كلود كود التي تمكن التعلم الذاتي والتحسين المستمر للوصول إلى الأهداف. يستخدم هيكلاً معمارية متوحداً للتكرار والتحسين.","en":"A Claude Code skill for autonomous goal achievement through iterative learning and self-improvement"},"definition":{"en":"A Claude Code skill for autonomous goal achievement through iterative learning and self-improvement"},"features":{"zh":["原子化架构","PDCA 执行","自动领域识别","多策略重试","定期健检"],"ja":["原子化アーキテクチャ","PDCA 実行","自動ドメイン識別","多策略再試行","定期健康診断"],"ko":["원자화 아키텍처","PDCA 실행","자동 도메인 식별","다중 전략 재시도","정기적 건강 진단"],"es":["Aprendizaje iterativo","Mejora continua","Análisis de objetivos","Identificación automática de dominios","Ejecución de PDCA","Depuración sistemática"],"fr":["Apprentissage itératif","Amélioration continue","Analyse d''objectifs","Identification automatique de domaines","Exécution de PDCA","Débogage systématique"],"de":["Iteratives Lernen","Kontinuierliche Verbesserung","Zielanalyse","Automatische Domänenidentifizierung","PDCA-Ausführung","Systematisches Debugging"],"pt":["Aprendizado autônomo","Arquitetura modular","Iteração e melhoria contínua","Análise de metas","Execução de PDCA","Depuração sistemática"],"ru":["Автономное обучение","Модульная архитектура","Итерация и непрерывное улучшение","Анализ целей","Выполнение PDCA","Систематическая отладка"],"ar":["التعلم الذاتي","الهيكل المعماري المتوحد","التكرار والتحسين المستمر","تحليل الأهداف","تنفيذ PDCA","التصحيح النظامي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Evolve 技术","自主目标实现","迭代学习","原子化架构","PDCA 执行","自动领域识别"],"ja":["Evolve 技術","自律的な目標達成","イテレーティブ学習","原子化アーキテクチャ","PDCA 実行","自動ドメイン識別"],"ko":["Evolve 기술","자동 목표 달성","반복 학습","원자화 아키텍처","PDCA 실행","자동 도메인 식별"],"es":["aprendizaje autónomo","desarrollo de software","mejora continua","análisis de objetivos","identificación de dominios","PDCA","depuración sistemática","desarrollo de habilidades"],"fr":["apprentissage autonome","développement de logiciels","amélioration continue","analyse d''objectifs","identification de domaines","PDCA","débogage systématique","développement de compétences"],"de":["autonomes Lernen","Software-Entwicklung","kontinuierliche Verbesserung","Zielanalyse","Domänenidentifizierung","PDCA","systematisches Debugging","Fähigkeitsentwicklung"],"pt":["aprendizado autônomo","desenvolvimento de software","arquitetura modular","iteração e melhoria","análise de metas","PDCA","depuração sistemática","desenvolvedores","código Claude"],"ru":["автономное обучение","разработка программного обеспечения","модульная архитектура","итерация и улучшение","анализ целей","PDCA","систематическая отладка","разработчики","код Claude"],"ar":["التعلم الذاتي","تطوير البرمجيات","الهيكل المعماري المتوحد","التكرار والتحسين","تحليل الأهداف","PDCA","التصحيح النظامي","المطورين","كود كلود"]}},"owner":"miles990","repo":"self-evolving-agent","repoPath":"miles990/self-evolving-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"evolve","description":"自我進化 Agent：給定目標，自主學習並迭代改進直到完成。整合 superpowers 工作流紀律。","version":"5.11.0","bodyPreview":"# Self-Evolving Agent v5.11.0\n\n> [**版本檢查**] → **北極星錨定** → [**Worktree 隔離**] → PSB 環境檢查 → 目標分析（**🔗 brainstorming**）→ **自動領域識別** → 評估能力 → 習得技能 → PDCA 執行（**🔗 TDD + verification**）→ 診斷（**🔗 systematic-debugging**）→ 多策略重試 → Repo 記憶 → **定期健檢** → [**Worktree 完成**] → 直到成功\n\n## 快速導覽\n\n本 skill 採用**原子化架構**，將知識拆分為獨立模組：\n\n| 模組 | 用途 | 路徑 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **00-getting-started** | 入門與環境設定 | [→](./00-getting-started/) |\n| **01-core** | 核心流程（PSB + PDCA） | [→](./01-core/) |\n| **02-checkpoints** | 強制檢查點（護欄","body":"# Self-Evolving Agent v5.11.0\n\n> [**版本檢查**] → **北極星錨定** → [**Worktree 隔離**] → PSB 環境檢查 → 目標分析（**🔗 brainstorming**）→ **自動領域識別** → 評估能力 → 習得技能 → PDCA 執行（**🔗 TDD + verification**）→ 診斷（**🔗 systematic-debugging**）→ 多策略重試 → Repo 記憶 → **定期健檢** → [**Worktree 完成**] → 直到成功\n\n## 快速導覽\n\n本 skill 採用**原子化架構**，將知識拆分為獨立模組：\n\n| 模組 | 用途 | 路徑 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **00-getting-started** | 入門與環境設定 | [→](./00-getting-started/) |\n| **01-core** | 核心流程（PSB + PDCA） | [→](./01-core/) |\n| **02-checkpoints** | 強制檢查點（護欄） | [→](./02-checkpoints/) |\n| **03-memory** | 記憶系統操作 | [→](./03-memory/) |\n| **04-emergence** | 涌現機制 | [→](./04-emergence/) |\n| **05-integration** | 外部工具整合（含 **superpowers**） | [→](./05-integration/) |\n| **06-scaling** | 大規模專案優化 | [→](./06-scaling/) |\n| **99-evolution** | 自我進化機制 | [→](./99-evolution/) |\n\n## 使用方式\n\n```bash\n/evolve [目標描述]\n\n# 範例\n/evolve 建立一個能自動生成遊戲道具圖片的 ComfyUI 工作流程\n/evolve 優化這段程式碼的效能，目標是降低 50% 執行時間\n/evolve 為這個專案建立完整的測試覆蓋率達到 80%\n```\n\n### Flags\n\n```bash\n--explore          # 探索模式 - 允許自主選擇方向\n--emergence        # 涌現模式 - 啟用跨領域連結探索\n--autonomous       # 自主模式 - 完全自主，追求系統性創新\n--max-iterations N # 最大迭代次數（預設 10）\n--from-spec NAME   # 從 spec-workflow 的 tasks.md 執行\n```\n\n## 核心哲學\n\n**人類與 AI 協作的本質：透過抽象化介面溝通**\n\n| 傳統軟體 | AI 協作 | 作用 |\n|----------|---------|------|\n| API | MCP | 能力邊界（能做什麼） |\n| SDK/Library | Tools | 具體實作（怎麼做） |\n| 文檔+實踐 | Skill | 領域知識（何時用什麼） |\n| Config | CLAUDE.md | 上下文約束（專案規範） |\n\n**深層洞察**：\n- Skill 不只是知識，是「封裝好的判斷力」\n- 告訴 AI 在什麼情況下，用什麼方式，達成什麼目標\n- 減少決策點 > 讓 AI 自己選擇\n\n### 設計原則\n\n| 原則 | 說明 |\n|------|------|\n| **有主見的設計** | 合理預設值 > 讓 AI 選擇，必填參數 ≤ 2 個 |\n| **深且窄** | 專注 10% 高價值任務，不追求功能廣度 |\n| **預期失敗** | 95% Agent 在生產環境失敗是常態，設計優雅降級 |\n| **增強回饋** | 執行中提醒目標和進度，失敗時說明影響範圍 |\n\n## 執行流程概覽\n\n**Self-Evolving Loop v5.2**\n\n0. 🔄 **版本檢查**（自動）— 檢查更新、詢問用戶、自動更新\n1. 🌟 **CP0: 北極星錨定** — 願景、完成標準、不做清單、動機\n2. 🔒 **CP0.5: Worktree 隔離**（條件觸發）— Level 2 / autonomous / 並行任務\n3. **PSB System** — Plan → Setup → Build（環境準備）\n4. **目標分析** — 深度訪談 + 架構等級判斷（Level 2 強制）\n5. **能力評估 → Skill 習得**\n6. **PDCA Cycle** — Plan → Do → Check → Act（含多策略選擇）\n   - CP3: 方向校正（對照北極星）\n7. **Git-based Memory** — 記錄學習經驗\n8. 🏥 **CP6: 專案健檢**（每 5 次迭代）— Scope、方向、終止檢查\n9. 🏁 **CP6.5: Worktree 完成**（條件觸發）— 合併/清理\n\n↻ 重複直到：目標達成 或 達到最大迭代次數\n\n> **主要功能**：Superpowers 整合 | LEANN 語義搜尋 | Worktree 隔離 | 北極星系統 | 深度訪談\n>\n> 詳見：[CHANGELOG](../CHANGELOG.md) | [05-integration](./05-integration/) | [02-checkpoints](./02-checkpoints/)\n\n### 架構考量三層設計\n\n| Layer | 階段 | 動作 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| 1 | Goal Analysis | 判斷架構等級 (0/1/2) |\n| 2 | PDCA Plan | 依等級做架構設計 |\n| 3 | CP1.5 Phase 2 | 驗證實作符合設計 |\n\n→ 設計 → 實作 → 驗證 閉環\n\n## 強制檢查點（護欄）\n\n> **這些檢查點不可跳過**，詳見 [02-checkpoints](./02-checkpoints/)\n\n| 檢查點 | 時機 | 動作 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **CP0** 🌟 | 專案/任務開始前 | 北極星錨定（建立或讀取） |\n| **CP0.5** 🔒 | CP0 後（條件觸發） | Worktree 隔離環境準備 |\n| **CP1** | 任務開始前 | 搜尋 .claude/memory/ 查找相關經驗 |\n| **CP1.5** | 寫程式碼前 | 一致性檢查（兩階段） |\n| **CP2** | 程式碼變更後 | 編譯 + 測試驗證 |\n| **CP3** | Milestone 完成後 | 確認目標、**方向校正**、下一步 |\n| **CP3.5** | Memory 文件創建後 | 立即同步 index.md |\n| **CP4** | 迭代完成後 | 涌現機會檢查（選擇性） |\n| **CP5** | PDCA Check 失敗時 | 失敗後驗屍，生成結構化 Lesson |\n| **CP6** 🏥 | 每 5 次迭代後 | 專案健檢（Scope、方向、終止檢查） |\n| **CP6.5** 🏁 | 任務完成時（條件觸發） | Worktree 合併/清理 |\n\n### Checkpoint 並行化\n\n效率優化：以下 CP 可並行執行：\n- **CP1 + CP1.5 Phase 1**：Memory 搜尋與基礎一致性檢查互不依賴，使用 `run_in_background: true` 同時啟動\n- **CP4 + 下一迭代 Plan**：涌現檢查在背景運行，不阻塞後續 PDCA\n\n不可並行：CP0/CP0.5 必須先完成；CP1.5 Phase 2 依賴 CP1 結果；CP2 → CP3 為序列關係。\n\n> 詳見 [02-checkpoints/README.md](./02-checkpoints/README.md#checkpoint-並行化)\n\n### CP1.5 兩階段設計\n\n**Phase 1: 基礎檢查（必執行）**\n- 搜尋現有實作，避免重複造輪子\n- 檢查專案慣例（命名、風格）\n- 檢查 Schema/API 一致性\n\n**Phase 2: 架構檢查（自動偵測觸發）**\n- 依賴方向、錯誤處理一致性、橫切關注點、設計模式一致性\n\n**觸發條件**：新增目錄/模組、變更涉及 3+ 目錄、新增外部依賴、觸及 core/infra/domain/shared/、新增公開 API\n\n## 停止條件\n\n| 狀態 | 條件 |\n|------|------|\n| ✅ 成功 | 所有子目標完成 + 驗收標準通過 |\n| ❌ 失敗 | 達到最大迭代次數 或 連續 3 次相同錯誤 |\n| ⏸️ 暫停 | 需要用戶決策 或 風險操作需確認 |\n\n## 完成信號\n\n- `✅ GOAL ACHIEVED: [目標描述]`\n- `⏸️ NEED HUMAN: [原因]`\n- `❌ CANNOT COMPLETE: [原因]`\n\n## 相關資源\n\n- [Reflexion Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.11366)\n- [OpenAI Self-Evolving Agents Cookbook](https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/partners/self_evolving_agents/autonomous_agent_retraining)\n- [Andrew Ng - Agentic Design Patterns](https://www.deeplearning.ai/the-batch/agentic-design-patterns-part-2-reflection/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:35.881Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing iterative learning and self-improvement capabilities through PDCA execution and systematic debugging.","zh":"非常适合需要通过PDCA执行和系统调试实现迭代学习和自我改进能力的自治代理。","ja":"PDCAの実行と体系的なデバッグを通じてイテレーティブな学習と自己改善の機能を必要とする自律エージェントに最適です。","ko":"PDCA 수행 및 체계적인 디버깅을 통해 반복적 학습 및 자기 향상 능력을 필요로 하는 자율 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes autónomos que necesitan capacidades de aprendizaje iterativo y auto-mejora a través de la ejecución de PDCA y depuración sistemática.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents autonomes ayant besoin de capacités d''apprentissage itératif et d''auto-amélioration grâce à l''exécution de PDCA et à la débogage systématique.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die iterative Lern- und Selbstverbesserungsfähigkeiten durch PDCA-Ausführung und systematische Fehlersuche benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que necessitam de capacidades de aprendizado iterativo e auto-aperfeiçoamento por meio da execução do PDCA e depuração sistemática.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, которым требуются возможности итеративного обучения и самоусовершенствования посредством выполнения PDCA и системной отладки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التعلم التكراري والتحسين الذاتي من خلال تنفيذ PDCA والتصحيح النظامي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to achieve autonomous goal achievement through iterative learning, self-improvement, and automatic domain identification, utilizing techniques like TDD, verification, and systematic debugging within a modular, atomicized architecture.","zh":"通过迭代学习、自我改进和自动域识别，利用TDD、验证和系统调试等技术，赋予代理实现自主目标实现的能力，架构采用模块化、原子化设计。","ja":"イテレーティブな学習、自己改善、自動ドメイン識別を通じて、TDD、検証、システムデバッグなどの技術を利用し、モジュラーでアトミック化されたアーキテクチャで自律的な目標達成能力をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"반복적 학습, 자기 향상, 자동 도메인 식별을 통해 TDD, 검증, 시스템 디버깅 등의 기술을 활용하여 모듈화된 원자화된 아키텍처에서 자율적인 목표 달성 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a lograr metas autónomas a través del aprendizaje iterativo, la auto-mejora y la identificación automática de dominios, utilizando técnicas como TDD, verificación y depuración sistemática dentro de una arquitectura modular y atomizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''atteindre des objectifs autonomes grâce à l''apprentissage itératif, à l''auto-amélioration et à l''identification automatique de domaines, en utilisant des techniques comme TDD, vérification et débogage systématique au sein d''une architecture modulaire et atomisée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, autonome Ziele zu erreichen durch iteratives Lernen, Selbstverbesserung und automatische Domänenidentifizierung, indem Techniken wie TDD, Verifizierung und systematische Fehlersuche innerhalb einer modularen, atomisierten Architektur verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a alcançar a realização autônoma de objetivos por meio do aprendizado iterativo, auto-aperfeiçoamento e identificação automática de domínio, utilizando técnicas como TDD, verificação e depuração sistemática dentro de uma arquitetura modular e atomizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью достижения автономного достижения целей посредством итеративного обучения, самоусовершенствования и автоматической идентификации области, используя методы, такие как TDD, верификация и системная отладка в рамках модульной, атомизированной архитектуры.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحقيق الأهداف المستقلة من خلال التعلم التكراري والتحسين الذاتي والتحديد التلقائي للمجال، باستخدام تقنيات مثل TDD والتحقق والتصحيح النظامي داخل بنية متكاملة ومتجزئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating goal-oriented workflows","Generating modular knowledge graphs","Debugging complex system failures using PDCA and systematic debugging"],"zh":["自动化面向目标的工作流程","生成模块化知识图","使用PDCA和系统调试来调试复杂系统故障"],"ja":["目標指向型ワークフローの自動化","モジュラー化されたナレッジグラフの生成","PDCAとシステムデバッグを使用した複雑なシステム障害のデバッグ"],"ko":["목표 지향형 워크플로의 자동화","모듈화된 지식 그래프 생성","PDCA 및 시스템 디버깅을 사용한 복잡한 시스템 장애 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo orientados a metas","Generación de gráficos de conocimiento modulares","Depuración de fallos complejos de sistemas utilizando PDCA y depuración sistemática"],"fr":["Automatisation de flux de travail orientés vers les objectifs","Génération de graphes de connaissance modulaires","Débogage de défaillances complexes de systèmes en utilisant PDCA et débogage systématique"],"de":["Automatisierung von zielorientierten Workflows","Erzeugung von modularen Wissensgraphen","Fehlersuche bei komplexen Systemfehlern unter Verwendung von PDCA und systematischer Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho orientados por objetivos","Gerar gráficos de conhecimento modulares","Depurar falhas complexas de sistema usando PDCA e depuração sistemática"],"ru":["Автоматизация цели, ориентированных на рабочие процессы","Генерация модульных графов знаний","Отладка сложных системных сбоев с помощью PDCA и системной отладки"],"ar":["تأتميم تدفقات العمل الموجهة بالغرض","генерация رسوم معرفية متكاملة","تصحيح أعطال النظام المعقدة باستخدام PDCA والتصحيح النظامي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires modular knowledge structure","Dependent on successful PDCA execution","Mandatory periodic health checks"],"zh":["需要模块化知识结构","依赖于成功的PDCA执行","需要强制执行周期性健康检查"],"ja":["モジュラー化されたナレッジ構造の必要性","成功したPDCAの実行への依存性","周期的なヘルスチェックの強制実行の必要性"],"ko":["모듈화된 지식 구조의 필요성","성공적인 PDCA 수행에 대한 의존성","주기적인 헬스 체크의 강제 수행 필요성"],"es":["Requiere estructura de conocimiento modular","Dependiente de la ejecución exitosa de PDCA","Revisión de salud periódica obligatoria"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de connaissance modulaire","Dépendante de l''exécution réussie de PDCA","Vérification de santé périodique obligatoire"],"de":["Benötigt modulare Wissensstruktur","Abhängig von erfolgreicher PDCA-Ausführung","Pflichtperiodische Gesundheitsprüfungen"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de conhecimento modular","Dependente da execução bem-sucedida do PDCA","Verificações periódicas de saúde obrigatórias"],"ru":["Требует модульной структуры знаний","Зависит от успешного выполнения PDCA","Обязательные периодические проверки здоровья"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكلا معرفيا متكاملا","يعتمد على تنفيذ PDCA بنجاح","فحوصات صحية دورية إجبارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('s-a-c/livewire-starter-kit/tailwindcss-development', 'community', 's-a-c', 'livewire-starter-kit', 's-a-c/livewire-starter-kit', 'tailwindcss-development', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z', '2026-02-18T07:04:00.175Z', NULL, '{"id":"s-a-c/livewire-starter-kit/tailwindcss-development","name":"tailwindcss-development","description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS是一种实用性高的CSS框架，用于构建响应式和可定制的Web应用","ja":"Tailwind CSSは、レスポンシブでカスタマイズ可能なWebアプリケーションを構築するための実用的なCSSフレームワークです","ko":"Tailwind CSS는 반응형 및 사용자 지정 가능한 Web 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 실용적인 CSS 프레임워크입니다","es":"Tailwind CSS es una herramienta para desarrollar estilos y patrones de diseño web de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil pour développer des styles et des modèles de conception web de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Werkzeug für die effiziente Entwicklung von Web-Styles und -Mustern","pt":"Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que permite criar componentes personalizados e responsivos","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это инструмент для разработки, позволяющий создавать настраиваемые и адаптивные компоненты","ar":"Tailwind CSS هو أداة تطوير تمكنك من إنشاء مكونات مخصصة ومتجاوبة","en":"slightly customised"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS 开发","ja":"Tailwind CSS開発","ko":"Tailwind CSS 개발","es":"Desarrollo con Tailwind CSS","fr":"Développement avec Tailwind CSS","de":"Tailwind CSS-Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Разработка с Tailwind CSS","ar":"تطوير Tailwind CSS","en":"tailwindcss-development"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS是一种实用性高的CSS框架，用于构建响应式和可定制的Web应用","ja":"Tailwind CSSは、レスポンシブでカスタマイズ可能なWebアプリケーションを構築するための実用的なCSSフレームワークです","ko":"Tailwind CSS는 반응형 및 사용자 지정 가능한 Web 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 실용적인 CSS 프레임워크입니다","es":"Tailwind CSS es una herramienta para desarrollar estilos y patrones de diseño web de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un outil pour développer des styles et des modèles de conception web de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Werkzeug für die effiziente Entwicklung von Web-Styles und -Mustern","pt":"Tailwind CSS é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que permite criar componentes personalizados e responsivos","ru":"Tailwind CSS - это инструмент для разработки, позволяющий создавать настраиваемые и адаптивные компоненты","ar":"Tailwind CSS هو أداة تطوير تمكنك من إنشاء مكونات مخصصة ومتجاوبة","en":"slightly customised"},"definition":{"en":"slightly customised"},"features":{"zh":["响应式设计","暗黑模式支持","布局调试","可定制的组件","简化的CSS编写"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード対応","レイアウトデバッグ","カスタマイズ可能なコンポーネント","簡素化されたCSS記述"],"ko":["반응형 디자인","다크 모드 지원","레이아웃 디버깅","사용자 지정 가능한 컴포넌트","간소화된 CSS 작성"],"es":["Estilos personalizables","Diseño responsivo","Modo oscuro","Depuración de espaciado y diseño","Patrones de diseño reutilizables"],"fr":["Styles personnalisables","Conception responsives","Mode sombre","Débogage d''espacement et de conception","Modèles de conception réutilisables"],"de":["Anpassbare Styles","Responsives Design","Dunkles Design","Fehlerbehebung bei Abstand und Design","Wiederverwendbare Designmuster"],"pt":["Criação de componentes personalizados","Desenvolvimento de layouts responsivos","Implementação de modo noturno","Depuração de problemas de espaçamento e layout","Uso de classes CSS para estilizar HTML"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых компонентов","Разработка адаптивных макетов","Реализация темного режима","Отладка проблем с间ованием и макетом","Использование классов CSS для стилизации HTML"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات مخصصة","تطوير تصاميم متجاوبة","تنفيذ وضع الليل","تصحيح أخطاء المسافات والتخطيط","استخدام فئات CSS لتنسيق HTML"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","响应式设计","暗黑模式","布局调试","CSS框架","Web开发","前端开发","UI组件"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","レスポンシブデザイン","ダークモード","レイアウトデバッグ","CSSフレームワーク","Web開発","フロントエンド開発","UIコンポーネント"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","반응형 디자인","다크 모드","레이아웃 디버깅","CSS 프레임워크","Web 개발","프론트엔드 개발","UI 컴포넌트"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","Desarrollo web","Estilos personalizables","Diseño responsivo","Modo oscuro","Depuración de espaciado","Patrones de diseño reutilizables","CSS","Framework de CSS"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","Développement web","Styles personnalisables","Conception responsives","Mode sombre","Débogage d''espacement","Modèles de conception réutilisables","CSS","Framework CSS"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Web-Entwicklung","Anpassbare Styles","Responsives Design","Dunkles Design","Fehlerbehebung bei Abstand","Wiederverwendbare Designmuster","CSS","CSS-Framework"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","componentes personalizados","layouts responsivos","modo noturno","depuração de CSS"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","настраиваемые компоненты","адаптивные макеты","темный режим","отладка CSS"],"ar":["Tailwind CSS","تطوير الويب","مكونات مخصصة","تصاميم متجاوبة","وضع الليل","تصحيح أخطاء CSS"]}},"owner":"s-a-c","repo":"livewire-starter-kit","repoPath":"s-a-c/livewire-starter-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:00.175Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined CSS development with Tailwind CSS v4 patterns","zh":"非常适合需要使用Tailwind CSS v4模式进行简化CSS开发的前端代理","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4パターンを使用したストリームライン化されたCSS開発が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4 패턴을 사용하여 CSS 개발을 간소화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de CSS optimizado con patrones de Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement de CSS simplifié avec des modèles de Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine optimierte CSS-Entwicklung mit Tailwind-CSS-v4-Mustern benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de CSS simplificado com padrões do Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим упрощенный разработка CSS с помощью шаблонов Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى تطوير CSS مبسط باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS v4"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to style HTML components using Tailwind CSS classes, enabling responsive design, dark mode implementation, and efficient debugging of spacing or layout issues with `search-docs` documentation support","zh":"赋予代理使用Tailwind CSS类来样式HTML组件的能力，实现响应式设计、暗黑模式实现和使用`search-docs`文档支持高效调试间距或布局问题","ja":"Tailwind CSSクラスを使用してHTMLコンポーネントをスタイリングするエージェントの能力を提供し、レスポンシブデザイン、ダークモードの実装、および`search-docs`ドキュメントサポートを使用したスペーシングまたはレイアウトの問題の効率的なデバッグを可能にします","ko":"Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 HTML 컴포넌트를 스타일링할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여, 반응형 디자인, 다크 모드 구현 및 `search-docs` 문서 지원을 사용한 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제의 효율적인 디버깅을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dar estilo a componentes HTML utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS, lo que permite un diseño receptivo, la implementación del modo oscuro y la depuración eficiente de problemas de espaciado o diseño con soporte de documentación `search-docs`","fr":"Permet aux agents de styler les composants HTML à l''aide de classes Tailwind CSS, permettant ainsi une conception réactive, la mise en œuvre du mode sombre et le débogage efficace des problèmes de disposition ou de mise en page avec une prise en charge de documentation `search-docs`","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, HTML-Komponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen zu stylen, wodurch ein responsives Design, die Implementierung des Dunkelmodus und eine effiziente Fehlersuche bei Problemen mit Abständen oder Layout mit `search-docs`-Dokumentationsunterstützung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estilizar componentes HTML usando classes do Tailwind CSS, permitindo design responsivo, implementação do modo escuro e depuração efi