tion":{"zh":"tx-styling是一个用于编译时Tailwind分组和linting的工具，帮助开发者优化React和Next.js应用","ja":"tx-stylingはコンパイル時Tailwindグループ化とlintingを行うツールで、ReactとNext.jsアプリの最適化を支援します","ko":"tx-styling은 컴파일 시 Tailwind 그룹화 및 린팅을 수행하는 도구로, 개발자가 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"tx-styling es una herramienta que combina la agrupación de Tailwind en tiempo de compilación con linting para mejorar la eficiencia del código CSS.","fr":"tx-styling est un outil qui combine le regroupement de Tailwind en temps de compilation avec le linting pour améliorer l''efficacité du code CSS.","de":"tx-styling ist ein Tool, das die Gruppierung von Tailwind zur Kompilierungszeit mit Linting kombiniert, um die Effizienz des CSS-Codes zu verbessern.","pt":"O tx-styling é uma ferramenta de otimização de estilos que melhora a performance e a manutenção de componentes React e Next.js com Tailwind.","ru":"Tx-styling - это инструмент оптимизации стилей, который улучшает производительность и обслуживание компонентов React и Next.js с Tailwind.","ar":"tx-styling هو أداة لتحسين أنماط الطلاء التي تحسن الأداء وصيانة مكونات React و Next.js مع Tailwind.","en":"Compile-time Tailwind grouping + linting."},"definition":{"en":"Compile-time Tailwind grouping + linting."},"features":{"zh":["编译时Tailwind分组","linting支持","优化React和Next.js应用","提高开发效率","简化CSS样式管理"],"ja":["コンパイル時Tailwindグループ化","lintingサポート","ReactとNext.jsアプリの最適化","開発効率の向上","CSSスタイル管理の簡素化"],"ko":["컴파일 시 Tailwind 그룹화","린팅 지원","React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션 최적화","개발 효율성 향상","CSS 스타일 관리 단순화"],"es":["Agrupación de Tailwind en tiempo de compilación","Linting para reducir errores","Preferencia por tx sobre className para clases de Tailwind","Uso de matrices para estilos condicionales","Sintaxis de agrupación como hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"fr":["Regroupement de Tailwind en temps de compilation","Linting pour réduire les erreurs","Préférence pour tx sur className pour les classes de Tailwind","Utilisation de tableaux pour les styles conditionnels","Syntaxe de regroupement comme hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"de":["Gruppierung von Tailwind zur Kompilierungszeit","Linting zur Fehlerreduzierung","Bevorzugung von tx über className für Tailwind-Klassen","Verwendung von Arrays für bedingte Stile","Gruppierungssyntax wie hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"pt":["Agrupamento de estilos Tailwind em tempo de compilação","Linting para evitar erros de sintaxe","Suporte a React e Next.js","Otimização de performance","Manutenção simplificada"],"ru":["Группировка стилей Tailwind во время компиляции","Линтинг для предотвращения ошибок синтаксиса","Поддержка React и Next.js","Оптимизация производительности","Упрощенное обслуживание"],"ar":["تجميع أنماط الطلاء Tailwind في وقت الترجمة","لينтинج لمنع أخطاء السينتكس","دعم React و Next.js","تحسين الأداء","صيانة مبسطة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["tx-styling","Tailwind","linting","React","Next.js","CSS优化","开发效率"],"ja":["tx-styling","Tailwind","linting","React","Next.js","CSS最適化","開発効率"],"ko":["tx-styling","Tailwind","린팅","React","Next.js","CSS 최적화","개발 효율성"],"es":["tx-styling","Tailwind CSS","linting","agrupación de Tailwind","eficiencia del código CSS","mejora de la eficiencia","reducción de errores"],"fr":["tx-styling","Tailwind CSS","linting","regroupement de Tailwind","efficacité du code CSS","amélioration de l''efficacité","réduction des erreurs"],"de":["tx-styling","Tailwind CSS","Linting","Gruppierung von Tailwind","Effizienz des CSS-Codes","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Fehlerreduzierung"],"pt":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","otimização de estilos","linting","performance","manutenção"],"ru":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","оптимизация стилей","линтинг","производительность","обслуживание"],"ar":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","تحسين أنماط الطلاء","لينтинج","أداء","صيانة"]}},"owner":"landfolk","repo":"tx","repoPath":"landfolk/tx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tx-styling","description":"Guidance for using @landfolk/tx styling (tx prop, grouping syntax, Tailwind transformer, SWC + ESLint plugins) in React/Next.js.","bodyPreview":"# tx styling\n\n## When to use\n- Editing components that use the `tx` prop or `tx` template literals.\n- Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into a React/Next.js app.\n- Debugging grouping, Tailwind extraction, or linting around `tx`.\n\n## Core rules\n- Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes.\n- Use arrays for conditional styles; avoid string concatenation.\n- Use grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`.\n- Do not forward `tx` props; only forward `className`.\n- For styleable components, m","body":"# tx styling\n\n## When to use\n- Editing components that use the `tx` prop or `tx` template literals.\n- Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into a React/Next.js app.\n- Debugging grouping, Tailwind extraction, or linting around `tx`.\n\n## Core rules\n- Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes.\n- Use arrays for conditional styles; avoid string concatenation.\n- Use grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`.\n- Do not forward `tx` props; only forward `className`.\n- For styleable components, merge `className` into `tx`.\n\n## Tooling overview\n- SWC plugin rewrites `tx` to `className` at compile time.\n- Tailwind transformer expands grouped classes for JIT extraction.\n- ESLint rule sorts and validates classes.\n\n## Grouping syntax\nExample:\n\n```tsx\n<div tx=\"hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)\" />\n```\n\nCompiles to `className=\"hover:bg-blue-500 hover:text-white\"`.\nGroups can be nested.\n\n## SWC transform\n- `tx=\"...\"` becomes `className=\"...\"`.\n- Arrays like `tx={[cond && tx`...`]}` become joined `className` arrays.\n- Tagged `tx` templates expand at compile time.\n- In dev, class strings can be wrapped with a conflict checker if registered.\n\nRegister the dev-only conflict checker once:\n\n```ts\nimport ''@landfolk/tx/checkConflicts''\n```\n\n## Tailwind transformer\nThe transformer scans `tx` attributes and template literals to expand grouped\nsyntax into full class lists so Tailwind JIT sees every class.\n\n## ESLint rule\n`@landfolk/tx/optimize-tailwind-classes`:\n- Expands grouped syntax and re-compacts in a stable order.\n- Sorts classes using Tailwind''s internal order.\n- Normalizes whitespace in arbitrary values.\n- Can validate class names when given a Tailwind config path.\n\n## Getting started\nSee `getting-started.md` for install, config, and Next.js compatibility.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:04:51.238Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents leveraging React/Next.js and Tailwind CSS, seeking to enhance their styling capabilities with compile-time grouping and linting.","zh":"适用于使用 React/Next.js 和 Tailwind CSS 的前端代理，旨在通过编译时分组和 linting 增强其样式能力。","ja":"React/Next.js および Tailwind CSS を使用するフロントエンド エージェントに適しており、コンパイル時グループ化および linting を使用してスタイリング機能を強化することを目指しています。","ko":"React/Next.js와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 컴파일 타임 그룹화 및 린팅을 통해 스타일링 기능을 강화하고자 함.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que utilizan React/Next.js y Tailwind CSS, y que buscan mejorar sus capacidades de estilo con agrupación y análisis en tiempo de compilación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend utilisant React/Next.js et Tailwind CSS, cherchant à améliorer leurs capacités de style avec un regroupement et une analyse en temps de compilation.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die React/Next.js und Tailwind CSS nutzen und ihre Stilfähigkeiten mit Compile-Zeit-Gruppierung und Linting erweitern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que utilizam React/Next.js e Tailwind CSS, buscando melhorar suas capacidades de estilização com agrupamento e linting em tempo de compilação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, использующих React/Next.js и Tailwind CSS, стремящихся повысить возможности стилизации с группировкой и проверкой в время компиляции.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذين يستخدمون React/Next.js و Tailwind CSS، والذين يبحثون عن تحسين قدرات التنسيق الخاصة بهم مع التجميع والتنقيح في وقت الترجمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce consistent styling conventions using Tailwind classes, conditional styles via arrays, and grouping syntax like hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white), while integrating seamlessly with @landfolk/tx for robust React/Next.js applications.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行一致的样式约定，使用 Tailwind 类、数组条件样式和分组语法（如 hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)），同时与 @landfolk/tx 无缝集成，以构建强大的 React/Next.js 应用。","ja":"エージェントに一貫したスタイリング規約を適用させることで、Tailwind クラス、配列条件スタイル、グループ化構文（例：hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)）を使用し、同時に @landfolk/tx とシームレスに統合して、強力な React/Next.js アプリケーションを構築します。","ko":"에이전트가 일관된 스타일링 규칙을 강제 적용할 수 있도록 해줌으로써, Tailwind 클래스, 배열 조건 스타일 및 그룹화 구문(예: hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white))을 사용하며,同時に @landfolk/tx와 無縫に 統合して 강력한 React/Next.js 애플리케이션을 구축.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir convenciones de estilo coherentes utilizando clases de Tailwind, estilos condicionales a través de matrices y sintaxis de agrupación como hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white), mientras se integra de manera transparente con @landfolk/tx para aplicaciones robustas de React/Next.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des conventions de style cohérentes en utilisant des classes Tailwind, des styles conditionnels via des tableaux et une syntaxe de regroupement comme hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white), tout en s''intégrant sans heurt avec @landfolk/tx pour des applications React/Next.js robustes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, konsistente Stilkonventionen durchzusetzen, indem sie Tailwind-Klassen, bedingte Styles über Arrays und Gruppierungssyntax wie hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white) verwenden, während sie nahtlos mit @landfolk/tx für robuste React/Next.js-Anwendungen integriert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor convenções de estilização consistentes usando classes Tailwind, estilos condicionais via arrays e sintaxe de agrupamento como hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white), enquanto se integra perfeitamente com @landfolk/tx para aplicações React/Next.js robustas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать последовательные соглашения стилизации с использованием классов Tailwind, условных стилей через массивы и синтаксиса группировки, такого как hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white), при этом обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с @landfolk/tx для прочных приложений React/Next.js.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من فرض اتفاقيات تنسيق متسقة باستخدام فئات Tailwind وأساليب مشروطة عبر المصفوفات وتركيبات التجميع مثل hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)، مع التكامل السلس مع @landfolk/tx من أجل تطبيقات React/Next.js قوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging grouping and Tailwind extraction issues in tx-styled components","Optimizing styling consistency across React/Next.js applications using tx prop and template literals","Enforcing best practices for conditional styles and className forwarding in styleable components"],"zh":["调试 tx-styled 组件中的分组和 Tailwind 提取问题","使用 tx 属性和模板字面量在 React/Next.js 应用中优化样式一致性","在可样式化组件中执行条件样式和 className 转发的最佳实践"],"ja":["tx-styled コンポーネントのグループ化および Tailwind 抽出に関する問題のデバッグ","tx プロパティおよびテンプレート リテラルを使用して React/Next.js アプリケーションでのスタイリングの一貫性を最適化","スタイリング可能なコンポーネントでの条件スタイルおよび className フォワーディングのベスト プラクティスを適用"],"ko":["tx-styled 컴포넌트의 그룹화 및 Tailwind 추출 관련 문제 디버깅","tx 속성 및 템플릿 리터럴을 사용하여 React/Next.js 애플리케이션의 스타일링 일관성을 최적화","스타일링 가능한 컴포넌트에서 조건부 스타일 및 className 전달의 베스트 프랙티스를 적용"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de agrupación y extracción de Tailwind en componentes tx-styled","Optimización de la coherencia de estilo en aplicaciones React/Next.js utilizando la propiedad tx y literales de plantilla","Aplicación de las mejores prácticas para estilos condicionales y reenvío de className en componentes estilables"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de regroupement et d''extraction de Tailwind dans les composants tx-styled","Optimisation de la cohérence des styles dans les applications React/Next.js en utilisant la propriété tx et les littéraux de modèle","Application des meilleures pratiques pour les styles conditionnels et le transfert de className dans les composants stylisables"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Gruppierungs- und Tailwind-Extraktionsproblemen in tx-styled-Komponenten","Optimierung der Stilkonsistenz in React/Next.js-Anwendungen unter Verwendung der tx-Eigenschaft und Template-Literale","Durchsetzung der Best Practices für bedingte Styles und className-Weiterleitung in stilbaren Komponenten"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de agrupamento e extração Tailwind em componentes tx-styled","Otimização da consistência de estilização em aplicações React/Next.js usando prop tx e literais de modelo","Impor as melhores práticas para estilos condicionais e encaminhamento de className em componentes estilizados"],"ru":["Отладка проблем группировки и извлечения Tailwind в компонентах tx-styled","Оптимизация согласованности стилизации в приложениях React/Next.js с помощью свойства tx и шаблонных литералов","Внедрение лучших практик для условных стилей и передачи className в компонентах, поддерживающих стилизацию"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء التجميع واستخراج Tailwind في المكونات المُصممة ب tx","تحسين الاتساق في التنسيق عبر تطبيقات React/Next.js باستخدام خاصية tx والتراكيب النموذجية","فرض أفضل الممارسات لأساليب مشروطة وتوجيه className في المكونات القابلة للتنسيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @landfolk/tx integration","Specific to React/Next.js applications","Limited to Tailwind CSS styling"],"zh":["需要 @landfolk/tx 集成","特定于 React/Next.js 应用","仅限于 Tailwind CSS 样式"],"ja":["@landfolk/tx の統合が必要","React/Next.js アプリケーションに特化","Tailwind CSS スタイルに限定"],"ko":["@landfolk/tx 통합이 필요","React/Next.js 애플리케이션에 특화","Tailwind CSS 스타일만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere integración con @landfolk/tx","Específico para aplicaciones React/Next.js","Limitado a estilos de Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec @landfolk/tx","Spécifique aux applications React/Next.js","Limité aux styles de Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit @landfolk/tx","Spezifisch für React/Next.js-Anwendungen","Begrenzt auf Tailwind-CSS-Stile"],"pt":["Exige integração com @landfolk/tx","Específico para aplicações React/Next.js","Limitado à estilização Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с @landfolk/tx","Специфичен для приложений React/Next.js","Ограничен стилизацией Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع @landfolk/tx","محدد لتطبيقات React/Next.js","محدود بتنسيق Tailwind CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('wrsmith108/governance-claude-skill/governance', 'community', 'wrsmith108', 'governance-claude-skill', 'wrsmith108/governance-claude-skill', 'governance', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z', '2026-02-18T07:05:29.072Z', NULL, '{"id":"wrsmith108/governance-claude-skill/governance","name":"governance","description":{"zh":"代码治理技能通过并行代理执行，强制执行工程标准和代码质量政策，提高代码效率","ja":"コードガバナンススキルは並列エージェント実行により、エンジニアリング標準とコード品質ポリシーを強制実行し、コードの効率を向上","ko":"코드 거버넌스 스킬은 병렬 에이전트 실행을 통해 엔지니어링 표준 및 코드 품질 정책을 강제 적용하여 코드 효율성을 향상","es":"La habilidad de gobernanza de Claude Code garantiza la calidad y los estándares en tus proyectos de desarrollo mediante la ejecución paralela de agentes","fr":"La compétence de gouvernance de Claude Code assure la qualité et les normes dans vos projets de développement grâce à l''exécution parallèle des agents","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur Code-Governance von Claude Code gewährleistet die Qualität und die Standards in Ihren Entwicklungsprojekten durch die parallele Ausführung von Agenten","en":"Claude Code skill for engineering standards and code governance enforcement"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码治理技能 - Claude Code","ja":"コードガバナンススキル - Claude Code","ko":"코드 거버넌스 스킬 - Claude Code","es":"Gobernanza de Código: Estándares y Cumplimiento","fr":"Gouvernance du Code: Normes et Conformité","de":"Code-Governance: Standards und Einhaltung","en":"governance"},"description":{"zh":"代码治理技能通过并行代理执行，强制执行工程标准和代码质量政策，提高代码效率","ja":"コードガバナンススキルは並列エージェント実行により、エンジニアリング標準とコード品質ポリシーを強制実行し、コードの効率を向上","ko":"코드 거버넌스 스킬은 병렬 에이전트 실행을 통해 엔지니어링 표준 및 코드 품질 정책을 강제 적용하여 코드 효율성을 향상","es":"La habilidad de gobernanza de Claude Code garantiza la calidad y los estándares en tus proyectos de desarrollo mediante la ejecución paralela de agentes","fr":"La compétence de gouvernance de Claude Code assure la qualité et les normes dans vos projets de développement grâce à l''exécution parallèle des agents","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur Code-Governance von Claude Code gewährleistet die Qualität und die Standards in Ihren Entwicklungsprojekten durch die parallele Ausführung ...","en":"Claude Code skill for engineering standards and code governance enforcement"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code skill for engineering standards and code governance enforcement"},"features":{"zh":["并行代理执行","工程标准强制执行","代码质量政策强制执行","提高代码效率","委托执行模型","支持多语言"],"ja":["並列エージェント実行","エンジニアリング標準の強制実行","コード品質ポリシーの強制実行","コードの効率向上","委託実行モデル","多言語対応"],"ko":["병렬 에이전트 실행","엔지니어링 표준 강제 적용","코드 품질 정책 강제 적용","코드 효율성 향상","위임 실행 모델","다중 언어 지원"],"es":["Ejecución paralela de agentes para mayor eficiencia","Aplicación de estándares y políticas de calidad","Soporte para la ejecución delegada","Integración con scripts de auditoría","Compatibilidad con la versión 2.0 del modelo de ejecución","Mejora de la calidad y la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Exécution parallèle des agents pour une plus grande efficacité","Application de normes et de politiques de qualité","Prise en charge de l''exécution déléguée","Intégration avec des scripts d''audit","Compatibilité avec la version 2.0 du modèle d''exécution","Amélioration de la qualité et de l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels"],"de":["Parallele Ausführung von Agenten für höhere Effizienz","Anwendung von Standards und Richtlinien für die Qualität","Unterstützung für die delegierte Ausführung","Integration mit Audit-Skripten","Kompatibilität mit der Version 2.0 des Ausführungsmodells","Verbesserung der Qualität und Effizienz in der Softwareentwicklung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码治理","工程标准","代码质量","并行代理执行","委托执行模型","代码效率","代码安全","代码规范"],"ja":["コードガバナンス","エンジニアリング標準","コード品質","並列エージェント実行","委託実行モデル","コードの効率","コードの安全性","コード規範"],"ko":["코드 거버넌스","엔지니어링 표준","코드 품질","병렬 에이전트 실행","위임 실행 모델","코드 효율성","코드 보안","코드 규范"],"es":["gobernanza de código","estándares de desarrollo","calidad del software","desarrollo de software","ejecución paralela","agentes delegados","auditoría de código","mejora de la calidad","eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["gouvernance du code","normes de développement","qualité du logiciel","développement de logiciels","exécution parallèle","agents délégués","audit de code","amélioration de la qualité","efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["Code-Governance","Entwicklungsstandards","Software-Qualität","Softwareentwicklung","parallele Ausführung","delegierte Agenten","Code-Audit","Qualitätsverbesserung","Effizienz in der Entwicklung"]}},"owner":"wrsmith108","repo":"governance-claude-skill","repoPath":"wrsmith108/governance-claude-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"governance","description":"Engineering standards and code governance enforcement with parallel agent execution. Triggers during code reviews, commits, and standards discussions. 70-90% token savings via delegated execution.","version":"2.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Governance Skill\n\nEnforces engineering standards and code quality policies with parallel agent execution for context efficiency.\n\n> **Standards Document**: [docs/architecture/standards.md](../../../docs/architecture/standards.md)\n> **Audit Script**: `npm run audit:standards`\n\n---\n\n## Execution Model (v2.0)\n\n**Type**: Delegated Execution\n\nThis skill operates through the `governance-specialist` subagent for context efficiency:\n\n1. **Spawn** the specialist agent in parallel\n2. **Delegate** the go","body":"# Governance Skill\n\nEnforces engineering standards and code quality policies with parallel agent execution for context efficiency.\n\n> **Standards Document**: [docs/architecture/standards.md](../../../docs/architecture/standards.md)\n> **Audit Script**: `npm run audit:standards`\n\n---\n\n## Execution Model (v2.0)\n\n**Type**: Delegated Execution\n\nThis skill operates through the `governance-specialist` subagent for context efficiency:\n\n1. **Spawn** the specialist agent in parallel\n2. **Delegate** the governance task with clear instructions\n3. **Await** completion without intervention\n4. **Report** the structured summary to the user\n\n### Token Efficiency\n\n| Execution Mode | Token Usage | Benefit |\n|----------------|-------------|---------|\n| Direct (v1.x) | ~3,000-8,000 | Full context in main thread |\n| Delegated (v2.0) | ~500-800 | 70-90% token savings |\n\n---\n\n## How to Invoke (Orchestrator Instructions)\n\nWhen this skill is triggered, delegate to a parallel agent:\n\n### Code Review\n```javascript\nTask({\n  description: \"Governance code review\",\n  prompt: `Review the following files for standards compliance:\n- [list files or PR description]\n\nExecute full code review workflow:\n1. Run standards audit\n2. Check each file against standards\n3. Fix ALL issues immediately (zero deferral)\n4. Create code review report\n5. Return structured summary`,\n  subagent_type: \"reviewer\"\n})\n```\n\n### Pre-Commit Check\n```javascript\nTask({\n  description: \"Pre-commit governance\",\n  prompt: `Run pre-commit governance checks:\n1. typecheck, lint, format:check, test\n2. Check for untracked source files\n3. Return pass/fail with specific failures`,\n  subagent_type: \"reviewer\"\n})\n```\n\n### Retrospective\n```javascript\nTask({\n  description: \"Run retrospective\",\n  prompt: `Run retrospective for [topic/sprint]:\n1. Analyze completed issues\n2. Gather metrics\n3. Write report\n4. Return summary`,\n  subagent_type: \"reviewer\"\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Behavioral Classification\n\n**Zero Deferral Policy**: The specialist fixes ALL issues immediately - no tickets, no \"later\".\n\n| Pattern | Status |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"Would you like me to fix these issues?\" | Anti-pattern |\n| \"Created ticket to track this for later.\" | Anti-pattern |\n| \"Found 5 issues. All fixed. Commits: abc123, def456.\" | Correct |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Run Setup Check\n\n```bash\nnode .claude/skills/governance/scripts/governance-check.mjs\n```\n\n### 2. Two-Document Model\n\n| Document | Purpose | Update Frequency |\n|----------|---------|------------------|\n| **CLAUDE.md** | AI operational context | Frequent |\n| **standards.md** | Engineering policy (authoritative) | Infrequent |\n\n### 3. Common Operations\n\n```bash\n# Check standards compliance\nnpm run audit:standards\n\n# Pre-commit suite\nnpm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Standards Quick Reference\n\n### Code Quality (§1)\n\n| Standard | Requirement | Check |\n|----------|-------------|-------|\n| TypeScript | Strict mode enabled | `npm run typecheck` |\n| No `any` types | Use `unknown` for external data | Audit script |\n| Max file length | 500 lines | Audit script |\n| JSDoc | Required for public APIs | Audit script |\n\n### Naming Conventions (§1.2)\n\n| Element | Convention | Example |\n|---------|------------|---------|\n| Components | PascalCase | `Button.tsx` |\n| Utilities | camelCase | `userService.ts` |\n| Constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE | `MAX_RETRIES` |\n| DB columns | snake_case | `user_id` |\n\n### Testing (§2)\n\n| Layer | Target |\n|-------|--------|\n| Unit tests | 90-100% |\n| API routes | 90-100% |\n| E2E critical | 100% |\n\n---\n\n## Compliance Check\n\n```bash\nnpm run audit:standards\n```\n\nChecks:\n- TypeScript strict mode\n- No `any` types in source\n- File length limits (500 lines)\n- JSDoc on exported functions\n- Test files exist\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns vs Correct Patterns\n\n### Code Quality\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Correct Pattern |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| ❌ `any` type | ✅ `unknown` for external data |\n| ❌ 600+ line files | ✅ Split at 500 lines |\n| ❌ Hardcoded secrets | ✅ Environment variables |\n\n### Workflow\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Correct Pattern |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| ❌ Commit to main | ✅ Feature branches with PR |\n| ❌ Skip audit | ✅ Run `audit:standards` before commit |\n| ❌ Defer issues | ✅ Fix immediately |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Commit Checklist\n\n```\n[ ] npm run typecheck\n[ ] npm run lint\n[ ] npm run test\n[ ] npm run audit:standards\n[ ] No console.log statements\n[ ] No hardcoded secrets\n```\n\n---\n\n## PR Review Checklist\n\n| Category | Criteria |\n|----------|----------|\n| Correctness | Does it work? Edge cases? |\n| Security | No secrets, injection, auth bypasses |\n| Performance | No N+1, memory leaks |\n| Testing | Tests exist for new code |\n\n---\n\n## Output Format (Specialist Response)\n\nThe governance-specialist returns structured summaries:\n\n```\n- **Task:** Code review for feature X\n- **Checks Run:** typecheck, lint, audit:standards\n- **Results:**\n  - Found 3 issues: 1 missing test, 1 type issue, 1 style\n  - All issues fixed in-place\n- **Issues Fixed:** 3 (commits: abc1234, def5678, ghi9012)\n- **Report:** docs/code_review/2026-01-28-feature-x.md\n- **Status:** PASS\n```\n\n---\n\n*Updated: January 2026*\n*Version 2.0.0 - Delegated Execution Model*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:29.072Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring rigorous enforcement of engineering standards and code quality policies","zh":"适用于需要严格执行工程标准和代码质量政策的代码审查代理","ja":"エンジニアリング標準とコード品質ポリシーの厳格な適用が必要なコードレビュー代理に適している","ko":"엔지니어링 표준 및 코드 품질 정책의 엄격한 적용이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren un cumplimiento riguroso de los estándares de ingeniería y las políticas de calidad de código","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une application stricte des normes d''ingénierie et des politiques de qualité de code","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine strenge Einhaltung der Ingenieurnormen und Codequalitätsrichtlinien erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem aplicação rigorosa de padrões de engenharia e políticas de qualidade de código","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих строгого соблюдения стандартов инженерии и политики качества кода","ar":"مثالية لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يتطلب تطبيق صارم لمعايير الهندسة وسياسات جودة الكود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce parallel execution for context efficiency, utilizing npm scripts like `npm run audit:standards` and referencing standards documents for adherence to best practices, ensuring high-quality code through delegated execution via the `governance-specialist` subagent","zh":"赋予代理执行并行执行以提高上下文效率，利用类似 `npm run audit:standards` 的npm脚本，并参考标准文档以遵循最佳实践，通过 `governance-specialist` 子代理的委托执行来确保高质量代码","ja":"コンテキスト効率のための並行実行をエージェントに実行させることで、`npm run audit:standards` のようなnpmスクリプトを利用し、標準文書を参照してベストプラクティスに従い、高品質コードを `governance-specialist` サブエージェントによる委託実行を通じて保証する","ko":"컨텍스트 효율성을 위한 병렬 실행을 에이전트에 실행시키는ことで, `npm run audit:standards`와 같은 npm 스크립트를 활용하고, 표준 문서를 참조하여 최선의 관행을 따르고, `governance-specialist` 서브 에이전트를 통해 위임 실행을 통해 고품질 코드를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar la ejecución paralela para la eficiencia del contexto, utilizando scripts de npm como `npm run audit:standards` y haciendo referencia a documentos de estándares para el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas, garantizando un código de alta calidad a través de la ejecución delegada a través del subagente `governance-specialist`","fr":"Habilite les agents à appliquer l''exécution parallèle pour l''efficacité du contexte, en utilisant des scripts npm comme `npm run audit:standards` et en faisant référence à des documents de normes pour le respect des meilleures pratiques, garantissant un code de haute qualité grâce à l''exécution déléguée via le sous-agent `governance-specialist`","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, parallele Ausführung für Kontexteffizienz durchzuführen, indem npm-Skripte wie `npm run audit:standards` verwendet und auf Standardsdokumente für die Einhaltung der Best Practices verwiesen wird, um einen hochwertigen Code durch die delegierte Ausführung über den Subagenten `governance-specialist` zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor a execução paralela para eficiência de contexto, utilizando scripts npm como `npm run audit:standards` e referenciando documentos de padrões para aderência às melhores práticas, garantindo código de alta qualidade por meio da execução delegada via subagente `governance-specialist`","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обеспечить параллельное выполнение для контекстной эффективности, используя скрипты npm, такие как `npm run audit:standards`, и ссылки на документы стандартов для соблюдения лучших практик, обеспечивая высококачественный код посредством делегированного выполнения через субагент `governance-specialist`","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من فرض التنفيذ الموازي لэффективية السياق، باستخدام نصوص npm مثل `npm run audit:standards` ومراجعة مستندات المعايير للامتثال لأفضل الممارسات، وضمان الحصول على كود عالي الجودة من خلال التنفيذ المفوض عبر وكيل `governance-specialist` الفرعي"},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing coding standards across large repositories","Automating code audits with parallel agent execution","Implementing delegated execution for efficient governance"],"zh":["在大型仓库中执行编码标准","使用并行代理执行自动代码审计","实施委托执行以实现高效治理"],"ja":["大規模リポジトリ全体でコード規約を適用する","並行エージェント実行による自動コード監査","効率的なガバナンスのための委託実行を実装する"],"ko":["대규모 저장소 전반에서 코딩 표준 적용","병렬 에이전트 실행을 통한 자동 코드 감사","효율적인 거버넌스를 위한 위임 실행 구현"],"es":["Aplicar estándares de codificación en grandes repositorios","Automatizar auditorías de código con la ejecución paralela de agentes","Implementar la ejecución delegada para una gobernanza eficiente"],"fr":["Appliquer des normes de codage dans de grands référentiels","Automatiser les audits de code avec l''exécution parallèle d''agents","Mettre en œuvre l''exécution déléguée pour une gouvernance efficace"],"de":["Codierungsstandards in großen Repositories durchsetzen","Code-Audits mit paralleler Agentenausführung automatisieren","Delegierte Ausführung für effiziente Governance implementieren"],"pt":["Aplicação de padrões de codificação em repositórios grandes","Automatização de auditorias de código com execução paralela de agentes","Implementação de execução delegada para governança eficiente"],"ru":["Применение стандартов кодирования в больших репозиториях","Автоматизация аудита кода с параллельным выполнением агентов","Реализация делегированного выполнения для эффективного управления"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير الترميز على مستودعات كبيرة","أتمتة تدقيق الكود مع تنفيذ موازي للوكيل","تنفيذ التنفيذ المفوض للحوكمة الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to standards documents like `docs/architecture/standards.md`","Dependent on npm for script execution","Limited to delegated execution model"],"zh":["需要访问类似 `docs/architecture/standards.md` 的标准文档","依赖于npm进行脚本执行","仅限于委托执行模型"],"ja":["`docs/architecture/standards.md` のような標準文書へのアクセスが必要","npmに依存してスクリプトを実行する","委託実行モデルのみに限定される"],"ko":["`docs/architecture/standards.md`와 같은 표준 문서에 접근할 필요가 있음","npm에 의존하여 스크립트를 실행","위임 실행 모델에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a documentos de estándares como `docs/arquitectura/estándares.md`","Depende de npm para la ejecución de scripts","Limitado al modelo de ejecución delegada"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des documents de normes comme `docs/architecture/standards.md`","Dépend de npm pour l''exécution de scripts","Limité au modèle d''exécution déléguée"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Standardsdokumente wie `docs/architektur/standards.md`","Hängt von npm für die Skriptausführung ab","Begrenzt auf das Modell der delegierten Ausführung"],"pt":["Exige acesso a documentos de padrões como `docs/architecture/standards.md`","Dependente do npm para execução de scripts","Limitado ao modelo de execução delegada"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документам стандартов, таким как `docs/architecture/standards.md`","Зависит от npm для выполнения скриптов","Ограничен моделью делегированного выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستندات المعايير مثل `docs/architecture/standards.md`","يعتمد على npm لتنفيذ البرامج النصية","محدود بنموذج التنفيذ المفوض"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('johnlindquist/claude/changelog', 'community', 'johnlindquist', 'claude', 'johnlindquist/claude', 'changelog', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z', '2026-02-18T07:05:29.321Z', NULL, '{"id":"johnlindquist/claude/changelog","name":"changelog","description":{"zh":"Changelog Git","ja":"Changelog Git","ko":"Changelog Git","es":"El generador de registros de cambios crea y administra notas de lanzamiento a partir de confirmaciones de Git","fr":"Le générateur de journal des modifications crée et gère les notes de version à partir de validations Git","de":"Der Changelog-Generator erstellt und verwaltet Versionshinweise aus Git-Commits","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Changelog ","ja":"Changelog","ko":"Changelog ","es":"Generador de registros de cambios","fr":"Générateur de journal des modifications","de":"Changelog-Generator","en":"changelog"},"description":{"zh":"Changelog Git","ja":"Changelog Git","ko":"Changelog Git","es":"El generador de registros de cambios crea y administra notas de lanzamiento a partir de confirmaciones de Git","fr":"Le générateur de journal des modifications crée et gère les notes de version à partir de validations Git","de":"Der Changelog-Generator erstellt und verwaltet Versionshinweise aus Git-Commits","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Git","GitHub CLI","Gemini AI","20","Git","Gemini AI"],"ja":["Git","GitHub CLI","Gemini AI","20","Git","Gemini AI"],"ko":["Git","GitHub CLI","Gemini AI","20","Git","Gemini AI"],"es":["Generación de registros de cambios a partir de confirmaciones de Git","Administración de notas de lanzamiento","Compatibilidad con GitHub CLI","Resumen de cambios con Gemini","Historial de commits","Filtrado de commits por etiquetas"],"fr":["Génération de journaux des modifications à partir de validations Git","Gestion des notes de version","Compatibilité avec GitHub CLI","Résumé des modifications avec Gemini","Historique des validations","Filtrage des validations par étiquettes"],"de":["Erstellung von Änderungsprotokollen aus Git-Commits","Verwaltung von Versionshinweisen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub CLI","Zusammenfassung von Änderungen mit Gemini","Commits-Historie","Filtern von Commits nach Tags"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Changelog","Git","GitHub CLI","Gemini AI","Git","AI","Changelog","DevOps","Release Notes"],"ja":["Changelog","Git","GitHub CLI","Gemini AI","Git","AI","Changelog","DevOps","Release Notes"],"ko":["Changelog","Git","GitHub CLI","Gemini AI","Git","AI","Changelog","DevOps","Release Notes"],"es":["generador de registros de cambios","git","github cli","gemini","notas de lanzamiento","historial de commits","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","gestión de versiones"],"fr":["générateur de journal des modifications","git","github cli","gemini","notes de version","historique des validations","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","gestion de versions"],"de":["changelog-generator","git","github cli","gemini","versionshinweise","commits-historie","software-entwicklung","entwicklungstools","versionsverwaltung"]}},"owner":"johnlindquist","repo":"claude","repoPath":"johnlindquist/claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"changelog","description":"Generate and manage changelogs from git history. Use for release notes, tracking breaking changes, and maintaining project history.","bodyPreview":"# Changelog Generator\n\nGenerate changelogs from git commits and manage release notes.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Git\ngit --version\n\n# GitHub CLI (for release notes)\nbrew install gh\ngh auth login\n\n# Gemini (for AI summaries)\npip install google-generativeai\nexport GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key\n```\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n### Git History Commands\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits\ngit log --oneline -20\n\n# Since last tag\ngit log $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0)..HEAD --oneline\n\n# Between tags\ngit log v1.0.0..v1.","body":"# Changelog Generator\n\nGenerate changelogs from git commits and manage release notes.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Git\ngit --version\n\n# GitHub CLI (for release notes)\nbrew install gh\ngh auth login\n\n# Gemini (for AI summaries)\npip install google-generativeai\nexport GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key\n```\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n### Git History Commands\n\n```bash\n# Recent commits\ngit log --oneline -20\n\n# Since last tag\ngit log $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0)..HEAD --oneline\n\n# Between tags\ngit log v1.0.0..v1.1.0 --oneline\n\n# With full messages\ngit log v1.0.0..v1.1.0 --pretty=format:\"%h %s%n%b\"\n\n# By author\ngit log --author=\"name\" --oneline -10\n\n# With dates\ngit log --format=\"%h %ad %s\" --date=short\n```\n\n### Finding Tags\n\n```bash\n# List all tags\ngit tag\n\n# List tags with dates\ngit tag --sort=-creatordate --format=''%(refname:short) %(creatordate:short)''\n\n# Latest tag\ngit describe --tags --abbrev=0\n\n# Tags matching pattern\ngit tag -l \"v1.*\"\n```\n\n### Generating Changelogs\n\n#### From Git Log\n```bash\n# Simple changelog since tag\ngit log v1.0.0..HEAD --oneline > CHANGELOG_DRAFT.md\n\n# Categorized by conventional commits\ngit log v1.0.0..HEAD --oneline | grep \"^[a-f0-9]* feat:\"\ngit log v1.0.0..HEAD --oneline | grep \"^[a-f0-9]* fix:\"\ngit log v1.0.0..HEAD --oneline | grep \"^[a-f0-9]* chore:\"\n```\n\n#### Using GitHub CLI\n```bash\n# Generate release notes\ngh release create v1.1.0 --generate-notes\n\n# View release notes draft\ngh release create v1.1.0 --generate-notes --notes-start-tag v1.0.0 --dry-run\n\n# From existing release\ngh release view v1.0.0\n```\n\n### AI-Generated Changelog\n\n```bash\n# Get commits since last tag\nCOMMITS=$(git log $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0)..HEAD --pretty=format:\"%s%n%b\")\n\n# Generate polished changelog\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Generate a changelog from these commits:\n\n$COMMITS\n\nFormat as:\n## [Version] - Date\n\n### Added\n- New features\n\n### Changed\n- Modifications\n\n### Fixed\n- Bug fixes\n\n### Breaking Changes\n- Any breaking changes\n\nWrite user-friendly descriptions, not raw commit messages.\"\n```\n\n## Workflow Patterns\n\n### Release Preparation\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nVERSION=$1\nLAST_TAG=$(git describe --tags --abbrev=0)\n\necho \"# Release $VERSION\"\necho \"\"\necho \"Changes since $LAST_TAG:\"\necho \"\"\n\n# Categorize commits\necho \"## Features\"\ngit log $LAST_TAG..HEAD --oneline | grep -i \"feat:\" | sed ''s/^[a-f0-9]* feat: /- /''\n\necho \"\"\necho \"## Fixes\"\ngit log $LAST_TAG..HEAD --oneline | grep -i \"fix:\" | sed ''s/^[a-f0-9]* fix: /- /''\n\necho \"\"\necho \"## Other\"\ngit log $LAST_TAG..HEAD --oneline | grep -v -i \"feat:\\|fix:\" | sed ''s/^[a-f0-9]* /- /''\n```\n\n### Breaking Changes Detection\n\n```bash\n# Find breaking changes in commit messages\ngit log v1.0.0..HEAD --oneline | grep -i \"breaking\\|BREAKING\"\n\n# Find in commit bodies\ngit log v1.0.0..HEAD --grep=\"BREAKING\" --pretty=format:\"%h %s\"\n```\n\n### Maintaining CHANGELOG.md\n\nStandard format (Keep a Changelog):\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n### Added\n- New feature X\n\n### Changed\n- Updated Y\n\n### Fixed\n- Bug in Z\n\n## [1.1.0] - 2024-01-15\n\n### Added\n- Feature A\n- Feature B\n\n### Fixed\n- Issue #123\n```\n\n### Update Script\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nVERSION=$1\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\n# Generate new section\nNEW_SECTION=\"## [$VERSION] - $DATE\n\n$(git log $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0)..HEAD --pretty=format:\"- %s\")\n\"\n\n# Prepend to changelog (after header)\nhead -7 CHANGELOG.md > CHANGELOG_NEW.md\necho \"\" >> CHANGELOG_NEW.md\necho \"$NEW_SECTION\" >> CHANGELOG_NEW.md\necho \"\" >> CHANGELOG_NEW.md\ntail -n +8 CHANGELOG.md >> CHANGELOG_NEW.md\nmv CHANGELOG_NEW.md CHANGELOG.md\n```\n\n## Statistics\n\n```bash\n# Commits by author since tag\ngit shortlog -sn v1.0.0..HEAD\n\n# Files changed\ngit diff --stat v1.0.0..HEAD | tail -1\n\n# Commits per day\ngit log --format=\"%ad\" --date=short v1.0.0..HEAD | sort | uniq -c\n\n# Most changed files\ngit diff --stat v1.0.0..HEAD | sort -k3 -n -r | head -10\n```\n\n## GitHub Releases\n\n```bash\n# Create release with notes\ngh release create v1.1.0 --title \"v1.1.0\" --notes-file RELEASE_NOTES.md\n\n# Create from tag with auto-notes\ngh release create v1.1.0 --generate-notes\n\n# Edit existing release\ngh release edit v1.1.0 --notes-file UPDATED_NOTES.md\n\n# List releases\ngh release list\n\n# Download release assets\ngh release download v1.1.0\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use conventional commits** - Enables automatic categorization\n2. **Tag releases** - Clean boundaries for changelogs\n3. **Write for users** - Translate technical to user impact\n4. **Note breaking changes** - Prominently marked\n5. **Include issue references** - Link to related issues\n6. **Date your releases** - Clear timeline\n7. **Keep unreleased section** - Track ongoing work\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:29.321Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated changelog generation from git commits.","zh":"非常适合需要从git提交生成自动变更日志的开发代理。","ja":"Gitコミットから自動的に変更履歴を生成する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Git 커밋에서 자동으로 변경 기록을 생성해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan generación automática de registros de cambios desde los commits de git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération automatique de journaux des modifications à partir des commits Git.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungss_agenten, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen aus Git-Commits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração automatizada de registros de alterações a partir de commits do git.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное создание журнала изменений из коммитов git.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلقائي لسجل التغييرات من التعليقات الغيت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate changelogs from git history using Git CLI and GitHub CLI, and manage release notes with Gemini AI summaries via the google-generativeai library.","zh":"赋予代理从git历史记录中使用Git CLI和GitHub CLI生成变更日志的能力，并通过google-generativeai库中的Gemini AI摘要管理发布说明。","ja":"Git CLIとGitHub CLIを使用してGitの履歴から変更履歴を生成し、google-generativeaiライブラリ内のGemini AIのサマリーを介してリリースノートを管理する機能をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"Git CLI와 GitHub CLI를 사용하여 Git 기록에서 변경 기록을 생성하고 google-generativeai 라이브러리의 Gemini AI 요약을 통해 릴리스 노트를 관리할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar registros de cambios desde el historial de git utilizando Git CLI y GitHub CLI, y gestionar notas de lanzamiento con resúmenes de Gemini AI a través de la biblioteca google-generativeai.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des journaux des modifications à partir de l''historique Git en utilisant Git CLI et GitHub CLI, et de gérer les notes de version avec les résumés de Gemini AI via la bibliothèque google-generativeai.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Änderungsprotokolle aus dem Git-Verlauf mit Git CLI und GitHub CLI zu generieren und Versionshinweise mit Gemini-KI-Zusammenfassungen über die google-generativeai-Bibliothek zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar registros de alterações a partir do histórico do git usando Git CLI e GitHub CLI, e gerenciar notas de lançamento com resumos de IA da Gemini via biblioteca google-generativeai.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать журналы изменений из истории git с помощью Git CLI и GitHub CLI, а также управлять заметками о выпуске с помощью резюме ИИ от Gemini через библиотеку google-generativeai.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد سجلات التغييرات من تاريخ الغيت باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر الغيت و واجهة سطر أوامر جيت هب، وإدارة ملاحظات الإصدار مع ملخصات الذكاء الاصطناعي من جيميني عبر مكتبة جوجل-الذكاء الإبداعي"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating changelogs from recent commits","Automating release note management between tags","Debugging git commit history since last tag"],"zh":["从最近的提交生成变更日志","自动管理标签之间的发布说明","调试自上一个标签以来的Git提交历史"],"ja":["最近のコミットから変更履歴を生成する","タグ間のリリースノートを自動管理する","前のタグ以降のGitコミット履歴をデバッグする"],"ko":["최근 커밋에서 변경 기록을 생성하는 것","태그 간 릴리스 노트를 자동으로 관리하는 것","이전 태그 이후의 Git 커밋 기록을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Generar registros de cambios desde los commits recientes","Automatizar la gestión de notas de lanzamiento entre etiquetas","Depurar el historial de commits de git desde la última etiqueta"],"fr":["Générer des journaux des modifications à partir des commits récents","Automatiser la gestion des notes de version entre les balises","Déboguer l''historique des commits Git depuis la dernière balise"],"de":["Änderungsprotokolle aus den letzten Commits generieren","Automatisieren der Verwaltung von Versionshinweisen zwischen Tags","Fehlerbehebung des Git-Commit-Verlaufs seit dem letzten Tag"],"pt":["Geração de registros de alterações a partir de commits recentes","Automação da gestão de notas de lançamento entre tags","Depuração do histórico de commits do git desde a última tag"],"ru":["Генерация журналов изменений из недавних коммитов","Автоматизация управления заметками о выпуске между тегами","Отладка истории коммитов git с момента последнего тега"],"ar":["توليد سجلات التغييرات من التعليقات الأخيرة","أتمتة إدارة ملاحظات الإصدار بين العلامات","تصحيح أخطاء تاريخ التعليقات الغيت منذ العلامة الأخيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Needs GitHub CLI for release notes","Depends on Gemini API Key for AI summaries","Python 3.x required for google-generativeai library"],"zh":["需要Git安装","需要GitHub CLI来管理发布说明","依赖于Gemini API密钥来生成AI摘要","需要Python 3.x来使用google-generativeai库"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","リリースノートを管理するためにGitHub CLIが必要","Gemini APIキーのサマリーを生成するために依存","google-generativeaiライブラリを使用するためにPython 3.xが必要"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요합니다","릴리스 노트를 관리하기 위해 GitHub CLI가 필요합니다","AI 요약을 생성하기 위해 Gemini API 키에 의존합니다","google-generativeai 라이브러리를 사용하기 위해 Python 3.x가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Git","Necesita GitHub CLI para las notas de lanzamiento","Depende de la clave de API de Gemini para los resúmenes de AI","Se requiere Python 3.x para la biblioteca google-generativeai"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","A besoin de GitHub CLI pour les notes de version","Dépend de la clé d''API de Gemini pour les résumés de l''IA","Python 3.x est requis pour la bibliothèque google-generativeai"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Git","Benötigt GitHub CLI für Versionshinweise","Hängt von dem Gemini-API-Schlüssel für KI-Zusammenfassungen ab","Python 3.x wird für die google-generativeai-Bibliothek benötigt"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Necessita de GitHub CLI para notas de lançamento","Depende da Chave de API da Gemini para resumos de IA","Python 3.x necessário para biblioteca google-generativeai"],"ru":["Требуется установка Git","Необходим GitHub CLI для заметок о выпуске","Зависит от ключа API Gemini для резюме ИИ","Python 3.x требуется для библиотеки google-generativeai"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت الغيت","يحتاج إلى واجهة سطر أوامر جيت هب لملاحظات الإصدار","يعتمد على مفتاح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات جيميني لملخصات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بايثون 3.x مطلوب لمكتبة جوجل-الذكاء الإبداعي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
