 asistida por IA te ayuda a mejorar tu código de manera sistemática. Aprende a migrar de JavaScript a TypeScript","fr":"Notre outil de réfactoration assisté par IA vous aide à améliorer votre code de manière systématique. Découvrez comment migrer de JavaScript à TypeScript","de":"Unser Tool für Refactoring mit KI-Unterstützung hilft Ihnen, Ihren Code systematisch zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie von JavaScript zu TypeScript migrieren","pt":"O Refatoramento de Código é uma técnica que melhora a qualidade do software com a ajuda da IA","ru":"Рефакторинг кода - это техника, которая улучшает качество программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ","ar":"إعادة هيكلة الكود هو تقنية تحسن جودة البرامج باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持JavaScript到TypeScript的转换","使用AI指导进行代码优化","提供系统化的代码重构功能","支持多种编程语言","提高代码可维护性和可扩展性"],"ja":["JavaScriptからTypeScriptへの変換をサポート","AIガイダンスを使用してコードを最適化","体系的コードリファクタリング機能を提供","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","コードのメンテナンス性と拡張性を向上させる"],"ko":["JavaScript에서 TypeScript로의 변환 지원","AI 가이드를 사용하여 코드를 최적화","체계적인 코드 리팩토링 기능 제공","다양한 프로그래밍 언어 지원","코드의 유지 보수성과 확장성을 향상시키는"],"es":["Análisis de código con IA","Migración de JavaScript a TypeScript","Mejora de la legibilidad del código","Optimización del rendimiento","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Analyse de code avec IA","Migration de JavaScript à TypeScript","Amélioration de la lisibilité du code","Optimisation des performances","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Code-Analyse mit KI","Migration von JavaScript zu TypeScript","Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit des Codes","Optimierung der Leistung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Análise de código com IA","Sugestões de refatoramento","Conversão de JavaScript para TypeScript","Otimização de código","Melhoria da legibilidade do código"],"ru":["Анализ кода с ИИ","Предложения по рефакторингу","Преобразование JavaScript в TypeScript","Оптимизация кода","Улучшение читаемости кода"],"ar":["تحليل الكود بالذكاء الاصطناعي","اقتراحات لإعادة هيكلة الكود","تحويل جافا سكريبت إلى تايب سكريبت","تحسين الكود","تحسين قراءة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码重构","AI指导","代码优化","TypeScript","JavaScript","代码可维护性","代码可扩展性"],"ja":["コードリファクタリング","AIガイダンス","コード最適化","TypeScript","JavaScript","コードメンテナンス性","コード拡張性"],"ko":["코드 리팩토링","AI 가이드","코드 최적화","TypeScript","JavaScript","코드 유지 보수성","코드 확장성"],"es":["refactorización de código","IA en desarrollo","migración a TypeScript","mejora de código","optimización de rendimiento","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["réfactoration de code","IA dans le développement","migration vers TypeScript","amélioration de code","optimisation des performances","outils de développement"],"de":["Code-Refaktorisierung","KI im Entwicklung","Migration zu TypeScript","Code-Verbesserung","Leistungs-Optimierung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["refatoramento de código","IA no desenvolvimento de software","melhoria da qualidade do software","análise de código","sugestões de refatoramento","conversão de JavaScript para TypeScript"],"ru":["рефакторинг кода","ИИ в разработке программного обеспечения","улучшение качества программного обеспечения","анализ кода","предложения по рефакторингу","преобразование JavaScript в TypeScript"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الكود","الذكاء الاصطناعي في تطوير البرامج","تحسين جودة البرامج","تحليل الكود","اقتراحات لإعادة هيكلة الكود","تحويل جافا سكريبت إلى تايب سكريبت"]}},"owner":"johnlindquist","repo":"claude","repoPath":"johnlindquist/claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refactor","description":"Code refactoring with AI assistance. Use for modernizing code, converting JavaScript to TypeScript, class to hooks conversions, and systematic renaming.","bodyPreview":"# Refactoring Assistant\n\nSystematic code refactoring with AI guidance.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Gemini for analysis and suggestions\npip install google-generativeai\nexport GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key\n\n# AST-based tools\nnpm install -g jscodeshift\nnpm install -g typescript\n```\n\n## Refactoring Operations\n\n### JavaScript to TypeScript\n\n```bash\n# Step 1: Rename file\nmv file.js file.ts\n\n# Step 2: AI assistance for types\nCODE=$(cat file.ts)\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Convert this JavaScript to Typ","body":"# Refactoring Assistant\n\nSystematic code refactoring with AI guidance.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Gemini for analysis and suggestions\npip install google-generativeai\nexport GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key\n\n# AST-based tools\nnpm install -g jscodeshift\nnpm install -g typescript\n```\n\n## Refactoring Operations\n\n### JavaScript to TypeScript\n\n```bash\n# Step 1: Rename file\nmv file.js file.ts\n\n# Step 2: AI assistance for types\nCODE=$(cat file.ts)\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Convert this JavaScript to TypeScript with proper types:\n\n$CODE\n\nRequirements:\n- Add explicit types for function parameters and returns\n- Create interfaces for object shapes\n- Use strict TypeScript (no any unless necessary)\n- Preserve functionality exactly\"\n```\n\n### Class to React Hooks\n\n```bash\nCODE=$(cat ClassComponent.tsx)\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Convert this React class component to functional component with hooks:\n\n$CODE\n\nRequirements:\n- Convert state to useState\n- Convert lifecycle methods to useEffect\n- Convert class methods to functions\n- Preserve all functionality\n- Use proper TypeScript types\"\n```\n\n### Modernize Code\n\n```bash\nCODE=$(cat legacy.ts)\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Modernize this code to current best practices:\n\n$CODE\n\nApply:\n- ES2023+ features where appropriate\n- Modern TypeScript patterns\n- Current framework idioms\n- Better error handling\n- Improved readability\"\n```\n\n### Systematic Rename\n\n```bash\n# Using sed for simple renames\nfind src -name \"*.ts\" -exec sed -i '''' ''s/oldName/newName/g'' {} +\n\n# Using ripgrep to preview\nrg \"oldName\" src/\n\n# With jscodeshift for AST-safe rename\nnpx jscodeshift -t rename-transform.ts src/\n\n# AI-assisted rename planning\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"I want to rename ''oldName'' to ''newName'' across the codebase.\n\nFiles that use it:\n$(rg -l \"oldName\" src/)\n\nSuggest:\n1. Order of changes to avoid breaks\n2. Any tricky cases to watch for\n3. Tests to run after\"\n```\n\n## Analysis Commands\n\n### Find Refactoring Opportunities\n\n```bash\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Analyze this code for refactoring opportunities:\n\n$(cat src/module.ts)\n\nLook for:\n- Code duplication\n- Long functions\n- Deep nesting\n- Magic numbers/strings\n- Poor naming\n- Missing abstractions\n- Tight coupling\"\n```\n\n### Complexity Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Find complex functions\nrg \"function|=>\\s*{\" src/ -A 50 | head -200\n\n# Ask AI to identify complexity\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Identify the most complex functions in this code and suggest simplifications:\n\n$(cat src/complex-file.ts)\"\n```\n\n## Safe Refactoring Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Ensure Test Coverage\n\n```bash\n# Check coverage before refactoring\nnpm test -- --coverage\n\n# Identify untested code\nnpx jest --coverage --coverageReporters=text | grep -E \"^(File|.*\\|)\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Plan the Refactoring\n\n```bash\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Plan a safe refactoring for:\n\nCURRENT CODE:\n$(cat src/file.ts)\n\nGOAL: [what you want to improve]\n\nProvide:\n1. Step-by-step plan\n2. Risk assessment\n3. Rollback strategy\n4. Tests to add first\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Small, Tested Changes\n\n```bash\n# Make one small change\n# Run tests\nnpm test\n\n# Commit if green\ngit add -A && git commit -m \"refactor: [specific change]\"\n\n# Repeat\n```\n\n### Step 4: Verify Behavior\n\n```bash\n# Compare before/after behavior\n# Run integration tests\n# Manual testing if needed\n```\n\n## Common Refactorings\n\n### Extract Function\n\n```bash\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Extract a reusable function from this code:\n\n$(cat src/file.ts | sed -n ''10,50p'')\n\nCreate a well-named function with:\n- Clear parameters\n- Typed return value\n- JSDoc comment\n- Single responsibility\"\n```\n\n### Simplify Conditionals\n\n```bash\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Simplify these conditionals:\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\n$(rg -A 10 \"if.*{\" src/file.ts)\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nUse:\n- Early returns\n- Guard clauses\n- Lookup tables where appropriate\n- Optional chaining\"\n```\n\n### Remove Duplication\n\n```bash\n# Find similar code\ngemini -m pro -o text -e \"\" \"Find duplicate or similar code patterns in:\n\n$(cat src/*.ts)\n\nSuggest how to DRY it up with:\n- Shared functions\n- Higher-order functions\n- Generics if TypeScript\"\n```\n\n## jscodeshift Transforms\n\n### Create Transform\n\n```typescript\n// rename-transform.ts\nexport default function transformer(file, api) {\n  const j = api.jscodeshift;\n  return j(file.source)\n    .find(j.Identifier, { name: ''oldName'' })\n    .replaceWith(j.identifier(''newName''))\n    .toSource();\n}\n```\n\n### Run Transform\n\n```bash\n# Dry run\nnpx jscodeshift -d -p -t transform.ts src/\n\n# Apply\nnpx jscodeshift -t transform.ts src/\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Test first** - Don''t refactor untested code\n2. **Small steps** - One change at a time\n3. **Commit often** - Each working state\n4. **Preserve behavior** - Refactoring isn''t rewriting\n5. **Use tools** - AST transforms > find-replace\n6. **Review diffs** - Verify each change\n7. **Run tests continuously** - Catch breaks early\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:01.954Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Optimization Agents needing systematic refactoring with AI guidance and AST-based tools like jscodeshift and typescript.","zh":"非常适合需要系统重构的代码优化代理，具有AI指导和基于AST的工具，如jscodeshift和typescript。","ja":"コード最適化エージェントが体系的にリファクタリングする必要がある場合に最適です。AIのガイダンスとjscodeshiftやtypescriptなどのASTベースのツールを使用します。","ko":"코드 최적화 에이전트가 체계적인 리팩토링을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. AI 가이드와 jscodeshift 및 typescript 같은 AST 기반 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de código que necesitan refactorización sistemática con orientación de IA y herramientas basadas en AST como jscodeshift y typescript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de code nécessitant une refactorisation systématique avec une orientation IA et des outils basés sur AST tels que jscodeshift et typescript.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Optimierungsagenten, die eine systematische Refaktorierung mit KI-Anleitung und AST-basierten Tools wie jscodeshift und typescript benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Código que necessitam de refatoração sistemática com orientação de IA e ferramentas baseadas em AST, como jscodeshift e typescript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации кода, которым требуется системная рефакторинг с помощью руководства ИИ и инструментов на основе AST, таких как jscodeshift и typescript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين الكود الذي يحتاج إلى إعادة هيكلة منهجية مع توجيه ذكاء اصطناعي وأدوات قائمة على AST مثل jscodeshift و typescript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform systematic code refactoring with AI assistance, utilizing libraries like google-generativeai for analysis and suggestions, and supporting conversions such as JavaScript to TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理使用AI辅助进行系统代码重构的能力，利用如google-generativeai的库进行分析和建议，并支持如JavaScript到TypeScript的转换。","ja":"エージェントがAIの支援を受けて体系的にコードをリファクタリングできるようにします。google-generativeaiなどのライブラリを使用して分析と提案を行い、JavaScriptからTypeScriptへの変換などのサポートを行います。","ko":"에이전트가 AI의 지원을 받아 체계적으로 코드를 리팩토링할 수 있도록 합니다. google-generativeai 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 분석과 제안을 수행하며, JavaScript에서 TypeScript로의 변환 같은 것을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar una refactorización de código sistemática con asistencia de IA, utilizando bibliotecas como google-generativeai para análisis y sugerencias, y admitiendo conversiones como de JavaScript a TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une refactorisation de code systématique avec une assistance IA, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme google-generativeai pour l''analyse et les suggestions, et en prenant en charge des conversions telles que JavaScript vers TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine systematische Code-Refaktorierung mit KI-Unterstützung durchzuführen, indem Bibliotheken wie google-generativeai für Analyse und Vorschläge verwendet werden und Konvertierungen wie von JavaScript zu TypeScript unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar refatoração de código sistemática com assistência de IA, utilizando bibliotecas como google-generativeai para análise e sugestões, e suportando conversões como JavaScript para TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять системную рефакторинг кода с помощью ИИ, используя библиотеки như google-generativeai для анализа и предложений, и поддерживая преобразования, такие как JavaScript в TypeScript.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من أداء إعادة هيكلة الكود المنهجية بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي، باستخدام مكتبات مثل google-generativeai للتحليل والاقتراحات، ودعم التحويلات مثل جافاسكريبت إلى تايبسكريبت."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring JavaScript code to TypeScript for enhanced type safety","Automating code analysis and suggestion generation with Gemini","Migrating existing JavaScript projects to TypeScript for better maintainability"],"zh":["将JavaScript代码重构为TypeScript以提高类型安全性","使用Gemini自动化代码分析和建议生成","将现有的JavaScript项目迁移到TypeScript以提高可维护性"],"ja":["JavaScriptコードをTypeScriptにリファクタリングしてタイプセーフティを高める","Geminiを使用してコード分析と提案の生成を自動化する","既存のJavaScriptプロジェクトをTypeScriptに移行してメンテナンス性を高める"],"ko":["JavaScript 코드를 TypeScript로 리팩토링하여 타입 안전성을 향상시키기","Gemini를 사용하여 코드 분석 및 제안 생성을 자동화하기","기존 JavaScript 프로젝트를 TypeScript로 마이그레이션하여 유지보수성을 향상시키기"],"es":["Refactorización de código JavaScript a TypeScript para una mayor seguridad de tipos","Automatización del análisis y la generación de sugerencias con Gemini","Migración de proyectos JavaScript existentes a TypeScript para una mejor mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Refactorisation de code JavaScript en TypeScript pour une s