laude Code","ConstraintLayout","Jetpack Compose","дизайн пользовательского интерфейса","приложения Android","плагин разработки"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم","اندرويد","Claude Code","ConstraintLayout","Jetpack Compose","تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تطبيقات اندرويد","إضافة تطوير"]}},"owner":"pluginagentmarketplace","repo":"custom-plugin-android","repoPath":"pluginagentmarketplace/custom-plugin-android","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui","description":"XML layouts, ConstraintLayout, Jetpack Compose, Material Design 3.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# UI Design Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### ConstraintLayout\n```xml\n<androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>\n    <Button\n        android:id=\"@+id/btn\"\n        android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"\n        android:layout_height=\"wrap_content\"\n        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf=\"parent\"\n        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf=\"parent\"\n        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf=\"parent\" />\n</androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>\n```\n\n### Jetpack Compose\n```kotlin\nColumn(mo","body":"# UI Design Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### ConstraintLayout\n```xml\n<androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>\n    <Button\n        android:id=\"@+id/btn\"\n        android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"\n        android:layout_height=\"wrap_content\"\n        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf=\"parent\"\n        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf=\"parent\"\n        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf=\"parent\" />\n</androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>\n```\n\n### Jetpack Compose\n```kotlin\nColumn(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize().padding(16.dp)) {\n    Text(\"Hello Compose\", fontSize = 20.sp)\n    Button(onClick = { }) { Text(\"Click Me\") }\n}\n```\n\n### Material Design 3\n```kotlin\nScaffold(\n    topBar = { TopAppBar(title = { Text(\"MyApp\") }) }\n) { padding ->\n    // Content\n}\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n### Constraint Types\n- Start/End, Top/Bottom\n- Chains (spread, packed)\n- Guidelines\n- Barriers\n- Bias\n\n### Compose State\n```kotlin\nvar count by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }\nButton(onClick = { count++ }) { Text(\"Count: $count\") }\n```\n\n### Material Components\n- Buttons (filled, outlined, text)\n- Cards, FABs, Dialogs\n- Navigation patterns\n- Theme system\n\n## Best Practices\n\n✅ Use ConstraintLayout for efficiency\n✅ Implement Material Design\n✅ Test on multiple screen sizes\n✅ Optimize rendering performance\n✅ Support accessibility\n\n## Resources\n\n- [ConstraintLayout Guide](https://developer.android.com/training/constraint-layout)\n- [Compose Documentation](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose)\n- [Material Design 3](https://m3.material.io/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:08.073Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Android Development Agents needing advanced UI design capabilities with ConstraintLayout and Jetpack Compose","zh":"非常适合需要高级UI设计能力的Android开发代理，特别是使用ConstraintLayout和Jetpack Compose","ja":"Android開発エージェントがConstraintLayoutおよびJetpack Composeを使用して高度なUIデザイン機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"ConstraintLayout와 Jetpack Compose를 사용하여 고급 UI 설계 기능이 필요한 Android 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Android que necesitan capacidades de diseño de interfaz de usuario avanzadas con ConstraintLayout y Jetpack Compose","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Android ayant besoin de capacités de conception d''interface utilisateur avancées avec ConstraintLayout et Jetpack Compose","de":"Perfekt für Android-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Benutzeroberflächendesignfunktionen mit ConstraintLayout und Jetpack Compose benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Android que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design de UI com ConstraintLayout e Jetpack Compose","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Android, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проектирования интерфейса пользователя с помощью ConstraintLayout и Jetpack Compose","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى مهارات تصميم واجهة المستخدم المتقدمة باستخدام ConstraintLayout و Jetpack Compose"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement responsive Android UI components using ConstraintLayout and Kotlin-based Jetpack Compose, enabling seamless integration with Android development plugins like Claude Code","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现使用ConstraintLayout和基于Kotlin的Jetpack Compose的响应式Android UI组件的能力，使得与Android开发插件（如Claude Code）实现无缝集成","ja":"ConstraintLayoutおよびKotlinベースのJetpack Composeを使用して、レスポンシブなAndroid UIコンポーネントを設計および実装するエージェントの能力を提供し、Android開発プラグイン（Claude Codeなど）とのシームレスな統合を可能に","ko":"ConstraintLayout와 Kotlin 기반의 Jetpack Compose를 사용하여 반응형 Android UI 컴포넌트를 설계하고 구현할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 Android 개발 플러그인(Claude Code 등)과 無縫な 통합을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar componentes de interfaz de usuario de Android responsivos utilizando ConstraintLayout y Jetpack Compose basado en Kotlin, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con plugins de desarrollo de Android como Claude Code","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des composants d''interface utilisateur Android responsifs en utilisant ConstraintLayout et Jetpack Compose basé sur Kotlin, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec des plugins de développement Android comme Claude Code","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, responsive Android-Benutzeroberflächenelemente mit ConstraintLayout und Kotlin-basiertem Jetpack Compose zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Android-Entwicklungs-Plugins wie Claude Code ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar componentes de UI do Android responsivos usando ConstraintLayout e Jetpack Compose baseado em Kotlin, permitindo uma integração perfeita com plugins de desenvolvimento do Android, como Claude Code","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать отзывчивые компоненты интерфейса пользователя Android, используя ConstraintLayout и Jetpack Compose на основе Kotlin, обеспечивая беспроблемную интеграцию с плагинами разработки Android, такими как Claude Code","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ مكونات واجهة المستخدم الإponsive في Android باستخدام ConstraintLayout و Jetpack Compose المعتمدة على Kotlin، وتمكين التكامل السلس بدون مشاكل مع إضافات تطوير Android مثل Claude Code"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive layouts with ConstraintLayout","Building declarative UIs with Jetpack Compose","Integrating UI components with Android development plugins"],"zh":["使用ConstraintLayout设计响应式布局","使用Jetpack Compose构建声明式UI","将UI组件与Android开发插件集成"],"ja":["ConstraintLayoutを使用したレスポンシブレイアウトの設計","Jetpack Composeを使用した宣言的UIの構築","UIコンポーネントとAndroid開発プラグインの統合"],"ko":["ConstraintLayout를 사용하여 반응형 레이아웃 설계","Jetpack Compose를 사용하여 선언적 UI 구축","UI 컴포넌트와 Android 개발 플러그인 통합"],"es":["Diseñar diseños responsivos con ConstraintLayout","Crear interfaces de usuario declarativas con Jetpack Compose","Integrar componentes de interfaz de usuario con plugins de desarrollo de Android"],"fr":["Concevoir des mises en page responsives avec ConstraintLayout","Créer des interfaces utilisateur déclaratives avec Jetpack Compose","Intégrer des composants d''interface utilisateur avec des plugins de développement Android"],"de":["Responsive Layouts mit ConstraintLayout entwerfen","Declarative Benutzeroberflächen mit Jetpack Compose erstellen","Benutzeroberflächenelemente in Android-Entwicklungs-Plugins integrieren"],"pt":["Projetar layouts responsivos com ConstraintLayout","Construir interfaces de usuário declarativas com Jetpack Compose","Integrar componentes de UI com plugins de desenvolvimento do Android"],"ru":["Проектирование отзывчивых макетов с помощью ConstraintLayout","Создание декларативных интерфейсов пользователя с помощью Jetpack Compose","Интеграция компонентов интерфейса пользователя с плагинами разработки Android"],"ar":["تصميم تخطيطات مستجيبة مع ConstraintLayo