Hub ディスカッションの効率的なクエリを提供し、内蔵の jq フィルタリングをサポートして構造化データを取得します","ko":"GitHub 토론 쿼리 스킬은 GitHub 토론의 효율적인 쿼리를 제공하며, 내장된 jq 필터링을 지원하여 구조화된 데이터를 얻을 수 있습니다","es":"Esta habilidad proporciona una consulta eficiente de discusiones de GitHub con soporte de filtrado jq integrado.","fr":"Cette compétence fournit une requête efficace de discussions GitHub avec une prise en charge de filtrage jq intégrée.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit bietet eine effiziente Abfrage von GitHub-Diskussionen mit integrierter jq-Filterunterstützung.","pt":"Este skill fornece uma consulta eficiente de discussões do GitHub com suporte a filtragem jq. Permite consultar discussões de forma personalizada","ru":"Этот навык обеспечивает эффективный запрос обсуждений GitHub с поддержкой фильтрации jq. Позволяет запрашивать обсуждения в индивидуальном порядке","ar":"يوفر هذا المهارة استعلامًا فعالًا للمناقشات على جيثب مع دعم لمرشح jq. يسمح باستعلام المناقشات بطرق مخصصة","en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"definition":{"en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"features":{"zh":["高效查询 GitHub 讨论","内置 jq 过滤支持","获取结构化数据","支持自定义过滤","防止大数据量的响应","理解数据结构"],"ja":["GitHub ディスカッションの効率的なクエリ","内蔵の jq フィルタリングのサポート","構造化データの取得","カスタムフィルタリングのサポート","大量のデータ量のレスポンスを防ぐ","データ構造の理解"],"ko":["GitHub 토론의 효율적인 쿼리","내장된 jq 필터링의 지원","구조화된 데이터의取得","사용자 정의 필터링의 지원","大量의 데이터량의 응답을 방지","데이터 구조의 이해"],"es":["Soporte de filtrado jq integrado","Consulta eficiente de discusiones de GitHub","Opción de devuelve información de esquema y tamaño de datos","Compatibilidad con parámetro --jq opcional","Filtrado de datos personalizado con jq"],"fr":["Prise en charge de filtrage jq intégrée","Requête efficace de discussions GitHub","Option de retour d''informations de schéma et de taille de données","Compatibilité avec le paramètre --jq facultatif","Filtrage de données personnalisé avec jq"],"de":["Integrierte jq-Filterunterstützung","Effiziente Abfrage von GitHub-Diskussionen","Option zur Rückgabe von Schema- und Datengrößeninformationen","Kompatibilität mit dem optionalen --jq-Parameter","Benutzerdefiniertes Datenfiltern mit jq"],"pt":["Suporte a filtragem jq","Consulta de discussões personalizadas","Retorno de informações de tamanho e estrutura de dados","Otimização de respostas para conjuntos de dados grandes","Flexibilidade na consulta de discussões"],"ru":["Поддержка фильтрации jq","Запрос обсуждений в индивидуальном порядке","Возврат информации о размере и структуре данных","Оптимизация ответов для крупных наборов данных","Гибкость в запросе обсуждений"],"ar":["دعم لمرشح jq","استعلام المناقشات بطرق مخصصة","إرجاع معلومات حول حجم وструкتور البيانات","تحسين الاستجابات لل مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة","المرونة في استعلام المناقشات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 讨论查询","jq 过滤","结构化数据","效率查询","GitHub API","开发者工具","数据分析","代码管理"],"ja":["GitHub ディスカッションクエリ","jq フィルタリング","構造化データ","効率的なクエリ","GitHub API","開発者ツール","データ分析","コード管理"],"ko":["GitHub 토론 쿼리","jq 필터링","구조화된 데이터","효율적인 쿼리","GitHub API","개발자 도구","데이터 분석","코드 관리"],"es":["consulta de discusiones de GitHub","jq","filtrado de datos","GitHub","desarrollo de software","integración de API","automatización de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["requête de discussion GitHub","jq","filtrage de données","GitHub","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API","automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["Abfrage von GitHub-Diskussionen","jq","Datenfilterung","GitHub","Softwareentwicklung","API-Integration","Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["github discussion query","consulta de discussões do github","filtragem jq","desenvolvimento de software","github api","consulta de dados","otimização de respostas","conjuntos de dados grandes","flexibilidade na consulta"],"ru":["github discussion query","запрос обсуждений github","фильтрация jq","разработка программного обеспечения","github api","запрос данных","оптимизация ответов","крупные наборы данных","гибкость в запросе"],"ar":["استعلام مناقشات جيثب","github discussion query","مرشح jq","تطوير البرمجيات","جيثب api","استعلام البيانات","تحسين الاستجابات","مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة","المرونة في الاستعلام"]}},"owner":"github","repo":"gh-aw","repoPath":"github/gh-aw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-discussion-query","description":"Query GitHub discussions efficiently with jq argument support for filtering","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Discussion Query Skill\n\nThis skill provides efficient querying of GitHub discussions with built-in jq filtering support.\n\n## Important: jq Parameter is Optional\n\nThe `--jq` parameter is **optional**. When called without `--jq`, this skill returns **schema and data size information** instead of the full data.\nThis prevents overwhelming responses with large datasets and helps you understand the data structure before querying.\n\nUse `--jq ''.''` to get all data, or use a more specific filter","body":"# GitHub Discussion Query Skill\n\nThis skill provides efficient querying of GitHub discussions with built-in jq filtering support.\n\n## Important: jq Parameter is Optional\n\nThe `--jq` parameter is **optional**. When called without `--jq`, this skill returns **schema and data size information** instead of the full data.\nThis prevents overwhelming responses with large datasets and helps you understand the data structure before querying.\n\nUse `--jq ''.''` to get all data, or use a more specific filter for targeted results.\n\n## Usage\n\nUse this skill to query discussions from the current repository or any specified repository.\n\n### Basic Query (Returns Schema Only)\n\nTo list discussions from the current repository:\n\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh\n# Returns schema and data size, not full data\n```\n\n### Get All Data\n\nTo get all discussion data:\n\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.''\n```\n\n### With Repository\n\nTo query a specific repository:\n\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n### With jq Filtering\n\nUse the `--jq` argument to filter and transform the output:\n\n```bash\n# Get discussion numbers and titles\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | {number, title}''\n\n# Get discussions by a specific author\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.author.login == \"username\")''\n\n# Get discussions in a specific category\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.category.name == \"Ideas\")''\n\n# Get answered discussions\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.answer != null)''\n\n# Count discussions by category\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''group_by(.category.name) | map({category: .[0].category.name, count: length})''\n```\n\n### Common Options\n\n- `--limit`: Maximum number of discussions to fetch. Default: 30\n- `--repo`: Repository in owner/repo format. Default: current repo\n- `--jq`: (Optional) jq expression for filtering/transforming output. If omitted, returns schema info\n\n### Example Queries\n\n**Find discussions with many comments:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.comments.totalCount > 5) | {number, title, comments: .comments.totalCount}''\n```\n\n**Get unanswered discussions:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.answer == null) | {number, title, category: .category.name}''\n```\n\n**List discussions with their labels:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | {number, title, labels: [.labels[].name]}''\n```\n\n**Find discussions by category:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.category.name == \"Q&A\") | {number, title, author: .author.login}''\n```\n\n**Get recently updated discussions:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''sort_by(.updatedAt) | reverse | .[0:10] | .[] | {number, title, updatedAt}''\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe script outputs JSON by default, making it easy to pipe through jq for additional processing.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated\n- `jq` for filtering (installed by default on most systems)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:43.058Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing efficient GitHub discussion data retrieval with optional jq filtering support.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要高效地检索GitHub讨论数据，并支持可选的jq过滤","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しており、GitHubの議論データの効率的な取得とオプションのjqフィルタリングのサポートが必要です","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 GitHub 토론 데이터를 효율적으로检索하고 선택적 jq 필터링 지원이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una recuperación eficiente de datos de discusión de GitHub con soporte de filtrado opcional jq.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une récupération efficace des données de discussion GitHub avec une prise en charge facultative de filtrage jq.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine effiziente GitHub-Diskussionsdatenabfrage mit optionaler jq-Filterunterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de recuperação eficiente de dados de discussão do GitHub com suporte opcional de filtragem jq.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется эффективное получение данных обсуждений GitHub с опциональной поддержкой фильтрации jq.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى استرجاع بيانات مناقشات GitHub بكفاءة مع دعم تجزئة jq اختياري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query GitHub discussions with precision using jq filtering, preventing overwhelming responses with large datasets and providing schema and data size information for informed decision-making, leveraging protocols like REST and data formats like JSON.","zh":"赋予代理查询GitHub讨论的精确性，使用jq过滤，防止大量数据集的压倒性响应，并为明智的决策提供模式和数据大小信息，利用REST等协议和JSON等数据格式","ja":"エージェントがGitHubの議論を正確に照会できるようにし、jqフィルタリングを使用して大量のデータセットによる過剰なレスポンスを防ぎ、RESTやJSONなどのプロトコルとデータ形式を利用して、情報に基づいた意思決定を行うためのスキーマとデータサイズの情報を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 토론을 정확하게 쿼리할 수 있도록하여 jq 필터링을 사용하고大量 데이터 세트에 의한 과도한 응답을 방지하며 REST 및 JSON과 같은 프로토콜 및 데이터 형식을 활용하여 정보에 기반한 의사결정을 위한 스키마 및 데이터 크기 정보를 제공합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes consultar discusiones de GitHub con precisión utilizando el filtrado jq, evitando respuestas abrumadoras con grandes conjuntos de datos y proporcionando información de esquema y tamaño de datos para la toma de decisiones informadas, aprovechando protocolos como REST y formatos de datos como JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger des discussions GitHub avec précision en utilisant le filtrage jq, empêchant les réponses accablantes avec de grands ensembles de données et fournissant des informations de schéma et de taille de données pour une prise de décision éclairée, en exploitant des protocoles comme REST et des formats de données comme JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, GitHub-Diskussionen mit Präzision abzufragen, indem jq-Filterung verwendet wird, überwältigende Antworten mit großen Datensätzen vermeidet und Schema- und Datengrößeninformationen für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung bereitstellt, indem Protokolle wie REST und Datenformate wie JSON genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a consultar discussões do GitHub com precisão usando a filtragem jq, evitando respostas esmagadoras com grandes conjuntos de dados e fornecendo informações de esquema e tamanho de dados para tomada de decisões informadas, aproveitando protocolos como REST e formatos de dados como JSON.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность запроса обсуждений GitHub с точностью, используя фильтрацию jq, предотвращая подавляющие ответы с большими наборами данных и предоставляя информацию о схеме и размере данных для принятия обоснованных решений, используя протоколы, такие как REST, и форматы данных, такие как JSON.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استفسار مناقشات GitHub بدقة باستخدام فلتر jq، ومنع الاستجابات المثيرة للاضطراب مع مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة وتوفير معلومات حول مخطط البيانات وحجمها لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل REST وأشكال بيانات مثل JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Querying specific GitHub discussion threads","Filtering discussion data using custom jq parameters","Retrieving schema and data size information for large GitHub discussions"],"zh":["查询特定的GitHub讨论线程","使用自定义jq参数过滤讨论数据","检索大型GitHub讨论的模式和数据大小信息"],"ja":["特定のGitHubディスカッションスレッドを照会する","カスタムjqパラメータを使用してディスカッションデータをフィルタリングする","大規模なGitHubディスカッションのスキーマとデータサイズの情報を取得する"],"ko":["특정 GitHub 토론 스레드를 쿼리하는 것","사용자 정의 jq 매개 변수를 사용하여 토론 데이터 필터링","대규모 GitHub 토론의 스키마 및 데이터 크기 정보를 가져오는 것"],"es":["Consultar hilos de discusión específicos de GitHub","Filtrar datos de discusión utilizando parámetros personalizados jq","Recuperar información de esquema y tamaño de datos para grandes discusiones de GitHub"],"fr":["Interroger des threads de discussion GitHub spécifiques","Filtrer les données de discussion à l''aide de paramètres jq personnalisés","Récupérer des informations de schéma et de taille de données pour de grandes discussions GitHub"],"de":["Abfragen spezifischer GitHub-Diskussionsthreads","Filtern von Diskussionsdaten unter Verwendung benutzerdefinierter jq-Parameter","Abrufen von Schemainformationen und Datengrößen für große GitHub-Diskussionen"],"pt":["Consultar threads de discussão específicos do GitHub","Filtrar dados de discussão usando parâmetros jq personalizados","Obter informações de esquema e tamanho de dados para discussões grandes do GitHub"],"ru":["Запрос конкретных нитей обсуждений GitHub","Фильтрация данных обсуждений с помощью пользовательских параметров jq","Получение информации о схеме и размере данных для крупных обсуждений GitHub"],"ar":["استفسار عن خيوط مناقشات GitHub محددة","تجزئة بيانات المناقشة باستخدام معلمات jq مخصصة","استرجاع معلومات مخطط وحجم البيانات للمناقشات الكبيرة على GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Optional jq parameter must be used with caution to avoid data overload"],"zh":["需要GitHub API访问","可选的jq参数必须谨慎使用，以避免数据过载"],"ja":["GitHub APIへのアクセスが必要","オプションのjqパラメータは、データの過負荷を避けるために注意して使用する必要がある"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요합니다","옵션의 jq 매개 변수는 데이터 과부하를 방지하기 위해 주의해서 사용해야합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","El parámetro opcional jq debe usarse con precaución para evitar la sobrecarga de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Le paramètre facultatif jq doit être utilisé avec prudence pour éviter la surcharge de données"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Der optionale jq-Parameter muss mit Vorsicht verwendet werden, um eine Datenüberlastung zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Parâmetro opcional jq deve ser usado com cautela para evitar sobrecarga de dados"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API GitHub","Опциональный параметр jq должен использоваться с осторожностью, чтобы избежать перегрузки данных"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","يجب استخدام معلمة jq الاختيارية بحذر لتفادي أعباء البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lee-to/ai-factory/ai-factory.fix', 'community', 'lee-to', 'ai-factory', 'lee-to/ai-factory', 'ai-factory.fix', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:05:49.109Z', NULL, '{"id":"lee-to/ai-factory/ai-factory.fix","name":"ai-factory.fix","description":{"zh":"AI-factory.fix 是一个用于修复代码库中特定 bug 或问题的工作流程，支持两种模式：立即修复和计划优先方法","ja":"AI-factory.fix はコードベースの特定のバグまたは問題を修正するワークフローであり、2 つのモードをサポートします: 即時修正と計画優先アプローチ","ko":"AI-factory.fix는 코드베이스의 특정 버그 또는 문제를 수정하는 워크플로우로서 즉시 수정과 계획 우선 방식을 지원합니다","es":"ai-factory.fix es una herramienta que te permite solucionar errores en tu código de manera inmediata o planificada","fr":"ai-factory.fix est un outil qui vous permet de corriger les erreurs dans votre code de manière immédiate ou planifiée","de":"ai-factory.fix ist ein Tool, das es Ihnen ermöglicht, Fehler in Ihrem Code sofort oder geplant zu beheben","pt":"O ai-factory.fix é uma ferramenta que ajuda a corrigir erros de código, suportando abordagens imediata ou planejada.","ru":"ai-factory.fix - это инструмент, помогающий исправлять ошибки кода, поддерживающий подходы немедленного или планового исправления.","ar":"ai-factory.fix هو أداة تساعد في إصلاح أخطاء الكود، تدعم النهج الفوري أو المخطط مسبقا.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI Bug Fix 工作流程","ja":"AI バグフィックス ワークフロー","ko":"AI 버그 수정 워크플ロー","es":"Reparación de errores con ai-factory.fix","fr":"Correction de bogues avec ai-factory.fix","de":"Fehlerbehebung mit ai-factory.fix","pt":"ai-factory.fix: Corrija Erros de Código","ru":"ai-factory.fix: Исправление ошибок кода","ar":"ai-factory.fix: إصلاح أخطاء الكود","en":"ai-factory.fix"},"description":{"zh":"AI-factory.fix 是一个用于修复代码库中特定 bug 或问题的工作流程，支持两种模式：立即修复和计划优先方法","ja":"AI-factory.fix はコードベースの特定のバグまたは問題を修正するワークフローであり、2 つのモードをサポートします: 即時修正と計画優先アプローチ","ko":"AI-factory.fix는 코드베이스의 특정 버그 또는 문제를 수정하는 워크플로우로서 즉시 수정과 계획 우선 방식을 지원합니다","es":"ai-factory.fix es una herramienta que te permite solucionar errores en tu código de manera inmediata o planificada","fr":"ai-factory.fix est un outil qui vous permet de corriger les erreurs dans votre code de manière immédiate ou planifiée","de":"ai-factory.fix ist ein Tool, das es Ihnen ermöglicht, Fehler in Ihrem Code sofort oder geplant zu beheben","pt":"O ai-factory.fix é uma ferramenta que ajuda a corrigir erros de código, suportando abordagens imediata ou planejada.","ru":"ai-factory.fix - это инструмент, помогающий исправлять ошибки кода, поддерживающий подходы немедленного или планового исправления.","ar":"ai-factory.fix هو أداة تساعد في إصلاح أخطاء الكود، تدعم النهج الفوري أو المخطط مسبقا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持立即修复和计划优先方法","检查现有修复计划","读取.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md 文件","跳过不必要的步骤","直接执行修复"],"ja":["即時修正と計画優先アプローチをサポート","既存の修正計画を確認",".ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md ファイルを読み取り","不要なステップをスキップ","直ちに修正を実行"],"ko":["즉시 수정과 계획 우선 방식을 지원","기존 수정 계획 확인",".ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md 파일 읽기","불필요한 단계 생략","직접 수정 실행"],"es":["Solución de errores inmediata o planificada","Compatibilidad con planes de reparación existentes","Análisis del código para identificar problemas","Ejecución de reparaciones basadas en planes","Informes de progreso y resultados"],"fr":["Correction de bogues immédiate ou planifiée","Compatibilité avec les plans de correction existants","Analyse du code pour identifier les problèmes","Exécution des corrections basées sur les plans","Rapports de progrès et de résultats"],"de":["Sofortige oder geplante Fehlerbehebung","Kompatibilität mit bestehenden Reparaturplänen","Code-Analyse zur Identifizierung von Problemen","Ausführung von Reparaturen basierend auf Plänen","Berichte über Fortschritt und Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Correção de erros de código","Abordagem imediata ou planejada","Leitura de planos de correção existentes","Execução de correções com base em planos","Investigação do código-fonte"],"ru":["Исправление ошибок кода","Немедленный или плановый подход","Чтение существующих планов исправления","Выполнение исправлений на основе планов","Изучение исходного кода"],"ar":["إصلاح أخطاء الكود","نهج فوري أو مخطط مسبقا","قراءة خطط الإصلاح الموجودة","تنفيذ الإصلاحات بناءً على الخطط","تحقيق الكود المصدري"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 工作流程","代码库修复","bug 修复","自动化工作流程","代码库管理","AI-factory.fix"],"ja":["AI ワークフロー","コードベース修正","バグ修正","自動化ワークフロー","コードベース管理","AI-factory.fix"],"ko":["AI 워크플로우","코드베이스 수정","버그 수정","자동화 워크플로우","코드베이스 관리","AI-factory.fix"],"es":["reparación de errores","corrección de código","flujo de trabajo de reparación","herramientas de desarrollo","ai-factory.fix","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["correction de bogues","correction de code","flux de travail de correction","outils de développement","ai-factory.fix","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung","Code-Korrektur","Workflow zur Fehlerbehebung","Entwicklungstools","ai-factory.fix","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["correção de erros de código","ai-factory.fix","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","correção de bugs","abordagem imediata","abordagem planejada"],"ru":["исправление ошибок кода","ai-factory.fix","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","исправление ошибок","немедленный подход","плановый подход"],"ar":["إصلاح أخطاء الكود","ai-factory.fix","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إصلاح العيوب","نهج فوري","نهج مخطط مسبقا"]}},"owner":"lee-to","repo":"ai-factory","repoPath":"lee-to/ai-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-factory.fix","description":"Fix a specific bug or problem in the codebase. Supports two modes - immediate fix or plan-first. Without arguments executes existing FIX_PLAN.md. Always suggests test coverage and adds logging. Use when user says fix bug, debug this, something is broken, or pastes an error message.","bodyPreview":"# Fix - Bug Fix Workflow\n\nFix a specific bug or problem in the codebase. Supports two modes: immediate fix or plan-first approach.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 0: Check for Existing Fix Plan\n\n**BEFORE anything else**, check if `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` exists.\n\n**If the file EXISTS:**\n- Read `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`\n- Inform the user: \"Found existing fix plan. Executing fix based on the plan.\"\n- **Skip Steps 0.1 through 1** — go directly to **Step 2: Investigate the Codebase**, using the plan as your","body":"# Fix - Bug Fix Workflow\n\nFix a specific bug or problem in the codebase. Supports two modes: immediate fix or plan-first approach.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 0: Check for Existing Fix Plan\n\n**BEFORE anything else**, check if `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` exists.\n\n**If the file EXISTS:**\n- Read `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`\n- Inform the user: \"Found existing fix plan. Executing fix based on the plan.\"\n- **Skip Steps 0.1 through 1** — go directly to **Step 2: Investigate the Codebase**, using the plan as your guide\n- Follow each step of the plan sequentially\n- After the fix is fully applied and verified, **delete** `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`:\n  ```bash\n  rm .ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md\n  ```\n- Continue to Step 4 (Verify), Step 5 (Test suggestion), Step 6 (Patch)\n\n**If the file DOES NOT exist AND `$ARGUMENTS` is empty:**\n- Tell the user: \"No fix plan found and no problem description provided. Please either provide a bug description (`/ai-factory.fix <description>`) or create a fix plan first.\"\n- **STOP.**\n\n**If the file DOES NOT exist AND `$ARGUMENTS` is provided:**\n- Continue to Step 0.1 below.\n\n### Step 0.1: Load Project Context & Past Experience\n\n**Read `.ai-factory/DESCRIPTION.md`** if it exists to understand:\n- Tech stack (language, framework, database)\n- Project architecture\n- Coding conventions\n\n**Read all patches from `.ai-factory/patches/`** if the directory exists:\n- Use `Glob` to find all `*.md` files in `.ai-factory/patches/`\n- Read each patch file to learn from past fixes\n- Pay attention to recurring patterns, root causes, and solutions\n- If the current problem resembles a past patch — apply the same approach or avoid the same mistakes\n- This is your accumulated experience. Use it.\n\n### Step 1: Understand the Problem & Choose Mode\n\nFrom `$ARGUMENTS`, identify:\n- Error message or unexpected behavior\n- Where it occurs (file, function, endpoint)\n- Steps to reproduce (if provided)\n\nIf unclear, ask:\n```\nTo fix this effectively, I need more context:\n\n1. What is the expected behavior?\n2. What actually happens?\n3. Can you share the error message/stack trace?\n4. When did this start happening?\n```\n\n**After understanding the problem, ask the user to choose a mode using `AskUserQuestion`:**\n\nQuestion: \"How would you like to proceed with the fix?\"\n\nOptions:\n1. **Fix now** — Investigate and apply the fix immediately\n2. **Plan first** — Create a fix plan for review, then fix later\n\n**If user chooses \"Plan first\":**\n- Proceed to **Step 1.1: Create Fix Plan**\n\n**If user chooses \"Fix now\":**\n- Skip Step 1.1, proceed directly to **Step 2: Investigate the Codebase**\n\n### Step 1.1: Create Fix Plan\n\nInvestigate the codebase enough to understand the problem and create a plan.\n\n1. Search for relevant files using Glob/Grep\n2. Read the code around the issue\n3. Trace the data flow\n4. Identify the root cause (or most likely candidates)\n\nThen create `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Fix Plan: [Brief title]\n\n**Problem:** [What''s broken — from user''s description]\n**Created:** YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\n\n## Analysis\n\nWhat was found during investigation:\n- Root cause (or suspected root cause)\n- Affected files and functions\n- Impact scope\n\n## Fix Steps\n\nStep-by-step plan for implementing the fix:\n\n1. [ ] Step one — what to change and why\n2. [ ] Step two — ...\n3. [ ] Step three — ...\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `path/to/file.ts` — what changes are needed\n- `path/to/another.ts` — what changes are needed\n\n## Risks & Considerations\n\n- Potential side effects\n- Things to verify after the fix\n- Edge cases to watch for\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n- What tests should be added\n- What edge cases to cover\n```\n\n**After creating the plan, output:**\n\n```\n## Fix Plan Created ✅\n\nPlan saved to `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`.\n\nReview the plan and when you''re ready to execute, run:\n\n/ai-factory.fix\n```\n\n**STOP here. Do NOT apply the fix.**\n\n### Step 2: Investigate the Codebase\n\n**Search for the problem:**\n- Find relevant files using Glob/Grep\n- Read the code around the issue\n- Trace the data flow\n- Check for similar patterns elsewhere\n\n**Look for:**\n- The root cause (not just symptoms)\n- Related code that might be affected\n- Existing error handling\n\n### Step 3: Implement the Fix\n\n**Apply the fix with logging:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ REQUIRED: Add logging around the fix\nconsole.log(''[FIX] Processing user input'', { userId, input });\n\ntry {\n  // The actual fix\n  const result = fixedLogic(input);\n  console.log(''[FIX] Success'', { userId, result });\n  return result;\n} catch (error) {\n  console.error(''[FIX] Error in fixedLogic'', {\n    userId,\n    input,\n    error: error.message,\n    stack: error.stack\n  });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n**Logging is MANDATORY because:**\n- User needs to verify the fix works\n- If it doesn''t work, logs help debug further\n- Feedback loop: user provides logs → we iterate\n\n### Step 4: Verify the Fix\n\n- Check the code compiles/runs\n- Verify the logic is correct\n- Ensure no regressions introduced\n\n### Step 5: Suggest Test Coverage\n\n**ALWAYS suggest covering this case with a test:**\n\n```\n## Fix Applied ✅\n\nThe issue was: [brief explanation]\nFixed by: [what was changed]\n\n### Logging Added\nThe fix includes logging with prefix `[FIX]`.\nPlease test and share any logs if issues persist.\n\n### Recommended: Add a Test\n\nThis bug should be covered by a test to prevent regression:\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\ndescribe(''functionName'', () => {\n  it(''should handle [the edge case that caused the bug]'', () => {\n    // Arrange\n    const input = /* the problematic input */;\n\n    // Act\n    const result = functionName(input);\n\n    // Assert\n    expect(result).toBe(/* expected */);\n  });\n});\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nWould you like me to create this test?\n- [ ] Yes, create the test\n- [ ] No, skip for now\n```\n\n## Logging Requirements\n\n**All fixes MUST include logging:**\n\n1. **Log prefix**: Use `[FIX]` or `[FIX:<issue-id>]` for easy filtering\n2. **Log inputs**: What data was being processed\n3. **Log success**: Confirm the fix worked\n4. **Log errors**: Full context if something fails\n5. **Configurable**: Use LOG_LEVEL if available\n\n```typescript\n// Pattern for fixes\nconst LOG_FIX = process.env.LOG_LEVEL === ''debug'' || process.env.DEBUG_FIX;\n\nfunction fixedFunction(input) {\n  if (LOG_FIX) console.log(''[FIX] Input:'', input);\n\n  // ... fix logic ...\n\n  if (LOG_FIX) console.log(''[FIX] Output:'', result);\n  return result;\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Null Reference Error\n\n**User:** `/ai-factory.fix TypeError: Cannot read property ''name'' of undefined in UserProfile`\n\n**Actions:**\n1. Search for UserProfile component/function\n2. Find where `.name` is accessed\n3. Add null check with logging\n4. Suggest test for null user case\n\n### Example 2: API Returns Wrong Data\n\n**User:** `/ai-factory.fix /api/orders returns empty array for authenticated users`\n\n**Actions:**\n1. Find orders API endpoint\n2. Trace the query logic\n3. Find the bug (e.g., wrong filter)\n4. Fix with logging\n5. Suggest integration test\n\n### Example 3: Form Validation Not Working\n\n**User:** `/ai-factory.fix email validation accepts invalid emails`\n\n**Actions:**\n1. Find email validation logic\n2. Check regex or validation library usage\n3. Fix the validation\n4. Add logging for validation failures\n5. Suggest unit test with edge cases\n\n## Important Rules\n\n1. **Check FIX_PLAN.md first** - Always check for existing plan before anything else\n2. **Plan mode = plan only** - When user chooses \"Plan first\", create the plan and STOP. Do NOT fix.\n3. **Execute mode = follow the plan** - When FIX_PLAN.md exists, follow it step by step, then delete it\n4. **NO reports** - Don''t create summary documents (patches are learning artifacts, not reports)\n5. **ALWAYS log** - Every fix must have logging for feedback\n6. **ALWAYS suggest tests** - Help prevent regressions\n7. **Root cause** - Fix the actual problem, not symptoms\n8. **Minimal changes** - Don''t refactor unrelated code\n9. **One fix at a time** - Don''t scope creep\n10. **Clean up** - Delete FIX_PLAN.md after successful fix execution\n\n## After Fixing\n\n```\n## Fix Applied ✅\n\n**Issue:** [what was broken]\n**Cause:** [why it was broken]\n**Fix:** [what was changed]\n\n**Files modified:**\n- path/to/file.ts (line X)\n\n**Logging added:** Yes, prefix `[FIX]`\n**Test suggested:** Yes\n\nPlease test the fix and share logs if any issues.\n\nTo add the suggested test:\n- [ ] Yes, create test\n- [ ] No, skip\n```\n\n### Step 6: Create Self-Improvement Patch\n\n**ALWAYS create a patch after every fix.** This builds a knowledge base for future fixes.\n\n**Create the patch:**\n\n1. Create directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p .ai-factory/patches\n   ```\n\n2. Create a patch file with the current timestamp as filename.\n   **Format:** `YYYY-MM-DD-HH.mm.md` (e.g., `2026-02-07-14.30.md`)\n\n3. Use this template:\n\n```markdown\n# [Brief title describing the fix]\n\n**Date:** YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\n**Files:** list of modified files\n**Severity:** low | medium | high | critical\n\n## Problem\n\nWhat was broken. How it manifested (error message, wrong behavior).\nBe specific — include the actual error or symptom.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nWHY the problem occurred. This is the most valuable part.\nNot \"what was wrong\" but \"why it was wrong\":\n- Logic error? Why was the logic incorrect?\n- Missing check? Why was it missing?\n- Wrong assumption? What was assumed?\n- Race condition? What sequence caused it?\n\n## Solution\n\nHow the fix was implemented. Key code changes and reasoning.\nInclude the approach, not just \"changed line X\".\n\n## Prevention\n\nHow to prevent this class of problems in the future:\n- What pattern/practice should be followed?\n- What should be checked during code review?\n- What test would catch this?\n\n## Tags\n\nSpace-separated tags for categorization, e.g.:\n`#null-check` `#async` `#validation` `#typescript` `#api` `#database`\n```\n\n**Example patch:**\n\n```markdown\n# Null reference in UserProfile when user has no avatar\n\n**Date:** 2026-02-07 14:30\n**Files:** src/components/UserProfile.tsx\n**Severity:** medium\n\n## Problem\n\nTypeError: Cannot read property ''url'' of undefined when rendering\nUserProfile for users without an uploaded avatar.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe `user.avatar` field is optional in the database schema but the\ncomponent accessed `user.avatar.url` without a null check. This was\nintroduced in commit abc123 when avatar display was added — the\ndeveloper tested only with users that had avatars.\n\n## Solution\n\nAdded optional chaining: `user.avatar?.url` with a fallback to a\ndefault avatar URL. Also added a null check in the Avatar sub-component.\n\n## Prevention\n\n- Always check if database fields marked as `nullable` / `optional`\n  are handled with null checks in the UI layer\n- Add test cases for \"empty state\" — user with minimal data\n- Consider a lint rule for accessing nested optional properties\n\n## Tags\n\n`#null-check` `#react` `#optional-field` `#typescript`\n```\n\n**This is NOT optional.** Every fix generates a patch. The patch is your learning.\n\n### Context Cleanup\n\nContext is heavy after investigation, fix, and patch generation. All results are saved — suggest freeing space:\n\n```\nAskUserQuestion: Free up context before continuing?\n\nOptions:\n1. /clear — Full reset (recommended)\n2. /compact — Compress history\n3. Continue as is\n```\n\n---\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- ❌ Apply a fix when user chose \"Plan first\" — only create FIX_PLAN.md and stop\n- ❌ Skip the FIX_PLAN.md check at the start\n- ❌ Leave FIX_PLAN.md after successful fix execution — always delete it\n- ❌ Generate reports or summaries (patches are NOT reports — they are learning artifacts)\n- ❌ Refactor unrelated code\n- ❌ Add features while fixing\n- ❌ Skip logging\n- ❌ Skip test suggestion\n- ❌ Skip patch creation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:49.109Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring structured bug fixing workflows with support for immediate fix or plan-first approaches.","zh":"适合需要结构化的 Bug 修复工作流程的代码分析代理，支持立即修复或计划优先的方法。","ja":"コード分析エージェントに最適で、構造化されたバグ修正ワークフローと、即時修正または計画優先アプローチのサポートが必要です。","ko":"구조화된 버그 수정 워크플로를 필요로 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에 이상적이며 즉시 수정 또는 계획 우선 접근 방식의 지원을 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de código que requieren flujos de trabajo de solución de errores estructurados con soporte para enfoques de solución inmediata o planificación previa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des flux de travail de correction de bogues structurés avec un support pour les approches de correction immédiate ou de planification préalable.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agents, die strukturierte Workflows für die Fehlerbehebung mit Unterstützung für sofortige oder planbasierte Ansätze erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que exigem fluxos de trabalho de correção de bugs estruturados com suporte para abordagens de correção imediata ou planejamento primeiro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов анализа кода, требующих структурированных рабочих процессов исправления ошибок с поддержкой подходов немедленного исправления или планирования.","ar":"مثالية لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يتطلب سير عمل إصلاح الأعطال المهيكلة مع دعم للنهج الصحيح الفوري أو تخطيط أولاً."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute fix workflows based on existing plans stored in `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`, leveraging step-by-step investigation of the codebase, and informs users about the execution status, utilizing markdown files for fix planning and skipping unnecessary steps.","zh":"赋予代理执行修复工作流的能力，基于存储在 `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` 中的现有计划，利用代码库的步骤式调查，并告知用户执行状态，利用 Markdown 文件进行修复计划和跳过不必要的步骤。","ja":"エージェントに、`.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` に保存されている既存のプランに基づいて修正ワークフローを実行する機能を付与し、コードベースのステップごとの調査を利用し、ユーザーに実行状況を通知し、Markdown ファイルを使用して修正計画を作成し、不要なステップをスキップします。","ko":"에이전트가 `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`에 저장된 기존 계획을 기반으로 수정 워크플로를 실행하도록 하는 기능을 부여하며 코드베이스의 단계별 조사와 마크다운 파일을 사용한 수정 계획 및 불필요한 단계 생략을 통해 실행 상태를 사용자에게 알립니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar flujos de trabajo de solución basados en planes existentes almacenados en `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`, aprovechando la investigación paso a paso de la base de código e informando a los usuarios sobre el estado de ejecución, utilizando archivos markdown para la planificación de soluciones y saltando los pasos innecesarios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des flux de travail de correction basés sur des plans existants stockés dans `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`, en exploitant l''investigation étape par étape de la base de code et en informant les utilisateurs sur le statut d''exécution, en utilisant des fichiers markdown pour la planification de correction et en sautant les étapes inutiles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Fix-Workflows auf der Grundlage vorhandener Pläne in `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` auszuführen, indem sie die schrittweise Untersuchung des Codebestands nutzen und Benutzer über den Ausführungsstatus informieren, wobei Markdown-Dateien für die Planung von Fixes verwendet werden und unnötige Schritte übersprungen werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho de correção com base em planos existentes armazenados em `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`, utilizando investigação passo a passo da base de código e informa os usuários sobre o status de execução, utilizando arquivos markdown para planejamento de correção e pulando etapas desnecessárias.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять рабочие процессы исправления на основе существующих планов, хранящихся в `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`, используя пошаговое расследование кодовой базы и информируя пользователей о статусе выполнения, используя файлы markdown для планирования исправления и пропуская ненужные шаги.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ سير عمل الإصلاح على أساس الخطط القائمة المخزنة في `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` ، واستخدام التحقيق خطوة بخطوة لقاعدة الشفرة ، وإطلاع المستخدمين على حالة التنفيذ ، واستخدام ملفات markdown لتحديد خطة الإصلاح وتخطي الخطوات غير الضرورية."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing immediate fixes for known issues","Planning and implementing fixes based on `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`","Investigating codebases for bug fixing","Informing users about existing fix plans and execution status"],"zh":["执行针对已知问题的立即修复","根据 `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` 计划和实施修复","调查代码库以进行 Bug 修复","告知用户关于现有修复计划和执行状态"],"ja":["既知の問題に対する即時修正の実行","`.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` に基づいて修正を計画して実施","バグ修正のためのコードベースの調査","ユーザーに既存の修正計画と実行状況を通知"],"ko":["既知 문제에 대한 즉시 수정 실행","`.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`를 기준으로 수정 계획 및 구현","버그 수정을 위한 코드베이스 조사","사용자에게 기존 수정 계획 및 실행 상태 알림"],"es":["Ejecutar soluciones inmediatas para problemas conocidos","Planificar e implementar soluciones basadas en `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`","Investigar bases de código para la solución de errores","Informar a los usuarios sobre planes de solución existentes y estado de ejecución"],"fr":["Exécuter des corrections immédiates pour des problèmes connus","Planifier et mettre en œuvre des corrections basées sur `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`","Investiguer les bases de code pour la correction de bogues","Informer les utilisateurs sur les plans de correction existants et le statut d''exécution"],"de":["Sofortige Lösungen für bekannte Probleme ausführen","Lösungen basierend auf `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` planen und umsetzen","Codebestände für die Fehlerbehebung untersuchen","Benutzer über vorhandene Lösungspläne und Ausführungsstatus informieren"],"pt":["Executando correções imediatas para problemas conhecidos","Planejando e implementando correções com base em `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`","Investigando bases de código para correção de bugs","Informando usuários sobre planos de correção existentes e status de execução"],"ru":["Выполнять немедленные исправления для известных проблем","Планировать и реализовывать исправления на основе `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`","Расследовать кодовые базы для исправления ошибок","Информировать пользователей о существующих планах исправления и статусе выполнения"],"ar":["تنفيذ إصلاحات فورية للمشكلات المعروفة","تخطيط وتنفيذ الإصلاحات على أساس `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`","التحقيق في قواعد الشفرة لتصحيح الأعطال","إطلاع المستخدمين على خطط الإصلاح القائمة وحالة التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` for plan-first approach","Filesystem access needed to read `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"],"zh":["需要 `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` 来支持计划优先方法","需要文件系统访问来读取 `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"],"ja":["計画優先アプローチをサポートするために `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` が必要","`.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` を読み取るためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["계획 우선 방법을 지원하기 위해 `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`가 필요","`.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`를 읽기 위해 파일 시스템 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` para el enfoque de planificación previa","Se necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para leer `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"],"fr":["Nécessite `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` pour l''approche de planification préalable","Un accès au système de fichiers est nécessaire pour lire `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"],"de":["Benötigt `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` für den planbasierten Ansatz","Zugriff auf das Dateisystem erforderlich, um `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` zu lesen"],"pt":["Exige `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` para abordagem de planejamento primeiro","Acesso ao sistema de arquivos necessário para ler `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"],"ru":["Требует `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` для подхода планирования primero","Требуется доступ к файловой системе для чтения `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"],"ar":["يتطلب `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md` لنهج التخطيط أولاً","يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لقراءة `.ai-factory/FIX_PLAN.md`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zylos-ai/zylos-core/scheduler', 'community', 'zylos-ai', 'zylos-core', 'zylos-ai/zylos-core', 'scheduler', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:06:19.848Z', NULL, '{"id":"zylos-ai/zylos-core/scheduler","name":"scheduler","description":{"zh":"AI 定时器允许 Claude 自主工作，通过 C4 通信桥接调度任务。该功能实现了自动化和高效的 AI 任务执行","ja":"AI スケジューラーは、Claude が C4 コミュニケーションブリッジを介して自動的にタスクを実行できるようにします。自動化と効率的な AI タスクの実行を実現します","ko":"AI 스케줄러는 Claude가 C4 통신ブリ지를 통해 자동으로 작업을 실행할 수 있도록 합니다. 자동화와 효율적인 AI 작업 실행을 구현합니다","es":"El programador de tareas permite a Claude trabajar de forma autónoma mediante la programación de tareas. Es parte de la infraestructura de código abierto de Claude.","fr":"Le planificateur de tâches permet à Claude de travailler de manière autonome en programmant des tâches. Il fait partie de l''infrastructure open source de Claude.","de":"Der Aufgabenplaner ermöglicht es Claude, autonom zu arbeiten, indem er Aufgaben plant. Er ist Teil der Open-Source-Infrastruktur von Claude.","en":"Give your AI a life — open-source infrastructure for persistent, self-maintaining AI companions. Powered by Claude Code."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI 定时器 - 持续运行的AI伴侣","ja":"AI スケジューラー - 自動で動くAIコンパニオン","ko":"AI 스케줄러 - 지속적으로 실행되는 AI 동료","es":"Programador de tareas para AI","fr":"Planificateur de tâches pour l''IA","de":"Aufgabenplaner für KI","en":"scheduler"},"description":{"zh":"AI 定时器允许 Claude 自主工作，通过 C4 通信桥接调度任务。该功能实现了自动化和高效的 AI 任务执行","ja":"AI スケジューラーは、Claude が C4 コミュニケーションブリッジを介して自動的にタスクを実行できるようにします。自動化と効率的な AI タスクの実行を実現します","ko":"AI 스케줄러는 Claude가 C4 통신ブリ지를 통해 자동으로 작업을 실행할 수 있도록 합니다. 자동화와 효율적인 AI 작업 실행을 구현합니다","es":"El programador de tareas permite a Claude trabajar de forma autónoma mediante la programación de tareas. Es parte de la infraestructura de código abierto de ...","fr":"Le planificateur de tâches permet à Claude de travailler de manière autonome en programmant des tâches. Il fait partie de l''infrastructure open source de Cla...","de":"Der Aufgabenplaner ermöglicht es Claude, autonom zu arbeiten, indem er Aufgaben plant. Er ist Teil der Open-Source-Infrastruktur von Claude.","en":"Give your AI a life — open-source infrastructure for persistent, self-maintaining AI companions. Powered by Claude Code."},"definition":{"en":"Give your AI a life — open-source infrastructure for persistent, self-maintaining AI companions. Powered by Claude Code."},"features":{"zh":["自动化调度","持久运行","自我维护","C4 通信桥接","任务优先级控制"],"ja":["自動化スケジューリング","持続的な実行","自己維持","C4 コミュニケーションブリッジ","タスクの優先度制御"],"ko":["자동화 스케줄링","지속적인 실행","자체 유지","C4 통신ブリ지","작업 우선순위 제어"],"es":["Programación de tareas autónomas","Integración con el puente de comunicación C4","Gestión de tareas en cola de prioridad","Compatibilidad con Claude Code","Interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) para una fácil configuración","Soporte para tareas programadas y en tiempo real"],"fr":["Planification de tâches autonomes","Intégration avec le pont de communication C4","Gestion de tâches en file d''attente de priorité","Compatibilité avec Claude Code","Interface de ligne de commande (CLI) pour une configuration facile","Prise en charge de tâches planifiées et en temps réel"],"de":["Autonome Aufgabenplanung","Integration mit der C4-Kommunikationsbrücke","Aufgabenverwaltung in einer Prioritätswarteschlange","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Kommandozeileninterface (CLI) für eine einfache Konfiguration","Unterstützung für geplante und Echtzeit-Aufgaben"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 定时器","自动化调度","持久运行","自我维护","C4 通信桥接","任务优先级控制","开源基础设施"],"ja":["AI スケジューラー","自動化スケジューリング","持続的な実行","自己維持","C4 コミュニケーションブリッジ","タスクの優先度制御","オープンソースのインフラストラクチャ"],"ko":["AI 스케줄러","자동화 스케줄링","지속적인 실행","자체 유지","C4 통신ブリ지","작업 우선순위 제어","오픈소스 인프라"],"es":["programador de tareas","IA autónoma","Claude Code","C4 comm-bridge","tareas programadas","prioridad de tareas","desarrollo de IA","infraestructura de IA"," companiones de IA"],"fr":["planificateur de tâches","IA autonome","Claude Code","C4 comm-bridge","tâches planifiées","priorité de tâches","développement d''IA","infrastructure d''IA","compagnons d''IA"],"de":["Aufgabenplaner","autonome KI","Claude Code","C4-Kommunikationsbrücke","geplante Aufgaben","Aufgabenpriorität","KI-Entwicklung","KI-Infrastruktur","KI-Begleiter"]}},"owner":"zylos-ai","repo":"zylos-core","repoPath":"zylos-ai/zylos-core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scheduler","description":"Use when user wants to schedule tasks for future, recurring, or interval execution. Manages one-time, cron, and interval tasks dispatched via C4 comm-bridge.","bodyPreview":"# Task Scheduler (C5)\n\nEnables Claude to work autonomously by dispatching scheduled tasks via C4 comm-bridge.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Activity Monitor writes state to `~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json`\n2. Scheduler checks for pending tasks that are due\n3. If runtime is alive, dispatches task to C4 comm-bridge\n4. C4 handles execution control (idle waiting, priority queueing)\n5. Task sent to Claude based on priority and idle requirements\n\n## CLI\n\n`~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/c","body":"# Task Scheduler (C5)\n\nEnables Claude to work autonomously by dispatching scheduled tasks via C4 comm-bridge.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Activity Monitor writes state to `~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json`\n2. Scheduler checks for pending tasks that are due\n3. If runtime is alive, dispatches task to C4 comm-bridge\n4. C4 handles execution control (idle waiting, priority queueing)\n5. Task sent to Claude based on priority and idle requirements\n\n## CLI\n\n`~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/cli.js <command>`\n\n| Command | Description | Reference |\n|---------|-------------|-----------|\n| `add <prompt> [options]` | Add a new task | `references/add.md` |\n| `update <task-id> [options]` | Update an existing task | `references/update.md` |\n| `list` / `next` / `running` / `history` | Query tasks | `references/query.md` |\n| `done` / `remove` / `pause` / `resume` | Task lifecycle | `references/lifecycle.md` |\n\n## Timezone\n\nResolves TZ: `~/zylos/.env` > `process.env.TZ` > `UTC`. Times are parsed and displayed in configured timezone. DB stores UTC. See `references/config.md` for details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:06:19.848Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for autonomous Claude Code agents requiring persistent, self-maintaining task execution capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要持久、自我维护任务执行能力的自主Claude Code代理。","ja":"永続的なタスク実行機能を必要とする自律的なClaude Codeエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"지속적이고 자기 유지 작업 실행 기능을 필요로 하는 자율적인 Claude Code 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes autónomos de Claude Code que requieren capacidades de ejecución de tareas persistentes y de auto-mantenimiento.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents autonomes Claude Code nécessitant des capacités d''exécution de tâches persistantes et d''auto-entretien.","de":"Wesentlich für autonome Claude Code-Agenten, die persistente, selbstwartende Aufgabenausführungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Essential for autonomous Claude Code agents requiring persistent, self-maintaining task execution capabilities.","ru":"Essential for autonomous Claude Code agents requiring persistent, self-maintaining task execution capabilities.","ar":"Essential for autonomous Claude Code agents requiring persistent, self-maintaining task execution capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables persistent autonomous operation by dispatching scheduled tasks through the C4 comm-bridge infrastructure. Provides runtime-aware task execution with priority queueing and idle state management for continuous AI companion maintenance.","zh":"通过C4通讯桥接基础设施调度任务，实现持久的自主运行。提供运行时感知的任务执行、优先队列和空闲状态管理，以维护AI伴侣的连续性。","ja":"C4コミュニケーションブリッジインフラストラクチャを介してスケジュールされたタスクをディスパッチすることで、永続的な自律運用を可能にします。優先順位付きのタスクキューとアイドル状態管理を備えたランタイムアウェアのタスク実行を提供し、AIコンパニオンの連続したメンテナンスを行います。","ko":"C4 통신 브릿지 인프라를 통해 예약된 작업을 디스패치하여 지속적인 자동 작동을 가능하게 함으로써 런타임 인식 작업 실행과 우선순위 큐 및 유휴 상태 관리를 제공하여 AI 동료의 지속적인 유지 보수를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la operación autónoma persistente al enviar tareas programadas a través de la infraestructura de comm-bridge de C4. Proporciona ejecución de tareas con cola de prioridad y administración de estado de inactividad para el mantenimiento continuo del compañero de inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Permet l''opération autonome persistante en envoyant des tâches planifiées via l''infrastructure de comm-bridge de C4. Fournit l''exécution de tâches avec file d''attente de priorité et gestion d''état d''inactivité pour la maintenance continue du compagnon d''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Ermöglicht persistierenden autonomen Betrieb durch Senden geplanter Aufgaben über die C4 comm-bridge-Infrastruktur. Bietet Laufzeit-orientierte Aufgabenausführung mit Prioritäts-Queueing und Idle-Zustandsverwaltung für kontinuierliche Wartung des künstlichen Intelligenz-Begleiters.","pt":"Enables persistent autonomous operation by dispatching scheduled tasks through the C4 comm-bridge infrastructure. Provides runtime-aware task execution with priority queueing and idle state management for continuous AI companion maintenance.","ru":"Enables persistent autonomous operation by dispatching scheduled tasks through the C4 comm-bridge infrastructure. Provides runtime-aware task execution with priority queueing and idle state management for continuous AI companion maintenance.","ar":"Enables persistent autonomous operation by dispatching scheduled tasks through the C4 comm-bridge infrastructure. Provides runtime-aware task execution with priority queueing and idle state management for continuous AI companion maintenance."},"useCases":{"en":["Dispatching scheduled maintenance tasks during agent idle periods","Managing priority-based task queues for autonomous operation","Monitoring runtime status through activity-monitor integration","Executing self-maintaining routines via C4 comm-bridge"],"zh":["在代理空闲期间调度维护任务","管理自主运行的优先任务队列","通过活动监视器集成监视运行时状态","通过C4通讯桥接执行自我维护例程"],"ja":["エージェントのアイドル期間中にメンテナンスタスクをスケジュールする","自律運用の優先順位付きタスクキューを管理する","アクティビティモニター統合を介してランタイムステータスを監視する","C4コミュニケーションブリッジを介して自己維持ルーチンを実行する"],"ko":["에이전트의 유휴 기간 중에 유지 보수 작업을 예약함","자율 작동을 위한 우선순위 작업 큐 관리","활동 모니터 통합을 통해 런타임 상태 모니터링","C4 통신 브릿지를 통해 자기 유지 루틴 실행"],"es":["Envío de tareas de mantenimiento programadas durante los periodos de inactividad del agente","Administración de colas de tareas basadas en prioridad para la operación autónoma","Supervisión del estado de ejecución a través de la integración de activity-monitor","Ejecución de rutinas de auto-mantenimiento a través de C4 comm-bridge"],"fr":["Envoi de tâches de maintenance planifiées pendant les périodes d''inactivité de l''agent","Gestion de files d''attente de tâches basées sur la priorité pour l''opération autonome","Supervision de l''état d''exécution via l''intégration d''activity-monitor","Exécution de routines d''auto-entretien via C4 comm-bridge"],"de":["Senden geplanter Wartungsaufgaben während der Idle-Perioden des Agents","Verwaltung von Prioritäts-Queues für autonomen Betrieb","Überwachung des Laufzeitstatus durch activity-monitor-Integration","Ausführung von Selbstwartungs-Routinen über C4 comm-bridge"],"pt":["Dispatching scheduled maintenance tasks during agent idle periods","Managing priority-based task queues for autonomous operation","Monitoring runtime status through activity-monitor integration","Executing self-maintaining routines via C4 comm-bridge"],"ru":["Dispatching scheduled maintenance tasks during agent idle periods","Managing priority-based task queues for autonomous operation","Monitoring runtime status through activity-monitor integration","Executing self-maintaining routines via C4 comm-bridge"],"ar":["Dispatching scheduled maintenance tasks during agent idle periods","Managing priority-based task queues for autonomous operation","Monitoring runtime status through activity-monitor integration","Executing self-maintaining routines via C4 comm-bridge"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires C4 comm-bridge infrastructure for execution control","Dependent on activity-monitor status file (~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","CLI access needed through ~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/"],"zh":["需要C4通讯桥接基础设施来控制执行","依赖于活动监视器状态文件(~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","需要CLI访问~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/"],"ja":["実行制御にはC4コミュニケーションブリッジインフラストラクチャが必要","アクティビティモニター状態ファイル(~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)に依存","CLIアクセスは~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/が必要"],"ko":["실행 제어를 위해 C4 통신 브릿지 인프라가 필요함","활동 모니터 상태 파일(~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)에 의존","CLI 액세스는 ~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la infraestructura de comm-bridge de C4 para el control de ejecución","Dependiente del archivo de estado de activity-monitor (~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","Se requiere acceso CLI a través de ~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/"],"fr":["Nécessite l''infrastructure de comm-bridge de C4 pour le contrôle d''exécution","Dépendant du fichier d''état d''activity-monitor (~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","Accès CLI nécessaire via ~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/"],"de":["Benötigt die C4 comm-bridge-Infrastruktur für die Ausführungskontrolle","Abhängig von der activity-monitor-Status-Datei (~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","CLI-Zugriff erforderlich über ~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/"],"pt":["Requires C4 comm-bridge infrastructure for execution control","Dependent on activity-monitor status file (~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","CLI access needed through ~/zylos/.claude/skills/scheduler/scripts/"],"ru":["Requires C4 comm-bridge infrastructure for execution control","Dependent on activity-monitor status file (~/zylos/activity-monitor/claude-status.json)","CLI access needed through ~