、移动、复制文件或目录\n- 读取或写入文件内容\n- 搜索文件\n- 列出目录内容\n- 获取文件信息（大小、修改时间等）\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 列出目录\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py list <path> [--recursive] [--pattern \"*.py\"]\n```\n\n### 读取文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py read <file_path> [--encoding utf-8]\n```\n\n### 写入文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py write <file_path> --content \"内容\" [--append]\n```\n\n### 复制文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py copy <source> <destination>\n```\n\n### 移动/重命名\n\n```ba","body":"# File Manager\n\n管理文件和目录的工具集。\n\n## When to Use\n\n- 创建、删除、移动、复制文件或目录\n- 读取或写入文件内容\n- 搜索文件\n- 列出目录内容\n- 获取文件信息（大小、修改时间等）\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 列出目录\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py list <path> [--recursive] [--pattern \"*.py\"]\n```\n\n### 读取文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py read <file_path> [--encoding utf-8]\n```\n\n### 写入文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py write <file_path> --content \"内容\" [--append]\n```\n\n### 复制文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py copy <source> <destination>\n```\n\n### 移动/重命名\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py move <source> <destination>\n```\n\n### 删除\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py delete <path> [--recursive]\n```\n\n### 搜索文件\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py search <directory> --pattern \"*.py\" [--content \"search_text\"]\n```\n\n### 获取文件信息\n\n```bash\npython scripts/file_ops.py info <path>\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n所有操作返回 JSON 格式:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"operation\": \"list\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"files\": [\"file1.py\", \"file2.py\"],\n    \"directories\": [\"subdir\"],\n    \"count\": 3\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Safety Notes\n\n- 删除操作不可恢复，谨慎使用\n- 写入文件会覆盖原有内容（除非使用 --append）\n- 对于重要文件，建议先备份\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:05:55.475Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for System Administration Agents requiring advanced file and directory management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级文件和目录管理功能的系统管理代理。","ja":"システム管理エージェントが高度なファイルおよびディレクトリ管理機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 파일 및 디렉토리 관리 기능이 필요한 시스템 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de sistemas que requieren capacidades avanzadas de gestión de archivos y directorios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''administration de système nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de fichiers et de répertoires.","de":"Ideal für Systemadministration-Agenten, die erweiterte Datei- und Verzeichnisverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for System Administration Agents requiring advanced file and directory management capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for System Administration Agents requiring advanced file and directory management capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for System Administration Agents requiring advanced file and directory management capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage files and directories efficiently using Python scripts, enabling operations such as reading, writing, copying, and moving files, as well as listing directory contents and searching for files, all with support for recursive operations and pattern matching.","zh":"通过Python脚本赋予代理高效管理文件和目录的能力，支持读取、写入、复制和移动文件，以及列出目录内容和搜索文件等操作，所有操作均支持递归操作和模式匹配。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトを使用して、エージェントがファイルとディレクトリを効率的に管理できるようにします。ファイルの読み取り、書き込み、コピー、移動、ディレクトリの内容のリスト作成、ファイルの検索などの操作が可能であり、すべての操作で再帰操作とパターンマッチングがサポートされます。","ko":"파이썬 스크립트를 사용하여 에이전트가 파일과 디렉토리를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 파일 읽기, 쓰기, 복사, 이동, 디렉토리 내용 목록 생성, 파일 검색 등의 작업을 지원하며, 모든 작업에서 재귀 작업과 패턴 매칭이 지원됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar archivos y directorios de manera eficiente utilizando scripts de Python, lo que permite operaciones como leer, escribir, copiar y mover archivos, así como listar el contenido de directorios y buscar archivos, todo con soporte para operaciones recursivas y coincidencia de patrones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les fichiers et les répertoires de manière efficace à l''aide de scripts Python, ce qui permet des opérations telles que la lecture, l''écriture, la copie et le déplacement de fichiers, ainsi que la liste des contenus de répertoire et la recherche de fichiers, le tout avec une prise en charge des opérations récursives et de la correspondance de modèles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dateien und Verzeichnisse effizient mit Python-Skripten zu verwalten, wodurch Operationen wie Lesen, Schreiben, Kopieren und Verschieben von Dateien sowie Auflisten von Verzeichnisinhalten und Suchen nach Dateien ermöglicht werden, alles mit Unterstützung für rekursive Operationen und Musterabgleich.","pt":"Empowers agents to manage files and directories efficiently using Python scripts, enabling operations such as reading, writing, copying, and moving files, as well as listing directory contents and searching for files, all with support for recursive operations and pattern matching.","ru":"Empowers agents to manage files and directories efficiently using Python scripts, enabling operations such as reading, writing, copying, and moving files, as well as listing directory contents and searching for files, all with support for recursive operations and pattern matching.","ar":"Empowers agents to manage files and directories efficiently using Python scripts, enabling operations such as reading, writing, copying, and moving files, as well as listing directory contents and searching for files, all with support for recursive operations and pattern matching."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating file backups by copying files to a secure location","Generating directory listings for system audits","Searching for files based on specific patterns or extensions"],"zh":["通过复制文件到安全位置实现文件备份自动化","为系统审计生成目录列表","根据特定模式或扩展名搜索文件"],"ja":["ファイルをセキュアな場所にコピーしてファイルバックアップの自動化を実現する","システム監査のためにディレクトリリストを生成する","特定のパターンまたは拡張子に基づいてファイルを検索する"],"ko":["파일을 안전한 위치에 복사하여 파일 백업 자동화","시스템 감사를 위한 디렉토리 목록 생성","특정 패턴 또는 확장자에 따라 파일 검색"],"es":["Automatizar copias de seguridad de archivos copiando archivos a una ubicación segura","Generar listados de directorios para auditorías del sistema","Buscar archivos en función de patrones o extensiones específicas"],"fr":["Automatiser les sauvegardes de fichiers en copiant les fichiers vers un emplacement sécurisé","Générer des listes de répertoires pour les audits de système","Rechercher des fichiers en fonction de modèles ou d''extensions spécifiques"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dateisicherungskopien durch Kopieren von Dateien in einen sicheren Speicherort","Erstellen von Verzeichnislisten für Systemaudits","Suchen nach Dateien basierend auf bestimmten Mustern oder Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Automating file backups by copying files to a secure location","Generating directory listings for system audits","Searching for files based on specific patterns or extensions"],"ru":["Automating file backups by copying files to a secure location","Generating directory listings for system audits","Searching for files based on specific patterns or extensions"],"ar":["Automating file backups by copying files to a secure location","Generating directory listings for system audits","Searching for files based on specific patterns or extensions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Filesystem access needed","Limited to local file system operations"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要文件系统访问权限","仅限于本地文件系统操作"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","ローカルファイルシステム操作のみ"],"ko":["파이썬 환경 필요","파일 시스템 액세스 필요","로컬 파일 시스템 작업만"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesita acceso al sistema de archivos","Limitado a operaciones del sistema de archivos local"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","L''accès au système de fichiers est nécessaire","Limité aux opérations du système de fichiers local"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Zugriff auf Dateisystem erforderlich","Begrenzt auf lokale Dateisystemoperationen"],"pt":["Requires Python environment","Filesystem access needed","Limited to local file system operations"],"ru":["Requires Python environment","Filesystem access needed","Limited to local file system operations"],"ar":["Requires Python environment","Filesystem access needed","Limited to local file system operations"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
