age personnalisé avec ''--jq''"],"de":["Integrierte jq-Filterunterstützung","Effiziente Abfrage von GitHub-Diskussionen","Informationen über das Schema und die Datengröße","Option, alle Daten mit ''--jq ''.'' zu erhalten","Benutzerdefiniertes Filtern mit ''--jq''"],"pt":["Suporte a filtro jq para consultas personalizadas","Retorna informações de esquema e tamanho de dados","Prevenção de respostas excessivas com grandes conjuntos de dados","Uso de ''--jq'' para filtrar dados","Compatibilidade com a plataforma GitHub"],"ru":["Поддержка фильтра jq для настраиваемых запросов","Возвращает информацию о схеме и размере данных","Предотвращение чрезмерных ответов с большими наборами данных","Использование ''--jq'' для фильтрации данных","Совместимость с платформой GitHub"],"ar":["دعم مرشح jq للاستعلامات المخصصة","إرجاع معلومات حول مخطط البيانات وحجمها","منع الإجابات الزائدة مع مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة","استخدام ''--jq'' لمرشح البيانات","التوافق مع منصة جيت هاب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 讨论查询","jq 过滤","GitHub API","开发者工具","效率查询","数据获取","GitHub 技术"],"ja":["GitHub ディスカッション クエリ","jq フィルタリング","GitHub API","開発者ツール","効率的なクエリ","データ取得","GitHub 技術"],"ko":["GitHub 토론 쿼리","jq 필터링","GitHub API","개발자 도구","효율적인 쿼리","데이터 가져오기","GitHub 기술"],"es":["consulta de discusiones de GitHub","filtrado jq","discusiones de GitHub","esquema de datos","tamaño de los datos","desarrollo de software","GitHub"],"fr":["requête de discussion GitHub","filtrage jq","discussions GitHub","schéma de données","taille des données","développement de logiciels","GitHub"],"de":["GitHub-Diskussionsabfrage","jq-Filter","GitHub-Diskussionen","Datenschema","Datengröße","Software-Entwicklung","GitHub"],"pt":["github discussion query","filtro jq","consulta de discussões","desenvolvimento de software","plataforma github","api github","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["github discussion query","фильтр jq","запрос обсуждений","разработка программного обеспечения","платформа github","api github","разработчики"],"ar":["استعلام مناقشات جيت هاب","مرشح jq","استعلام مناقشات","تطوير البرمجيات","منصة جيت هاب","api جيت هاب","مطورون"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-discussion-query","description":"Query GitHub discussions efficiently with jq argument support for filtering","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Discussion Query Skill\n\nThis skill provides efficient querying of GitHub discussions with built-in jq filtering support.\n\n## Important: jq Parameter is Optional\n\nThe `--jq` parameter is **optional**. When called without `--jq`, this skill returns **schema and data size information** instead of the full data.\nThis prevents overwhelming responses with large datasets and helps you understand the data structure before querying.\n\nUse `--jq ''.''` to get all data, or use a more specific filter","body":"# GitHub Discussion Query Skill\n\nThis skill provides efficient querying of GitHub discussions with built-in jq filtering support.\n\n## Important: jq Parameter is Optional\n\nThe `--jq` parameter is **optional**. When called without `--jq`, this skill returns **schema and data size information** instead of the full data.\nThis prevents overwhelming responses with large datasets and helps you understand the data structure before querying.\n\nUse `--jq ''.''` to get all data, or use a more specific filter for targeted results.\n\n## Usage\n\nUse this skill to query discussions from the current repository or any specified repository.\n\n### Basic Query (Returns Schema Only)\n\nTo list discussions from the current repository:\n\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh\n# Returns schema and data size, not full data\n```\n\n### Get All Data\n\nTo get all discussion data:\n\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.''\n```\n\n### With Repository\n\nTo query a specific repository:\n\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n### With jq Filtering\n\nUse the `--jq` argument to filter and transform the output:\n\n```bash\n# Get discussion numbers and titles\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | {number, title}''\n\n# Get discussions by a specific author\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.author.login == \"username\")''\n\n# Get discussions in a specific category\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.category.name == \"Ideas\")''\n\n# Get answered discussions\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.answer != null)''\n\n# Count discussions by category\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''group_by(.category.name) | map({category: .[0].category.name, count: length})''\n```\n\n### Common Options\n\n- `--limit`: Maximum number of discussions to fetch. Default: 30\n- `--repo`: Repository in owner/repo format. Default: current repo\n- `--jq`: (Optional) jq expression for filtering/transforming output. If omitted, returns schema info\n\n### Example Queries\n\n**Find discussions with many comments:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.comments.totalCount > 5) | {number, title, comments: .comments.totalCount}''\n```\n\n**Get unanswered discussions:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.answer == null) | {number, title, category: .category.name}''\n```\n\n**List discussions with their labels:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | {number, title, labels: [.labels[].name]}''\n```\n\n**Find discussions by category:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''.[] | select(.category.name == \"Q&A\") | {number, title, author: .author.login}''\n```\n\n**Get recently updated discussions:**\n```bash\n./query-discussions.sh --jq ''sort_by(.updatedAt) | reverse | .[0:10] | .[] | {number, title, updatedAt}''\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe script outputs JSON by default, making it easy to pipe through jq for additional processing.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated\n- `jq` for filtering (installed by default on most systems)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:06:29.557Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing efficient GitHub discussion querying with jq filtering support.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的 GitHub 讨论查询和 jq 过滤支持的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub のディスカッションの効率的な検索や jq フィルタリングのサポートが必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 GitHub 논의 쿼리 및 jq 필터링 지원이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una consulta eficiente de discusiones de GitHub con soporte de filtrado jq.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une interrogation efficace des discussions GitHub avec une prise en charge du filtrage jq.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine effiziente GitHub-Diskussionsabfrage mit jq-Filterunterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de consulta eficiente de discussões do GitHub com suporte a filtragem jq.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется эффективный запрос обсуждений на GitHub с поддержкой фильтрации jq.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى استفسار كفء لمحادثات GitHub مع دعم مرشح jq."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query GitHub discussions with optional jq filtering, providing schema and data size information to prevent overwhelming responses, and enabling advanced data querying using the jq parameter.","zh":"赋予代理查询 GitHub 讨论的能力，包括可选的 jq 过滤，并提供模式和数据大小信息以防止过载的响应，同时通过 jq 参数实现高级数据查询。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub のディスカッションを検索する機能を提供し、オプションの jq フィルタリングを使用して、過負荷のレスポンスを防ぐためにスキーマとデータサイズの情報を提供し、jq パラメータを使用して高度なデータ検索を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 논의를 쿼리하는 기능을 제공하며, 선택적 jq 필터링을 사용하여 과부하 응답을 방지하기 위해 스키마 및 데이터 크기 정보를 제공하고, jq 매개 변수를 사용하여 고급 데이터 쿼리를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar discusiones de GitHub con filtrado jq opcional, proporcionando información de esquema y tamaño de datos para evitar respuestas abrumadoras, y permitiendo consultas de datos avanzadas mediante el parámetro jq.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les discussions GitHub avec un filtrage jq facultatif, en fournissant des informations de schéma et de taille de données pour éviter des réponses accablantes, et en permettant des requêtes de données avancées à l''aide du paramètre jq.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-Diskussionen mit optionaler jq-Filterung abzufragen, wobei Schema- und Datengrößeninformationen bereitgestellt werden, um überwältigende Antworten zu vermeiden, und erweiterte Datenabfragen mithilfe des jq-Parameters zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar discussões do GitHub com filtragem jq opcional, fornecendo informações de esquema e tamanho de dados para evitar respostas esmagadoras e permitir a consulta de dados avançada usando o parâmetro jq.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запроса обсуждений на GitHub с опциональной фильтрацией jq, предоставляя информацию о схеме и размере данных для предотвращения подавляющих ответов и ermöglicht расширенный запрос данных с помощью параметра jq.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل استفسار محادثات GitHub مع مرشح jq اختياري، يوفر معلومات مخطط وقدرة بيانات لمنع استجابات مدمرة وتمكين استفسار بيانات متقدم باستخدام معامل jq."},"useCases":{"en":["Querying GitHub discussions with custom jq filters","Retrieving schema and data size information for GitHub discussions","Filtering large GitHub discussion datasets using jq"],"zh":["使用自定义 jq 过滤器查询 GitHub 讨论","检索 GitHub 讨论的模式和数据大小信息","使用 jq 过滤大型 GitHub 讨论数据集"],"ja":["カスタム jq フィルタを使用して GitHub のディスカッションを検索する","GitHub のディスカッションのスキーマとデータサイズの情報を取得する","jq を使用して大規模な GitHub ディスカッションデータセットをフィルタリングする"],"ko":["사용자 정의 jq 필터를 사용하여 GitHub 논의를 쿼리하는 것","GitHub 논의의 스키마 및 데이터 크기 정보를 검색하는 것","jq를 사용하여 대형 GitHub 논의 데이터셋 필터링"],"es":["Consulta de discusiones de GitHub con filtros jq personalizados","Recuperación de información de esquema y tamaño de datos para discusiones de GitHub","Filtrado de grandes conjuntos de datos de discusiones de GitHub mediante jq"],"fr":["Interrogation de discussions GitHub avec des filtres jq personnalisés","Récupération d''informations de schéma et de taille de données pour les discussions GitHub","Filtrage de grands ensembles de données de discussions GitHub à l''aide de jq"],"de":["Abfrage von GitHub-Diskussionen mit benutzerdefinierten jq-Filtern","Abrufen von Schemainformationen und Datengrößen für GitHub-Diskussionen","Filtern großer GitHub-Diskussionsdatensätze mithilfe von jq"],"pt":["Consulta de discussões do GitHub com filtros jq personalizados","Recuperação de informações de esquema e tamanho de dados para discussões do GitHub","Filtragem de grandes conjuntos de dados de discussões do GitHub usando jq"],"ru":["Запрос обсуждений на GitHub с пользовательскими фильтрами jq","Получение информации о схеме и размере данных для обсуждений на GitHub","Фильтрация больших наборов данных обсуждений на GitHub с помощью jq"],"ar":["استفسار محادثات GitHub مع مرشحات jq مخصصة","استرجاع معلومات مخطط وقدرة بيانات لمحادثات GitHub","ترشيح مجموعات بيانات كبيرة لمحادثات GitHub باستخدام jq"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub discussion data access","Optional jq parameter must be used carefully to avoid overwhelming responses"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 讨论数据访问权限","可选的 jq 参数必须谨慎使用以避免过载的响应"],"ja":["GitHub のディスカッションデータへのアクセスが必要","オプションの jq パラメータを使用する際には、過負荷のレスポンスを避けるために注意が必要"],"ko":["GitHub 논의 데이터 액세스가 필요함","선택적 jq 매개 변수는 과부하 응답을 방지하기 위해 주의하여 사용되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de discusiones de GitHub","El parámetro jq opcional debe usarse con cuidado para evitar respuestas abrumadoras"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de discussion GitHub","Le paramètre jq facultatif doit être utilisé avec précaution pour éviter des réponses accablantes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-Diskussionsdaten","Der optionale jq-Parameter muss sorgfältig verwendet werden, um überwältigende Antworten zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de discussões do GitHub","O parâmetro jq opcional deve ser usado com cuidado para evitar respostas esmagadoras"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к данным обсуждений на GitHub","Опциональный параметр jq должен быть использован осторожно, чтобы избежать подавляющих ответов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات محادثات GitHub","يجب استخدام معامل jq الاختياري بحذر لمنع الاستجابات المدمرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/shadcn-ui', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'shadcn-ui', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:06:19.930Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/shadcn-ui","name":"shadcn-ui","description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ja":"shadcn-uiRadix UITailwind CSS","ko":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI, Tailwind CSS ","es":"Shadcn-ui es una biblioteca para crear componentes UI personalizables y accesibles. Aprende a utilizarla con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Shadcn-ui est une bibliothèque pour créer des composants UI personnalisables et accessibles. Découvrez comment l''utiliser avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Shadcn-ui ist eine Bibliothek zur Erstellung von anpassbaren und zugänglichen UI-Komponenten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS verwenden.","pt":"Guia de componentes UI shadcn-ui para desenvolvedores, abordando acessibilidade e personalização com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui для разработчиков, освещающее доступность и настраиваемость с помощью Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui للمطورين، يغطي الوصول والتعديل باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"shadcn-ui ","ja":"shadcn-ui","ko":"shadcn-ui ","es":"Guía de shadcn-ui para componentes UI personalizables","fr":"Guide de shadcn-ui pour des composants UI personnalisables","de":"Anleitung für shadcn-ui zur Erstellung von anpassbaren UI...","pt":"Guia de Componentes UI shadcn-ui","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui","en":"shadcn-ui"},"description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ja":"shadcn-uiRadix UITailwind CSS","ko":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI, Tailwind CSS ","es":"Shadcn-ui es una biblioteca para crear componentes UI personalizables y accesibles. Aprende a utilizarla con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Shadcn-ui est une bibliothèque pour créer des composants UI personnalisables et accessibles. Découvrez comment l''utiliser avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Shadcn-ui ist eine Bibliothek zur Erstellung von anpassbaren und zugänglichen UI-Komponenten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS verwenden.","pt":"Guia de componentes UI shadcn-ui para desenvolvedores, abordando acessibilidade e personalização com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui для разработчиков, освещающее доступность и настраиваемость с помощью Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui للمطورين، يغطي الوصول والتعديل باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Button","Input & Form Fields","Forms with Validation"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Button","Input & Form Fields","Forms with Validation"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Button","Input & Form Fields","Forms with Validation"],"es":["Componentes UI personalizables","Accesibilidad integrada","Compatibilidad con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Fácil configuración y uso","Documentación detallada"],"fr":["Composants UI personnalisables","Accessibilité intégrée","Compatibilité avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Configuration et utilisation faciles","Documentation détaillée"],"de":["Anpassbare UI-Komponenten","Integrierte Zugänglichkeit","Kompatibilität mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Einfache Konfiguration und Verwendung","Detaillierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Componentes UI personalizáveis","Acessibilidade garantida","Integração com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Guia de início rápido","Configuração de projeto","Componentes principais como botões e formulários"],"ru":["Настраиваемые компоненты UI","Гарантия доступности","Интеграция с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Быстрый старт","Настройка проекта","Основные компоненты, такие как кнопки и формы"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","ضمان الوصول","التكامل مع Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","دليل البدء السريع","تكوين المشروع","المكونات الأساسية مثل الأزرار والنماذج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn-ui","UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn-ui","UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn-ui","UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI personalizables","accesibilidad web","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario","bibliotecas de componentes"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants UI personnalisables","accessibilité web","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","développement web","interfaces utilisateur","bibliothèques de composants"],"de":["shadcn-ui","anpassbare UI-Komponenten","Web-Zugänglichkeit","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Web-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Bibliotheken von Komponenten"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","acessibilidade","personalização","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","guias de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты UI","доступность","настраиваемость","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","руководства для разработчиков"],"ar":["shadcn-ui","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","الوصول","التعديل","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الويب","دلائل المطورين"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Complete shadcn/ui component library guide including installation, configuration, and implementation of accessible React components. Use when setting up shadcn/ui, installing components, building forms with React Hook Form and Zod, customizing themes with Tailwind CSS, or implementing UI patterns like buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, tables, and complex form layouts.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card]","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card](#card-component)\n  - [Dialog (Modal)](#dialog-modal-component)\n  - [Select (Dropdown)](#select-dropdown-component)\n  - [Sheet (Slide-over)](#sheet-slide-over-component)\n  - [Menubar & Navigation](#menubar--navigation)\n  - [Table](#table-component)\n  - [Toast Notifications](#toast-notifications)\n- [Advanced Patterns](#advanced-patterns)\n- [Customization](#customization)\n- [Next.js Integration](#nextjs-integration)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Common Component Combinations](#common-component-combinations)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up a new project with shadcn/ui\n- Installing or configuring individual components\n- Building forms with React Hook Form and Zod validation\n- Creating accessible UI components (buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, sheets)\n- Customizing component styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Implementing design systems with shadcn/ui\n- Building Next.js applications with TypeScript\n- Creating complex layouts and data displays\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor new projects, use the automated setup:\n\n```bash\n# Create Next.js project with shadcn/ui\nnpx create-next-app@latest my-app --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app\ncd my-app\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Install essential components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form card dialog select\n```\n\nFor existing projects:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install tailwindcss-animate class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react\n\n# Initialize shadcn/ui\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n## What is shadcn/ui?\n\nshadcn/ui is **not** a traditional component library or npm package. Instead:\n\n- It''s a **collection of reusable components** that you can copy into your project\n- Components are **yours to customize** - you own the code\n- Built with **Radix UI** primitives for accessibility\n- Styled with **Tailwind CSS** utilities\n- Includes CLI tool for easy component installation\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in your project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nDuring setup, you''ll configure:\n- TypeScript or JavaScript\n- Style (Default, New York, etc.)\n- Base color theme\n- CSS variables or Tailwind CSS classes\n- Component installation path\n\n### Installing Individual Components\n\n```bash\n# Install a single component\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n\n# Install multiple components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form\n\n# Install all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add --all\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\nIf you prefer manual setup:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies for a specific component\nnpm install @radix-ui/react-slot\n\n# Copy component code from ui.shadcn.com\n# Place in src/components/ui/\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@radix-ui/react-accordion\": \"^1.1.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu\": \"^2.0.6\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-label\": \"^2.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-select\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-separator\": \"^1.0.3\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-slot\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-toast\": \"^1.1.5\",\n    \"class-variance-authority\": \"^0.7.0\",\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.294.0\",\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss-animate\": \"^1.0.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSConfig Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"es5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"dom\", \"dom.iterable\", \"es6\"],\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"preserve\",\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"plugins\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"next\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/components/*\": [\"./src/components/*\"],\n      \"@/lib/*\": [\"./src/lib/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"next-env.d.ts\", \"**/*.ts\", \"**/*.tsx\", \".next/types/**/*.ts\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Configuration\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  darkMode: [\"class\"],\n  content: [\n    ''./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./app/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n  ],\n  prefix: \"\",\n  theme: {\n    container: {\n      center: true,\n      padding: \"2rem\",\n      screens: {\n        \"2xl\": \"1400px\",\n      },\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        input: \"hsl(var(--input))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        popover: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--popover))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--popover-foreground))\",\n        },\n        card: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--card))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--card-foreground))\",\n        },\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        \"accordion-down\": {\n          from: { height: \"0\" },\n          to: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n        },\n        \"accordion-up\": {\n          from: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n          to: { height: \"0\" },\n        },\n      },\n      animation: {\n        \"accordion-down\": \"accordion-down 0.2s ease-out\",\n        \"accordion-up\": \"accordion-up 0.2s ease-out\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables (globals.css)\n\n```css\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card: 0 0% 100%;\n    --card-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover: 0 0% 100%;\n    --popover-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --card: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --popover: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --input: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Button Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\nBasic usage:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonDemo() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nButton variants:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonVariants() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nButton sizes:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n  <Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n  <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n  <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n  <Button size=\"icon\">\n    <Icon className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n  </Button>\n</div>\n```\n\nWith loading state:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport function ButtonLoading() {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled>\n      <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />\n      Please wait\n    </Button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input & Form Fields\n\n#### Input Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add input\n```\n\nBasic input:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputDemo() {\n  return <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />;\n}\n```\n\nInput with label:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\";\n\nexport function InputWithLabel() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n      <Input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nInput with button:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputWithButton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-2\">\n      <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"outline\">Subscribe</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Forms with Validation\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n```\n\nThis installs React Hook Form, Zod, and form components.\n\nComplete form example:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormDescription,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2, {\n    message: \"Username must be at least 2 characters.\",\n  }),\n  email: z.string().email({\n    message: \"Please enter a valid email address.\",\n  }),\n})\n\nexport function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    toast({\n      title: \"You submitted the following values:\",\n      description: (\n        <pre className=\"mt-2 w-[340px] rounded-md bg-slate-950 p-4\">\n          <code className=\"text-white\">{JSON.stringify(values, null, 2)}</code>\n        </pre>\n      ),\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"shadcn\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormDescription>\n                This is your public display name.\n              </FormDescription>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add card\n```\n\nBasic card:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function CardDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card Description</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card Content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter>\n        <p>Card Footer</p>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nCard with form:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\nexport function CardWithForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Create project</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Deploy your new project in one-click.</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <form>\n          <div className=\"grid w-full items-center gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5\">\n              <Label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</Label>\n              <Input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name of your project\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n        <Button>Deploy</Button>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog (Modal) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\nBasic dialog:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogFooter,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport function DialogDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent className=\"sm:max-w-[425px]\">\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Edit profile</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <DialogFooter>\n          <Button type=\"submit\">Save changes</Button>\n        </DialogFooter>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Sheet (Slide-over) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\n```\n\nBasic sheet:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nexport function SheetDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Sheet>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Sheet</Button>\n      </SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>Edit profile</SheetTitle>\n          <SheetDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </SheetDescription>\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"username\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Username\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"username\" value=\"@peduarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSheet with side placement:\n\n```tsx\n<Sheet>\n  <SheetTrigger asChild>\n    <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Right Sheet</Button>\n  </SheetTrigger>\n  <SheetContent side=\"right\">\n    <SheetHeader>\n      <SheetTitle>Settings</SheetTitle>\n      <SheetDescription>\n        Configure your application settings here.\n      </SheetDescription>\n    </SheetHeader>\n    {/* Settings content */}\n  </SheetContent>\n</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Menubar & Navigation\n\n#### Menubar Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add menubar\n```\n\nBasic menubar:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarSub,\n  MenubarSubContent,\n  MenubarSubTrigger,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n\nexport function MenubarDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Menubar>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>File</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Tab <MenubarShortcut>⌘T</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Window <MenubarShortcut>⌘N</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Share</MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Print</MenubarItem>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>Edit</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Undo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Z</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Redo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Y</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarSub>\n            <MenubarSubTrigger>Find</MenubarSubTrigger>\n            <MenubarSubContent>\n              <MenubarItem>Search the web</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find...</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Next</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Previous</MenubarItem>\n            </MenubarSubContent>\n          </MenubarSub>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n    </Menubar>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select (Dropdown) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add select\n```\n\nBasic select:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Select,\n  SelectContent,\n  SelectItem,\n  SelectTrigger,\n  SelectValue,\n} from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport function SelectDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSelect in form:\n\n```tsx\n<FormField\n  control={form.control}\n  name=\"role\"\n  render={({ field }) => (\n    <FormItem>\n      <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n      <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n        <FormControl>\n          <SelectTrigger>\n            <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n          </SelectTrigger>\n        </FormControl>\n        <SelectContent>\n          <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n        </SelectContent>\n      </Select>\n      <FormMessage />\n    </FormItem>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add toast\n```\n\nSetup toast provider in root layout:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nUsing toast:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useToast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastDemo() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Scheduled: Catch up\",\n          description: \"Friday, February 10, 2023 at 5:57 PM\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nToast variants:\n\n```tsx\n// Success\ntoast({\n  title: \"Success\",\n  description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n})\n\n// Error\ntoast({\n  variant: \"destructive\",\n  title: \"Error\",\n  description: \"Something went wrong.\",\n})\n\n// With action\ntoast({\n  title: \"Uh oh! Something went wrong.\",\n  description: \"There was a problem with your request.\",\n  action: <ToastAction altText=\"Try again\">Try again</ToastAction>,\n})\n```\n\n### Table Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add table\n```\n\nBasic table:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCaption,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", method: \"Credit Card\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", method: \"PayPal\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function TableDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableCaption>A list of your recent invoices.</TableCaption>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Method</TableHead>\n          <TableHead className=\"text-right\">Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell className=\"font-medium\">{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.method}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell className=\"text-right\">{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theming with CSS Variables\n\nshadcn/ui uses CSS variables for theming. Configure in `globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    /* ... other dark mode variables */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Customizing Components\n\nSince you own the code, customize directly:\n\n```tsx\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline: \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent\",\n        // Add custom variant\n        custom: \"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n        lg: \"h-11 rounded-md px-8\",\n        // Add custom size\n        xl: \"h-14 rounded-md px-10 text-lg\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = React.forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : \"button\"\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = \"Button\"\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n```\n\n## Next.js Integration\n\n### App Router Setup\n\nFor Next.js 13+ with App Router, ensure components use `\"use client\"` directive:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ... rest of component\n```\n\n### Layout Integration\n\nAdd the Toaster to your root layout:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className=\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\">\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Server Components\n\nWhen using shadcn/ui components in Server Components, wrap them in a Client Component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/page.tsx\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { ButtonClient } from \"@/components/ui/button-client\"\n\nexport default function DashboardPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>Dashboard</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <ButtonClient>Interactive Button</ButtonClient>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button-client.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"./button\"\n\nexport function ButtonClient(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Button>) {\n  return <Button {...props} />\n}\n```\n\n### Route Handlers with Forms\n\nCreate API routes for form submissions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/contact/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\n\nconst contactSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json()\n    const validated = contactSchema.parse(body)\n\n    // Process form data\n    console.log(\"Form submission:\", validated)\n\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true })\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { errors: error.errors },\n        { status: 400 }\n      )\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 }\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Server Action\n\nUsing Next.js 14+ Server Actions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/contact/page.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Textarea } from \"@/components/ui/textarea\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nasync function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\"/api/contact\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values),\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\"Failed to submit\")\n\n    toast({\n      title: \"Success!\",\n      description: \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    })\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast({\n      variant: \"destructive\",\n      title: \"Error\",\n      description: \"Failed to send message. Please try again.\",\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nexport default function ContactPage() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto max-w-2xl py-8\">\n      <Form {...form}>\n        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"name\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Name</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input placeholder=\"Your name\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"email\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"message\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Message</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Textarea\n                    placeholder=\"Your message...\"\n                    className=\"resize-none\"\n                    {...field}\n                  />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Send Message\n          </Button>\n        </form>\n      </Form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Metadata with shadcn/ui\n\nUsing shadcn/ui components in metadata:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: {\n    default: \"My App\",\n    template: \"%s | My App\",\n  },\n  description: \"Built with shadcn/ui and Next.js\",\n}\n\n// app/about/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"About Us\",\n  description: \"Learn more about our company\",\n}\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto py-8\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>About Our Company</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <p>We build amazing products with modern web technologies.</p>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Font Optimization\n\nOptimize fonts with next/font:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from \"next/font/google\"\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"] })\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={cn(\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\", inter.className)}>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Form with Multiple Fields\n\n```tsx\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  bio: z.string().max(160).min(4),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(false),\n})\n\nexport function AdvancedForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n      bio: \"\",\n      role: \"user\",\n      notifications: false,\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        {/* Username field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Email field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"john@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Textarea field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"bio\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Bio</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Textarea\n                  placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself\"\n                  className=\"resize-none\"\n                  {...field}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Select field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"role\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n              <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <SelectTrigger>\n                    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n                  </SelectTrigger>\n                </FormControl>\n                <SelectContent>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n                </SelectContent>\n              </Select>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Checkbox field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"notifications\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem className=\"flex flex-row items-start space-x-3 space-y-0\">\n              <FormControl>\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={field.value}\n                  onCheckedChange={field.onChange}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <div className=\"space-y-1 leading-none\">\n                <FormLabel>Email notifications</FormLabel>\n                <FormDescription>\n                  Receive emails about your account activity.\n                </FormDescription>\n              </div>\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Accessibility**: Components use Radix UI primitives for ARIA compliance\n2. **Customization**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n3. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript for type-safe props and state\n4. **Validation**: Use Zod schemas for form validation\n5. **Styling**: Leverage Tailwind utilities and CSS variables\n6. **Consistency**: Use the same component patterns across your app\n7. **Testing**: Components are testable with React Testing Library\n8. **Performance**: Components are optimized and tree-shakeable\n\n## Common Component Combinations\n\n### Login Form\n\n```tsx\n<Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Login</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Enter your credentials to continue</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Login</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  </CardContent>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Official Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Radix UI: https://www.radix-ui.com\n- React Hook Form: https://react-hook-form.com\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Examples: https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:06:19.930Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents seeking to build accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"适合前端代理构建可访问和自定义的UI组件，使用shadcn/ui和Tailwind CSS。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがshadcn/uiとTailwind CSSを使用してアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを構築するのに適しています。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 shadcn/ui와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 접근 가능한 사용자 인터페이스 구성 요소를 구축하기에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que buscan crear componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend souhaitant créer des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn/ui und Tailwind CSS erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que buscam criar componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com shadcn/ui e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, стремящихся создавать доступные и настраиваемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью shadcn/ui и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لويب فرنت-إند يبحثون عن إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والمتوافقة مع shadcn/ui و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive and validated forms using shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS, enabling the development of accessible UI components such as buttons, input fields, and cards with seamless integration and customization capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式和验证表单的能力，使用shadcn/ui、Radix UI和Tailwind CSS，实现可访问的UI组件的开发，例如按钮、输入字段和卡片，并具有无缝集成和自定义能力。","ja":"shadcn/ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSSを使用して、レスポンシブで検証されたフォームを作成するエージェントの能力を強化し、アクセシブルなUIコンポーネントの開発を可能にします。たとえば、ボタン、入力フィールド、カードなどをシームレスに統合およびカスタマイズできます。","ko":"shadcn/ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 대응형 및 유효성 검사된 양식을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하여, 버튼, 입력 필드 및 카드와 같은 접근 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 개발하고, 무결점 통합 및 사용자 지정 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear formularios responsivos y validados utilizando shadcn/ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS, lo que permite el desarrollo de componentes de UI accesibles como botones, campos de entrada y tarjetas con capacidades de integración y personalización sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des formulaires responsives et validés en utilisant shadcn/ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS, ce qui permet le développement de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles tels que des boutons, des champs de saisie et des cartes avec des capacités d''intégration et de personnalisation sans rupture.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, responsieve und validierte Formulare mit shadcn/ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS zu erstellen, was die Entwicklung von zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten wie Schaltflächen, Eingabefeldern und Karten mit nahtloser Integrations- und Anpassungsfähigkeit ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar formulários responsivos e validados usando shadcn/ui, Radix UI e Tailwind CSS, permitindo o desenvolvimento de componentes de UI acessíveis, como botões, campos de entrada e cartões com capacidades de integração e personalização sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать адаптивные и проверенные формы с использованием shadcn/ui, Radix UI и Tailwind CSS, что позволяет разрабатывать доступные компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, такие как кнопки, поля ввода и карточки с бесшовными возможностями интеграции и настройки.","ar":"يمنح الوكالات khảية إنشاء استمارات متجاوبة ومصادق عليها باستخدام shadcn/ui و Radix UI و Tailwind CSS، مما يتيح تطوير مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول، مثل الأزرار وحقول الإدخال والبطاقات مع إمكانيات التكامل والتعديل دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui","Creating responsive forms with validation using Radix UI and Tailwind CSS","Developing reusable UI patterns with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["使用shadcn/ui构建可访问和自定义的UI组件","使用Radix UI和Tailwind CSS创建响应式表单并进行验证","使用shadcn/ui和Tailwind CSS开发可重用的UI模式"],"ja":["shadcn/uiを使用してアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを構築する","Radix UIとTailwind CSSを使用してレスポンシブなフォームを作成し、検証する","shadcn/uiとTailwind CSSを使用して再利用可能なUIパターンを開発する"],"ko":["shadcn/ui를 사용하여 접근 가능한 사용자 인터페이스 구성 요소를 구축하고 사용자 지정하기","Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 대응형 양식을 생성하고 유효성 검사하기","shadcn/ui 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 UI 패턴 개발하기"],"es":["Creación de componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui","Creación de formularios responsivos con validación utilizando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Desarrollo de patrones de UI reutilizables con shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui","Création de formulaires responsives avec validation en utilisant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Développement de modèles d''interface utilisateur réutilisables avec shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Erstellung von zugänglichen und anpassbaren Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten 