함합니다","es":"El skill web-perf analiza el rendimiento de una página web utilizando Chrome DevTools MCP","fr":"Le skill web-perf analyse les performances d''une page web à l''aide de Chrome DevTools MCP","de":"Der web-perf-Skill analysiert die Leistung einer Webseite mithilfe von Chrome DevTools MCP","pt":"O skill web-perf é uma coleção de ferramentas para auditar o desempenho da página web, incluindo Core Web Vitals e otimização de rede","ru":"Навык web-perf представляет собой сборку инструментов для анализа производительности веб-страницы, включая Core Web Vitals и сетевую оптимизацию","ar":"مهارة web-perf هي مجموعة من الأدوات لفحص أداء صفحة الويب، بما في ذلك Core Web Vitals وتحسين الشبكة","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["Core Web Vitals评估","网络优化","无障碍性评估","Chrome DevTools集成","MCP工具支持"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals評価","ネットワーク最適化","無障礙性評価","Chrome DevTools統合","MCPツールサポート"],"ko":["Core Web Vitals 평가","네트워크 최적화","无障碍성 평가","Chrome DevTools 통합","MCP 도구 지원"],"es":["Análisis de vitales web","Optimización de red","Detección de brechas de accesibilidad","Uso de Chrome DevTools MCP","Verificación de herramientas MCP","Informes de rendimiento detallados"],"fr":["Analyse des vitales web","Optimisation du réseau","Détection des lacunes d''accessibilité","Utilisation de Chrome DevTools MCP","Vérification des outils MCP","Rapports de performance détaillés"],"de":["Analyse von Web-Vitalwerten","Netzwerkoptimierung","Erkennung von Zugänglichkeitslücken","Verwendung von Chrome DevTools MCP","Überprüfung von MCP-Tools","Detaillierte Leistungsberichte"],"pt":["Auditoria de desempenho da página web com Chrome DevTools","Análise de Core Web Vitals","Otimização de rede","Identificação de lacunas de acessibilidade","Uso de MCP Tools para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Анализ производительности веб-страницы с помощью Chrome DevTools","Анализ Core Web Vitals","Сетевая оптимизация","Обнаружение пробелов в доступности","Использование MCP Tools для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["فحص أداء صفحة الويب باستخدام أدوات مطور كروم","تحليل Core Web Vitals","تحسين الشبكة","تحديد الفجوات في إمكانية الوصول","استخدام MCP Tools لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web性能优化","Core Web Vitals","网络优化","无障碍性","Chrome DevTools","MCP工具"],"ja":["Webパフォーマンス最適化","Core Web Vitals","ネットワーク最適化","無障礙性","Chrome DevTools","MCPツール"],"ko":["웹 성능 최적화","Core Web Vitals","네트워크 최적화","无障碍성","Chrome DevTools","MCP 도구"],"es":["auditoría de rendimiento web","optimización de sitio web","vitales web","accesibilidad web","Chrome DevTools MCP","herramientas de desarrollo web","rendimiento web","velocidad de carga"],"fr":["audit de performance web","optimisation de site web","vitales web","accessibilité web","Chrome DevTools MCP","outils de développement web","performance web","vitesse de chargement"],"de":["Web-Performance-Audit","Webseiten-Optimierung","Web-Vitalwerte","Barrierefreiheit","Chrome DevTools MCP","Web-Entwicklungstools","Web-Performance","Ladezeit"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho web","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","otimização de rede","acessibilidade web","MCP Tools","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["оптимизация веб-производительности","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","сетевая оптимизация","веб-доступность","MCP Tools","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تحسين أداء الويب","أدوات مطور كروم","Core Web Vitals","تحسين الشبكة","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","MCP Tools","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-perf","description":"Analyzes web performance using Chrome DevTools MCP. Measures Core Web Vitals (FCP, LCP, TBT, CLS, Speed Index), identifies render-blocking resources, network dependency chains, layout shifts, caching issues, and accessibility gaps. Use when asked to audit, profile, debug, or optimize page load performance, Lighthouse scores, or site speed.","bodyPreview":"# Web Performance Audit\n\nAudit web page performance using Chrome DevTools MCP tools. This skill focuses on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps.\n\n## FIRST: Verify MCP Tools Available\n\n**Run this before starting.** Try calling `navigate_page` or `performance_start_trace`. If unavailable, STOP—the chrome-devtools MCP server isn''t configured.\n\nAsk the user to add this to their MCP config:\n\n```json\n\"chrome-devtools\": {\n  \"type\": \"local\",\n  \"command\": [\"npx\", \"-y\",","body":"# Web Performance Audit\n\nAudit web page performance using Chrome DevTools MCP tools. This skill focuses on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps.\n\n## FIRST: Verify MCP Tools Available\n\n**Run this before starting.** Try calling `navigate_page` or `performance_start_trace`. If unavailable, STOP—the chrome-devtools MCP server isn''t configured.\n\nAsk the user to add this to their MCP config:\n\n```json\n\"chrome-devtools\": {\n  \"type\": \"local\",\n  \"command\": [\"npx\", \"-y\", \"chrome-devtools-mcp@latest\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Key Guidelines\n\n- **Be assertive**: Verify claims by checking network requests, DOM, or codebase—then state findings definitively.\n- **Verify before recommending**: Confirm something is unused before suggesting removal.\n- **Quantify impact**: Use estimated savings from insights. Don''t prioritize changes with 0ms impact.\n- **Skip non-issues**: If render-blocking resources have 0ms estimated impact, note but don''t recommend action.\n- **Be specific**: Say \"compress hero.png (450KB) to WebP\" not \"optimize images\".\n- **Prioritize ruthlessly**: A site with 200ms LCP and 0 CLS is already excellent—say so.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Call |\n|------|-----------|\n| Load page | `navigate_page(url: \"...\")` |\n| Start trace | `performance_start_trace(autoStop: true, reload: true)` |\n| Analyze insight | `performance_analyze_insight(insightSetId: \"...\", insightName: \"...\")` |\n| List requests | `list_network_requests(resourceTypes: [\"Script\", \"Stylesheet\", ...])` |\n| Request details | `get_network_request(reqid: <id>)` |\n| A11y snapshot | `take_snapshot(verbose: true)` |\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist to track progress:\n\n```\nAudit Progress:\n- [ ] Phase 1: Performance trace (navigate + record)\n- [ ] Phase 2: Core Web Vitals analysis (includes CLS culprits)\n- [ ] Phase 3: Network analysis\n- [ ] Phase 4: Accessibility snapshot\n- [ ] Phase 5: Codebase analysis (skip if third-party site)\n```\n\n### Phase 1: Performance Trace\n\n1. Navigate to the target URL:\n   ```\n   navigate_page(url: \"<target-url>\")\n   ```\n\n2. Start a performance trace with reload to capture cold-load metrics:\n   ```\n   performance_start_trace(autoStop: true, reload: true)\n   ```\n\n3. Wait for trace completion, then retrieve results.\n\n**Troubleshooting:**\n- If trace returns empty or fails, verify the page loaded correctly with `navigate_page` first\n- If insight names don''t match, inspect the trace response to list available insights\n\n### Phase 2: Core Web Vitals Analysis\n\nUse `performance_analyze_insight` to extract key metrics.\n\n**Note:** Insight names may vary across Chrome DevTools versions. If an insight name doesn''t work, check the `insightSetId` from the trace response to discover available insights.\n\nCommon insight names:\n\n| Metric | Insight Name | What to Look For |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| LCP | `LCPBreakdown` | Time to largest contentful paint; breakdown of TTFB, resource load, render delay |\n| CLS | `CLSCulprits` | Elements causing layout shifts (images without dimensions, injected content, font swaps) |\n| Render Blocking | `RenderBlocking` | CSS/JS blocking first paint |\n| Document Latency | `DocumentLatency` | Server response time issues |\n| Network Dependencies | `NetworkRequestsDepGraph` | Request chains delaying critical resources |\n\nExample:\n```\nperformance_analyze_insight(insightSetId: \"<id-from-trace>\", insightName: \"LCPBreakdown\")\n```\n\n**Key thresholds (good/needs-improvement/poor):**\n- TTFB: < 800ms / < 1.8s / > 1.8s\n- FCP: < 1.8s / < 3s / > 3s\n- LCP: < 2.5s / < 4s / > 4s\n- INP: < 200ms / < 500ms / > 500ms\n- TBT: < 200ms / < 600ms / > 600ms\n- CLS: < 0.1 / < 0.25 / > 0.25\n- Speed Index: < 3.4s / < 5.8s / > 5.8s\n\n### Phase 3: Network Analysis\n\nList all network requests to identify optimization opportunities:\n```\nlist_network_requests(resourceTypes: [\"Script\", \"Stylesheet\", \"Document\", \"Font\", \"Image\"])\n```\n\n**Look for:**\n\n1. **Render-blocking resources**: JS/CSS in `<head>` without `async`/`defer`/`media` attributes\n2. **Network chains**: Resources discovered late because they depend on other resources loading first (e.g., CSS imports, JS-loaded fonts)\n3. **Missing preloads**: Critical resources (fonts, hero images, key scripts) not preloaded\n4. **Caching issues**: Missing or weak `Cache-Control`, `ETag`, or `Last-Modified` headers\n5. **Large payloads**: Uncompressed or oversized JS/CSS bundles\n6. **Unused preconnects**: If flagged, verify by checking if ANY requests went to that origin. If zero requests, it''s definitively unused—recommend removal. If requests exist but loaded late, the preconnect may still be valuable.\n\nFor detailed request info:\n```\nget_network_request(reqid: <id>)\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Accessibility Snapshot\n\nTake an accessibility tree snapshot:\n```\ntake_snapshot(verbose: true)\n```\n\n**Flag high-level gaps:**\n- Missing or duplicate ARIA IDs\n- Elements with poor contrast ratios (check against WCAG AA: 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text)\n- Focus traps or missing focus indicators\n- Interactive elements without accessible names\n\n## Phase 5: Codebase Analysis\n\n**Skip if auditing a third-party site without codebase access.**\n\nAnalyze the codebase to understand where improvements can be made.\n\n### Detect Framework & Bundler\n\nSearch for configuration files to identify the stack:\n\n| Tool | Config Files |\n|------|--------------|\n| Webpack | `webpack.config.js`, `webpack.*.js` |\n| Vite | `vite.config.js`, `vite.config.ts` |\n| Rollup | `rollup.config.js`, `rollup.config.mjs` |\n| esbuild | `esbuild.config.js`, build scripts with `esbuild` |\n| Parcel | `.parcelrc`, `package.json` (parcel field) |\n| Next.js | `next.config.js`, `next.config.mjs` |\n| Nuxt | `nuxt.config.js`, `nuxt.config.ts` |\n| SvelteKit | `svelte.config.js` |\n| Astro | `astro.config.mjs` |\n\nAlso check `package.json` for framework dependencies and build scripts.\n\n### Tree-Shaking & Dead Code\n\n- **Webpack**: Check for `mode: ''production''`, `sideEffects` in package.json, `usedExports` optimization\n- **Vite/Rollup**: Tree-shaking enabled by default; check for `treeshake` options\n- **Look for**: Barrel files (`index.js` re-exports), large utility libraries imported wholesale (lodash, moment)\n\n### Unused JS/CSS\n\n- Check for CSS-in-JS vs. static CSS extraction\n- Look for PurgeCSS/UnCSS configuration (Tailwind''s `content` config)\n- Identify dynamic imports vs. eager loading\n\n### Polyfills\n\n- Check for `@babel/preset-env` targets and `useBuiltIns` setting\n- Look for `core-js` imports (often oversized)\n- Check `browserslist` config for overly broad targeting\n\n### Compression & Minification\n\n- Check for `terser`, `esbuild`, or `swc` minification\n- Look for gzip/brotli compression in build output or server config\n- Check for source maps in production builds (should be external or disabled)\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent findings as:\n\n1. **Core Web Vitals Summary** - Table with metric, value, and rating (good/needs-improvement/poor)\n2. **Top Issues** - Prioritized list of problems with estimated impact (high/medium/low)\n3. **Recommendations** - Specific, actionable fixes with code snippets or config changes\n4. **Codebase Findings** - Framework/bundler detected, optimization opportunities (omit if no codebase access)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:07:20.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Performance Optimization Agents needing advanced Chrome DevTools integration for web performance audits.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Chrome DevTools集成的性能优化代理，用于进行Web性能审计。","ja":"パフォーマンス最適化エージェントがWebパフォーマンス監査のために高度なChrome DevTools統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 성능 감사를 위한 고급 Chrome DevTools 통합이 필요한 성능 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de rendimiento que necesitan una integración avanzada de Chrome DevTools para auditorías de rendimiento web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation des performances nécessitant une intégration avancée de Chrome DevTools pour les audits de performances web.","de":"Perfekt für Leistungs-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Chrome DevTools-Integration für Web-Leistungsaudits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que necessitam de integração avançada com o Chrome DevTools para auditorias de desempenho web.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации производительности, которым необходима расширенная интеграция с Chrome DevTools для аудита веб-производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين الأداء الذي يحتاج إلى إدماج متقدم مع أدوات Chrome DevTools لأداء الاختبارات الويب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Core Web Vitals, optimize network performance, and identify high-level accessibility gaps using Chrome DevTools MCP tools, while leveraging protocols like JSON for configuration and tools such as navigate_page and performance_start_trace.","zh":"赋予代理分析核心Web指标、优化网络性能、并使用Chrome DevTools MCP工具识别高级可访问性差距的能力，同时利用JSON等协议进行配置，并使用navigate_page和performance_start_trace等工具。","ja":"Core Web Vitalsの分析、ネットワークパフォーマンスの最適化、高レベルのアクセシビリティギャップの識別をChrome DevTools MCPツールを使用して行うエージェントをEmpower化し、JSONなどのプロトコルを使用して構成し、navigate_pageやperformance_start_traceなどのツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Chrome DevTools MCP 도구를 사용하여 핵심 웹 비탈을 분석하고 네트워크 성능을 최적화하며 고급 접근성 격차를 식별할 수 있도록 하며 JSON과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 구성하고 navigate_page 및 performance_start_trace와 같은 도구를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar los vitales web centrales, optimizar el rendimiento de la red y identificar brechas de accesibilidad de alto nivel utilizando las herramientas MCP de Chrome DevTools, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha protocolos como JSON para la configuración y herramientas como navigate_page y performance_start_trace.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les indicateurs de vitalité web de base, d''optimiser les performances du réseau et d''identifier les lacunes en matière d''accessibilité de haut niveau en utilisant les outils MCP de Chrome DevTools, tout en exploitant des protocoles tels que JSON pour la configuration et des outils tels que navigate_page et performance_start_trace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kernwebvitalitäten zu analysieren, Netzwerkleistung zu optimieren und hochrangige Barrierefreilücken mit Hilfe der Chrome DevTools-MCP-Tools zu identifizieren, während es Protokolle wie JSON für die Konfiguration und Tools wie navigate_page und performance_start_trace nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar os principais indicadores de desempenho da web, otimizar o desempenho da rede e identificar lacunas de acessibilidade de alto nível usando as ferramentas MCP do Chrome DevTools, aproveitando protocolos como JSON para configuração e ferramentas como navigate_page e performance_start_trace.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать основные веб-витали, оптимизировать производительность сети и определять высокоуровневые пробелы в доступности с помощью инструментов MCP Chrome DevTools, используя при этом протоколы, такие как JSON, для конфигурации и инструменты, такие как navigate_page и performance_start_trace.","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحليل أهم معايير أداء الويب وتحسين أداء الشبكة وتحديد الفجوات العالية في إمكانية الوصول باستخدام أدوات MCP من Chrome DevTools والاستفادة من بروتوكولات مثل JSON للتهيئة وأدوات مثل navigate_page وperformance_start_trace"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing web page performance using Chrome DevTools","Optimizing network requests for faster load times","Identifying accessibility gaps in web applications"],"zh":["使用Chrome DevTools进行网页性能审计","优化网络请求以实现更快的加载时间","在Web应用程序中识别可访问性差距"],"ja":["Chrome DevToolsを使用したWebページのパフォーマンス監査","ネットワークリクエストの最適化による高速なロード時間の実現","Webアプリケーションにおけるアクセシビリティギャップの識別"],"ko":["Chrome DevTools를 사용한 웹 페이지 성능 감사","네트워크 요청 최적화를 통한 빠른 로드 시간","웹 애플리케이션의 접근성 격차 식별"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de la página web con Chrome DevTools","Optimización de solicitudes de red para tiempos de carga más rápidos","Identificación de brechas de accesibilidad en aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Auditorat des performances de la page web avec Chrome DevTools","Optimisation des requêtes réseau pour des temps de chargement plus rapides","Identification des lacunes en matière d''accessibilité dans les applications web"],"de":["Auditorium des Webseiten-Leistungs mit Chrome DevTools","Optimierung von Netzwerkanfragen für schnellere Ladezeiten","Identifizierung von Barrierefreilücken in Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de páginas web usando o Chrome DevTools","Otimização de solicitações de rede para tempos de carregamento mais rápidos","Identificação de lacunas de acessibilidade em aplicações web"],"ru":["Аудит производительности веб-страниц с помощью Chrome DevTools","Оптимизация сетевых запросов для более быстрых времен загрузки","Определение пробелов в доступности веб-приложений"],"ar":["فحص أداء صفحات الويب باستخدام أدوات Chrome DevTools","تحسين طلبات الشبكة لأوقات تحميل أسرع","تحديد الفجوات في إمكانية الوصول لتطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires chrome-devtools MCP server configuration","Needs navigate_page or performance_start_trace availability"],"zh":["需要chrome-devtools MCP服务器配置","需要navigate_page或performance_start_trace的可用性"],"ja":["chrome-devtools MCPサーバーの構成が必要","navigate_pageまたはperformance_start_traceの可用性が必要"],"ko":["chrome-devtools MCP 서버 구성이 필요","navigate_page 또는 performance_start_trace의 가용성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor MCP de chrome-devtools","Necesita la disponibilidad de navigate_page o performance_start_trace"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur MCP de chrome-devtools","Nécessite la disponibilité de navigate_page ou performance_start_trace"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration des chrome-devtools-MCP-Servers","Benötigt die Verfügbarkeit von navigate_page oder performance_start_trace"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor MCP do chrome-devtools","Necessita da disponibilidade de navigate_page ou performance_start_trace"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера MCP chrome-devtools","Требует доступности navigate_page или performance_start_trace"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة خادم MCP لبرنامج chrome-devtools","يحتاج إلى توفر navigate_page أو performance_start_trace"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ncolex/oc33ren/bird', 'community', 'ncolex', 'oc33ren', 'ncolex/oc33ren', 'bird', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:07:22.777Z', NULL, '{"id":"ncolex/oc33ren/bird","name":"bird","description":{"zh":"Bird 是一个快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面，使用 GraphQL 和 Cookie 身份验证。它支持多种安装方式，包括 npm、Homebrew 和一键安装","ja":"Bird は、GraphQL と Cookie 認証を使用した高速の X/Twitter CLI です。複数のインストール方法、包括 npm、Homebrew、一键安装をサポート","ko":"Bird는 GraphQL과 Cookie 인증을 사용하는 빠른 X/Twitter 커맨드 라인 인터페이스입니다. 여러 가지 설치 방법을 지원합니다.","es":"Bird es una CLI de Twitter que utiliza autenticación de cookie y GraphQL para proporcionar una experiencia rápida y segura","fr":"Bird est une CLI Twitter qui utilise l''authentification par cookie et GraphQL pour offrir une expérience rapide et sécurisée","de":"Bird ist eine Twitter-CLI, die Cookie-Authentifizierung und GraphQL verwendet, um eine schnelle und sichere Erfahrung zu bieten","pt":"Bird é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o Twitter, utilizando autenticação por cookie e GraphQL.","ru":"Bird — это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с Twitter, использующий аутентификацию по cookie и GraphQL.","ar":"Bird هي أداة سطر الأوامر للتفاعل مع تويتر، تستخدم مصادقة الكوكيز و GraphQL.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Bird AI 代理：快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面","ja":"Bird AI エージェント：高速の X/Twitter CLI","ko":"Bird AI 에이전트: 빠른 X/Twitter 커맨드 라인 인터페이스","es":"Bird: CLI de Twitter con autenticación de cookie","fr":"Bird : CLI Twitter avec authentification par cookie","de":"Bird: Twitter-CLI mit Cookie-Authentifizierung","pt":"Bird: CLI do Twitter com Autenticação por Cookie","ru":"Bird: Twitter CLI с аутентификацией по cookie","ar":"鳥: واجهة سطر الأوامر لتويتر مع مصادقة الكوكيز","en":"bird"},"description":{"zh":"Bird 是一个快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面，使用 GraphQL 和 Cookie 身份验证。它支持多种安装方式，包括 npm、Homebrew 和一键安装","ja":"Bird は、GraphQL と Cookie 認証を使用した高速の X/Twitter CLI です。複数のインストール方法、包括 npm、Homebrew、一键安装をサポート","ko":"Bird는 GraphQL과 Cookie 인증을 사용하는 빠른 X/Twitter 커맨드 라인 인터페이스입니다. 여러 가지 설치 방법을 지원합니다.","es":"Bird es una CLI de Twitter que utiliza autenticación de cookie y GraphQL para proporcionar una experiencia rápida y segura","fr":"Bird est une CLI Twitter qui utilise l''authentification par cookie et GraphQL pour offrir une expérience rapide et sécurisée","de":"Bird ist eine Twitter-CLI, die Cookie-Authentifizierung und GraphQL verwendet, um eine schnelle und sichere Erfahrung zu bieten","pt":"Bird é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o Twitter, utilizando autenticação por cookie e GraphQL.","ru":"Bird — это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с Twitter, использующий аутентификацию по cookie и GraphQL.","ar":"Bird هي أداة سطر الأوامر للتفاعل مع تويتر، تستخدم مصادقة الكوكيز و GraphQL.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面","使用 GraphQL 和 Cookie 身份验证","支持多种安装方式","包括 npm、Homebrew 和一键安装","支持 Cookie-based 身份验证"],"ja":["高速の X/Twitter CLI","GraphQL と Cookie 認証を使用","複数のインストール方法をサポート","npm、Homebrew、一键安装を含む","Cookie-based 認証をサポート"],"ko":["빠른 X/Twitter 커맨드 라인 인터페이스","GraphQL과 Cookie 인증을 사용","여러 가지 설치 방법을 지원","npm, Homebrew, 일회성 설치 포함","Cookie 기반 인증 지원"],"es":["Autenticación de cookie","Soporte para GraphQL","Instalación mediante npm o Homebrew","Autenticación mediante token o fuente de cookies","Compatibilidad con Arc/Brave"],"fr":["Authentification par cookie","Prise en charge de GraphQL","Installation via npm ou Homebrew","Authentification via jeton ou source de cookies","Compatibilité avec Arc/Brave"],"de":["Cookie-Authentifizierung","Unterstützung für GraphQL","Installation über npm oder Homebrew","Authentifizierung über Token oder Cookie-Quelle","Kompatibilität mit Arc/Brave"],"pt":["Autenticação por cookie","Suporte a GraphQL","Instalação via npm ou Homebrew","Opção de autenticação por token","Verificação de fonte de autenticação ativa","Suporte a perfis do Chrome"],"ru":["Аутентификация по cookie","Поддержка GraphQL","Установка через npm или Homebrew","Вариант аутентификации по токену","Проверка активного источника аутентификации","Поддержка профилей Chrome"],"ar":["مصادقة الكوكيز","دعم GraphQL","التثبيت عبر npm أو Homebrew","خيار مصادقة بالرمز","التحقق من مصدر المصادقة النشط","دعم ملفات تعريف Chrome"]},"keywords":{"zh":["X/Twitter 命令行界面","GraphQL","Cookie 身份验证","快速访问 X/Twitter","CLI 工具","npm","Homebrew","一键安装"],"ja":["X/Twitter CLI","GraphQL","Cookie 認証","X/Twitter への迅速なアクセス","CLI ツール","npm","Homebrew","一键インストール"],"ko":["X/Twitter 커맨드 라인 인터페이스","GraphQL","Cookie 인증","X/Twitter에 빠르게 액세스","CLI 도구","npm","Homebrew","일회성 설치"],"es":["CLI de Twitter","autenticación de cookie","GraphQL","desarrollo de Twitter","herramientas de desarrollo","Bird CLI"],"fr":["CLI Twitter","authentification par cookie","GraphQL","développement Twitter","outils de développement","CLI Bird"],"de":["Twitter-CLI","Cookie-Authentifizierung","GraphQL","Twitter-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Bird-CLI"],"pt":["twitter cli","autenticação por cookie","graphql","ferramenta de linha de comando","desenvolvimento de software","integração com twitter"],"ru":["twitter cli","аутентификация по cookie","graphql","инструмент командной строки","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция с twitter"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر لتويتر","مصادقة الكوكيز","graphql","أداة سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","التكامل مع تويتر"]}},"owner":"ncolex","repo":"oc33ren","repoPath":"ncolex/oc33ren","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bird","description":"X/Twitter CLI for reading, searching, posting, and engagement via cookies.","bodyPreview":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n##","body":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Account & Auth\n\n```bash\nbird whoami                    # Show logged-in account\nbird check                     # Show credential sources\nbird query-ids --fresh         # Refresh GraphQL query ID cache\n```\n\n### Reading Tweets\n\n```bash\nbird read <url-or-id>          # Read a single tweet\nbird <url-or-id>               # Shorthand for read\nbird thread <url-or-id>        # Full conversation thread\nbird replies <url-or-id>       # List replies to a tweet\n```\n\n### Timelines\n\n```bash\nbird home                      # Home timeline (For You)\nbird home --following          # Following timeline\nbird user-tweets @handle -n 20 # User''s profile timeline\nbird mentions                  # Tweets mentioning you\nbird mentions --user @handle   # Mentions of another user\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```bash\nbird search \"query\" -n 10\nbird search \"from:steipete\" --all --max-pages 3\n```\n\n### News & Trending\n\n```bash\nbird news -n 10                # AI-curated from Explore tabs\nbird news --ai-only            # Filter to AI-curated only\nbird news --sports             # Sports tab\nbird news --with-tweets        # Include related tweets\nbird trending                  # Alias for news\n```\n\n### Lists\n\n```bash\nbird lists                     # Your lists\nbird lists --member-of         # Lists you''re a member of\nbird list-timeline <id> -n 20  # Tweets from a list\n```\n\n### Bookmarks & Likes\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks -n 10\nbird bookmarks --folder-id <id>           # Specific folder\nbird bookmarks --include-parent           # Include parent tweet\nbird bookmarks --author-chain             # Author''s self-reply chain\nbird bookmarks --full-chain-only          # Full reply chain\nbird unbookmark <url-or-id>\nbird likes -n 10\n```\n\n### Social Graph\n\n```bash\nbird following -n 20           # Users you follow\nbird followers -n 20           # Users following you\nbird following --user <id>     # Another user''s following\nbird about @handle             # Account origin/location info\n```\n\n### Engagement Actions\n\n```bash\nbird follow @handle            # Follow a user\nbird unfollow @handle          # Unfollow a user\n```\n\n### Posting\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hello world\"\nbird reply <url-or-id> \"nice thread!\"\nbird tweet \"check this out\" --media image.png --alt \"description\"\n```\n\n**⚠️ Posting risks**: Posting is more likely to be rate limited; if blocked, use the browser tool instead.\n\n## Media Uploads\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hi\" --media img.png --alt \"description\"\nbird tweet \"pics\" --media a.jpg --media b.jpg  # Up to 4 images\nbird tweet \"video\" --media clip.mp4            # Or 1 video\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\nCommands supporting pagination: `replies`, `thread`, `search`, `bookmarks`, `likes`, `list-timeline`, `following`, `followers`, `user-tweets`\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks --all                    # Fetch all pages\nbird bookmarks --max-pages 3            # Limit pages\nbird bookmarks --cursor <cursor>        # Resume from cursor\nbird replies <id> --all --delay 1000    # Delay between pages (ms)\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n```bash\n--json          # JSON output\n--json-full     # JSON with raw API response\n--plain         # No emoji, no color (script-friendly)\n--no-emoji      # Disable emoji\n--no-color      # Disable ANSI colors (or set NO_COLOR=1)\n--quote-depth n # Max quoted tweet depth in JSON (default: 1)\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n```bash\n--auth-token <token>       # Set auth_token cookie\n--ct0 <token>              # Set ct0 cookie\n--cookie-source <source>   # Cookie source for browser cookies (repeatable)\n--chrome-profile <name>    # Chrome profile name\n--chrome-profile-dir <path> # Chrome/Chromium profile dir or cookie DB path\n--firefox-profile <name>   # Firefox profile\n--timeout <ms>             # Request timeout\n--cookie-timeout <ms>      # Cookie extraction timeout\n```\n\n## Config File\n\n`~/.config/bird/config.json5` (global) or `./.birdrc.json5` (project):\n\n```json5\n{\n  cookieSource: [\"chrome\"],\n  chromeProfileDir: \"/path/to/Arc/Profile\",\n  timeoutMs: 20000,\n  quoteDepth: 1,\n}\n```\n\nEnvironment variables: `BIRD_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_COOKIE_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_QUOTE_DEPTH`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Query IDs stale (404 errors)\n\n```bash\nbird query-ids --fresh\n```\n\n### Cookie extraction fails\n\n- Check browser is logged into X\n- Try different `--cookie-source`\n- For Arc/Brave: use `--chrome-profile-dir`\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR**: Read/search/engage with CLI. Post carefully or use browser. 🐦\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:07:22.777Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring streamlined Twitter CLI interactions via GraphQL and cookie-based authentication.","zh":"适用于需要通过 GraphQL 和基于 cookie 的身份验证进行 Twitter 命令行交互的社交媒体代理的理想选择。","ja":"GraphQL と Cookie ベースの認証を使用した Twitter CLI インタラクションをストリームライン化する必要があるソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GraphQL 및 쿠키 기반 인증을 사용하는 Twitter CLI 상호 작용을 스트림 라인화해야 하는 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Medios Sociales que requieren interacciones de Twitter CLI optimizadas a través de GraphQL y autenticación basada en cookies.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias sociaux nécessitant des interactions de Twitter CLI optimisées via GraphQL et authentification basée sur les cookies.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die optimierte Twitter-CLI-Interaktionen über GraphQL und cookiebasierte Authentifizierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que exigem interações de linha de comando do Twitter otimizadas via GraphQL e autenticação baseada em cookies.","ru":"Идеально для социальных медиа-агентов, требующих оптимизированных взаимодействий с Twitter CLI через GraphQL и аутентификацию на основе файлов cookie.","ar":"مثالية للموظفين الإعلاميين الاجتماعيين الذين يتطلبون تفاعلات سطر أوامر تويتر محسنة عبر GraphQL والتحقق من الهوية المعتمد على ملفات تعريف الارتباط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage GraphQL for efficient Twitter data retrieval, utilizing cookie auth for secure and seamless interactions, with options for direct cookie passing or browser cookie sourcing, including support for Chrome profiles.","zh":"赋予代理使用 GraphQL 进行高效的 Twitter 数据检索的能力，利用 cookie 身份验证进行安全和无缝的交互，并提供直接传递 cookie 或从浏览器源 cookie 的选项，包括对 Chrome 配置文件的支持。","ja":"GraphQL を使用した効率的な Twitter データの取得を可能にし、Cookie 認証を使用してセキュアでシームレスなインタラクションを実現し、直接 Cookie を渡すか、ブラウザからの Cookie ソースを使用するオプションを提供し、Chrome プロファイルのサポートを含む。","ko":"GraphQL을 사용하여 효율적인 Twitter 데이터 검색을 가능하게 하고 쿠키 인증을 사용하여 보안 및 무결점 상호 작용을 구현하며 직접 쿠키를 전달하거나 브라우저에서 쿠키 소스를 사용하는 옵션을 제공하며 Chrome 프로필 지원을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar GraphQL para una recuperación eficiente de datos de Twitter, utilizando la autenticación de cookies para interacciones seguras y sin problemas, con opciones para pasar cookies directamente o obtener cookies del navegador, incluyendo soporte para perfiles de Chrome.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser GraphQL pour une récupération efficace de données Twitter, en utilisant l''authentification par cookie pour des interactions sécurisées et sans accroc, avec des options pour passer des cookies directement ou obtenir des cookies du navigateur, y compris le support pour les profils Chrome.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GraphQL für eine effiziente Twitter-Datenabfrage zu nutzen, indem sie die Cookie-Authentifizierung für sichere und nahtlose Interaktionen verwenden, mit Optionen für die direkte Cookie-Übermittlung oder die Browser-Cookie-Quelle, einschließlich Unterstützung für Chrome-Profile.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o GraphQL para recuperação eficiente de dados do Twitter, utilizando a autenticação de cookie para interações seguras e sem interrupções, com opções para passagem direta de cookies ou obtenção de cookies do navegador, incluindo suporte a perfis do Chrome.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать GraphQL для эффективного извлечения данных Twitter, используя аутентификацию на основе файлов cookie для безопасных и бесшовных взаимодействий, с возможностью прямой передачи файлов cookie или получения файлов cookie из браузера, включая поддержку профилей Chrome.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخدام GraphQL لاسترجاع بيانات تويتر بكفاءة، باستخدام التحقق من الهوية المعتمد على ملفات تعريف الارتباط من أجل تفاعلات آمنة وخالية من الانقطاع، مع خيارات لتمرير ملفات تعريف الارتباط بشكل مباشر أو الحصول على ملفات تعريف الارتباط من المتصفح، بما في ذلك دعم ملفات تعريف Chrome."},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating with Twitter via cookie-based auth","Retrieving Twitter data using GraphQL queries","Automating Twitter CLI tasks with custom scripts"],"zh":["通过基于 cookie 的身份验证进行 Twitter 身份验证","使用 GraphQL 查询检索 Twitter 数据","使用自定义脚本自动执行 Twitter CLI 任务"],"ja":["Cookie ベースの認証を使用した Twitter 認証","GraphQL クエリを使用した Twitter データの取得","カスタム スクリプトを使用した Twitter CLI タスクの自動化"],"ko":["쿠키 기반 인증을 사용한 Twitter 인증","GraphQL 쿼리를 사용한 Twitter 데이터 검색","사용자 지정 스크립트를 사용한 Twitter CLI 작업 자동화"],"es":["Autenticar con Twitter a través de autenticación basada en cookies","Recuperar datos de Twitter usando consultas GraphQL","Automatizar tareas de Twitter CLI con scripts personalizados"],"fr":["S''authentifier sur Twitter via une authentification basée sur les cookies","Récupérer des données Twitter en utilisant des requêtes GraphQL","Automatiser des tâches de Twitter CLI avec des scripts personnalisés"],"de":["Mit Twitter über cookiebasierte Authentifizierung authentifizieren","Twitter-Daten mithilfe von GraphQL-Abfragen abrufen","Twitter-CLI-Aufgaben mit benutzerdefinierten Skripten automatisieren"],"pt":["Autenticar no Twitter por meio de autenticação baseada em cookies","Recuperar dados do Twitter usando consultas GraphQL","Automatizar tarefas do Twitter CLI com scripts personalizados"],"ru":["Аутентификация в Twitter через аутентификацию на основе файлов cookie","Получение данных Twitter с помощью запросов GraphQL","Автоматизация задач Twitter CLI с помощью пользовательских скриптов"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية على تويتر من خلال التحقق من الهوية المعتمد على ملفات تعريف الارتباط","استرجاع بيانات تويتر باستخدام استفسارات GraphQL","الاستفادة من مهام سطر أوامر تويتر تلقائيًا باستخدام نصوص مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires cookie-based authentication or auth token","Limited to Twitter API access via GraphQL"],"zh":["需要基于 cookie 的身份验证或身份验证令牌","仅限通过 GraphQL 访问 Twitter API"],"ja":["Cookie ベースの認証または認証トークンが必要","GraphQL を使用した Twitter API アクセスのみ"],"ko":["쿠키 기반 인증 또는 인증 토큰이 필요","GraphQL을 사용한 Twitter API 액세스만"],"es":["Requiere autenticación basada en cookies o token de autenticación","Limitado al acceso a la API de Twitter a través de GraphQL"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification basée sur les cookies ou un jeton d''authentification","Limité à l''accès à l''API Twitter via GraphQL"],"de":["Erfordert cookiebasierte Authentifizierung oder Authentifizierungstoken","Begrenzt auf den Zugriff auf die Twitter-API über GraphQL"],"pt":["Exige autenticação baseada em cookies ou token de autenticação","Limitado ao acesso à API do Twitter via GraphQL"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации на основе файлов cookie или токена аутентификации","Ограничен доступом к API Twitter через GraphQL"],"ar":["يتطلب التحقق من الهوية المعتمد على ملفات تعريف الارتباط أو رمز التحقق من الهوية","محدود بالوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تويتر عبر GraphQL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
