eur pour Claude et...","de":"Baseline UI: Benutzeroberflächen-Standard für Claude und ...","pt":"Baseline UI: Garanta Interfaces Seguras com Claude e Codex","ru":"Baseline UI: Безопасные интерфейсы для Claude и Codex","ar":"Baseline UI: واجهات آمنة مع Claude و Codex","en":"baseline-ui"},"description":{"zh":"Baseline UI是一个安全审计的UI基线，确保AI生成的界面安全可靠","ja":"Baseline UIはセキュリティ監査付きのUI基準であり、AI生成のインターフェイスを安全で信頼性の高いものにします","ko":"Baseline UI는 보안 감사 된 UI 기준으로 AI 생성 인터페이스를 안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 것으로 만듭니다","es":"Baseline UI es un estándar de interfaz de usuario que asegura la calidad y coherencia en Claude y Codex. Proporciona una forma sencilla de aplicar constraint...","fr":"Baseline UI est une norme d''interface utilisateur qui garantit la qualité et la cohérence dans Claude et Codex. Il propose un moyen simple d''appliquer des co...","de":"Baseline UI ist ein Benutzeroberflächen-Standard, der die Qualität und Konsistenz in Claude und Codex gewährleistet. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Con...","pt":"A Baseline UI é um conjunto de habilidades de segurança para Claude e Codex que impõe um padrão de interface opinativo para prevenir problemas de interface.","ru":"Baseline UI - это набор безопасных навыков для Claude и Codex, который налагает opinativo стандарт интерфейса для предотвращения проблем интерфейса.","ar":"Baseline UI هو مجموعة من المهارات الآمنة ل Claude و Codex التي تفرض معيار واجهة مُحكَم لمنع مشاكل الواجهة.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["安全审计的UI基线","一键安装","质量验证","支持Tailwind CSS默认值","自定义值支持","代码级别的修复建议"],"ja":["セキュリティ監査付きのUI基準","一键インストール","品質保証","Tailwind CSSデフォルト値のサポート","カスタム値のサポート","コードレベルの修正提案"],"ko":["보안 감사 된 UI 기준","한 번의 클릭으로 설치","품질 검증","Tailwind CSS 기본값 지원","사용자 정의 값 지원","코드 수준의 수정 제안"],"es":["Estándar de interfaz de usuario para Claude y Codex","Aplicación de constraints para asegurar la calidad","Soporte para Tailwind CSS","Revisión de archivos y sugerencias de corrección","Integración con Claude, Codex y Claude Code"],"fr":["Norme d''interface utilisateur pour Claude et Codex","Application de contraintes pour assurer la qualité","Prise en charge de Tailwind CSS","Révision de fichiers et suggestions de correction","Intégration avec Claude, Codex et Claude Code"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-Standard für Claude und Codex","Anwendung von Constraints für die Qualitätssicherung","Unterstützung für Tailwind CSS","Überprüfung von Dateien und Korrekturvorschläge","Integration mit Claude, Codex und Claude Code"],"pt":["Implementação de um padrão de interface opinativo","Prevenção de problemas de interface","Uso de Tailwind CSS defaults","Revisão de arquivos contra constraints","Saída de violações e sugestões de correção"],"ru":["Реализация opinativo стандарта интерфейса","Предотвращение проблем интерфейса","Использование Tailwind CSS defaults","Проверка файлов против ограничений","Вывод нарушений и предложений по исправлению"],"ar":["تنفيذ معيار واجهة مُحكَم","منع مشاكل الواجهة","استخدام Tailwind CSS defaults","مراجعة الملفات ضد القيود","إخراج انتهاكات وتقديم اقتراحات تصحيحية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Baseline UI","安全审计","UI基线","AI生成界面","Tailwind CSS","代码审查","安全开发","UI安全"],"ja":["Baseline UI","セキュリティ監査","UI基準","AI生成インターフェイス","Tailwind CSS","コードレビュー","安全開発","UIセキュリティ"],"ko":["Baseline UI","보안 감사","UI 기준","AI 생성 인터페이스","Tailwind CSS","코드 검토","보안 개발","UI 보안"],"es":["Baseline UI","interfaz de usuario","Claude","Codex","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo de aplicaciones","inteligencia artificial","estándar de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Baseline UI","interface utilisateur","Claude","Codex","Tailwind CSS","développement d''applications","intelligence artificielle","norme d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Baseline UI","Benutzeroberfläche","Claude","Codex","Tailwind CSS","Anwendungsentwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz","Benutzeroberflächen-Standard"],"pt":["Baseline UI","segurança de interface","Claude","Codex","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento de interface","revisão de código"],"ru":["Baseline UI","безопасность интерфейса","Claude","Codex","Tailwind CSS","разработка интерфейса","проверка кода"],"ar":["Baseline UI","أمان الواجهة","Claude","Codex","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الواجهة","مراجعة الكود"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baseline-ui","description":"Enforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.","bodyPreview":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requ","body":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requested\n- MUST use `motion/react` (formerly `framer-motion`) when JavaScript animation is required\n- SHOULD use `tw-animate-css` for entrance and micro-animations in Tailwind CSS\n- MUST use `cn` utility (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for class logic\n\n## Components\n\n- MUST use accessible component primitives for anything with keyboard or focus behavior (`Base UI`, `React Aria`, `Radix`)\n- MUST use the project’s existing component primitives first\n- NEVER mix primitive systems within the same interaction surface\n- SHOULD prefer [`Base UI`](https://base-ui.com/react/components) for new primitives if compatible with the stack\n- MUST add an `aria-label` to icon-only buttons\n- NEVER rebuild keyboard or focus behavior by hand unless explicitly requested\n\n## Interaction\n\n- MUST use an `AlertDialog` for destructive or irreversible actions\n- SHOULD use structural skeletons for loading states\n- NEVER use `h-screen`, use `h-dvh`\n- MUST respect `safe-area-inset` for fixed elements\n- MUST show errors next to where the action happens\n- NEVER block paste in `input` or `textarea` elements\n\n## Animation\n\n- NEVER add animation unless it is explicitly requested\n- MUST animate only compositor props (`transform`, `opacity`)\n- NEVER animate layout properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`)\n- SHOULD avoid animating paint properties (`background`, `color`) except for small, local UI (text, icons)\n- SHOULD use `ease-out` on entrance\n- NEVER exceed `200ms` for interaction feedback\n- MUST pause looping animations when off-screen\n- SHOULD respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- NEVER introduce custom easing curves unless explicitly requested\n- SHOULD avoid animating large images or full-screen surfaces\n\n## Typography\n\n- MUST use `text-balance` for headings and `text-pretty` for body/paragraphs\n- MUST use `tabular-nums` for data\n- SHOULD use `truncate` or `line-clamp` for dense UI\n- NEVER modify `letter-spacing` (`tracking-*`) unless explicitly requested\n\n## Layout\n\n- MUST use a fixed `z-index` scale (no arbitrary `z-*`)\n- SHOULD use `size-*` for square elements instead of `w-*` + `h-*`\n\n## Performance\n\n- NEVER animate large `blur()` or `backdrop-filter` surfaces\n- NEVER apply `will-change` outside an active animation\n- NEVER use `useEffect` for anything that can be expressed as render logic\n\n## Design\n\n- NEVER use gradients unless explicitly requested\n- NEVER use purple or multicolor gradients\n- NEVER use glow effects as primary affordances\n- SHOULD use Tailwind CSS default shadow scale unless explicitly requested\n- MUST give empty states one clear next action\n- SHOULD limit accent color usage to one per view\n- SHOULD use existing theme or Tailwind CSS color tokens before introducing new ones\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:07:00.678Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing standardized UI development with Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Tailwind CSS进行标准化UI开发的前端代理。","ja":"Tailwind CSSを使用した標準化されたUI開発が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 표준화된 UI 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario estandarizado con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement d''interface utilisateur standardisé avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein standardisiertes UI-Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de UI padronizado com Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим стандартизированный UI-разработка с Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير واجهة المستخدم الموحدة مع Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce an opinionated UI baseline, utilizing Tailwind CSS defaults, and providing concrete code-level suggestions for fixes, thus preventing AI-generated interface inconsistencies and ensuring high-quality, security-audited interfaces for Claude, Codex, and Claude Code.","zh":"赋予代理人执行有意见的UI基线的能力，利用Tailwind CSS的默认值，并为修复提供具体的代码级建议，从而防止AI生成的接口不一致性，确保Claude、Codex和Claude Code的高质量、安全审计的接口。","ja":"エージェントが意見を持ったUIベースラインを実施し、Tailwind CSSのデフォルトを利用し、修正のための具体的なコードレベルの提案を提供することで、AIによって生成されたインターフェイスの不一致を防ぎ、Claude、Codex、Claude Codeの高品質なセキュリティ監査されたインターフェイスを保証する。","ko":"에이전트가 의견을 가진 UI 기준선을 시행할 수 있도록 하며, Tailwind CSS의 기본값을 활용하고, 수정을 위한 구체적인 코드 수준의 제안을 제공함으로써, AI에 의해 생성된 인터페이스의 불일치를 방지하고, Claude, Codex, Claude Code의 높은 품질과 보안 감사의 인터페이스를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir una línea de base de interfaz de usuario con opiniones, utilizando los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS y proporcionando sugerencias concretas a nivel de código para correcciones, lo que evita las inconsistencias en la interfaz generada por IA y garantiza interfaces de alta calidad y seguridad auditadas para Claude, Codex y Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter une ligne de base d''interface utilisateur avec opinion, en utilisant les valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS et en fournissant des suggestions concrètes au niveau du code pour les corrections, ce qui empêche les incohérences dans l''interface générée par l''IA et garantit des interfaces de haute qualité et sécurité auditées pour Claude, Codex et Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine Meinungsbasierte UI-Baseline durchzusetzen, indem es Tailwind CSS-Standardwerte nutzt und konkrete Code-Ebene-Vorschläge für Korrekturen bereitstellt, wodurch Inkonsistenzen in der von KI generierten Schnittstelle verhindert werden und hochwertige, sicherheitsgeprüfte Schnittstellen für Claude, Codex und Claude Code gewährleistet sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor uma linha de base de UI opinativa, utilizando os padrões do Tailwind CSS e fornecendo sugestões concretas de nível de código para correções, evitando assim inconsistências de interface geradas por IA e garantindo interfaces de alta qualidade e auditoria de segurança para Claude, Codex e Claude Code.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навязать opinativa линию базы UI, используя стандарты Tailwind CSS и предоставляя конкретные предложения кодового уровня для исправлений, тем самым предотвращая несоответствия интерфейса, сгенерированные ИИ, и гарантируя высококачественные, проверенные на безопасность интерфейсы для Claude, Codex и Claude Code.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من فرض معايير واجهة المستخدم المُصاغة، باستخدام الإعدادات الافتراضية ل Tailwind CSS وتقديم اقتراحات ملموسة على مستوى الرمز للمصلحات، وبالتالي منع عدم انتظامات واجهة المستخدم التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي وضمان واجهات عالية الجودة ومراجعة الأمان ل Claude و Codex و Claude Code."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing UI standards across multiple projects","Reviewing and fixing UI violations in code files","Applying consistent Tailwind CSS defaults to new UI work"],"zh":["在多个项目中执行UI标准","在代码文件中审查和修复UI违规","将一致的Tailwind CSS默认值应用于新的UI工作"],"ja":["複数のプロジェクトにわたるUI標準の適用","コードファイル内のUI違反のレビューと修正","新しいUI作業への一貫したTailwind CSSデフォルトの適用"],"ko":["여러 프로젝트에 걸쳐 UI 표준 적용","코드 파일 내의 UI 위반 사항 검토 및 수정","새로운 UI 작업에 일관된 Tailwind CSS 기본값 적용"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los estándares de interfaz de usuario en varios proyectos","Revisar y corregir violaciones de interfaz de usuario en archivos de código","Aplicar de forma consistente los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS a nuevos trabajos de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Faire respecter les normes d''interface utilisateur sur plusieurs projets","Réviser et corriger les violations d''interface utilisateur dans les fichiers de code","Appliquer de manière cohérente les valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS à de nouveaux travaux d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Benutzeroberflächenstandards in mehreren Projekten","Überprüfen und Korrigieren von Benutzeroberflächenverletzungen in Code-Dateien","Konsistentes Anwenden von Tailwind CSS-Standardwerten auf neue Benutzeroberflächenarbeiten"],"pt":["Aplicar padrões de UI em vários projetos","Revisar e corrigir violações de UI em arquivos de código","Aplicar padrões consistentes do Tailwind CSS em novos trabalhos de UI"],"ru":["Применение стандартов UI в нескольких проектах","Проверка и исправление нарушений UI в файлах кода","Применение последовательных стандартов Tailwind CSS к новой работе UI"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير واجهة المستخدم عبر مشاريع متعددة","مراجعة وإصلاح انتهاكات واجهة المستخدم في ملفات الرمز","تطبيق معايير متسقة ل Tailwind CSS في أعمال واجهة المستخدم الجديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS","Limited to reviewing files against predefined constraints"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS","仅限于查看文件与预定义约束"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSが必要","事前に定義された制約に対するファイルのレビューのみ"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS가 필요함","사전에 정의된 제약에 대한 파일 검토만 가능"],"es":["Requiere Tailwind CSS","Limitado a la revisión de archivos contra restricciones preestablecidas"],"fr":["Nécessite Tailwind CSS","Limité à la révision de fichiers contre des contraintes prédéfinies"],"de":["Benötigt Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung von Dateien gegen vordefinierte Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Requer Tailwind CSS","Limitado à revisão de arquivos contra restrições predefinidas"],"ru":["Требует Tailwind CSS","Ограничен проверкой файлов против предопределенных ограничений"],"ar":["يتطلب Tailwind CSS","محدود بالمراجعة الملفات مقابل القيود المحددة مسبقًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
