":"Сервер GitHub MCP: Программный доступ к API","ar":"خادم GitHub MCP: الوصول البرمجي إلى API","en":"github-mcp-server"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub MCP 服务器提供 AI 代理程序化访问 GitHub API 的功能","ja":"GitHub MCP サーバーは、AI エージェントが GitHub API にプログラム的にアクセスできる機能を提供します","ko":"GitHub MCP 서버는 AI 에이전트가 GitHub API에 프로그래밍 방식으로 액세스할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다","es":"El servidor GitHub MCP ofrece un acceso programático a la API de GitHub para agentes de inteligencia artificial, permitiendo una integración más profunda con...","fr":"Le serveur GitHub MCP propose un accès programmatique à l''API GitHub pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle, permettant une intégration plus approfondie...","de":"Der GitHub-MCP-Server bietet einen programmatischen Zugriff auf die GitHub-API für künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten, ermöglicht eine tiefere Integration mit de...","pt":"O servidor GitHub MCP fornece acesso programático à API do GitHub para agentes de IA, permitindo a automação de tarefas e a integração com fluxos de trabalho","ru":"Сервер GitHub MCP обеспечивает программный доступ к API GitHub для ИИ-агентов, позволяя автоматизировать задачи и интегрироваться с рабочими процессами","ar":"ي 提供 خادم GitHub MCP الوصول البرمجي إلى API GitHub للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يسمح بالتutomatización من المهام والتكامل مع سير العمل","en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"definition":{"en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"features":{"zh":["程序化访问 GitHub API","支持 AI 代理","自动化工作流","配置选项","工具支持"],"ja":["GitHub API へのプログラム的なアクセス","AI エージェントのサポート","自動化されたワークフロー","構成オプション","ツールのサポート"],"ko":["GitHub API에 대한 프로그래밍 방식의 액세스","AI 에이전트 지원","자동화된 워크플ロー","구성 옵션","도구 지원"],"es":["Acceso programático a la API de GitHub","Integración con flujos de trabajo de GitHub","Compatibilidad con agentes de inteligencia artificial","Configuración y personalización de herramientas","Documentación automatizada y actualizada"],"fr":["Accès programmatique à l''API GitHub","Intégration avec les flux de travail GitHub","Compatibilité avec les agents d''intelligence artificielle","Configuration et personnalisation d''outils","Documentation automatique et mise à jour"],"de":["Programmatischer Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Integration mit GitHub-Workflows","Kompatibilität mit künstlichen Intelligenz-Agenten","Konfiguration und Anpassung von Tools","Automatisierte und aktualisierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Acesso programático à API do GitHub","Automação de tarefas","Integração com fluxos de trabalho","Suporte a agentes de IA","Configuração flexível"],"ru":["Программный доступ к API GitHub","Автоматизация задач","Интеграция с рабочими процессами","Поддержка ИИ-агентов","Гибкая конфигурация"],"ar":["الوصول البرمجي إلى API GitHub","التautomatización من المهام","التكامل مع سير العمل","دعم الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكوين المرن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub MCP 服务器","AI 代理","程序化访问","GitHub API","自动化工作流","配置选项"],"ja":["GitHub MCP サーバー","AI エージェント","プログラム的なアクセス","GitHub API","自動化されたワークフロー","構成オプション"],"ko":["GitHub MCP 서버","AI 에이전트","프로그래밍 방식의 액세스","GitHub API","자동화된 워크플ロー","구성 옵션"],"es":["GitHub MCP","API de GitHub","Agentes de inteligencia artificial","Flujos de trabajo de GitHub","Integración de herramientas","Desarrollo de software","Automatización de procesos"],"fr":["GitHub MCP","API GitHub","Agents d''intelligence artificielle","Flux de travail GitHub","Intégration d''outils","Développement de logiciels","Automatisation de processus"],"de":["GitHub-MCP","GitHub-API","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","GitHub-Workflows","Tool-Integration","Softwareentwicklung","Prozessautomatisierung"],"pt":["github mcp server","acesso programático à api","agentes de ia","automação de tarefas","integração com fluxos de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software","api github"],"ru":["github mcp сервер","программный доступ к api","ии-агенты","автоматизация задач","интеграция с рабочими процессами","разработка программного обеспечения","api github"],"ar":["خادم github mcp","الوصول البرمجي إلى api","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التautomatización من المهام","التكامل مع سير العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","api github"]}},"owner":"github","repo":"gh-aw","repoPath":"github/gh-aw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-mcp-server","description":"GitHub MCP Server Documentation","bodyPreview":"# GitHub MCP Server Documentation\n\nThis file contains comprehensive documentation about the GitHub MCP (Model Context Protocol) server, including available tools and configuration options.\n\n**Note**: This file is automatically generated and updated by the `github-mcp-tools-report.md` workflow. Manual edits may be overwritten.\n\n**Last Updated**: [To be filled by workflow]\n\n## Overview\n\nThe GitHub MCP server provides AI agents with programmatic access to GitHub''s API through the Model Context Prot","body":"# GitHub MCP Server Documentation\n\nThis file contains comprehensive documentation about the GitHub MCP (Model Context Protocol) server, including available tools and configuration options.\n\n**Note**: This file is automatically generated and updated by the `github-mcp-tools-report.md` workflow. Manual edits may be overwritten.\n\n**Last Updated**: [To be filled by workflow]\n\n## Overview\n\nThe GitHub MCP server provides AI agents with programmatic access to GitHub''s API through the Model Context Protocol. It supports two modes of operation:\n\n### Local Mode (Docker-based)\n- Runs as a Docker container on the GitHub Actions runner\n- Uses `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` environment variable for authentication\n- Configurable toolsets via `GITHUB_TOOLSETS` environment variable\n- Supports read-only mode via `GITHUB_READ_ONLY` environment variable\n\n### Remote Mode (Hosted)\n- Connects to hosted GitHub MCP server at `https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/`\n- Uses Bearer token authentication in HTTP headers\n- Supports read-only mode via `X-MCP-Readonly` header\n- No Docker container required\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Basic Configuration\n\n**Local Mode (Docker)**:\n```yaml\ntools:\n  github:\n    mode: \"local\"\n    toolsets: [default]  # or [repos, issues, pull_requests]\n```\n\n**Remote Mode (Hosted)**:\n```yaml\ntools:\n  github:\n    mode: \"remote\"\n    toolsets: [default]  # or [repos, issues, pull_requests]\n```\n\n### Read-Only Mode\n\nTo restrict the GitHub MCP server to read-only operations:\n\n```yaml\ntools:\n  github:\n    mode: \"remote\"\n    read-only: true\n    toolsets: [repos, issues]\n```\n\n### Custom Authentication\n\nUse a custom GitHub token instead of the default:\n\n```yaml\ntools:\n  github:\n    mode: \"remote\"\n    github-token: \"${{ secrets.CUSTOM_GITHUB_PAT }}\"\n    toolsets: [repos, issues]\n```\n\n## Available Toolsets\n\nThe GitHub MCP server organizes tools into logical toolsets. You can enable specific toolsets, use `[default]` for the recommended defaults, or use `[all]` to enable everything.\n\n:::note[Why Use Toolsets?]\nThe `allowed:` pattern for listing individual GitHub tools is **not recommended for new workflows**. Individual tool names may change between GitHub MCP server versions, but toolsets provide a stable API. Always use `toolsets:` instead. See [Migration from Allowed to Toolsets](#migration-from-allowed-to-toolsets) for guidance on updating existing workflows.\n:::\n\n:::tip[Best Practice]\n**Always use `toolsets:` for GitHub tools.** Toolsets provide:\n- **Stability**: Tool names may change between MCP server versions, but toolsets remain stable\n- **Better organization**: Clear groupings of related functionality\n- **Complete functionality**: Get all related tools automatically\n- **Reduced verbosity**: Cleaner configuration\n- **Future-proof**: New tools are automatically included as they''re added\n:::\n\n### Recommended Default Toolsets\n\nThe following toolsets are enabled by default when `toolsets:` is not specified:\n- `context` - User and environment context (strongly recommended)\n- `repos` - Repository management\n- `issues` - Issue management  \n- `pull_requests` - Pull request operations\n\n**Note**: The `users` toolset is not included by default and must be explicitly specified if needed.\n\n### All Available Toolsets\n\n| Toolset | Description | Common Tools |\n|---------|-------------|--------------|\n| `context` | User and environment context | `get_teams`, `get_team_members` |\n| `repos` | Repository management | `get_repository`, `get_file_contents`, `search_code`, `list_commits` |\n| `issues` | Issue management | `issue_read`, `list_issues`, `create_issue`, `search_issues` |\n| `pull_requests` | Pull request operations | `pull_request_read`, `list_pull_requests`, `create_pull_request` |\n| `actions` | GitHub Actions/CI/CD | `list_workflows`, `list_workflow_runs`, `download_workflow_run_artifact` |\n| `code_security` | Code scanning and security | `list_code_scanning_alerts`, `get_code_scanning_alert` |\n| `dependabot` | Dependency management | Dependabot alerts and updates |\n| `discussions` | GitHub Discussions | `list_discussions`, `create_discussion` |\n| `experiments` | Experimental features | Unstable/preview APIs |\n| `gists` | Gist operations | `create_gist`, `list_gists` |\n| `labels` | Label management | `get_label`, `list_labels`, `create_label` |\n| `notifications` | Notifications | `list_notifications`, `mark_notifications_read` |\n| `orgs` | Organization management | `get_organization`, `list_organizations` |\n| `projects` | GitHub Projects | Project board operations |\n| `secret_protection` | Secret scanning | Secret detection and management |\n| `security_advisories` | Security advisories | Advisory creation and management |\n| `stargazers` | Repository stars | Star-related operations |\n| `users` | User profiles | `get_me`, `get_user`, `list_users` |\n| `search` | Advanced search | Search across repos, code, users |\n\n## Available Tools by Toolset\n\nThis section maps individual tools to their respective toolsets to help with migration from `allowed:` to `toolsets:`.\n\n### Context Toolset\n- `get_teams` - List teams the user belongs to\n- `get_team_members` - List members of a specific team\n\n### Repos Toolset\n- `get_repository` - Get repository information\n- `get_file_contents` - Read file contents from repository\n- `search_code` - Search code across repositories\n- `list_commits` - List commits in a repository\n- `get_commit` - Get details of a specific commit\n- `get_latest_release` - Get the latest release\n- `list_releases` - List all releases\n\n### Issues Toolset\n- `issue_read` - Read issue details\n- `list_issues` - List issues in a repository\n- `create_issue` - Create a new issue\n- `update_issue` - Update an existing issue\n- `search_issues` - Search issues across repositories\n- `add_reaction` - Add reaction to an issue or comment\n- `create_issue_comment` - Add a comment to an issue\n\n### Pull Requests Toolset\n- `pull_request_read` - Read pull request details\n- `list_pull_requests` - List pull requests in a repository\n- `get_pull_request` - Get details of a specific pull request\n- `create_pull_request` - Create a new pull request\n- `search_pull_requests` - Search pull requests across repositories\n\n### Actions Toolset\n- `list_workflows` - List GitHub Actions workflows\n- `list_workflow_runs` - List workflow runs\n- `get_workflow_run` - Get details of a specific workflow run\n- `download_workflow_run_artifact` - Download workflow artifacts\n\n### Code Security Toolset\n- `list_code_scanning_alerts` - List code scanning alerts\n- `get_code_scanning_alert` - Get details of a specific alert\n- `create_code_scanning_alert` - Create a code scanning alert\n\n### Discussions Toolset\n- `list_discussions` - List discussions in a repository\n- `create_discussion` - Create a new discussion\n\n### Labels Toolset\n- `get_label` - Get label details\n- `list_labels` - List labels in a repository\n- `create_label` - Create a new label\n\n### Users Toolset\n- `get_me` - Get current authenticated user information\n- `get_user` - Get user profile information\n- `list_users` - List users\n\n### Notifications Toolset\n- `list_notifications` - List user notifications\n- `mark_notifications_read` - Mark notifications as read\n\n### Organizations Toolset\n- `get_organization` - Get organization details\n- `list_organizations` - List organizations\n\n### Gists Toolset\n- `create_gist` - Create a new gist\n- `list_gists` - List user''s gists\n\n## Authentication Details\n\n### Remote Mode Authentication\n\nThe remote mode uses Bearer token authentication:\n\n**Headers**:\n- `Authorization: Bearer <token>` - Required for authentication\n- `X-MCP-Readonly: true` - Optional, enables read-only mode\n\n**Token Source**:\n- Default: `${{ secrets.GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN }}` or `${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}`\n- Custom: Configure via `github-token` field\n\n### Local Mode Authentication\n\nThe local mode uses environment variables:\n\n**Environment Variables**:\n- `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` - Required for authentication\n- `GITHUB_READ_ONLY=1` - Optional, enables read-only mode\n- `GITHUB_TOOLSETS=<comma-separated-list>` - Optional, specifies enabled toolsets\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Toolset Selection\n\n1. **Start with defaults**: For most workflows, the recommended default toolsets provide sufficient functionality\n2. **Enable specific toolsets**: Only enable additional toolsets when you need their specific functionality\n3. **Security consideration**: Be mindful of write operations - consider using read-only mode when possible\n4. **Performance**: Using fewer toolsets reduces initialization time and memory usage\n\n### Token Permissions\n\nEnsure your GitHub token has appropriate permissions for the toolsets you''re enabling:\n\n- `repos` toolsets: Requires repository read/write permissions\n- `issues` toolsets: Requires issues read/write permissions\n- `pull_requests` toolsets: Requires pull requests read/write permissions\n- `actions` toolsets: Requires actions read/write permissions\n- `discussions` toolsets: Requires discussions read/write permissions\n\n### Remote vs Local Mode\n\n**Use Remote Mode when**:\n- You want faster initialization (no Docker container to start)\n- You''re running in a GitHub Actions environment with internet access\n- You want to use the latest version without specifying Docker image tags\n\n**Use Local Mode when**:\n- You need a specific version of the MCP server\n- You want to use custom arguments\n- You''re running in an environment without internet access\n- You want to test with a local build of the MCP server\n\n## Migration from Allowed to Toolsets\n\nIf you have existing workflows using the `allowed:` pattern, we recommend migrating to `toolsets:` for better maintainability and stability. Individual tool names may change between MCP server versions, but toolsets provide a stable API that won''t break your workflows.\n\n### Migration Examples\n\n**Using `allowed:` (not recommended):**\n```yaml\ntools:\n  github:\n    allowed:\n      - get_repository\n      - get_file_contents\n      - list_commits\n      - list_issues\n      - create_issue\n      - update_issue\n```\n\n**Using `toolsets:` (recommended):**\n```yaml\ntools:\n  github:\n    toolsets: [repos, issues]\n```\n\n### Tool-to-Toolset Mapping\n\nUse this table to identify which toolset contains the tools you need:\n\n| `allowed:` Tools | Migrate to `toolsets:` |\n|------------------|------------------------|\n| `get_me` | `users` |\n| `get_teams`, `get_team_members` | `context` |\n| `get_repository`, `get_file_contents`, `search_code`, `list_commits` | `repos` |\n| `issue_read`, `list_issues`, `create_issue`, `update_issue`, `search_issues` | `issues` |\n| `pull_request_read`, `list_pull_requests`, `create_pull_request` | `pull_requests` |\n| `list_workflows`, `list_workflow_runs`, `get_workflow_run` | `actions` |\n| `list_code_scanning_alerts`, `get_code_scanning_alert` | `code_security` |\n| `list_discussions`, `create_discussion` | `discussions` |\n| `get_label`, `list_labels`, `create_label` | `labels` |\n| `get_user`, `list_users` | `users` |\n| Mixed repos/issues/PRs tools | `[default]` |\n| All tools | `[all]` |\n\n### Quick Migration Steps\n\n1. **Identify tools in use**: Review your current `allowed:` list\n2. **Map to toolsets**: Use the table above to find corresponding toolsets\n3. **Replace configuration**: Change `allowed:` to `toolsets:`\n4. **Test**: Run `gh aw mcp inspect <workflow>` to verify tools are available\n5. **Compile**: Run `gh aw compile` to update the lock file\n\n## Using Allowed Pattern with Custom MCP Servers\n\n:::note[When to Use Allowed]\nThe `allowed:` pattern is appropriate for:\n- Custom MCP servers (non-GitHub)\n- Gradual migration of existing workflows\n- Fine-grained restriction of specific tools within a toolset\n\nFor GitHub tools, always use `toolsets:` instead of `allowed:`.\n:::\n\nThe `allowed:` field can still be used to restrict tools for custom MCP servers:\n\n```yaml\nmcp-servers:\n  notion:\n    container: \"mcp/notion\"\n    allowed: [\"search_pages\", \"get_page\"]  # Fine for custom MCP servers\n```\n\nFor GitHub tools, `allowed:` can be combined with `toolsets:` to further restrict access, but this pattern is not recommended for new workflows.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Issue**: Tool not found or not available\n- **Solution**: Check if you''re using `allowed:` to restrict tools. Consider using `toolsets:` instead to get all related tools.\n- **Verify**: Run `gh aw mcp inspect <workflow-name>` to see which tools are actually available.\n\n**Issue**: Missing functionality after specifying toolset\n- **Cause**: Using a too-narrow toolset that doesn''t include all needed tools\n- **Solution**: Either add additional toolsets (e.g., `toolsets: [default, actions]`) or use `[all]` for full access\n\n**Issue**: Workflow using `allowed:` list is verbose and hard to maintain\n- **Solution**: Migrate to `toolsets:` configuration using the migration guide above\n\n### Best Practices for Debugging\n\n1. **Start with `[default]` toolset**: Most workflows work well with default toolsets\n2. **Add specific toolsets as needed**: Incrementally add toolsets like `actions`, `discussions`, etc.\n3. **Use `gh aw mcp inspect`**: Verify which tools are actually available\n4. **Check tool-to-toolset mapping**: Reference the tables above to find the right toolset\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub MCP Server Repository](https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server)\n- [Model Context Protocol Specification](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/)\n- [GitHub Actions Documentation](https://docs.github.com/actions)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:07:46.447Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing programmatic access to GitHub''s API through the Model Context Protocol","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要通过模型上下文协议以编程方式访问GitHub的API","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。GitHubのAPIにプログラムによるアクセスが必要であり、モデルコンテキストプロトコルを通じてアクセスする必要があります","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. GitHub의 API에 프로그래밍 방식으로 접근할 수 있는 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜을 필요로 합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan acceso programático a la API de GitHub a través del Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''un accès programmatique à l''API de GitHub via le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die programmatischen Zugriff auf die GitHub-API über das Modell-Kontext-Protokoll benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de acesso programático à API do GitHub por meio do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется программный доступ к API GitHub через Протокол контекста модели","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى الوصول البرمجي إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub من خلال بروتوكول سياق النموذج"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the GitHub MCP server for automated workflow management, utilizing tools like github-mcp-tools-report.md, and integrating with GitHub''s API for seamless interactions, all while supporting the Model Context Protocol for enhanced context-aware operations","zh":"赋予代理通过模型上下文协议利用GitHub的MCP服务器进行自动化工作流管理的能力，使用github-mcp-tools-report.md等工具，并与GitHub的API集成以实现无缝交互，同时支持模型上下文协议以增强上下文感知操作","ja":"モデルコンテキストプロトコルを通じて、GitHubのMCPサーバーを利用し、自動化されたワークフロー管理を可能にします。github-mcp-tools-report.mdなどのツールを使用し、GitHubのAPIと統合してシームレスな相互作用を可能にします。また、モデルコンテキストプロトコルをサポートして、コンテキスト感知操作を強化します","ko":"모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜을 통해 GitHub의 MCP 서버를 활용하여 자동화된 워크플로우 관리를 가능하게 합니다. github-mcp-tools-report.md와 같은 도구를 사용하여 GitHub의 API와 통합하여 무결점 상호작용을 가능하게 하며, 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜을 지원하여 컨텍스트 인식 작동을 강화합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar el servidor de GitHub MCP para la gestión automatizada de flujos de trabajo, utilizando herramientas como github-mcp-tools-report.md, e integrándose con la API de GitHub para interacciones sin problemas, todo mientras admite el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para operaciones conscientes del contexto mejoradas","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti du serveur GitHub MCP pour la gestion automatisée des flux de travail, en utilisant des outils comme github-mcp-tools-report.md, et en s''intégrant à l''API de GitHub pour des interactions sans accroc, le tout en prenant en charge le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle pour des opérations conscientes du contexte améliorées","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den GitHub-MCP-Server für die automatisierte Workflow-Verwaltung zu nutzen, indem es Tools wie github-mcp-tools-report.md verwendet und sich in die GitHub-API integriert, um nahtlose Interaktionen zu ermöglichen, und unterstützt dabei das Modell-Kontext-Protokoll für kontextbewusste Operationen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o servidor GitHub MCP para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado, utilizando ferramentas como github-mcp-tools-report.md e integrando com a API do GitHub para interações transparentes, tudo isso enquanto suporta o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para operações com conscientização de contexto aprimorada","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать сервер GitHub MCP для автоматизации управления рабочим процессом, используя инструменты, такие как github-mcp-tools-report.md, и интегрируя с API GitHub для бесшовных взаимодействий, все это при поддержке Протокола контекста модели для контекстно-означимых операций","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله استغلال خادم GitHub MCP لإدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي، باستخدام أدوات مثل github-mcp-tools-report.md ودمجها مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub لتفاعلات سلسة، مع دعم بروتوكول سياق النموذج لعمليات متعرف على السياق المحسّن"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub workflow updates using github-mcp-tools-report.md","Integrating AI agents with GitHub''s API for enhanced repository management","Utilizing the Model Context Protocol for context-aware decision making"],"zh":["使用github-mcp-tools-report.md自动化GitHub工作流更新","将AI代理与GitHub的API集成以增强仓库管理","利用模型上下文协议进行上下文感知决策"],"ja":["github-mcp-tools-report.mdを使用してGitHubのワークフローを自動化する","AIエージェントをGitHubのAPIと統合してリポジトリ管理を強化する","モデルコンテキストプロトコルを使用してコンテキスト感知の意思決定を行う"],"ko":["github-mcp-tools-report.md를 사용하여 GitHub 워크플로우를 자동화합니다","AI 에이전트를 GitHub의 API와 통합하여 리포지토리 관리를 강화합니다","모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜을 사용하여 컨텍스트 인식 의사결정을 수행합니다"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones del flujo de trabajo de GitHub utilizando github-mcp-tools-report.md","Integrar agentes de IA con la API de GitHub para una gestión de repositorios mejorada","Utilizar el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para la toma de decisiones consciente del contexto"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour du flux de travail de GitHub en utilisant github-mcp-tools-report.md","Intégrer les agents IA à l''API de GitHub pour une gestion de dépôts améliorée","Utiliser le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle pour la prise de décision consciente du contexte"],"de":["Automatisieren von GitHub-Workflow-Aktualisierungen mit github-mcp-tools-report.md","Integrieren von KI-Agents in die GitHub-API für eine verbesserte Repository-Verwaltung","Verwenden des Modell-Kontext-Protokolls für kontextbewusste Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub usando github-mcp-tools-report.md","Integrar agentes de IA com a API do GitHub para gerenciamento de repositório aprimorado","Utilizar o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo para tomada de decisões com conscientização de contexto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления рабочего процесса GitHub с помощью github-mcp-tools-report.md","Интегрировать агентов ИИ с API GitHub для улучшенного управления репозиторием","Использовать Протокол контекста модели для принятия решений с контекстной осведомленностью"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات تدفق العمل في GitHub باستخدام github-mcp-tools-report.md","دمج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub لإدارة مستودع محسّن","استخدام بروتوكول سياق النموذج لاتخاذ القرارات مع التعرّف على السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub''s API","Manual edits to the github-mcp-tools-report.md file may be overwritten","Dependent on the github-mcp-tools-report.md workflow for updates"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub的API","github-mcp-tools-report.md文件的手动编辑可能会被覆盖","依赖于github-mcp-tools-report.md工作流以进行更新"],"ja":["GitHubのAPIへのアクセスが必要","github-mcp-tools-report.mdファイルの手動編集は上書きされる可能性がある","github-mcp-tools-report.mdワークフローに依存して更新を行う"],"ko":["GitHub의 API에 접근할 수 있어야 합니다","github-mcp-tools-report.md 파일의 수동 편집은 덮어써질 수 있습니다","github-mcp-tools-report.md 워크플로우에 의존하여 업데이트를 수행합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Las ediciones manuales del archivo github-mcp-tools-report.md pueden ser sobrescritas","Depende del flujo de trabajo github-mcp-tools-report.md para las actualizaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API de GitHub","Les éditions manuelles du fichier github-mcp-tools-report.md peuvent être écrasées","Dépend du flux de travail github-mcp-tools-report.md pour les mises à jour"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Manuelle Bearbeitungen der Datei github-mcp-tools-report.md können überschrieben werden","Hängt vom Workflow github-mcp-tools-report.md für Aktualisierungen ab"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do GitHub","Edições manuais no arquivo github-mcp-tools-report.md podem ser sobrescritas","Dependente do fluxo de trabalho github-mcp-tools-report.md para atualizações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GitHub","Ручные правки файла github-mcp-tools-report.md могут быть перезаписаны","Зависит от рабочего процесса github-mcp-tools-report.md для обновлений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","التعديلات اليدوية على ملف github-mcp-tools-report.md قد يتم كتابةها فوقها","يعتمد على تدفق العمل github-mcp-tools-report.md للتحديثات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
