"Integración con Claude Code","Navegación y captura de elementos","Interacción con elementos de la página"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail","Création d''applications autonomes","Intégration avec Claude Code","Navigation et capture d''éléments","Interaction avec les éléments de la page"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflows","Erstellung von Anwendungen autonom","Integration mit Claude Code","Navigation und Erfassung von Elementen","Interaktion mit Seitenelementen"],"pt":["Automação de fluxos de trabalho","Criação de aplicativos com Claude Code","Navegação automática","Interação com elementos da página","Preenchimento de formulários","Fechamento do navegador"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Создание приложений с Claude Code","Автоматическая навигация","Взаимодействие с элементами страницы","Заполнение форм","Закрытие браузера"],"ar":["أتمتة سلاسل العمل","إنشاء تطبيقات مع Claude Code","تنقل أتمتة","التفاعل مع عناصر الصفحة","ملء الاستمارات","إغلاق المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["agent-browser","自动化浏览器","自动化工作流","开发工具","浏览器自动化","命令行工具"],"ja":["agent-browser","自動化ブラウザ","自動化ワークフロー","開発ツール","ブラウザ自動化","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["agent-browser","자동화 브라우저","자동화 워크플로","개발 툴","브라우저 자동화","명령줄 툴"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","Claude Code","desarrollo de aplicaciones","automatización de flujos de trabajo","creación de aplicaciones autónomas"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","agent-browser","Claude Code","développement d''applications","automatisation des flux de travail","création d''applications autonomes"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","agent-browser","Claude Code","Anwendungsentwicklung","Automatisierung von Workflows","Erstellung von Anwendungen autonom"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","Claude Code","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","fluxos de trabalho","navegação automática","interação com elementos da página","preenchimento de formulários","fechamento do navegador"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","agent-browser","Claude Code","разработка приложений","рабочие процессы","автоматическая навигация","взаимодействие с элементами страницы","заполнение форм","закрытие браузера"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","agent-browser","Claude Code","تطوير التطبيقات","سلاسل العمل","تنقل أتمتة","التفاعل مع عناصر الصفحة","ملء الاستمارات","إغلاق المتصفح"]}},"owner":"rohunj","repo":"claude-build-workflow","repoPath":"rohunj/claude-build-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g agent-browser\nagent-browser install  # Download Chromium\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>           # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i          # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1            # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"      # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close                # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g agent-browser\nagent-browser install  # Download Chromium\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>           # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i          # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1            # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"      # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close                # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>           # Navigate to URL\nagent-browser back                 # Go back\nagent-browser forward              # Go forward\nagent-browser reload               # Reload page\nagent-browser close                # Close browser\n```\n\n### Snapshot (page analysis)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot             # Full accessibility tree\nagent-browser snapshot -i          # Interactive elements only (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -c          # Compact output\nagent-browser snapshot -d 3        # Limit depth to 3\n```\n\n### Interactions (use @refs from snapshot)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e1            # Click\nagent-browser dblclick @e1         # Double-click\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"      # Clear and type\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"      # Type without clearing\nagent-browser press Enter          # Press key\nagent-browser press Control+a      # Key combination\nagent-browser hover @e1            # Hover\nagent-browser check @e1            # Check checkbox\nagent-browser uncheck @e1          # Uncheck checkbox\nagent-browser select @e1 \"value\"   # Select dropdown\nagent-browser scroll down 500      # Scroll page\nagent-browser scrollintoview @e1   # Scroll element into view\n```\n\n### Get information\n\n```bash\nagent-browser get text @e1         # Get element text\nagent-browser get value @e1        # Get input value\nagent-browser get title            # Get page title\nagent-browser get url              # Get current URL\n```\n\n### Screenshots\n\n```bash\nagent-browser screenshot           # Screenshot to stdout\nagent-browser screenshot path.png  # Save to file\nagent-browser screenshot --full    # Full page\n```\n\n### Wait\n\n```bash\nagent-browser wait @e1             # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait 2000            # Wait milliseconds\nagent-browser wait --text \"Success\"  # Wait for text\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle  # Wait for network idle\n```\n\n### Semantic locators (alternative to refs)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output shows: textbox \"Email\" [ref=e1], textbox \"Password\" [ref=e2], button \"Submit\" [ref=e3]\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Example: Authentication with saved state\n\n```bash\n# Login once\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"username\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Later sessions: load saved state\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n## Sessions (parallel browsers)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session test1 open site-a.com\nagent-browser --session test2 open site-b.com\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n## JSON output (for parsing)\n\nAdd `--json` for machine-readable output:\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open example.com --headed  # Show browser window\nagent-browser console                    # View console messages\nagent-browser errors                     # View page errors\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:08:04.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing hands-free browser interaction and autonomous app building with Claude Code.","zh":"适用于需要无手浏览器交互和使用 Claude Code 自主构建应用的自动化代理。","ja":"Claude Code を使用した自動ブラウザ操作とアプリの自動構築が必要な自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드를 사용한 자동 브라우저 상호 작용 및 자동 앱 구축이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan interacción con el navegador sin intervención manual y construcción de aplicaciones autónomas con Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation ayant besoin d''une interaction avec le navigateur sans intervention manuelle et d''une construction d''applications autonome avec Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine handfreie Browserinteraktion und eine autonome App-Erstellung mit Claude Code benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de interação de navegador sem mãos e construção de aplicativos autônoma com Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым требуется безрукое взаимодействие с браузером и автономное построение приложений с помощью Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التأشير الذكي الذي يحتاج إلى تفاعل المتصفح بدون استخدام اليدين وبناء التطبيقات بشكل مستقل باستخدام Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser workflows using Chromium, enabling interactive element identification, clicking, and form filling via refs, and streamlining app development with autonomous building capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理自动化浏览器工作流的能力，使用 Chromium 实现交互元素识别、点击和表单填充，并通过自动构建功能简化应用开发。","ja":"エージェントに Chromium を使用してブラウザ ワークフローを自動化する機能を付与し、インタラクティブ要素の識別、クリック、フォーム入力を行い、アプリ開発を自動化して効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 크로미움을 사용하여 브라우저 워크플로를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 상호 작용 요소 인식, 클릭 및 폼填充 등의 기능을 제공하여 앱 개발을 자동화하고 효율화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo del navegador mediante Chromium, lo que permite la identificación de elementos interactivos, el hacer clic y el llenado de formularios a través de refs, y agiliza el desarrollo de aplicaciones con capacidades de construcción autónoma.","fr":"Permet aux agents de automatiser les flux de travail du navigateur à l''aide de Chromium, ce qui permet l''identification d''éléments interactifs, le clic et le remplissage de formulaires via des refs, et rationalise le développement d''applications avec des capacités de construction autonomes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Browser-Workflows mithilfe von Chromium zu automatisieren, wodurch interaktive Elemente identifiziert, geklickt und Formulare über refs ausgefüllt werden können, und rationalisiert die App-Entwicklung mit autonomen Build-Funktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do navegador usando o Chromium, permitindo a identificação de elementos interativos, cliques e preenchimento de formulários via refs e agilizando o desenvolvimento de aplicativos com capacidades de construção autônoma.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рабочие процессы браузера с помощью Chromium, обеспечивая идентификацию интерактивных элементов, клики и заполнение форм через refs, и оптимизируя разработку приложений с помощью автономных возможностей построения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير تلقائية في سير عمل المتصفح باستخدام Chromium، مما يتيح تحديد العناصر التفاعلية والنقر على الأشكال وإدخال البيانات من خلال المراجع، وتسهيل تطوير التطبيقات من خلال القدرات التلقائية لبناء التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser-based data extraction","Generating interactive UI tests","Building apps autonomously with Claude Code"],"zh":["基于浏览器的数据提取自动化","生成交互式 UI 测试","使用 Claude Code 自主构建应用"],"ja":["ブラウザ ベースのデータ抽出の自動化","インタラクティブ UI テストの生成","Claude Code を使用したアプリの自動構築"],"ko":["브라우저 기반 데이터 추출 자동화","인터랙티브 UI 테스트 생성","클라우드 코드를 사용한 앱 자동 구축"],"es":["Automatización de extracción de datos basada en el navegador","Generación de pruebas de interfaz de usuario interactivas","Construcción de aplicaciones de forma autónoma con Claude Code"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''extraction de données basée sur le navigateur","Génération de tests d''interface utilisateur interactifs","Construction d''applications de manière autonome avec Claude Code"],"de":["Automatisierung der browserbasierten Datenextraktion","Erzeugung interaktiver Benutzeroberflächentests","Autonome App-Erstellung mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Automação de extração de dados baseada em navegador","Geração de testes de interface do usuário interativos","Construção de aplicativos de forma autônoma com Claude Code"],"ru":["Автоматизация извлечения данных на основе браузера","Генерация интерактивных тестов пользовательского интерфейса","Автономное построение приложений с помощью Claude Code"],"ar":["أتمتة استخراج البيانات المعتمدة على المتصفح","إنشاء اختبارات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية","بناء التطبيقات بشكل مستقل باستخدام Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chromium installation","Global installation via npm required","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要 Chromium 安装","需要全局安装 via npm","仅限浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["Chromium のインストールが必要","npm 経由のグローバル インストールが必要","ブラウザ自動化タスクのみに限定される"],"ko":["크로미움 설치 필요","npm를 통한 글로벌 설치 필요","브라우저 자동화 작업만 해당"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Chromium","Instalación global a través de npm es necesaria","Limitado a tareas de automatización del navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Chromium","L''installation globale via npm est requise","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation du navigateur"],"de":["Benötigt Chromium-Installation","Globale Installation über npm erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Chromium","Instalação global via npm necessária","Limitado a tarefas de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Требуется установка Chromium","Глобальная установка через npm обязательна","Ограничен до задач автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Chromium","التثبيت العالمي عبر npm مطلوب","محدود بمهام أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
