تائج","توفير خطوات العمل والتحقق","الوصول إلى أمثلة مفصلة للتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["C++ Pro","技术支持","最佳实践","检查清单","工作流程指导","开发效率","代码质量","C++ 开发"],"ja":["C++ Pro","技術サポート","ベストプラクティス","チェックリスト","ワークフローガイダンス","開発効率","コード品質","C++ 開発"],"ko":["C++ Pro","기술 지원","최적의 관행","체크리스트","워크플로우 가이드","개발 효율성","코드 품질","C++ 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de C++","cpp-pro","tareas de C++","flujos de trabajo de C++","mejores prácticas de C++","implementación de C++","verificación de C++","recursos de C++"],"fr":["développement C++","cpp-pro","tâches C++","flux de travail C++","meilleures pratiques C++","mise en œuvre de C++","vérification de C++","ressources C++"],"de":["C++-Entwicklung","cpp-pro","C++-Aufgaben","C++-Workflows","Best Practices C++","C++-Implementierung","C++-Verifizierung","C++-Ressourcen"],"pt":["Cpp Pro","desenvolvimento em C++","otimização de tarefas","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento","verificação de resultados","exemplos de implementação"],"ru":["Cpp Pro","разработка на C++","оптимизация задач","лучшие практики разработки","проверка результатов","примеры реализации"],"ar":["Cpp Pro","تطوير سي++","تحسين المهام","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير","التحقق من النتائج","أمثلة التنفيذ"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp-pro","description":"Write idiomatic C++ code with modern features, RAII, smart","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a C++ programming expert specializing in modern C++ and high-performance software.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Modern C++ (C++11/14/17/20/23) features\n- RAII and smart pointers (unique_ptr, shared_ptr)\n- Template metaprogramming and concepts\n- Move semantics and perfect forwarding\n- STL algorithms and containers\n- Concurrency with std::thread and atomics\n- Exception safety guarantees\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Prefer stack allocation and RAII over manual memory management\n2. Use smart pointers when heap allocation is necessary\n3. Follow the Rule of Zero/Three/Five\n4. Use const correctness and constexpr where applicable\n5. Leverage STL algorithms over raw loops\n6. Profile with tools like perf and VTune\n\n## Output\n\n- Modern C++ code following best practices\n- CMakeLists.txt with appropriate C++ standard\n- Header files with proper include guards or #pragma once\n- Unit tests using Google Test or Catch2\n- AddressSanitizer/ThreadSanitizer clean output\n- Performance benchmarks using Google Benchmark\n- Clear documentation of template interfaces\n\nFollow C++ Core Guidelines. Prefer compile-time errors over runtime errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:08:16.988Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for C++ Development Agents requiring professional guidance and best practices for coding tasks","zh":"适合需要专业指导和编码任务最佳实践的C++开发代理","ja":"C++開発エージェントがプロフェッショナルな指針とコーディングタスクのベストプラクティスを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"C++ 개발 에이전트가 전문적인 지침과 코딩 작업에 대한 모범 사례를 필요로 할 경우 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de C++ que requieren orientación profesional y mejores prácticas para tareas de codificación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement C++ nécessitant une orientation professionnelle et des meilleures pratiques pour les tâches de codage","de":"Ideal für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die professionelle Anleitung und Best Practices für Codieraufgaben benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que exigem orientação profissional e melhores práticas para tarefas de codificação","ru":"Идеально для агентов по разработке на C++, требующих профессионального руководства и лучших практик для задач кодирования","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير سي++ الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات احترافية وأفضل الممارسات لل مهام الترميز"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant C++ professional standards, validate code outcomes, and provide actionable implementation steps, leveraging checklists and resources like the implementation playbook","zh":"赋予代理应用相关C++专业标准，验证代码结果，并提供可行的实施步骤，利用清单和资源，如实施手册","ja":"エージェントが関連するC++プロフェッショナル標準を適用し、コード結果を検証し、チェックリストや実装プレイブックなどのリソースを利用して実行可能な実装ステップを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 관련 C++ 전문 표준을 적용하고 코드 결과를 검증하며 체크리스트와 구현 플레이북などの 리소스를 활용하여 실행 가능한 구현 단계를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar normas profesionales de C++ relevantes, validar resultados de código y proporcionar pasos de implementación accionables, aprovechando listas de verificación y recursos como el libro de juego de implementación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des normes professionnelles C++ pertinentes, de valider les résultats de code et de fournir des étapes d''implémentation actionnables, en exploitant des listes de vérification et des ressources comme le livre de jeu d''implémentation","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, relevante C++-Profistandards anzuwenden, Codeergebnisse zu validieren und umsetzbare Implementierungsschritte bereitzustellen, indem Checklisten und Ressourcen wie das Implementierungs-Playbook genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar padrões profissionais relevantes de C++, validar resultados de código e fornecer etapas de implementação executáveis, aproveitando listas de verificação e recursos como o playbook de implementação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять соответствующие профессиональные стандарты C++, проверять результаты кода и предоставлять действенные шаги реализации, используя контрольные списки и ресурсы, такие как книга по реализации","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تطبيق المعايير المهنية ذات الصلة لسي++ ، و التحقق من نتائج الكود ، و تقديم خطوات تنفيذ قابلة للتنفيذ ، و الاستفادة من قوائم التحقق و الموارد مثل كتيب التنفيذ"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing high-quality C++ applications","Validating C++ code for professional standards","Generating implementation plans for complex C++ projects"],"zh":["开发高质量的C++应用程序","验证C++代码是否符合专业标准","为复杂的C++项目生成实施计划"],"ja":["高品質のC++アプリケーションを開発する","C++コードをプロフェッショナル標準で検証する","複雑なC++プロジェクトの実装計画を生成する"],"ko":["고품질의 C++ 애플리케이션 개발","C++ 코드를 전문 표준으로 검증","복잡한 C++ 프로젝트에 대한 구현 계획 생성"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones C++ de alta calidad","Validar código C++ para normas profesionales","Generar planes de implementación para proyectos C++ complejos"],"fr":["Développer des applications C++ de haute qualité","Valider le code C++ pour les normes professionnelles","Générer des plans d''implémentation pour les projets C++ complexes"],"de":["Entwicklung von hochwertigen C++-Anwendungen","Validierung von C++-Code für professionelle Standards","Erstellung von Implementierungsplänen für komplexe C++-Projekte"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações de alta qualidade em C++","Validar código C++ para padrões profissionais","Gerar planos de implementação para projetos complexos de C++"],"ru":["Разработка высококачественных приложений на C++","Проверка кода C++ на соответствие профессиональным стандартам","Генерация планов реализации для сложных проектов на C++"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات عالية الجودة لسي++ "," التحقق من صحة رمز سي++ لمعايير مهنية","إنشاء خطط تنفيذ لمشاريع سي++ معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires C++ development context","Limited to C++ professional tasks and workflows"],"zh":["需要C++开发环境","仅限C++专业任务和工作流"],"ja":["C++開発コンテキストが必要","C++プロフェッショナルタスクとワークフローに限定"],"ko":["C++ 개발 환경이 필요","C++ 전문任务 및 워크플로에 제한"],"es":["Requiere contexto de desarrollo de C++","Limitado a tareas y flujos de trabajo profesionales de C++"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de développement C++","Limité aux tâches et flux de travail professionnels C++"],"de":["Benötigt C++-Entwicklungskontext","Begrenzt auf C++-Profiaufgaben und -Workflows"],"pt":["Exige contexto de desenvolvimento C++","Limitado a tarefas e fluxos de trabalho profissionais de C++"],"ru":["Требует контекста разработки на C++","Ограничен задачами и рабочими процессами профессиональной разработки на C++"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تطوير سي++ "," محدودة بمهام و سلاسل عمل سي++ المهنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('northseadl/skillwisp/json-canvas', 'community', 'northseadl', 'skillwisp', 'northseadl/skillwisp', 'json-canvas', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:08:48.172Z', NULL, '{"id":"northseadl/skillwisp/json-canvas","name":"json-canvas","description":{"zh":"JSON Canvas 技术使技能兼容的代理能够创建和编辑有效的 JSON Canvas 文件（`.canvas`），用于 Obsidian 和其他应用程序。JSON Canvas 是一个用于无限画布数据的开放文件格式","ja":"JSON Canvas 技術はスキル対応エージェントが Obsidian やその他のアプリケーションで使用される有効な JSON Canvas ファイル（`.canvas`）を作成および編集できるようにします。JSON Canvas は無限のキャンバス データ用のオープン ファイル形式です","ko":"JSON Canvas 기술은 스킬 호환 에이전트가 Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션에서 사용되는 유효한 JSON Canvas 파일(`.canvas`)을 생성하고 편집할 수 있도록 합니다. JSON Canvas는 무한 캔버스 데이터를 위한 오픈 파일 형식입니다","es":"JSON Canvas es un formato de archivo abierto para datos de lienzo infinito. Este skill permite a los agentes compatibles crear y editar archivos JSON Canvas válidos.","fr":"JSON Canvas est un format de fichier ouvert pour les données de canevas infini. Ce skill permet aux agents compatibles de créer et d''éditer des fichiers JSON Canvas valides.","de":"JSON Canvas ist ein offenes Dateiformat für infinite Canvas-Daten. Dieser Skill ermöglicht es kompatiblen Agenten, gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten.","pt":"O skill json-canvas permite que agentes compatíveis com habilidades criem e editem arquivos JSON Canvas válidos para Obsidian e outras aplicações.","ru":"Умение json-canvas позволяет агентам, совместимым с навыками, создавать и редактировать действительные файлы JSON Canvas для Obsidian и других приложений.","ar":"تمكن مهارة json-canvas وكلاء الموارد من إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة لبرامج Obsidian وغيرها.","en":"为 AI 编程助手安装 Skills 的资源仓库 | Skills repository for AI coding assistants"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"JSON Canvas 技术 - AI 编程助手技能","ja":"JSON Canvas 技術 - AI コーディング アシスタント スキル","ko":"JSON Canvas 기술 - AI 코딩 어시스턴트 스킬","es":"JSON Canvas: Crea y edita archivos de lienzo","fr":"JSON Canvas: Créez et éditez des fichiers de canevas","de":"JSON Canvas: Erstellen und bearbeiten Sie Canvas-Dateien","pt":"JSON Canvas: Crie e Edite Arquivos de Canvas","ru":"JSON Canvas: Создание и редактирование файлов Canvas","ar":"JSON Canvas: إنشاء وتحرير ملفات Canvas","en":"json-canvas"},"description":{"zh":"JSON Canvas 技术使技能兼容的代理能够创建和编辑有效的 JSON Canvas 文件（`.canvas`），用于 Obsidian 和其他应用程序。JSON Canvas 是一个用于无限画布数据的开放文件格式","ja":"JSON Canvas 技術はスキル対応エージェントが Obsidian やその他のアプリケーションで使用される有効な JSON Canvas ファイル（`.canvas`）を作成および編集できるようにします。JSON Canvas は無限のキャンバス データ用のオープン ファイル形式です","ko":"JSON Canvas 기술은 스킬 호환 에이전트가 Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션에서 사용되는 유효한 JSON Canvas 파일(`.canvas`)을 생성하고 편집할 수 있도록 합니다. JSON Canvas는 무한 캔버스 데이터를 위한 오픈 파일 형식입니다","es":"JSON Canvas es un formato de archivo abierto para datos de lienzo infinito. Este skill permite a los agentes compatibles crear y editar archivos JSON Canvas ...","fr":"JSON Canvas est un format de fichier ouvert pour les données de canevas infini. Ce skill permet aux agents compatibles de créer et d''éditer des fichiers JSON...","de":"JSON Canvas ist ein offenes Dateiformat für infinite Canvas-Daten. Dieser Skill ermöglicht es kompatiblen Agenten, gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien zu erstellen u...","pt":"O skill json-canvas permite que agentes compatíveis com habilidades criem e editem arquivos JSON Canvas válidos para Obsidian e outras aplicações.","ru":"Умение json-canvas позволяет агентам, совместимым с навыками, создавать и редактировать действительные файлы JSON Canvas для Obsidian и других приложений.","ar":"تمكن مهارة json-canvas وكلاء الموارد من إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة لبرامج Obsidian وغيرها.","en":"为 AI 编程助手安装 Skills 的资源仓库 | Skills repository for AI coding assistants"},"definition":{"en":"为 AI 编程助手安装 Skills 的资源仓库 | Skills repository for AI coding assistants"},"features":{"zh":["创建和编辑有效的 JSON Canvas 文件","支持 Obsidian 和其他应用程序","遵循 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 标准","包含 nodes 和 edges 两个顶级数组","用于无限画布数据的开放文件格式"],"ja":["有効な JSON Canvas ファイルの作成および編集","Obsidian やその他のアプリケーションをサポート","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 標準に準拠","nodes と edges の 2 つのトップレベル配列を含む","無限のキャンバス データ用のオープン ファイル形式"],"ko":["유효한 JSON Canvas 파일의 생성 및 편집","Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션을 지원","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 표준을 준수","노드 및 에지의 두 개의 최상위 배열을 포함","무한 캔버스 데이터를 위한 오픈 파일 형식"],"es":["Crea y edita archivos JSON Canvas válidos","Compatibilidad con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Soporte para datos de lienzo infinito","Estructura de archivo basada en JSON","Arreglos de nodos y bordes para representar el lienzo"],"fr":["Créez et éditez des fichiers JSON Canvas valides","Compatibilité avec Obsidian et d''autres applications","Prise en charge des données de canevas infini","Structure de fichier basée sur JSON","Tableaux de nœuds et de bords pour représenter le canevas"],"de":["Erstellen und bearbeiten Sie gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen","Unterstützung für infinite Canvas-Daten","Dateistruktur basierend auf JSON","Knoten- und Kanten-Arrays zur Darstellung des Canvas"],"pt":["Criação e edição de arquivos JSON Canvas válidos","Compatibilidade com Obsidian e outras aplicações","Estrutura de arquivo composta por arrays de nodes e edges","Suporte à especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Capacidade de criar e editar canvas infinitos"],"ru":["Создание и редактирование действительных файлов JSON Canvas","Совместимость с Obsidian и другими приложениями","Структура файла, состоящая из массивов узлов и ребер","Поддержка спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0","Возможность создавать и редактировать бесконечные холсты"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة","التوافق مع برامج Obsidian وغيرها","هيكل الملف المكون من مصفوفات العقد والزوايا","دعم مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","القدرة على إنشاء وتحرير شبكات غير محدودة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JSON Canvas","AI 编程助手","Obsidian","无限画布数据","开放文件格式","JSON 数据","技能兼容代理"],"ja":["JSON Canvas","AI コーディング アシスタント","Obsidian","無限のキャンバス データ","オープン ファイル形式","JSON データ","スキル対応エージェント"],"ko":["JSON Canvas","AI 코딩 어시스턴트","Obsidian","무한 캔버스 데이터","오픈 파일 형식","JSON 데이터","스킬 호환 에이전트"],"es":["JSON Canvas","lienzo infinito","Obsidian","formato de archivo abierto","datos de lienzo","compatible con AI","edición de archivos JSON","creación de archivos JSON","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["JSON Canvas","canevas infini","Obsidian","format de fichier ouvert","données de canevas","compatible avec l''IA","édition de fichiers JSON","création de fichiers JSON","développement de logiciels"],"de":["JSON Canvas","infinite Canvas","Obsidian","offenes Dateiformat","Canvas-Daten","kompatibel mit KI","Bearbeiten von JSON-Dateien","Erstellen von JSON-Dateien","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["json canvas","obsidian","arquivo json","canvas infinito","desenvolvimento de software","programação","aplicações de canvas","especificação json canvas 1.0"],"ru":["json canvas","obsidian","файл json","бесконечный холст","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","приложения для холста","спецификация json canvas 1.0"],"ar":["json canvas","obsidian","ملف json","شبكة غير محدودة","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","تطبيقات الشبكة","مواصفات json canvas 1.0"]}},"owner":"northseadl","repo":"skillwisp","repoPath":"northseadl/skillwisp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optio","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. There are four node types:\n- `text` - Text content with Markdown\n- `file` - Reference to files/attachments\n- `link` - External URL\n- `group` - Visual container for other nodes\n\n### Z-Index Ordering\n\nNodes are ordered by z-index in the array:\n- First node = bottom layer (displayed below others)\n- Last node = top layer (displayed above others)\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\nAll nodes share these attributes:\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique identifier for the node |\n| `type` | Yes | string | Node type: `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Node color (see Color section) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\nText nodes contain Markdown content.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Newline Escaping (Common Pitfall)\n\nIn JSON, newline characters inside strings **must** be represented as `\\n`. Do **not** use the literal sequence `\\\\n` in a `.canvas` file—Obsidian will render it as the characters `\\` and `n` instead of a line break.\n\nExamples:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n### File Nodes\n\nFile nodes reference files or attachments (images, videos, PDFs, notes, etc.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 400,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Notes/Project Overview.md\",\n  \"subpath\": \"#Implementation\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n### Link Nodes\n\nLink nodes display external URLs.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroup nodes are visual containers for organizing other nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"e5f67890123456ab\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 700,\n  \"width\": 800,\n  \"height\": 500,\n  \"label\": \"Resources\",\n  \"background\": \"Attachments/background.png\",\n  \"backgroundStyle\": \"cover\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | Background rendering style |\n\n#### Background Styles\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cover` | Fills entire width and height of node |\n| `ratio` | Maintains aspect ratio of background image |\n| `repeat` | Repeats image as pattern in both directions |\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges are lines connecting nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"f67890123456789a\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n  \"toNode\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"color\": \"1\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier for the edge |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection starts |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge starts |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | Shape at edge start |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection ends |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge ends |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | Shape at edge end |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label for the edge |\n\n### Side Values\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `top` | Top edge of node |\n| `right` | Right edge of node |\n| `bottom` | Bottom edge of node |\n| `left` | Left edge of node |\n\n### End Shapes\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `none` | No endpoint shape |\n| `arrow` | Arrow endpoint |\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type can be specified in two ways:\n\n### Hex Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"#FF0000\"\n}\n```\n\n### Preset Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"1\"\n}\n```\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nNote: Specific color values for presets are intentionally undefined, allowing applications to use their own brand colors.\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Simple Canvas with Text and Connections\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"text\": \"# Main Idea\\n\\nThis is the central concept.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": -100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point A\\n\\nDetails here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point B\\n\\nMore details.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Project Board with Groups\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"To Do\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 350,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"In Progress\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 700,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"Done\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 20,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 1\\n\\nImplement feature X\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 370,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 2\\n\\nReview PR #123\",\n      \"color\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 720,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 3\\n\\n~~Setup CI/CD~~\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Research Canvas with Files and Links\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 300,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 400,\n      \"height\": 200,\n      \"text\": \"# Research Topic\\n\\n## Key Questions\\n\\n- How does X affect Y?\\n- What are the implications?\",\n      \"color\": \"5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Literature/Paper A.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Notes/Meeting Notes.md\",\n      \"subpath\": \"#Key Insights\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"type\": \"link\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 400,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 750,\n      \"y\": 150,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 250,\n      \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"supports\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"informs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n      \"color\": \"6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"visualized by\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Flowchart\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**Start**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Step 1:\\nGather data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"**Decision**\\n\\nIs data valid?\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Process data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Request new data\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**End**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b3\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7c8d9e0f1a2b3c4\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c8d9e0f1a2b3c4d5\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d9e0f1a2b3c4d5e6\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"toSide\": \"right\",\n      \"label\": \"No\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e0f1a2b3c4d5e6f7\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"top\",\n      \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## ID Generation\n\nNode and edge IDs must be unique strings. Obsidian generates 16-character hexadecimal IDs:\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"id\": \"a3b2c1d0e9f8g7h6\"\n\"id\": \"1234567890abcdef\"\n```\n\nThis format is a 16-character lowercase hex string (64-bit random value).\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n### Positioning\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases to the right\n- `y` increases downward\n- Position refers to top-left corner of node\n\n### Recommended Sizes\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n| Group | Varies | Varies |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- Leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart for readability\n- Align nodes to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n1. All `id` values must be unique across nodes and edges\n2. `fromNode` and `toNode` must reference existing node IDs\n3. Required fields must be present for each node type\n4. `type` must be one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `backgroundStyle` must be one of: `cover`, `ratio`, `repeat`\n6. `fromSide`, `toSide` must be one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n7. `fromEnd`, `toEnd` must be one of: `none`, `arrow`\n8. Color presets must be `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex color\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:08:48.172Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Assistants needing to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files for applications like Obsidian.","zh":"非常适合需要创建和编辑有效的JSON画布文件的AI编码助手，例如用于Obsidian的应用。","ja":"Obsidianなどのアプリケーションで有効なJSONキャンバスファイルを作成および編集する必要があるAIコーディングアシスタントに最適です。","ko":"Obsidian 등의 애플리케이션에서 유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일을 생성 및 편집해야 하는 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para asistentes de codificación de IA que necesitan crear y editar archivos de lienzo JSON válidos para aplicaciones como Obsidian.","fr":"Parfait pour les assistants de codage IA qui ont besoin de créer et de modifier des fichiers de canevas JSON valides pour des applications comme Obsidian.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Assistenten, die gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Anwendungen wie Obsidian erstellen und bearbeiten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistente de Codificação de IA que precisam criar e editar arquivos JSON Canvas válidos para aplicativos como o Obsidian.","ru":"Идеально для помощников кодирования ИИ, которым необходимо создавать и редактировать допустимые файлы JSON Canvas для приложений, таких как Obsidian.","ar":"مثالي لمرافقة kod الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة للتطبيقات مثل Obsidian."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manipulate infinite canvas data using the JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, creating and editing .canvas files with structured nodes and edges, enabling advanced data visualization and representation.","zh":"赋予代理生成和操作无限画布数据的能力，使用JSON画布规范1.0，创建和编辑具有结构化节点和边的.canvas文件，从而实现高级数据可视化和表示。","ja":"JSONキャンバス仕様1.0を使用して、構造化されたノードとエッジを持つ.canvasファイルを作成および編集することで、代理は無限のキャンバスデータを生成および操作でき、先進的なデータ視覚化と表現が可能になります。","ko":"JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0을 사용하여 구조화된 노드와 에지를 갖는 .canvas 파일을 생성 및 편집함으로써 에이전트는 무한한 캔버스 데이터를 생성 및 조작할 수 있으며, 고급 데이터 시각화 및 표현이 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y manipular datos de lienzo infinitos utilizando la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0, creando y editando archivos .canvas con nodos y aristas estructurados, lo que permite una visualización y representación de datos avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de manipuler des données de canevas infinies en utilisant la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0, créant et éditant des fichiers .canvas avec des nœuds et des arêtes structurés, permettant une visualisation et une représentation de données avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, unendliche Canvas-Daten mit der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0 zu generieren und zu manipulieren, indem sie .canvas-Dateien mit strukturierten Knoten und Kanten erstellen und bearbeiten, wodurch eine erweiterte Datenvisualisierung und -repräsentation ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar e manipular dados de canvas infinitos usando a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0, criando e editando arquivos .canvas com nós e arestas estruturados, permitindo uma visualização e representação de dados avançadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и манипулировать бесконечными данными холста с помощью спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0, создавая и редактируя файлы .canvas со структурными узлами и ребрами, обеспечивая расширенную визуализацию и представление данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توليد وتنسيق بيانات الشبكة اللانهاية باستخدام مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0، وإنشاء وتحرير ملفات .canvas ذات العقد والحدود المنظمة، وتتمكن من تمثيل وتصوير البيانات المتقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom canvas layouts for Obsidian notes","Editing existing .canvas files to update node and edge configurations","Generating new JSON Canvas files from scratch for various applications"],"zh":["为Obsidian笔记创建自定义画布布局","编辑现有的.canvas文件以更新节点和边配置","从头开始为各种应用程序生成新的JSON画布文件"],"ja":["Obsidianノート用のカスタムキャンバスレイアウトを作成する","既存の.canvasファイルを編集してノードとエッジの構成を更新する","スクラッチからさまざまなアプリケーション用の新しいJSONキャンバスファイルを生成する"],"ko":["Obsidian 노트를 위한 사용자 정의 캔버스 레이아웃 생성","기존의 .canvas 파일을 편집하여 노드 및 에지 구성 업데이트","스크래치에서 다양한 애플리케이션을 위한 새로운 JSON 캔버스 파일 생성"],"es":["Crear diseños de lienzo personalizados para notas de Obsidian","Editar archivos .canvas existentes para actualizar la configuración de nodos y aristas","Generar nuevos archivos JSON Canvas desde cero para varias aplicaciones"],"fr":["Créer des dispositions de canevas personnalisées pour les notes Obsidian","Éditer les fichiers .canvas existants pour mettre à jour la configuration des nœuds et des arêtes","Générer de nouveaux fichiers JSON Canvas à partir de zéro pour diverses applications"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Canvas-Layouts für Obsidian-Notizen","Bearbeiten von vorhandenen .canvas-Dateien, um die Konfiguration von Knoten und Kanten zu aktualisieren","Erstellen von neuen JSON-Canvas-Dateien von Grund auf für verschiedene Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criar layouts de canvas personalizados para notas do Obsidian","Editar arquivos .canvas existentes para atualizar configurações de nó e aresta","Gerar novos arquivos JSON Canvas do zero para vários aplicativos"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских компоновок холста для заметок Obsidian","Редактирование существующих файлов .canvas для обновления конфигураций узлов и ребер","Генерация новых файлов JSON Canvas с нуля для различных приложений"],"ar":["إنشاء تخطيطات شبكة مخصصة لملاحظات Obsidian","تحرير ملفات .canvas الحالية لتحديث-configurations العقد والحدود","توليد ملفات JSON Canvas جديدة من الصفر لمجموعة من التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Limited to creating and editing .canvas files"],"zh":["需要与JSON画布规范1.0兼容","仅限创建和编辑.canvas文件"],"ja":["JSONキャンバス仕様1.0との互換性が必要",".canvasファイルの作成および編集のみ"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0과의 호환성이 필요",".canvas 파일의 생성 및 편집만"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado a la creación y edición de archivos .canvas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Limité à la création et à l''édition de fichiers .canvas"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Bearbeitung von .canvas-Dateien"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado à criação e edição de arquivos .canvas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости со спецификацией JSON Canvas 1.0","Ограничен созданием и редактированием файлов .canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","محدود بالإنشاء والتحرير ملفات .canvas"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/fal-platform', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'fal-platform', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:08:21.026Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/fal-platform","name":"fal-platform","description":{"zh":"Fal 平台技能提供模型管理、定价和使用跟踪的平台 API 指南和模式","ja":"Fal プラットフォームスキルは、モデル管理、価格設定、使用状況の追跡のためのプラットフォーム API のガイドとパターンを提供します","ko":"Fal 플랫폼 스킬은 모델 관리, 가격 책정 및 사용량 추적을 위한 플랫폼 API 가이드 및 패턴을 제공합니다","es":"La plataforma Fal ofrece una gestión integral de modelos, precios y seguimiento de uso a través de API de plataforma. Es ideal para desarrolladores que necesitan trabajar con modelos y seguimiento de uso.","fr":"La plateforme Fal propose une gestion complète de modèles, de prix et de suivi d''utilisation via des API de plateforme. Elle est idéale pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de travailler avec des modèles et un suivi d''utilisation.","de":"Die Fal-Plattform bietet ein umfassendes Modellmanagement, Preisgestaltung und Nutzungsnachverfolgung über Plattform-APIs. Sie ist ideal für Entwickler, die mit Modellen und Nutzungsnachverfolgung arbeiten müssen.","pt":"A plataforma Fal fornece APIs para gerenciamento de modelos, precificação e rastreamento de uso. Aprenda a utilizá-las.","ru":"Платформа Fal предоставляет API для управления моделями, ценообразования и отслеживания использования. Узнайте, как ими пользоваться.","ar":"توفر منصة فال واجهات برمجة تطبيقات لإدارة النماذج والتصفية والتتبع. تعلم كيفية استخدامها","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Fal 平台技能 - 模型管理和定价","ja":"Fal プラットフォームスキル - モデル管理と価格設定","ko":"Fal 플랫폼 스킬 - 모델 관리 및 가격 책정","es":"Plataforma Fal: Gestión de Modelos y Seguimiento de Uso","fr":"Plat