con Composio"],"fr":["Connexion de Rube MCP et Kit","Automatisation des opérations de marketing par e-mail","Amélioration des campagnes avec les outils Kit","Configuration simple sans clés d''API","Intégration avec Composio"],"de":["Verbindung von Rube MCP und Kit","Automatisierung von E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen","Verbesserung von Kampagnen mit Kit-Tools","Einfache Konfiguration ohne API-Schlüssel","Integration mit Composio"],"pt":["Automação de operações de marketing por e-mail","Integração com o toolkit Composio","Conexão segura com o Rube MCP","Gerenciamento de conexões com o Kit","Sem necessidade de chaves de API"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций электронного маркетинга","Интеграция с инструментарием Composio","Безопасное подключение к Rube MCP","Управление соединениями с Kit","Не требуется ключи API"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات التسويق بالبريد الإلكتروني","التكامل مع أداة كومبوسيو","اتصال آمن بروب إم سي بي","إدارة الاتصالات بكيت","لا يتطلب مفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ConvertKit 自动化","Rube MCP","邮件营销自动化","工作流程简化","提高工作效率","生产力提高"],"ja":["ConvertKit オートメーション","Rube MCP","メールマーケティング自動化","ワークフロー簡素化","作業効率向上","生産性向上"],"ko":["ConvertKit 자동화","Rube MCP","이메일 마케팅 자동화","워크플로우 단순화","작업 효율 향상","생산성 향상"],"es":["automatización de ConvertKit","Rube MCP","Kit de Composio","marketing por correo electrónico","integración de herramientas","automatización de campañas"],"fr":["automatisation de ConvertKit","Rube MCP","outil Kit de Composio","marketing par e-mail","intégration d''outils","automatisation de campagnes"],"de":["ConvertKit-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Kit-Tool von Composio","E-Mail-Marketing","Tool-Integration","Kampagnenautomatisierung"],"pt":["automatização de marketing por e-mail","Rube MCP","Kit","Composio","automação de operações","integração de ferramentas","marketing digital","e-mail marketing"],"ru":["автоматизация электронного маркетинга","Rube MCP","Kit","Composio","автоматизация операций","интеграция инструментов","цифровой маркетинг","электронный маркетинг"],"ar":["أتمتة التسويق بالبريد الإلكتروني","روب إم سي بي","كيت","كومبوسيو","أتمتة العمليات","تكامل الأدوات","التسويق الرقمي","تسويق البريد الإلكتروني"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convertkit-automation","description":"Automate ConvertKit (Kit) tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): manage subscribers, tags, broadcasts, and broadcast stats. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — ju","body":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Kit authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Subscribers\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse, search, or filter email subscribers\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers with filters and pagination [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `status`: Filter by status (''active'' or ''inactive'')\n- `email_address`: Exact email to search for\n- `created_after`/`created_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `updated_after`/`updated_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `sort_field`: Sort by ''id'', ''cancelled_at'', or ''updated_at''\n- `sort_order`: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n- `per_page`: Results per page (min 1)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' to get total subscriber count\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- If `sort_field` is ''cancelled_at'', the `status` must be set to ''cancelled''\n- Date filters use YYYY-MM-DD format (no time component)\n- `email_address` is an exact match; partial email search is not supported\n- Pagination uses cursor-based approach with `after`/`before` cursor strings\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean\n\n### 2. Manage Subscriber Tags\n\n**When to use**: User wants to tag subscribers for segmentation\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID by email [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER` - Associate a subscriber with a tag [Required]\n3. `KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers for a specific tag [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for tagging**:\n- `tag_id`: Numeric tag ID (required)\n- `subscriber_id`: Numeric subscriber ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Both `tag_id` and `subscriber_id` must be positive integers\n- Tag IDs must reference existing tags; tags are created via the Kit web UI\n- Tagging an already-tagged subscriber is idempotent (no error)\n- Subscriber IDs are returned from LIST_SUBSCRIBERS; use `email_address` filter to find specific subscribers\n\n### 3. Unsubscribe a Subscriber\n\n**When to use**: User wants to unsubscribe a subscriber from all communications\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER` - Unsubscribe the subscriber [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Subscriber ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This permanently unsubscribes the subscriber from ALL email communications\n- The subscriber''s historical data is retained but they will no longer receive emails\n- Operation is idempotent; unsubscribing an already-unsubscribed subscriber succeeds without error\n- Returns empty response (HTTP 204 No Content) on success\n- Subscriber ID must exist; non-existent IDs return 404\n\n### 4. List and View Broadcasts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse email broadcasts or get details of a specific one\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - List all broadcasts with pagination [Required]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Get detailed information for a specific broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS` - Get performance statistics for a broadcast [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-500)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' for total count\n\n**Key parameters for details**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `per_page` max is 500 for broadcasts\n- Broadcast stats are only available for sent broadcasts\n- Draft broadcasts will not have stats\n- Broadcast IDs are numeric integers\n\n### 5. Delete a Broadcast\n\n**When to use**: User wants to permanently remove a broadcast\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - Find the broadcast to delete [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Verify it is the correct broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST` - Permanently delete the broadcast [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone\n- Deleting a sent broadcast removes it but does not unsend the emails\n- Confirm the broadcast ID before deleting\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Subscriber Lookup by Email\n\n```\n1. Call KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS with email_address=''user@example.com''\n2. Extract subscriber ID from the response\n3. Use ID for tagging, unsubscribing, or other operations\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\nKit uses cursor-based pagination:\n- Check response for `after` cursor value\n- Pass cursor as `after` parameter in next request\n- Continue until no more cursor is returned\n- Use `include_total_count: ''true''` to track progress\n\n### Tag-Based Segmentation\n\n```\n1. Create tags in Kit web UI\n2. Use KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER to assign tags to subscribers\n3. Use KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS to view subscribers per tag\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Subscriber IDs: positive integers (e.g., 3887204736)\n- Tag IDs: positive integers\n- Broadcast IDs: positive integers\n- All IDs are numeric, not strings\n\n**Status Values**:\n- Subscriber statuses: ''active'', ''inactive'', ''cancelled''\n- Some operations are restricted by status (e.g., sorting by cancelled_at requires status=''cancelled'')\n\n**String vs Boolean Parameters**:\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean true\n- `sort_order` is a string enum: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Kit API has per-account rate limits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n- Bulk operations should be paced appropriately\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Cursor values are opaque strings; use exactly as returned\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List subscribers | KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS | status, email_address, per_page |\n| Tag subscriber | KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER | tag_id, subscriber_id |\n| List tag subscribers | KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS | tag_id |\n| Unsubscribe | KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER | id |\n| List broadcasts | KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS | per_page, after |\n| Get broadcast | KIT_GET_BROADCAST | id |\n| Get broadcast stats | KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS | id |\n| Delete broadcast | KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST | id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:09:06.217Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced email marketing operations through ConvertKit automation via Rube MCP.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Rube MCP 的 ConvertKit 自动化实现高级电子邮件营销操作的营销自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCP を介して ConvertKit オートメーションを使用した高度な電子メールマーケティング操作が必要なマーケティングオートメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 ConvertKit 자동화를 사용하여 고급 이메일 마케팅 운영이 필요한 마케팅 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced email marketing operations through ConvertKit automation via Rube MCP.","fr":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced email marketing operations through ConvertKit automation via Rube MCP.","de":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced email marketing operations through ConvertKit automation via Rube MCP.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que necessitam de operações avançadas de marketing por e-mail por meio da automação do ConvertKit via Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов маркетинговой автоматизации, которым необходимы продвинутые операции по маркетингу электронной почты через автоматизацию ConvertKit через Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين للتسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات تسويق بريد إلكتروني متقدمة من خلال أتمتة ConvertKit عبر Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and supporting protocols like MCP.","zh":"赋予代理人通过 Composio 的 Kit 工具包和 Rube MCP 实现 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销操作的自动化能力，利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 和 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 实现无缝集成，并支持像 MCP 的协议","ja":"エージェントが Composio の Kit ツールキットと Rube MCP を使用して ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティング操作を自動化する能力を提供し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS と RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用してシームレスな統合を実現し、MCP のようなプロトコルをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 Composio의 Kit 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 사용하여 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 운영을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 무縫 통합을 구현하고, MCP와 같은 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and supporting protocols like MCP.","fr":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and supporting protocols like MCP.","de":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and supporting protocols like MCP.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit por meio da ferramenta Kit da Composio via Rube MCP, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para integração perfeita, e suportando protocolos como MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции по маркетингу электронной почты ConvertKit через набор инструментов Kit от Composio через Rube MCP, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для беспрепятственной интеграции, и поддерживая протоколы, такие как MCP.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من أتمتة عمليات تسويق البريد الإلكتروني من ConvertKit من خلال أداة Kit من Composio عبر Rube MCP، وذلك باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل التكامل السلس، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ConvertKit email marketing campaigns","Integrating Kit toolkit with Rube MCP for streamlined operations","Managing connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for efficient workflow"],"zh":["自动化 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销活动","将 Kit 工具包与 Rube MCP 集成以实现流畅的操作","通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 管理连接以实现高效的工作流"],"ja":["ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティングキャンペーンの自動化","Kit ツールキットと Rube MCP の統合によるスムーズな操作","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用した接続の管理による効率的なワークフロー"],"ko":["ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 캠페인 자동화","Kit 툴킷과 Rube MCP의 통합을 통한 원활한 운영","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용한 연결 관리를 통한 효율적인 워크플로"],"es":["Automating ConvertKit email marketing campaigns","Integrating Kit toolkit with Rube MCP for streamlined operations","Managing connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for efficient workflow"],"fr":["Automating ConvertKit email marketing campaigns","Integrating Kit toolkit with Rube MCP for streamlined operations","Managing connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for efficient workflow"],"de":["Automating ConvertKit email marketing campaigns","Integrating Kit toolkit with Rube MCP for streamlined operations","Managing connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for efficient workflow"],"pt":["Automatizar campanhas de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit","Integrar a ferramenta Kit com o Rube MCP para operações simplificadas","Gerenciar conexões via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para fluxo de trabalho eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать кампании маркетинга электронной почты ConvertKit","Интегрировать набор инструментов Kit с Rube MCP для оптимизированных операций","Управлять соединениями через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для эффективного рабочего процесса"],"ar":["أتمتة حملات تسويق البريد الإلكتروني من ConvertKit","دمج أداة Kit مع Rube MCP من أجل عمليات مبسطة","إدارة الاتصالات من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل تدفق عمل فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit kit necessary","Always call RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS first to get current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接并且 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 可用","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 的 Kit 连接以及工具包 kit","始终首先调用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 以获取当前工具架构"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続と RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS の使用が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 経由の Kit 接続とツールキット kit が必要","常に RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS を最初に呼び出して現在のツールスキーマを取得"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 및 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 사용이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 Kit 연결 및 툴킷 kit가 필요","항상 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 먼저 호출하여 현재 툴 스키마를 가져옴"],"es":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit kit necessary","Always call RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS first to get current tool schemas"],"fr":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit kit necessary","Always call RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS first to get current tool schemas"],"de":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit kit necessary","Always call RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS first to get current tool schemas"],"pt":["Exige conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Conexão ativa Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com toolkit kit necessária","Sempre chamar RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS primeiro para obter esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с необходимым набором инструментов kit","Всегда вызывать RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS сначала, чтобы получить текущие схемы инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال ب Rube MCP مع أدوات RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","اتصال Kit نشط من خلال Rube Manage Connections مع أداة kit مطلوبة","دعوة RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS دائمًا أولاً للحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
