попапов для увеличения коэффициента конверсии","Создание индивидуальных попапов для удовлетворения потребностей пользователей","Анализ производительности попапов для выявления возможностей улучшения","Интеграция с инструментами маркетинга для повышения эффективности","Разработка стратегий попапов для разных устройств и платформ"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة منبثقة لزيادة معدل التحويل","إنشاء نافذة منبثقة مخصصة لتلبي احتياجات المستخدم","تحليل أداء نافذة منبثقة لتحديد فرص التحسين","التكامل مع أدوات التسويق لزيادة الفعالية","تطوير استراتيجيات نافذة منبثقة لمختلف الأجهزة والمنصات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["popup-cro","CRO","popup","email"," "," "],"ja":["popup-cro","CRO","popup","email"," "," "],"ko":["popup-cro","CRO","popup","email"," "," "],"es":["optimización de popups","CRO","experiencia del usuario","tasas de conversión","popups personalizados","análisis de datos","marketing digital","desarrollo web"],"fr":["optimisation des popups","CRO","expérience utilisateur","taux de conversion","popups personnalisés","analyse de données","marketing digital","développement web"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups","CRO","Benutzererfahrung","Umwandlungsrate","personalisierte Popups","Datenanalyse","digitales Marketing","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["popup CRO","otimização de popups","taxa de conversão","desenvolvimento de popups","análise de desempenho","integração com ferramentas de marketing"],"ru":["попап CRO","оптимизация попапов","коэффициент конверсии","разработка попапов","анализ производительности","интеграция с инструментами маркетинга"],"ar":["نافذة منبثقة CRO","تحسين نافذة منبثقة","معدل التحويل","تطوير نافذة منبثقة","تحليل الأداء","التكامل مع أدوات التسويق"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:09:20.030Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents specializing in Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) needing expert-level popup and modal optimization strategies.","zh":"非常适合专门从事转化率优化（CRO）的营销代理商，需要专家级的弹出窗口和模态优化策略。","ja":"コンバージョンレート最適化（CRO）を専門とするマーケティングエージェントに最適です。ポップアップとモーダル最適化の専門家レベルの戦略が必要です。","ko":"전환률 최적화(CRO)에 전문적인 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 팝업 및 모달 최적화 전략을 전문가 수준으로 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing especializados en optimización de la tasa de conversión (CRO) que necesitan estrategias de optimización de emergentes y modales de nivel experto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans l''optimisation du taux de conversion (CRO) ayant besoin de stratégies d''optimisation de popups et de modales de niveau expert.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die auf Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) spezialisiert sind und expertenlevel Strategien für die Optimierung von Popups und Modals benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing especializados em Otimização da Taxa de Conversão (CRO) que precisam de estratégias de otimização de popup e modal de nível expert.","ru":"Идеально для Маркетинговых Агентов, специализирующихся на оптимизации коэффициента конверсии (CRO) и требующих экспертных стратегий оптимизации попапов и модальных окон.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الذين يختصون بتحسين معدل التحويل (CRO) وهم بحاجة إلى استراتيجيات محسنة للشعارات المنبثقة وتنسيق نمطية الخبراء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-converting popups that balance user experience with brand perception, utilizing product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and optimizing for specific purposes like email or newsletter capture, all while ensuring seamless integration with existing marketing workflows and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理商创建高转化率弹出窗口的能力，这些弹出窗口平衡了用户体验和品牌认知，利用来自`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`的产品营销背景，并针对特定目的（如电子邮件或新闻稿捕获）进行优化，同时确保与现有营销工作流和协议的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが、高い転換率をもたらすポップアップを作成できるようにします。これらのポップアップは、ユーザーエクスペリエンスとブランド認知のバランスをとり、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`からの製品マーケティングコンテキストを利用し、メールやニュースレターのキャプチャなどの特定の目的を最適化します。また、既存のマーケティングワークフローやプロトコルとの無縫な統合も保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 전환률을 가진 팝업을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 이 팝업들은 사용자 경험과 브랜드 인식을 균형있게 유지하며, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`에서 가져온 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하며, 이메일 또는 뉴스레터 캡처와 같은 특정 목적을 최적화합니다. 또한 기존 마케팅 워크플로우 및 프로토콜과의 無縫な 統合도 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear popups de alta conversión que equilibren la experiencia del usuario con la percepción de la marca, utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y optimizando para propósitos específicos como la captura de correos electrónicos o boletines, todo mientras se garantiza una integración sin problemas con los flujos de trabajo y protocolos de marketing existentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des popups à forte conversion qui équilibrent l''expérience utilisateur avec la perception de la marque, en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en optimisant pour des objectifs spécifiques tels que la capture d''adresses e-mail ou de newsletters, tout en garantissant une intégration sans problème avec les flux de travail et les protocoles de marketing existants.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Popups mit hoher Konvertierungsrate zu erstellen, die die Nutzererfahrung mit dem Markenbild in Einklang bringen, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen und für spezifische Zwecke wie die Erfassung von E-Mails oder Newslettern optimieren, während sie gleichzeitig eine nahtlose Integration mit bestehenden Marketing-Workflows und -Protokollen gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar popups de alta conversão que equilibrem a experiência do usuário com a percepção da marca, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e otimizando para propósitos específicos como captura de e-mail ou boletim, garantindo ao mesmo tempo uma integração perfeita com os fluxos de trabalho e protocolos de marketing existentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокоэффективные попапы, которые балансируют опыт пользователя с восприятием бренда, используя контекст продукта маркетинга из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и оптимизируя для конкретных целей, таких как захват электронной почты или новостей, обеспечивая при этом бесшовную интеграцию с существующими маркетинговыми рабочими процессами и протоколами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة عالية التحويل توازن بين تجربة المستخدم وتصور العلامة التجارية، باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وضبطه لغايات محددة مثل التقاط البريد الإلكتروني أو النشرة الإخبارية، مع ضمان التكامل السلس مع سير عمل التسويق والبروتوكولات الحالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement and timing for maximum conversion","Crafting compelling popup copy that resonates with target audiences","Analyzing user interaction with popups to inform future CRO strategies"],"zh":["优化弹出窗口的位置和时机以实现最大转化率","制作引人入胜的弹出窗口副本以与目标受众产生共鸣","分析用户与弹出窗口的交互以指导未来的CRO策略"],"ja":["最大転換率を実現するためのポップアップの配置とタイミングの最適化","ターゲットオーディエンスと共鳴するポップアップコピーの作成","将来のCRO戦略を導くためのユーザーとポップアップの相互作用の分析"],"ko":["최대 전환률을 달성하기 위한 팝업의 위치와 타이밍 최적화","대상 청중과 공감할 수 있는 팝업 복사본 제작","미래의 CRO 전략을 안내하기 위한 사용자와 팝업의 상호작용 분석"],"es":["Optimizar la colocación y el momento de los popups para una máxima conversión","Crear copias de popups atractivas que resuenen con las audiencias objetivo","Analizar la interacción del usuario con los popups para informar las estrategias de CRO futuras"],"fr":["Optimiser le positionnement et le moment des popups pour une conversion maximale","Créer des copies de popups convaincantes qui résonnent avec les publics cibles","Analyser l''interaction de l''utilisateur avec les popups pour éclairer les stratégies de CRO futures"],"de":["Die Platzierung und den Zeitpunkt von Popups für eine maximale Konvertierungsrate optimieren","Überzeugende Popuptexte erstellen, die bei den Zielgruppen Anklang finden","Die Interaktion des Nutzers mit Popups analysieren, um zukünftige CRO-Strategien zu informieren"],"pt":["Otimizando a posição e o tempo de exibição do popup para máxima conversão","Criando cópias de popup atraentes que ressoam com os públicos-alvo","Analysando a interação do usuário com os popups para informar futuras estratégias de CRO"],"ru":["Оптимизация размещения и времени показа попапа для максимальной конверсии","Создание привлекательных копий попапов, которые находят отклик у целевой аудитории","Анализ взаимодействия пользователя с попапами для информирования будущих стратегий CRO"],"ar":["تحسين положية ونقطة ظهور الشعارات المنبثقة للحصول على أقصى تحويل","إنشاء نسخ من الشعارات المنبثقة التي تجذب انتباه الجمهور المستهدف","تحليل تفاعل المستخدم مع الشعارات المنبثقة لتوجيه استراتيجيات CRO المستقبلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for optimal performance","Limited to popup and modal optimization within the scope of CRO"],"zh":["需要来自`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`的产品营销背景以实现最佳性能","仅限于CRO范围内的弹出窗口和模态优化"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`からの製品マーケティングコンテキストが必要","CROの範囲内でのポップアップとモーダルの最適化に限定"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`에서 가져온 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트가 필요","CRO 범위 내에서의 팝업 및 모달 최적화에 한정"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a la optimización de popups y modals dentro del alcance de la CRO"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour une performance optimale","Limité à l''optimisation des popups et des modals dans le cadre de la CRO"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für eine optimale Leistung","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von Popups und Modals im Rahmen der CRO"],"pt":["Requer contexto de marketing de produto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para desempenho ótimo","Limitado à otimização de popup e modal dentro do escopo da CRO"],"ru":["Требует контекста продукта маркетинга из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен оптимизацией попапов и модальных окон в рамках CRO"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للأداء الأمثل","محدود بتحسين الشعارات المنبثقة ونمطية الخبراء في نطاق CRO"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/popup-cro', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'popup-cro', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:09:26.754Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/popup-cro","name":"popup-cro","description":{"zh":"popup-cro ","ja":"popup-cro","ko":"popup-cro ","pt":"O popup CRO é uma habilidade que visa criar popups que convertem sem afetar negativamente a experiência do usuário","ru":"Попап CRO — это навык, направленный на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без негативного влияния на опыт пользователя","ar":"نافذة منبثقة CRO هي مهارة تهدف إلى إنشاء نافذة منبثقة تحول دون المساس بتجربة المستخدم","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"popup-cro ","ja":"popup-cro","ko":"popup-cro ","pt":"Otimização de Popups CRO","ru":"Попап CRO Оптимизация","ar":"تحسين 팝업 CRO","en":"popup-cro"},"description":{"zh":"popup-cro ","ja":"popup-cro","ko":"popup-cro ","pt":"O popup CRO é uma habilidade que visa criar popups que convertem sem afetar negativamente a experiência do usuário","ru":"Попап CRO — это навык, направленный на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без негативного влияния на опыт пользователя","ar":"نافذة منبثقة CRO هي مهارة تهدف إلى إنشاء نافذة منبثقة تحول دون المساس بتجربة المستخدم","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["popup","cro","email","newsletter"," ","brand"],"ja":["popup","cro","email","newsletter","","brand"],"ko":["popup","cro","email","newsletter","","brand"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversões","Criação de popups personalizados","Análise de desempenho de popups","Otimização para dispositivos móveis","Integração com marketing de produto"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсий","Создание индивидуальных попапов","Анализ эффективности попапов","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств","Интеграция с маркетингом продукта"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة منبثقة للتحويلات","إنشاء نافذة منبثقة مخصصة","تحليل أداء نافذة منبثقة","تحسين للهواتف المحمولة","التكامل مع تسويق المنتج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["popup-cro","cro","popup","email","newsletter","brand","seo","cro","web"],"ja":["popup-cro","cro","popup","email","newsletter","brand","seo","cro","web"],"ko":["popup-cro","cro","popup","email","newsletter","brand","seo","cro","web"],"pt":["popup CRO","otimização de popups","conversões","marketing de produto","análise de desempenho","dispositivos móveis","personalização"],"ru":["попап CRO","оптимизация попапов","конверсии","маркетинг продукта","анализ эффективности","мобильные устройства","пersonalização"],"ar":["نافذة منبثقة CRO","تحسين نافذة منبثقة","التحويلات","تسويق المنتج","تحليل الأداء","الهواتف المحمولة","التنسيق"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:09:26.754Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing expert popup and modal optimization for enhanced conversion rates.","zh":"非常适合需要专家弹出窗口和模态优化以提高转换率的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントがコンバージョン率を向上させるために、ポップアップとモーダルを最適化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"전환율을 향상시키기 위한 팝업 및 모달 최적화를 필요로 하는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan expertos en optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales para tasas de conversión mejoradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin d''experts en optimisation de fenêtres contextuelles et de modales pour des taux de conversion améliorés.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die Experten für die Optimierung von Popups und Modals für verbesserte Konversionsraten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de especialização em otimização de popups e modais para taxas de conversão aprimoradas.","ru":"Идеально для Маркетинговых Агентов, которым необходимы экспертные навыки оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон для повышения коэффициентов конверсии.","ar":" مثالي لوجوهاء التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تحسين النوافذ المنبثقة و_optimization المودال لتعزيز معدلات التحويل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create targeted popups for email/newsletter capture, leveraging product marketing context to boost conversions without damaging brand perception, utilizing contextual understanding from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files.","zh":"赋予代理创建针对性的弹出窗口以用于电子邮件/新闻通讯捕获，利用产品营销背景来提高转换率而不损害品牌形象，利用 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文件中的上下文理解。","ja":"エージェントが、製品マーケティングの文脈を利用してコンバージョンを向上させ、ブランドの認識を損なわずに、メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャ用のターゲットを絞ったポップアップを作成できるようにします。 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ファイルからの文脈理解を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 마케팅 문脈을 활용하여 전환율을 향상시키고 브랜드 인식을 손상하지 않으면서 이메일/뉴스레터 캡처를 위한 타겟팅된 팝업을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 문脈 이해를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ventanas emergentes dirigidas para la captura de correos electrónicos y boletines, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos para aumentar las conversiones sin dañar la percepción de la marca, utilizando la comprensión contextual de los archivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fenêtres contextuelles ciblées pour la capture d''adresses e-mail et de newsletters, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits pour améliorer les conversions sans nuire à la perception de la marque, en utilisant la compréhension contextuelle des fichiers `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gezielte Popups für die Erfassung von E-Mails und Newslettern zu erstellen, indem sie den Kontext des Produktmarketings nutzen, um Konversionen zu steigern, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu beeinträchtigen, unter Nutzung des Kontextverständnisses aus den Dateien `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem popups direcionados para captura de e-mails/boletins, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produtos para aumentar as conversões sem danificar a percepção da marca, utilizando a compreensão contextual a partir de arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целевые всплывающие окна для захвата электронной почты/новостей, используя контекст маркетинга продукта для повышения коэффициентов конверсии без ущерба для восприятия бренда, используя контекстное понимание из файлов `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مستهدفة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني/النشرة الإخبارية ، باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج لتعزيز معدلات التحويل دون الإضرار باستهلاك العلامة التجارية ، باستخدام الفهم السياقي من الملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement for maximum conversions","Generating targeted modal content based on user behavior","Analyzing popup effectiveness to refine marketing strategies"],"zh":["优化弹出窗口位置以实现最大转换率","根据用户行为生成目标模态内容","分析弹出窗口的有效性以改进营销策略"],"ja":["最大のコンバージョン率を実現するためのポップアップの配置の最適化","ユーザーの行動に基づいてターゲットを絞ったモーダルコンテンツを生成する","ポップアップの有効性を分析してマーケティング戦略を改善する"],"ko":["최대 전환율을 달성하기 위한 팝업 배치 최적화","사용자 행동에 따라 타겟팅된 모달 콘텐츠를 생성하는","팝업의 효과를 분석하여 마케팅 전략을 개선하는"],"es":["Optimización de la colocación de ventanas emergentes para un máximo de conversiones","Generación de contenido de modal dirigido en función del comportamiento del usuario","Análisis de la efectividad de las ventanas emergentes para perfeccionar las estrategias de marketing"],"fr":["Optimisation du positionnement des fenêtres contextuelles pour un maximum de conversions","Génération de contenu de modal ciblé en fonction du comportement de l''utilisateur","Analyse de l''efficacité des fenêtres contextuelles pour affiner les stratégies de marketing"],"de":["Optimierung der Platzierung von Popups für maximale Konversionen","Generierung von gezieltem Modalinhalt basierend auf dem Benutzerverhalten","Analyse der Wirksamkeit von Popups, um Marketingstrategien zu verfeinern"],"pt":["Otimizando a posição do popup para conversões máximas","Gerando conteúdo de modal direcionado com base no comportamento do usuário","Analisando a eficácia do popup para refinar estratégias de marketing"],"ru":["Оптимизация размещения всплывающих окон для максимальных конверсий","Генерация целевого контента модального окна на основе поведения пользователя","Анализ эффективности всплывающих окон для усовершенствования маркетинговых стратегий"],"ar":["تحسين وضع النافذة المنبثقة لتحقيق أقصى معدل تحويل","генерация محتوى المودال المستهدفة بناءً على سلوك المستخدم","تحليل فعالية النافذة المنبثقة لتحسين استراتيجيات التسويق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context for optimal performance","Limited to popup and modal optimization"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景以实现最佳性能","仅限于弹出窗口和模态优化"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために製品マーケティングの文脈が必要","ポップアップとモーダルの最適化のみに限定される"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 제품 마케팅 문脈이 필요","팝업 및 모달 최적화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a la optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits pour une performance optimale","Limité à l''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et des modales"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext für optimale Leistung","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von Popups und Modals"],"pt":["Requer contexto de marketing de produtos para desempenho ótimo","Limitado à otimização de popups e modais"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продукта для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен оптимизацией всплывающих окон и модальных окон"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج للأداء الأمثل","محدود بتحسين النوافذ المنبثقة والمواد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
