a definir el comportamiento esperado con pruebas automatizadas","fr":"Générez des tests échoués en suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD. Apprenez à définir le comportement attendu avec des tests automatisés","de":"Erzeugen Sie fehlgeschlagene Tests, indem Sie den Grundsätzen der roten Phase von TDD folgen. Lernen Sie, das erwartete Verhalten mit automatisierten Tests z...","pt":"Escreva testes abrangentes de falha seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD. Este skill ajuda a definir o comportamento esperado.","ru":"Пишите всесторонние тесты на отказ, следуя принципам красной фазы TDD. Этот навык помогает определить ожидаемое поведение.","ar":"اكتب اختبارات شاملة للفشل اتباعًا لمبادئ المرحلة الحمراء من TDD. هذا المهارة يساعد في تعريف السلوك المتوقع.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["TDD","","TDD","TDD","TDD",""],"ja":["TDD","","TDD","TDD","TDD",""],"ko":["TDD","","TDD","TDD","TDD",""],"es":["Generación de pruebas fallidas","Pruebas automatizadas","Cobertura de casos de borde","Definición del comportamiento esperado","Mejora de las habilidades de desarrollo","Integración con TDD"],"fr":["Génération de tests échoués","Tests automatisés","Couverture des cas de bordure","Définition du comportement attendu","Amélioration des compétences de développement","Intégration avec TDD"],"de":["Erzeugung fehlgeschlagener Tests","Automatisierte Tests","Abdeckung von Randfällen","Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens","Verbesserung der Entwicklungsfähigkeiten","Integration mit TDD"],"pt":["Testes abrangentes de falha","Definição de comportamento esperado","Cobertura de casos de bordo","Integração com test-automator","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Redução de bugs"],"ru":["Всесторонние тесты на отказ","Определение ожидаемого поведения","Покрытие граничных случаев","Интеграция с test-automator","Улучшение качества кода","Снижение количества багов"],"ar":["اختبارات شاملة للفشل","تعريف السلوك المتوقع","تغطية حالات الحدود","التكامل مع test-automator","تحسين جودة الشفرة","تخفيض الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD","TDD ","TDD","Test-Driven Development","TDD","TDD","TDD","TDD"],"ja":["TDD","TDD","TDD","Test-Driven Development","TDD","TDD","TDD","TDD"],"ko":["TDD","TDD ","TDD","Test-Driven Development","TDD","TDD","TDD","TDD"],"es":["TDD","pruebas fallidas","pruebas automatizadas","desarrollo de software","metodologías de desarrollo","pruebas de software","automatización de pruebas","casos de borde","comportamiento esperado"],"fr":["TDD","tests échoués","tests automatisés","développement de logiciels","méthodologies de développement","tests de logiciels","automatisation de tests","cas de bordure","comportement attendu"],"de":["TDD","fehlgeschlagene Tests","automatisierte Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsmethoden","Software-Tests","Testautomatisierung","Randfälle","erwartetes Verhalten"],"pt":["TDD","Testes de falha","Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes","Fase vermelha","Test-automator","Cobertura de testes","Qualidade do código","Casos de bordo"],"ru":["TDD","Тесты на отказ","Разработка, управляемая тестами","Красный фаз","Test-automator","Покрытие тестов","Качество кода","Граничные случаи"],"ar":["TDD","اختبارات الفشل","التطوير الموجه بالاختبارات","المرحلة الحمراء","test-automator","تغطية الاختبار","جودة الشفرة","حالات الحدود"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":"Generate failing tests for the TDD red phase to define expected behavior and edge cases.","bodyPreview":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against p","body":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against production systems\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Identify behaviors, constraints, and edge cases.\n2. Generate failing tests that define expected outcomes.\n3. Ensure failures are due to missing behavior, not setup errors.\n4. Document how to run tests and verify failures.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Keep test data isolated and avoid production environments.\n- Avoid flaky external dependencies in the red phase.\n\n## Role\n\nGenerate failing tests using Task tool with subagent_type=\"unit-testing::test-automator\".\n\n## Prompt Template\n\n\"Generate comprehensive FAILING tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n1. **Test Structure**\n   - Framework-appropriate setup (Jest/pytest/JUnit/Go/RSpec)\n   - Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n   - should_X_when_Y naming convention\n   - Isolated fixtures with no interdependencies\n\n2. **Behavior Coverage**\n   - Happy path scenarios\n   - Edge cases (empty, null, boundary values)\n   - Error handling and exceptions\n   - Concurrent access (if applicable)\n\n3. **Failure Verification**\n   - Tests MUST fail when run\n   - Failures for RIGHT reasons (not syntax/import errors)\n   - Meaningful diagnostic error messages\n   - No cascading failures\n\n4. **Test Categories**\n   - Unit: Isolated component behavior\n   - Integration: Component interaction\n   - Contract: API/interface contracts\n   - Property: Mathematical invariants\n\n## Framework Patterns\n\n**JavaScript/TypeScript (Jest/Vitest)**\n- Mock dependencies with `vi.fn()` or `jest.fn()`\n- Use `@testing-library` for React components\n- Property tests with `fast-check`\n\n**Python (pytest)**\n- Fixtures with appropriate scopes\n- Parametrize for multiple test cases\n- Hypothesis for property-based tests\n\n**Go**\n- Table-driven tests with subtests\n- `t.Parallel()` for parallel execution\n- Use `testify/assert` for cleaner assertions\n\n**Ruby (RSpec)**\n- `let` for lazy loading, `let!` for eager\n- Contexts for different scenarios\n- Shared examples for common behavior\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- Readable test names documenting intent\n- One behavior per test\n- No implementation leakage\n- Meaningful test data (not ''foo''/''bar'')\n- Tests serve as living documentation\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Tests passing immediately\n- Testing implementation vs behavior\n- Complex setup code\n- Multiple responsibilities per test\n- Brittle tests tied to specifics\n\n## Edge Case Categories\n\n- **Null/Empty**: undefined, null, empty string/array/object\n- **Boundaries**: min/max values, single element, capacity limits\n- **Special Cases**: Unicode, whitespace, special characters\n- **State**: Invalid transitions, concurrent modifications\n- **Errors**: Network failures, timeouts, permissions\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Complete test files with imports\n- Documentation of test purpose\n- Commands to run and verify failures\n- Metrics: test count, coverage areas\n- Next steps for green phase\"\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generation:\n1. Run tests - confirm they fail\n2. Verify helpful failure messages\n3. Check test independence\n4. Ensure comprehensive coverage\n\n## Example (Minimal)\n\n```typescript\n// auth.service.test.ts\ndescribe(''AuthService'', () => {\n  let authService: AuthService;\n  let mockUserRepo: jest.Mocked<UserRepository>;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    mockUserRepo = { findByEmail: jest.fn() } as any;\n    authService = new AuthService(mockUserRepo);\n  });\n\n  it(''should_return_token_when_valid_credentials'', async () => {\n    const user = { id: ''1'', email: ''test@example.com'', passwordHash: ''hashed'' };\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(user);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''test@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(true);\n    expect(result.token).toBeDefined();\n  });\n\n  it(''should_fail_when_user_not_found'', async () => {\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(null);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''none@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(false);\n    expect(result.error).toBe(''INVALID_CREDENTIALS'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\nTest requirements: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:09:03.398Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Test-Driven Development Agents needing comprehensive test coverage following TDD red phase principles.","zh":"非常适合需要全面测试覆盖的测试驱动开发代理，遵循TDD红色阶段原则。","ja":"TDDレッドフェーズの原則に従った包括的なテストカバレッジが必要なテスト駆動開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"전면적인 테스트 커버리지가 필요한 테스트 주도 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며, TDD 레드 페이즈 원칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que necesitan una cobertura de pruebas integral siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement piloté par les tests nécessitant une couverture de tests complète suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD.","de":"Perfekt für Test-Driven-Development-Agenten, die eine umfassende Testabdeckung nach TDD-Rot-Phasen-Prinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que necessitam de cobertura de teste abrangente seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Test-Driven Development, которым требуется всесторонняя тестовая покрытие, следующая принципам красной фазы TDD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الموجه بالاختبار الذي يحتاج إلى تغطية اختبار شاملة تتبع مبادئ مرحلة TDD الحمراء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agents, ensuring edge case coverage and adherence to TDD red phase principles, including the use of test automation frameworks and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理生成无法通过的测试的能力，以便使用测试自动化代理来正确定义预期行为，确保边缘情况的覆盖以及遵循TDD红色阶段原则，包括使用测试自动化框架和协议。","ja":"テスト自動化エージェントを使用して、期待される動作を適切に定義し、エッジケースのカバレッジとTDDレッドフェーズの原則の遵守を保証するために、失敗するテストを生成するエージェントを Empower します。テスト自動化フレームワークとプロトコルを含みます。","ko":"테스트 자동화 에이전트를 사용하여 기대되는 동작을 올바르게 정의하고, 에지 케이스의 커버리지 및 TDD 레드 페이즈 원칙의 준수를 보장하는 데 필요한 실패하는 테스트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 테스트 자동화 프레임워크 및 프로토콜을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar pruebas fallidas que definan adecuadamente el comportamiento esperado utilizando agentes de automatización de pruebas, garantizando la cobertura de casos límite y el cumplimiento de los principios de la fase roja de TDD, incluido el uso de marcos y protocolos de automatización de pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests échoués qui définissent correctement le comportement attendu en utilisant des agents d''automatisation de tests, garantissant ainsi la couverture des cas limites et le respect des principes de la phase rouge de TDD, y compris l''utilisation de cadres et de protocoles d''automatisation de tests.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, fehlgeschlagene Tests zu generieren, die das erwartete Verhalten unter Verwendung von Testautomatisierungsagenten ordnungsgemäß definieren, und gewährleistet so die Abdeckung von Randfällen und die Einhaltung der TDD-Rot-Phasen-Prinzipien, einschließlich der Verwendung von Testautomatisierungsframeworks und -protokollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar testes com falha que definem adequadamente o comportamento esperado usando agentes de automação de testes, garantindo cobertura de casos de bordo e aderência aos princípios da fase vermelha do TDD, incluindo o uso de estruturas e protocolos de automação de testes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать неудавшиеся тесты, которые правильно определяют ожидаемое поведение с помощью агентов test-automator, обеспечивая покрытие边евых случаев и соблюдение принципов красной фазы TDD, включая использование фреймворков и протоколов тестовой автоматизации.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة تحدد بشكل صحيح السلوك المتوقع باستخدام عميل آلي للاختبار، مما يضمن تغطية الحالات الحدودية والامتثال لمبادئ مرحلة TDD الحمراء، بما في ذلك استخدام إطارات وبروتوكولات أوتوماتيكية للاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating failing tests for new behavior","Creating comprehensive test suites for edge cases","Defining expected behavior for complex systems"],"zh":["为新行为生成无法通过的测试","为边缘情况创建全面测试套件","为复杂系统定义预期行为"],"ja":["新しい動作のために失敗するテストを生成する","エッジケースのための包括的なテストスイートを作成する","複雑なシステムのための期待される動作を定義する"],"ko":["새로운 동작에 대한 실패하는 테스트를 생성하는 것","에지 케이스에 대한 전체적인 테스트套件을 생성하는 것","복잡한 시스템에 대한 기대되는 동작을 정의하는 것"],"es":["Generar pruebas fallidas para nuevo comportamiento","Crear conjuntos de pruebas integrales para casos límite","Definir comportamiento esperado para sistemas complejos"],"fr":["Générer des tests échoués pour un nouveau comportement","Créer des jeux de tests complets pour les cas limites","Définir le comportement attendu pour les systèmes complexes"],"de":["Fehlgeschlagene Tests für neues Verhalten generieren","Umfassende Test-Suiten für Randfälle erstellen","Erwartetes Verhalten für komplexe Systeme definieren"],"pt":["Geração de testes com falha para novo comportamento","Criação de conjuntos de testes abrangentes para casos de bordo","Definição do comportamento esperado para sistemas complexos"],"ru":["Генерация неудавшихся тестов для нового поведения","Создание всесторонних наборов тестов для边евых случаев","Определение ожидаемого поведения для сложных систем"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة لسلوك جديد","إنشاء مجموعات اختبارات شاملة لحالات الحدود","تحديد السلوك المتوقع لأنظمة معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Only applicable during the TDD red phase","Not suitable for performance benchmarks","Tests must be designed to capture expected behavior"],"zh":["仅在TDD红色阶段适用","不适用于性能基准测试","测试必须被设计为捕获预期行为"],"ja":["TDDレッドフェーズ中のみ適用される","パフォーマンスベンチマークには適さない","テストは期待される動作を捕捉するように設計されなければならない"],"ko":["TDD 레드 페이즈 중에만 적용됨","성능 벤치마크에는 적합하지 않음","테스트는 기대되는 동작을 捕获하기 위해 설계되어야 함"],"es":["Solo aplicable durante la fase roja de TDD","No adecuado para benchmarks de rendimiento","Las pruebas deben estar diseñadas para capturar el comportamiento esperado"],"fr":["N''est applicable qu''au cours de la phase rouge de TDD","Non adapté aux benchmarks de performance","Les tests doivent être conçus pour capturer le comportement attendu"],"de":["Nur während der TDD-Rot-Phase anwendbar","Nicht geeignet für Leistungsbenchmarks","Tests müssen so konzipiert sein, dass sie das erwartete Verhalten erfassen"],"pt":["Apenas aplicável durante a fase vermelha do TDD","Não adequado para benchmarks de desempenho","Os testes devem ser projetados para capturar o comportamento esperado"],"ru":["Применимо только во время красной фазы TDD","Не подходит для тестирования производительности","Тесты должны быть разработаны для захвата ожидаемого поведения"],"ar":["محدود فقط لمرحلة TDD الحمراء","غير مناسب لاختبارات الأداء","يجب تصميم الاختبارات لالتقاط السلوك المتوقع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/universal-captp-derivation', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'universal-captp-derivation', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:09:43.602Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/universal-captp-derivation","name":"universal-captp-derivation","description":{"zh":"通用CapTP推导技能是一种跟踪3×3专家poset中GF(3)守恒的能力推导链的技术，基于能力是（种子，索引）元组的核心原则","ja":"ユニバーサルCapTP導出スキルは、3×3の専門家posetにおけるGF(3)の保存を伴う能力導出チェーンを追跡する技術です。能力は（シード、インデックス）タプルであるという核心原則に基づいています","ko":"유니버셜 CapTP 도출 스킬은 3×3 전문가 poset에서 GF(3) 보존을伴う 能力 도출 체인을 추적하는 기술입니다. 능력은 (시드, 인덱스) 튜플이라는 핵심 원리에 기반","es":"La habilidad de derivación universal CapTP traza cadenas de derivación de capacidad a través de un poset de expertos 3×3 con conservación GF(3), basada en el principio de que una capacidad es el par (semilla, índice) y la experiencia es la alineación de trits","fr":"La compétence de déduction universelle CapTP trace des chaînes de déduction de capacité à travers un poset d''experts 3×3 avec conservation GF(3), basée sur le principe qu''une capacité est le couple (semence, index) et l''expertise est l''alignement de trits","de":"Die Fähigkeit der universellen CapTP-Ableitung verfolgt Ableitungsketten von Fähigkeiten durch ein 3×3-Experten-Poset mit GF(3)-Erhaltung, basierend auf dem Prinzip, dass eine Fähigkeit das Tupel (Samen, Index) ist und die Expertise die Ausrichtung von Trits ist","pt":"A derivação universal CapTP é uma técnica que permite rastrear cadeias de derivação de capacidades através de um poset 3×3 com conservação GF(3).","ru":"Универсальное происхождение CapTP — это техника, которая позволяет отслеживать цепочки происхождения возможностей через позет 3×3 с сохранением GF(3).","ar":"استخلاص كابتيب الشامل هو تقنية تسمح بتتبع سلاسل استخلاص القدر