":{"zh":["跟踪3×3专家poset中GF(3)守恒的能力推导链","基于能力是（种子，索引）元组的核心原则","支持多层次的专家poset结构","能够处理复杂的能力推导关系"],"ja":["3×3の専門家posetにおけるGF(3)の保存を伴う能力導出チェーンを追跡","能力は（シード、インデックス）タプルであるという核心原則に基づく","多層の専門家poset構造をサポート","複雑な能力導出関係を処理可能"],"ko":["3×3 전문가 poset에서 GF(3) 보존을伴う 能力 도출 체인을 추적","능력은 (시드, 인덱스) 튜플이라는 핵심 원리에 기반","다층 전문가 poset 구조를 지원","복잡한 능력 도출 관계를 처리 가능"],"es":["Traza cadenas de derivación de capacidad","Utiliza un poset de expertos 3×3","Con conservación GF(3)","Basada en el principio de capacidad como par (semilla, índice)","Incluye alineación de trits como expertise","Aplicable en categorical-games"],"fr":["Trace des chaînes de déduction de capacité","Utilise un poset d''experts 3×3","Avec conservation GF(3)","Basée sur le principe de capacité comme couple (semence, index)","Inclut l''alignement de trits comme expertise","Applicable dans categorical-games"],"de":["Verfolgt Ableitungsketten von Fähigkeiten","Verwendet ein 3×3-Experten-Poset","Mit GF(3)-Erhaltung","Basierend auf dem Prinzip der Fähigkeit als Tupel (Samen, Index)","Inklusive Ausrichtung von Trits als Expertise","Anwendbar in categorical-games"],"pt":["Rastreio de cadeias de derivação de capacidades","Poset 3×3 com conservação GF(3)","Técnica de programação avançada","Desenvolvimento de habilidades em programação","Documentação técnica detalhada"],"ru":["Отслеживание цепочек происхождения возможностей","Позет 3×3 с сохранением GF(3)","Продвинутая техника программирования","Развитие навыков программирования","Детальная техническая документация"],"ar":["تتبع سلاسل استخلاص القدرات","بوزيت 3×3 مع الحفاظ على GF(3)","تقنية برمجة متقدمة","تطوير مهارات البرمجة","توثيق فني مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["通用CapTP推导技能","能力推导链","3×3专家poset","GF(3)守恒","能力是（种子，索引）元组","多层次专家poset结构"],"ja":["ユニバーサルCapTP導出スキル","能力導出チェーン","3×3の専門家poset","GF(3)の保存","能力は（シード、インデックス）タプル","多層の専門家poset構造"],"ko":["유니버셜 CapTP 도출 스킬","능력 도출 체인","3×3 전문가 poset","GF(3) 보존","능력은 (시드, 인덱스) 튜플","다층 전문가 poset 구조"],"es":["derivación universal CapTP","poset de expertos","conservación GF(3)","capacidad como par","alineación de trits","categorical-games","desarrollo de software","tecnologías emergentes"],"fr":["déduction universelle CapTP","poset d''experts","conservation GF(3)","capacité comme couple","alignement de trits","categorical-games","développement de logiciels","technologies émergentes"],"de":["universelle CapTP-Ableitung","Experten-Poset","GF(3)-Erhaltung","Fähigkeit als Tupel","Ausrichtung von Trits","categorical-games","Softwareentwicklung","emergente Technologien"],"pt":["derivação universal CapTP","poset 3×3","conservação GF(3)","programação avançada","desenvolvimento de habilidades","documentação técnica","cadeias de derivação de capacidades"],"ru":["универсальное происхождение CapTP","позет 3×3","сохранение GF(3)","продвинутая программа","развитие навыков","техническая документация","цепочки происхождения возможностей"],"ar":["استخلاص كابتيب الشامل","بوزيت 3×3","الحفاظ على GF(3)","برمجة متقدمة","تطوير مهارات","توثيق فني","سلاسل استخلاص القدرات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"universal-captp-derivation","description":"Universal CapTP Derivation Skill","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Universal CapTP Derivation Skill\n\nTraces capability derivation chains through 3×3 expert poset with GF(3) conservation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> **A capability IS the (seed, index) tuple. Expertise IS the trit alignment.**\n\n## 3×3 Expert Poset Structure\n\n| Layer | Validator (-1) | Coordinator (0) | Generator (+1) | Domain |\n|-------|----------------|-----------------|----------------|--------|\n| 1 | Jules Hedges | John Baez | Fabrizio Genovese | categorical-games |\n| 2 | David Egolf | Mike Shulma","body":"# Universal CapTP Derivation Skill\n\nTraces capability derivation chains through 3×3 expert poset with GF(3) conservation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> **A capability IS the (seed, index) tuple. Expertise IS the trit alignment.**\n\n## 3×3 Expert Poset Structure\n\n| Layer | Validator (-1) | Coordinator (0) | Generator (+1) | Domain |\n|-------|----------------|-----------------|----------------|--------|\n| 1 | Jules Hedges | John Baez | Fabrizio Genovese | categorical-games |\n| 2 | David Egolf | Mike Shulman | sarahzrf | sheaf-theory |\n| 3 | Betweenness | Mantissa | ModalNoah | neural-categorical |\n\n## Derivation Chains\n\n```\ncapability(-1) → vat(0) → invoke(+1)     [spawn-lifecycle]\nmembrane(-1)   → netlayer(0) → lambda(+1) [invoke-path]\nhandoff(-1)    → syrup(0) → sturdy_ref(+1) [transfer-path]\nrevoke(-1)     → promise(0) → goblin(+1)   [revoke-path]\n```\n\n## Superposition States\n\nEach capability exists in superposition across expert domains:\n- **generator-dominant**: Red channel highest (trit=+1)\n- **coordinator-dominant**: Green channel highest (trit=0)\n- **validator-dominant**: Blue channel highest (trit=-1)\n- **superposed**: Balanced RGB\n\n## GF(3) Conservation\n\n```\nTerm Σ + Expert Σ ≡ 0 (mod 3)\n```\n\nCurrent state: **COHERENT** (residue = 0)\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n# Trace derivation chains\npython3 -c \"import duckdb; c=duckdb.connect(''culture_evolution.duckdb''); print(c.execute(''SELECT * FROM derivation_chains'').df())\"\n\n# View expert triads\npython3 -c \"import duckdb; c=duckdb.connect(''culture_evolution.duckdb''); print(c.execute(''SELECT * FROM expert_triads'').df())\"\n\n# Query NOW superposition\npython3 -c \"import duckdb; c=duckdb.connect(''culture_evolution.duckdb''); print(c.execute(''SELECT * FROM now_superposition'').df())\"\n\n# Universal skill derivation\npython3 -c \"import duckdb; c=duckdb.connect(''culture_evolution.duckdb''); print(c.execute(''SELECT * FROM universal_skill_derivation LIMIT 20'').df())\"\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\n| Database | Table/View | Purpose |\n|----------|------------|---------|\n| culture_evolution.duckdb | derivation_chains | CapTP flow traces |\n| culture_evolution.duckdb | expert_triads | 3×3 expert poset |\n| culture_evolution.duckdb | capability_poset | Lattice structure |\n| culture_evolution.duckdb | now_superposition | Current state |\n| culture_evolution.duckdb | universal_skill_derivation | Full matrix |\n| gh_interactome.duckdb | captp_third_party_contributions | Contributor mapping |\n\n## Key Files\n\n- [lib/culture_alter.rb](../../lib/culture_alter.rb) - Stigmergic evolution\n- [lib/color_capability.rb](../../lib/color_capability.rb) - CapTP goblin swarm\n- [lib/interactome_open_games.rb](../../lib/interactome_open_games.rb) - Expert triads\n- [scripts/culture_games.rb](../../scripts/culture_games.rb) - Culture × Open Games\n\n## Trit Assignments\n\n| Trit | Role | Color Channel | Experts |\n|------|------|---------------|---------|\n| -1 | Validator | Blue | Hedges, Egolf, Betweenness |\n| 0 | Coordinator | Green | Baez, Shulman, Mantissa |\n| +1 | Generator | Red | Genovese, sarahzrf, ModalNoah |\n\n\n\n## Scientific Skill Interleaving\n\nThis skill connects to the K-Dense-AI/claude-scientific-skills ecosystem:\n\n### Graph Theory\n- **networkx** [○] via bicomodule\n  - Universal graph hub\n\n### Bibliography References\n\n- `general`: 734 citations in bib.duckdb\n\n\n\n## SDF Interleaving\n\nThis skill connects to **Software Design for Flexibility** (Hanson & Sussman, 2021):\n\n### Primary Chapter: 6. Layering\n\n**Concepts**: layered data, metadata, provenance, units\n\n### GF(3) Balanced Triad\n\n```\nuniversal-captp-derivation (+) + SDF.Ch6 (+) + [balancer] (+) = 0\n```\n\n**Skill Trit**: 1 (PLUS - generation)\n\n### Secondary Chapters\n\n- Ch10: Adventure Game Example\n- Ch1: Flexibility through Abstraction\n\n### Connection Pattern\n\nLayering adds metadata. This skill tracks provenance or annotations.\n## Cat# Integration\n\nThis skill maps to **Cat# = Comod(P)** as a bicomodule in the equipment structure:\n\n```\nTrit: 0 (ERGODIC)\nHome: Prof\nPoly Op: ⊗\nKan Role: Adj\nColor: #26D826\n```\n\n### GF(3) Naturality\n\nThe skill participates in triads satisfying:\n```\n(-1) + (0) + (+1) ≡ 0 (mod 3)\n```\n\nThis ensures compositional coherence in the Cat# equipment structure."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:09:43.602Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Math Agents needing capability derivation chain tracing through expert posets with GF(3) conservation.","zh":"非常适合需要通过专家偏序集进行能力推导链追踪并保持GF(3)守恒的高级数学智能体。","ja":"GF(3)の保存を伴う専門家の偏順集合を介した能力導出チェーンの追跡が必要な高度な数学エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GF(3) 보존과 전문가의 부분 순서 집합을 통한 능력 유도 체인의 추적이 필요한 고급 수학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Matemáticas Avanzadas que necesitan derivar la cadena de trazado de capacidades a través de posets de expertos con conservación GF(3).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de mathématiques avancées ayant besoin de dériver la chaîne de capacités de traçage à travers des posets d''experts avec conservation GF(3).","de":"Perfekt für Advanced-Math-Agents, die eine Fähigkeitsableitungskette durch Experten-Posets mit GF(3)-Erhaltung ableiten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Matemática Avançada que necessitam de capacidade de derivar cadeias de traçado por meio de posets de especialistas com conservação GF(3).","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых математических агентов, которым необходима возможность вывода цепочки возможностей через экспертные поcеты с сохранением GF(3).","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرياضيات المتقدمة الذين يحتاجون إلى القدرة على اشتقاق سلسلة اشتقاق القدرة من خلال مجموعات الخبراء مع الحفاظ على GF(3)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to derive capability chains using a 3×3 expert poset structure, aligning trits with expertise and conserving GF(3), enabling advanced mathematical modeling and analysis.","zh":"赋予智能体使用3×3专家偏序结构推导能力链的能力，将三进制数与专业知识对齐，并保持GF(3)不变，从而实现高级数学建模和分析。","ja":"3×3の専門家の偏順集合構造を使用して能力チェーンを導出する機能をエージェントに与え、トリットを専門知識と一致させ、GF(3)を保存することで、高度な数学モデリングと分析を可能にします。","ko":"3×3 전문가의 부분 순서 구조를 사용하여 능력 체인을 유도하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여, 트리트를 전문 지식과 일치시키고 GF(3)를 보존함으로써 고급 수학 모델링 및 분석을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a derivar cadenas de capacidades utilizando una estructura de poset de expertos 3×3, alineando trits con la experiencia y conservando GF(3), lo que permite modelado y análisis matemáticos avanzados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de dériver des chaînes de capacités en utilisant une structure de poset d''experts 3×3, en alignant les trits avec l''expertise et en conservant GF(3), permettant ainsi la modélisation et l''analyse mathématiques avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Fähigkeitsketten unter Verwendung einer 3×3-Experten-Poset-Struktur abzuleiten, Trits mit Expertenwissen auszurichten und GF(3) zu erhalten, wodurch erweiterte mathematische Modellierung und Analyse ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a derivarem cadeias de capacidade usando uma estrutura de poset de especialista 3×3, alinhando trits com especialização e conservando GF(3), permitindo modelagem e análise matemática avançada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вывода цепочки возможностей с использованием структуры экспертного поcета 3×3, выравнивая триты с опытом и сохраняя GF(3), что позволяет выполнять продвинутую математическую модель и анализ.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على اشتقاق سلسلة القدرة باستخدام هيكل مجموعة الخبراء 3×3، وترتيب التريتس مع التخصص والحفاظ على GF(3)، مما يتيح النمذجة والتحليل الرياضي المتقدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Tracing capability derivation chains through categorical games","Aligning trits with expertise in GF(3) conservation","Deriving capability chains using a 3×3 expert poset structure"],"zh":["通过分类游戏追踪能力推导链","在GF(3)守恒中将三进制数与专业知识对齐","使用3×3专家偏序结构推导能力链"],"ja":["カテゴリゲームを介した能力導出チェーンの追跡","GF(3)保存におけるトリットと専門知識の統合","3×3の専門家の偏順集合構造を使用した能力チェーンの導出"],"ko":["분류 게임을 통한 능력 유도 체인의 추적","GF(3) 보존에서의 트리트와 전문 지식의 일치","3×3 전문가의 부분 순서 구조를 사용한 능력 체인의 유도"],"es":["Seguir cadenas de derivación de capacidades a través de juegos categóricos","Alinear trits con la experiencia en la conservación de GF(3)","Derivar cadenas de capacidades utilizando una estructura de poset de expertos 3×3"],"fr":["Traçer des chaînes de dérivation de capacités à travers des jeux catégoriels","Aligner les trits avec l''expertise dans la conservation de GF(3)","Dériver des chaînes de capacités en utilisant une structure de poset d''experts 3×3"],"de":["Ableiten von Fähigkeitsableitungsketten durch kategorische Spiele","Ausrichten von Trits mit Expertenwissen in der GF(3)-Erhaltung","Ableiten von Fähigkeitsketten unter Verwendung einer 3×3-Experten-Poset-Struktur"],"pt":["Rastrear cadeias de derivação de capacidade por meio de jogos categóricos","Alinhar trits com especialização na conservação GF(3)","Derivar cadeias de capacidade usando uma estrutura de poset de especialista 3×3"],"ru":["Отслеживать цепочки вывода возможностей через категориальные игры","Выравнивать триты с опытом в сохранении GF(3)","Выводить цепочки возможностей с использованием структуры экспертного поcета 3×3"],"ar":["تتبع سلسلة اشتقاق القدرة من خلال ألعاب مجسمة","ترتيب التريتس مع التخصص في الحفاظ على GF(3)","اشتقاق سلسلة القدرة باستخدام هيكل مجموعة الخبراء 3×3"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of GF(3) and expert posets","Limited to 3×3 expert poset structure","Domain-specific to categorical games"],"zh":["需要了解GF(3)和专家偏序集","仅限于3×3专家偏序结构","仅适用于分类游戏"],"ja":["GF(3)と専門家の偏順集合の理解が必要","3×3の専門家の偏順集合構造に限定される","カテゴリゲームに特有"],"ko":["GF(3)와 전문가의 부분 순서 집합에 대한 이해가 필요","3×3 전문가의 부분 순서 구조에만 제한","분류 게임에 특정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de GF(3) y posets de expertos","Limitado a la estructura de poset de expertos 3×3","Específico de dominio para juegos categóricos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de GF(3) et de posets d''experts","Limité à la structure de poset d''experts 3×3","Spécifique au domaine des jeux catégoriels"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von GF(3) und Experten-Posets","Begrenzt auf die 3×3-Experten-Poset-Struktur","Domänen-spezifisch für kategorische Spiele"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de GF(3) e posets de especialistas","Limitado à estrutura de poset de especialista 3×3","Específico de domínio para jogos categóricos"],"ru":["Требует понимания GF(3) и экспертных поcетов","Ограничен структурами экспертных поcетов 3×3","Доменно-специфичен для категориальных игр"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم GF(3) ومجموعات الخبراء","محدود بهيكل مجموعة الخبراء 3×3","محدد النطاق لمجموعة ألعاب مجسمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
