ls-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["代码示例验证","文档字符串验证","Pytest 集成","方便的测试功能","自动化测试"],"ja":["コード例の検証","ドキュメント文字列の検証","Pytest 統合","便利なテスト機能","自動化テスト"],"ko":["코드 예시 확인","문서 문자열 확인","Pytest 통합","편리한 테스트 기능","자동화 테스트"],"pt":["Validação de exemplos de código em documentação","Integração com Pytest","Suporte a múltiplos parsers de código","Documentação detalhada e de fácil uso","Instalação simples via pip"],"ru":["Проверка примеров кода в документации","Интеграция с Pytest","Поддержка нескольких парсеров кода","Дetailed и простая в использовании документация","Простая установка через pip"],"ar":["التحقق من الأمثلة البرمجية في الوثائق","التكامل مع باي تيست","دعم متعددة لمحلل الكود","وثائق مفصلة وسهلة الاستخدام","التثبيت البسيط عبر باي بى آي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sybil","文档测试","代码示例","文档字符串","Pytest","自动化测试","代码验证"],"ja":["Sybil","ドキュメントテスト","コード例","ドキュメント文字列","Pytest","自動化テスト","コード検証"],"ko":["Sybil","문서 테스트","코드 예시","문서 문자열","Pytest","자동화 테스트","코드 확인"],"pt":["validação de código","documentação de código","pytest","parsers de código","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["проверка кода","документация кода","pytest","парсеры кода","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["التحقق من الكود","وثائق الكود","باي تيست","محرلات الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sybil","description":"Use Sybil for testing code examples in documentation and docstrings. Covers pytest integration, parsers, skip directives, and namespace management.","bodyPreview":"# Sybil Documentation Testing\n\nSybil validates code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs.\n\n**Official Documentation**: https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install sybil[pytest]\n```\n\n## Pytest Integration\n\nConfigure in `conftest.py`. See [pytest integration docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/integration.html#pytest-integration).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.parsers.m","body":"# Sybil Documentation Testing\n\nSybil validates code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs.\n\n**Official Documentation**: https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install sybil[pytest]\n```\n\n## Pytest Integration\n\nConfigure in `conftest.py`. See [pytest integration docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/integration.html#pytest-integration).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import PythonCodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[\n        SkipParser(),\n        PythonCodeBlockParser(),\n    ],\n    patterns=[\"*.md\", \"**/*.py\"],\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Sybil Parameters\n\nSee [API reference](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#sybil.Sybil).\n\n| Parameter        | Description                                                     |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `parsers`        | Sequence of parser callables                                    |\n| `patterns`       | File glob patterns to include (e.g., `[\"*.md\", \"src/**/*.py\"]`) |\n| `excludes`       | File glob patterns to exclude                                   |\n| `setup`          | Callable receiving namespace dict, called before each document  |\n| `teardown`       | Callable receiving namespace dict, called after each document   |\n| `fixtures`       | List of pytest fixture names to inject into namespace           |\n| `document_types` | Map file extensions to Document classes                         |\n\n### Document Types\n\nSee [API reference](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#documents).\n\n- **Default**: Parse entire file\n- `PythonDocument`: Import `.py` file as module, names available in namespace\n- `PythonDocStringDocument`: Parse only docstrings from `.py` files\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.document import PythonDocStringDocument\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    patterns=[\"src/**/*.py\"],\n    document_types={\".py\": PythonDocStringDocument},\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Fixtures\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom sybil import Sybil\n\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef my_fixture():\n    return {\"key\": \"value\"}\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    patterns=[\"*.md\"],\n    fixtures=[\"my_fixture\"],  # Available in document namespace\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Setup/Teardown\n\n```python\ndef sybil_setup(namespace):\n    namespace[\"helper\"] = lambda x: x * 2\n\n\ndef sybil_teardown(namespace):\n    pass  # Cleanup if needed\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    setup=sybil_setup,\n    teardown=sybil_teardown,\n).pytest()\n```\n\n## Disable pytest''s Built-in Doctest\n\nAdd to `pyproject.toml` to prevent conflicts:\n\n```toml\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\naddopts = \"-p no:doctest\"\n```\n\n## Markdown Parsers\n\nSee [Markdown parsers docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import PythonCodeBlockParser, CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.clear import ClearNamespaceParser\n```\n\n## Skip Directives\n\nSee [skip directive docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#skipping-examples).\n\n**SkipParser must come before other parsers** to handle skip directives.\n\n````markdown\n<!-- skip: next -->\n\n```python\n# This example is skipped\n```\n````\n\n<!-- skip: next \"reason for skipping\" -->\n\n```python\n# Skipped and reported as skipped test with reason\n```\n\n<!-- skip: start -->\n\n```python\n# Multiple examples\n```\n\n```python\n# All skipped\n```\n\n<!-- skip: end -->\n\n<!-- skip: next if(condition_var) -->\n\n```python\n# Conditionally skipped based on namespace variable\n```\n\n````\n## Invisible Code Blocks\n\nSetup code that doesn''t render in documentation. See [invisible code blocks docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#invisible-code-blocks).\n\n```markdown\n<!-- invisible-code-block: python\nsetup_var = \"hidden setup\"\n-->\n````\n\n## Clear Namespace\n\nReset the document namespace for isolation. See [clear namespace docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#clearing-the-namespace).\n\n```markdown\n<!-- clear-namespace -->\n```\n\n## Custom Evaluators\n\nSee [evaluators API](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#evaluators).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.evaluators.python import PythonEvaluator\n\n# Custom evaluator with future imports\nevaluator = PythonEvaluator(future_imports=[\"annotations\"])\n\nparser = CodeBlockParser(language=\"python\", evaluator=evaluator)\n```\n\n## Running Sybil Tests\n\nSybil tests are collected like regular pytest tests. To run only Sybil tests:\n\n```bash\n# Run tests from specific directory containing documented code\npytest src/mypackage/ -v\n\n# Exclude regular tests, only run documentation examples\npytest docs/ -v\n```\n\nTo exclude Sybil tests from regular test runs, use pytest''s `--ignore` flag or configure `addopts` in `pyproject.toml`.\n\n## Example: Complete conftest.py\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Sybil configuration for docstring testing.\"\"\"\n\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.document import PythonDocStringDocument\nfrom sybil.evaluators.python import PythonEvaluator\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\n\nimport mypackage\n\n\ndef sybil_setup(namespace):\n    \"\"\"Pre-populate namespace for all examples.\"\"\"\n    namespace[\"pkg\"] = mypackage\n\n\ndef sybil_teardown(namespace):\n    \"\"\"Cleanup after document.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[\n        SkipParser(),\n        CodeBlockParser(language=\"python\", evaluator=PythonEvaluator()),\n        CodeBlockParser(language=\"py\", evaluator=PythonEvaluator()),\n    ],\n    patterns=[\"src/mypackage/**/*.py\"],\n    document_types={\".py\": PythonDocStringDocument},\n    setup=sybil_setup,\n    teardown=sybil_teardown,\n    excludes=[\n        \"**/tests/**\",\n        \"**/_internal/**\",\n    ],\n).pytest()\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:10:19.814Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced code validation and documentation testing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级代码验证和文档测试功能的Python分析代理。","ja":"Python分析エージェントが高度なコード検証およびドキュメントのテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 코드 검증 및 문서 테스트 기능이 필요한 파이썬 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan validación de código avanzada y capacidades de prueba de documentación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant une validation de code avancée et des capacités de test de documentation.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Code-Validierung und Dokumentationstestfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que precisam de validação de código avançada e capacidades de teste de documentação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым необходима продвинутая проверка кода и возможности тестирования документации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق المتقدم من الشفرة وقدرات اختبار الوثائق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs using pytest integration and Python libraries.","zh":"使代理能够通过解析和执行pytest集成和Python库来验证文档和docstring中的代码示例，以实现正常的测试运行。","ja":"エージェントがドキュメントおよびdocstring内のコード例を解析および実行して検証できるようにし、pytest統合およびPythonライブラリを使用して通常のテスト実行を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 문서 및 docstring 내의 코드 예시를 파싱하고 실행하여 검증할 수 있도록 하며, pytest 통합 및 Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 일반적인 테스트 실행을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar ejemplos de código incrustados en la documentación y cadenas de documentación analizando y ejecutándolos como parte de las pruebas normales utilizando la integración de pytest y bibliotecas de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les exemples de code intégrés dans la documentation et les docstrings en les analysant et en les exécutant dans le cadre de l''exécution des tests normaux en utilisant l''intégration de pytest et les bibliothèques Python.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Codebeispiele in der Dokumentation und Docstrings zu validieren, indem sie diese als Teil der normalen Testläufe mithilfe der Pytest-Integration und Python-Bibliotheken analysieren und ausführen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar exemplos de código incorporados na documentação e docstrings, analisando e executando-os como parte de execuções de teste normais usando a integração do pytest e bibliotecas Python.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять примеры кода, встроенные в документацию и docstrings, анализируя и выполняя их как часть обычных запусков тестов с использованием интеграции pytest и библиотек Python.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من التحقق من أمثلة الشفرة المضمنة في وثائق المستندات والتعليقات التوضيحية من خلال تحليلها وتنفيذها كجزء من تشغيل الاختبارات العادي باستخدام دمج pytest ومكتبات بايثون."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating code examples in documentation","Testing docstrings for accuracy","Automating code validation as part of CI/CD pipelines"],"zh":["验证文档中的代码示例","测试docstring的准确性","自动将代码验证作为CI/CD流水线的一部分"],"ja":["ドキュメント内のコード例の検証","docstringの正確性のテスト","コード検証をCI/CDパイプラインの一部とし