ui propose des fonctionnalités telles que la conversion, l''extraction, la fusion et plus pour les développeurs","de":"PDF.co ist eine PDF-Verarbeitungs-API, die Funktionen wie Konvertierung, Extraktion, Fusion und mehr für Entwickler bietet","pt":"A API pdfco é uma solução completa para processamento de PDF, permitindo conversão, extração, mesclagem e compressão de arquivos PDF","ru":"API pdfco является полным решением для обработки PDF, позволяющим конвертировать, извлекать, сливать и сжимать файлы PDF","ar":"واجهة برمجة تطبيقات pdfco هي حل كامل لمعالجة ملفات PDF، مما يسمح بالتحويل والاستخراج والدمج والضغط","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["PDF","OCR","PDF","PDF","PDF","HTML/URL"],"ja":["PDF","OCR","PDF","PDF","PDF","HTML/URL"],"ko":["PDF","OCR","PDF","PDF","PDF","HTML/URL"],"es":["Conversión de PDF a CSV, JSON y otros formatos","Fusión de múltiples PDF en uno","División de PDF en varios archivos","Compresión de PDF para reducir el tamaño del archivo","Conversión de HTML/URL a PDF","Análisis de facturas y documentos con IA"],"fr":["Conversion de PDF en CSV, JSON et d''autres formats","Fusion de plusieurs PDF en un seul","Division de PDF en plusieurs fichiers","Compression de PDF pour réduire la taille du fichier","Conversion d''HTML/URL en PDF","Analyse de factures et de documents avec l''IA"],"de":["Konvertierung von PDF in CSV, JSON und andere Formate","Fusion von mehreren PDF-Dateien in eine","Aufteilung von PDF-Dateien in mehrere Dateien","Komprimierung von PDF-Dateien, um die Dateigröße zu reduzieren","Konvertierung von HTML/URL in PDF","Analyse von Rechnungen und Dokumenten mit KI"],"pt":["Conversão de PDF para CSV, JSON e outros formatos","Extração de texto de arquivos PDF com suporte a OCR","Mesclagem de múltiplos arquivos PDF em um","Compressão de arquivos PDF para reduzir o tamanho do arquivo","Conversão de HTML/URL para PDF"],"ru":["Конвертация PDF в CSV, JSON и другие форматы","Извлечение текста из файлов PDF с поддержкой OCR","Слияние нескольких файлов PDF в один","Сжатие файлов PDF для уменьшения размера файла","Конвертация HTML/URL в PDF"],"ar":["تحويل PDF إلى CSV و JSON وتنسيقات أخرى","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF مع دعم OCR","دمج ملفات PDF متعددة في ملف واحد","ضغط ملفات PDF لتقليل حجم الملف","تحويل HTML/URL إلى PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF.co","PDF","OCR","PDF","PDF","HTML/URL","API"],"ja":["PDF.co","PDF","OCR","PDF","PDF","HTML/URL","API"],"ko":["PDF.co","PDF","OCR","PDF","PDF","HTML/URL","API"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","api de pdf","conversión de pdf","extracción de pdf","fusión de pdf","compresión de pdf","desarrollo de pdf","pdf para desarrolladores","herramientas de pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","api de pdf","conversion de pdf","extraction de pdf","fusion de pdf","compression de pdf","développement de pdf","pdf pour développeurs","outils de pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","pdf-api","pdf-konvertierung","pdf-extraktion","pdf-fusion","pdf-komprimierung","pdf-entwicklung","pdf-für-entwickler","pdf-tools"],"pt":["API de processamento de PDF","conversão de PDF","extração de texto de PDF","mesclagem de PDF","compressão de PDF","OCR para PDF"],"ru":["API для обработки PDF","конвертация PDF","извлечение текста из PDF","слияние PDF","сжатие PDF","OCR для PDF"],"ar":["واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لمعالجة PDF","تحويل PDF","استخراج النص من PDF","دمج PDF","ضغط PDF","OCR لملفات PDF"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdfco","description":"PDF processing API for conversion, extraction, merging, splitting and more","bodyPreview":"# PDF.co\n\nAll-in-one PDF processing API. Convert, extract, merge, split, compress PDFs and more. Supports OCR for scanned documents.\n\n> Official docs: https://docs.pdf.co/\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n\n- Extract text from PDF files (with OCR support)\n- Convert PDF to CSV, JSON, or other formats\n- Merge multiple PDFs into one\n- Split PDF into multiple files\n- Compress PDF to reduce file size\n- Convert HTML/URL to PDF\n- Parse invoices and documents with AI\n\n---\n\n## Prereq","body":"# PDF.co\n\nAll-in-one PDF processing API. Convert, extract, merge, split, compress PDFs and more. Supports OCR for scanned documents.\n\n> Official docs: https://docs.pdf.co/\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n\n- Extract text from PDF files (with OCR support)\n- Convert PDF to CSV, JSON, or other formats\n- Merge multiple PDFs into one\n- Split PDF into multiple files\n- Compress PDF to reduce file size\n- Convert HTML/URL to PDF\n- Parse invoices and documents with AI\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. Create an account at https://pdf.co/\n2. Get your API key from https://app.pdf.co/\n\nSet environment variable:\n\n```bash\nexport PDFCO_API_KEY=\"your-email@example.com_your-api-key\"\n```\n\n---\n\n\n> **Important:** When using `$VAR` in a command that pipes to another command, wrap the command containing `$VAR` in `bash -c ''...''`. Due to a Claude Code bug, environment variables are silently cleared when pipes are used directly.\n> ```bash\n> bash -c ''curl -s \"https://api.example.com\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer $API_KEY\"''\n> ```\n\n## How to Use\n\n### 1. PDF to Text\n\nExtract text from PDF with OCR support:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-to-text/sample.pdf\",\n  \"inline\": true\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/to/text\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n**With specific pages (1-indexed):**\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-to-text/sample.pdf\",\n  \"pages\": \"1-3\",\n  \"inline\": true\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/to/text\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 2. PDF to CSV\n\nConvert PDF tables to CSV:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-to-csv/sample.pdf\",\n  \"inline\": true\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/to/csv\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 3. Merge PDFs\n\nCombine multiple PDFs into one:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-merge/sample1.pdf,https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-merge/sample2.pdf\",\n  \"name\": \"merged.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/merge\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 4. Split PDF\n\nSplit PDF by page ranges:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-split/sample.pdf\",\n  \"pages\": \"1-2,3-\"\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/split\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 5. Compress PDF\n\nReduce PDF file size:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/pdf-optimize/sample.pdf\",\n  \"name\": \"compressed.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/optimize\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 6. HTML to PDF\n\nConvert HTML or URL to PDF:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"html\": \"<h1>Hello World</h1><p>This is a test.</p>\",\n  \"name\": \"output.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/from/html\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n**From URL:**\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"webpage.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/from/url\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 7. AI Invoice Parser\n\nExtract structured data from invoices:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdfco-test-files.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/ai-invoice-parser/sample-invoice.pdf\",\n  \"inline\": true\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/ai-invoice-parser\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 8. Upload Local File\n\nUpload a local file first, then use the returned URL:\n\n**Step 1: Get presigned upload URL**\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl -s \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/file/upload/get-presigned-url?name=myfile.pdf&contenttype=application/pdf\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\"'' | jq -r ''.presignedUrl, .url''\n```\n\nCopy the presigned URL and file URL from the response.\n\n**Step 2: Upload file**\n\nReplace `<presigned-url>` with the URL from Step 1:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X PUT \"<presigned-url>\" --header \"Content-Type: application/pdf\" --data-binary @/path/to/your/file.pdf\n```\n\n**Step 3: Use file URL in subsequent API calls**\n\nReplace `<file-url>` with the file URL from Step 1:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"<file-url>\",\n  \"inline\": true\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/to/text\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n### 9. Async Mode (Large Files)\n\nFor large files, use async mode to avoid timeouts:\n\n**Step 1: Start async job**\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/large-file.pdf\",\n  \"async\": true\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl -s --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/pdf/convert/to/text\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json'' | jq -r ''.jobId''\n```\n\nCopy the job ID from the response.\n\n**Step 2: Check job status**\n\nReplace `<job-id>` with the job ID from Step 1:\n\nWrite to `/tmp/request.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"jobid\": \"<job-id>\"\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nbash -c ''curl --location --request POST \"https://api.pdf.co/v1/job/check\" --header \"x-api-key: ${PDFCO_API_KEY}\" --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @/tmp/request.json''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | string | URL to source file (required) |\n| `inline` | boolean | Return result in response body |\n| `async` | boolean | Run as background job |\n| `pages` | string | Page range, **1-indexed** (e.g., \"1-3\", \"1,3,5\", \"2-\") |\n| `name` | string | Output filename |\n| `password` | string | PDF password if protected |\n| `expiration` | integer | Output link expiration in minutes (default: 60) |\n\n---\n\n## Response Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://pdf-temp-files.s3.amazonaws.com/.../result.pdf\",\n  \"pageCount\": 5,\n  \"error\": false,\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"name\": \"result.pdf\",\n  \"credits\": 10,\n  \"remainingCredits\": 9990\n}\n```\n\nWith `inline: true`, the response includes `body` field with extracted content.\n\n---\n\n## API Endpoints\n\n| Endpoint | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `/pdf/convert/to/text` | PDF to text (OCR supported) |\n| `/pdf/convert/to/csv` | PDF to CSV |\n| `/pdf/convert/to/json` | PDF to JSON |\n| `/pdf/merge` | Merge multiple PDFs |\n| `/pdf/split` | Split PDF by pages |\n| `/pdf/optimize` | Compress PDF |\n| `/pdf/convert/from/html` | HTML to PDF |\n| `/pdf/convert/from/url` | URL to PDF |\n| `/ai-invoice-parser` | AI-powered invoice parsing |\n| `/document-parser` | Template-based document parsing |\n| `/file/upload/get-presigned-url` | Get upload URL |\n| `/job/check` | Check async job status |\n\n---\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **File Sources**: Use direct URLs or upload files first via presigned URL\n2. **Large Files**: Use `async: true` for files over 40 pages or 10MB\n3. **OCR**: Automatically enabled for scanned PDFs (set `lang` for non-English)\n4. **Rate Limits**: Check your plan at https://pdf.co/pricing\n5. **Output Expiration**: Download results within expiration time (default 60 min)\n6. **Credits**: Each operation costs credits; check `remainingCredits` in response\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:10:21.568Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Processing Agents needing advanced PDF manipulation capabilities with OCR support","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF操作能力和OCR支持的文档处理代理","ja":"高度なPDF操作機能とOCRサポートが必要な文書処理エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 PDF 조작 기능과 OCR 지원이 필요한 문서 처리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Procesamiento de Documentos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de PDF con soporte OCR","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Traitement de Documents nécessitant des capacités avancées de manipulation de PDF avec prise en charge OCR","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenverarbeitungsagenten, die erweiterte PDF-Manipulationsfunktionen mit OCR-Unterstützung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de manipulação de PDF com suporte a OCR","ru":"Идеально для агентов обработки документов, требующих расширенных возможностей манипулирования PDF с поддержкой OCR","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معالجة المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности متقدمة لتعديل ملفات PDF مع دعم OCR"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text from PDF files, convert PDF to CSV, JSON, or other formats, and parse invoices and documents with AI using the PDF.co API, supporting protocols like OCR for scanned documents and file formats like PDF, CSV, and JSON","zh":"赋予代理从PDF文件中提取文本的能力，转换PDF为CSV、JSON或其他格式，并使用PDF.co API和OCR等协议解析发票和文档","ja":"エージェントがPDFファイルからテキストを抽出する機能を提供し、PDFをCSV、JSON、その他の形式に変換し、PDF.co APIとOCRなどのプロトコルを使用して請求書や文書を解析する","ko":"에이전트가 PDF 파일에서 텍스트를 추출하고 PDF를 CSV, JSON 또는 다른 형식으로 변환하며 PDF.co API와 OCR 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 청구서 및 문서를 해석할 수 있는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto de archivos PDF, convertir PDF a CSV, JSON u otros formatos, y analizar facturas y documentos con IA utilizando la API de PDF.co, que admite protocolos como OCR para documentos escaneados y formatos de archivo como PDF, CSV y JSON","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte à partir de fichiers PDF, de convertir des PDF en CSV, JSON ou d''autres formats, et d''analyser des factures et des documents avec l''IA en utilisant l''API PDF.co, qui prend en charge des protocoles tels que l''OCR pour les documents scannés et des formats de fichiers tels que PDF, CSV et JSON","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Text aus PDF-Dateien zu extrahieren, PDF in CSV, JSON oder andere Formate umzuwandeln und Rechnungen und Dokumente mit KI unter Verwendung der PDF.co-API zu analysieren, die Protokolle wie OCR für gescannte Dokumente und Dateiformate wie PDF, CSV und JSON unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto de arquivos PDF, converter PDF para CSV, JSON ou outros formatos e analisar notas fiscais e documentos com IA usando a API PDF.co, que suporta protocolos como OCR para documentos digitalizados e formatos de arquivo como PDF, CSV e JSON","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст из файлов PDF, преобразовывать PDF в CSV, JSON или другие форматы, и парсить счета-фактуры и документы с помощью ИИ, используя API PDF.co, поддерживающую протоколы, такие как OCR для сканированных документов и форматы файлов, такие как PDF, CSV и JSON","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استخراج النص من ملفات PDF، وتحويل PDF إلى CSV أو JSON أو صيغ أخرى، وتحليل الفواتير والوثائق باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات PDF.co، والتي تدعم بروتوكولات مثل OCR للوثائق الممسوحة ضوئياً وتنسيقات الملفات مثل PDF و CSV و JSON"},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from scanned PDF documents using OCR","Converting HTML pages to PDF files","Merging multiple PDF reports into a single file"],"zh":["使用OCR从扫描的PDF文档中提取文本","将HTML页面转换为PDF文件","合并多个PDF报告到一个文件中"],"ja":["OCRを使用してスキャナPDF文書からテキストを抽出する","HTMLページをPDFファイルに変換する","複数のPDFレポートを1つのファイルに結合する"],"ko":["OCR을 사용하여 스캔된 PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 추출하는 것","HTML 페이지를 PDF 파일로 변환하는 것","여러 개의 PDF 보고서를 하나의 파일로 병합하는 것"],"es":["Extraer texto de documentos PDF escaneados utilizando OCR","Convertir páginas HTML en archivos PDF","Combinar varios informes PDF en un solo archivo"],"fr":["Extraire du texte à partir de documents PDF scannés en utilisant l''OCR","Convertir des pages HTML en fichiers PDF","Fusionner plusieurs rapports PDF en un seul fichier"],"de":["Text aus gescannten PDF-Dokumenten mithilfe von OCR extrahieren","HTML-Seiten in PDF-Dateien umwandeln","Mehrere PDF-Berichte in eine einzige Datei zusammenführen"],"pt":["Extrair texto de documentos PDF digitalizados usando OCR","Converter páginas HTML em arquivos PDF","Mesclar vários relatórios PDF em um único arquivo"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из сканированных документов PDF с помощью OCR","Преобразование страниц HTML в файлы PDF","Объединение нескольких отчетов PDF в один файл"],"ar":["استخراج النص من ملفات PDF الممسوحة ضوئياً باستخدام OCR","تحويل صفحات HTML إلى ملفات PDF","دمج عدة تقارير PDF في ملف واحد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PDF.co API access","Dependent on API request limits and OCR accuracy"],"zh":["需要访问PDF.co API","依赖于API请求限制和OCR准确性"],"ja":["PDF.co APIへのアクセスが必要","APIリクエストの制限とOCRの精度に依存する"],"ko":["PDF.co API에 접근할 수 있는 권한이 필요","API 요청 제한 및 OCR 정확도에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de PDF.co","Dependiente de los límites de solicitudes de API y la precisión de OCR"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API PDF.co","Dépend des limites de requêtes API et de la précision de l''OCR"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die PDF.co-API","Abhängig von API-Anfragegrenzen und OCR-Genauigkeit"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API PDF.co","Dependente dos limites de solicitação de API e precisão da OCR"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API PDF.co","Зависит от ограничений запросов API и точности OCR"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات PDF.co","يعتمد على حدود الطلبات لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات ودقة OCR"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/brevo', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'brevo', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:11:13.723Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/brevo","name":"brevo","description":{"zh":"Brevo 是一个综合的联系人和电子邮件营销管理平台，提供创建、读取、更新和删除联系人、联系人列表、电子邮件营销活动和模板的功能","ja":"Brevo はコンタクトとメールマーケティングの総合管理プラットフォームで、コンタクト、コンタクトリスト、メールマーケティングキャンペーン、テンプレートの作成、読み取り、更新、削除機能を提供します","ko":"Brevo는 종합적인 연락처 및 이메일 마케팅 관리 플랫폼으로, 연락처, 연락처 목록, 이메일 마케팅 캠페인, 템플릿의 생성, 읽기, 업데이트, 삭제 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Brevo es una herramienta para gestionar contactos, listas de contactos, campañas de email y plantillas de manera integral","fr":"Brevo est un outil pour gérer les contacts, les listes de contacts, les campagnes email et les modèles de manière intégrée","de":"Brevo ist ein Werkzeug zur Verwaltung von Kontakten, Kontaktlisten, E-Mail-Kampagnen und Vorlagen in einem integralen Ansatz","pt":"O Brevo é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de contatos e campanhas de email que permite criar, ler, atualizar e excluir contatos, listas de contatos e campanhas de email. Além disso, é possível visualizar modelos de email.","ru":"Brevo - это инструмент управления контактами и электронными кампаниями, который позволяет создавать, читать, обновлять и удалять контакты, списки контактов и электронные кампании. Кроме того, можно просматривать шаблоны электронной почты.","ar":"بريفو هو أداة لإدارة جهات الاتصال والحملات البريدية التي تسمح بإنشاء وقراءة وتحديث وحذف جهات الاتصال وقوائم جهات الاتصال والحملات البريدية. بالإضافة إلى ذلك، يمكن عرض قوالب البريد الإلكتروني.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Brevo 技术文档：全面管理联系人和电子邮件营销","ja":"Brevo 技術ドキュメント：コンタクトとメールマーケティングの総合管理",