 관리","CRUD 작업"],"es":["Gestión de contactos","Gestión de listas de contactos","Creación y edición de campañas de email","Gestión de plantillas de email","Acceso a sublistas de contactos","Creación de campañas de email personalizadas"],"fr":["Gestion de contacts","Gestion de listes de contacts","Création et édition de campagnes email","Gestion de modèles de email","Accès à des sous-listes de contacts","Création de campagnes email personnalisées"],"de":["Kontaktverwaltung","Kontaktlistenverwaltung","Erstellung und Bearbeitung von E-Mail-Kampagnen","Vorlagenverwaltung","Zugriff auf Teillisten von Kontakten","Erstellung von personalisierten E-Mail-Kampagnen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de contatos","Gerenciamento de listas de contatos","Criação e gerenciamento de campanhas de email","Visualização de modelos de email","Funcionalidades de CRUD para contatos e listas de contatos","Funcionalidades de CRUD para campanhas de email"],"ru":["Управление контактами","Управление списками контактов","Создание и управление электронными кампаниями","Просмотр шаблонов электронной почты","Функции CRUD для контактов и списков контактов","Функции CRUD для электронных кампаний"],"ar":["إدارة جهات الاتصال","إدارة قوائم جهات الاتصال","إنشاء وإدارة الحملات البريدية","عرض قوالب البريد الإلكتروني","وظائف CRUD لجهات الاتصال وقوائم جهات الاتصال","وظائف CRUD للحملات البريدية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Brevo","联系人管理","电子邮件营销","CRUD 操作","模板管理","联系人列表管理","电子邮件营销活动管理"],"ja":["Brevo","コンタクト管理","メールマーケティング","CRUD 操作","テンプレート管理","コンタクトリスト管理","メールマーケティングキャンペーン管理"],"ko":["Brevo","연락처 관리","이메일 마케팅","CRUD 작업","템플릿 관리","연락처 목록 관리","이메일 마케팅 캠페인 관리"],"es":["gestión de contactos","campañas de email","plantillas de email","registros de habilidades","Claude Code","desarrollo de software","herramientas de marketing","gestión de listas de contactos","automatización de marketing"],"fr":["gestion de contacts","campagnes email","modèles de email","registres de compétences","Claude Code","développement de logiciels","outils de marketing","gestion de listes de contacts","automatisation de marketing"],"de":["Kontaktverwaltung","E-Mail-Kampagnen","E-Mail-Vorlagen","Fähigkeitsregister","Claude Code","Software-Entwicklung","Marketing-Tools","Kontaktlistenverwaltung","Marketing-Automatisierung"],"pt":["Brevo","gerenciamento de contatos","campanhas de email","CRUD","contatos","listas de contatos","modelos de email","ferramenta de gerenciamento","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Brevo","управление контактами","электронные кампании","CRUD","контакты","списки контактов","шаблоны электронной почты","инструмент управления","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["بريفو","إدارة جهات الاتصال","الحملات البريدية","CRUD","جهات الاتصال","قوائم جهات الاتصال","قوالب البريد الإلكتروني","أداة الإدارة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brevo","description":"Full access to Brevo (email marketing, newsletters) using curl and the Brevo REST API directly - no MCP server or additional dependencies required.","bodyPreview":"# Brevo Skill\n\nAccess Brevo to manage contacts, contact lists, email campaigns, and templates. Add subscribers to newsletters, draft email campaigns, and view email templates.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Full CRUD for **Contacts** (create, read, update, delete subscribers)\n- Full CRUD for **Contact Lists** (create, read, update, delete lists)\n- Full CRUD for **Email Campaigns** (create, read, update, delete drafts)\n- Read **Email Templates** (list and get)\n\n## Pre-flight Check\n\nBefore making API calls,","body":"# Brevo Skill\n\nAccess Brevo to manage contacts, contact lists, email campaigns, and templates. Add subscribers to newsletters, draft email campaigns, and view email templates.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Full CRUD for **Contacts** (create, read, update, delete subscribers)\n- Full CRUD for **Contact Lists** (create, read, update, delete lists)\n- Full CRUD for **Email Campaigns** (create, read, update, delete drafts)\n- Read **Email Templates** (list and get)\n\n## Pre-flight Check\n\nBefore making API calls, verify the user is authenticated:\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/check-auth.sh\n```\n\nReturns `USER_AUTHENTICATED` or `USER_NOT_AUTHENTICATED`.\n\n## Scripts Reference\n\nAll scripts are located at `$SKILL_PATH/`. Replace `$SKILL_PATH` with the actual skill directory path.\n\n### Contact Lists\n\n```bash\n# List all contact lists (to find list IDs and names)\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/list.sh [limit] [offset]\n\n# Get details of a specific list\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/get.sh <list_id>\n\n# Create a new list\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/create.sh ''<json_data>''\n\n# Update a list\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/update.sh <list_id> ''<json_data>''\n\n# Delete a list (contacts are not deleted)\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/delete.sh <list_id>\n```\n\n**Example - Create a new list:**\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/create.sh ''{\"name\":\"VIP Customers\",\"folderId\":1}''\n```\n\n### Contacts\n\n```bash\n# List all contacts\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/list.sh [limit] [offset]\n\n# Get contact by email or ID\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/get.sh <identifier>\n\n# Create contact (optionally add to lists)\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/create.sh ''<json_data>''\n\n# Update contact\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/update.sh <identifier> ''<json_data>''\n\n# Delete contact\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/delete.sh <identifier>\n```\n\n**Example - Add contact to newsletter:**\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/create.sh ''{\"email\":\"john@example.com\",\"attributes\":{\"FIRSTNAME\":\"John\",\"LASTNAME\":\"Doe\"},\"listIds\":[4],\"updateEnabled\":true}''\n```\n\n**Contact JSON fields:**\n\n- `email` (required): Email address\n- `attributes`: Object with contact attributes (FIRSTNAME, LASTNAME, etc.)\n- `listIds`: Array of list IDs to add the contact to\n- `updateEnabled`: If true, updates existing contact with same email (default: false)\n\n**Example - Update contact attributes:**\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/update.sh john@example.com ''{\"attributes\":{\"LASTNAME\":\"Smith\"}}''\n```\n\n### Email Campaigns\n\n```bash\n# List all campaigns\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/list.sh [type] [status] [limit] [offset]\n# type: classic, trigger (default: all)\n# status: draft, sent, queued, suspended, in_process, archive (default: all)\n\n# Get campaign details\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/get.sh <campaign_id>\n\n# Create campaign draft\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/create.sh ''<json_data>''\n\n# Update campaign draft (to iterate on content)\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/update.sh <campaign_id> ''<json_data>''\n\n# Delete campaign\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/delete.sh <campaign_id>\n```\n\n**Example - Create newsletter draft:**\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/create.sh ''{\n  \"name\": \"Weekly Newsletter\",\n  \"subject\": \"This Week''\\''''s Updates\",\n  \"sender\": {\"name\": \"Company Name\", \"email\": \"newsletter@example.com\"},\n  \"htmlContent\": \"<html><body><h1>Hello!</h1><p>Newsletter content here...</p></body></html>\",\n  \"recipients\": {\"listIds\": [4]}\n}''\n```\n\n**Campaign JSON fields:**\n\n- `name` (required): Campaign name (internal identifier)\n- `subject` (required): Email subject line\n- `sender` (required): Object with `name` and `email`\n- `htmlContent` (required): HTML body of the email\n- `recipients` (required): Object with `listIds` array\n\nThe campaign is created as a **draft** and can be edited in the Brevo UI before sending.\n\n**Example - Update campaign content:**\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/update.sh 123 ''{\"subject\":\"Updated Subject Line\",\"htmlContent\":\"<html><body><h1>Revised Content</h1><p>New newsletter content...</p></body></html>\"}''\n```\n\n### Email Templates\n\n```bash\n# List all templates\nbash $SKILL_PATH/templates/list.sh [limit] [offset]\n\n# Get template details\nbash $SKILL_PATH/templates/get.sh <template_id>\n```\n\n## Setup Instructions\n\n1. **Get your API key** from Brevo:\n   - Log in to [Brevo](https://app.brevo.com)\n   - Navigate to Settings → SMTP & API → API Keys\n   - Or go directly to: https://app.brevo.com/settings/keys/api\n   - Generate a new API key\n\n2. **Create the config file:**\n\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p ~/.config/brevo\n   cat > ~/.config/brevo/config.json << ''EOF''\n   {\n     \"api_key\": \"your-api-key-here\"\n   }\n   EOF\n   chmod 600 ~/.config/brevo/config.json\n   ```\n\n3. **Verify authentication:**\n   ```bash\n   bash $SKILL_PATH/check-auth.sh\n   ```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Add a person to the newsletter\n\n```bash\n# 1. Find the newsletter list ID\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/list.sh\n# Look for the list named \"Newsletter\" and note its ID (e.g., 4)\n\n# 2. Create contact and add to list\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/create.sh ''{\"email\":\"john@example.com\",\"attributes\":{\"FIRSTNAME\":\"John\",\"LASTNAME\":\"Doe\"},\"listIds\":[4],\"updateEnabled\":true}''\n```\n\n### Draft a newsletter campaign\n\n```bash\n# 1. Check available templates (optional)\nbash $SKILL_PATH/templates/list.sh\n\n# 2. Find the target list\nbash $SKILL_PATH/lists/list.sh\n\n# 3. Create the campaign draft\nbash $SKILL_PATH/campaigns/create.sh ''{\n  \"name\": \"Product Launch Newsletter\",\n  \"subject\": \"Introducing Our New Product\",\n  \"sender\": {\"name\": \"Company\", \"email\": \"newsletter@example.com\"},\n  \"htmlContent\": \"<html><body><h1>New Product Launch</h1><p>We are excited to announce...</p></body></html>\",\n  \"recipients\": {\"listIds\": [4]}\n}''\n\n# 4. Go to Brevo UI to review and send the campaign\n```\n\n### Check if a contact exists\n\n```bash\nbash $SKILL_PATH/contacts/get.sh john@example.com\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Authentication fails:**\n\n- Verify config file exists at `~/.config/brevo/config.json`\n- Check API key is valid and not expired\n- Ensure API key has proper permissions\n\n**Contact creation fails:**\n\n- Verify email format is valid\n- Check list IDs exist (use `lists/list.sh` to verify)\n- Attribute names must be UPPERCASE (e.g., FIRSTNAME, not firstName)\n\n**Campaign creation fails:**\n\n- All required fields must be present (name, subject, sender, htmlContent, recipients)\n- Sender email must be a verified sender in Brevo\n- List IDs in recipients must exist\n\n## API Reference\n\n- [Brevo API Documentation](https://developers.brevo.com/reference)\n- [Create Contact](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/createcontact)\n- [Get Lists](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/getlists-1)\n- [Create Email Campaign](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/createemailcampaign-1)\n- [Update Email Campaign](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/updateemailcampaign)\n- [Delete Email Campaign](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/deleteemailcampaign)\n- [Update Contact](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/updatecontact)\n- [Delete Contact](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/deletecontact)\n- [Create List](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/createlist-1)\n- [Update List](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/updatelist-1)\n- [Delete List](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/deletelist-1)\n- [Get Templates](https://developers.brevo.com/reference/getsmtptemplates)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:11:13.723Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced email campaign management capabilities with CRUD operations for contacts, contact lists, and email campaigns.","zh":"非常适合需要高级电子邮件活动管理功能的营销代理，包括对联系人、联系人列表和电子邮件活动的CRUD操作。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度な電子メールキャンペーン管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。コンタクト、コンタクトリスト、電子メールキャンペーンのCRUD操作が可能です。","ko":"고급 이메일 캠페인 관리 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 연락처, 연락처 목록, 이메일 캠페인의 CRUD 작업을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades de gestión de campañas de correo electrónico avanzadas con operaciones CRUD para contactos, listas de contactos y campañas de correo electrónico.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de gestion de campagnes e-mail avancées avec des opérations CRUD pour les contacts, les listes de contacts et les campagnes e-mail.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte E-Mail-Kampagnen-Management-Funktionen mit CRUD-Operationen für Kontakte, Kontaktlisten und E-Mail-Kampagnen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de campanhas de e-mail com operações CRUD para contatos, listas de contatos e campanhas de e-mail.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по маркетингу, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления кампаниями по электронной почте с операциями CRUD для контактов, списков контактов и кампаний по электронной почте.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة حملات البريد الإلكتروني مع عمليات CRUD للمتصلين وقوائم المتصلين وحملات البريد الإلكتروني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage contacts, contact lists, email campaigns, and templates using full CRUD operations, enabling seamless email campaign drafting, subscriber management, and template viewing through API calls.","zh":"使代理能够使用完整的CRUD操作来管理联系人、联系人列表、电子邮件活动和模板，从而通过API调用实现无缝的电子邮件活动草稿、订阅者管理和模板查看。","ja":"エージェントがコンタクト、コンタクトリスト、電子メールキャンペーン、テンプレートをフルCRUD操作で管理できるようにし、APIコールを介して電子メールキャンペーンの草稿作成、サブスクライバー管理、テンプレートの表示をシームレスに実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 연락처, 연락처 목록, 이메일 캠페인, 템플릿을 완전한 CRUD 작업으로 관리할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 API 호출을 통해 이메일 캠페인 초안, 구독자 관리, 템플릿 보기의 무중단 작성을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar contactos, listas de contactos, campañas de correo electrónico y plantillas utilizando operaciones CRUD completas, lo que permite la creación, administración y visualización sin problemas de borradores de campañas de correo electrónico, gestión de suscriptores y visualización de plantillas a través de llamadas a la API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les contacts, les listes de contacts, les campagnes e-mail et les modèles en utilisant des opérations CRUD complètes, permettant ainsi une création, une gestion et une visualisation sans problème de brouillons de campagnes e-mail, de gestion d''abonnés et de visualisation de modèles via des appels d''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Kontakte, Kontaktlisten, E-Mail-Kampagnen und Vorlagen mithilfe vollständiger CRUD-Operationen zu verwalten, was eine nahtlose Erstellung, Verwaltung und Anzeige von E-Mail-Kampagnen-Entwürfen, Abonnentenverwaltung und Vorlagenanzeige über API-Aufrufe ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar contatos, listas de contatos, campanhas de e-mail e modelos usando operações CRUD completas, permitindo a criação de campanhas de e-mail, gerenciamento de assinantes e visualização de modelos por meio de chamadas de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять контактами, списками контактов, кампаниями по электронной почте и шаблонами, используя полные операции CRUD, что позволяет создавать черновики кампаний по электронной почте, управлять подписчиками и просматривать шаблоны через вызовы API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إدارة الاتصالات وقوائم الاتصالات وحملات البريد الإلكتروني والنماذج باستخدام عمليات CRUD الكاملة، مما يتيح صياغة حملات البريد الإلكتروني وادارة المشتركين وعرض النماذج من خلال مكالمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating newsletter subscriber additions","Generating and managing email campaign drafts","Debugging email template rendering issues"],"zh":["自动化新闻稿订阅者添加","生成和管理电子邮件活动草稿","调试电子邮件模板渲染问题"],"ja":["ニュースレターのサブスクライバー追加の自動化","電子メールキャンペーンの草稿の生成と管理","電子メールテンプレートのレンダリング問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["뉴스레터 구독자 추가 자동화","이메일 캠페인 초안 생성 및 관리","이메일 템플릿 렌더링 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la adición de suscriptores de boletines","Generación y gestión de borradores de campañas de correo electrónico","Depuración de problemas de representación de plantillas de correo electrónico"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''ajout d''abonnés à des bulletins","Génération et gestion de brouillons de campagnes e-mail","Débogage des problèmes de rendu de modèles e-mail"],"de":["Automatisierung der Hinzufügung von Newsletter-Abonnenten","Erstellung und Verwaltung von E-Mail-Kampagnen-Entwürfen","Fehlerbehebung bei der Darstellung von E-Mail-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Automatizar adições de assinantes de boletins","Gerar e gerenciar rascunhos de campanhas de e-mail","Depurar problemas de renderização de modelos de e-mail"],"ru":["Автоматизировать добавление подписчиков рассылки","Генерировать и управлять черновиками кампаний по электронной почте","Отлаживать проблемы с отображением шаблонов электронной почты"],"ar":["آلية إضافة مشتركين في النشرة","توليد وإدارة مسودات حملات البريد الإلكتروني","تصحيح مشاكل عرض قوالب البريد الإلكتروني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API access for Brevo","Limited to read-only operations for Email Templates"],"zh":["需要Brevo的API访问","电子邮件模板仅限读取操作"],"ja":["BrevoのAPIアクセスが必要","電子メールテンプレートは読み取り専用操作のみ"],"ko":["Brevo의 API 액세스가 필요함","이메일 템플릿은 읽기 전용 작업만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API para Brevo","Limitado a operaciones de solo lectura para plantillas de correo electrónico"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API pour Brevo","Limité aux opérations de lecture seule pour les modèles e-mail"],"de":["Benötigt API-Zugriff für Brevo","Begrenzt auf Leseoperationen für E-Mail-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API para Brevo","Limitado a operações somente leitura para Modelos de E-mail"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API для Brevo","Ограничен только операциями чтения для шаблонов электронной почты"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Brevo","محدود بالعمليات القراءة فقط لنموذج البريد الإلكتروني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
