n":{"zh":"miles是一个高性能的企业级强化学习框架，优化了大规模模型的后训练","ja":"milesは、高性能のエンタープライズグレードの強化学習フレームワークであり、大規模モデルの後期訓練を最適化しています","ko":"miles는 대규모 모델의 후期 훈련을 최적화한 고성능 엔터프라이즈급 강화 학습 프레임워크입니다","es":"miles es un framework de RL de alto rendimiento para entrenamiento de modelos a gran escala, optimizado para estabilidad y precisión","fr":"miles est un framework RL haute performance pour l''entraînement de modèles à grande échelle, optimisé pour la stabilité et la précision","de":"miles ist ein High-Performance-RL-Framework für groß angelegtes Modelltraining, optimiert für Stabilität und Präzision","pt":"Miles é um framework de treinamento RL de alto desempenho, projetado para modelos de grande escala e estabilidade de treinamento","ru":"Miles - это высокопроизводительный фреймворк тренировки RL, предназначенный для крупномасштабных моделей и стабильности тренировки","ar":"مايلس هو إطار عمل تدريب RL عالي الأداء، مصمم لنمذجة كبيرة الحجم واستقرار التدريب","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持1TB+ MoE模型训练","支持FP8或INT4量化感知训练","支持训练和推理的一致性"],"ja":["1TB以上のMoEモデル訓練をサポート","FP8またはINT4量化認識訓練をサポート","訓練と推論の一貫性をサポート"],"ko":["1TB 이상의 MoE 모델 훈련 지원","FP8 또는 INT4 정량화 인식 훈련 지원","훈련과 추론의 일관성을 지원"],"es":["Entrenamiento de modelos MoE de 1TB+","Quantización FP8 o INT4","Alineación de entrenamiento e inferencia","Estabilidad en el entrenamiento de MoE","Optimización para entrenamiento a gran escala"],"fr":["Entraînement de modèles MoE de 1TB+","Quantification FP8 ou INT4","Alignement de l''entraînement et de l''inférence","Stabilité dans l''entraînement de MoE","Optimisation pour l''entraînement à grande échelle"],"de":["Training von MoE-Modellen über 1TB","Quantisierung FP8 oder INT4","Trainings- und Inferenz-Alignment","Stabilität im MoE-Training","Optimierung für groß angelegtes Training"],"pt":["Treinamento de modelos MoE de grande escala","Otimização para estabilidade de treinamento","Compatibilidade com quantização FP8 e INT4","Alinhamento de treinamento e inferência"],"ru":["Обучение крупномасштабных моделей MoE","Оптимизация для стабильности тренировки","Совместимость с квантованием FP8 и INT4","Совпадение тренировки и вывода"],"ar":["تدريب نمذجة MoE كبيرة الحجم","تحسين الاستقرار في التدريب","التوافق مع التكميم FP8 وINT4","التوافق بين التدريب والاستدلال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["强化学习","大规模模型","后训练","MoE训练","低精度训练","训练推理一致性"],"ja":["強化学習","大規模モデル","後期訓練","MoE訓練","低精度訓練","訓練と推論の一貫性"],"ko":["강화 학습","대규모 모델","후期 훈련","MoE 훈련","저정도 훈련","훈련-추론 일관성"],"es":["entrenamiento de RL","framework de RL","modelo MoE","quantización FP8","quantización INT4","entrenamiento a gran escala","estabilidad en el entrenamiento","aprendizaje por refuerzo"],"fr":["entraînement RL","framework RL","modèle MoE","quantification FP8","quantification INT4","entraînement à grande échelle","stabilité dans l''entraînement","apprentissage par renforcement"],"de":["RL-Training","RL-Framework","MoE-Modell","FP8-Quantisierung","INT4-Quantisierung","groß angelegtes Training","Stabilität im Training","maschinelles Lernen durch Verstärkung"],"pt":["treinamento RL","framework de alto desempenho","modelos de grande escala","estabilidade de treinamento","quantização FP8","INT4"],"ru":["тренировка RL","высокопроизводительный фреймворк","крупномасштабные модели","стабильность тренировки","квантование FP8","INT4"],"ar":["تدريب RL","إطار عمل عالي الأداء","نمذجة كبيرة الحجم","استقرار التدريب","تكميم FP8","INT4"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"miles-rl-training","description":"Provides guidance for enterprise-grade RL training using miles, a production-ready fork of slime. Use when training large MoE models with FP8/INT4, needing train-inference alignment, or requiring speculative RL for maximum throughput.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["Reinforcement Learning","MoE","FP8","INT4","Enterprise","SGLang","Megatron-LM"],"bodyPreview":"# miles: Enterprise-Grade RL for Large-Scale Model Training\n\nmiles is a high-performance, enterprise-ready RL framework optimized for large-scale model post-training. Built as a production fork of slime, it addresses critical challenges in MoE training stability, low-precision training, and train-inference alignment.\n\n## When to Use miles\n\n**Choose miles when you need:**\n- Training 1TB+ MoE models (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)\n- FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training\n- Bit-wise identical train-infer","body":"# miles: Enterprise-Grade RL for Large-Scale Model Training\n\nmiles is a high-performance, enterprise-ready RL framework optimized for large-scale model post-training. Built as a production fork of slime, it addresses critical challenges in MoE training stability, low-precision training, and train-inference alignment.\n\n## When to Use miles\n\n**Choose miles when you need:**\n- Training 1TB+ MoE models (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)\n- FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training\n- Bit-wise identical train-inference alignment\n- Speculative RL for maximum throughput\n- Production stability with enterprise support\n\n**Consider alternatives when:**\n- You want the research-grade original → use **slime**\n- You need flexible backend swapping → use **verl**\n- You want PyTorch-native abstractions → use **torchforge**\n\n## Key Features\n\n### Low-Precision Training\n- **Unified FP8**: End-to-end FP8 for both inference and training\n- **INT4 QAT**: 1TB models on single-machine VRAM (H200)\n- **Rollout Routing Replay (R3)**: Bit-wise expert alignment for MoE\n\n### Performance Optimizations\n- **Speculative RL**: 25%+ rollout speedup with online SFT draft models\n- **Zero-Copy Weight Sync**: CUDA IPC zero-copy mapping\n- **Partial Rollout**: Recycle half-finished trajectories\n\n### Train-Inference Alignment\n- **TIS/MIS**: Truncated/Masked Importance Sampling for off-policy correction\n- **Kernel-level optimization**: FlashAttention-3, DeepGEMM integration\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Recommended: Docker\ndocker pull radixark/miles:latest\ndocker run --rm --gpus all --ipc=host --shm-size=16g \\\n  -it radixark/miles:latest /bin/bash\n\n# From source\ngit clone https://github.com/radixark/miles.git\ncd miles\npip install -r requirements.txt\npip install -e .\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\nmiles inherits slime''s configuration system. Basic training:\n\n```bash\npython train.py \\\n    --advantage-estimator grpo \\\n    --model-name qwen3-30b-a3b \\\n    --hf-checkpoint /path/to/qwen3-30b-a3b-hf \\\n    --rollout-batch-size 512 \\\n    --n-samples-per-prompt 8\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow 1: Large MoE Training\n\nUse this workflow for training large MoE models like DeepSeek V3 or Qwen3-MoE.\n\n### Prerequisites Checklist\n- [ ] H100/H200 GPUs with FP8 support\n- [ ] MoE model (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)\n- [ ] Docker environment with miles\n\n### Step 1: Environment Setup\n\n```bash\n# FP8 block scaling (recommended for stability)\nexport NVTE_FP8_BLOCK_SCALING_FP32_SCALES=1\nexport CUDA_DEVICE_MAX_CONNECTIONS=1\n```\n\n### Step 2: Configure Training\n\n```bash\npython train.py \\\n    --actor-num-gpus-per-node 8 \\\n    --rollout-num-gpus 8 \\\n    --hf-checkpoint /path/to/deepseek-v3 \\\n    --advantage-estimator grpo \\\n    --tensor-model-parallel-size 8 \\\n    --expert-model-parallel-size 4 \\\n    --prompt-data /path/to/data.jsonl \\\n    --num-rollout 3000\n```\n\n### Verification Checklist\n- [ ] Model loads without errors\n- [ ] Routing decisions are consistent\n- [ ] No NaN/Inf in loss values\n\n---\n\n## Workflow 2: Speculative RL Training\n\nUse this workflow for maximum rollout throughput with EAGLE speculative decoding.\n\n### How Speculative RL Works\n\n1. Small draft model generates candidate tokens\n2. Target model verifies in parallel\n3. Draft model updated via online SFT to track policy\n\n### Step 1: Enable Speculative Decoding\n\nmiles supports EAGLE speculative decoding via SGLang:\n\n```bash\npython train.py \\\n    --actor-num-gpus-per-node 8 \\\n    --hf-checkpoint /path/to/target-model \\\n    --sglang-speculative-algorithm EAGLE \\\n    --sglang-speculative-num-steps 3 \\\n    --sglang-speculative-eagle-topk 1 \\\n    --sglang-speculative-num-draft-tokens 4 \\\n    --sglang-speculative-draft-model-path /path/to/draft-model \\\n    --advantage-estimator grpo \\\n    --prompt-data /path/to/data.jsonl\n```\n\n### Step 2: Enable Online MTP Training (Optional)\n\nFor online SFT of draft model during training:\n\n```bash\n--mtp-num-layers 1 \\\n--enable-mtp-training \\\n--mtp-loss-scaling-factor 0.2\n```\n\n**Note**: Online MTP training requires a torch dist checkpoint with MTP weights. Add `--mtp-num-layers 1` during checkpoint conversion from HuggingFace.\n\n### Expected Speedup\n\n- **Standard rollout**: Baseline\n- **Speculative RL**: 25-40% faster rollout\n- **With partial rollout**: Additional 10-15% throughput\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Reference\n\nmiles inherits all slime arguments. See [slime API Reference](../slime/references/api-reference.md) for the complete list.\n\n### Cluster Resources (from slime)\n\n```bash\n--actor-num-nodes 1\n--actor-num-gpus-per-node 8\n--rollout-num-gpus 8\n--rollout-num-gpus-per-engine 2\n--colocate\n```\n\n### Megatron Parallelism (from slime)\n\n```bash\n--tensor-model-parallel-size 8\n--pipeline-model-parallel-size 2\n--expert-model-parallel-size 4    # MoE expert parallelism\n```\n\n### Speculative Decoding (miles-specific)\n\n```bash\n--sglang-speculative-algorithm EAGLE\n--sglang-speculative-num-steps 3\n--sglang-speculative-eagle-topk 1\n--sglang-speculative-num-draft-tokens 4\n--sglang-enable-draft-weights-cpu-backup\n--sglang-speculative-draft-model-path /your/draft/model/path\n```\n\n### Online MTP Training (miles-specific)\n\n```bash\n--mtp-num-layers 1\n--enable-mtp-training\n--mtp-loss-scaling-factor 0.2\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Features (Conceptual)\n\nThe following features are documented in miles but specific CLI flags may vary. Consult the miles repository for latest configuration.\n\n### Unified FP8 Pipeline\n\nEnd-to-end FP8 sampling and training that eliminates quantization-induced discrepancy causing RL collapse in MoE models.\n\n### Rollout Routing Replay (R3)\n\nRecords expert routing decisions during SGLang inference and replays them during Megatron training for bit-wise expert alignment.\n\n**How R3 Works**:\n1. During SGLang inference, expert routing decisions are recorded\n2. Routing decisions stored in `sample.rollout_routed_experts`\n3. During Megatron training, routing is replayed instead of recomputed\n4. Ensures identical expert selection between train and inference\n\n### INT4 Quantization-Aware Training\n\nEnables single-machine deployment of 1TB+ models (e.g., on H200).\n\n**Memory Savings with INT4**:\n\n| Model Size | BF16 VRAM | INT4 VRAM | Reduction |\n|------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|\n| 70B | 140GB | 45GB | 3.1x |\n| 235B | 470GB | 150GB | 3.1x |\n| 671B | 1.3TB | 420GB | 3.1x |\n\n### Train-Inference Alignment\n\nmiles achieves \"exactly 0 KL divergence\" between training and inference through:\n- Flash Attention 3\n- DeepGEMM\n- Batch-invariant kernels from Thinking Machines Lab\n- `torch.compile` integration\n\n---\n\n## Sample Data Structure\n\nmiles uses the same `Sample` dataclass as slime with the `rollout_routed_experts` field for MoE routing replay:\n\n```python\n@dataclass\nclass Sample:\n    prompt: str | list[dict]\n    tokens: list[int]\n    response: str\n    reward: float | dict\n    loss_mask: list[int]\n    status: Status\n    metadata: dict\n    rollout_log_probs: list[float]\n    rollout_routed_experts: list[list[int]]  # MoE routing for R3\n```\n\nSee [slime API Reference](../slime/references/api-reference.md) for the complete Sample definition.\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues and Solutions\n\n### Issue: FP8 Training Collapse\n\n**Symptoms**: Loss explodes, NaN values\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Use block scaling: `export NVTE_FP8_BLOCK_SCALING_FP32_SCALES=1`\n- Reduce learning rate: `--lr 5e-7`\n- Ensure MoE routing is consistent between train/inference\n\n### Issue: Speculative Draft Drift\n\n**Symptoms**: Low acceptance rate over time\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Enable online MTP training to keep draft model aligned\n- Reduce speculative steps: `--sglang-speculative-num-steps 2`\n- Use CPU backup: `--sglang-enable-draft-weights-cpu-backup`\n\n### Issue: Train-Inference Mismatch\n\n**Symptoms**: Policy divergence, reward collapse\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Use TIS for off-policy correction: `--use-tis --tis-threshold 0.9`\n- Verify log probs match between SGLang and Megatron\n- Enable R3 for MoE models\n\n---\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Family | Models | MoE Support |\n|--------|--------|-------------|\n| DeepSeek | R1, V3, V3.2 | Full |\n| Qwen | 2, 2.5, 3 (including MoE) | Full |\n| Llama | 3, 3.1, 3.3, 4 | Dense only |\n| Gemma | 2, 3, 3N | Dense only |\n| GLM | 4.5, 4.6, 4.7 | Dense only |\n| MiniMax | M2, M2.1 | Full |\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/radixark/miles\n- **Introduction Blog**: https://lmsys.org/blog/2025-11-19-miles/\n- **Slime (upstream)**: https://github.com/THUDM/slime\n- **SGLang**: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:11:13.192Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in large-scale model training, particularly those utilizing Reinforcement Learning and requiring high-performance, enterprise-ready frameworks like miles-rl-training.","zh":"适用于专门从事大规模模型训练的AI代理，特别是那些利用强化学习并需要高性能、企业级框架的，如miles-rl-training。","ja":"大規模モデルトレーニングを専門とするAIエージェントに適しています。特に、強化学習を利用し、高性能でエンタープライズレディなフレームワークであるmiles-rl-trainingを必要とするものに適しています。","ko":"대규모 모델 훈련을 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 강화 학습을 사용하고 고성능, 엔터프라이즈급 프레임워크인 miles-rl-training을 필요로 하는 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se especializan en la formación de modelos a gran escala, particularmente aquellos que utilizan Aprendizaje por Refuerzo y requieren marcos de alto rendimiento y listos para la empresa como miles-rl-training.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA spécialisés dans la formation de modèles à grande échelle, en particulier ceux qui utilisent l''apprentissage par renforcement et nécessitent des frameworks de haute performance et prêts pour l''entreprise comme miles-rl-training.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten, die sich auf die Schulung von groß angelegten Modellen spezialisieren, insbesondere solchen, die Reinforcement Learning verwenden und hochleistungsstarke, unternehmensbereite Frameworks wie miles-rl-training erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA especializados em treinamento de modelos em larga escala, particularmente aqueles que utilizam Aprendizado por Reforço e exigem frameworks de alto desempenho e prontos para empresas, como o miles-rl-training.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на обучении крупномасштабных моделей, особенно тех, которые используют обучение с подкреплением и требуют высокопроизводительных, корпоративно-готовых фреймворков, таких как miles-rl-training.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصص في تدريب نماذج كبيرة النطاق، ولا سيما تلك التي تستخدم التعلم التعاوني والمتطلبات الإطار عالية الأداء وجاهزة للشركات مثل miles-rl-training."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform training of 1TB+ MoE models with FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training and ensures bit-wise identical train-infer alignment, leveraging the production-ready capabilities of miles, a high-performance RL framework.","zh":"赋予代理执行1TB+ MoE模型的FP8或INT4量化感知训练能力，并确保比特级别的训练-推理对齐，利用miles生产就绪功能，这是一种高性能的RL框架。","ja":"エージェントが1TB+のMoEモデルをFP8またはINT4量化感知トレーニングでトレーニングできるようにし、ビットレベルのトレーニング-推論の整合を確保し、高性能なRLフレームワークであるmilesの本番環境で利用可能な機能を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 1TB+ MoE 모델을 FP8 또는 INT4 양자화 인식 훈련으로 훈련할 수 있도록 하며, 비트 수준의 훈련-추론 일치를 보장하며, 고성능 RL 프레임워크인 miles의 생산 준비 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar la capacitación de modelos MoE de 1TB+ con formación con quantización FP8 o INT4 y asegura la alineación de entrenamiento-inferencia idéntica bit a bit, aprovechando las capacidades listas para producción de miles, un framework de RL de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser la formation de modèles MoE de 1To+ avec une formation avec quantification FP8 ou INT4 et assure l''alignement formation-inférence identique bit à bit, en exploitant les capacités prêtes pour la production de miles, un framework RL de haute performance.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Schulung von MoE-Modellen von 1TB+ mit FP8- oder INT4-Quantisierungs-Schulung durchzuführen und stellt sicher, dass die Trainings- und Inferenz-Übereinstimmung bitweise identisch ist, indem es die produktionsreifen Fähigkeiten von miles, ein Hochleistungs-RL-Framework, nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar treinamento de modelos MoE de 1TB+ com treinamento de quantização FP8 ou INT4 e garante alinhamento de treinamento-inferência idêntico bit a bit, aproveitando as capacidades de produção prontas do miles, um framework de alto desempenho de Aprendizado por Reforço.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять обучение моделей MoE размером 1ТБ+ с помощью тренировки, осведомленной о квантовании FP8 или INT4, и гарантирует идентичность обучения и вывода бит в бит, используя возможности производственной готовности miles, высокопроизводительного фреймворка обучения с подкреплением.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على أداء تدريب نموذج MoE بحجم 1 تيرابايت أو أكثر مع تدريب موجه للكمية FP8 أو INT4 وضمان انسجام تدريب-استدلال متطابق على مستوى البت، مستفيداً من القدرات الجاهزة للإنتاج لميلز، إطار عمل تعلم تعاوني عالي الأداء."},"useCases":{"en":["Training large-scale MoE models such as DeepSeek V3 and Qwen3-MoE","Implementing FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training for optimized model performance","Ensuring bit-wise identical train-infer alignment for consistent model behavior"],"zh":["训练大规模MoE模型，如DeepSeek V3和Qwen3-MoE","实现FP8或INT4量化感知训练以优化模型性能","确保比特级别的训练-推理对齐以获得一致的模型行为"],"ja":["DeepSeek V3やQwen3-MoEなどの大規模MoEモデルをトレーニングする","FP8またはINT4量化感知トレーニングを実装してモデル性能を最適化する","ビットレベルのトレーニング-推論の整合を確保して一貫したモデル動作を実現する"],"ko":["DeepSeek V3 및 Qwen3-MoE와 같은 대규모 MoE 모델을 훈련하는 것","모델 성능 최적화를 위해 FP8 또는 INT4 양자화 인식 훈련을 구현하는 것","비트 수준의 훈련-추론 일치를 보장하여 일관된 모델 동작을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Capacitación de grandes modelos MoE como DeepSeek V3 y Qwen3-MoE","Implementación de la formación con quantización FP8 o INT4 para un rendimiento de modelo optimizado","Aseguramiento de la alineación de entrenamiento-inferencia idéntica bit a bit para un comportamiento de modelo coherente"],"fr":["Formation de grands modèles MoE tels que DeepSeek V3 et Qwen3-MoE","Mise en œuvre d''une formation avec quantification FP8 ou INT4 pour des performances de modèle optimisées","Assurance de l''alignement formation-inférence identique bit à bit pour un comportement de modèle cohérent"],"de":["Schulung von großen MoE-Modellen wie DeepSeek V3 und Qwen3-MoE","Implementierung der Schulung mit FP8- oder INT4-Quantisierung für ein optimiertes Modellverhalten","Sicherstellung der Trainings- und Inferenz-Übereinstimmung bitweise identisch für ein konsistentes Modellverhalten"],"pt":["Treinamento de modelos MoE de grande escala, como o DeepSeek V3 e o Qwen3-MoE","Implementação de treinamento de quantização FP8 ou INT4 para desempenho de modelo otimizado","Garantia de alinhamento de treinamento-inferência idêntico bit a bit para comportamento de modelo consistente"],"ru":["Обучение крупномасштабных моделей MoE, таких как DeepSeek V3 и Qwen3-MoE","Реализация обучения с учетом квантования FP8 или INT4 для оптимизированного производительности модели","Обеспечение идентичности обучения и вывода бит в бит для последовательного поведения модели"],"ar":["تدريب نماذج MoE كبيرة النطاق، مثل DeepSeek V3 و Qwen3-MoE","تنفيذ تدريب كمي موجه FP8 أو INT4 لأداء نموذج محسّن","ضمان انسجام تدريب-استدلال متطابق على مستوى البت لسلوك نموذج متسق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires large computational resources for 1TB+ model training","Specifically optimized for MoE training stability, low-precision training, and train-inference alignment"],"zh":["需要大量计算资源进行1TB+模型训练","特别优化用于MoE训练稳定性、低精度训练和训练-推理对齐"],"ja":["1TB+モデルトレーニングには大量の計算リソースが必要","特にMoEトレーニングの安定性、低精度トレーニング、トレーニング-推論の整合に最適化"],"ko":["1TB+ 모델 훈련을 위해大量의 계산 리소스가 필요","특히 MoE 훈련 안정성, 저정도 훈련 및 훈련-추론 일치에 최적화"],"es":["Requiere grandes recursos computacionales para la capacitación de modelos de 1TB+","Optimizado específicamente para la estabilidad de la capacitación MoE, la formación de baja precisión y la alineación de entrenamiento-inferencia"],"fr":["Nécessite de grandes ressources computationnelles pour la formation de modèles de 1To+","Optimisé spécifiquement pour la stabilité de la formation MoE, la formation à basse précision et l''alignement formation-inférence"],"de":["Benötigt große Rechenressourcen für die Schulung von 1TB+-Modellen","Speziell optimiert für die Stabilität der MoE-Schulung, die Niedrigpräzisionsschulung und die Trainings- und Inferenz-Übereinstimmung"],"pt":["Exige recursos computacionais grandes para treinamento de modelos de 1TB+","Otimizado especificamente para estabilidade de treinamento MoE, treinamento de baixa precisão e alinhamento treinamento-inferência"],"ru":["Требует больших вычислительных ресурсов для обучения моделей размером 1ТБ+","Оптимизирован специально для стабильности обучения MoE, обучения с низкой точностью и соответствия обучения и вывода"],"ar":["يتطلب موارد حسابية كبيرة لتدريب نماذج بحجم 1 تيرابايت أو أكثر","مُحسّن خصيصا لاستقرار تدريب MoE، التدريب بدقة منخفضة، وانسجام التدريب-الاستدلال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/trino', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'trino', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:11:09.917Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/trino","name":"trino","description":{"zh":"Trino SQL 提供了强大的时间函数，包括 td_interval，用于处理相对时间和时间区间","ja":"Trino SQL には強力な時間関数が備わっており、td_interval を使用して相対時間や時間間隔を処理できます","ko":"Trino SQL은 강력한 시간 함수를 제공하며, td_interval을 사용하여 상대 시간 및 시간 간격을 처리할 수 있습니다","es":"Trino SQL ofrece funciones de tiempo avanzadas para simplificar tus consultas. Aprende a utilizar td_interval y otros.","fr":"Trino SQL propose des fonctions de temps avancées pour simplifier vos requêtes. Découvrez comment utiliser td_interval et d''autres.","de":"Trino SQL bietet erweiterte Zeitfunktionen, um Ihre Abfragen zu vereinfachen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie td_interval und andere verwenden können.","pt":"Trino SQL oferece funções de tempo poderosas para consultar dados. Aprenda a usar td_interval para trabalhar com intervalos de tempo e fusos horários.","ru":"Trino SQL предоставляет мощные временные функции для запросов данных. Узнайте, как использовать td_interval для работы с временными интервалами и часовыми поясами.","ar":"يقدم ترينو إس كيو إل دوال وقت قوية لاستعلام البيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدام td_interval للعمل مع فترات الزمن والمناطق الزمنية.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Trino SQL 时间函数","ja":"Trino SQL 時間関数","ko":"Trino SQL 시간 함수","es":"Trino SQL: Funciones de Tiempo para Desarrolladores","fr":"Trino SQL: Fonctions de Temps pour Développeurs","de":"Trino SQL: Zeitfunktionen für Entwickler","pt":"Trino SQL: Funções de Tempo para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Trino SQL: Временные функции для разработчиков","ar":"ترينو إس كيو إل: دوال زمنية للمطورين","en":"trino"},"description":{"zh":"Trino SQL 提供了强大的时间函数，包括 td_interval，用于处理相对时间和时间区间","ja":"Trino SQL には強力な時間関数が備わっており、td_interval を使用して相対時間や時間間隔を処理できます","ko":"Trino SQL은 강력한 시간 함수를 제공하며, td_interval을 사용하여 상대 시간 및 시간 간격을 처리할 수 있습니다","es":"Trino SQL ofrece funciones de tiempo avanzadas para simplificar tus consultas. Aprende a utilizar td_interval y otros.","fr":"Trino SQL propose des fonctions de temps avancées pour simplifier vos requêtes. Découvrez comment utiliser td_interval et d''autres.","de":"Trino SQL bietet erweiterte Zeitfunktionen, um Ihre Abfragen zu vereinfachen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie td_interval und andere verwenden können.","pt":"Trino SQL oferece funções de tempo poderosas para consultar dados. Aprenda a usar td_interval para trabalhar com intervalos de tempo e fusos horários.","ru":"Trino SQL предоставляет мощные временные функции для запросов данных. Узнайте, как использовать td_interval для работы с временными интервалами и часовыми по...","ar":"يقدم ترينو إس كيو إل دوال وقت قوية لاستعلام البيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدام td_interval للعمل مع فترات الزمن والمناطق الزمنية.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持相对时间","支持时间区间","可选时区，默认为 UTC","td_interval 函数","支持多种时间格式"],"ja":["相対時間をサポート","時間間隔をサポート","オプションのタイムゾーン、デフォルトは UTC","td_interval 関数","複数の時間形式をサポート"],"ko":["상대 시간 지원","시간 간격 지원","선택적 시간대, 기본값은 UTC","td_interval 함수","다중 시간 형식 지원"],"es":["Funciones de tiempo avanzadas","Uso de td_interval","Compatibilidad con zonas horarias","Simplificación de consultas","Análisis de datos temporales"],"fr":["Fonctions de temps avancées","Utilisation de td_interval","Compatibilité avec les fuseaux horaires","Simplification des requêtes","Analyse de données temporaires"],"de":["Erweiterte Zeitfunktionen","Verwendung von td_interval","Unterstützung von Zeitzonen","Vereinfachung von Abfragen","Analyse von Zeitdaten"],"pt":["Funções de tempo para consultar dados","Trabalho com intervalos de tempo","Suporte a fusos horários","Uso de td_interval para consultar dados","Flexibilidade para trabalhar com diferentes fusos horários"],"ru":["Временные функции для запросов данных","Работа с временными интервалами","Поддержка часовых поясов","Использование td_interval для запросов данных","Гибкость для работы с разными часовыми поясами"],"ar":["دوال وقت لاستعلام البيانات","العمل مع فترات الزمن","دعم المناطق الزمنية","استخدام td_interval لاستعلام البيانات","المرونة للعمل مع مناطق زمنية مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Trino SQL","时间函数","td_interval","相对时间","时间区间","时区","UTC"],"ja":["Trino SQL","時間関数","td_interval","相対時間","時間間隔","タイムゾーン","UTC"],"ko":["Trino SQL","시간 함수","td_interval","상대 시간","시간 간격","시간대","UTC"],"es":["Trino SQL","funciones de tiempo","td_interval","zonas horarias","consultas SQL","análisis de datos"],"fr":["Trino SQL","fonctions de temps","td_interval","fuseaux horaires","requêtes SQL","analyse de données"],"de":["Trino SQL","Zeitfunktionen","td_interval","Zeitzonen","SQL-Abfragen","Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Trino SQL","funções de tempo","td_interval","fusos horários","consultar dados","desenvolvedores","Trino","SQL","tempo"],"ru":["Trino SQL","временные функции","td_interval","часовые пояса","запросы данных","разработчики","Trino","SQL","время"],"ar":["ترينو إس كيو إل","دوال وقت","td_interval","مناطق زمنية","استعلام البيانات","مطورين","ترينو","إس كيو إل","زمن"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"trino","description":"TD Trino SQL with TD-specific functions (td_interval, td_time_range, td_time_string, td_sessionize). Use for time-based filtering, partition pruning, and TD query patterns.","bodyPreview":"# TD Trino SQL\n\n## TD Time Functions\n\n### td_interval (Recommended for relative time)\n\n```sql\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d'', ''JST'')      -- Yesterday (JST)\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d'')             -- Yesterday (UTC)\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1w'', ''JST'')      -- Previous week\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1M'', ''JST'')      -- Previous month\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d/-1d'', ''JST'')  -- 2 days ago\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1M/-2M'', ''JST'')  -- 3 months ago\n```\n\nTimezone is optional (defaults to UTC).","body":"# TD Trino SQL\n\n## TD Time Functions\n\n### td_interval (Recommended for relative time)\n\n```sql\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d'', ''JST'')      -- Yesterday (JST)\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d'')             -- Yesterday (UTC)\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1w'', ''JST'')      -- Previous week\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1M'', ''JST'')      -- Previous month\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d/-1d'', ''JST'')  -- 2 days ago\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1M/-2M'', ''JST'')  -- 3 months ago\n```\n\nTimezone is optional (defaults to UTC).\n\n**Note**: Cannot use `td_scheduled_time()` as first arg. Include `td_scheduled_time()` elsewhere in query to establish reference date.\n\n### td_time_range (Explicit dates)\n\n```sql\nwhere td_time_range(time, ''2024-01-01'', ''2024-01-31'')\nwhere td_time_range(time, td_time_add(td_scheduled_time(), ''-7d''), td_scheduled_time())\n```\n\n### td_time_string (Display formatting)\n\n```sql\ntd_time_string(time, ''d!'')         -- 2024-01-15 (UTC)\ntd_time_string(time, ''d!'', ''JST'')  -- 2024-01-15 (JST)\ntd_time_string(time, ''s!'', ''JST'')  -- 2024-01-15 10:30:45\ntd_time_string(time, ''M!'')         -- 2024-01\ntd_time_string(time, ''h!'')         -- 2024-01-15 10\n```\n\nFormat codes: `y!`=year, `q!`=quarter, `M!`=month, `w!`=week, `d!`=day, `h!`=hour, `m!`=minute, `s!`=second. Without `!`, includes timezone offset. Timezone is optional (defaults to UTC).\n\n**Critical**: Use for display only, never for filtering:\n- Good: `select td_time_string(time, ''d!'', ''JST'') as date`\n- Bad: `where td_time_string(time, ''d!'', ''JST'') = ''2024-01-01''`\n\n### td_time_format (Legacy)\n\n```sql\ntd_time_format(time, ''yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss'', ''JST'')\n```\n\n### td_sessionize\n\n```sql\nselect td_sessionize(time, 1800, user_id) as session_id  -- 30min timeout\nfrom events\n```\n\n## Table Format\n\n```sql\nselect * from database_name.table_name\nwhere td_interval(time, ''-1d'', ''JST'')\n```\n\n## Performance\n\nAlways include time filters for partition pruning:\n\n```sql\n-- Good: Partition pruning\nwhere td_time_range(time, ''2024-01-01'', ''2024-01-02'')\n\n-- Bad: Full table scan\nwhere event_type = ''click''  -- Missing time filter!\n```\n\nUse `approx_distinct()` and `approx_percentile()` for large datasets.\n\n## Common Errors\n\n| Error | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Query exceeded memory limit | Add time filters, use approx_ functions |\n| Partition not found | Verify time range syntax |\n\n## Resources\n\n- https://trino.io/docs/current/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:11:09.917Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced time-series querying capabilities in Trino SQL.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Trino SQL 中进行高级时间序列查询的数据分析代理。","ja":"Trino SQL で高度な時系列クエリ機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Trino SQL에서 고급 시계열 쿼리 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan capacidades de consulta de series temporales avanzadas en Trino SQL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant des fonctionnalités de requête de séries chronologiques avancées dans Trino SQL.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Zeitreihen-Abfragefunktionen in Trino SQL benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades de consulta de séries temporais avançadas em Trino SQL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются расширенные возможности запросов временных рядов в Trino SQL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات استعلام متقدمة للسلاسل الزمنية في Trino SQL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables precise relative time filtering in Trino SQL queries with timezone-aware date intervals. Provides built-in functions like td_interval for calculating ''yesterday'', ''previous week'', and custom date ranges with optional timezone specification (defaults to UTC).","zh":"启用 Trino SQL 查询中的精确相对时间过滤，具有时区感知的日期间隔。提供内置函数，如 td_interval，用于计算“昨天”、“上周”和自定义日期范围，带有可选的时区规范（默认为 UTC）。","ja":"Trino SQL クエリで正確な相対時間フィルタリングを可能にし、タイムゾーン認識のある日付間隔を提供します。昨日、前週、カスタム日付範囲（オプションのタイムゾーン指定、デフォルトは UTC）を計算するための td_interval などの組み込み関数を提供します。","ko":"Trino SQL 쿼리에서 정確한 상대 시간 필터링을 가능하게 하며, 시간대 인식 날짜 간격을 제공합니다.昨天, 전주, 사용자 정의 날짜 범위(옵션 시간대 지정, 기본값 UTC)를 계산하는 td_interval과 같은 내장 함수를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite un filtrado de tiempo relativo preciso en consultas de Trino SQL con intervalos de fecha con zona horaria. Proporciona funciones integradas como td_interval para calcular ''ayer'', ''semana anterior'' y rangos de fechas personalizados con especificación de zona horaria opcional (predeterminada en UTC).","fr":"Permet un filtrage de temps relatif précis dans les requêtes Trino SQL avec des intervalles de dates à zone horaire. Fournit des fonctions intégrées comme td_interval pour calculer ''hier'', ''semaine précédente'' et des plages de dates personnalisées avec spécification de fuseau horaire facultatif (par défaut en UTC).","de":"Ermöglicht eine präzise relative Zeitfilterung in Trino SQL-Abfragen mit datumbezogenen Intervallen mit Zeitzone. Bietet integrierte Funktionen wie td_interval zur Berechnung von ''gestern'', ''vorheriger Woche'' und benutzerdefinierten Datumbereichen mit optionaler Zeitzone-Angabe (Standardmäßig UTC).","pt":"Permite filtragem de tempo relativo precisa em consultas Trino SQL com intervalos de datas com fuso horário. Fornece funções incorporadas como td_interval para calcular ''ontem'', ''semana anterior'' e intervalos de datas personalizados com especificação de fuso horário opcional (padrão UTC).","ru":"Позволяет выполнять точную фильтрацию относительного времени в запросах Trino SQL с интервалами дат с учетом часового пояса. Предоставляет встроенные функции, такие как td_interval, для расчета ''вчера'', ''предыдущая неделя'' и пользовательских диапазонов дат с необязательной спецификацией часового пояса (по умолчанию UTC).","ar":"تمكن من تصفية الوقت النسبي الدقيق في استعلامات Trino SQL مع فترات التاريخ مع توفير المنطقة الزمنية. يوفر وظائف مدمجة مثل td_interval لحساب ''الأمس'' و ''الأسبوع السابق'' ومدى التاريخ المخصص مع تحديد المنطقة الزمنية الإختياري (افتراضيًا UTC)."},"useCases":{"en":["Filtering time-series data by relative periods","Generating time-aware analytics reports","Creating dynamic date range queries for dashboards","Handling timezone conversions in temporal data"],"zh":["通过相对周期过滤时间序列数据","生成时间感知的分析报告","为仪表板创建动态日期范围查询","处理时间数据中的时区转换"],"ja":["相対期間で時系列データをフィルタリングする","時間認識のある分析レポートを生成する","ダッシュボード用の動的日付範囲クエリを作成する","時系列データでのタイムゾーン変換を処理する"],"ko":["상대 기간으로 시계열 데이터 필터링","시간 인식 분석 보고서 생성","대시보드에 대한 동적 날짜 범위 쿼리 생성","시간 데이터의 시간대 변환 처리"],"es":["Filtrado de datos de series temporales por períodos relativos","Generación de informes analíticos con conciencia del tiempo","Creación de consultas de rangos de fechas dinámicos para tableros","Gestión de conversiones de zona horaria en datos temporales"],"fr":["Filtrage de données de séries chronologiques par périodes relatives","Génération de rapports d''analyse sensibles au temps","Création de requêtes de plages de dates dynamiques pour tableaux de bord","Gestion des conversions de fuseau horaire dans les données temporelles"],"de":["Filtern von Zeitreihendaten nach relativen Perioden","Erzeugen von zeitbewussten Analyseberichten","Erstellen von dynamischen Datumbereichsabfragen für Dashboards","Verwaltung von Zeitzone-Konvertierungen in temporalen Daten"],"pt":["Filtragem de dados de séries temporais por períodos relativos","Geração de relatórios analíticos com consciência de tempo","Criação de consultas de intervalo de datas dinâmicas para dashboards","Manipulação de conversões de fuso horário em dados temporais"],"ru":["Фильтрация данных временных рядов по относительным периодам","Генерация отчетов аналитики, осведомленных о времени","Создание динамических запросов диапазона дат для панелей","Обработка преобразований часового пояса в временных данных"],"ar":["تصفية بيانات السلاسل الزمنية حسب الفترات النسبية","إنتاج تقارير تحليلية واعية بالزمن","إنشاء استفسارات نطاق التاريخ الديناميكي للوحات التحكم","تعامل مع تحويلات المنطقة الزمنية في البيانات الزمنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Trino-specific SQL syntax required","Timezone support limited to JST/UTC in examples","Requires time column in compatible format"],"zh":["需要 Trino 特定的 SQL 语法","时区支持仅限于 JST/UTC 示例","需要时间列在兼容格式中"],"ja":["Trino 特有的 SQL 構文が必要","タイムゾーンのサポートは JST/UTC の例に限定される","互換性のある形式の時間列が必要"],"ko":["Trino 특정 SQL 구문이 필요","시간대 지원은 JST/UTC 예제로 제한","호환 가능한 형식의 시간 열이 필요"],"es":["Se requiere sintaxis SQL específica de Trino","El soporte de zona horaria está limitado a JST/UTC en los ejemplos","Requiere una columna de tiempo en formato compatible"],"fr":["Une syntaxe SQL spécifique à Trino est requise","Le support de fuseau horaire est limité à JST/UTC dans les exemples","Nécessite une colonne de temps au format compatible"],"de":["Trino-spezifische SQL-Syntax erforderlich","Zeitzone-Unterstützung auf JST/UTC in Beispielen beschränkt","Benötigt eine Zeit-Spalte im kompatiblen Format"],"pt":["Sintaxe SQL específica do Trino necessária","Suporte a fuso horário limitado a JST/UTC nos exemplos","Requer coluna de tempo em formato compatível"],"ru":["Требуется специфический синтаксис SQL Trino","Поддержка часового пояса ограничена JST/UTC в примерах","Требуется столбец времени в совместимом формате"],"ar":["مطلوب بناء الجملة SQL الخاص ب Trino","دعم المنطقة الزمنية مقيد ب JST/UTC في الأمثلة","يتطلب عمود الزمن في تنسيق متوافق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/input', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'input', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:11:11.884Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/input","name":"input","description":{"zh":"输入处理和CLI提示会话管理，实现高效的命令行交互","ja":"入力ハンドリングとCLIのプロンプトセッション管理により、効率的なコマンドライン操作を実現","ko":"입력 처리 및 CLI 프롬프트 세션 관리를 통해 효율적인 명령줄 상호작용을 구현","es":"Input es una habilidad que permite el manejo de entradas y completado para CLI, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Input est une compétence qui permet la gestion des entrées et la complétion pour CLI, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Input ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Handhabung von Eingaben und Vervollständigung für CLI ermöglicht, die Benutzererfahrung verbessert","pt":"O Input é uma habilidade do Claude Code que fornece manipulação de entrada de dados no CLI, incluindo autocompletar e gerenciamento de sessões","ru":"Input — это навык Claude Code, который обеспечивает обработку входных данных в CLI, включая автозаполнение и управление сеансами","ar":"الإدخال هو مهارة في Claude Code تقدم معالجة الإدخال في واجهة سطر الأوامر، بما في ذلك الإكمال التلقائي وإدارة الجلسات","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"输入处理和命令行提示","ja":"入力ハンドリングとCLIのプロンプト","ko":"입력 처리 및 CLI 프롬프트","es":"Input: Manejo de entradas y completado para CLI","fr":"Input: Gestion des entrées et complétion pour CLI","de":"Input: Eingabehandling und Vervollständigung für CLI","pt":"Input: Manipulação de Entrada de Dados no CLI","ru":"Input: Обработка Входных Данных в CLI","ar":"إدخال: معالجة الإدخال في واجهة سطر الأوامر","en":"input"},"description":{"zh":"输入处理和CLI提示会话管理，实现高效的命令行交互","ja":"入力ハンドリングとCLIのプロンプトセッション管理により、効率的なコマンドライン操作を実現","ko":"입력 처리 및 CLI 프롬프트 세션 관리를 통해 효율적인 명령줄 상호작용을 구현","es":"Input es una habilidad que permite el manejo de entradas y completado para CLI, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Input est une compétence qui permet la gestion des entrées et la complétion pour CLI, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Input ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Handhabung von Eingaben und Vervollständigung für CLI ermöglicht, die Benutzererfahrung verbessert","pt":"O Input é uma habilidade do Claude Code que fornece manipulação de entrada de dados no CLI, incluindo autocompletar e gerenciamento de sessões","ru":"Input — это навык Claude Code, который обеспечивает обработку входных данных в CLI, включая автозаполнение и управление сеансами","ar":"الإدخال هو مهارة في Claude Code تقدم معالجة الإدخال في واجهة سطر الأوامر، بما في ذلك الإكمال التلقائي وإدارة الجلسات","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["输入处理","命令行提示","会话管理","自动完成","路径完成"],"ja":["入力ハンドリング","CLIのプロンプト","セッション管理","自動完了","パス完了"],"ko":["입력 처리","CLI 프롬프트","세션 관리","자동 완성","경로 완성"],"es":["Manejo de entradas para CLI","Completado de sesiones de CLI","Soporte para varias opciones de edición","Compatibilidad con diferentes modos de edición","Uso de PathCompleter para completar rutas de archivos","Integración con prompt_toolkit para una mejor experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Gestion des entrées pour CLI","Complétion des sessions CLI","Prise en charge de plusieurs options d''édition","Compatibilité avec différents modes d''édition","Utilisation de PathCompleter pour compléter les chemins de fichiers","Intégration avec prompt_toolkit pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Eingabehandling für CLI","Vervollständigung von CLI-Sitzungen","Unterstützung für verschiedene Editieroptionen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Editiermodi","Verwendung von PathCompleter zur Vervollständigung von Dateipfaden","Integration mit prompt_toolkit für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Manipulação de entrada de dados no CLI","Recursos de autocompletar","Gerenciamento de sessões","Integração com o Prompt Toolkit","Suporte a diferentes modos de edição"],"ru":["Обработка входных данных в CLI","Функции автозаполнения","Управление сеансами","Интеграция с Prompt Toolkit","Поддержка разных режимов редактирования"],"ar":["معالجة الإدخال في واجهة سطر الأوامر","ميزات الإكمال التلقائي","إدارة الجلسات","التكامل مع Prompt Toolkit","دعم أوضاع تحرير مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["输入处理","命令行提示","CLI工具","自动完成","路径完成","会话管理","开发效率"],"ja":["入力ハンドリング","CLIのプロンプト","CLIツール","自動完了","パス完了","セッション管理","開発効率"],"ko":["입력 처리","CLI 프롬프트","CLI 도구","자동 완성","경로 완성","세션 관리","개발 효율"],"es":["input","CLI","manejo de entradas","completado","prompt_toolkit","PathCompleter","edición de texto","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["input","CLI","gestion des entrées","complétion","prompt_toolkit","PathCompleter","édition de texte","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["input","CLI","Eingabehandling","Vervollständigung","prompt_toolkit","PathCompleter","Texteditierung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Input","CLI","Autocompletar","Gerenciamento de sessões","Prompt Toolkit","Desenvolvimento de software","Experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Input","CLI","Автозаполнение","Управление сеансами","Prompt Toolkit","Разработка программного обеспечения","Пользовательский опыт"],"ar":["إدخال","واجهة سطر الأوامر","الإكمال التلقائي","إدارة الجلسات","Prompt Toolkit","تطوير البرمجيات","تجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"input","description":"Imported skill input from langchain","bodyPreview":"\"\"\"Input handling, completers, and prompt session for the CLI.\"\"\"\n\nimport asyncio\nimport os\nimport re\nimport time\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom prompt_toolkit import PromptSession\nfrom prompt_toolkit.completion import (\n    Completer,\n    Completion,\n    PathCompleter,\n    merge_completers,\n)\nfrom prompt_toolkit.document import Document\nfrom prompt_toolkit.enums import EditingMode\nfrom prompt_toolkit.formatted_text import HTML\nfrom prompt_toolkit.key_binding","body":"\"\"\"Input handling, completers, and prompt session for the CLI.\"\"\"\n\nimport asyncio\nimport os\nimport re\nimport time\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom prompt_toolkit import PromptSession\nfrom prompt_toolkit.completion import (\n    Completer,\n    Completion,\n    PathCompleter,\n    merge_completers,\n)\nfrom prompt_toolkit.document import Document\nfrom prompt_toolkit.enums import EditingMode\nfrom prompt_toolkit.formatted_text import HTML\nfrom prompt_toolkit.key_binding import KeyBindings\n\nfrom .config import COLORS, COMMANDS, SessionState, console\nfrom .image_utils import ImageData, get_clipboard_image\n\n# Regex patterns for context-aware completion\nAT_MENTION_RE = re.compile(r\"@(?P<path>(?:[^\\s@]|(?<=\\\\)\\s)*)$\")\nSLASH_COMMAND_RE = re.compile(r\"^/(?P<command>[a-z]*)$\")\n\nEXIT_CONFIRM_WINDOW = 3.0\n\n\nclass ImageTracker:\n    \"\"\"Track pasted images in the current conversation.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.images: list[ImageData] = []\n        self.next_id = 1\n\n    def add_image(self, image_data: ImageData) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Add an image and return its placeholder text.\n\n        Args:\n            image_data: The image data to track\n\n        Returns:\n            Placeholder string like \"[image 1]\"\n        \"\"\"\n        placeholder = f\"[image {self.next_id}]\"\n        image_data.placeholder = placeholder\n        self.images.append(image_data)\n        self.next_id += 1\n        return placeholder\n\n    def get_images(self) -> list[ImageData]:\n        \"\"\"Get all tracked images.\"\"\"\n        return self.images.copy()\n\n    def clear(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Clear all tracked images and reset counter.\"\"\"\n        self.images.clear()\n        self.next_id = 1\n\n\nclass FilePathCompleter(Completer):\n    \"\"\"Activate filesystem completion only when cursor is after ''@''.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.path_completer = PathCompleter(\n            expanduser=True,\n            min_input_len=0,\n            only_directories=False,\n        )\n\n    def get_completions(self, document, complete_event):\n        \"\"\"Get file path completions when @ is detected.\"\"\"\n        text = document.text_before_cursor\n\n        # Use regex to detect @path pattern at end of line\n        m = AT_MENTION_RE.search(text)\n        if not m:\n            return  # Not in an @path context\n\n        path_fragment = m.group(\"path\")\n\n        # Unescape the path for PathCompleter (it doesn''t understand escape sequences)\n        unescaped_fragment = path_fragment.replace(\"\\\\ \", \" \")\n\n        # Strip trailing backslash if present (user is in the process of typing an escape)\n        unescaped_fragment = unescaped_fragment.removesuffix(\"\\\\\")\n\n        # Create temporary document for the unescaped path fragment\n        temp_doc = Document(text=unescaped_fragment, cursor_position=len(unescaped_fragment))\n\n        # Get completions from PathCompleter and use its start_position\n        # PathCompleter returns suffix text with start_position=0 (insert at cursor)\n        for comp in self.path_completer.get_completions(temp_doc, complete_event):\n            # Add trailing / for directories so users can continue navigating\n            completed_path = Path(unescaped_fragment + comp.text).expanduser()\n            # Re-escape spaces in the completion text for the command line\n            completion_text = comp.text.replace(\" \", \"\\\\ \")\n            if completed_path.is_dir() and not completion_text.endswith(\"/\"):\n                completion_text += \"/\"\n\n            yield Completion(\n                text=completion_text,\n                start_position=comp.start_position,  # Use PathCompleter''s position (usually 0)\n                display=comp.display,\n                display_meta=comp.display_meta,\n            )\n\n\nclass CommandCompleter(Completer):\n    \"\"\"Activate command completion only when line starts with ''/''.\"\"\"\n\n    def get_completions(self, document, _complete_event):\n        \"\"\"Get command completions when / is at the start.\"\"\"\n        text = document.text_before_cursor\n\n        # Use regex to detect /command pattern at start of line\n        m = SLASH_COMMAND_RE.match(text)\n        if not m:\n            return  # Not in a /command context\n\n        command_fragment = m.group(\"command\")\n\n        # Match commands that start with the fragment (case-insensitive)\n        for cmd_name, cmd_desc in COMMANDS.items():\n            if cmd_name.startswith(command_fragment.lower()):\n                yield Completion(\n                    text=cmd_name,\n                    start_position=-len(command_fragment),  # Fixed position for original document\n                    display=cmd_name,\n                    display_meta=cmd_desc,\n                )\n\n\ndef parse_file_mentions(text: str) -> tuple[str, list[Path]]:\n    \"\"\"Extract @file mentions and return cleaned text with resolved file paths.\"\"\"\n    pattern = r\"@((?:[^\\s@]|(?<=\\\\)\\s)+)\"  # Match @filename, allowing escaped spaces\n    matches = re.findall(pattern, text)\n\n    files = []\n    for match in matches:\n        # Remove escape characters\n        clean_path = match.replace(\"\\\\ \", \" \")\n        path = Path(clean_path).expanduser()\n\n        # Try to resolve relative to cwd\n        if not path.is_absolute():\n            path = Path.cwd() / path\n\n        try:\n            path = path.resolve()\n            if path.exists() and path.is_file():\n                files.append(path)\n            else:\n                console.print(f\"[yellow]Warning: File not found: {match}[/yellow]\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            console.print(f\"[yellow]Warning: Invalid path {match}: {e}[/yellow]\")\n\n    return text, files\n\n\ndef parse_image_placeholders(text: str) -> tuple[str, int]:\n    \"\"\"Count image placeholders in text.\n\n    Args:\n        text: Input text potentially containing [image] or [image N] placeholders\n\n    Returns:\n        Tuple of (text, count) where count is the number of image placeholders found\n    \"\"\"\n    # Match [image] or [image N] patterns\n    pattern = r\"\\[image(?:\\s+\\d+)?\\]\"\n    matches = re.findall(pattern, text, re.IGNORECASE)\n    return text, len(matches)\n\n\ndef get_bottom_toolbar(\n    session_state: SessionState, session_ref: dict\n) -> Callable[[], list[tuple[str, str]]]:\n    \"\"\"Return toolbar function that shows auto-approve status and BASH MODE.\"\"\"\n\n    def toolbar() -> list[tuple[str, str]]:\n        parts = []\n\n        # Check if we''re in BASH mode (input starts with !)\n        try:\n            session = session_ref.get(\"session\")\n            if session:\n                current_text = session.default_buffer.text\n                if current_text.startswith(\"!\"):\n                    parts.append((\"bg:#ff1493 fg:#ffffff bold\", \" BASH MODE \"))\n                    parts.append((\"\", \" | \"))\n        except (AttributeError, TypeError):\n            # Silently ignore - toolbar is non-critical and called frequently\n            pass\n\n        # Base status message\n        if session_state.auto_approve:\n            base_msg = \"auto-accept ON (CTRL+T to toggle)\"\n            base_class = \"class:toolbar-green\"\n        else:\n            base_msg = \"manual accept (CTRL+T to toggle)\"\n            base_class = \"class:toolbar-orange\"\n\n        parts.append((base_class, base_msg))\n\n        # Show exit confirmation hint if active\n        hint_until = session_state.exit_hint_until\n        if hint_until is not None:\n            now = time.monotonic()\n            if now < hint_until:\n                parts.append((\"\", \" | \"))\n                parts.append((\"class:toolbar-exit\", \" Ctrl+C again to exit \"))\n            else:\n                session_state.exit_hint_until = None\n\n        return parts\n\n    return toolbar\n\n\ndef create_prompt_session(\n    _assistant_id: str, session_state: SessionState, image_tracker: ImageTracker | None = None\n) -> PromptSession:\n    \"\"\"Create a configured PromptSession with all features.\"\"\"\n    # Set default editor if not already set\n    if \"EDITOR\" not in os.environ:\n        os.environ[\"EDITOR\"] = \"nano\"\n\n    # Create key bindings\n    kb = KeyBindings()\n\n    @kb.add(\"c-c\")\n    def _(event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Require double Ctrl+C within a short window to exit.\"\"\"\n        app = event.app\n        now = time.monotonic()\n\n        if session_state.exit_hint_until is not None and now < session_state.exit_hint_until:\n            handle = session_state.exit_hint_handle\n            if handle:\n                handle.cancel()\n                session_state.exit_hint_handle = None\n            session_state.exit_hint_until = None\n            app.invalidate()\n            app.exit(exception=KeyboardInterrupt())\n            return\n\n        session_state.exit_hint_until = now + EXIT_CONFIRM_WINDOW\n\n        handle = session_state.exit_hint_handle\n        if handle:\n            handle.cancel()\n\n        loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\n        app_ref = app\n\n        def clear_hint() -> None:\n            if (\n                session_state.exit_hint_until is not None\n                and time.monotonic() >= session_state.exit_hint_until\n            ):\n                session_state.exit_hint_until = None\n                session_state.exit_hint_handle = None\n                app_ref.invalidate()\n\n        session_state.exit_hint_handle = loop.call_later(EXIT_CONFIRM_WINDOW, clear_hint)\n\n        app.invalidate()\n\n    # Bind Ctrl+T to toggle auto-approve\n    @kb.add(\"c-t\")\n    def _(event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Toggle auto-approve mode.\"\"\"\n        session_state.toggle_auto_approve()\n        # Force UI refresh to update toolbar\n        event.app.invalidate()\n\n    # Custom paste handler to detect images\n    if image_tracker:\n        from prompt_toolkit.keys import Keys\n\n        def _handle_paste_with_image_check(event, pasted_text: str = \"\") -> None:\n            \"\"\"Check clipboard for image, otherwise insert pasted text.\"\"\"\n            # Try to get an image from clipboard\n            clipboard_image = get_clipboard_image()\n\n            if clipboard_image:\n                # Found an image! Add it to tracker and insert placeholder\n                placeholder = image_tracker.add_image(clipboard_image)\n                # Insert placeholder (no confirmation message)\n                event.current_buffer.insert_text(placeholder)\n            elif pasted_text:\n                # No image, insert the pasted text\n                event.current_buffer.insert_text(pasted_text)\n            else:\n                # Fallback: try to get text from prompt_toolkit clipboard\n                clipboard_data = event.app.clipboard.get_data()\n                if clipboard_data and clipboard_data.text:\n                    event.current_buffer.insert_text(clipboard_data.text)\n\n        @kb.add(Keys.BracketedPaste)\n        def _(event) -> None:\n            \"\"\"Handle bracketed paste (Cmd+V on macOS) - check for images first.\"\"\"\n            # Bracketed paste provides the pasted text in event.data\n            pasted_text = event.data if hasattr(event, \"data\") else \"\"\n            _handle_paste_with_image_check(event, pasted_text)\n\n        @kb.add(\"c-v\")\n        def _(event) -> None:\n            \"\"\"Handle Ctrl+V paste - check for images first.\"\"\"\n            _handle_paste_with_image_check(event)\n\n    # Bind regular Enter to submit (intuitive behavior)\n    @kb.add(\"enter\")\n    def _(event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Enter submits the input, unless completion menu is active.\"\"\"\n        buffer = event.current_buffer\n\n        # If completion menu is showing, apply the current completion\n        if buffer.complete_state:\n            # Get the current completion (the highlighted one)\n            current_completion = buffer.complete_state.current_completion\n\n            # If no completion is selected (user hasn''t navigated), select and apply the first one\n            if not current_completion and buffer.complete_state.completions:\n                # Move to the first completion\n                buffer.complete_next()\n                # Now apply it\n                buffer.apply_completion(buffer.complete_state.current_completion)\n            elif current_completion:\n                # Apply the already-selected completion\n                buffer.apply_completion(current_completion)\n            else:\n                # No completions available, close menu\n                buffer.complete_state = None\n        # Don''t submit if buffer is empty or only whitespace\n        elif buffer.text.strip():\n            # Normal submit\n            buffer.validate_and_handle()\n            # If empty, do nothing (don''t submit)\n\n    # Alt+Enter for newlines (press ESC then Enter, or Option+Enter on Mac)\n    @kb.add(\"escape\", \"enter\")\n    def _(event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Alt+Enter inserts a newline for multi-line input.\"\"\"\n        event.current_buffer.insert_text(\"\\n\")\n\n    # Ctrl+E to open in external editor\n    @kb.add(\"c-e\")\n    def _(event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Open the current input in an external editor (nano by default).\"\"\"\n        event.current_buffer.open_in_editor()\n\n    # Backspace handler to retrigger completions and delete image tags as units\n    @kb.add(\"backspace\")\n    def _(event) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Handle backspace: delete image tags as single unit, retrigger completion.\"\"\"\n        buffer = event.current_buffer\n        text_before = buffer.document.text_before_cursor\n\n        # Check if cursor is right after an image tag like [image 1] or [image 12]\n        image_tag_pattern = r\"\\[image \\d+\\]$\"\n        match = re.search(image_tag_pattern, text_before)\n\n        if match and image_tracker:\n            # Delete the entire tag\n            tag_length = len(match.group(0))\n            buffer.delete_before_cursor(count=tag_length)\n\n            # Remove the image from tracker and reset counter\n            tag_text = match.group(0)\n            image_num_match = re.search(r\"\\d+\", tag_text)\n            if image_num_match:\n                image_num = int(image_num_match.group(0))\n                # Remove image at index (1-based to 0-based)\n                if 0 < image_num <= len(image_tracker.images):\n                    image_tracker.images.pop(image_num - 1)\n                    # Reset counter to next available number\n                    image_tracker.next_id = len(image_tracker.images) + 1\n        else:\n            # Normal backspace\n            buffer.delete_before_cursor(count=1)\n\n        # Check if we''re in a completion context (@ or /)\n        text = buffer.document.text_before_cursor\n        if AT_MENTION_RE.search(text) or SLASH_COMMAND_RE.match(text):\n            # Retrigger completion\n            buffer.start_completion(select_first=False)\n\n    from prompt_toolkit.styles import Style\n\n    # Define styles for the toolbar with full-width background colors\n    toolbar_style = Style.from_dict(\n        {\n            \"bottom-toolbar\": \"noreverse\",  # Disable default reverse video\n            \"toolbar-green\": \"bg:#10b981 #000000\",  # Green for auto-accept ON\n            \"toolbar-orange\": \"bg:#f59e0b #000000\",  # Orange for manual accept\n            \"toolbar-exit\": \"bg:#2563eb #ffffff\",  # Blue for exit hint\n        }\n    )\n\n    # Create session reference dict for toolbar to access session\n    session_ref = {}\n\n    # Create the session\n    session = PromptSession(\n        message=HTML(f''<style fg=\"{COLORS[\"user\"]}\">></style> ''),\n        multiline=True,  # Keep multiline support but Enter submits\n        key_bindings=kb,\n        completer=merge_completers([CommandCompleter(), FilePathCompleter()]),\n        editing_mode=EditingMode.EMACS,\n        complete_while_typing=True,  # Show completions as you type\n        complete_in_thread=True,  # Async completion prevents menu freezing\n        mouse_support=False,\n        enable_open_in_editor=True,  # Allow Ctrl+X Ctrl+E to open external editor\n        bottom_toolbar=get_bottom_toolbar(\n            session_state, session_ref\n        ),  # Persistent status bar at bottom\n        style=toolbar_style,  # Apply toolbar styling\n        reserve_space_for_menu=7,  # Reserve space for completion menu to show 5-6 results\n    )\n\n    # Store session reference for toolbar to access\n    session_ref[\"session\"] = session\n\n    return session\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:11:11.884Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for CLI-based Agents requiring sophisticated user interaction and input completion capabilities.","zh":"对于需要复杂用户交互和输入补全功能的基于CLI的代理而言至关重要。","ja":"CLIベースのエージェントで、高度なユーザーインタラクションと入力補完機能を必要とする場合に必須です。","ko":"CLI 기반 에이전트에서 정교한 사용자 상호작용 및 입력 완성 기능이 필요한 경우 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes basados en CLI que requieren una interacción de usuario sofisticada y capacidades de finalización de entrada.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents basés sur CLI nécessitant une interaction utilisateur sophistiquée et des capacités de complétion de saisie.","de":"Wesentlich für CLI-basierte Agenten, die eine anspruchsvolle Benutzerinteraktion und Eingabe-Vervollständigungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes baseados em CLI que exigem interação do usuário sofisticada e capacidades de conclusão de entrada.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов на основе CLI, требующих сложного взаимодействия с пользователем и возможностей завершения ввода.","ar":"ضروري لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يتطلب تفاعل مستخدم متقدم وقدرات إكمال الإدخال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables advanced prompt handling with multi-source completion through prompt_toolkit integration, featuring PathCompleter and custom Completer support for dynamic input processing in interactive sessions.","zh":"通过prompt_toolkit集成实现多源补全的高级提示处理，具有PathCompleter和自定义Completer支持，用于交互式会话中的动态输入处理。","ja":"prompt_toolkit統合によるマルチソース補完を備えた高度なプロンプト処理を実現し、対話型セッションにおける動的入力処理のためのPathCompleterとカスタムCompleterサポートを特徴とします。","ko":"prompt_toolkit 통합을 통한 다중 소스 완료로 고급 프롬프트 처리를 가능하게 하며, 대화형 세션에서 동적 입력 처리를 위한 PathCompleter 및 사용자 정의 Completer 지원을 특징으로 합니다.","es":"Permite el manejo avanzado de solicitudes con finalización multi-origen a través de la integración de prompt_toolkit, con función de PathCompleter y soporte de finalizador personalizado para el procesamiento dinámico de entrada en sesiones interactivas.","fr":"Permet la gestion avancée des invites avec une complétion multi-source via l''intégration de prompt_toolkit, présentant la fonction PathCompleter et le support de compléteur personnalisé pour le traitement dynamique de saisie dans les sessions interactives.","de":"Ermöglicht erweitertes Prompt-Handling mit Multi-Quellen-Vervollständigung durch prompt_toolkit-Integration, mit Funktionen wie PathCompleter und benutzerdefiniertem Completer-Unterstützung für dynamische Eingabeverarbeitung in interaktiven Sitzungen.","pt":"Permite tratamento de prompt avançado com conclusão multi-fonte por meio da integração do prompt_toolkit, com recursos de PathCompleter e suporte a Completer personalizado para processamento de entrada dinâmico em sessões interativas.","ru":"Позволяет обрабатывать advanced-промпты с помощью многозначной завершения через интеграцию с prompt_toolkit, включающую поддержку PathCompleter и пользовательского Completer для динамической обработки ввода в интерактивных сессиях.","ar":"يسمح بمعالجة سهم متقدم مع إكمال متعدد المراجع من خلال دمج أداة الإشارة، وتضمين دعم PathCompleter و Completer مخصص لعملية إدخال ديناميكية في الجلسات التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing auto-complete for file system navigation","Building interactive CLI sessions with custom completion logic","Handling complex user input patterns with regex validation","Managing asynchronous input streams in agent environments"],"zh":["实现文件系统导航的自动补全","构建具有自定义补全逻辑的交互式CLI会话","使用正则表达式验证处理复杂的用户输入模式","在代理环境中管理异步输入流"],"ja":["ファイルシステムナビゲーションの自動補完の実装","カスタム補完ロジックを持つ対話型CLIセッションの構築","正規表現検証による複雑なユーザー入力パターンの処理","エージェント環境での非同期入力ストリームの管理"],"ko":["파일 시스템 탐색을 위한 자동 완성 구현","사용자 정의 완성 로직을 갖춘 대화형 CLI 세션 구축","정규식 검증으로 복잡한 사용자 입력 패턴 처리","에이전트 환경에서 비동기 입력 스트림 관리"],"es":["Implementar la finalización automática para la navegación del sistema de archivos","Crear sesiones de CLI interactivas con lógica de finalización personalizada","Controlar patrones de entrada de usuario complejos con validación de regex","Administrar flujos de entrada asíncronos en entornos de agentes"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''autocomplétion pour la navigation du système de fichiers","Construire des sessions CLI interactives avec une logique de complétion personnalisée","Gérer des modèles d''entrée utilisateur complexes avec validation regex","Gérer les flux d''entrée asynchrones dans les environnements d''agents"],"de":["Automatische Vervollständigung für die Dateisystemnavigation implementieren","Interaktive CLI-Sitzungen mit benutzerdefinierter Vervollständigungslogik erstellen","Komplexe Benutzereingabemuster mit Regex-Validierung verarbeiten","Asynchrone Eingabeströme in Agenten-Umgebungen verwalten"],"pt":["Implementação de auto-completar para navegação do sistema de arquivos","Construção de sessões de CLI interativas com lógica de conclusão personalizada","Tratamento de padrões de entrada de usuário complexos com validação por regex","Gerenciamento de fluxos de entrada assíncronos em ambientes de agente"],"ru":["Реализация автозаполнения для навигации по файловой системе","Создание интерактивных сессий CLI с пользовательской логикой завершения","Обработка сложных шаблонов ввода пользователя с помощью валидации regex","Управление асинхронными потоками ввода в средах агента"],"ar":["تنفيذ التكميل التلقائي للتنقل في نظام الملفات","بناء جلسات واجهة سطر الأوامر التفاعلية مع منطق إكمال مخصص","معالجة أنماط إدخال المستخدم المعقدة بالتحقق من النمط","إدارة تدفقات الإدخال غير المتزامنة في بيئات العميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prompt_toolkit dependency","Python-specific implementation","Limited to CLI interface contexts","Asynchronous operations require asyncio compatibility"],"zh":["需要prompt_toolkit依赖项","特定于Python的实现","仅限于CLI接口上下文","异步操作需要asyncio兼容性"],"ja":["prompt_toolkit依存関係が必要","Pythonに特化した実装","CLIインターフェースコンテキストに限定","非同期操作にはasyncio互換性が必要"],"ko":["prompt_toolkit 종속성 필요","Python 전용 구현","CLI 인터페이스 컨텍스트로 제한됨","비동기 작업에는 asyncio 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la dependencia de prompt_toolkit","Implementación específica de Python","Limitado a contextos de interfaz de CLI","Operaciones asíncronas requieren compatibilidad con asyncio"],"fr":["Nécessite la dépendance prompt_toolkit","Implémentation spécifique à Python","Limité aux contextes d''interface CLI","Les opérations asynchrones nécessitent une compatibilité avec asyncio"],"de":["Benötigt die Abhängigkeit von prompt_toolkit","Python-spezifische Implementierung","Begrenzt auf CLI-Schnittstellenkontexte","Asynchrone Operationen erfordern asyncio-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Exige dependência do prompt_toolkit","Implementação específica do Python","Limitado a contextos de interface de CLI","Operações assíncronas exigem compatibilidade com asyncio"],"ru":["Требует зависимости от prompt_toolkit","Реализация специфичная для Python","Ограничен контекстами интерфейса командной строки","Асинхронные операции требуют совместимости с asyncio"],"ar":["يتطلب اعتمادًا على حزمة أداة الإشارة","تنفيذ محدد لغة بايثون","محدود سياقات واجهة سطر الأوامر","العمليات غير المتزامنة تتطلب توافقًا مع asyncio"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
