erzeichnissen","Integration mit CLI"],"pt":["Validação de qualidade de código para 9 linguagens de programação","Análise assistida por TLDR","Detecção automática de linguagens de programação","Suporte a execução via CLI","Suporte a execução em diretórios específicos"],"ru":["Проверка качества кода для 9 языков программирования","Анализ, помогаемый TLDR","Автоматическое обнаружение языков программирования","Поддержка выполнения через CLI","Поддержка выполнения в конкретных директориях"],"ar":["التحقق من جودة الكود لدعم 9 لغات برمجة","التحليل المدعوم من TLDR","التحديد التلقائي للغات البرمجة","دعم التشغيل عبر CLI","دعم التشغيل في مجلدات محددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码质量验证","Gates","自动检测","TLDR","代码分析","代码验证","编程语言","命令行工具","代码结构"],"ja":["コード品質バリデーション","Gates","自動検出","TLDR","コード分析","コード検証","プログラミング言語","コマンドラインツール","コード構造"],"ko":["코드 품질 검증","Gates","자동 탐지","TLDR","코드 분석","코드 검증","프로그래밍 언어","명령행 도구","코드 구조"],"es":["validación de calidad","análisis de código","desarrollo de software","lenguajes de programación","TLDR","CLI","pruebas automatizadas","calidad del código","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["validation de qualité","analyse de code","développement de logiciels","langages de programmation","TLDR","CLI","tests automatisés","qualité du code","outils de développement"],"de":["Qualitätssicherung","Code-Analyse","Software-Entwicklung","Programmiersprachen","TLDR","CLI","automatisierte Tests","Code-Qualität","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["validação de qualidade de código","análise de código","desenvolvimento de software","linguagens de programação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","qualidade de código","TLDR","CLI","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["проверка качества кода","анализ кода","разработка программного обеспечения","языки программирования","инструменты разработки","качество кода","TLDR","CLI","разработка приложений"],"ar":["التحقق من جودة الكود","تحليل الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","لغات البرمجة","أدوات التطوير","جودة الكود","TLDR","CLI","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gates","description":"9-language quality gate validation: linting, formatting, type checking, and test execution. Validates code changes meet quality standards before completion. Use when: (1) after code implementation, (2) before PR creation, (3) as part of /orchestrator Step 6, (4) manual quality check. Triggers: /gates, quality gates, run validation, check quality, validate code.","bodyPreview":"# Gates - Quality Validation (v2.37)\n\nComprehensive quality validation across 9 programming languages with **TLDR-assisted analysis**.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n/gates              # Run all quality gates\nralph gates         # Via CLI\nralph gates src/    # Specific directory\n```\n\n## Pre-Gates: TLDR Language Detection (v2.37)\n\n**AUTOMATIC** - Detect project languages efficiently:\n\n```bash\n# Get codebase structure to detect languages (95% token savings)\ntldr structure . > /tmp/project-structure.md","body":"# Gates - Quality Validation (v2.37)\n\nComprehensive quality validation across 9 programming languages with **TLDR-assisted analysis**.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n/gates              # Run all quality gates\nralph gates         # Via CLI\nralph gates src/    # Specific directory\n```\n\n## Pre-Gates: TLDR Language Detection (v2.37)\n\n**AUTOMATIC** - Detect project languages efficiently:\n\n```bash\n# Get codebase structure to detect languages (95% token savings)\ntldr structure . > /tmp/project-structure.md\n\n# From structure, identify:\n# - Primary language(s)\n# - Config files present\n# - Test frameworks used\n```\n\n## Supported Languages\n\n| Language | Linter | Formatter | Types |\n|----------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| TypeScript | ESLint | Prettier | tsc |\n| JavaScript | ESLint | Prettier | - |\n| Python | Ruff | Black | mypy |\n| Rust | Clippy | rustfmt | cargo check |\n| Go | golint | gofmt | go vet |\n| Java | Checkstyle | google-java-format | - |\n| Ruby | RuboCop | - | Sorbet |\n| PHP | PHP_CodeSniffer | php-cs-fixer | PHPStan |\n| Solidity | Solhint | prettier-solidity | - |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Detect Languages\n```bash\n# Auto-detect based on file extensions and config files\n```\n\n### 2. Run Linters\n```bash\n# Per-language linting\nnpx eslint src/          # TypeScript/JavaScript\nruff check .             # Python\ncargo clippy             # Rust\ngolangci-lint run        # Go\n```\n\n### 3. Check Formatting\n```bash\nnpx prettier --check .   # JS/TS\nblack --check .          # Python\nrustfmt --check src/     # Rust\ngofmt -l .               # Go\n```\n\n### 4. Type Checking\n```bash\nnpx tsc --noEmit         # TypeScript\nmypy .                   # Python\ncargo check              # Rust\ngo vet ./...             # Go\n```\n\n### 5. Run Tests\n```bash\nnpm test                 # Node projects\npytest                   # Python\ncargo test               # Rust\ngo test ./...            # Go\n```\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| 0 | All gates passed |\n| 1 | Lint errors |\n| 2 | Format errors |\n| 3 | Type errors |\n| 4 | Test failures |\n\n## Gate Configuration\n\n### Minimal (fast)\n```bash\nralph gates --minimal    # Lint only\n```\n\n### Standard (default)\n```bash\nralph gates              # Lint + Format + Types\n```\n\n### Full (CI)\n```bash\nralph gates --full       # Lint + Format + Types + Tests\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n- Invoked by /orchestrator in Step 6\n- **Pre-step: tldr structure for language detection** (v2.37)\n- Must pass before VERIFIED_DONE\n- Hooks: `quality-gates.sh` (PostToolUse)\n\n## TLDR Integration (v2.37)\n\n| Phase | TLDR Command | Purpose |\n|-------|--------------|---------|\n| Language detection | `tldr structure .` | Identify languages |\n| Error context | `tldr context $FILE .` | Understand failing code |\n| Impact analysis | `tldr deps $FILE .` | Find related tests |\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Never skip gates for \"quick fixes\"\n- Never ignore type errors\n- Never commit with lint warnings\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:11:29.677Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing comprehensive quality validation across multiple programming languages.","zh":"非常适合需要跨多种编程语言进行全面质量验证的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が複数のプログラミング言語で包括的な品質検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"여러 프로그래밍 언어에서 포괄적인 품질 검증이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una validación de calidad integral en múltiples lenguajes de programación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une validation de qualité complète sur plusieurs langages de programmation.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine umfassende Qualitätsvalidierung in mehreren Programmiersprachen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de validação de qualidade abrangente em várias linguagens de programação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым требуется всесторонняя проверка качества на нескольких языках программирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق الشامل من الجودة عبر عدة لغات برمجة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform TLDR-assisted analysis and automatic language detection, enabling efficient codebase structure analysis and quality gate validation across 9 programming languages via CLI commands like `/gates` and `ralph gates`.","zh":"赋予代理执行TLDR辅助分析和自动语言检测的能力，使得通过CLI命令（如 `/gates` 和 `ralph gates`）能够高效地分析代码库结构并验证质量门控，支持9种编程语言。","ja":"TLDRアシスト分析と自動言語検出を実行するエージェントを可能にし、CLIコマンド（例： `/gates` と `ralph gates`）を介してコードベース構造を効率的に分析し、9つのプログラミング言語をサポートして品質ゲート検証を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 TLDR 보조 분석 및 자동 언어 감지를 수행하도록 하여 CLI 명령어(예: `/gates` 및 `ralph gates`)를 통해 코드베이스 구조를 효율적으로 분석하고 9개 프로그래밍 언어를 지원하여 품질 게이트 검증을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis asistidos por TLDR y detección automática de lenguaje, lo que permite un análisis eficiente de la estructura del código y la validación de la calidad en 9 lenguajes de programación a través de comandos de CLI como `/gates` y `ralph gates`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une analyse assistée par TLDR et une détection automatique de langage, ce qui permet une analyse efficace de la structure du code et une validation de la qualité sur 9 langages de programmation via des commandes CLI comme `/gates` et `ralph gates`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, TLDR-unterstützte Analysen und automatische Spracherkennung durchzuführen, wodurch eine effiziente Analyse der Codebasis-Struktur und die Qualitäts-Tor-Validierung in 9 Programmiersprachen über CLI-Befehle wie `/gates` und `ralph gates` ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análise assistida por TLDR e detecção automática de idioma, permitindo análise eficiente da estrutura do código e validação da porta de qualidade em 9 linguagens de programação por meio de comandos CLI como `/gates` e `ralph gates`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить анализ с помощью TLDR и автоматическое обнаружение языка, что позволяет эффективно анализировать структуру кода и проверять качество ворот в 9 языках программирования посредством команд CLI, таких как `/gates` и `ralph gates`.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إجراء تحليل مدعوم من TLDR والكشف التلقائي عن اللغة، مما يسمح بتحليل فعال للبنية البرمجية و التحقق من بوابة الجودة في 9 لغات برمجة عبر أوامر CLI مثل `/gates` و `ralph gates`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code quality validation","Detecting project languages efficiently","Validating codebase structure"],"zh":["自动化代码质量验证","高效地检测项目语言","验证代码库结构"],"ja":["コード品質の検証を自動化する","プロジェクト言語を効率的に検出する","コードベース構造を検証する"],"ko":["코드 품질 검증 자동화","프로젝트 언어를 효율적으로 감지","코드베이스 구조 검증"],"es":["Automatizar la validación de la calidad del código","Detectar los lenguajes del proyecto de manera eficiente","Validar la estructura de la base de código"],"fr":["Automatiser la validation de la qualité du code","Détecter les langages du projet de manière efficace","Valider la structure de la base de code"],"de":["Automatisieren der Code-Qualitätsvalidierung","Effiziente Erkennung der Projekt-Sprachen","Validierung der Codebasis-Struktur"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação da qualidade do código","Detectar idiomas de projeto de forma eficiente","Validar a estrutura da base de código"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки качества кода","Эффективное обнаружение языков проекта","Проверка структуры кода"],"ar":["تأتمتة التحقق من جودة الكود","الكشف الفعال عن لغات المشروع","التحقق من بنية الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLI access","Limited to 9 supported programming languages"],"zh":["需要CLI访问","仅限9种支持的编程语言"],"ja":["CLIアクセスが必要","9つのサポートされているプログラミング言語に限定される"],"ko":["CLI 접근이 필요","9개의 지원되는 프로그래밍 언어로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a CLI","Limitado a 9 lenguajes de programación compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à CLI","Limité à 9 langages de programmation pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt CLI-Zugriff","Begrenzt auf 9 unterstützte Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Requer acesso CLI","Limitado a 9 linguagens de programação suportadas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ CLI","Ограничен 9 поддерживаемыми языками программирования"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى CLI","محدود بلغات برمجة مدعومة 9"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
