volvimento de software","engenharia de software","documentação técnica"],"ru":["технический отчет","сводка для discord","создание отчетов","структура отчета","markdown","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","техническая документация"],"ar":["تقرير تقني","ملخص لمنصة Discord","إنشاء تقارير","هيكل تقرير","markdown","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","وثائق تقنية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"report","description":"Create structured reports for technical findings, test results, and analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Report Skill\n\nCreate technical reports with Discord-friendly summaries for sharing findings.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `<topic>`: Brief description of what the report covers (e.g., \"CREATE2 collision resolution\")\n\n## Output\n\nReports are saved to `reports/YYMMDD_SLUG.md` where:\n- `YYMMDD` is the current date (e.g., 260130 for 2026-01-30)\n- `SLUG` is a brief descriptive name in SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE\n\n## Report Structure\n\nEvery report has two parts:\n\n### 1. Discord Summary (top of file)\n\nWrapped in HTML co","body":"# Report Skill\n\nCreate technical reports with Discord-friendly summaries for sharing findings.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `<topic>`: Brief description of what the report covers (e.g., \"CREATE2 collision resolution\")\n\n## Output\n\nReports are saved to `reports/YYMMDD_SLUG.md` where:\n- `YYMMDD` is the current date (e.g., 260130 for 2026-01-30)\n- `SLUG` is a brief descriptive name in SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE\n\n## Report Structure\n\nEvery report has two parts:\n\n### 1. Discord Summary (top of file)\n\nWrapped in HTML comment markers for easy copy-paste. Must follow these rules:\n\n**Character Limit:** Maximum 1900 characters (buffer under Discord''s 2000 limit)\n\n**Formatting Rules:**\n- NO TABLES - Discord doesn''t render markdown tables\n- Use code blocks for tabular data instead\n- Use `**bold**` for emphasis\n- Use `### Headings` for sections\n- Wrap URLs in angle brackets: `<https://example.com>`\n\n**Required Sections:**\n1. Title with key metric\n2. Metadata line (client, suite, counts)\n3. Brief summary (1-2 sentences)\n4. Key findings in code block format\n5. Analysis (root cause in 2-3 sentences)\n6. Impact assessment\n7. Next steps (numbered list)\n8. Link to full report\n\n**Template:**\n\n```markdown\n<!-- DISCORD SUMMARY (paste everything between the markers) -->\n## [Title]: [Key Metric]\n\n**[Context]:** [value] | **[Metric]:** [numbers]\n\n[1-2 sentence summary]\n\n### [Section Name]\n\n```\n[Data in code block - NOT a table]\n```\n\n### Analysis\n\n**Root cause:** [Brief explanation]\n\n### Impact\n\n**[Severity] for [context]** - [Practical implications]\n\n### Next Steps\n1. [Action item]\n2. [Action item]\n\n**Full report:** <[URL]>\n<!-- END DISCORD SUMMARY -->\n```\n\n### 2. Full Report (below the summary)\n\nAfter a horizontal rule (`---`), include the detailed report:\n\n**Required Sections:**\n1. Title and metadata (date, test suite, client version)\n2. Executive summary\n3. Context (why this report exists)\n4. Detailed findings (tables, logs, specifics)\n5. Root cause analysis\n6. Impact assessment\n7. Recommendations (short/medium/long-term)\n8. References (links to specs, repos)\n9. Appendix (log locations, raw data)\n\n**Formatting:**\n- Tables are fine in full report (GitHub renders them)\n- Include code blocks for log excerpts\n- Link to specific files with `file:line` notation\n- Reference external specs with full URLs\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Gather all relevant data (logs, test results, metrics)\n2. Analyze root cause and impact\n3. Draft Discord summary first (ensures conciseness)\n4. Verify Discord summary is under 1900 characters\n5. Write full report with complete details\n6. Save to `reports/YYMMDD_SLUG.md`\n7. Output the Discord summary for easy copy-paste\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:12:10.093Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing to create comprehensive Discord-friendly reports.","zh":"非常适合需要创建全面 Discord 友好报告的技术写作代理","ja":"技術文書エージェントが包括的な Discord フレンドリーレポートを作成する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"포괄적인 Discord 친화적 보고서를 созд해야 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de redacción técnica que necesitan crear informes comprehensivos compatibles con Discord.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de créer des rapports complets compatibles avec Discord.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die umfassende Discord-freundliche Berichte erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que precisam criar relatórios abrangentes e compatíveis com o Discord.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технического письма, которым необходимо создавать всесторонние отчеты, дружественные к Discord.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء تقارير شاملة ومتوافقة مع ديسكورد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate technical reports with HTML summaries, saving them to markdown files with descriptive filenames, utilizing protocols like Markdown formatting and file formats like .md.","zh":"赋予代理生成技术报告的能力，包括 HTML 摘要，并将其保存到具有描述性文件名的 markdown 文件中，利用 Markdown 格式化和 .md 等文件格式","ja":"エージェントが技術レポートを生成する機能を付与し、HTML のサマリーを含み、説明的なファイル名を持つ Markdown ファイルに保存し、Markdown 形式や .md などのファイル形式を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 기술 보고서를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, HTML 요약을 포함하고 설명적인 파일 이름을 가진 마크다운 파일에 저장하며, 마크다운 형식 및 .md와 같은 파일 형식을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar informes técnicos con resúmenes en HTML, guardándolos en archivos markdown con nombres de archivo descriptivos, utilizando protocolos como la formación de Markdown y formatos de archivo como .md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des rapports techniques avec des résumés HTML, les sauvegardant dans des fichiers markdown avec des noms de fichier descriptifs, en utilisant des protocoles comme la mise en forme Markdown et des formats de fichier comme .md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, technische Berichte mit HTML-Zusammenfassungen zu erstellen, diese in Markdown-Dateien mit beschreibenden Dateinamen zu speichern, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Markdown-Formatierung und Dateiformaten wie .md.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem relatórios técnicos com resumos em HTML, salvando-os em arquivos markdown com nomes de arquivos descritivos, utilizando protocolos como formatação Markdown e formatos de arquivo como .md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать технические отчеты с резюме в HTML, сохраняя их в файлах markdown с описательными именами файлов, используя протоколы như форматирование Markdown и форматы файлов типа .md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء تقارير فنية تحتوي على ملخصات HTML، وحفظها في ملفات تنسيق Markdown مع أسماء ملفات وصفية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تنسيق Markdown وأشكال الملفات مثل .md."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating technical reports for project findings","Creating Discord-friendly summaries for complex topics","Organizing reports with descriptive filenames in SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"],"zh":["为项目发现生成技术报告","为复杂主题创建 Discord 友好摘要","使用 SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE 组织报告，并具有描述性文件名"],"ja":["プロジェクトの調査結果の技術レポートを生成する","複雑なトピックの Discord フレンドリーサマリーを作成する","SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE を使用してレポートを整理し、説明的なファイル名を付ける"],"ko":["프로젝트 조사 결과의 기술 보고서 생성","복잡한 주제에 대한 Discord 친화적 요약 생성","SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE를 사용하여 보고서를 구성하고 설명적인 파일 이름을 부여"],"es":["Generación de informes técnicos para hallazgos de proyectos","Creación de resúmenes compatibles con Discord para temas complejos","Organización de informes con nombres de archivo descriptivos en SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"],"fr":["Génération de rapports techniques pour les résultats de projet","Création de résumés compatibles avec Discord pour des sujets complexes","Organisation de rapports avec des noms de fichier descriptifs en SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"],"de":["Erstellung von technischen Berichten für Projektergebnisse","Erstellung von Discord-freundlichen Zusammenfassungen für komplexe Themen","Organisation von Berichten mit beschreibenden Dateinamen in SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios técnicos para descobertas de projetos","Criação de resumos compatíveis com o Discord para tópicos complexos","Organização de relatórios com nomes de arquivos descritivos em SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"],"ru":["Генерация технических отчетов для результатов проектов","Создание резюме, дружественных к Discord, для сложных тем","Организация отчетов с описательными именами файлов в формате SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"],"ar":["توليد تقارير فنية لنتائج المشاريع","إنشاء ملخصات متوافقة مع ديسكورد لمواضيع معقدة","تنظيم التقارير بأسماء ملفات وصفية في تنسيق SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to save reports","Limited to Markdown file format"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来保存报告","仅限于 Markdown 文件格式"],"ja":["レポートを保存するためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","Markdown ファイル形式のみに限定される"],"ko":["보고서를 저장하려면 파일 시스템 액세스 권한이 필요","마크다운 파일 형식으로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para guardar informes","Limitado al formato de archivo Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour enregistrer les rapports","Limité au format de fichier Markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um Berichte zu speichern","Begrenzt auf das Markdown-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para salvar relatórios","Limitado ao formato de arquivo Markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для сохранения отчетов","Ограничен форматом файла Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لحفظ التقارير","محدود بتنسيق ملف Markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/df:az-cli', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'df:az-cli', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z', '2026-02-18T07:12:42.663Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/df:az-cli","name":"df:az-cli","description":{"es":"La extensión azure-devops de la CLI de Azure permite gestionar recursos de Azure DevOps. Cubre repositorios, solicitudes de extracción, pipelines, tableros y elementos de trabajo.","fr":"L''extension azure-devops de la CLI Azure permet de gérer les ressources Azure DevOps. Elle couvre les référentiels, les demandes d''extraction, les pipelines, les tableaux et les éléments de travail.","de":"Die azure-devops-Erweiterung der Azure-CLI ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Azure DevOps-Ressourcen. Sie umfasst Repositorys, Pull-Anfragen, Pipelines, Boards und Arbeitselemente.","pt":"O Azure DevOps CLI é uma ferramenta para gerenciar recursos do Azure DevOps. Ele cobre repositórios, pull requests, pipelines, boards e itens de trabalho.","ru":"Azure DevOps CLI — это инструмент для управления ресурсами Azure DevOps. Он охватывает репозитории, запросы на включение, конвейеры, доски и элементы работы.","ar":"Azure DevOps CLI هو أداة لإدارة مورد Azure DevOps. ويتضمن مستودعات، وتحديثات السحب، وخطوط أنابيب، واللوحات، وأعمال العناصر.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Azure DevOps CLI: Gestión de recursos con az","fr":"Azure DevOps CLI : Gestion des ressources avec az","de":"Azure DevOps CLI: Ressourcenverwaltung mit az","pt":"Azure DevOps CLI: Gerenciamento de Recursos","ru":"Azure DevOps CLI: Управление ресурсами","ar":"Azure DevOps CLI: إدارة الموارد","en":"df:az-cli"},"description":{"es":"La extensión azure-devops de la CLI de Azure permite gestionar recursos de Azure DevOps. Cubre repositorios, solicitudes de extracción, pipelines, tableros y...","fr":"L''extension azure-devops de la CLI Azure permet de gérer les ressources Azure DevOps. Elle couvre les référentiels, les demandes d''extraction, les pipelines,...","de":"Die azure-devops-Erweiterung der Azure-CLI ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Azure DevOps-Ressourcen. Sie umfasst Repositorys, Pull-Anfragen, Pipelines, Boards u...","pt":"O Azure DevOps CLI é uma ferramenta para gerenciar recursos do Azure DevOps. Ele cobre repositórios, pull requests, pipelines, boards e itens de trabalho.","ru":"Azure DevOps CLI — это инструмент для управления ресурсами Azure DevOps. Он охватывает репозитории, запросы на включение, конвейеры, доски и элементы работы.","ar":"Azure DevOps CLI هو أداة لإدارة مورد Azure DevOps. ويتضمن مستودعات، وتحديثات السحب، وخطوط أنابيب، واللوحات، وأعمال العناصر.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"es":["Gestión de repositorios","Gestión de solicitudes de extracción","Gestión de pipelines","Gestión de tableros","Gestión de elementos de trabajo","Autenticación y configuración"],"fr":["Gestion des référentiels","Gestion des demandes d''extraction","Gestion des pipelines","Gestion des tableaux","Gestion des éléments de travail","Authentification et configuration"],"de":["Verwaltung von Repositorys","Verwaltung von Pull-Anfragen","Verwaltung von Pipelines","Verwaltung von Boards","Verwaltung von Arbeitselementen","Authentifizierung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de repositórios","Gerenciamento de pull requests","Gerenciamento de pipelines","Gerenciamento de boards","Gerenciamento de itens de trabalho"],"ru":["Управление репозиториями","Управление запросами на включение","Управление конвейерами","Управление досками","Управление элементами работы"],"ar":["إدارة مستودعات","إدارة تحديثات السحب","إدارة خطوط الأنابيب","إدارة اللوحات","إدارة أعمال العناصر"]},"keywords":{"es":["Azure DevOps CLI","az cli","azure-devops extension","gestión de recursos","desarrollo de software","devops","azure","CLI","línea de comandos"],"fr":["Azure DevOps CLI","az cli","azure-devops extension","gestion des ressources","développement de logiciels","devops","azure","CLI","ligne de commande"],"de":["Azure DevOps CLI","az cli","azure-devops-Erweiterung","Ressourcenverwaltung","Softwareentwicklung","devops","azure","CLI","Befehlszeile"],"pt":["Azure DevOps CLI","Gerenciamento de recursos","Azure DevOps","CLI az","Extensão azure-devops","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Azure DevOps CLI","Управление ресурсами","Azure DevOps","CLI az","Расширение azure-devops","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Azure DevOps CLI","إدارة الموارد","Azure DevOps","CLI az","امتداد azure-devops","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"df:az-cli","description":"This skill should be used when working with Azure DevOps from the command line. Trigger when user mentions az devops, az repos, az pipelines, az boards, or asks about managing PRs, work items, pipelines, or repositories in Azure DevOps. Also trigger for questions about Azure DevOps CLI setup, authentication, or querying work items.","bodyPreview":"# Azure DevOps CLI\n\n## Overview\n\nManage Azure DevOps resources using the `az` CLI with the `azure-devops` extension. Covers repositories, pull requests, pipelines, boards, and work items.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install azure-devops extension (requires az cli 2.30+)\naz extension add --name azure-devops\n\n# Authenticate\naz login\n\n# Set defaults (recommended)\naz devops configure --defaults organization=https://dev.azure.com/YOUR_ORG project=YOUR_PROJECT\n```\n\n## Most-Used Commands\n\n### My Pull","body":"# Azure DevOps CLI\n\n## Overview\n\nManage Azure DevOps resources using the `az` CLI with the `azure-devops` extension. Covers repositories, pull requests, pipelines, boards, and work items.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install azure-devops extension (requires az cli 2.30+)\naz extension add --name azure-devops\n\n# Authenticate\naz login\n\n# Set defaults (recommended)\naz devops configure --defaults organization=https://dev.azure.com/YOUR_ORG project=YOUR_PROJECT\n```\n\n## Most-Used Commands\n\n### My Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# List PRs I created\naz repos pr list --creator \"$(az account show --query user.name -o tsv)\"\n\n# List PRs assigned to me for review\naz repos pr list --reviewer \"$(az account show --query user.name -o tsv)\"\n\n# Show PR details\naz repos pr show --id <pr-id>\n\n# Checkout PR locally\naz repos pr checkout --id <pr-id>\n```\n\n### My Work Items\n\n```bash\n# List work items assigned to me\naz boards query --wiql \"SELECT [System.Id], [System.Title], [System.State] FROM WorkItems WHERE [System.AssignedTo] = @Me AND [System.State] <> ''Closed'' ORDER BY [System.ChangedDate] DESC\"\n\n# Show work item details\naz boards work-item show --id <work-item-id>\n\n# Create work item\naz boards work-item create --title \"Task title\" --type \"Task\"\n\n# Update work item state\naz boards work-item update --id <id> --state \"In Progress\"\n```\n\n### Pipelines\n\n```bash\n# List pipelines\naz pipelines list\n\n# List recent runs\naz pipelines runs list --top 10\n\n# Run a pipeline\naz pipelines run --name \"pipeline-name\"\n\n# Run with parameters\naz pipelines run --name \"pipeline-name\" --parameters \"env=prod version=1.0\"\n\n# Show run details\naz pipelines runs show --id <run-id>\n```\n\n### Repositories\n\n```bash\n# List repositories\naz repos list\n\n# Show repo details\naz repos show --repository <repo-name>\n\n# Create repository\naz repos create --name \"new-repo\"\n```\n\n### Pull Request Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Create PR\naz repos pr create --source-branch feature/my-branch --target-branch main --title \"PR Title\" --description \"Description\"\n\n# Add reviewers\naz repos pr update --id <pr-id> --reviewers user@email.com\n\n# Set vote (approve: 10, approve with suggestions: 5, wait: -5, reject: -10)\naz repos pr set-vote --id <pr-id> --vote 10\n\n# Complete/merge PR\naz repos pr update --id <pr-id> --status completed\n```\n\n## References\n\nDetailed command references available:\n\n- **`references/repos.md`** - Repository management, PRs, policies, refs\n- **`references/pipelines.md`** - Pipeline CRUD, runs, variables, releases\n- **`references/boards.md`** - Work items, queries, areas, iterations\n- **`references/devops.md`** - Organization, projects, teams, wikis, auth\n\n## Common Flags\n\nMost commands support:\n\n| Flag                | Description                                         |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--org`             | Organization URL (or set via `az devops configure`) |\n| `--project`         | Project name (or set via `az devops configure`)     |\n| `--detect`          | Auto-detect org/project from git remote             |\n| `-o json/table/tsv` | Output format                                       |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n```bash\n# Check current config\naz devops configure --list\n\n# Verify authentication\naz account show\n\n# Check extension version\naz extension show --name azure-devops\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:12:42.663Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing advanced Azure resource management via the Azure CLI with azure-devops extension","zh":"适用于需要通过 Azure CLI 和 azure-devops 扩展进行高级 Azure 资源管理的 DevOps Agent","ja":"Azure CLI と azure-devops 拡張機能を使用した高度な Azure リソース管理を必要とする DevOps エージェントに適しています","ko":"Azure CLI와 azure-devops 확장을 사용한 고급 Azure 리소스 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión avanzada de recursos de Azure a través de la CLI de Azure con la extensión azure-devops","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée des ressources Azure via l''interface de ligne de commande Azure avec l''extension azure-devops","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine erweiterte Azure-Ressourcenverwaltung über die Azure-CLI mit der Erweiterung azure-devops benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de gerenciamento avançado de recursos do Azure via Azure CLI com extensão azure-devops","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется расширенное управление ресурсами Azure через Azure CLI с расширением azure-devops","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل DevOps التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لموارد Azure عبر Azure CLI مع الامتداد azure-devops"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Azure DevOps resources, including repositories, pull requests, pipelines, boards, and work items, using the az CLI with the azure-devops extension, supporting protocols like authentication and configuration","zh":"赋予代理管理 Azure DevOps 资源的能力，包括存储库、拉取请求、管道、板和工作项，使用 az CLI 和 azure-devops 扩展，支持身份验证和配置等协议","ja":"Azure DevOps リソースの管理をエージェントに可能にし、リポジトリ、プルリクエスト、パイプライン、ボード、ワークアイテムなどを、az CLI と azure-devops 拡張機能を使用して、認証と構成などのプロトコルをサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 Azure DevOps 리소스를 관리할 수 있도록 허용하며, 저장소, 풀 요청, 파이프라인, 보드, 작업 항목 등을 az CLI와 azure-devops 확장을 사용하여 인증 및 구성과 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar recursos de Azure DevOps, incluyendo repositorios, solicitudes de incorporación, pipelines, tableros y elementos de trabajo, utilizando la CLI de az con la extensión azure-devops, y soportando protocolos como la autenticación y la configuración","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les ressources Azure DevOps, y compris les référentiels, les demandes d''extraction, les pipelines, les tableaux et les éléments de travail, en utilisant la CLI az avec l''extension azure-devops, et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que l''authentification et la configuration","de":"Ermächtigt Agents zur Verwaltung von Azure DevOps-Ressourcen, einschließlich Repositorys, Pull-Requests, Pipelines, Boards und Arbeitselementen, unter Verwendung der az-CLI mit der Erweiterung azure-devops, und unterstützt Protokolle wie Authentifizierung und Konfiguration","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar recursos do Azure DevOps, incluindo repositórios, solicitações de pull, pipelines, quadros e itens de trabalho, usando o az CLI com a extensão azure-devops, com suporte a protocolos como autenticação e configuração","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять ресурсами Azure DevOps, включая репозитории, запросы на вытягивание, конвейеры, доски и элементы работы, используя az CLI с расширением azure-devops, поддерживающим протоколы, такие как аутентификация и конфигурация","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إدارة موارد Azure DevOps، بما في ذلك المستودعات وطلبات السحب والأنابيب واللوحات وعناصر العمل، باستخدام az CLI مع الامتداد azure-devops، مع دعم البروتوكولات مثل المصادقة والتكوين"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pipeline deployments","Managing work items and boards","Analyzing pull requests and repositories"],"zh":["自动化管道部署","管理工作项和板","分析拉取请求和存储库"],"ja":["パイプラインのデプロイの自動化","ワークアイテムとボードの管理","プルリクエストとリポジトリの分析"],"ko":["파이프라인 배포 자동화","작업 항목 및 보드 관리","풀 요청 및 저장소 분석"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de pipelines","Gestión de elementos de trabajo y tableros","Análisis de solicitudes de incorporación y repositorios"],"fr":["Automatisation des déploiements de pipelines","Gestion des éléments de travail et des tableaux","Analyse des demandes d''extraction et des référentiels"],"de":["Automatisierung von Pipeline-Implementierungen","Verwaltung von Arbeitselementen und Boards","Analyse von Pull-Requests und Repositorys"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de pipeline","Gerenciar itens de trabalho e quadros","Analisar solicitações de pull e repositórios"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание конвейеров","Управлять элементами работы и досками","Анализировать запросы на вытягивание и репозитории"],"ar":["أتمتة نشر الأنابيب","إدارة عناصر العمل واللوحات","تحليل طلبات السحب والمستودعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires az CLI 2.30+","Needs azure-devops extension installation","Authentication required via az login"],"zh":["需要 az CLI 2.30+","需要安装 azure-devops 扩展","需要通过 az login 进行身份验证"],"ja":["az CLI 2.30+ が必要","azure-devops 拡張機能のインストールが必要","az login による認証が必要"],"ko":["az CLI 2.30+ 필요","azure-devops 확장 설치 필요","az 로그인 통해 인증 필요"],"es":["Requiere az CLI 2.30 o superior","Requiere instalación de la extensión azure-devops","Se requiere autenticación a través de az login"],"fr":["Nécessite az CLI 2.30 ou supérieur","Nécessite l''installation de l''extension azure-devops","Authentification requise via az login"],"de":["Benötigt az CLI 2.30 oder höher","Benötigt Installation der Erweiterung azure-devops","Authentifizierung über az login erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer az CLI 2.30+","Necessita instalação da extensão azure-devops","Autenticação necessária via az login"],"ru":["Требуется az CLI 2.30+","Требуется установка расширения azure-devops","Требуется аутентификация через az login"],"ar":["يتطلب az CLI 2.30+","يحتاج إلى تثبيت الامتداد azure-devops","المصادقة مطلوبة عبر az login"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
