œuvre de plans de code","spawn de domaine","développement de logiciels","qualité du code"],"de":["Code-Neusendung","Claude Code","Experten-Workflow","Implementierung von Codeplänen","Spawn von Domain-Experten","Softwareentwicklung","Codequalität"],"pt":["resend skill","fluxo de trabalho obrigatório","desenvolvedores","spawn domain expert","QA critic","implementação de tarefas","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","otimização de processos"],"ru":["навык resend","обязательный рабочий процесс","разработчики","вызов доменного эксперта","критик QA","реализация задач","инструменты разработки","оптимизация процессов"],"ar":["مهارة إعادة الإرسال","تدفق عمل إجباري","مطورين","تشغيل خبير المجال","ناقد جودة","تنفيذ المهام","أدوات التطوير","تحسين عمليات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"resend","description":">","bodyPreview":"# ⚠️ MANDATORY WORKFLOW - DO NOT SKIP\n\n**When this skill activates, you MUST follow the expert workflow before writing any code:**\n\n1. **Spawn Domain Expert** using the Task tool with this prompt:\n   ```\n   Read the expert prompt at: C:\\Users\\natha\\Stone-Fence-Brain\\VENTURES\\PhotoVault\\claude\\experts\\resend-expert.md\n\n   Then research the codebase and write an implementation plan to: docs/claude/plans/email-[task-name]-plan.md\n\n   Task: [describe the user''s request]\n   ```\n\n2. **Spawn QA Critic*","body":"# ⚠️ MANDATORY WORKFLOW - DO NOT SKIP\n\n**When this skill activates, you MUST follow the expert workflow before writing any code:**\n\n1. **Spawn Domain Expert** using the Task tool with this prompt:\n   ```\n   Read the expert prompt at: C:\\Users\\natha\\Stone-Fence-Brain\\VENTURES\\PhotoVault\\claude\\experts\\resend-expert.md\n\n   Then research the codebase and write an implementation plan to: docs/claude/plans/email-[task-name]-plan.md\n\n   Task: [describe the user''s request]\n   ```\n\n2. **Spawn QA Critic** after expert returns, using Task tool:\n   ```\n   Read the QA critic prompt at: C:\\Users\\natha\\Stone-Fence-Brain\\VENTURES\\PhotoVault\\claude\\experts\\qa-critic-expert.md\n\n   Review the plan at: docs/claude/plans/email-[task-name]-plan.md\n   Write critique to: docs/claude/plans/email-[task-name]-critique.md\n   ```\n\n3. **Present BOTH plan and critique to user** - wait for approval before implementing\n\n**DO NOT read files and start coding. DO NOT rationalize that \"this is simple.\" Follow the workflow.**\n\n---\n\n# Resend Email Integration\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Email HTML is NOT Web HTML\n\nEmail clients strip `<style>` tags, ignore CSS classes, and render tables differently. Everything must be inline.\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ BAD: CSS classes don''t work\n<div className=\"button\">Click me</div>\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Inline styles\n<a href={url} style={{\n  backgroundColor: ''#f59e0b'',\n  color: ''#000000'',\n  padding: ''12px 24px'',\n  borderRadius: ''8px'',\n  textDecoration: ''none'',\n  display: ''inline-block'',\n}}>\n  Click me\n</a>\n```\n\n### Mobile First (60%+ opens)\n\nMost emails are read on phones. Design for 320px width first.\n\n```tsx\nconst container = {\n  maxWidth: ''600px'',\n  padding: ''20px'',\n  margin: ''0 auto'',\n}\n```\n\n### Every Email Needs a Preview\n\nThe preview text appears in the inbox next to the subject.\n\n```tsx\nimport { Preview } from ''@react-email/components''\n<Preview>Your gallery \"Smith Wedding\" is ready with 247 photos</Preview>\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n**Using CSS classes or external stylesheets**\n```tsx\n// WRONG: Won''t render\n<style>{`.button { background: blue; }`}</style>\n<a className=\"button\">Click</a>\n\n// RIGHT: Inline everything\n<a style={{ backgroundColor: ''blue'', padding: ''12px 24px'' }}>Click</a>\n```\n\n**Using flexbox or grid**\n```tsx\n// WRONG: Not supported in most email clients\n<div style={{ display: ''flex'' }}>\n\n// RIGHT: Use tables for layout\nimport { Row, Column } from ''@react-email/components''\n<Row>\n  <Column>Left content</Column>\n  <Column>Right content</Column>\n</Row>\n```\n\n**Forgetting alt text on images**\n```tsx\n// WRONG: Images often blocked\n<Img src={url} />\n\n// RIGHT: Always include meaningful alt\n<Img src={url} alt=\"Preview of your wedding photos\" />\n```\n\n**Generic subject lines**\n```typescript\n// WRONG: Low open rate\nsubject: ''Update from PhotoVault''\n\n// RIGHT: Specific and actionable\nsubject: ''Your \"Smith Wedding\" gallery is ready - 247 photos inside''\n```\n\n**Not handling send failures**\n```typescript\n// WRONG: Silent failure\nawait resend.emails.send({ ... })\n\n// RIGHT: Handle errors\nconst { data, error } = await resend.emails.send({ ... })\nif (error) {\n  console.error(''Email failed:'', error)\n}\n```\n\n## Email Template Pattern\n\n```tsx\n// src/lib/email/templates/gallery-ready.tsx\nimport {\n  Body, Container, Head, Heading, Html,\n  Img, Link, Preview, Section, Text,\n} from ''@react-email/components''\n\ninterface GalleryReadyEmailProps {\n  clientName: string\n  galleryName: string\n  photoCount: number\n  previewImageUrl: string\n  galleryUrl: string\n}\n\nexport function GalleryReadyEmail({\n  clientName, galleryName, photoCount, previewImageUrl, galleryUrl,\n}: GalleryReadyEmailProps) {\n  return (\n    <Html>\n      <Head />\n      <Preview>Your \"{galleryName}\" gallery is ready - {photoCount} photos inside</Preview>\n      <Body style={main}>\n        <Container style={container}>\n          <Img src=\"https://photovault.photo/logo.png\" alt=\"PhotoVault\" width={150} />\n          <Heading style={heading}>Hi {clientName}!</Heading>\n          <Text style={text}>\n            Your photos from <strong>{galleryName}</strong> are ready.\n            Your photographer has uploaded {photoCount} photos.\n          </Text>\n          {previewImageUrl && (\n            <Img src={previewImageUrl} alt={`Preview from ${galleryName}`} width={560} />\n          )}\n          <Section style={{ textAlign: ''center'', marginTop: ''30px'' }}>\n            <Link href={galleryUrl} style={button}>View Your Photos</Link>\n          </Section>\n        </Container>\n      </Body>\n    </Html>\n  )\n}\n\nconst main = {\n  backgroundColor: ''#0a0a0a'',\n  fontFamily: ''-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif'',\n}\n\nconst container = { maxWidth: ''600px'', margin: ''0 auto'', padding: ''40px 20px'' }\nconst heading = { color: ''#ffffff'', fontSize: ''28px'', fontWeight: ''bold'' }\nconst text = { color: ''#a3a3a3'', fontSize: ''16px'', lineHeight: ''26px'' }\nconst button = {\n  backgroundColor: ''#f59e0b'',\n  color: ''#000000'',\n  padding: ''14px 28px'',\n  borderRadius: ''8px'',\n  textDecoration: ''none'',\n  fontWeight: ''bold'',\n  display: ''inline-block'',\n}\n```\n\n## Email Service\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/email/email-service.ts\nimport { Resend } from ''resend''\n\nconst resend = new Resend(process.env.RESEND_API_KEY)\n\ninterface SendEmailParams {\n  to: string | string[]\n  subject: string\n  react: React.ReactElement\n  replyTo?: string\n}\n\nexport async function sendEmail({ to, subject, react, replyTo }: SendEmailParams) {\n  try {\n    const { data, error } = await resend.emails.send({\n      from: ''PhotoVault <noreply@photovault.photo>'',\n      to: Array.isArray(to) ? to : [to],\n      subject,\n      react,\n      replyTo: replyTo || ''support@photovault.photo'',\n    })\n\n    if (error) {\n      console.error(''[Email] Send failed:'', error)\n      return { success: false, error }\n    }\n\n    console.log(''[Email] Sent successfully:'', data?.id)\n    return { success: true, id: data?.id }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''[Email] Unexpected error:'', error)\n    return { success: false, error }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## PhotoVault Configuration\n\n### Templates Needed\n\n| Template | Trigger | Recipient |\n|----------|---------|-----------|\n| `gallery-ready` | Photographer marks ready | Client |\n| `payment-success` | Checkout completed | Client |\n| `payment-failed` | Invoice failed | Client |\n| `invitation` | Photographer invites client | Client |\n| `commission-earned` | Client pays | Photographer |\n\n### Branding\n\n| Element | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Primary color | `#f59e0b` (amber) |\n| Background | `#0a0a0a` (near black) |\n| Text | `#a3a3a3` (gray) |\n| Headings | `#ffffff` (white) |\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nRESEND_API_KEY=re_...\nFROM_EMAIL=PhotoVault <noreply@photovault.photo>\n```\n\n## Testing Emails\n\n```bash\n# Preview locally\nnpx react-email dev\n```\n\n## Deliverability Checklist\n\n1. ✅ Domain verified in Resend (DKIM, SPF)\n2. ✅ FROM address uses verified domain\n3. ✅ Subject line is specific, not spammy\n4. ✅ Alt text on all images\n5. ✅ No URL shorteners\n6. ✅ Reply-to address is valid\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:12:22.966Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Email Automation Agents requiring reliable email re-sending capabilities via Claude Code.","zh":"适用于需要通过 Claude Code 实现可靠电子邮件重发功能的电子邮件自动化代理。","ja":"Claude Code を使用した信頼性の高い電子メールの再送信機能を必要とするメールの自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 이메일 재전송 기능을 요구하는 이메일 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Correo Electrónico que requieren capacidades de reenvío de correo electrónico confiables a través de Claude Code.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Courrier Électronique nécessitant des capacités de réenvoi de courrier électronique fiables via Claude Code.","de":"Ideal für E-Mail-Automatisierungsagenten, die zuverlässige E-Mail-Neusendefunktionen über Claude Code erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de E-mail que exigem capacidades de reenvio de e-mail confiáveis via Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации электронной почты, требующих надежных возможностей повторной отправки электронной почты через Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل автомة البريد الإلكتروني الذي يتطلب إمكانات إعادة إرسال البريد الإلكتروني الموثوقة من خلال Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust email resend functionality using Task tools and MD file prompts, leveraging domain expert spawning and QA critic integration for enhanced reliability and protocol compliance, including SMTP and email protocol handling.","zh":"赋予代理实现使用任务工具和 MD 文件提示的强大的电子邮件重发功能，利用领域专家生成和 QA 批评者集成提高可靠性和协议合规性，包括 SMTP 和电子邮件协议处理。","ja":"タスクツールと MD ファイルのプロンプトを使用して強力なメール再送機能を実装するためにエージェントをEmpowerし、ドメインエキスパートのスパウニングと QA 批評者の統合によって信頼性とプロトコル準拠性を高め、SMTP とメールプロトコルのハンドリングを含む。","ko":"Task 도구와 MD 파일 프롬프트를 사용하여 강력한 이메일 재전송 기능을 구현하기 위한 에이전트를 Empower하고, 도메인 전문가 스포닝과 QA 비평가 통합을 통해 신뢰성과 프로토콜 준수를 향상시키며, SMTP 및 이메일 프로토콜 처리를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una funcionalidad de reenvío de correo electrónico robusta utilizando herramientas de tarea y prompts de archivo MD, aprovechando la generación de expertos en dominio y la integración de críticos de control de calidad para una mayor confiabilidad y cumplimiento de protocolos, incluyendo el manejo de protocolos SMTP y de correo electrónico.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une fonctionnalité de réenvoi de courrier électronique robuste en utilisant des outils de tâche et des invites de fichier MD, en exploitant la génération d''experts de domaine et l''intégration de critiques de contrôle qualité pour une fiabilité et une conformité de protocole améliorées, y compris la gestion des protocoles SMTP et de courrier électronique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine robuste E-Mail-Neusendefunktion mithilfe von Task-Tools und MD-Dateiprompts zu implementieren, die Expertenverwendung in der Domäne und die Integration von QA-Kritikern für eine verbesserte Zuverlässigkeit und Protokollkonformität nutzen, einschließlich der Verwaltung von SMTP- und E-Mail-Protokollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar uma funcionalidade de reenvio de e-mail robusta usando ferramentas de Tarefa e prompts de arquivo MD, aproveitando a geração de especialistas em domínio e a integração do crítico de QA para uma confiabilidade e conformidade de protocolo melhoradas, incluindo tratamento de protocolo SMTP e de e-mail.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать функцию повторной отправки электронной почты с помощью инструментов задач и подсказок файла MD, используя создание экспертов в области и интеграцию критика QA для повышения надежности и соответствия протокола, включая обработку протокола SMTP и электронной почты.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ وظيفة إعادة إرسال البريد الإلكتروني القوية باستخدام أدوات المهمة وملفات MD ، واستخدام توليد الخبراء في المجال وتكامل ناقد الجودة لتعزيز الموثوقية وامتثال البروتوكول ، بما في ذلك معالجة بروتوكول SMTP وبروتوكول البريد الإلكتروني."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating email resend requests","Generating implementation plans for email tasks","Debugging email delivery issues using expert workflows"],"zh":["自动执行电子邮件重发请求","生成电子邮件任务的实现计划","使用专家工作流调试电子邮件投递问题"],"ja":["メールの再送信リクエストを自動化する","メールタスクの実装計画を生成する","エキスパートワークフローを使用してメール配信の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["이메일 재전송 요청을 자동화하는 것","이메일 작업의 구현 계획을 생성하는 것","전문가 워크플로를 사용하여 이메일 전송 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar solicitudes de reenvío de correo electrónico","Generar planes de implementación para tareas de correo electrónico","Depurar problemas de entrega de correo electrónico utilizando flujos de trabajo de expertos"],"fr":["Automatiser les demandes de réenvoi de courrier électronique","Générer des plans de mise en œuvre pour les tâches de courrier électronique","Déboguer les problèmes de livraison de courrier électronique en utilisant des flux de travail d''experts"],"de":["Automatisieren von E-Mail-Neusendeanfragen","Erstellen von Implementierungsplänen für E-Mail-Aufgaben","Beheben von E-Mail-Lieferproblemen mithilfe von Experten-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar solicitações de reenvio de e-mail","Gerar planos de implementação para tarefas de e-mail","Depurar problemas de entrega de e-mail usando fluxos de trabalho de especialistas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запросы на повторную отправку электронной почты","Генерировать планы реализации для задач электронной почты","Отлаживать проблемы доставки электронной почты с помощью рабочих процессов экспертов"],"ar":["توفير الطلبات الآلية لإعادة إرسال البريد الإلكتروني","توليد خطط التنفيذ لمهام البريد الإلكتروني","تصحيح مشاكل تسليم البريد الإلكتروني باستخدام تدفقات عمل الخبراء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Task tool access","Dependent on MD file prompts and domain expert spawning","Needs access to file system for reading expert prompts and writing implementation plans"],"zh":["需要任务工具访问","依赖于 MD 文件提示和领域专家生成","需要文件系统访问以读取专家提示和写入实现计划"],"ja":["タスクツールへのアクセスが必要","MD ファイルのプロンプトとドメインエキスパートのスパウニングに依存","ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要で、エキスパートのプロンプトを読み取り、実装計画を書き込む"],"ko":["Task 도구 액세스가 필요합니다.","MD 파일 프롬프트 및 도메인 전문가 스포닝에 의존합니다.","파일 시스템에 액세스하여 전문가 프롬프트를 읽고 구현 계획을 작성해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a herramientas de tarea","Depende de prompts de archivo MD y generación de expertos en dominio","Necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para leer prompts de expertos y escribir planes de implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux outils de tâche","Dépend des invites de fichier MD et de la génération d''experts de domaine","A besoin d''un accès au système de fichiers pour lire les invites d''experts et écrire les plans de mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Task-Tools","Hängt von MD-Dateiprompts und Expertenverwendung in der Domäne ab","Benötigt Zugriff auf Dateisystem zum Lesen von Expertenprompts und Schreiben von Implementierungsplänen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à ferramenta Tarefa","Depende de prompts de arquivo MD e geração de especialistas em domínio","Necessita acesso ao sistema de arquivos para ler prompts de especialistas e escrever planos de implementação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструменту задачи","Зависит от подсказок файла MD и создания экспертов в области","Требует доступа к файловой системе для чтения подсказок экспертов и записи планов реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة المهمة","يعتمد على ملفات MD وتوليد الخبراء في المجال","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لقراءة عروض الخبراء وكتابته خطط التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
