ciamento de contas","Navegação de jogos","Rastreamento de favoritos","Monitoramento de saldo de Robux","Visualização de atividade de amigos"],"ru":["Управление аккаунтами","Просмотр игр","Отслеживание любимых игр","Мониторинг баланса Robux","Просмотр активности друзей"],"ar":["إدارة الحسابات","استعراض الألعاب","تتبع المفضلة","مراقبة رصيد Robux","عرض نشاط الأصدقاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Roblox","Claude 代码技能","技术集成","账户管理","游戏浏览","Robux 余额"],"ja":["Roblox","Claude コードスキル","技術統合","口座管理","ゲーム閲覧","Robux 残高"],"ko":["Roblox","Claude 코드 스킬","기술 통합","계정 관리","게임 브라우징","Robux 잔액"],"es":["Roblox","habilidad Roblox","gestión de cuentas","búsqueda de juegos","seguidores de Roblox","desarrollo de juegos","plataforma de juegos"],"fr":["Roblox","compétence Roblox","gestion de comptes","recherche de jeux","suiveurs de Roblox","développement de jeux","plateforme de jeux"],"de":["Roblox","Roblox-Fähigkeit","Kontenverwaltung","Spuchsuche","Roblox-Follower","Spieleentwicklung","Spieleplattform"],"pt":["Roblox","Integração de conta","Gerenciamento de jogos"," Claude","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Plataforma de jogos online"],"ru":["Roblox","Интеграция аккаунта","Управление играми","Claude","Разработка игр","Онлайн-платформа для игр"],"ar":["Roblox","دمج الحساب","إدارة الألعاب","Claude","تطوير الألعاب","منصة ألعاب trực tuyến"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"roblox","description":"Manage Roblox account, track favorites, and monitor Robux balance","bodyPreview":"# Roblox Skill\n\n## Overview\nEnables Claude to interact with Roblox for managing account, browsing games, tracking favorites, monitoring Robux balance, and viewing friend activity.\n\n## Quick Install\n\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://canifi.com/skills/roblox/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\ncp -r skills/roblox ~/.canifi/skills/\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nConfigure via [canifi-env](https://canifi.com/setup/scripts):\n\n```bash\n# First, ensure canifi-env is installed:\n# curl -sSL https://canifi.com/install.sh","body":"# Roblox Skill\n\n## Overview\nEnables Claude to interact with Roblox for managing account, browsing games, tracking favorites, monitoring Robux balance, and viewing friend activity.\n\n## Quick Install\n\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://canifi.com/skills/roblox/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\ncp -r skills/roblox ~/.canifi/skills/\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nConfigure via [canifi-env](https://canifi.com/setup/scripts):\n\n```bash\n# First, ensure canifi-env is installed:\n# curl -sSL https://canifi.com/install.sh | bash\n\ncanifi-env set ROBLOX_EMAIL \"your-email@example.com\"\n```\n\n## Privacy & Authentication\n\n**Your credentials, your choice.** Canifi LifeOS respects your privacy.\n\n### Option 1: Manual Browser Login (Recommended)\nIf you prefer not to share credentials with Claude Code:\n1. Complete the [Browser Automation Setup](/setup/automation) using CDP mode\n2. Login to the service manually in the Playwright-controlled Chrome window\n3. Claude will use your authenticated session without ever seeing your password\n\n### Option 2: Environment Variables\nIf you''re comfortable sharing credentials, you can store them locally:\n```bash\ncanifi-env set SERVICE_EMAIL \"your-email\"\ncanifi-env set SERVICE_PASSWORD \"your-password\"\n```\n\n**Note**: Credentials stored in canifi-env are only accessible locally on your machine and are never transmitted.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Browse and discover Roblox experiences\n- Manage favorite games list\n- View Robux balance and transactions\n- Check friend activity and status\n- Track badges and achievements\n\n## Usage Examples\n### Example 1: Favorites Check\n```\nUser: \"What are my favorite Roblox games?\"\nClaude: I''ll check your Roblox favorites list.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Robux Balance\n```\nUser: \"How much Robux do I have?\"\nClaude: I''ll check your current Robux balance.\n```\n\n### Example 3: Friend Activity\n```\nUser: \"What games are my Roblox friends playing?\"\nClaude: I''ll check what experiences your friends are currently in.\n```\n\n## Authentication Flow\n1. Navigate to roblox.com via Playwright MCP\n2. Click \"Login\" button\n3. Enter credentials\n4. Handle 2FA via email or authenticator\n5. Maintain session for subsequent requests\n\n## Error Handling\n- Login Failed: Retry authentication up to 3 times, then notify via iMessage\n- Session Expired: Re-authenticate automatically\n- 2FA Required: Wait for code via email\n- Rate Limited: Implement exponential backoff\n- Age Restrictions: Note content filtering\n\n## Self-Improvement Instructions\nWhen encountering new UI patterns:\n1. Document Roblox web interface changes\n2. Update selectors for new layouts\n3. Track popular experience trends\n4. Monitor platform updates\n\n## Notes\n- Parental controls may limit access\n- Robux is premium currency\n- Experiences range widely in type\n- Creator tools available\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:13:12.361Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Gaming Agents aiming to manage Roblox accounts and interact with the platform seamlessly.","zh":"适合用于管理 Roblox 账户并与平台无缝交互的游戏代理。","ja":"Roblox アカウントを管理し、プラットフォームと無縫にやり取りすることを目的としたゲームエージェントに最適です。","ko":"로블록스 계정을 관리하고 플랫폼과 무리없이 상호 작용하려는 게임 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal for Gaming Agents aiming to manage Roblox accounts and interact with the platform seamlessly.","fr":"Ideal for Gaming Agents aiming to manage Roblox accounts and interact with the platform seamlessly.","de":"Ideal for Gaming Agents aiming to manage Roblox accounts and interact with the platform seamlessly.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Jogos que visam gerenciar contas Roblox e interagir com a plataforma de forma perfeita.","ru":"Идеально для агентов игр, стремящихся управлять учетными записями Roblox и взаимодействовать с платформой без проблем.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللعبة الذين يهدفون إلى إدارة حسابات Roblox والتفاعل مع المنصة بسلاسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to browse games, track favorites, monitor Robux balance, and view friend activity using the Roblox API, enabling streamlined interaction with the Roblox ecosystem via bash scripts and the canifi-env setup.","zh":"赋予代理浏览游戏、跟踪最爱、监控 Robux 余额、查看好友活动的能力，使用 Roblox API 并通过 bash 脚本和 canifi-env 设置实现与 Roblox 生态系统的流畅交互。","ja":"Roblox API を使用し、bash スクリプトおよび canifi-env 設定を介して、エージェントがゲームを閲覧し、お気に入りを追跡し、Robux の残高を監視し、友人の活動を表示できるようにし、Roblox エコシステムとのスムーズなやり取りを可能にします。","ko":"로블록스 API를 사용하여 에이전트가 게임을 탐색하고, 즐겨찾기를 추적하고, 로블록스 잔액을 모니터링하고, 친구 활동을 보고하는 기능을 제공하여 bash 스크립트와 canifi-env 설정을 통해 로블록스 생태계와의 원활한 상호 작용을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to browse games, track favorites, monitor Robux balance, and view friend activity using the Roblox API, enabling streamlined interaction with the Roblox ecosystem via bash scripts and the canifi-env setup.","fr":"Empowers agents to browse games, track favorites, monitor Robux balance, and view friend activity using the Roblox API, enabling streamlined interaction with the Roblox ecosystem via bash scripts and the canifi-env setup.","de":"Empowers agents to browse games, track favorites, monitor Robux balance, and view friend activity using the Roblox API, enabling streamlined interaction with the Roblox ecosystem via bash scripts and the canifi-env setup.","pt":"Permite que os agentes naveguem por jogos, rastreiem favoritos, monitorem o saldo de Robux e visualizem a atividade de amigos usando a API do Roblox, permitindo uma interação sem problemas com o ecossistema do Roblox por meio de scripts de bash e configuração do canifi-env.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью просматривать игры, отслеживать избранное, контролировать баланс Robux и просматривать активность друзей с помощью API Roblox, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие с экосистемой Roblox посредством скриптов bash и настройки canifi-env.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تصفح الألعاب وتتبع المفضلة ومراقبة رصيد Robux وعرض نشاط الأصدقاء باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Roblox، مما يتيح التفاعل السلس مع نظام روبلوكس الإيكولوجي عبر سكريبتات الباش وضبط canifi-env."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing Roblox account settings","Browsing and filtering games based on user preferences","Tracking and analyzing Robux transactions and balance"],"zh":["管理 Roblox 账户设置","根据用户偏好浏览和筛选游戏","跟踪和分析 Robux 交易和余额"],"ja":["Roblox アカウント設定の管理","ユーザーの好みに基づいてゲームを閲覧およびフィルタリング","Robux 取引および残高の追跡および分析"],"ko":["로블록스 계정 설정 관리","사용자 선호도에 따라 게임을 탐색하고 필터링","로블록스 거래 및 잔액 추적 및 분석"],"es":["Managing Roblox account settings","Browsing and filtering games based on user preferences","Tracking and analyzing Robux transactions and balance"],"fr":["Managing Roblox account settings","Browsing and filtering games based on user preferences","Tracking and analyzing Robux transactions and balance"],"de":["Managing Roblox account settings","Browsing and filtering games based on user preferences","Tracking and analyzing Robux transactions and balance"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de configurações de conta Roblox","Navegação e filtragem de jogos com base nas preferências do usuário","Rastreamento e análise de transações e saldo de Robux"],"ru":["Управление настройками учетной записи Roblox","Просмотр и фильтрация игр на основе предпочтений пользователя","Отслеживание и анализ транзакций и баланса Robux"],"ar":["إدارة إعدادات حساب Roblox","تصفح الألعاب وتصفيتها بناءً على تفضيلات المستخدم","تتبع وتحليل معاملات رصيد Robux"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires canifi-env installation","Needs bash script execution for setup","Specific to Roblox platform only"],"zh":["需要安装 canifi-env","需要 bash 脚本执行以设置","仅限于 Roblox 平台"],"ja":["canifi-env のインストールが必要","設定のために bash スクリプトの実行が必要","Roblox プラットフォームにのみ特有"],"ko":["canifi-env 설치가 필요","설정하기 위해 bash 스크립트 실행이 필요","로블록스 플랫폼에서만 사용"],"es":["Requires canifi-env installation","Needs bash script execution for setup","Specific to Roblox platform only"],"fr":["Requires canifi-env installation","Needs bash script execution for setup","Specific to Roblox platform only"],"de":["Requires canifi-env installation","Needs bash script execution for setup","Specific to Roblox platform only"],"pt":["Requer instalação do canifi-env","Necessita execução de script de bash para configuração","Específico para plataforma Roblox apenas"],"ru":["Требует установки canifi-env","Требует выполнения скрипта bash для настройки","Специфичен только для платформы Roblox"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت canifi-env","يحتاج إلى تشغيل سكريبت الباش للتكوين","محدد لمنصة Roblox فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
