e production prêts à l''emploi","Guide de dépannage","Création de flux de travail JSON avec des nœuds et des connexions"],"de":["Muster und Best Practices für die Entwicklung von Workflows","Umfassende Dokumentation von Knoten und Ausdrücken","Produktionsbereite Beispiele","Fehlerbehebungsleitfaden","Erstellung von Workflow-JSON mit Knoten und Verbindungen"],"pt":["Criação de workflows personalizados","Padrões e práticas recomendadas","Exemplos de produção","Documentação completa","Suporte à automação de APIs"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных рабочих процессов","Шаблоны и рекомендации","Примеры производства","Полная документация","Поддержка автоматизации API"],"ar":["إنشاء سير عمل مخصصة","أنماط وأفضل الممارسات","أمثلة الإنتاج","دليل مرجعي شامل","دعم تحسين واجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["n8n v2.0","工作流开发","节点","表达式","模式","API测试","生产就绪","工作流JSON"],"ja":["n8n v2.0","ワークフロー開発","ノード","式","パターン","APIテスト","プロダクションレディー","ワークフローJSON"],"ko":["n8n v2.0","워크플로 개발","노드","표현식","패턴","API 테스트","생산 준비","워크플로 JSON"],"es":["n8n v2.0","desarrollo de flujos de trabajo","automatización de flujos de trabajo","patrones de desarrollo","prácticas recomendadas","ejemplos de producción"],"fr":["n8n v2.0","développement de flux de travail","automatisation de flux de travail","modèles de développement","bonnes pratiques","exemples de production"],"de":["n8n v2.0","Workflow-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Workflows","Entwicklungsmodelle","Best Practices","Produktionsbeispiele"],"pt":["n8n v2.0","desenvolvimento de workflows","automação de workflows","criação de workflows personalizados","padrões e práticas recomendadas","exemplos de produção"],"ru":["n8n v2.0","разработка рабочих процессов","автоматизация рабочих процессов","создание индивидуальных рабочих процессов","шаблоны и рекомендации","примеры производства"],"ar":["n8n v2.0","تطوير سير عمل","تحسين سير العمل","إنشاء سير عمل مخصصة","أنماط وأفضل الممارسات","أمثلة الإنتاج"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"n8n-v2","description":"Comprehensive n8n v2.0 reference for building workflow automation. Use this skill when working with n8n workflows, especially for (1) creating workflow JSON files for import, (2) implementing human-in-the-loop approval workflows with Wait nodes, (3) troubleshooting Execute Sub-Workflow node issues, (4) setting up API credentials (LinkedIn, Anthropic, NewsAPI), (5) building orchestrator patterns with sub-workflows, (6) using expressions in nodes, (7) understanding MCP server limitations, or (8) any n8n workflow development task.","bodyPreview":"# n8n v2.0 Workflow Development\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive reference for building n8n workflows using v2.0 patterns and best practices. This skill provides complete documentation for nodes, expressions, patterns, troubleshooting, and production-ready examples.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### 1. Test APIs First\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"https://api.example.com/endpoint\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"\n```\n\n### 2. Create Workflow JSON\nGenerate workflow JSON with nodes and connections.\n\n### 3. Im","body":"# n8n v2.0 Workflow Development\n\n## Overview\n\nComprehensive reference for building n8n workflows using v2.0 patterns and best practices. This skill provides complete documentation for nodes, expressions, patterns, troubleshooting, and production-ready examples.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### 1. Test APIs First\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"https://api.example.com/endpoint\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"\n```\n\n### 2. Create Workflow JSON\nGenerate workflow JSON with nodes and connections.\n\n### 3. Import into n8n\nn8n UI > Settings > Import from File\n\n### 4. Configure & Fix\n- Replace Execute Sub-Workflow nodes (if needed)\n- Configure credentials\n- Test each node\n\n### 5. Test Execution\nUse MCP server `mcp__n8n__execute_workflow` or manual trigger\n\n---\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### n8n MCP Server Integration\n\n**What it CAN do:**\n- ✅ Search workflows\n- ✅ View workflow details\n- ✅ Execute workflows\n\n**What it CANNOT do:**\n- ❌ Create workflows\n- ❌ Modify workflows\n- ❌ Manage credentials\n\n**Workaround:** Generate JSON files, import via UI\n\n📖 **Deep dive:** [references/mcp-limitations.md](references/mcp-limitations.md)\n\n---\n\n### Node Library\n\nComplete reference for all n8n nodes:\n\n**Trigger Nodes:** Manual Trigger, Execute Workflow Trigger\n**Data Processing:** Code, Set, Merge, Filter, Split in Batches\n**Flow Control:** IF, Wait\n**Integration:** HTTP Request, RSS Feed Read\n**Action:** Execute Workflow, Respond to Webhook\n\nEach node documented with configuration examples, parameters, and patterns.\n\n📖 **Complete reference:** [references/node-library.md](references/node-library.md)\n\n---\n\n### Expression Syntax\n\nDynamic values in node parameters using `={{ expression }}`:\n\n```javascript\n{{ $json.field }}                      // Current item\n{{ $(''Node Name'').first().json.field }} // Cross-node\n{{ $json.url || ''default'' }}           // Fallback\n{{ new Date().toISOString() }}         // Date/time\n`urn:li:person:${$json.sub}`          // Template literal\n```\n\n📖 **Complete guide:** [references/expression-syntax.md](references/expression-syntax.md)\n\n---\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Human-in-the-Loop Approval\n\nUse **Wait nodes** with forms (NOT respondToWebhook):\n\n```\nTrigger → Generate Content → Wait Node (form) → IF → Action\n```\n\n📖 **Complete patterns:** [references/wait-nodes-guide.md](references/wait-nodes-guide.md)\n\n---\n\n### Multi-Workflow Orchestration\n\nOrchestrator coordinates sub-workflows:\n\n```\nMain Orchestrator\n├── Trigger\n├── Execute Sub-Workflow: Data Fetcher\n├── Wait Node: Review\n├── Execute Sub-Workflow: Processor\n└── Execute Sub-Workflow: Output\n```\n\n📖 **All patterns:** [references/workflow-patterns.md](references/workflow-patterns.md)\n\n---\n\n### News Aggregation\n\nMulti-source data fetch, normalize, merge, deduplicate, rank:\n\n```\nTrigger\n├── HTTP Request: Source 1 → Normalize\n├── HTTP Request: Source 2 → Normalize\n└── RSS Feed: Source 3 → Normalize\n    → Merge → Deduplicate → Rank\n```\n\n📖 **Detailed patterns:** [references/workflow-patterns.md](references/workflow-patterns.md#news-aggregation-pattern)\n\n---\n\n### AI Content Generation\n\nSub-workflow pattern for AI content:\n\n```\nExecute Workflow Trigger\n→ Code: Build Prompt\n→ HTTP Request: AI API\n→ Code: Extract Response\n```\n\n📖 **Implementation:** [references/workflow-patterns.md](references/workflow-patterns.md#content-generation-with-ai-pattern)\n\n---\n\n## Critical Issues & Solutions\n\n### Execute Sub-Workflow \"Out of Date\" Error\n\n**Problem:** Imported nodes show error after import\n\n**Solution:**\n1. Delete old Execute Sub-Workflow nodes\n2. Add fresh nodes from palette\n3. Select \"Database\" and choose workflow\n\n📖 **Detailed troubleshooting:** [references/execute-sub-workflow-issues.md](references/execute-sub-workflow-issues.md)\n\n---\n\n### Wait Node Not Pausing\n\n❌ **Wrong:** respondToWebhook, Set nodes, IF on unset fields\n✅ **Correct:** Wait node with `resume: \"form\"`\n\n📖 **Complete guide:** [references/wait-nodes-guide.md](references/wait-nodes-guide.md)\n\n---\n\n### LinkedIn `unauthorized_scope_error`\n\n❌ Turn OFF both: \"Organization Support\" and \"Legacy\" toggles\n\n📖 **All auth issues:** [references/api-credentials.md](references/api-credentials.md)\n\n---\n\n## Templates & Examples\n\n### Basic Templates\n\nStarting points for common structures:\n\n- `assets/templates/wait-node-approval-template.json`\n- `assets/templates/orchestrator-template.json`\n- `assets/templates/sub-workflow-template.json`\n\n---\n\n### Complete Workflow Examples\n\nProduction-ready workflows you can import and use:\n\n- **News Aggregation** - Multi-source fetch, normalize, deduplicate, rank\n  `assets/examples/news-aggregation-workflow.json`\n\n- **Content Generation** - AI-powered content creation sub-workflow\n  `assets/examples/content-generation-workflow.json`\n\n- **LinkedIn Member ID** - Retrieve your LinkedIn member URN\n  `assets/examples/linkedin-member-id-workflow.json`\n\n- **Multi-Source Deduplication** - Merge and deduplicate pattern\n  `assets/examples/multi-source-deduplication-workflow.json`\n\n---\n\n## Code Snippet Library\n\nReusable JavaScript for Code nodes:\n\n- **Deduplication** - Remove duplicates by URL, title, ID, or multiple fields\n  `code-snippets/deduplication.js`\n\n- **Ranking Algorithms** - Multi-factor ranking (relevance, recency, engagement)\n  `code-snippets/ranking-algorithms.js`\n\n- **Data Normalization** - Unify data from different API sources\n  `code-snippets/data-normalization.js`\n\n- **Form Data Preparation** - Format data for Wait node forms\n  `code-snippets/form-data-preparation.js`\n\n- **Cross-Node Data Access** - Reference data from other nodes\n  `code-snippets/cross-node-data-access.js`\n\n---\n\n## API Credentials Quick Reference\n\n**LinkedIn OAuth2:**\n- Scopes: `openid`, `profile`, `w_member_social`\n- ❌ OFF: Organization Support, Legacy\n- URN format: `urn:li:person:{id}`\n\n**Anthropic API:**\n- Header: `x-api-key`\n- Model: `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022`\n- Temp: 0.7, Max tokens: 400\n\n**NewsAPI:**\n- Header: `X-Api-Key`\n- Endpoints: `/v2/everything`, `/v2/top-headlines`\n- Free tier: 100 requests/day\n\n📖 **Complete setup:** [references/api-credentials.md](references/api-credentials.md)\n\n---\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n### Core References\n- [node-library.md](references/node-library.md) - Comprehensive node documentation\n- [expression-syntax.md](references/expression-syntax.md) - Complete expression guide\n- [workflow-patterns.md](references/workflow-patterns.md) - Common workflow architectures\n- [wait-nodes-guide.md](references/wait-nodes-guide.md) - Human-in-the-loop patterns\n- [api-credentials.md](references/api-credentials.md) - Authentication setup\n- [mcp-limitations.md](references/mcp-limitations.md) - MCP server constraints\n- [execute-sub-workflow-issues.md](references/execute-sub-workflow-issues.md) - Sub-workflow troubleshooting\n- [troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) - Common issues and solutions\n\n---\n\n## Official n8n Documentation\n\n- [n8n Documentation](https://docs.n8n.io/)\n- [Execute Sub-Workflow Node](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.executeworkflow/)\n- [Sub-workflows Guide](https://docs.n8n.io/flow-logic/subworkflows/)\n- [Wait Node](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.wait/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:13:29.777Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced n8n workflow development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级n8n工作流开发功能的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"n8nワークフロー開発の高度な機能を必要とするワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 n8n 워크플ロー 개발 기능이 필요한 워크플ロー 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Flujo de Trabajo que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de flujo de trabajo n8n avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Flux de Travail nécessitant des capacités de développement de flux de travail n8n avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte n8n-Workflow-Entwicklungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de fluxo de trabalho n8n.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки рабочих процессов n8n.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي لاستكمال تدفق العمل الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير تدفق العمل n8n."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement production-ready n8n workflows using v2.0 patterns, best practices, and comprehensive node documentation, including API testing with curl and workflow JSON generation.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现生产就绪的n8n工作流，使用v2.0模式、最佳实践和全面节点文档，包括使用curl进行API测试和工作流JSON生成。","ja":"エージェントがv2.0パターン、ベストプラクティス、および包括的なノードのドキュメントを使用して、生产就绪のn8nワークフローを設計および実装できるようにします。curlを使用したAPIテストやワークフローJSONの生成も含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 v2.0 패턴, 최선의 관행 및 종합 노드 문서를 사용하여 생산 준비가 된 n8n 워크플ロー를 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. curl을 사용한 API 테스트 및 워크플로 JSON 생성도 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar flujos de trabajo de n8n listos para producción utilizando patrones de la versión 2.0, las mejores prácticas y una documentación de nodos completa, incluyendo pruebas de API con curl y generación de JSON de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail n8n prêts pour la production en utilisant des modèles de la version 2.0, les meilleures pratiques et une documentation complète des nœuds, y compris les tests d''API avec curl et la génération de JSON de flux de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionsreife n8n-Workflows mithilfe von v2.0-Mustern, Best Practices und umfassender Knotendokumentation zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, einschließlich API-Tests mit curl und Workflow-JSON-Generierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar fluxos de trabalho n8n prontos para produção usando padrões da versão 2.0, melhores práticas e documentação abrangente de nós, incluindo testes de API com curl e geração de JSON de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать рабочие процессы n8n, готовые к производству, используя шаблоны версии 2.0, лучшие практики и полную документацию по узлам, включая тестирование API с помощью curl и генерацию JSON рабочего процесса.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تصميم وتنفيذ تدفقات عمل n8n جاهزة للإنتاج باستخدام أنماط الإصدار 2.0 وأفضل الممارسات وتوثيق شامل للعقد ، بما في ذلك اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام curl وإنشاء JSON لتدفق العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflow development with n8n v2.0","Generating workflow JSON with nodes and connections","Troubleshooting n8n workflows with comprehensive documentation"],"zh":["使用n8n v2.0自动化工作流开发","使用节点和连接生成工作流JSON","使用全面文档排除n8n工作流故障"],"ja":["n8n v2.0を使用したワークフロー開発の自動化","ノードと接続を使用したワークフローJSONの生成","包括的なドキュメントを使用したn8nワークフローのトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["n8n v2.0를 사용한 워크플ロー 개발 자동화","노드 및 연결을 사용한 워크플로 JSON 생성","종합 문서를 사용한 n8n 워크플로 트러블슈팅"],"es":["Automatización del desarrollo de flujos de trabajo con n8n v2.0","Generación de JSON de flujo de trabajo con nodos y conexiones","Solución de problemas de flujos de trabajo de n8n con documentación completa"],"fr":["Automatisation du développement de flux de travail avec n8n v2.0","Génération de JSON de flux de travail avec des nœuds et des connexions","Dépannage des flux de travail n8n avec une documentation complète"],"de":["Automatisierung der Workflow-Entwicklung mit n8n v2.0","Generierung von Workflow-JSON mit Knoten und Verbindungen","Fehlerbehebung bei n8n-Workflows mit umfassender Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento de fluxo de trabalho com n8n v2.0","Gerar JSON de fluxo de trabalho com nós e conexões","Solucionar problemas de fluxo de trabalho n8n com documentação abrangente"],"ru":["Автоматизация разработки рабочих процессов с помощью n8n v2.0","Генерация JSON рабочего процесса с узлами и соединениями","Устранение неполадок в рабочих процессах n8n с помощью полной документации"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتطوير تدفق العمل باستخدام n8n v2.0","إنشاء JSON لتدفق العمل باستخدام العقد والاتصالات","معالجة مشاكل تدفق العمل n8n باستخدام توثيق شامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires n8n v2.0 compatibility","API testing requires valid tokens and endpoint URLs"],"zh":["需要n8n v2.0兼容性","API测试需要有效令牌和端点URL"],"ja":["n8n v2.0の互換性が必要","APIテストには有効なトークンとエンドポイントURLが必要"],"ko":["n8n v2.0 호환성이 필요","API 테스트에는 유효한 토큰 및 엔드포인트 URL이 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con n8n v2.0","Las pruebas de API requieren tokens y URL de endpoints válidos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec n8n v2.0","Les tests d''API nécessitent des jetons et des URL d''endpoints valides"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit n8n v2.0","API-Tests erfordern gültige Token und Endpunkt-URLs"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com n8n v2.0","Testes de API requerem tokens e URLs de endpoint válidos"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с n8n v2.0","Тестирование API требует действительных токенов и URL-адресов конечных точек"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع n8n v2.0","يتطلب اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات رموزًا و URLs نهاية صالحين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
