clara de presencia o ausencia","Evaluación del riesgo de falsos positivos","Puntuación de confianza justificada por la calidad de la evidencia","Compatibilidad con esquemas de salida definidos"],"fr":["Détection de modèles et d''entités dans les sources de données","Détermination booléenne claire de présence ou d''absence","Évaluation du risque de faux positifs","Score de confiance justifié par la qualité des preuves","Compatibilité avec les schémas de sortie définis"],"de":["Erkennung von Mustern und Entitäten in Datenquellen","Klare boolesche Bestimmung von Anwesenheit oder Abwesenheit","Bewertung des Risikos von Falschpositiven","Vertrauensscore begründet durch die Qualität der Beweise","Kompatibilität mit definierten Ausgabeschemata"],"pt":["Detecção binária de padrões","Força do sinal associada à detecção","Critérios de sucesso claros","Avaliação de risco de falsos positivos","Esquemas de saída compatíveis"],"ru":["Бинарное обнаружение закономерностей","Сила сигнала, связанная с обнаружением","Ясные критерии успеха","Оценка риска ложных положительных результатов","Совместимые схемы вывода"],"ar":["اكتشاف ثنائي الأنماط","قوة الإشارة المرتبطة بالكشف","معايير نجاح واضحة","تقييم مخاطر الإيجابيات الكاذبة","مخططات الإخراج المتوافقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["检测技能","二进制模式识别","数据源扫描","信号强度","存在判断","检测技术"],"ja":["検出スキル","バイナリパターン認識","データソーススキャン","信号強度","存在判断","検出技術"],"ko":["검출 스킬","바이너리 패턴 인식","데이터 소스 스캔","신호 강도","존재 판단","검출 기술"],"es":["detección de patrones","análisis de datos","reconocimiento de entidades","evaluación de riesgos","puntuación de confianza","esquemas de salida","desarrollo de software","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["détection de modèles","analyse de données","reconnaissance d''entités","évaluation de risques","score de confiance","schémas de sortie","développement de logiciels","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Mustererkennung","Datenanalyse","Entitätenerkennung","Risikobewertung","Vertrauensscore","Ausgabeschemata","Softwareentwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["detecção de padrões","desenvolvimento de software","análise de dados","inteligência artificial","aprendizado de máquina","Claude Code"],"ru":["обнаружение закономерностей","разработка программного обеспечения","анализ данных","искусственный интеллект","машинное обучение","Claude Code"],"ar":["اكتشاف الأنماط","تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل البيانات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعلم الآلة","Claude Code"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"detect","description":"Determine whether a specific pattern, entity, or condition exists in the given data. Use when searching for patterns, checking existence, validating presence, or finding signals.","bodyPreview":"## Intent\n\nScan data sources to determine whether a specified pattern, entity, or condition is present. Detection is binary (present/absent) with associated signal strength.\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- Clear boolean determination of presence/absence\n- At least one evidence anchor for positive detections\n- False positive risk assessment provided\n- Confidence score justified by evidence quality\n\n**Compatible schemas:**\n- `schemas/output_schema.yaml`\n\n## Inputs\n\n| Parameter | Required | Type | Descrip","body":"## Intent\n\nScan data sources to determine whether a specified pattern, entity, or condition is present. Detection is binary (present/absent) with associated signal strength.\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- Clear boolean determination of presence/absence\n- At least one evidence anchor for positive detections\n- False positive risk assessment provided\n- Confidence score justified by evidence quality\n\n**Compatible schemas:**\n- `schemas/output_schema.yaml`\n\n## Inputs\n\n| Parameter | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `target` | Yes | string\\|object | The data source to scan (file path, URL, or structured data) |\n| `pattern` | Yes | string\\|regex | The pattern, entity type, or condition to detect |\n| `threshold` | No | object | Detection sensitivity settings (e.g., min_matches, confidence_floor) |\n| `scope` | No | string | Limit search to specific regions (e.g., \"functions\", \"imports\", \"comments\") |\n\n## Procedure\n\n1) **Define detection criteria**: Clarify exactly what constitutes a positive detection\n   - Convert vague patterns to concrete search terms or regex\n   - Establish minimum evidence threshold for positive detection\n\n2) **Scan target systematically**: Search the target data for matching signals\n   - Use Grep for text patterns with appropriate flags (-i for case-insensitive, etc.)\n   - Use Read for structural inspection when pattern requires context\n   - Record location (file:line) for each potential match\n\n3) **Evaluate signal strength**: For each match, assess how strongly it indicates true presence\n   - Strong: exact match with clear context\n   - Medium: partial match or ambiguous context\n   - Weak: possible match requiring human verification\n\n4) **Assess false positive risk**: Determine likelihood that detections are spurious\n   - High risk: generic patterns, noisy data, few matches\n   - Low risk: specific patterns, clean data, multiple corroborating signals\n\n5) **Ground claims**: Attach evidence anchors to all detection signals\n   - Format: `file:line` for file-based targets\n   - Include snippet of matched content for verification\n\n6) **Format output**: Structure results according to the output contract below\n\n## Output Contract\n\nReturn a structured object:\n\n```yaml\ndetected: boolean  # True if pattern/entity was found\ntarget_type: string  # What was being detected (e.g., \"security vulnerability\", \"deprecated API\")\nsignals:\n  - signal: string  # Description of what was found\n    strength: low | medium | high  # Signal strength\n    location: string  # file:line or path where found\nfalse_positive_risk: low | medium | high  # Likelihood of spurious detection\nconfidence: number  # 0.0-1.0 based on evidence quality\nevidence_anchors: array[string]  # File:line references\nassumptions: array[string]  # Explicit assumptions made\nnext_actions: array[string]  # 0-3 suggested follow-ups if uncertain\n```\n\n### Field Definitions\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `detected` | boolean | True if the target pattern/entity was found |\n| `target_type` | string | Category of what was searched for |\n| `signals` | array | List of individual detection signals with strength |\n| `false_positive_risk` | enum | Assessment of detection reliability |\n| `confidence` | number | 0.0-1.0 based on evidence completeness |\n| `evidence_anchors` | array[string] | File:line references or tool outputs |\n| `assumptions` | array[string] | Explicitly stated assumptions |\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Detect SQL Injection Vulnerability\n\n**Input:**\n```yaml\ntarget: src/api/user_controller.py\npattern: \"SQL injection pattern\"\nthreshold:\n  min_matches: 1\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```yaml\ndetected: true\ntarget_type: \"SQL injection vulnerability\"\nsignals:\n  - signal: \"String concatenation in SQL query with user input\"\n    strength: high\n    location: \"src/api/user_controller.py:47\"\n  - signal: \"Raw SQL execution without parameterization\"\n    strength: medium\n    location: \"src/api/user_controller.py:52\"\nfalse_positive_risk: low\nconfidence: 0.85\nevidence_anchors:\n  - \"src/api/user_controller.py:47\"\n  - \"src/api/user_controller.py:52\"\nassumptions:\n  - \"User input flows from request.params to query variable\"\n  - \"No input sanitization in calling function\"\nnext_actions:\n  - \"Verify data flow from user input to SQL query\"\n  - \"Check for parameterized query alternatives in codebase\"\n```\n\n**Evidence pattern:** Grep for SQL keywords combined with string formatting patterns, then Read to verify context.\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: Detect Deprecated API Usage\n\n**Input:**\n```yaml\ntarget: src/\npattern: \"componentWillMount|componentWillReceiveProps\"\nscope: \"*.jsx,*.tsx\"\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```yaml\ndetected: true\ntarget_type: \"deprecated React lifecycle method\"\nsignals:\n  - signal: \"componentWillMount usage\"\n    strength: high\n    location: \"src/components/Dashboard.jsx:23\"\nfalse_positive_risk: low\nconfidence: 0.95\nevidence_anchors:\n  - \"src/components/Dashboard.jsx:23\"\nassumptions:\n  - \"Project uses React 16.3+ where these methods are deprecated\"\nnext_actions:\n  - \"Migrate to componentDidMount or useEffect hook\"\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n- [ ] Output contains `detected` boolean matching signal presence\n- [ ] At least one evidence anchor exists for positive detections\n- [ ] Confidence score correlates with number and strength of signals\n- [ ] All referenced file:line locations are valid and accessible\n- [ ] False positive risk assessment is justified\n\n**Verification tools:** Read (to verify file:line references exist)\n\n## Safety Constraints\n\n- `mutation`: false\n- `requires_checkpoint`: false\n- `requires_approval`: false\n- `risk`: low\n\n**Capability-specific rules:**\n- Do not access paths outside the specified target scope\n- Do not modify any files during detection\n- Stop and request clarification if detection criteria are ambiguous\n- Report uncertainty rather than guessing when signals are weak\n\n## Composition Patterns\n\n**Commonly follows:**\n- `inspect` - Detection often follows initial observation of a system\n- `search` - Detection may refine broad search results\n\n**Commonly precedes:**\n- `identify` - Positive detection often leads to classification of what was found\n- `estimate-risk` - Detection of anomalies feeds into risk assessment\n- `plan` - Detected issues may trigger remediation planning\n\n**Anti-patterns:**\n- Never use detect for complex entity classification (use `identify` instead)\n- Avoid detect for quantitative assessment (use `estimate` instead)\n\n**Workflow references:**\n- See `reference/composition_patterns.md#risk-assessment` for detection in risk workflows\n- See `reference/composition_patterns.md#observe-model-act` for detection in agentic loops\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:13:44.656Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing precise pattern detection capabilities in various data sources.","zh":"适用于需要在各种数据源中进行精确模式检测的数据分析代理。","ja":"データ分析エージェントが様々なデータソースで正確なパターン検出能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"다양한 데이터 소스에서 정確한 패턴 감지 능력이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan capacidades de detección de patrones precisas en diversas fuentes de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant des capacités de détection de modèles précises dans diverses sources de données.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die präzise Mustererkennungsfähigkeiten in verschiedenen Datenquellen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades de detecção de padrões precisas em várias fontes de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются точные возможности обнаружения закономерностей в различных источниках данных.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات كشف الأنماط الدقيقة في مصادر البيانات المختلفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scan data sources and determine the presence or absence of specified patterns, entities, or conditions with clear boolean determination and associated signal strength, utilizing evidence anchors and confidence scores justified by evidence quality.","zh":"赋予代理扫描数据源并确定指定模式、实体或条件的存在或不存在，具有明确的布尔值判断和关联信号强度，利用证据锚点和证据质量证明的置信度。","ja":"エージェントがデータソースをスキャンし、明示されたパターン、エンティティ、または条件の存在または不存在を判断することができ、明確なブール値の判断と関連する信号強度、証拠アンカーと証拠品質によって裏付けられた信頼度スコアを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 데이터 소스를 스캔하여 지정된 패턴, 엔티티 또는 조건의 존재 또는 존재하지 않음을 판단할 수 있으며, 명확한 불리언 판단 및 관련 신호 강도, 증거 앵커 및 증거 품질에 의한 신뢰도 점수를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escanear fuentes de datos y determinar la presencia o ausencia de patrones, entidades o condiciones especificadas con una determinación booleana clara y una fuerza de señal de referencia, utilizando anclajes de evidencia y puntuaciones de confianza justificadas por la calidad de la evidencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de scanner les sources de données et de déterminer la présence ou l''absence de modèles, d''entités ou de conditions spécifiées avec une détermination booléenne claire et une force de signal associée, en utilisant des ancrages d''évidence et des scores de confiance justifiés par la qualité de l''évidence.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Datenquellen zu scannen und das Vorhandensein oder Fehlen spezifizierter Muster, Entitäten oder Bedingungen mit einer klaren booleschen Bestimmung und einer zugehörigen Signalstärke zu bestimmen, indem sie Beweisanker und Vertrauenswerte verwenden, die durch die Beweisqualität gerechtfertigt sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a scanner fontes de dados e determinar a presença ou ausência de padrões, entidades ou condições específicas com determinação booleana clara e força de sinal associada, utilizando âncoras de evidências e escores de confiança justificados pela qualidade da evidência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сканировать источники данных и определять наличие или отсутствие указанных закономерностей, сущностей или условий с четким булевым определением и связанной силой сигнала, используя якоря доказательств и баллы доверия, обоснованные качеством доказательств.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من مسح مصادر البيانات وتحديد وجود أو عدم وجود الأنماط أو الكيانات أو الشروط المحددة مع تحديد بووليان واضح وقوة إشارة مرتبطة ، باستخدام مراسي الأدلة ودرجات الثقة المبررة بجودة الأدلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating entity recognition in large datasets","Detecting specific conditions in real-time data streams","Validating pattern presence with associated false positive risk assessment"],"zh":["自动化大型数据集中的实体识别","实时数据流中的特定条件检测","验证模式存在并评估假阳性风险"],"ja":["大規模データセットでのエンティティ認識の自動化","リアルタイムデータストリームでの特定条件の検出","パターンの存在を検証して偽陽性リスクを評価"],"ko":["대규모 데이터셋의 엔티티 인식 자동화","실시간 데이터 스트림의 특정 조건 감지","패턴 존재를 검증하고 거짓 양성 위험 평가"],"es":["Automatización del reconocimiento de entidades en grandes conjuntos de datos","Detección de condiciones específicas en flujos de datos en tiempo real","Validación de la presencia de patrones con evaluación asociada del riesgo de falsos positivos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la reconnaissance d''entités dans de grands ensembles de données","Détection de conditions spécifiques dans des flux de données en temps réel","Validation de la présence de modèles avec évaluation associée du risque de faux positifs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erkennung von Entitäten in großen Datenmengen","Erkennung spezifischer Bedingungen in Echtzeit-Datenströmen","Validierung der Musterpräsenz mit zugehöriger Falsch-Positiv-Risikobewertung"],"pt":["Automatizar o reconhecimento de entidades em grandes conjuntos de dados","Detectar condições específicas em fluxos de dados em tempo real","Validar a presença de padrões com avaliação associada de risco de falso positivo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать распознавание сущностей в больших наборах данных","Обнаруживать конкретные условия в потоках данных в режиме реального времени","Проверять наличие закономерностей с оценкой риска ложного положительного результата"],"ar":["أتمتة التعرف على الكيانات في مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة","كشف الشروط المحددة في تدفقات البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","التحقق من وجود الأنماط مع تقييم خطر الإيجابية الكاذبة المرتبط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear definition of pattern, entity, or condition to detect","Binary detection only (present/absent)","Dependent on data source quality and availability"],"zh":["需要明确定义要检测的模式、实体或条件","仅二元检测（存在/不存在）","依赖于数据源质量和可用性"],"ja":["検出するパターン、エンティティ、または条件の明確な定義が必要","二元検出のみ（存在/不存在）","データソースの品質と可用性に依存"],"ko":["검출할 패턴, 엔티티 또는 조건의 명확한 정의 필요","이진 감지만（존재/존재하지 않음）","데이터 소스의 품질 및 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una definición clara del patrón, la entidad o la condición a detectar","Detección binaria solo (presente/ausente)","Dependiente de la calidad y disponibilidad de la fuente de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition claire du modèle, de l''entité ou de la condition à détecter","Détection binaire uniquement (présent/absent)","Dépendante de la qualité et de la disponibilité de la source de données"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Definition des Musters, der Entität oder der Bedingung, die erkannt werden soll","Binäre Erkennung nur (vorhanden/nicht vorhanden)","Abhängig von der Datenquellenqualität und -verfügbarkeit"],"pt":["Exige definição clara do padrão, entidade ou condição a detectar","Detecção binária apenas (presente/ausente)","Dependente da qualidade e disponibilidade da fonte de dados"],"ru":["Требует четкого определения закономерности, сущности или условия для обнаружения","Только бинарное обнаружение (наличие/отсутствие)","Зависит от качества и доступности источника данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفًا واضحًا للنمط أو الكيان أو الشرط الذي سيتم الكشف عنه","كشف ثنائي فقط (حاضر/غائب)","يعتمد على جودة ومدى توافر مصدر البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
