akes pour la configuration"],"de":["Deklarative und reproduzierbare Konfigurationen","Multi-Repo-Composition","Airgapped-Deployments","Deklarative Infrastruktur","Paketverwaltung mit Nix","Verwendung von Nix Flakes für die Konfiguration"],"pt":["Construção de configurações com Nix flakes","Deploy em ambientes isolados","Infraestrutura declarativa","Gerenciamento de configurações de forma eficiente","Suporte a multi-repo composition","Atualização de dependências com facilidade"],"ru":["Создание конфигураций с помощью Nix flakes","Деплой в изолированных средах","Декларативная инфраструктура","Эффективное управление конфигурациями","Поддержка multi-repo composition","Простая актуализация зависимостей"],"ar":["بناء التكوينات باستخدام Nix flakes","نشر التطبيقات في بيئات معزولة","بنية تحتية إعلانية","إدارة التكوينات بسهولة","دعم التركيب متعدد المستودعات","تحديث الإعتماديات بسهولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NixOS","Nix","NixOS ","Nix ","NixOS","Declarative Infrastructure"],"ja":["NixOS","Nix","NixOS","Nix","NixOS","Declarative Infrastructure"],"ko":["NixOS","Nix","NixOS","Nix","NixOS","Declarative Infrastructure"],"es":["NixOS","Nix flakes","configuraciones declarativas","despliegues airgapped","infraestructura declarativa","gestión de paquetes","desarrollo de software","sistemas operativos"],"fr":["NixOS","Nix flakes","configurations déclaratives","déploiements airgapped","infrastructure déclarative","gestion des paquets","développement de logiciels","systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["NixOS","Nix Flakes","deklarative Konfigurationen","airgapped-Deployments","deklarative Infrastruktur","Paketverwaltung","Software-Entwicklung","Betriebssysteme"],"pt":["NixOS","Nix flakes","Desenvolvimento de configurações","Deploy em ambientes isolados","Infraestrutura declarativa","Gerenciamento de configurações","Multi-repo composition","Atualização de dependências"],"ru":["NixOS","Nix flakes","Разработка конфигураций","Деплой в изолированных средах","Декларативная инфраструктура","Управление конфигурациями","Multi-repo composition","Актуализация зависимостей"],"ar":["NixOS","Nix flakes","تطوير التكوينات","نشر التطبيقات في بيئات معزولة","بنية تحتية إعلانية","إدارة التكوينات","تركيب متعدد المستودعات","تحديث الإعتماديات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nixos","description":"NixOS and Nix flake development for multi-repo architectures, airgapped deployments, and K3s infrastructure. Use when working with flake.nix files, NixOS modules, derivations, devShells, overlays, OCI image packaging, or composing multiple flake repositories. Covers Nix language syntax, flake inputs/outputs, nixosModules exports, stdenv.mkDerivation, and home-manager integration.","bodyPreview":"# NixOS Development\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild and maintain NixOS configurations using Nix flakes. Focus on multi-repo composition, airgapped deployments, and declarative infrastructure.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Build package | `nix build .#packageName` |\n| Enter devShell | `nix develop` |\n| Update flake inputs | `nix flake update` |\n| Update single input | `nix flake lock --update-input nixpkgs` |\n| Show flake outputs | `nix flake show` |\n| Check flake | `nix flake","body":"# NixOS Development\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild and maintain NixOS configurations using Nix flakes. Focus on multi-repo composition, airgapped deployments, and declarative infrastructure.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Build package | `nix build .#packageName` |\n| Enter devShell | `nix develop` |\n| Update flake inputs | `nix flake update` |\n| Update single input | `nix flake lock --update-input nixpkgs` |\n| Show flake outputs | `nix flake show` |\n| Check flake | `nix flake check` |\n| Rebuild NixOS | `sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#hostname` |\n| Build ISO | `nix build .#nixosConfigurations.iso.config.system.build.isoImage` |\n\n## Flake Structure\n\nStandard multi-repo flake pattern:\n\n```nix\n{\n  inputs = {\n    nixpkgs.url = \"github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-unstable\";\n\n    # Pin dependent flakes to same nixpkgs\n    other-flake.url = \"git+ssh://gitlab.example.com/repo\";\n    other-flake.inputs.nixpkgs.follows = \"nixpkgs\";\n  };\n\n  outputs = { self, nixpkgs, other-flake, ... }:\n    let\n      system = \"x86_64-linux\";\n      pkgs = import nixpkgs { inherit system; };\n    in {\n      # NixOS system configurations\n      nixosConfigurations.hostname = nixpkgs.lib.nixosSystem {\n        inherit system;\n        modules = [\n          other-flake.nixosModules.default\n          ./configuration.nix\n        ];\n      };\n\n      # Reusable NixOS modules\n      nixosModules.default = import ./modules;\n\n      # Packages\n      packages.${system} = { /* ... */ };\n\n      # Development shells\n      devShells.${system}.default = pkgs.mkShell { /* ... */ };\n    };\n}\n```\n\n## NixOS Module Pattern\n\nExport modules for composition:\n\n```nix\n# modules/default.nix\n{ config, lib, pkgs, ... }:\n{\n  imports = [ ./service.nix ];\n\n  options.myModule.enable = lib.mkEnableOption \"my module\";\n\n  config = lib.mkIf config.myModule.enable {\n    # configuration here\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## OCI Image Packaging\n\nFor airgapped deployments, package images as store paths:\n\n```nix\n# Single image to OCI tarball\nimagePackage = pkgs.runCommand \"image-name\" {\n  buildInputs = [ pkgs.skopeo ];\n} ''''\n  skopeo copy docker://registry/image:tag oci-archive:$out\n'''';\n```\n\n## Helm + Kustomize in Nix\n\nRender manifests at build time:\n\n```nix\nmanifests = pkgs.runCommand \"manifests\" {\n  buildInputs = [ pkgs.kubernetes-helm pkgs.kustomize ];\n} ''''\n  helm template release ${./chart} --namespace ns > base.yaml\n  kustomize build ${./overlays} > $out\n'''';\n```\n\n## Detailed References\n\nFor comprehensive documentation on specific topics:\n\n| Topic | Reference File |\n|-------|----------------|\n| Nix language syntax | `references/nix-language.md` |\n| Flake inputs/outputs | `references/flakes.md` |\n| NixOS modules & options | `references/nixos-modules.md` |\n| Packaging & derivations | `references/packaging.md` |\n| DevShells & overlays | `references/devshells.md` |\n| Home Manager | `references/home-manager.md` |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pin nixpkgs across repos\nUse `inputs.X.inputs.nixpkgs.follows = \"nixpkgs\"` to ensure consistent package versions.\n\n### Conditional module loading\n```nix\nimports = lib.optionals config.feature.enable [ ./optional-module.nix ];\n```\n\n### Lazy evaluation with mkIf\nAlways use `lib.mkIf` for conditional config to avoid infinite recursion:\n```nix\nconfig = lib.mkIf config.myService.enable { /* ... */ };\n```\n\n### Override priorities\n- `lib.mkDefault` (priority 1000) - easily overridable defaults\n- `lib.mkForce` (priority 50) - force value regardless of other definitions\n- `lib.mkOverride N` - custom priority (lower = higher priority)\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"error: getting status of ''/nix/store/...'': No such file or directory\"\nMissing store path. Run `nix build` or ensure binary cache is configured.\n\n### \"error: infinite recursion encountered\"\nUsing config values in imports or not wrapping conditional config in `lib.mkIf`.\n\n### \"error: attribute ''X'' missing\"\nCheck flake inputs match expected names. Verify `follows` directives.\n\n### Flake not seeing local changes\nRun `git add .` - flakes ignore untracked files.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:14:24.487Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing declarative infrastructure management with NixOS configurations.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 NixOS 配置进行声明式基础设施管理的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"NixOS 構成を使用した宣言型インフラストラクチャ管理を必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適です。","ko":"NixOS 구성으로 선언적 인프라 관리를 필요로 하는 DevOps 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de infraestructura declarativa con configuraciones de NixOS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion d''infrastructure déclarative avec des configurations NixOS.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine deklarative Infrastrukturverwaltung mit NixOS-Konfigurationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que precisam de gerenciamento de infraestrutura declarativo com configurações NixOS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, которым требуется декларативное управление инфраструктурой с конфигурациями NixOS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة بنية تحتية إعلانية مع تكوينات NixOS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage NixOS configurations using Nix flakes, enabling multi-repo composition, airgapped deployments, and declarative infrastructure with commands like `nix build` and `nix flake update`.","zh":"赋予代理管理 NixOS 配置的能力，使用 Nix flakes 实现多仓库组合、空隙部署和声明式基础设施，并支持诸如 `nix build` 和 `nix flake update` 之类的命令。","ja":"エージェントに NixOS 構成を管理する能力を与え、Nix フレークを使用してマルチリポジトリの構成、エアギャップ デプロイ、宣言型インフラストラクチャを可能にし、`nix build` および `nix flake update` などのコマンドをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 NixOS 구성 관리를 가능하게 하고, Nix flakes를 사용하여 멀티 리포지토리 구성, 에어갭 배포 및 선언적 인프라를 지원하며, `nix build` 및 `nix flake update` 같은 명령어를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar configuraciones de NixOS utilizando copos de Nix, lo que permite la composición multi-repositorio, despliegues aislados y una infraestructura declarativa con comandos como `nix build` y `nix flake update`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les configurations NixOS en utilisant des flocons Nix, permettant ainsi la composition multi-dépôt, les déploiements aérés et une infrastructure déclarative avec des commandes comme `nix build` et `nix flake update`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, NixOS-Konfigurationen mithilfe von Nix-Flocken zu verwalten, wodurch eine Multi-Repo-Zusammensetzung, luftgekapselte Bereitstellungen und eine deklarative Infrastruktur mit Befehlen wie `nix build` und `nix flake update` ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar configurações NixOS usando Nix flakes, permitindo composição multi-repositório, implantações airgapped e infraestrutura declarativa com comandos como `nix build` e `nix flake update`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять конфигурациями NixOS с помощью Nix flakes, что позволяет осуществлять многорепозиторную композицию, воздушные развертывания и декларативную инфраструктуру с помощью команд như `nix build` и `nix flake update`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة تكوينات NixOS باستخدام Nix flakes، مما يسمح بالتركيب متعددة المستودعات والتركيب المحجوب والبنية التحتية الإعلانية باستخدام أوامر مثل `nix build` و `nix flake update`."},"useCases":{"en":["Building and maintaining NixOS configurations","Managing multi-repo compositions","Deploying airgapped environments"],"zh":["构建和维护 NixOS 配置","管理多仓库组合","部署空隙环境"],"ja":["NixOS 構成の構築とメンテナンス","マルチリポジトリ構成の管理","エアギャップ環境のデプロイ"],"ko":["NixOS 구성의 구축 및 유지 보수","멀티 리포지토리 구성 관리","에어갭 환경의 배포"],"es":["Construir y mantener configuraciones de NixOS","Gestionar composiciones multi-repositorio","Desplegar entornos aislados"],"fr":["Construire et maintenir des configurations NixOS","Gérer des compositions multi-dépôt","Déployer des environnements aérés"],"de":["NixOS-Konfigurationen erstellen und warten","Multi-Repo-Zusammensetzungen verwalten","Luftgekapselte Umgebungen bereitstellen"],"pt":["Construir e manter configurações NixOS","Gerenciar composições multi-repositório","Implantar ambientes airgapped"],"ru":["Создание и поддержание конфигураций NixOS","Управление многорепозиторной композицией","Развертывание воздушных сред"],"ar":["بناء وتحديث تكوينات NixOS","إدارة التركيب متعددة المستودعات","نشر بيئات محجوبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NixOS installation","Nix flakes support needed"],"zh":["需要 NixOS 安装","需要 Nix flakes 支持"],"ja":["NixOS のインストールが必要","Nix フレークのサポートが必要"],"ko":["NixOS 설치가 필요","Nix flakes 지원이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de NixOS","Se requiere soporte para copos de Nix"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de NixOS","Un support pour les flocons Nix est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt eine NixOS-Installation","Nix-Flocken-Unterstützung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do NixOS","Suporte a Nix flakes necessário"],"ru":["Требуется установка NixOS","Необходимо поддержка Nix flakes"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت NixOS","دعم Nix flakes مطلوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
