tructures d''emballage et types de variantes"],"de":["Detaillierte MPN-Strukturen","Dekodierungsbeispiele","Register von Claude-Codefähigkeiten","Informationen für Entwickler","Dekodierung von Werten und Toleranzen","Verpackungsstrukturen und Typvarianten"],"pt":["Registro de habilidades de código aberto","Estrutura de MPN detalhada","Código de indutância","Variante de tipo","Código de tamanho","Embalação"],"ru":["Реестр навыков открытого кода","Структура MPN подробно","Код индуктивности","Вариант типа","Код размера","Упаковка"],"ar":["سجل مهارات الكود المفتوح","هيكل MPN مفصل","كود الحث","نوع متغير","كود الحجم","التغليف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cyntec MPN","MPN","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC","T, S","20%, 10%"],"ja":["Cyntec MPN","MPN","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC","T, S","20%, 10%"],"ko":["Cyntec MPN","MPN","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC","T, S","20%, 10%"],"es":["cyntec","registro de habilidades de código","estructuras de MPN","descodificación","desarrolladores","claude code","mpn structure","decodificación de valores","tolerancias"],"fr":["cyntec","registre des compétences de code","structures de MPN","décodage","développeurs","claude code","structure mpn","décodage des valeurs","tolérances"],"de":["cyntec","register von codefähigkeiten","mpn-strukturen","dekodeierung","entwickler","claude code","mpn-struktur","dekodeierung von werten","toleranzen"],"pt":["Cyntec","registro de habilidades de código aberto","estrutura de MPN","desenvolvedores","código de indutância","variante de tipo","código de tamanho","embalação","tecnologia"],"ru":["Cyntec","реестр навыков открытого кода","структура MPN","разработчики","код индуктивности","вариант типа","код размера","упаковка","технологии"],"ar":["Cyntec","سجل مهارات الكود المفتوح","هيكل MPN","منصة المطورين","كود الحث","نوع متغير","كود الحجم","التغليف","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cyntec","description":"Cyntec power inductor MPN encoding patterns, value decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Cyntec inductors or CyntecHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Cyntec Corporation Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nCyntec MPNs follow this structure:\n\n```\n[SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]\n   |      |     |      |        |        |\n   |      |     |      |        |        +-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n   |      |     |      |        +-- M=20%, K=10%\n   |      |     |      +-- Inductance code\n   |      |     +-- Type variant (T, S, etc.)\n   |      +-- 3-4 digit size code\n   +-- Series (PCMC, VCMD, MCPA, CMC)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nPC","body":"# Cyntec Corporation Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nCyntec MPNs follow this structure:\n\n```\n[SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]\n   |      |     |      |        |        |\n   |      |     |      |        |        +-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n   |      |     |      |        +-- M=20%, K=10%\n   |      |     |      +-- Inductance code\n   |      |     +-- Type variant (T, S, etc.)\n   |      +-- 3-4 digit size code\n   +-- Series (PCMC, VCMD, MCPA, CMC)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nPCMC063T-1R0MN\n|   |  |  |  ||\n|   |  |  |  |+-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n|   |  |  |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|   |  |  +-- Inductance (1R0 = 1.0uH)\n|   |  +-- Type variant (T)\n|   +-- Size (063 = 6.3mm)\n+-- PCMC = Power Inductor series\n\nMCPA0504-1R0MN\n|   |    |  ||\n|   |    |  |+-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n|   |    |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|   |    +-- Inductance (1R0 = 1.0uH)\n|   +-- Size (0504 = 5.0mm x 4.0mm)\n+-- MCPA = Automotive Power Inductor series\n\nCMC0503-471M\n|  |    |  |\n|  |    |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|  |    +-- Impedance (471 = 470 ohm)\n|  +-- Size (0503 = 5.0mm x 3.0mm)\n+-- CMC = Common Mode Choke series\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Reference\n\n### PCMC - Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^PCMC[0-9]{3,4}.*` |\n| Size format | 3-4 digits |\n| Application | General power conversion |\n\n### VCMD - Molded Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Molded power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^VCMD[0-9]{3,4}.*` |\n| Size format | 3-4 digits |\n| Application | High current, shielded |\n\n### MCPA - Automotive Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Automotive-grade power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^MCPA[0-9]{4}.*` |\n| Size format | 4 digits |\n| Application | AEC-Q200 qualified |\n\n### CMC - Common Mode Chokes\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Common mode choke |\n| Pattern | `^CMC[0-9]{4}.*` |\n| Size format | 4 digits |\n| Application | EMI/EMC filtering |\n\n---\n\n## Inductance Encoding\n\nCyntec uses standard R-notation:\n\n### R-Notation (Decimal Point)\n\n| Code | Value | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| R47 | 0.47uH | R at start = sub-1uH |\n| R68 | 0.68uH | R at start |\n| 1R0 | 1.0uH | R in middle |\n| 2R2 | 2.2uH | R in middle |\n| 4R7 | 4.7uH | R in middle |\n| 6R8 | 6.8uH | R in middle |\n\n### 3-Digit Multiplier Code\n\n| Code | Value | Calculation |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| 100 | 10uH | 10 x 10^0 |\n| 101 | 100uH | 10 x 10^1 |\n| 220 | 22uH | 22 x 10^0 |\n| 470 | 47uH | 47 x 10^0 |\n| 471 | 470uH | 47 x 10^1 |\n\n### Decoding Algorithm\n\n```java\n// R at start (R47, R68)\nif (code.startsWith(\"R\")) {\n    double value = Double.parseDouble(\"0.\" + code.substring(1));\n    return formatInductance(value);\n}\n\n// R in middle (1R0, 2R2)\nif (code.contains(\"R\")) {\n    String[] parts = code.split(\"R\");\n    double value = Double.parseDouble(parts[0] + \".\" + parts[1]);\n    return formatInductance(value);\n}\n\n// 3-digit code\nif (code.matches(\"\\\\d{3}\")) {\n    int mantissa = Integer.parseInt(code.substring(0, 2));\n    int exponent = Integer.parseInt(code.substring(2, 3));\n    double microhenries = mantissa * Math.pow(10, exponent);\n    return formatInductance(microhenries);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Size Code Formats\n\n### 3-Digit Size (PCMC, VCMD)\n\n| Code | Dimension |\n|------|-----------|\n| 063 | 6.3mm |\n| 050 | 5.0mm |\n| 040 | 4.0mm |\n\n### 4-Digit Size (MCPA, CMC)\n\n| Code | Dimensions |\n|------|------------|\n| 0504 | 5.0mm x 4.0mm |\n| 0403 | 4.0mm x 3.0mm |\n| 0503 | 5.0mm x 3.0mm |\n\n---\n\n## Tolerance Codes\n\n| Code | Tolerance |\n|------|-----------|\n| K | +/- 10% |\n| M | +/- 20% |\n\n---\n\n## Package Type by Series\n\n| Series | Package Type |\n|--------|--------------|\n| PCMC | Power Inductor |\n| VCMD | Molded Power Inductor |\n| MCPA | Automotive Power Inductor |\n| CMC | Common Mode Choke |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// Returns series + size + type as the full identifier\n// PCMC063T-1R0MN -> \"PCMC063T\"\n// MCPA0504-1R0MN -> \"MCPA0504\"\n\nMatcher m = PCMC_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String type = m.group(3);\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2) + (type != null ? type : \"\");\n}\n\nm = VCMD_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String type = m.group(3);\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2) + (type != null ? type : \"\");\n}\n\n// MCPA and CMC don''t have type suffix\nm = MCPA_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2);\n}\n```\n\n### Package Code Extraction\n\n```java\n// Returns the package type description based on series\nString series = extractSeriesPrefix(mpn);\nreturn SERIES_PACKAGE_MAP.get(series);\n// Returns: \"Power Inductor\", \"Molded Power Inductor\", etc.\n```\n\n### Value Extraction\n\n```java\n// Value code position varies by series\n// PCMC/VCMD: group(4) after type\n// MCPA/CMC: group(3) directly after size\n\nMatcher m = PCMC_PATTERN.matcher(mpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String valueCode = m.group(4);\n    return parseInductanceCode(valueCode);\n}\n\nm = MCPA_PATTERN.matcher(mpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String valueCode = m.group(3);\n    return parseInductanceCode(valueCode);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern Details\n\n### PCMC Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(PCMC)(\\\\d{3,4})([A-Z]?)[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Groups: (1)series (2)size (3)type (4)value (5)tolerance+options\n```\n\n### VCMD Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(VCMD)(\\\\d{3,4})([A-Z]?)[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Same structure as PCMC\n```\n\n### MCPA Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(MCPA)(\\\\d{4})[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// No type field, 4-digit size only\n```\n\n### CMC Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(CMC)(\\\\d{4})[-]?([0-9]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Numeric-only value (impedance), no R-notation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Types\n\nCyntec products map to:\n- `INDUCTOR` - All inductor and choke products\n- `IC` - Also registered for pattern matching compatibility\n\n---\n\n## CMC Impedance Encoding\n\nCommon mode chokes use 3-digit impedance code (like ferrite beads):\n\n| Code | Impedance |\n|------|-----------|\n| 471 | 470 ohm |\n| 102 | 1000 ohm |\n| 222 | 2200 ohm |\n\n---\n\n## Common Part Numbers\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| PCMC063T-1R0MN | 1.0uH power inductor, 6.3mm |\n| VCMD063T-2R2MN | 2.2uH molded inductor, 6.3mm |\n| MCPA0504-1R0MN | 1.0uH automotive inductor |\n| CMC0503-471M | 470 ohm common mode choke |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/CyntecHandler.java`\n- Supported types: `INDUCTOR`, `IC`\n- No manufacturer-specific ComponentType enum entries\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **Variable size digit count**: PCMC/VCMD can have 3 OR 4 digit size codes (063 vs 0504). MCPA/CMC always have 4.\n- **Type field presence**: PCMC/VCMD have optional type letter (T, S). MCPA/CMC don''t have this field.\n- **CMC uses impedance**: Common mode chokes encode impedance, not inductance. No R-notation allowed.\n- **Series included in package code**: Unlike other handlers, Cyntec returns the package TYPE name (e.g., \"Power Inductor\") not size.\n- **Dash is optional**: The dash before value code may be present or absent.\n- **N suffix = tape and reel**: Standard packaging suffix.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:13:49.400Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronic Component Analysis Agents needing advanced MPN decoding capabilities for Cyntec Corporation products.","zh":"非常适合需要高级MPN解码功能的电子元件分析代理，特别是用于晨泰股份有限公司（Cyntec Corporation）的产品。","ja":"電子部品分析エージェントがサインテック社の製品向けに高度なMPNデコーディング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"사이버텍 코퍼레이션 제품을 위한 고급 MPN 디코딩 기능이 필요한 전자 부품 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de componentes electrónicos que necesitan capacidades de decodificación de MPN avanzadas para productos de Cyntec Corporation.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de composants électroniques ayant besoin de capacités de décodage de MPN avancées pour les produits de Cyntec Corporation.","de":"Perfekt für elektronische Bauteilanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte MPN-Decodierfunktionen für Cyntec Corporation-Produkte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Componentes Eletrônicos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de decodificação de MPN para produtos da Cyntec Corporation.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа электронных компонентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности декодирования MPN для продуктов корпорации Cyntec.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل المكونات الإلكترونية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات فك تشفير متقدمة لمنتجات شركة Cyntec."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to accurately decode Cyntec MPNs, utilizing the structure of SERIES, SIZE, TYPE, VALUE, TOLERANCE, and PACK to extract critical component information, supporting protocols like web search via https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app.","zh":"赋予代理准确解码サインテック MPN的能力，利用SERIES、SIZE、TYPE、VALUE、TOLERANCE和PACK的结构来提取关键元件信息，支持通过https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app的Web搜索等协议。","ja":"エージェントがサインテックMPNを正確にデコードできるようにし、SERIES、SIZE、TYPE、VALUE、TOLERANCE、PACKの構造を使用して重要なコンポーネント情報を抽出し、https://skills-registry-web.vercel.appによるWeb検索などのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 사이버텍 MPN을 정확하게 디코딩할 수 있도록 해주며, 시리즈, 크기, 유형, 값, 허용오차, 패키지의 구조를 사용하여 중요한 구성요소 정보를 추출하며, https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app를 통한 웹 검색 등의 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a decodificar los MPN de Cyntec con precisión, utilizando la estructura de SERIE, TAMAÑO, TIPO, VALOR, TOLERANCIA y PAQUETE para extraer información crítica de componentes, y soporta protocolos como la búsqueda web a través de https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app.","fr":"Permet aux agents de décodrer avec précision les MPN de Cyntec, en utilisant la structure de SÉRIE, TAILLE, TYPE, VALEUR, TOLÉRANCE et PAQUET pour extraire des informations critiques de composants, et prend en charge des protocoles tels que la recherche web via https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Cyntec-MPNs genau zu decodieren, indem sie die Struktur von SERIE, GRÖSSE, TYP, WERT, TOLERANZ und VERPACKUNG nutzen, um kritische Bauteilinformationen zu extrahieren, und unterstützt Protokolle wie die Web-Suche über https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a decodificar com precisão os MPNs da Cyntec, utilizando a estrutura de SÉRIE, TAMANHO, TIPO, VALOR, TOLERÂNCIA e EMBALAGEM para extrair informações críticas de componentes, suportando protocolos como busca na web via https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью точно декодировать MPN Cyntec, используя структуру СЕРИЯ, РАЗМЕР, ТИП, ЗНАЧЕНИЕ, ТОЛЕРАНТНОСТЬ и УПАКОВКА для извлечения критической информации о компонентах, поддерживая протоколы như веб-поиск через https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من فك تشفيرMPN لشركة Cyntec بدقة، باستخدام هيكل السلسلة، والحجم، والنوع، والقيمة، والتسامح، وال包 باستخدام بروتوكول مثل البحث عبر الويب من خلال https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app."},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding Cyntec MPNs for component procurement","Validating component specifications using tolerance and value codes","Automating inventory management with precise packaging information"],"zh":["用于部件采购的サインテック MPN解码","使用公差和值代码验证部件规格","使用精确的包装信息自动化库存管理"],"ja":["コンポーネント調達のためのサインテックMPNのデコード","公差と値のコードを使用したコンポーネント仕様の検証","正確なパッケージ情報を使用した在庫管理の自動化"],"ko":["구성요소 조달을 위한 사이버텍 MPN 디코딩","허용오차 및 값 코드를 사용한 구성요소 사양 검증","정확한 패키징 정보를 사용한 재고 관리 자동화"],"es":["Decodificar MPN de Cyntec para la compra de componentes","Validar las especificaciones de los componentes utilizando códigos de tolerancia y valor","Automatizar la gestión de inventario con información de embalaje precisa"],"fr":["Décodrer les MPN de Cyntec pour l''approvisionnement en composants","Valider les spécifications des composants en utilisant les codes de tolérance et de valeur","Automatiser la gestion des stocks avec des informations d''emballage précises"],"de":["Decodieren von Cyntec-MPNs für die Beschaffung von Bauteilen","Validieren der Bauteilspezifikationen unter Verwendung von Toleranz- und Wertcodes","Automatisieren des Lagermanagements mit genauer Verpackungsinformation"],"pt":["Decodificação de MPNs da Cyntec para aquisição de componentes","Validação de especificações de componentes usando códigos de tolerância e valor","Automatização da gestão de estoque com informações de embalagem precisas"],"ru":["Декодирование MPN Cyntec для закупки компонентов","Проверка спецификаций компонентов с помощью кодов допуска и значения","Автоматизация управления запасами с точной информацией об упаковке"],"ar":["فك تشفير MPN لشركة Cyntec لشراء المكونات","التحقق من مواصفات المكونات باستخدام رموز التسامح والقيمة","أتمتة إدارة المخزون بمعلومات التعبئة الدقيقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Cyntec MPN structure","Limited to Cyntec Corporation products"],"zh":["需要了解サインテック MPN结构","仅限于サインテック株式会社的产品"],"ja":["サインテックMPN構造の知識が必要","サインテック株式会社の製品に限定される"],"ko":["사이버텍 MPN 구조에 대한 지식이 필요","사이버텍 코퍼레이션 제품에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la estructura de MPN de Cyntec","Limitado a productos de Cyntec Corporation"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la structure de MPN de Cyntec","Limité aux produits de Cyntec Corporation"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Cyntec-MPN-Struktur","Begrenzt auf Cyntec Corporation-Produkte"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da estrutura de MPN da Cyntec","Limitado a produtos da Cyntec Corporation"],"ru":["Требует знания структуры MPN Cyntec","Ограничен продуктами корпорации Cyntec"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة هيكل MPN لشركة Cyntec","محدود لمنتجات شركة Cyntec"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
