-lib es una herramienta para generar bibliotecas de Angular siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto","fr":"ng-lib est un outil pour générer des bibliothèques Angular en suivant les conventions du projet","de":"ng-lib ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Angular-Bibliotheken, die den Projektconventionen folgen","pt":"O ng-lib é uma ferramenta para gerar bibliotecas Angular personalizadas, seguindo convenções de projeto e escopo adequados","ru":"Ng-lib - это инструмент для генерации настраиваемых библиотек Angular, следуя проектным конвенциям и области видимости","ar":"ng-lib هو أداة لإنشاء مكتبات Angular مخصصة، متبعا اتفاقيات المشروع والنطاق المناسب","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["生成遵循项目约定的Angular库","实现正确的作用域和模块边界","支持Global shared和Landing shared库生成","支持Landing feature库生成","提供快速参考指南"],"ja":["プロジェクトの規約に従ったAngularライブラリを生成","適切なスコープとモジュール境界を実現","Global sharedとLanding sharedライブラリの生成をサポート","Landing featureライブラリの生成をサポート","クイックリファレンスガイドを提供"],"ko":["프로젝트 규약을 따르는 Angular 라이브러리를 생성","적절한 범위와 모듈 경계를 구현","Global shared와 Landing shared 라이브러리의 생성을 지원","Landing feature 라이브러리의 생성을 지원","快速 참조 가이드를 제공"],"es":["Generación de bibliotecas de Angular","Seguimiento de convenciones del proyecto","Ámbito y límites de módulos adecuados","Compatibilidad con diferentes tipos de bibliotecas","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Génération de bibliothèques Angular","Suivi des conventions du projet","Portées et limites de modules appropriées","Compatibilité avec différents types de bibliothèques","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Erstellung von Angular-Bibliotheken","Einhalten der Projektconventionen","Geeignete Gültigkeitsbereiche und Modulgrenzen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Arten von Bibliotheken","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Geração de bibliotecas Angular personalizadas","Seguimento de convenções de projeto","Escopo e limites de módulos adequados","Suporte a bibliotecas compartilhadas e de recursos","Geração de caminhos de importação personalizados"],"ru":["Генерация настраиваемых библиотек Angular","Следование проектным конвенциям","Область видимости и границы модулей","Поддержка общих и функциональных библиотек","Генерация пользовательских путей импорта"],"ar":["إنشاء مكتبات Angular مخصصة","اتباع اتفاقيات المشروع","نطاق وحدود الوحدات","دعم المكتبات المشتركة والموارد","إنشاء مسارات الاستيراد المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular库生成","ng-lib","Angular开发工具","库生成工具","Angular项目约定","作用域和模块边界"],"ja":["Angularライブラリ生成","ng-lib","Angular開発ツール","ライブラリ生成ツール","Angularプロジェクト規約","スコープとモジュール境界"],"ko":["Angular 라이브러리 생성","ng-lib","Angular 개발 도구","라이브러리 생성 도구","Angular 프로젝트 규약","범위와 모듈 경계"],"es":["ng-lib","generador de bibliotecas de Angular","bibliotecas de Angular","convenciones del proyecto","ámbito y límites de módulos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["ng-lib","générateur de bibliothèques Angular","bibliothèques Angular","conventions du projet","portées et limites de modules","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["ng-lib","Generator für Angular-Bibliotheken","Angular-Bibliotheken","Projektconventionen","Gültigkeitsbereiche und Modulgrenzen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["ng-lib","bibliotecas Angular","gerador de bibliotecas","convenções de projeto","escopo e módulos","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ng-lib","библиотеки Angular","генератор библиотек","проектные конвенции","область видимости и модули","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ng-lib","مكتبات Angular","محرك مكتبات","اتفاقيات المشروع","نطاق والوحدات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ng-lib","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Angular Library Generator\n\nGenerate Angular libraries following project conventions with proper scoping and module boundaries.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Scope | Directory Pattern | Tags | Import Path |\n|-------|------------------|------|-------------|\n| Global shared | `libs/shared/{name}` | `scope:shared`, `type:{name}` | `@portfolio/shared/{name}` |\n| Landing shared | `libs/landing/shared/{type}` | `scope:landing`, `type:shared-{type}` | `@portfolio/landing/shared/{type}` |\n| Landing feature |","body":"# Angular Library Generator\n\nGenerate Angular libraries following project conventions with proper scoping and module boundaries.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Scope | Directory Pattern | Tags | Import Path |\n|-------|------------------|------|-------------|\n| Global shared | `libs/shared/{name}` | `scope:shared`, `type:{name}` | `@portfolio/shared/{name}` |\n| Landing shared | `libs/landing/shared/{type}` | `scope:landing`, `type:shared-{type}` | `@portfolio/landing/shared/{type}` |\n| Landing feature | `libs/landing/feature-{name}` | `scope:landing`, `type:feature` | `@portfolio/landing/feature-{name}` |\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Gather input** - Ask user for library name and purpose\n2. **Classify** - Determine scope (global-shared, landing-shared, landing-feature)\n3. **Prefill** - Auto-generate all options based on classification\n4. **Confirm** - Show user the command before execution\n5. **Execute** - Run nx generate command\n\n## Interactive Questions\n\nAsk user:\n1. \"What is the library name?\" (e.g., `projects`, `data-access`, `ui`)\n2. \"What is the library''s purpose?\" (helps classify scope)\n3. \"Which scope?\" - Offer options based on purpose:\n   - **Feature** - Landing page section (projects, skills, experience, hero)\n   - **Landing Shared** - Shared within landing app (data-access, ui, util, types)\n   - **Global Shared** - Shared across FE+BE (types, utils, testing)\n\n## Generator Options\n\nReference: `references/generator-options.md`\n\n### Project Defaults (from nx.json)\n\n```\nlinter: eslint\nunitTestRunner: jest\nstyle: scss (for components)\nstandalone: true\n```\n\n### Computed Options by Scope\n\n**Global Shared** (`libs/shared/{name}`):\n```bash\nnx g @nx/angular:library {name} \\\n  --directory=libs/shared/{name} \\\n  --importPath=@portfolio/shared/{name} \\\n  --tags=\"scope:shared,type:{name}\" \\\n  --prefix=shared \\\n  --standalone \\\n  --style=scss\n```\n\n**Landing Shared** (`libs/landing/shared/{type}`):\n```bash\nnx g @nx/angular:library {type} \\\n  --directory=libs/landing/shared/{type} \\\n  --importPath=@portfolio/landing/shared/{type} \\\n  --tags=\"scope:landing,type:shared-{type}\" \\\n  --prefix=landing \\\n  --standalone \\\n  --style=scss\n```\n\n**Landing Feature** (`libs/landing/feature-{name}`):\n```bash\nnx g @nx/angular:library feature-{name} \\\n  --directory=libs/landing/feature-{name} \\\n  --importPath=@portfolio/landing/feature-{name} \\\n  --tags=\"scope:landing,type:feature\" \\\n  --prefix=landing \\\n  --standalone \\\n  --style=scss\n```\n\n## Post-Generation\n\nAfter generating, remind user to:\n1. Update `tsconfig.base.json` paths if not auto-added\n2. Verify tags in `project.json`\n3. Run `pnpm lint` to verify module boundaries\n\n## Module Boundary Rules\n\nReference: `references/module-boundaries.md` for ESLint enforce-module-boundaries configuration.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:15:06.768Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined Angular library generation with proper scoping and module boundaries.","zh":"非常适合需要流线型Angular库生成并具有适当作用域和模块边界的前端代理。","ja":"Angularライブラリのストリームライン化された生成と適切なスコープとモジュールの境界が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"적절한 범위와 모듈 경계를 갖춘 Angular 라이브러리 스트림 라인 생성이 필요한 프론트 엔드 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que necesitan una generación de bibliotecas Angular optimizada con un ámbito y límites de módulo adecuados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin d''une génération de bibliothèques Angular rationalisée avec une portée et des limites de module appropriées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine optimierte Generierung von Angular-Bibliotheken mit ordnungsgemäßer Bereichs- und Modulbegrenzung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de geração de bibliotecas Angular otimizada com escopo e limites de módulo apropriados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется упрощенная генерация библиотек Angular с правильным областями видимости и границами модулей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى توليد مكتبات Angular المتنقلة مع نطاقات وحدود الوحدات المناسبة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate Angular libraries following project conventions, utilizing scope and directory patterns like ''libs/shared/{name}'' and import paths such as ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'', while adhering to specific tags for organization like ''scope:shared'' and ''type:{name}''.","zh":"赋予代理生成遵循项目约定的Angular库的能力，利用作用域和目录模式（如''libs/shared/{name}''）和导入路径（如''@portfolio/shared/{name}''），同时遵循特定的标签用于组织（如''scope:shared''和''type:{name}''）。","ja":"エージェントが、プロジェクトの規約に従ったAngularライブラリを生成する能力を与え、スコープとディレクトリパターン（例：''libs/shared/{name}''）とインポートパス（例：''@portfolio/shared/{name}''）を利用し、特定のタグ（例：''scope:shared''と''type:{name}''）に従って組織化します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 규칙을 따르는 Angular 라이브러리를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 범위 및 디렉토리 패턴(예: ''libs/shared/{name}'') 및 가져오기 경로(예: ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'')를 활용하고 특정 태그(예: ''scope:shared'' 및 ''type:{name}'')를 따르는 조직을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar bibliotecas de Angular siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto, utilizando patrones de ámbito y directorio como ''libs/shared/{name}'' y rutas de importación como ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'', mientras se adhieren a etiquetas específicas para la organización como ''scope:shared'' y ''type:{name}''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des bibliothèques Angular en suivant les conventions de projet, en utilisant des modèles de portée et de répertoire tels que ''libs/shared/{name}'' et des chemins d''importation tels que ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'', tout en respectant des balises spécifiques pour l''organisation comme ''scope:shared'' et ''type:{name}''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Angular-Bibliotheken zu generieren, die den Projektkonventionen folgen, indem sie Bereichs- und Verzeichnismuster wie ''libs/shared/{name}'' und Importpfade wie ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'' verwenden, während sie sich an bestimmte Tags für die Organisation wie ''scope:shared'' und ''type:{name}'' halten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem bibliotecas Angular seguindo as convenções do projeto, utilizando padrões de escopo e diretório como ''libs/shared/{name}'' e caminhos de importação como ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'', enquanto adere a tags específicas para organização como ''scope:shared'' e ''type:{name}''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать библиотеки Angular в соответствии с конвенциями проекта, используя шаблоны области видимости и каталогов, такие как ''libs/shared/{name}'' и пути импорта, такие как ''@portfolio/shared/{name}'', при этом придерживаясь конкретных тегов для организации, таких как ''scope:shared'' и ''type:{name}''.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توليد مكتبات Angular تتبع اتفاقيات المشروع، باستخدام أنماط النطاق والكتل مثل ''libs/shared/{name}'' ومسارات الاستيراد مثل ''@portfolio/shared/{name}''، مع الالتزام بالوسوم المحددة للت组织 مثل ''scope:shared'' و ''type:{name}''."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating global shared libraries with proper naming conventions","Creating landing shared libraries with specific type categorizations","Automating Angular library setup for new projects with predefined directory structures"],"zh":["使用适当的命名约定生成全局共享库","创建具有特定类型分类的登陆共享库","自动化新项目的Angular库设置，具有预定义的目录结构"],"ja":["適切な命名規則を使用してグローバル共有ライブラリを生成する","特定のタ