 Teile","Leistungsanalyse von Webanwendungen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Análise de bundle de código","Visualização de bundle","Verificação de pacotes grandes","Divisão de código em rotas","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Анализ пучка кода","Визуализация пучка","Проверка крупных пакетов","Разделение кода на маршруты","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تحليل حزمة الكود","تصور حزمة","التحقق من حزم كبيرة","تقسيم الكود إلى طرق","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PF 性能优化","Bundle 分析","代码拆分","性能问题分析","优化建议","Web 性能优化"],"ja":["PF パフォーマンス最適化","バンドル分析","コード分割","パフォーマンス問題分析","最適化提案","Web パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["PF 성능 최적화","번들 크기 분석","코드 스플리팅","성능 문제 분석","최적화 제안","웹 성능 최적화"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","análisis de bundles","optimización de código","división de código","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","aplicaciones web","desarrollo web"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","analyse des bundles","optimisation de code","division de code","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","applications web","développement web"],"de":["Leistungs-Optimierung","Bundle-Analyse","Code-Optimierung","Code-Aufteilung","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Webanwendungen","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","análise de bundle","visualização de bundle","verificação de pacotes","divisão de código","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","анализ пучка","визуализация пучка","проверка пакетов","разделение кода","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","تحليل حزمة","تصور حزمة","التحقق من الحزم","تقسيم الكود","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pf-perf","description":"성능 최적화 제안. 성능, 최적화, 느림, 번들 관련 요청 시 사용.","bodyPreview":"# PF 성능 최적화\n\n$ARGUMENTS 성능 문제를 분석하고 최적화를 제안합니다.\n\n---\n\n## 1. 번들 크기 분석\n\n### 번들 시각화\n\n```bash\n# vite-bundle-visualizer 설치\npnpm add -D rollup-plugin-visualizer\n\n# vite.config.ts\nimport { visualizer } from \"rollup-plugin-visualizer\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    visualizer({\n      open: true,\n      filename: \"stats.html\",\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n\n# 빌드 후 stats.html 확인\npnpm build\n```\n\n### 큰 패키지 확인\n\n```bash\n# 패키지 크기 확인\nnpx vite-bundle-analyzer\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. 코드 스플리팅\n\n### 라우트 기반 분할\n\n```tsx\nim","body":"# PF 성능 최적화\n\n$ARGUMENTS 성능 문제를 분석하고 최적화를 제안합니다.\n\n---\n\n## 1. 번들 크기 분석\n\n### 번들 시각화\n\n```bash\n# vite-bundle-visualizer 설치\npnpm add -D rollup-plugin-visualizer\n\n# vite.config.ts\nimport { visualizer } from \"rollup-plugin-visualizer\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    visualizer({\n      open: true,\n      filename: \"stats.html\",\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n\n# 빌드 후 stats.html 확인\npnpm build\n```\n\n### 큰 패키지 확인\n\n```bash\n# 패키지 크기 확인\nnpx vite-bundle-analyzer\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. 코드 스플리팅\n\n### 라우트 기반 분할\n\n```tsx\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from \"react\";\n\n// ❌ 정적 import (모든 페이지가 초기 번들에 포함)\nimport HomePage from \"./pages/home\";\nimport DashboardPage from \"./pages/dashboard\";\n\n// ✅ 동적 import (필요할 때 로드)\nconst HomePage = lazy(() => import(\"./pages/home\"));\nconst DashboardPage = lazy(() => import(\"./pages/dashboard\"));\n\nfunction Routes() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<PageSkeleton />}>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/\" element={<HomePage />} />\n        <Route path=\"/dashboard\" element={<DashboardPage />} />\n      </Routes>\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 컴포넌트 분할\n\n```tsx\n// 무거운 컴포넌트 지연 로드\nconst HeavyChart = lazy(() => import(\"./components/HeavyChart\"));\nconst MapViewer = lazy(() => import(\"@pf-dev/map\").then(m => ({ default: m.MapViewer })));\n\nfunction Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n        <HeavyChart data={data} />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. 의존성 최적화\n\n### Barrel Import 피하기\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ 전체 패키지 import (tree-shaking 불가능할 수 있음)\nimport { Button, Input, Select, Dialog } from \"@pf-dev/ui\";\n\n// ✅ 직접 import (확실한 tree-shaking)\nimport { Button } from \"@pf-dev/ui/atoms/Button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@pf-dev/ui/atoms/Input\";\n```\n\n### 무거운 패키지 대체\n\n| 패키지 | 크기 | 대안 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| moment.js | 288KB | date-fns (30KB) |\n| lodash | 71KB | lodash-es + 개별 import |\n| chart.js | 200KB+ | lightweight-charts |\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ 전체 lodash\nimport _ from \"lodash\";\n_.debounce(fn, 300);\n\n// ✅ 개별 함수만\nimport debounce from \"lodash-es/debounce\";\ndebounce(fn, 300);\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. React 렌더링 최적화\n\n### 불필요한 리렌더링 방지\n\n```tsx\n// React DevTools Profiler로 확인\n// Components > Profiler > 녹화\n\n// 1. Selector로 Zustand 구독 최적화\nconst user = useAuthStore(state => state.user);  // ✅ user만 구독\nconst { user, settings } = useAuthStore();       // ❌ 전체 구독\n\n// 2. 객체/배열 props 메모이제이션 (필요시)\nconst columns = useMemo(() => [\n  { key: \"name\", label: \"이름\" },\n  { key: \"email\", label: \"이메일\" },\n], []);\n\n// 3. 콜백 메모이제이션 (필요시)\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id) => {\n  deleteItem(id);\n}, [deleteItem]);\n```\n\n### 큰 리스트 가상화\n\n```tsx\nimport { useVirtualizer } from \"@tanstack/react-virtual\";\n\nfunction VirtualList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const parentRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  const virtualizer = useVirtualizer({\n    count: items.length,\n    getScrollElement: () => parentRef.current,\n    estimateSize: () => 50,  // 예상 아이템 높이\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={parentRef} className=\"h-[400px] overflow-auto\">\n      <div\n        style={{\n          height: `${virtualizer.getTotalSize()}px`,\n          position: \"relative\",\n        }}\n      >\n        {virtualizer.getVirtualItems().map((virtualItem) => (\n          <div\n            key={virtualItem.key}\n            style={{\n              position: \"absolute\",\n              top: 0,\n              left: 0,\n              width: \"100%\",\n              height: `${virtualItem.size}px`,\n              transform: `translateY(${virtualItem.start}px)`,\n            }}\n          >\n            <ItemRow item={items[virtualItem.index]} />\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. 이미지 최적화\n\n```tsx\n// 1. lazy loading\n<img src=\"/image.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"...\" />\n\n// 2. 적절한 크기\n<img\n  src=\"/image.jpg\"\n  srcSet=\"/image-400.jpg 400w, /image-800.jpg 800w\"\n  sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 400px, 800px\"\n  alt=\"...\"\n/>\n\n// 3. WebP 포맷\n<picture>\n  <source srcSet=\"/image.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n  <img src=\"/image.jpg\" alt=\"...\" />\n</picture>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. API 최적화\n\n### 요청 병렬화\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ 순차 요청\nconst users = await fetchUsers();\nconst posts = await fetchPosts();\nconst comments = await fetchComments();\n\n// ✅ 병렬 요청\nconst [users, posts, comments] = await Promise.all([\n  fetchUsers(),\n  fetchPosts(),\n  fetchComments(),\n]);\n```\n\n### 캐싱\n\n```tsx\n// React Query / SWR 사용\nconst { data } = useQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"users\"],\n  queryFn: fetchUsers,\n  staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000,  // 5분간 캐시\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## 7. 측정 도구\n\n### Lighthouse\n\n```bash\n# CLI로 실행\nnpx lighthouse http://localhost:3000 --view\n```\n\n**목표 점수:**\n- Performance: 90+\n- Accessibility: 90+\n- Best Practices: 90+\n- SEO: 90+\n\n### Web Vitals\n\n```tsx\nimport { onCLS, onFID, onLCP, onFCP, onTTFB } from \"web-vitals\";\n\nonCLS(console.log);   // Cumulative Layout Shift\nonFID(console.log);   // First Input Delay\nonLCP(console.log);   // Largest Contentful Paint\nonFCP(console.log);   // First Contentful Paint\nonTTFB(console.log);  // Time to First Byte\n```\n\n**목표:**\n- LCP: < 2.5초\n- FID: < 100ms\n- CLS: < 0.1\n\n---\n\n## 8. 빌드 최적화\n\n### Vite 설정\n\n```ts\n// vite.config.ts\nexport default defineConfig({\n  build: {\n    rollupOptions: {\n      output: {\n        manualChunks: {\n          vendor: [\"react\", \"react-dom\"],\n          cesium: [\"cesium\"],\n          three: [\"three\", \"@react-three/fiber\"],\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    chunkSizeWarningLimit: 500,  // KB\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### 압축\n\n```ts\nimport viteCompression from \"vite-plugin-compression\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    viteCompression({\n      algorithm: \"gzip\",\n    }),\n    viteCompression({\n      algorithm: \"brotliCompress\",\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## 체크리스트\n\n- [ ] 번들 크기 500KB 이하\n- [ ] 라우트별 코드 스플리팅\n- [ ] 불필요한 리렌더링 없음\n- [ ] 이미지 lazy loading\n- [ ] API 요청 병렬화/캐싱\n- [ ] Lighthouse 성능 90+\n- [ ] LCP < 2.5초\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:15:12.054Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced bundle optimization and performance analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级捆绑包优化和性能分析功能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なバンドル最適化とパフォーマンス分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 번들 최적화 및 성능 분석 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de optimización y análisis de rendimiento de paquetes avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités d''optimisation et d''analyse de performances de paquetes avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Bundle-Optimierungs- und Leistungsanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de otimização de pacote avançada e capacidades de análise de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации пакетов и анализа производительности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين حزمة متقدم وسمات تحليل الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and optimize bundle sizes using vite-bundle-visualizer and vite-bundle-analyzer, and implement code splitting for improved performance, leveraging rollup-plugin-visualizer and Vite configuration.","zh":"赋予代理分析和优化捆绑包大小的能力，使用vite-bundle-visualizer和vite-bundle-analyzer，并通过rollup-plugin-visualizer和Vite配置实现代码拆分以提高性能。","ja":"vite-bundle-visualizerとvite-bundle-analyzerを使用してバンドルサイズを分析および最適化し、rollup-plugin-visualizerとViteの設定を使用してコード分割を実装してパフォーマンスを向上させるエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"vite-bundle-visualizer와 vite-bundle-analyzer를 사용하여 번들 크기를 분석 및 최적화하고 rollup-plugin-visualizer 및 Vite 구성으로 코드 분할을 구현하여 성능을 개선할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar y optimizar los tamaños de los paquetes utilizando vite-bundle-visualizer y vite-bundle-analyzer, e implementar la división de código para mejorar el rendimiento, aprovechando rollup-plugin-visualizer y la configuración de Vite.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et d''optimiser les tailles de paquetes en utilisant vite-bundle-visualizer et vite-bundle-analyzer, et de mettre en œuvre un code splitting pour améliorer les performances, en exploitant rollup-plugin-visualizer et la configuration de Vite.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Bundle-Größen mit vite-bundle-visualizer und vite-bundle-analyzer zu analysieren und zu optimieren, sowie Code-Splitting für verbesserte Leistung umzusetzen, indem rollup-plugin-visualizer und Vite-Konfiguration genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e otimizar os tamanhos dos pacotes usando vite-bundle-visualizer e vite-bundle-analyzer, e implementar a divisão de código para melhorar o desempenho, aproveitando rollup-plugin-visualizer e configuração do Vite.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать и оптимизировать размеры пакетов с помощью vite-bundle-visualizer и vite-bundle-analyzer, и реализовывать разделение кода для улучшения производительности, используя rollup-plugin-visualizer и конфигурацию Vite.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحليل وتحسين أحجام الحزم باستخدام vite-bundle-visualizer وvite-bundle-analyzer، وتنفيذ تقسيم الشفرة لتحسين الأداء، بافتراض rollup-plugin-visualizer وتكوين Vite."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing bundle sizes and identifying large packages","Implementing route-based code splitting for improved load times","Debugging performance issues using visualized bundle statistics"],"zh":["分析捆绑包大小并识别大型包","实现基于路由的代码拆分以提高加载时间","使用可视化的捆绑包统计数据调试性能问题"],"ja":["バンドルサイズを分析し、大きなパッケージを特定する","ルートベースのコード分割を実装してロード時間を改善する","視覚化されたバンドル統計を使用してパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["번들 크기를 분석하고 큰 패키지를 식별하는 것","루트 기반 코드 분할을 구현하여 로드 시간을 개선하는 것","시각화된 번들 통계를 사용하여 성능 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Análisis de tamaños de paquetes e identificación de paquetes grandes","Implementación de división de código basada en rutas para tiempos de carga mejorados","Depuración de problemas de rendimiento utilizando estadísticas de paquetes visualizadas"],"fr":["Analyse des tailles de paquetes et identification des packages importants","Mise en œuvre d''un code splitting basé sur les routes pour améliorer les temps de chargement","Débogage des problèmes de performances à l''aide de statistiques de paquetes visualisées"],"de":["Analyse von Bundle-Größen und Identifizierung großer Pakete","Implementierung von route-basiertem Code-Splitting für verbesserte Ladezeiten","Fehlerbehebung von Leistungsproblemen unter Verwendung von visualisierten Bundle-Statistiken"],"pt":["Analisar tamanhos de pacotes e identificar pacotes grandes","Implementar divisão de código baseada em rotas para melhorar os tempos de carregamento","Depurar problemas de desempenho usando estatísticas de pacotes visualizadas"],"ru":["Анализировать размеры пакетов и определять большие пакеты","Реализовывать разделение кода на основе маршрутов для улучшения времени загрузки","Отлаживать проблемы производительности с помощью визуализированных статистик пакетов"],"ar":["تحليل أحجام الحزم وتحديد الحزم الكبيرة","تنفيذ تقسيم الشفرةตาม المسار لتحسين أوقات التحميل","تصحيح أخطاء الأداء باستخدام إحصائيات الحزم المرئية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite configuration and setup","Limited to JavaScript-based projects","Dependent on rollup-plugin-visualizer and vite-bundle-analyzer libraries"],"zh":["需要Vite配置和设置","仅限于JavaScript基础项目","依赖于rollup-plugin-visualizer和vite-bundle-analyzer库"],"ja":["Viteの設定とセットアップが必要","JavaScriptベースのプロジェクトのみ","rollup-plugin-visualizerとvite-bundle-analyzerライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Vite 구성 및 설정이 필요함","JavaScript 기반 프로젝트에만 제한됨","rollup-plugin-visualizer 및 vite-bundle-analyzer 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Vite","Limitado a proyectos basados en JavaScript","Dependiente de las bibliotecas rollup-plugin-visualizer y vite-bundle-analyzer"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une configuration de Vite","Limité aux projets basés sur JavaScript","Dépendant des bibliothèques rollup-plugin-visualizer et vite-bundle-analyzer"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-Konfiguration und -Einrichtung","Begrenzt auf JavaScript-basierte Projekte","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken rollup-plugin-visualizer und vite-bundle-analyzer"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Vite","Limitado a projetos baseados em JavaScript","Dependente das bibliotecas rollup-plugin-visualizer e vite-bundle-analyzer"],"ru":["Требует конфигурации и настройки Vite","Ограничен проектами на основе JavaScript","Зависит от библиотек rollup-plugin-visualizer и vite-bundle-analyzer"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين Vite وضبطه","محدود بمشاريع قاعدة JavaScript","يعتمد على مكتبات rollup-plugin-visualizer وvite-bundle-analyzer"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/cynefin', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'cynefin', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z', '2026-02-18T07:14:34.356Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/cynefin","name":"cynefin","description":{"zh":"Cynefin 框架是一种问题分析工具，帮助您了解问题的类型和应对策略","ja":"Cynefin フレームワークは問題分析ツールであり、問題のタイプと対応戦略を理解するのに役立ちます","ko":"Cynefin 프레임워크는 문제 분석 도구로서 문제의 유형과 대응 전략을 이해하는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"El análisis Cynefin es un marco para comprender y responder a problemas complejos. Ayuda a identificar el dominio de Cynefin y aplicar el enfoque de respuesta adecuado","fr":"L''analyse Cynefin est un cadre pour comprendre et répondre à des problèmes complexes. Elle aide à identifier le domaine de Cynefin et à appliquer l''approche de réponse appropriée","de":"Die Cynefin-Analyse ist ein Rahmen für das Verständnis und die Reaktion auf komplexe Probleme. Sie hilft, den Cynefin-Bereich zu identifizieren und den geeigneten Reaktionsansatz anzuwenden","pt":"A análise Cynefin é uma abordagem para entender problemas complexos e escolher as respostas adequadas. Ela ajuda a identificar o domínio do problema e aplicar a abordagem de resposta apropriada.","ru":"Анализ Cynefin - это подход к пониманию сложных проблем и выбору подходящих ответов. Он помогает определить домен проблемы и применить подходящий подход к ответу.","ar":"تحليل Cynefin هو نهج لفهم المشكلات المعقدة واختيار الاستجابات المناسبة. يساعد على تحديد مجال المشكلة وتطبيق نهج الاستجابة المناسب.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Cynefin 框架分析","ja":"Cynefin フレームワーク分析","ko":"Cynefin 분석 프레임워크","es":"Análisis Cynefin: Marco de Problemas Complejos","fr":"Analyse Cynefin : Cadre de Problèmes Complexes","d