management","Integration mit API","Python-Skripte für Automatisierung","Aufgaben- und Produktverwaltung"],"pt":["Integração com tempo e projetos","Gerenciamento de relações com clientes","Gerenciamento de tarefas e produtos","Configuração simples com MILKEE_API_TOKEN e MILKEE_COMPANY_ID","Comandos principais para tempo e projetos"],"ru":["Интеграция с временем и проектами","Управление отношениями с клиентами","Управление задачами и продуктами","Простая настройка с MILKEE_API_TOKEN и MILKEE_COMPANY_ID","Основные команды для времени и проектов"],"ar":["دمج الوقت والمشاريع","إدارة علاقات العملاء","إدارة المهام والمنتجات","إعداد بسيط باستخدام MILKEE_API_TOKEN و MILKEE_COMPANY_ID","الأوامر الرئيسية للوقت والمشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["milkee","瑞士会计平台","时间跟踪","项目管理","客户关系管理","会计软件","项目管理工具"],"ja":["milkee","スイス会計プラットフォーム","タイムトラッキング","プロジェクト管理","顧客関係管理","会計ソフト","プロジェクト管理ツール"],"ko":["milkee","스위스 회계 플랫폼","시간 추적","프로젝트 관리","고객 관계 관리","회계 소프트웨어","프로젝트 관리 도구"],"es":["milkee","integración","seguimiento de tiempo","gestión de proyectos","API","Python","automatización","contabilidad"],"fr":["milkee","intégration","suivi du temps","gestion de projets","API","Python","automatisation","comptabilité"],"de":["milkee","Integration","Zeiterfassung","Projektmanagement","API","Python","Automatisierung","Contabilität"],"pt":["Milkee","plataforma de contabilidade","desenvolvedores","integração de tempo","gerenciamento de projetos","relações com clientes","tarefas","produtos"],"ru":["Milkee","бухгалтерская платформа","разработчики","интеграция времени","управление проектами","отношения с клиентами","задачи","продукты"],"ar":["Milkee","منصة محاسبة","مطورين","دمج الوقت","إدارة المشاريع","علاقات العملاء","مهام","منتجات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"milkee","description":"Complete MILKEE accounting integration for Swiss businesses. Manage projects, customers, time tracking, tasks, and products. Use when: (1) tracking billable time with start/stop timers, (2) creating/managing projects and customers, (3) recording work entries with descriptions, (4) viewing daily time summaries, (5) managing tasks and products. Features fuzzy project matching, persistent timer state, auto-calculated hours/minutes, and full CRUD operations. Requires MILKEE_API_TOKEN and MILKEE_COMPANY_ID.","bodyPreview":"# MILKEE Accounting Skill\n\nSwiss accounting platform integration for time tracking, project management, customer relations, tasks, and products.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nSee [configuration.md](references/configuration.md) to set up:\n- `MILKEE_API_TOKEN` (format: `USER_ID|API_KEY`)\n- `MILKEE_COMPANY_ID` (from MILKEE URL)\n\nThen run commands below using `scripts/milkee.py`\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Time Tracking (Primary Feature)\n```bash\n# Start timer (auto-matches project name via fuzzy matching)\npython3 scr","body":"# MILKEE Accounting Skill\n\nSwiss accounting platform integration for time tracking, project management, customer relations, tasks, and products.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nSee [configuration.md](references/configuration.md) to set up:\n- `MILKEE_API_TOKEN` (format: `USER_ID|API_KEY`)\n- `MILKEE_COMPANY_ID` (from MILKEE URL)\n\nThen run commands below using `scripts/milkee.py`\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Time Tracking (Primary Feature)\n```bash\n# Start timer (auto-matches project name via fuzzy matching)\npython3 scripts/milkee.py start_timer \"Website\" \"Implementing authentication module\"\n\n# Stop timer (auto-calculates hours/minutes, uploads to MILKEE)\npython3 scripts/milkee.py stop_timer\n\n# Show today''s time entries\npython3 scripts/milkee.py list_times_today\n```\n\n### Projects\n```bash\npython3 scripts/milkee.py list_projects\npython3 scripts/milkee.py create_project \"My Project\" --customer-id 123 --budget 5000\npython3 scripts/milkee.py update_project 7478 --name \"New Name\" --budget 6000\n```\n\n### Customers\n```bash\npython3 scripts/milkee.py list_customers\npython3 scripts/milkee.py create_customer \"ACME Corp\" --city \"Zürich\"\npython3 scripts/milkee.py update_customer 123 --name \"ACME AG\"\n```\n\n### Tasks\n```bash\npython3 scripts/milkee.py list_tasks --project-id 7478\npython3 scripts/milkee.py create_task \"Implement Auth\" --project-id 7478\npython3 scripts/milkee.py update_task 456 --name \"Updated Task\"\n```\n\n### Products\n```bash\npython3 scripts/milkee.py list_products\npython3 scripts/milkee.py create_product \"Consulting Hour\" --price 150\npython3 scripts/milkee.py update_product 789 --price 175\n```\n\n## Features\n\n✅ **Smart Fuzzy Matching**: \"Milkee\" → \"Milkee Company AG\" (auto-selects closest project)\n✅ **Timer Persistence**: State saved to `~/.milkee_timer` between sessions\n✅ **Auto-Calculation**: Elapsed time computed to hours/minutes\n✅ **Full CRUD**: Projects, customers, tasks, products\n✅ **Billable Time Tracking**: Daily summaries with total hours\n✅ **No External Dependencies**: Uses Python stdlib only\n\n## How Fuzzy Matching Works\n\n1. User says: `start_timer \"website\"`\n2. Skill fetches all projects from MILKEE\n3. Uses Levenshtein distance to find best match\n4. Auto-starts timer on highest-scoring project\n\n**Example**: \"website\" matches \"Website Redesign Project\" with 96.5% confidence\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n- **scripts/milkee.py**: CLI tool (300 lines, no dependencies)\n- **references/configuration.md**: Setup + troubleshooting\n- **references/api-endpoints.md**: Full API reference\n\nSee these files for:\n- Detailed configuration instructions\n- API endpoint documentation\n- Error handling guide\n- Security best practices\n\n## Official Documentation\n\nFor complete API reference, see:\n- **MILKEE API Docs**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api\n- **Projects**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api/resources/projects.html\n- **Customers**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api/resources/customers.html\n- **Time Entries**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api/resources/times.html\n- **Tasks**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api/resources/tasks.html\n- **Products**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api/resources/products.html\n- **Authentication**: https://apidocs.milkee.ch/api/authentifizierung.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:15:36.574Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing integrated time tracking and project management capabilities with Swiss accounting platforms.","zh":"非常适合需要与瑞士会计平台集成时间跟踪和项目管理功能的生产力代理","ja":"スイスの会計プラットフォームとの統合されたタイムトラッキングとプロジェクト管理機能を必要とする生産性エージェントに最適","ko":"스위스의 회계 플랫폼과 통합된 시간 추적 및 프로젝트 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 생산성 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de productividad que necesitan seguimiento de tiempo integrado y capacidades de gestión de proyectos con plataformas de contabilidad suizas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de productivité ayant besoin d''un suivi du temps intégré et de capacités de gestion de projet avec des plateformes de comptabilité suisses.","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die integrierte Zeitverfolgung und Projektmanagement-Funktionen mit Schweizer Buchhaltungsplattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que necessitam de acompanhamento de tempo integrado e capacidades de gerenciamento de projetos com plataformas de contabilidade suíças.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов продуктивности, которым необходимы интегрированные возможности отслеживания времени и управления проектами с швейцарскими бухгалтерскими платформами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإنتاجية الذين يحتاجون إلى تتبع زمني متكامل وخصائص إدارة المشاريع مع منصات المحاسبة السويسرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate time tracking, project management, and customer relations tasks via the MILKEE API, utilizing Python scripts and fuzzy matching for seamless integration, and supports tasks and products management through the MILKEE_COMPANY_ID and MILKEE_API_TOKEN configurations.","zh":"通过MILKEE API、Python脚本和模糊匹配实现时间跟踪、项目管理和客户关系任务的自动化，并通过MILKEE_COMPANY_ID和MILKEE_API_TOKEN配置支持任务和产品管理","ja":"MILKEE API、Pythonスクリプト、ファジーマッチングを利用して、時間追跡、プロジェクト管理、顧客関係タスクの自動化を可能とし、MILKEE_COMPANY_IDとMILKEE_API_TOKENの設定を通じてタスクと製品の管理をサポート","ko":"MILKEE API, Python 스크립트 및 퍼지 매칭을 통해 시간 추적, 프로젝트 관리 및 고객 관계 태스크의 자동화를 가능하게 하며, MILKEE_COMPANY_ID 및 MILKEE_API_TOKEN 구성으로 태스크 및 제품 관리를 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar el seguimiento de tiempo, la gestión de proyectos y las tareas de relaciones con los clientes a través de la API de MILKEE, utilizando scripts de Python y coincidencia difusa para una integración perfecta, y admite la gestión de tareas y productos a través de las configuraciones de MILKEE_COMPANY_ID y MILKEE_API_TOKEN.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le suivi du temps, la gestion de projet et les tâches de relations avec les clients via l''API MILKEE, en utilisant des scripts Python et un appariement flou pour une intégration transparente, et prend en charge la gestion des tâches et des produits via les configurations MILKEE_COMPANY_ID et MILKEE_API_TOKEN.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Zeitverfolgung, Projektmanagement und Kundenbeziehungs-Aufgaben über die MILKEE-API zu automatisieren, indem Python-Skripte und Fuzzy-Matching für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden, und unterstützt die Aufgaben- und Produktverwaltung durch die Konfigurationen von MILKEE_COMPANY_ID und MILKEE_API_TOKEN.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas de acompanhamento de tempo, gerenciamento de projetos e relações com os clientes por meio da API MILKEE, utilizando scripts Python e correspondência difusa para integração perfeita, e suporta gerenciamento de tarefas e produtos por meio das configurações MILKEE_COMPANY_ID e MILKEE_API_TOKEN.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи отслеживания времени, управления проектами и отношений с клиентами через API MILKEE, используя скрипты Python и нечеткое совпадение для бесшовной интеграции, и поддерживает управление задачами и продуктами через конфигурации MILKEE_COMPANY_ID и MILKEE_API_TOKEN.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير تتبع زمني وتحكم في المشاريع وعلاقات العملاء عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات MILKEE، باستخدام نصوص برمجة Python والتعيين الغامض للتكامل السلس، ودعم إدارة المهام والمنتجات من خلال تكوين MILKEE_COMPANY_ID و MILKEE_API_TOKEN."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating time tracking with fuzzy project matching","Managing customer relations and tasks through MILKEE API","Integrating project management with Swiss accounting platforms"],"zh":["使用模糊项目匹配自动化时间跟踪","通过MILKEE API管理客户关系和任务","将项目管理与瑞士会计平台集成"],"ja":["ファジープロジェクトマッチングを使用した時間追跡の自動化","MILKEE APIを通じた顧客関係とタスクの管理","プロジェクト管理をスイスの会計プラットフォームと統合"],"ko":["퍼지 프로젝트 매칭을 사용한 시간 추적 자동화","MILKEE API를 통해 고객 관계 및 태스크 관리","프로젝트 관리를 스위스의 회계 플랫폼과 통합"],"es":["Automatizar el seguimiento de tiempo con coincidencia difusa de proyectos","Gestionar relaciones con los clientes y tareas a través de la API de MILKEE","Integrar la gestión de proyectos con plataformas de contabilidad suizas"],"fr":["Automatiser le suivi du temps avec un appariement flou de projets","Gérer les relations avec les clients et les tâches via l''API MILKEE","Intégrer la gestion de projet avec des plateformes de comptabilité suisses"],"de":["Automatisieren der Zeitverfolgung mit Fuzzy-Projekt-Matching","Verwalten von Kundenbeziehungen und Aufgaben über die MILKEE-API","Integrieren des Projektmanagements mit Schweizer Buchhaltungsplattformen"],"pt":["Automatizar o acompanhamento de tempo com correspondência difusa de projetos","Gerenciar relações com os clientes e tarefas por meio da API MILKEE","Integrar gerenciamento de projetos com plataformas de contabilidade suíças"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание времени с нечетким совпадением проектов","Управлять отношениями с клиентами и задачами через API MILKEE","Интегрировать управление проектами с швейцарскими бухгалтерскими платформами"],"ar":["توفير تتبع زمني آلي مع مطابقة مشاريع غامضة","إدارة علاقات العملاء وا