res de calidad","Creación de diagramas personalizados mediante lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes techniques de haute qualité","Révision de qualité intelligente avec Gemini 3 Pro","Itération intelligente pour économiser les appels API","Connaissance du type de document pour différents standards de qualité","Création de diagrammes personnalisés à l''aide de langage naturel"],"de":["Erstellung von technischen Diagrammen in hoher Qualität","Intelligente Qualitätsprüfung mit Gemini 3 Pro","Intelligente Iteration zur Einsparung von API-Aufrufen","Kenntnis des Dokumententyps für unterschiedliche Qualitätsstandards","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Diagrammen mithilfe von natürlicher Sprache"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas técnicos de alta qualidade","Revisão de qualidade inteligente","Iteração inteligente para economia de API","Compatibilidade com diferentes tipos de documentos","Revisão de qualidade profissional com Gemini 3 Pro"],"ru":["Генерация технических диаграмм высокого качества","Интеллектуальный контроль качества","Умная итерация для экономии API","Возможность работы с разными типами документов","Профессиональный контроль качества с Gemini 3 Pro"],"ar":["توليد مخططات تقنية عالية الجودة","مراجعة الجودة الذكية","التكرار الذكي لتوفير API","التوافق مع أنواع مختلفة من المستندات","مراجعة الجودة الاحترافية مع Gemini 3 Pro"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术图表生成","智能图表创建","自然语言输入","AI 质量审查","文档类型感知","技术图表工具"],"ja":["テクニカルダイアグラム生成","自動生成ツール","自然言語入力","AI 品質レビュー","ドキュメントタイプ認識","テクニカルダイアグラムツール"],"ko":["기술 도표 생성","智能 도표 생성기","자연어 입력","AI 품질審查","문서 유형 인식","기술 도표 도구"],"es":["diagramas técnicos","inteligencia artificial","generación de diagramas","lenguaje natural","calidad de diagramas","Gemini 3 Pro","iteración inteligente","API"],"fr":["diagrammes techniques","intelligence artificielle","génération de diagrammes","langage naturel","qualité de diagrammes","Gemini 3 Pro","itération intelligente","API"],"de":["technische Diagramme","künstliche Intelligenz","Erstellung von Diagrammen","natürliche Sprache","Qualität von Diagrammen","Gemini 3 Pro","intelligente Iteration","API"],"pt":["geração de diagramas técnicos","nano banana","revisão de qualidade","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","diagramas de alta qualidade","linguagem natural","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["генерация технических диаграмм","nano banana","контроль качества","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","диаграммы высокого качества","естественный язык","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["توليد مخططات تقنية","nano banana","مراجعة الجودة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","مخططات عالية الجودة","اللغة الطبيعية","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"diagram","description":"Generate publication-quality technical diagrams using Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image) with AI-powered quality review. Smart iteration only regenerates when quality is below threshold.","bodyPreview":"# Nano Banana - Diagram Generation\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate any technical diagram by describing it in natural language. Nano Banana Pro automatically creates publication-quality diagrams with intelligent quality review.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- 🍌 **Smart Iteration**: Only regenerates if quality is below threshold (saves API calls)\n- 🎯 **Document-Type Aware**: Different quality standards for different document types\n- 🔍 **AI Quality Review**: Gemini 3 Pro reviews each generation for professional sta","body":"# Nano Banana - Diagram Generation\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate any technical diagram by describing it in natural language. Nano Banana Pro automatically creates publication-quality diagrams with intelligent quality review.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- 🍌 **Smart Iteration**: Only regenerates if quality is below threshold (saves API calls)\n- 🎯 **Document-Type Aware**: Different quality standards for different document types\n- 🔍 **AI Quality Review**: Gemini 3 Pro reviews each generation for professional standards\n- 📊 **Publication-Ready**: High contrast, readable fonts, colorblind-friendly\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need:\n\n- **Architecture Diagrams**: System designs, microservices, C4 models\n- **Flowcharts**: Process flows, decision trees, user journeys\n- **Data Models**: ERD diagrams, schema visualizations\n- **Sequence Diagrams**: API interactions, message flows\n- **Infrastructure Diagrams**: Cloud architecture, deployment topologies\n- **Pipeline Diagrams**: CI/CD, data pipelines, ML workflows\n- **Any Technical Visualization**: Describe it, Nano Banana creates it\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Generate an architecture diagram\npython skills/diagram/scripts/generate_diagram.py \"Microservices architecture with API gateway, auth service, and database\" -o architecture.png --doc-type architecture\n\n# Generate a flowchart for a presentation\npython skills/diagram/scripts/generate_diagram.py \"User authentication flow with OAuth2\" -o auth_flow.png --doc-type presentation\n\n# Generate with verbose output\npython skills/diagram/scripts/generate_diagram.py \"Database schema for e-commerce\" -o schema.png -v\n```\n\n## Document Types & Quality Thresholds\n\nDifferent documents have different quality requirements. Nano Banana automatically adjusts:\n\n| Document Type | Threshold | Best For |\n|--------------|-----------|----------|\n| `specification` | 8.5/10 | Technical specs, PRDs |\n| `architecture` | 8.0/10 | Architecture documents |\n| `proposal` | 8.0/10 | Business proposals |\n| `journal` | 8.5/10 | Academic publications |\n| `conference` | 8.0/10 | Conference papers |\n| `thesis` | 8.0/10 | Dissertations |\n| `grant` | 8.0/10 | Grant proposals |\n| `sprint` | 7.5/10 | Sprint planning |\n| `report` | 7.5/10 | Technical reports |\n| `preprint` | 7.5/10 | arXiv, bioRxiv |\n| `readme` | 7.0/10 | README files |\n| `poster` | 7.0/10 | Academic posters |\n| `presentation` | 6.5/10 | Slides, talks |\n| `default` | 7.5/10 | General purpose |\n\n**Smart Iteration**: If the first generation scores above the threshold, no second iteration is performed. This saves time and API costs.\n\n## Diagram Examples\n\n### System Architecture\n```bash\npython generate_diagram.py \"Three-tier web application architecture with:\n- React frontend\n- Node.js API layer with load balancer\n- PostgreSQL database with read replicas\n- Redis cache layer\n- CDN for static assets\" -o three_tier.png --doc-type architecture\n```\n\n### Sequence Diagram\n```bash\npython generate_diagram.py \"Sequence diagram showing OAuth2 authorization code flow:\n1. User clicks login\n2. App redirects to auth server\n3. User authenticates\n4. Auth server returns code\n5. App exchanges code for token\n6. App accesses protected resource\" -o oauth_flow.png --doc-type specification\n```\n\n### Data Flow\n```bash\npython generate_diagram.py \"Data pipeline showing:\n- Data ingestion from multiple sources (API, files, streaming)\n- ETL processing with Apache Spark\n- Data warehouse (Snowflake)\n- BI dashboards and ML model training\" -o pipeline.png --doc-type report\n```\n\n### C4 Model - Container Diagram\n```bash\npython generate_diagram.py \"C4 Container diagram for e-commerce platform:\n- Web App (React SPA)\n- Mobile App (React Native)\n- API Gateway (Kong)\n- Order Service (Python)\n- Payment Service (Go)\n- Inventory Service (Java)\n- PostgreSQL Database\n- Redis Cache\n- RabbitMQ Message Queue\" -o c4_container.png --doc-type architecture\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. **Initial Generation**: Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image) generates the diagram\n2. **Quality Review**: Gemini 3 Pro evaluates on 5 criteria:\n   - Technical Accuracy (0-2 pts)\n   - Clarity and Readability (0-2 pts)\n   - Label Quality (0-2 pts)\n   - Layout and Composition (0-2 pts)\n   - Professional Appearance (0-2 pts)\n3. **Decision**: If score ≥ threshold → Done! If score < threshold → Iterate\n4. **Improvement**: Feedback is incorporated into an improved prompt\n5. **Regeneration**: New diagram generated with improvements (max 2 iterations)\n\n## Output Files\n\nFor an output path of `diagram.png`, you''ll get:\n- `diagram_v1.png` - First iteration\n- `diagram_v2.png` - Second iteration (if needed)\n- `diagram.png` - Final version (copy of best iteration)\n- `diagram_review_log.json` - Quality scores and review details\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Environment Variable (Recommended)\n```bash\nexport OPENROUTER_API_KEY=''your_api_key_here''\n```\n\n### .env File\nCreate a `.env` file in your project:\n```\nOPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here\n```\n\n### Get Your API Key\n1. Go to https://openrouter.ai/keys\n2. Create a new API key\n3. Add credits to your account\n\n## Tips for Better Diagrams\n\n### Be Specific\n```bash\n# ❌ Too vague\n\"System diagram\"\n\n# ✅ Specific and detailed\n\"Microservices architecture diagram showing user service, order service, and payment service communicating via REST APIs, with a shared PostgreSQL database and Redis cache\"\n```\n\n### Include Relationships\n```bash\n# ✅ Good - describes connections\n\"Data flow diagram showing:\n- User uploads file to S3\n- Lambda triggered on upload\n- Lambda processes and stores metadata in DynamoDB\n- SNS notifies downstream services\"\n```\n\n### Specify Style When Needed\n```bash\n# ✅ Style hints\n\"Flowchart with decision diamonds for the loan approval process, using green for approved paths and red for rejected paths\"\n```\n\n## Python API\n\n```python\nfrom skills.diagram.scripts.generate_diagram_ai import NanoBananaGenerator\n\ngenerator = NanoBananaGenerator(verbose=True)\nresults = generator.generate_iterative(\n    user_prompt=\"Kubernetes cluster architecture with ingress, services, and pods\",\n    output_path=\"k8s_arch.png\",\n    iterations=2,\n    doc_type=\"architecture\"\n)\n\nprint(f\"Final Score: {results[''final_score'']}/10\")\nprint(f\"Early Stop: {results[''early_stop'']}\")\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- Use with **sprint planning** to visualize user story workflows\n- Use with **architecture research** to diagram ADR decisions\n- Use with **building blocks** to visualize component relationships\n- Use with **competitive analysis** to create comparison diagrams\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"OPENROUTER_API_KEY not found\"\nSet the environment variable or create a `.env` file. See Configuration section.\n\n### Low Quality Scores\n- Add more detail to your prompt\n- Specify relationships between components\n- Use a higher threshold document type to force more iterations\n\n### Generation Timeout\nComplex diagrams may take up to 2 minutes. The timeout is set to 120 seconds per API call.\n\n## Cost Considerations\n\n- Gemini 3 Pro Image: ~$2/M input, ~$12/M output tokens\n- Simple diagram (1 iteration): ~$0.05-0.15\n- Complex diagram (2 iterations): ~$0.10-0.30\n- Smart iteration saves costs by stopping early when quality is sufficient\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:16:08.512Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing advanced diagram generation capabilities for documentation and presentation purposes.","zh":"非常适合需要高级图表生成能力的技术写作代理，用于文档和演示目的。","ja":"高度な図表生成能力が必要なテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適です。ドキュメントとプレゼンテーションの目的で使用します。","ko":"문서 및 프레젠테이션 목적으로 고급 도표 생성 기능을 필요로 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura técnica que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de diagramas para documentación y presentaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de diagrammes pour la documentation et les présentations.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die erweiterte Diagrammgenerierungsfunktionen für Dokumentations- und Präsentationszwecke benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de diagramas para fins de documentação e apresentação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов технического письма, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации диаграмм для целей документации и представления.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذي يحتاج إلىقدرات متقدمة لتوليد المخططات لأغراض الوثائق والمقدمات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate publication-quality diagrams using natural language descriptions, leveraging AI quality review and smart iteration for optimized results in various document types, including support for intelligent quality review and document-type aware generation.","zh":"赋予代理使用自然语言描述生成出版质量图表的能力，利用AI质量审查和智能迭代来优化结果，支持各种文档类型，包括智能质量审查和文档类型感知生成。","ja":"エージェントに自然言語の説明を使用して出版品質の図表を生成する能力を与え、AIの品質レビューとスマートイテレーションを利用して結果を最適化します。さまざまなドキュメントタイプをサポートし、インテリジェントな品質レビューとドキュメントタイプに応じた生成を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어 설명을 사용하여 출판 품질의 도표를 생성하도록 하는 것으로, AI 품질 리뷰 및 스마트 반복을 통해 결과를 최적화하며, 다양한 문서 유형을 지원하고, 지능형 품질 리뷰 및 문서 유형 인식 생성을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diagramas de publicación de alta calidad utilizando descripciones en lenguaje natural, aprovechando la revisión de calidad de IA y la iteración inteligente para resultados optimizados en varios tipos de documentos, incluyendo el soporte para la revisión de calidad inteligente y la generación consciente del tipo de documento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes de publication de haute qualité à l''aide de descriptions en langage naturel, en exploitant la révision de la qualité de l''IA et l''itération intelligente pour des résultats optimisés dans divers types de documents, y compris le support pour la révision de la qualité intelligente et la génération sensible au type de document.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Publikationsqualitätsdiagramme unter Verwendung von natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen zu generieren, die die Qualität der künstlichen Intelligenz und die intelligente Iteration für optimierte Ergebnisse in verschiedenen Dokumententypen nutzen, einschließlich Unterstützung für intelligente Qualitätsprüfung und dokumententypabhängige Generierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar diagramas de publicação de qualidade usando descrições em linguagem natural, aproveitando a revisão de qualidade de IA e iteração inteligente para resultados otimizados em vários tipos de documentos, incluindo suporte à revisão de qualidade inteligente e geração consciente do tipo de documento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать диаграммы издательского качества с использованием описаний на естественном языке, используя проверку качества ИИ и умную итерацию для оптимизированных результатов в различных типах документов, включая поддержку интеллектуальной проверки качества и генерации, осведомленной о типе документа.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد مخططات منشورة عالية الجودة باستخدام الوصف باللغة الطبيعية، مستفيدا من مراجعة جودة الذكاء الاصطناعي والتحديث الذكي للحصول على نتائج محسنة في أنواع مختلفة من المستندات، بما في ذلك الدعم لمراجعة الجودة الذكية وتوليد المستندات المطلوبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating technical diagrams for software documentation","Creating publication-quality flowcharts for business presentations","Automating diagram updates based on smart iteration and quality thresholds"],"zh":["为软件文档生成技术图表","为商业演示创建出版质量的流程图","基于智能迭代和质量阈值自动更新图表"],"ja":["ソフトウェアドキュメントのテクニカル図表の生成","ビジネスプレゼンテーションのための出版品質のフローチャートの作成","スマートイテレーションと品質閾値に基づく図表の自動更新"],"ko":["소프트웨어 문서를 위한 기술 도표 생성","사업 프레젠테이션을 위한 출판 품질의 흐름圖 생성","스마트 반복 및 품질 임계값에 따른 도표 자동 업데이트"],"es":["Generación de diagramas técnicos para la documentación de software","Creación de diagramas de flujo de publicación para presentaciones comerciales","Automatización de actualizaciones de diagramas en función de la iteración inteligente y los umbrales de calidad"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes techniques pour la documentation logicielle","Création de diagrammes de flux de publication pour les présentations commerciales","Automatisation des mises à jour de diagrammes en fonction de l''itération intelligente et des seuils de qualité"],"de":["Generierung technischer Diagramme für Software-Dokumentation","Erstellung von Publikationsqualitäts-Flussdiagrammen für Geschäftspräsentationen","Automatisierung von Diagramm-Aktualisierungen basierend auf intelligenter Iteration und Qualitäts-Schwellenwerten"],"pt":["Gerar diagramas técnicos para documentação de software","Criar fluxogramas de publicação de qualidade para apresentações de negócios","Automatizar atualizações de diagramas com base na iteração inteligente e limiares de qualidade"],"ru":["Генерировать технические диаграммы для документации программного обеспечения","Создавать издательские потоки для бизнес-презентаций","Автоматизировать обновления диаграмм на основе умной итерации и порогов качества"],"ar":["توليد مخططات فنية لتوثيق البرمجيات","إنشاء مخططات تدفق منشورة عالية الجودة لأغراض العروض التجارية","تأتمتة تحديث المخططات بالاعتماد على التحديث الذكي ومعايير الجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API calls for generation and review","Dependent on quality thresholds for regeneration","Limited to document types with predefined quality standards"],"zh":["需要API调用来生成和审查","依赖于质量阈值来重新生成","仅限于具有预定义质量标准的文档类型"],"ja":["生成とレビューにはAPIコールが必要","再生成には品質閾値に依存する","事前に定義された品質基準を持つドキュメントタイプのみに限定される"],"ko":["생성 및 검토를 위해 API 호출이 필요","재생성에 품질 임계값에 의존","사전 정의된 품질 표준을 갖는 문서 유형만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere llamadas a la API para la generación y revisión","Dependiente de los umbrales de calidad para la regeneración","Limitado a tipos de documentos con normas de calidad predefinidas"],"fr":["Nécessite des appels d''API pour la génération et la révision","Dépendante des seuils de qualité pour la régénération","Limité aux types de documents avec des normes de qualité prédéfinies"],"de":["Benötigt API-Aufrufe für die Generierung und Überprüfung","Abhängig von Qualitäts-Schwellenwerten für die Regenerierung","Begrenzt auf Dokumententypen mit vordefinierten Qualitätsstandards"],"pt":["Requer chamadas de API para geração e revisão","Dependente de limiares de qualidade para regeneração","Limitado a tipos de documentos com padrões de qualidade pré-definidos"],"ru":["Требует вызовов API для генерации и проверки","Зависит от порогов качества для регенерации","Ограничен типами документов с предварительно определенными стандартами качества"],"ar":["يتطلب呼呼ات واجهة البرمجة للتوليد والمراجعة","يعتمد على معايير الجودة لإعادة التوليد","محدود بنوع المستندات التي تم تعريف معايير الجودة لها مسبقا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
