priétaires et appareils personnalisés"],"de":["Hersteller von diskreten Halbleitern","Produziert Dioden, Gleichrichter und Transistoren","Branchenstandard-MPN-Struktur","Branchenkompatible Geräte","Eigene Serien und kundenspezifische Geräte"],"pt":["Fabricante de semicondutores discretos","Inclui diodos, retificadores e transistores","Produz dispositivos compatíveis com a indústria","Séries próprias de semicondutores","Padrões de MPN seguem a indústria"],"ru":["Производитель дискретных полупроводников","Включает диоды, выпрямители и транзисторы","Производит устройства, совместимые с отраслью","Собственные серии полупроводников","Структура MPN соответствует отрасли"],"ar":["شركة لصناعة الشبه موصلات المنفصلة","تشمل الثنائيات والمتحولات والترانزستورات","تصنع أجهزة متوافقة مع الصناعة","السلاسل الخاصة من الشبه موصلات","هيكل MPN يتوافق مع الصناعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Good-Ark","MPN","Good-Ark","Good-Ark","Good-Ark","Good-Ark"],"ja":["Good-Ark","MPN","Good-Ark","Good-Ark","Good-Ark","Good-Ark"],"ko":["Good-Ark","MPN","Good-Ark","Good-Ark","Good-Ark","Good-Ark"],"es":["Good-Ark Semiconductor","semiconductores discretos","diodos","rectificadores","transistores","MPN","industria electrónica","componentes electrónicos"],"fr":["Good-Ark Semiconductor","semiconducteurs discrets","diodes","redresseurs","transistors","MPN","industrie électronique","composants électroniques"],"de":["Good-Ark-Halbleiter","diskrete Halbleiter","Dioden","Gleichrichter","Transistoren","MPN","Elektronikindustrie","elektronische Bauelemente"],"pt":["semicondutores discretos","diodos","retificadores","transistores","Good-Ark","fabricante de semicondutores","componentes eletrônicos","indústria de semicondutores"],"ru":["дискретные полупроводники","диоды","выпрямители","транзисторы","Good-Ark","производитель полупроводников","электронные компоненты","полупроводниковая промышленность"],"ar":["الشبه موصلات المنفصلة","الثنائيات","المتحولات","الترانزستورات","Good-Ark","شركة لصناعة الشبه موصلات","مكونات إلكترونية","صناعة الشبه موصلات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"goodark","description":"Good-Ark Semiconductor MPN encoding patterns, suffix decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Good-Ark diodes, transistors, or GoodArkHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Good-Ark Semiconductor Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nGood-Ark Semiconductor is a Chinese manufacturer specializing in discrete semiconductors including diodes, rectifiers, and transistors. They produce both proprietary series and industry-standard compatible devices.\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nGood-Ark MPNs follow industry-standard patterns with package suffixes:\n\n### Diode Pattern\n\n```\n[SERIES][VARIANT][-SUFFIX]\n   |        |        |\n   |        |        +-- Package/lead-free indicator\n   |","body":"# Good-Ark Semiconductor Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nGood-Ark Semiconductor is a Chinese manufacturer specializing in discrete semiconductors including diodes, rectifiers, and transistors. They produce both proprietary series and industry-standard compatible devices.\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nGood-Ark MPNs follow industry-standard patterns with package suffixes:\n\n### Diode Pattern\n\n```\n[SERIES][VARIANT][-SUFFIX]\n   |        |        |\n   |        |        +-- Package/lead-free indicator\n   |        +-- Voltage/rating code\n   +-- Series prefix (1N, SS, SK, BAV, etc.)\n```\n\n### Transistor Pattern\n\n```\n[SERIES][NUMBER][VARIANT][SUFFIX]\n   |       |        |        |\n   |       |        |        +-- Package code\n   |       |        +-- Optional variant (A, B)\n   |       +-- Part number\n   +-- Prefix (2N, MMBT, BC, etc.)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\n1N4007G\n|  |  ||\n|  |  |+-- G = DO-41 package\n|  |  +-- 7 = 1000V voltage rating\n|  +-- 400 = Rectifier series\n+-- 1N = Standard diode prefix\n\nMMBT3904LT1\n|   |  | ||\n|   |  | |+-- 1 = Variant\n|   |  | +-- T = SOT package indicator\n|   |  +-- L = SOT-23 package\n|   +-- 3904 = NPN low power transistor\n+-- MMBT = SMD transistor prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## Product Lines\n\n### Standard Rectifier Diodes (1N400x)\n\n| Part | Voltage | Current | Package |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| 1N4001 | 50V | 1A | DO-41 |\n| 1N4002 | 100V | 1A | DO-41 |\n| 1N4003 | 200V | 1A | DO-41 |\n| 1N4004 | 400V | 1A | DO-41 |\n| 1N4005 | 600V | 1A | DO-41 |\n| 1N4006 | 800V | 1A | DO-41 |\n| 1N4007 | 1000V | 1A | DO-41 |\n\n### Power Rectifiers (1N540x)\n\n| Part | Voltage | Current | Package |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| 1N5400 | 50V | 3A | DO-201AD |\n| 1N5401 | 100V | 3A | DO-201AD |\n| 1N5402 | 200V | 3A | DO-201AD |\n| 1N5404 | 400V | 3A | DO-201AD |\n| 1N5406 | 600V | 3A | DO-201AD |\n| 1N5408 | 800V | 3A | DO-201AD |\n\n### Signal Diodes\n\n| Part | Description | Package |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| 1N4148 | Small signal, 100V | DO-35/SOD-123 |\n| 1N4448 | High-speed signal, 100V | DO-35 |\n| 1N914 | Signal diode (equiv. 1N4148) | DO-35 |\n\n### Schottky Diodes (SS Series)\n\n| Part | Voltage | Current | Package |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| SS12 | 20V | 1A | SMA |\n| SS14 | 40V | 1A | SMA |\n| SS16 | 60V | 1A | SMA |\n| SS24 | 40V | 2A | SMA |\n| SS34 | 40V | 3A | SMA |\n| SS54 | 40V | 5A | SMA |\n\n### Schottky Diodes (SK Series)\n\n| Part | Voltage | Current | Package |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| SK34 | 40V | 3A | SMB |\n| SK36 | 60V | 3A | SMB |\n| SK54 | 40V | 5A | SMB |\n| SK56 | 60V | 5A | SMB |\n\n### Fast Recovery Diodes (ES/US Series)\n\n| Series | Speed | Applications |\n|--------|-------|--------------|\n| ES1x | Fast | ES1J, ES1D, ES2D |\n| US1x | Ultra-fast | US1M, US1G, US2G |\n| UF | Ultra-fast | UF4001-UF4007 |\n\n### Signal Diodes (BAV/BAT Series)\n\n| Series | Type | Examples |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| BAV | Small signal | BAV21, BAV70, BAV99 |\n| BAT | Schottky barrier | BAT54, BAT85, BAT46 |\n\n### TVS Diodes\n\n| Series | Package | Examples |\n|--------|---------|----------|\n| SMBJ | SMB | SMBJ5.0A, SMBJ15A |\n| SMAJ | SMA | SMAJ5.0A, SMAJ15CA |\n| P4KE | DO-41 | P4KE6.8A, P4KE15A |\n| P6KE | DO-41 | P6KE6.8A, P6KE15A |\n\n### Transistors (2N Series)\n\n| Part | Type | Package |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 2N2222 | NPN | TO-92 |\n| 2N2907 | PNP | TO-92 |\n| 2N3904 | NPN low power | TO-92 |\n| 2N3906 | PNP low power | TO-92 |\n| 2N4401 | NPN high gain | TO-92 |\n| 2N4403 | PNP high gain | TO-92 |\n| 2N5401 | PNP high voltage | TO-92 |\n| 2N5551 | NPN high voltage | TO-92 |\n\n### SMD Transistors (MMBT Series)\n\n| Part | Equivalent | Package |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| MMBT2222 | 2N2222 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT2907 | 2N2907 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT3904 | 2N3904 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT3906 | 2N3906 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT4401 | 2N4401 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT4403 | 2N4403 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT5401 | 2N5401 | SOT-23 |\n| MMBT5551 | 2N5551 | SOT-23 |\n\n### European Transistors (BC Series)\n\n| Part | Type | Package |\n|------|------|---------|\n| BC547 | NPN | TO-92/SOT-23 |\n| BC557 | PNP | TO-92/SOT-23 |\n| BC337 | NPN | TO-92 |\n| BC327 | PNP | TO-92 |\n\n### Asia-Market Transistors (S Series)\n\n| Part | Type | Application |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| S8050 | NPN | General purpose |\n| S8550 | PNP | General purpose |\n| S9012 | PNP | Low noise |\n| S9013 | NPN | Low noise |\n| S9014 | NPN | Low noise |\n| S9015 | PNP | Low noise |\n| S9018 | NPN | High frequency |\n\n---\n\n## Package Codes\n\n### Through-Hole Diode Packages\n\n| Code | Package | Notes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| A | DO-41 | Standard axial |\n| B | DO-15 | Medium current |\n| G | DO-35 | Small signal |\n| RL | DO-201AD | Power rectifier |\n| TAP | DO-41 | Tape and ammo pack |\n\n### SMD Diode Packages\n\n| Code | Package | Notes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| S | DO-214AA (SMB) | Medium power SMD |\n| F | DO-214AB (SMC) | Large SMD |\n| FA | DO-214AC (SMA) | Standard SMD |\n| FL | SOD-123FL | Flat lead |\n| W | SOD-123 | Small signal SMD |\n\n### Transistor Packages\n\n| Code | Package | Notes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| TO | TO-92 | Standard through-hole |\n| TA | TO-92 | Alternate suffix |\n| TF | TO-92F | Flat package |\n| LT | SOT-23 | SMD 3-pin |\n| LT1 | SOT-23 | SMD 3-pin |\n| G3 | SOT-323 | Small SMD |\n| K | SOT-23 | Alternative marking |\n\n### Power Packages\n\n| Code | Package | Notes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| CT | TO-220 | Through-hole power |\n| TU | TO-220F | Isolated tab |\n| D | TO-252 | DPAK |\n| D2 | TO-263 | D2PAK |\n| D3 | TO-268 | D3PAK |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Pattern Matching\n\n```java\n// 1N series diodes\n\"^1N400[1-7].*\"       // Standard rectifiers\n\"^1N4148.*\"           // Signal diode\n\"^1N914.*\"            // Signal diode equivalent\n\"^1N47[0-9]{2}.*\"     // Zener diodes\n\"^1N540[0-8].*\"       // Power rectifiers\n\"^1N58[0-9]{2}.*\"     // Schottky rectifiers\n\n// Schottky diodes\n\"^SS[1-5][0-9].*\"     // SS series\n\"^SK[1-5][0-9].*\"     // SK series\n\"^SB[1-5][0-9]{2}.*\"  // SB series\n\n// Signal diodes\n\"^BAV[0-9]+.*\"        // BAV series\n\"^BAT[0-9]+.*\"        // BAT series\n\n// Fast recovery\n\"^ES[12][A-Z].*\"      // ES series\n\"^US[12][A-Z].*\"      // US series\n\"^UF[0-9]+.*\"         // UF series\n\n// TVS diodes\n\"^SMBJ[0-9]+.*\"       // SMB package\n\"^SMAJ[0-9]+.*\"       // SMA package\n\"^P[46]KE[0-9]+.*\"    // P4KE/P6KE\n\n// Transistors\n\"^2N[0-9]{3,4}.*\"     // 2N series\n\"^MMBT[A]?[0-9]+.*\"   // MMBT/MMBTA series\n\"^PN[0-9]{4}.*\"       // PN series\n\"^MPSA[0-9]+.*\"       // MPSA series\n\"^BC[0-9]{3}.*\"       // BC series\n\"^S8[05][0-9]{2}.*\"   // S80xx series\n\"^S90[0-9]{2}.*\"      // S90xx series\n```\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// Signal diodes (specific before generic)\n\"1N4148W\" -> \"1N4148\"\n\"1N914\" -> \"1N914\"\n\n// Rectifiers\n\"1N4007G\" -> \"1N400x\"\n\"1N5408RL\" -> \"1N540x\"\n\n// Schottky\n\"SS14\" -> \"SS14\"\n\"SK34\" -> \"SK34\"\n\"SB160\" -> \"SB160\"\n\n// Fast recovery\n\"ES1J\" -> \"ES1\"\n\"US1M\" -> \"US1\"\n\n// Transistors\n\"MMBT3904LT1\" -> \"MMBT3904\"\n\"2N2222A\" -> \"2N2222\"\n\"BC547B\" -> \"BC547\"\n```\n\n### Replacement Logic\n\n```java\n// 1N400x: higher voltage can replace lower\n\"1N4007\" can replace \"1N4001\" through \"1N4007\"\n\n// MMBT equivalent to 2N\n\"MMBT2222\" == \"2N2222\"\n\"MMBT3904\" == \"2N3904\"\n\n// Signal diode equivalents\n\"1N4148\" == \"1N914\"\n\n// SS series: higher current can replace lower\n\"SS34\" can replace \"SS14\" (same voltage, higher current)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Types\n\n| Pattern | ComponentType |\n|---------|---------------|\n| 1N*, SS*, SK*, SB*, BAV*, BAT*, ES*, US*, SMBJ*, SMAJ*, P4KE*, P6KE*, MB*S | DIODE |\n| 2N*, MMBT*, MMBTA*, PN*, MPSA*, BC*, BF*, S80*, S90* | TRANSISTOR |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/GoodArkHandler.java`\n- Component types: `ComponentType.DIODE`, `ComponentType.TRANSISTOR`\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **1N400x voltage order**: 1N4001=50V, 1N4002=100V, ..., 1N4007=1000V. The digit maps to voltage rating.\n- **1N540x voltage order**: 1N5400=50V, 1N5401=100V, ..., 1N5408=800V. Similar pattern but different mapping.\n- **MMBT vs 2N**: MMBT is the SMD (SOT-23) equivalent of 2N through-hole transistors. Same electrical specs, different package.\n- **PN vs 2N**: PN series (PN2222) is plastic-packaged version of 2N series. Generally interchangeable with 2N.\n- **1N4148 vs 1N914**: These are electrically equivalent signal diodes. Can be used interchangeably.\n- **SS current rating**: First digit indicates current (SS14=1A, SS34=3A). Higher current can replace lower.\n- **S80xx/S90xx series**: Common in Asian markets. S8050/S8550 are general purpose NPN/PNP pairs.\n- **BAV70/BAV99**: Dual diode packages (SOT-23). BAV70 = common cathode, BAV99 = series pair.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:16:01.900Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronics and Manufacturing Agents requiring detailed semiconductor component information from Good-Ark","zh":"非常适合需要从 Good-Ark 获取详细半导体组件信息的电子和制造代理","ja":"Good-Ark からの詳細な半導体部品情報を必要とするエレクトロニクスおよび製造エージェントに最適","ko":"Good-Ark에서詳細한 반도체 부품 정보를 필요로하는 전자 및 제조 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de electrónica y fabricación que requieren información detallada sobre componentes semiconductores de Good-Ark","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''électronique et de fabrication qui nécessitent des informations détaillées sur les composants semiconducteurs Good-Ark","de":"Perfekt für Elektronik- und Fertigungsagenten, die detaillierte Informationen über Good-Ark-Halbleiterkomponenten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de Eletrônica e Manufatura que exigem informações detalhadas sobre componentes semicondutores da Good-Ark","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электроники и производства, требующих подробной информации о полупроводниковых компонентах Good-Ark","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الإلكترونيات والتصنيع التي تتطلب معلومات مفصلة عن مكونات أشباه الموصلات من Good-Ark"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to decode and analyze Good-Ark Semiconductor part numbers using industry-standard MPN patterns, including diode and package suffixes, enabling precise component identification and procurement","zh":"赋予代理解码和分析 Good-Ark 半导体部品号的能力，使用行业标准的 MPN 模式，包括二极管和包装后缀，实现精确的部品识别和采购","ja":"Good-Ark 半導体部品番号を解読および分析するためのエージェントをEmpowerし、業界標準のMPNパターンを使用し、ダイオードおよびパッケージサフィックスを含み、正確な部品識別および調達を可能に","ko":"Good-Ark 반도체 부품 번호를 디코딩 및 분석하기 위한 에이전트를 강화하고, 산업 표준 MPN 패턴을 사용하여, 다이오드 및 패키지 접미사를 포함하여, 정확한 부품 식별 및 조달을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para decodificar y analizar números de pieza de semiconductor Good-Ark utilizando patrones de MPN estándar de la industria, incluidos sufijos de diodo y paquete, lo que permite la identificación y adquisición de componentes precisos","fr":"Permet aux agents de décoder et d''analyser les numéros de pièce de semiconducteurs Good-Ark en utilisant des modèles de MPN standard de l''industrie, y compris les suffixes de diode et de paquet, permettant une identification et un approvisionnement de composants précis","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Good-Ark-Halbleiter-Bauteilnummern mithilfe von branchenüblichen MPN-Mustern zu decodieren und zu analysieren, einschließlich Diode- und Paketsuffixen, wodurch eine präzise Komponentenidentifizierung und Beschaffung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a decodificar e analisar números de peças de semicondutores da Good-Ark usando padrões de MPN padrão da indústria, incluindo sufixos de diodo e pacote, permitindo a identificação e aquisição precisas de componentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расшифровывать и анализировать номера деталей полупроводников Good-Ark, используя отраслевые стандарты шаблонов MPN, включая суффиксы диода и упаковки, что позволяет точно определять компоненты и осуществлять их закупку","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية فك وتحليل أرقام قطع أشباه الموصلات من Good-Ark باستخدام أنماط MPN القياسية في الصناعة، بما في ذلك لاحقات الثنائي والصندوق، مما يسمح بالتعرف الدقيق على المكونات وشرائها"},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding Good-Ark MPNs for procurement and inventory management","Analyzing diode patterns for variant and package type identification","Validating component compatibility using Good-Ark''s industry-standard compatible devices"],"zh":["用于采购和库存管理的 Good-Ark MPN 解码","用于变体和包装类型识别的二极管模式分析","使用 Good-Ark 行业标准兼容设备的部品兼容性验证"],"ja":["調達および在庫管理のためのGood-Ark MPNの解読","バリエーションおよびパッケージタイプの識別のためのダイオードパターンの分析","Good-Arkの業界標準互換デバイスを使用した部品の互換性の検証"],"ko":["조달 및 재고 관리를 위한 Good-Ark MPN 디코딩","변종 및 패키지 유형 식별을 위한 다이오드 패턴 분석","Good-Ark 산업 표준 호환 장치를 사용한 부품 호환성 검증"],"es":["Decodificar MPNs de Good-Ark para la gestión de compras y inventario","Analizar patrones de diodos para la identificación de variantes y tipos de paquetes","Validar la compatibilidad de componentes utilizando dispositivos compatibles estándar de la industria de Good-Ark"],"fr":["Décoder les MPN de Good-Ark pour la gestion des achats et de l''inventaire","Analyser les modèles de diodes pour l''identification des variantes et des types de paquets","Valider la compatibilité des composants en utilisant des dispositifs compatibles standard de l''industrie Good-Ark"],"de":["Decodieren von Good-Ark-MPNs für Beschaffungs- und Bestandsmanagement","Analysieren von Diodenmustern zur Identifizierung von Varianten und Pakettypen","Validieren der Kompatibilität von Komponenten unter Verwendung von branchenüblichen kompatiblen Geräten von Good-Ark"],"pt":["Decodificação de MPNs da Good-Ark para gestão de compras e estoque","Análise de padrões de diodo para identificação de variantes e tipo de pacote","Validação da compatibilidade de componentes usando dispositivos compatíveis padrão da indústria da Good-Ark"],"ru":["Расшифровка MPN от Good-Ark для закупок и управления запасами","Анализ шаблонов диода для определения варианта и типа упаковки","Проверка совместимости компонентов с помощью совместимых устройств отраслевого стандарта Good-Ark"],"ar":["فك شفرة أرقام MPN من Good-Ark لإدارة المشتريات وإدارة المخزون","تحليل أنماط الثنائي لتحديد المتغيرات ونوع الحزمة","التحقق من توافق المكونات باستخدام أجهزة متوافقة مع معايير الصناعة من Good-Ark"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Good-Ark Semiconductor products","Requires knowledge of industry-standard MPN structures"],"zh":["仅限 Good-Ark 半导体产品","需要了解行业标准 MPN 结构"],"ja":["Good-Ark 半導体製品のみ","業界標準のMPN構造に関する知識が必要"],"ko":["Good-Ark 반도체 제품만 해당","산업 표준 MPN 구조에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a productos de semiconductores Good-Ark","Requiere conocimiento de estructuras de MPN estándar de la industria"],"fr":["Limité aux produits de semiconducteurs Good-Ark","Nécessite une connaissance des structures de MPN standard de l''industrie"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Good-Ark-Halbleiterprodukte","Benötigt Kenntnisse von branchenüblichen MPN-Strukturen"],"pt":["Limitado a produtos de semicondutores da Good-Ark","Exige conhecimento das estruturas de MPN padrão da indústria"],"ru":["Ограничен только продукцией полупроводников Good-Ark","Требует знания отраслевых стандартов структур MPN"],"ar":["محدود منتجات أشباه الموصلات من Good-Ark","يتطلب معرفة بتركيبات MPN القياسية في الصناعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/rubocop', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'rubocop', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z', '2026-02-18T07:16:26.049Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/rubocop","name":"rubocop","description":{"zh":"RuboCop是Ruby的静态代码分析器和格式化工具，根据社区驱动的Ruby风格指南进行代码分析和格式化","ja":"RuboCopはRubyの静的コード解析ツールとフォーマッタです。コミュニティ駆動のRubyスタイルガイドに基づいてコードを解析してフォーマットします","ko":"RuboCop는 루비의 정적 코드 분석기와 포맷터입니다. 커뮤니티 주도 루비 스타일 가이드에 따라 코드를 분석하고 포맷팅합니다","es":"RuboCop es un analizador de código estático y formateador para Ruby, basado en la Guía de Estilos de Ruby.","fr":"RuboCop est un analyseur de code statique et un formateur pour Ruby, basé sur le Guide de style Ruby.","de":"RuboCop ist ein statischer Code-Analysator und -Formateur für Ruby, basierend auf dem Ruby-Style-Guide.","pt":"RuboCop é um analisador de código estático e formatador de código Ruby, baseado no Guia de Estilo de Ruby da comunidade","ru":"RuboCop - это статический анализатор кода и форматировщик кода Ruby, основанный на руководстве по стилю Ruby сообщества","ar":"محول شفرة روبي هو محول شفرة ثابت و محول تنسيق شفرة روبي، يستند إلى دليل أسلوب روبي المجتمعي","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RuboCop: Ruby代码分析和格式化工具","ja":"RuboCop: Rubyコード解析とフォーマットツール","ko":"RuboCop: 루비 코드 분석 및 포맷팅 도구","es":"Análisis y formato de código con RuboCop","fr":"Analyse et formatage de code avec RuboCop","de":"Code-Analyse und -Formatierung mit RuboCop","pt":"RuboCop: Analisador de Código Ruby","ru":"RuboCop: Анализатор КодаРуби","ar":"RuboCop: محول شفرة روبي","en":"rubocop"},"description":{"zh":"RuboCop是Ruby的静态代码分析器和格式化工具，根据社区驱动的Ruby风格指南进行代码分析和格式化","ja":"RuboCopはRubyの静的コード解析ツールとフォーマッタです。コミュニティ駆動のRubyスタイルガ