I","nuevas funciones de Expo"],"fr":["mise à niveau d''Expo","SDK d''Expo","changement important","dépendances","compatibilité","migration d''API","nouvelles fonctionnalités d''Expo"],"de":["Expo-Aktualisierung","Expo-SDK","wichtige Änderungen","Abhängigkeiten","Kompatibilität","API-Migration","neue Expo-Funktionen"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upgrading-expo","description":"Upgrade Expo SDK versions","bodyPreview":"# Upgrading Expo\n\n## Overview\n\nUpgrade Expo SDK versions safely, handling breaking changes, dependencies, and configuration updates.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to upgrade Expo SDK versions.\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Upgrading to a new Expo SDK version\n- Handling breaking changes between SDK versions\n- Updating dependencies for compatibility\n- Migrating deprecated APIs to new versions\n- Preparing apps for new Expo features\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill guides you throug","body":"# Upgrading Expo\n\n## Overview\n\nUpgrade Expo SDK versions safely, handling breaking changes, dependencies, and configuration updates.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to upgrade Expo SDK versions.\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Upgrading to a new Expo SDK version\n- Handling breaking changes between SDK versions\n- Updating dependencies for compatibility\n- Migrating deprecated APIs to new versions\n- Preparing apps for new Expo features\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill guides you through upgrading Expo SDK versions:\n\n1. **Pre-Upgrade Planning**: Review release notes and breaking changes\n2. **Dependency Updates**: Update packages for SDK compatibility\n3. **Configuration Migration**: Update app.json and configuration files\n4. **Code Updates**: Migrate deprecated APIs to new versions\n5. **Testing**: Verify app functionality after upgrade\n\n## Upgrade Process\n\n### 1. Pre-Upgrade Checklist\n\n- Review Expo SDK release notes\n- Identify breaking changes affecting your app\n- Check compatibility of third-party packages\n- Backup current project state\n- Create a feature branch for the upgrade\n\n### 2. Update Expo SDK\n\n```bash\n# Update Expo CLI\nnpm install -g expo-cli@latest\n\n# Upgrade Expo SDK\nnpx expo install expo@latest\n\n# Update all Expo packages\nnpx expo install --fix\n```\n\n### 3. Handle Breaking Changes\n\n- Review migration guides for breaking changes\n- Update deprecated API calls\n- Modify configuration files as needed\n- Update native dependencies if required\n- Test affected features thoroughly\n\n### 4. Update Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Check for outdated packages\nnpx expo-doctor\n\n# Update packages to compatible versions\nnpx expo install --fix\n\n# Verify compatibility\nnpx expo-doctor\n```\n\n### 5. Testing\n\n- Test core app functionality\n- Verify native modules work correctly\n- Check for runtime errors\n- Test on both iOS and Android\n- Verify app store builds still work\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Dependency Conflicts\n\n- Use `expo install` instead of `npm install` for Expo packages\n- Check package compatibility with new SDK version\n- Resolve peer dependency warnings\n\n### Configuration Changes\n\n- Update `app.json` for new SDK requirements\n- Migrate deprecated configuration options\n- Update native configuration files if needed\n\n### Breaking API Changes\n\n- Review API migration guides\n- Update code to use new APIs\n- Test affected features after changes\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always upgrade in a feature branch\n- Test thoroughly before merging\n- Review release notes carefully\n- Update dependencies incrementally\n- Keep Expo CLI updated\n- Use `expo-doctor` to verify setup\n\n## Resources\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/expo/skills/tree/main/plugins/upgrading-expo).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:17:05.899Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing seamless Expo SDK upgrades and compatibility management.","zh":"适用于需要无缝升级Expo SDK和兼容性管理的移动应用开发代理。","ja":"Expo SDKの無縫なアップグレードと互換性管理が必要なモバイルアプリ開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"무결점의 Expo SDK 업그레이드 및 호환성 관리가 필요한 모바일 앱 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan actualizaciones y administración de compatibilidad de SDK de Expo sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de mises à jour et de gestion de compatibilité de SDK Expo sans heurts.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App Development Agents, die eine reibungslose Aktualisierung und Kompatibilitätsverwaltung von Expo SDK benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de atualizações e gerenciamento de compatibilidade do SDK Expo sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходимы бесшовные обновления и управление совместимостью SDK Expo.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى ترقية SDK Expo وتحكم متوافق دون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle breaking changes, update dependencies, and migrate deprecated APIs to new Expo SDK versions, ensuring a smooth transition to the latest features and configurations.","zh":"赋予代理处理破坏性更改、更新依赖项并将过时的API迁移到新的Expo SDK版本的能力，确保平稳过渡到最新的功能和配置。","ja":"エージェントに破壊的な変更を処理し、依存関係を更新し、非推奨のAPIを新しいExpo SDKバージョンに移行する能力を与え、最新の機能と構成へのスムーズな移行を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 破壊적인 변경을 처리하고 의존성을 업데이트하며废弃된 API를 새로운 Expo SDK 버전에 마이그레이션 할 수 있도록 해주어 최신 기능 및 구성으로의 매끄러운 전환을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar cambios importantes, actualizar dependencias y migrar API obsoletas a nuevas versiones de SDK de Expo, garantizando una transición sin problemas a las últimas características y configuraciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les changements importants, de mettre à jour les dépendances et de migrer les API obsolètes vers de nouvelles versions de SDK Expo, assurant ainsi une transition en douceur vers les dernières fonctionnalités et configurations.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wichtige Änderungen zu verwalten, Abhängigkeiten zu aktualisieren und veraltete APIs auf neue Expo-SDK-Versionen zu migrieren, um so einen reibungslosen Übergang zu den neuesten Funktionen und Konfigurationen zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com alterações importantes, atualizarem dependências e migrarem APIs preteridas para novas versões do SDK Expo, garantindo uma transição suave para os recursos e configurações mais recentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью справляться с критическими изменениями, обновлять зависимости и переносить устаревшие API в новые версии SDK Expo, обеспечивая плавный переход к последним функциям и настройкам.","ar":"يُمكّن العميل من التعامل مع التغييرات الحاسمة و تحديث الاعتمادات و نقل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القديمة إلى إصدارات جديدة من SDK Expo، مما يضمن الانتقال السلس إلى الميزات وأعداد الإعدادات الأحدث."},"useCases":{"en":["Upgrading to the latest Expo SDK versions","Handling breaking changes between SDK versions","Updating dependencies for compatibility","Migrating deprecated APIs to new versions"],"zh":["升级到最新的Expo SDK版本","处理SDK版本之间的破坏性更改","更新依赖项以确保兼容性","将过时的API迁移到新版本"],"ja":["最新のExpo SDKバージョンへのアップグレード","SDKバージョン間の破壊的な変更の処理","依存関係の更新による互換性の確保","非推奨のAPIの新しいバージョンへの移行"],"ko":["최신 Expo SDK 버전으로의 업그레이드","SDK 버전 간의 破壊적인 변경의 처리","의존성의 업데이트를 통한 호환성 보장","废弃된 API를 새로운 버전으로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Actualización a las últimas versiones de SDK de Expo","Manejo de cambios importantes entre versiones de SDK","Actualización de dependencias para garantizar la compatibilidad","Migración de API obsoletas a nuevas versiones"],"fr":["Mise à jour vers les dernières versions de SDK Expo","Gestion des changements importants entre les versions de SDK","Mise à jour des dépendances pour assurer la compatibilité","Migration des API obsolètes vers de nouvelles versions"],"de":["Aktualisierung auf die neuesten Expo-SDK-Versionen","Verwaltung von wichtigen Änderungen zwischen SDK-Versionen","Aktualisierung von Abhängigkeiten für Kompatibilität","Migration von veralteten APIs auf neue Versionen"],"pt":["Atualizar para as versões mais recentes do SDK Expo","Lidar com alterações importantes entre versões do SDK","Atualizar dependências para compatibilidade","Migrar APIs preteridas para novas versões"],"ru":["Обновление до последних версий SDK Expo","Управление критическими изменениями между версиями SDK","Обновление зависимостей для совместимости","Миграция устаревших API на новые версии"],"ar":["تحديث إلى أحدث إصدارات SDK Expo","التعامل مع التغييرات الحاسمة بين إصدارات SDK","تحديث الاعتمادات لتحقيق التوافق","نقل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القديمة إلى إصدارات جديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo SDK installation","Compatibility issues may arise with unsupported dependencies"],"zh":["需要安装Expo SDK","可能出现与不支持的依赖项相关的兼容性问题"],"ja":["Expo SDKのインストールが必要","サポートされていない依存関係に関連する互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["Expo SDK의 설치가 필요","지원되지 않는 의존성과 관련된 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de SDK de Expo","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad con dependencias no compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de SDK Expo","Des problèmes de compatibilité peuvent survenir avec des dépendances non prises en charge"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Expo SDK","Kompatibilitätsprobleme können mit nicht unterstützten Abhängigkeiten auftreten"],"pt":["Exige instalação do SDK Expo","Pode surgir problemas de compatibilidade com dependências não suportadas"],"ru":["Требует установки SDK Expo","Могут возникнуть проблемы совместимости с не поддерживаемыми зависимостями"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت SDK Expo","قد تظهر مشاكل في التوافق مع الاعتمادات غير المدعومة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/monitor', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'monitor', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z', '2026-02-18T07:16:43.892Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/monitor","name":"monitor","description":{"zh":"监控代码仓库，自动修复CI检查失败的错误，确保代码质量","ja":"コードリポジトリを監視してCIチェックのエラーを自動修復し、コード品質を確保する","ko":"코드 저장소를 모니터링하고 CI 검사 오류를 자동으로 수정하여 코드 품질 보장","es":"La habilidad de monitoreo de Claude Code garantiza que las solicitudes de extracción sean 100% verdes. Analiza y soluciona problemas de CI de forma automática","fr":"La compétence de surveillance de Claude Code garantit que les demandes d''extraction soient 100% vertes. Analysez et résolvez les problèmes de CI de manière automatique","de":"Die Überwachungsfähigkeit von Claude Code stellt sicher, dass Pull-Requests 100% grün sind. Analysieren und beheben Sie CI-Probleme automatisch","pt":"A ferramenta de monitoração de PR ajuda a garantir que as verificações de CI sejam 100% verde","ru":"Инструмент мониторинга PR помогает гарантировать, что проверки CI проходят на 100%","ar":"أداة مراقبة طلب الPR تساعد على ضمان أن يتم إجراء عمليات التحقق من CI بنجاح 100%","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码监控技能","ja":"コード監視スキル","ko":"코드 모니터링 스킬","es":"Monitoreo de PR: habilidad de código de Claude","fr":"Surveillance de PR : compétence de code Claude","de":"PR-Überwachung: Claude Code-Fähigkeit","pt":"Monitoração de PR: Ferramenta de Análise de Falhas","ru":"Мониторинг PR: Инструмент Анализа Неисправностей","ar":"مراقبة 请求: أداة تحليل الفشل","en":"monitor"},"description":{"zh":"监控代码仓库，自动修复CI检查失败的错误，确保代码质量","ja":"コードリポジトリを監視してCIチェックのエラーを自動修復し、コード品質を確保する","ko":"코드 저장소를 모니터링하고 CI 검사 오류를 자동으로 수정하여 코드 품