シュコマンドが含まれています","ko":"project-workflow 스킬에는 프로젝트 生命周期를 자동화하는 9개의 통합 슬래시 명령어가 포함되어 있습니다","es":"Nuestra habilidad de flujo de proyecto ofrece 9 comandos integrados para automatizar el ciclo de vida completo del proyecto.","fr":"Notre compétence de flux de projet offre 9 commandes intégrées pour automatiser le cycle de vie complet du projet.","de":"Unsere Projekt-Workflow-Fähigkeit bietet 9 integrierte Befehle, um den gesamten Projekt-Lebenszyklus zu automatisieren.","pt":"O skill de fluxo de trabalho é uma solução para automatizar o ciclo de vida do projeto, desde a validação da ideia até a release","ru":"Навык рабочего потока - это решение для автоматизации жизненного цикла проекта, от валидации идеи до релиза","ar":"مهارة متابعة المشروع هي حل لتحسين دورة حياة المشروع، من التحقق من الفكرة إلى الإصدار","en":"DodaTech team-approved agent skills, security-scanned and ready for remote environments"},"definition":{"en":"DodaTech team-approved agent skills, security-scanned and ready for remote environments"},"features":{"zh":["9个集成的斜杠命令","自动化项目生命周期","节省35-55分钟的时间","支持远程环境","安全扫描","DodaTech团队批准"],"ja":["9つの統合スラッシュコマンド","プロジェクトライフサイクルの自動化","35-55分の時間の節約","リモート環境のサポート","セキュリティスキャン","DodaTechチームの承認"],"ko":["9개의 통합 슬래시 명령어","프로젝트 生命周期의 자동화","35-55분의 시간 절약","원격 환경 지원","보안 스캔","DodaTech 팀의 승인"],"es":["9 comandos integrados","Automatización del ciclo de vida del proyecto","Validación de ideas","Planificación","Ejecución","Gestión de sesiones","Preservación de contexto","Lanzamiento"],"fr":["9 commandes intégrées","Automatisation du cycle de vie du projet","Validation d''idées","Planification","Exécution","Gestion de sessions","Préservation de contexte","Lancement"],"de":["9 integrierte Befehle","Automatisierung des Projekt-Lebenszyklus","Ideenvalidierung","Planung","Ausführung","Sitzungsverwaltung","Kontexterhaltung","Veröffentlichung"],"pt":["9 comandos integrados para automação do ciclo de vida do projeto","Validação de ideias","Planejamento","Execução","Gerenciamento de sessões","Preservação de contexto","Lançamento"],"ru":["9 интегрированных команд для автоматизации жизненного цикла проекта","Валидация идей","Планирование","Исполнение","Управление сессиями","Сохранение контекста","Релиз"],"ar":["9 أوامر متكاملة لتحسين دورة حياة المشروع","التحقق من الفكرة","التخطيط","تنفيذ","إدارة الجلسات","الحفاظ على السياق","الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目工作流程自动化","项目生命周期管理","斜杠命令","远程环境","安全扫描","DodaTech","自动化工具","项目管理"],"ja":["プロジェクトワークフローの自動化","プロジェクトライフサイクル管理","スラッシュコマンド","リモート環境","セキュリティスキャン","DodaTech","自動化ツール","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["프로젝트 워크플로 자동화","프로젝트 生命周期 관리","슬래시 명령어","원격 환경","보안 스캔","DodaTech","자동화 도구","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["automatización de flujo de proyecto","ciclo de vida del proyecto","validación de ideas","planificación de proyectos","ejecución de proyectos","gestión de sesiones","preservación de contexto","lanzamiento de proyectos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["automatisation du flux de projet","cycle de vie du projet","validation d''idées","planification de projets","exécution de projets","gestion de sessions","préservation de contexte","lancement de projets","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Projekt-Workflow-Automatisierung","Projekt-Lebenszyklus","Ideenvalidierung","Projektplanung","Projektausführung","Sitzungsverwaltung","Kontexterhaltung","Projektveröffentlichung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho de projeto","automação de projeto","gestão de projeto","desenvolvimento de software","ciclo de vida do projeto","validação de ideias","planejamento de projeto"],"ru":["рабочий поток проекта","автоматизация проекта","управление проектом","разработка программного обеспечения","жизненный цикл проекта","валидация идей","планирование проекта"],"ar":["متابعة مشروع","توفير الوقت في المشروع","إدارة المشروع","تطوير البرمجيات","دورة حياة المشروع","التحقق من الفكرة","تخطيط المشروع"]}},"owner":"fefogarcia","repo":"approved-skills","repoPath":"fefogarcia/approved-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-workflow","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech","body":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech stack validation, scope management, or research before planning.\n\n**Creates**: PROJECT_BRIEF.md with validated decisions → hands off to /plan-project\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/plan-project` - Generate Project Planning Docs\n\n**Use when**: Starting new project with clear requirements, or after /explore-idea.\n\n**Creates**: IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, SESSION.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md (if needed), API_ENDPOINTS.md (if needed), ARCHITECTURE.md\n\n**Invokes**: project-planning skill\n\n**Time savings**: 5-7 min\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/plan-feature` - Add Features to Existing Projects\n\n**Use when**: Adding feature to existing project with SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md.\n\n**Does**: Generates new phases via project-planning skill, integrates into IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md with renumbering, updates SESSION.md.\n\n**Time savings**: 7-10 min\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/wrap-session` - End-of-Session Checkpoint\n\n**Use when**: Context full (>150k tokens), end of work session, or before task switch.\n\n**Does**: Task agent analyzes session → updates SESSION.md (progress, Next Action, blockers) → git checkpoint commit → formatted handoff summary.\n\n**Time savings**: 2-3 min\n\n---\n\n### 5. `/continue-session` - Start-of-Session Context Loading\n\n**Use when**: Starting new session or after /wrap-session checkpoint.\n\n**Does**: Explore agent loads SESSION.md + planning docs → shows git history + session summary (phase, progress, Next Action, blockers) → optionally opens file → asks permission to continue.\n\n**Time savings**: 1-2 min\n\n---\n\n### 6. `/workflow` - Interactive Workflow Guide\n\n**Use when**: First time user, unsure which command to use, or need quick reference.\n\n**Does**: Shows all 9 commands → context-aware guidance with decision trees → offers to execute appropriate command.\n\n---\n\n### 7. `/release` - Pre-Release Safety Checks\n\n**Use when**: Ready to push to public GitHub or create release.\n\n**8 Phases**:\n1. **Critical Safety** (BLOCKERS): Secrets scan (gitleaks), personal artifacts check, git remote verification\n2. **Documentation** (REQUIRED): LICENSE, README (>100 words), CONTRIBUTING.md (>500 LOC), CODE_OF_CONDUCT (>1000 LOC)\n3. **Configuration**: .gitignore, package.json, git branch warning\n4. **Quality** (NON-BLOCKING): Build test, npm audit, large files (>1MB)\n5. **Report**: Blockers/warnings/recommendations + safe to release verdict\n6-8. **Auto-Fix & Publish**: Fix issues, release prep commit, optional git tag + GitHub release\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 8. `/brief` - Context Preservation Document\n\n**Use when**: Before clearing context, to preserve key decisions and requirements for future sessions.\n\n**Creates**: `docs/brief-[slug].md` with extracted information from current conversation.\n\n**Does**: Analyzes conversation → extracts what''s being built, decisions made, technical details → creates organized markdown file → optionally creates GitHub issue for tracking.\n\n**Time savings**: 3-5 min\n\n---\n\n### 9. `/reflect` - Capture Operational Knowledge\n\n**Use when**: Before context compaction, after completing significant work, or when valuable learnings accumulated.\n\n**Does**: Reviews conversation → identifies workflows discovered, patterns learned, tool sequences, corrections made → routes each learning to appropriate destination (rules, CLAUDE.md, skills, docs) → optionally suggests automation (scripts, commands, custom agents).\n\n**Key Feature**: Considers whether processes should become custom agents when they require reasoning/decisions, benefit from parallel execution, or involve research/exploration.\n\n**Time savings**: 5-10 min\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n**Full**: /explore-idea → /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /plan-feature (if needed) → repeat → /reflect → /release\n\n**Quick** (clear requirements): /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /release\n\n**Context Preservation**: /brief (before clearing context), /reflect (capture learnings)\n\n**Helpers**: /workflow (guidance), /plan-feature (add feature), /release (publish)\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n**project-planning**: Invoked by /plan-project and /plan-feature (generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md, API_ENDPOINTS.md)\n\n**project-session-management**: SESSION.md protocol for /wrap-session and /continue-session\n\n**Claude Code agents**: /wrap-session (Task agent), /continue-session + /explore-idea (Explore agent)\n\n---\n\n## Command Relationships\n\n```\nEXPLORATION PHASE\n/explore-idea (optional)\n    ↓\n    Creates PROJECT_BRIEF.md\n    ↓\nPLANNING PHASE\n/plan-project (reads PROJECT_BRIEF.md if exists)\n    ↓\n    Creates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md + SESSION.md\n    ↓\nEXECUTION PHASE\nWork on phases\n    ↓\n/wrap-session (when context full)\n    ↓\n    Updates SESSION.md, git checkpoint\n    ↓\n/continue-session (new session)\n    ↓\n    Loads SESSION.md, continues work\n    ↓\n/plan-feature (when need new features)\n    ↓\n    Adds phases to IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n    ↓\nContinue wrap → resume cycle\n    ↓\nCONTEXT PRESERVATION\n/brief (before clearing context)\n    ↓\n    Creates docs/brief-[slug].md\n    ↓\n/reflect (capture learnings)\n    ↓\n    Routes knowledge to rules, docs, CLAUDE.md\n    ↓\nRELEASE PHASE\n/release (when ready to publish)\n    ↓\n    Safety checks → GitHub release\n\nHELPER\n/workflow (anytime)\n    ↓\n    Interactive guidance\n```\n\n---\n\n## Time Savings Breakdown\n\n| Command | Time Saved | Tasks Automated |\n|---------|------------|-----------------|\n| `/explore-idea` | 10-15 min | Research, validation, scope management, tech stack evaluation |\n| `/plan-project` | 5-7 min | Planning doc generation, git setup, phase structuring |\n| `/plan-feature` | 7-10 min | Feature planning, phase integration, doc updates |\n| `/wrap-session` | 2-3 min | SESSION.md updates, git checkpoint, handoff summary |\n| `/continue-session` | 1-2 min | Context loading, git history review, next action display |\n| `/workflow` | Instant | Navigation, decision trees, command selection |\n| `/release` | 10-15 min | Secret scanning, doc validation, build testing, release creation |\n| `/brief` | 3-5 min | Context extraction, decisions capture, markdown generation |\n| `/reflect` | 5-10 min | Learning extraction, knowledge routing, automation suggestions |\n\n**Total per project lifecycle:** 45-70 minutes\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**All**: Claude Code CLI, git repo (recommended)\n\n**/plan-feature**: Existing SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n\n**/wrap-session, /continue-session**: SESSION.md (created by /plan-project)\n\n**/release**: Git repo with commits, package.json (Node.js), remote URL (for publishing)\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**/plan-project \"No project description\"**: Use /explore-idea first or discuss project with Claude\n\n**/plan-feature \"Prerequisites not met\"**: Run /plan-project first (creates SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md)\n\n**/wrap-session \"No git repository\"**: Run `git init`\n\n**/continue-session \"SESSION.md not found\"**: Run /plan-project\n\n**/release \"Secrets detected\"**: Add to .gitignore, remove from git history\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n**1.1.0** (2026-01-11)\n- Added `/brief` command for context preservation\n- Added `/reflect` command for capturing operational knowledge\n- `/reflect` now suggests custom agents for processes requiring reasoning\n- Total commands: 9\n\n**1.0.0** (2025-11-12)\n- Initial release\n- 7 integrated slash commands\n- Plugin marketplace distribution\n- Command bundling via plugin.json\n\n---\n\n**Issues**: https://github.com/jezweb/claude-skills/issues | **Author**: Jeremy Dawes (jeremy@jezweb.net) | **License**: MIT\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:17:23.830Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing integrated project lifecycle automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要集成项目生命周期自动化能力的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが統合されたプロジェクトライフサイクル自動化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"통합된 프로젝트 라이프사이클 자동화 기능이 필요한 태스크 관리 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que necesitan capacidades de automatización del ciclo de vida del proyecto integradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Tâches nécessitant des capacités d''automatisation du cycle de vie du projet intégrées.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die integrierte Projekt-Lebenszyklus-Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de capacidades de automação de ciclo de vida de projeto integradas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих интегрированных возможностей автоматизации жизненного цикла проекта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات أتمتة دورة حياة المشروع المتكاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate project workflows using 9 integrated slash commands, streamlining idea validation, planning, execution, and release, while preserving context and managing sessions, leveraging markdown files and remote environment compatibility.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 9 个集成的斜杠命令来自动化项目工作流的能力，简化想法验证、规划、执行和发布，同时保留上下文和管理会话，利用 markdown 文件和远程环境兼容性。","ja":"9 つの統合スラッシュコマンドを使用してプロジェクトワークフローを自動化することで、エージェントに力を与え、アイデアの検証、計画、実行、リリースを効率化し、同時にコンテキストとセッションを管理し、Markdown ファイルとリモート環境の互換性を利用する。","ko":"9개의 통합 슬래시 명령을 사용하여 프로젝트 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하여 에이전트에게 힘을 부여하고, 아이디어 검증, 계획, 실행 및 릴리즈를 간소화同时 컨텍스트와 세션을 관리하고, 마크다운 파일 및 원격 환경 호환성을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de proyecto utilizando 9 comandos de barra integrados, simplificando la validación de ideas, la planificación, la ejecución y la publicación, al tiempo que se conserva el contexto y se gestionan las sesiones, aprovechando archivos markdown y la compatibilidad con entornos remotos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail de projet en utilisant 9 commandes de barre intégrées, simplifiant la validation des idées, la planification, l''exécution et la publication, tout en préservant le contexte et en gérant les sessions, en exploitant les fichiers markdown et la compatibilité avec les environnements distants.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projekt-Workflows mithilfe von 9 integrierten Schrägkommandos zu automatisieren, wodurch die Ideenvalidierung, Planung, Ausführung und Veröffentlichung rationalisiert werden, während der Kontext erhalten und Sitzungen verwaltet werden, unter Ausnutzung von Markdown-Dateien und Remote-Umgebungs-Kompatibilität.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho de projeto usando 9 comandos de barra integrados, simplificando a validação de ideias, planejamento, execução e lançamento, preservando o contexto e gerenciando sessões, aproveitando arquivos markdown e compatibilidade com ambientes remotos.","ru":"Наделяет а