les-RL","en":"miles-rl-training"},"description":{"zh":"miles-rl-training是一个高性能的企业级RL框架，用于大规模模型的后训练，解决了MoE训练稳定性、低精度训练和训练推理一致性等关键挑战","ja":"miles-rl-trainingは、大規模モデル後のトレーニングのための高性能エンタープライズグレードRLフレームワークであり、MoEトレーニングの安定性、低精度トレーニング、トレーニングと推論の一貫性など、重要な課題を解決","ko":"miles-rl-training은 대규모 모델의 후 훈련을 위한 높은 성능의 엔터프라이즈급 RL 프레임워크로서 MoE 훈련 안정성, 저정도 훈련 및 훈련-추론 일관성 등의 주요 도전을 해결","es":"miles es un framework de RL de alto rendimiento para el entrenamiento de modelos de gran escala, optimizado para la estabilidad y la precisión","fr":"miles est un framework RL haute performance pour la formation de modèles à grande échelle, optimisé pour la stabilité et la précision","de":"miles ist ein Hochleistungs-RL-Framework für das Training von Großmodellen, optimiert für Stabilität und Präzision","pt":"Miles é um framework de RL de alto desempenho para treinamento de modelos de grande escala, otimizado para estabilidade de treinamento e alinhamento de infer...","ru":"Miles - это высокопроизводительный фреймворк RL для обучения крупномасштабных моделей, оптимизированный для стабильности обучения и выравнивания вывода.","ar":"Miles هو إطار عمل RL عالي الأداء لتدريب النماذج على نطاق واسع، ومحسّن لاستقرار التدريب وتحسين الاستدلال.","en":"Create, Evaluate, and Connect AI Skills"},"definition":{"en":"Create, Evaluate, and Connect AI Skills"},"features":{"zh":["高性能的企业级RL框架","支持大规模模型（1TB+）的训练","FP8或INT4量化感知训练","位级别相同的训练和推理"],"ja":["高性能エンタープライズグレードRLフレームワーク","大規模モデル（1TB+）のトレーニングをサポート","FP8またはINT4量化感知トレーニング","ビットレベルの同じトレーニングと推論"],"ko":["높은 성능의 엔터프라이즈급 RL 프레임워크","대규모 모델（1TB+）의 훈련을 지원","FP8 또는 INT4量化 인식 훈련","비트 레벨의 동일한 훈련 및 추론"],"es":["Entrenamiento de modelos MoE de gran escala","Optimización para la estabilidad y la precisión","Compatibilidad con cuantización FP8 e INT4","Alineación de entrenamiento e inferencia"],"fr":["Formation de modèles MoE à grande échelle","Optimisation pour la stabilité et la précision","Compatibilité avec la quantification FP8 et INT4","Alignement de la formation et de l''inférence"],"de":["Training von Großmodellen MoE","Optimierung für Stabilität und Präzision","Kompatibilität mit FP8- und INT4-Quantifizierung","Ausrichtung von Training und Inferenz"],"pt":["Treinamento de modelos de 1TB+ MoE","Treinamento com quantização FP8 ou INT4","Alinhamento de treinamento e inferência idêntico em nível de bit","Otimização para estabilidade de treinamento","Suporte a modelos DeepSeek V3 e Qwen3-MoE"],"ru":["Обучение моделей 1ТБ+ MoE","Обучение с квантованием FP8 или INT4","Выравнивание обучения и вывода на уровне бита","Оптимизация для стабильности обучения","Поддержка моделей DeepSeek V3 и Qwen3-MoE"],"ar":["تدريب نماذج 1TB+ MoE","تدريب مع كمية FP8 أو INT4","تحسين التدريب والاستدلال على مستوى البت","تحسين استقرار التدريب","دعم نماذج DeepSeek V3 و Qwen3-MoE"]},"keywords":{"zh":["大规模模型训练","企业级RL框架","高性能训练","MoE训练稳定性","低精度训练","训练推理一致性"],"ja":["大規模モデル訓練","エンタープライズグレードRLフレームワーク","高性能トレーニング","MoEトレーニングの安定性","低精度トレーニング","トレーニングと推論の一貫性"],"ko":["대규모 모델 훈련","엔터프라이즈급 RL 프레임워크","높은 성능의 훈련","MoE 훈련의 안정성","저정도 훈련","훈련-추론의 일관성"],"es":["entrenamiento de RL","modelos MoE","cuantización FP8","cuantización INT4","aprendizaje por refuerzo","framework de RL"],"fr":["formation RL","modèles MoE","quantification FP8","quantification INT4","apprentissage par renforcement","framework RL"],"de":["RL-Training","MoE-Modelle","FP8-Quantifizierung","INT4-Quantifizierung","maschinelles Lernen durch Verstärkung","RL-Framework"],"pt":["treinamento de RL","modelo de grande escala","estabilidade de treinamento","alinhamento de inferência","quantização FP8","quantização INT4","DeepSeek V3","Qwen3-MoE"],"ru":["обучение RL","крупномасштабная модель","стабильность обучения","выравнивание вывода","квантование FP8","квантование INT4","DeepSeek V3","Qwen3-MoE"],"ar":["تدريب RL","نموذج على نطاق واسع","استقرار التدريب","تحسين الاستدلال","كمية FP8","كمية INT4","DeepSeek V3","Qwen3-MoE"]}},"owner":"zjunlp","repo":"SkillNet","repoPath":"zjunlp/SkillNet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"miles-rl-training","description":"Provides guidance for enterprise-grade RL training using miles, a production-ready fork of slime. Use when training large MoE models with FP8/INT4, needing train-inference alignment, or requiring speculative RL for maximum throughput.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["Reinforcement Learning","MoE","FP8","INT4","Enterprise","SGLang","Megatron-LM"],"bodyPreview":"# miles: Enterprise-Grade RL for Large-Scale Model Training\n\nmiles is a high-performance, enterprise-ready RL framework optimized for large-scale model post-training. Built as a production fork of slime, it addresses critical challenges in MoE training stability, low-precision training, and train-inference alignment.\n\n## When to Use miles\n\n**Choose miles when you need:**\n- Training 1TB+ MoE models (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)\n- FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training\n- Bit-wise identical train-infer","body":"# miles: Enterprise-Grade RL for Large-Scale Model Training\n\nmiles is a high-performance, enterprise-ready RL framework optimized for large-scale model post-training. Built as a production fork of slime, it addresses critical challenges in MoE training stability, low-precision training, and train-inference alignment.\n\n## When to Use miles\n\n**Choose miles when you need:**\n- Training 1TB+ MoE models (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)\n- FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training\n- Bit-wise identical train-inference alignment\n- Speculative RL for maximum throughput\n- Production stability with enterprise support\n\n**Consider alternatives when:**\n- You want the research-grade original → use **slime**\n- You need flexible backend swapping → use **verl**\n- You want PyTorch-native abstractions → use **torchforge**\n\n## Key Features\n\n### Low-Precision Training\n- **Unified FP8**: End-to-end FP8 for both inference and training\n- **INT4 QAT**: 1TB models on single-machine VRAM (H200)\n- **Rollout Routing Replay (R3)**: Bit-wise expert alignment for MoE\n\n### Performance Optimizations\n- **Speculative RL**: 25%+ rollout speedup with online SFT draft models\n- **Zero-Copy Weight Sync**: CUDA IPC zero-copy mapping\n- **Partial Rollout**: Recycle half-finished trajectories\n\n### Train-Inference Alignment\n- **TIS/MIS**: Truncated/Masked Importance Sampling for off-policy correction\n- **Kernel-level optimization**: FlashAttention-3, DeepGEMM integration\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Recommended: Docker\ndocker pull radixark/miles:latest\ndocker run --rm --gpus all --ipc=host --shm-size=16g \\\n  -it radixark/miles:latest /bin/bash\n\n# From source\ngit clone https://github.com/radixark/miles.git\ncd miles\npip install -r requirements.txt\npip install -e .\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\nmiles inherits slime''s configuration system. Basic training:\n\n```bash\npython train.py \\\n    --advantage-estimator grpo \\\n    --model-name qwen3-30b-a3b \\\n    --hf-checkpoint /path/to/qwen3-30b-a3b-hf \\\n    --rollout-batch-size 512 \\\n    --n-samples-per-prompt 8\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow 1: Large MoE Training\n\nUse this workflow for training large MoE models like DeepSeek V3 or Qwen3-MoE.\n\n### Prerequisites Checklist\n- [ ] H100/H200 GPUs with FP8 support\n- [ ] MoE model (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)\n- [ ] Docker environment with miles\n\n### Step 1: Environment Setup\n\n```bash\n# FP8 block scaling (recommended for stability)\nexport NVTE_FP8_BLOCK_SCALING_FP32_SCALES=1\nexport CUDA_DEVICE_MAX_CONNECTIONS=1\n```\n\n### Step 2: Configure Training\n\n```bash\npython train.py \\\n    --actor-num-gpus-per-node 8 \\\n    --rollout-num-gpus 8 \\\n    --hf-checkpoint /path/to/deepseek-v3 \\\n    --advantage-estimator grpo \\\n    --tensor-model-parallel-size 8 \\\n    --expert-model-parallel-size 4 \\\n    --prompt-data /path/to/data.jsonl \\\n    --num-rollout 3000\n```\n\n### Verification Checklist\n- [ ] Model loads without errors\n- [ ] Routing decisions are consistent\n- [ ] No NaN/Inf in loss values\n\n---\n\n## Workflow 2: Speculative RL Training\n\nUse this workflow for maximum rollout throughput with EAGLE speculative decoding.\n\n### How Speculative RL Works\n\n1. Small draft model generates candidate tokens\n2. Target model verifies in parallel\n3. Draft model updated via online SFT to track policy\n\n### Step 1: Enable Speculative Decoding\n\nmiles supports EAGLE speculative decoding via SGLang:\n\n```bash\npython train.py \\\n    --actor-num-gpus-per-node 8 \\\n    --hf-checkpoint /path/to/target-model \\\n    --sglang-speculative-algorithm EAGLE \\\n    --sglang-speculative-num-steps 3 \\\n    --sglang-speculative-eagle-topk 1 \\\n    --sglang-speculative-num-draft-tokens 4 \\\n    --sglang-speculative-draft-model-path /path/to/draft-model \\\n    --advantage-estimator grpo \\\n    --prompt-data /path/to/data.jsonl\n```\n\n### Step 2: Enable Online MTP Training (Optional)\n\nFor online SFT of draft model during training:\n\n```bash\n--mtp-num-layers 1 \\\n--enable-mtp-training \\\n--mtp-loss-scaling-factor 0.2\n```\n\n**Note**: Online MTP training requires a torch dist checkpoint with MTP weights. Add `--mtp-num-layers 1` during checkpoint conversion from HuggingFace.\n\n### Expected Speedup\n\n- **Standard rollout**: Baseline\n- **Speculative RL**: 25-40% faster rollout\n- **With partial rollout**: Additional 10-15% throughput\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Reference\n\nmiles inherits all slime arguments. See [slime API Reference](../slime/references/api-reference.md) for the complete list.\n\n### Cluster Resources (from slime)\n\n```bash\n--actor-num-nodes 1\n--actor-num-gpus-per-node 8\n--rollout-num-gpus 8\n--rollout-num-gpus-per-engine 2\n--colocate\n```\n\n### Megatron Parallelism (from slime)\n\n```bash\n--tensor-model-parallel-size 8\n--pipeline-model-parallel-size 2\n--expert-model-parallel-size 4    # MoE expert parallelism\n```\n\n### Speculative Decoding (miles-specific)\n\n```bash\n--sglang-speculative-algorithm EAGLE\n--sglang-speculative-num-steps 3\n--sglang-speculative-eagle-topk 1\n--sglang-speculative-num-draft-tokens 4\n--sglang-enable-draft-weights-cpu-backup\n--sglang-speculative-draft-model-path /your/draft/model/path\n```\n\n### Online MTP Training (miles-specific)\n\n```bash\n--mtp-num-layers 1\n--enable-mtp-training\n--mtp-loss-scaling-factor 0.2\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Features (Conceptual)\n\nThe following features are documented in miles but specific CLI flags may vary. Consult the miles repository for latest configuration.\n\n### Unified FP8 Pipeline\n\nEnd-to-end FP8 sampling and training that eliminates quantization-induced discrepancy causing RL collapse in MoE models.\n\n### Rollout Routing Replay (R3)\n\nRecords expert routing decisions during SGLang inference and replays them during Megatron training for bit-wise expert alignment.\n\n**How R3 Works**:\n1. During SGLang inference, expert routing decisions are recorded\n2. Routing decisions stored in `sample.rollout_routed_experts`\n3. During Megatron training, routing is replayed instead of recomputed\n4. Ensures identical expert selection between train and inference\n\n### INT4 Quantization-Aware Training\n\nEnables single-machine deployment of 1TB+ models (e.g., on H200).\n\n**Memory Savings with INT4**:\n\n| Model Size | BF16 VRAM | INT4 VRAM | Reduction |\n|------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|\n| 70B | 140GB | 45GB | 3.1x |\n| 235B | 470GB | 150GB | 3.1x |\n| 671B | 1.3TB | 420GB | 3.1x |\n\n### Train-Inference Alignment\n\nmiles achieves \"exactly 0 KL divergence\" between training and inference through:\n- Flash Attention 3\n- DeepGEMM\n- Batch-invariant kernels from Thinking Machines Lab\n- `torch.compile` integration\n\n---\n\n## Sample Data Structure\n\nmiles uses the same `Sample` dataclass as slime with the `rollout_routed_experts` field for MoE routing replay:\n\n```python\n@dataclass\nclass Sample:\n    prompt: str | list[dict]\n    tokens: list[int]\n    response: str\n    reward: float | dict\n    loss_mask: list[int]\n    status: Status\n    metadata: dict\n    rollout_log_probs: list[float]\n    rollout_routed_experts: list[list[int]]  # MoE routing for R3\n```\n\nSee [slime API Reference](../slime/references/api-reference.md) for the complete Sample definition.\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues and Solutions\n\n### Issue: FP8 Training Collapse\n\n**Symptoms**: Loss explodes, NaN values\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Use block scaling: `export NVTE_FP8_BLOCK_SCALING_FP32_SCALES=1`\n- Reduce learning rate: `--lr 5e-7`\n- Ensure MoE routing is consistent between train/inference\n\n### Issue: Speculative Draft Drift\n\n**Symptoms**: Low acceptance rate over time\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Enable online MTP training to keep draft model aligned\n- Reduce speculative steps: `--sglang-speculative-num-steps 2`\n- Use CPU backup: `--sglang-enable-draft-weights-cpu-backup`\n\n### Issue: Train-Inference Mismatch\n\n**Symptoms**: Policy divergence, reward collapse\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Use TIS for off-policy correction: `--use-tis --tis-threshold 0.9`\n- Verify log probs match between SGLang and Megatron\n- Enable R3 for MoE models\n\n---\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Family | Models | MoE Support |\n|--------|--------|-------------|\n| DeepSeek | R1, V3, V3.2 | Full |\n| Qwen | 2, 2.5, 3 (including MoE) | Full |\n| Llama | 3, 3.1, 3.3, 4 | Dense only |\n| Gemma | 2, 3, 3N | Dense only |\n| GLM | 4.5, 4.6, 4.7 | Dense only |\n| MiniMax | M2, M2.1 | Full |\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/radixark/miles\n- **Introduction Blog**: https://lmsys.org/blog/2025-11-19-miles/\n- **Slime (upstream)**: https://github.com/THUDM/slime\n- **SGLang**: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:17:37.169Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents requiring large-scale model post-training with enterprise-grade Reinforcement Learning (RL) capabilities","zh":"非常适合需要大规模模型后训练的企业级强化学习（RL）能力的AI代理","ja":"大規模モデルの事後トレーニングが必要なエンタープライズグレードの強化学習（RL）機能を備えたAIエージェントに最適","ko":"대규모 모델 후훈련이 필요한 기업급 강화학습(RL) 기능을 갖춘 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que requieren un entrenamiento posterior a gran escala con capacidades de Aprendizaje por Refuerzo (RL) de nivel empresarial","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une formation post-modèle à grande échelle avec des capacités d''Apprentissage par Renforcement (RL) de niveau entreprise","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine großflächige Modellnachtraining mit Unternehmensgrad-Reinforcement-Learning-(RL)-Funktionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que exigem pós-treinamento de modelos em larga escala com capacidades de Aprendizado por Reforço (RL) de classe empresarial","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих постобучения крупномасштабных моделей с возможностями обучения с подкреплением (RL) класса предприятия","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب مرحلة ما بعد التدريب للنماذج ذات الحجم الكبير مع امكانيات تعلم التعزيز (RL) من فئة الشركات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to train 1TB+ MoE models with FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training and achieve bit-wise identical train-infer alignment, leveraging miles'' high-performance RL framework for enhanced model stability and low-precision training","zh":"赋予代理训练1TB+ MoE模型的能力，具有FP8或INT4量化感知训练，并实现位级相同的训练-推理对齐，利用Miles的高性能RL框架增强模型稳定性和低精度训练","ja":"エージェントに1TB以上のMoEモデルをFP8またはINT4量子化認識トレーニングでトレーニングする能力を与え、ビットごとのトレーニング-インファレンスの整合を実現し、Milesの高性能RLフレームワークを利用してモデル安定性と低精度トレーニングを向上させる","ko":"에이전트가 1TB 이상의 MoE 모델을 FP8 또는 INT4 정량화 인식 트레이닝으로 트레이닝할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 비트 단위 동일한 트레이닝-추론 일치를 달성하며, Miles의 고성능 RL 프레임워크를 활용하여 모델 안정성과 저정밀도 트레이닝을 향상","es":"Habilita a los agentes a entrenar modelos MoE de 1TB+ con entrenamiento con quantización FP8 o INT4 y lograr un alineamiento de entrenamiento-inferencia idéntico bit a bit, aprovechando el marco de alto rendimiento RL de miles para una mayor estabilidad del modelo y un entrenamiento de baja precisión","fr":"Permet aux agents de former des modèles MoE de 1 To ou plus avec une formation avec quantification FP8 ou INT4 et d''atteindre un alignement formation-inférence identique au niveau du bit, en exploitant le cadre haute performance RL de miles pour une stabilité améliorée du modèle et une formation à faible précision","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, MoE-Modelle von 1TB+ mit Quantisierungs-bewusstem Training mit FP8 oder INT4 auszubilden und eine bitweise identische Trainings-Schlussfolgerungs-Übereinstimmung zu erreichen, indem sie den Hochleistungs-RL-Rahmen von Miles für eine verbesserte Modellstabilität und ein Training mit niedriger Genauigkeit nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a treinarem modelos MoE de 1TB+ com treinamento com quantização FP8 ou INT4 e alcançar alinhamento de treinamento-inferência bit-a-bit, utilizando a estrutura de alto desempenho RL da Miles para estabilidade e treinamento de baixa precisão aprimorados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обучать модели MoE размером 1ТБ+ с обучением, осведомленным о квантовании FP8 или INT4, и достижением бит-в-бит идентичного выравнивания обучения и вывода, используя высокопроизводительную основу RL от Miles для улучшения стабильности модели и обучения с низким разрешением","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تدريب نماذج MoE بحجم 1 تيرابايت+ مع تدريب يعرف الكمية FP8 أو INT4 وتحقيق انسجام تدريب-استدلال متطابق بت-بت، مستفيدا من هيكل تعلم التعزيز عالي الأداء من Miles لتحسين استقرار النموذج وتدريب الدقة المنخفضة"},"useCases":{"en":["Training large-scale DeepSeek V3 and Qwen3-MoE models","Implementing quantization-aware training for optimized model performance","Ensuring train-inference alignment for reliable model deployment"],"zh":["训练大规模DeepSeek V3和Qwen3-MoE模型","实现量化感知训练以优化模型性能","确保训练-推理对齐以实现可靠的模型部署"],"ja":["大規模DeepSeek V3およびQwen3-MoEモデルのトレーニング","量子化認識トレーニングを実現してモデル性能を最適化","トレーニング-インファレンスの整合を確保して信頼性の高いモデル展開を実現"],"ko":["대규모 DeepSeek V3 및 Qwen3-MoE 모델 트레이닝","정량화 인식 트레이닝을 구현하여 모델 성능을 최적화","트레이닝-추론 일치를 보장하여 신뢰할 수 있는 모델 배포를 달성"],"es":["Entrenamiento de modelos DeepSeek V3 y Qwen3-MoE a gran escala","Implementación de un entrenamiento con quantización para un rendimiento óptimo del modelo","Garantizar el alineamiento de entrenamiento e inferencia para una implementación confiable del modelo"],"fr":["Formation de modèles DeepSeek V3 et Qwen3-MoE à grande échelle","Mise en œuvre d''une formation avec quantification pour des performances optimales du modèle","Assurer l''alignement formation-inférence pour un déploiement fiable du modèle"],"de":["Training von DeepSeek-V3- und Qwen3-MoE-Modellen im großen Maßstab","Implementierung eines quantisierungs-bewussten Trainings für ein optimales Modellverhalten","Gewährleistung der Übereinstimmung zwischen Training und Schlussfolgerung für eine zuverlässige Modellimplementierung"],"pt":["Treinamento de modelos DeepSeek V3 e Qwen3-MoE em larga escala","Implementação de treinamento com quantização para desempenho de modelo otimizado","Garantia de alinhamento treinamento-inferência para implantação de modelo confiável"],"ru":["Обучение крупномасштабных моделей DeepSeek V3 и Qwen3-MoE","Реализация обучения, осведомленного о квантовании, для оптимизированной производительности модели","Обеспечение выравнивания обучения и вывода для надежной развертки модели"],"ar":["تدريب نماذج DeepSeek V3 و Qwen3-MoE على نطاق واسع","تنفيذ تدريب يعرف الكمية لتحسين أداء النموذج","ضمان انسجام تدريب-استدلال لتنفيذ نموذج موثوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires large-scale model training infrastructure","Optimized for MoE models (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","Specifically designed for FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training"],"zh":["需要大规模模型训练基础设施","针对MoE模型（DeepSeek V3，Qwen3-MoE）进行优化","专门为FP8或INT4量化感知训练设计"],"ja":["大規模モデルトレーニングインフラストラクチャが必要","MoEモデル（DeepSeek V3、Qwen3-MoE）に最適化","FP8またはINT4量子化認識トレーニング専用に設計"],"ko":["대규모 모델 트레이닝 인프라가 필요","MoE 모델(DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)에 최적화","FP8 또는 INT4 정량화 인식 트레이닝을 위한専用 설계"],"es":["Requiere infraestructura de entrenamiento de modelos a gran escala","Optimizado para modelos MoE (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","Diseñado específicamente para entrenamiento con quantización FP8 o INT4"],"fr":["Nécessite une infrastructure de formation de modèles à grande échelle","Optimisé pour les modèles MoE (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","Conçu spécifiquement pour la formation avec quantification FP8 ou INT4"],"de":["Benötigt eine Infrastruktur für das Training von Modellen im großen Maßstab","Optimiert für MoE-Modelle (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","Speziell für ein Training mit Quantisierung FP8 oder INT4 konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige infraestrutura de treinamento de modelos em larga escala","Otimizado para modelos MoE (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","Projetado especificamente para treinamento com quantização FP8 ou INT4"],"ru":["Требует инфраструктуры для обучения крупномасштабных моделей","Оптимизирован для моделей MoE (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","Специально разработан для обучения с квантованием FP8 или INT4"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية تحتية لتدريب النماذج على نطاق واسع","مُحسّن لنماذج MoE (DeepSeek V3, Qwen3-MoE)","مصمم خصيصا لتدريب يعرف الكمية FP8 أو INT4"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ngxtm/devkit/upgrading-expo', 'community', 'ngxtm', 'devkit', 'ngxtm/devkit', 'upgrading-expo', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z', '2026-02-18T07:17:19.757Z', NULL, '{"id":"ngxtm/devkit/upgrading-expo","name":"upgrading-expo","description":{"zh":"升级 Expo SDK 版本，处理破坏性变化、依赖和配置更新。该技能帮助您升级到新版本、处理破坏性变化、更新依赖和配置","ja":"Expo SDK バージョンをアップグレードし、破壊的な変更、依存関係、および構成の更新を処理します。このスキルは、新しいバージョンへのアップグレード、破壊的な変更の処理、依存関係および構成の更新を支援","ko":"Expo SDK 버전을 업그레이드하고 破壊적인 변경, 의존성 및 구성 업데이트를 처리합니다. 이 스킬은 새로운 버전으로의 업그레이드, 破壊적인 변경의 처리, 의존성 및 구성 업데이트를 지원","pt":"Atualize o Expo SDK de forma segura, lidando com mudanças quebrantes e dependências. Este skill ajuda a migrar APIs depreciadas e preparar aplicativos para novos recursos do Expo.","ru":"Обновите Expo SDK безопасно, xửлявая изменения и зависимости. Этот навык помогает перенести устаревшие API и подготовить приложения к новым возможностям Expo.","ar":"ترقية إكسبو SDK بأمان، وتعامل مع التغييرات التي تسبب مشاكل وتعديلات. هذا المهارة يساعد على نقل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المرفوضة وتهيئة التطبيقات لميزات إكسبو الجديدة.","en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart tech   detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"升级 Expo SDK 版本","ja":"Expo SDK バージョンのアップグレード","ko":"Expo SDK 버전 업그레이드","pt":"Atualize o Expo com Segurança","ru":"Обновление Expo Безопасно","ar":"ترقية إكسبو بأمان","en":"upgrading-expo"},"description":{"zh":"升级 Expo SDK 版本，处理破坏性变化、依赖和配置更新。该技能帮助您升级到新版本、处理破坏性变化、更新依赖和配置","ja":"Expo SDK バージョンをアップグレードし、破壊的な変更、依存関係、および構成の更新を処理します。このスキルは、新しいバージョンへのアップグレード、破壊的な変更の処理、依存関係および構成の更新を支援","ko":"Expo SDK 버전을 업그레이드하고 破壊적인 변경, 의존성 및 구성 업데이트를 처리합니다. 이 스킬은 새로운 버전으로의 업그레이드, 破壊적인 변경의 처리, 의존성 및 구성 업데이트를 지원","pt":"Atualize o Expo SDK de forma segura, lidando com mudanças quebrantes e dependências. Este skill ajuda a migrar APIs depreciadas e preparar aplicativos para n...","ru":"Обновите Expo SDK безопасно, xửлявая изменения и зависимости. Этот навык помогает перенести устаревшие API и подготовить приложения к новым возможностям Expo.","ar":"ترقية إكسبو SDK بأمان، وتعامل مع التغييرات التي تسبب مشاكل وتعديلات. هذا المهارة يساعد على نقل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المرفوضة وتهيئة التطبيقات لميزات إكسبو ...","en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart..."},"definition":{"en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart tech   detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"features":{"zh":["安全升级 Expo SDK 版本","处理破坏性变化","更新依赖和配置","支持新 Expo 功能"],"ja":["Expo SDK バージョンの安全なアップグレード","破壊的な変更の処理","依存関係および構成の更新","新しい Expo 機能のサポート"],"ko":["Expo SDK 버전의 안전한 업그레이드","파괴적인 변경의 처리","의존성 및 구성 업데이트","새로운 Expo 기능 지원"],"pt":["Atualização segura do Expo SDK","Lidando com mudanças quebrantes entre versões","Atualização de dependências para compatibilidade","Migração de APIs depreciadas para novas versões","Preparação de aplicativos para novos recursos do Expo"],"ru":["Безопасное обновление Expo SDK","Обработка изменений между версиями","Обновление зависимостей для совместимости","Перенос устаревших API в новые версии","Подготовка приложений к новым возможностям Expo"],"ar":["ترقية إكسبو SDK بأمان","التعامل مع التغييرات التي تسبب مشاكل بين الإصدارات","تحديث التبعيات للتوافق","نقل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المرفوضة إلى إصدارات جديدة","تهيئة التطبيقات لميزات إكسبو الجديدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo SDK 升级","安全升级","破坏性变化","依赖更新","Expo 功能"],"ja":["Expo SDK アップグレード","安全なアップグレード","破壊的な変更","依存関係の更新","Expo 機能"],"ko":["Expo SDK 업그레이드","안전한 업그레이드","파괴적인 변경","의존성 업데이트","Expo 기능"],"pt":["atualização do Expo","Expo SDK","mudanças quebrantes","dependências","APIs depreciadas","novos recursos do Expo"],"ru":["обновление Expo","Expo SDK","изменения","зависимости","устаревшие API","новые возможности Expo"],"ar":["ترقية إكسبو","إكسبو SDK","التغييرات التي تسبب مشاكل","التبعيات","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المرفوضة","ميزات إكسبو الجديدة"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upgrading-expo","description":"Upgrade Expo SDK versions","bodyPreview":"# Upgrading Expo\n\n## Overview\n\nUpgrade Expo SDK versions safely, handling breaking changes, dependencies, and configuration updates.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to upgrade Expo SDK versions.\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Upgrading to a new Expo SDK version\n- Handling breaking changes between SDK versions\n- Updating dependencies for compatibility\n- Migrating deprecated APIs to new versions\n- Preparing apps for new Expo features\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill guides you throug","body":"# Upgrading Expo\n\n## Overview\n\nUpgrade Expo SDK versions safely, handling breaking changes, dependencies, and configuration updates.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to upgrade Expo SDK versions.\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Upgrading to a new Expo SDK version\n- Handling breaking changes between SDK versions\n- Updating dependencies for compatibility\n- Migrating deprecated APIs to new versions\n- Preparing apps for new Expo features\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill guides you through upgrading Expo SDK versions:\n\n1. **Pre-Upgrade Planning**: Review release notes and breaking changes\n2. **Dependency Updates**: Update packages for SDK compatibility\n3. **Configuration Migration**: Update app.json and configuration files\n4. **Code Updates**: Migrate deprecated APIs to new versions\n5. **Testing**: Verify app functionality after upgrade\n\n## Upgrade Process\n\n### 1. Pre-Upgrade Checklist\n\n- Review Expo SDK release notes\n- Identify breaking changes affecting your app\n- Check compatibility of third-party packages\n- Backup current project state\n- Create a feature branch for the upgrade\n\n### 2. Update Expo SDK\n\n```bash\n# Update Expo CLI\nnpm install -g expo-cli@latest\n\n# Upgrade Expo SDK\nnpx expo install expo@latest\n\n# Update all Expo packages\nnpx expo install --fix\n```\n\n### 3. Handle Breaking Changes\n\n- Review migration guides for breaking changes\n- Update deprecated API calls\n- Modify configuration files as needed\n- Update native dependencies if required\n- Test affected features thoroughly\n\n### 4. Update Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Check for outdated packages\nnpx expo-doctor\n\n# Update packages to compatible versions\nnpx expo install --fix\n\n# Verify compatibility\nnpx expo-doctor\n```\n\n### 5. Testing\n\n- Test core app functionality\n- Verify native modules work correctly\n- Check for runtime errors\n- Test on both iOS and Android\n- Verify app store builds still work\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Dependency Conflicts\n\n- Use `expo install` instead of `npm install` for Expo packages\n- Check package compatibility with new SDK version\n- Resolve peer dependency warnings\n\n### Configuration Changes\n\n- Update `app.json` for new SDK requirements\n- Migrate deprecated configuration options\n- Update native configuration files if needed\n\n### Breaking API Changes\n\n- Review API migration guides\n- Update code to use new APIs\n- Test affected features after changes\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always upgrade in a feature branch\n- Test thoroughly before merging\n- Review release notes carefully\n- Update dependencies incrementally\n- Keep Expo CLI updated\n- Use `expo-doctor` to verify setup\n\n## Resources\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/expo/skills/tree/main/plugins/upgrading-expo).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:17:19.757Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Assistants like Claude Code and Cursor needing seamless Expo SDK version upgrades and management.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝升级和管理Expo SDK版本的AI编码助手，如Claude Code和Cursor。","ja":"Claude CodeやCursorのようなExpo SDKバージョンのシームレスなアップグレードと管理が必要なAIコーディングアシスタントに最適。","ko":"Claude Code와 Cursor 같은 Expo SDK 버전의 무결점 업그레이드와 관리가 필요한 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para asistentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code y Cursor que necesitan actualizaciones y administración de versiones de SDK de Expo sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les assistants de codage IA comme Claude Code et Cursor nécessitant des mises à jour et une gestion de version de SDK Expo sans problèmes.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code und Cursor, die eine reibungslose Aktualisierung und Verwaltung von Expo-SDK-Versionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistente de Codificação de IA, como Claude Code e Cursor, que precisam de atualizações e gerenciamento de versão do SDK Expo sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально подходит для помощников кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code и Cursor, которым необходимы бесперебойные обновления и управление версиями SDK Expo.","ar":"مثالي لمساعدي 코딩 الإصدارات مثل Claude Code و Cursor التي تحتاج إلى ترقية وتشغيل إصدار SDK Expo بدون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle breaking changes between Expo SDK versions, update dependencies for compatibility, and migrate deprecated APIs to new versions, ensuring apps are always prepared for the latest Expo features and updates, leveraging smart tech detection and auto-sync from upstream sources.","zh":"赋予代理处理Expo SDK版本之间的破坏性变化、更新依赖项以确保兼容性，并将过时的API迁移到新版本，确保应用程序始终为最新的Expo功能和更新做好准备，利用智能技术检测和从上游源自动同步。","ja":"エージェントがExpo SDKバージョン間の破壊的な変更を処理し、依存関係を更新して互換性を確保し、廃止されたAPIを最新バージョンに移行することを可能にし、スマートテクノロジーの検出と上流ソースからの自動同期を利用して、常に最新のExpo機能と更新に対応できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Expo SDK 버전 간의 破壊적인 변경 사항을 처리하고, 의존성을 업데이트하여 호환성을 보장하며, 사용 중단된 API를 최신 버전으로 마이그레이션할 수 있도록 하여, 스마트 기술 감지 및 업스트림 소스에서 자동 동기화를 활용하여 애플리케이션이 항상 최신 Expo 기능 및 업데이트에 대한 준비를 갖추도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar cambios importantes entre versiones de SDK de Expo, actualizar dependencias para garantizar la compatibilidad y migrar API en desuso a nuevas versiones, asegurando que las aplicaciones estén siempre preparadas para las últimas características y actualizaciones de Expo, aprovechando la detección de tecnología inteligente y la auto-sincronización desde fuentes de origen.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les changements importants entre les versions de SDK Expo, de mettre à jour les dépendances pour assurer la compatibilité et de migrer les API obsolètes vers de nouvelles versions, en s''assurant que les applications soient toujours prêtes pour les dernières fonctionnalités et mises à jour d''Expo, en exploitant la détection de technologie intelligente et la synchronisation automatique à partir de sources en amont.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wichtige Änderungen zwischen Expo-SDK-Versionen zu verwalten, Abhängigkeiten für die Kompatibilität zu aktualisieren und veraltete APIs auf neue Versionen zu migrieren, sodass sichergestellt wird, dass Anwendungen immer für die neuesten Expo-Features und -Updates bereit sind, indem sie intelligente Technikerkennung und Auto-Synchronisierung aus Quellen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com alterações significativas entre as versões do SDK Expo, atualizarem dependências para compatibilidade e migrarem APIs obsoletas para novas versões, garantindo que os aplicativos estejam sempre preparados para os recursos e atualizações mais recentes do Expo, aproveitando a detecção de tecnologia inteligente e a sincronização automática de fontes upstream.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать критические изменения между версиями SDK Expo, обновлять зависимости для обеспечения совместимости и переносить устаревшие API в новые версии, гарантируя, что приложения всегда готовы к последним функциям и обновлениям Expo, используя умную технологию обнаружения и автоматическую синхронизацию из источников upstream.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع التغييرات الكبيرة بين إصدارات SDK Expo، وتحديث التبعيات للتوافق، وترقية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القديمة إلى إصدارات جديدة، مما يضمن أن تكون التطبيقات دائمًا مستعدة لميزات Expo وأحدث التحديثات، مستفيدة من الكشف التقني الذكي والمتزامن تلقائيًا من المصادر الرئيسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Upgrading to the latest Expo SDK version while managing dependencies and configuration updates","Automating the migration of deprecated APIs to their latest versions","Preparing apps for new Expo features by safely handling breaking changes and updates"],"zh":["在管理依赖项和配置更新的同时升级到最新的Expo SDK版本","自动迁移过时的API到其最新版本","通过安全地处理破坏性变化和更新来为新的Expo功能做好应用程序的准备"],"ja":["依存関係と構成の更新を管理しながら最新のExpo SDKバージョンにアップグレードする","廃止されたAPIを自動的に最新バージョンに移行する","破壊的な変更と更新を安全に処理することで、新しいExpo機能に対応するためのアプリケーションの準備"],"ko":["의존성 및 구성 업데이트를 관리하면서 최신 Expo SDK 버전으로 업그레이드","사용 중단된 API를 자동으로 최신 버전으로 마이그레이션","파괴적인 변경 및 업데이트를 안전하게 처리하여 새로운 Expo 기능에 대한 애플리케이션 준비"],"es":["Actualización a la última versión de SDK de Expo mientras se gestionan las dependencias y las actualizaciones de configuración","Automatización de la migración de API en desuso a sus últimas versiones","Preparación de aplicaciones para nuevas características de Expo mediante el manejo seguro de cambios importantes y actualizaciones"],"fr":["Mise à jour vers la dernière version de SDK Expo tout en gérant les dépendances et les mises à jour de configuration","Automatisation de la migration des API obsolètes vers leurs dernières versions","Préparation des applications pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités d''Expo en gérant de manière sécurisée les changements importants et les mises à jour"],"de":["Aktualisierung auf die neueste Expo-SDK-Version unter Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten und Konfigurationsupdates","Automatisierung der Migration veralteter APIs auf ihre neuesten Versionen","Vorbereitung von Anwendungen auf neue Expo-Features durch sichere Verwaltung wichtiger Änderungen und Updates"],"pt":["Atualizar para a versão mais recente do SDK Expo, gerenciando dependências e atualizações de configuração","Automatizar a migração de APIs obsoletas para suas versões mais recentes","Preparar aplicativos para novos recursos do Expo, lidando com alterações significativas e atualizações de forma segura"],"ru":["Обновление до последней версии SDK Expo, управление зависимостями и обновлениями конфигурации","Автоматизация миграции устаревших API в их последние версии","Подготовка приложений к новым функциям Expo, безопасное xử lý критических изменений и обновлений"],"ar":["ترقية إلى أحدث إصدار من SDK Expo، وإدارة التبعيات وتحديثات التهيئة","تأتميم ترقية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القديمة إلى إصداراتها الأخيرة","إعداد التطبيقات لميزات Expo الجديدة، التعامل مع التغييرات الكبيرة والتحديثات بأمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo SDK installation and configuration","Dependent on upstream sources for auto-sync functionality"],"zh":["需要Expo SDK的安装和配置","依赖于上游源以实现自动同步功能"],"ja":["Expo SDKのインストールと構成が必要","自動同期機能を実現するために上流ソースに依存"],"ko":["Expo SDK 설치 및 구성이 필요","자동 동기화 기능을 구현하기 위해 업스트림 소스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de SDK de Expo","Dependiente de fuentes de origen para la funcionalidad de auto-sincronización"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de SDK Expo","Dépendante des sources en amont pour la fonctionnalité de synchronisation automatique"],"de":["Benötigt Installation und Konfiguration von Expo-SDK","Abhängig von Quellen für die Auto-Synchronisierungsfunktion"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do SDK Expo","Depende de fontes upstream para funcionalidade de auto-sincronização"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации SDK Expo","Зависит от источников upstream для функциональности автоматической синхронизации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين SDK Expo","يعتمد على المصادر الرئيسية للوظيفة المتزامنة تلقائيًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
