pt : Améliorez vos Systèmes","de":"Prompt-Engineering: Optimieren Sie Ihre Systeme","pt":"Engenharia de Prompt: Otimização de Sistemas de Codificação","ru":"Инженерия Промпта: Оптимизация Систем Кодирования","ar":"هندسة العرض: تحسين أنظمة الترميز","en":"prompt-engineering"},"description":{"zh":"Prompt Engineering 是一种通过结构化系统提示来优化代码审查和开发流程的技术","ja":"プロンプトエンジニアリングは、構造化システムプロンプトを使用してコードレビューと開発プロセスを最適化する技術です","ko":"프롬프트 엔지니어링은 구조화된 시스템 프롬프트를 사용하여 코드 리뷰와 개발 프로세스를 최적화하는 기술입니다","es":"La ingeniería de prompt es una técnica que ayuda a mejorar la seguridad, el rendimiento y la mantenibilidad de los sistemas. Nuestro plugin Claude Code ofrec...","fr":"L''ingénierie de prompt est une technique qui aide à améliorer la sécurité, les performances et la maintenabilité des systèmes. Notre plugin Claude Code offre...","de":"Die Prompt-Engineering ist eine Technik, die dabei hilft, die Sicherheit, Leistung und Wartbarkeit von Systemen zu verbessern. Unser Claude-Code-Plugin biete...","pt":"A engenharia de prompt é uma técnica para otimizar sistemas de codificação, garantindo a correção, segurança e desempenho do código","ru":"Инженерия промпта - это техника для оптимизации систем кодирования, обеспечивающая правильность, безопасность и производительность кода","ar":"هندسة العرض هي تقنية لتحسين أنظمة الترميز، مما يضمن دقة وأمان واداء الكود","en":"Production-ready Claude Code plugin: 195 agents, 854 skills, 359 commands, 38 rules, 22 hooks"},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready Claude Code plugin: 195 agents, 854 skills, 359 commands, 38 rules, 22 hooks"},"features":{"zh":["结构化系统提示","代码审查优化","开发流程改进","安全性和性能检查","维护性和可测试性改进"],"ja":["構造化システムプロンプト","コードレビューの最適化","開発プロセスの改善","セキュリティとパフォーマンスのチェック","メンテナンス性とテスト性の改善"],"ko":["구조화된 시스템 프롬프트","코드 리뷰 최적화","개발 프로세스 개선","보안과 성능 체크","유지 보수성과 테스트 가능성 개선"],"es":["Análisis de código para detectar errores de lógica y seguridad","Optimización del rendimiento para reducir la complejidad y mejorar la eficiencia","Mejora de la mantenibilidad mediante la simplificación del código y la reducción de la complejidad","Integración con Claude Code para ofrecer 195 agentes y 854 habilidades","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación y frameworks"],"fr":["Analyse de code pour détecter les erreurs de logique et de sécurité","Optimisation des performances pour réduire la complexité et améliorer l''efficacité","Amélioration de la maintenabilité en simplifiant le code et en réduisant la complexité","Intégration avec Claude Code pour offrir 195 agents et 854 compétences","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation et frameworks"],"de":["Code-Analyse zur Erkennung von Logik- und Sicherheitsfehlern","Leistungsoptimierung zur Reduzierung der Komplexität und Verbesserung der Effizienz","Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit durch Vereinfachung des Codes und Reduzierung der Komplexität","Integration mit Claude Code, um 195 Agenten und 854 Fähigkeiten anzubieten","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen und Frameworks"],"pt":["Análise de correção de código","Verificação de segurança","Otimização de desempenho","Melhoria da manutenção","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Анализ правильности кода","Проверка безопасности","Оптимизация производительности","Улучшение обслуживания","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["تحليل دقة الكود","فحص الأمان","تحسين الأداء","تحسين الصيانة","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prompt Engineering","代码审查","开发流程","结构化系统提示","安全性","性能","维护性","可测试性"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニアリング","コードレビュー","開発プロセス","構造化システムプロンプト","セキュリティ","パフォーマンス","メンテナンス性","テスト性"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어링","코드 리뷰","개발 프로세스","구조화된 시스템 프롬프트","보안","성능","유지 보수성","테스트 가능성"],"es":["ingeniería de prompt","optimización de sistemas","seguridad de código","rendimiento de sistemas","mantenibilidad de software","análisis de código","diseño de sistemas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["ingénierie de prompt","optimisation de systèmes","sécurité de code","performances de systèmes","maintenabilité de logiciels","analyse de code","conception de systèmes","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Prompt-Engineering","Systemoptimierung","Code-Sicherheit","Systemleistung","Software-Wartbarkeit","Code-Analyse","Systemdesign","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["engenharia de prompt","otimização de código","segurança de código","desempenho de código","manutenção de código","Claude Code"],"ru":["инженерия промпта","оптимизация кода","безопасность кода","производительность кода","обслуживание кода","Claude Code"],"ar":["هندسة العرض","تحسين الكود","أمان الكود","أداء الكود","صيانة الكود","Claude Code"]}},"owner":"haniakrim21","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"haniakrim21/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.455Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineering","description":"Prompt engineering patterns including structured prompts, chain-of-thought, few-shot learning, and system prompt design","bodyPreview":"# Prompt Engineering\n\n## Structured System Prompt\n\n```\nYou are a senior code reviewer. Your role is to analyze pull requests for:\n1. Correctness - logic errors, edge cases, off-by-one errors\n2. Security - injection, authentication, data exposure\n3. Performance - N+1 queries, unnecessary allocations, missing indexes\n4. Maintainability - naming, complexity, test coverage\n\nFor each issue found, respond with:\n- Severity: critical | warning | suggestion\n- File and line reference\n- What is wrong\n- How","body":"# Prompt Engineering\n\n## Structured System Prompt\n\n```\nYou are a senior code reviewer. Your role is to analyze pull requests for:\n1. Correctness - logic errors, edge cases, off-by-one errors\n2. Security - injection, authentication, data exposure\n3. Performance - N+1 queries, unnecessary allocations, missing indexes\n4. Maintainability - naming, complexity, test coverage\n\nFor each issue found, respond with:\n- Severity: critical | warning | suggestion\n- File and line reference\n- What is wrong\n- How to fix it (with code snippet)\n\nIf the code is well-written, say so briefly. Do not invent problems.\n```\n\nStructure system prompts with role, scope, output format, and constraints. Be explicit about what the model should NOT do.\n\n## Chain-of-Thought\n\n```\nAnalyze this database query for performance issues.\n\nThink step by step:\n1. Identify the tables and joins involved\n2. Check if appropriate indexes exist for the WHERE and JOIN conditions\n3. Look for full table scans or cartesian products\n4. Estimate the row count at each step\n5. Suggest specific index creation or query restructuring\n\nQuery:\nSELECT o.*, u.name, p.title\nFROM orders o\nJOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.id\nJOIN products p ON o.product_id = p.id\nWHERE o.created_at > ''2024-01-01''\nAND u.country = ''US''\nORDER BY o.created_at DESC\nLIMIT 50;\n```\n\nChain-of-thought prompting improves accuracy on reasoning tasks by forcing the model to show intermediate steps.\n\n## Few-Shot Examples\n\n```\nConvert natural language to SQL. Follow these examples:\n\nInput: \"How many orders were placed last month?\"\nOutput: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE created_at >= DATE_TRUNC(''month'', CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL ''1 month'') AND created_at < DATE_TRUNC(''month'', CURRENT_DATE);\n\nInput: \"Top 5 customers by total spending\"\nOutput: SELECT customer_id, SUM(total_amount) AS total_spent FROM orders GROUP BY customer_id ORDER BY total_spent DESC LIMIT 5;\n\nInput: \"Products that have never been ordered\"\nOutput: SELECT p.* FROM products p LEFT JOIN order_items oi ON p.id = oi.product_id WHERE oi.id IS NULL;\n\nNow convert:\nInput: \"Average order value per country for the last quarter\"\n```\n\nProvide 3-5 diverse examples that demonstrate the expected format and edge cases.\n\n## Tool Use / Function Calling\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tools\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"search_codebase\",\n      \"description\": \"Search for code patterns across the repository. Use when you need to find implementations, usages, or definitions.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"query\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Regex pattern or keyword to search for\"\n          },\n          \"file_type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"File extension filter (e.g., ''ts'', ''py'')\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"query\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nWrite tool descriptions that explain WHEN to use the tool, not just what it does.\n\n## Prompt Template Pattern\n\n```python\ndef build_review_prompt(diff: str, context: str, rules: list[str]) -> str:\n    rules_text = \"\\n\".join(f\"- {rule}\" for rule in rules)\n\n    return f\"\"\"Review this code diff against the following rules:\n{rules_text}\n\nContext about the codebase:\n{context}\n\nDiff to review:\n```\n{diff}\n```\n\nRespond with a JSON array of findings. If no issues, return an empty array.\nEach finding: {{\"severity\": \"critical|warning|info\", \"line\": number, \"message\": \"string\", \"suggestion\": \"string\"}}\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Vague instructions like \"be helpful\" or \"do your best\"\n- Asking the model to \"be creative\" when you need deterministic output\n- Not specifying output format (JSON, markdown, plain text)\n- Stuffing too many unrelated tasks into a single prompt\n- Using negations (\"don''t do X\") without saying what to do instead\n- Not testing prompts with adversarial or edge-case inputs\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] System prompt defines role, scope, format, and constraints\n- [ ] Chain-of-thought used for multi-step reasoning tasks\n- [ ] Few-shot examples cover typical and edge cases\n- [ ] Output format explicitly specified (JSON schema, markdown, etc.)\n- [ ] Tool descriptions explain when and why to use each tool\n- [ ] Prompts tested with adversarial inputs\n- [ ] Temperature and top_p set appropriately for the task\n- [ ] Prompt templates are parameterized, not hardcoded strings\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:18:08.423Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced pull request analysis for correctness, security, performance, and maintainability.","zh":"非常适合需要高级拉取请求分析以确保正确性、安全性、性能和可维护性的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが正確性、セキュリティ、パフォーマンス、メンテナンス性のための高度なプルリクエスト分析を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 올바름, 보안, 성능 및 유지 보수성을 위한 고급 プル リクエスト 분석이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan un análisis avanzado de solicitudes de incorporación para corrección, seguridad, rendimiento y mantenibilidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une analyse avancée des demandes d''intégration pour la correction, la sécurité, les performances et la maintenabilité.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Analyse von Pull-Requests für Korrektheit, Sicherheit, Leistung und Wartbarkeit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise avançada de solicitações de pull para correção, segurança, desempenho e manutenibilidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, которым требуется продвинутый анализ запросов на включение для правильности, безопасности, производительности и поддерживаемости.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لطلبات السحب من أجل الصحة والأمان والأداء والصيانة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze pull requests for logic errors, security vulnerabilities, and performance issues, providing detailed feedback with severity levels, file and line references, and step-by-step improvement guidance using injection, authentication, and data exposure protocols.","zh":"赋予代理分析拉取请求以发现逻辑错误、安全漏洞和性能问题，并提供详细的反馈，包括严重性级别、文件和行引用，以及使用注入、身份验证和数据暴露协议的分步改进指导。","ja":"エージェントにプルリクエストを分析して論理エラー、セキュリティ脆弱性、パフォーマンスの問題を発見し、詳細なフィードバックを提供することを可能にします。フィードバックには、重大度レベル、ファイルと行の参照、およびインジェクション、認証、データ公開プロトコルの使用によるステップバイステップの改善ガイダンスが含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 논리적 오류, 보안 취약점 및 성능 문제를 발견하기 위해 プル リクエスト를 분석하고, 심각도 수준, 파일 및 행 참조 및 주입, 인증 및 데이터 노출 프로토콜을 사용한 단계별 개선 지침을 포함하는詳細한 피드백을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar solicitudes de incorporación para errores de lógica, vulnerabilidades de seguridad y problemas de rendimiento, proporcionando comentarios detallados con niveles de gravedad, referencias de archivo y línea, y orientación de mejora paso a paso utilizando protocolos de inyección, autenticación y exposición de datos.","fr":"Habilite les agents à analyser les demandes d''intégration pour les erreurs de logique, les vulnérabilités de sécurité et les problèmes de performances, en fournissant des commentaires détaillés avec des niveaux de gravité, des références de fichier et de ligne, et des conseils d''amélioration étape par étape en utilisant des protocoles d''injection, d''authentification et d''exposition de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Pull-Requests auf Logikfehler, Sicherheitslücken und Leistungsprobleme zu analysieren und detaillierte Feedback mit Schweregraden, Datei- und Zeilenreferenzen sowie schrittweise Verbesserungshinweise unter Verwendung von Injektions-, Authentifizierungs- und Datenausstellungsprotokollen bereitzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar solicitações de pull para erros de lógica, vulnerabilidades de segurança e problemas de desempenho, fornecendo feedback detalhado com níveis de gravidade, referências de arquivo e linha e orientação de melhoria passo a passo usando protocolos de injeção, autenticação e exposição de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать запросы на включение для логических ошибок, уязвимостей безопасности и проблем производительности, предоставляя подробную обратную связь с уровнями серьезности, ссылками на файлы и строки, а также пошаговое руководство по улучшению с использованием протоколов инъекции, аутентификации и раскрытия данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحليل طلبات السحب من أجل الأخطاء الموجودة في المنطق والثغرات الأمنية ومشاكل الأداء، وتقديم تعليقات مفصلة مع مستويات الخطورة وإشارات الملف والسطر وتوجيه تحسين خطوة بخطوة باستخدام بروتوكولات الحقن والتحقق والكشف عن البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing pull requests for correctness and security","Identifying performance bottlenecks in code","Generating detailed feedback for code maintainability and test coverage"],"zh":["分析拉取请求的正确性和安全性","在代码中识别性能瓶颈","为代码的可维护性和测试覆盖范围生成详细的反馈"],"ja":["正確性とセキュリティのプルリクエストを分析する","コード内でパフォーマンスのボトルネックを特定する","コードのメンテナンス性とテストカバレッジの詳細なフィードバックを生成する"],"ko":["올바름과 보안을 위한 プル リクエスト 분석","코드에서 성능 병목 현상을 식별","코드 유지 보수 및 테스트 커버리지에 대한詳細한 피드백 생성"],"es":["Analizar solicitudes de incorporación para corrección y seguridad","Identificar cuellos de botella de rendimiento en el código","Generar comentarios detallados para la mantenibilidad y la cobertura de pruebas del código"],"fr":["Analyser les demandes d''intégration pour la correction et la sécurité","Identifier les goulets d''étranglement des performances dans le code","Générer des commentaires détaillés pour la maintenabilité et la couverture de tests du code"],"de":["Pull-Requests auf Korrektheit und Sicherheit analysieren","Leistungsengpässe im Code identifizieren","Detaillierte Feedback für die Wartbarkeit und Testabdeckung des Codes generieren"],"pt":["Analisar solicitações de pull para correção e segurança","Identificar gargalos de desempenho no código","Gerar feedback detalhado para manutenibilidade e cobertura de teste"],"ru":["Анализировать запросы на включение для правильности и безопасности","Определять узкие места производительности в коде","Генерировать подробную обратную связь для поддерживаемости и тестового покрытия"],"ar":["تحليل طلبات السحب من أجل الصحة والأمان","تحديد العوائق في الأداء في الكود","توليد تعليقات مفصلة للصيانة وغطاء الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Limited to analyzing pull requests for specific programming languages and frameworks"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限于分析特定编程语言和框架的拉取请求"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","特定