s Frontend para Backend","ru":"Требования Frontend для Backend","ar":"متطلبات واجهة المستخدم للخادم الخلفي","en":"frontend-to-backend-requirements"},"description":{"zh":"前端开发人员可以使用此模式记录后端数据需求，简化开发流程","ja":"フロントエンド開発者はこのモードを使用してバックエンドのデータ要件を文書化し、開発プロセスを簡素化する","ko":"프론트엔드 개발자는 이 모드를 사용하여 백엔드 데이터 요구 사항을 문서화하고 개발 프로세스를 단순화할 수 있습니다","es":"El modo de requisitos de backend permite a los desarrolladores de frontend documentar las necesidades de datos sin especificar detalles de implementación","fr":"Le mode d''exigences de backend permet aux développeurs de frontend de documenter les besoins de données sans spécifier les détails d''implémentation","de":"Der Backend-Anforderungsmodus ermöglicht es Frontend-Entwicklern, Datenanforderungen zu dokumentieren, ohne Implementierungsdetails anzugeben","pt":"O modo de requisitos de backend permite que desenvolvedores frontend documentem necessidades de dados de forma eficaz.","ru":"Режим требований бэкенда позволяет фронтенд-разработчикам документировать потребности в данных эффективно.","ar":"الوضع المتعلق بمتطلبات الخادم الخلفي يسمح لمطوري واجهة المستخدم بتوثيق احتياجات البيانات بفعالية.","en":"A curated collection of skills for AI coding agents. Skills are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities across development, document..."},"definition":{"en":"A curated collection of skills for AI coding agents. Skills are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities across development, documentation, planning, and professional workflows."},"features":{"zh":["记录前端数据需求","简化开发流程","提高团队合作效率","减少后端实现细节","提高代码质量"],"ja":["フロントエンドのデータ要件を文書化","開発プロセスを簡素化","チームコラボレーションの効率を向上","バックエンドの実装詳細を減らす","コード品質を向上"],"ko":["프론트엔드 데이터 요구 사항을 문서화","개발 프로세스를 단순화","팀 협업 효율을 향상","백엔드 구현 세부 사항을 줄임","코드 품질을 향상"],"es":["Documentación de necesidades de datos de frontend","Comunicación de requisitos sin detalles de implementación","Flexibilidad para el equipo de backend","Mejora de la colaboración entre equipos","Automatización de la documentación de requisitos"],"fr":["Documentation des besoins de données de frontend","Communication des exigences sans détails d''implémentation","Flexibilité pour l''équipe de backend","Amélioration de la collaboration entre les équipes","Automatisation de la documentation des exigences"],"de":["Dokumentation von Datenanforderungen von Frontend","Kommunikation von Anforderungen ohne Implementierungsdetails","Flexibilität für das Backend-Team","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit zwischen den Teams","Automatisierung der Dokumentation von Anforderungen"],"pt":["Documentação de necessidades de dados","Comunicação eficaz com a equipe de backend","Definição clara de requisitos","Flexibilidade na implementação","Melhoria na colaboração entre equipes"],"ru":["Документирование потребностей в данных","Эффективное общение с командой бэкенда","Ясное определение требований","Гибкость в реализации","Улучшение сотрудничества между командами"],"ar":["توثيق احتياجات البيانات","التواصل الفعال مع فريق الخادم الخلفي","التعريف الواضح للمتطلبات","المرونة في التنفيذ","تحسين التعاون بين الفرق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发","后端开发","数据需求","开发流程","团队合作","代码质量","技术文档","软件开发"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発","バックエンド開発","データ要件","開発プロセス","チームコラボレーション","コード品質","テクニカルドキュメント","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발","백엔드 개발","데이터 요구 사항","개발 프로세스","팀 협업","코드 품질","기술 문서","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["requisitos de backend","desarrollo de frontend","comunicación de datos","colaboración entre equipos","automatización de documentación","agentes de codificación de IA"],"fr":["exigences de backend","développement de frontend","communication de données","collaboration entre les équipes","automatisation de la documentation","agents de codage de l''IA"],"de":["Anforderungen von Backend","Entwicklung von Frontend","Kommunikation von Daten","Zusammenarbeit zwischen den Teams","Automatisierung der Dokumentation","IA-Coding-Agenten"],"pt":["requisitos de backend","desenvolvimento frontend","comunicação de dados","documentação de requisitos","colaboração entre equipes","implementação de backend"],"ru":["требования бэкенда","фронтенд-разработка","общение данных","документирование требований","сотрудничество между командами","реализация бэкенда"],"ar":["متطلبات الخادم الخلفي","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","تواصل البيانات","توثيق المتطلبات","تعاون بين الفرق","تنفيذ الخادم الخلفي"]}},"owner":"softaworks","repo":"agent-toolkit","repoPath":"softaworks/agent-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":"Document frontend data needs for backend developers. Use when frontend needs to communicate API requirements to backend, or user says backend requirements, what data do I need, API requirements, or is describing data needs for a UI.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to re","body":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to render this screen?\n- What actions should the user be able to perform?\n- What business rules affect the UI?\n- What states and errors should I handle?\n\n**You''re requesting, not demanding.** Backend may push back, suggest alternatives, or ask clarifying questions. That''s healthy collaboration.\n\n---\n\n## What You Own vs. What Backend Owns\n\n| Frontend Owns | Backend Owns |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| What data is needed | How data is structured |\n| What actions exist | Endpoint design |\n| UI states to handle | Field names, types |\n| User-facing validation | API conventions |\n| Display requirements | Performance/caching |\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Describe the Feature\n\nBefore listing requirements:\n\n1. **What is this?** — Screen, flow, component\n2. **Who uses it?** — User type, permissions\n3. **What''s the goal?** — What does success look like?\n\n### Step 2: List Data Needs\n\nFor each screen/component, describe:\n\n**Data I need to display:**\n- What information appears on screen?\n- What''s the relationship between pieces?\n- What determines visibility/state?\n\n**Actions user can perform:**\n- What can the user do?\n- What''s the expected outcome?\n- What feedback should they see?\n\n**States I need to handle:**\n- Loading, empty, error, success\n- Edge cases (partial data, expired, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Surface Uncertainties\n\nList what you''re unsure about:\n- Business rules you don''t fully understand\n- Edge cases you''re not sure how to handle\n- Places where you''re guessing\n\n**These invite backend to clarify or push back.**\n\n### Step 4: Leave Room for Discussion\n\nEnd with open questions:\n- \"Would it make sense to...?\"\n- \"Should I expect...?\"\n- \"Is there a simpler way to...?\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nCreate `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Backend Requirements: <Feature Name>\n\n## Context\n[What we''re building, who it''s for, what problem it solves]\n\n## Screens/Components\n\n### <Screen/Component Name>\n**Purpose**: What this screen does\n\n**Data I need to display**:\n- [Description of data piece, not field name]\n- [Another piece]\n- [Relationships between pieces]\n\n**Actions**:\n- [Action description] → [Expected outcome]\n- [Another action] → [Expected outcome]\n\n**States to handle**:\n- **Empty**: [When/why this happens]\n- **Loading**: [What''s being fetched]\n- **Error**: [What can go wrong, what user sees]\n- **Special**: [Any edge cases]\n\n**Business rules affecting UI**:\n- [Rule that changes what''s visible/enabled]\n- [Permissions that affect actions]\n\n### <Next Screen/Component>\n...\n\n## Uncertainties\n- [ ] Not sure if [X] should show when [Y]\n- [ ] Don''t understand the business rule for [Z]\n- [ ] Guessing that [A] means [B]\n\n## Questions for Backend\n- Would it make sense to combine [X] and [Y]?\n- Should I expect [Z] to always be present?\n- Is there existing data I can reuse for [W]?\n\n## Discussion Log\n[Backend responses, decisions made, changes to requirements]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Good vs. Bad Requests\n\n### Bad (Dictating Implementation)\n> \"I need a GET /api/contracts endpoint that returns an array with fields: id, title, status, created_at\"\n\n### Good (Describing Needs)\n> \"I need to show a list of contracts. Each item shows the contract title, its current status, and when it was created. User should be able to filter by status.\"\n\n### Bad (Assuming Structure)\n> \"The provider object should be nested inside the contract response\"\n\n### Good (Describing Relationship)\n> \"For each contract, I need to show who the provider is (their name and maybe logo)\"\n\n### Bad (No Context)\n> \"I need contract data\"\n\n### Good (With Context)\n> \"On the dashboard, there''s a ''Recent Contracts'' widget showing the 5 most recent contracts. User clicks one to go to detail page.\"\n\n---\n\n## Encouraging Pushback\n\nInclude these prompts in your requirements:\n\n- \"Let me know if this doesn''t make sense for how the data is structured\"\n- \"Open to suggestions on a better approach\"\n- \"Not sure if this is the right way to think about it\"\n- \"Push back if this complicates things unnecessarily\"\n\n**Good collaboration = frontend describes the problem, backend proposes the solution.**\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NO IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS**—don''t specify endpoints, methods, field names\n- **DESCRIBE, DON''T PRESCRIBE**—say what you need, not how to provide it\n- **INCLUDE CONTEXT**—why you need it helps backend make better choices\n- **SURFACE UNKNOWNS**—don''t hide confusion, invite clarification\n- **INVITE PUSHBACK**—explicitly ask for backend''s input\n- **UPDATE THE DOC**—add backend responses to Discussion Log\n- **STAY HUMBLE**—you''re asking, not demanding\n\n---\n\n## After Backend Responds\n\nUpdate the requirements doc:\n1. Add responses to Discussion Log\n2. Adjust requirements based on feedback\n3. Mark resolved uncertainties\n4. Note any decisions made\n\nThe doc becomes the source of truth for what was agreed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:18:49.240Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing streamlined frontend-to-backend communication and requirements documentation.","zh":"非常适合需要简化前端到后端通信和需求文档的全栈代理","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがフロントエンドからバックエンドへの通信と要件の文書化を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"전체 스택 에이전트가 프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지의 통신과 요구 사항 문서를 간소화하는 데 필요한 경우에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan una comunicación de frontend a backend simplificada y documentación de requisitos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''une communication de frontend à backend simplifiée et de documentation de exigences.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Kommunikation von Frontend zu Backend und eine Anforderungsdokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de comunicação simplificada do frontend para o backend e documentação de requisitos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется упрощенная связь между frontend и backend, а также документация требований.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تواصل مبسط من جانب الواجهة إلى جانب الخلفية وتوثيق المتطلبات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to effectively communicate data needs using Markdown files, specifically generating backend requirements in `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` format, without delving into implementation details such as endpoints or API structure.","zh":"使代理能够使用Markdown文件有效地传达数据需求，特别是生成后端需求文档，格式为`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`，而无需深入实现细节，如端点或API结构","ja":"エージェントがMarkdownファイルを使用してデータの必要性を効果的に伝えることができるようにし、特に`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`形式のバックエンドの要件を生成することができ、エンドポイントやAPI構造などの実装の詳細には触れません","ko":"에이전트가 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 데이터 요구 사항을 효과적으로 전달할 수 있도록 하며, 특히 `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` 형식의 백엔드 요구 사항을 생성하는 동안 구현 세부 정보인 엔드ポイント 또는 API 구조와 같은 사항에 대한 자세한 정보는 제공하지 않음","es":"Permite a los agentes comunicar de manera efectiva las necesidades de datos utilizando archivos Markdown, generando específicamente requisitos de backend en formato `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, sin profundizar en detalles de implementación como puntos de conexión o estructura de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de communiquer de manière efficace les besoins de données en utilisant des fichiers Markdown, en générant spécifiquement des exigences de backend au format `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, sans s''engager dans les détails d''implémentation tels que les points de terminaison ou la structure de l''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Datenanforderungen effektiv mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien zu kommunizieren, indem speziell Backend-Anforderungen im Format `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` generiert werden, ohne sich mit Implementierungsdetails wie Endpunkten oder API-Struktur auseinanderzusetzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes comuniquem efetivamente as necessidades de dados usando arquivos Markdown, gerando especificações de requisitos de backend no formato `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, sem se aprofundar em detalhes de implementação, como pontos de extremidade ou estrutura de API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно общаться потребности в данных с помощью файлов Markdown, генерируя спецификации требований к backend в формате `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, не вдаваясь в детали реализации, такие как конечные точки или структура API.","ar":"يمكن للعاملين التواصل بفعالية مع احتياجات البيانات باستخدام ملفات Markdown، وإنشاء مواصفات متطلبات الخلفية بناءً على تنسيق `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`، دون الخوض في تفاصيل التنفيذ مثل نقاط النهاية أو هيكل واجهة البرمجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting frontend data requirements","Generating backend requirements documents","Streamlining frontend-to-backend communication"],"zh":["记录前端数据要求","生成后端需求文档","简化前端到后端的通信"],"ja":["フロントエンドのデータ要件のドキュメント化","バックエンドの要件文書の生成","フロントエンドからバックエンドへの通信の簡素化"],"ko":["프론트엔드 데이터 요구 사항 문서화","백엔드 요구 사항 문서 생성","프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지의 통신을 간소화"],"es":["Documentar los requisitos de datos de frontend","Generar documentos de requisitos de backend","Simplificar la comunicación de frontend a backend"],"fr":["Documenter les exigences de données de frontend","Générer des documents d''exigences de backend","Simplifier la communication de frontend à backend"],"de":["Dokumentation der Datenanforderungen von Frontend","Generierung von Backend-Anforderungsdokumenten","Vereinfachung der Kommunikation von Frontend zu Backend"],"pt":["Documentação de requisitos de dados do frontend","Geração de documentos de requisitos de backend","Simplificação da comunicação do frontend para o backend"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным frontend","Генерация документов требований к backend","Упрощение связи между frontend и backend"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات بيانات جانب الواجهة","إنشاء مستندات لطلبات جانب الخلفية","تبسيط التواصل بين جانب الواجهة وجانب الخلفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["No implementation details allowed","Output limited to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files","Backend implementation specifics are not included"],"zh":["不允许包含实现细节","输出仅限于`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`文件","后端实现的具体细节不包括"],"ja":["実装の詳細を含めることはできない","出力は`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`ファイルに限定される","バックエンドの実装の具体的な詳細は含まれない"],"ko":["구현 세부 정보를 포함할 수 없음","출력은 `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` 파일로 제한됨","백엔드 구현의 세부 사항은 포함되지 않음"],"es":["No se permiten detalles de implementación","Salida limitada a archivos `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Los detalles específicos de la implementación de backend no están incluidos"],"fr":["Aucun détail d''implémentation n''est autorisé","Sortie limitée aux fichiers `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Les détails spécifiques de l''implémentation de backend ne sont pas inclus"],"de":["Implementierungsdetails sind nicht erlaubt","Ausgabe beschränkt auf Dateien im Format `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Backend-Implementierungsdetails sind nicht enthalten"],"pt":["Não são permitidos detalhes de implementação","Saída limitada a arquivos `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Detalhes específicos da implementação do backend não estão incluídos"],"ru":["Не допускаются детали реализации","Выходные данные ограничены файлами `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","Конкретные детали реализации backend не включены"],"ar":["لا يسمح بالتفاصيل التنفيذية","الخرج مقيد بملفات `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`","ال细يات المحددة لتنفيذ الخلفية غير مدرجة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
