,"en":"handoff"},"description":{"zh":"Claude 会话交接技能是一组自定义技能，用于创建结构化文档以实现会话间的无缝连续性。该技能可用于会话结束、暂停或切换项目时","ja":"Claude セッションハンドオフスキルは、セッション間のシームレスな継続性を実現する構造化ドキュメントを作成するためのカスタムスキルセットです。このスキルは、セッションの終了、暂停、またはプロジェクトの切り替え時に使用できます","ko":"Claude 세션 핸드오프 기술은 세션 간의 무결점 연속성을 구현하는 구조화된 문서를 생성하는 사용자 정의 기술 집합입니다. 이 기술은 세션 종료, 일시 중지 또는 프로젝트 전환 시 사용할 수 있습니다","es":"El Skill Handoff de Claude permite crear documentos estructurados para garantizar la continuidad de las sesiones. Aprende a utilizarlo.","fr":"Le Skill Handoff de Claude permet de créer des documents structurés pour assurer la continuité des sessions. Découvrez comment l''utiliser.","de":"Der Handoff-Skill von Claude ermöglicht die Erstellung strukturierter Dokumente für eine nahtlose Fortsetzung von Sitzungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn nutzen...","pt":"A habilidade Handoff em Claude permite criar documentos estruturados para continuidade de sessão","ru":"Навык Handoff в Claude позволяет создавать структурированные документы для передачи сессии","ar":"مهارة هاندوف في كلود تمكن من إنشاء مستندات منظمّة لاستمرارية الجلسة","en":"A collection of custom skills that extend Claude''s capabilities with specialized workflows, methods, and domain knowledge."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of custom skills that extend Claude''s capabilities with specialized workflows, methods, and domain knowledge."},"features":{"zh":["创建结构化文档","实现会话间的无缝连续性","支持会话结束、暂停或切换项目时的使用","快速评估会话状态","支持多种会话阶段（探索、规划、实现、调试、审查）"],"ja":["構造化ドキュメントの作成","セッション間のシームレスな継続性の実現","セッションの終了、暂停、またはプロジェクトの切り替え時の使用をサポート","セッション状態の迅速な評価","多種のセッション段階（探索、計画、実装、デバッグ、レビュー）をサポート"],"ko":["구조화된 문서 생성","세션 간의 무결점 연속성 구현","세션 종료, 일시 중지 또는 프로젝트 전환 시 사용 지원","세션 상태의 빠른 평가","다양한 세션 단계（탐색, 계획, 구현, 디버깅, 검토）지원"],"es":["Creación de documentos estructurados","Continuidad de sesiones","Flujos de trabajo especializados","Métodos y conocimientos de dominio personalizados","Asesamiento de estado de sesión"],"fr":["Création de documents structurés","Continuité de sessions","Flux de travail spécialisés","Méthodes et connaissances de domaine personnalisées","Évaluation de l''état de session"],"de":["Erstellung strukturierter Dokumente","Nahtlose Fortsetzung von Sitzungen","Spezialisierte Workflows","Benutzerdefinierte Methoden und Domänenwissen","Sitzungsstatusbewertung"],"pt":["Criação de documentos estruturados","Continuidade de sessão","Avaliação rápida do estado da sessão","Capacidade de capturar estado para futuras sessões","Integração com workflows e métodos especializados"],"ru":["Создание структурированных документов","Передача сессии","Быстрая оценка состояния сессии","Возможность захватить состояние для будущих сессий","Интеграция с специализированными рабочими процессами и методами"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات منظمّة","استمرارية الجلسة","التقييم السريع لحالة الجلسة","القدرة على 捕获 حالة لمستقبل الجلسة","التكامل مع عمليات العمل والأساليب المتخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude 会话交接技能","结构化文档","会话间的无缝连续性","会话结束","暂停","切换项目","快速评估会话状态"],"ja":["Claude セッションハンドオフスキル","構造化ドキュメント","セッション間のシームレスな継続性","セッションの終了","暂停","プロジェクトの切り替え","セッション状態の迅速な評価"],"ko":["Claude 세션 핸드오프 기술","구조화된 문서","세션 간의 무결점 연속성","세션 종료","일시 중지","프로젝트 전환","세션 상태의 빠른 평가"],"es":["Handoff","Continuidad de sesiones","Documentos estructurados","Flujos de trabajo especializados","Desarrollo de software","Inteligencia artificial","Claude"],"fr":["Handoff","Continuité de sessions","Documents structurés","Flux de travail spécialisés","Développement de logiciels","Intelligence artificielle","Claude"],"de":["Handoff","Nahtlose Fortsetzung von Sitzungen","Strukturierte Dokumente","Spezialisierte Workflows","Softwareentwicklung","Künstliche Intelligenz","Claude"],"pt":["handoff","continuidade de sessão","documentos estruturados","claude","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","tecnologia da informação"],"ru":["handoff","передача сессии","структурированные документы","claude","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","информационные технологии"],"ar":["هاندوف","استمرارية الجلسة","مستندات منظمّة","كلود","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"robertguss","repo":"claude-code-toolkit","repoPath":"robertguss/claude-code-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"handoff","description":"Create a structured session handoff document for continuity across sessions. Use when ending a work session, switching contexts, or before a break. Captures decisions, progress, code changes, and next steps so a future session can pick up where you left off without losing context.","bodyPreview":"# Session Handoff Skill\n\nCreate structured documents that enable seamless continuity across Claude sessions.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Ending a work session for the day\n- Before taking a break mid-task\n- Switching to a different project temporarily\n- When you want to capture state for a future session\n- Before a context reset you know is coming\n\n## Handoff Process\n\n### Step 1: Assess Session State\n\nQuickly assess:\n\n1. **What phase are we in?** (exploration, planning, implementation, debugging, review)","body":"# Session Handoff Skill\n\nCreate structured documents that enable seamless continuity across Claude sessions.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Ending a work session for the day\n- Before taking a break mid-task\n- Switching to a different project temporarily\n- When you want to capture state for a future session\n- Before a context reset you know is coming\n\n## Handoff Process\n\n### Step 1: Assess Session State\n\nQuickly assess:\n\n1. **What phase are we in?** (exploration, planning, implementation, debugging, review)\n2. **What''s the active task?** (what we''re trying to accomplish)\n3. **How far along are we?** (just started, mid-way, almost done)\n\n### Step 2: Ask What Matters\n\nAsk the user:\n\n> \"I''ll create a handoff document. Is there anything specific you want to make sure I capture? (Key decisions, code snippets, context about the problem, things you''ll forget, etc.)\"\n\n### Step 3: Generate Handoff Document\n\nCreate a structured document:\n\n```markdown\n# Session Handoff: [Brief Description]\n\n**Date:** [YYYY-MM-DD]\n**Project:** [project name/path]\n**Session Duration:** [approximate]\n\n## Current State\n\n**Task:** [What we''re working on]\n**Phase:** [exploration/planning/implementation/debugging/review]\n**Progress:** [where we are - percentage or milestone]\n\n## What We Did\n\n[2-3 sentence summary of the session''s work]\n\n## Decisions Made\n\n- **[Decision]** — [Rationale]\n- **[Decision]** — [Rationale]\n\n## Code Changes\n\n**Files modified:**\n\n- `path/to/file.ts` — [what and why]\n- `path/to/other.ts` — [what and why]\n\n**Key code context:**\n[Critical snippets or patterns to remember]\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- [ ] [Question needing resolution]\n- [ ] [Question needing resolution]\n\n## Blockers / Issues\n\n- [Issue] — [current status]\n\n## Context to Remember\n\n[Important background, constraints, user preferences, domain knowledge - things that would take time to re-establish]\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [ ] [First thing to do next session]\n2. [ ] [Second thing]\n3. [ ] [Third thing]\n\n## Files to Review on Resume\n\n- `path/to/key/file.ts` — [why it matters]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Write the File\n\nWrite to: `.claude/handoffs/[YYYY-MM-DD]-[brief-description].md`\n\nConfirm location with user:\n\n> \"I''ll save this to `.claude/handoffs/[filename].md`. Want a different location?\"\n\n## What to Capture\n\n### Always Include\n\n1. **Decisions with reasoning** — The \"why\" is often more valuable than the \"what\"\n2. **Code changes** — File paths, what changed, the intent\n3. **Current progress** — Where in the task we stopped\n4. **Next steps** — Clear, actionable items to resume with\n5. **User context** — Constraints, preferences, domain knowledge they shared\n\n### Include When Relevant\n\n- **Errors encountered** — And how they were (or weren''t) resolved\n- **Dead ends** — Approaches tried that didn''t work (saves re-exploration)\n- **Key files** — Files to read to get back up to speed\n- **External dependencies** — APIs, services, tools involved\n\n### Skip\n\n- Verbose tool output (file listings, grep results)\n- Intermediate reasoning that reached conclusions\n- Repeated similar operations\n- Information that''s obvious from the code\n\n## Format Guidelines\n\n- **Bullet points** — Scannable over narrative\n- **File paths** — `src/foo.ts:42` not \"that function\"\n- **Checkboxes for actions** — `- [ ]` for next steps and open questions\n- **Specifics** — \"Added retry logic to fetchUser()\" not \"made improvements\"\n\n## Quality Check\n\nBefore saving, verify:\n\n1. **Could a fresh Claude pick up from this?** — Enough context to continue?\n2. **Are decisions traceable?** — Clear why things were decided?\n3. **Are next steps actionable?** — Know exactly what to do first?\n4. **Is code work clear?** — Know which files matter?\n\n## Using a Handoff Document\n\nWhen starting a new session, the user can:\n\n1. Share the handoff file at session start\n2. Say \"Resume from this handoff: [paste or path]\"\n3. Reference it with @ mention if supported\n\nThe handoff should let you hit the ground running without lengthy re-explanation.\n\n## Example Handoff\n\n```markdown\n# Session Handoff: Auth System Implementation\n\n**Date:** 2025-01-15\n**Project:** /Users/robert/projects/my-api\n**Session Duration:** ~2 hours\n\n## Current State\n\n**Task:** Implementing user authentication for the API\n**Phase:** Implementation\n**Progress:** ~60% - basic flow works, need refresh tokens\n\n## What We Did\n\nBuilt the core JWT authentication flow including token generation, validation middleware, and login/logout endpoints. Hit an issue with key rotation that we resolved by moving to config-based key paths.\n\n## Decisions Made\n\n- **JWT with RS256** — Stateless auth, works with distributed setup\n- **Redis for refresh tokens** — Need revocation capability\n- **15-min access token expiry** — Balance security/UX for mobile app\n\n## Code Changes\n\n**Files modified:**\n\n- `src/auth/jwt.ts` — Token generation and validation logic\n- `src/middleware/auth.ts` — Request authentication middleware\n- `src/routes/auth.ts` — Login/logout endpoints\n- `config/keys/` — RSA key pair storage\n\n**Key code context:**\nToken validation uses RS256. Keys loaded from `config/keys/` based on NODE_ENV.\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- [ ] Automatic vs opt-in refresh token rotation?\n- [ ] Rate limit for login attempts? (User mentioned 10k DAU)\n\n## Context to Remember\n\n- Client is a mobile app - tokens need offline capability\n- User has 10k daily active users - scale matters\n- Using PostgreSQL for user storage\n- User prefers explicit error messages over generic ones\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [ ] Implement `/auth/refresh` endpoint\n2. [ ] Add rate limiting to `/auth/login`\n3. [ ] Write tests for token expiry edge cases\n4. [ ] Update API docs with auth flow\n\n## Files to Review on Resume\n\n- `src/auth/jwt.ts` — Core token logic\n- `src/routes/auth.ts` — Current endpoint implementation\n```\n\n## Key Reminders\n\n- Ask what matters to the user before generating\n- Decisions need reasoning — capture the \"why\"\n- File paths anchor the work — always include them\n- Next steps should be immediately actionable\n- Better slightly longer and useful than short and vague\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:18:41.041Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain that require session continuity and state management","zh":"适合于 Claude、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等需要会话连续性和状态管理的代理","ja":"セッションの連続性と状態管理が必要な Claude、AutoGPT、LangChain などのエージェントに適しています","ko":"클라우드, 오토지페이트, 랑체인 등과 같은 세션 연속성 및 상태 관리가 필요한 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren continuidad de sesión y gestión de estado","fr":"Idéal pour les agents comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain qui nécessitent une continuité de session et une gestion d''état","de":"Ideal für Agenten wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die Sitzungsfortsetzung und Statusverwaltung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem continuidade de sessão e gerenciamento de estado","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, которые требуют непрерывности сеанса и управления состоянием","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب استمرار الجلسة وإدارة الحالة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create structured documents for seamless session handoffs, enabling continuity across different projects and tasks using protocols like session state assessment and context reset handling","zh":"赋予代理创建结构化文档的能力，以实现不同项目和任务之间的无缝会话交接，使用诸如会话状态评估和上下文重置处理等协议","ja":"エージェントが構造化ドキュメントを作成できるようにし、セッション状態の評価やコンテキストのリセット処理などのプロトコルを使用して、異なるプロジェクトやタスク間で会話を継続できるようにします","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 문서를 생성할 수 있도록하여, 세션 상태 평가 및 컨텍스트 재설정 처리와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 다른 프로젝트 및 작업 간에 무중단 세션 전환을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentos estructurados para una transferencia de sesión fluida, lo que permite la continuidad en diferentes proyectos y tareas utilizando protocolos como evaluación del estado de sesión y manejo de restablecimiento de contexto","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des documents structurés pour une réception de session fluide, permettant la continuité à travers différents projets et tâches en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''évaluation de l''état de session et la gestion de réinitialisation du contexte","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, strukturierte Dokumente für eine nahtlose Sitzungsübergabe zu erstellen, wodurch die Fortsetzung über verschiedene Projekte und Aufgaben mithilfe von Protokollen wie Sitzungsstatusbewertung und Kontextzurücksetzungsverwaltung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem documentos estruturados para transferências de sessão sem problemas, permitindo a continuidade em diferentes projetos e tarefas usando protocolos como avaliação de estado de sessão e tratamento de redefinição de contexto","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать структурированные документы для бесшовной передачи сеанса, обеспечивая непрерывность в различных проектах и задачах с использованием протоколов, таких как оценка состояния сеанса и обработка сброса контекста","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء مستندات منظمة لنقل جلسات دون مشاكل، وتمكين الاستمرارية عبر مشاريع ومهام مختلفة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تقييم حالة الجلسة ومعالجة إعادة تعيين السياق"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating session state capture for future reference","Generating structured documents for project handovers","Debugging context loss issues across sessions"],"zh":["自动捕获会话状态以备将来参考","生成结构化文档以进行项目交接","调试会话间的上下文丢失问题"],"ja":["将来参照するためにセッション状態を自動でキャプチャする","プロジェクトのハンドオーバーに構造化ドキュメントを生成する","セッション間のコンテキストの喪失問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["미래 참조를 위해 세션 상태를 자동으로 캡처하는 것","프로젝트 인수인계를 위한 구조화된 문서 생성","세션 간 컨텍스트 손실 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la captura del estado de la sesión para referencia futura","Generar documentos estructurados para la transferencia de proyectos","Depurar problemas de pérdida de contexto entre sesiones"],"fr":["Automatiser la capture de l''état de la session pour référence future","Générer des documents structurés pour la passation de projets","Déboguer les problèmes de perte de contexte entre les sessions"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erfassung des Sitzungsstatus für zukünftige Referenzen","Erstellen strukturierter Dokumente für die Projektnachfolge","Beheben von Kontextverlustproblemen zwischen den Sitzungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a captura de estado de sessão para referência futura","Gerar documentos estruturados para transferências de projetos","Depurar problemas de perda de contexto entre sessões"],"ru":["Автоматизировать захват состояния сеанса для будущей ссылки","Генерировать структурированные документы для передачи проектов","Отлаживать проблемы потери контекста между сеансами"],"ar":["أتمتة التقاط حالة الجلسة للمرجع المستقبلي","إنشاء مستندات منظمة لنقل المشاريع","تصحيح أخطاء فقدان السياق بين الجلسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude or compatible agent architecture","Limited to text-based session state capture"],"zh":["需要 Claude 或兼容的代理架构","仅限文本 기반的会话状态捕获"],"ja":["Claude または互換性のあるエージェントアーキテクチャが必要","テキストベースのセッション状態のキャプチャのみ"],"ko":["클라우드 또는 호환 가능한 에이전트 아키텍처 필요","텍스트 기반 세션 상태 캡처만 가능"],"es":["Requiere Claude o arquitectura de agente compatible","Limitado a la captura de estado de sesión basada en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite Claude ou une architecture d''agent compatible","Limité à la capture de l''état de la session basée sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Claude oder kompatible Agentenarchitektur","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Sitzungsstatuserfassung"],"pt":["Exige Claude ou arquitetura de agente compatível","Limitado à captura de estado de sessão baseada em texto"],"ru":["Требует Claude или совместимой архитектуры агента","Ограничен захватом состояния сеанса на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب Claude أو هيكل وكيل متوافق","محدود بالتقاط حالة الجلسة المستندة إلى النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Heyvhuang/ship-faster/mcp-cloudflare', 'community', 'Heyvhuang', 'ship-faster', 'Heyvhuang/ship-faster', 'mcp-cloudflare', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z', '2026-02-18T07:19:17.760Z', NULL, '{"id":"Heyvhuang/ship-faster/mcp-cloudflare","name":"mcp-cloudflare","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare MCP 技能提供了与 Cloudflare 服务的无缝集成，包括 Workers、KV、R2 等，帮助开发者优化工作流","ja":"Cloudflare MCP スキルは、Workers、KV、R2 などの Cloudflare サービスとのシームレスな統合を提供し、開発者のワークフローを最適化します","ko":"Cloudflare MCP 기술은 Workers, KV, R2 등 Cloudflare 서비스와의 통합을 제공하여 개발자의 워크플로우를 최적화합니다","es":"La habilidad MCP de Cloudflare permite interactuar con servicios como Workers, KV y R2. Es ideal para integrar soluciones de troubleshooting en flujos de trabajo multinivel.","fr":"La compétence MCP Cloudflare permet d''interagir avec des services tels que Workers, KV et R2. Elle est idéale pour intégrer des solutions de dépannage dans des flux de travail multiniveaux.","de":"Die MCP-Cloudflare-Fähigkeit ermöglicht die Interaktion mit Diensten wie Workers, KV und R2. Sie ist ideal für die Integration von Troubleshooting-Lösungen in mehrstufige Workflows.","pt":"O MCP Cloudflare é uma habilidade que permite interagir com os serviços Cloudflare via MCP. Ele oferece uma forma eficiente de integrar os serviços em nuvem em pipelines de trabalho.","ru":"MCP Cloudflare — это навык, который позволяет взаимодействовать с сервисами Cloudflare через MCP. Он предлагает эффективный способ интегрировать облачные сервисы в рабочие конвейеры.","ar":"MCP Cloudflare هو مهارة يسمح بالتفاعل مع خدمات Cloudflare عبر MCP. يقدم وسيلة فعالة لتكامل الخدمات السحابية في أنابيب العمل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Cloudflare MCP 技能： Workers、KV、R2 等服务","ja":"Cloudflare MCP スキル： Workers、KV、R2 など","ko":"Cloudflare MCP 기술: Workers, KV, R2 등","es":"Habilidad MCP de Cloudflare: Integración de Servicios","fr":"Compétence MCP Cloudflare: Interaction avec les Services","de":"MCP-Cloudflare-Fähigkeit: Integration von Diensten","pt":"MCP Cloudflare: Integração de Serviços em Nuvem","ru":"MCP Cloudflare: Интеграция Облачных Сервисов","ar":"MCP Cloudflare: تكامل الخدمات السحابية","en":"mcp-cloudflare"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare MCP 技能提供了与 Cloudflare 服务的无缝集成，包括 Workers、KV、R2 等，帮助开发者优化工作流","ja":"Cloudflare MCP スキルは、Workers、KV、R2 などの Cloudflare サービスとのシームレスな統合を提供し、開発者のワークフローを最適化します","ko":"Cloudflare MCP 기술은 Workers, KV, R2 등 Cloudflare 서비스와의 통합을 제공하여 개발자의 워크플로우를 최적화합니다","es":"La habilidad MCP de Cloudflare permite interactuar con servicios como Workers, KV y R2. Es ideal para integrar soluciones de troubleshooting en flujos de tra...","fr":"La compétence MCP Cloudflare permet d''interagir avec des services tels que Workers, KV et R2. Elle est idéale pour intégrer des solutions de dépannage dans d...","de":"Die MCP-Cloudflare-Fähigkeit ermöglicht die Interaktion mit Diensten wie Workers, KV und R2. Sie ist ideal für die Integration von Troubleshooting-Lösungen i...","pt":"O MCP Cloudflare é uma habilidade que permite interagir com os serviços Cloudflare via MCP. Ele oferece uma forma eficiente de integrar os serviços em nuvem ...","ru":"MCP Cloudflare — это навык, который позволяет взаимодействовать с сервисами Cloudflare через MCP. Он предлагает эффективный способ интегрировать облачные сер...","ar":"MCP Cloudflare هو مهارة يسمح بالتفاعل مع خدمات Cloudflare عبر MCP. يقدم وسيلة فعالة لتكامل الخدمات السحابية في أنابيب العمل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 Workers、KV、R2 等 Cloudflare 服务","实现文件 기반的流水线","优化开发工作流","支持 Observability、Builds、Audit 等功能","提供 Container Sandbox 支持"],"ja":["Workers、KV、R2 などの Cloudflare サービスをサポート","ファイルベースのパイプラインを実現","開発ワークフローを最適化","Observability、Builds、Audit などの機能をサポート","Container Sandbox をサポート"],"ko":["Workers, KV, R2 등 Cloudflare 서비스 지원","파일 기반 파이프라인 구현","개발 워크플로우 최적화","Observability, Builds, Audit 등의 기능 지원","Container Sandbox 지원"],"es":["Integración con Cloudflare Workers","Acceso a KV y R2","Compatibilidad con Observability y Builds","Soporte para Hyperdrive y Container Sandbox","Integración con Audit y Container Sandbox","Flujos de trabajo multinivel con persistencia de datos"],"fr":["Intégration avec Cloudflare Workers","Accès à KV et R2","Compatibilité avec Observability et Builds","Prise en charge de Hyperdrive et Container Sandbox","Intégration avec Audit et Container Sandbox","Flux de travail multiniveaux avec persistance des données"],"de":["Integration mit Cloudflare Workers","Zugriff auf KV und R2","Kompatibilität mit Observability und Builds","Unterstützung für Hyperdrive und Container Sandbox","Integration mit Audit und Container Sandbox","Mehrstufige Workflows mit Datenpersistenz"],"pt":["Integração com Workers","Acesso a KV","Uso de R2","Integração com D1","Suporte a Hyperdrive","Observabilidade e Builds"],"ru":["Интеграция с Workers","Доступ к KV","Использование R2","Интеграция с D1","Поддержка Hyperdrive","Наблюдаемость и Builds"],"ar":["تكامل مع Workers","وصول إلى KV","استخدام R2","تكامل مع D1","دعم Hyperdrive","مراقبة و_Builds"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare MCP","Workers","KV","R2","开发工作流","文件基于流水线","Observability","Builds","Audit","Container Sandbox"],"ja":["Cloudflare MCP","Workers","KV","R2","開発ワークフロー","ファイルベースのパイプライン","Observability","Builds","Audit","Container Sandbox"],"ko":["Cloudflare MCP","Workers","KV","R2","개발 워크플로우","파일 기반 파이프라인","Observability","Builds","Audit","Container Sandbox"],"es":["Cloudflare MCP","Integración de servicios","Workers","KV","R2","Troubleshooting","Flujos de trabajo multinivel","Desarrollo de software","Cloud computing"],"fr":["Cloudflare MCP","Intégration de services","Workers","KV","R2","Dépannage","Flux de travail multiniveaux","Développement de logiciels","Cloud computing"],"de":["Cloudflare MCP","Dienstintegration","Workers","KV","R2","Troubleshooting","Mehrstufige Workflows","Softwareentwicklung","Cloud-Computing"],"pt":["MCP Cloudflare","Serviços em Nuvem","Workers","KV","R2","D1","Hyperdrive","Observabilidade","Builds","Pipelines de Arquivos"],"ru":["MCP Cloudflare","Облачные Сервисы","Workers","KV","R2","D1","Hyperdrive","Наблюдаемость","Builds","Файловые Конвейеры"],"ar":["MCP Cloudflare","خدمات السحابية","Workers","KV","R2","D1","Hyperdrive","مراقبة","Builds","أنابيب الملفات"]}},"owner":"Heyvhuang","repo":"ship-faster","repoPath":"Heyvhuang/ship-faster","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-cloudflare","description":"Manage Workers/KV/R2/D1/Hyperdrive via Cloudflare MCP, perform observability/build troubleshooting/audit/container sandbox operations. Triggers: worker/KV/R2/D1/logs/build/deploy/screenshot/audit/sandbox. Three permission tiers: Diagnose (read-only), Change (write requires confirmation), Super Admin (isolated environment). Write operations must follow read-first, user confirmation, post-execution verification.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare MCP Skill\n\nInteract with Cloudflare services via MCP: Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observability, Builds, Audit, Container Sandbox.\n\n## File-based Pipeline (Pass Paths Only)\n\nWhen integrating troubleshooting/changes into multi-step workflows, persist all evidence and artifacts to disk, passing only paths between agents/sub-agents.\n\nRecommended directory structure (within project): `runs/<workflow>/active/<run_id>/`\n\n- Input: `01-input/goal.md` (symptoms/objectives), `01-input/co","body":"# Cloudflare MCP Skill\n\nInteract with Cloudflare services via MCP: Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observability, Builds, Audit, Container Sandbox.\n\n## File-based Pipeline (Pass Paths Only)\n\nWhen integrating troubleshooting/changes into multi-step workflows, persist all evidence and artifacts to disk, passing only paths between agents/sub-agents.\n\nRecommended directory structure (within project): `runs/<workflow>/active/<run_id>/`\n\n- Input: `01-input/goal.md` (symptoms/objectives), `01-input/context.json` (account/worker/resource/time_range, etc.)\n- Evidence: `02-analysis/observability.md`, `02-analysis/audit.md`, `02-analysis/screenshots/`\n- Plan: `03-plans/change-plan.md` (write operation plan; must write here and await confirmation first)\n- Output: `05-final/report.md` (conclusion + evidence chain + tool call summary + next steps)\n- Logs: `logs/events.jsonl` (summary of each tool call)\n\n## Permission Tiers (Core Principles)\n\n| Tier | Purpose | Tool Scope | Risk Control |\n|------|---------|------------|--------------|\n| **Diagnose** | Read-only/query/troubleshoot | Observability, Builds, Browser, Audit | Default entry point, no write operations |\n| **Change** | Create/modify/delete resources | Workers Bindings (KV/R2/D1) | Requires user confirmation, post-execution verification |\n| **Super Admin** | Highest privileges | All + Container Sandbox | Only in isolated environments/test accounts |\n\n## Tool Reference\n\n### Diagnose Tier (Read-only)\n\n**Observability**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `query_worker_observability` | Query logs/metrics (events, CPU, error rate) |\n| `observability_keys` | Discover available fields |\n| `observability_values` | Explore field values |\n\n**Builds**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `workers_builds_list_builds` | List build history |\n| `workers_builds_get_build` | Get build details |\n| `workers_builds_get_build_logs` | Get build logs |\n\n**Browser Rendering (Page Capture)**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `get_url_html_content` | Fetch page HTML |\n| `get_url_markdown` | Convert to Markdown |\n| `get_url_screenshot` | Take page screenshot |\n\n**Audit Logs**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `auditlogs_by_account_id` | Pull change history by time range |\n\n### Change Tier (Write Operations)\n\n**Account**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `accounts_list` | List accounts |\n| `set_active_account` | Set active account |\n\n**Builds (Settings)**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `workers_builds_set_active_worker` | ⚠️ Set active worker (requires confirmation) |\n\n**KV**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `kv_namespaces_list` | List namespaces |\n| `kv_namespace_get` | Get details |\n| `kv_namespace_create` | Create (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n| `kv_namespace_update` | Update (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n| `kv_namespace_delete` | Delete (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n\n**R2**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `r2_buckets_list` | List buckets |\n| `r2_bucket_get` | Get details |\n| `r2_bucket_create` | Create (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n| `r2_bucket_delete` | Delete (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n\n**D1**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `d1_databases_list` | List databases |\n| `d1_database_get` | Get details |\n| `d1_database_query` | Execute SQL |\n| `d1_database_create` | Create (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n| `d1_database_delete` | Delete (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n\n**Hyperdrive**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `hyperdrive_configs_list` | List configs |\n| `hyperdrive_config_get` | Get details |\n| `hyperdrive_config_create` | Create (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n| `hyperdrive_config_edit` | Edit (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n| `hyperdrive_config_delete` | Delete (⚠️ requires confirmation) |\n\n**Workers**\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `workers_list` | List workers |\n| `workers_get_worker` | Get worker details |\n| `workers_get_worker_code` | Get source code |\n\n### Super Admin Tier (Container Sandbox)\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `container_initialize` | Initialize container (~10 min lifecycle) |\n| `container_exec` | Execute command |\n| `container_file_write` | Write file |\n| `container_file_read` | Read file |\n| `container_files_list` | List files |\n| `container_file_delete` | Delete file |\n\n**Container Notes**: No persistent state, short lifespan, only for temporary tasks (running tests/reproducing issues/parsing data).\n\n## Security Rules (Must Follow)\n\n### Read Operations\n1. **Define scope first**: account / worker / resource ID\n2. **No account? Run `accounts_list` first**\n3. Conclusions must have evidence chain: logs/screenshots/audit records\n\n### Write Operations (Three-step Flow)\n```\n1. Plan: Read current state first (list/get)\n2. Confirm: Output precise change (name/ID/impact scope), await user confirmation\n3. Execute: create/delete/update\n4. Verify: audit logs + observability confirm no new errors\n```\n\n### Prohibited Actions\n- ❌ Execute create/delete/update without confirmation\n- ❌ Delete production resources (unless user explicitly says \"delete production xxx\")\n- ❌ Use Super Admin privileges in non-isolated environments\n- ❌ Use container sandbox as persistent environment\n\n## Operation Workflows\n\n### Troubleshooting Flow (Typical)\n```\n1. Clarify symptoms → worker name/time range/error type\n2. query_worker_observability to pull logs/metrics\n3. If build-related → workers_builds_get_build_logs\n4. If page-related → get_url_screenshot to reproduce\n5. Trace changes → auditlogs_by_account_id\n6. Summarize: root cause + evidence + fix recommendations\n```\n\n### Resource Management Flow\n```\n1. accounts_list → set_active_account\n2. List resources (kv_namespaces_list / r2_buckets_list / d1_databases_list)\n3. Plan changes → present to user\n4. Execute after confirmation\n5. Verify: audit logs + observability shows no errors\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n- **Language**: English\n- **Structure**: Conclusion → Key data/evidence → Tool call summary → Next steps\n- **Write operations**: Must clearly list operations to be executed and impact scope\n\nExample output:\n```\n✅ Investigation complete: worker `api-gateway` experienced 5xx spike between 18:00-18:30\n\nRoot cause: New code deployed threw TypeError when processing /v2/users\nEvidence:\n- Logs: 18:02 first occurrence of \"Cannot read property ''id'' of undefined\"\n- Audit: 18:00 user dev@example.com deployed new version\n- Metrics: error_rate jumped from 0.1% to 12%\n\nRecommendation: Roll back to previous version, or fix /v2/users handler\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Account not set | Run `accounts_list` → `set_active_account` first |\n| Resource doesn''t exist | Verify ID/name is correct, list available resources |\n| Insufficient permissions | Explain required permissions, suggest checking API token scope |\n| Observability query too long | Split into smaller time ranges, ask more specific questions |\n\n## Scenario Examples\n\nSee [scenarios.md](scenarios.md) for 20 real-world development scenarios.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:19:17.760Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare-integrated Agents needing streamlined interactions with Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observability, Builds, Audit, and Container Sandbox services.","zh":"适用于需要与Workers、KV、R2、D1、Hyperdrive、Observability、Builds、Audit和Container Sandbox服务进行流畅交互的Cloudflare集成代理。","ja":"Workers、KV、R2、D1、Hyperdrive、Observability、Builds、Audit、Container Sandboxサービスとの無摩擦なやり取りを必要とするCloudflare統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observability, Builds, Audit 및 Container Sandbox 서비스와의 원활한 상호 작용이 필요한 Cloudflare 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes integrados con Cloudflare que necesitan interacciones optimizadas con Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observabilidad, Builds, Auditoría y servicios de Container Sandbox.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents intégrés à Cloudflare nécessitant des interactions optimisées avec Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observabilité, Builds, Audit et services de Container Sandbox.","de":"Perfekt für in Cloudflare integrierte Agenten, die optimierte Interaktionen mit Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Beobachtbarkeit, Builds, Audit und Container-Sandbox-Diensten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes integrados ao Cloudflare que precisam de interações simplificadas com Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observabilidade, Builds, Auditoria e serviços de Container Sandbox.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, интегрированных с Cloudflare, которым необходимы упрощенные взаимодействия с Workers, KV, R2, D1, Hyperdrive, Observability, Builds, Audit и сервисами Container Sandbox.","ar":"مثالي لعميل متكامل مع Cloudflare والذي يحتاج إلى تفاعلات مبسطة مع Workers، KV، R2، D1، Hyperdrive، Observability، Builds، Audit، وخدمات Container Sandbox."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Cloudflare services via MCP, leveraging file-based pipelines for efficient troubleshooting and change integration, while utilizing protocols like Workers and KV for seamless data storage and retrieval.","zh":"通过MCP使代理能够与Cloudflare服务交互，利用基于文件的管道进行高效的故障排除和更改集成，同时利用Workers和KV等协议实现无缝的数据存储和检索。","ja":"MCPを通じてエージェントがCloudflareサービスとやり取りできるようにし、ファイルベースのパイプラインを利用して効率的なトラブルシューティングと変更の統合を行い、WorkersやKVなどのプロトコルを利用して無摩擦なデータストレージと取得を実現します。","ko":"MCP를 통해 에이전트가 Cloudflare 서비스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하며, 파일 기반 파이프라인을 사용하여 효율적인 문제 해결 및 변경 통합을 수행하며, Workers 및 KV와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 무제한 데이터 저장 및 검색을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con los servicios de Cloudflare a través de MCP, aprovechando pipelines basados en archivos para un seguimiento y una integración de cambios eficientes, mientras utiliza protocolos como Workers y KV para un almacenamiento y recuperación de datos sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec les services Cloudflare via MCP, en exploitant des pipelines basés sur des fichiers pour un dépannage et une intégration de modifications efficaces, tout en utilisant des protocoles comme Workers et KV pour un stockage et une récupération de données sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, mit Cloudflare-Diensten über MCP zu interagieren, indem Dateibasierte Pipelines für effizientes Fehlersuche und Änderungsintegration genutzt werden, während Protokolle wie Workers und KV für eine nahtlose Datenspeicherung und -abruf verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes interajam com os serviços do Cloudflare via MCP, aproveitando pipelines baseadas em arquivos para solução de problemas eficiente e integração de alterações, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza protocolos como Workers e KV para armazenamento e recuperação de dados sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с сервисами Cloudflare через MCP, используя файловые конвейеры для эффективной отладки и интеграции изменений, а также использует протоколы seperti Workers и KV для бесперебойного хранения и извлечения данных.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من التفاعل مع خدمات Cloudflare عبر MCP، واستخدام خطوط أنابيب قائمة على الملفات من أجل حل مشاكل فعال وتكامل التغييرات، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام بروتوكولات مثل Workers و KV من أجل تخزين البيانات واسترجاعها بدون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Cloudflare worker deployments","Debugging issues with Cloudflare KV storage","Generating observability reports for Cloudflare services"],"zh":["自动化Cloudflare Worker部署","调试Cloudflare KV存储问题","为Cloudflare服务生成可观察性报告"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workerの自動化されたデプロイ","Cloudflare KVストレージの問題のデバッグ","Cloudflareサービスの観測可能性レポートの生成"],"ko":["Cloudflare Worker 자동 배포","Cloudflare KV 저장소 문제 디버깅","Cloudflare 서비스에 대한 관찰 가능성 보고서 생성"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de Cloudflare Worker","Depuración de problemas con el almacenamiento KV de Cloudflare","Generación de informes de observabilidad para servicios de Cloudflare"],"fr":["Automatisation des déploiements de Cloudflare Worker","Débogage des problèmes avec le stockage KV de Cloudflare","Génération de rapports d''observabilité pour les services Cloudflare"],"de":["Automatisierung von Cloudflare-Worker-Bereitstellungen","Fehlersuche bei Problemen mit dem Cloudflare-KV-Speicher","Erstellung von Beobachtbarkeitsberichten für Cloudflare-Dienste"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de trabalhadores do Cloudflare","Depurar problemas com armazenamento KV do Cloudflare","Gerar relatórios de observabilidade para serviços do Cloudflare"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание рабочих процессов Cloudflare","Отладить проблемы с хранилищем KV Cloudflare","Генерировать отчеты об наблюдаемости для сервисов Cloudflare"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات نشر عميل Cloudflare","تصحيح مشاكل مع تخزين KV من Cloudflare","generar تقارير مراقبة لخدمات Cloudflare"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare account and MCP access","Filesystem access needed for persisting evidence and artifacts","Specific directory structure required for workflow organization"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare账户和MCP访问","需要文件系统访问以持久化证据和工件","需要特定的目录结构来组织工作流"],"ja":["CloudflareアカウントとMCPへのアクセスが必要","証拠とアーティファクトを永続化するためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","ワークフローの組織化に特定のディレクトリ構造が必要"],"ko":["Cloudflare 계정 및 MCP 액세스가 필요","증거 및 아티팩트를 영속화하기 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","워크플로우를 조직화하기 위해 특정 디렉토리 구조가 필요"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Cloudflare y acceso a MCP","Se necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para persistir pruebas y artefactos","Se requiere una estructura de directorio específica para la organización del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Cloudflare et un accès à MCP","L''accès au système de fichiers est nécessaire pour persister les preuves et les artefacts","Une structure de répertoire spécifique est requise pour l''organisation du flux de travail"],"de":["Benötigt ein Cloudflare-Konto und Zugriff auf MCP","Zugriff auf das Dateisystem ist erforderlich, um Beweise und Artefakte zu speichern","Eine spezifische Verzeichnisstruktur ist erforderlich, um den Arbeitsablauf zu organisieren"],"pt":["Requer conta do Cloudflare e acesso ao MCP","Acesso ao sistema de arquivos necessário para persistir evidências e artefatos","Estrutura de diretório específica necessária para organização de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись Cloudflare и доступ к MCP","Необходим доступ к файловой системе для сохранения доказательств и артефактов","Требуется специальная структура директории для организации рабочего процесса"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Cloudflare وصول إلى MCP","مطلوب وصول إلى نظام الملفات من أجل الحفاظ على الأدلة والمنحوتات","مطلوبة هيكلية دليل معينة من أجل تنظيم سير العمل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sammcj/agentic-coding/swift-best-practices', 'community', 'sammcj', 'agentic-coding', 'sammcj/agentic-coding', 'swift-best-practices', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z', '2026-02-18T07:18:59.501Z', NULL, '{"id":"sammcj/agentic-coding/swift-best-practices","name":"swift-best-practices","description":{"zh":"应用现代Swift开发最佳实践，专注于Swift 6+特性、并发安全、API设计原则和代码质量指南","ja":"Swift 6+の機能、並行性の安全性、API設計原則、コード品質ガイドラインを中心に、モダンなSwift開発ベストプラクティスを適用する","ko":"스위프트 6+ 기능, 병렬 처리 안전성, API 설계 원칙, 코드 품질 가이드ライン을 중점으로 현대적인 스위프트 개발 최적화 팁을 적용합니다","es":"Aplica las mejores prácticas de desarrollo de Swift para proyectos de iOS y macOS, con enfoque en características de Swift 6+ y concurrencia segura","fr":"Appliquez les meilleures pratiques de développement Swift pour les projets iOS et macOS, en mettant l''accent sur les fonctionnalités de Swift 6+ et la concurrence sécurisée","de":"Wenden Sie die besten Praktiken für die Swift-Entwicklung für iOS- und macOS-Projekte an, mit Fokus auf Swift 6+-Funktionen und sicherer Konkurrenz","pt":"Aprenda a aplicar as melhores práticas de desenvolvimento Swift para criar aplicativos de alta qualidade","ru":"Узнайте, как применять лучшие практики разработки на Swift для создания высококачественных приложений","ar":"تعلم كيفية تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات لغة سوفت عالية الجودة","en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Swift最佳实践","ja":"Swiftベストプラクティス","ko":"스위프트 최적화 팁","es":"Mejores Prácticas de Swift para Desarrolladores","fr":"Bonnes Pratiques de Swift pour les Développeurs","de":"Best Practices für Swift-Entwickler","pt":"Melhores Práticas Swift para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Лучшие практики Swift для разработчиков","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لغة سوفت للبرمجة","en":"swift-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"应用现代Swift开发最佳实践，专注于Swift 6+特性、并发安全、API设计原则和代码质量指南","ja":"Swift 6+の機能、並行性の安全性、API設計原則、コード品質ガイドラインを中心に、モダンなSwift開発ベストプラクティスを適用する","ko":"스위프트 6+ 기능, 병렬 처리 안전성, API 설계 원칙, 코드 품질 가이드ライン을 중점으로 현대적인 스위프트 개발 최적화 팁을 적용합니다","es":"Aplica las mejores prácticas de desarrollo de Swift para proyectos de iOS y macOS, con enfoque en características de Swift 6+ y concurrencia segura","fr":"Appliquez les meilleures pratiques de développement Swift pour les projets iOS et macOS, en mettant l''accent sur les fonctionnalités de Swift 6+ et la concur...","de":"Wenden Sie die besten Praktiken für die Swift-Entwicklung für iOS- und macOS-Projekte an, mit Fokus auf Swift 6+-Funktionen und sicherer Konkurrenz","pt":"Aprenda a aplicar as melhores práticas de desenvolvimento Swift para criar aplicativos de alta qualidade","ru":"Узнайте, как применять лучшие практики разработки на Swift для создания высококачественных приложений","ar":"تعلم كيفية تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات لغة سوفت عالية الجودة","en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"definition":{"en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"features":{"zh":["Swift 6+特性支持","并发安全保证","API设计原则指导","代码质量检查","macOS 15.7+项目支持"],"ja":["Swift 6+機能対応","並行性の安全性確保","API設計原則ガイド","コード品質チェック","macOS 15.7+プロジェクト対応"],"ko":["스위프트 6+ 기능 지원","병렬 처리 안전성 보장","API 설계 원칙 가이드","코드 품질 검사","macOS 15.7+ 프로젝트 지원"],"es":["Concurrencia segura con async/await y actores","Diseño de API con principios de diseño de Swift","Directrices de calidad de código para proyectos de iOS y macOS","Soporte para Swift 6+ y características de concurrencia","Revisión de código para corrección, seguridad y estilo"],"fr":["Concurrence sécurisée avec async/await et acteurs","Conception d''API avec les principes de conception de Swift","Directives de qualité de code pour les projets iOS et macOS","Prise en charge de Swift 6+ et des fonctionnalités de concurrence","Révision de code pour la correction, la sécurité et le style"],"de":["Sichere Konkurrenz mit async/await und Akteuren","API-Design mit Swift-Designprinzipien","Codequalitätsrichtlinien für iOS- und macOS-Projekte","Unterstützung für Swift 6+ und Konkurrenzfunktionen","Code-Überprüfung für Korrektheit, Sicherheit und Stil"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento Swift moderno","Concorrência segura","Princípios de design de API","Diretrizes de qualidade de código"],"ru":["Современное развитие на Swift","Безопасная конкурентность","Принципы дизайна API","Руководящие принципы качества кода"],"ar":["تطوير لغة سوفت الحديث","تزامن آمن","مبادئ تصميم واجهة البرمجة","إرشادات جودة الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Swift最佳实践","Swift开发","并发安全","API设计","代码质量","macOS开发","iOS开发","Swift 6+"],"ja":["Swiftベストプラクティス","Swift開発","並行性の安全性","API設計","コード品質","macOS開発","iOS開発","Swift 6+"],"ko":["스위프트 최적화 팁","스위프트 개발","병렬 처리 안전성","API 설계","코드 품질","macOS 개발","iOS 개발","스위프트 6+"],"es":["mejores prácticas de Swift","desarrollo de Swift","concurrencia segura","diseño de API","calidad de código","Swift 6+","iOS","macOS"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques de Swift","développement de Swift","concurrence sécurisée","conception d''API","qualité de code","Swift 6+","iOS","macOS"],"de":["beste Praktiken für Swift","Swift-Entwicklung","sichere Konkurrenz","API-Design","Codequalität","Swift 6+","iOS","macOS"],"pt":["desenvolvimento Swift","melhores práticas Swift","concorrência segura","design de API","qualidade de código","iOS","macOS"],"ru":["разработка на Swift","лучшие практики Swift","безопасная конкурентность","дизайн API","качество кода","iOS","macOS"],"ar":["تطوير لغة سوفت","أفضل الممارسات لغة سوفت","تزامن آمن","تصميم واجهة البرمجة","جودة الشفرة","آي أو إس","أوس إكس"]}},"owner":"sammcj","repo":"agentic-coding","repoPath":"sammcj/agentic-coding","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"swift-best-practices","description":"This skill should be used when writing or reviewing Swift code for iOS or macOS projects. Apply modern Swift 6+ best practices, concurrency patterns, API design guidelines, and migration strategies. Covers async/await, actors, MainActor, Sendable, typed throws, and Swift 6 breaking changes.","bodyPreview":"# Swift Best Practices Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nApply modern Swift development best practices focusing on Swift 6+ features, concurrency safety, API design principles, and code quality guidelines for iOS and macOS projects targeting macOS 15.7+.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Writing new Swift code for iOS or macOS applications\n- Reviewing Swift code for correctness, safety, and style\n- Implementing Swift concurrency features (async/await, actors, MainActor)\n- Designing Swift APIs","body":"# Swift Best Practices Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nApply modern Swift development best practices focusing on Swift 6+ features, concurrency safety, API design principles, and code quality guidelines for iOS and macOS projects targeting macOS 15.7+.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Writing new Swift code for iOS or macOS applications\n- Reviewing Swift code for correctness, safety, and style\n- Implementing Swift concurrency features (async/await, actors, MainActor)\n- Designing Swift APIs and public interfaces\n- Migrating code from Swift 5 to Swift 6\n- Addressing concurrency warnings, data race issues, or compiler errors related to Sendable/isolation\n- Working with modern Swift language features introduced in Swift 6 and 6.2\n\n## Core Guidelines\n\n### Fundamental Principles\n\n1. **Clarity at point of use** is paramount - evaluate designs by examining use cases, not just declarations\n2. **Clarity over brevity** - compact code comes from the type system, not minimal characters\n3. **Write documentation for every public declaration** - if you can''t describe functionality simply, the API may be poorly designed\n4. **Name by role, not type** - `var greeting = \"Hello\"` not `var string = \"Hello\"`\n5. **Favour elegance through simplicity** - avoid over-engineering unless complexity genuinely warrants it\n\n### Swift 6 Concurrency Model\n\nSwift 6 enables complete concurrency checking by default with region-based isolation (SE-0414). The compiler now proves code safety, eliminating many false positives whilst catching real concurrency issues at compile time.\n\n**Critical understanding:**\n- **Async ≠ background** - async functions can suspend but don''t automatically run on background threads\n- Actors protect mutable shared state through automatic synchronisation\n- `@MainActor` ensures UI-related code executes on the main thread\n- Global actor-isolated types are automatically `Sendable`\n\n### Essential Patterns\n\n#### Async/Await\n```swift\n// Parallel execution with async let\nfunc fetchData() async -> (String, Int) {\n    async let stringData = fetchString()\n    async let intData = fetchInt()\n    return await (stringData, intData)\n}\n\n// Always check cancellation in long-running operations\nfunc process(_ items: [Item]) async throws -> [Result] {\n    var results: [Result] = []\n    for item in items {\n        try Task.checkCancellation()\n        results.append(await process(item))\n    }\n    return results\n}\n```\n\n#### MainActor for UI Code\n```swift\n// Apply at type level for consistent isolation\n@MainActor\nclass ContentViewModel: ObservableObject {\n    @Published var images: [UIImage] = []\n\n    func fetchData() async throws {\n        self.images = try await fetchImages()\n    }\n}\n\n// Avoid MainActor.run when direct await works\nawait doMainActorStuff()  // Good\nawait MainActor.run { doMainActorStuff() }  // Unnecessary\n```\n\n#### Actor Isolation\n```swift\nactor DataCache {\n    private var cache: [String: Data] = [:]\n\n    func store(_ data: Data, forKey key: String) {\n        cache[key] = data  // No await needed inside actor\n    }\n\n    nonisolated func cacheType() -> String {\n        return \"DataCache\"  // No await needed - doesn''t access isolated state\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n1. **Don''t mark functions as `async` unnecessarily** - async calling convention has overhead\n2. **Never use `DispatchSemaphore` with async/await** - risk of deadlock\n3. **Don''t create stateless actors** - use non-isolated async functions instead\n4. **Avoid split isolation** - don''t mix isolation domains within one type\n5. **Check task cancellation** - long operations must check `Task.checkCancellation()`\n6. **Don''t assume async means background** - explicitly move work to background if needed\n7. **Avoid excessive context switching** - group operations within same isolation domain\n\n### API Design Quick Reference\n\n#### Naming Conventions\n- Types/protocols: `UpperCamelCase`\n- Everything else: `lowerCamelCase`\n- Protocols describing capabilities: `-able`, `-ible`, `-ing` suffixes (`Equatable`, `ProgressReporting`)\n- Factory methods: Begin with `make` (`x.makeIterator()`)\n- Mutating pairs: imperative vs past participle (`x.sort()` / `x.sorted()`)\n\n#### Method Naming by Side Effects\n- No side effects: Noun phrases (`x.distance(to: y)`)\n- With side effects: Imperative verbs (`x.append(y)`, `x.sort()`)\n\n#### Argument Labels\n- Omit when arguments can''t be distinguished: `min(number1, number2)`\n- Value-preserving conversions omit first label: `Int64(someUInt32)`\n- Prepositional phrases label at preposition: `x.removeBoxes(havingLength: 12)`\n- Label all other arguments\n\n### Swift 6 Breaking Changes\n\n#### Must Explicitly Mark Types with @MainActor (SE-0401)\nProperty wrappers no longer infer actor isolation automatically.\n\n```swift\n@MainActor\nstruct LogInView: View {\n    @StateObject private var model = ViewModel()\n}\n```\n\n#### Global Variables Must Be Concurrency-Safe (SE-0412)\n```swift\nstatic let config = Config()  // Constant - OK\n@MainActor static var state = State()  // Actor-isolated - OK\nnonisolated(unsafe) var cache = [String: Data]()  // Unsafe - use with caution\n```\n\n#### Other Changes\n- `@UIApplicationMain`/`@NSApplicationMain` deprecated (use `@main`)\n- `any` required for existential types\n- Import visibility requires explicit access control\n\n### API Availability Patterns\n\n```swift\n// Basic availability\n@available(macOS 15, iOS 18, *)\nfunc modernAPI() { }\n\n// Deprecation with message\n@available(*, deprecated, message: \"Use newMethod() instead\")\nfunc oldMethod() { }\n\n// Renaming with auto-fix\n@available(*, unavailable, renamed: \"newMethod\")\nfunc oldMethod() { }\n\n// Runtime checking\nif #available(iOS 18, *) {\n    // iOS 18+ code\n}\n\n// Inverted checking (Swift 5.6+)\nif #unavailable(iOS 18, *) {\n    // iOS 17 and lower\n}\n```\n\n**Key differences:**\n- `deprecated` - Warning, allows usage\n- `obsoleted` - Error from specific version\n- `unavailable` - Error, completely prevents usage\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n### When Writing Code\n\n1. Apply naming conventions following role-based, clarity-first principles\n2. Use appropriate isolation (`@MainActor` for UI, actors for mutable state)\n3. Implement async/await patterns correctly with proper cancellation handling\n4. Follow Swift 6 concurrency model - trust compiler''s flow analysis\n5. Document public APIs with clear, concise summaries\n\n### When Reviewing Code\n\n1. Check for concurrency safety violations\n2. Verify proper actor isolation and Sendable conformance\n3. Ensure async functions handle cancellation appropriately\n4. Validate API naming follows Swift guidelines\n5. Confirm availability annotations are correct for target platforms\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n\n- Minimise comments - code should be self-documenting where possible\n- Avoid over-engineering and unnecessary abstractions\n- Use meaningful variable names based on role, not type\n- Follow established project architecture and patterns\n- Prefer `count(where:)` over `filter().count`\n- Use `InlineArray` for fixed-size, performance-critical data\n- Trust compiler''s concurrency flow analysis - avoid unnecessary `Sendable` conformances\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/\n\nDetailed reference material to load when in-depth information is needed:\n\n- **api-design.md** - Complete API design conventions, documentation standards, parameter guidelines, and naming patterns\n- **concurrency.md** - Detailed async/await patterns, actor best practices, common pitfalls, performance considerations, and thread safety patterns\n- **swift6-features.md** - New language features in Swift 6/6.2, breaking changes, migration strategies, and modern patterns\n- **availability-patterns.md** - Comprehensive `@available` attribute usage, deprecation strategies, and platform version management\n\nLoad these references when detailed information is needed beyond the core guidelines provided above.\n\n## Platform Requirements\n\n- Swift 6.0+ compiler for Swift 6 features\n- Swift 6.2+ for InlineArray and enhanced concurrency features\n- macOS 15.7+ with appropriate SDK\n- iOS 18+ for latest platform features\n- Use `#available` for runtime platform detection\n- Use `@available` for API availability marking\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:18:59.501Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS and macOS Development Agents needing advanced Swift coding standards and concurrency safety features","zh":"非常适合需要高级Swift编码标准和并发安全功能的iOS和macOS开发代理","ja":"iOSおよびmacOS開発エージェントが高度なSwiftコーディング標準とコンカレンシーセーフティ機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 스위프트 코딩 표준 및 동시성 안전 기능이 필요한 iOS 및 macOS 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de iOS y macOS que necesitan estándares de codificación avanzados de Swift y características de seguridad de concurrencia","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement iOS et macOS nécessitant des normes de codage Swift avancées et des fonctionnalités de sécurité de concurrence","de":"Perfekt für iOS- und macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Swift-Codierungsstandards und Konkurrenzsicherheitsfunktionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS que necessitam de padrões de codificação Swift avançados e recursos de segurança de concorrência","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS и macOS, которым необходимы продвинутые стандарты кодирования Swift и функции безопасности конкурентного доступа","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون تطبيقات iOS وmacOS الذين يحتاجون إلى معايير برمجة سوفت متقدمة وميزات أمان التزامن"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement modern Swift development best practices, focusing on Swift 6+ features, concurrency safety with async/await and actors, and API design principles for high-quality iOS and macOS projects targeting macOS 15.7+","zh":"赋予代理实现现代Swift开发最佳实践的能力，重点关注Swift 6+功能、使用异步/等待和actors实现的并发安全性，以及针对高质量iOS和macOS项目的API设计原则，目标平台为macOS 15.7+","ja":"エージェントがモダンなSwift開発のベストプラクティスを実装する能力を提供することで、Swift 6+の機能、async/awaitおよびactorを使用したコンカレンシーセーフティ、およびmacOS 15.7+やiOSを対象とする高品質プロジェクトのAPI設計原則に焦点を当てたもの","ko":"에이전트가 최신 스위프트 개발 모범 사례를 구현할 수 있도록 해주는 것에서 힘을 얻어 스위프트 6+ 기능, 비동기/대기 및 액터를 사용한 동시성 안전성, macOS 15.7+ 및 iOS를 대상으로 하는 고품질 프로젝트를 위한 API 설계 원칙에 중점을 둠","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar las mejores prácticas de desarrollo moderno de Swift, centrándose en las características de Swift 6+, la seguridad de concurrencia con async/await y actores, y los principios de diseño de API para proyectos de alta calidad de iOS y macOS que se dirigen a macOS 15.7+","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de développement Swift modernes, en se concentrant sur les fonctionnalités Swift 6+, la sécurité de la concurrence avec async/await et les acteurs, et les principes de conception d''API pour les projets iOS et macOS de haute qualité ciblant macOS 15.7+","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, moderne Swift-Entwicklungsbest-Practices umzusetzen, mit Fokus auf Swift-6+-Funktionen, Konkurrenzsicherheit mit async/await und Akteuren sowie API-Designprinzipien für hochwertige iOS- und macOS-Projekte, die macOS 15.7+ anvisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar as melhores práticas de desenvolvimento Swift moderno, focando em recursos do Swift 6+, segurança de concorrência com async/await e atores, e princípios de design de API para projetos de alta qualidade do iOS e macOS com destino ao macOS 15.7+","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать современные лучшие практики разработки Swift, сосредотачиваясь на функциях Swift 6+, безопасности конкурентного доступа с async/await и актерами, а также принципах проектирования API для проектов высокого качества для iOS и macOS, ориентированных на macOS 15.7+","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات الحديثة لتطوير سوفت، مع التركيز على ميزات سوفت 6+ وأمان التزامن مع async/await والتمثيل، ومبادئ تصميم واجهة البرنامج لمشاريع iOS وmacOS عالية الجودة التي تستهدف macOS 15.7+"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Swift concurrency features for safer asynchronous code","Designing and reviewing Swift APIs for correctness and style","Writing and reviewing new Swift code for iOS or macOS applications with a focus on code quality guidelines"],"zh":["实现Swift并发功能以获得更安全的异步代码","设计和审查Swift API以确保正确性和风格","为iOS或macOS应用程序编写和审查新的Swift代码，重点关注代码质量指南"],"ja":["より安全な非同期コードを得るためにSwiftのコンカレンシーフィーチャを実装する","Swift APIを設計およびレビューして正しさおよびスタイルを確保する","iOSまたはmacOSアプリケーションのための新しいSwiftコードを書きおよびレビューする、コード品質ガイドラインに焦点を当てて"],"ko":["보다 안전한 비동기 코드를 얻기 위해 스위프트 동시성 기능을 구현하는 것","스위프트 API를 설계 및 검토하여 올바름 및 스타일을 보장하는 것","iOS 또는 macOS 애플리케이션을 위한 새로운 스위프트 코드를 작성 및 검토하는 것, 코드 품질 지침에 중점을 둔 것"],"es":["Implementar características de concurrencia de Swift para un código asíncrono más seguro","Diseñar y revisar API de Swift para la corrección y el estilo","Escribir y revisar nuevo código Swift para aplicaciones iOS o macOS, centrándose en las directrices de calidad del código"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre les fonctionnalités de concurrence Swift pour un code asynchrone plus sûr","Concevoir et examiner les API Swift pour la correction et le style","Écrire et examiner le nouveau code Swift pour les applications iOS ou macOS, en se concentrant sur les directives de qualité du code"],"de":["Implementieren von Swift-Konkurrenzfunktionen für sichereren asynchronen Code","Entwerfen und Überprüfen von Swift-APIs für Richtigkeit und Stil","Schreiben und Überprüfen von neuem Swift-Code für iOS- oder macOS-Anwendungen, mit Fokus auf die Codierungsqualitätsrichtlinien"],"pt":["Implementação de recursos de concorrência Swift para código assíncrono mais seguro","Desenho e revisão de APIs Swift para correção e estilo","Escrita e revisão de novo código Swift para aplicativos iOS ou macOS com foco em diretrizes de qualidade de código"],"ru":["Реализация функций конкурентного доступа Swift для более безопасного асинхронного кода","Проектирование и проверка API Swift на правильность и стиль","Написание и проверка нового кода Swift для приложений iOS или macOS с фокусом на руководствах по качеству кода"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزات التزامن في سوفت لأكواد غير متزامنة أكثر أمانًا","تصميم ومراجعة واجهات البرنامج سوفت للصحة والنمط","كتابة ومراجعة كود سوفت جديد لتطبيقات iOS أو macOS مع التركيز على إرشادات جودة الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Swift 6+ compatibility","Targeted for macOS 15.7+ and iOS projects"],"zh":["需要Swift 6+兼容性","针对macOS 15.7+和iOS项目"],"ja":["Swift 6+の互換性が必要","macOS 15.7+およびiOSプロジェクトを対象"],"ko":["스위프트 6+ 호환성이 필요","macOS 15.7+ 및 iOS 프로젝트를 대상"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Swift 6+","Orientado a proyectos macOS 15.7+ y iOS"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité Swift 6+","Ciblant les projets macOS 15.7+ et iOS"],"de":["Erfordert Swift-6+-Kompatibilität","Zielt auf macOS-15.7+- und iOS-Projekte ab"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com Swift 6+","Direcionado para projetos macOS 15.7+ e iOS"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Swift 6+","Направлено на проекты macOS 15.7+ и iOS"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع سوفت 6+","موجه لمشاريع macOS 15.7+ وتطبيقات iOS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
